('string/en/barada.stf', 1, 'bar1', 'You shouldn''t be here.  Go see Bib Fortuna if you need work.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 2, 'bar2', 'I have work to do.  Come back when you''ve helped Yena.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 3, 'bar3', 'I''m Barada.  Bib says we can trust you, so I have some work for you to do.  Are you ready to do some work?\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 4, 'bar4', 'Yes sir.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 5, 'bar5', 'At the moment I''m a little busy.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 6, 'bar6', 'Good.  I''m going to input the code to a self destruct device attached to one of Valarian''s warehouses.  I just want you to go enter it and blow it up.  Simple enough?  Make sure you leave before that timer goes off!\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 7, 'bar7', 'Ok.  Come back and see me when you have time.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 8, 'bar8', 'Jabba says to tell you thanks.  You''ve done a good job.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 9, 'bar9', 'What should I do now?\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 10, 'bar10', 'Go see Ephant Mon.  He has something he needs done.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 11, 'bar11', 'Max Rebo, the bandleader, is in need of some assistance I hear.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 12, 'bar12', 'Bib Fortuna would like to speak with you again.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 13, 'bar13', 'I don''t have any more work for you right now.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 14, 'bar14', 'Ok.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 15, 'bar15', 'Good, you''ve arrived.  Unfortunately, someone''s stolen some of our engine parts.  It looks like Jawa tracks. Miserable little buggers.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 16, 'bar16', 'Shall I hunt them down?\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 17, 'bar17', 'I''m not here to hunt down Jawas!\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 18, 'bar18', 'I''m marking their location on your datapad.  Just get my parts back, I don''t care how you do it.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 19, 'bar19', 'Oh.  A coward.  Well, you can either go get my parts or I can tell Jabba why he didn''t get his shipment.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 20, 'bar20', 'The shipment wasn''t my repsonsibility!\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 21, 'bar21', 'What are you going to do?\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 22, 'bar22', 'You don''t know Jabba very well, do you?  Do you think he cares whose responsibility it was?  We''ll all get thrown to the Rancor!\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 23, 'bar23', 'We''re not out of the woods yet.  I''ll get the truck, you get the parts.'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 24, 'bar24', 'OK, I''ll get the parts.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 25, 'bar25', 'You don''t seem to have the parts yet.\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 26, 'bar26', 'Good, you''ve got parts.  Keep me covered while I get this transport running\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 27, 'bar27', 'This one''s done.  There''s more Imperials on the way, cover me while I get the second truck running\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 28, 'bar28', 'That''s it!  See you back at the palace!\n'),
('string/en/barada.stf', 29, 'busy', 'I can''t talk now, I''m working.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 1, 'opt_buy', 'I''d like to buy a drink...'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 2, 'opt_rumor', 'Heard anything interesting lately?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 3, 'opt_yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 4, 'opt_no', 'No'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 5, 'greet', 'Welcome! Hey, you look a bit parched. Is there anything I can do for you?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 6, 'msg_buy', 'Well, you have come to the right place! Allow me to provide you with a menu of our choice selections.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 7, 'query_buy', 'You still look like you could use a drink though. Can I interest you in one of fine beverages?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 8, 'msg_yes', 'Your patronage is kindly appreciated.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 9, 'msg_no', 'Then get out of my bar you miserable wretch. Your kind is not appreciated around here...'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 10, 'no_rumor', 'Can''t say that I have heard anything recently...'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 11, 'prose_rumor1', 'I did overhear %TT say ''%TO''.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 12, 'prose_rumor2', 'I hear that %TT said something like ''%TO''.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 13, 'prose_rumor3', 'Well, there was some chatter about %TT saying something like ''%TO''.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 14, 'prose_rumor4', 'I''m not sure but it *did* sound like %TT said ''%TO''.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 15, 'sui_title', 'Bar Menu'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 16, 'sui_prompt', 'Please select the beverage you would like from the list.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 17, 'inv_full', 'The bartender was unable to hand you your %TO. It is likely your inventory is full.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 18, 'prose_buy_fail', 'You were unable to purchase %TO. Perhaps you do not have enough credits?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 19, 'prose_buy_pass', 'You successfully purchase a %TT for %DI credits.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 20, 'talk_to_me', 'Tell me about current events.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 21, 'monthly_fiction_1', 'I heard something about the drall...you know those guys from Corellia?  Rumor has it there''s been some anti-imperial sentiment amongst them, and they''re planning on doing something about it.  Couldn''t tell you what, but I think the Empire might take matters into their own hands soon.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 22, 'monthly_fiction_2', 'I''ve been hearing rumors that the empire is getting ready to step on some Drall that are getting out of line on Corellia. Ya know, sometimes it''s better to just fly the course and not make trouble.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 23, 'monthly_fiction_3', 'I got a regular who comes in here who tells me that his friend heard that the rebels are knocking themselves out trying to find one of their spies.  Some girl who stole plans from a scientist named Vacca.  I''d hate to be her!'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 24, 'monthly_fiction_4', 'I hear the Imperials are looking for loyal citizens to find some sort of disk the rebels are trying to protect. If you ask me, it''s better to fight for the Empire than to fight against them. After all, who wants an AT-ST showing up at your door because you backed the wrong side?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 25, 'monthly_fiction_5', 'The rebels are trying to find someone foolish enough to help them find their lost spy. I wouldn''t do it. You''d have to be dumber than a newborn Wookiee to cross the Empire!'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 26, 'monthly_fiction_6', 'Some junk dealers were in here trying to sell some old Imperial decoders. They said they found a crashed shuttle with a whole cargo of them. I bet the Rebels would pay good money to get their hands on one of them, even if they are a bit out of date.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 27, 'monthly_fiction_7', 'Did you scan that article on Dr. Vacca? I can''t believe the Empire would fund a scientist who is that friendly with the Drall. If I were him, I''d be careful because you never know when the Empire will decide to send you a "message" to get with the party line.'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 28, 'monthly_fiction_8', 'I got a friend who sells hyperdrives to the Alliance and he tells me that they have some mission planned to recruit some bigwig scientist away from the Empire. Normally I''d say it wouldn''t work, but this guy''s from Alderaan, so who knows?'),
('string/en/bartender.stf', 29, 'monthly_fiction_9', 'Something''s got the Empire warping mad. I think it''s got something to do with some scientist named Vacca spending too much time with the Drall. I hear the Imps are looking for someone to do a little dirty work to teach him a lesson in obedience.\n'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 1, 'bartender_1', 'I had the strangest dream last night.'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 2, 'bartender_2', 'What was your dream about?'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 3, 'bartender_3', 'Tell me about these imperials outside of town.'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 4, 'bartender_4', 'I dreamed I was being put out of business by a bunch of imperials who...oh, wait, that''s happening isn''t it?\n'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 5, 'bartender_5', 'They''ve cut a deal with Jabba.  He lets them pretend to be in charge and they let him smuggle spices.'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 6, 'bartender_6', 'Things are sure weird around here.'),
('string/en/bartender_e3_convo.stf', 7, 'bartender_7', 'Yeah, well, I got to get back to packing up.'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 12, 'bar_1', 'You looking for work?'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 13, 'bar_2', 'I might be.'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 14, 'bar_3', 'I''m just here to have a drink.'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 15, 'bar_4', 'You have any problem shooting imperials?'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 16, 'bar_5', 'That''s too bad.  There''s a ton of work and everybody''s leaving town.'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 17, 'bar_6', 'What kind of work?'),
('string/en/bar_e3_convo.stf', 18, 'bar_7', 'Go out the front door and down the street.  You''ll find a guy there who''s been looking to hire some muscle.  Ask him some questions, eh?');
