('string/en/base_player.stf', 138, 'upload_success', 'Your character has been successfully uploaded. You may now log into the target Galaxy and attempt to complete this transfer. If this transfer is to a Galaxy other than Test Center, you may need additional authorization and your source character may be disabled.'),
