('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 4, 's_1ccf69c4', 'Shield Connections'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 5, 's_20141151', 'Tell me about these special resources again.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 6, 's_212d314f', 'The overall project'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 7, 's_261bbc0d', 'What would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 8, 's_27509fa0', 'There are people who are working for Eozlin who are gathering special resources. You must get the resources from them to craft the items needed for the shields. There are also reports that the Sith Shadows are using them to build their bases. The resources are Ardanium II, Endrine, Ostrine, Rudic, and Wind Crystal.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 9, 's_2ce1f012', 'How many more items do I need to contribute?'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 10, 's_31b4836a', 'I''m sorry, something went wrong; you could not be given the project schematics.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 11, 's_39019ea3', 'I''d like to know about the quality of the ingredients people are giving.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 12, 's_4ccd023a', 'Which ingredient would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 13, 's_5f230d28', 'I''d like to add an ingredient to the village shields.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 14, 's_67afc98f', 'What would you like to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 15, 's_739cd87c', 'Please put the ingredients you want to add into my inventory.'),
('string/en/conversation/qtqc_phase_3.stf', 16, 's_74be10c7', 'You don''t need to give any more items, although you can to help the project.'),
