('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 3, 's_11a3b43', 'I''ll have to come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 4, 's_1204a0c6', 'I see. Now, do you want to audition as a musician or a dancer?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 5, 's_1343b0ab', 'Nah, doesn''t really sound like something I want to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 6, 's_1377703a', 'Yes, I''m ready. Let''s get this show on the road.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 7, 's_14556b51', 'OK. Go ahead and make your preparations. You know the drill. Just come back and talk with me when you''re ready to audition.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 8, 's_16e98373', 'Ah, you''re here about your last show?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 9, 's_183e8ee4', 'As a musician.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 10, 's_1a0fba4e', 'Wow, that was a great act! Really! Here, I''m supposed to give you an advance for your next performance. Go get some rest, and come see me whenever you want to talk about your next show.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 11, 's_1b58131a', 'Alright. If you change your mind, I''ll be here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 12, 's_1c296980', 'It doesn''t look like you''re skilled enough to perform yet. Go practice a little more and come back when you''re ready to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 13, 's_1dc24a1', 'I''m here to talk about my next performance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 14, 's_1e0d968c', 'Whenever you like. Just go make yourself ready and speak to me again when you want to start.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 15, 's_1fe0d27c', 'I don''t have time for that stuff now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 16, 's_2224e2b8', 'It should be quite simple. Just go out there and do a little performance routine for some people. I think that if you were to entertain ten people, that would be enough. Are you ready to do this now?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 17, 's_250ebca6', 'Oh yes, I see, I see. Yes, we do have an open slot coming up here very shortly. Are you ready to get started with your show now?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 18, 's_274a8930', 'Alright, I''ll go ahead and get things set up. You''d better hurry up and get onstage. The audition will start in thirty seconds.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 19, 's_2883b989', 'Not right now, thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 20, 's_2a8b6bf', 'Only entertainers and crew should be backstage. What are you doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 21, 's_2b8d253d', 'Excellent work. I''m starting to hear the buzz about your performance! We should be able to put on the show whenever you''re ready. Go make your preparations, then come speak with me again when you want to begin.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 22, 's_2cf69669', 'That''s right. This is the last show scheduled for your concert series. But don''t worry, for an entertainer such as yourself, I''m sure that there will be many opportunities for you in the future.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 23, 's_2f3d57d6', 'I don''t really like doing the promotions.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 24, 's_303aa95e', 'Alright. Come back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 25, 's_326a697e', 'Sorry, I''ll come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 26, 's_34bf7b50', 'I see. Just tell me what I need to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 27, 's_350a3257', 'Not right now, I''ve got some stuff to do first.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 28, 's_353af024', 'Well, before you put on your first show, we need to do some advertising. You know, what good is a show if nobody comes to see it?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 29, 's_36a4e374', 'Yes, I am.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 30, 's_37b822c1', 'Hello there! You''re a member of the entertainment industry are you not? I''ve got an offer for you if you''re interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 31, 's_388438a6', 'How much will I get paid?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 32, 's_38a3b1e2', 'Nervous? I understand. Just come back when you''re ready and we''ll get you up on stage.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 33, 's_3936bc63', 'Oh, you didn''t pass the audition? That''s too bad. We can set you up with another audition, but not until twenty-four hours have passed since your last audition. Come back then and we''ll talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 34, 's_39aa9593', 'Sure, I can give it a try.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 35, 's_3cdabd0e', 'What? Oh, hello there. I''m sorry, it''s recently become rather busy. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 36, 's_3d244a46', 'You haven''t completed your promotional assignment have you? Come back when you''re done and we''ll talk about your next performance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 37, 's_3e04f6f', 'Alright. What do I need to do this time?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 38, 's_3ef23ade', 'Sorry. I''ll come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 39, 's_414898b2', 'I''m not quite ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 40, 's_4365b273', 'I''m not nervous.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 41, 's_472f2a5e', 'You''re here for an audition, yes? Are you ready to get started now?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 42, 's_499afb89', 'What is your offer?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 43, 's_4a1d2431', 'Yes, I''m ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 44, 's_4be62475', 'No way. I don''t want to go through that again.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 45, 's_4dbb8ff6', 'I''ll take care of all the promotions on this end, but you need to go out and promote yourself, if you know what I''m saying. Get your name out there on the streets... get people talking.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 46, 's_55e428e8', 'Last show?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 47, 's_56d2a81f', 'I understand. Come back if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 48, 's_57c8489e', 'What should I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 49, 's_57f90c0e', 'Hm... it looks like someone else is on stage right now. Try back again in a little while and we''ll see if we can get you set up.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 50, 's_58ea419', 'Indeed! This show will be even bigger than the last one! If the next show is as good as the last, you''ll be on your way to the top!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 51, 's_59a59142', 'As ready as I''ll ever be.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 52, 's_5a936e2e', 'That''s fine. I don''t mind doing the promotions.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 53, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 54, 's_64d20f97', 'Audition? Uh, I''d rather not be judged.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 55, 's_664ead2a', 'I''m hearing people talk about your upcoming show, but it''s not enough. Go finish your promotional job, and then we''ll discuss your performance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 56, 's_668b00bf', 'That''s fantastic. This is going to be your biggest performance ever! I can feel it!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 57, 's_67e4d556', 'OK... Well, if you ever need any more work, just come see me.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 58, 's_68c92267', 'Actually, we''re all booked up right now. Maybe some other time, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 59, 's_694f2644', 'OK, so what do we do next?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 60, 's_6b02387e', 'I see. I''m not ready for that yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 61, 's_705ff1a9', 'Excellent. Make whatever preparations you feel are necessary, and then come back to me when you are ready to start the audition.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 62, 's_70da1c6a', 'OK. You''ll still need to audition though. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 63, 's_7223d3c0', 'Amazing. Simply amazing. You truly are one of the best performers I''ve seen in a long time. Here''s a bonus for doing so well. Also, one of our past acts left this scroll here. It''s not much use to us, maybe you''d like to have it?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 64, 's_7943785d', 'Sure, no time like the present.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 65, 's_7b58a334', 'When can we get started with the next show?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 66, 's_7b9543aa', 'Let''s not get ahead of ourselves. First, you must pass an audition. We can''t just have anyone getting up on the stage now, can we?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 67, 's_7cef0609', 'Here''s what you do. Go out and do a small performance routine for thirty people. Soon, everybody should be talking about you, and if the word is good, we might even have a sell out show!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 68, 's_810fffd0', 'Oh, you''re back. But I don''t think you''ve finished your promotional campaign have you? Come back when you''re done and we''ll talk about your show.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 69, 's_82b273a8', 'Suit yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 70, 's_847c3be4', 'More promotion?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 71, 's_857ede28', 'Hey! I hear that you passed the audition! That''s fantastic. Here, let me give you a payment in advance for your up-coming performances. You deserve a break now, though. Come back later and we''ll discuss what needs to be done next.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 72, 's_85b97ed7', 'Sure, sure. You''ve got a stomach of pure steel. So, are you ready to get started?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 73, 's_86731ce6', 'Good. I''ll let the crew know so that they can start setting up. The performance will start in three minutes. You may speak with the audience beforehand if you like, but you must be on the stage when the show starts, alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 74, 's_8b00fbc4', 'OK, I''ll get the promotions started, you just go out and entertain ten people. Then come back here and we''ll talk about getting the concert started.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 75, 's_8ddf8010', 'How do we do that?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 76, 's_8e4955d6', 'OK, count me in.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 77, 's_9172f29c', 'As a dancer.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 78, 's_919f9d5a', 'Well, I''ll be honest with you. Ever since your show, every hack that thinks he can dance a step has come here to perform. So we''re all full on dance shows, but we still have a few spots open for a musical show if you''re interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 79, 's_9288900f', 'I understand.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 80, 's_937f2001', 'Back already, huh? I don''t blame you for wanting to get started.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 81, 's_942ddb10', 'Alright, come back when you have the time.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 82, 's_95037778', 'Oh, hello! Welcome back, friend. Are you looking to participate in another performance?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 83, 's_9728f9e3', 'No, that''s not really something I want to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 84, 's_9739cb4c', 'Yes, that''s fine.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 85, 's_9d801ae8', 'OK, come back anytime.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 86, 's_a19891a9', 'OK, that''s fine.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 87, 's_a2ce6dd9', 'That''s all you youngsters are worried about these days, isn''t it? Don''t worry, you''ll be compensated for your time.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 88, 's_a2fae368', 'Sure, that sounds like a lot of fun.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 89, 's_a820a6d1', 'I don''t have time for that now. I''ll come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 90, 's_a84a3743', 'Well, I''ll be honest with you. Ever since your show, every hack that thinks he can play a note has come here to perform. So we''re all full on musical shows, but we still have a few spots open for a dance show if you''re interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 91, 's_a99397a', 'Yeah, I guess so.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 92, 's_aa18ac6', 'It looks like your previous show didn''t go over so well. That''s too bad. You can try the performance again, but not until twenty-four hours have passed since your last one. Come back then and we''ll talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 93, 's_ab1c9c5f', 'That''s fine. Take your time. Just come back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 94, 's_ad679858', 'I changed my mind. I''m not ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 95, 's_b1522710', 'I see. Well, come back when you have more time and we''ll get started.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 96, 's_b5131941', 'Ready to start the show, are you? Don''t worry if you''re nervous. Everybody gets like that the first time they''re on stage.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 97, 's_b5c6a62d', 'Wow... this is fantastic! Everybody in town is talking about you! We''ll have a sold out show for sure! Go make your preparations and come back whenever you''re ready to start the performance!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 98, 's_b6dac7cf', 'OK, I''ll get started on that now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 99, 's_b751f222', 'If you''re ready now, I''ll go ahead and start getting things set up. What do you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 100, 's_b85a558e', 'Nah, it''s not for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 101, 's_bba5f6f2', 'Excellent. Just go out and entertain thirty people. After that, no more promotional work, I promise. Then come back and we''ll talk about your next show.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 102, 's_c08ff946', 'I''m looking for some new solo acts to perform here at the theater. I''ve been scouring the city trying to find fresh new talent to put on some live shows. Would you possibly be interested in doing a performance series?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 103, 's_c5a66e82', 'No, not really.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 104, 's_c6403b16', 'OK, I''ll go get started.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 105, 's_c73756f7', 'On second thought, I''m not quite ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 106, 's_c7cb7929', 'I don''t really have time for that right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 107, 's_c9770db7', 'I would think that if you were to go out and do a performance routine for at least twenty people, that would be sufficient. Remember, the more people that get a taste of your act, the more tickets we''ll sell!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 108, 's_cad51774', 'You''ve completed your first show! Congratulations, the audience loved you. Let me give you another advance for your next performance. Come back and see me again when you''re ready to talk about your next show.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 109, 's_d0fc43d', 'Hm. I don''t have time for that right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 110, 's_d66dc712', 'Too busy to talk right now. I''m very busy, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 111, 's_d730c5dd', 'No, I''m not quite ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 112, 's_da9a29e9', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 113, 's_db3a3e40', 'Good. I''ll let the crew know so that they can start setting up. The performance will start in two minutes. You may speak with the audience beforehand if you like, but you must be on the stage when the show starts, alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 114, 's_dd4bb16d', 'Let''s do it!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 115, 's_dda95847', 'Is that possible?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 116, 's_e5438cc6', 'Welcome back! I still can''t tell you how impressed I am with your performances. You truly are a credit to the entertainment professions. Best of luck to you in the future, friend!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 117, 's_e66da464', 'Good. I''ll let the crew know so that they can start setting up. The performance will start in two and a half minutes. You may speak with the audience beforehand if you like, but you must be on the stage when the show starts, alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 118, 's_e8276d66', 'That sounds pretty hard, maybe I''ll come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 119, 's_ed9c9f8d', 'Oh yes. You''re ready to get going for your next show. Let''s not get too ahead of ourselves, though. You need to go out and do some more promotion before the next performance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 120, 's_f148a2c3', 'Hm... it looks like someone else is on stage right now. Try back again in a little while and we''ll see if we can get your show started.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 121, 's_f29e46b6', 'Great work! Really great work! I''m starting to hear a lot of people talk about you! I''ve got a feeling that this show is going to be fantastic.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 122, 's_f3d46f0b', 'No, not quite yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 123, 's_f66a7b69', 'Excellent. Just go out and entertain twenty people. That should be enough. Then come back and we''ll talk about your next show.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 124, 's_f72be127', 'Alright. Come back whenever you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 125, 's_fa31756f', 'OK, come back when you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 126, 's_fb55e1c0', 'Actually I''m not quite ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 127, 's_fd047f06', 'I''d better come back later then.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 128, 's_fe82f47f', 'Advertising and promotion is part of the business kid. Now are you ready to go out there and spread the word, or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_crowd_pleaser_manager.stf', 129, 's_ffa16d1d', 'You''re here about your next show aren''t you? Sure, sure, I understand. You''ll need to go out and do some more promotion before you get started with the next performance, though. Is that alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 3, 's_12afde00', 'Smugglers? Why would I know any smugglers?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 4, 's_1892fb83', 'Good for you. So long!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 5, 's_1b0651f8', 'Yes, I think I know who it is.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 6, 's_1fa16fd3', 'Then why not find the one with the transponder?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 7, 's_239b0909', 'Well, I hope you find him. Good-bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 8, 's_250df636', 'One of these smugglers is my mark. I think. I''m not sure.  I''ve been tracking him for some time and just now caught up with him here in this city.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 9, 's_254a92c6', 'To be honest, I''m a little confused. I know the smuggler captain and I can trust him. But everyone else just blames each other, and I don''t know what to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 10, 's_29ecd548', 'You had your shot, kid. I''m not going to give you another chance. Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 11, 's_369a8bff', 'Maybe I can find out who your mark is.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 12, 's_3769e5f8', 'I don''t have time to talk right now. Sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 13, 's_3ece0ca2', 'You''ve got to be the worst bounty hunter ever.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 14, 's_402e3e9a', 'Wow, I wouldn''t want to be in your position.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 15, 's_44f4df', 'You really do think I''m stupid. I can handle this myself... but, uh... if you want to, give it a shot. See what you can find out.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 16, 's_47482ee2', 'What did you find out?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 17, 's_54e633f8', 'Then leave me alone. I''m busy.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 18, 's_5e244342', 'I''ve helped all I can. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 19, 's_5fdaa4bb', 'Well, so long then.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 20, 's_60d63ec8', 'No, I didn''t think that you would. Curses. Now what do I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 21, 's_624a9b6f', 'Yea, yea. Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 22, 's_659bb141', 'Listen up, kid. This stuff isn''t as easy as it sounds. Cut me some slack.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 23, 's_69cdbab1', 'Not yet. I''m still looking.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 24, 's_775eed34', 'No, can''t say as I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 25, 's_7cf16bce', 'Sounds like you have it under control.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 26, 's_7eb6abbe', 'I figured as much. Blast it all. Now what do I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 27, 's_806d4263', 'Questioned them? Yep, I found all the suspected smugglers in the area and brought them here. Questioned them, pushed them around, roughed them up, you name it.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 28, 's_86c02324', 'A lotta help you were. Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 29, 's_922dd166', 'Then why don''t you arrest him?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 30, 's_a49ad86c', 'I don''t know, but good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 31, 's_b8bf2aa9', 'Yea, that''s the thing. I don''t know which one of these smugglers is my mark.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 32, 's_b8f4813d', 'Well, that one guy does look kinda familiar.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 33, 's_b932a57a', 'Hey there! Thanks again for helping me find the right mark. You''re OK in my book.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 34, 's_bd2c41cb', 'You there. Do you know any of these smugglers here?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 35, 's_bebac1d7', 'You must think I''m stupid don''t you? A little while after I tracked the signal to this city, it went dead. He must have found it and turned it off.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 36, 's_cd33dbbc', 'OK. If you find out who it is, let me know.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 37, 's_d3412303', 'What seems to be the problem?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 38, 's_d9ec1dc4', '''Arrest him''... heh. Yea, I would ''arrest him'' but the problem is, I don''t know which one of these smugglers he is.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 39, 's_dce437b6', 'Have you questioned all the smugglers here?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 40, 's_dd6f7e', 'Good luck with all that!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 41, 's_dec94c0f', 'I''ve got no time for ''kinda familiar''. I need concrete information.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 42, 's_df879e', 'No time to talk now, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 43, 's_df981c5e', 'I thought you were tracking him for a long time?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 44, 's_eaa5c299', 'You''re not sure?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 45, 's_faaf7075', 'Did you find out who my mark is?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 46, 's_fc5b59e0', 'That''s great! Just point out who you think it is. If your reasoning is justified, I''ll take care of the rest.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_bounty_hunter.stf', 47, 's_ffdc10ae', 'The guy I''m looking for stole some equipment. Nobody got a good look at him, but the crate that he stole had a transponder signal attached to it.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 3, 's_19cc687c', 'Stay quiet in there! I''ll do no such thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 4, 's_31845b51', '....'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 5, 's_46d11795', 'Oh, nothing. I''ll go back to my business.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 6, 's_46ea9e29', 'I''m here to watch over you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 7, 's_68f8b129', 'Fantastic! We''ll wait. Quick! Go talk to her..'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 8, 's_83c7eb4e', 'Who sent you? That wife?! She''s no good. She tricked us and is starving us in here! C''mon. Help us out of here. We can''t do it alone. Our means of escape will cause too much of a ruckuss and she''ll just catch us again! Go distract her and we''ll do our thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 9, 's_8ce1bb85', 'Scram!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 10, 's_cf46030c', 'Hey! Is anyone out there? Who''s that!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 11, 's_d22d9b89', 'Okay. I guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 12, 's_e601f570', 'Blast it! We''re going to be stuck in here! Don''t tell her our plans! We''ll be finished!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_box.stf', 13, 's_e606ff8b', 'Is that you again? What do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 3, 's_12d39d30', 'Who do you say might have taken your family, again?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 4, 's_17089ea4', 'Yes, I will go save your wife and daughter.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 5, 's_22e3a3', 'Thanks again for paying the ransom! I''m going to go set the deal up right now!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 6, 's_27d7b600', 'Thank you! Oh, thank you so much. I will be in your debt always. I''m going to go make arrangements to pay the ransom money now. Thank you again for your kindness.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 7, 's_28fe80fc', 'That''s terrible!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 8, 's_29e0b99d', 'Thanks. I think that I''ll need it.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 9, 's_2e1d6626', 'Oops. Looks like I don''t have that much money either.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 10, 's_2f051629', 'I will go rescue your family for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 11, 's_2fdb8fbd', 'On second thought, I don''t think I can help right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 12, 's_31e2a586', 'I don''t know for sure. There was a name scribbled at the bottom of the note that was left. It said, ''Sennex''. But I don''t know what that means. I don''t know anyone named Sennex.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 13, 's_3abf0d9c', 'Thank you so very much. You have my sincerest gratitude. But do be careful, for my family''s sake. Here, I''ll transmit a location to your datapad. I think that the brutes that did this might be holed up in a cave there.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 14, 's_46d3276e', 'Sorry, I don''t think I can help right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 15, 's_498b2572', 'Are you sure? I appreciate your selflessness, but it will probably be very dangerous. Though I agree that you are probably better equipped to go than I.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 16, 's_4b28f5f9', 'It doesn''t sound like there''s much that I can do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 17, 's_4de6ecbe', 'Please, oh please. You''ve got to help me! I''m desperate!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 18, 's_53686a92', 'Yes, I''m going to go rescue your family.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 19, 's_53fb3746', 'Don''t yell at me. I didn''t kidnap them.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 20, 's_545b2c24', 'Really? I would be forever grateful, but that''s a lot of money. Are you sure?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 21, 's_5a04437', 'Well, I don''t have the money to pay the ransom, and if I don''t pay, they said they would sell my wife and daughter into slavery. So I''m on my way to try and rescue them myself, although I don''t think that I''ll be able to put up a good fight.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 22, 's_5cdaed70', 'Yes, I am sure. [give 10000 credits]'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 23, 's_7c31a6a3', 'Can you show me where you think the cave is again?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 24, 's_7d7b9050', 'I''m a moisture farmer. And not even a very good one. I can''t help but think that if I was at home instead of checking the evaporators, this never would have happened.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 25, 's_7f1f06ba', 'Oh, hello. Yes, I did have a problem, but a very kind soul has already offered to help. Thank you very much, though.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 26, 's_8c9c92a', 'Alright. Good luck and be safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 27, 's_8e117483', 'You''re right. I''m sorry, but of course you realize why I''m upset.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 28, 's_91139d19', 'It''s my wife and daughter, they''re gone! I was out checking the moisture crop and when I got back to the house I found a note saying they''d been kidnapped! They''re being held for ransom!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 29, 's_916b0cc0', 'Sure. Here is the location of the cave where I think the brutes might be hiding. Now please save my family, and do be careful.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 30, 's_9930ca3d', 'How much is the ransom?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 31, 's_9e0bb613', 'Slow down. What''s the matter?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 32, 's_9ead1175', 'Oh well. Thanks anyway for offering. I guess there''s nothing left for me to do but go and try to rescue my wife and daughter myself.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 33, 's_a6faa65a', 'How much did you say the ransom was?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 34, 's_ab3e1351', 'Yes, hello. You are going to go rescue my wife and daughter are you not?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 35, 's_b394e1eb', 'No, I don''t. There were lots of tracks leading away from our house heading this way though. I think there might be a cave or something in this direction. They might be holed up in there.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 36, 's_b658a801', 'Sorry, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 37, 's_b7068b53', 'Calm down. Do you know who took your family?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 38, 's_ba7f35a5', 'Tell me what''s wrong.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 39, 's_bed5a497', 'The note says that I need to pay ten thousand credits. But I barely break even as a moisture farmer. I don''t have that kind of money!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 40, 's_c1d778b6', 'I will give you the ransom money.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 41, 's_c4fbf8c5', 'Calm down. Do you know where your family was taken?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 42, 's_c5196416', 'I don''t think I can help right now, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 43, 's_c6144200', 'Do you know who took your family?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 44, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 45, 's_cadf41fb', 'I guess I''ll have to go myself then. Wish me luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 46, 's_cdbae137', 'Sorry, I can''t help right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 47, 's_cf9c96f0', 'What can I do to help?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 48, 's_d5adc7c6', 'Actually, I''d rather go rescue your family for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 49, 's_da11deae', 'Hello! I wanted to thank you again for helping to rescue my family. We are all deeply indebted to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 50, 's_f26c1a9', 'Don''t you think I know that? My family has been kidnapped! The only two things in my life that I hold dear! Of course it''s terrible!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 51, 's_f4a9d6e8', 'Do you know where your family was taken?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 52, 's_f4d0be1e', 'Sorry, I can''t talk right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 53, 's_f7d18c26', 'Did you say you knew where your family was taken?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_farmer.stf', 54, 's_fb52d10a', 'I wish you the best of luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 3, 's_194db552', 'The Marks? Which one?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 4, 's_1bb3475f', 'I would like to learn about...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 5, 's_1bb7b1eb', 'I was curious to see who lived here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 6, 's_1f8abb5f', 'Return to me when you have proven the measure of your character.  An act of honor.  An act of intellect.  An act of courage.  An act of altruism.  Demonstrate to me these characteristics and I will bestow upon you the Mark of the Hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 7, 's_2a82993c', 'I see that you have returned, my child. What do you seek?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 8, 's_2a85c56b', 'I am able to watch after myself. These cold, lifeless walls do not disturb me any longer. Far too long have I lived here in solitude. I have become stoic to its effects.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 9, 's_2d0b6a', 'What do you philosophize about, old man?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 10, 's_342ec337', 'Travel the world.  Perform acts that demonstrate your heroism.  Through these actions you will be transformed.  A hero must be honorable, intelligent, courageous, and altruistic.  You must seek to help the world despite the cost.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 11, 's_48a263f0', 'Well met, traveler.  What brings you to my small and lonely abode?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 12, 's_48bfa35f', 'Yes, I am the hero you seek.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 13, 's_4fcf6919', 'Good. First, a small task for you to prove yourself worthy of my challenge...worthy of becoming a hero. Within the depths of this cave, there lies an item which has been stolen from my home by the vile creatures that live here. I need it to continue my studies. It is the skull of a squill. Find it, return to me, and I will present to you the ways in which you can become the Hero of Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 14, 's_503d468c', 'I would like more information about...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 15, 's_50c6e23d', 'The Mark of Honor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 16, 's_55937d94', 'You speak boldly, my friend. Dangerously, in fact. '),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 17, 's_579bac17', 'You have done great things in the name of the light.  I am honored to be in your presence.  Take my Mark of the Hero and let it remind you of your cause.  Do not forget why you fight.  Good luck, young warrior.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 18, 's_59283967', 'I see you bear the Marks of Courage, Honor, Intellect and Altruism! Can it be?  Have I found the one I have sought for so long?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 19, 's_599bebab', 'Go then.  One cannot become a hero by spending all day chatting with a crazed old man...and may the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 20, 's_5e7d1e16', 'You will gain the Mark of Courage by defeating a ferocious beast bent on terrorizing the world. Speak with the people of the cities of Tatooine. Perhaps they know of such a beast.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 21, 's_5ff9d2ec', 'You do not have the room in your inventory to receive all the items you need. Please free some room and speak to me again.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 22, 's_63076377', 'I see that you have returned. You have done well so far, but I sense that something is missing. Please allow me to fulfil that which you are owed.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 23, 's_6441a2a6', 'As you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 24, 's_66270434', 'I will seek to prove my character.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 25, 's_669b88aa', 'The Mark of Courage.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 26, 's_66fbfd08', 'It is my belief that the galaxy is in dire need of heroes--those individuals who have demonstrated beyond doubt their dedication to the path of light.  You are brash and young, but perhaps one day you will become a hero and bring light to this darkened place.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 27, 's_6cd88f7f', 'I wasn''t always an old man.  Many years ago, I won many a campaign against the forces of darkness.  I wore the symbol about my neck as a reminder of my cause.  I would pass this thing to the one I believe capable of continuing my work.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 28, 's_7abf0913', 'How do I prove that I am a hero?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 29, 's_7adceec5', 'Ah!  The hero returns!  It is good to see you are still well.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 30, 's_856de06c', 'Somewhere on this desert planet, strife between ranchers and pirates rages on. Seek them out, choose the correct path, and the Mark of Honor shall be bestowed upon you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 31, 's_8bfb7334', 'You speak truly.  The Empire rules ruthlessly and unjustly.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 32, 's_8cb1f35d', 'You will gain the Mark of Courage by defeating a ferocious beast bent of terrorizing the world. Speak with the people of the cities of Tatooine. Perhaps they know of such a beast.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 33, 's_8ecd39ce', 'What is the Mark of the Hero?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 34, 's_920f731c', 'The Mark of Intellect.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 35, 's_96a66dea', 'A noble intent, but intentions in the face of a challenge are as dust upon a Tatooine windstorm.  One must act and through one''s actions, one might be proven a hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 36, 's_96fd32c3', 'To attain the Mark of Altruism, you must selflessly help a soul in need. Somewhere, in the harsh desert heat, a farmer desperately cries out...in need of a hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 37, 's_9b634554', 'I wish to become a hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 38, 's_a5bd2f51', 'Go then. Seek the tasks which I have described for you. Return to me when you have completed them. Only then will you become the Hero of Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 39, 's_ab4620a6', 'It appears that your inventory is full. You must free some room before we proceed.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 40, 's_af540d0', 'I have the skull you are looking for.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 41, 's_b2929fdf', 'Merely an old man.  I keep to myself and tend my books.  I think.  I philosophize.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 42, 's_b6a019cf', 'The Mark of the Hero will only be granted to those who have completed acts of Intellect, Honor, Courage, and Altruism. When you feel you have completed such tasks, return to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 43, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 44, 's_bbb8e096', 'Excellent. You have proven yourself as worthy of my challenges. In order to deserve the Mark of the Hero, you must undergo four different tasks and gain the Marks of Courage, Honor, Intellect, and Altruism. Which task and mark would you like to learn about?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 45, 's_c6825098', 'Within the depths of this cave, there lies an item which has been stolen from my home by the vile creatures that live here. I need it to continue my studies. It is the skull of a squill. Find it, return to me, and I will present to you the ways in which you can become the Hero of Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 46, 's_cb535214', 'The Mark of Altruism.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 47, 's_cbb8634f', 'The Mark of the Hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 48, 's_cc62685c', 'Tell me about the squill skull again?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 49, 's_cd2c070a', 'I have returned from my journeys, my friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 50, 's_cf3b7067', 'I will do these things.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 51, 's_cfb883ed', 'I am well. Just seeing how the old man is.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 52, 's_d111fbf4', 'I will do this for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 53, 's_d22f1e74', 'I have no interest in bandying words with you, child.  Educate yourself and seek out enlightenment. Perhaps then we might have a civilized discussion.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 54, 's_d2a7ff43', 'Mind your manners, child.  I philosophize of the state of our worlds...of these dark times.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 55, 's_d38cc2cb', 'Pirates and criminals travel freely.  The Old Republic has been shattered.  The Jedi have been hunted to all but extinction.  Over all of this hangs the shadow of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 56, 's_d86dc24', 'I''m done. Thank you for the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 57, 's_da196589', 'Nevermind.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 58, 's_db6d4167', 'You should now have all the items that you have not yet received.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 59, 's_e0ab34b6', 'I am well. Yet, I am still here in this drafty old cave. It suits me well, I think. I must return to my meditation. Go forth and spread your wisdom throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 60, 's_e9bd97f9', 'Here? In this cave?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 61, 's_f013aca1', 'Yes, my friend?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 62, 's_f297414', 'Dark times? What do you know of dark times?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_hermit.stf', 63, 's_f9a4e3e3', 'In order to attain the Mark of Intellect, you must find one in need of your wisdom. Perhaps a bounty hunter needs assistance...or a puzzle needs to be solved somewhere in the galaxy. I beseech you to keep an eye out while traveling to the cities of Tatooine. You''ll find what you''re looking for there.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 3, 's_5e328776', 'Follow me. Let''s get you out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 4, 's_6441a2a6', 'As you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 5, 's_76752ac6', 'Who are you? Another one of those filthy pirates? Get away from me...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 6, 's_7d25e81f', 'Wait right here. I''ll come back for you in a moment.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 7, 's_877ce91a', 'OK. We''ll be right behind you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 8, 's_8892a744', 'Really? Oh I knew that someone would come to save us! What would you like us to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 9, 's_8beec89f', 'Follow me. I''ll lead you out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 10, 's_8de4e85c', 'I''ve been sent to rescue you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 11, 's_9fe4df0a', 'I''ve got better things to do with my time.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 12, 's_cd1765f7', 'OK. We''ll wait right here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 13, 's_d0294ce0', 'What would you like us to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 14, 's_d28e075c', 'I''m no pirate. I''m here to rescue you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 15, 's_da196589', 'Nevermind.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 16, 's_e72f8b74', 'No, please don''t go...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_mother.stf', 17, 's_ecd319b', 'Wait, wait. I''m sorry. You really don''t seem like one of those brutes.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 3, 's_256d8f99', 'Little skeptical, eh? I guess I don''t blame you. After all, we are pirates! Har, Har! Oh--the task, right. Some of our boys were looting a rancher''s house when he walked in. He and his wife are holding our boys captive. We want you to go and help them escape. Well, what do you think?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 4, 's_34bde7db', 'I guess I''ll help you out.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 5, 's_446af42e', 'First, what''s the task?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 6, 's_4575b29e', 'We''ll be in debt to you. That''s all we can offer. There might be some loot still left at the house.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 7, 's_48566ef9', 'What''s in it for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 8, 's_543c2619', 'You just made an old pirate happy. The location of the house is around here somewhere. I marked it on your map. Be careful. Them ranchers aren''t the nicest people in the galaxy. But then again, neither are we! HA HA! Oh, and don''t come looking for us. You won''t find us here. We pirates like to keep ourselves "on the go" if you know what I mean. Now, scram!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 9, 's_5a3d905f', 'Oh, is that so? Time to be taught a lesson. Boys!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 10, 's_7557e310', 'Whoa! Hold on! I give up! Whew... you''re pretty tough, my friend. In fact... you''d be the perfect person to help us in our little dilemma we''ve been facing. Right boys? Are you interested in a little task we have for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 11, 's_a6c6f57b', 'No! Die, fools!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 12, 's_abc7e09d', 'I think they deserved it. Nope, I won''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 13, 's_cacfa6a2', 'I guess I was mistaken. Boys, let''s show this peasant how real pirates plunder! Get ''em!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 14, 's_d57d668a', 'Yeah, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 15, 's_d9706ae2', 'Won''t help us? Boys, let''s teach this peasant a lesson for wasting our time.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 16, 's_da25a2d9', 'Bad deal. No, I won''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_pirate_leader.stf', 17, 's_e30e7484', 'Good. The rancher''s house is around this location. I''ve marked in on your map. Be quick about it. Oh, and don''t come looking for me after the deed is done. We pirates don''t stay in the same place for long.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 3, 's_18dbba11', 'Ugh! You''re so heartless! Get out of my house! I don''t need this right now!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 4, 's_1ecfff90', 'No, I have other things to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 5, 's_210b4c5b', 'Yes, I will!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 6, 's_2622df9f', 'You''re so nice! I--AHHH!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 7, 's_3220d628', 'How are they? Are they behaving? Thank you for helping me. I completely appreciate this.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 8, 's_37c0824f', 'Wait! I want to help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 9, 's_43f5726a', 'It''s you again! What do you want? Can''t you see I''m busy?!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 10, 's_50587782', 'You do? I''m so riled up I can hardly think straight. My husband has left to contact the authorities. I need to go calm down or I may do something drastic. Please, go down the stairs and keep an eye on those thugs for me. It would really help me out. Will you help me?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 11, 's_63f6701b', 'I can''t believe this! I am awed by your honor. Thank you so much for helping us! Oh, here comes my husband now! They''re going to take those nasty thugs away! Here, you really deserve this. I hope it will do you well.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 12, 's_6422820b', 'Go away!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 13, 's_7ee07d1c', 'I need to get myself calm. Please go downstairs and keep an eye out for escaping thugs.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 14, 's_82bd1b20', 'Who are you?! More of those thugs? I''ll lock you up like I did the rest of your friends! Get out!!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 15, 's_83da2e04', 'Thank you so much! There''s an intercom outside the room in which I''ve locked them up. They may try to coerce you into helping them. Just ignore them. I need to go relax for a minute...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 16, 's_84ee73da', 'Hold on! I''m not a thug or a pirate at all.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 17, 's_8ad6289', 'You really think so?! I''m so glad you noticed! I hope to win a house decorating contest this coming summer. I hope to get my home in the spotlight! Do you really think I''ll win?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 18, 's_abec95a3', 'I really think so!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 19, 's_aebcaa68', 'Really? Wait a second. I guess you don''t look like a pirate or a thug. I''m sorry. I''m so riled up I can hardly think straight. Look, I could use your help with this. My husband has left to contact the authorities. I need to go calm down or I may do something drastic. Please, go down the stairs and keep an eye on those thugs for me. It would really help me out.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 20, 's_b8584429', 'Being a rancer''s wife is hard work. I barely get any time for myself with what all the work I have to do. Oh well. As you can see, having a successful rancher as a husband has its perks! Do you like how I decorated the place? Ack! Look at the time... I really need to get back to work. Nice meeting you!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 21, 's_c5a33502', 'I''ll go keep an eye on them.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 22, 's_c74cdffb', 'I''m sorry. I''m having issues with pirates right now. Come back a little later. Maybe you can help me then. I really need to concentrate on the situation at hand...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 23, 's_e45adc31', 'I''d rather not get into this mess.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 24, 's_e83ad536', 'I''m sorry to disturb you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 25, 's_ea1b59c', 'They''re planning to break out as we speak!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 26, 's_f26b5d58', 'I''ll call the authorities on you!! Leave now!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 27, 's_f6c25472', 'Eep! Okay, bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_hero_of_tatooine_wife.stf', 28, 's_f74cb815', 'You know, you did a great job decorating this place.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_rebel_easy.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 's_1090e3ab', 'You too, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 's_116dbc9b', 'Are you serious?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 's_11eb3ca', 'You too!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 's_139ad943', 'TIE Fighters are menacing quadrant IV.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 's_1537650', 'Stay safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 's_16582dba', 'See you then!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 's_16f717c7', 'I am ready for duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 's_170b675c', 'Great! I look forward to returning here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 's_17536b20', 'Take care of yourself, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 's_18866b1f', 'Same here. Let me know if at any time you''d like orders from base command. The Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 's_1a78337', 'Let''s not be wasting time, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 's_1b97ed30', 'Good to see you again, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 's_1c862b5e', 'Stay safe, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 's_1d888221', 'Get more quest information.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 's_1e37c708', 'I guess so. You''ve done an excellent job. If you''re ever in the neighborhood - I can set you up with some missions at a decent pay rate.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 's_1e72f5f8', 'How can I be of service?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 's_1f7c77cd', 'The Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 's_201dcb2c', 'You''re right. And if nobody is there to clear those TIE patrols, our new pilots won''t fare very well. If you''d like I can assign you to patrol for long-range TIE patrols in quad IV.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 's_254c300d', 'Well, finish your business and get back to me as soon as you can. We need to keep those probes away from this outpost!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 's_2723fb62', 'True. They can''t be too heavily defended, can they? How do you feel about being re-assigned to transport protection duty?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 's_2a13170', 'Look, all probots must be destroyed.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 's_2eb41112', 'Good-bye, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 's_2ffec059', 'Stay safe, ma''am.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 's_342438b9', 'How''s it going?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 's_36142d2b', 'I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 's_3f1b5d3f', 'I can''t help right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 's_49c77b48', 'Well, we always need talented pilots to brave the Imperial onslaught!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 's_4d71aa70', 'You too, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 's_51b761c0', 'I, for one, cannot fight without faith... in something.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 's_525dad8e', 'We''d be happy to provide some work for you if you ever return. Just let me know!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 's_5602d6a5', 'Our supply lines need more protection.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 's_5802a59d', 'Good-bye, ma''am.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 's_58432c68', 'Hey there. What''s happening?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 's_59087c6e', 'Well, it''s about time I got a promotion.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 's_5cf59b4a', 'I''m looking for a challenge.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 's_6074dcc9', 'Probots are still a problem in quad IV.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 's_615f324e', 'Actually, I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 's_63e686c1', 'Well - we''re going to need this done as soon as possible. Please let me know when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 's_653ab907', 'Great! Intercept friendly transports in this quadrant and escort them to quad I - and make sure they all jump out safely!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 's_665d84b0', 'Good! The Alliance is always looking for able-bodied pilots. Let me know if you''re interested in flying for us.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 's_67c1a3c3', 'Unfortunately, I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 's_6b65d95', 'What can I do for you, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 's_6d3b2601', 'Hey! Alliance HQ has new orders for you. Looks like you''ve been transferred to Reeda Bluewater''s command. Congratulations.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 's_6e06ed41', 'Yeah, but we already have people who handle that.. Are you saying you want me to assign you to TIE fighter search and destroy duty in quadrant IV?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 's_6e9aa5a0', 'At the moment, we are most concerned about long-range TIE patrols that are showing up at the upper-edge of quad IV. Patrol this region in search of TIE craft... and destroy each and every one of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 's_74010e27', 'Nah. I''m not coming back here.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 's_74d6040c', 'No, I am not a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 's_75699acd', 'Probably, but they''re certainly not as common as they used to be. I can re-assign you temporarily to a sweep-and-clear job at the upper edge of quad IV if you''d like...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 's_75a599ec', 'This is true. If you''d like, I can have you assigned to this region again. Although I do think the problem has gotten much better, - and we could really use you on the transport route. Are you sure you want to clear quad IV of probots?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 's_78bcdcf6', 'See you then, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 's_796eb235', 'In that case, I should tell you about the pirate attacks on our heavy deep-space freighters. Several important weapon supply lines run through the asteroid field in quadrant II. Pirates have sniffed it out and now we''re losing half a dozen transports every week.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 's_82b273a8', 'Suit yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 's_84a11719', 'Outstanding. I''ll upload the navigation package to your ship. The Force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 's_84e1d1bc', 'I''m ready for action.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 's_8693f72c', 'Good luck. I''ll upload the navigation package to your ship right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 's_894f192b', 'I''m requesting orders to patrol qadrant IV.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 's_89b72435', 'Thanks. Good-bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 's_8bc0699c', 'I can''t do this now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 's_8f878421', 'Can I be assigned to probot duty?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 's_90fc8440', 'I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 's_95f5718c', 'How can I best serve the Alliance?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 's_962df3c0', 'I want to pursue more Interdiction duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 's_967bf166', 'I am Humbek, the Alliance flight coordinator. I work with new recruits - get them into space, and give them a part to play in the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 's_9a133a37', 'TIE Fighter patrols are still giving us grief, commander.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 's_9beeb96c', 'That won''t be necessary.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 's_9c1466ca', 'That''s honorable. A real thankless job.. you have to inspect all transports to root out Imperial spies.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 's_a081a078', 'Get more quest info.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 's_a2fc624a', 'Take care of yourself, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 's_a83c3d32', 'Sir! Yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 's_aca51392', 'Honestly, I don''t believe in this Force nonsense.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 's_ae492561', 'I guess so. But it really seems like a waste of talent to have you sweeping probots in quad IV instead of protecting supply lines or running interdiction dutyl. Are you sure you want to clear the area of probots?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 's_bacdd03c', 'Additional quest information.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 's_c08b1382', 'What can I do for the Alliance today?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 's_c1013aa7', 'Whatever.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 's_c1edf4f', 'What sort of part would I play?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 's_c2db6878', 'Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 's_c4762a08', 'I''d bet you want to be one, though! Everyone wants to fly starfighters for the Alliance! Just let me know when you''re interested in some training and I''ll get it taken care of.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 's_c648ac95', 'I guess word is getting around. The rumors are true - fleet action is definitely heating up.  We can use you. Are you ready to launch?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 's_cba5214a', 'Recent pilot transfers have left the Corellian transport route somewhat vulnerable. I''d like to assign you to protection duty along this supply route. Meet up with Alliance transports, and ensure their safety as they push through Corellia space.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 's_cc569d6f', 'What is this place?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 's_ccfcfa6f', 'Those supply transports still need protection.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 's_d0c0c6b', 'I guess so. Seems like a waste of talent, but if you''d like I can assign you to transport duty along the Corellian supply route.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 's_d2722119', 'Excellent! Intercept transports anywhere along the convoy line. Inspect them. Let the Rebel ships go - and disintegrate the Imperials. The Force be with you, friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 's_d2b76d1', 'I have enjoyed working with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 's_d623f2e5', 'That''s good news. We''re short-handed in quadrant IV. Imperial probots are raining down on us. This is a definite sign of fleet action... and, at the moment, all we can do is try to keep them blind. We need you to patrol quad IV and destroy any probot you encounter.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 's_d6cd8f5b', 'Well, I have word that the Empire is attempting to insert spy ships in our supply convoy. They''re disguised as transports... blending easily with the legitimate Alliance craft. We need someone to inspect transports and eliminate any undercover Imperials they find.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 's_dd95d118', 'I appreciate that. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 's_de131dac', 'Yes I am a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 's_e037a4ee', 'This is the Rebel HQ in orbit above Corellia. You''re obviously part of the Alliance - or you would have been shot dead by now. And I''m also guessing you''re a pilot...?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 's_e12d7cb1', 'I hoped you''d say something like that! I''ll upload a nav package to your ship. Rescue any disabled Rebel freighters you find along the route.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 's_e90efb5f', 'Well, let me know as soon as you are free. Maintaining our chief supply route is critical and we could really use the help.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 's_efc3891a', 'I still think the TIE fighter patrols are an issue.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 's_eff1c76c', 'How are you, my friend?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 's_f1d613dd', 'Let me at ''em.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 's_f323f799', 'See you then, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 's_f69aa3a8', 'Thank you! Take care of yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 's_f6c52e55', 'Take care.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 's_fa27d75e', 'I''ll protect our transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 's_fc12045e', 'Excellent. Would you be willing to tour quadrant IV and eliminate Imperial probe droids that have been pouring into this system?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 's_fd20ae06', 'Additional quest info.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 's_ffe8fcc8', 'I would like to fly for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_ship_imperial.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 3, 's_14aaf93d', 'Are you ready to take command of your Star Destroyer, now?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 4, 's_244895bc', 'TIE Interceptor'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 5, 's_31fc03a8', 'Sorry, I think I''m in the wrong place.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 6, 's_3a362bd6', 'Pilot! Report!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 7, 's_4c76a3f0', 'I''m sorry, but I cannot help you. There is no civilian business aboard the space station. I''d advise you to leave, my friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 8, 's_578cba1', 'This is wartime, Pilot. Put your emotions aside. Now, are you ready to sign in?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 9, 's_5d18271d', 'TIE Advanced'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 10, 's_5e865634', 'Done. Here''s your starship keycard. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 11, 's_5f1e2428', 'I swear - I didn''t mean to come here. In fact, can you direct me to a transport? I really must be going, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 12, 's_6a70a479', 'Directly behind you. Be quick...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 13, 's_6b65d95', 'What can I do for you, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 14, 's_6e8fe246', 'Threatening me, eh? You''d get out of here if you knew what was good for you!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 15, 's_77d62be0', 'Sir! I am ready for my ship assignment, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 16, 's_7bb9cd35', 'Hm. That''s interesting... This is a military recruiting station, my friend! You don''t get here by mistake!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 17, 's_7e996dfd', 'That''s it! I don''t want to see you here again! Get back on the shuttle and get off of this base or I will call the MP''s and have you tossed out of an airlock!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 18, 's_8d16305a', 'Sorry, sir! I apologize. I''m just nervous.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 19, 's_9177e268', 'I advise you to make it fast, Pilot. The war waits for no one.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 20, 's_919e66c4', 'I see. What sort of ship do you think you''ll need, then?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 21, 's_9e3acb05', 'Outstanding, Pilot! How much will you donate to your Empire?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 22, 's_a095b54f', 'Actually, I have some business to attend to before I can sign in.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 23, 's_a83c3d32', 'Sir! Yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 24, 's_ac02bc4c', 'Look! Get out of here, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 25, 's_bebfdbe9', 'What do you want, now?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 26, 's_bf0b73d6', 'TIE Sentinel'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 27, 's_c460e647', 'Outstanding! What equipment will you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 28, 's_daffa30b', 'Oh really? Why don''t you just back off!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 29, 's_dcd8623e', 'Sir! I would like to donate to the war effort. My last act as a civilian... sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 30, 's_e228175b', 'TIE Fighter'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 31, 's_e68165ba', 'TIE Defender'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 32, 's_f1bd17f2', 'Sir! I am ready for my assignment, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_imperial.stf', 33, 's_f9585f15', 'Gimme a TIE-Fighter!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_ship_rebel.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 3, 's_13e02273', 'Z-95 Headhunter'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 4, 's_159911f5', 'Tell me more.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 5, 's_248053ce', 'I want to join the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 6, 's_2bf47aa', 'Excellent. The Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 7, 's_3af0ea69', 'Any news to speak of?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 8, 's_40daf62', 'Then, keep your mouth shut about the operation. Stay close. Let me know when you''re ready to fly.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 9, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 10, 's_5e865634', 'Done. Here''s your starship keycard. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 11, 's_6d4ad708', 'Takes a lot of guts to fly for the Alliance, my friend. Do you expect me to believe you''re ready... just like that?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 12, 's_7971c070', 'IMPERIAL SECRET DRY DOCK'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 13, 's_869babb1', 'QUEST 02 SUMMARY. WANT IT?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 14, 's_8c8023e8', 'QUEST 03 SUMMARY. WANT IT?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 15, 's_8c832f88', 'I am ready for my ship assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 16, 's_8d00c343', 'NPC INFO'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 17, 's_8e631419', 'Y-Wing'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 18, 's_954b1961', 'X-Wing'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 19, 's_97b1a69', 'PLAYER IS ON MISSION.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 20, 's_98b7335a', 'QUEST 01 SUMMARY. WANT IT?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 21, 's_a4c56130', 'BASIC LOCATION INFO.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 22, 's_a560e84c', 'I am looking for work.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 23, 's_b1655983', 'QUEST INFO.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 24, 's_b4adb823', 'MISSION IS COMPLETE. HOW DID IT GO?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 25, 's_c478ce87', 'Tell me about yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 26, 's_cc1aa266', 'B-Wing'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 27, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 28, 's_dde9987c', 'GREETING.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 29, 's_e162b5ee', 'A-Wing'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 30, 's_e45f3234', 'Greetings, Pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 31, 's_eafe8f5e', 'SELONIAN SEPARATISTS VS REBEL SUPPLY CNV'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 32, 's_ee9092a0', 'What does your mission require?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_rebel.stf', 33, 's_fc91ea69', 'ROGUE CORSEC VS TALUSIAN MERCHANTS'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quest_ship_smuggler.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 3, 's_160bdc1c', 'Hutt Devastator'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 4, 's_203aa348', 'Look, I''m sorry. I''m new around here and I got kinda nervous. Will you help me find some work?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 5, 's_2401ede8', 'I''m new here. Looking for work... whatever you need done.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 6, 's_2b30f56', 'What do you know about the pirate ace Kott Gars?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 7, 's_30a96992', 'Heh. Good smugglers generally don''t go around bragging about how they''re big-time smugglers, do they? Good smugglers keep a low profile. So, grow up will ya? What can I do to speed you on your way?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 8, 's_512ba759', 'I''d like to ask you some questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 9, 's_55ab3705', 'I know you were once married to the pirate ace Kott Gars. I know he left you here - injured... and that you made friends with the Hutts.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 10, 's_67ade299', 'Gimme a break, lady. How about setting me up with a starship so I can get out of your hair?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 11, 's_74925e77', 'Hutt Scarab'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 12, 's_7718ed43', 'Well, pick your poison...'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 13, 's_85be3317', 'A smuggler. Just like you, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 14, 's_8becc67e', 'Nobody. Forget it.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 15, 's_8ca80840', 'Tell me about yourself?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 16, 's_8dc2800e', 'E-Wing'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 17, 's_95095dca', 'What do you want to know?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 18, 's_960dbcdf', 'You mean you don''t recognize me? I''m a major smuggler around here!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 19, 's_9fdd7cf3', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 20, 's_a1ca1166', 'Your lies stink, kid. I''d say you''d be wise not to rely on your wits. So why don''t we set you up with a fast ship, then?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 21, 's_a8ff14ff', 'What do you know about deep space pilots in the Outer Rim?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 22, 's_acb2bff2', 'I know there''s a lot of them... most of them smell bad, and you can''t trust any them. What''s the matter did a deep space pilot threaten you or something?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 23, 's_add31f19', 'I need a starship.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 24, 's_b2c34bd4', 'Thrilling. Can you fly?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 25, 's_b6715881', 'Heh. Look - if you still wanna get to know me after you''re through proving yourself to the Hutts, then fine. I''ll be here. Until then, let''s keep this on a business level, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 26, 's_bb5254e1', 'Oh you do, huh? You KNOW this? How do you KNOW any of this?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 27, 's_bf2e9dcd', 'Consider yourself forgotten, buddy.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 28, 's_c69b4483', 'Sunflare Cruiser'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 29, 's_ca582823', 'Get rid of me? Lady - I''m the best thing that''s ever happened to this run-down excuse for a pirate base!'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 30, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 31, 's_dfbfdcbe', 'Oh yeah! I recognize you. What do I have to do to get rid of you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 32, 's_e125f8e1', 'Big surprise. What kind?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 33, 's_e4fd9825', 'Done. Here''s your starship keycard. Don''t go getting yourself killed, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 34, 's_eceba92b', 'Ha! Ha! Well, I like you''re style, kid! Loud, boastful and completely ignorant! You''re tailor-made for the smuggler''s life! What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 35, 's_f507e1a8', 'ST-52'),
('string/en/conversation/quest_ship_smuggler.stf', 36, 's_f52fac53', 'Nothing! Who said I knew anything about Kott, anyhow? What sort of nerf-herders are you running with these days?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quharek_phase_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 3, 's_15c7f70f', 'Thanks for helping out with the defenses.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 4, 's_212d314f', 'The overall project'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 5, 's_261bbc0d', 'What would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 6, 's_2a94bc85', 'Refined Endrine'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 7, 's_36cd5966', 'Reinforced Wall Module'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 8, 's_39019ea3', 'I''d like to know about the quality of the ingredients people are giving.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 9, 's_4ccd023a', 'Which ingredient would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 10, 's_4f68f375', 'That''s no problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 11, 's_574683dc', 'Small Turret'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 12, 's_6f1f7b10', 'I''m sorry you can''t help out. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 13, 's_87a5e151', 'Refined Ardanium II'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 14, 's_955b2ddb', 'I hear you''re looking for crafters.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 15, 's_99347a8f', 'Yes, I''d like to help out.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 16, 's_a1a54741', 'I was, but I''ve got plenty of people helping me at the moment. Perhaps you should see if someone else needs assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 17, 's_a489b2f6', 'The overall project.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 18, 's_a9474f4a', 'Ok. You should know that if you help out with the defenses, you won''t be able to do any other work here in the village until later. Is that ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 19, 's_baf57f52', 'I''d like to get the status of the village defenses.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 20, 's_bc2ccc0e', 'There is no crafting project currently being run. Please come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 21, 's_c1dac897', 'How may I help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 22, 's_c57c793', 'I''d like to know about the amount of ingredients people are giving.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 23, 's_ca02afa6', 'Refined Rudic'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 24, 's_cf89ace1', 'Yes, we need people to help create defenses for the village. You''ll need to contribute at least %DI ingredients to the project. If you do, it will help you gain insight into how the Force can be used to improve your crafting technique. We''re also giving awards to whoever brings the most or best ingredients. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 25, 's_da07ca0e', 'Thanks for helping out with the defenses. You can still supply more ingredients if you''d like.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 26, 's_e0c642e', 'Excellent! The binary load lifter droid QT-QC has the schematics you''ll need for the project. You''ll also give it the ingredients you make. You can check the status of the defenses and how well you''re contributing to the project at any time. May the Force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 27, 's_e25e215d', 'No, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 28, 's_ef01f5ee', 'Yes, but I''m afraid you don''t have the even the most basic skills needed to help out. Perhaps you should see if someone else needs assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 29, 's_f9d5461c', 'Oh. Maybe I''d better do something else then.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_2.stf', 30, 's_ff02a401', 'I''d like to see the project''s current attributes.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quharek_phase_3.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 3, 's_10aecfa1', 'Regulator'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 4, 's_1ccf69c4', 'Shield Connections'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 5, 's_212d314f', 'The overall project'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 6, 's_261bbc0d', 'What would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 7, 's_39019ea3', 'I''d like to know about the quality of the ingredients people are giving.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 8, 's_4ccd023a', 'Which ingredient would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 9, 's_4f68f375', 'That''s no problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 10, 's_6c81c99f', 'Yes, we need people to help create energy shields for the village. You''ll need to contribute at least %DI ingredients to the project. If you do, it will help you gain insight into how the Force can be used to improve your crafting experimentation. We''re also giving awards to whoever brings the most or best ingredients. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 11, 's_6f1f7b10', 'I''m sorry you can''t help out. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 12, 's_75024256', 'Unit Computer'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 13, 's_955b2ddb', 'I hear you''re looking for crafters.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 14, 's_99347a8f', 'Yes, I''d like to help out.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 15, 's_a1a54741', 'I was, but I''ve got plenty of people helping me at the moment. Perhaps you should see if someone else needs assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 16, 's_a489b2f6', 'The overall project.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 17, 's_a9474f4a', 'Ok. You should know that if you help out with the defenses, you won''t be able to do any other work here in the village until later. Is that ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 18, 's_b200fa3f', 'Shield Housing'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 19, 's_bc2ccc0e', 'There is no crafting project currently being run. Please come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 20, 's_be53a473', 'Thanks for helping out with the shields. You can still supply more ingredients if you''d like.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 21, 's_c1dac897', 'How may I help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 22, 's_c266e38f', 'I''d like to get the status of the village shields.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 23, 's_c57c793', 'I''d like to know about the amount of ingredients people are giving.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 24, 's_c61bebb1', 'Power Supply');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 25, 's_e0c642e', 'Excellent! The binary load lifter droid QT-QC has the schematics you''ll need for the project. You''ll also give it the ingredients you make. You can check the status of the defenses and how well you''re contributing to the project at any time. May the Force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 26, 's_e25e215d', 'No, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 27, 's_e9fef768', 'Primary Computer'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 28, 's_ed69bd0c', 'Thanks for helping out with the shields.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 29, 's_ef01f5ee', 'Yes, but I''m afraid you don''t have the even the most basic skills needed to help out. Perhaps you should see if someone else needs assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 30, 's_f580c83d', 'Endrost Alloy'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 31, 's_f9d5461c', 'Oh. Maybe I''d better do something else then.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_3.stf', 32, 's_ff02a401', 'I''d like to see the project''s current attributes.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (quharek_phase_4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 3, 's_1fcf4289', 'Good! I am glad we have had some small part in your self-realization and growth. One of the greatest things a sapient can do on their path of life is to enhance the well being of other sapient beings.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 4, 's_30920b89', 'It''s going well. I have learned a lot.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 5, 's_3a5501aa', 'Perhaps your ''self-realization and growth'' wasn''t as pronounced as it could have been. Good wishes to you friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 6, 's_46847c8d', 'Wow, that''s pretty sappy!'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 7, 's_4909db59', 'Personally, I''d be happier if you directed that assistance to others not in this camp. We tend to do ok for ourselves even out in the desolate wilderness. There are those that are still far more in need of help than us.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 8, 's_55ff471a', 'No. Our new Chief engineer is handling all new crafting tasks.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 9, 's_8a61b230', 'I agree. I hope I can return the favor someday.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 10, 's_c3af3465', 'Hi. How go things?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 11, 's_c9211a00', 'Do you have any other tasks for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 12, 's_cae55dfb', 'Along the South wall near the sensor array. Good luck to you friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/quharek_phase_4.stf', 13, 's_f3f4fde4', 'Where can I find the Chief engineer?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (racing_agrilat.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 3, 's_145d0a85', 'Give me another moment.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 4, 's_1736e216', 'Tell me about this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 5, 's_1cd82216', 'Get ready... I''ll start the timer when you say go!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 6, 's_1e9a4eea', 'Greetings, I''m the coordinator for the Agrilat Swamp circuit. If you''d like to race the track, just let me know. How may I serve you today?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 7, 's_2492930f', 'I''d like to see who holds the current record for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 8, 's_2528fad7', 'GO!!!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 9, 's_262e8687', 'Uhh, wait a minute.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 10, 's_27aa48e0', 'Oh dear, such a drastic measure but sometimes a fresh start can be invigorating. I am here to serve. I must warn you this will PERMANENTLY remove your best time and I will forget we''ve ever met. Are you CERTAIN you wish to do this?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 11, 's_31168968', 'I am CERTAIN I want to PERMANENTLY erase my best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 12, 's_371b3f4', 'Displaying current data...'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 13, 's_48072ab3', 'Welcome back! How may I serve you?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 14, 's_4aa68942', 'Aborting race as requested.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 15, 's_4b4fb2b7', 'A series of waypoints will appear one after the other. Head to each waypoint as quickly as possible. When you arrive back here, talk to me again and I''ll register your last time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 16, 's_4c21202f', 'As you wish. I have made no changes to my records.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 17, 's_5014ede5', 'WAIT. I don''t want to erase me best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 18, 's_59d4e0ee', 'I''d like to PERMANENTLY ERASE my personal best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 19, 's_6441a2a6', 'As you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 20, 's_6a5b9858', 'The clock is ticking, get moving!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 21, 's_838e4ffb', 'I''d like to see my best time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 22, 's_891e1f6', 'Race completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 23, 's_8bc77434', 'Nice speaking with you again anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 24, 's_abd9745d', 'Displaying data.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 25, 's_b2acc217', 'And they''re off!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 26, 's_c0918d6', 'No hurry. Let me know when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 27, 's_d24f3595', 'That''s the spirit! Just say go when you want me to begin the timer. Good luck and may the force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 28, 's_d459b94a', 'Accessing data...'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 29, 's_d900d1be', 'I need to abort this race.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 30, 's_dffdee4b', 'I''d like to give this track a try.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 31, 's_e460e3d3', 'How do I race?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 32, 's_ed644123', 'I''d like to race this track again.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 33, 's_f6b2a28e', 'This dangerous course was used for illegal races many years ago. Hot springs, deadly updrafts and sharp crystalline underbrush make it a particularly hazardous course. Until recently, there haven''t been many races since the near-death of a swoop jockey named Dengar. If memory serves, it was a very exciting match between him and someone called Solo.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 34, 's_f9faa915', 'Very well. I am erasing your personal best time now... Oh hello, I don''t believe we''ve met before!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_agrilat.stf', 35, 's_fbd55d9d', 'I don''t need anything right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (racing_keren.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 3, 's_145d0a85', 'Give me another moment.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 4, 's_1736e216', 'Tell me about this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 5, 's_1cd82216', 'Get ready... I''ll start the timer when you say go!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 6, 's_2492930f', 'I''d like to see who holds the current record for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 7, 's_2528fad7', 'GO!!!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 8, 's_262e8687', 'Uhh, wait a minute.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 9, 's_27aa48e0', 'Oh dear, such a drastic measure but sometimes a fresh start can be invigorating. I am here to serve. I must warn you this will PERMANENTLY remove your best time and I will forget we''ve ever met. Are you CERTAIN you wish to do this?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 10, 's_31168968', 'I am CERTAIN I want to PERMANENTLY erase my best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 11, 's_371b3f4', 'Displaying current data...'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 12, 's_46163ea3', 'Greetings, I''m the coordinator for the Keren Street Race. If you''d like to race the track, just let me know. How may I serve you today?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 13, 's_48072ab3', 'Welcome back! How may I serve you?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 14, 's_4aa68942', 'Aborting race as requested.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 15, 's_4b4fb2b7', 'A series of waypoints will appear one after the other. Head to each waypoint as quickly as possible. When you arrive back here, talk to me again and I''ll register your last time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 16, 's_4c21202f', 'As you wish. I have made no changes to my records.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 17, 's_5014ede5', 'WAIT. I don''t want to erase me best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 18, 's_59d4e0ee', 'I''d like to PERMANENTLY ERASE my personal best time.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 19, 's_6441a2a6', 'As you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 20, 's_6a5b9858', 'The clock is ticking, get moving!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 21, 's_838e4ffb', 'I''d like to see my best time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 22, 's_891e1f6', 'Race completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 23, 's_8bc77434', 'Nice speaking with you again anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 24, 's_abd9745d', 'Displaying data.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 25, 's_b2acc217', 'And they''re off!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 26, 's_ba9eff79', 'This circuit will take you winding through the narrow bridges and streets of Keren and it is favored by the more technically minded racer. Focusing more on finesse then it does raw speed this course will definately challenge your racing skills. Due to the danger street racing poses to pedestrians, the RSF does not approve of this activity so participation is at your own risk.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 27, 's_c0918d6', 'No hurry. Let me know when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 28, 's_d24f3595', 'That''s the spirit! Just say go when you want me to begin the timer. Good luck and may the force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 29, 's_d459b94a', 'Accessing data...'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 30, 's_d900d1be', 'I need to abort this race.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 31, 's_dffdee4b', 'I''d like to give this track a try.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 32, 's_e460e3d3', 'How do I race?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 33, 's_ed644123', 'I''d like to race this track again.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 34, 's_f9faa915', 'Very well. I am erasing your personal best time now... Oh hello, I don''t believe we''ve met before!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_keren.stf', 35, 's_fbd55d9d', 'I don''t need anything right now.'),
