('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 26, 's_cea50112', 'If the information in my databanks are accurate, during the last decades of the Old Republic podraces were run on this track. The series was formed and controlled by the Hutts many years ago. Following the decline of podracing''s popularity, this track was more or less abandoned by the Hutts. It was eventually taken over by a small band of swoop racers, who used it to stage a regular series of semi-legitimate races.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 27, 's_d24f3595', 'That''s the spirit! Just say go when you want me to begin the timer. Good luck and may the force be with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 28, 's_d459b94a', 'Accessing data...'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 29, 's_d900d1be', 'I need to abort this race.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 30, 's_dffdee4b', 'I''d like to give this track a try.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 31, 's_e0de16cc', 'Greetings, I''m the race coordinator for the old Mos Espa Circuit. If you''d like to race the track, just let me know. How may I serve you today?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 32, 's_e460e3d3', 'How do I race?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_mosespa.stf', 33, 's_ed644123', 'I''d like to race this track again.'),
