('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 12, 's_3a139108', 'Greetings, I''m the coordinator for the Narmle Memorial Rally. If you''d like to race the track, just let me know. How may I serve you today?'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 13, 's_48072ab3', 'Welcome back! How may I serve you?'),
