('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 15, 's_4b4fb2b7', 'A series of waypoints will appear one after the other. Head to each waypoint as quickly as possible. When you arrive back here, talk to me again and I''ll register your last time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 16, 's_4c21202f', 'As you wish. I have made no changes to my records.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 17, 's_5014ede5', 'WAIT. I don''t want to erase me best time.'),
