('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 19, 's_6441a2a6', 'As you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 20, 's_6a5b9858', 'The clock is ticking, get moving!'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 21, 's_6ea32c0e', 'Legends say that this track retraces the route used by local smuggler, Trein Veltin as he tried to elude authorities intent on his arrest. Weaving through the streets desperately trying to lose his pursuers he made it out of the city. Unfortunately his escape was cut short due to a fatal collision with a flesh eating chuba. Since that time many have made the run in his memory. Eventually it became a semi-formal track for a thoroughly illegal street race. '),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 22, 's_838e4ffb', 'I''d like to see my best time for this track.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 23, 's_891e1f6', 'Race completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 24, 's_8bc77434', 'Nice speaking with you again anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 25, 's_abd9745d', 'Displaying data.'),
('string/en/conversation/racing_narmle.stf', 26, 's_b2acc217', 'And they''re off!'),
