('string/en/conversation/static_quests_record_keeper_tatooine.stf', 37, 's_f51b07ff', 'What kind of questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/static_quests_record_keeper_tatooine.stf', 38, 's_ff20b1f1', 'Yes, please reset my employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_corellia.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 3, 's_108cc9eb', 'There are four starports available to a ship of your class, %TU.  Please indicate your destination.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 4, 's_1270fff5', 'Copy that. Awaiting navigation data.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 5, 's_13071055', 'Roger, %TU.  We are a fully functional station and can provide you with whatever level of repairs that are necessary.  Please indicate your status.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 6, 's_19bf16ff', 'Doaba Guerfel Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 7, 's_1bbaf71f', 'Roger that, %TU.  Please clear the area for other traffic.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 8, 's_1d1ea6ae', 'This assignment is critical! We cannot allow the cloak leader to escape. Now get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 9, 's_206f187d', 'Failure does not become you, pilot. This will go in your permanent record.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 10, 's_229f6f26', 'I''m not sure I''m comfortable with that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 11, 's_23058f01', 'Great work, pilot. Under the circumstances things went as well as could be expected. Since the Cloak leader was destroyed, I don''t think the remaining forces will be much of a threat. Here is your final extended mission pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 12, 's_26f0c6f6', 'Repairs complete!  You are clear to leave CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 13, 's_28d56475', 'Affirmative, %TU.  Repairing half your current damage will cost %DI credits. Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 14, 's_2b28cd2', 'This is against my better judgement, but I guess I have no choice. We''ve got to try and run this operation again. Hopefully better this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 15, 's_2b40f4fd', 'Excellent work, pilot. I''ll transfer your extended mission pay now. The Cloak officer is on his way to the interrogation base now. Hopefully we''ll get some more answers as to who these pirates are and what they''re after.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 16, 's_2dc4697a', '(Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 17, 's_2dfdd4ae', 'Greetings, pilot. Please go to CorSec secure channel 37 Alpha.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 18, 's_2f3c1bdc', 'Copy that, %TU.  CorSec station out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 19, 's_2f8c6a62', '25% of your ship damage has been fixed. Please clear the area for other traffic.  CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 20, 's_31b2918b', 'Tyrena Starport (Rebel Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 21, 's_31b93be', 'Pilot, we''ve got a special assignment for you. We''ve received a distress call on emergency channels. A freighter was attacked by an unknown group of ships. We need you to go assist with repairs and investigate the situation.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 22, 's_35836858', 'Secure channel open. Go ahead, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 23, 's_370822d1', 'Yes'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 24, 's_37b5c504', 'Repair half the damage'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 25, 's_383d79b3', 'Nevermind'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 26, 's_4490cfae', 'Alright. Get back out there and investigate the situation. Let''s not have a repeat of the last operation, ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 27, 's_453e4f7d', '(Explain Cloak Communication)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 28, 's_457a7010', 'No'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 29, 's_4a546bbb', 'Funds received, %TU... Repairs complete.  You are clear to leave the station.  CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 30, 's_4e134be8', 'Alright, but don''t let this become a habit.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 31, 's_4f83609d', 'Good job, pilot. Going undercover isn''t for everyone, and now there''s at least one less Cloak ship in the system. Here is your extended mission pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 32, 's_504294eb', 'You have entered CorSec space in the Corellia System.  Please identify yourself, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 33, 's_51cc9a48', 'Requesting secure channel 37 Alpha.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 34, 's_52917b0d', 'Of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 35, 's_58263150', 'I cannot help now. Please reassign this mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 36, 's_5a29d93f', 'Meet with the representative if you want to go undercover. However, if you change your mind and want to go the direct route, just destroy his ship. '),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 37, 's_5e10bea5', 'Of course. Awaiting tracking data.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 38, 's_5f4e62c9', 'Understood. I am in need of repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 39, 's_61071474', 'Repair all of the damage'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 40, 's_6223506b', 'That sounds like a good plan.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 41, 's_63ccb695', 'Tyrena Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 42, 's_652d249e', 'If you were to meet with this Cloak representative and mislead him to believe that you are going to betray CorSec, we might be able to get some information about the inner workings and rankings of the Cloaks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 43, 's_6926e8ad', 'Ackowledged. Find and eliminate the Cloak attack wings.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 44, 's_6c23a697', 'You were right to come to us with this, pilot. It is good to see that your loyalty to CorSec is unwavering. However, this does present a unique opportunity to go undercover with the cloaks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 45, 's_7023f204', 'CorSec Command is impressed, pilot. That went off without a hitch. We will get to work tracking down how this information was leaked, and who leaked it. Here is your extended mission pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 46, 's_71a60205', 'As you wish, %TU.  Please clear the area for other traffic.  CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 47, 's_71e0fb8', 'I am. Awaiting data transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 48, 's_77e48d5b', 'What do you mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 49, 's_7defec52', 'Secure channel open.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 50, 's_7e77cbe2', 'I would like to land'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 51, 's_7f59cc25', 'CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 52, 's_82701bb4', 'Repair most of the damage'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 53, 's_835e1db9', 'Since you are interested, we do have an elective duty assignment for you. You''ve done a good job eliminating the Cloak sect in this system. Now the survivors have fled and are trying to regroup. We need you to get to the Dathomir system and eliminate the remnants. Will you accept this mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 54, 's_851eb5fa', 'Disregard'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 55, 's_87bb06cf', 'You have entered CorSec space in the Corellia System.  Please identify yourself and state your business.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 56, 's_8bd9c726', 'Do you have any assignments for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 57, 's_8eddcaf7', 'You have entered CorSec space in the Corellia System.  Please identify yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 58, 's_903180db', 'CorSec command will contact the freighter and have them hyperspace out as soon as the Cloak attack ships start to come in. We will send an attack squadron there to ambush them.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 59, 's_9288900f', 'I understand.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 60, 's_942f251f', 'As a matter of fact, we do have an elective duty assignment for you. Ever since we''ve uncovered this Cloak sect, small attack wings have been popping up everywhere. We need you to go out and destroy them. Will you accept this mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 61, 's_9624c26b', 'Get out there and capture the Cloak officer. Hurry we don''t have much time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 62, 's_99824a76', 'Roger, %TU.  For a fee of %DI credits we''ll repair just enough to get you underway.  Please confirm.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 63, 's_9bd6e8c6', 'This is top priority, pilot. Intelligence tells us that the leader of the Cloak sect will be passing through the sector very soon. We need you to intercept, disable, and upload your autopilot override program to his ship. Hopefully capturing this villain will squelch any further Cloak activity in this sector.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 64, 's_9be6fb53', 'Received, %TU.  Half of your ship damage has been fixed.  You are clear to leave the area.  CorSec station, out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 65, 's_a4e56782', 'So you''ve decided to go undercover? You are to be commended. Not many pilots would be so brave. There''s not much to do now but wait until the Cloaks contact you. In the meantime, here is your extended mission pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 66, 's_a5591c27', 'I accept this mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 67, 's_a7a9ff1a', 'I see. That is excellent. Now is the perfect time to strike. Here''s what we''ll do. Meet the freighter and offer an escort as expected. When the Cloaks come in, they will expect you to allow them to freely attack and board the freighter.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 68, 's_a827381c', 'Good work, pilot. Here is your extended mission pay. We''ll look into who these ''Cloak'' pilots are and keep our eyes open for more activity. In the meantime, carry on with your standard operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 69, 's_a8b432b3', 'Good. Taking out an entire Cloak attack wing should weaken their forces significantly. Of course then your cover will be blown, but that should be acceptable. Are you ready?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 70, 's_a98368fb', 'As you wish, %TU.  Please leave the area to make room for incoming traffic.  Out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 71, 's_ade7f893', 'No, I will decline this mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 72, 's_ae89219d', 'Acknowledged. Proceed to the Dathomir system and destroy the Cloak remnants.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 73, 's_af84143a', 'Bye'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 74, 's_b1525744', 'Do it'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 75, 's_b284b08f', 'Very well. Carry on, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 76, 's_b596ece0', 'Very well, %TU, you are cleared for landing at the Doaba Guerfel Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 77, 's_b6a0e70f', 'Request declined. I am in need of urgent repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 78, 's_b84b366c', 'How can I help?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 79, 's_bf0e6b55', 'This is a very important operation, pilot. Don''t screw it up this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 80, 's_bf5b2480', 'Welcome to the Corellia system.  We cannot assist you at this range.  Fly closer and identify yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 81, 's_c11eb75b', 'Request declined. I must land immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 82, 's_c3399297', 'Coronet Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 83, 's_c358d041', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 84, 's_c3f09c65', 'Roger that, %TU.  We can repair three-fourths of your ship''s damage at a fee of %DI credits.  Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 85, 's_c804e280', 'Very well, %TU, please clear the area for other traffic.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 86, 's_c84e1098', 'You''re treading thin ice here, pilot. Hopefully nothing will go wrong this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 87, 's_c9c08b99', 'Let me try again.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 88, 's_ccc6f3ed', 'Kor Vella Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 89, 's_cd78560b', 'Sorry, you cannot try again right now. Maybe later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 90, 's_d00437d0', 'Very well, %TU, you are cleared for landing at the Coronet Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 91, 's_d066a27d', 'The officer gave up a meeting location and a time. A courier is bringing leaked CorSec information to transfer to a Cloak ship at that location. We need you to destroy the Cloak ship and pick up the leaked information in its place. Are you up to it?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 92, 's_d44fd86f', 'That''s understandable. It could be extremely dangerous. In that case, just go to the location and destroy his ship. However, if you change your mind and decide to go undercover, dock with him and see what he has to say.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 93, 's_d6306870', 'We''ve interrogated the Cloak Officer that you captured. It seems like this group is a splinter cell of the Hidden Daggers clan. We''re still not sure what their intentions are, but it seems like they are targeting CorSec exclusively.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 94, 's_d8f24b5b', 'Repair a little of the damage'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 95, 's_db1a3377', 'Good. The operation is about to begin. We''ll assign you an operator and transmit the mission data now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 96, 's_dfd4b5bb', 'I am ready and willing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 97, 's_e0234542', 'Understood. I would like to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 98, 's_e2d1b03', 'Something urgent just came up. A ranking officer of these ''Cloaks'' has been seen passing through the system. We need to capture him for questioning. Do you think you can handle it?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 99, 's_ecb04612', 'Good work, pilot. Under the circumstances things went as well as could be expected. Since the Cloak leader was destroyed, I don''t think the remaining forces will be much of a threat. Here is your final extended mission pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 100, 's_edb238bc', 'Go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 101, 's_eec4dc6e', 'Very well, %TU, you are cleared for landing at the Kor Vella Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 102, 's_ef7f535a', 'A complete repair of your ship will cost %DI credits, %TU.  Are you sure?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 103, 's_f0f7d52d', 'Very well, %TU, you are cleared for landing at the Tyrena Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 104, 's_f6948278', 'Coronet Starport (Freelance Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_corellia.stf', 105, 's_f7203392', 'Assigning you an operator. Transmitting data now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_dantooine.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 3, 's_106850f3', 'Well, this should be simple enough for someone like you. I have some things that I need to have...picked up. Ya see, I was promised some goods and those goods never showed up. I need someone with your talents to go make those goods show up.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 4, 's_15716a1', 'I am surprised that Tatooine had anything...they are almost as remote as I am. Must be nice to have everyone flying around there. Oh well, here is your payment.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 5, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 6, 's_1841fbde', 'Hey, nice job. The freighter showed up just a short time ago and those micro-processors will come in handy. Whenever you need repairs, I will fix your ship to full...for a price of course. Is there anything else you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 7, 's_1b496fe4', 'Excellent. I have been waiting for this. I hope your trip to Lok went smoothly. As promised here is your payment for a job well done.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 8, 's_1b800e2e', 'Yes. Let me land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 9, 's_1b90bd5', 'I think you must have comm''d me by mistake... but if not, well then you''re going to have to fly a bit closer than that. I can''t help you with anything from this range!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 10, 's_1c95bcfd', 'Good luck with your repairs! You''re cleared to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 11, 's_1e46e4ca', 'I need to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 12, 's_2102ee02', 'You have a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 13, 's_21255661', 'I should have known that my plan wouldn''t work out...nothing else ever does. It''s this place...Dantooine...it''s cursed, I tell ya.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 14, 's_23615777', 'I was thinking of some ''special'' help.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 15, 's_245c7c6d', 'Repair half.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 16, 's_25329888', 'Ok, just try to be timely. I am really running low here.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 17, 's_25a58267', 'Na, I just want my ship fixed.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 18, 's_2612d825', 'How about you finish up with what you are working on and then come back to talk to me. I want your full attention before I will just hand out jobs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 19, 's_26c53da2', 'Fantastic. Repairs complete! You''ll want to hit a better-equipped station to get the rest of that damage taken care of.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 20, 's_2798158f', 'I am still listening.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 21, 's_28876db2', 'Ok, ok... You''re cleared for landing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 22, 's_29632203', 'Keep talking. I''m listening.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 23, 's_2ba33f79', 'Hey, look whose back and look at all of this nice stuff. You did good...real good. I cannot wait to take a little sniff of that brandy...I know I deserve it. Oh, yeah...ya need to be paid.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 24, 's_2f1ada36', 'Right ya are. I have several scheduled pick ups in a few other systems. If ya go pick that stuff up for me I will pay you for each of the deliveries you make. I cannot pay ya a lot but at least it is something. You should do this for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 25, 's_2fc5fe5d', 'We can manage that. Do you have the %DI credits to pay for this, though?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 26, 's_305434ff', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 27, 's_338dd0a0', 'Ok, what do ya want then?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 28, 's_3555e858', 'Part of my freighter fleet has been conscripted by those blasted Imperials. Even with those ships I cannot keep my station fully stocked...without them I am running dangerously low on supplies. If you get my fleet back from those Imperials, I will let you land at that base that isn''t really there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 29, 's_3626cec6', '''Fraid we can''t manage that, friend. We''re all out of supplies ''til the next shipment comes in.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 30, 's_362a48e0', 'Anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 31, 's_3ca4bcbc', 'Ok, ok... don''t know why you''re in such a rush to go there, though. You''re cleared for landing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 32, 's_3d1c2e17', 'Don''t worry about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 33, 's_3da1b8c8', 'Whatever...I am just glad to have those much needed supplies. Is there anything else I can do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 34, 's_3ea99f04', 'Sounds good to me. Travel to Corellia and meet with the freighter that is supposed to have a load of cargo for me. You will be payed when ya return with the cargo.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 35, 's_407899ba', 'I thought you would be interested. I will find someone else to escort those freighters coming into this system, so all ya need to do is to capture them in Corellia and send them out here. Watch out for those CorSec...they get rather upset about losing freighters for some reason.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 36, 's_432005ea', 'Ok what do ya want then?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 37, 's_460d6dba', 'There are nicer places to visit in the galaxy, but I suppose if you''re in a pinch, then you might be able to get by on Dantooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 38, 's_478f318d', 'Fine with me. Travel to Lok and meet with a delivery vessel that is waiting there. I will pay ya for the trouble when you get back to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 39, 's_48d5ef59', 'I am just the pilot you are looking for.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 40, 's_49140378', 'Fine, fine. I will pay ya what I can for taking out those pirates. It seems that even the few supply freighters that make it out this far always seem to get ambushed by those scum. I will send ya location points to where they usually hang out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 41, 's_49a5815f', 'Sure thing, friend. Maybe you want to land, though? Could get some help on the planet, maybe.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 42, 's_49c64100', 'Why can''t you fix all of it?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 43, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 44, 's_4daeb488', 'Repairs complete! Give us a comm if there''s anything else you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 45, 's_4ff8fc41', 'I need to try that one again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 46, 's_5076c164', 'It wasn''t any problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 47, 's_53317e16', 'So, did you get my stuff from Lok for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 48, 's_54c04765', 'I need repairs!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 49, 's_5600fd38', 'There you go. You might be limpin'' for a while ''til you can afford some more repairs. Just give us a comm if there''s anything else we can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 50, 's_59a700b5', 'Oh, ya will. That is surprising news I must admit. Meet up with the delivery vessel in the Naboo systsem. Once I have the cargo, ya can get paid.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 51, 's_5ac08819', 'Hey, I haven''t gotten my stuff yet! What is the deal?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 52, 's_5ce90655', 'On second thought...no thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 53, 's_5d4f7fdb', 'On second thought...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 54, 's_5f4f6d25', 'I am looking for some adventure.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 55, 's_60117ea4', 'I have been waiting for this. I understand that Naboo is nice this time of year...wish I could be there instead of here. As promised here is your payment for a job well done.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 56, 's_61aa8974', 'Well, let me see. I am out of nearly everything here. Hey...maybe you could help me and get me some more supplies? If you do, I will fix your ship to full...but don''t go around telling everyone that I gave you this opportunity.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 57, 's_6301c26', 'I knew you were going to help me. Ok, this is the deal. First you need to go to Corellia and pick up an order of micro-processors that I put in close to a month ago. After that there is a freighter in Tatooine that is dragging it''s feet getting here. You get me those processors and get that freighter here and I will repair your ship to full when you need me to.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 58, 's_688c4b5e', 'Good grief, friend. Why would you want to land here?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 59, 's_6b2d605a', 'Ok, that shouldn''t be too much trouble. We can fix you up just enough for you to get underway again for a mere %DI credits. How''s that sound?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 60, 's_6bceda29', 'A deal is a deal. Do you have the %DI credits to cover the costs for this? Hey, I never said I would do it for free!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 61, 's_6c9d2543', 'Let me land at the Imperial Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 62, 's_6ee8b2ec', 'Yeah, I thought ya looked the shady type. Maybe...I have something for ya. I have this problem of never getting my supplies. Now how am I supposed to run a station without supplies, I ask you? There are some pretty fat shipping lanes in Corellia, I doubt that they would miss a few freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 63, 's_70876928', 'All of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 64, 's_72db56e1', 'And I thought ya were looking for adventure. Fine...play it safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 65, 's_72e300ed', 'I want to travel to Naboo.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 66, 's_737e644a', 'Never mind then.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 67, 's_73a08149', 'This is Dantooine Station. What can I do for ya?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 68, 's_75f22c97', 'I want to land on Dantooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 69, 's_772ab602', 'Yeah, that''s what I thought. Give us a comm if you need anything else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 70, 's_7823bf', 'Yeah...I want something for me, blast it. There is a ship in Tatooine called the Lord''s Mistress. She is loaded with Corellian Brandy and I want some. Being out here makes a man want to drink. Inspect her and get me some of that brandy. Just watch out for Hap, he owns the Mistress and is a real vengeful cuss.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 71, 's_783aa9d8', 'Illegal! No way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 72, 's_7a1a092d', 'Fine. Let me land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 73, 's_7e303ed8', 'Ok, %NU. Give us a comm if there''s anything we can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 74, 's_7f5d5f9d', 'I need special landing permission.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 75, 's_7f81007d', 'Let me land at the Rebel Base.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 76, 's_8316a19c', 'Oh... Oh! You''re one of... I mean. Ok, then. You''re sure you want to land there? I mean, there''s some rough customers around those parts, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 77, 's_853a6233', 'Ok, I''ll land at the Mining Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 78, 's_874539f7', 'Oh, really? Well then I have just what ya need...or rather maybe ya can help me with some problems around here. Seems like I have nothin'' but problems. Let me see here...I need someone to take out some pirates. I have some supply pickups that need to be made. And..oh yeah...I need some freighters escorted through the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 79, 's_87f1159b', 'It looks like you are a bit busy, ya know. Maybe finish up with what you are doing and talk to me later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 80, 's_890b6a4c', 'Just clear me for landing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 81, 's_89c649f8', '''Fraid we can''t manage that, friend. Probably the best we could do would be to repair three-quarters of your damage... How about for %DI credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 82, 's_8a3087d7', 'Tatooine must be nice this time of year. Wish I was there...by the way did you make that pickup for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 83, 's_90ee7f5d', 'Just a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 84, 's_90f8c50e', 'The first thing I need is on a freighter called the Shifty Prince. It is carrying a load of phasotron radium and is in the Naboo system right now. Inspect that ship and get the radium. Then I need you to go to Corellia and capture the Bez''ox Mentzz. The load of atmospheric inhibitors is mine but the shipping company won''t send them to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 85, 's_9121f9d2', 'I have a slight Imperial problem. If you help me out with my problem, I can see fit to look the other way if you were to...say land at a base on the planet that isn''t supposed to be there...if ya get my drift.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 86, 's_925010fb', 'Ok, for each of the freighters ya get through I will pay you. These freighters are coming in from Corellia and I am not really sure what is on them...but we do need them. I will send ya the arrival location of each of the freighters when they are ready to arrive.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 87, 's_9553e32c', 'Anything else I can do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 88, 's_964449aa', 'I didn''t say anything about piracy...how insulting. I am an honest businessman. We are done talking now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 89, 's_965f7738', 'Ok, fine...fine. I should have known I wouldn''t have been getting my supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 90, 's_9977dcd9', 'Let me land at the Agro Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 91, 's_9e962746', 'Ok then. Nice talking to you, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 92, 's_9fa6755e', 'Let me land at the Mining Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 93, 's_a14e5fb1', 'I will try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 94, 's_a3c632c9', 'I will escort your freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 95, 's_a545492f', 'Do you have anything in the Lok system?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 96, 's_a560e84c', 'I am looking for work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 97, 's_a567620f', 'No thanks. I am not interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 98, 's_a7b78b9d', 'Alright. I will forward you coordinates of each of the ships when you arrive in the system. Oh, and if you get caught I will deny everything.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 99, 's_a7c07d40', 'No, no...is there anything that I can do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 100, 's_aa9dafbe', 'Fine, I hope you remember the instructions because I am not going to explain myself twice. I have better things to do than hope for the best.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 101, 's_aec16b0a', 'On second thought, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 102, 's_b0cfe018', 'No problem, friend. Give us a comm if you''re needin'' anything else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 103, 's_b16218ce', 'I really hate Corellia. Always fully stocked...never having any problems getting goods. I bet those station owners are making a fortune. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 104, 's_b22f6cee', 'Well, you sure picked a backwater station to get repairs from. Until our next supply ship comes through, we''re sort of limited with that. Just how much of that damage do you need repaired?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 105, 's_b6546bce', 'Ok, I will send you the navigation location to one of the freighters. You capture it and bring it back here. I will repaint and rename it. The dumb Imperials won''t know the difference. Thanks for helping out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 106, 's_b6617db1', 'Adventure, eh? I might have something for ya if ya don''t mind...doing something that isn''t exactly legal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 107, 's_bbdda3b3', 'Fine. Bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 108, 's_bc8bd720', 'That mining outpost hasn''t been producing decent resources for months. I''d suggest traveling to a different system. I hear Naboo is nice.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 109, 's_bceb6c8c', 'Yes, clear me for landing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 110, 's_be141863', 'How did your trip to Naboo go?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 111, 's_be24e8c2', 'Your call, friend. Give us a comm if there''s something we can help you with.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 112, 's_c03160ec', 'What about Tatooine?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 113, 's_c0ce6b3a', 'You are talking about piracy. No way!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 114, 's_c385e8d2', 'Ok, you have a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 115, 's_c3d29ec8', 'I am heading to the Corellia system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 116, 's_c9aa99a2', 'I am listening.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 117, 's_ca932c28', 'Forget it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 118, 's_cb019515', 'I''ll wait.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 119, 's_cbcf9a11', 'I would like to make the pickups.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 120, 's_cc899cff', 'I want to try something else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 121, 's_d1d752d1', 'I am not afraid to bend a few laws.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 122, 's_d3dfb66a', 'Sorry we couldn''t be of more help. You might be able to find an engineer on Dantooine at one of the mining outposts to help you, or if you can make it to a better-equipped station...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 123, 's_d4c99a54', 'Have it your way. If you change your mind...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 124, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 125, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 126, 's_d7c1b26f', 'Listen! You are going to have to do better than that. I am not going to be breaking Imperial law and letting ya land where ya want if my freighters are not returned.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 127, 's_d857aa79', 'Heh. Ok, you got it. Good Luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 128, 's_da7e618d', 'Fine. Just try to get it done this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 129, 's_df473597', 'Whatever. Not that I expect ya to ever come back...no one else ever does.  Anyways, head to Tatooine and meet up with the delivery vessel there. I will have your payment waiting for ya on delivery of the goods.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 130, 's_e06f5f77', 'Oh, it''s you. Sure thing buddy. No problems. Thanks again for helping me earlier.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 131, 's_e141a0e8', 'Let me give it another go.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 132, 's_e2fc1d54', 'Ok, got it. This should be a snap.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 133, 's_ea0c00c7', 'Did you managed to pick up that cargo from Corellia?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 134, 's_eb3c41c', 'Oh, I see. Here on official business, are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 135, 's_ebe2e111', 'It''s a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 136, 's_f00111d', 'I was wondering if ya were going to ask me about that? I have been watching ya from up here...don''t have much else to do really. I am willing to help ya out if ya help me out. One hand washes the other...ya know?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 137, 's_f3b73e85', 'I''m afraid I can''t help you, then. Give us a comm if there''s something we can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 138, 's_f7587a6', 'You did it. Now at least I will be able to do get some supplies in here. You can land anywhere ya want. Oh and I suppose I can manage a slight monetary reward too. Thanks again, friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 139, 's_f801849e', 'I will take care of the pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 140, 's_fc85e244', 'I have business on Dantooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 141, 's_fe0697d3', 'Shouldn''t be long now. Check back in a few. Or I guess you could land on Dantooine and see if there''s a shipwright handy.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 142, 's_fef28268', 'Do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dantooine.stf', 143, 's_ff02facb', 'Ok. Give us a comm if there''s anything I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_dathomir.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 2, 's_560', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 3, 's_562', 'If you wish to interact with this station, then you must fly within scanning range. And please have your authorization code ready!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 4, 's_564', 'Good news, %TU! I found a crate of old parts that might be just what you need!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 5, 's_566', 'Sorry, %TU, I still haven''t found any supplies we could use to repair your ship. Do you want to land on the planet? Maybe there''s a shipwright that could help you there?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 6, 's_568', 'No, I''ll keep waiting.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 7, 's_571', 'Very well, %TU. Dathomir Station, out!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 8, 's_574', 'Yes!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 9, 's_576', 'I don''t think you''re supposed to be here. Do you have the Imperial authorization code to be in this system?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 10, 's_578', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 11, 's_581', 'I''m sorry. I won''t be able to help you. In fact, I should probably call this in...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 12, 's_583', 'Wait! Yes I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 13, 's_586', 'Don''t do that. I''ll leave.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 14, 's_588', 'Well... I guess it would save me some paperwork to forget I ever saw you. But don''t hang around here!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 15, 's_591', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 16, 's_594', 'Transmit your authorization code, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 17, 's_598', 'I don''t have one.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 18, 's_601', 'Stop playing games, pilot. Do you have the authorization code or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 19, 's_603', '(Fake it)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 20, 's_605', 'This code doesn''t look right... *sigh* Why doesn''t the Empire ever send me the latest codes? This must be new. Okay, how can I help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 21, 's_608', 'This is Dathomir Station. Ah, it''s you. You''ve served me well, and I appreciate that. \n\nAs a reward for your loyalty and assistance, I can arrange for your ship to be fully repaired instead of only up to 75%. There will still be a fee for this service, of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 22, 's_610', 'You''ve returned. Are you ready to continue?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 23, 's_613', 'Yes, what is my next move?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 24, 's_616', 'Your next move is to finish your current mission. Come back when that one has been completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 25, 's_619', 'This is odd. The captured Black Sun pirate claims that no Rebel has ever been given authorization codes by them. And that the Rebels have never even approached them for anything like that. He further claims that you don''t need any codes. That you can just make up any code and be granted access to the planet''s surface. [*he suddenly looks flustered*] No, it can''t be....'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 26, 's_621', 'Is everything okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 27, 's_623', '[*He visibly composes himself and pushes a button in front of him on his console*] Yes, yes. I''m fine. The pirate''s claims are, of course, untrue. How could they be anything but? And, oh my, look at that. The pirate has escaped! Such a shame. Go destroy him.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 28, 's_625', 'Don''t worry, I''ll take care of him.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 29, 's_627', 'Go now and be swift about it!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 30, 's_629', 'I''ll go after him later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 31, 's_631', 'Very well, but don''t delay too long. We''ll monitor his location.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 32, 's_633', 'Arrgh, you let that Black Sun pirate escape! I''m certain he knew something. We... wait. Excellent, we''ve located a ship matching the one that escaped. Go capture that pirate, and this time there had better be no mistakes!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 33, 's_635', 'I''ll catch that pirate!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 34, 's_638', 'You''d better. Now go!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 35, 's_640', 'I''ll catch the pirate another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 36, 's_642', 'Arrgh. Return when you are ready, but be quick about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 37, 's_645', 'Your attack on the Rebel officer''s comrades worked beautifully. She has finally opened up and named the Black Sun as the source of the codes. She still wouldn''t name anyone specific by name, which is a bit odd, but that''s not a matter of concern. We will target Black Sun ships in the area until we get the information we seek. Go attack some Black Sun pirates, and we''ll see what more we can learn.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 38, 's_648', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 39, 's_650', 'Excellent. Hit them hard, and we''ll see what happens in response.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 40, 's_652', 'I''ll do that another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 41, 's_654', 'Very well. Return when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 42, 's_657', 'The Rebel officer you captured refuses to reveal the source of the authorization code. She claims that no one gave her any codes, and that she just had them. I don''t believe her.\n\nGo kill some other members of her squad. Maybe the news that we are hunting and destroying her comrades will loosen her tongue.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 43, 's_660', 'I''m on it. She''ll talk soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 44, 's_663', 'Excellent. She''ll soon be singing like a witch from that mountain on the planet below.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 45, 's_666', 'I''ll take care of that another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 46, 's_669', 'Hmmph. Well, come back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 47, 's_673', 'You let the Rebel officer elude you, but we''ve managed to recover from your incompetence. My technicians have gotten a fix on her location.\n\nSee to it that this time we are able to interrogate this Rebel. Now go.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 48, 's_676', 'She won''t get away again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 49, 's_680', 'Good. That''s the attitude I like to see. Now go.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 50, 's_684', 'I''ll go after her another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 51, 's_686', 'Bah. Fine then, but don''t delay too long. I wish to find out what she knows as soon as possible. Return when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 52, 's_688', 'Any duties I could do instead?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 53, 's_690', 'Your need to finish your current mission. Come back when that one has been completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 54, 's_692', 'As it ends up, I do. There are two duties you could undertake. One is to teach some Rebel pilots not to mess with this station. The other is to escort supply freighters that are en route to the Imperial prison.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 55, 's_695', '(Request Permission to Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 56, 's_698', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 57, 's_702', 'You''re back. Are you ready to continue?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 58, 's_705', 'Yes, what do I do next?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 59, 's_707', 'Next you need to finish your current mission. Come back when you ''re done with that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 60, 's_709', 'I can''t say what a relief it is to finally be rid of those [*itches*] lice. Well, mostly rid of anyway. And well on the way to having the station be pest-free again. Which leaves one other matter to deal with. I''ve got to send a message to those [*itches*] who sent me that lice infested cargo. And I want you to deliver it. Go to the Lok system and let that Kimogila battlelord know that I didn''t appreciate his little surprise.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 61, 's_711', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 62, 's_713', 'Good. Teach them that this station is not to be trifled with.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 63, 's_716', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 64, 's_720', 'Very well, but return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 65, 's_723', 'Good work recovering my [*itches*] shipment. There''s one small hitch, as it turns [*itches*] out. The packing [*itches*] crates were infested with lice! Those [*itches*] sent me a shipment infested with [*itches*] lice! Arrgh! We''ll deal with them [*itches*] later. For now, I have arranged for ointments [*itches*] and pesticides to be delivered to the station. Go escort the freighter [*itches*] carrying those and make sure they arrive safely.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 66, 's_727', 'I''ll protect those freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 67, 's_731', 'Yes. Good. Please hurry. [*itches*]'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 68, 's_733', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 69, 's_735', 'I was afraid you''d say that. [*itches*] Very well, but please hurry back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 70, 's_737', 'The freighter with the cargo you delivered was ambushed by Black Sun pirates. They killed everyone on board and took everything that was worth salvaging including my cargo. We can forget about the casualties for now, but I need that cargo recovered. Luckily, foresight prompted me to have a tracking transmitter installed in one of the packing crates, so I''ve been able to locate the pirate ship. Go recover my cargo!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 71, 's_739', 'I''ll recover the cargo.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 72, 's_741', 'Catch those pirates before they escape. Off with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 73, 's_743', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 74, 's_745', 'Time isn''t exactly on our side, so hurry back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 75, 's_747', 'You failed! How could you fail such a simple task? How? I''ll give you another chance, but don''t press your luck. Be more careful this time.\n\nThe cargo awaits you in the Lok system. Pick it up and shuttle it to a freighter here in the Dathomir system. I''m counting on you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 76, 's_749', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 77, 's_751', 'Good. And be more careful this time. Please.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 78, 's_753', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 79, 's_755', 'Okay. I guess waiting a bit longer will make no difference. Return here when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 80, 's_757', 'Any duties I could do instead?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 81, 's_759', 'You need to finish your current mission. Come back when you ''re done with that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 82, 's_761', 'As it happens, I do. I have two duties you can undertake. One is to deal with some Black Sun pirates and teach them to honor their agreements with this station. The other is to escort the transport of.... Well, let''s just call it the transport of passengers who have managed to arrange to leave the Dathomir system, but who wish to do so in secrecy.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 83, 's_763', '(Request Permission to Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 84, 's_765', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 85, 's_767', 'This is Dathomir Station. What do you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 86, 's_769', '(Request Permission to Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 87, 's_771', 'There are only two outposts on this planet than can accommodate your ship. Where do you want to land?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 88, 's_773', 'Trade Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 89, 's_775', 'You are cleared for landing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 90, 's_777', '(Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 91, 's_779', 'Be careful down there. This is a dangerous world!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 92, 's_781', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 93, 's_783', 'Acknowledged. Landing clearance aborted. Hail me if I can be of service.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 94, 's_785', 'Dathomir Science Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 95, 's_787', 'Acknowledged. Dathomir Science Outpost is ready for you to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 96, 's_789', '(Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 97, 's_791', 'Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 98, 's_793', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 99, 's_795', 'Acknowledged. Landing clearance aborted.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 100, 's_797', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 101, 's_799', 'Sorry, %TU, but we don''t have the supplies on hand to provide you with more repairs. We should be getting more supplies any day now though.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 102, 's_801', 'I can''t wait that long!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 103, 's_803', 'Well, just give me a few minutes... maybe I can scrounge something up...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 104, 's_805', 'Arrgh!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 105, 's_807', 'I know, I know. It''s terrible being stationed in such a remote locale. We hardly ever get a supply run through here.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 106, 's_809', 'That''s okay. I''ll manage somehow.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 107, 's_811', 'Okay, %NU. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 108, 's_813', 'This is the worst station in the galaxy!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 109, 's_815', 'I know, I know... but what can I do? I wish I could get a transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 110, 's_817', 'You don''t deserve a transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 111, 's_819', 'Well... look... it''s not my fault. I wish I could help you, I really do. I just don''t have the supplies on hand here.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 112, 's_821', 'I don''t believe you!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 113, 's_823', 'But it''s true! I mean... maybe I could scrounge something up to get you under way, but... it wouldn''t be much.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 114, 's_825', 'Try!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 115, 's_827', 'Aw, forget it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 116, 's_829', 'I really am sorry, %TU. Very, very sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 117, 's_831', 'That''s okay. Forget it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 118, 's_833', 'I really am sorry, %TU. Very, very sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 119, 's_835', 'Well, hang in there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 120, 's_837', 'Thanks, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 121, 's_839', 'We''re not equipped to provide more than the most basic level of repairs. How much of the damage do you want us to fix?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 122, 's_841', 'Just a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 123, 's_843', 'I think we can manage to get you underway. There will be a fee of %DI credits for this, though. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 124, 's_845', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 125, 's_847', 'Acknowledged. I hope that holds you until you can get back to civilization.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 126, 's_849', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 127, 's_851', 'I don''t think there''s anything we can do for you, unless you''d like to land and seek repairs on Dathomir.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 128, 's_853', 'Yes, I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 129, 's_855', 'No thank you. Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 130, 's_857', 'Very well. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 131, 's_859', 'Half?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 132, 's_861', 'Repairing half of the damage on your ship shouldn''t be a problem. There will be a fee of %DI credits, however. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 133, 's_863', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 134, 's_865', 'Repairs Complete! Let me know if there is anything else I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 135, 's_867', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 136, 's_869', 'All of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 137, 's_871', 'Repairing your ship of all damage shouldn''t be a problem. There will be a fee of %DI credits, however. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 138, 's_873', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 139, 's_875', 'Repairs Complete! Let me know if there is anything else I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 140, 's_877', 'I can''t afford that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 141, 's_879', 'Well, we can repair 75% of your ship''s damage for %DI credits, and it looks like you could afford that amount. Would you like to try that instead?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 142, 's_881', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 143, 's_883', 'Repairs Complete! Let me know if there is anything else I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 144, 's_885', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 145, 's_887', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 146, 's_889', 'The most we could possibly repair at this station is 75% of your ship''s damage. There will be a fee of %DI credits for that repair... is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 147, 's_891', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 148, 's_893', 'Repairs Complete! Let me know if there is anything else I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 149, 's_895', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 150, 's_897', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 151, 's_899', 'Any work for an Imperial pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 152, 's_901', 'Actually, I do. There are a number of things you could help me with. I have two duties you could undertake. One is to teach some Rebel pilots not to mess with this station. The other is to escort supply freighters that are en route to the Imperial prison.\n\nOh, there is one other thing. You could track down a Rebel officer for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 153, 's_903', 'I''ll teach those Rebel pilots a lesson.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 154, 's_905', 'Excellent. They had the gall to try and use a fake code, and then the stupidity to celebrate its use while their comm link was still open. Teach them that this station is not to be taken so lightly.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 155, 's_907', 'I''ll escort the supply freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 156, 's_909', 'Supply routes to the Imperial prison on Dathomir''s surface are vital to its smooth operation. Freighters are en route with new supplies and must be protected from Alliance interference. To be honest, some of the freighters are decoys to help increase our chances of the actual supply freighters making it through. Even I don''t know which are real and which are just decoys. Your job would be to provide protection to any or all of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 157, 's_911', 'I''ll track down that Rebel officer for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 158, 's_913', 'Very good. Let me brief you on the details. A Rebel officer presented what looked like a genuine authorization code for Dathomir. If I hadn''t recognized her as a member of the Rebel Alliance, she would have been allowed to land. She fled once she realized we knew who she was, but we managed to get a fix on her location. Capture her so that we may interrogate her and find out where she got those codes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 159, 's_915', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 160, 's_917', 'Very well. Was there anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 161, 's_919', 'Actually, I do. There are two duties you could undertake. One is to teach some Rebel pilots not to mess with this station. The other is to escort supply freighters that are en route to the Imperial prison.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 162, 's_921', 'I''ll teach those Rebel pilots a lesson.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 163, 's_923', 'I''ll escort the supply freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 164, 's_925', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 165, 's_927', 'Very well. Was there anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 166, 's_929', 'Do you have any work?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 167, 's_931', 'For one such as you? As it happens, I do. I have two duties you can undertake. One is to deal with some Black Sun pirates and teach them to honor their agreements with this station. The other is to escort the transport of.... Well, let''s just call it the transport of passengers who have managed to arrange to leave the Dathomir system, but who wish to do so in secrecy. There''s also one other thing... if I can trust you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 168, 's_933', 'I''ll deal with the Black Sun pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 169, 's_935', 'Excellent. I had a... business arrangement of sorts with some local Black Sun pirates. Don''t ask what it involved, because I''ll certainly not say more. The important part is that these pirates failed to uphold their part of the arrangement. And for that they must be punished.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 170, 's_937', 'I''ll escort the passenger transports.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 171, 's_939', 'Very good. You task will be to escort transports that are on their way out of the Dathomir system. As I previously stated, these transports are carrying passengers who have arranged to leave the system. Their reasons for this vary and should be of no concern to you. What you should concern yourself with is the safety of these passengers. They have paid well for this service, and I intend to see that they gain their freedom. So to speak.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 172, 's_941', 'You can trust me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 173, 's_943', 'Good. This needs to remain strictly between the two of us. I arranged to obtain some goods from some associates in the Lok system. I need you to go pickup that cargo and shuttle it to a freighter here in the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 174, 's_945', 'I''ll take care of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 175, 's_947', 'Excellent. Be careful. I outbid a Black Sun Captain in order to obtain these goods, and I expect him to make an attempt to take them from you as you return here. '),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 176, 's_949', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 177, 's_951', 'Very well. Was there anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 178, 's_953', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 179, 's_955', 'Very well. Was there anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 180, 's_957', 'For one such as you? As it happens, I do. I have two duties you can undertake. One is to deal with some Black Sun pirates and teach them to honor their agreements with this station. The other is to escort the transport of.... Well, let''s just call it the transport of passengers who have managed to arrange to leave the Dathomir system, but who wish to do so in secrecy.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 181, 's_959', 'I''ll deal with the Black Sun pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 182, 's_961', 'I''ll escort the passenger transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 183, 's_963', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_dathomir.stf', 184, 's_965', 'Very well. Was there anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_endor.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 3, 's_1110e057', 'Ha ha! I know that you do, %NU! But this is serious business. You be careful! I''d hate for anything bad to happen to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 4, 's_143e876a', 'Certainly!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 5, 's_14897567', 'Most of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 6, 's_1572cf8', 'Would you? Oh that''s fantastic! Thanks so much for your help, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 7, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 8, 's_203953bd', 'Ok, I''ll make sure he''s safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 9, 's_24dd12a9', 'I''m glad you asked, %NU! An Imperial transport coming out of the Rori Weapons Research Center has had a run in with Rebel forces and are listing.  If you can travel out to the Naboo system and get them under way it would be great.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 10, 's_25759913', 'No, but I do want to land on Endor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 11, 's_2610c442', 'Yes! I want to land at the Research Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 12, 's_26dfa294', 'You worry too much.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 13, 's_2944ab48', 'Oh, I know, %NU. I just can''t help it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 14, 's_2a121119', 'Not a problem! It may surprise you to learn that our little research station is well-supplied by the Empire! How much damage do you need repaired?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 15, 's_2d9d1ee4', 'That''s great, %NU! You are always so helpful! I''ll give you the coordinates to check-out for me. Thank you very much for doing this for me!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 16, 's_2f9e3b7b', 'Maybe later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 17, 's_31e68e8b', 'Wait, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 18, 's_35417d09', 'I''ll notify the Research Outpost that you are on your way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 19, 's_3b68a624', 'I guess that is pretty expensive. Maybe you can get some cheaper repairs somewhere else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 20, 's_4360fc64', 'Do you have any work for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 21, 's_460bcfda', 'We could repair three-fourths of your ship''s damage for %DI credits. Ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 22, 's_478bdae6', 'Oh, ok. Well if you need anything, just comm me. I''m here to serve!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 23, 's_4a43e175', 'I''ll find a place.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 24, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 25, 's_549ada4b', 'Repairs complete! Thank you for visiting the Forest Moon of Endor Research Station!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 26, 's_592038e', 'Be careful. The Forest Moon of Endor is not very civilized!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 27, 's_5f4952b7', 'No, I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 28, 's_685bb895', 'In that case, let me know if there is anything else I can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 29, 's_695e2019', '(Land at the Research Outpost)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 30, 's_70876928', 'All of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 31, 's_7272cd2a', 'I sure do, %NU! A friend of mine, Jenson Marsh, has been doing some freelance work for the Empire since his retirement. It would be a great help if you could check-up on him for me. Just give him an escort so that no pirates or Rebels attack him, ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 32, 's_75d638d8', 'Be careful. Endor is uncivilized.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 33, 's_78f29efc', 'That''s great, %NU! I have a couple of assignments for you to choose from. You know there are always freighters coming through that could use an escort, or you could help us kick the Pirates out of this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 34, 's_7bc8f950', 'Your ship has been completely fixed. Thank you for coming.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 35, 's_809da719', 'I certainly do, %NU! I''ve been picking-up a lot of unauthorized activity in this system lately. I''m sure it''s nothing, but would you mind terribly checking things out for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 36, 's_8353c277', 'Do you have any special assignments?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 37, 's_895d093', 'Ok.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 38, 's_8ae30058', 'Only a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 39, 's_90fc8440', 'I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 40, 's_9445899b', 'Oh. Well... Ok... Comm me if you need anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 41, 's_96ff1c97', 'I''ll be careful.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 42, 's_9e0cc5c', 'If you say so. You''re cleared to land... wherever it is you''re going to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 43, 's_9eae7799', 'I... see... I wasn''t aware of another outpost on Endor, but...'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 44, 's_a115d9be', 'I''m a little busy right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 45, 's_a168a94b', 'You''d better be!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 46, 's_a19e12a1', 'That''s OK, %NU. I''m sure he''ll be ok on his own. I worry for no reason sometimes. So do you want to visit the Endor Research Center?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 47, 's_a22bada4', 'Repairs complete. That should get you underway, at least.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 48, 's_a9d26781', 'Ok, %NU. Do you want to visit the Endor Research Center?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 49, 's_ab6892a7', 'Good Luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 50, 's_b40dc05e', 'Thank you very much, %NU! I really appreciate this!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 51, 's_b68693bb', 'We can completely repair your ship for %DI credits. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 52, 's_c0d7347d', 'Not a problem. There will be a fee of %DI credits, however. Is that acceptable?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 53, 's_c0da04f9', 'I can''t thank you enough, %NU! I''ll comm him to let him know you are on the way!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 54, 's_c3d359f2', 'Need any help?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 55, 's_c6b82293', 'There you are! Come back any time!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 56, 's_c6f610d3', '(Land at the Smuggler''s Outpost)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 57, 's_c98e000', 'Just repair half of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 58, 's_cc059cc2', 'Oh, ok, %NU. I guess if you''re too busy. Do you just want to visit the Endor Research Center?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 59, 's_cfc852d9', 'I''m ready for work!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 60, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 61, 's_d9c39726', 'I''ll escort those freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 62, 's_de3168cf', 'Greetings! Have you come to visit the Endor Research Center?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 63, 's_e1c14e1d', 'Greetings! If you require emergency repairs or clearing to land at our research station, you''ll need to fly closer to the station. I''ll be happy to help you then!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 64, 's_e8eb7684', 'Ok, bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 65, 's_eb2adf47', 'Ok, come back any time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 66, 's_ebe2e111', 'It''s a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 67, 's_edc85a49', 'Will do! Repairing half of the damage on your ship will cost %DI credits. Ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 68, 's_fb6681b8', 'I love killing Pirate scum!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_endor.stf', 69, 's_fc27931b', 'Thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_lok.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 3, 's_10c4c33b', 'Doesn''t it always? Some Storm Squadron operatives captured our transport, and the ''guests''.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 4, 's_14a79f3e', 'That''s it?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 5, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 6, 's_185ada38', 'Bah! Later, later. Maybe I''ll just get someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 7, 's_1b3d0b9e', 'I''m looking for work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 8, 's_20fce91c', 'I''m too busy.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 9, 's_2d1962b', 'Repair most of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 10, 's_2f9e3b7b', 'Maybe later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 11, 's_305434ff', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 12, 's_3538339', 'I can see that! I mean, I wasn''t going to say anything, but since you mentioned it... Anyway, we''ve got all the necessary equipment to fix you right up! Want a complete repair job?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 13, 's_35f718b7', 'Well, there''s only one starport on Lok that can handle that ship of yours... So will it be Nym''s Stronghold for you then?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 14, 's_360058b6', 'Easy to say, easy to do! And a bargain at %DI credits, don''t you agree?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 15, 's_3e88ac8b', 'Ha ha! That''s the spirit! No sense limping around in a damaged heap, right! This will only cost you %DI credits, and a better price you''ll never find!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 16, 's_40a7b30f', 'I have a job for you, if you are interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 17, 's_445607d0', 'Repair all of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 18, 's_474141fe', 'I''m interested in some work, start talking.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 19, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 20, 's_59b2e836', 'Destroying a helpless freighter, sounds like easy money.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 21, 's_5adb5e96', 'Capture?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 22, 's_5d8ae855', 'Hey hey! Welcome to the Lok system! I can''t do anything for you at this distance, but give a shout when you''re a little closer, ok?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 23, 's_5e3dd46f', 'Lazy? Did you say you''re too lazy? Ha ha! Fine, %NU. You go be lazy then.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 24, 's_60460c5', 'And here''s your repairs! That ought to allow you to limp back home, anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 25, 's_63942640', 'Hey, you know we''ve always got something special for you to do, %NU! Those Storm Squadron thugs are always hassling us around here. If you''re not in the mood for that sort of rumble, maybe you could get our gunships through to upgrade their reactors.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 26, 's_676e1e17', 'Not yet.  And we would like to keep it that way.  They are flying an Imperial Scan Freighter through the system soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 27, 's_6c8ffad8', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 28, 's_6cc25feb', 'I''ve got something for you. So... we had acquired some Imperial ''guests'' in the compound and needed to get them to a safe place.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 29, 's_716b5194', 'Destroy.  We already know all that they hope to learn, so what use are they to us?  We want them to be blind to our actions.  Enough chatter, are you up for it?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 30, 's_720fe84e', 'Ho-yeah! They won''t know what hit them! Good luck, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 31, 's_7488284', 'The Kimogila''s Claw will be making their departure soon and you will fly with them to their hyperspace jump point.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 32, 's_77685adb', 'You say, ''had''.  I take it something came up.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 33, 's_8a98e9e7', 'Well, what do you know about the cost of repairing a ship as damaged as yours, anyway? Ask around and you''ll see that was a fair price. Then you''ll be back, won''t you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 34, 's_8d68ee17', 'Sounds dangerous.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 35, 's_94d99aa4', 'I would alert the authorities of your arrival... if there were any!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 36, 's_96576ff4', 'It seems there''s nothing I can do for you then. Off you go!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 37, 's_a6054d56', 'Repairs complete! How''s that for quick work? Stop by again if you need anything else!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 38, 's_a6a8081b', 'Don''t expect them to be alone.  The Imperials can be wasteful, but never count on them being stupid.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 39, 's_a77bdd74', 'Imperial attack is expected, this won''t be a snooze assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 40, 's_a7ea491f', 'So what are the details?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 41, 's_ad7b177d', 'I''ll take on Storm Squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 42, 's_b1729740', 'I am interested in your credits.  So what little thing is keeping the two of us apart?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 43, 's_b69f3131', 'Bingo.  Are you up to the task?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 44, 's_bb83a046', 'Something new has come up.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 45, 's_bbfa316b', 'I''m ready for anything.  Let the Kimogila''s Claw know to expect me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 46, 's_bc1b6f03', 'Ok. I guess I''d better get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 47, 's_bc62d0fb', 'Greets to you! And welcome to the Lok Station. What are you needing today?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 48, 's_bf151ca2', 'No, just fix a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 49, 's_c23916c6', 'Not now %NU, perhaps not ever.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 50, 's_c408ae1e', 'I''ve notified Vestil Kwass to expect you.  I trust you enjoyed working with him before.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 51, 's_c6280dee', 'My contacts in the stronghold tell me that a transport carrying some very important people will be traveling out of the system soon and they need an escort.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 52, 's_c80840ca', 'Just fix half of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 53, 's_cac4df9f', 'Not right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 54, 's_ce3f3ff6', 'Your ship has been completely fixed! And that work is guaranteed for life... barring any sort of combat-related damage, or normal wear and tear, or acts of the Force and the like. Come see us again if you have problems at all!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 55, 's_d34f2ea4', 'I will transfer you to our special operations guy, he can handle the mission details.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 56, 's_d38dd40', 'Right! Money''s a bit tight, isn''t it? How about we get you running for %DI credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 57, 's_d47aa2c4', 'How does this sound? We''ll take care of three-fourths of the damage, and you take care of us to the tune of... say... %DI credits. Sounds good?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 58, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 59, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 60, 's_daa54d2', 'Go to it, %NU! Our gunships demand respect from the enemies of Nym, but the factory models never really cut it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 61, 's_e39c0a00', 'I''m much too busy for that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 62, 's_e5ce7fcb', 'I''ll get our gunships through.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 63, 's_e99611e', 'Hey, around here a love of money is a virtue.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 64, 's_e998576d', 'I can see where I come in.  You want me to get them back?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 65, 's_ea7d0b42', 'Lazy? Did you say you''re too lazy?  Ha ha! Fine, %NU.  You go be lazy then... and let our boys rot in some Imperial prison.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 66, 's_eb2cfdac', 'You bet.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 67, 's_ebe2e111', 'It''s a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 68, 's_f17c177b', 'It will be.  Every time we take out a mole, some other information leak opens up around here.  I am constantly amazed at how efficient Imperial Intelligence is.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 69, 's_f33a826f', 'Yeah, you''re not so badly damaged after all, I s''pose. If you''re on your way, then I''ll be getting back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 70, 's_fc6171f1', 'Right, so Storm Squadron has you in a fit again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_lok.stf', 71, 's_fef28268', 'Do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_naboo.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 3, 's_13eddc62', 'Enjoy your stay in Keren, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 4, 's_14897567', 'Most of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 5, 's_14ed557a', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Kaadara Starport is awaiting your arrival.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 6, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 7, 's_1951f1c1', 'You are too far away for us to be of assistance. Please fly closer and contact us at that time. Out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 8, 's_1a18a604', 'I''ll save that freighter!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 9, 's_28586fd5', 'Very well.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 10, 's_2c7bc9c5', 'Might be wise. Carry on then, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 11, 's_2dc4697a', '(Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 12, 's_2ebb5be7', 'Yes in fact I do. The Imperial station has informed us that they are looking for some loyal and able pilots to travel to Lok and disrupt some of the Rebel operations there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 13, 's_2f99890c', 'Moenia Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 14, 's_3466611d', 'Bah, that''s their problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 15, 's_382e612d', 'What? Oh... very well. Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 16, 's_390e6f9a', 'Enjoy your stay in Theed, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 17, 's_3b9f150e', 'Repairs complete, %TU. 50% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Thank you for visiting the Royal Security Forces Naboo Station.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 18, 's_3bf3c89f', 'What''s the emergency?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 19, 's_41f82cf5', 'Enjoy your stay in Moenia, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 20, 's_43af1e95', 'Ok, %NU. Please comm us if this station can be of service.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 21, 's_4468336c', 'Half of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 22, 's_45426495', 'Very well. Head for the Karthakk system. An Imperial commander will contact you near Lok.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 23, 's_4b9c311', 'Acknowledged, %TU. How much of the damage to your ship do you want to be repaired at this time?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 24, 's_4bb1f207', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Please transmit your destination for flight clearance.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 25, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 26, 's_5cc333f9', 'Repairs complete, %TU. All of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Thank you for visiting the Royal Security Forces Naboo Station.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 27, 's_612d9759', 'Moenia Starport (Rebel Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 28, 's_67f72920', 'This station will charge a fee of %DI credits to repair all of the damage to your ship. Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 29, 's_6bbe88b4', 'Kaadara Starport (Imperial Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 30, 's_70876928', 'All of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 31, 's_72a90512', 'Of course I''m allowed to land there!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 32, 's_7cffc9b4', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Moenia Starport is awaiting your arrival.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 33, 's_7e7609c1', 'Nym is an honorable man, for a pirate at least. So far he''s only seen these attacks as a challenge. He seems to think that if the Rebels can''t handle a single pilot, they are weak. So, if you want I can connect you with the Imperial station and you can get started.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 34, 's_7f991ab5', 'This station will charge a fee of %DI credits to fix half of your ship''s damage. Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 35, 's_81db3c91', 'Won''t Nym be angry?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 36, 's_8460cdcf', 'Before I do anything, I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 37, 's_8845528b', 'Kaadara Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 38, 's_8e61aac7', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Theed Starport is awaiting your arrival.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 39, 's_90ee7f5d', 'Just a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 40, 's_917c9894', 'I''ve changed my mind. I''ll be back.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 41, 's_96d14fea', 'Very well, carry on then pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 42, 's_98f3774d', 'Do you need assistance with anything?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 43, 's_98fa9519', 'A loyal pilot...and just in time too! We need your help, stat, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 44, 's_9c3ac80a', 'Enjoy your stay at our beloved Emperor''s Retreat, Sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 45, 's_9daa68de', 'I''m not afraid of a pirate!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 46, 's_a0434258', 'This station will charge a fee of %DI credits to repairs most of the damage to your ship. Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 47, 's_a60e86c5', 'You ungrateful... I will report this to your superior, mark my words!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 48, 's_a716a9c7', 'Keren Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 49, 's_be07ed49', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Your clearance to land has been revoked.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 50, 's_bece5a73', 'This sounds too complicated.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 51, 's_c1ae5dd1', 'An Imperial freighter is under attack by the Rebel filth and needs help right away, but I can''t seem to get in touch with the Imperial space station.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 52, 's_c295eda3', 'Excellent, pilot. The Rebels think they are safe in the Karthakk system since they have a fragile alliance with the space pirate Nym. The Empire doesn''t want to risk a full out assault on the system. Nym is quite powerful for a pirate and they have enough trouble fighting the Rebels right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 53, 's_c358d041', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 54, 's_c42b6203', 'Theed Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 55, 's_c6aaa6b3', 'Of course, Sir! Let me know when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 56, 's_c9361653', 'Enjoy your stay in Kaadara, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 57, 's_ca5ee405', 'Repairs complete, %TU. 75% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Thank you for visiting the Royal Security Forces Naboo Station.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 58, 's_cb44587c', 'This station will charge a fee of %DI credits to make only the most basic repairs to your ship. Are you ready to transfer the funds?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 59, 's_ce98dec5', 'Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 60, 's_cebd107d', '(Request Permission to Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 61, 's_cfbc1584', 'Acknowledged, %TU. Keren Starport is awaiting your arrival.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 62, 's_d392ae0b', 'Sounds like my kind of work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 63, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 64, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 65, 's_decdd151', 'You have entered Naboo space, under the protection of the Royal Security Forces. Please identify yourself and your reason for visiting Naboo.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 66, 's_e331a0a5', 'I knew I could count on you! Let me patch you through to the freighter''s emergency broadcast. Good luck, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 67, 's_e3843534', 'Don''t underestimate Nym, pilot. He''s got a tight crew and is clever. The Empire wants to show the Rebels that they are not untouchable anywhere though. So, they are sending in solo pilots to disrupt Rebel operations in the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 68, 's_e4c8ff17', 'Sorry, I need to land on Naboo right away.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 69, 's_e809e957', 'Theed Starport (Freelance Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 70, 's_ee26e33e', 'No thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 71, 's_f148786f', 'Cancel request to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 72, 's_f190c97c', 'Let''s get started.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 73, 's_f3b40ad6', 'Hmm, yes it does indeed seem that you have the correct permissions. You''re clear to land, Sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 74, 's_f478139', 'Repairs complete, %TU. 25% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Thank you for visiting the Royal Security Forces Naboo Station.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 75, 's_f918e086', 'Acknowledged, %NU. Please comm us when we can be of further service.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 76, 's_f98be94d', 'I don''t want to mess with Nym.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_naboo.stf', 77, 's_fadd1b3c', 'Nothing at the moment, pilot. I will let you know if anything shows up.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_rori.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 2, 's_199', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 3, 's_201', 'Heyo-dalee, %TU! Yous comen hereabout.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 4, 's_203', 'Wesa no like yousa! You tink you so smarty!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 5, 's_205', 'I just want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 6, 's_207', 'Okeyday, yousa wanna git ta Roritowns. Mesa tell you howta do it. Yousa speedaway to Nabootowns and yousa taken da shuttle!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 7, 's_209', 'Just let me land, idiot.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 8, 's_211', 'Mesa no tink so! Yousa wude. Yousa say sorry or yousa no comenback hare!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 9, 's_213', 'I changed my mind, repair my ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 10, 's_215', 'Ho No! Yousa tink yousa smarty. Byenow! Yousa not ganna bean friends wit anybody hare!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 11, 's_217', 'I''m sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 12, 's_219', 'Rilly Sorry?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 13, 's_221', 'Yes, I''m really sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 14, 's_223', 'Rilly rilly sorry?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 15, 's_225', 'Yes, I''m really sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 16, 's_227', 'Yousa ganna bean nice ta wesa now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 17, 's_229', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 18, 's_231', 'Yousa gonna be nice ta all da Gungans now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 19, 's_233', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 20, 's_235', 'And yousa ganna be rilly nice to Rori-gungans now an allways?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 21, 's_237', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 22, 's_239', 'Yousa promise?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 23, 's_241', 'Yes, I promise!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 24, 's_243', 'Okeyday, den! No more crunchen! We bean friends now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 25, 's_245', 'Oh FORGET IT!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 26, 's_247', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 27, 's_249', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 28, 's_251', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 29, 's_253', 'No, I''m not that sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 30, 's_255', 'No, not really.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 31, 's_257', 'Den yousa ganna go away now and no comenback hare!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 32, 's_259', 'Ello, boyos! Ah, ''tis yousa. mesa appreciate yousa help!\n\nMesa have some work yousa can do if yousa want, and mesa''ll also let yousa speedaway down at da Rebel Base on Rori if yousa wanna. Or yousa been crunchen?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 33, 's_261', 'Good, yousa back. But yousa no finishin'' yet!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 34, 's_263', 'What do I do next?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 35, 's_265', 'Yousa next move bein'' to finish yousa current mission. Come back when dat one has been completin''.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 36, 's_267', 'An Imperial spy in place at mesa supplier has learned of mesa arrangement with dem and is rushin'' to report to hissen superiors. Wesa jammin'' hissen communications, but yousa must go stop hesa before hesa can report in!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 37, 's_269', 'I''ll catch hm. Don''t worry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 38, 's_271', 'Hurry. Hesa gettin'' away!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 39, 's_273', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 40, 's_275', 'Arrgh. But hesa getaway. Please hurry back so yousa can catch hims.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 41, 's_277', 'Mesa know dissen one bein'' tough, but Imperial squads sometimes intercept our shipments. Defeat a squadron of Imperial fighters to show yousa could handle dem.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 42, 's_279', 'Imperials, eh? Okay, I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 43, 's_281', 'Yousa doin'' good. Dem Imperials mean, though. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 44, 's_283', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 45, 's_285', 'Okeyday. Return when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 46, 's_287', 'Yousa have ta prove dat yousa can defeat dese Borvo pirates, or mesa repair droid supplier goin'' to refuse future shipments. Go destroy dat squadron of Borvo pirates!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 47, 's_289', 'Borvo pirates. No problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 48, 's_291', 'Mesa not like dem Borvo pirates. Yousa make dem hurtin''.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 49, 's_293', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 50, 's_295', 'Okeyday. Return when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 51, 's_297', 'Mesa repair droid suppliers are no confident dat wesa can protect deir ships. Dey are goin'' to back out unless dey believe dey can make deir deliveries in safety. Prove dat dey can be protected by defeatin'' fighter squadrons from our most common troublemakers. First up are Black Sun fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 52, 's_299', 'Black Sun fighters. I''m on it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 53, 's_301', 'Go show them whosa owns dissen system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 54, 's_303', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 55, 's_305', 'Okeyday. Return when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 56, 's_307', 'Dat Borvo pilot whosa stole mesa repair droids escaped, but wesa managed to get a fix on hissen location. Go and get mesa repair droids!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 57, 's_309', 'I''ll get them! Count on me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 58, 's_311', 'Go and get mesa repair droids! Hurry!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 59, 's_313', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 60, 's_315', 'But mesa need dem droids. Hurry and return when ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 61, 's_317', 'Yousa let them destroy mesa shipment! Mesa repair droids! Maybe yousa no up to dissen, but mesa''ll give yousa another chance. Mostly because mesa have no other option.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 62, 's_319', 'I''ll protect it this time. Trust me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 63, 's_321', 'Yousa better. Mesa need dem droids.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 64, 's_323', 'I''ll do this another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 65, 's_325', 'If yousa must. Return when yousa ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 66, 's_327', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 67, 's_329', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 68, 's_331', 'Ello, boyos! Yous wantin ta speedaway down ta Roritowns? Or yousa been crunchen?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 69, 's_333', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 70, 's_335', 'Okeyday! Wesa give usa landaway... Which Roritown yousa goen?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 71, 's_337', 'Narmle Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 72, 's_339', 'Allee clear! Yousen landaway now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 73, 's_341', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 74, 's_343', 'Wesa thankin yousa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 75, 's_345', 'On second thought, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 76, 's_347', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 77, 's_349', 'Restuss Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 78, 's_351', 'Werry good! Restuss is waitin-now fer yousa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 79, 's_353', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 80, 's_355', 'Wesa thankin yousa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 81, 's_357', 'Cancel that request.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 82, 's_359', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 83, 's_361', 'The (Rebel) Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 84, 's_363', 'Werry good! Tey is waitin-now fer yousa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 85, 's_365', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 86, 's_367', 'Wesa thankin yousa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 87, 's_369', 'Cancel that request.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 88, 's_371', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 89, 's_373', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 90, 's_375', 'Oie Boie! You been crunchen, huh? Wesa gonna fix you up!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 91, 's_377', 'Just fix a little.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 92, 's_379', 'Wesa fixen some da crunchen to your ship. You payin %DI credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 93, 's_381', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 94, 's_383', 'Okeyday! We dood it!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 95, 's_385', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 96, 's_387', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 97, 's_389', 'Repair half the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 98, 's_391', 'Wesa fixen halfsies on da crunchen. You payin %DI credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 99, 's_393', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 100, 's_395', 'Okeyday! We dood it!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 101, 's_397', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 102, 's_399', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 103, 's_401', 'Repair most of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 104, 's_403', 'Wesa fixen mossen all da crunchen. You payin %DI credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 105, 's_405', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 106, 's_407', 'Okeyday! We dood it!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 107, 's_409', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 108, 's_411', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 109, 's_413', 'Fully repair my ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 110, 's_415', 'We fixen all dat crunchen fer %DI credits. Okeyday?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 111, 's_417', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 112, 's_419', 'We dood it! Yousa allee bombad now!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 113, 's_421', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 114, 's_423', 'Okeyday! Byenow, %NU!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 115, 's_425', 'Okeyday!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 116, 's_427', 'We dood it! Yousa allee bombad now!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 117, 's_429', 'Are you sure you can repair my ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 118, 's_431', 'No problem, %TU! Wesa pitty good at dis!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 119, 's_433', 'Ok, I want repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 120, 's_435', 'Yuosa see, we fix dat crunchen an yousa been good en new.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 121, 's_437', 'Forget it. I''ll get repairs somewhere else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 122, 's_439', 'Yousa tink yous smarty den us-ens? Yousa tink yous brain so big. Yousa fixen dat crunchen on your own sef den!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 123, 's_441', 'Have any jobs for an Imperial Pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 124, 's_443', 'Yin''. Yin''. Mesa got two duties for yousa. One bein'' ta protect supply line for da Imperial force. Da other bein'' ta reduce Rebel fighter activin'' in dissen system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 125, 's_445', 'I''ll escort those supply ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 126, 's_447', 'Da Imperial order says dat yousa are ta protect supply ships comin'' into da system from bein'' attackin'' and destroyin'' by Rebel fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 127, 's_449', 'I''ll fight Rebel ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 128, 's_451', 'Da Imperial order says dat da Rebels know too much about what''s happenin'' in dissen system. Yousa are ta knock dem down and disrupt deir efforts here.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 129, 's_453', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 130, 's_455', 'Okeyday! Byenow.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 131, 's_457', 'Do you know of any work for an RSF Pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 132, 's_459', 'Yin''. Mesa have two duties for yousa. Yousa can choose one. Da first bein'' ta fight Borvo piratin'' in da system. Da other bein'' ta escort and protect incomin'' dignitary transports from Black Sun attacks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 133, 's_461', 'I''ll fight Borvo pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 134, 's_463', 'Borvo''s pirates have been causin'' many problems lately. Yousa orders from da Queen are to take da fight to dese pirates and remind dem whosa controls dissen system. '),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 135, 's_465', 'I''ll escort the dignitary transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 136, 's_467', 'Black Sun ships have been harassin'' dignitary transports comin'' to Naboo. Da Queen desirin'' yousa help in protectin'' dese ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 137, 's_469', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 138, 's_471', 'Okeyday! Byenow.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 139, 's_473', 'Would you have any work for a Rebel Pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 140, 's_475', 'For yousa, yin''! Yousa helpin'' mesa, and now mesa help yousa. Mesa have two duties yousa could perform. One bein'' ta distract Imperial inquiries into dissen station by destroyin'' some Imperial fighters. Da other bein'' ta protect inbound shipments of repair droids.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 141, 's_477', 'I''ll distract the Empire for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 142, 's_479', 'Thank yousa. Dissen will give those nosy Imperials somethin'' else ta look into instead of mesa. Go destroy some Imperial fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 143, 's_481', 'I''ll protect inbound repair droid shipments.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 144, 's_483', 'Yin'', thank yousa. Dose repair droids are awful important to dissen station. Without dem, wesa no able to make any repairs, but wesa also can''t let anyone know wesa are usin'' dem. Make sure dey arrive safely and in secret.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 145, 's_485', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 146, 's_487', 'Okeyday! Byenow.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 147, 's_489', 'Hmmm. Mesa hear yousa Rebels are good at keepin'' a secret. If yousa''ll help mesa wid somedin'', mesa''ll send some work yousa way. And mesa''ll even let yousa land at da Rebel Base which mesa no supposin'' to know about. See, mesa can keep a secret as okiday.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 148, 's_491', 'Sounds good. What do you need me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 149, 's_493', 'Um, yeah. Da fact bein'', wesa no awful good at doin'' ship repairs, so mesa usin'' repair droids. Awful good repair droids. Da droids do everything and wesa no actually do anythin''. But mesa don''t want dissen secret to get out. People might just buy da repair droids demselvin'', and wesa''d lose all dat moolah.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 150, 's_495', 'Okay, I get it. Where do I come in?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 151, 's_497', 'Mesa needin'' yousa ta protect a shipment of repair droids on its way to dissen station. Borvo''s pirates keep attackin'' our shipments and tryin'' ta disrupt station business. Escort da freighter ta a safe location where station transports can accept da delivery in secrecy.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 152, 's_499', 'I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 153, 's_501', 'Ah, much thank yousa! Make sure dose droids make it here safely.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 154, 's_503', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 155, 's_505', 'Okeyday! Byenow. And forget mesa mentionin'' a Rebel Base on Rori, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 156, 's_507', 'No thanks. I''m not interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_rori.stf', 157, 's_509', 'Okeyday! Byenow. And forget mesa mentionin'' a Rebel Base on Rori, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_talus.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 3, 's_103ebe2f', 'You are cleared for landing at Dearic Starport. Please confirm.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 4, 's_13cd465', 'Negative, cancel that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 5, 's_16015565', 'Nashal Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 6, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 7, 's_16dacacf', 'You are cleared for landing at Nashall Starport. Please confirm.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 8, 's_1b3d0b9e', 'I''m looking for work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 9, 's_20df8d79', 'I... see... Well, what sort of work do you do?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 10, 's_22f23540', 'You are cleared for landing at the Talus Imperial Outpost. Please confirm.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 11, 's_234498b9', 'Very well, %NU. Enjoy your stay on Talus.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 12, 's_278cd19d', 'Alright. I''ll upload the program to your ship. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 13, 's_2902ab38', 'Imperial Outpost Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 14, 's_2b17557d', 'It''s a series of fake smuggling jobs to and from droid controlled drone ships. Some pilots make the run to hone their smuggling skills. But it''s all just for fun really.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 15, 's_305434ff', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 16, 's_335e1e3', 'Mag''n fweroba, %NU! Eshka b''lor ka pa?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 17, 's_38572429', 'Repair half of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 18, 's_38ddef56', 'Thanks. I''d like to land now, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 19, 's_39ecf00a', 'Looks like you''re a little busy right now. Why don''t you finish up what you''re doing and come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 20, 's_3a99c5fa', 'N''rynma, Pa! Range?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 21, 's_3adc835a', 'T''cost din miska %DI credits. Ka dir pa?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 22, 's_3eaa38fc', 'Thank you, %NU. Please comm the station again when you are within range. I look forward to talking to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 23, 's_3ee404d7', 'Fnyenk, b''dor, %TU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 24, 's_40163a4', 'Eh, you''re right. Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 25, 's_460e892f', 'Very well. Repairs complete. Thank you for allowing Talus station to be of service.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 26, 's_494f7626', 'Sorry, %TU. Perhaps we may be of service in the future. Please comm Talus Station again if there is anything we can do for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 27, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 28, 's_5360ec3f', 'Well, if you say so. Here''s the information for your first delivery run. We''ll contact you with more information when that''s finished.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 29, 's_536fb215', 'Good luck to you, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 30, 's_55ea041', 'Maybe another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 31, 's_5cf3921', 'Repair most of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 32, 's_5e3d8b95', 'Nyard''msh k''rall deeba Dearic Starport?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 33, 's_5e5b02dc', 'We can repair all of the damage for %DI credits. Is that acceptable, %NU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 34, 's_608c1c86', 'A very discreet delivery person?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 35, 's_622304ca', 'Oh.... alright. As a matter of fact, yes. I do have a couple of deliveries that you could make. The first one is here in the Corellia system. If that goes ok, then we will contact you with more. Too risky to be seen talking with you here, you see?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 36, 's_672b2c6f', 'Fnyorgin p''shhis!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 37, 's_67820697', 'Affirmative. I''m landing now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 38, 's_6997c76', 'Oh, wait... uh. No sir. Not right now. Have a pleasant day, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 39, 's_69e2af52', 'We can repair a half of the damage for %DI credits. Is that acceptable, %NU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 40, 's_6c8ffad8', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 41, 's_7b41cc12', 'Understood. Got work for me, or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 42, 's_7dbb29de', 'Very well. Stand by.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 43, 's_808845f3', 'As you wish, %TU. We can offer a variety of services with a fair and balanced fee for the amount of damage you wish to be repaired. Please indicate the degree to which you wish your ship to be repaired.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 44, 's_80d1bac3', 'You know, %TU, there is an IMPERIAL OUTPOST right here on Talus! They could be monitoring ALL of our comms!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 45, 's_8633b901', 'Welcome to Talus Station, %TU. How may we be of service to you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 46, 's_86511be7', 'There are droid controlled attack drones along the way, but hey, what fun is a smuggling job without a little challenge, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 47, 's_8bc61a14', 'Whatever you say, captain.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 48, 's_8c4754ed', 'OK, I''ll try it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 49, 's_90ab9704', 'Your range is too great for this station to assist you in any way, %TU. In order to request landing clearance or emergency repairs, you must decrease your range.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 50, 's_918c1120', 'Well, it doesn''t look like you did too well on your last job. Are you sure you''d like to try again?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 51, 's_91f9c80', 'Alright, I''ll upload the program to your ship. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 52, 's_9288900f', 'I understand.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 53, 's_998a06e6', 'You might say I''m sort of a delivery-person.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 54, 's_9b8f2142', 'Dearic Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 55, 's_a830645d', 'Neeshter syish freg''n Talus Station. Meesta krand''t fnyor, %TU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 56, 's_a9bcbfea', 'Oh, sure. You''ve proven yourself to be a pretty decent smuggler. Why don''t you try out the Tusk Cat Run?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 57, 's_ab4e2dfb', 'Say, you ARE a pretty good delivery person. Stop by again the next time you''re around. We might have a little something for you to try out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 58, 's_ab77f60d', 'Is it dangerous?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 59, 's_afed720c', 'We can repair a little of the damage for %DI credits. Is that acceptable, %NU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 60, 's_b1f89988', 'Thanks. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 61, 's_b27ab51e', 'Sure, sounds like fun!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 62, 's_b2f28d35', 'We can repair most of the damage for %DI credits. Is that acceptable, %NU?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 63, 's_b3c0bdbd', '(switch to encrypted channel)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 64, 's_ba2af981', 'Repair all of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 65, 's_be61c03c', 'Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 66, 's_c245bae', 'Pa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 67, 's_c2a24c7f', 'What is the Tusk Cat Run?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 68, 's_c358d041', '(Request Repairs)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 69, 's_c36f297f', 'Thanks. I need repairs now, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 70, 's_c8613339', 'Very well, %NU. Talus Station is at your disposal should the need arise.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 71, 's_cd4fd870', 'Nyard''msh k''rall deeba Talus Imperial Outpost?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 72, 's_d082abf0', 'Repair a little of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 73, 's_d3b3ffb2', 'Nyard''msh k''rall deeba Nashal Starport?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 74, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 75, 's_e03a2006', 'Yes, of course I''m sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 76, 's_ec207c14', 'As you wish, %NU. Please comm Talus Station again if we may be of any service to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 77, 's_ec7d72e3', 'Oh! Oh! Please switch to encrypted holochannel p278-98-alpha.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 78, 's_f34bcf78', '(Request Landing Permission)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 79, 's_f3dea437', 'Ok, I''ll fly closer.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 80, 's_f7c832f1', 'Imperial Outpost (Imperial Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 81, 's_f895eb69', 'Kan''dest ka nir zint! Pa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 82, 's_fd46b8d9', 'Kan''dest ka nir zan da zint! Pa!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 83, 's_fe3902e2', 'You know it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_talus.stf', 84, 's_ff85dbce', 'No problem, %NU, you''re welcome to land anywhere on Talus, at any time. What is your destination?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_tatooine.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 3, 's_121c3b6', 'What does this look like, an unemployment agency?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 4, 's_12b89c7f', 'Very well, good luck. Oh, and this target you''re going after, he''s a clever guy. Make sure to search the cargo of his ship if you get him.  He''s bound to have something interesting.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 5, 's_1ba81e14', 'Fine by me. Stay in orbit and rot. Tatooine Station, out!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 6, 's_1d21e3c0', 'Let me see if you''re welcome there. I guess you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 7, 's_1dbd74da', 'Well hail me when you figure out what it is you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 8, 's_27445295', 'Your ship has been completely fixed. No doubt I''ll be seeing you again real soon. Ha!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 9, 's_28b0a7fa', 'Well, if you don''t mind helping the Hutts, I might have something.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 10, 's_2a7858d1', 'Well, hail me when you figure out what it is you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 11, 's_2e631d52', 'Hook me up!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 12, 's_2f2188d5', 'I will come back later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 13, 's_3147a9c7', 'Sounds interesting, how do I get started?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 14, 's_333ffc01', 'Yeah, yeah. Tatooine station, out!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 15, 's_35221afe', 'So I noticed. Looks like you bit off a little more than you could chew. So what do want: a complete overhaul or just enough repairs to put you back on your way?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 16, 's_375a3c20', 'I just want to land on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 17, 's_382cb25f', 'Hutts?! I don''t think so.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 18, 's_39076454', 'Suit yourself, you were probably not the right person for the job anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 19, 's_3cbb3f38', 'Keep in mind, the target is pretty dangerous. Looking at you, you may need some help in completing this. Anyway, if you are ready now, I will patch you up to the contact Lady Valarian gave me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 20, 's_3cdf6820', 'Mos Espa Starport (Rebel Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 21, 's_42648804', 'Ok, how does %DI credits in exchange for repairing three-fourths of the damage sound to ya?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 22, 's_4360fc64', 'Do you have any work for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 23, 's_43b6dcb9', 'I''m too busy to wait. Let me know when you figure out what it is you want.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 24, 's_43d2bcbe', 'Bestine Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 25, 's_462a718b', 'Lady Valarian has placed a bounty on one of Jabba''s smugglers and is looking for competent pilots to collect it. Interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 26, 's_4650b19f', 'Watch your back.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 27, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 28, 's_4d9fae53', 'Ok, there you go. We fixed just enough to get you out of my face. See you next time. Ha!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 29, 's_4dc4840b', 'Wait, I changed my mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 30, 's_4fd56d4d', 'Mos Eisley Starport (Freelance Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 31, 's_52917b0d', 'Of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 32, 's_5739799e', 'These are not times to be picky, but suit yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 33, 's_5964dabc', 'I don''t think so, maybe another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 34, 's_5984746e', 'I want to land on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 35, 's_5cf3921', 'Repair most of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 36, 's_5e2a2bb1', 'Sounds good.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 37, 's_630ab375', 'Alright. The Hutts are hiring pilots to assist them in capturing freighters around the Tatooine system. If that sounds like something you want to do, I can connect you to one of them right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 38, 's_66b68768', 'I thought so.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 39, 's_696719e4', 'Minor repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 40, 's_69ffeefe', 'Mos Entha Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 41, 's_6aea6f34', 'Repair half the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 42, 's_6c8ffad8', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 43, 's_6ff46cdd', 'Go ahead and land. No one there cares who comes or goes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 44, 's_75ba8830', 'Mos Espa Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 45, 's_7a45c683', 'We can repair all the damage on your ship for a mere %DI credits. Good luck finding another offer like that around here.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 46, 's_82f403b1', 'I don''t have time for this, come back when you have made up your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 47, 's_83bace61', 'Yeah? Anywhere in particular or were you just gonna set down in the desert?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 48, 's_895d093', 'Ok.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 49, 's_96bea28d', 'I just need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 50, 's_a5254f36', 'No I don''t have time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 51, 's_a9152d31', 'Hey, you! What do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 52, 's_a9ce7ad3', 'Hey, what do you expect me to do for you when you''re so far away? Come closer before you bother me.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 53, 's_b086bdca', 'Fine by me. Repair it yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 54, 's_b26eb03c', 'Good riddance!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 55, 's_b6e0e78d', 'Repairs complete. You''re almost as good as new. Good as you probably need to be, anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 56, 's_b729c637', 'Land in the Dune Sea for all I care. Tatooine Station, out!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 57, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 58, 's_c1013aa7', 'Whatever.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 59, 's_c130a6b8', 'Sure, we can do that. Does %DI credits sound fair?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 60, 's_c4682ea6', 'Thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 61, 's_c5b42136', 'Repairs complete! See you soon! Ha!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 62, 's_ccbc6cf4', 'Mos Eisley Starport.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 63, 's_cd0dcead', 'Of course not.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 64, 's_ce4621b5', 'Jabba''s Palace.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 65, 's_d0fd857b', 'I''ll take it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 66, 's_d1076b9d', 'Repair all the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 67, 's_d195782', 'Wait! I changed my mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 68, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 69, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 70, 's_d7e462ff', 'Very well, give me a second.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 71, 's_da196589', 'Nevermind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 72, 's_dbc1c043', 'Bestine Starport (Imperial Pilot Trainer).'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 73, 's_dd4bb16d', 'Let''s do it!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 74, 's_e1ef9209', 'Wait, I don''t want to land there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 75, 's_e2190b5d', 'That name, I recognize that name. Oh, that''s right, you''re on my list to be offered some sensitive work if you''re interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 76, 's_e76d5278', 'On second thought, I don''t want to land there.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 77, 's_ea06a410', 'Ok, you''re clear to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 78, 's_eecfecc1', 'We can touch up the paint for %DI credits. How''s that sound?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_tatooine.stf', 79, 's_f2b8a1d8', 'What kind of work?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (station_yavin4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 3, 's_1000a375', 'Sure, what can I do to help?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 4, 's_1642841a', 'So...so did you find out...anything?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 5, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 6, 's_170a9bf2', 'I will take a crack at the second area.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 7, 's_17204aa9', 'Ok! Back to work, right!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 8, 's_1be05588', 'Did the ship go boom? I hope you made them...pay for scaring all of us. They will think twice about trying anything like that again, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 9, 's_1c7eca56', 'The third area is probably where they are.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 10, 's_1e323046', 'I have been watching you and I think you are just...shady enough to be of use. Maybe you would like to carry a...a secret package to Naboo. No questions asked, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 11, 's_1e46e4ca', 'I need to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 12, 's_238a5da3', 'Oh yeah, right! You''re ok! Land when ready, huh!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 13, 's_24645c62', 'What is the message?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 14, 's_27407967', 'You got the ship back in one piece. Your command will be pleased to discover that. We have transferred the freighter to them and they are...they are questioning the pilot, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 15, 's_281a828d', 'You want me to...to stall the Empire? I am grateful for what you have done but I will only stall them for a little while, right? What else can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 16, 's_29093d3e', 'Okay. They are not going to hold off on killing our man much longer, right? Try to hurry.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 17, 's_2b11ced5', 'Bosses think we should send Corellia Deep Mining a...a message. We pay you to go destroy the leader...you know...of these fake Massa...the mercenaries, right? We have spotted where that ship is. You got destroy them and then we laugh at Corellia Mining Company, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 18, 's_2b867034', 'Yeah, right? Ok. Where do you want to land now, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 19, 's_2c9ad69a', 'Do they want anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 20, 's_2d2ea22b', 'Fine...I will tell your command and it will not be company''s fault, right? They can...well they can blame you for not doing what needs to be done. Maybe you make things right later on. Is there anything you need now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 21, 's_2dbe402f', 'There was nothing there. Let me try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 22, 's_2dc4697a', '(Land)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 23, 's_2e963e84', 'They are not going to like that...you know. You are in luck...another freighter left and they didn''t pay either. Maybe you should...you know...get them, right? I will send you an update to where they are, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 24, 's_305434ff', 'I want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 25, 's_32c93882', 'Fix half the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 26, 's_33418857', 'You seem a little out of it today.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 27, 's_337d7f80', 'He said...he said you need to focus on one task at a time, right. Come back when you are not working, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 28, 's_36142d2b', 'I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 29, 's_362a48e0', 'Anything else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 30, 's_382df536', 'How did...your assignment go? Did you help the convoy out...did you find out who is doing this to us? We are still getting reports...of trouble from all over the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 31, 's_38f85840', 'Massassi?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 32, 's_3aac2f84', 'Yeah, right! You can never mind, too, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 33, 's_3c12de44', 'I don''t have time for this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 34, 's_3d4bf49c', 'Fine...fine. I will update the location of the enemy ship yet again. The bosses are getting impatient and want this matter solved...you know...quickly, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 35, 's_40aac287', 'No, thanks. Sounds too dangerous.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 36, 's_4110b7ff', 'Wow...I didn''t think you would say that. Maybe, you come back later and save us all from...from certain doom, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 37, 's_41cc7b3e', 'Ya? Me either. I don''t like crazy people and they are...touched, you know. I send you to areas where they hang out. You kill them all, right? The company will pay for each one you take out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 38, 's_4658b1ba', 'No, thanks. I think I will stay out of this.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 39, 's_48d5ef59', 'I am just the pilot you are looking for.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 40, 's_4bb8df07', '%DI credits! You gotta pay now, huh!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 41, 's_4ed46b5d', '[relate mission details]'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 42, 's_4f34ceb5', 'That showed those crazies that we mean business. You did...good. The bosses like it when a plan works out.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 43, 's_4f36a268', 'Ah, so they are not Massassi! The Corellia Deep Mining Company was just trying to...you know...scare us into leaving and taking our operation over. HA! They almost got away with it too. You sure meddled in their plans, right? I bet...I bet they are not happy right now. We will pay you for doing so good.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 44, 's_4fe53802', 'The bosses are very...pleased, right? You got our man back from the loonies. We always pay for a job well done. If you...you know...don''t mind we might have more work for you in the future.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 45, 's_504c55d7', 'I need to go out again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 46, 's_5171cf99', 'You brought back a very nice...prize for your command. They are glad...they are pleased that you have succeeded.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 47, 's_5482942', 'Yes...payment. Here is your pay for a job well done. Now forget you ever did that for us, right? Is there anything else you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 48, 's_54aa968b', 'Oh...yes. They have told me to pay you for them. Is there anything else I can help you with?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 49, 's_550d80c', 'I am looking for some quick work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 50, 's_56df1754', 'So...so did you find them? Maybe not...eh? Yes, right? Did you stop them from killing us all?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 51, 's_57a3711', 'Well, I...we need help! But you are too busy...too busy. If you were not working on something else...you know...you could work for us!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 52, 's_5b3f10e8', 'I will try to help them.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 53, 's_5bbcc6ae', 'Sounds like I can help.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 54, 's_5bd69df6', 'What do you need me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 55, 's_5f17be38', 'I will check out the second location.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 56, 's_61d2adfc', 'So what does the computer say about the Massassi?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 57, 's_66b09324', 'Well...I cannot say that the executives are...you know...happy about this turn of events. We cannot pay you for this...job, right? But at least you were willing to help. Maybe in the future we can have work for you...work that you won''t screw up.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 58, 's_698e2f7b', 'I think I will head to the second area.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 59, 's_6a96c9e9', 'Huh? Oh. Ok, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 60, 's_6c8ffad8', 'I need repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 61, 's_6ca9e420', 'Good...good. You need to meet our delivery ship in this system and take it out to Naboo. When you are in Naboo, you need to...to fly a special route. Our pickup man will recognize you by that route. If anyone interferes you will...well you will have to make them uninterfere, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 62, 's_6e605bd6', 'About payment?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 63, 's_6f79f449', 'People...dead long time ago. They lived on Yavin...you see their writings all over Yavin 4. I will use computer to translate, right? I don''t know why...I don''t know how the fighters would be using Massassi language. That is very strange, right? We will pay for your services. Computer should have answers soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 64, 's_6ff7e194', 'Stall them. I need to do something else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 65, 's_70ff6541', 'Good...good. I will point you in the right direction again, okay? Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 66, 's_74cde053', 'Debris Cult! They are here...wait no...oh! My bosses said they have something for you...you know...to do. But they need your full attention, right? Come back when you are not...you know...working on something else.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 67, 's_75d9fc2d', 'That is great...great news. I will send you information on where he is being held. Capture the ship and...and bring it back here, right? You do this for us and we...we will not forget, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 68, 's_7771bbc9', 'I need to get back to you on that.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 69, 's_7afe2900', 'Imperial Base.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 70, 's_7c3eca7b', '50% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Now you go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 71, 's_7ce5949b', 'Hmmm...oh, yes...yes, you can. We are having this problem with those crazy debris cultists, right? They decided that we were to blame for the Imperial salvage operation and have taken one of our executives hostage. Those loonies say that if we don''t leave they are going...they are going to kill him, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 72, 's_7d8d113d', 'Let me see that. Oh...wow! This is great. This has the location of where they are keeping our man. We will pay you for your help in finding this, but maybe you could...you know...rescue our executive, right? We might have a...short time so you let me know when you are ready, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 73, 's_7de495e9', 'Just fix a little of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 74, 's_7e57c029', 'I am looking for some special work.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 75, 's_7e90de8b', 'So does my command need anything now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 76, 's_7ee088d3', 'Ok, you know what you are doing, right? I will send you a patrol route that...it will take you around the area mentioned in the writing.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 77, 's_7f4fd215', 'I can rescue your executive now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 78, 's_7fab133d', 'Alright, so what do you need now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 79, 's_826b822', 'Mining Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 80, 's_82e7434e', 'Fine...same drill as before. We will give you new package to deliver. You do this and we pay you, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 81, 's_84388bb', 'Ok, I will take care of that for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 82, 's_84ee6fa0', 'I will check out the first location.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 83, 's_85861a57', 'Hmmm? Yes...messages from your...commander. But he said that you cannot be working on...you know...other things. So maybe come back when you are free, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 84, 's_85a18987', 'Yes...yes. That is good...great news. We will pay you for what you have done. You are good pilot, very good pilot. Is there anything else you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 85, 's_85e232ff', 'I will watch over the freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 86, 's_8684604b', 'Nope, but I will go look again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 87, 's_86922104', 'Yes. I found this on the debris cult ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 88, 's_89761e1', 'You are busy. I am busy. Too busy to discuss this matter. Come back when you are less busy, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 89, 's_89c7160a', 'We have this convoy that just sent out a...a distress signal. They need help. You can go help them and maybe also find out who is...you know...attacking them, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 90, 's_8ac5cbaf', '[relate details of mission]'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 91, 's_8bd7b9f9', 'I...I understand. We could really use your help in dealing with these loonies. But if you won''t, you won''t. Is there anything...anything else you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 92, 's_8d876d5d', 'How is that Debris Cult problem going?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 93, 's_914cece8', 'Ok, see you, right? Later, huh!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 94, 's_9512e7b6', 'Ah, so you just need quick...job, right? I have what you need. We need help with...cutting down on the Debris Cult numbers. Also, maybe you...if you want...could help escort some of our freighters?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 95, 's_96106d14', 'Your high command...well...they wanted one of their people to go get this freighter. You can go get this freighter, right? I will send you the location of where it is...you better hurry before it leaves the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 96, 's_97155f17', 'I will need to get back to this problem of yours.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 97, 's_994bdf16', 'You will! Great...that makes me happy to hear. I don''t want to be killed by these...Massassi. The document mentions three areas that seem to be...to be important. Those might be good to check out, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 98, 's_9d3a870e', 'They told me to give you...I am supposed to pay you. They also said that they are almost done with the questions and they might need you to help...you know...later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 99, 's_9ed36c63', 'Do...what? We didn''t ask you to do anything, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 100, 's_a0d09783', 'Only my failure. I need to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 101, 's_a11e9514', 'Yeah, you should go out again. What route do you plan on taking this time?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 102, 's_a3447b3e', 'No, thanks. I will pass.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 103, 's_a3a3ddb5', 'Fix all of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 104, 's_a5105d38', 'Glad I could help.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 105, 's_a5e6e823', 'Quick work? You already have a...a job. Finish that before we spend time working together, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 106, 's_a7682fb9', 'Yeah, no worries, right? We will deal with it. So what do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 107, 's_a8657d8a', 'Yes? What? I mean... oh. Yavin Four Labor and Mining Company station, here. Who are you and what do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 108, 's_aa668ed0', 'I never liked those cultists.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 109, 's_ac3664be', 'Those Massassi are sure...sneaky. Which area would you like to check out next. You go out and you will find them, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 110, 's_ac4d2f7b', 'Yeah, you got damage, right. We can fix that, no problem, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 111, 's_ac93ee89', 'Right, never mind, huh? I guess so!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 112, 's_afffbb01', 'Hmmm...well all reports show another ship in the same area of the Corellia system. Maybe you go check that one out, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 113, 's_b0064b47', 'Sounds like a mystery for me to solve.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 114, 's_b10d0d97', 'Don''t know! It''s not pirates, since they are not taking anything...just destroying. Maybe you could find out who it is...if you want. We will pay you, of course, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 115, 's_b1d9e97d', 'I would rather not get involved right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 116, 's_b239081a', '25% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Now you go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 117, 's_b3228c04', 'You can go kill the cult leader, right? The leader of the...loonies never tries to hide so we know where he is. We can send you right to him. You blow that crazy out of the system and we will pay you for your...services.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 118, 's_b4d282f9', 'No worries...I said nothing, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 119, 's_b745173d', 'What? Oh, it''s you. Did you find out anything about our missing man?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 120, 's_b883f442', 'So, the leader got away, right? Not that it is any problem really...he came back. I told you they were loonies. Even with us...trying to kill him, he still comes back. You can take another whack at him, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 121, 's_b942e498', 'Oh yeah, right! Hard workers there. You''re ok! Land when ready, huh!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 122, 's_b989d1b3', '(Abort Landing)'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 123, 's_bad44c3c', 'I do not have special work for busy...pilots. Finish what you are working on and then...you know...I might have something for you, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 124, 's_bc264042', 'I will get back to this problem later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 125, 's_bc357ddf', 'Did you find...you know...any of those Massassi out there? Wait! I don''t want to know...I don''t like ghosts. You just tell me if you won or lost, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 126, 's_bee28138', 'Glad you have asked...glad indeed. The bosses are still...you know...mad about the hostage taking incident, right? Maybe you could help make them...not so mad, you know?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 127, 's_bf4f4650', 'It seems to be some sort of warning...these Massassi want us...the company...to leave the planet and system. If we do not, they...they will kill us all. Maybe you could destroy them first, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 128, 's_bf522c1c', 'What? No...yes! It''s nothing, right. Well, actually we have been losing lots of ships lately. They are being attacked and destroyed. No survivors. The bosses decided...for safety...to send out convoys of freighter but that apparently hasn''t helped.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 129, 's_bf544155', 'I take it that you failed and don''t want to try again. I understand...those mystery fighters worry me too. We will find a way to deal with them...maybe you will help in the future...right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 130, 's_c04cb7fd', 'I just got another report of another convoy in trouble. Maybe you would like...you know...try to help them out, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 131, 's_c1a784c7', 'Hey, you are back..good. Did you find the evil Massassi trying to kill us all? You did...didn''t you? Did you destroy them all...you know...and save us?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 132, 's_c22323cb', 'That area is very dangerous...but you are good pilot, right? I will send you patrol route. It will take you around the area mentioned by the Massassi.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 133, 's_c26109ef', 'Not right now. Maybe later.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 134, 's_c3e92bf9', 'I see you out there, right? But why are you so far away? Can''t help you with anything from way out there, huh? Ok! Fly closer if you need me, right!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 135, 's_c4025f7f', 'You let me know what you want to do, right? I will see to it that you get what you...what you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 136, 's_c65f1e3e', 'I don''t want to talk about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 137, 's_c820fb26', 'Ok, ok...we still happy that you helped us before. What can we help you with...now, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 138, 's_c88bcdf1', 'Let me try out the first area.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 139, 's_c9085385', 'No worries...you just let me know if you are interested. So...can I help you with something now, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 140, 's_c9c08b99', 'Let me try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 141, 's_ca8c30c3', 'We got word from our man in Naboo that the...that the special package made it there. You did...good.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 142, 's_ce5c006e', 'Let me check out that...document you recovered. What! This shouldn''t be...not at all. This document is written...it is written...in Massassi. But Massassi are dead...they all dead...hundreds...thousands...they all dead a long time ago.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 143, 's_ce7c38dc', 'Not yet. I need to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 144, 's_cfeb314', 'What? Who are you...wait never mind. Let me see here...oh, yeah, this. Listen this isn''t the company''s fault...this is the pilot''s fault, right? We hired some pilots to help us ship some stuff and they didn''t pay their Imperial flight taxes before they left the system. We reported it to your command...you know...like a good loyal company would.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 145, 's_d0a3dd21', 'My bosses are not happy that you...you know...lost the first man. But they are pleased to get a new, shiny executive fresh from headquarters. The bosses told me to pay you. Also they said for me to give you...work if you need it, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 146, 's_d1e796bb', 'You got it. I will send you a patrol route that will take you around the area mentioned in these writings. You go out and see what...see what you can find.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 147, 's_d431431b', 'Are there any messages for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 148, 's_d6871012', 'You''re the boss, right? If you want to take another...shot at him, just let me know.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 149, 's_d751e8a9', 'I cannot wait to see look on...on their CEO when we tell him...you know...that we know. I will send you the location of their ship. You go blow it up and we all profit, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 150, 's_d7bd9744', 'Let me check out the first area.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 151, 's_d8fb3431', 'Our man in Naboo said he didn''t get the...special delivery.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 152, 's_dce1cf5c', 'That is great news...I will tell the bosses that I have found a pilot that can help us out. We don''t know where they are keeping our man, but we do know where the...demands are being broadcast from. If you go check out that ship, I bet they will know where our man is, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 153, 's_e0bc7c8a', 'I need repairs'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 154, 's_e233265e', 'Fix most of the damage.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 155, 's_e5cc8ab2', '75% of your ship''s damage has been fixed. Now you go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 156, 's_e6b2affe', 'That mercenary will not be pretending to be Massassi again.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 157, 's_e6bdd32b', 'That is good. The company has been having...problems with our freighters being attacked. We will pay for each freighter you get out of the system, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 158, 's_e6e072e0', 'What? Mining Outpost? Ok, right. You''re clear. Land any time you want, so!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 159, 's_e9060855', 'I will check out the third location.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 160, 's_ea72067c', 'Can we send message taunting Corellia Mining Company? I have been waiting...been waiting to taunt them.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 161, 's_f03bdbb4', 'You seem a little confused. Can I help?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 162, 's_f2d0e888', 'I got a report that they...you know...finished their questioning of the pilot you brought back. It would seem that this is...this is part of a larger smuggler operation. They need you to travel to the Corellia system and meet with the ship...the vessel that the freighter was going to meet with. I have been instructed to send you the location, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 163, 's_f366ed39', 'Here is your payment...for services rendered...as promised. You just let me know if you are willing to do some more work. Yes, we always have something that needs done, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 164, 's_f3ae756e', 'Right...you make the call. You let me know when you are ready, right? What can I do for you now?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 165, 's_f3c91859', 'Your ship is fixed, now. So! Now you''re leaving, ok!'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 166, 's_f4af242d', 'Labor Outpost.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 167, 's_f5012975', 'Are you sure? Yes...yes you are sure, right? Fine, maybe you keep the Massassi from slaughtering us all later. Do you need something else?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 168, 's_f771fd8a', 'Let''s just say it didn''t turn out well.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 169, 's_f7a9938a', 'Who is attacking your vessels?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 170, 's_f81ac626', 'Your command wants an update...you know...on your progress with the smuggler operation. Do you have anything to report?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 171, 's_f87400e1', 'Did you get the vessel? Your command wants a...an update. I will contact them with what happened, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 172, 's_fa50b9ba', 'Sure. I won''t miss this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 173, 's_fb527baf', 'How did...your assignment go? Did you help the convoy out...did you find out who is doing this to us? Do not keep me in suspense...what did you find out?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 174, 's_fc7d4b5c', 'Good...great...wonderful. You go and help them now. I will send you their location, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 175, 's_fca1af26', 'So what about those fake Massassi?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 176, 's_fd0f3d0e', 'No...well not right now anyways, right? How about you finish up with what you are...you know...working on. Then come back and see me, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/station_yavin4.stf', 177, 's_fdfb1283', '(Transfer funds)'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_bestine.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 3, 's_2e41605f', 'Your aura indicates you are a pilot. Is this true, young %TO?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 4, 's_324c1a5a', 'Yeah, but.. I gotta do other things.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 5, 's_499a8089', 'Dathomir? Even more impressive. I suppose I can tolerate you a little longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 6, 's_49ebaa61', 'Corellia.. what a waste of my time!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 7, 's_50394b57', 'Why, indeed, it is. I''ve never noticed him before. Of course, it''s a Hutt, you dolt! In fact, *he* is my employer. I highly recommend oweing him the proper respect. He hasn''t been fed today.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 8, 's_6128587b', 'What information? Where can I find it?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 9, 's_61e0fe65', 'Oh... it''s you. Well, what did you find? If you managed to find anything with your mundane fighting skills, just drag the object on me and we''ll get this over with.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 10, 's_66e27b28', 'I don''t have all day to chatter with you, little %TO. The information can be found in the space systems. Go up there, try not to die *too* often and collect information from the enemies you eliminate. The information can be in the form of a log or even a diary. Go now. Your presence make me nauseous.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 11, 's_6c3929dd', 'Hurrah. You managed to bring something back from Yavin 4. I''m not impressed.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 12, 's_6d679a15', 'You petty %TO. My employer, Belhata the Hutt--how original--is here to mingle with his... ''friends'', the twisted politicians of Bestine. While Belhata is here, he assumed it would be a good idea to employ peons, like yourself, to gather information for him. Unfortunately, to make it worth while, I have to pay you for any type of information you find. My life has turned painfully pitiful.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 13, 's_781f5cfe', 'Out of all the creatures to make you nauseous...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 14, 's_7b7f4a0f', 'I said go!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 15, 's_7cbeeeed', 'No, I don''t want to get you any information!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 16, 's_811e4893', 'I suppose this information will be worth a few credits.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 17, 's_a050b81f', 'That''s a shame.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 18, 's_b05e0d8c', 'Fine, then don''t!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 19, 's_c03b2cd7', 'Yes, yes. Go away.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 20, 's_c10227fa', 'You''re setting your sights a little higher, I see. I still find you annoying.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 21, 's_c2e59721', 'Wow! I''ve never seen one before. What is he doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 22, 's_c333eea', 'I''ll bring you your information, but only because you''re paying me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 23, 's_d4673a', 'Not a pilot, eh? Go away. We don''t want to talk to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 24, 's_d7e58047', 'Tatooine. I could walk outside this cantina and find more information than this!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 25, 's_da2693fc', 'Endor? I''m slightly impressed. You may not be completely wrothless, after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 26, 's_de1ad09e', 'Yeah, sure. Hey, is that a Hutt?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 27, 's_e523caed', 'Of alll the places, you decided to hunt in Naboo? Ugh. Please leave. Find something better than this next time!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_bestine.stf', 28, 's_f468472d', 'From a freighter? You may be a good choice to serve in our court. Ruthless, I like it!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_collector.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 3, 's_11bab004', 'Yousa hep mesa?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 4, 's_18833216', 'Oh. And you need information?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 5, 's_20931802', 'Ooie booie! Mesa welcome yousa, boyo! Did yousa find anythin''? If yousa did, drag da object onto mesa and mesa pay yousa for it! Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 6, 's_236d3d10', 'Maccaneks..? Yousa basic folks say ''ship''? Flyin'' in da space?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 7, 's_253fa7ea', 'Oh. Okay. I''m sad.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 8, 's_26df7294', 'Corellia.. Mesa thank yousa for hepin'' mesa with dis.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 9, 's_2b8acda7', 'I''ll think about it. I need more information.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 10, 's_37b0ec80', 'Naboo! Mesa recognize anythin'' from dere. Thank yousa for hepin'' mesa. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 11, 's_48d5fb5a', 'I can''t understand a word you''re saying.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 12, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 13, 's_5a59fcdc', 'Sounds good. I''ll go look and come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 14, 's_5d39c47e', 'Ooie booie! Yousa a pilot! Mesa need yousa hep with somethin''. Okieday? Will yousa hep mesa? Mesa need some information from da space systems above usan. Yousa have a maxibig maccaneks, okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 15, 's_618244d1', 'Yes, I will *help* you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 16, 's_64f35d26', 'Ooie booie, Endor! Mesa hear lot of rumors about dat space system. Stinkowiff Imps!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 17, 's_7cabd9ea', 'Mesa thankful.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 18, 's_8bac8381', 'Ooie booie! Mesa happy!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 19, 's_91b60e5f', 'Dis'' from Yavin 4. Mooie mooie! One day, mesa hope to visit de space systems too. Okieday! Mesa almost forgot. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 20, 's_9a173443', 'Okay. Now we''re getting somewhere.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 21, 's_a3b5a049', 'Lok.. Mesa not heard much about dat place. Was yousa okieday up dere?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 22, 's_afaf698', 'Ooie booie! Yousa not a pilot. Mesa need a pilot. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 23, 's_b21c6039', 'Ooie booie! From Dathomir? Dat deserves a lot of moola, okieday. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 24, 's_b5402a0f', 'Wheresan isa dis from? Ooie booie! Itsa from a freighter. Yousa not a mooie mooie nice %TO!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 25, 's_b59591d7', 'Okieday. Mesa sad now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 26, 's_c416ff05', 'Dantooine isa a fine place. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 27, 's_c5da1302', 'Okay. Sounds fair.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 28, 's_c7c399e0', 'Tatooine! Mesa hear many thin''s about space system. Lot of pirates, okieday? If mesa ever visit de space systems, mesa goin'' to stay away from dat one.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 29, 's_c8984072', 'Okieday. Enemies drop logs and diaries? Yousa get. Bring to mesa. Mesa give moola.. er--credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 30, 's_c8d95e9d', 'Ooie booie! Mesa glad! Whensa yousa find anythin'', just come back and drag de object on mesa and mesa will pay yousa for it. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 31, 's_d89d872a', 'No, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_collector.stf', 32, 's_f37c7b85', 'Okieday. Mesa need information for mesa clan. Wesa really interested in what goes on in da space systems. Yousa enemies have a chance of droppin'' logs or diaries when yousa defeat them. If yousa don''t want what yousa find, yousa can bring them to mesa and mesa pay yousa for them. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_coronet.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 3, 's_1b7e5efd', 'Hm. Sounds fair. I''m a part of the ''News Now!'' Information Guild, specializing in the news of the galaxy. Here''s where you come in.. I''m afraid of heights, you see. I can''t fly and often get motion sickness up there when I try. You need to go up there and gather information for me. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 4, 's_43fa3ec7', 'Alright! I''m so excited! In space, there''s a chance your enemy will drop a bit of information be it ''a log'', or ''a diary'', or what have you. If you bring them to me, I''ll pay you handsomely for them. Granted, some will be worth more than others. If you find some, just hand them to me, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 5, 's_4670569c', 'From Corellia? This ought to be valuable information! Here''s your pay. Keep bringing them to me if you find anymore. I''ll always need them!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 6, 's_480f9afe', 'Greetin''s! Aren''t you a lil'' young to be walkin'' ''round here all by your lonesome? Oh, hon. Don''t be like that. I was just givin'' you a hard time. Listen.. are you a pilot? You look to be. I need your help with somethin''. What do you think?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 7, 's_491794fd', 'Oh! This looks like it came from a freighter! Wait a second.. shame on you for picking on poor, defenseless freighters! Oh well.. news is news, right? Here''s your pay. Remember, come back if you find more!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 8, 's_4b465cc3', 'Oh. Okay. Maybe you can come by and see me after I get off from work, then? *wink*'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 9, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 10, 's_5a59fcdc', 'Sounds good. I''ll go look and come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 11, 's_6de6d29b', 'First, explain what you need done. Then, I''ll think about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 12, 's_86775be0', 'Ah, Tatooine! So much pirate activity going on in that system. I was expecting something from there soon. And here you are! Thank you. Here''s your pay. I hope to see you again with more information. It''s doing wonders for the Information Guild!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 13, 's_8794aec1', 'Oh! Welcome back! Didja'' enjoy your flight? I bet you have some information for me. If you do, just give it to me by dragging and dropping! I''ll pay you handsomely for anything you find.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 14, 's_8894e226', 'What a sweetie! This information from the Lok system will do wonders for the Information Guild. Thank you for doing this. I hope to see you soon. Bring any tidbits of information you find out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 15, 's_8e14e452', 'Oh.. you don''t look like you''re a pilot, hon. That''s too bad. I could use someone like you to help me with a lil'' somethin''. Let me know when you get a ship and your wings, alright hon?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 16, 's_9e4796e9', 'Endor? I keep hearing a lot about that space system. Seems the Empire is up to no good up there. Here''s your pay. Keep visiting me with information!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 17, 's_a050b81f', 'That''s a shame.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 18, 's_a0c8586a', 'News from Dathomir? That deserves a hefty credit, indeed! Here''s your pay. Keep visiting those space systems and collect information for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 19, 's_b02ea236', 'I need more information. Where do I get this ''information''?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 20, 's_cde666f4', 'Let me see. Oh! Do you find yourself in a lot of dogfights? If you do, there''s a chance your enemy will drop a bit of information be it ''a log'', or ''a diary'', or what have you. If you bring them to me, I''ll pay you handsomely for them. Granted, some will be worth more than others. If you find some, just hand them to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 21, 's_d2e79392', 'Thanks, hon! You''re a life saver!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 22, 's_d38cbaeb', 'Yavin 4''s system.. it seems you''ve provided great information here. Great job! Here''s your pay. Keep returning with those bits of information!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 23, 's_d50da00e', 'Naboo, huh? What a peaceful place. I didn''t think I''d get any information from that system. I''m so glad! Here''s your pay. Keep coming back with the information you find, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 24, 's_d89d872a', 'No, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 25, 's_eeb5ec9', 'Yes, I am!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_coronet.stf', 26, 's_fb2d2773', 'Information straight from Dantooine! There''s so much going on there. Thank you so much! I should be getting a promotion soon with all this information I keep getting! Here''s your pay. Be sure to come back with more.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_eisley.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 3, 's_1938855f', 'I don''t know anything about Lok. I wonder what it''s like. Maybe I''ll go there one day. Oh--sorry. Thank you for this. Here''s your pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 4, 's_249fa88e', 'Oh no!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 5, 's_39ab0bf8', 'I don''t know where this is from, but it seems interesting. Thank you, kind %TO.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 6, 's_3a570abb', 'I''m going to get into so much trouble.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 7, 's_3e114acc', 'That mouse thing is your master?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 8, 's_4cf73d47', 'Okay. What about this task?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 9, 's_4dcc9c02', 'My master is a Chadra-Fan. He does kinda look like a mouse, doesn''t he? We came to Mos Eisley because Chadra-Fan are very afraid of drowning. Since there''s no water here on Tatooine, it really isn''t a problem for him.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 10, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 11, 's_5fea04c', 'My master says I can speak with you. You seem to be a pilot and we--or at least, he--could use your help with a small task. If you don''t say yes, my master will be very angry at me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 12, 's_60682af', 'Tatoo--Tatooine! That''s where we are now! Sorry, I''m just learning how to read. My master will be very happy with this.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 13, 's_6acea54', 'Naboo.. I hear it''s such a nice, pleasant place. I want to go there one day, but my master won''t let me yet. He''s very protective. Thank you for this.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 14, 's_7c4f443', 'I''ve been to Corellia a couple of times. It''s kinda depressing, though. The colors are too grey. Oh--thank you for the information. Here''s your pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 15, 's_8aa2d689', 'Well, I was orphaned at a very young age and was found by a slave smuggler. He sold me to a Chadra-Fan whom took me to his homeworld on Chad. I met my master, Peraw, soon afterward and he taught me the Chadra-Fan language. I''m a loyal servant who happens to know Basic as well.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 16, 's_914ec8cb', 'Oh, he does. You''re such a nice %TO.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 17, 's_95de3587', 'You''re the best %TO! This is great information for my master.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 18, 's_9c4a22e', 'Thanks. About this task you mentioned...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 19, 's_9f7731a8', 'Wow! Dathomir! I''ve heard so many things about the nasty Imperials and their prison on that planet--oh, I better be quiet, my master says. There are a lot of Imperial friends around here.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 20, 's_a128c839', 'Thank you for the information. My master will be most happy!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 21, 's_a1368bc4', 'Oh yeah. Sorry. The task... My master needs information from the.. uh, space systems, I guess it is? I''m not really too smart about those beyond the ground. Anyway, the information can be ''a log'', or ''a diary'', or anything like that. If you find them, just give them to me. My master trusts me when it comes in his money. I can give you some for the information you bring us.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 22, 's_a27729d9', 'Interesting. What task did you want me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 23, 's_a5a29e5e', 'I hope he treats you nicely.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 24, 's_b73ef16b', 'Sounds good. I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 25, 's_c28b61a1', 'I''m so happy! Please come back as soon as you can. I always get a good behavior treat when I do well for my master.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 26, 's_ca583977', 'Endor... I''ve never been there before either. I really need to travel one of these days. It''s one of my dreams.. Oh well. Thank you for this.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 27, 's_cbf9648e', 'Oh yeah. Sorry. I can get so talkative sometimes. My master doesn''t like it so much. The task... My master needs information from the.. uh, space systems, I guess it is? I''m not really too smart about those beyond the ground. Anyway, the information can be ''a log'', or ''a diary'', or anything like that. If you find them, just give them to me. My master trusts me when it comes in his money. I can give you some for the information you bring us.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 28, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 29, 's_da79c836', 'Weird. How did he become your master?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 30, 's_db040e63', 'I''m so glad you''ve returned. You didn''t forget about me! Did you find anything up there? If you did, you can just drag it on me. I will pay you for each. My master will be so happy!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_eisley.stf', 31, 's_e0574420', 'My master says I can''t talk to you because you''re not a pilot. Please forgive me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_espa.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 3, 's_33ae86cf', 'I feed you to Jabba''s sarlacc.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 4, 's_518aa438', 'Weequay, servant to Jabba. Now go.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 5, 's_526a8baa', 'Yavin 4 provide good information. Here. Go away.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 6, 's_59bbb156', 'You are a pilot. I need information and you will help me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 7, 's_85a47567', 'You find information for Jabba? Drag object on me for pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 8, 's_9208410d', '...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 9, 's_9a1df5f5', 'What are you, anyway?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 10, 's_a01d56d5', 'Tatooine provide little information. Jabba on Tatooine. But, pay anyway. Here.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 11, 's_aa27fded', 'I''m not afraid of you or Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 12, 's_abaa5f2c', 'Okay. By the way, your Basic is pretty good.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 13, 's_b7dcdcb5', 'I have something else to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 14, 's_bad36576', 'Can you be anymore rude? What if I don''t want to help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 15, 's_bf137a50', 'So be it.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 16, 's_c234a75b', 'Jabba needs information from space systems. Go, fight and bring back data disks and logs. You find one, you will know what I talk about.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 17, 's_d00fd861', 'You are not a pilot. Leave now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 18, 's_d92b587c', 'Endor... strong place. Here good pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 19, 's_dda5f48c', 'Naboo place where weak humans go. Here pay. Go get more.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 20, 's_e13ea287', 'I advise you to steer clear of Jabba''s men, then, little %TO.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 21, 's_e7b0189e', 'Hm. Fair enough. What do you need help with?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 22, 's_e8d7669c', 'Dathomir... another strong place. Jabba will be happy.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_espa.stf', 23, 's_eb89c5e8', 'Corellia.. weak place! Get better information!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_kaadara.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 3, 's_15849cf7', 'Yavin 4. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 4, 's_17719eaa', 'Scanning.. .. Little %TO. Welcomed return. Model 5-D23 requests information. Drag and drop object for processing identification.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 5, 's_2c1ae38f', 'Scanning. Little %TO does not compute. Not a pilot. Move along.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 6, 's_348fdf07', 'I must go do something else for now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 7, 's_35e1b3d3', 'Scanning.. .. Scanning complete. Confimed. You''re a pilot. Mobel number 5-D23 asks for your assistance. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 8, 's_3a806939', 'Roger, roger. Model 5-D23 is requesting that little %TO gather information that can be found of enemies in space systems.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 9, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 10, 's_61ab006', 'Okay. What should I look for?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 11, 's_700de710', 'Information, huh? What kind? Do you need helping getting it?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 12, 's_8102799c', 'Scanning.. .. .. Source of Origin does not compute. Scanning. Object accepted. Model 5-D23 recognizes object as acceptable information.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 13, 's_89fa7715', 'Scanning.. .. Look for logs, diaries. Roger, roger. Model 5-D23 is authorized to pay monetary value for information.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 14, 's_8f76b872', 'Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 15, 's_9e214a10', 'I''ll help you!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 16, 's_9f9d56f7', 'Clone Wars. Attack. Does not compute. Model number 5-D23 is programmed to collect information. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 17, 's_9fea5784', 'Roger, roger. Model 5-D23 and manufacturer thanks you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 18, 's_b467075c', 'Tatooine. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 19, 's_b73343f', 'Dathomir. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 20, 's_c3034c17', 'Endor. Roger, roger. Planet system identified.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 21, 's_d6e4c4f4', 'Whoa. A battle Droid from the Clone Wars! Aren''t you suppose to attack me?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 22, 's_da89aca1', 'Corellia. Roger, roger. Object accepted.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 23, 's_df3acc86', 'Dantooine. Roger, roger.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 24, 's_f377335c', 'Space System Lok. Roger, roger. Object accepted.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_kaadara.stf', 25, 's_ffeed2dd', 'Naboo. Roger, roger. Object accepted.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_moenia.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 3, 's_308c2df6', '[Droijack-dyn the Ishi Tib, an avian race whose language consists of chirping, waves you off. It seems like he--is it a he or a she?--needs someone specific. With all the space talk around, you assume he needs a pilot to help him.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 4, 's_34e97c89', 'Okay. I''ll help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 5, 's_43728039', '[Bird people are weird and you''d rather not help them. Droijack-dyn advances toward you. You bet, by his physique, he could really give you a pounding. You run away. You have Almond-Kwevvu Crisp Munchies to eat and enemies to fight.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 6, 's_45d96c97', 'I can kinda understand you. I think you need help.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 7, 's_4f8f72e2', '[Dantooine didn''t offer much in the ruse of excitement. As Droijack-dyn hands you a hanfdul of credits for giving him the information he needed, you begin to wonder. Do the Ishi Tib like crackers? You decide against giving him a sample of your favorite snack, Almond-Kwevvu Crisp Munchies. They''re too good to share.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 8, 's_56dc8579', '[Droijack-dyn nods again, pulling a handful of credits from his backpack. You wonder what else he has in there. Snapping out of your daydream, you guess what he''s trying to say is he''ll pay you for any ''information'' you find. Sounds like a sweet deal. You shrug. Time to go into space and defeat some enemies, hoping they''ll drop their diaries. Nice.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 9, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 10, 's_57df7ab9', '[Right on the first try! Looks like you have all of your kreetles in one lair and definitely the sharpest stone knife in the drawer. The bird-man pulls out several objects, looking to contain some pretty neat information. You start to piece together that he wants these objects, you can get them from space and from the enemies you defeat. Wow, your intellect is amazing. You puff up, trying to look all impressive.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 11, 's_5b01a6db', '[You fight the urge to hand the bird a cracker and give him the object he requested instead. Droijack-dyn appears to be happy with it.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 12, 's_5b29fb2', '[Droijack-dyn the Ishi Tib tries to get your attention by spouting off what sounds like chipring. Ah, yes. The Ishi Tib, an avian race whose language consists of bird-like sounds and squawks. You try to understand what it''s saying.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 13, 's_5b7b08d1', 'But.. what exactly am I looking for?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 14, 's_5c453f12', 'Nah, I''ve got other things to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 15, 's_61cc04c8', '[You hope that Droijack-dyn doesn''t mind that the objects you bring back are a little.. crispy. You hand the information disk to the bird-man and it falls apart when he touches it. He frowns.. at least, you guess that''s what he''s doing. You shrug. Information is information, right? ... right?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 16, 's_6d9c4154', 'You want.. information!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 17, 's_7f89f5d3', '[Droijack-dyn advances toward you threatingly. You know, for a bird-man he''s pretty impressive. In fact, you begin to wonder what profession he is. Just your luck, he''s probably a Teras Kasi. That''d really ruin your day. You bet he has some powerful ''beak attack'' that only birds get. You''ve decided you''d rather not find out and run off.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 18, 's_81fa3514', '[Well, Droijack-dyn looks like he''s pretty mad. You better scram before he pecks you pretty hard.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 19, 's_8a1e08c', '[You had front row tickets to the Galactic Civil War Extravaganza in Corellia. If only you had brought your favorite snack, Almond-Kwevvu Crisp Munchies, you would have been happy. What a show. You give Droijack-dyn his information and, in return, he gives you a handful of credits.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 20, 's_8b12a5dd', '[You crinkle your nose. Where did that come from? Well, he is a bird, isn''t he? Droijack-dyn the Ishi Tib shakes his head. Of course that''s not what he wanted! You try some more guesses.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 21, 's_92154c00', 'A cracker!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 22, 's_a8aa7613', '[Finally, Droijack-dyn nods and pulls out two objects from his backpack. One looks like a log of some sort, the other, a diary--you can tell because ''diary'' is written across the front of it. Pretty tricky. Droijack-dyn points up. You begin to piece together that you can find objects like this in space and that the bird-man needs them. Will you help?]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 23, 's_aa0a2be5', '[That freighter had it coming. It seems that Droijack-dyn knows exactly where it came from too, according to his birdly expression. You scram before the bird-man pecks you really hard. Freighter sympathizer.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 24, 's_aa1b838f', '[You look closer at the objects Droijack-dyn is holding. The objects appear to be disks, and a datapad of some sort. Huh. One of them has ''diary'' written on the front of it. Looks like you''ll be hunting enemies for their diaries and logs of information. Just your line of work. Droijack-dyn pulls out some credits from his backpack, either gloating he has way more money than you or that he''ll pay you for the information you get him.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 25, 's_b3731646', '[Droijack-dyn the Ishi Tib nods. He seems happy, but you can''t tell because.. well, he has a bird face. You stop wondering exactly why birds like crackers so much and run off.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 26, 's_b953d944', '[You barely came back from that trip alive and expect a large pay ount from the bird-man. You desperately need to do some repairs. When he does, you celebrate in the only way you know how.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 27, 's_c9179ad6', '[Droijack-dyn the Ishi Tib nods. It, although you''ve kinda figured out it''s male by it''s appearance, points to the sky. Space. Obviously, he wants something from the space systems. But, what, you can''t tell. You start to guess.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 28, 's_d3466494', 'I don''t want to help after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 29, 's_d57d668a', 'Yeah, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 30, 's_d701ec31', '[Naboo was easy sailing. In fact, you were able to stop by the local freighter and get a souvenir *while* dogfighting some pirates. You''re just that good. Because the trip was so easy, you really don''t expect much credit-wise.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 31, 's_d70926bc', '[Droijack-dyn greets you warmly. His bird expression appears to be quizzical, you think. You smile. You''re getting pretty good at understanding this bird-man. Hm. You bet he''s waiting for those nifty objects he requested. Do you have any? You look in your backpack. Your backpack isn''t as neat as his is. You bet you can just drag the object onto him and he''ll pick it up with his little--er big bird hands. Maybe you should try?]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 32, 's_d768ce2d', '[You shake the sand off the item from Tatooine and hand it to him. Droijack-dyn pulls out a handful of credits from his backpack and gives them to you. If you could only steal that backpack...]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 33, 's_e9574203', '[You think back to your trip to Endor as you hand Droijack-dyn the item requested. You had a feeling the Imperials were up to something up there. But you can''t seem to figure out exactly what it was. Hm. You forget anything about Endor as Droijack-dyn hands you a rather large handful of credits. Endor smendor.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 34, 's_f09b75ae', '[Would you stop that? It seems Droijack-dyn really needs some help. Get serious, here. You try again.]'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 35, 's_f93d75ff', 'You want.. hm. Information?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_moenia.stf', 36, 's_fb58660c', 'You want.. a bird bath!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_talus.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 3, 's_1eaeb942', 'Uh... nothing. Bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 4, 's_244d9ea1', '... Oh, yesss. I remember you. Drag the objectsss onto me and I will pay you for your ssservicess.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 5, 's_2e907efd', 'That''s a little vague. But you''re not much for talking. But okay.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 6, 's_383cdae', 'Naboo, yesss.. Delicate, tasty humanss.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 7, 's_435d9064', 'C''mon. Maybe I can help.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 8, 's_6236530', 'Alright, if you want to be like that.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 9, 's_82270559', 'Oh. What kind of information?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 10, 's_8696779b', 'It doesss not concern you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 11, 's_9208410d', '...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 12, 's_9b37d148', '... You are not a pilot. Go away.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 13, 's_a10eda57', 'Whoa! What are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 14, 's_a3d8ff73', '... I am a Marauder, a race of reptilian humanoidsss, sssurviving as best we can on Endor. We lure sssilly humanoidsss like you to their death and ssteal their technology sso we can ssurvive. Now, what iss it that you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 15, 's_a5556cbd', 'Corellia... Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 16, 's_b7dfba8d', 'But this is Talus. Are you lost?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 17, 's_c42087aa', '... You ssseem to be a pilot. I sssuppose I can implore you to help me. I am ssseeking information from the ssspace sssystemss. When you find it, you will know what I am looking for. Bring them to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 18, 's_c4dd562d', 'Ssstupid human. I am here to gather information for my people.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 19, 's_c4f7d1f', 'Yavin 4, yesss...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 20, 's_d446e3df', 'Freightersss... deviousss, are you not?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 21, 's_dd1eea6d', 'Dathomir... yesss. Go find more.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 22, 's_e45caf5a', 'Endor.. Yesss! My homeworld. How I missss it.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_talus.stf', 23, 's_ece79bc1', 'Tatooine, yesss.. My people will approve.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_theed.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 3, 's_11bab004', 'Yousa hep mesa?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 4, 's_18833216', 'Oh. And you need information?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 5, 's_20931802', 'Ooie booie! Mesa welcome yousa, boyo! Did yousa find anythin''? If yousa did, drag da object onto mesa and mesa pay yousa for it! Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 6, 's_236d3d10', 'Maccaneks..? Yousa basic folks say ''ship''? Flyin'' in da space?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 7, 's_253fa7ea', 'Oh. Okay. I''m sad.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 8, 's_26df7294', 'Corellia.. Mesa thank yousa for hepin'' mesa with dis.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 9, 's_2b8acda7', 'I''ll think about it. I need more information.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 10, 's_37b0ec80', 'Naboo! Mesa recognize anythin'' from dere. Thank yousa for hepin'' mesa. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 11, 's_48d5fb5a', 'I can''t understand a word you''re saying.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 12, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 13, 's_5a59fcdc', 'Sounds good. I''ll go look and come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 14, 's_5d39c47e', 'Ooie booie! Yousa a pilot! Mesa need yousa hep with somethin''. Okieday? Will yousa hep mesa? Mesa need some information from da space systems above usan. Yousa have a maxibig maccaneks, okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 15, 's_618244d1', 'Yes, I will *help* you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 16, 's_64f35d26', 'Ooie booie, Endor! Mesa hear lot of rumors about dat space system. Stinkowiff Imps!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 17, 's_7cabd9ea', 'Mesa thankful.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 18, 's_8bac8381', 'Ooie booie! Mesa happy!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 19, 's_91b60e5f', 'Dis'' from Yavin 4. Mooie mooie! One day, mesa hope to visit de space systems too. Okieday! Mesa almost forgot. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 20, 's_9a173443', 'Okay. Now we''re getting somewhere.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 21, 's_a3b5a049', 'Lok.. Mesa not heard much about dat place. Was yousa okieday up dere?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 22, 's_afaf698', 'Ooie booie! Yousa not a pilot. Mesa need a pilot. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 23, 's_b21c6039', 'Ooie booie! From Dathomir? Dat deserves a lot of moola, okieday. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 24, 's_b5402a0f', 'Wheresan isa dis from? Ooie booie! Itsa from a freighter. Yousa not a mooie mooie nice %TO!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 25, 's_b59591d7', 'Okieday. Mesa sad now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 26, 's_c416ff05', 'Dantooine isa a fine place. Yousa moola.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 27, 's_c5da1302', 'Okay. Sounds fair.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 28, 's_c7c399e0', 'Tatooine! Mesa hear many thin''s about space system. Lot of pirates, okieday? If mesa ever visit de space systems, mesa goin'' to stay away from dat one.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 29, 's_c8984072', 'Okieday. Enemies drop logs and diaries? Yousa get. Bring to mesa. Mesa give moola.. er--credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 30, 's_c8d95e9d', 'Ooie booie! Mesa glad! Whensa yousa find anythin'', just come back and drag de object on mesa and mesa will pay yousa for it. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 31, 's_d89d872a', 'No, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_theed.stf', 32, 's_f37c7b85', 'Okieday. Mesa need information for mesa clan. Wesa really interested in what goes on in da space systems. Yousa enemies have a chance of droppin'' logs or diaries when yousa defeat them. If yousa don''t want what yousa find, yousa can bring them to mesa and mesa pay yousa for them. Okieday?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (story_loot_tyrena.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 3, 's_11676386', 'Hey! Oh wait--you don''t look like you''re a pilot. Sorry, I was waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 4, 's_21a1e8c0', 'Straight from Dantooine''s system. What a neat story! I think the Information Guild will be pretty excited about this one.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 5, 's_36989baf', 'Wow Tatooine! I hear about so many things happening in that system. Thank you for the great story. I should definitely get that promotion soon!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 6, 's_3c1f9431', 'I guess I can help.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 7, 's_446fdc1d', 'A freighter?! Hey, you''re mean! Oh well.. I guess I can take it. Here''s your pay. Be nicer to people!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 8, 's_45768069', 'Endor! What''s going on up there, anyway? I keep hearing weird rumors. The people would love to know! This story will go into our next paper.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 9, 's_46258640', 'Psst! Hey! You look like you''re a pilot! Am I right? I could really use your help if you are. I''m in a bit of a bind.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 10, 's_4bab1b65', 'Naboo.. what a pretty place. And it has news! Thank you so much for this!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 11, 's_5432ff59', 'I need more of an explination. Where do I get this ''information''?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 12, 's_579e662c', 'Uh.. no thanks. I''ll be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 13, 's_57b843a1', 'Dathomir.. What a scary place! Was it dangerous up there? I sure am glad you''re okay. Thanks so much for doing this!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 14, 's_5a59fcdc', 'Sounds good. I''ll go look and come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 15, 's_66dce3ab', 'I don''t know a lot about Lok. But it sure seems like interesting things are happening there! Thanks so much!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 16, 's_83d5af87', 'You don''t know how much this is gonna help me out! Thank you!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 17, 's_9030290e', 'I''m an intern at the ''News Now!'' Information Guild. If I don''t get enough news stories, they may let me go. I can get some, but not enough to make me the top reporter. I''m really aspiring to be the best, you know? What do you think? I''d pay you, of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 18, 's_9176a524', 'Wow, I''m *so* grateful! Okay, so space systems, right? If you go to any of those, like Corellia or Tatooine for instance, an enemy has a chance of dropping a little tidbit of news. If you bring those to me, I''ll pay you a generous sum. Some are worth more than others, you see. Like risk and reward, you know? Look for ''a log'', or ''a diary''. Those are exactly what I need.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 19, 's_9208410d', '...'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 20, 's_9b448b0d', 'Yavin 4, huh? Hmm.. Aha! This is a great story. I should get a pat on the back for this one at the guild. Thank you!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 21, 's_b36ae370', 'Corellia.. home of the Alliance, right? I hear they''re pretty troublesome! I really don''t pay too much attention to the war between the EMpire and the Rebellion. I should, shouldn''t I? This is a great story, by the way. Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 22, 's_b4192cf', 'You''re back so soon! I knew you were the right one to help me. Didja'' find anything? If you did, just give it to me by dragging and dropping. Okay, I''m waiting!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 23, 's_c33acdc8', 'Oh no! I''m going to be a failure!'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 24, 's_d89d872a', 'No, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 25, 's_e339c89e', 'What do you need done?'),
('string/en/conversation/story_loot_tyrena.stf', 26, 's_e35ea3ad', 'In the space systems, of course! Like Corellia and Tatooine except all over. You know? I guess I''m not making much sense. If you find yourself in a dogfight up there, just check to see if they drop ''a log'', or ''a diary'' or something. Data disks that contain information, you know? Those are what I need. Just give them to me and I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 3, 's_10a5b81d', 'I really hope this is a sweep and clear.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 4, 's_13380a80', 'I don''t think that peace can only be brought about by loss of freedom.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 5, 's_162e1268', 'Regardless, you have made Storm Squadron look very good to our superiors.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 6, 's_187c0a86', 'Oh it won''t. I see. Well I admire your confidence, but what is it based on?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 7, 's_1b1b59fd', 'Excellent. We are sending the plans on Lambda shuttle to the Endor system. Meet up with the shuttle and transfer them to your craft. Then drop them off at Endor control. Once that is done the real operation can begin. Good luck to you, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 8, 's_1ba3e73d', 'The Inquisition has not given us an update on their progress. That is not really a surprise. They tend to dislike sharing information with other branches. I can only hope that they stop the traitor from committing more acts of treason.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 9, 's_1bc2db0c', 'Of course you are. Like I said before, if you continue to successfully perform your duty then I have no problem with your distorted vision of your self worth. But we really need to get back to matters at hand.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 10, 's_1c4ab1df', 'That is exactly how I feel.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 11, 's_1cbb3be8', 'Then go to the Endor system and destroy a flight of Rebel X-wings that we have been tracking. It is time that we cull their growing numbers and show them that the Empire is not to be trifled with. I have dispatched other pilots to assist in this great undertaking, so that we will strike the Rebels from all sides.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 12, 's_1d653cbd', 'And what did they uncover?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 13, 's_1d6ab832', 'If anyone deserves it...I do!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 14, 's_1d7c7ed2', 'Good. We are beginning our planning for what to do next. Once we are ready then you will be called on again. But before that you need to work on some of your techniques. What skill would you like to learn?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 15, 's_1ebe3b4f', 'I''ll go again - if it''s not too late.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 16, 's_1efa28ce', 'From the reports you recovered we discovered that the Rebels were given access to our security frequency. They have been listening in on our chatter and have been using what they heard from us to help plan their attacks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 17, 's_202ff29c', 'Of course we do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 18, 's_20350ba5', 'The documents will have coordinates to a supposed command station. If all goes well the Rebels will take the bait and attack in force. They will not find any station at that location but they will find you. You are keep the fighters occupied while we scan the surrounding area for the Rebel command.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 19, 's_20d40c9b', 'We are going to continue our job in trying to lock down the Endor system. The other matter has been turned over the Inquisition. If anyone can sniff out a traitor it will be them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 20, 's_24315068', 'It''s not. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 21, 's_25042a7a', 'I will not fail you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 22, 's_25c39c01', 'You cannot understand, so you fear.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 23, 's_2642ebb3', 'Don''t worry. I can keep a cool head when needed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 24, 's_266e8481', 'Don''t become over confident. You are no good to me dead. Now go take out at least ten Rebel fighters. Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 25, 's_2800345f', 'Intelligence has finished decrypting the data that you recovered from that Rebel scout. The data only included the operational status of a few of the Rebels in the area but it was enough to give us an idea of what the Rebels are doing in this area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 26, 's_299e29d5', 'Regardless of why you did it, you have gained some measure of fame over your actions against the Rebellion. My superiors were quite impressed when I explained your value to the operation. I wouldn''t be surprised if one of them took over your command.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 27, 's_2bdc8841', 'It was nothing. Just doing my job, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 28, 's_2dc37e6c', 'It has been a pleasure, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 29, 's_2e0a96f8', 'To bad! In this outfit you will work on my schedule not your own. I only asked to be polite, I honestly didn''t expect you to say no. Let us try this again. Pilot are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 30, 's_2e4db1a8', 'Yes, sir! Ready and willing, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 31, 's_2e8fad6a', 'So are we going to try to find out who the traitor is?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 32, 's_2ec9494f', 'I''m certain it is a mistake of some sort.  Nevertheless, my hands are tied.  You must improve your standing with the Empire - prove that you are devoted to crushing the Rebellion - and do it quickly!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 33, 's_30651d99', 'I wouldn''t be surprised if it is. But in order to better serve the Empire you must have training. What skill would you like to be trained in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 34, 's_31d67ce2', 'Yes he does. And this is what he wants you to do. First, you need to inform Endor about our intentions. Because the Rebels are listening into our transmissions we will have to send the plans to them on your vessel. Once they have the plans we will send out a message about a shuttle carrying top secret documents on its way through the Endor system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 35, 's_31e494df', 'What does sealed to the throne mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 36, 's_32778372', 'So we are not in trouble right now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 37, 's_33061c38', 'I will destroy that scout with extremely prejudice.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 38, 's_36111dde', 'Hey, wait a minute!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 39, 's_37f05ce8', 'An Imperial officer has turned traitor! What are we going to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 40, 's_381d2195', 'If my plan works then you will have your opportunity. From the reports you recovered we discovered that the Rebels were given access to our security frequency. They have been listening in on our chatter and have been using what they heard from us to help plan their attacks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 41, 's_386b16a5', 'Understood, sir. What is my first assignment?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 42, 's_3898a3b8', 'So what did the brains at Intel find out?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 43, 's_38a75f0', 'What is Storm Squadron''s next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 44, 's_39538c2a', 'What did they find out?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 45, 's_39a5745d', 'Let me at them! I will drive them off.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 46, 's_3b0a14d7', 'I''ll get them this time. I promise.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 47, 's_3c1eecb4', 'I take it the documents will be fakes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 48, 's_3c3702e6', 'All in good time. Although this is not all bad now that we know about the leak. My plan involves using this leak in order to draw the Rebels out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 49, 's_3e08af61', '%NU, I am glad to see you are back. We have completed our evaluation of the reports you took off of the Rebel command vessel. Based off of what we have found, I believe I have devised a way to bring the Rebel menace out into the open.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 50, 's_3ec1a288', 'Of course. we''ll begin now. Report back to me as soon as possible. The Empire needs all hands on deck.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 51, 's_40cda759', 'Teach me about advanced capability TIE vessels.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 52, 's_40dea799', 'Why quickly?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 53, 's_41ecd1f', 'I told you that I don''t want you to tell me! Once we have worked out the details we will contact you again to fly our next mission. Until then let us see if you cannot wrap your mind around some training. Hopefully that will help cool your zeal. What skill would you like to learn?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 54, 's_421f0679', 'Be sure that you don''t. We will update you to the location of the new Rebel scout as soon as you are in the Endor system. Remember a lot is riding on your success. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 55, 's_4296221e', 'Send me after the traitor. I will destroy him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 56, 's_430701b', 'Your job''s not done yet. I need you to see this through.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 57, 's_43b48713', 'I am not sure who you are or why you are here, but I assure you I do not have time to help you regardless.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 58, 's_44bd3318', 'What is it you need me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 59, 's_44bf27d7', 'That was nothing. You should have seen me in the battle of...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 60, 's_44f098fe', 'It is not safe to assume any such thing, but all signs do point towards that conclusion. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 61, 's_457d29c5', 'The sooner this war is over, the sooner we can all go home. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 62, 's_463a0835', 'Perfect! The Rebels fell right into our trap. We are monitoring the movements of the Rebel command vessel. I am fairly certain that they know we set a trap for them, but I do not think they understand to what purpose.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 63, 's_46977c75', 'I''ll crush the Rebellion; whatever it takes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 64, 's_47021aad', 'Experience. I''m a great pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 65, 's_473d09d8', 'Teach me about system balance programming.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 66, 's_47edbf24', 'Yes, SIR!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 67, 's_4ac29222', 'Somehow the Rebels have gotten word of what is going on here. We don''t believe that they have the complete story, but they are aware that the Empire is working on a top secret project in the Endor system. They also are aware that engineers working on the Yavin salvage operation are being transferred to the Endor system. It would seem they were trying to capture a few of them in order to discover the exact nature of the project.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 68, 's_4b2d23bc', 'No, we are going to continue our job and try to lock down the Endor system. We have to make sure that the Rebels are unable to find the answers that they are looking for. The matter of the traitor has been turned over to the Inquisition. If anyone can find the traitor, they can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 69, 's_4c927c36', 'I am ready to crush the Rebels, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 70, 's_4ca34e11', 'I think that you and I are going to get along just splendidly. From what I understand you have the makings of a very find pilot, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 71, 's_4d64efd2', 'I am sure if you perform the mission half as well as you think you will, it will go smoothly. We are sending the plans on Lambda shuttle to the Endor system. Meet up with the shuttle and transfer them to your craft. Then drop them off at Endor control. Once that is done the real operation can begin. Good luck to you, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 72, 's_4ec1bd6b', 'It''s about time I was noticed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 73, 's_51a40299', '[deny it]'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 74, 's_51f13870', 'I am proud to have been of assistance, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 75, 's_52345d7c', 'That is what I wanted to hear. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 76, 's_524d9247', 'Not yet. But if we don''t put a lid on this it is very likely that they will shortly. We need to find out more about what the Rebels are planning. THat is where you come in.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 77, 's_52651592', 'Intelligence has discovered from the reports you captured that the Rebels have been using our communications to help plan their attacks. The traitor apparently gave them our frequencies and access codes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 78, 's_5332f155', 'And you need your best pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 79, 's_540bd108', 'Then move on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 80, 's_558af4fe', 'Yes, but he''s out on a mission. You''ll have to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 81, 's_5669d57a', 'In good time. Right now we have to make sure that we get a good grasp on the situation. If we send pilots out without figuring out what the Rebels are up to we could be in serious trouble.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 82, 's_567580f2', 'So we still have not been able to find the traitor?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 83, 's_5814e23b', 'I don''t know what you''re talking about'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 84, 's_599cef6e', 'So.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 85, 's_5bd69df6', 'What do you need me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 86, 's_5c298649', 'Your first assignment will be the protection of engineers being transferred from the Yavin salvage operation. You are to meet their shuttle in the Endor system and escort them safely through the area until they reach system headquarters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 87, 's_5c4d8358', 'The traitor again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 88, 's_5de22b37', 'I do not fight for glory, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 89, 's_5e3cc3ae', 'Alozen did mention to me that you had a slight ego, but he also said you at least had the skills to back up you mouth. If this is true you can brag all you want. I find that pilots who express themselves fair far better on the battlefield. Although, I will not tolerate any rudeness towards me, this outfit, or the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 90, 's_5f736ba3', 'Very well. Let''s begin. And later, report to me for your next mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 91, 's_60893b02', 'If we find it, should it be destroyed?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 92, 's_609b8560', 'I was guided to victory by a greater power.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 93, 's_60c284ea', 'Ah, yes. That was my finest hour.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 94, 's_60f183ae', 'Of course. Although this is not all bad now that we know about the leak. My plan involves using this leak in order to draw the Rebels out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 95, 's_612db735', 'Well, we are in the process of planning our next step now. Once we have it worked out you will be called on again to perform the next mission. Even a ''great'' pilot, such as yourself, has a thing or two to learn. What skill would you like training in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 96, 's_6196f26f', 'What I did, I did for the glory of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 97, 's_637a3419', 'The Rebellion will pay for that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 98, 's_645af1cb', 'I''ll train you now. Afterwards, report to me when you''re ready for the next step.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 99, 's_64617aad', 'And you are proving yourself over and over again. The information you recovered from the Rebels is still being examined by Intelligence. We should have more answers soon. Once we have all of it compiled, we will be sending you out again. Hopefully with more direction this time around. Until then let us see what we can do to increase your already very accomplished talents. What skill would you like training in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 100, 's_6612078b', 'I do not fear the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 101, 's_66506cea', 'I doubt that is it. But, you are no longer my problem. You have been transferred to Admiral Kilnstrider, head of Storm Squadron. Report to him at his command post at the research center on the moon of Endor. He will be granting you missions from the Emperor from now on. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 102, 's_666d4e98', 'Good. Then we will not have to worry about any sort of disciplinary action. For the time being Storm Squadron has been personally chosen by the Emperor to head security for a most important and secret project in the Endor system. We are beginning our move out of the Yavin system but have not yet set up a base of operations in Endor. Command will still be stationed on Yavin 4 for the time being.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 103, 's_6802fe45', 'How would we learn anything about the Rebel plans if you go around destroying our best leads? I don''t what the scout destroyed! I want you to capture and inspect it for any new information that it might be carrying. Is that understood, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 104, 's_68b52625', 'That sounded sort of traitorous?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 105, 's_69f62a43', 'As was foretold.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 106, 's_6aba6ae5', 'How much more do the Rebels know?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 107, 's_6acf2f90', 'And what would that job be?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 108, 's_6b6b3e96', 'Good. Somehow the Rebels have gotten word of what is going on here. We don''t believe that they have the complete story, but they are aware that the Empire is working on a top secret project in the Endor system. They also are aware that engineers working on the Yavin salvage operation are being transferred to the Endor system. It would seem they were trying to capture a few of them in order to discover the exact nature of the project.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 109, 's_6b9765c5', 'Good luck, soldier. I think you will need it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 110, 's_6da8109', 'If that is in my fate.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 111, 's_6e86b00', 'I''m ready to blast holes in as many Rebel ships as I can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 112, 's_6efcdb6b', 'Treason?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 113, 's_6f21dd8e', 'You are under investigation for crimes against the Empire, %TU.  What is going on?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 114, 's_704da203', 'Your time with me is over. I figured one of my superiors would have you transferred under his command.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 115, 's_7077d0f3', 'Oh, of course I knew that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 116, 's_71375f7a', 'In this system?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 117, 's_71d95d29', 'Hmm. Well any ways, Intelligence has finished decrypting the data that you recovered from that Rebel scout. The data only included the operational status of a few of the Rebels in the area but it was enough to give us an idea of what the Rebels are doing in this area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 118, 's_730d9c3d', 'It''s hard to tell. Since they were trying to capture engineers for interrogation I think it is safe to assume that they are not yet aware of the nature of the Endor project. If I had to guess the traitor is either working on this project or a related project but does not have significant enough clearance to have the whole story.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 119, 's_74df4', 'Then I suggest you leave, before my men take you into custody.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 120, 's_7679bb3b', 'Good! Then we will not have any problems understanding one another. Our mission is highly important and the Emperor has placed his faith in us. We will not fail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 121, 's_76bbd809', 'I know you will not. I have every faith in your ability to handle the Rebels. You are dismissed, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 122, 's_7728672b', 'Not at all. I have made my choice and I am completely loyal to the Emperor. Only he can bring about order from the chaos that the Old Republic left us with. In these times you need to have a strong, capable leader and there is no one I would rather follow than the Emperor. But I am a realist and completely understand that to gain peace one must sacrifice some personal freedoms.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 123, 's_7750f639', 'You are to travel to Endor and start culling the number of Rebel fighters in the system. There is a flight of X-wing that we have been tracking for sometime that I want you to destroy. I have sent other Storm Squadron pilots out on similar missions so if you can take out that flight of Rebel fighters we should have their numbers reduced to a manageable amount.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 124, 's_789def9d', 'I am ready for my assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 125, 's_78b0ecc0', 'That is very unfortunate.  I need for you to get this situation resolved.  I cannot trust you with any more assignments so long as you are suspected of treason.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 126, 's_78cd7b47', 'I failed. It won''t happen again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 127, 's_78d45540', 'Don''t fail this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 128, 's_7c0ad410', 'Strong words from a pilot who''s done nothing but fail since he got here! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 129, 's_7e276839', 'So they could be making another...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 130, 's_7ea66fab', 'Well you have been noticed by Admiral Kilnstrider, head of Storm Squadron. He is taking over security for the Endor system and has set up operations on the moon of Endor at the research center. Again, I highly advise that you do not be yourself with Admiral Kilnstrider. He has very little use for braggarts. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 131, 's_7eeba249', 'Excellent plan, sir. It went off without any trouble.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 132, 's_813c7eed', 'We are working on that. Right now what we have Intelligence focused on deciphering that data you recovered from the Rebel scout. Once we have that information we should have a better idea of how to proceed. While we are waiting for that we need you to get your skills up to speed. What are you interested in learning?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 133, 's_81652bd6', 'There is no strength without the guidance of the Emperor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 134, 's_8195ae89', 'This shouldn''t be too hard.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 135, 's_826b239', 'Clear enough.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 136, 's_8323fc9a', 'I''ll explain this very simply. You are replaceable. The engineers are not. Get them, and bring them back - NOW.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 137, 's_846bd129', 'I am afraid that you are not ready for the rigors I would be forced to put you through. I suggest you go work on your skills and perhaps we will meet again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 138, 's_84affc75', 'Now that we have a lock on the Rebel command vessel the time has come for us to start flexing our muscles, so to speak.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 139, 's_84b912c3', 'Very well, what is my assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 140, 's_853fa46c', 'We should change our frequencies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 141, 's_86137261', 'No sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 142, 's_88d2aba6', 'STOP RIGHT THERE! I told you to keep any speculation you might have to yourself and I will not tolerate otherwise.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 143, 's_890ce7a3', 'I couldn''t agree more, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 144, 's_89af090b', ' You are on assignment, soldier. Get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 145, 's_8ace66c8', 'You wouldn''t be here if you felt otherwise. The Empire will unify the galaxy and bring about an era of unprecedented peace. Storm Squadron''s current assignment might play an important role in the realization of that goal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 146, 's_8d0d7812', 'As I said before we will be running security detail in the Endor system for a project that has been sealed to the throne. To my understanding there will be numerous engineers, supply freighters, and command vessels will need protection from any interference. On top of that the entire system must be kept under quarantine to avoid any word of the project from reaching the outside.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 147, 's_8df560dd', 'Nope, I can''t say that I am ready yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 148, 's_8ff025a4', 'Storm Squadron has been personally chosen by the Emperor to head security for a most important and secret project in the Endor system. We are beginning our move out of the Yavin system but have not yet set up a base of operations in Endor. Command will still be stationed on Yavin 4 for the time being.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 149, 's_9011f51', 'I couldn''t agree more. But that is why the Emperor asked for Storm Squadron. We are the best military outfit in the whole of the Navy. Your first assignment will be the protection of engineers being transferred from the Yavin salvage operation. You are to meet their shuttle in the Endor system and escort them safely through the area until they reach system headquarters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 150, 's_9104408b', 'Please do not tell me that you are hearing voices. I cannot afford to take you off of active duty right now.We are in the process of planning our next step and you will be vital to the success of our plans.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 151, 's_926a6e73', 'Is it wise to tell the Rebellion that we are sending top secret documents?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 152, 's_934958df', 'Do you have a problem with my assessment of your skills? I would suggest that you try harder and maybe they will change. Regardless, we still have a job to do,'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 153, 's_936b8cfc', 'You have been removed as head of Endor security?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 154, 's_93e9d03b', 'If you say so. But I would ask that you try to keep your zeal for killing the Emperor''s enemies to a minimum and focus on the mission I am about to give to you. There will be plenty of enemy smiting on it, I assure you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 155, 's_9511fbeb', 'That was a question that didn''t need a response. I can see that I am going to have to keep a close watch on your activities. You are supposed to be a fine pilot so I would highly suggest that you keep your focus on that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 156, 's_953ef4f4', 'Hmmm...well what is it you want for me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 157, 's_95984c4', 'I live only to serve.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 158, 's_996c6fd3', 'What''s Storm Squadron''s assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 159, 's_9a5c94ec', 'Yes...yes. You did very well in capturing that Rebel scout. Now that I have stroked your obviously fragile ego, may I continue with my briefing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 160, 's_9a760bb5', 'I am ready, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 161, 's_9ae62db', 'You have yourself the best pilot in the fleet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 162, 's_9b266fb', 'Yes. The Emperor needs me here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 163, 's_9cfbfe87', 'Good to see that you are back. We have a mess on our hands right now. Reports are coming in from all over the Endor system that Rebels have been spotted in almost every quadrant.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 164, 's_9dbb5a9a', 'What is the plan?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 165, 's_9dedc264', 'I don''t know if I would say...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 166, 's_9fbaa975', 'Keeping a lid on entire system will be no easy task.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 167, 's_a099839c', 'I am afraid so. I am to remain here and finish the preparations for the rest of Storm Squadron to be moved out of this system. Good luck to you, %NU. If you serve the Admiral as well as you served me all will be well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 168, 's_a0aa65a4', 'Yes, I know. I was the one who foretold that you would be transferred. I cannot say that I am not happy to see you leave. Frankly, you worry me a little bit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 169, 's_a14faca6', 'A squadron of X-wings? I don''t like their chances.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 170, 's_a22823c2', 'You''re wrong!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 171, 's_a3d2c25b', 'Those weak minded fools were hardly a challenge.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 172, 's_a3f5c141', 'Neither do I. But I have respect for their abilities. The information you recovered from the Rebels is still being examined by Intelligence. We should have more answers soon. Once we have all of it compiled we will be sending you out again. Hopefully with more direction this time around. Until then let us see what we can do to increase your lethal talents. What skill would you like training in? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 173, 's_a49e0a76', 'Then you must explain this mission to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 174, 's_a5f19408', 'The pleasure has been all mine. You are being transferred to Admiral Kilnstrider, head of Storm Squadron. He is personally taking over security of the Endor system. A base of operations has been set up on the research center on the moon of Endor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 175, 's_a7d9a14d', 'You have been far more than an assistance, you have been instrumental. I have made sure to note your contributions in my reports and you have garnished more than a fair share of attention. I fear that you will not be under my command for very much longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 176, 's_a7f392e3', 'And the Emperor wants you to follow my instructions. I am sure his guidance will lead you to victory over our enemies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 177, 's_a835651f', 'Understood! I will not let you down.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 178, 's_a8daab7', 'I am sure the Inquisition appreciates your faith in their abilities. They will handle the matter of the traitor. Your concern should be on Storm Squadron business. The Emperor wants to here to help protect his interests.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 179, 's_a950fa1d', 'What is the plan, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 180, 's_a9aeb386', 'Teach me about advanced starship component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 181, 's_aa3bdfaa', 'I am sure you were simply amazing in that battle. Of course, you will be happy to know that I listed your accomplishments in my reports to my superiors. They were rather impressed by your prowess. I wouldn''t be surprised if you were promoted over this.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 182, 's_aad92c11', 'No, Storm Squadron is moving out of the Yavin system. We have been reassigned to security detail for a top secret project taking place inside the Endor system. For the time being we will still be operating command from here on Yavin 4 until the move is completed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 183, 's_abcfd5a5', 'There is only one way that the Rebels could have gotten the information that they did have...a member of the Empire leaked it to them. A since they were aware of the flight times and routes of the vessels they attacked that can only mean that whoever leaked this information was a commanding officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 184, 's_abdbf980', 'Exactly. We are counting on the Rebels attacking the shuttle, which you will be escorting. If we can make this look very real to them and kill enough of their fighters, it will cause them to want to find out what we are fighting so hard to protect. When the time is right, the shuttle will pretend to make a run for it and allow itself to be captured. The Rebels will find the fake documents and they will be ours.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 185, 's_ac951104', 'You''ll get your chance. The Rebel faction remains active across a number of systems. Of course, we will only be dealing with security in one system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 186, 's_ad08e741', 'We have placed out a number of barrier satellites around the Endor system. They are designed to track the movements of any vessels that move to close to them. They have recorded a few Rebel fighters moving and fortunately for us another of the Rebel scouts.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 187, 's_ad5060b2', 'Doesn''t matter where I am located. I rule space no matter the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 188, 's_ad622e6d', 'I see. About my assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 189, 's_ad784b0a', 'My ego isn''t fragile. I know I am the best!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 190, 's_afdf6d6', 'What is it you want me to do, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 191, 's_afe7ad77', 'We will update you to the location of the new Rebel scout as soon as you are in the Endor system. Remember a lot is riding on your success. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 192, 's_b16490f1', 'Secret project? Sounds interesting.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 193, 's_b196e01f', 'Even though we are still looking for the clues as to how much information the Rebellion has been given by the traitor, we have allowed the Rebels to run rampant through out the Endor system for long enough. We need to start reducing their numbers before they get out of control.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 194, 's_b3001b77', 'How can we provide security without knowing what we are protecting?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 195, 's_b3f090c6', 'I wouldn''t say perfect. But fortunately I was able to compensate.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 196, 's_b40f340', 'Not a chance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 197, 's_b4880204', 'Much better! As I said before we will be running security detail in the Endor system for a project that has been sealed to the throne. To my understanding there will be numerous engineers, supply freighters, and command vessels will need protection from any interference. On top of that the entire system must be kept under quarantine to avoid any word of the project from reaching the outside.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 198, 's_b5094e65', 'Go with the Emperor''s blessing. You are dismissed, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 199, 's_b6b37d2c', 'Well, we shall see now won''t we? Storm Squadron has been personally chosen by the Emperor to head security for a most important and secret project in the Endor system. We are beginning our move out of the Yavin system but have not yet set up a base of operations in Endor. Command will still be stationed on Yavin 4 for the time being.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 200, 's_b89e6b42', 'That is what I wanted to hear. Intelligence has finished decrypting the data that you recovered from that Rebel scout. The data only included the operational status of a few of the Rebels in the area but it was enough to give us an idea of what the Rebels are doing in this area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 201, 's_b8fba9bb', 'We know exactly what we are protecting. We are protecting the personnel and vessels involved in a top secret project. That means we keep them safe and keep others out. Fairly simple, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 202, 's_b9bfd3a8', 'You are absolutely correct. You are to destroy a flight of X-wings that we have been tracking. Since I have dispatched other pilots from Storm Squadron you should only need to destroy that one squadron for us to accomplish our goals, but feel free to destroy any extra you wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 203, 's_b9c26cb1', 'Just tell me who to kill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 204, 's_bb9e4a63', 'Understood, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 205, 's_be28f7e0', 'First, we will need to inform Endor about our intentions. Because the Rebels are listening into our communications we will have to send the plans to them on your vessel. Once they have the plans we will send out a message about a shuttle carrying top secret documents on its way through the Endor system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 206, 's_bf67c417', 'So they are not yet aware of what the Empire is doing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 207, 's_c01151b0', 'Sure. That might be useful.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 208, 's_c0cba601', 'Prove it to me. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 209, 's_c118c966', 'I am honored to serve under the Emperor''s Hand.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 210, 's_c17e8fe8', 'Hopefully they will attract some attention.The practice would be nice.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 211, 's_c183fa1a', 'Let''s hope that this stays a simple escort. This project is of utmost importance to the Empire. Any disruption could jeopardize the entire operation. You will make sure that those engineers arrive in Endor just as safely as they left here. Dismissed, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 212, 's_c198d74c', 'I don''t need any of your lip right now. We will have this situation under control shortly, you can count on that. Right now we have Intelligence deciphering that data you recovered from the Rebel scout and once we have that we will have a better understanding of how best to proceed. While we are waiting for that we need you to get your skills up to speed. What are you interested in learning?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 213, 's_c23c0889', 'Indeed. But now that we know they have access to our communications, we have the advantage. My plan involves using this leak in order to draw the Rebels out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 214, 's_c27dc8c9', 'I am honored to serve under the Emperor''s hand.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 215, 's_c33ed1f7', 'No, I think you are doing fine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 216, 's_c3a1b3b3', 'Well done, %NU. Not only did you manage to drive the Rebel force back into hiding from the Endor system, you also managed to uncover all the information that was leaked to them by the traitor. We will be able to quickly change our plans for the system based off of that information and neutralize any advantage the Rebels might have had.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 217, 's_c3fac79d', 'Of course you did. The documents will have coordinates to a supposed command station. If all goes well the Rebels will take the bait and attack in force. They will not find any station at that location but they will find you. You are keep the fighters occupied while we scan the surrounding area for the Rebel command.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 218, 's_c4088008', 'Get off my case.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 219, 's_c4b21396', 'I see that you are eager to get underway. But perhaps it would be best if you allowed me to explain what we are going to try to accomplish before flying off.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 220, 's_c4f3b92c', 'Let''s begin your training. When you''re done, you''ll be ready for a new mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 221, 's_c5320bec', 'I don''t have an ego. I am the best!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 222, 's_c70eec74', 'I should never have accepted you into this unit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 223, 's_c7db2e97', 'So a simple, escort. I thought this was going to be hard.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 224, 's_c84be049', 'Sorry, sir. Now about my assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 225, 's_c8f732dc', 'What was in that report?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 226, 's_c8fb2a47', 'Direct and to the point, I like it. Storm Squadron has been personally chosen by the Emperor to head security for a most important and secret project in the Endor system. We are beginning our move out of the Yavin system but have not yet set up a base of operations in Endor. Command will still be stationed on Yavin 4 for the time being.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 227, 's_c9189ff3', 'Pilot! Get you emotions under control. I cannot afford to hand this operation over to someone with a personnel vendetta. I want pilots, not rampaging psychopaths. Is that clear?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 228, 's_cb3f07d5', 'We have Intelligence working on deciphering the data that you recovered from the scout as we speak. Once we have that information we should have a better grasp on the situation and be able to figure out how best to proceed. Until then we need you to get up to speed with your skills. I think you will be instrumental in the upcoming days. What are you interested in learning?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 229, 's_cc9d8558', 'Welcome back. You have successfully managed to retrieve the information from the Rebel command vessel, as well as, save the 3rd TIE Wing from destruction. A very nice days work if I say so myself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 230, 's_cd3a54f7', 'Because we need you, %TU.  And others like you.  But only so long as we can trust you.  So go handle this situation.  Pilots of your skill are not exactly common, you know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 231, 's_d09291f7', 'Please, keep your curiosity to yourself. This project has been sealed to the throne, any violation of that order will result in immediate execution. We are simply in the Endor system to provide security for the engineers, cargo freighters, and command personnel. We are NOT there to ask questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 232, 's_d0ca9684', 'The AGENTS in Intelligence discovered that the Rebellion has managed to get their hands on some very confidential information. They had flight schedules, routes, and defense plans from all over the system. It would seem that the Rebels were supposed to capture some of the engineers in order to find out more about the Imperial operations in the Endor system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 233, 's_d19e7587', 'I am ready to add another notch to my belt.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 234, 's_d1fb3414', 'Maybe YOU''RE the traitor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 235, 's_d20bfc57', 'Uhh, yes of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 236, 's_d25510d5', 'Understood. I am ready to begin, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 237, 's_d2ef774', 'I have heard that from more than a few young pilots who have walked through my door. Most of those pilots only live in my memory now. I sincerely hope that the same fate does not await you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 238, 's_d3fb9e20', 'They''re idiots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 239, 's_d4402e2e', 'The Emperor will guide me true.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 240, 's_d55771c4', 'Absolute freedom breeds discontent and anarchy. If everyone is allowed to do their own thing then there will be growth for society as a whole. And there can be no peace as long as the galaxy is splintered into many different factions. Only the Empire can unify all those different factions and bring about ultimate peace. In order for us to do that we must be strong. Storm Squadron is part of that unifying strength.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 241, 's_d6bf6113', 'The documents will be fake. We are counting on the Rebels attacking the shuttle, which you will be escorting. If we can make this look real to them by killing enough of their fighters, it will cause them to want to find out what we are fighting so hard to protect. When the time is right, the shuttle will pretend to make a run for it and allow itself to be captured. The Rebels will find the fake documents and they will be ours.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 242, 's_d6e0ca4c', 'It''s about time you let me take off the kid gloves.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 243, 's_d760b1fe', 'Yes, that is a sound plan. I will destroy our enemies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 244, 's_d837376f', 'If the time comes and you are promoted, I would highly suggest curbing your ego a bit. Most officers above me are not as tolerant as I am. But if you are promoted we cannot have any of them being unimpressed by your skill. What skill would you like training in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 245, 's_d8c02b03', 'Not quite yet. We are going to use our knowledge that the Rebels have tapped into our secure lines against them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 246, 's_dab3c286', 'I know what I''m doing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 247, 's_dc98dda7', 'That is still being examined by Intelligence. We should have more answers soon. Once we have all of it compiled we will be sending you out again. Hopefully with more direction this time around. Until then let us see what we can do to get you better prepared for your next assignment. What skill would you like training in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 248, 's_dcbac482', 'Of course, I told you I was good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 249, 's_dd4be05c', 'What is my first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 250, 's_df0f8037', 'I know that. But you have gained some measure of fame regardless. It has not been made official but I believe you will be transferred soon. If that is the case we must be sure that you are up to snuff. What skill would you like training in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 251, 's_dfb20007', 'I can hear him talking to...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 252, 's_e094e94b', 'Send me back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 253, 's_e2ebe5ea', 'And how would the Rebels have gotten that information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 254, 's_e374b3bf', 'I will remember that, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 255, 's_e5e51881', 'Field Commander Alozen tells me that you''re ready to serve under my command. We will see, won''t we?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 256, 's_e634eb73', 'It is the Emperor''s will that I defeat his foes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 257, 's_e6e2ab99', 'You are not here on Imperial business. Leave now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 258, 's_e82e2f2d', 'You can count on me, sir! They will arrive safely.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 259, 's_e83e03f6', 'They''re dreamers. They fail to recognize the futility of their cause. So many wasted lives all in the name of so called freedom. What they fail to understand that even if they win they will just be under someone else''s control. There is no such thing as true freedom.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 260, 's_e8e85347', 'Direct me and I shall succeed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 261, 's_e956329d', 'How would they have managed to get that information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 262, 's_e99b920a', 'The Rebellion might be foolish but they are hardly weak minded. The Empire has underestimated their abilities too often and has paid dearly for those mistakes. Storm Squadron will not make that same mistake. We will learn everything we can about our enemy and then defeat them using what we have learned.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 263, 's_ea1cf0eb', 'Nice, timing. I was just about to send for you. We have work to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 264, 's_eacf6042', 'What information will those documents contain?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 265, 's_ec6eda2a', 'Sealed to the throne basically means that all project information about Endor is on a need to know basis. Usually only a few top personnel even know entirely what is happening when something is sealed to the throne. Everyone is told only enough to do their jobs. Of course that doesn''t mean we cannot speculate, just be sure to keep your speculation to yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 266, 's_ee1dc70b', 'Well this is your chance. We are still looking for clues as to how much information the Rebellion has at their disposal, but we cannot ignore the growing number of Rebel fighters in the Endor system any longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 267, 's_ef128cbc', 'So, it is safe to assume they don''t know exactly what the operation is.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 268, 's_ef77d77a', 'Hopefully we most certainly will not attract any attention! You will not go out of your way to find any sort of action. Those engineers will arrive in Endor safely, you WILL be sure of that. You are dismissed, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 269, 's_ef7a2df5', 'Teach me about special forces training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 270, 's_efdebeb8', 'You can count on it, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 271, 's_f06f4a8', 'You are not assigned to this Squadron, pilot. Perhaps you have gotten lost? I suggest you un-lose yourself quickly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 272, 's_f0d5d662', 'No. We still do not know everything that the traitor has given to the Rebellion. Without that information the Rebels could simply send in another command ship and we would be right back to where we are now. But we will keep track of the vessel until we can decide how best to proceed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 273, 's_f1ae24d9', 'Go forth, execute the Emperor''s plan, and smite his enemies. We are sending the plans on Lambda shuttle to the Endor system. Meet up with the shuttle and transfer them to your craft. Then drop them off at Endor control. Once that is done the real operation can begin. Good luck to you, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 274, 's_f2bc2a81', 'Get back out there. Shut this situation down.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 275, 's_f51fd3ee', 'Naturally. That scout probably contains another piece of the puzzle. If we can gather enough information on the Rebel operation then we will be able to plug this leak. Unfortunately, the Rebel will always know about the Imperial project in the Endor system but we can stop them from finding out what it is.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 276, 's_f733628f', 'What did we find out from the Rebel information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 277, 's_f9d2ed90', 'Very crafty of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 278, 's_fae9ce56', 'Prove it. Get back out there and do your job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 279, 's_fb75707f', 'Then it is fortunate we have such a ''talented'' pilot in Storm Squadron. Perhaps you would care to plan the next mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 280, 's_fb7fd32', 'I take it you want me to inspect that scout as well?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier3.stf', 281, 's_ff74cc15', 'Good! It would be a shame for me to have to discipline someone who has just entered my command. So pilot, are you ready to take your first assignment or do you need a little time?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 3, 's_134dd45', 'I will accept it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 4, 's_146bc0b9', 'I just received the orders, you are shipping out. Grand Admiral Nial Declann has ordered that you attend him immediately. The orders come from the Palace at Theed so that is where I expect he wants you to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 5, 's_175d585', 'I will kill you myself. Is that enough motivation for you? Return to your duties!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 6, 's_1c3b8136', 'You will personally escort the Inquisitor''s ship to this position. You are to leave at once.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 7, 's_1e20c3ab', 'You did. And the Emperor thanks you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 8, 's_1e4c7d44', 'Ha! How very kind of you.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 9, 's_21b67b7a', 'I have nothing to fear from them, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 10, 's_2483f4e0', 'The Inquisition means to get to the bottom of this. You are to escort their ship to this location. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 11, 's_2a35d2fe', 'This war will be won by pilots who FIGHT, not by  pilots who like to drop by for visits! Begone!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 12, 's_2a973dfa', 'Something is knocking our system satellites offline.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 13, 's_2afd4ef5', 'I would expect nothing less.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 14, 's_2c2ce09e', 'I want to learn about heavy starship component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 15, 's_2c46518', 'It''s always useful.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 16, 's_2c4789b', 'Understood.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 17, 's_2d7a9ef4', 'Freighters are also a popular target for Rebel forces. Several have taken damage, and they must be rescued. And that is the situation. Tell me, which one interests you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 18, 's_2e7cf1a7', 'No. You did not. Several shuttles managed to escape our sensors. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 19, 's_2eb3aa2', 'You are resting on your laurels, %TU. Do not be so overconfident. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 20, 's_2f748550', 'I thought I had all of them!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 21, 's_31428bf1', 'Looks like that somebody is you, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 22, 's_333f441a', 'What would a Grand Admiral want with me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 23, 's_33cd03fd', 'I am sure the Inquisition is interested in Bothan spy activity. This particular - person - is very important to me, which means he is very important to you as well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 24, 's_34f8d771', 'Why? Have you been naughty?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 25, 's_3de69a90', 'They are attempting to leave this system. You will stop them. Fire at will.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 26, 's_3e3689e0', 'Do you REALIZE what will happen if you fail this mission?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 27, 's_3e6a4237', 'Very well. The sitrep is as follows. A pirate clan has foolishly chosen to set up operations in this system. They must be dealt with. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 28, 's_3ec8b347', 'The Rebels continue to bother us. They are incessant! But you have done well, %TU. You have earned your duty pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 29, 's_43e05ffa', 'Exactly. Now listen! Satellites in this system are going offline. There is no reason this should be happening.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 30, 's_45c5c358', 'The orders don''t say and I don''t make a point of sticking my nose in their business. The order simply say that you are being transferred under his command and that you are to report to him immediately. I suggest that you be on your best behavior for this one.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 31, 's_4621ec24', 'I''ll report my findings back to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 32, 's_469b88eb', 'I wish only to serve.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 33, 's_484092bd', 'The Bothans took the ships to the Dantooine system. They will be transferred to the Rebellion shortly. But that must not happen.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 34, 's_4854758d', 'I would like to request a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 35, 's_49237f95', 'No...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 36, 's_49425c4b', 'I''d like to do more than talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 37, 's_49805f81', 'Can I hear the briefing again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 38, 's_499130ad', 'Then shut your mouth and listen! We have learned that Bothan spies are operating in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 39, 's_4aef73fb', 'You have earned some of my trust, %NU. Not all, but some. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 40, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 41, 's_4d41f7fe', 'Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 42, 's_50605b35', 'What are you doing here pilot. You are not a part of this unit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 43, 's_5066022c', 'And so, of course, I will pay you now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 44, 's_5085bdab', 'I can use the money.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 45, 's_510025b7', 'Not yet. But we DO know that the stolen shuttles were taken to the Dantooine system - and will  be transferred to the Rebel Alliance shortly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 46, 's_5208f382', 'I can help those damaged freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 47, 's_52917b0d', 'Of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 48, 's_52bae760', 'Incredible! Bothans are rarely so bold.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 49, 's_535d53b3', 'That must not happen!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 50, 's_53773f7e', 'Welcome back, %TU. Your next assignment is waiting. Are you ready?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 51, 's_555b7ab7', 'Sabotage?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 52, 's_5ec3bab9', 'It''s as good as done.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 53, 's_60db9426', 'I should...finish my mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 54, 's_613f70ae', 'So I shouldn''t call him Nial?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 55, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 56, 's_643d24c8', 'An Inquisitor?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 57, 's_661f1464', 'Excellent idea! Let''s do that. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 58, 's_665b67d1', 'Very good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 59, 's_66bd8046', 'The Emperor continues to take an interest in this system. He is sending an Inquisitor here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 60, 's_67f91789', 'Always plenty of work for a pilot like you. Are you ready to accept an assignment? Or would you like to hear the briefing again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 61, 's_6a85372e', 'What are they doing with them?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 62, 's_6c642831', 'And I speak for the Emperor! The Endor system is back under our control. This is as it should be.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 63, 's_6dda58fa', 'Of course not. Our engineers plan for that kind of logical event. It''s something else.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 64, 's_6ebb13d3', 'I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 65, 's_7090182', 'What?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 66, 's_71197541', 'Yes. I have.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 67, 's_7177c3f2', 'Who is Grand Admiral Nial Declann?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 68, 's_717d4e48', 'Don''t be. I''m only giving you the information you need to serve the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 69, 's_71874e85', 'You have earned some of my trust, %NU. Not all, but some.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 70, 's_71e775f5', 'You have not done your job!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 71, 's_7247f243', 'I do not have any missions for which you are authorized. But I do have some elective duty tasks if you are interested. Would you like a briefing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 72, 's_7426e000', 'No!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 73, 's_77788129', 'More supply freighters are arriving every day. They must be transported to headquarters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 74, 's_77e48d5b', 'What do you mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 75, 's_783f1d49', 'We have gathered information from that Rebel shuttle.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 76, 's_7a3b60ae', 'Pretty words. I would rather see ugly action, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 77, 's_7b2d0234', 'I''ll be happy to transport those freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 78, 's_7b7590d4', 'Yes...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 79, 's_7f465235', 'Oh yes. I was told to expect you. I imagine you fancy yourself quite the pilot. Well I''ll make my own judgments once your prove yourself. Now, how about you get to work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 80, 's_8028a6ed', 'I am not concerned. We took action in time. The Empire may shoot too far or too wide at times - but at least we shoot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 81, 's_83cb9cbb', 'I would have no problem replacing you with another pilot. And replaced pilots are dead pilots. Am I making myself clear?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 82, 's_83e62040', 'They are attempting to leave this system. But they will not - because you will stop them. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 83, 's_86c72612', 'That''s very good of you. My men will upload coordinates to your ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 84, 's_87d4bfc2', 'Crystal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 85, 's_898e32ed', 'I should say not! I am unsatisfied! Finish what you have started, imbecile!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 86, 's_8a4f7617', 'Please.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 87, 's_8bcb23a1', 'Then show me  that you are a person of your word.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 88, 's_8eb7d0ee', 'Destroy those shuttles!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 89, 's_8f48acff', 'Unlikely. But whatever it is, it will be corrected. By you. I want you to investigate each satellite personally. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 90, 's_8f4d001d', 'I haven''t?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 91, 's_951d1b06', 'There must be...How many satellites are there in this system?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 92, 's_958dc561', 'The Emperor''s most potent weapon - besides myself,  that is. Your fears are well founded.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 93, 's_96443422', 'We''ll get them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 94, 's_97682588', 'I want to learn about droid intelligence theory.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 95, 's_9853c232', 'That is not my concern. It is yours. You will fix the problem. I want you to inspect each satellite personally.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 96, 's_99e3a272', 'My thoughts exactly. You must make your way to Dantooine and destroy those stolen shuttles.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 97, 's_9ad8fa8f', 'Use extreme prejudice. We''d rather see those ships destroyed than fall into Rebel hands. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 98, 's_9b43a7ee', 'Yes sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 99, 's_9cc5ad7c', 'I am here to serve the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 100, 's_9da5d80d', 'See that it doesn''t! The Empire only has room for the best. Get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 101, 's_9e02d014', 'Incredible! How can this be? We''ve been pursuing them at full speed!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 102, 's_9ff091bd', 'Ah. %TU. Hello. I wish to give you your duty pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 103, 's_a0bfbb', 'We are also receiving reports that several freighters were attacked by pirate vessels. We need an experienced pilot to retrieve those freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 104, 's_a1586753', 'Do you know how the Bothans managed to pull this off?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 105, 's_a46cdee9', 'Excellent!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 106, 's_a4dd5d0d', 'Very good, %TU. I have your duty pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 107, 's_a4f1dc7d', 'How would I know? I have never had the honor of meeting a Grand Admiral. But your behavior reflects on me. If you screw up  he will probably just have you executed. I on the other hand will probably be put on garbage detail for the rest of my life. So show this Grand Admiral what being a member of Storm Squadron is all about.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 108, 's_a50d5eb4', 'I want to learn about experimental TIE vessels.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 109, 's_a5182b84', 'You have earned it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 110, 's_a5827814', 'You will address him as Grand Admiral or sir! If you lip off to the Grand Admiral he is liable to have you shot on the spot and then he will probably turn his vengeance on me. You are a reflection of our entire squadron so you had better not screw this up. Now get to Theed Palace and report in.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 111, 's_a5b9be0a', 'The Bothan spies are good pilots after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 112, 's_a5d7d28d', 'I want to learn about elite TIE guard training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 113, 's_a87c6f7d', 'You must control your temper. If you find these Bothans, you must deliver them to the Inquisitor unharmed. They will know what to do, believe me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 114, 's_a9fb7454', 'I suggest you get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 115, 's_abddb145', 'I am sorry, it won''t happen again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 116, 's_ad56e0fd', 'For what reason?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 117, 's_adcc0a23', 'You want me to be lazy and undisciplined?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 118, 's_adfa15d1', 'Any idea what it could be?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 119, 's_ae9853f8', 'Bothan spies are operating in this system. They have gone so far as to capture several of our command shuttles.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 120, 's_b03d4317', 'It is curious, isn''t it? But no matter. They won''t get far. Bothan spies have no chance against an Imperial pilot such as yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 121, 's_b1d99272', 'Life is short - especially for an Imperial pilot. I would enjoy that money if I were you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 122, 's_b2a9497c', 'Enough to keep you busy, I think. You are to leave immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 123, 's_b2da1ce2', 'Bothan? They usually work with the Rebels.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 124, 's_b3c5ff5e', 'Have you completed your mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 125, 's_b3d150e3', 'I know I have not completed my mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 126, 's_b474959c', 'Of course! I did my duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 127, 's_b7879974', 'How do you know they''re here? Bothan spies are usually invisible.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 128, 's_b78b6139', 'Good. Now don''t keep the Admiral waiting. Get to Theed Palace on the double and report in.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 129, 's_b8173a60', 'Yes, sir. I won''t let the squadron down.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 130, 's_b885dd25', 'Can I fire on the ships?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 131, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 132, 's_bac59fd8', 'No. Of course not. I am not concerned. You know and I know that if you betrayed the Empire, you would be dead before nightfall.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 133, 's_bc2b5278', 'I hope so. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 134, 's_bf2260fb', 'Yes, sir. I will be on my best behavior.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 135, 's_c1ce722e', 'I will complete my mission! I swear it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 136, 's_c28a04da', 'I don''t tell secrets.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 137, 's_c3f0115e', 'Not this time. They have captured several of our command shuttles.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 138, 's_c782ced7', 'I''m flattered.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 139, 's_c8003afd', 'Don''t play innocent with me, %TU.  You need to get this situation straightened out.  If you cannot improve your standing with the Empire, then you can''t be trusted with any more assignments.  Do I make myself clear?  You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 140, 's_c90d9b02', 'The Empire pays well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 141, 's_c9b872a1', 'Then continue your search for those shuttles.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 142, 's_cae57de6', 'There''s more where that came from.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 143, 's_cc9ccc9a', 'Well then. There''s your answer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 144, 's_cec1f447', 'I''d like to take out that pirate clan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 145, 's_d115dd42', 'Somebody''s got to recover those freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 146, 's_d1e73984', 'It is essential that all pilots continue their training. Select your next course of study!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 147, 's_d318f289', 'You don''t look like much of a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 148, 's_d3b2272c', 'I believe your trainer is looking for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 149, 's_d669284c', 'Pilot, if you screw this up, the Grand Admiral won''t have a chance to execute you because I will do it myself. And I won''t make it all pleasant like he would. You will suffer long, you will suffer hard, and you will live to regret ever messing with my squadron. Now get out of my sight before I have to inform the Grand Admiral that you had a little accident involving my foot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 150, 's_d7be8f57', 'Don''t spend it all in one place.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 151, 's_d88c15de', 'Of that you can be sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 152, 's_dc219a69', 'Grand Admiral Nial Declann is one of the twelve men in charge of the Imperial Navy. From what I have heard he has the Emperor''s ear and is definitely not a man to be trifled with. I would suggest that you be on your best behavior because that man will not tolerate any impertinence.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 153, 's_dd2ae025', 'I don''t know what to say.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 154, 's_df3eeb29', 'Why, what sort of man is he?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 155, 's_e015cb4', 'Good. Remember you reflect on me and the entire squadron. The Grand Admiral has the power to eliminate our entire group with a single order, so don''t let us down. Now don''t keep the Admiral waiting. Get to Theed Palace and report in right away.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 156, 's_e0e28bdb', 'You are drawing the attention of the Inquisition. They are wondering how a pilot like yourself could possibly be an Imperial.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 157, 's_e16137e8', 'Get out of my sight immediately!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 158, 's_e26ff616', 'I will do my job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 159, 's_e542a06b', 'You are not authorized to fly the missions that I have. You would probably have more luck talking to your commanding officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 160, 's_e5f302f7', 'Space debris?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 161, 's_e604f53', 'And that''s why we will win.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 162, 's_e91413e7', 'I am amazed myself. As is the Inquisitor. He is eager to speak to one of these Bothan spies. They''ve done an amazing job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 163, 's_eb570c2b', 'Ah yes. I know this too. What should we do about this?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 164, 's_ebe5a831', 'We destroyed the Rebel command ship, but they may still have the stolen information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 165, 's_ee15b61', 'I hope so - for your sake. Return to your duties immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 166, 's_ee7cbdbe', 'See that you do. Because, you see, it is also drawing attention to myself. And I do not want that. So do good - for me. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 167, 's_eef2363b', 'Mm.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 168, 's_ef420789', 'Yes!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 169, 's_f10afb8', 'Very good! Now you will serve me! I have a mission for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 170, 's_f2643fdd', 'What is your major malfunction, %TU!?  I just got a report that you''re under investigation for treason!  Do you realize how this makes ME look?  I should shoot you myself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 171, 's_f4d0ec53', 'Do so! You''re clear to leave.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 172, 's_f5e3efbe', 'I understand that you served the Grand Admiral with distinction. You have done well by me and the squadron. Are you just here for more work?  Sure you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 173, 's_f5ef44e1', 'The Emperor appreciates your loyalty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 174, 's_f6f97563', 'Excellent. Sometimes I think half the galaxy has taken an interest in this godforsaken little corner. You''re free to leave anytime.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 175, 's_fcc7875e', 'Do you have any more information on the shuttles?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_tier4.stf', 176, 's_fee3d28f', 'We continue to pursue these stolen shuttles.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 3, 's_101a6629', 'Report back to me when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 4, 's_10675ec9', 'Keep quiet and listen. Bestine has become a key base location for Imperial Naval operations in the Outer Rim. Many ships and men are moved through this region on a daily basis. Ships and men consume supplies and uninterrupted delivery of supplies is critical to the integrity of base operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 5, 's_1091c96a', 'I''m done for now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 6, 's_1144321a', 'Don''t get too cocky, it might have just been luck. I''ve convinced the Naval Command to test your abilities further. We want to crush the pirates and demonstrate that Imperial resolve remains strong. I want you to get into space and destroy any Commerce Raiders you find. Your mission is to eliminate four of the pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 7, 's_11fcdd9f', 'I''m interested in hearing about the Imperial Navy, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 8, 's_13195064', 'Here''s your salary for the operation and another bonus for exceptional duty. I also received your Imperial flight suit. Please wear it while you are on duty. Your helmet will take a while longer, the inertia electronics have to be calibrated for every pilot. You wouldn''t want to black out during a fast maneuver.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 9, 's_13a199af', 'Why recruit volunteers? Is not the strength of the Emperor''s Navy unmatched?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 10, 's_14aa29c', 'I haven''t exactly enjoyed your company, either. Yes, it does mean you will have a new commanding officer. I''ll skip the formality. You are now a Pilot Officer. Personally, I think it''s a mistake, but Naval Command likes the results you''ve shown.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 11, 's_153a5c24', 'You are the most obstinate person I have ever had the displeasure of meeting. Report back to me when you are ready for another mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 12, 's_154024b0', 'Get out of my office, trash! Guards, throw this scum out!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 13, 's_15a6458f', 'What is Oberhaur like?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 14, 's_15daf24e', 'You don''t take complements very well. This one was worth double the normal rate. I''ve also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 15, 's_16244233', 'I''m ready for a mission, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 16, 's_163d48b6', '(Take the form.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 17, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 18, 's_16c1201f', 'Ah, joy. A briefing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 19, 's_16f8c58a', 'I will not disappoint, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 20, 's_16fc739e', 'I...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 21, 's_17519607', 'Good luck, pilot. Stay sharp.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 22, 's_1768c7c4', 'Just a minor set back. Those pirates won''t last long.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 23, 's_19288eda', 'I think I need to rethink things.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 24, 's_19d7d16a', 'It''s too bad you can''t wear it. It would be a marked improvement. Report back to me when you''re ready for more work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 25, 's_19ff301f', 'What kind of training?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 26, 's_1a100286', 'I think you need to prove you''re worhty first, don''t you?  Now stand at attention!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 27, 's_1a5d8b73', 'Don''t underestimate him. A particularly skilled and charismatic leader might explain the increase in the pirate activity. You must continue to hunt him down.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 28, 's_1cccf249', 'You are not a pilot in my squadron, and therefore unable to fly any of the missions I have. Go back to your unit and speak with your commanding officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 29, 's_1d0e7364', 'I''m transferring a ship authorization and control device to your datapad. You''ll need this to use your TIE Fighter. Should you lose your control device and access to your ship, you can apply for a new one at any time. Unfortunately, I''m only authorized to supply you with access to our low end TIE technology.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 30, 's_21309acb', 'I''m no Inquisitor. I merely seek the will of the Emperor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 31, 's_22451e60', 'We serve as the Emperor wills.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 32, 's_22564d44', 'Sir, I can fly. It would be an honor to serve the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 33, 's_23600775', '(Yawn.) My payment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 34, 's_247ae5a6', 'Here is your salary for the mission. This one was worth double the normal rate. I''ve also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet. Unfortunately, these standard issue helmets are not suited to meet your, uh... cranial proportions. Nevertheless, keep it as a symbol of the technological and military might of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 35, 's_24890a54', 'This recognition should have happened a long time ago.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 36, 's_248cfc90', '(Relate information on your inability to defeat the pirate leader.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 37, 's_2562a051', 'For the Emperor. Sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 38, 's_259013cd', '[Destroy Duty] I''m interested in hunting pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 39, 's_25d6b961', 'Their destruction is inevitable.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 40, 's_263baa57', '(Brag about how you bagged several raiders.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 41, 's_264e2e43', 'Or your ego. Here is your payment for a successful mission and an additional sum to compensate for hazards encountered.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 42, 's_266d5a8d', 'I''m not sure that''s the right kind of motivation, citizen. The Imperial Navy is the finest fleet in the galaxy. We command the Empire''s starships and fighters. We are the hammer of Imperial justice. The Navy wants patriots who will fight for the security of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 43, 's_2800bbf1', 'Yes, I''ve heard. Saving that transport was very uncharacteristic of you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 44, 's_2844cc74', 'Pilot, you are a disgrace.  You have been assisting the Rebel Alliance against the Empire.  This will not be tolerated.  You are grounded until further notice!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 45, 's_28526663', 'Later!  This situation is urgent.  I''ll train you AFTER you have completed this special assignment.  Got it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 46, 's_28586fd5', 'Very well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 47, 's_2879b9e3', 'Indeed.  You didn''t seem the type.  You realize that enlisting with the ground forces - even as a covert operative - could open you to attack from Rebels when you least expect it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 48, 's_2a1015e6', '(Don''t salute.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 49, 's_2a1af001', 'I defeated him with ease.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 50, 's_2bca7dec', 'Apparently there are few skilled warriors in this Navy, if my actions are surprising.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 51, 's_2c3d0c07', 'I will find and destroy the enemy, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 52, 's_2d4337c5', 'I''ve seen your face! You''re a known Rebel pilot! Guards, arrest this man!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 53, 's_2d5d4bf0', 'I''m interested in a duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 54, 's_2e48b5f1', 'It''s no secret that Imperial pilots utilize some of the best starfighter tactics the galaxy has ever seen.  I can get you started on the road to mastering these uniquely Imperial procedures.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 55, 's_2e935a2c', 'Good to see you again, pilot. I hope your new assignment is going well. The voluntary conscription program has been quite successful. If there is anything I can help you with, let me know. Although you are overqualified, I can offer you some basic missions and duties. I can also train you in simple skills, in case you need a refresher.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 56, 's_2f923a47', 'Yes, you''re probably right about that. You managed to help secure valuable medical supplies. A lot of people owe you for your bravery.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 57, 's_2fe328e', 'By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby conscript you to service with the non-officer flight rank of Pilot Initiate. May you serve the Empire dutifully. Welcome to the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 58, 's_304d169e', 'I am honored, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 59, 's_3060d15b', '(Patronizing) The Emperor himself will take note of you, I''m sure. Here is your salary as well as a little extra. The Emperor rewards dutiful service.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 60, 's_30a48366', 'Perhaps. By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby commend you and bestow upon you the rank of Pilot Officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 61, 's_311a3b47', 'Stand at attention. Now, deliver your report on the Commerce Route patrol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 62, 's_31967d85', 'Does this mean I get a new handler? I''m sick of working with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 63, 's_323e4b0d', 'I will decide when you are ready for training, Pilot.  And right now I say you aren''t.  Now, about your new role in the Outer Rim security detail...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 64, 's_34975e9f', 'Report back to me when you''ve successfully completed the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 65, 's_34bc5f5e', 'You don''t have the experience to apply to training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 66, 's_34ff44c5', 'Maybe you should reread your flight manual. Come back when you want to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 67, 's_35daf5c2', 'You responded to a rapidly changing situation, eliminated the enemy, and helped secure valuable medical supplies. I''m proud of you, pilot. You''ve come a long way in a short time. The Empire could use more people like you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 68, 's_36b3ba5a', 'Report on your patrol, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 69, 's_36f7cf1e', 'Perhaps they merely find them surprising coming from you. Here''s your payment as well as a bonus for saving the transport. I also received your Imperial flight suit. Please wear it while you are on duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 70, 's_378987b0', 'Let me know if you decide you want to work with us.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 71, 's_37910d75', 'With the recent increase in pirate activity, our supply transports are at risk. The Empire would like to assign at least one TIE pilot to every transport operating in the Tatooine region. You will be paid for every successful escort operation you complete.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 72, 's_37979335', 'Report back to me when you are finished with the patrol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 73, 's_37ae364a', 'That overconfidence will get you killed some day. We have Intelligence reports on areas of high pirate activity that will be good places for you to start your search for the pirates. Report back to me upon completion of your task.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 74, 's_37eb1d12', 'I''d rather not sign up right now, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 75, 's_388cfea9', 'The Empire is recruiting volunteer pilots?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 76, 's_3988f447', 'We are the greatest fleet in the galaxy, surmounting even the warships of the old Republic. Nonetheless, Rebel opposition has become more direct. We want to recruit new pilots for support duty, freeing up combat pilots for the front lines. Are you a pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 77, 's_39aba3b6', '(Tell him about your victory in battle.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 78, 's_39f8ff3b', 'How else may I serve the Empire?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 79, 's_3ab04e84', 'As much as it pains me to say it, I hereby conscript you to service with the non-officer flight rank of Pilot Initiate. May you serve the Empire dutifully. Come back when you''re ready for your ''job.'''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 80, 's_3b1fee95', 'Report to me when you are ready to give it another try.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 81, 's_3b3aabc1', 'I''d like training, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 82, 's_3b510c1a', 'The purpose of this patrol assignment isn''t to add any additional security to the Commerce Route. I highly doubt you would be effective in a combat situation. This is to assess your ability to pilot a ship and follow basic instructions. I''ve transferred the patrol route to your datapad. You are to fly to each point in the patrol route and then report back to me upon completion. Is this clear, Pilot Initiate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 83, 's_3ca32099', 'They''re as good as dead.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 84, 's_3d5b4720', 'Why would the Imperial Navy need to...outsource?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 85, 's_3de840b5', 'I need to spend some time practicing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 86, 's_3f6a8711', 'Thank you, sir. I do my best.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 87, 's_3f904297', 'Lost it? How do you lose one of those massive things? Alright, I''ll imprint you a new one, but don''t lose it. They only give me a limited allotment of these disks every week.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 88, 's_40f3848e', 'I''m interested in space combat training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 89, 's_42b12aab', 'Perhaps they merely find them surprising coming from you. Here''s your payment as well as a bonus for saving the transport. I also received your Imperial flight suit, but you''re much too large to fit into this... take this bandolier instead.  At the very least, it will help you organize your things.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 90, 's_42be2dbc', 'Tighten it up, pilot! If you fly half as bad as you smell, you''ll end up space scrap. Discipline is key to victory.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 91, 's_42bfca2f', 'If you''ve got work that pays, I''ll listen.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 92, 's_42dfe6db', 'Indeed. The Empire rarely enlists non-Humans as pilots, and so we are poorly prepared to equip someone such as yourself. But do not be discouraged. Your current standing in the Imperial Navy is a testament to your abilities.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 93, 's_431ac3d4', 'Very good. How may I help you, Initiate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 94, 's_438b2349', 'So far you''ve been flying a basic TIE.  The normal TIE is quite a bit more complicated than that.  For one thing, you''ll find that you can install better components on it... better weapons, better armor, and so on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 95, 's_4608dfe8', 'The Imperial Navy is the finest fleet in the galaxy. The brave and the bold. We command the Empire''s starships and fighters. We are the hammer of Imperial justice. All members of the Imperial Navy are officers, however we are now starting to recruit non-officer pilots for limited support duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 96, 's_465b51a7', 'I am sick of this insubordinate, disrespectful attitude. Shape up or you''ll find yourself in a detention block.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 97, 's_46c8d76c', 'Show respect, Pilot! Outside you might be street scum, but in this office you are a pilot of the Imperial Navy. You will demonstrate the proper respect to your senior officer or you will demonstrate how to clean a sewage compactor. Is that clear?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 98, 's_47691a6', 'Report to me when you are ready to attempt the patrol again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 99, 's_4854758d', 'I would like to request a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 100, 's_49af5773', 'You heard me.  If you ever want to fly for the Imperial Navy again, you''d better improve your standing with the Empire!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 101, 's_4c6875a7', 'In this outfit, you serve as I will. Now get out to that patrol. Report to me when you''re done.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 102, 's_4c97441f', 'Report to me when you have completed your mission. May the Emperor guide you to victory.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 103, 's_4d41f7fe', 'Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 104, 's_4d7a1ae4', 'Spaced him. Now, about my fee?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 105, 's_4e95ac78', 'Service Pilot Initiate, it is beyond my understanding how you could fail to achieve the objective of flying such a simple circuit patrol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 106, 's_4efae056', 'I''m surprised those pirates didn''t turn your ship into a burning heap. Here''s your payment. Report back to me when you''re ready for another job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 107, 's_506aa7cf', 'Sorry, pilot, but you are carrying way too much stuff. I hope you don''t take all of that into your ship with you. Drop some of it and come back for your form.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 108, 's_5070b6e', 'Very good. By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby conscript you to service with the non-officer flight rank of Pilot Initiate. May you serve the Empire dutifully. Welcome to the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 109, 's_518959d2', 'Good, I have a lot of work for you. Pirate activity in the area is still fairly high. There are plenty of pirates to hunt or you could help escort transports moving supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 110, 's_523f6698', 'This sounds like something that might be worthy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 111, 's_52b712dc', '(Relate the details of the distress call.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 112, 's_561d4b08', 'I will have you confined if you cannot control yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 113, 's_565cc8ba', 'I live only to serve the Emperor, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 114, 's_566cddb5', 'This is a patrol and only a patrol. The purpose of the assignment is to assess your ability to pilot a ship and follow basic instructions. I will be very surprised if you manage to succeed. I''ve transferred the patrol route to your datapad. You are to report back to me upon completion.  Is this clear, Pilot Initiate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 115, 's_577aca95', 'I''m interested in weapons.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 116, 's_59c8db72', 'Sir, yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 117, 's_5b34a8a8', 'In the Imperial Navy we don''t pick our postings, they pick us. The Naval Command feels you make a good candidate for Security.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 118, 's_5c4e4259', 'Whatever. Like I said before, just name the target and the price.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 119, 's_5c5b19e2', 'Yes, Sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 120, 's_5c709097', 'It is not the Emperor''s will.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 121, 's_5c8922d8', 'That''s the spirit, Pilot Initiate! You''re starting to sound like an Imperial Pilot should. We have Intelligence reports on areas of high pirate activity that will be good places for you to start your search for the pirates. Report back to me upon completion of your task.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 122, 's_5cd3c77', 'There are those who believe the officers lack faith.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 123, 's_5ce97ee2', 'Imperial intelligence has located a suspected pirate leader. He seems to frequent a staging area close to the Bestine Orbital Region. I''m transferring the coordinates to your datapad now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 124, 's_5e3cf461', 'I''m interested in Imperial technology.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 125, 's_5e6be58d', '(Nod silently, but stare intensely.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 126, 's_5ebce168', 'Actually, I''d like to do this later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 127, 's_5f418636', 'They were dead money. Now I want to be paid.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 128, 's_5fdd32ea', 'Excellent. Deliver a report to me upon completion of the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 129, 's_601e26c5', 'Here''s your salary for the operation and another bonus for exceptional duty. I also received your Imperial flight suit, but you''ll never fit into this...Why don''t you take this bandolier, instead.  At least you can keep your things organized.  Your helmet will take a while longer, the inertia electronics have to be calibrated for every pilot. You wouldn''t want to black out during a fast maneuver.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 130, 's_60c81a4c', 'Absolutely, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 131, 's_6138854f', 'Do you have business with the Imperial Navy? No? Then I suggest that you come back another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 132, 's_61f0326', 'Figured if I didn''t, you wouldn''t pay me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 133, 's_627065f5', 'I work alone and then I get paid.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 134, 's_6337731b', 'I suggest you reign in your enthusiasm. I need you to have a clear mind up there. Do not underestimate your enemy. We have Intelligence reports on areas of high pirate activity that will be good places for you to start your search for the pirates. Report back to me when you''ve completed the objective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 135, 's_63380f34', 'I''ve always been an independent agent. I work alone.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 136, 's_63f41edf', 'A glorious achievement, I''m sure. You responded to a rapidly changing situation, eliminated the enemy, and helped secure valuable medical supplies. The Naval Command is pleased with your adaptability.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 137, 's_64b01ff', 'That may be, but they haven''t stood on the command deck of an Imperial Star Destroyer while facing down a squadron of enemy hostiles. Sir, I have no time for the Imperial Inquisition. My record shows that I am a patriot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 138, 's_65dcd253', 'I''d rather suck plasma than work for you.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 139, 's_668cac00', 'I need to think about the mission and figure out what went wrong.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 140, 's_66ac46dc', 'A patrol is somewhat less than my ability. I prefer a warrior''s assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 141, 's_670201ae', 'I need a ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 142, 's_6705894e', 'Service in the Imperial Navy isn''t to be taken lightly. You''ll be expected to follow orders and any association with the Rebellion would be punished severely.  Are you sure you want to sign up? You aren''t exactly Imperial Pilot quality.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 143, 's_6868d86b', 'Return to me when you are ready to take the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 144, 's_68c831e7', 'Yes. I want to be in the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 145, 's_6942663f', 'Recently, Rebel opposition has become more direct. We want to recruit new pilots for support duty, freeing up combat pilots for the front lines. Under normal circumstances it takes years of formal education to become a flight officer in the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 146, 's_6942ec7e', 'You want me to eliminate him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 147, 's_6971748f', 'So, it seems I was right after all. Your success with the pirates was just luck and the trust of Naval Command was misplaced. I suppose you could try hunting down the pirates again, but you would probably still fail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 148, 's_6988fd93', 'Now then, your mission. Bestine has become a key base location for Imperial Naval operations in the Outer Rim. Many ships and men are moved through this region on a daily basis. Ships and men consume supplies and uninterrupted delivery of supplies is critical to the integrity of base operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 149, 's_69d5148f', 'Thank you sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 150, 's_6a128385', 'What is a duty?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 151, 's_6a7d2af7', 'The purpose of the mission is to assess your ability to pilot a ship and follow basic instructions. If you pass, you will be considered for more dangerous assignments. You are to report back to me upon completion. Is this clear, Pilot Initiate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 152, 's_6b63ee3', 'Stand at attention, Pilot. Having shown skill in combat situations you are being elevated to an Outer Rim security detail. For the time being, I will handle your assignments, briefings, and deployment. You will operate as an independent agent until we determine a specific placement for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 153, 's_6cb86d0c', 'Ah...yes. Good day then.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 154, 's_6d8d3e00', 'I will not fail you, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 155, 's_6e62e955', 'You should be. An officer rank is usually only given to those who graduate Naval Command School. All combat pilots in the Imperial Navy hold at least the rank of Pilot Officer. The Empire has recognized your ability and has seen fit to elevate you to the lowest rank of the command echelon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 156, 's_6fcaa2a', 'You''ve earned it, pilot. You have exceeded the expectations of this program and of myself. Your duty has not ended, however. Return when you are ready to take on another operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 157, 's_701f8a8e', 'Report back to me when you are ready for your next mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 158, 's_703a1e55', 'Now, do you have further business here? I am quite busy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 159, 's_7090182', 'What?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 160, 's_713afe89', 'Yeah? Well you can tell ''em where to find me so they can pay up.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 161, 's_726bd76b', 'Wing Epsilon Zeta, operating out of the garrisoned ISD Accuser, usually handles supply security operations.  Escort, patrol, and the like. They are overtaxed and have asked for additional support. Your job will be to fly a standard patrol sweep through the region.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 162, 's_7279069a', 'Your job is to locate and eliminate the pirate leader. Imperial Naval Command believes a decisive strike against the pirates would cripple, if not eliminate, their operations in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 163, 's_72ed61c', 'Yes, volunteers. Under normal circumstances it takes years of formal education to become a flight officer in the Imperial Navy. Recently, Rebel opposition has become more direct. We want to recruit new pilots for support duty, freeing up combat pilots for the front lines. Are you a pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 164, 's_7537c07c', 'I think I recognize you. You''re on a wanted list I think...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 165, 's_7611fee0', 'It is the Emperor''s will.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 166, 's_76de9d3f', 'My talents lie in the direction of hunting men, not patrols.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 167, 's_7796b57c', 'Great, I can''t wait to try this baby out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 168, 's_780a9b6f', 'A patrol? I want something to shoot. Shooting always pays better.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 169, 's_786f3cf7', 'I want to study something else.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 170, 's_78dbec92', 'Whatever. Sounds like easy money.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 171, 's_79ab4bbe', '[Escort Duty] I''m interested in escorting transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 172, 's_7ba2ac61', 'No excuses! Get back out there and complete your mission, or I''ll find someone who can!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 173, 's_7baeb853', 'I expect to be paid for each kill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 174, 's_7c4d87dd', 'Pilot Initiate. Your success in responding to pirate aggression during patrol has encouraged the local Naval Command. Despite their enthusiasm, I am still not convinced their faith in voluntary conscripts is justified. I am honestly surprised you survived.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 175, 's_7c8aca1b', 'Good choice.  Report back when you are ready for an assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 176, 's_7c96fa97', 'Imperial Naval Command believes a decisive strike against the pirates would cripple their operations in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 177, 's_7d477c70', 'Sir...I...ah...lost my ship control device.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 178, 's_7e347138', 'He''s as good as dead.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 179, 's_7ef9666e', 'They were no match for my skill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 180, 's_7f6cd2e6', 'Listen up. Bestine has become a key base location for Imperial Naval operations in the Outer Rim. Many ships and men are moved through this region on a daily basis. Ships and men consume supplies and uninterrupted delivery of supplies is critical to the integrity of base operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 181, 's_7fa6a6f8', 'What did you expect? Glory in the name of the Emperor? That may be what the men and women of the Death Star found, but out here its business as usual. This war will be won through the daily effort of loyal officers doing their assigned duties, not the heroics of a single SpecOps ghost.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 182, 's_7fdc4805', 'As a member of this Navy you will be expected to work with the team when necessary. Your assignments, while small, are critical to Imperial interests in the Outer Rim. If I need you to work with others to achieve those goals, you will do so and you will like it. Is that clear?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 183, 's_7ff3bffd', 'It never changes with you does it. Here''s your payment as well as a bonus for saving the transport. I also received your Imperial flight suit. At least try to look like a pilot and wear it while you''re on duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 184, 's_8273f08f', 'Naval Command will be pleased. I didn''t expect someone like you to be such an asset to the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 185, 's_82f901aa', 'Report back to me when you are ready for another duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 186, 's_838b6daf', 'They died cursing my name.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 187, 's_83d1f7de', 'Understood, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 188, 's_83ea480b', '(Glare) Very well. Sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 189, 's_83fa9322', 'Give me an update on the status of your operation against the pirate leader, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 190, 's_83fc71cf', 'What kind of assignment is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 191, 's_84047858', '(Glare at him, violently.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 192, 's_84cc9ca1', 'The Imperial Navy prides itself on the character and loyalty of its officers. I don''t think you understand what it means to be a patriot. The lines are drawn, citizen. You are either with us or you are a Rebel. There is no neutral ground.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 193, 's_853678d0', 'I have an assignment for you. As you know, ships travel to and from Bestine every day along the Primary Commerce Route. Commercial traffic to Bestine is limited to the route, so we can scan each ship for illegal cargo. I want you to perform a circuit patrol of the Bestine PCR.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 194, 's_85414d61', '(Brag about how you saved some stupid transport.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 195, 's_860c425d', 'Great, where''s my ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 196, 's_87e1d305', 'It''s kinda ugly lookin''.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 197, 's_88241861', 'I lost my Application of Transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 198, 's_88ffee3a', 'Report back to me when you are ready for some work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 199, 's_8a6a16c8', 'A simple ''sir'' is fine, Initiate.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 200, 's_8c262163', 'Report back to me when you are finished with your current mission.  You can abort your mission if you want to start over.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 201, 's_8c63d8cd', 'You''ll wear what you are told to wear. Now get lost. I have other business to attend to. Let me know when you''re ready for another job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 202, 's_8cd3467e', '(Salute) For the Emperor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 203, 's_8d324b72', 'I''ve transferred the patrol coordinates to your datapad. Try harder this time, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 204, 's_8df7dba2', 'I can fly and I can shoot, but I don''t come cheap.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 205, 's_8e66d267', 'You don''t have the experience for training, yet. Perform some more duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 206, 's_8efde2ae', 'Yes, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 207, 's_8fc0b08b', 'You won''t make many friends in the Imperial Navy if you question the faith of everyone you meet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 208, 's_8fc58e91', 'The Empire has recognized your ability and has seen fit to elevate you to the lowest rank of the Naval command echelon. Don''t abuse that trust. Commander Oberhaur of the ISD Accuser will handle your assignments from this point on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 209, 's_9237617f', 'What about training?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 210, 's_92c85144', 'You flubbed a simple operation. This patrol should have been flawless.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 211, 's_930b7f4c', 'Your job is to locate and eliminate the pirate leader at the coordinates I have given you. Imperial Naval Command believes a decisive strike against the pirates would cripple, if not eliminate, their operations in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 212, 's_93b4f46e', 'Cdr. Oberhaur is friendly, but a tough man. He''ll work you hard. You aren''t officially a member of Storm Squadron yet. You need to impress Cdr. Oberhaur during the application phase to be accepted. You''ll need to take this Authorization of Transfer to him. He''s currently stationed here in Bestine. You can find his office over in the capital building. Sign this form and give it to him to start.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 213, 's_94131047', 'Don''t lose it this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 214, 's_943c7ba6', 'I''d like training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 215, 's_9465e2c7', 'You must have impressed someone, pilot. You are being posted for consideration to join Storm Squadron. The squadron is a special operations wing based here in the Tatooine system. Their C.O. is a man named Commander Jhon Oberhaur.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 216, 's_94eb8fab', 'As I said, I''m not convinced their faith in ''volunteers'' is justified, and I''m certainly not ready to trust you with more knowledge just yet, in spite of your recent victory.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 217, 's_94ed5057', 'I''ve transferred the patrol coordinates to your datapad.  Try not to fly into anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 218, 's_95f0e74b', 'Even so, I suggest you wear it. It would be a marked improvement. Report back to me when you''re ready for more work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 219, 's_966ca13e', 'Ah, yes. You''re in my files as a member of the Imperial Navy, but you''re not assigned to my roster. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 220, 's_969498f6', 'I don''t want to hear excuses. You haven''t earned the right to give excuses. I want you to get back up there and finish that patrol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 221, 's_96c14c06', 'Yes, sir. I overcame the enemy with ease.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 222, 's_976cba8a', '(Sniff derisively.) You got a job for me or what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 223, 's_976ec302', 'Calm down, your payment has been arranged. I''ve also taken the liberty of submitting your physical profile to the Commissions Office. You stink and you aren''t dressed for your position as an Imperial Pilot. A spec TIE pilot flightsuit will be ready for you soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 224, 's_987445c9', 'Thank you, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 225, 's_989ea72c', 'I am aware of how fleets function.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 226, 's_9a79a8e3', 'You are a disgrace. Get out of my sight, pilot. I don''t want to see you again until you have results. If you perform capably, I might see about fitting you with a nice garbage escort detail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 227, 's_9a809034', 'As it stands, I do have an assignment for you. As you know, ships travel to and from Bestine every day along the Primary Commerce Route. Commercial traffic to Bestine is limited to the route, so we can scan each ship for illegal cargo. I want you to perform a circuit patrol of the Bestine PCR.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 228, 's_9bcd2229', 'What kind of assignment is this?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 229, 's_9eb2b131', 'Return later and I''ll have another mission prepared for you. Good day, Initiate.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 230, 's_9ef7bea1', 'Motivation doesn''t matter if the job gets done.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 231, 's_a0129ea3', 'I told you before, I wear what I want.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 232, 's_a0d8ac32', 'Then be on your way. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 233, 's_a1088c08', 'Just a simple patrol, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 234, 's_a2d4dd9d', 'I will not fail the Emperor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 235, 's_a3b6d1bc', 'Clear as Duralian Tea, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 236, 's_a4622f42', 'I don''t care about your civil war. I''m just looking for work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 237, 's_a490d2c6', 'Alright.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 238, 's_a4c65e0b', 'With just a little more training, you could be using better weapons.  Missiles can really help to swing the battle your way, and this skill can allow you to use some good ones.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 239, 's_a57e647c', 'I''m interested in astromech management.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 240, 's_a607dd0f', 'I wear what I please.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 241, 's_a6574c9a', 'Service in the Imperial Navy isn''t to be taken lightly.  You''ll be expected to follow orders and any association with the Rebellion would be punished severely. Are you sure you want to sign up?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 242, 's_a742819b', 'I''ve got most of the critical assignments covered right now, but I do have some elective duty missions if you are interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 243, 's_a79075ab', 'Report on the status of your operation against the pirate leader, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 244, 's_a7f76b6d', 'We''ll see about that.  If you want to enlist then speak to an Imperial Recruiter.  He will put your name on the roster.  I''m certain the Empire can put you to as good use on the ground, as it does in space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 245, 's_a8c82b1c', 'Sir, yes sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 246, 's_a91015df', 'You certainly think highly of yourself. Too highly. Until you prove otherwise, you are at the lowest rung on the ladder. Tools do not select how they are used.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 247, 's_a934fd0c', 'Go ahead then, try again. The destruction of the pirates benefits the Empire''s business in this region. Report back to me when your task is complete.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 248, 's_aaa6ec13', '(Salute) Sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 249, 's_aaac7e85', 'I don''t expect you will need to shoot at anything. Let me be particularly clear: this is a patrol. Keep your guns cold unless you are fired upon first.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 250, 's_abffcfd7', 'Pirate activity is still high enough that we need combat capable pilots on active duty locating and eliminating them. You have free reign to use lethal force against any commerce raiders you locate around Tatooine. The Empire will pay a bounty on every one you destroy. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 251, 's_aceff31e', 'Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 252, 's_adf9eee2', 'Report to me when you''ve completed your mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 253, 's_ae6ab110', 'Glad I could bring a little spice to your life.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 254, 's_b0b9044d', 'So it would seem. Naval Command would like to test your abilities further. We want to crush the pirates and demonstrate that Imperial resolve remains strong. I want you to get into space and destroy any Commerce Raiders you find. Your mission is to eliminate four of the pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 255, 's_b1f99085', 'This information will please the Naval Command. You have done an impressive job, Pilot. Perhaps you really are all that you claim.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 256, 's_b2995db3', '(Growl at him.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 257, 's_b2b35c1f', 'Special, eh? Hope that means it pays more money.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 258, 's_b3408be1', 'Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 259, 's_b36213b9', 'It never changes with you does it. Here''s your payment as well as a bonus for saving the transport. I also received your Imperial flight suit, but I''m not going to give it to you... you''d be an embarrassment to the Empire.  Just take this bandolier.  At least you can keep your things organized, for a change.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 260, 's_b3753189', 'I was able to eliminate all of the pirates who attacked, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 261, 's_b3e4cc19', 'Ahem. You appear to be capable of things the average conscript is not. Report to me when you are ready for further duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 262, 's_b5d0e16a', 'This information will please the Naval Command. No doubt they will also realize that part of your success came from my masterful instruction. I think you may have done us both a great service.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 263, 's_b737f77e', 'I have other things to attend to, good day.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 264, 's_b7c14c03', 'Good morning. My name is Lieutenant Akal Colzet, Imperial Navy. I''ve been assigned to Tatooine to recruit local volunteer pilots into service. Are you interested in learning about the Imperial Navy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 265, 's_b8ca7ab0', 'As long as you keep paying, I''ll keep delivering.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 266, 's_b8f011dc', 'Here is your salary for the mission. This one was worth double the normal rate. I''ve also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet, specifically calibrated for your mental and physical flight profile. Wear this whenever you are on duty as a symbol of the Empire''s technological and military might.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 267, 's_b9173bca', 'I''ve already received word of your success against Commerce Raiders in the region. It seems the Empire was not at error to place its trust in you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 268, 's_b9b88c88', 'I see success in your future, Initiate. You appear to be capable of things the average conscript is not. Report to me when you are ready for further duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 269, 's_bb4e17d0', 'No doubt you did, as would be expected from any Imperial pilot. Here is your salary as well as a little extra. The Emperor rewards dutiful service. I''ve taken liberty of submitting your physical profile to the Commissions Office. Your spec TIE flight suit will be ready soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 270, 's_bb6caa54', 'You can learn about Imperial technology, weapons, standard Imperial training, or astromech management.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 271, 's_bc1c993d', 'I am. I would be honored to hunt the enemies of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 272, 's_bc6327c0', 'I don''t like working with bounty hunters like you. For a soldier, killing is a necessary evil. You seem to get some kind of thrill from it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 273, 's_bc695163', 'I can clear you for a new TIE Fighter, but only the basic model. Are you sure you want a new control device?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 274, 's_bc7382d4', '''We are but a tool to achieve that end.'' I, too, know the text of the Imperial Doctrine. It''s an element of core officer training. Although many members of the Imperial Navy are adherents to the doctrine, we are ultimately a military organization. Politics and theology are the realm of the bureaucrats.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 275, 's_bf64734d', 'I don''t want to learn anything right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 276, 's_c01da9e4', '(Sneer at him.) Just pay me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 277, 's_c08929f2', 'Consider them dead, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 278, 's_c0c8fe59', 'One day the Emperor himself will recognize my strength.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 279, 's_c0ce49d6', '(Grunt in affirmation.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 280, 's_c124ad4f', 'Sir, I can fly. It would be an honor to fly with the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 281, 's_c16743ff', 'Service Pilot Initiate stand at attention!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 282, 's_c19ed115', 'You''ve got your assignment, and the control device for your ship in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 283, 's_c2ef0b45', 'Pilot. You''ve managed to achieve some level of success, but you are still relatively inexperienced. I have been authorized to give you special instruction in an area of your choosing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 284, 's_c3e56b53', 'Perhaps.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 285, 's_c48451bf', 'I don''t expect you will run into trouble, as many ships safely move through the region every day, but be on guard. If you do encounter something amiss, you have permission to respond as you see fit. This operational autonomy is contingent upon your continued success.  Screw up and you''ll be kept on a short leash.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 286, 's_c6aae4cb', 'Cranial proportions?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 287, 's_c6d9f61', 'I''d like to study that in detail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 288, 's_c9d11db3', 'You might come to regret it. I''ve convinced the Naval Command to test your abilities further. We want to crush the pirates and demonstrate that Imperial resolve remains strong. I want you to get into space and destroy any Commerce Raiders you find. Your mission is to eliminate four of the pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 289, 's_ca3578cc', 'I think it suits you. You have exceeded the expectations of this program and of myself. Your duty has not ended, however. Return when you are ready to take on another operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 290, 's_cb99174', 'I have to study what went wrong.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 291, 's_cbfb3200', 'Only the will of the Emperor delivers true justice...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 292, 's_cd024d84', 'It looks intimidating. I like it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 293, 's_cdbce743', 'I want to enlist in the ground forces.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 294, 's_ce681825', 'You should have realized this long ago.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 295, 's_d07b11b5', '(Glower at him, disapprovingly.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 296, 's_d09c1ecb', 'Just doing my duty, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 297, 's_d25495b9', 'Pilot, I am singularly impressed. You have mastered the fundamentals of your profession and have performed beyond expectation and all without formal Imperial Naval Flight & Command training. I think it''s time for a promotion.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 298, 's_d25c510b', 'Duty missions are open ended assignments. They end when you choose to end them. For example, if I assign you the task of hunting pirates, you can hunt as many pirates as you want. You can end the duty any time from the mission entry in your datapad. Perform duties to earn pay and build experience. Once you''ve received enough experience, I can instruct you on various aspects of the pilot''s combat role.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 299, 's_d422a73d', 'Your attitude is poor and I can tell by your dress that you are nothing more than petty scum. I don''t like you, but then I suppose that I don''t have to like you. I need to hire volunteers for limited military service. If you really can fly and shoot, we might have something for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 300, 's_d4dd5a28', 'There was a...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 301, 's_d51ef84a', '(Give a mocking salute.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 302, 's_d7816410', 'Look, I''ve got people to pay. Do you have work for me or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 303, 's_d788f447', 'Pirates? Tatooine is known for criminal activity, but Bestine has always been strongly protected by Imperial justice. The recent Rebel insurgency must be giving the pirates a new spirit of confidence.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 304, 's_d825aeb0', 'Very well, good day Pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 305, 's_d8487693', 'Pilot. I don''t have any specific work for you at this time. You can now select your preferred operation from a list of general duties. Or, if you have enough experience, pursue training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 306, 's_d8a302bc', 'All who oppose me are destined to fail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 307, 's_d90e49c9', 'Ah, yes, well, the Imperial Navy is the finest fleet in the galaxy. We command the Empire''s starships and fighters. We are the hammer of Imperial justice. All members of the Imperial Navy are officers, however we are now starting to recruit non-officer pilots for limited support duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 308, 's_d92fcf8d', '(Relate how you purged several Imperial enemies.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 309, 's_d9d4feec', 'Will you train me, now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 310, 's_da07fb7a', 'I would prefer a posting to Special Operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 311, 's_dae6651c', 'Pirates?  Tatooine is known for criminal activity, but Bestine has always been strongly protected by Imperial justice.  The recent Rebel insurgency must be giving the pirates a new spirit of confidence.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 312, 's_dc63dc1a', 'Never mind, I don''t want any training after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 313, 's_dd40f86b', 'As do we all. Now that you have achieved an official command rank, I am no longer your commanding officer. Although it pains me to lose such a fine pilot, you have been reassigned pending approval of transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 314, 's_de76730a', 'Where is my new assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 315, 's_df69a100', 'If you don''t get yourself killed first. Now that you have achieved an official command rank, I am no longer your commanding officer. You have been reassigned. Commander Oberhaur of the ISD Accuser will handle your assignments from this point on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 316, 's_df76b2e8', 'Imperial astromech functionality is typically built into a rugged navicomputer, rather than those annoying sorts of astromech units that the Rebel Alliance relies on.  I can teach you how to utilize some of the basic functionality of the droid interface to normalize your shields, overload your weapons, and that sort of thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 317, 's_dfd0987b', 'You don''t take complements very well. This one was worth double the normal rate. I''ve also received your Imperial TIE pilot helmet, specifically calibrated for your mental and physical flight profile.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 318, 's_e106780b', 'Good to see you, Pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 319, 's_e12b6418', 'I located and destroyed him, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 320, 's_e1da893f', 'I''m fairly busy, so I''ll have to talk to you later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 321, 's_e4e336cc', 'Report to me upon completion of the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 322, 's_e4e8b551', 'There seems to be no end to these petty duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 323, 's_e814cf37', 'I would like a duty mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 324, 's_e87a40f8', 'I''d rather not right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 325, 's_e92da88', 'Sure, sign me up. I like making you squirm.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 326, 's_e95fb13d', 'If you perform capably, we will consider you for more dangerous assignments. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 327, 's_ea5b6641', 'I have to admit that you have the makings of a true Imperial officer about you. Report back to me when you are ready for your next mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 328, 's_eb1ee299', 'Why don''t you run missions for the ground-pounders until you''ve got better faction standing?  Until then, don''t talk to me.  You brought this on yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 329, 's_ee63dfa9', 'Report back to me when you would like a new duty or mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 330, 's_ee657693', 'Service in the Imperial Navy isn''t something to be taken lightly. Your training will be strict, you''ll be expected to follow orders, and of course, any association with the Rebellion would be punished severely. Are you sure you want to sign up?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 331, 's_ee91723f', '(Relate the facts on the commerce raider attack.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 332, 's_eee17bb3', 'I seek to serve the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 333, 's_f1471b6a', 'As well you should not. You will be given assignments that, while small, are still critical to Imperial interests in the Outer Rim. The consequences of failure would be significant.  So, as you say, you will not fail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 334, 's_f195b141', 'Yes, I know'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 335, 's_f3852d77', 'They have underestimated my ability.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 336, 's_f43f3569', 'I''m ready for training'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 337, 's_f4d10868', 'Report to me when you have completed your mission to claim your bounty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 338, 's_f4fa11bb', 'Hmm. Nope, don''t know the guy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 339, 's_f7913cae', 'At ease, Pilot. The security situation in the Bestine Orbital Region has clearly deteriorated. Pirate attacks on commerce lanes and supply transports cannot be tolerated. You have shown commendable initiative in responding to pirate aggression, so you have been selected for a special mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 340, 's_f91b288f', 'Very well. I''ll fly it again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 341, 's_fa0ab23c', 'By the powers vested in me by the Imperial Naval Command, under the ever watchful eye of the Emperor, I hereby commend you and bestow upon you the rank of Pilot Officer. Congratulations, Pilot Officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 342, 's_fcb1448e', 'I hope you reconsider. You have the right kind of attitude and character. If you decide you''d like to fly for us, you know where to find me. Good day, citizen.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 343, 's_fcf4d778', 'How?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 344, 's_fd4fe208', 'That is your choice, but you may not get this chance again.  I suggest that you take it while you can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 345, 's_fd8bce2a', 'A mission, pilot? Don''t overstep your station. You''re a voluntary conscript, not a combat pilot. If you''re lucky, the Empire might one day see fit to post you to combat duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 346, 's_fdbe01c2', 'Report in with me when you''ve completed the operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_1.stf', 347, 's_ffd5b6f7', 'Hmm. You may have what it takes to be a combat pilot. On the other hand, you might have just gotten lucky. Either way, you fulfilled your duty. Here is your payment and an additional sum to compensate for hazards encountered.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 3, 's_1524504', 'Second, Nym has established a significant trade in contraband and weapons technology. We believe this is his primary method of income. Fortunately, the majority of Nym''s smuggler captains are only dubiously loyal. We believe that these criminals can be convinced to abandon Nym''s cause with the application of modest force.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 4, 's_15b68f56', 'Return to me with any information you find. It is critical that you move quickly on this. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 5, 's_16cbd029', 'Excellent. Carry on, Pilot. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 6, 's_183bb6da', 'Sign the form and then talk to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 7, 's_1940763a', 'Are you sure they''ll be able to capture the ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 8, 's_198d54a6', 'It should keep Nym busy for a while.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 9, 's_1d4a07d0', 'Where can I find such a vendor?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 10, 's_1e3ab8f3', 'You need to report to Field Commander Alozen at the Imperial outpost on Yavin 4. He will be handling your assignments for the time being.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 11, 's_203532fd', 'Exactly. Initial reports indicated that Nym was merely an outsystem pirate. Clearly those reports were incorrect. His operation has grown beyond a simple pirate outpost and he now poses a possible military threat should he enter the war on the side of the insurgency. We want to destroy his resource base and devastate his space power.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 12, 's_21772e5a', 'I''m sorry, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 13, 's_22461041', 'The information you retrieved from the pirate officer has been decrypted. It''s a transport and transfer schedule for the hostages. Nym apparently doesn''t want them located in his main stronghold. He''s having them moved to a secret location and he''s moving them today.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 14, 's_22a1fc52', 'Perhaps Imperial Intelligence can crack it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 15, 's_2358dc3e', 'I don''t have time to explain this all to you, pilot! Double-check what skills you have. Make sure that you are certified to fly the ship you plan to buy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 16, 's_237eaf5c', 'Check your planetary map, or just ask around to find a Shipwright vendor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 17, 's_23ca92a1', 'Report on the status of the hostage rescue operation, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 18, 's_263bc84b', 'Ah, this is interesting. Looks like a manifest detailing the transport of the hostages. Part of it is encoded, but it doesn''t look like a very strong form of encryption.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 19, 's_28a8e342', 'Imperial Intelligence has supplied us with several convoy freighters disguised to emit weapon and equipment signatures. That should attract the interest of Nym''s pirate gangs. Fly escort and eliminate the pirates as they show up.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 20, 's_29d0a2db', 'I''ve run into some trouble so far.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 21, 's_2c4789b', 'Understood.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 22, 's_2f3095bd', 'Be on your guard. Nym may decide to dispatch his ace pilots once you''re detected.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 23, 's_2f84158b', 'How can I do that?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 24, 's_311f2b4', 'Flying Officer %NU, I have the highest level of respect for you, but I want to see more results in the operation against Nym before I authorize you for advanced training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 25, 's_31804e15', 'Understanding how to rapidly and efficiently manage the complex systems on board a fighter is a necessary step in your development as a pilot. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 26, 's_3321cb2d', 'Imperial Intelligence has identified several key elements of Nym''s power base. I have a briefing prepared. Or if you''ve already examined the briefing material, you can select a type of operation to begin.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 27, 's_350d8ffa', 'Our remaining agent within Nym''s stronghold has succeeded in avoiding detection. His latest report indicates that Nym is frustrated by our progress and has ordered several of his captains to plan a heavy armed response.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 28, 's_355e31ff', 'You may think you''re ready, but I don''t believe you really are. You need to prove you are capable of meeting my standards before I''ll let you into the Storm Squadron. Just being considered is a grand honor and will look good on your record. If you can stay alive and perform to standard, you will be one of the few and great.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 29, 's_36fb7ae1', 'Who is Nym?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 30, 's_3821ef35', 'Uh, whoops?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 31, 's_392923da', 'Not a problem. It''s always a pleasure to talk to a fellow serviceman. If you''re interested in working with the Navy you might talk to Lt. Colzet in Bestine or Lt. Sinkko in Kadaara. Both are good men.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 32, 's_3cfac67e', 'The agent indicated that the rest of the operation, five men total, had indeed been compromised and taken captive by pirate gunmen loyal to Nym.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 33, 's_3ed9f29c', 'No, seriously!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 34, 's_3f799832', 'Pilot, you''re supposed to be on your ship! Get up there and intercept the hostage transport immediately!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 35, 's_401fdcbd', 'How do I get to Lok?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 36, 's_435dd8f2', 'Nym''s officers may try to recover the transports, so be on your guard.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 37, 's_43862ef7', 'Of course not, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 38, 's_44d66989', 'You''ve shown considerable improvement in ability since joining the Squadron. It''s time to allow you access to the next level of training and technology. I remind you that anything you learn is highly confidential, security rating Gamma Three. You may not share your knowledge with fellow officers of any rank at or below your own. What area would you like to train in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 39, 's_451c0d14', 'So you want to join Storm Squadron? It won''t be easy. We take tough jobs and we expect results. Unquestioned loyalty and a steel will are merely the most basic of prerequisites to being a member of Storm Squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 40, 's_45f4f7db', 'I''d like to engage Nym''s combat fleet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 41, 's_45fa29cc', '(Grin and listen.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 42, 's_46185cf9', 'The Imperial Intelligence organization has, for several years, conducted a small operation in the Lok system. The target of the operation is a pirate warlord named Nym. Lok holds little to no strategic value for the Empire, so only limited resources have been invested in the operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 43, 's_466882ff', 'Tell you what. How about I just go out and buy everything for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 44, 's_46b74bbf', 'We''ve had reports of pro-Rebel, anti-Imperial activity from you.  Obviously, you can''t be trusted.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 45, 's_46d97b9f', 'For the time being, continue to harass Nym''s forces. Naval Operations will deliver new orders when they want us to withdraw. So far this has been a high impact operation with little drain on resources. They will probably want to draw it out a bit longer before moving us to a new theater.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 46, 's_4838444a', 'Outstanding.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 47, 's_4854758d', 'I would like to request a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 48, 's_48636f93', 'Pilot Officer %NU, it''s time that you were elevated to full operational status within the Squadron. You are hereby granted the rank of Flying Officer. Congratulations Flying Officer %NU. You are now a full member of the Storm Squadron. Fly with honor and fight with the Emperor''s own fury.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 49, 's_486da900', 'Your continued success will rely on your ability to make maximum use of all new Imperial technology. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 50, 's_49d848b8', 'She is located at the Imperial compound on Talus. She''s a core worlds kind of woman. Cloak and daggers, venom and roses.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 51, 's_49f3270b', 'Report back to me when you''re ready for an assignment.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 52, 's_4afba144', 'First, we need to determine the status and location of the hostages. If the hostages are dead, we need to launch a hostile response. If the hostages are alive, we need to find and recover them. Your orders are to dispatch to the Lok system immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 53, 's_4d13db1b', 'We aren''t entirely sure. It''s out of character for him to murder needlessly. He''s scum, but he''s also smart enough to avoid Imperial scrutiny. The fact that he hasn''t released the spies tells me that he''s probably going to hand them over to the Rebellion. High Command probably considers that worse than if he just killed them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 54, 's_4d6d2800', 'As of this time, Nym has not delivered demands. It is unclear if the hostages are still alive. Imperial Intelligence and Naval Command have decided that the situation must be resolved before it spirals into a major incident. Storm Squadron has been assigned with the cleanup.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 55, 's_5102164f', '(Nod and listen.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 56, 's_55b3e68b', 'Someone I''ve worked with in the past. A Zabrak with the trust of some very important, very dangerous people. If you work with her, watch your back. She''s as likely to pay you with a blaster bolt as she is with credits.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 57, 's_58c1df5a', 'I don''t have an Authorization of Transfer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 58, 's_594a07fa', 'I want to study advanced TIE combat operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 59, 's_5b4ccb84', 'You have operational discretion to choose an assignment from the areas outlined by Imperial Intelligence in your briefing. I can also instruct you in the use of new technology if you think you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 60, 's_5c1a4059', 'Go grab yourself a quick bite to eat and then report back. We''ll have these logs cracked in a nanosec.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 61, 's_5c222b7', 'We have a tactical intelligence and telemetry probe inside the Lok System. Go to Lok and download enemy position information from the probe. Use that information to hunt Nym''s fighter wings. Any damage you inflict will make it harder for Nym to carry out military operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 62, 's_5d988999', 'That would be nice. Thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 63, 's_5ea454fa', 'Here''s the flight plan of the transport. Expect it to be under guard. The operatives on board are valuable: we want them alive. Your mission is to disable the transport. Fire on the engines or the reactor. Either one should be enough to give our boys a chance to take over the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 64, 's_5f703249', 'Increasing insurgent activity in the Yavin system has drawn the interest of High Command. Since the destruction of the Death Star, the Imperial Engineering Corps have carried out an ongoing scrap recovery operation. Command suspects the Rebels may be conducting their own salvage operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 65, 's_5fdd804', 'While Lok has no overt value, there have been indications that the Rebellion may be working with the pirate Nym to undermine Imperial interests. Imperial Intelligence set up their infiltration operation to probe the pirate connections to the Rebellion and, if connections were found, sever them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 66, 's_6047677', 'I''m ready, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 67, 's_60c9f5e1', 'I know just the man for the job. Good work, pilot. Here is a consignment fee for completing the job. Stay close, though. Once this data is cracked we will need to move quickly to secure the hostages.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 68, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 69, 's_61e8cd5e', 'Greetings, pilot. I don''t see you on the Storm Squadron roster. Why have you come here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 70, 's_6598178f', 'Interesting.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 71, 's_6927e4a9', 'SS Command has authorized a duty pay increase for your exceptional performance and new rank. Since you are now a Flying Officer, you may select your own assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 72, 's_6a67413c', 'What''s the ISD Accuser?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 73, 's_6abf6436', 'What''s the assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 74, 's_6ae72fac', 'What is the Storm Squadron?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 75, 's_6c1a8ce', 'The war has taken a significant toll... even considering the strength our great Galactic Empire. These more modern TIE designs are only available on the free market through third party engineers.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 76, 's_6f520748', 'Morv is disguised as one of Nym''s fuel technicians. He is undercover so he will not be using his real name, you will have to find him. You can identify yourself to him with the codephrase ''I''m here to clean the antimatter condenser.'' Be discrete. We don''t usually send pilots to interact with intelligence officers, but in this case you may be best equipped to handle whatever Nym has planned.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 77, 's_706c2e4c', 'Have you managed to track down information on the hostages, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 78, 's_70a7d20e', 'Good to see you, Flying Officer %NU. You''ve been making significant headway into reducing Nym''s influence in the Lok system, so High Command has selected you for a special operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 79, 's_712ea0b5', 'What will Nym do to the hostages?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 80, 's_721e2818', 'I''d like to trap a few pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 81, 's_72d41043', 'I am prepared.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 82, 's_746fbd0c', 'I''ll do what I can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 83, 's_773fa657', 'No, that would not be nice! Check your planetary map, or just ask around to find a Shipwright vendor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 84, 's_78af2fb0', 'Indeed. Nym will have to find replacements and rebuild his command. I''m transferring a pay reward to your account. I will also inform High Command of the status of our operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 85, 's_7936c7db', 'Lok is remote and Nym''s pirates travel openly. Locate one of his Lieutenants. Disable the pirate''s ship and search it for information on the whereabouts of the hostages. You may then eliminate the pirate. We are uncertain of these officer''s location but a good bet is you can find them around the Lok station after they have taken off from the planet surface on their way to hyperspace.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 86, 's_7970189a', 'I don''t know, %NU.  But if I were you, I''d be trying to figure out SOME way of doing it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 87, 's_7a3165e7', 'Hold on, there, %TU.  I''ve got strict orders about you.  You''re GROUNDED!  Finished!  You won''t be flying for the Empire ever again!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 88, 's_7a761694', '(Continue to listen.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 89, 's_7b25fbc3', 'You''re cleared for training, so let me know when you are ready to begin.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 90, 's_7d4535c0', 'Nym has smuggler fleets moving through Lok on a regular basis. Since he controls most of the system, he doesn''t worry about stealth. Intercept the fleets, destroy the escorts, and disable the smuggler transports. That should be enough show of force to convince the smuggler captains to surrender. Once you''ve secured the transports, escort them to interrogation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 91, 's_7e66b604', 'Go take it easy for now and report back to me when you are ready to begin. I''ve received new orders from Command and I need someone like you for the operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 92, 's_7f95f0a5', 'Get suited up, you''re being scrambled immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 93, 's_802f576d', 'Well, your history is very impressive. You have participated in several missions that required accuracy and skill. Why, then, did you sign this form with someone else''s name? The Naval Command wants to give you an opportunity, but you are putting it at risk by playing games. Sign the form correctly and then we''ll talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 94, 's_8065ca4e', 'This form looks correct. Pilot you have an impressive history. In a short period of time you''ve managed to rise above your station and perform at a level much higher than expected.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 95, 's_81198b45', 'Why is that?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 96, 's_82669139', 'Glad to meet you. I''m Commander Oberhaur, of Storm Squadron. Several members of the squadron are currently bunking here Bestine on shore leave. We operate from the ISD Accuser, in Tatooine Orbit. Being shut up in a Star Destroyer for weeks is bad for the men''s morale, so we''re down here for leave.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 97, 's_84a82bee', 'Then I can''t help you. This stuff has to be done by the books and unless you can prove your flight combat record, I can''t deal with you in an official capacity.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 98, 's_8739f4b1', 'I''m glad we''re on the same page. Since you have complete operational discretion, it will be up to you to decide how to attack Nym''s power base. Other Storm Squadron operatives will be carrying out similar assignments. Nym will soon regret casting his lot in with the insurgents.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 99, 's_88311d58', 'For the time being, Storm Squadron has been assigned to continue operations in the Lok system. High Command has decided that Nym has grown far too prominent and he represents a potential threat that must be checked.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 100, 's_883a28d9', 'Pilot, it is time for you to learn some new skills. It is important that you keep sharp and keep your skills at the top of their game in order to succeed as an Imperial pilot. Are you ready?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 101, 's_884a3faf', 'Outstanding. Now begone.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 102, 's_88796240', 'Thanks for the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 103, 's_89bc583c', 'Very well, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 104, 's_8bd72bb5', 'Mastering proper use of heavy weapons technology is key. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 105, 's_8d17fc6e', 'How do I travel to another system?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 106, 's_8ebfa37e', 'Nym is a Feeorin. The self proclaimed ''Lord'' of the Lok system. He''s a pirate and absolute scum. Many years ago, Nym was a war hero, when the Trade Federation attempted to capture Naboo. He seems to have forgotten what it means to be a hero and now he simply preys on the spacelanes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 107, 's_8efde2ae', 'Yes, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 108, 's_91223b5c', 'I''m ready to begin immediately, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 109, 's_9288900f', 'I understand.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 110, 's_92b2297b', 'Hrmph.  In that case, if I were you, I''d be trying to do SOMETHING to prove to the Empire that you are 100% behind us in this war, and not some sort of Rebel sympathizer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 111, 's_93a06155', 'I hope you''ve studied those information programs I gave you. You''ll need your new training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 112, 's_94999d7b', 'What is the next step?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 113, 's_94a3f917', 'Incredible work, pilot. You''ve managed to eliminate several of Nym''s key commanders with a single decisive strike. I''m impressed by your initiative in this matter.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 114, 's_986aeb7b', 'Once the agents capture the ship, protect her while she calculates a hyperspace jump. The Lok region isn''t well known, so it may take some time. Nym may try to recapture the ship or just take you both out. That cannot happen.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 115, 's_987445c9', 'Thank you, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 116, 's_99306072', 'Get back out there. You need to find one of the Nym''s Lieutenants. He''ll have probably entrusted them with information regarding the status of the hostages. Disable the pirate scum and inspect his ship for information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 117, 's_9940eb95', 'Return to me once you''ve freed the hostages and delivered them to safety. Your window to pull off this operation is limited, so get your jax in gear soldier! Dismissed!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 118, 's_9b9f672f', 'Pilot you have quite a history. Seems you''ve come through for us several times in the past. With that in mind...why is it you failed to follow simple instructions and sign this form? Until you confirm things with a digital signature, we can''t move forward with your new assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 119, 's_9c0c10ef', 'Report back to me when you are ready for a new assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 120, 's_9d8051f1', 'High Command has decided that Nym''s operations have been sufficiently neutralized. Any aid he renders the Rebellion from this point will be inconsequential to the outcome of the overall conflict. You are commended for your contribution to the Lok operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 121, 's_9f814876', 'Report what you''ve found regarding Nym''s plans.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 122, 's_a30c1a53', 'Yes sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 123, 's_a329a20', 'While the smuggler trade is a primary source of income for Nym, he relies on piracy to make up the balance. You could fly as an ''escort'' for some Imperial transports in the Lok system to bait and trap Nym''s pirates. There''s no need to capture them alive for interrogation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 124, 's_a4faf714', 'I am ready for some training, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 125, 's_a59c7bd7', 'It looks like you''re busy with an assignment already. Come talk to me when you''re done.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 126, 's_a6363375', 'I''d like to pressure Nym''s smuggler fleet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 127, 's_a784219e', 'Only your commanding officer can assign you missions, pilot. Go back to your own unit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 128, 's_a787fa2e', '(Stand at attention.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 129, 's_a78a4ac3', 'What do I do now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 130, 's_ac71da57', 'I''m ready to take an assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 131, 's_aceff31e', 'Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 132, 's_ad7e53a9', 'Firstly, you will need a vessel capable of hyperspace travel. Unfortunately the Empire does not issue TIE craft equipped with the engine upgrades and hyperdrive abilities you will need.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 133, 's_ad8385f7', 'I am being serious.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 134, 's_ae061ee', 'I was able to recover all of our agents, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 135, 's_ae06e68f', 'But I want to fly for the Imperial Navy!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 136, 's_ae26c22', 'Let me think about this for a bit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 137, 's_afce570', 'He has extensive resources, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 138, 's_b0d3b474', 'I''m ready for training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 139, 's_b1097134', 'The freighters aren''t carrying anything valuable, but we don''t want the pilots to die needlessly. Make sure you keep them alive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 140, 's_b2a924ab', 'I''d like a briefing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 141, 's_b2ef8844', 'Uh, sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 142, 's_b56905cc', 'Naval Command wants us to continue to harass Nym''s forces. Their assessment of the situation is positive, but they feel that inflicting further damage is necessary. They want to avoid any possibility of having to bring a large force to bear against Nym should he decide to openly declare support for the insurgents.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 143, 's_b6b25f13', 'Yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 144, 's_b9024ec3', 'Storm Squadron is an elite special operations team within the Imperial Navy. Our jurisdiction extends to many worlds throughout the Outer Rim and we have a complement of fighters, transports, and equipment we maintain ourselves. Life in the Storm Squadron can be hard, some missions require operating with limited or no support behind enemy lines. Our pilots work hard and earn their pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 145, 's_bc375f79', 'Got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 146, 's_c13418d8', 'We''ve been reassigned to the Yavin system. Yavin has been plagued with insurgent activity ever since the destruction of the Death Star. This is the front line of the civil war and our assignments in the region will be dangerous.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 147, 's_c14f8951', 'How do I know what I can handle?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 148, 's_c4880407', 'Developing new levels of tactical and physical excellence will be critical in realizing your true potential. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 149, 's_c64c7c75', 'I will do that immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 150, 's_c6b6729b', 'Well, if it were up to me, you''d be shot, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 151, 's_c76594d7', 'I want to study advanced reactor engineering algorithms.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 152, 's_c81a4272', 'Where can I find one?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 153, 's_ca6a5e04', 'Alozen is a ground pounder and may show you a little disrespect. Ignore it and behave professionally. I know you''ll do the right thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 154, 's_cacf4333', 'As I said, there are several areas of Nym''s power that need to be neutralized. First, the relative isolation of the Lok System has allowed Nym to build a significant rogue fleet. While the size of this fleet pales in comparison to that of the Empire, the potential for its use in rapid strike or terrorist operations cannot be ignored. It must be eliminated.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 155, 's_cf8e92fc', 'Positive. We suspect the only reason they don''t try to escape now is Nym''s armed escort. You need to take out the escort to give the operatives a shot at survival.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 156, 's_d1be90a9', 'What''s the plan?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 157, 's_d424ba86', 'We aren''t sure and we need to find out. Contact with the agent has been limited. I need you to go to Nym''s stronghold on Lok and find the agent. His name is Trizan Morv, but he is undercover as one of Nym''s Fuel Technicians. See if you can find out from Morv what Nym has planned. If you get the opportunity, stop those plans.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 158, 's_d4648675', 'Return to me when you have information. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 159, 's_d55f2579', 'I''m ready to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 160, 's_d7001705', 'What about in an unofficial capacity?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 161, 's_d96f60fb', 'Who is Hakasha Sireen?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 162, 's_dacc15a0', 'The Accuser is an Imperator class Star Destroyer currently on assignment here in the Tatooine system. She has a storied history and a long service record. Storm Squadron has served aboard the Accuser for as long as I can remember. The Accuser is on duty out here on the Rim to show the flag...a warning against Rebel activity.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 163, 's_dbb5bf46', 'I want to study advanced weapons technology.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 164, 's_dcf3ae18', 'Then I will acquire a new ship, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 165, 's_de381f95', 'I have, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 166, 's_df611704', 'I cannot assign you a mission, but I do have a number of elective duty assignments. If you like, I can give you a briefing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 167, 's_e06d735b', 'You are? Let me see your Authorization of Transfer. Make sure it''s filled out and signed. They''ll have my jax if I send along an incomplete form.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 168, 's_e0d37cc2', 'I''ve seen one of your ships in the hangar. It looks capable of hyperspace travel. After you launch, just open your Hyperspace Map and select the system to which you want to travel. Pretty simple, no?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 169, 's_e27dc0f8', 'Outstanding work. You''ve managed to defuse what could have become a major incident. I''m impressed, HQ is impressed, and most of all the rest of Storm Squadron is impressed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 170, 's_e3d28c95', '(Give him your Authorization of Transfer.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 171, 's_e44ffcd2', '[Relate the destruction of the Kimogila''s Claw.]'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 172, 's_e73e5d21', 'I want to study pilot combat training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 173, 's_e8e1f35f', 'I''m here to apply to Storm Squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 174, 's_eac44789', 'Applicant, I hope you are well rested because today you begin working with Storm Squadron. Stand at attention for briefing!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 175, 's_ed3a1afc', 'I operate strictly on the record. Storm Squadron has a noble history within the service and we aren''t about to tarnish it. Talk to Hakasha Sireen on Talus if you want something under the table.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 176, 's_ed65d4cb', 'You''ll be doing some leg work on this mission. I want you to go to the Imperial outpost on Yavin 4. Report to Field Commander Alozen, of the Imperial Army, for a situation report. He''s requested the assistance of the fleet. Storm Squadron has been assigned to see to his needs.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 177, 's_eda80412', 'At 09:50 this morning, the primary ground agent in the Lok operation failed to contact his handler and deliver a status report. Imperial Intelligence immediately reported the failure, suspecting the agent had been compromised. At 11:32, shortly following that report, an as of yet uncompromised agent contacted the handler.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 178, 's_edeedb42', 'How will I recognize Morv?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 179, 's_f1f7e3da', '(Listen intently.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 180, 's_f3ce4b22', 'Why?  What did I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 181, 's_f432c46f', '(Transfer the information to Oberhaur.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 182, 's_f542dcb0', 'Most lawful Shipwrights will put ship chassis up for sale on vendors in local shops. So, locate a vendor or contact a Shipwright, find a TIE fighter that you''re capable of handling, and purchase a suite of upgrades... including a modern engine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 183, 's_f7876bb3', 'Nym may be planning on ransoming the officers or he may decide to hand them over to the insurgents. Imperial Intel thinks the latter is more likely. What better way to win favor with his fellow criminals. We need to recover our agents before they are moved to an unknown location.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 184, 's_f91e446d', 'What have you learned so far, %NU?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 185, 's_fb57ae40', 'Come back with the form and we can get things moving.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 186, 's_fb7f6474', 'What kind of response?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 187, 's_fced7bf', 'Once you have launched, simply activate your Hyperspace map and select the system to which you would like to travel.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 188, 's_fe63bc1a', 'My thoughts exactly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 189, 's_fea3d7f3', 'You can find our agent, Morv, at Nym''s stronghold on Lok. He''ll be disguised as a fuel technician. Use the codephrase *I''m here to clean the antimatter condenser.* He is probably not using his real name so you will have to find him. Report to me when you have his information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2.stf', 190, 's_ffaac8c1', 'Where can I find her?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 3, 's_10c85b25', 'Good for me you don''t have things your way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 4, 's_10ee338d', 'Do you have something wrong with your hearing, pilot? You are working for Captain Denner now. Report to him here in the Outpost on the double!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 5, 's_128d62a', 'I''m very busy coordinating the ground effort here at the base. I''ll have to talk to you later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 6, 's_12d564a4', 'It''s priority clearance Bravo Zeta. Way above my head. All I''ve been told is that the Storm Squadron was being assigned to deal with the situation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 7, 's_16de6424', 'You want me to capture a gunboat?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 8, 's_17ce8fe5', 'It''s nearly impossible to patrol the entire debris field, so some pirates go undetected. Any pirate salvage convoys you manage to capture would be an added bonus to our own operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 9, 's_18478398', 'Although the Imperial Navy usually handles space operations, the Imperial Engineering Corps is in charge of materials recovery. We''ve been slowly salvaging large portions of the Death Star to be recycled into new projects.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 10, 's_19717825', 'Since the destruction of the Death Star, the Empire has maintained a heavy presence in Yavin. The Death Star was not completely disintegrated in the core explosion and the remaining debris still contains valuable raw materials and technology.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 11, 's_1a4113b', 'I''ve already received the report! You lost the scanning team. Unbelievable. Do you know how much it costs to manufacture and deploy a scanning freighter? I thought the Storm Squadron could handle this, but clearly I was misinformed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 12, 's_1af04177', 'I am not privy to that information. Perhaps Captain Denner can fill you in more on your assignment. I am still required to continue with my salvage operation here and that is all I know or care about.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 13, 's_1d253370', 'I''m not convinced you''re ready for training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 14, 's_1da2b1f3', 'So the Twilight Sun is still in the Yavin system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 15, 's_1eb2fb7a', 'If you see a pilot from Storm Squadron tell him to come talk to me. Oberhaur promised he''d be here by now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 16, 's_1ff4247a', 'I will not fail.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 17, 's_20009dcb', 'That is what I said soldier. Don''t you fly boys ever pay any attention?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 18, 's_2172d08a', 'As much as I''d like to deny your request, I''ve seen nothing but good work from you over the past few operations. I have received permission from command to give you access to new training programs. This information is security rated Gamma Three and you may not share any information regarding your training level with another officer. What area would you like to train in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 19, 's_21772e5a', 'I''m sorry, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 20, 's_24fbbc08', 'I''ll keep searching.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 21, 's_2eaae5bc', 'Commander Oberhaur told me to contact you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 22, 's_2f3bf1d8', 'Captain Denner is stationed here in the outpost for the time being. He is organizing the transfer of Storm Squadron and salvage operatives to their new theater of operation. Jump to it soldier. Don''t keep your commanding officer waiting. Oh, by the way here is your duty pay for the Twilight Sun.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 23, 's_31804e15', 'Understanding how to rapidly and efficiently manage the complex systems on board a fighter is a necessary step in your development as a pilot. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 24, 's_34b41ecc', 'Those orders detailed that you are under my direct supervision for the duration of this operation. You will be prompt next time, is that clear?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 25, 's_38c83a93', 'I''ll see if I can help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 26, 's_395c2680', 'The scan team has finished processing the results of the system sweep. The scan has revealed a large concentration of Rebel ships in region M84/2. The scan details indicate the Rebels already have a Gunboat class in the region.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 27, 's_3c521b4d', 'Watch your mouth, pilot. I can still stick a reprimand on your file a shipload of boronic acid couldn''t clean off.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 28, 's_3cbda2cf', 'What are the new details?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 29, 's_3d7cbb44', 'You could hunt Rebel raiders, escort our salvage transports or capture some of the pirate salvage transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 30, 's_42e9d63a', 'Well if it isn''t another pilot for the Imperial Navy. What do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 31, 's_44522227', 'What sort of new project?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 32, 's_47f58b41', 'You think they found something?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 33, 's_4854758d', 'I would like to request a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 34, 's_486da900', 'Your continued success will rely on your ability to make maximum use of all new Imperial technology. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 35, 's_48a73eb9', 'Very likely. Region M84/2 is within the probability projection that Imperial Intelligence sent us. We still don''t know what we''ll find there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 36, 's_4b074298', 'Come back when you''re done with your mission. You can abort your mission if you want to start over.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 37, 's_4d81d507', 'I managed to find this activity log on a Rebel ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 38, 's_4e7a1e3a', 'We need to keep it that way. The last thing we need are other races attempting their own recovery operations. Yavin could become a warzone.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 39, 's_4fc85d67', 'What are you still doing standing here talking to me? Get to your ship and get me that core...NOW SOLDIER!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 40, 's_5365b13d', 'When do you expect the results?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 41, 's_53923b62', 'Yes sir! We certainly...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 42, 's_53b0407b', 'I am a member of Storm Squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 43, 's_54c421ec', 'Never mind. Disregard that. Regardless you are being transferred over to Captain Denner. Word is that all members of Storm Squadron are being transferred over to his command for a priority alpha assignment. It would appear that the Empire is preparing to transfer resources out of this system in order for some new project.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 44, 's_55289b72', 'Well, it''s the pilot from the Navy. Having fun in your auto cooled little cockpit? You know what its like to trudge around in the jungle wearing armor? The sun is killing me, today.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 45, 's_567022e6', 'You do that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 46, 's_57c8489e', 'What should I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 47, 's_591121d9', 'That''s better. The least you fly boys can do is show a little respect.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 48, 's_594a07fa', 'I want to study advanced TIE combat operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 49, 's_5950b85e', 'I''ll try and capture pirate salvage ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 50, 's_598456ed', 'Search the Death Star debris, the radiation clouds, and the nebulae from the Yavin gas giant. They seem like likely areas for the Rebels to hide. All of the garbage from the Death Star makes it hard to scan the system, so you''re on your own.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 51, 's_5a7ec1e4', 'What kind of operations can I help with?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 52, 's_5c8a242', 'We haven''t had any luck finding the relic, either.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 53, 's_5cab0f15', 'I haven''t had luck in finding Rebel information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 54, 's_5d5a0c89', 'There''s a never ending supply of salvage to recover. The Rebels and other pirates have been capturing our salvage transports. The transport pilots would be grateful of any cover you could provide.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 55, 's_62e2ea4c', 'Not quite but pretty close. The fact that this gunboat evaded our sensor net is disturbing. HQ believes the Rebels are planning to transport the Death Star firing core on board that vessel. Since the sensor sweep data is old, they may already have the core.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 56, 's_647a7426', 'Any advice?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 57, 's_6598178f', 'Interesting.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 58, 's_65d0e7ef', 'Do you think that''s where the relic is located?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 59, 's_6d22cae7', 'We aren''t the only ones interested by the Death Star''s potential. Various alien factions, as well as pirates, and the Rebellion has sent scavengers and special teams in to try and recover secret technology. We have a Navy division here, but lately the Rebellion has been sending in larger and larger incursions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 60, 's_71bf4315', 'I am being transferred again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 61, 's_7a761694', '(Continue to listen.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 62, 's_7b25fbc3', 'You''re cleared for training, so let me know when you are ready to begin.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 63, 's_7e1391b7', 'Welcome back, Officer %NU. The scanning team has submitted their data for review. It''s going to take some time to process it all. The debris and the radiation fields make it difficult to get clear readings.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 64, 's_7e1ae5f8', 'It could take a few days, even with maximum computing power directed at the problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 65, 's_7ec622db', 'Flying Officer %NU, I have an urgent assignment for you. Stand at attention for briefing!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 66, 's_7eed59f9', 'I am ready for my training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 67, 's_80efb61c', 'Any progress with the search?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 68, 's_81e0c16', 'What is it they found?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 69, 's_847e12c5', 'Hmm. Looks like the Rebels have definitely found something. There''s a lot of activity in region M84/2. I''ll dispatch a scanning team to check it out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 70, 's_86b2a029', '(Roll eyes.) Yes, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 71, 's_8a202d7b', 'I''m going to hunt Rebel raiders.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 72, 's_8bd72bb5', 'Mastering proper use of heavy weapons technology is key. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 73, 's_8dbf276d', 'Figures. Go get lost.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 74, 's_8e9a6b0f', 'Any raiders you destroy will hurt the Rebellion''s recovery operation. Keep them busy while we finish refining the scan information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 75, 's_8efde2ae', 'Yes, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 76, 's_916abbd9', 'They may have already escaped.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 77, 's_9315388f', '(Whistle, impressed.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 78, 's_9506a2bd', 'A squad of Storm Troopers will be standing by to board the ship. All you need to do is disable the ship''s reactor or engine subsystems and render them helpless. Once the Storm Troopers are on board they will take over the ship and then you will have to escort them and the ship to a safe jump point.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 79, 's_95549379', 'We need to buy time. Slow down the Rebel efforts until we can determine the exact location of the relic. You have operational discretion in this regard, but let me know your plans so I can coordinate with HQ. I''ve also received new details on the relic from Imperial Intelligence.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 80, 's_957a3e29', 'Here''s the situation. This information is highly classified, I do not need to remind you of the penalties of leaking Gamma Three intelligence.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 81, 's_9893fb0', 'Against my better judgment it would appear that you are fit for some flight training. Personally, I wouldn''t waste my time training you but I have my orders too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 82, 's_9c0c10ef', 'Report back to me when you are ready for a new assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 83, 's_9f6b62d3', 'I see why Intelligence put a lid on this.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 84, 's_a30c1a53', 'Yes sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 85, 's_a73dd488', 'I''m sorry, I''ll leave you alone.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 86, 's_ad3ca2e6', 'Do you think that I''m here to hand out missions like so much candy? Why don''t you go talk to your own commanding officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 87, 's_ae26c22', 'Let me think about this for a bit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 88, 's_aec16b0a', 'On second thought, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 89, 's_b0d3b474', 'I''m ready for training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 90, 's_b2d005b0', 'You did it. I would be lying if I said that I wasn''t shocked. You have proven yourself to be one excellent pilot and an asset to the Empire. Unfortunately, for me I have just received word that you are being transferred from under my command. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 91, 's_b54802f8', 'We need to find the relic soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 92, 's_b6b25f13', 'Yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 93, 's_b7cb6b94', 'This is an Ultimate Omega priority operation. The Emperor would dispatch a more elite team to handle the recovery, but there is no time. You must succeed. Failure to capture the firing core could result in disaster.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 94, 's_b84b366c', 'How can I help?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 95, 's_bd3101cc', 'We''ve dispatched teams to search for whatever the Rebels found, but it will take time. Command has the idea that one of you Storm Squadron thugs could accelerate the process by hunting down the Rebels and beating the information out of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 96, 's_bf7bc308', 'Where can I find Captain Denner?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 97, 's_bf7cf7b8', 'I''ll dispatch the scanning team. I need you to go up and escort the team while they make their sweep. There are probably Rebel fighters in that region, so you''ll need to stay sharp. Once the scans are complete, return to me. I have a few things you can do while we process the scan results.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 98, 's_c0203d03', 'That is the only reason that I have not busted you right out of the service. You are going to get another crack at capturing the vessel. Get up there and get me that ship before it''s able to repair itself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 99, 's_c27ccdd6', 'If I had things my way, you''d never see the inside of a fighter again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 100, 's_c4880407', 'Developing new levels of tactical and physical excellence will be critical in realizing your true potential. Use these study programs and destroy them when you have internalized the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 101, 's_c76594d7', 'I want to study advanced reactor engineering algorithms.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 102, 's_d040d381', 'I take it you don''t agree?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 103, 's_d1b5b50', 'Given our calculations of their incursions and the blast pattern of the Death Star''s destruction, Imperial Intelligence believes they''ve found something. Something big. In fact, they are hopping mad we didn''t find it first.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 104, 's_d5ee9adc', 'I''d like to escort salvage transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 105, 's_d7641f66', 'Normally I wouldn''t even consider it, but as it turns out I do have some elective duty tasks that require a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 106, 's_da3db7b8', 'I..'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 107, 's_dbb5bf46', 'I want to study advanced weapons technology.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 108, 's_dbcc5353', 'The new scan ship is waiting for you. Don''t lose this one.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 109, 's_dc229c8d', 'Blast it! You were supposed to be the best man for the job and you seriously botched it. Fortunately for you it would appear that we managed to damage the gunboat enough that it has not been able to hyperspace out of the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 110, 's_e053d691', '(Nod.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 111, 's_e240955d', 'If I had anyone else to send up, I would, but you''re the only pilot in the system rated for this kind of thing. As much as it disgusts me, I''ve been ordered to send another scanning team up. You''re lucky they aren''t sending you to fly garbage detail on some backwater outer rim world.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 112, 's_e617e5c8', 'We have located an area that it would appear the rebel agents are using as a meeting place with flight commanders. We believe it is these agents that have the information we are after. If you find a Rebel, search his ship''s computer for the ships activity logs and return to me when you find anything that might help us out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 113, 's_e6315aa', 'Command is working to refine the scan data as quickly as possible. If we can recover the relic it may help us to construct similar weapons.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 114, 's_e6647df0', 'The Emperor himself is interested in the outcome of this operation. Failure will result in harsh penalties.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 115, 's_e70b39dd', 'Intelligence has lowered the security rating on this operation so key command elements can operate more effectively. The ''relic'' is believed to be the firing core of the Death Star''s planet-killer weapon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 116, 's_e73e5d21', 'I want to study pilot combat training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 117, 's_ea3da11c', 'By the Emperor, I hope for all our sakes that is not the case. Your assignment is to locate that gunboat and disable it. We need to recover the core if it is on board and interrogate the crew if it isn''t.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 118, 's_ed5d85e3', 'You aren''t the one I was told to expect. My information is security rated Gamma Three. I can only talk to the one Oberhaur is sending.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 119, 's_f08d82df', 'A capital ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 120, 's_f14c78f8', 'I came as soon as I received my orders.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 121, 's_f1639d7c', 'You flyboys certainly like to take your time. While you''ve been gallivanting across the stars, I''ve had men dying in Rebel raids.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 122, 's_f4817c', 'HQ believes that the Rebels have found the core and are planning to extract it. If they succeed, the Mon Cal traitors could duplicate the technology and fabricate their own super weapons.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 123, 's_f81f75fc', 'Command has us searching for something and we don''t even have specs on its dimensions. We don''t even know what its supposed to be. Now they want someone to go hunt down Rebels to find out the information they don''t know or do know and just won''t tell us? This job shouldn''t be this convoluted. I should be directing walkers in battle, not grubbing around in a debris field.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_imperial_trainer_2b.stf', 124, 's_fe624ae0', 'What do you plan to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 3, 's_1110a04b', '[no answer]'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 4, 's_11a6885c', 'You, actually.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 5, 's_1248fc74', 'Honestly, I''m not sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 6, 's_1360f736', 'We never DID work together. YOU worked for ME.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 7, 's_15349399', 'Are you? I hope so. These aren''t fluff jobs. You''ve got something to prove to Jabba. He expects to see loyalty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 8, 's_15ef997f', 'This is Jabba''s Palace. Unless you''re here to work, scram!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 9, 's_17c44740', 'I guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 10, 's_1875ff4e', 'Know what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 11, 's_1ad6a2e4', 'This system is ripe for the picking. And Jabba''s got plans, big plans. You''d be wise to show your loyalty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 12, 's_1adbadc4', 'I''m ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 13, 's_1b6a5a1c', 'I''m ready to find out more about this Dathomir situation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 14, 's_1baaff63', 'Who are you? One of Jabba''s new pilots?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 15, 's_1c10e380', 'Hurry up.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 16, 's_1c8bddbb', 'What is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 17, 's_1e18c922', 'I haven''t said a word! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 18, 's_1e9e6433', 'If I find out you''re lying to me, I''ll kill you myself. And I''ll do it slowly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 19, 's_1edbaf3a', 'Obviously you can, you traitorous Valarian-loving goon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 20, 's_221dc44d', 'You''ve never heard of them? They live on Dathomir. Been there for centuries. They have their own ideas about how things should work. AND they''re Force sensitive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 21, 's_22f30f4c', 'The VIPs have all arrived safely. There is going to be a party at the Palace tonight. And what''s a party without party favors? The first one''s for you. Here! Pick a skill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 22, 's_249fa88e', 'Oh no!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 23, 's_255518bb', 'Don''t be ridiculous. Tell me what''s going on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 24, 's_25ba96cd', 'I don''t have anything to say to you - not until you finish your job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 25, 's_2675f275', 'Uh oh. Those witches are Force sensitive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 26, 's_26790919', 'No. But it''s nice to know that you''ll do what you''re told. Shamdon found some talented replacements for you! I wasn''t sure you were going to make it back alive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 27, 's_26c54c13', 'That''s why Jabba assigned the mission to YOU!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 28, 's_272a2246', 'They''ve named themselves after rancors? Ha! Those idiotic creatures can''t even brush their own teeth, much less fly a spaceship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 29, 's_2795978a', 'Ha! Well, disgusting they may be, but they''re useful, too. Jabba''s laying the foundation for his Dathomir operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 30, 's_28a543ae', 'I''m not done yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 31, 's_29456ce7', 'Such an inquisitive mind! Young pilots like you shouldn''t ask so many questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 32, 's_2a03f752', 'Watch your mouth. Now listen up. Jabba''s decided that he''s ready to move his operations into Dathomir. It''s ripe. There''s plenty of contraband in the area - and plenty of potential customers, too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 33, 's_2a335ce3', 'Here comes a special pilot. Ready for a special mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 34, 's_2bbcaa92', 'Dathomir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 35, 's_2c4b729', 'You''re boring me. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 36, 's_2cb5d040', 'You know that Jabba has a whole cadre of assassins at his disposal. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 37, 's_2d9d7c64', 'Welcome back. I have an idea about how to use you. But first, tell me, can you work alongside the Imperials?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 38, 's_2e7619b1', 'If it were up to me, I wouldn''t tell you anything!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 39, 's_2feb7c0f', 'It''s all part of my plan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 40, 's_3024ad9d', 'Oh yeah? Are they your best friends forever or something?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 41, 's_315f6f1a', 'You''ll take MY orders, if you want to live! You''re on thin ice with Jabba as it is. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 42, 's_31960979', 'That''s why I''m here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 43, 's_32376199', 'Now who''s giving the orders?! Come see me sometime. I just love your company.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 44, 's_36d47f1a', 'You mean they''ll blast US. We''re in this together now, remember?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 45, 's_38c86018', 'You know what they say. Keep your friends close, and your enemies closer. Jabba''s getting ready to make a big move. He''s got to know what''s going on out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 46, 's_38d9a05a', 'Who are you? %TU? Oh, yeah...I''ve heard of you. Word is you''re a pretty fair pilot. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 47, 's_38f0bcdf', 'Hm. That''s good to know, because Imperials are a force to be reckoned with in Dathomir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 48, 's_3a0e2d87', 'Then I suggest you find the person you DO work for - and stop wasting my time!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 49, 's_3b45cd54', 'Of course. Jabba''s getting ready to throw a little party.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 50, 's_3c1e7fc0', 'The kind of gifts any Imperial would want. Data on other factions. Insider information. Secret passwords. The good stuff.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 51, 's_3e7d2d37', 'But the Imperials are bound to hear about this.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 52, 's_3f262d6b', 'The winner gets the toys. And you''re the winner! Which skill would you like?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 53, 's_4050c6fc', 'Of course not. Have fun!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 54, 's_40a19463', 'I don''t care what you tell him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 55, 's_40d4f979', 'You better START caring. I broker pilots for Jabba. My opinion carries a lot of weight with him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 56, 's_438512f8', 'And loyalty is what he''ll get.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 57, 's_4389abe9', 'I missed you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 58, 's_44285b8f', 'I know those people.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 59, 's_461e9b3f', 'You''ve got nothing to worry about.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 60, 's_473d09d8', 'Teach me about system balance programming.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 61, 's_48a3c712', 'Maybe! Or maybe he just has some use for you. And that''s where I come in! I have a job for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 62, 's_4b6d65c6', 'I can''t take any credit. This was all Jabba''s idea. He''s a genius.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 63, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 64, 's_4c6b6df2', 'You''re a strange one. Jabba''s finished with you for now, and Talon Karrde is waiting for you at the Mos Eisley cantina.  See you later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 65, 's_4d5af593', 'Well...then I''d be dead by now, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 66, 's_4d69a104', 'Shocking.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 67, 's_4edf9084', 'Or else they''ll blast you out of the galaxy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 68, 's_4f4e1c4e', 'How do I find it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 69, 's_505c7932', 'After that, Jabba would like you to clear a few of his enemies out of this system. It''s getting a little crowded.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 70, 's_509249db', 'I want to know if you can work with Imperials?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 71, 's_50b517b8', 'While you''re distracting the witches with your shenanigans, his assassins will move in and rig up explosives. We''ll blast those crazy ladies sky-high.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 72, 's_523a54d5', 'Teach me about advanced techniques.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 73, 's_5288ea5c', 'Why do you ask?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 74, 's_52917b0d', 'Of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 75, 's_535a48bf', 'Is that right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 76, 's_53b3094d', 'Ohhhh! I see! Well, genius, why don''t you get back to your master plan?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 77, 's_5413ef97', 'Fine. Whatever.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 78, 's_5494c458', 'Right. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 79, 's_54d1d117', 'Valarians are good pilots. Good people, too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 80, 's_551c4bc7', 'You''re right. They''ll like it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 81, 's_55fa5d7a', 'Well, regardless of the reason, the Rancor Clan is here. And they need to go. This is your problem, as of now. I want you to get back up there and patrol the area. If you find rancors, engage and destroy. Got it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 82, 's_5723e13e', 'The Imperials are going to be VERY upset with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 83, 's_57bbda2a', 'WHY?! You shouldn''t feel good! You should feel BAD! Because you haven''t finished your job yet! DO IT!!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 84, 's_58081a79', 'Uh huh. Got a mission for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 85, 's_581da545', 'I didn''t think those Witchbloods would be so tenacious.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 86, 's_589dbb5b', 'You showed up. THAT''S what you did. And now you''re MY problem. I don''t like problems. So you can just forget about those Valarians right now. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 87, 's_59d3a31c', 'Look. You''re good, but not that good. If I go around handing our missions to fresh-meat pilots like you, I''d be Sarlacc food in no time, if you know what I mean. Some other time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 88, 's_5a2f9ba', 'It''s not an easy assignment. But then, you''re still on thin ice with Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 89, 's_5a8556d4', 'I believe it! Seems like a plan that''s way overdue.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 90, 's_5ba23093', 'You''re going to get the Witchblood clan under control. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 91, 's_5d667e15', 'Me neither! Go intercept that freighter in near Yavin. See you later, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 92, 's_5dc82348', 'Good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 93, 's_5dd29234', 'Ahh. I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 94, 's_5e53a3dd', 'Yes I do, thank you very much! Jabba''s got a plan. It''ll make our life easier, and it''s a good way to earn points with the Imperials. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 95, 's_601fa39', 'I know, I know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 96, 's_61412ebf', 'But it''s not up to you. is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 97, 's_615d980b', 'I''m looking for work. You got anything?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 98, 's_63684ac5', 'I guess I better get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 99, 's_651adfc1', 'What kind of party?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 100, 's_6553e1d6', 'Are you being sarcastic?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 101, 's_65ef9330', 'The name is silly; the threat is not. These are aggressive, dangerous fighters. I wonder why they''ve taken an interest in this area?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 102, 's_66ec8629', 'Back off! What did I ever do to you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 103, 's_66f326f', 'You''re going to go there for a little visit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 104, 's_6713da6c', 'Did he announce his plans?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 105, 's_6a5f1bad', 'Well? Cat got your tongue?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 106, 's_6ce4e96f', 'Right.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 107, 's_6d22c58', 'Later on, I''ll need your help with the Imperials. For now, you need to get the Witchblood clan under control. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 108, 's_6ec06027', 'What plans?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 109, 's_6fe71f0c', 'Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 110, 's_70969772', 'I can see that. Look, let''s start over. YOU''RE with Jabba, and I''M with Jabba. That''s all that matters right now. And I have a job for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 111, 's_719a036e', 'Who?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 112, 's_72318c63', 'What kind of gifts?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 113, 's_731189e6', 'I get it! What do I have to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 114, 's_73e3d4ef', 'How could I forget?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 115, 's_741f40ea', 'Hm! You know what? I don''t think I''ll miss you too much.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 116, 's_7943df8d', 'Jabba''s decided that he''s ready to move his operations into Dathomir. It''s ripe. There''s plenty of contraband in the area - and plenty of potential customers, too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 117, 's_79a6c35c', 'Oh, I''m scared.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 118, 's_7a9d89cc', 'These witches are obsessed with respect. They want everybody who comes to Dathomir to respect  them. Whatever! That is their weakness, as far as I''m concerned. I want you to find the clan''s burial ground. It''s an asteroid base somewhere nearby.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 119, 's_7f124363', 'Not in so many words. But he made sure that he knew who his friends were, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 120, 's_800d8ca1', 'Who is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 121, 's_80b8ba1c', 'Sometime this century?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 122, 's_80bfc2af', 'I wouldn''t think of it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 123, 's_8117e382', 'You just don''t understand genius.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 124, 's_81ed00dd', 'Their soldiers will know. I suggest you commandeer one of their ships and interrogate the captain. He''ll tell you what you need to know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 125, 's_821a5372', 'Well, that''s why Jabba''s a syndicate head, and you''re just a lowly pilot. You don''t have to like Jabba, but you have to respect him. He knows how to get things done. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 126, 's_8255ca09', 'I did my job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 127, 's_82751e5b', 'Guess what, %TU. Jabba''s sending you somewhere else.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 128, 's_83c2b64', 'The bad news is that a new clan is trying to make inroads in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 129, 's_841d27db', 'Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 130, 's_84c0df0e', 'Of course! You know how these witches are obsessed with respect. They want everybody who comes to Dathomir to respect  them. Whatever! That is their weakness, as far as I''m concerned. I want you to find the clan''s burial ground. It''s an asteroid base somewhere nearby.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 131, 's_8516d505', 'I know that I haven''t finished my job yet!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 132, 's_859cab0', 'The kind of party people like YOU don''t get invited to. All the big names will be there. Including some of Jabba''s biggest competitors.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 133, 's_85af2484', 'I will - as soon as you stop talking to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 134, 's_86313707', 'How are you feeling? Good?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 135, 's_8be640b8', 'Sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 136, 's_8c796cbf', 'Hey, why me? I''m friends with some of  those people.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 137, 's_8e5921a5', 'Back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 138, 's_8ecd2ed0', 'I don''t have to explain myself to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 139, 's_9532fb5c', '[stay quiet]'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 140, 's_95ff4e4', 'Well...it all depends on how you define Good. Every situation is different. Take the Imperial forces, for example. We need to treat them with the utmost respect.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 141, 's_974272bf', 'That''s EVERYTHING, as far as the witches are concerned. Non-believers like you will desecrate their sacred burial ground! They''ll be entirely focused on you. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 142, 's_9754c9cf', 'No. I don''t know what you mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 143, 's_98504882', 'First, you''ll recover a weapons shipment. Somebody had the nerve to steal it from Jabba. Can you believe the nerve?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 144, 's_98b1ccd4', 'No idea.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 145, 's_98be92ae', 'Looking for something?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 146, 's_999144d9', 'Tut, tut! No please? You should learn better manners. Come see me when you are ready. I''ll have work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 147, 's_99b1ec0', 'Of course! We don''t pay you to stand around and look pretty. I have good news and bad news. The good news is, business is booming.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 148, 's_9b113074', 'Do you have a point?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 149, 's_9b22b078', 'I''m not going to face an angry Jabba on account of you! Get the job done, or I''ll find somebody who can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 150, 's_9dd2c52f', 'Like we did with the witches of Dathomir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 151, 's_9ea143d7', 'Have we met?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 152, 's_9ef8ae7d', 'Who? I''ve already forgotten them. Give me a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 153, 's_9fc316af', 'Sure - when I have to.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 154, 's_a042a4cf', 'Are you kidding? Nothing stops me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 155, 's_a2c78f81', 'Unless you''re here to buy something, I suggest you keep walking.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 156, 's_a4c5fb69', 'No. They''ll be fine. Because I''m going to finish the job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 157, 's_a609e8c', 'That might get me killed, but I don''t understand how this helps Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 158, 's_a75b6949', 'Don''t believe me? Just cross me once. You''ll find out how much pull I have. And remember. Jabba''s rancors are ALWAYS hungry.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 159, 's_a7edf0be', 'And once I''ve found the burial ground?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 160, 's_a8371342', 'For now, you need to get the Witchblood clan under control. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 161, 's_a92435e7', 'The kicker is that Jabba is installing a vigo on Dathomir. He''ll be here soon.  We need to eliminate this problem before this guy arrives. If he decides that we''re doing a bad job, he will DEFINITELY replace us. And do you know what replace means?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 162, 's_a9aeb386', 'Teach me about advanced starship component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 163, 's_ac7fe93', 'My mistake.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 164, 's_acbfc0cc', 'The Imperials and Rebels in this system are fighting like cats and dogs, which leaves the whole area ripe for  the picking. Play your cards right, and you could find yourself a very wealthy pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 165, 's_ad7db4d', 'More orders from you! I can''t wait.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 166, 's_aea8a145', 'Hm! Sounds dangerous.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 167, 's_af22b9b2', 'I guess so.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 168, 's_afa084aa', 'Those Valarians really put up a fight!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 169, 's_b3b64ad2', 'I won''t miss you either. Jabba''s done with you for now, so go back to where you came from.  I think Talon Karrde is expecting you at the Mos Eisley cantina.  And in the future, if you see me coming, do me a favor and get out of my way!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 170, 's_b3b84a9f', 'Oh really? Have you been talking to your friends about Dathomir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 171, 's_b55e3f14', 'I can work with anybody, if the money''s right.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 172, 's_b834e090', 'All right, all right! You don''t need to take my head off. I have good news and bad news. The good news is, business is booming.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 173, 's_b984dc7a', 'Probably not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 174, 's_b9ca256f', 'Lady Valarian...you know how to choose the losing team. Don''t you realize that Jabba is unstoppable?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 175, 's_bb7d89de', 'THAT''S RIGHT! You haven''t! So DO IT NOW!!!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 176, 's_bc375f79', 'Got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 177, 's_bc7d4c35', 'Jabba''s very impressed. In fact, he''d like me to let you in on his secret plans.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 178, 's_bcad400e', 'And you can be a part of it, but only if you work with Jabba. This is going to be a juicy deal, and he''s not going to let anybody outside of his organization have a taste.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 179, 's_bcb460ff', 'Who wants a skill?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 180, 's_be1391ec', 'Maybe you''re not loyal to Jabba after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 181, 's_be822621', 'I didn''t expect you back so soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 182, 's_bee781d7', 'Strange!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 183, 's_bf01df79', 'Who is the Witchblood clan?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 184, 's_c0b27fdb', 'What do I have to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 185, 's_c1730a04', 'We''ve uploaded the Imperials'' coordinates to your ship''s system. And we''ve uploaded the data as well. They''re password-protected. We wouldn''t want you taking those - gifts - for yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 186, 's_c1c1d8a5', 'Getting shot down is part of your plan? That''s quite a plan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 187, 's_c33fad75', 'It''s always good to make friends with the Imperials, but is there some reason behind the timing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 188, 's_c4f23e9b', 'I suggest you run OVER that little problem, if you get my drift. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 189, 's_c4fdcde1', 'Don''t tell me you believe in the Force! Please. You should just use their superstitious nature to your advantage. We have to get them under control, for Jabba''s sake.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 190, 's_c59afc3a', 'Oh hi!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 191, 's_c634ffcd', 'Teach me about special warships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 192, 's_c6e0e27', 'First, get that weapons shipment. I''ll transmit your other orders later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 193, 's_c9979b12', 'Me neither. Intercept that freighter in near Yavin. See you later, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 194, 's_cb13d341', 'So here is your mission. I want you to deliver a few gifts to Imperial officers operating in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 195, 's_cc1cb635', 'Does that mean we aren''t going to work together any more?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 196, 's_cd0dcead', 'Of course not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 197, 's_d33e2776', 'Of course not! I have no friends.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 198, 's_d59f78b0', 'That''s it?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 199, 's_d60918d0', 'Here is your mission. I want you to deliver a few gifts to Imperial officers operating in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 200, 's_d6d5b88c', 'It''s a little strange, I guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 201, 's_d793b51', 'You have an idea?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 202, 's_d7c19f3f', 'Well here I am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 203, 's_d87ceb8', 'Then why are you here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 204, 's_da70d826', 'So YOU''RE the fool!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 205, 's_da8f9cc9', 'So testy! What did you have for breakfast? You need to work on the subtle art of conversation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 206, 's_db3d67b', 'I don''t work for Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 207, 's_db509386', 'Was killing them really necessary?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 208, 's_dc7d2ed4', 'OK. You''ve got a couple of items on your to-do list. First, you''ll recover a weapons shipment. Somebody stole it from Jabba. Can you believe the nerve? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 209, 's_dcea0b58', 'The kind of gifts any Imperial would accept. Data on other factions. Insider information. Secret passwords. You know. The good stuff.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 210, 's_dd19988e', 'And the bad news?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 211, 's_de174124', 'Nobody orders me around.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 212, 's_dea9aa2e', 'I know all about you. You were working with Lady Valarian. Going against Jabba! Are you crazy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 213, 's_e0114da3', 'Exactly. Which is why it''s important that we start making inroads with them now. We''ll scratch their back, and then they''ll scratch ours. Or something like that. Anyway! Back to my point. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 214, 's_e17cca44', 'Your old friends, the Valarians. You remember them, don''t you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 215, 's_e1ffebd7', 'What am I supposed to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 216, 's_e2b3bd3d', 'They were almost as disgusting as Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 217, 's_e2e25101', 'You might want to be a little more friendly, %TU. I''m your contact for Jabba. You don''t want me telling him what a sourpuss you are, do you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 218, 's_e413d452', 'If you say so! Try to learn quickly, I have more exciting missions for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 219, 's_e480eda0', 'What''s there to tell? Dathomir''s a gold mine, for the right sort of entrepreneur. We just need to establish good relationships with the neighbors.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 220, 's_e4b6a4d3', 'Because you''re supposed to be working. I can''t figure out why you''d be shuffling around here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 221, 's_e4dc5d6', 'Very.  These are aggressive, dangerous fighters. I wonder why they''ve taken an interest in this area?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 222, 's_e610029c', 'I didn''t think so. Why did you come back, anyway?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 223, 's_e9b69720', 'That''s the plan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 224, 's_ea4e584a', 'I salute you, %TU, for your brave and loyal service! Jabba is always generous with his employees. He''d like to offer you a training session. Isn''t that nice? What would you like to learn?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 225, 's_ea84693', 'You''re hurting my feelings.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 226, 's_ea9e3ad2', 'I can guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 227, 's_eb9f64f0', 'Maybe he brought you back so that he could have you killed. Did you ever think of that?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 228, 's_ecbb4e43', 'Oh whatever.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 229, 's_ed7786ee', 'Yes, quite ingenious! Once the Witchbloods are under control, we can move forward with our plans. It all hinges on you. Get to your ship!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 230, 's_edd73236', 'What is the Witchblood clan?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 231, 's_ef2cceae', 'Yes, you did. Jabba thanks you. I don''t think Lady Valaria will want to see you again anytime soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 232, 's_ef696d16', 'Doesn''t that seem strange? You WERE working for the competition, after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 233, 's_f0fbdf16', 'That''s the REALLY bad news - we don''t know. Nobody''s been able to identify them yet. They call themselves the Rancor Clan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 234, 's_f20d43a6', 'I''ve learned the error of my ways. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 235, 's_f2593c16', 'Next time, say Please. I''m sure we''ll meet again soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 236, 's_f390de3b', 'How did you like Jabba''s party guests?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 237, 's_f3d30738', 'Makes you the perfect person for the job, doesn''t it? You know how they think. Remember, this is your big chance to show Jabba how loyal you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 238, 's_f5427310', 'Of course not!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 239, 's_f5dff86f', 'Your old friends, Lady Valarian''s thugs. You remember the Valarians, don''t you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 240, 's_f5f8f818', 'Excellent! Then we''re getting off to the right start. I''m Beissa. I''ll be your commanding officer today.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 241, 's_f840ac8a', 'Was it too much for you to handle, %TU?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 242, 's_f9a25cfc', 'Hey, I know when to shut up!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 243, 's_f9cb6eac', 'Get out of here before I blast you myself!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 244, 's_fa1878f7', 'I AM. I just ran into a little problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 245, 's_fa60efdf', 'Looks like SOMETHING stopped you. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 246, 's_fbe476b0', 'Um...hi.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 247, 's_fcb2370', 'This is confidential information. You cannot share this, with anybody.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 248, 's_fccc4442', 'Jabba invited me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier3.stf', 249, 's_ff68e70a', 'Very nice. First, you''ll recover a weapons shipment. Somebody stole it from Jabba. Can you believe the nerve?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 3, 's_1056a46b', 'They sure are! But even they get into trouble now and then. Any interest in helping them out?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 4, 's_10652869', 'Try not to get killed. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 5, 's_10c507d9', 'Now that Jabba''s content, we can go about our business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 6, 's_11bcf0c', 'I guess so! Let me know how it goes! Get to Dantooine and hurry up.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 7, 's_11eba9b0', 'Here''s your pay!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 8, 's_11ed6849', 'Valarians are starting to get active around Dantooine. Too active, if you know what I mean. We need to nip that nonsense in the bud. I want you to disable a Valarian gunship and inspect it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 9, 's_1234129d', 'Are you mocking me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 10, 's_13031eaa', 'What brings a pilot like you out this way? Surely you didn''t come just to say hello.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 11, 's_1371de7b', 'I''m always happy to see TIE fighter debris, floating through space. Nice work out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 12, 's_14a79f3e', 'That''s it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 13, 's_15e60405', 'Lots of people in this sector hate the Valarians. They appreciate what you did. It''s good publicity for the Smugglers Alliance, see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 14, 's_164c9f60', 'If you say so! You''ll find the coordinates in your ship''s database. Bye now!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 15, 's_17c44740', 'I guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 16, 's_17dede1', 'You know I worked WITH the Empire when I was helping Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 17, 's_18b41c2f', 'OK! So far, so good. Mission accomplished. And in true pirate tradition, you get a little off the top.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 18, 's_190e0e72', 'Good point.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 19, 's_192c6747', 'Not likely. The Black Sun have their own code of ethics when it comes to business. They stick to their own.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 20, 's_1a5ce928', 'Time is money! And you''re wasting time! I don''t do business with malingerers!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 21, 's_1bfa482b', 'Good job with those Valarian fighters! You really put them in their place.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 22, 's_1c8bddbb', 'What is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 23, 's_1d267ca4', 'I can''t really say, since I don''t know. But it won''t kill you to see this Admiral and hear what he has to say, right? He can''t exactly force you to do anything for him, but there is a lot of things a pilot can learn from the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 24, 's_21cba89', 'Pirate life, my friend! There''s no black and white. It''s all just shades of gray.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 25, 's_2313ac9e', 'What are you talking about?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 26, 's_2836e6b5', 'OK.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 27, 's_293b395b', 'Well...I want everybody to be free to do business with our smugglers, if that''s what you mean! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 28, 's_29b1a1b4', 'So I want to keep spreading the love. You''re going to go on a goodwill mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 29, 's_2a9aa104', 'Write that one down in your diary! I just gave you a compliment. I NEVER give compliments. It''s a red-letter day.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 30, 's_2bf9b1f7', 'Oh yeah.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 31, 's_2e0d4c28', 'Money! You want it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 32, 's_2e5c16e2', 'Oh come on! You''re kidding, right? The Black Sun is the biggest criminal syndicate around. And they are CONNECTED. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 33, 's_303b5f14', 'Hey! There''s my favorite bum now. I have some surprising news here for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 34, 's_30860224', 'So I''m gunning for the Imperials.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 35, 's_30a9191e', 'Hey! I''ve got no time for bums like you. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 36, 's_30ea47ea', 'There''s CorSec, for one thing. Those guys are always mucking things up for us. Then you''ve got your stuck-up RSF forces. The Imperials would like us to straighten up and fly right - and that''ll never happen! Even your old friend Lady Valarian is gunning for us, since we''re aligned with Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 37, 's_312a9b56', 'You never know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 38, 's_324779f6', 'Do I have any missions? Yes. Do I think you can handle them? No. Why don''t you go find your mama and quit bothering me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 39, 's_33dc0069', 'If you say so! You''ll find the coordinates in your ship''s database. Bye now! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 40, 's_351c69aa', 'Don''t bother! I know what you''re going to say.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 41, 's_35a6c533', 'You''ve got it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 42, 's_36a61f55', 'OK! I get it! I''ll get back to work!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 43, 's_38264798', 'GET TO WORK!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 44, 's_38a1649f', 'Better make sure your blasters are operating at full capacity before you take off for Lok! Watch your back, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 45, 's_39d3e7a3', 'I''m warning you now - it''s the big time! Lots of unsavory elements flying around out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 46, 's_3afa07bf', 'Hey! Don''t be ungrateful. It''s unattractive. If you want more, just ask me for another mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 47, 's_3c7012a7', 'No. I said I was good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 48, 's_3c81c35', 'What? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 49, 's_3d6e04e6', 'Oh boy. Here we go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 50, 's_3f68df7d', 'Sounds easy enough.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 51, 's_3fac3195', 'THAT''S RIGHT! You must be some kind of mindreader! Maybe you should quit being a pilot and get a job reading palms down at the cantina!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 52, 's_3ff5bba1', 'I said that? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 53, 's_412dc22e', 'I''ll take that escort.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 54, 's_443da380', 'Sure - for now. One of these days, Lady Valarian could become the strongest.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 55, 's_4499bb6', 'Valarians are becoming active around Dantooine. Too active, if you know what I mean. We need to nip that nonsense in the bud. I want you to disable a Valarian gunship and inspect it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 56, 's_472841f4', 'Freight plans. I want to know what they''re transporting! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 57, 's_4854b859', 'I thought you told me you were the greatest pilot of all time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 58, 's_49155225', 'I want to see the back of you! Pronto!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 59, 's_49a22a42', 'Including Karrde''s?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 60, 's_4bb3bd9d', 'Sounds like that poor smuggler needs my help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 61, 's_4bb84e05', 'Jabba''s happy. And that means I''m happy. And if I''m happy, you''re happy! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 62, 's_4bef9ff9', 'Then I guess I better get to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 63, 's_4ca03ddb', 'How so?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 64, 's_4d999afa', 'I know they''re trouble.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 65, 's_4e27fe11', 'I don''t know what you''re talking about. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 66, 's_4eee118b', 'Nym''s going to appreciate that! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 67, 's_4f268deb', 'Uh huh. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 68, 's_50335ae8', 'So tell me. Did you hear any good rumors in Jabba''s Palace?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 69, 's_5206ea9b', 'Mind your own business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 70, 's_53de9d8f', 'Like what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 71, 's_555c668c', 'I know all! Get your backside over to Jabba''s Palace.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 72, 's_55671c91', 'Not really. It smelled terrible. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 73, 's_559912', 'Don''t be so quick to judge me. I can get the job done.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 74, 's_5681e74d', 'He is one of the Alliance fleet commanders. He''s got a force stationed in the Outer Rim. Not really sure what they are planning to do out there, but if he is looking for outside help, it must be something big.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 75, 's_58362a8d', 'Tell me about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 76, 's_5866c569', 'I follow you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 77, 's_58b4c6a6', 'The last thing you want is a bunch of fighter aces gunning for you. Get back out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 78, 's_59209e57', 'So put me to work! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 79, 's_593a67cd', 'Talon says you''re a good worker. But I''ll believe it when I see it! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 80, 's_59fffde8', 'Sure! But the ship''s almost completely disabled, so the guys on board are no use. And there aren''t any other Black Sun in the vicinity. We''re it! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 81, 's_5af217dd', 'Thanks. I think so! You''re clear to leave anytime.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 82, 's_5c05ecff', 'I just did what I was told.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 83, 's_5e6a9bde', 'No, I''M telling YOU to mind your OWN business! And your business is at Jabba''s Palace! So start walking, bub.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 84, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 85, 's_616c8086', 'If Jabba''s happy, we''re happy. We can''t do our jobs without the love and affection of our local crime lords.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 86, 's_62b0748', 'Everything''s coming up roses, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 87, 's_636f3f4d', 'Sure is! The Black Sun are killers and sociopaths, but they''re good earners. And they need our help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 88, 's_658f174d', 'What am I looking for?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 89, 's_6598178f', 'Interesting.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 90, 's_677b3694', 'EVERYBODY wants money!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 91, 's_67e6df55', 'Okay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 92, 's_67ec71d0', 'Hey, there you are. Ready to get back to work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 93, 's_694ce3f1', 'Could you explain it to me again?.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 94, 's_69647725', 'Actually, no, you didn''t. Talon said it! Maybe Talon was wrong!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 95, 's_6b1ef548', 'I''m looking for Talon Karrde.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 96, 's_6bc1a8b4', 'Sure is! They''re killers and sociopaths, but they''re good earners. And they need our help.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 97, 's_6c251948', 'You got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 98, 's_6c6479e8', 'All your action''s going to be in Lok. Later on, you''ll be targeting CorSec forces, even RSF - all the guys that do their part to stifle and subjugate the masses.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 99, 's_6e4cac2c', 'I can use it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 100, 's_6f729033', 'Okay. Suit up. You''re going back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 101, 's_70597637', 'I want you to start targeting enemy forces - starting with an Imperial Ace. Everybody hates the Imperials! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 102, 's_70a95d7f', 'False modesty! I love it. Here''s your cut. Let me know when you''re ready to do some more work for Talon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 103, 's_717febcb', 'Did you like the palace?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 104, 's_71d852f5', 'How about droid intelligence theory?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 105, 's_71d95498', 'So you want me to join the Rebellion?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 106, 's_73d0a21b', 'What? No!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 107, 's_741df7ed', 'Where?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 108, 's_74aa808d', 'If you want to stick it to the Imperials, you could liberate - wink, wink - one of their freighters and bring it to a hyperspace jump point. We could always use something like that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 109, 's_76e45e0f', 'If I give you another shot, do you think you can handle it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 110, 's_77e48d5b', 'What do you mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 111, 's_7934ba4d', 'Sure! It''d be REAL easy, if the Imperials would just mind their own business! But I think you can count on some interference from Imperial forces.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 112, 's_7b0a4618', 'But I thought...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 113, 's_7b6327ac', 'And they are CONNECTED. They''ve got their fingers in every pie.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 114, 's_7e0dff76', 'Yeah. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 115, 's_7f405b16', 'And remember: Jabba forever! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 116, 's_8138df62', 'Jabba''s a good ally for us. He''s the strongest crime lord in the sector, by far. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 117, 's_81f135c8', 'Time for you to get to work! You''re no use to me when you''re just standing around. What are you going to do? Or do you need me to explain the situation to you again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 118, 's_842279cd', 'How about exotic vessels?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 119, 's_842eb2d9', 'Well, good pilots don''t flub missions! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 120, 's_851d7ea3', 'Well, it''s a little hard to explain.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 121, 's_85c8a240', 'What about the Black Sun? Don''t they want to save their own ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 122, 's_85ddd986', 'You sure are!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 123, 's_87550112', 'If you want to be a hero to Nym''s group, you could rescue one of his transports. CorSec and RSF ships are attacking it as we speak!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 124, 's_877810f1', 'Enlighten me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 125, 's_8782c730', 'You guessed right. Let''s see what I''ve got on my roster! If you want to be a hero to Nym''s group, you could rescue one of his transports. CorSec and RSF ships are attacking it as we speak!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 126, 's_879f33d', 'I''m assuming you have work for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 127, 's_87d7e908', 'I know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 128, 's_88926265', 'Here''s a little something to tide you over until your next mission. Don''t spend it all in one place.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 129, 's_8945d3f4', 'Smugglers like us, we have a code.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 130, 's_8be640b8', 'Sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 131, 's_8c39d757', 'Why would we want to help the Rebellion?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 132, 's_8d8e36c9', 'We''re doing our part to keep Jabba on top. And that leads me to your next assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 133, 's_8e76f5e4', 'Sure. What''s not to love?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 134, 's_8ee47f8c', 'Jabba''s always working an angle. And we haven''t heard much from him lately. Is he planning something in Dathomir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 135, 's_900f01d1', 'What?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 136, 's_908cfde5', 'What''s the situation? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 137, 's_90f41db9', 'Don''t bother! He''s too busy to deal with the likes of you. As far as you''re concerned, I AM Talon Karrde.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 138, 's_92118a17', 'Talon and the Black Sun have an... understanding. A lucrative one. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 139, 's_94e9bd3b', 'I don''t want you to join ANYTHING. But I''ll tell you one thing, if the Alliance is going to do something big, you can be sure that the Empire will be involved. And the way I see it, anything that is bad for the Empire is good for us.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 140, 's_95b55346', 'I just got a communique from Alliance headquarters. Admiral Burke is asking us for help. They''re in a jam, and they are looking for the best pilots they can find.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 141, 's_95c7e5cc', 'He is, isn''t he? I''ve heard stories.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 142, 's_96c7f9b', 'Um, okay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 143, 's_96d69e86', 'Especially smugglers! Here''s your pay. Nice work out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 144, 's_9a63e564', 'Pilots like you receive skills training. And you''ll be getting that training from me. So get ready! And pick your poison.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 145, 's_9c834ac9', 'OK tough guy, have it your way. Let''s get down to business. We need to help Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 146, 's_9cc12ff4', 'I''m not happy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 147, 's_9ee65601', 'Good luck! You''ll need it! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 148, 's_9f0981a2', 'What''s in a name? You can just call me Sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 149, 's_a084de70', 'Now you''re talking.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 150, 's_a1c0645d', 'The Imperials have captured a Black Sun freighter. It''s carrying some good contraband - the kind of thing that would eventually end up in our pockets, if the Imperials would just mind their own business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 151, 's_a30c1a53', 'Yes sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 152, 's_a38a9e82', 'Nope! I think I got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 153, 's_a587c342', 'Mm hmm.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 154, 's_a59a1d43', 'Skip the lecture and give me a mission! I need the money.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 155, 's_a6359b23', 'That''s the smell of money, %TU! Jabba''s a good ally for us. He''s the strongest crime lord in the system, by far. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 156, 's_a6d95597', 'Not much.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 157, 's_a85bc17d', 'And then you DO it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 158, 's_a87f150c', 'You know Jabba was always trying to make backdoor deal with the Imperials.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 159, 's_aa6112c9', 'An Imperial freighter? Sounds like a tough assignment. I''ll take it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 160, 's_aba2cf17', 'Sounds that way! They are in Lok. Get going.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 161, 's_ac1da756', 'What are the Rebels planning to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 162, 's_ad973bd9', 'Yeah.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 163, 's_ae92ea5d', 'You tell ME how tough it is - when you get back from Dantooine! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 164, 's_ae9a6733', 'Of course. Come see me when you''re ready for some more interstellar action! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 165, 's_aeab6bd1', 'Get back to work! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 166, 's_b00344d', 'Droids! Done! Now then. You did good work with Jabba. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 167, 's_b0328fe7', 'Okay. So what''s your name?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 168, 's_b16ff72d', 'Lots of people in this system hate the Valarians. They appreciate what you did. It''s good publicity for the Smugglers Alliance, see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 169, 's_b1d60b3e', 'He''s stationed on Corellia, in Doaba Guerfel. He is expecting someone from our operation to show up... and I think that someone should be you. I can''t force you to go. It''s up to you, but I think it would be a smart move, %TU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 170, 's_b2909765', 'Why not? They''re useful, in their way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 171, 's_b30e002f', 'Those Imperials are STOMPING you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 172, 's_b3e1da76', 'Aw shucks. Lucky me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 173, 's_b504a09d', 'Hey! Good idea! Listen pal, there''s a whole galaxy of booty out there, ripe for the picking! It''s time for you to branch out, see what''s out there. Think you''re up to it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 174, 's_b5a3db93', 'Then why have we got this situation?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 175, 's_b6298a33', 'Is there any part of that you don''t understand? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 176, 's_b7e5af8c', 'That I blew it! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 177, 's_b857b065', 'I''m still working on it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 178, 's_b8dd8b3d', 'Very touching.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 179, 's_baacb22a', 'Sure! We all need a little something now and then. Come back when you''re ready for more.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 180, 's_bbe3529b', 'Who is Admiral Burke?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 181, 's_bc331bd7', 'Nothing to tell. I''m here to get a mission!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 182, 's_bd9c8748', 'She''s definitely the UGLIEST - and that''s saying something! Jabba''s not exactly easy on the eyes. And forget about Lady Valarian becoming the top player. It''ll never happen. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 183, 's_bdae1e2f', 'Vessels! Done! Now then. You did good work with Jabba. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 184, 's_c1ff5062', 'I''m looking for a mission. Do you have any?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 185, 's_c3363bcd', 'Uh huh.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 186, 's_c39e9b19', 'Depends. I don''t want to get sucked into their world. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 187, 's_c4076628', 'First, I TELL you what to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 188, 's_c40a86d2', 'Components! Done! Now then. You did good work with Jabba. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 189, 's_c4b1700b', 'You''ve got to finish what you''ve started.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 190, 's_c758f78a', 'I can''t tell you what I don''t know! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 191, 's_c8046dd', 'No way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 192, 's_c82e9a2f', 'Yes, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 193, 's_c870211d', 'OK! That''s all I need to hear. Now listen up! Here''s the situation. One of Nym''s ships is carrying a load of spice - although you didn''t hear that from me. You''re going to transfer that spice to a Hutt smuggler.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 194, 's_c91fbb55', 'And if you just feel like blasting everything in sight, I could send you out a Dantooine patrol! Everybody''s out there these days: CorSec, RSF, Imperial, even Valarian ships. Plenty of targets. So which one is it going to be? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 195, 's_c9b06630', 'Let''s review the basics here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 196, 's_cad10f7b', 'It''s simple. We just try to help people in need. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 197, 's_cf53514d', 'I hope so! Go on, get out of here! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 198, 's_cfd8a48c', 'Enough for a lifetime!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 199, 's_d2c2dc92', 'I''m warning you buddy - it''s the big time! Lots of unsavory elements flying around out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 200, 's_d48df184', 'Well listen up, there''s a whole galaxy of booty out there, ripe for the picking! It''s time for you to branch out, see what''s out there. Think you''re up to it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 201, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 202, 's_da0b2b1e', 'Now then. You did good work with Jabba. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 203, 's_da3439a6', 'Where is this guy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 204, 's_db089cf0', 'What are you trying to say?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 205, 's_db65cfb3', 'Well...we really try to help people who can help US later on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 206, 's_dbb3b0b0', 'How about heavy starship component use?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 207, 's_dcc126b1', 'Just doing my job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 208, 's_dd5bf0f8', 'Not for us, they''re not! Talon and the Black Sun have an... understanding. A lucrative one. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 209, 's_dd67013', 'What does that mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 210, 's_df1485b', 'Don''t beat around the bush! Just give it to me straight.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 211, 's_e00688cd', 'OK smartmouth, that''s enough out of you. Just get back to work! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 212, 's_e15e4244', 'You''re upsetting me! And I don''t LIKE getting upset! Get back to work! And do the job right this time! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 213, 's_e2084aee', 'What do you know about the Black Sun?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 214, 's_e30ce38b', 'I know they''re good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 215, 's_e3cee4d9', 'Techniques! Done! Now then. You did good work with Jabba. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 216, 's_e46f0376', 'Hey, you''re still in one piece. I guess those Alliance boys didn''t work you over TOO hard. Are you looking for work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 217, 's_e56b171a', 'I thought I was done with him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 218, 's_e5da4e7', 'Then there''s a Nym smuggler who needs an escort if he''s going to make it though Lok space. As you can see, we have lots of opportunities here to earn Nym''s gratitude. And that''s a good thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 219, 's_e5e29dc', 'You stink!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 220, 's_e61fa67b', 'So you''re just a freedom fighter.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 221, 's_e6d5d85c', 'It means that Jabba''s paid us for services rendered! And since YOU''RE the one that rendered said service, here''s a little cut.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 222, 's_e775f9ef', 'Anytime! I''m a generous Rodian. See me later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 223, 's_e79eddec', 'Sounds like fun.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 224, 's_e86f1062', 'How do you know?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 225, 's_e9125b15', 'But the question is, what have you done for me lately? So let''s get to work. Had enough of this place?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 226, 's_e9b39b51', 'Lok! Prettiest corner of the galaxy. Although you won''t be doing any business on the surface. This is strictly a space mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 227, 's_e9cabb66', 'Eh, you''re in luck. Normally I would send you packing, but I do actually have a couple of duty missions . Do you want me to give you a briefing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 228, 's_eb577cb4', 'None of your business. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 229, 's_ed173ecd', 'What happened? Did you blow your paycheck at the cantina?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 230, 's_ee28691a', 'How about expert techniques?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 231, 's_f13c9503', 'Now that Jabba''s happy, you''re free to work with Talon Karrde again. But Talon''s busy. So you''re reporting to me!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 232, 's_f14cd6bf', 'Really, I don''t! I didn''t have any time for gossip. I was too busy working.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 233, 's_f17a86bc', 'I''ll just say one word: Dathomir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 234, 's_f1aeca8b', 'Sounds like you''re really in love with yourself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 235, 's_f2648004', 'Buried deep, deep down inside.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 236, 's_f43dd2bd', 'Jabba works all the angles! Things are different with Talon. He''s no fan of the Empire. Are you willing to aim your blasters at those TIE fighters?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 237, 's_f600815f', 'Okay, NOW I''m happy!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 238, 's_f69cf191', 'This is all I get?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 239, 's_f8674c23', 'Where am I supposed to meet him?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 240, 's_f8e8d1ee', 'The Imperials have captured a Black Sun transport. It''s carrying some good contraband - the kind of thing that would eventually end up in our pockets, if the Imperials would just mind their own business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 241, 's_f8e8f311', 'What''d you call me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 242, 's_fa259cfa', 'The Imperials are giving it to YOU straight - with both barrels! Come on, now! Where''s your pirate pride?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 243, 's_fabf48da', 'Hey! Beissa''s looking for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 244, 's_fc00cf40', 'I see what you mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 245, 's_fc27931b', 'Thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 246, 's_fc7d0eed', 'I can handle them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_tier4.stf', 247, 's_fcb2db97', 'Let''s see what I can do about making Dantooine safe for smuggler kind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 3, 's_110c7bdd', 'Just complete a couple more assignment, %TU. You''re doing a good job. Don''t worry, I''ll train you soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 4, 's_111621e7', 'Where do I go now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 5, 's_140229b8', 'Oh yeah? That was fast. Must have been a level zip ship. So, you ready to sign up with old Dravis?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 6, 's_174c33a6', 'Whoa, whoa! Don''t be hasty. Look, you don''t want to join the Imperial Academy. Do you have any idea how long they make you serve? Years! Trust me, you''ll be dying to get away from the Empire within a month.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 7, 's_1adbadc4', 'I''m ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 8, 's_1f0c9843', 'Ha! That''ll get the Black Sun off our backs for a while. Way to go!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 9, 's_20df70f7', 'Hey, I''ve heard of you! Not a bad pilot, as I understand it. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 10, 's_2268b9e0', 'I got a ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 11, 's_25669048', 'So the Black Sun are trying to move in on Hutt space, huh? Well we''d better show them who''s in charge around here. Analyzing the sensor data from that ship you killed, you should find more in the system. We will provide you with some possible locations, now get at it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 12, 's_25cf6221', 'You''d better run a more thorough patrol to make sure there aren''t more Black Sun in the area. We don''t want to lose any more shipments through here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 13, 's_2883b989', 'Not right now, thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 14, 's_298df3ee', 'It''s Talon Karrde''s idea, really. Just something we''re trying out here on Tatooine. Nothing strictly what you''d call ''legal'' exactly, but here in the Outer Rim who cares, you know?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 15, 's_2a8b0366', 'Well these Black Sun pirates aren''t getting the message. We need to hit them hard: Cut off the head and the tail will follow. I want you to kill an ace pilot operating in our area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 16, 's_2b595da6', 'No one sent me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 17, 's_2b691aa0', 'A friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 18, 's_2b94498c', 'Excellent choice. Learning to pilot better ships will allow you to tackle more difficult assignments.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 19, 's_2d1e63d0', 'I don''t want to smuggle.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 20, 's_2e13d0e0', 'The station operator will recognize you when you show up and they''ll comm you... but if you get impatient, hit SHIFT+C.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 21, 's_2e5f3688', 'I really don''t know what you are talking about.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 22, 's_31fc5801', 'Well then go away and stop bothering me. I''m a busy man!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 23, 's_32c51f93', 'I probably shouldn''t, but the Smugglers need all the help they can get right now. I do have some duty missions available. Are you ready for a duty mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 24, 's_35047e82', 'Look, no offense, but I could get in big trouble with the Smugglers Alliance if I started just handing out missions to anybody. You should really go through your own contacts.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 25, 's_35a591ea', 'The ability to interface with droids is an invaluable skill for any pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 26, 's_370822d1', 'Yes'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 27, 's_3818dc2a', 'I am interested in basic fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 28, 's_381dd7dd', 'How much is this going to cost?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 29, 's_3924fc00', 'There are still pirates in the area. We need you to get out there and kill them right now, understand?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 30, 's_3fa70900', 'I am interested in basic starship component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 31, 's_40a69ad7', 'Maybe I will...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 32, 's_41e93b9e', 'Perhaps some other time, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 33, 's_429872ac', 'Ok, it''s a deal!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 34, 's_4358efe9', 'Where is my ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 35, 's_4440ce87', 'I changed my mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 36, 's_4738e99f', 'How do I find a space station?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 37, 's_481c3940', 'When will you teach me to fly?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 38, 's_49a60ce1', 'I don''t want any trouble, Imperial. Why don''t you go harass someone else?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 39, 's_4a441e77', 'Improving your skills as a pilot will definitely help you in your career. This will probably save your life someday!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 40, 's_4d19fcb1', 'What''s on your mind? Thinking about performing some duty missions?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 41, 's_4ff172ab', 'I don''t want to fly for the Empire!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 42, 's_541c2f70', 'Well that''s just fine. I''ve got plenty of people working for me already. Come see me if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 43, 's_58b6db3f', 'Well, ok, then. Go bother someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 44, 's_599b087d', 'You''ll launch into the vicinity of a space station just above Tatooine. A waypoint will be automatically created. Fly back to this point when you are done with your assignment. You can also use the zone map to find space stations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 45, 's_5ac0c4a5', 'Good, great, whatever. See you later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 46, 's_5f272b1e', 'I don''t know what you''re talking about.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 47, 's_60225cc9', 'Thanks, but it was nothing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 48, 's_605d90db', 'Right! I think you''re ready for some additional training. Now tell me, which area interests you the most?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 49, 's_6106187c', 'What is a duty mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 50, 's_61b6e28a', 'Healthy competition.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 51, 's_62f16f7a', 'Well, training like this, it''s worth its weight in spice. And I hope you don''t think you''re going to turn into an ace spacer overnight! Tell you what: you come to work for me and I''ll teach you how fly. We''ll call it OJT - On the Job Training. Do a good job and maybe I''ll even pay you, too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 52, 's_66ef1520', 'Fantastic job! The Black Sun ace won''t bother us again, I can tell you that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 53, 's_676c343f', 'That was easy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 54, 's_681e480d', 'I hear you can train pilots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 55, 's_695b8483', 'Black Sun pirates.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 56, 's_6bedd221', 'You must be lost! Why don''t you go somewhere else before you attract any unwanted attention my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 57, 's_6d273b75', 'Will you train me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 58, 's_6d6f9a8d', 'We thought that would be the last of the Black Sun pirates, but I guess there were more out there. Try running that patrol again, ok? Maybe they''ve moved on.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 59, 's_6e03f969', 'So can you teach me to fly?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 60, 's_70421509', 'You''ve got your assignment and the control device for your ship in your datapad. Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 61, 's_71015a7d', 'There are a lot of Black Sun pirates in the Tatooine system and they have no business being here. Just go out and kill all of them that you can find and we''ll pay you for each kill. This is HUTT space!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 62, 's_71e7a88', 'You don''t look like much of a pilot to me. Get lost before I feed you to the womp rats.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 63, 's_7262f027', 'Hey wait... you''re not going to say anything about that shuttle business are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 64, 's_7425c603', 'Your ship is parked at the starport. The control codes are uploaded to your personal datapad. Check your datapad to review the status of your ship. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 65, 's_7436b5b6', 'That''s good thinking. We need to make sure our shipments are making it through safely. Get out there and escort our transports through and we''ll pay you for every one that makes it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 66, 's_7705d12c', 'Good job. I knew that patrol would be no problem for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 67, 's_7d5682f4', 'You''re going to need a ship with a hyperdrive. Do you have one?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 68, 's_7d57477f', 'I am interested in basic training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 69, 's_7f1ca275', 'The space station will let you land. You know - you might want to have the station repair your ship before landing. It would save me some trouble...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 70, 's_80094dc8', 'Great idea!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 71, 's_807f6dd0', 'Ok, I''ll let Talon Karrde know we''ve got a new employee. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 72, 's_8467c710', 'Ok'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 73, 's_85355c2f', 'Ok, ok... tell ya what, %NU. You go dispose of that ace pilot for me, and then I''ll train you to be a better pilot. I''ll even throw in a new blaster for your ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 74, 's_85dd7d6c', 'How do I get back?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 75, 's_8622fd74', 'Go to the starport. Look for a ''starship terminal.'' You can use these terminals to configure your ship and to launch into space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 76, 's_87f48e61', 'The Black Sun leader.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 77, 's_88a0099', 'That''s the beauty of it! Forming a Smugglers Alliance means we have jobs for all types. We need combat pilots to guard shipments, rescue ships for when things go bad. Heck, we could even use someone to run decoy flights.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 78, 's_8aeba6e5', 'Yes, I am. What missions are available?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 79, 's_8d95c731', 'I''d rather take care of some things, first.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 80, 's_900f01d1', 'What?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 81, 's_9237617f', 'What about training?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 82, 's_940e1e78', 'I want to join.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 83, 's_9480f430', 'I am interested in droid interface basics.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 84, 's_94e896c1', 'NMP. Do you know what that stands for? Not my problem. Come see me when you get your own ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 85, 's_95df6b05', 'Some of our shipments have come up missing. We suspect foul play... Why don''t you run a quick patrol and make sure there''s nothing under-handed going on out there? Jabba''s going to be pretty angry if we start failing to deliver the goods!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 86, 's_96294214', 'Escort Duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 87, 's_9690c2f9', 'There are a few simple tricks I can teach you that will make you a much more lethal fighter pilot. Of course, you''ll need to get out there and practice these maneuvers in order to really improve.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 88, 's_98d00f66', 'Great! Thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 89, 's_999009d', 'What happened to you? I thought you could handle this? Look, we need that ace DEAD. If you''re not up to this, then maybe you should hire some help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 90, 's_9dcdd171', 'I don''t want to work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 91, 's_9ea8105f', 'Alright, make your preparations and come see me again when you''re ready. But don''t take too long...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 92, 's_9f8c06d0', 'So you''re smuggling?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 93, 's_9fdd7cf3', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 94, 's_a02b95fc', 'Look, this is no job for a creddrone. You''ve got to have SKILLS to be a pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 95, 's_a0b4565', 'Can''t you loan me one?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 96, 's_a2123b71', 'You need to do some more for me, before I do anything more for you. There''ll be time for training later. Go get those Black Sun right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 97, 's_a2e76d1a', 'No sooner do you kill one of their leaders than they find some thug to take his place. We''re just going to have to take their leader out, is all. I hope you''re committed to this!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 98, 's_aa69d394', 'I suppose we could work something out. But you''re going to owe me! And you''ll need your own ship! I can''t supply every wannabe freighter bum.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 99, 's_ae220ebc', 'There''s no doubt all that practice has paid off. I think you''ve proven you''re ready for some additional training. What skill interests you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 100, 's_afc7e628', 'Depends who''s asking.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 101, 's_b1f10b5', 'I don''t care about that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 102, 's_b26194cb', 'What are you doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 103, 's_b34a0dd2', 'That was quick thinking on your part, rescuing our transport like that and escorting it through. You deserve a bonus for that. I''ve also got something special for you... this mercenary bandolier will help you keep your things organized.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 104, 's_b4d6cb30', 'Ok, fine. Look, here are the access codes to a little thing that I, uh, found. Do you think you''re ready for your first assignment NOW? Or do you want me to pull it around front for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 105, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 106, 's_bb3a34dc', 'Maybe I can...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 107, 's_be1beb37', 'Listen, something has come up that we need you to take care of. Talon Karrde''s got a special assignment for you. He is right over there. Go talk to him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 108, 's_c1ff5062', 'I''m looking for a mission. Do you have any?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 109, 's_c28cc06d', 'Are you here about that Imperial Shuttle? I''m telling you, that''s an unsubstantiated rumor, nothing more. I have never stolen a shuttle in my life. Don''t you think the Empire has precautions and safeguards to prevent that sort of thing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 110, 's_c30fda16', 'Don''t you have something you should be doing right now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 111, 's_c4c3d546', 'How do I comm the space station?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 112, 's_c6f8e9e9', 'Ever heard of the Smugglers Alliance?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 113, 's_c86b6bef', 'I''m minding my own business. What are YOU doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 114, 's_c8bcb663', 'You''re right! It is rather unfortunate but we find that the Valarians are not keeping up their end of the bargain. So we need to help them meet their dues. Go ''recover'' some of their precious cargo, though I don''t expect they will just hand it to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 115, 's_ca38bc3e', 'Run that patrol, and we''ll talk about training later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 116, 's_ca932c28', 'Forget it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 117, 's_cd038c67', 'Look, if you''re here about the kid... It''s not mine'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 118, 's_cd0dcead', 'Of course not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 119, 's_cdcb429b', 'Nothing! Forget I said anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 120, 's_ce52ddaa', 'You''re going to need a ship if you plan on doing anything constructive around here. I''ll add the control codes to your datapad that will get you into a little model that I, uh, found. You''d better think about upgrading to a better ship, though.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 121, 's_cf4d3521', 'We''ll see about that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 122, 's_cff9699e', 'Well, I can''t say I blame you. After what happened to that massive space station of theirs!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 123, 's_d038a005', 'And then what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 124, 's_d0cc72e0', 'I bet there are more out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 125, 's_d24a2285', 'Will do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 126, 's_d335136f', 'Yes I am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 127, 's_d345d41f', 'Hutts in a handbag, you''re starting to be more trouble than you''re worth. Fine, make your preparations and come see me again when you''re ready. But don''t take too long...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 128, 's_d3d66c68', 'Excellent! Now talk to Talon Karrde.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 129, 's_d43b2932', 'Duty missions are a good way for you to get experience as a pilot. Only experienced pilots can receive the proper training to learn new skills and abilities.There''s no real final objective so you can end the mission whenever you want. So, would you like to take a duty mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 130, 's_d57c89f2', 'Ha! All right then, go ahead and join the Empire! You''ll rue the day!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 131, 's_d5cecb82', 'Hey, the way the Empire has been cracking down lately, it''s not as if a free-freighter bum has any choice, right? Anyway, we figure we''ve all got to stick together, so we''re forming a sort of Smugglers Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 132, 's_d60a3e3', 'Oh you do, huh? Well what do I look like, a flight instructor? Go join the Imperial Academy if you want to learn how to fly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 133, 's_d9eefb7e', 'I am'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 134, 's_db74ddc6', 'How about some training?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 135, 's_dc5b3564', 'A friend of yours or a friend of mine? And just what did this friend tell you about me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 136, 's_dc9e436d', 'What do you do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 137, 's_e2bc57c4', 'Who sent you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 138, 's_e5c453e0', 'You''re not ready for more training yet. But duty missions are a good way of getting good experience so that you''ll be ready for training soon. What do you say? Are you ready to try a duty mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 139, 's_e81a1436', 'I want to be a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 140, 's_e84d85e2', 'Sounds great.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 141, 's_ea9c260b', 'Oh good. I''d really appreciate that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 142, 's_eb2cfdac', 'You bet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 143, 's_ebe2e111', 'It''s a deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 144, 's_f04d5e44', 'Well, we do need someone to escort our supply shipments. If you''re feeling more aggresive, you could take out some Black Sun pirates, or even the Black Sun leader. Of course, there''s always room for some healthy competition with the Valarians, too. What do you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 145, 's_f17c03b4', 'Oh, and %TU...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 146, 's_fa5082f1', 'Ran into a spot of trouble, huh? Are you up to running that patrol again, or not? ''Course you are!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 147, 's_fc0b7ade', 'Er... I don''t have a ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 148, 's_fc27931b', 'Thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 149, 's_fc4ba900', 'Well what DO you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 150, 's_fc963b1e', 'I''m ready to train'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 151, 's_fd8bee64', 'You''ll need to comm the Tatooine space station and tell them you want to land.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_1.stf', 152, 's_ff2a95e8', 'A Black Sun pirate attacked me!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 3, 's_1169dea4', 'Whoa! Listen up, you need to keep a low profile as long as you''re working for Shamdon! We don''t want Jabba to find out we''re also working for his competitors! Just hang out at the Lucky Despot for a while and do what Shamdon asks of you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 4, 's_12f6a89c', 'I don''t want to hear about YOUR problem. Now complete that assignment or something REAL bad is going to happen to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 5, 's_151b3d1', 'That''s right.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 6, 's_1c8bddbb', 'What is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 7, 's_238f162d', 'Yeah, so? Never heard of hyperspace? Nym''s boys go wherever there''s an opportunity for profit. Especially at the Empire''s expense.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 8, 's_25e48bc1', 'No, actually, I don''t.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 9, 's_2a5548e1', 'He''s told me about you, %NU. Keep up the good work. You should talk to Dravis if you''re looking for something to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 10, 's_2d0c7400', 'I don''t have any work for you here, %NU. But you have enough contacts by now to stay busy. Why don''t you see if you can squeeze some coin out Shamdon or Nirame?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 11, 's_365a729a', 'I know him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 12, 's_3f10da9d', 'I got here as fast as I could.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 13, 's_3f2c222d', 'And what are you now, some sort of Imperial Inquisitor? It''s none of your business what I''m doing!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 14, 's_3ff6efdd', 'Ah, %TU! One of Dravis''s new ''employees'', right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 15, 's_415dfb0e', 'So what do I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 16, 's_4312ff91', 'That''s ok. He''s one nasty customer anyway. He''s a Feeorin, if you can believe that. You know how they are!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 17, 's_4963bef6', 'Good, then you know he''s not one to mess with. ''Course, he has a lot of enemies, but it''s better to be on his good side than not, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 18, 's_6372b444', 'Can you give me an assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 19, 's_697e04cf', 'So Shamdon got cold feet and decided to call off the operation. Nothing unusual about that though, you have to have an iron will to mess with Jabba. No matter, we always have work lined up for our pilots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 20, 's_71162f37', 'Busy?! You lazy antenna-breaker! Next time Dravis tells you that I need to see you, you''d better haul jets! This is no Lum Run, I''ve got an important job for you... and this assignment is going to make us RICH.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 21, 's_74bf2381', 'So, Jabba''s happy with your performance, I guess, or else he''d have fed you to his rancor, right? Well that''s excellent news, and I''ve got some even better.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 22, 's_7642f4a4', 'What did you do? Kill a bunch of fodder that Jabba really doesn''t care about? Jabba respects only one thing and that is strength. You showed backbone and Jabba is more then willing to forgive and forget as long as you do a good job for him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 23, 's_7a2ca8fc', 'That''s what passes as ''fast'' for you? Look, this is no Lum Run, I have an important job for you. And this assignment is going to make us RICH!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 24, 's_800d8ca1', 'Who is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 25, 's_805cb6f3', 'Alright I will report to Jabba.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 26, 's_810a7e7', 'Oh NOW you''re in a hurry. You greedy bludfly! Alright, here''s the deal, I need you to travel to Lok. Ever heard of a guy named Nym?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 27, 's_89b061e3', '%NU! It''s about time you got here. Didn''t Dravis tell you I wanted to see you right away?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 28, 's_9504aca1', 'So you are smarter than you look. I would have really hated to train a new pilot after Jabba''s men got through with you, had you refused. Go talk to Beissa in Jabba''s Palace. Good luck to you and welcome to the big time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 29, 's_9571c1b4', 'Excellent work! We have recovered the package from the scene of the battle; Now deliver it to Shamdon in the Lucky Despot like I asked you to. She''s going to be one of the Smugglers Alliance''s best clients after this. Just keep a low profile and work for Shamdon, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 30, 's_983a902c', 'What are you doing here? Didn''t I tell you to go to Lok?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 31, 's_98893f74', 'So what is going to be my next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 32, 's_9a287fb8', 'What? Why? What did you do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 33, 's_9cf1e4c3', 'Say no more.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 34, 's_9fcfc09a', 'Ever heard of a place called Dathomir? Sure you have. Well it''s a nasty little place with lots of opportunity for us to expand our operations. I''ve got a contact there you should meet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 35, 's_a134e447', 'Like I said, we''re branching out. Nirame gives us a cut of his profits. He helps Nym''s operation in the Dathomir system, and everyone is happy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 36, 's_a60a995b', 'I ran into a problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 37, 's_a89cdefd', 'But Nym is on Lok!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 38, 's_aa257bf2', 'Of course you''ll go. Don''t think all that work you did for Jabba changed who your boss is. You work for me! Now get to the Trade Outpost on Dathomir and start earning us some credits!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 39, 's_af906d73', 'No? Well, I suppose you wouldn''t. Not many of them around any more. Anyway, like I said, it''s not really important.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 40, 's_b50f6fd1', 'I''m too busy to talk to you. If you''re looking for work, then talk to my man Dravis.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 41, 's_ba77b53a', 'What sort of work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 42, 's_ba9fbfb1', 'Yes... and he really hates me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 43, 's_bb6309e6', 'Simple. Just travel to the Lok system and rendezvous with Nym''s man. Here are the coordinates. All you need to do is to pick-up a package from him and deliver it to Shamdon in the Lucky Despot here on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 44, 's_c3c2195b', 'I was busy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 45, 's_c8206f73', 'If you don''t know, then I''m not going to tell you. Go talk to Dravis if you''re curious. He''ll either tell you or shoot you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 46, 's_daf180e6', 'Right to the point, huh.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 47, 's_db4bd0fd', 'What is the job?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 48, 's_dc9e436d', 'What do you do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 49, 's_de0bf763', 'He goes by the name of Nirame Sakute, and he''s trying to make a name for himself in Nym''s organization.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 50, 's_de9b68cd', 'Jabba wants me to work for him after what I did?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 51, 's_e002e01a', 'What are you doing here? I told you to go to Lok!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 52, 's_e70a45c9', 'Never heard of him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 53, 's_e8ed6f9a', 'Ok, I''ll go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 54, 's_fa31c92f', 'Believe it or not, Jabba was so impressed by your work against him that he has asked for your services specifically. You are to speak with Beissa in Jabba''s Palace.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_2.stf', 55, 's_ff6979b6', 'Sorry, %NU, I don''t think you''re quite ready for anything that I would need for you to do. Check with Dravis and see if he''s got some work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 3, 's_114c29a9', 'So?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 4, 's_197f4f94', 'I am interested in intermediate starship component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 5, 's_1a3dce13', 'This isn''t much money.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 6, 's_1aaeed53', 'No I am not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 7, 's_1b1dd9b4', 'What do you think? Did you eliminate that pirate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 8, 's_1c8bddbb', 'What is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 9, 's_1f4922ce', '%NU, you''d make an excellent pirate. Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 10, 's_1fe46aff', 'Well what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 11, 's_2118caa8', 'Ha ha! Well that''s none of your business now, is it? You go on now and find something useful to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 12, 's_2640d39c', 'You know Lady Valarian and Jabba are... ''competitors''... so to speak. Right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 13, 's_2b2c40c1', 'I knew you could handle it. Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 14, 's_2e6c7754', 'Oh you must be Talon Karrde''s new man. Thanks for this. Here''s the money Talon and I agreed upon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 15, 's_2fef6afd', 'Good choice. No doubt that will come in handy soon. Are you ready for your next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 16, 's_32965dab', 'Who is Talon Karrde?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 17, 's_34e4d30', 'I doubt it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 18, 's_360d8728', 'No thanks'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 19, 's_36a4e374', 'Yes, I am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 20, 's_36bdb4df', 'I don''t know why you''re talking to me... do I know you? Why are you here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 21, 's_383435', 'You''ve done an excellent job for me, %NU. I can see that you are ready for more training. What are you interested in learning?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 22, 's_3b48f08', 'That Canyon Corsair leader needs to be taken out! He''s responsible for our lost transports in the Lok system. Go defeat him!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 23, 's_3c3002fc', 'Oh, I don''t think so. The only people doing jobs for me are from Talon Karrde''s outfit. And if Talon sent you, you''d have something for me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 24, 's_4362ba26', 'The Imperial Pilot has been neutralized.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 25, 's_43f63a81', 'I killed the Imperial.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 26, 's_45b71b4d', 'I am interested in advanced fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 27, 's_474f9205', 'Who cares what Jabba wants?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 28, 's_52e7e5e', 'You''d better go talk to Talon Karrde. I have a feeling he''s made some promises to Jabba on your behalf.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 29, 's_5423b2d0', 'Right! Help our shipments get through to Lok without being hijacked by those Canyon Corsairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 30, 's_57adb96', 'Who knew you''d make such a good pirate, %NU? Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 31, 's_5ad49b89', 'Alright. Well come see me when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 32, 's_5af9448', 'Good. There are a number of things you can do for me. What can you do for me right now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 33, 's_5b1bed8b', 'Well?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 34, 's_5c522568', 'Yes, of course.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 35, 's_5d262b71', 'You are here for work now, yes?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 36, 's_5f96d75a', '%NU, don''t be naive. This is Tatooine. Everyone cares what Jabba wants. More importantly, Talon Karrde cares, so you better care too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 37, 's_63227fe4', 'You''re probably right. Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 38, 's_650a0c35', 'Bad news, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 39, 's_666ebdc8', 'Excellent. Our shipments to Dantooine have been blocked by a surprisingly competent Imperial patrol. I need you to go destroy it so we can resume operations there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 40, 's_66b1a06f', 'Alright. Come see me when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 41, 's_69e17dd2', 'I''m sure I''ll have more for you if you''re up to doing some more jobs... or say, if you''d like to flip for that. What do you say, double or nothing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 42, 's_6e21ce1c', 'Talon thinks Jabba''s going to put a death-mark on him... because of you!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 43, 's_6ff30da7', 'Hijack transports in Dantooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 44, 's_71a8cc01', 'Why is Karrde spooked?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 45, 's_725573da', 'What now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 46, 's_739845d3', 'No... especially not for the likes of you. Go find your own contacts.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 47, 's_75d43a2b', 'Well apparently you''ve been just a little TOO successful, working for Lady Valarian. Jabba wants Talon Karrde to work for him, and only for him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 48, 's_766563c7', 'Nothing I couldn''t handle.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 49, 's_7cb248ee', 'Did it go alright? Any problems?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 50, 's_8179979d', 'Naturally.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 51, 's_89555084', 'Excellent. I want you to head Lok and destroy a Canyon Corsair Behemoth. This pirate''s been trying to block our shipments to Nym... and we just can''t have that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 52, 's_895d093', 'Ok.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 53, 's_8a24761e', 'Me? What did I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 54, 's_8be640b8', 'Sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 55, 's_8be95ab4', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 56, 's_8f5942fa', 'I am interested in starship defense training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 57, 's_90a85d36', 'A smart-looking girl like you ought to be able to figure that on your own. You go on now and interrogate someone else, alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 58, 's_93ba78e7', 'Kill Black Sun Pirates in Yavin.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 59, 's_9839c24f', 'Eh... I may be making a mistake, but you''ve got that look about you... like you might make a good smuggler one day. Yes, I do have some duty missions. What do you think you can handle?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 60, 's_98adf66d', 'I can see you''re busy. Come talk to me when you''ve got some time. I can always use your services.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 61, 's_9939e2d7', 'A smart-looking boy like you ought to be able to figure that on your own. You go on now and interrogate someone else, alright?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 62, 's_9b0ac27a', 'Jabba sent a thug over to have a little ''talk'' with Talon Karrde. He''s a little spooked, I think.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 63, 's_9eb35e93', 'Good thinking. The Imperial patrols there are making it difficult to operate, but if we can cut down on the amount of legal traffic, demand for our services will soar!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 64, 's_9f5f269', 'No problem'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 65, 's_9fa5f777', 'Excellent! They''ve been moving in on our operations for just a little too long. Go to the Yavin system and wipe them out!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 66, 's_a07f4bc4', 'Excellent. This is a very special assignment! Jabba''s pirates have been cracking down on our smuggling operations in Tatooine and we''re having problems getting shipments out of the system. I want you to escort one of our transports out of the system... and watch out for the Hutts!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 67, 's_a24306df', 'There''s no way we''re going to allow the Black Sun to move in on our operations! Get back to the Yavin system and destroy that ship before it''s too late!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 68, 's_acda8fe', 'What are you interested in?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 69, 's_ae1a4b87', 'Our contacts on Dantooine are getting nervous. You have to destroy that Imperial patrol before our customers decide to take their business elsewhere. Now get out there are finish the job!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 70, 's_aed52b48', 'Yes, I''m here to do a job for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 71, 's_b4790825', 'I don''t know why you''re talking to me... do I know you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 72, 's_bb27779e', 'What would I have?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 73, 's_bc000879', 'It was nothing.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 74, 's_bce510d4', 'Alright, but you''d better be ready soon. Hurry back.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 75, 's_c1ff5062', 'I''m looking for a mission. Do you have any?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 76, 's_c261cfae', 'No problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 77, 's_c29ec5c2', 'Well, we''ve got some bad news, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 78, 's_c4682ea6', 'Thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 79, 's_c562c4fb', 'Oh, I guess you''re the new woman working for Talon Karrde''s outfit. Here''s the payment Talon and I agreed upon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 80, 's_c631f8da', 'Escort Transports in Lok.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 81, 's_cbe97427', 'Then stop bothering me. Can''t you see I''m busy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 82, 's_d01d0154', 'No, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 83, 's_d14c381d', 'I brought this from Lok.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 84, 's_d4079379', 'That''s what makes you such a good pilot. Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 85, 's_d5a42663', 'Good choice. Are you ready for your next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 86, 's_d6695e83', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 87, 's_d6924ee9', 'Welcome back, %NU. Are you ready to get back to work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 88, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 89, 's_d70e2c34', 'Excellent. This is a special assignment. The Black Sun pirates are trying to move in on our territory. They been blocking our operations in the Yavin system. I want you to go there and destroy the Black Sun leader. Once he''s out of the picture we''ll own smuggling there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 90, 's_d9b1bd09', 'Nice work with that Corsair leader. Maybe that''ll teach those guys to steer clear of our transports. I''ve got your payment right here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 91, 's_da9a29e9', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 92, 's_dab97824', 'I don''t know who you are, but you don''t look like someone I want to talk to.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 93, 's_dfd3392c', 'Good choice. Your new abilities will come in handy soon. Are you ready for your next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 94, 's_dffe951a', 'Fantastic! %NU, I knew I could count on you. Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 95, 's_e4c0ecd', 'We can''t afford any more mistakes! It''s only a matter of time before Jabba figures out you''re working for me. Now go escort our transport so it can make it out of the system!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 96, 's_eca7c053', 'No problem at all.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 97, 's_eff66f4d', 'I am interested in reactor engineering algorithms.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 98, 's_f1bbe36f', 'Don''t get too full of yourself. It''s a dangerous world, you know? Ready for another assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 99, 's_f3d46f0b', 'No, not quite yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 100, 's_f4b9423e', 'Yes, I am'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 101, 's_f520ab35', 'How did it go?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_privateer_trainer_shamdon.stf', 102, 's_ff5b4126', 'Jabba? Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 3, 's_123f7ff1', 'You new around here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 4, 's_48759a79', 'Rebel starfighter outpost. We coordinate starfighter activity here on the ground.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 5, 's_57c8489e', 'What should I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 6, 's_7c5e0cfa', 'Talk to the general. Do missions for her. Then do missions for the special operations fellow here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 7, 's_a19d6d5a', 'I''m a high-ranking character without much dialog.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 8, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_helper_1.stf', 9, 's_cc569d6f', 'What is this place?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 3, 's_1061c440', 'Your reputation is well deserved.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 4, 's_1106a07b', 'That''s ridiculous! I''ve served the Alliance well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 5, 's_114c29a9', 'So?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 6, 's_11a59fbe', 'Answer my question!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 7, 's_129732ea', 'Can he escape?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 8, 's_129bdf42', 'Why are you asking me these questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 9, 's_12e4e81a', 'Do not take it personally.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 10, 's_137f3e6f', 'Then there is nothing in your dossier of interest to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 11, 's_13faa821', 'He''s also flying with an elite escort.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 12, 's_151b3d1', 'That''s right.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 13, 's_15e6c3e4', 'Whatever. What''s my mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 14, 's_188d0288', 'Then I have a job for you. Your attack on those Imperial ships was effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 15, 's_189648be', 'At the moment, he is in Dathomir space on a Lambda shuttle, en route between the planet and an Imperial fleet... with an Imperial escort.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 16, 's_18b63392', 'Do me a favor and back off.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 17, 's_1a40c7ec', 'Of course. This is a bit of a change for you. You won''t be chasing after Imperials this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 18, 's_1bd3a505', 'He has a Lambda shuttle AND an escort? He must be important.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 19, 's_1d28ae3', 'Nothing!  Not until you straighten this situation out.  You need to improve your standing with the Rebel Alliance before I can trust you with any more assignments.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 20, 's_1fd170b2', 'It''s a must, for my job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 21, 's_23c7ed04', 'He''s killed more Rebel pilots that any other soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 22, 's_2493aca3', 'He''s in the Endor system, en route to Dathomir. You''re clear to leave anytime.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 23, 's_24d21bf3', 'As do I. There''s only one problem - he''s in a Dathomir prison. As long as he''s there, we don''t know what he knows.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 24, 's_25e98647', 'Where can I find this guy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 25, 's_26c0af06', 'Sounds logical.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 26, 's_2700bc9b', 'Maybe I''ll tell you about it - another time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 27, 's_2787404a', 'Why? What''s so special about a prison?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 28, 's_27bc6d70', 'I''d like to introduce you to someone. He''s a smuggler. He works with Nym.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 29, 's_2914d34b', 'Trust isn''t necessary. You can still work together. After all, we work together, and I don''t think you trust me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 30, 's_2bc4bdb7', 'Sounds like fun - but why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 31, 's_2cc79657', 'What would you do to stop the Empire?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 32, 's_2f463615', 'Some.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 33, 's_2f6ac50d', 'The Empire will love that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 34, 's_3059f369', 'What then?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 35, 's_30a2d12d', 'I''m afraid I won''t be of much use to you. I suggest you find someone else. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 36, 's_315ecc88', 'We believe the Empire plans to return the favor, and launch attacks against OUR ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 37, 's_3269c6d', 'Not really.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 38, 's_329414b2', 'Please, do not waste your time talking to me. You are needed elsewhere.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 39, 's_337aea88', 'I am not in need of training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 40, 's_3414728a', 'Only with our help. I want you to go to Lok and meet with one of Nym''s smugglers.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 41, 's_341568b3', 'There is an Imperial security officer in the area. He has information we need.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 42, 's_35b12d6', 'Just a habit. Your attack on those Imperial ships was effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 43, 's_37402596', 'It will bring pain and suffering!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 44, 's_374e94fe', 'It''s a type of shuttle reserved for only the most important Empire personnel. It''s heavily armed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 45, 's_3899c4e1', 'And it''s my job to get him. Right?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 46, 's_3949fe14', 'Some people think the Empire will bring order to the galaxy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 47, 's_39d07e54', 'There''s nothing for you here. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 48, 's_3a9f883c', 'Teach me about advanced space combat.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 49, 's_3aa053cf', 'Where is he?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 50, 's_3b851af5', 'I''ll teach you what I know. If you want another mission later, ask me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 51, 's_3d2253c6', 'Shame. You''re very good at it. We now have the spies and an Imperial Security Officer, thanks to you. They continue to provide us with information. (It''s against their will, but still.) The Empire''s plans are even more sinister than we imagined.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 52, 's_3dc14ee3', 'Any idea what they have planned?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 53, 's_3eeaed57', 'I suggest you get to it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 54, 's_404b8a10', 'Yes. But first we need a plan. Go to Lok, meet with the smuggler, and deliver his information to the Rebel Commando team in the Dathomir system. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 55, 's_4103a0b8', 'No. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 56, 's_412e0683', 'Where is this ex-convict?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 57, 's_41a00423', 'How did you like using that space assault droid?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 58, 's_4291c3cf', 'Is he really that good?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 59, 's_42a9f4a3', 'And I''m supposed to trust him?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 60, 's_43647dca', 'Oh, I don''t know about that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 61, 's_459dafe4', 'He''s on board a Lambda shuttle. Do you know what that is?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 62, 's_473d09d8', 'Teach me about system balance programming.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 63, 's_4748286f', 'That pilot''s not going to get the better of you, I hope. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 64, 's_47da17a9', 'Not at all. Forgive me. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 65, 's_4bbc7af6', 'Why do you think that is?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 66, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 67, 's_4d74f4db', 'He once fought for the Empire. And now he fights for us. People do change allegiances, you see. We must always keep a close eye on our people. And that includes you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 68, 's_4d7b2f02', 'Do you have something to hide?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 69, 's_4df738bb', 'Anything?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 70, 's_4ece8e4c', 'I''m not going to gather any more information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 71, 's_4ffa3018', 'Worked like a charm.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 72, 's_4ffe2e0d', 'I did. Do you think you can hold your own against an Imperial pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 73, 's_51a30f3e', 'Perhaps nothing! There''s no doubt about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 74, 's_527fe7c', 'Anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 75, 's_52819991', 'Defector? I like the sound of that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 76, 's_52d4385d', 'What kind of attacks?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 77, 's_53de9d8f', 'Like what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 78, 's_554b78dd', 'That''s a shame. I''m starting to enjoy the idea of being a spy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 79, 's_55eef619', 'Of course. Now let''s get down to business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 80, 's_573af66b', 'So there you go. Travel to Lok, meet up with the smuggler, and bring his information to the Rebel Commando team in the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 81, 's_58159522', 'Of course. Congratulations on catching them. Very nice work up there, but I''m also referring to Eker.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 82, 's_5852ee6b', 'The intel was correct.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 83, 's_58999327', 'Yes - from the outside, in. But we have access to a former prisoner. He will help us.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 84, 's_58cd53b6', 'I don''t know. But I''d like to find out. And there''s an Imperial Security Officer who may have the information we need. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 85, 's_59552474', 'Then the Alliance will crumble. You don''t want that on your conscience, do you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 86, 's_5973a2b6', 'No. NOW.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 87, 's_59cd5207', 'If I didn''t know better, I''d say you were an Imperial.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 88, 's_5a66cd79', 'You haven''t finished your assignment. Please get back to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 89, 's_5b000af8', 'Different how?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 90, 's_5bd53e0a', 'We meet again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 91, 's_5bd69df6', 'What do you need me to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 92, 's_5c8eeafa', 'You''ve got nothing to worry about with me. I''ll prove it to you. Give me a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 93, 's_5e8b8f88', 'He''s one of the best. In fact, the Emperor himself is going to award him with their highest medal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 94, 's_5f46c092', 'What can I say? I''m good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 95, 's_614f7f1c', 'You haven''t been cleared for this level yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 96, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 97, 's_628181f3', 'Are you kidding?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 98, 's_64170652', 'Your hair. You''ve changed it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 99, 's_645464dc', 'What you''d expect. Tell me, have you been here before?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 100, 's_652ff698', 'Come now. I was born at night, but not LAST night.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 101, 's_658f174d', 'What am I looking for?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 102, 's_665b67d1', 'Very good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 103, 's_67c8f113', 'You still have work to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 104, 's_69f60e66', 'It relates to your recent attacks against those Imperial ships. You were effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 105, 's_6a45ad00', 'What sort of security has he got?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 106, 's_6b4f10db', 'Hm. Interesting. You''ve been very helpful so far. You''ve brought us the Imperial Security Officer, and you''ve launched a devastating wave of attacks against Imperial forces. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 107, 's_6f921f12', 'Welcome, %TU. You look different than I expected from your picture.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 108, 's_710aa637', 'Who do YOU know here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 109, 's_738d24fd', 'Very well, let''s begin. Talk to me again when you are ready for a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 110, 's_75913251', 'You''re referring to those spies. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 111, 's_76340c2f', 'So he''s good. I''m good too.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 112, 's_77e48d5b', 'What do you mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 113, 's_783af10a', 'What picture?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 114, 's_79209e7', 'Can I see it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 115, 's_7a9322d', 'I won''t? '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 116, 's_7b3fb40b', 'He''s in the Endor system, en route to the medal ceremony. Make sure he doesn''t get there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 117, 's_7b907498', 'We have been tracking the movements of an Imperial Security Officer. He has information we need. The time has come to capture him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 118, 's_7da64d88', 'Ah, that will be very useful.  Let''s begin, and later I''ll be ready to give you a mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 119, 's_7f0ba495', 'Let''s drop it, before I get angry.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 120, 's_81682525', 'Dossier? What''s in my dossier?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 121, 's_81d92cad', 'Ah. That would be telling.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 122, 's_821fd0ab', 'We have to stop the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 123, 's_825313cf', 'Do you think the Emperor is an idiot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 124, 's_82f0aea5', 'Hmph.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 125, 's_83b7fee0', 'Absolutely. And after that attack, we can be sure they''re watching us closely. We''ve GOT to find out what the Empire is planning. Tell me %NU, do you know many people in this system?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 126, 's_841d27db', 'Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 127, 's_843eff43', 'Bomb-making material, Imperial comlinks, schematics, anything suspicious.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 128, 's_8539c0c6', 'Absolutely. Thanks to you, we now have Imperial spies in our custody. They''ve provided us with extremely useful information. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 129, 's_861c21de', 'The Rebel Alliance can''t trust just ANYONE, you know.  You could be a spy for the Empire... and the reports we''ve been receiving about you are making me nervous.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 130, 's_86fe6fa2', 'There is an Imperial Security Officer in the area. He may be carrying useful information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 131, 's_87d7e908', 'I know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 132, 's_887fc0e9', 'The battles have been going our way. We have captured an Imperial Security Officer, thanks to you, and your attacks against those Imperial ships was effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 133, 's_895be92b', 'Why wouldn''t I?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 134, 's_89962192', 'He''s been to the Dathomir prison. He can help us plan an escape. Get his information and deliver it to the Rebel Commando team in the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 135, 's_89dfa4de', 'That''s what I''m here for.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 136, 's_8a4015bb', 'As a matter of fact, yes - thanks to that Security Officer. We believe the Empire plans to return the favor, and launch attacks against OUR ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 137, 's_8a88463d', 'Please keep your ears open, %TU - and tell me everything you learn. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 138, 's_8b436d82', 'So you can gather more information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 139, 's_8b898446', 'Tell me, why do you fight with the Rebellion?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 140, 's_8bd6bf55', 'Well done. I look forward to meeting that Imperial officer. Let me teach you a skill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 141, 's_8bf6086e', 'We''ve had a run of good luck. A hard blow against the Empire now would destroy morale.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 142, 's_8cfb34cb', 'Just rumors.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 143, 's_8e632a96', 'You''re awfully paranoid.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 144, 's_8fbd3f85', 'I don''t think it''s the prison that interests them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 145, 's_90377ed4', 'Affirmative!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 146, 's_90875aed', 'What''s going on here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 147, 's_9173548c', 'Right away.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 148, 's_92bcea', 'You''re going to find out. I want you to track him down. Make sure he never gets that medal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 149, 's_9401fd7b', 'It''s very difficult.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 150, 's_94a2001c', 'He''s a smuggler who works with Nym. You can find him in Lok. Meet with him there and bring his information back to the Rebel Commando team in the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 151, 's_94ece311', 'I think that''s my line. And besides, you should know better than most people how important security is these days.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 152, 's_966a1e03', 'Information is more valuable than gold in wartime. And remember, I''m working for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 153, 's_9b989e16', 'Teach me about advanced Alliance component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 154, 's_9c7613eb', 'Perhaps. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 155, 's_9c91459e', 'You should always keep your eyes and ears open.  But as of now, you''re stationed at a Rebel outpost on the planet Rori. You''ll report to General Ufwol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 156, 's_9df42b04', 'So are you. Please return to your ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 157, 's_9e4da02c', 'And we''re going  to free him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 158, 's_9f86f530', 'There is an Imperial defector in the Dathomir prison. We want to free him and find out what he knows. This smuggler I mentioned, he has been to the prison, he knows the layout.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 159, 's_9fb0046e', 'He''s good.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 160, 's_a0e63032', 'That prison is impenetrable.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 161, 's_a30c8590', 'Because we don''t inspect our own ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 162, 's_a41a2281', 'Hm. Rumors. Interesting. I wonder what people are saying.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 163, 's_a53ea74c', 'Worthwhile things often are.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 164, 's_a68dfaa6', 'Sure I have!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 165, 's_a8af09fc', 'Why do you want me to meet him?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 166, 's_a8e0243a', 'All Rebel ships are now subject to inspection. And YOU will inspect them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 167, 's_a91e3c6b', 'You sent for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 168, 's_a927c891', 'What''s next?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 169, 's_a9bcadc0', 'I''d like to see YOUR dossier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 170, 's_a9cddbcc', 'I hit them hard with that last attack.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 171, 's_aa4f6738', 'I can and I will. Find me later, when you are ready for another mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 172, 's_ab085367', 'Those spies would have been no use to us dead. But you brought them back alive. Very useful. And that''s why I''ve chosen you for this next mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 173, 's_ab1cce5f', 'That thermal bomb would have ripped this place apart.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 174, 's_ae11747c', 'Leave that to me. Are you ready for a dogfight?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 175, 's_aeb6556c', 'You would be tremendously bored by it, I think.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 176, 's_b0da26cf', 'I''m sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 177, 's_b136da95', 'Then you know about the prison here. This planet is a backwater, a worthless hunk of rock. Yet for some reason, the Empire has taken an unusual interest in the area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 178, 's_b1479cf9', 'Now would be a good time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 179, 's_b2aeeeda', 'He''s a pirate. Everything he does is illegal.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 180, 's_b3ae7d2', 'Yes. Well, that brings me to my next mission. The Empire knows that we have this information, and I am sure they are planning attacks as we speak, to kill us before we can take action.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 181, 's_b3f5831e', 'Ah, we do not know each other yet. Even if I knew, I would not tell you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 182, 's_b40f340', 'Not a chance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 183, 's_b4a1239c', 'Ugly word. I prefer ''information broker.'''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 184, 's_b6da869b', 'We are both serving the Rebellion. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 185, 's_b7138aed', 'I''m not following.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 186, 's_b7d2e561', 'The information is frightening, but not specific. And for all we know, they''re giving us disinformation. It will take us a while before we can be sure they are telling us the truth.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 187, 's_b84b366c', 'How can I help?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 188, 's_b9f4f973', 'I didn''t know they were keeping a file on me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 189, 's_be155900', 'No, of course not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 190, 's_be88a7d6', 'Because he''s been to prison.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 191, 's_be9caae0', 'The Rebellion sent me your dossier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 192, 's_bf9961a9', 'Blah. Do you have work for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 193, 's_c2051287', 'I think you ask a lot of questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 194, 's_c265503e', 'He is? Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 195, 's_c2850e6', 'Same difference.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 196, 's_c2efe3eb', 'They''re not just going to walk through the front door, either. I expect they''ll try something more devious. According to our intel, they may try to smuggle explosives into this system on Rebel ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 197, 's_c3e376a5', '%TU!  Explain yourself!  What''s this I''ve heard about you assisting the Empire?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 198, 's_c43eb58', 'Teach me about space superiority fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 199, 's_c4bc453f', 'Indeed. We''ve equipped your ship with a space assault droid. Disable his ship and shoot that droid onto its hull. The droid will breach the ship, subdue the crew and take control of the ship. Then we''ll see what we''ve got.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 200, 's_c4dbdf08', 'So now I have a dossier AND a reputation.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 201, 's_c4f6eef8', 'It was?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 202, 's_c599f19a', 'There''s a prisoner there, an Imperial defector. He will be helpful to us - once he''s free.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 203, 's_c6594c52', 'Are you trying to anger me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 204, 's_c65b834a', 'Exactly. But we are going to start inspecting them, starting immediately. And YOU will inspect them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 205, 's_c74a6348', 'You must finish what you started.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 206, 's_c7aa6bdb', 'The Bothan reputation precedes me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 207, 's_c93b6a54', 'That won''t be necessary. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 208, 's_c9ba6bc2', 'Of course. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 209, 's_ca2ba04f', 'Speaking of Imperials, you did a very nice job out there with the Corellian Corvette. Thanks to you, we now have several Imperial spies in our custody. They are founts of information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 210, 's_ca8f5dda', 'When do I start?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 211, 's_cd86689a', 'They''re not going to walk through the front door and announce themselves, that''s for sure. According to our intel, they''re going to try and smuggle explosives into this system using Rebel ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 212, 's_d057d7d3', 'That is the price of success. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 213, 's_d1ec36f0', 'Very good. We have been tracking the movements of an Imperial Security Officer. He has information we need. The time has come to capture him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 214, 's_d258e826', 'Do not underestimate your enemies. They are as dedicated to their cause as you are to yours.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 215, 's_d2d48b62', 'You''re very observant.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 216, 's_d2f7d204', 'This is a prison planet. Worthless. And yet for some reason, the Empire has taken a keen interest in the area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 217, 's_d31b92f9', 'Perhaps you could introduce me to your friends. I am always interested in meeting new people.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 218, 's_d35a8803', 'One of the Empire''s best pilots is en route to a medal ceremony. He is the hope of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 219, 's_d3e5c0aa', 'Then how about another mission?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 220, 's_d454739a', 'Soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 221, 's_d5bf212f', 'The coordinates are in your database. Go now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 222, 's_d6643019', 'Actions speak louder than words.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 223, 's_d6963a70', 'About the Dathomir system?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 224, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 225, 's_d72cbbfa', 'You are now assigned to the Rebel outpost on Rori. You''ll be reporting to General Ufwol.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 226, 's_d762182e', 'The Empire''s good too. And they want to put a stop to our activities, immediately if not sooner.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 227, 's_d85b3a9c', 'What if I refuse to continue?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 228, 's_d9245236', 'I don''t think I know you. I''m certainly not expecting you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 229, 's_d9a23c21', 'Your attack on those Imperial ships was effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 230, 's_db13b2d9', 'Immediately. Thank you again for all your hard work. And remember: watch your back.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 231, 's_db14e2c1', 'We believe the Empire plans to return the favor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 232, 's_db5f856c', 'He''s an Imperial defector. We plan to engineer an outbreak.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 233, 's_dc95008b', 'We''ll soon find out which one of you is the best. I want you to go after him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 234, 's_de2df0e3', 'Thanks - I think.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 235, 's_dfcc11ba', 'Yes, about that assault. It was effective - perhaps too effective.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 236, 's_e19c193f', 'That Imperial Security Officer has provided us with a tremendous amount of information. With it, we can launch attacks that will decimate the Imperial fleet''s infrastructure.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 237, 's_e24417b', 'He will help us to plan an attack on Dathomir prison.  '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 238, 's_e3c318b4', 'Specifically the Dathomir prison.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 239, 's_e3d61563', 'Bomb-making material, Imperial comlinks, schematics - anything suspicious.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 240, 's_e5235eff', 'Do you have a mission for me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 241, 's_e6631bf8', 'What is my mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 242, 's_e68c0bb8', 'Anyone who believes that is an idiot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 243, 's_e95511fe', 'Of course they are. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 244, 's_eb3726f6', 'Yes. You''re going to help me get information - from an Imperial defector.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 245, 's_eba35f17', 'When do I leave?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 246, 's_ec3a4b5b', 'You''re dealing with a patriot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 247, 's_ec44bbf0', 'We are interested in an Imperial Security Officer. He has information we need.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 248, 's_ecb17e60', 'I don''t know what you mean'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 249, 's_ed4e5e50', 'Sure was. Do you have my next mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 250, 's_f6cd86be', 'Why was he in prison?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 251, 's_f72b6d44', 'Would you like to learn a new skill now?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 252, 's_f8b02865', 'What do I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 253, 's_f9044504', 'There''s more I could teach you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 254, 's_f9e6ef1b', 'I do. There''s a prisoner on Dathomir we wish to meet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 255, 's_f9f2fe5c', 'I like to know who I''m dealing with.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 256, 's_fa38c858', 'I thought I was working for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 257, 's_fa6e2383', 'Looks like our information was correct. Thank you for your efforts. Are you ready for a new skill?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 258, 's_fab55d44', 'I know a smuggler. He works with Nym. And now he''s going to work with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 259, 's_fb871ded', 'Central Command has issued new orders for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 260, 's_fd8741c0', 'I''m not scared of things that go bump in the night.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 261, 's_ff50cabc', 'All Bothans are spies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 262, 's_ff8b2372', 'Correct. They are fiercely guarding something there. Do you know anything about it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier3.stf', 263, 's_fffe6e23', 'You will be.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 3, 's_1131a10a', 'Sorry to hear that we wasted our time, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 4, 's_1338e704', 'I can give you an elective duty task. If you''re interested, I can give you a briefing?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 5, 's_15235513', 'You bet I do. There''s trouble brewing. I can smell it in the air. That''s why the Alliance created the Crimson Phoenix. We''re the frontline defenders. Think you can handle it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 6, 's_15bf89c7', 'Imperial engineers?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 7, 's_15dc5860', 'See? That''s what I hate about these guys. They never tell you anything until it''s absolutely necessary.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 8, 's_1678be5a', 'I haven''t brought one down yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 9, 's_18d61e21', 'Agreed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 10, 's_18e57f03', 'Well try harder! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 11, 's_1b9a0acd', 'What did you think of those new TIE fighters?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 12, 's_1cd7da68', 'I don''t think you''d be interested in an easy mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 13, 's_1d23eb6a', 'Where to?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 14, 's_1e8289a2', 'I''m interested in droid intelligence theory.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 15, 's_1ec8846c', 'Hello, pilot. Welcome to Rori. First time here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 16, 's_1eed1024', 'We''re taking a new tack. We may not know WHO''S building them. But maybe we can figure out WHERE their facilities are. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 17, 's_2022581b', 'Sir, it won''t happen again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 18, 's_2183d62a', 'I want to get inside one of those ships. Sit in the driver''s seat. Take it for a test ride. Smell that Imperial leather. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 19, 's_221bd4ce', 'Why would it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 20, 's_233489bc', 'Glad to see that you made it back from your assignment with Admiral Burke. Are you looking for work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 21, 's_24f29c02', 'I held my own.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 22, 's_258d2f1e', 'You''ll be working for me. You''ve been assigned to the Crimson Phoenix squad. Do you know what that means?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 23, 's_265095d0', 'Then you''ve been living under a rock. He''s heard of you. He''s looking for men who can handle a Black Ops mission. I think you may be just the pilot he needs.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 24, 's_270a2a57', 'I''m interested in special weapons and tactics training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 25, 's_2acccb89', 'They''re impressive. No doubt about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 26, 's_2c10011d', 'Imperial engineers are usually well hidden in the belly of the Empire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 27, 's_2c4789b', 'Understood.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 28, 's_2d4185b', 'Maybe it''s not his fault. Maybe the Imperials are just extremely motivated. What in blazes are they up to?!?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 29, 's_2db03120', 'It''s not a spy mission, that''s for sure. Hope that doesn''t bother you. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 30, 's_2eebfe4c', 'With the kind of opposition we''ve been facing lately, an understanding of new component technology will be invaluable.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 31, 's_2f190cf', 'Your attack was a success, no doubt about it. But those engineers have vanished. I''ve never seen anything like it! How can a group of men with heavy machinery be so mobile?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 32, 's_30a32651', 'Good, you''re here. I have your orders. Seems that somebody has taken an interest in your piloting abilities. You''re being transferred.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 33, 's_314f0ae4', 'A new model?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 34, 's_323479fd', 'Our attack in Endor was a complete dead end. I was SURE we''d find the manufacturing area. It''s too late now anyway. The ships are scattered all over the place, and there''s a million of them. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 35, 's_325c76db', 'Don''t have any patience for it, myself. Can''t stand all that sneaking around.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 36, 's_32b5bee1', 'Could it be the ship factory?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 37, 's_32b7bf59', 'I''m giving you access to a space assault droid. It''ll help you to get the job done. The droid will take control of the ship, once you''ve disabled the pilot.  '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 38, 's_33cdebfd', 'I''ve heard good things out there. My boys tell me you can hold your own.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 39, 's_35208536', 'Yes, you can. But that doesn''t mean you know everything. Keep your wits about you and pay attention. You could learn a lot from Admiral Burke. Now don''t keep him waiting. Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 40, 's_36085c51', ' Let me tell you something about Crimson Phoenix. This unit was designed to be the best. Do you hear me? THE BEST. I don''t tolerate anything less from my pilots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 41, 's_36fbddee', 'You getting smart with me? For crying out loud, soldier, it''s time for you to straighten up and fly right. Your orders are to report to Doaba Guerfel on Corellia. Admiral Burke will be there to fill you in on the rest of the details.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 42, 's_37df0fba', 'You''re up. Let''s see if you can keep up with my squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 43, 's_39a10eac', 'Well? Are you ready for a duty assignment? Or would you like to hear the briefing again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 44, 's_3a640dfa', 'And now they know we''re out here, so they''re sure to come after us eventually. We need to move quickly. I''d like to know who''s building these ships. They could answer a lot of questions for us. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 45, 's_3bf1bb23', 'Your new commanding officer, Admiral Willham Burke. You may have heard of him. Commander of the Fourth Battle Group stationed in the Outer Rim, two time recipient of the Alliance Medal of Valor, one of the finest field commanders in the business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 46, 's_3cc21469', 'I always knew I was destined for greatness.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 47, 's_4123d99b', 'That was my first thought. But I don''t think that''s it. It''s something bigger and much more complex. Based on the data, it doesn''t look like they''re churning out any mass-produced product. It''s something much more unusual, with very detailed specifications.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 48, 's_428c6440', 'My job is to protect my pilots as much as possible. They are the most valuable asset we''ve got. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 49, 's_43fcfbca', 'Imperial fighters? No problem!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 50, 's_4479e343', 'I do, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 51, 's_45ae8603', 'It''s not going to happen. Not with results like this. Get back out there and clean up that mess!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 52, 's_46ccc483', 'I think you''ve got work to do for Ulvaw''op, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 53, 's_48b7214b', 'I just do what I''m told.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 54, 's_49805f81', 'Can I hear the briefing again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 55, 's_49bf2ccb', 'We''ve been taking a close look at that TIE fighter. Quite a piece of machinery.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 56, 's_49e55ca2', 'Yes Sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 57, 's_4a4a0211', 'I don''t think that you belong here, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 58, 's_4b3f09bc', 'I need a pilot to travel to  the Yavin system and launch a series of attacks against Imperial patrols near the Death Star debris field. We''ve got Rebel smugglers in that system, and they''re doing their best to collect Death Star components for analysis.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 59, 's_4c56b685', 'Hey! Don''t assume you''re the best. You''re not a kid anymore, and this isn''t a holocron. This is the real thing. You remember that the next time you see one of your fellow pilots taking fire. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 60, 's_4ca48b38', 'But I think we can work smarter than that. I want to take a closer look at these new TIE fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 61, 's_4df417ce', 'These new Imperial ships constitute an imminent threat. We need to know what, EXACTLY, we''re up against. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 62, 's_521e8b09', 'I''m sure you''ve got a plan.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 63, 's_528a2d25', 'Absolutely. You''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 64, 's_5471712d', 'We''ve been planning an attack against a fleet of Imperial fighters for quite some time. We''ve laid the groundwork. We''re ready to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 65, 's_579532ac', 'There''s something else you need to know. You''ll be seeing a new breed of Imperial ships out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 66, 's_58a20c33', 'I know, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 67, 's_5b998dc7', 'On the contrary! We found some very interesting information - and we would have missed it completely if we hadn''t inspected Endor so closely.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 68, 's_5bb47d59', 'I agree.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 69, 's_5bc07030', 'What''s the mission, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 70, 's_5e35901c', 'I lost some brave men up there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 71, 's_614d7ac4', 'What is the mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 72, 's_61657d0f', 'I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 73, 's_622525cb', 'And Admiral Burke is...?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 74, 's_6231dba', 'So? Which mission will you take?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 75, 's_62fa1f75', 'There''s an Imperial space station in Endor. I think that''s where the engineers are unloading the new models. So that''s your primary target.  You''ll join forces with a Crimson Phoenix squad, travel to Endor, and launch an attack. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 76, 's_63740522', 'Requesting redeployment, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 77, 's_63e0ab42', 'Don''t blame ''em. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 78, 's_6425e854', 'Yes sir. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 79, 's_67ee2a0', 'I want to help those prisoners. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 80, 's_68772323', 'Sounds like you''re trying to stay one step ahead of the Imperials.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 81, 's_6912a453', 'We''re trying, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 82, 's_6c01a28a', 'Well, you''re not dead, I''ll give you that. Report to me later for your next assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 83, 's_6c38055e', 'I was good at it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 84, 's_6c524e01', 'Nice work, %TU. Our engineers are examining  that TIE fighter now. Here''s your duty pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 85, 's_6d164e59', 'The Empire has unveiled a new class of TIE fighter. These are brand-new models, next-generation material. They''re designed to be faster, lighter, more accurate and more deadly than any ship that''s come before them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 86, 's_6d4fe1fb', 'Unacceptable, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 87, 's_6db5d6ce', 'Well, put me up there, sir, and we''ll see which one of us is wrong.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 88, 's_6dea357d', 'Incredible handling. It''s going to take a while before we find a way to modify their technology for our X-Wings. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 89, 's_6e4f5881', 'I hear you did a good job under Ulvaw''op. Do you enjoy working with spies?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 90, 's_71854a18', 'Well let''s see some guts out  there! Get back in your ship! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 91, 's_719a036e', 'Who?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 92, 's_71a53f8b', 'What''s that, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 93, 's_73c9f8b3', 'Here''s an exciting one. I''m looking for a pilot willing to intercept prison ships in the Dathomir system. Those ships are carrying Rebels, and we need those men here with us! The pilot who takes this job will carry a probe outfitted with a virus. That virus will unlock the prisoners'' cells. Once they''re free, our men will be able to take control of the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 94, 's_742d8c68', 'I try, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 95, 's_76dd2544', 'I suggest you save it for a rainy day.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 96, 's_76e9b54b', 'Report to me later for your next assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 97, 's_790d22d6', 'That won''t be easy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 98, 's_79e6aa32', 'Oh one more thing %TU. All the missions I provide you with will be high risk missions and might be too much to handle by yourself. If you have any favors you can call in, doing so during my missions might be a good idea. Dismissed!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 99, 's_7aa5d0f7', 'The news isn''t all bad. We found some very interesting information - and we would have missed it completely if we hadn''t inspected Endor so closely.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 100, 's_7b03d343', 'My men tell me you weren''t too bad up there. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 101, 's_7ba8daf7', 'This doesn''t mean you''re a full member yet. I want to see what my men think of your abilities. Their opinions carry a lot of weight with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 102, 's_7d8f56b6', 'No luck there. The engineers, whoever they are, have done a good job covering their tracks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 103, 's_7dae4367', 'Sound choice %TU. Come back soon, we have a lot to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 104, 's_7e962bfb', 'Several Rebel operatives have been scouting Endor, looking for suspicious Imperial activity. Their mission is complete, and now they''re carrying valuable data. They need a fighter pilot to escort them safely out of the system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 105, 's_7f14ac3a', 'Don''t know. The engineers, whoever they are, have done a good job covering their tracks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 106, 's_8009422e', 'Any leads?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 107, 's_831e2b3a', 'All soldiers receive duty pay at the end of each mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 108, 's_83b2f3f1', 'The Empire has deep pockets. It''s incredible, the way they fund their research labs. It''s no surprise that their technology outstrips ours.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 109, 's_85660b3d', 'Any news from that Imperial space station?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 110, 's_856aca7d', 'Ulvaw''op has helped the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 111, 's_856e4aab', 'You''re now a full member of the squad. That means you''ll be reporting to me, and you''ll be participating in all squad missions. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 112, 's_8574f09', 'Don''t be a cowboy. Remember, you''re part of a team now. You''ve got to work with the squad members.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 113, 's_86137261', 'No sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 114, 's_87f091b9', 'Thank you, sir. I''m happy to be a part of the team. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 115, 's_89951606', 'Let me at those Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 116, 's_89e27dc9', 'There should be a manufacturing stamp on the chassis.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 117, 's_8c5f29f4', 'I want to be a part of the Crimson Phoenix, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 118, 's_8d9faecf', 'That''s mission failure, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 119, 's_8ddbf95b', 'I understand. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 120, 's_8e9d0848', '[nod]'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 121, 's_8ee4f074', 'Oh, THAT Admiral Burke. I thought you meant someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 122, 's_907e88bd', 'Lucky me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 123, 's_914a4095', 'I didn''t know the Empire was working on new designs.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 124, 's_91502216', 'I''ll fly escort for those Rebel spies.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 125, 's_917742b8', 'I don''t think you do. I think you''ll flame out on your first mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 126, 's_9288900f', 'I understand.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 127, 's_92a98982', 'With any luck, our technicians will figure out a way to put that new technology into OUR ships. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 128, 's_954ec468', 'We''ve heard advance warnings about this fleet, but we didn''t expect so see operational models so soon. The Empire is moving quickly.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 129, 's_958c1289', 'As long as they can keep up! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 130, 's_9722b330', 'I don''t think Imperials built these ships. I think they''re using a third-party group.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 131, 's_987445c9', 'Thank you, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 132, 's_9b43a7ee', 'Yes sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 133, 's_9b578280', 'Where''s that Imperial ship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 134, 's_9c236354', 'Excellent.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 135, 's_9e999838', 'I don''t really like Corellia this time of year.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 136, 's_9fc24a78', 'Are you transferring me out of this unit?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 137, 's_9fcfe841', 'Bring me one of those birds. Do whatever it takes. You''re cleared to leave for Dathomir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 138, 's_a33056f4', 'Absolutely not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 139, 's_a582cadc', 'These new Imperial ships constitute an imminent threat. We need to know what, EXACTLY, we''re up against.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 140, 's_a58b9067', 'Duty pay?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 141, 's_a5b93c4d', 'You''re cleared for liftoff.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 142, 's_a71cdd82', 'The new ships will be part of this fleet. But you''ve got more than ship technology to worry about. I''ll tell you now, based on the numbers, they''ve got us beat. No doubt about it. They''ve got far more ships out there than we do. So every single one of my fighters has got to do the job of TEN pilots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 143, 's_a72f79b2', 'Unknown.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 144, 's_a778e999', 'Are you trying to push my buttons? Bad move, soldier. Now listen to me. Obey your orders, don''t give Admiral Burke any of your lip, and pay attention. You could probably learn a thing or two from the Admiral. Now get moving.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 145, 's_a86d6540', 'You''ve already got a mission. I suggest you do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 146, 's_a871501f', 'Report back to me when you''re ready for another assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 147, 's_a95ef734', 'Requesting redeployment!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 148, 's_aa15510b', 'I know. His information has saved our butts more than once. And he''s probably onto something. I''ve never seen so much Imperial activity in this area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 149, 's_ab288b4d', 'OK! Well that''s a good start, soldier. You''ve got some options here. I need a pilot to travel to  the Yavin system and launch a series of attacks against Imperial patrols near the Death Star debris field. We''ve got Rebel smugglers in that system, and they''re doing their best to collect Death Star components for analysis.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 150, 's_ac30ef3', 'And finally, we''ve got several damaged freighters out there. Imperial forces attacked them, thinking they carried Rebel forces. They didn''t. These are innocent bystanders, and they''ve suffered on account of us, and now they''re sitting ducks. Imperial forces are getting ready to move in and seize those ships. We''re going to save them. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 151, 's_acef64cd', 'I did a good job out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 152, 's_ae002d12', 'Only your commanding officer can assign you a mission. Return to your unit.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 153, 's_afcb06fc', 'Not yet. But you''re on thin ice. Get back out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 154, 's_b0933679', 'Granted. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 155, 's_b1dd06bd', 'Exactly. These are next-generation models. They''re designed to be faster, lighter, more accurate and more deadly than any other Imperial ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 156, 's_b3e9c738', 'I''m ready for anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 157, 's_b659eebb', 'I want you to launch an attack against a TIE bomber. Intel tells us that this bomber is transporting a key piece of machinery to the planet''s surface. I''d like to know just what that piece IS.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 158, 's_b9b83ec5', 'Eh? You don''t fly for the Crimson Phoenix. What are you doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 159, 's_ba8b09ff', 'There is a strange level of Imperial activity taking place around Endor. There are hundreds of men and women working there. They are taking extraordinary measures to hide their activities. We just happened to catch a few irregularities on our radar. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 160, 's_bb9e4a63', 'Understood, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 161, 's_bbd20f83', 'See that it doesn''t. Return to your ship and finish what you started.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 162, 's_bc4f4a10', 'Nope, never heard of him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 163, 's_bc57b086', 'Sounds good to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 164, 's_bed2013a', 'Didn''t I say it was top secret? That generally means they don''t broadcast all the details. I am sure that Admiral Burke will fill you in once you report for duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 165, 's_bf1cdb65', 'Here''s a little something.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 166, 's_c01ad90e', 'They''re going to give us a problem, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 167, 's_c127c173', 'New TIE fighters?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 168, 's_c1c9b365', 'I''ll do whatever I can to help those disabled freighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 169, 's_c2b3ccaa', 'We''re tracking the path of these new ships. They''re scattered across several systems, but they seem to be concentrated around Endor. My guess is, where there''s smoke there''s fire. So let''s take a closer look. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 170, 's_c3bd7a11', 'Amazing. This place is lousy with Imperials! What did you learn?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 171, 's_c5512cb2', 'I''m giving you access to a space assault droid. It''ll help you to get the job done. The droid will take control of the ship, once you''ve disabled the pilot. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 172, 's_c82e9a2f', 'Yes, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 173, 's_c84fe27f', 'You got that right. Tell me, what did you accomplish while you were with Ulvaw''op?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 174, 's_c8a0830d', 'Especially those guns.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 175, 's_c8fa77b8', 'I can''t wait!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 176, 's_c946f118', 'So here''s what we''re going to do. %TU, you''re going to hijack one of those ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 177, 's_cb594529', 'Well soldier, you''ve earned the right to upgrade to a new skill. I expect all my pilots to continue their training, at all times! Pick a skill.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 178, 's_cbcd1643', 'We were able to capture several spies, a security officer, and an Imperial defector.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 179, 's_cc7b5947', 'See that you do. Head for the Endor system immediately. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 180, 's_cee1914e', 'Solid knowledge of your onboard droid is essential.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 181, 's_d059f8aa', 'Those TIE fighters are tough!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 182, 's_d0fd857b', 'I''ll take it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 183, 's_d157e1de', 'I''m looking for missions.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 184, 's_d30b6d26', 'Congratulations, soldier. You''re officially a part of the Crimson Phoenix.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 185, 's_d3234c01', 'Alliance leaders need to know that they can deploy a full Crimson Phoenix squad at any time. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 186, 's_d55f2579', 'I''m ready to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 187, 's_d5a98554', 'I have your duty pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 188, 's_d68a9f0a', 'At least you''ll have the element of surprise. They''re not expecting an attack. I want you to get out there and hit as many of them as you can. We''ve uploaded coordinates to your ships computer. You''re clear to leave for the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 189, 's_d82b46ba', 'I''ll try to bring it back in one piece.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 190, 's_d9cced1f', 'Absolutely.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 191, 's_daa1d4f4', 'I''m interested in heavy Alliance component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 192, 's_db77876d', 'I sure as heck am not going to put an untested pilot in charge of important missions. I need to test you out. See what you''re made of. Pilots in this unit have nerves of steel. Do you have nerves of steel?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 193, 's_e075ea09', 'You''ll be serving under Admiral Willham Burke. You may have heard of him. He''s commander of the Fourth Battle Group stationed in the Outer Rim, two time recipient of the Alliance Medal of Valor, and one of the finest field commanders in the business.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 194, 's_e1da7727', 'I can handle it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 195, 's_e2a4b15e', 'Don''t talk to me until you''ve completed your mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 196, 's_e2aefddd', 'Always. And in the meantime, we''ve got to find a way to deal with these new TIE fighters. It''s going to take a while before we find a way to modify their technology for our X-Wings. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 197, 's_e42b260e', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 198, 's_e7488f0b', 'You''ll find the Admiral on Corellia, in Doaba Guerfel. You had better prepare yourself. The Fourth Battle Group takes on some of the most dangerous and difficult tasks in the Outer Rim.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 199, 's_e816c4f3', 'I''m not following, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 200, 's_e81875f0', 'I don''t think they did this in-house. I think the Empire is working with a third party.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 201, 's_e9ad7c02', 'All right. I think you''re ready to at least FLY with my squad.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 202, 's_ea7b0fb2', 'Up ''til now, we''ve been able to level the playing field just by gutting it out.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 203, 's_eb925c97', 'I thought you said you WANTED to be a part of the Crimson Phoenix.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 204, 's_ef167e72', 'Where am I headed?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 205, 's_efdacfde', 'I''m interested in hyper-maneuverable starfighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 206, 's_f00c2726', 'Personally? Not much. Ulvaw''op was in charge of interrogations, and he wasn''t exactly forthcoming with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 207, 's_f252cbc8', 'I can assure you that Admiral Burke will not be interested in how great you think you are. He''ll expect you to shut your mouth and do your job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 208, 's_f3bbd7e7', 'I''m not so sure that''s a good idea. I''ll give you one more shot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 209, 's_f3c74323', 'Well now you''re going to do what I tell you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 210, 's_f3eda860', 'I''d like to know who''s building these ships. They could answer a lot of questions for us. '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 211, 's_f60ad3e3', 'You''ve earned it. You''ve done everything I''ve asked, and then some.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 212, 's_f689a56f', 'The Alliance wants to know one thing. They want to know if OUR best can handle THEIR best. And this is where they get their answer. Right here. Right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 213, 's_f69a2921', 'Glad to hear it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 214, 's_f73581de', 'Now listen. Based on the numbers, they''ve got us beat. No doubt about it. They''ve got far more ships out there than we do. So every single one of my fighters has got to do the job of TEN pilots.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 215, 's_f7cbbb30', 'And you''re in luck. You''re going to be one of the first Rebel soldiers to get an up close look at the new Imperial ships.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 216, 's_fa396956', 'What''s the project?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 217, 's_fb05125c', 'If Ulvaw''op would just TELL us something, maybe we could anticipate these kinds of problems! '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 218, 's_fb3d31a9', 'You earned it. Good work out there.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 219, 's_fb9f7cd6', 'I''ll deliver it to you personally.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 220, 's_fbb318e5', 'How can I help, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_tier4.stf', 221, 's_fed525e5', 'Let''s see how you do. This is your big break, %TU. Don''t screw it up.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 3, 's_111cd324', 'And with you as well. The Major is currently located at the labor outpost on the moon Yavin 4. Good luck, %NU. I know you will serve the Alliance well on Yavin 4.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 4, 's_11327023', 'The patrol was interrupted by a TIE attack.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 5, 's_1500b5d6', 'You know, all the pilots say that you''re the BEST!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 6, 's_1583743c', 'Do you have any missions I could fly?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 7, 's_1622e456', 'Good to meet you. My name is Da''la Socuna and I am here on behalf of the Rebel Alliance naval forces. I train pilots to fly and fight.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 8, 's_16949037', 'Outstanding work, pilot! Get some rest. Check back with me later for a new assignment.  Also, I''ve got something extra for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 9, 's_1809c6fc', 'What is the location?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 10, 's_1895ee37', 'Will you train me yet?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 11, 's_19d3ee2b', 'I can''t help you, smuggler. Try sniffing around Wayfar... you''ll find something that suits you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 12, 's_19ec1fce', 'Just how exactly do you expect to be a Rebel Alliance pilot without a ship?  Here.  I''ll add these access codes for a small fighter to your datapad.  You ought to upgrade to a better ship pretty soon, though.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 13, 's_1a1806c1', 'Okay, okay. I''m sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 14, 's_1b488c78', 'I''m... not sure'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 15, 's_1c2f3f24', 'The Force be with you, then...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 16, 's_1d3d8b65', 'You don''t look like any sort of pilot to me.  I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 17, 's_1e626caa', 'Of course. Those supplies are critical!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 18, 's_1eed018e', 'Fun? This is war, my friend. There''s nothing ''fun'' about having your friends swept away by the bloody tides of battle, losing your home, your future, everything that ever meant anything to you...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 19, 's_1f0828c5', 'Report mission status!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 20, 's_1f7c77cd', 'The Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 21, 's_22ce0785', 'No, you''re not!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 22, 's_2313ac9e', 'What are you talking about?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 23, 's_23567daf', 'I know that you are making the right decision, friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 24, 's_236daee8', 'So would you like a duty?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 25, 's_2427d272', 'Well... I''m sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 26, 's_2477af4a', 'For the Alliance... always.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 27, 's_26970ef', 'I am interested in basic starfighter training.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 28, 's_2784686', 'So the Empire knows a bit more than we expected. This is very bad news, pilot. Alliance HQ will want to learn of this attack as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 29, 's_288ce434', 'Ma''am! Thank you, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 30, 's_29b9c1a7', 'Use your zone map interface to locate space stations while in-flight. Or - use the automatic ''landing waypoint'' that your ship computer creates for you when you take off. The ''landing waypoint'' can be activated from your datapad. Just find your way back to that point when you are done with your assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 31, 's_2aab204b', 'Are you ready to redeem yourself, pilot?!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 32, 's_2adb435', 'Where am I patrolling?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 33, 's_2b43e56e', 'Good luck to you, pilot! The Major is currently located at the labor outpost on the moon Yavin 4. Hope to see you again when this war is over...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 34, 's_2c052357', 'Good to see you again, pilot! I will hear your report, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 35, 's_2c3fe4f', 'Listen, lady...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 36, 's_2c8ee9d', 'There is more I have to teach you, pilot. What areas interest you at the moment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 37, 's_2cb7683a', 'I feel our transports need escort...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 38, 's_2d4bb338', 'May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 39, 's_2da98563', 'Great work! Now, get some rest and check back with me later. I will have more for you to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 40, 's_2dfa0bf9', 'When do I get paid?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 41, 's_2e56f341', 'You''re not supposed to be here, pilot. You''re assigned to Major Eker''s group on Yavin 4.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 42, 's_2ea6d944', 'Really?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 43, 's_2f0da72f', 'Superb! We have located a rally point from which the Empire has staged their recent aggressions. Go to this point and bring down a veteran TIE fighter pilot - the ringleader, as it were.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 44, 's_2f8ec5d4', 'Report on the TIE veteran target!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 45, 's_2fdfe99f', 'Then we shall begin. Welcome to the Rebel Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 46, 's_306de5c', 'Excellent. Find any Imperial Tie Fighters in the Tatooine system and take out at least four of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 47, 's_30c1fec7', 'And also with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 48, 's_31123adb', 'Just four points, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 49, 's_31d45080', 'The Alliance has my eternal faith.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 50, 's_33823c2e', 'Try to keep this one from blowing up, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 51, 's_33e1f5f2', 'Your kindness is radiant, my friend. We could really use someone like you in our organization. Are you willing to place your trust in the Rebel Alliance?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 52, 's_347e4a03', 'Ma''am! Yes, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 53, 's_34bc4ce6', 'Yeah, right. Prove it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 54, 's_370822d1', 'Yes'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 55, 's_38485fa9', 'Not so fast, Pilot!  You need to complete a few assignments before I''ll train you.  Are you ready?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 56, 's_39f7d683', 'What a surprise. I''ll grant access to one of the refurbished Z95''s we have hidden here on Tatooine. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 57, 's_3b6d2f05', 'Whatever...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 58, 's_3cb5ab17', 'So thrilling... '),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 59, 's_3ccb2ef2', 'I responded to a distress call, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 60, 's_3d693d0', 'I will bring honor to the Alliance, ma''am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 61, 's_3f1a842c', 'Yeah, yeah.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 62, 's_3f30cd7b', '(Brag more)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 63, 's_3f5c320e', 'I know of the rebellion. I want to help!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 64, 's_3fa4f0ff', 'Fine!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 65, 's_40440fa', 'The TIE Vet is dead, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 66, 's_406f8d3e', 'It will take a bit to decode your ship sensor data. In the meantime, we have another assignment for you... if you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 67, 's_4101ebdd', 'Make me a part of the Rebel Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 68, 's_4136c2df', 'Thank you very much.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 69, 's_42ae7917', 'The Alliance has you covered. I''ll grant access to one of the refurbished Z95''s we have hidden here on Tatooine. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 70, 's_434aa00b', 'Make sure you stay in one piece, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 71, 's_4416b2d0', 'Outstanding. Your responsibility is to run a short-range, four-point patrol. When you are finished, your ship''s sensor data will be downloaded to the Alliance ''net for Intel to review. Any questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 72, 's_4536f86f', 'Yes. If you''re lucky...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 73, 's_463f3bbc', 'I anticipated as much. Good work, pilot! Check back with me soon for your next assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 74, 's_4738e99f', 'How do I find a space station?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 75, 's_492ca0a5', 'Fine. You''re in.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 76, 's_4ba4be80', 'What was that? I didn''t catch that...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 77, 's_4c1acfbf', 'And you performed beautifully. The Alliance thanks you.  I''ve got something special for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 78, 's_4c695dbd', 'No.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 79, 's_4c85e14a', 'I think you know why.  You don''t seem very dedicated to the cause.  I''ve heard reports that you''ve even been fighting FOR the Empire!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 80, 's_4d2987d3', 'No I haven''t!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 81, 's_4dd4aa17', 'Then you''ve been framed, %TU.  There''s nothing I can do about it.  You need to clear your name before you can fly any more missions for the Rebel Alliance.  Improve your faction standing!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 82, 's_4e8bbd4d', 'The Force be with you, friend...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 83, 's_4f90bab3', 'I was unable to finish.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 84, 's_4ffd4b9d', 'I am interested in a duty mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 85, 's_5100b9ac', 'You''re learning, then. Good. Try again!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 86, 's_52efbcd5', 'I hear you had some surprises up there?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 87, 's_54ec182b', 'I failed to destroy the targets.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 88, 's_55ce5bee', 'Nothing you can''t handle. Destroy the veteran TIE pilot leader at a specific rally point. Come back here... if you survive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 89, 's_55ea0c1b', 'Relax, lady. I didn''t mean anything by that!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 90, 's_57a53dcf', 'Where do I find them?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 91, 's_57c3f83e', 'Always good to see another Rebel pilot... but you''re not one of my recruits. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 92, 's_583707c4', '(Lie about what happened.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 93, 's_59c382bc', 'Good day, pilot. Are you here for elective duty mission? There is still plenty of work for us here in Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 94, 's_59dceadb', 'Now you need to go to the starport. Go inside and look for a ''starship terminal.'' Use the terminal to launch your starship into space. When you launch, a waypoint will be created to help guide you back to your landing spot. When you want to land - comm the space station and ask for landing clearance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 95, 's_5aa307dc', 'Piece o''cake, lady.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 96, 's_5b4a6885', 'It''s a flightsuit.  You''ll look like a real pilot, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 97, 's_5bfac9f1', 'Where''s my starship?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 98, 's_5c7ecf43', 'That''s good to know. You''re dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 99, 's_5d157c36', 'Just try not to stir up any pirate action - and don''t fire on any Imperials unless they threaten you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 100, 's_5f15e36', 'I know only that it involves researching the Death Star space station technology. With so much wreckage in the area, the Alliance has an opportunity to deconstruct the Empire''s elite doomsday weapon... and prepare an adequate response if they were to build another one.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 101, 's_6106187c', 'What is a duty mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 102, 's_616dbcc8', 'Save it! I''m assigning a new mission to you. Don''t come back until it''s finished!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 103, 's_618c3a1c', 'Very well, %NU.  Just find a Rebel Recruiter and tell him you want to join the Rebel Alliance.  He''ll sign you up with the ground forces.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 104, 's_61c8b0c2', 'Then you will be glad to know we have reliable information that the Empire is rallying TIE fighter forces at a nav point high above Tatooine. They are being led by an experienced TIE veteran. Eliminate this TIE veteran pilot with extreme prejudice. This should bring their plans crashing to the ground.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 105, 's_6221bd32', 'Congratulations, pilot. Our immediate goals have been met. We have time for training. What areas of Alliance piloting interest you the most?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 106, 's_6360ad02', 'Any Imperial activities. This is a little-used Alliance supply route. It will become more important in the near future - and we are concerned that the Empire has knowledge of our operations.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 107, 's_63642f8', 'It appears that our time together has come to an end, pilot. Alliance HQ wants you reallocated to special operations on Yavin 4 and placed under the command of Major Eker... immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 108, 's_63c4c628', 'You must try harder! The Alliance doesn''t stand a chance with pilots like you... with your attitude!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 109, 's_640d20f4', 'Yes ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 110, 's_6440d5e7', 'Target the space station and then comm the space station. Most likely the station will recognize you and will comm you first. But if you are in a hurry, use SHIFT+C to target the space station and open communication with the station commander.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 111, 's_648f0fc', 'You really disappoint me, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 112, 's_64b4e5f7', '(Brag about blasting TIE fighters)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 113, 's_658f174d', 'What am I looking for?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 114, 's_6657b5a3', 'It wasn''t my fault!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 115, 's_66ae2bdf', 'Then tell me what you want or get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 116, 's_66dc0f99', 'Interesting. Alliance HQ has a number of possible Imperial rally points for you to investigate. These ''duty'' missions have been prepared for you to gain some much needed space combat experience. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 117, 's_67104689', 'He has joined the infinite, Da''la.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 118, 's_680cda08', 'How do I get back from space?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 119, 's_68ee2577', 'I could not finish the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 120, 's_6a0aba27', 'I would like to patrol Tatooine space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 121, 's_6a150013', 'Let''s have some details.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 122, 's_6a7a0499', '(Brag about blasting even more TIE fighters)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 123, 's_6b490480', '(Salute) Affirmative!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 124, 's_6b52240', 'Not just yet, Pilot!  I have a few more assignments for you before I can train you.  Are you ready to get to work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 125, 's_6bb935f1', 'Yes, Da''la. I am ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 126, 's_6cf8e18b', '(Tell a bold lie.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 127, 's_6d7d5f1b', 'All targets eliminated, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 128, 's_6e646769', 'No, thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 129, 's_6f3e992', 'What can you tell me of Major Eker?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 130, 's_705f0112', 'Train me to fly for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 131, 's_7077f9f7', 'Outstanding!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 132, 's_71239ef6', 'I don''t want to hear it. Consider yourself lucky to be alive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 133, 's_71370b1e', 'Good! Try again!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 134, 's_740e2e66', 'Sorry, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 135, 's_74474b33', 'What is our next move, ma''am?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 136, 's_7478cd28', 'Will you train me after this?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 137, 's_7553991', 'Yeah, yeah!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 138, 's_766563c7', 'Nothing I couldn''t handle.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 139, 's_768b62bc', 'Just let me in your club, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 140, 's_784540b7', 'Greetings, pilot! Are you ready for your assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 141, 's_78679b31', 'Sounds like fun. Where do I sign?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 142, 's_790724e4', 'Then it is fortunate that we have met. I can induct you to the Alliance pilot training program immediately.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 143, 's_79e3a94', 'When you''re done with the mission, slaymo.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 144, 's_7a27e11', 'I''ll blast any Imperial crosses my path!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 145, 's_7d15be50', 'I am more than ready, Da''la.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 146, 's_7d2cd92d', 'Then it is my pleasure to welcome you to the Alliance space navy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 147, 's_7d4eaca7', 'I don''t know.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 148, 's_7e1ada01', 'Yeah, yeah...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 149, 's_7e77b672', 'Shouldn''t you be thanking me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 150, 's_7ed5fec3', 'I want to be part of the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 151, 's_7eff4d79', 'Perhaps you will show Major Eker more respect. The Major is currently located at the labor outpost on the moon Yavin 4. Good luck, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 152, 's_7f3c5f06', 'We can''t hold your hand all the time pilot. Search the system, you''re bound to find some!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 153, 's_7f9b8387', 'Why not?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 154, 's_8001a590', 'Outstanding! Find any Imperial TIE Fighters in the Tatooine system and take out at least four of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 155, 's_8234fa32', 'Yes... I am willing. Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 156, 's_8268c49d', 'We can skip the moral lesson, sister.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 157, 's_831a22ee', 'I know the dangers'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 158, 's_834edaa1', 'Good. Then get back out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 159, 's_841d27db', 'Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 160, 's_84d7bb8e', 'Your enthusiasm is welcome, friend!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 161, 's_855c7780', 'I''ve heard that Eker was a decorated Imperial pilot and leader of a vicious TIE squadron for several years... until he sickened of their tactics. I believe he defected after being ordered to fire on an unarmed medical transport.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 162, 's_8631e93', 'I don''t want to leave. I want to help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 163, 's_8685174d', 'I do, ma''am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 164, 's_8720792f', 'You will fly a four-point patrol above Tatooine. We will need your ship''s sensor data when you are finished. Stay hidden... sorry to say, I have a bad feeling about this one.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 165, 's_877e028c', 'Ma''am! I want another chance, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 166, 's_87a8cca7', 'How will I know this pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 167, 's_8916a30', 'It should not be difficult. He should be one of very few veteran TIE fighter pilots in this vicinity. But, if you want to be thorough... bring down any TIE fighter pilots you see in this area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 168, 's_8a4652c6', 'So now what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 169, 's_8a78d00e', 'Only TIE fighters, ma''am?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 170, 's_8a7cca63', 'You got LUCKY! You need to get your act together or you''ll be space dust. Understand me?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 171, 's_8b9926b6', 'Affirmative. Report when your patrol is complete.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 172, 's_8be95ab4', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 173, 's_8c272224', 'I am interested in starfighter survival tactics.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 174, 's_8da0fa08', 'Are you sure about that, %NU?  We could officially put your name on the roster, but even if you remain Covert, there''s always a chance of an Imperial uncovering you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 175, 's_8e0b0814', 'Hm. You''re not making any sense. Why don''t you try this mission again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 176, 's_8ef10336', 'Affirmative, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 177, 's_90087734', 'Bad news for you, %NU.  Alliance command has grounded you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 178, 's_90377ed4', 'Affirmative!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 179, 's_9109c202', 'An Alliance freighter needed my help.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 180, 's_91d36035', 'I think you''re going to get fried up there if you don''t take this seriously.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 181, 's_92e1301f', 'Don''t worry. I will be fine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 182, 's_93470245', 'How should I stay hidden?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 183, 's_9480f430', 'I am interested in droid interface basics.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 184, 's_9487e7cd', 'Something might be looking for you, pilot... so be careful.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 185, 's_949ea1ef', 'Just four should do it. We want the Empire to understand that their intel is compromised. This will buy us some time for other operations. Any more questions, or are you ready to shut up and get to work?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 186, 's_95310ec0', 'You have done great things here in Tatooine, %NU... but the Alliance needs you on Yavin. The stakes in this conflict are continuing to rise, and our pilots must go where they are needed. I am sure you will flourish under Major Eker''s command.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 187, 's_95ad8f55', 'You bring honor to the Alliance, my friend. This was no easy task.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 188, 's_968c130f', 'No. I will not!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 189, 's_96e50d8', 'Here is an update to your procedures manual.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 190, 's_9757e73a', 'You''ll be covering a little-used Alliance supply route. It''s become more important in recent days because of Imperial activity outside the asteroid belt. We have plans for this area, and need to know that we''ll remain unseen.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 191, 's_97e129cd', 'Where is the rally point?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 192, 's_97e13b2e', '(Brief Da''la with all due accuracy)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 193, 's_987055b5', 'We can always use cannon fodder. Welcome to the Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 194, 's_994615e7', 'This is good - for some day you shall rejoin the infinite... and I may then be allowed to rest.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 195, 's_9a159641', 'When you are done with your patrol, you will need to find your way to a space station above Tatooine. Communicate with the station operatives and request landing clearance. The rest is automatic.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 196, 's_9b562c5a', 'Don''t make this more than it is, pilot. This is not ''search and destroy'' - this is a sensor sweep. Stay out of trouble. Come back in one piece!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 197, 's_9c146b24', 'I don''t like what I''m hearing, pilot! Report, now!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 198, 's_9e21ae0d', 'I truly hope so.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 199, 's_9f625af9', 'That''s better! You''re assignment is a four-point patrol above Tatooine. Keep your sensors running the whole time - and when you come back, we''ll want to download the data.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 200, 's_a018cd7e', 'Let''s give Alliance HQ a moment to digest this information. A change of plans may be in store...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 201, 's_a13bb0b0', 'I hope I don''t regret this. I hereby admit you into the Alliance pilot training program.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 202, 's_a20f8416', 'The recent Imperial activity is being led by a veteran TIE fighter pilot. We know of his location. Fly to the nav point, and eliminate this pilot with extreme prejudice.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 203, 's_a42932d7', 'I will need a starship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 204, 's_a45033de', 'Okay, so it was mine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 205, 's_a46d9f8b', 'Our next move? We wait. Alliance HQ is going to want time to review our situation and re-evaluate our combat options. Check back with me later...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 206, 's_a5ecfd93', 'You think you can handle a simple four-point patrol?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 207, 's_a6c2aaa1', 'Then you rejoice! You''re still alive, you''re done with your assignment, and life is good... right? Come back here when you''re done so I can give you your next assignment.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 208, 's_a6ec653a', 'Focus! You need to get over yourself or you won''t be any use to us.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 209, 's_a7a6018f', 'Hm. Interesting. Are you ready to try again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 210, 's_a87c06b', 'I already know what happened. Do you have anything to say for yourself?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 211, 's_a89f2288', 'The Empire plans to move several wings of TIE fighters into this zone. If they are allowed to succeed, it could spell disaster for the Alliance here on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 212, 's_a8b44679', '(Brag about defeating the TIE Veteran)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 213, 's_a9163b5e', 'Whose fault was it, then?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 214, 's_a93c5fce', 'Well, it takes all kinds, doesn''t it? Welcome to the Rebel Alliance.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 215, 's_a994ca63', 'For the Alliance!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 216, 's_aa521016', 'Looking for something in particular?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 217, 's_aadc4812', 'Well, I''ll admit that I didn''t prep you for a TIE fighter attack. How do you think you''ll fare on your second try?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 218, 's_ab56e9c6', 'Do you have more target information?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 219, 's_ab640430', 'Critical to say the least, my friend. We must resume supply flights as soon as possible. To accomplish this, we need you to sweep a five-point area. Again, your ship sensor data will be used to plot an effective route for our larger transports.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 220, 's_abc65d0', 'Okay. Bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 221, 's_ac596e57', 'Outstanding! I''ll see you when you''re done!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 222, 's_aceff31e', 'Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 223, 's_adacb6c2', 'Well... the Empire''s?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 224, 's_add5c243', 'Well... do something about it!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 225, 's_ae1edd02', 'While you were away we gathered enough information to put the Imperial fleet movement out of commission. Are you ready to take flight again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 226, 's_aed0dff', 'I will require a starship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 227, 's_b0778713', 'The Empire does not yet know that their fleet info has been compromised. Strike the new TIE fighters moving into this area with extreme prejudice, and they will have no choice but to halt their invasion strategy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 228, 's_b2133e77', 'Not a problem. I''ll grant access to one of the refurbished Z95''s we have hidden here on Tatooine. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 229, 's_b2683b4a', 'Piece of cake.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 230, 's_b2c15146', 'Unfortunately, since you are not part of my unit, I cannot assign you missions. You should probably return and speak with your commanding officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 231, 's_b3408be1', 'Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 232, 's_b3bebc5e', 'How do I get there?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 233, 's_b3e9c738', 'I''m ready for anything.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 234, 's_b5719d30', 'Then get back out there and make it happen, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 235, 's_b7af9aa', 'Are you kidding me?! Not your fault? I have grown so sick of your attitude... I just can''t stand it! Tell me you''re going to get back up there and do it right this time!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 236, 's_b7b3029f', 'Get on with it, lady.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 237, 's_b91ba199', 'Outstanding! Check back with me when you are ready for your next assignment!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 238, 's_b9c55cab', 'I failed the mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 239, 's_b9c90f82', 'Well... maybe you are.  But this is more important, right now.  I''ll make a deal with you, complete this mission and THEN I will train you.  This is urgent, so I hope you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 240, 's_baae2f70', '(Salute) The Force be with you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 241, 's_bac616e6', 'I''m ready for my next mission!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 242, 's_bb68963e', 'You''ll be the death of me, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 243, 's_bb761ef6', 'This is unacceptable! You get back out there and finish this mission, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 244, 's_bc865091', 'Probably.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 245, 's_bd53784c', 'Ma''am, I require a starship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 246, 's_bda1eb17', 'Your ship sensor data has been completely decoded. The Alliance supply route is entirely compromised. We need you to scout a new route for our in-system supply convoy. Are you up to it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 247, 's_bf55aded', 'Great. You can either patrol the Tatooine system looking for Imperials to send to the scrapyard, or you can help escort Alliance transports. What sounds good to you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 248, 's_c19ed115', 'You''ve got your assignment, and the control device for your ship in your datapad.  Go to the Starport and access the terminal to launch into space.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 249, 's_c261cfae', 'No problem.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 250, 's_c3d77bb4', 'Expect the rally point to be patrolled by junior TIE cadets. They will be quick to respond if they see you first - so be very careful. Keep your eye out for the veteran TIE fighter pilot, eliminate him, and get back here as soon as you can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 251, 's_c4b9eaff', 'Maybe you should try again. And this time... don''t fail!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 252, 's_c4c3d546', 'How do I comm the space station?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 253, 's_c5ac7e76', 'I don''t have any pressing assignments right now, but I do have some elective duty missions if you''re interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 254, 's_c5cc6139', 'It''s about time.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 255, 's_c62cae3d', 'Good luck, my friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 256, 's_c7939f2f', 'What are we looking for?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 257, 's_c7afc225', 'Let''s upgrade your starship license then, shall we?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 258, 's_c8fa77b8', 'I can''t wait!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 259, 's_c92d07b4', 'Sure. Why not.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 260, 's_c93f1cdc', 'Here are some new droid programs. Use them wisely.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 261, 's_c9c9c683', 'What do you think, sweetie?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 262, 's_ca06f3a2', 'We cannot afford for you to fail, pilot. The Empire outnumbers us - outguns us... the only hope we have is to out-fight them! Are you ready to try again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 263, 's_ca0c0b13', 'What''s wrong with you? Get out there and prove your worth!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 264, 's_ca51315f', 'Always.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 265, 's_cac4a12c', 'Don''t worry, I''ll have a gonzo patrol ready for you when you come back!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 266, 's_cb60fa8', 'A duty mission is a good way to earn experience. Especially for a pilot looking for training like yourself. Duty missions have no real end. You just finish when you finish, know what I mean? So what do you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 267, 's_cc82ca6b', 'Good! Your orders have been renewed. Good luck, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 268, 's_cd0ae4c4', 'The Force be with you, Da''la...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 269, 's_cd1af2b9', 'Outstanding! Good luck, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 270, 's_cd68fc71', 'Well, I''m not getting any younger.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 271, 's_ce2c09ec', 'Mission accomplished, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 272, 's_ce6b43af', 'We have reason to believe that the Empire is moving a wing of TIE fighters directly into an Alliance supply route. We need to know more.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 273, 's_cf04e474', 'What more do we know of this TIE veteran?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 274, 's_cfba4c0a', 'We exchanged messages through the Alliance ''net right after the Battle of Yavin. He was in need of pilots then, too. So, we didn''t discuss anything outside of that. Of course, I have heard rumors of his history before joining the Alliance... but nothing concrete.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 275, 's_d01d0154', 'No, never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 276, 's_d0233b4b', 'The Force be with us.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 277, 's_d038a005', 'And then what?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 278, 's_d18e28ba', 'Maybe I got that completely backwards. Who knows?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 279, 's_d497fa22', 'Charming. What can I do to get you out of here?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 280, 's_d4f7f6d5', 'And with you as well.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 281, 's_d5bc59d9', 'I have adjusted your pilot certification to handle more intricate components.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 282, 's_d5c41154', 'What rumors?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 283, 's_d6c8f764', 'Heh. What do you know. An Imperial. Get out of here while you still can!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 284, 's_d6e44b20', 'You''re right. The Alliance is attempting to move a large number of refugees out of Tatooine space. Protect as many of them as you can. These ''duty'' missions have been prepared for you to gain some much needed space combat experience. You can return to the ground at any time when you feel that you have learned enough.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 285, 's_d70dba34', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 286, 's_d731f764', '(Shrug and smile.)'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 287, 's_d779178a', 'What other targets are in the area?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 288, 's_d7f5cd5b', 'You have no clue, do you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 289, 's_d806feaa', 'A number of slightly-used Z95 starships are parked around Tatooine... hidden from Imperial eyes. The codes I uploaded to your datapad will allow you to assume control of one. Just head down to the starport...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 290, 's_d8913d37', 'If it is my duty, Da''la.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 291, 's_d89a93ff', '%TU, you''re too impatient.  Right now I need you to scout that supply route.  We''ll talk about training later.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 292, 's_d912490', 'I am interested in basic Alliance component use.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 293, 's_db6b2243', 'We are kindred spirits, Da''la Socuna.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 294, 's_dcbc639a', 'The mission is a success, Da''la.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 295, 's_dcf7d387', 'I don''t think this is going to work out, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 296, 's_ddea1965', 'What''s the job, honey?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 297, 's_e03d1a04', 'Hm. This does not sound like a random encounter. I would bet the Empire has knowledge of our operations here. Alliance HQ isn''t going to like this report... but I''m very glad you''re safe and sound.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 298, 's_e095ac8', 'I need a space ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 299, 's_e0cb3e19', 'I''m ready to enlist with the ground forces!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 300, 's_e24d9d51', 'You already have. Good luck to you... I hope to see you again very soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 301, 's_e28249ac', 'I''ll be back in a snap!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 302, 's_e28bc942', 'Hmph. Take off. Find any Imperial Tie Fighters in the Tatooine system and take out at least four of them.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 303, 's_e2a3d627', 'Fly there, Pilot.  Your ship is equipped with a hyperdrive.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 304, 's_e31d65b7', 'The duty logs indicate that you are in mid-mission. We have nothing to discuss until you are finished.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 305, 's_e42b260e', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 306, 's_e9da2a94', 'More TIE fighters, huh?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 307, 's_eab1caa8', 'I''m not in the habit of making excuses.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 308, 's_eb7aaed2', 'Yes I am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 309, 's_ed5af630', 'Excellent. Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 310, 's_eff4eef6', '%TU, isn''t it?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 311, 's_f1147d11', 'There is none, it is your job to find them pilot. Search the Tatooine system for targets of opportunity.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 312, 's_f29cdd1', 'Understood, my friend. I''ll grant access to one of the refurbished Z95''s we have hidden here on Tatooine. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 313, 's_f2ef125b', 'Lucky for us.  Here''s a little bonus for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 314, 's_f4642ca3', 'It''s a multipocket bandolier.  I''d get you a flightsuit but I don''t think I have one that would fit you... anyway, this will help you keep your things organized.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 315, 's_f4cc85fa', 'Not very much. You may find more than one in the general area - but Alliance intelligence indicates that the Empire has charged one veteran TIE pilot with coordinating aggressions in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 316, 's_f5255b8a', 'Major Eker and his special operations team have a wide-range of responsibilities on Yavin 4. Before you head off, I want you to appreciate just how dangerous this assignment could be.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 317, 's_f6e9edd', 'You shall have one. I''ll grant access to one of the refurbished Z95''s we have hidden here on Tatooine. Are you ready for your first assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 318, 's_f7ebcc5f', 'Will you fail a second time if I re-assign the mission to you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 319, 's_f80372b3', 'I''m ready for training?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 320, 's_f843dc6a', '(Salute) Yes, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 321, 's_f892eb03', 'I make no guarantees.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 322, 's_fb7175d6', 'Get your act together!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 323, 's_fb9b39e5', 'Report, pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 324, 's_fbac0bde', '(Salute) Ma''am! Yes, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 325, 's_fc1f4e33', 'Okay, fine!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 326, 's_fcd9ce0e', 'This cannot stand, pilot! We need you to take down that Veteran TIE pilot!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 327, 's_fdb94a71', 'What do you know of the Yavin 4 operation?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 328, 's_fe789dac', 'Report!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_1.stf', 329, 's_ffb79794', 'I will complete the mission, ma''am!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 3, 's_113f133e', 'Are you ready for your next assignment?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 4, 's_14bb212a', 'Then get back out there and make it happen!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 5, 's_1d2c155d', 'Hold on, pal. I don''t think you''re ready to work for me, yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 6, 's_1f680e83', 'You sure?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 7, 's_24fcd0f1', 'Well, if you''re not ready - just say so!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 8, 's_30e82ed', 'You''re wasting my time, kid!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 9, 's_32583e8e', 'No, I haven''t even left yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 10, 's_32761c80', 'Excellent! The Force be with you, friend! See you soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 11, 's_32c77056', 'I have nothing to say to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 12, 's_340e3cc', 'How did the sensor sweep go?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 13, 's_3a8e238f', 'What does it pay?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 14, 's_3e8d2533', 'Are you ready for a very dangerous mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 15, 's_4021e802', 'What sort of ships should I target?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 16, 's_4243cd30', 'Get out of here, pirate!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 17, 's_49580a34', 'You know, that would take a long time to explain. Look - I need someone with guts to take flight against a swarm of assassins. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 18, 's_4e1e1511', 'Seems like a waste of resources.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 19, 's_56ea3421', 'You''ll know when you need to know. Talk to the general. She''s bound to have work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 20, 's_57c8489e', 'What should I do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 21, 's_65c6992e', 'Yes, I am ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 22, 's_6c251948', 'You got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 23, 's_704ffa17', 'Tell me about it, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 24, 's_71fdec41', 'Who is Black Sun?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 25, 's_76c732ab', 'I''m not afraid.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 26, 's_7aa2ae19', 'Heh. Get some missions under your belt, friend. Then come talk to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 27, 's_7f5b6f74', 'Good! Eliminate all Black Sun fighters at this nav point and return to me when you are finished.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 28, 's_803bce3f', 'Gonzo dangerous! An INSANE mission that will kill you flat out!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 29, 's_8af71059', 'So. I hear it was pretty rough out there. Would you like to try helping us again?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 30, 's_8d90443c', 'Where exactly?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 31, 's_95ca3dcc', 'Perfect. We have word that a Black Sun assassin force is gathering strength somewhere deep in the Tatooine system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 32, 's_9633bc98', 'How dangerous?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 33, 's_9ac87532', 'The mission is still in-progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 34, 's_9ccfeefa', 'Outstanding! Talk to me when you''re ready to fly again.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 35, 's_9d7e5a09', 'I must decline.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 36, 's_9d805e09', 'They want to cut a hole through the Outer Rim to run spice, and they''re sick of trying to negotiate with the Hutts...'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 37, 's_ad45bcbf', 'Talk to the general. She''ll have work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 38, 's_adb01382', 'The Black Sun are moving in to challenge the Hutts for this bit of the Outer Rim. That means bloodshed, and that''s bad news for us!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 39, 's_add38b4', 'Are you kidding me? This is the Alliance, friend! Straighten up!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 40, 's_b2f0eabb', 'C''mon, I''m just kidding. What say you fly for me? Bust up a Black Sun fighter rally in Quad III?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 41, 's_b65b63e', 'Outstanding! Let me know when you are ready to fly again!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 42, 's_b76bbf5f', 'Good. One of our top pilots is using a modified Y-Wing in this system to gather sensor data for the Alliance. Meet him at the rally point, and make sure he finishes his sensor sweep in one piece!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 43, 's_bf46ea6c', 'Deep in Tatooine system quadrant III. I think they''re prepping to stage an assault on the Hutts... and a lot of our friends could get caught in the cross-fire.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 44, 's_c1cb6e44', 'If you weren''t ready, you should''ve said so!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 45, 's_c49dadaf', 'Sweep is done, and our ship is safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 46, 's_c999ae60', 'Let me at ''em!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 47, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 48, 's_ce77bdfc', 'Hmm. This seems a bit rough.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 49, 's_e3034e87', 'Look for any Black Sun craft in the area. They''ll likely bring skiffs, some fighters, and maybe even a handful of gunboats.'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 50, 's_eeed5bcd', 'What does Black Sun want?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 51, 's_ef7c4c8', 'Do you have a progress report for me, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 52, 's_f3a2a7d2', 'I can''t believe you aborted the first mission I gave you! I hope you''re here to try again, soldier!'),
('string/en/conversation/tatooine_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 53, 's_fc01f22f', 'Those Black Sun fighters are history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 3, 's_13f4f4e9', 'Yes, I already have your employment history compiled. You do not need to speak with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 4, 's_14693cf1', 'What if I decide to continue my service?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 5, 's_2380d732', 'If you choose to continue from where you left off, you will simply return to the person which last gave you a job. You will then serve however he or she deems best. But remember that once you decide you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 6, 's_26df7262', 'I see. Please come back and speak with me when you get a free moment.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 7, 's_2e18346d', 'I don''t have time right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 8, 's_37160714', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Empire again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded again, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Empire. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 9, 's_3c440d33', 'I understand completely. Take all the time you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 10, 's_3cf75f2d', 'What does that entail?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 11, 's_49d330ac', 'Alright, but remember that once you decide to continue, you cannot change your mind. Are you sure that you want to continue your service where you left off?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 12, 's_4b845961', 'Certainly. Simply return and speak with me again when you have made your decision.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 13, 's_4fd35e09', 'YES, I am sure. Reset my employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 14, 's_5c8a1b58', 'Normally, those held in such high esteem as yourself are not asked to perform such services as you have done in the past. However, if you wish, I can reset your employment history with the Empire. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 15, 's_6e88ecc1', 'No, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 16, 's_710595f4', 'I''ve got to be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 17, 's_7837b05f', 'Hello. Ah yes, I know who you are. You have helped the Empire to a degree in the past. Actually I''m glad you stopped by, as I need to ask you some questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 18, 's_8886fdb', 'I don''t believe that you have an employment history with the Empire. You do not need to speak with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 19, 's_906058f6', 'Hello. Yes, I recognize you. Who wouldn''t? You have done great services for the Empire. Actually I''m glad you stopped by, as I need to ask you some questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 20, 's_93e226b7', 'NO, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 21, 's_a76f22bf', 'What if I decide to reset my history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 22, 's_ac97bdc2', 'If you like, I can reset your employment history and you can begin your service again. Otherwise, you can continue your services where you left off. Remember that once you decide, you cannot change your mind. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 23, 's_b193a14c', 'Alright, but keep in mind that once I reset your history, it cannot be undone. Are you sure that you want me to reset your employment history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 24, 's_b7023094', 'OK. What do you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 25, 's_bc41b885', 'Well, in order to keep my head on my shoulders, I have to recompile all the data in a timely fashion, and I need to ask you a question or two regarding your employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 26, 's_bfd7fb6d', 'Can I decide later?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 27, 's_c2663b63', 'You see, I''ve performed a grievous error, and many of the Imperial employment records were lost in a major computer crash. Given the rash nature of Lord Vader, I''m quite lucky to be alive actually.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 28, 's_cc3c10d2', 'I''m sorry, I only keep records for Imperial employees. I must ask you to leave now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 29, 's_cc551f39', 'What does this have to do with me?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 30, 's_ce56f943', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Empire again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Empire. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 31, 's_e3c4a3d5', 'No, do not reset my history. I will continue my service.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 32, 's_ea196d60', 'I understand completely. Please come back and see me again if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 33, 's_ebce22a9', 'NO, wait. Let me think a moment longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 34, 's_f1105bbd', 'Very well, it is done. You may go speak with Kaja Or''zee when you are ready to begin your service again.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 35, 's_f2538a47', 'Very well, it is done. You may continue your service to the Empire where you last left off.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 36, 's_f51b07ff', 'What kind of questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 37, 's_f7565bbd', 'YES, I am sure. I want to continue my service.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_imperial.stf', 38, 's_ff20b1f1', 'Yes, please reset my employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 3, 's_14693cf1', 'What if I decide to continue my service?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 4, 's_2e18346d', 'I don''t have time right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 5, 's_34f17e66', 'Due to an unfortunate incident caused by an irresponsible little droid, CZ-4, all of Lord Jabba''s employment and accounting records were erased.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 6, 's_3ae9c534', 'You have not performed any services for his exaltedness, Jabba the Hutt. I do not need to speak to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 7, 's_3be84186', 'Yes, I do need to speak with you. I have questions that you need to answer.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 8, 's_3cf75f2d', 'What does that entail?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 9, 's_4fd35e09', 'YES, I am sure. Reset my employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 10, 's_555b76aa', 'As you wish. Return to me when you have made your decision.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 11, 's_5cc1a230', 'It would seem that you have performed great services for Jabba in the past, and he has rewarded you well. However, if you wish, I can reset your employment history in our records. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 12, 's_5e8caf64', 'If you like, I can reset your employment history and you may serve Lord Jabba again. Otherwise, you can continue your service to him where you left off. Remember that once you decide, you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 13, 's_630c8b2', 'Very well, it is done. You should speak to Reelo Baruk when you wish to serve his highness, Lord Jabba, again.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 14, 's_6d63d30d', 'As you wish. Come back and speak to me again if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 15, 's_6e88ecc1', 'No, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 16, 's_710595f4', 'I''ve got to be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 17, 's_72907ccb', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist Jabba again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded again, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the eyes of Jabba himself. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 18, 's_741d0966', 'If you choose to continue from where you left off, you will simply return to the person which last gave you a job. That person will then tell you how you may best serve Jabba. But remember that once you decide you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 19, 's_866cf013', 'I see. What do you need me for?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 20, 's_93e226b7', 'NO, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 21, 's_960270ff', 'Very well. But do not take long.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 22, 's_9ef848f9', 'I will answer your questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 23, 's_a76f22bf', 'What if I decide to reset my history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 24, 's_adccd297', 'Your services for Jabba have already been recorded. I have no need to speak to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 25, 's_b193a14c', 'Alright, but keep in mind that once I reset your history, it cannot be undone. Are you sure that you want me to reset your employment history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 26, 's_badb4859', 'Remember that once you decide to continue, you cannot change your mind. Are you sure that you want to continue your services to Jabba where you left off?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 27, 's_bfd7fb6d', 'Can I decide later?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 28, 's_c1ff278a', 'I must recompile all of the data that was lost. For that reason, I must ask you some questions.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 29, 's_c7528c3b', 'I am sure you can imagine the turmoil it caused. Those on Jabba''s payroll are no longer getting paid, and those in debt to him, were free of their obligations. Needless to say, the CZ droid responsible was... disciplined.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 30, 's_e11b3d7c', 'Keep in mind that once I reset your history, it cannot be undone. Are you sure that you want me to reset your employment history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 31, 's_e3c4a3d5', 'No, do not reset my history. I will continue my service.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 32, 's_eac2e473', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist Lord Jabba again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the eyes of Jabba the Hutt. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 33, 's_ebce22a9', 'NO, wait. Let me think a moment longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 34, 's_edb238bc', 'Go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 35, 's_f3139d0', 'Very well. Return when you are available.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 36, 's_f51b07ff', 'What kind of questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 37, 's_f7565bbd', 'YES, I am sure. I want to continue my service.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 38, 's_faf7c09a', 'Very well, it is done. You may continue your service to the almighty Jabba the Hutt where you last left off.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_jabba.stf', 39, 's_ff20b1f1', 'Yes, please reset my employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 3, 's_11f0619b', 'Alright, but keep in mind that once I reset your history, it cannot be undone. Are you sure that you want me to reset your service history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 4, 's_14693cf1', 'What if I decide to continue my service?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 5, 's_19da6a67', 'We don''t know who the spy was, but we were able to destroy his ship as it took off. He was killed in the explosion, but unfortunately the data disks he stole were destroyed as well.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 6, 's_2e18346d', 'I don''t have time right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 7, 's_2eadaa06', 'If you like, I can reset your service history and you can assist the Rebellion again. Otherwise, you can continue your services where you left off. Remember that once you decide, you cannot change your mind. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 8, 's_3315cf03', 'Normally, those who have helped us so willingly in the past are not called on to do so again. However, if you wish, I can reset your service history with the Rebellion. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 9, 's_3547d92c', 'I don''t believe that you have performed any services for our cause in the past. You do not need to speak with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 10, 's_37420d49', 'Oh, good. I''m glad you stopped by, now I don''t have to go looking for you. I need to ask you some questions if you have a moment to spare.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 11, 's_3c440d33', 'I understand completely. Take all the time you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 12, 's_3cf75f2d', 'What does that entail?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 13, 's_3d89228f', 'If you choose to continue from where you left off, you will simply return to the person which last gave you a job. That person will give you further instructions then. But remember that once you decide you cannot change your mind. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 14, 's_45b87508', 'Very well, it is done. You may continue your service to the Rebellion where you last left off.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 15, 's_48d3face', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Rebellion again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded again, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Rebellion. Do you want me to reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 16, 's_49d330ac', 'Alright, but remember that once you decide to continue, you cannot change your mind. Are you sure that you want to continue your service where you left off?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 17, 's_4b845961', 'Certainly. Simply return and speak with me again when you have made your decision.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 18, 's_5a47438c', 'Yes, I have already recorded your services. You do not need to speak with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 19, 's_6e88ecc1', 'No, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 20, 's_710595f4', 'I''ve got to be going now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 21, 's_7666799', 'Very well, it is done. You may go speak with C-3PO when you are ready to begin your service again.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 22, 's_866cf013', 'I see. What do you need me for?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 23, 's_93e226b7', 'NO, do not reset my history right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 24, 's_9bc93d72', 'Yes, please reset my service history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 25, 's_a45bb0ec', 'Well, it''s up to me to recompile all the data that was on those disks, and I need to ask you a question or two regarding your employment history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 26, 's_a76f22bf', 'What if I decide to reset my history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 27, 's_b1f9a8ac', 'I''m sorry, I don''t believe that you would have been in our databases. You don''t need to speak with me.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 28, 's_b7023094', 'OK. What do you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 29, 's_b78f6030', 'Of course. Please come back and speak with me when you get a chance.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 30, 's_bfd7fb6d', 'Can I decide later?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 31, 's_ce26bb71', 'We almost had a major catastrophe. The data disks that we use to keep all information on our allies that have performed services for our cause were stolen recently by an Imperial spy.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 32, 's_dc1c8663', 'YES, I am sure. Reset my service history.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 33, 's_deeb1462', 'If I reset your history, you will be able to go back and assist the Rebellion again as you have done in the past. But don''t worry, you will be rewarded, and it will in no way reduce your standing in the rank of the Rebellion. Shall I reset your history?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 34, 's_e3c4a3d5', 'No, do not reset my history. I will continue my service.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 35, 's_ea196d60', 'I understand completely. Please come back and see me again if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 36, 's_ebce22a9', 'NO, wait. Let me think a moment longer.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 37, 's_edb238bc', 'Go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 38, 's_f51b07ff', 'What kind of questions?'),
('string/en/conversation/theme_park_record_keeper_rebel.stf', 39, 's_f7565bbd', 'YES, I am sure. I want to continue my service.'),
