('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tour_aryon.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 3, 's_16d541d2', 'There are two candidates eligible to work with me on a new project. The candidates are Victor Visalis, Officer of Defense and Sean Trenwell, Director of Commerce. You''ll need to speak with either of the two and join their campaign. They''ll most likely tell you what they propose for Bestine and the changes that will take hold if they win.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 4, 's_1797f2fb', 'Sean Trenwell won the election. Sean seems quite interested in the  financial and cultural health of Bestine. I''m sure he''ll do a very good job.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 5, 's_1a74caee', 'I am ready to vote.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 6, 's_1ec9d0f0', 'I only want to hear positive things about the candidates. There has been too many scandals and ill-spoken words thrown about during this thing. I''m really tired of it. I need to get back to work. I have a lot of things I need to get done. Go speak with either Victor Visalis or Sean Trenwell.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 7, 's_1f2450ea', 'No, I need to go get it.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 8, 's_2230b5b1', 'I see you''ve already voted. Unfortunately, you can only vote once per election. Be sure to come back during the next election and participate then!'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 9, 's_23877744', 'Are you ready to vote?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 10, 's_23b3506c', 'I need more information, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 11, 's_2a9eedba', 'I am glad you''re taking a part in this election. So many people have voted already and there will be tons more by night''s end. I''ll only register your vote if you have the proper evidence. Are you ready to vote?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 12, 's_3001dad0', 'No, not really. Just wandering through Bestine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 13, 's_3829680a', 'I''m... uh, gonna go. Bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 14, 's_3b657772', 'Welcome citizen. I hope you enjoy your time in Bestine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 15, 's_3c509be9', 'After speaking with the politician of your choice, you''ll need to decide if you wish to vote for him. It is imperative that I select the right man for the job. Just giving me a name won''t do. You''ll need to bring me evidence of a good deed in order for your vote to be registered. For example, if you wish to vote for Victor, you''ll need to bring me evidence of a good deed he has done for the people of Bestine. The same goes for Sean. '),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 16, 's_3dcd5980', 'The next election won''t start for well over a week.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 17, 's_3e9e3870', 'Very well. Take what time you need, but be sure to return before the election ends.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 18, 's_45511d66', 'It will be more than two weeks before the next election begins.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 19, 's_47117f94', 'Okay. I''d like to vote.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 20, 's_540ac7e9', 'Continue.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 21, 's_567d69e1', 'I will be here when you return. I am looking forward to collecting your vote for the election!'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 22, 's_57d5a9c4', 'It''s good to know that the citizens of Bestine care about the city. A fact much in evidence when so many people voted during the last election. And they chose wisely... I am quite satisfied with the winning candidate. You should come back in the next months. Listen to the people of Bestine. They usually talk about the events surrounding the city.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 23, 's_5d2e1112', 'Who was the winning candidate?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 24, 's_5ff564e3', 'The two candidates are Victor Visalis, Officer of Defense and Sean Trenwell, Director of Commerce. You''ll need to speak with either of the two and join their campaign. They''ll most likely tell you what they propose for Bestine and the changes that will take hold if they win. After speaking with the politician of your choice, you''ll need to decide if you wish to vote for him. '),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 25, 's_65a4282', 'I''d like to vote, yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 26, 's_68d96c4a', 'When does the next election begin?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 27, 's_6beb48d3', 'I hope you enjoy your time here.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 28, 's_6ff89ddc', 'You''ll want to speak with the various people around the capitol. I''m sure they will have ideas for evidence. I only want to hear positive things about the candidates. There has been too many scandals and ill-spoken words thrown about during this thing. I''m really tired of it. I need to get back to work. I have a lot of things I need to get done. Go speak with either Victor Visalis or Sean Trenwell.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 29, 's_7420991b', 'Victor Visalis won the election. Victor is very concerned with the welfare of those living in and visiting Bestine. He has strong ideas for increasing security and for providing better protection from the bands of Sand People that have been assaulting the city recently.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 30, 's_7603d7cd', 'Unfortunately, without the proper evidence, I cannot register your vote. Evidence can be anywhere from a written testimony from someone in the city, to a data disk containing valuable information. The evidence needs to be tied to a good deed. Return when you have such data.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 31, 's_90ec63e0', 'Yes, I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 32, 's_91852029', 'I''ve changed my mind and would like to think about this a bit more.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 33, 's_9b704e1e', 'The next election will start in less than a week.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 34, 's_9b77406a', 'Unfortunately, without the proper evidence, I cannot register your vote. Evidence can be anywhere from a written testimony from someone in the city, to a data disk containing valuable information. The evidence needs to be tied to a good deed. Do you have such evidence?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 35, 's_9bf39028', 'I am glad you''re taking a part in this election. So many people have voted already and there will be tons more by night''s end. I''ll only register your vote if you have the proper evidence. Do you need more information? Or are you ready to vote?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 36, 's_9e562b00', 'It''s just a few days until the next election begins.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 37, 's_9fadb4cd', 'The election won''t begin for more than a day.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 38, 's_a44272b4', 'What evidence?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 39, 's_a87968a2', 'The next election starts within the hour.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 40, 's_ab50056b', 'I wish you well!'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 41, 's_ae946995', 'The next election starts in just a few hours.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 42, 's_b1c70765', 'The capitol has been very active recently with the news of the new election. I have a new project that I''m heading and have chosen two eligible candidates to work with me. However, to avoid the show of unfair favoritism, I have left it to the people of Bestine to select the politician whom best represents them. I''ve been taking votes all day. It''s been a long and tedious process, but it''s been interesting. Are you here to vote?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 43, 's_b1e3db3e', 'Thank you for your vote. I will keep the tally in my database for when the election has been drawn to a close.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 44, 's_b51737ff', 'Yes, I wish to vote for him.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 45, 's_bb225c00', 'I need more information.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 46, 's_bc2f5e3d', 'In less than a day the next election will begin.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 47, 's_bf3641cd', 'Excellent! I see that you have positive evidence to support Victor Visalis'' campaign. Do you wish to vote for him?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 48, 's_c1091f5a', 'It''s always good to speak with one of our citizens. Are you here to speak about the little election I''m staging?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 49, 's_ca478f48', 'Yes, I''d like to get involved.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 50, 's_ccae64dd', 'On second thought, I think I''m not quite ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 51, 's_de483def', 'I understand. Please take what time you need, but be sure to return before the election ends.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 52, 's_dfebee34', 'I completely understand. I too have to complete a lot of work before the election. Feel free to come by when you have time and vote.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 53, 's_e547fd1e', 'Yeah?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 54, 's_eea34749', 'Okay. Thank you!'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 55, 's_f3d3efe5', 'Excellent! I see that you have positive evidence to support Sean Trenwell''s campaign. Do you wish to vote for him?'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 56, 's_f9c0d87f', 'I seem to be confused and don''t know who won. Maybe I should cut back on the Corellian ale.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 57, 's_fad1aba', 'I have some evidence I''d like to show you. It''s for the election.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 58, 's_fb124268', 'No, I really need to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/tour_aryon.stf', 59, 's_fbf7f817', 'It is imperative that I select the right man for the job. Just giving me a name won''t do. You''ll need to bring me evidence of a good deed in order for your vote to be registered. For example, if you wish to vote for Victor, you''ll need to bring me evidence of a good deed he has done for the people of Bestine. The same goes for Sean. You''ll want to speak with the various people around the capitol. I''m sure they will have ideas for evidence. '),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (tutorial_imperial_broker.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 3, 's_13a23fbc', 'Tell me what you can'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 4, 's_169df3bb', 'Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 5, 's_1b2086de', 'Black Epsilon?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 6, 's_23ef3e33', 'Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 7, 's_2698cd26', 'Well, off you go, then. Use that terminal there to select your destination. I''ll fly you there myself.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 8, 's_2eee3e2e', 'Yes, sir!  How may I be of assistance?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 9, 's_3930f2e7', 'Yes. The Imperial Inquisition. Enlighten me, pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 10, 's_3c9c6441', 'Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system.  Their mission is highly classified.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 11, 's_407fb5e3', 'Very well, ma''am.  What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 12, 's_42693321', 'I see.  What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 13, 's_445a2be4', 'No. Never mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 14, 's_4577214d', 'I''m authorized to send you to one of three assignments, sir.  You can choose Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, or the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 15, 's_4874a395', 'There''s not much more I can say, sir, but I will add the location to your datapad.  Talk to the Imperial Pilot trainer in Kaadara.  You''ll find the association hall in the main plaza.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 16, 's_4b0c16d2', 'Are you recruiting Imperial Pilots?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 17, 's_4cafd748', 'Storm Squadron?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 18, 's_54818bbc', 'I don''t know what you mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 19, 's_5612445a', 'Tell me about Storm Squadron.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 20, 's_57d2e86d', 'Yes. Tell me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 21, 's_5817eef2', 'Yes, sir.  I can''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of the Storm Squadron commander to your datapad.  He''ll be glad to have a soldier of your standing.  You can find him in the Bestine Pilot''s Club next to the capitol building on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 22, 's_64bd89e0', 'There''s not much more I can say, ma''am, but I will add this location to your datapad.  Talk to the Pilot Trainer in the association hall on Kaadara, near the main plaza.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 23, 's_6edcb265', 'Can I be a pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 24, 's_70f18874', 'I''m not interested in that.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 25, 's_727cf8b6', 'What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 26, 's_772c81dd', 'Yes, sir.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area, as you can imagine.  They could really use more pilots there, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 27, 's_7b522690', 'It takes a special breed to be a pilot like me.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 28, 's_83a7ae89', 'Very well, ma''am.  Please come see me if you change your mind.  The Empire could use more soldiers of your caliber in space!'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 29, 's_86cb9899', 'Yes.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 30, 's_8755e6eb', 'Very well, sir.  Please come see me if you change your mind.  The Empire could use more soldiers of your caliber in space!'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 31, 's_895d093', 'Ok.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 32, 's_8c387e5c', 'Sir! Yes, sir!  Are you here to sign-up?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 33, 's_8d91ee22', 'Was there something else, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 34, 's_8ed93c34', 'No, just checking.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 35, 's_929272e8', 'Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system, sir.  They tend to deal in highly classified missions, so I''m afraid there''s not a lot I''m authorized to tell you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 36, 's_987445c9', 'Thank you, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 37, 's_98a4e725', 'Then tell me what you can.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 38, 's_9f862c74', 'What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 39, 's_a7d90105', 'Very well, sir.  What about Storm Squadron or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 40, 's_a8b71650', 'Yes, sir.  What about Black Epsilon or the Imperial Inquisition?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 41, 's_ac926b4b', 'Was there something else, ma''am?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 42, 's_b0ea6e8c', 'Yes.  What do I need to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 43, 's_b26292fd', 'The Emperor is building a vast and powerful navy to defend the galaxy! We have been commanded to create vacancies within our ranks - for dutiful citizens such as you.  Among them are the Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, and the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 44, 's_b2884420', 'I am a pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 45, 's_b369f7cd', 'I know what you mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 46, 's_b8884586', 'I''m authorized to send you to one of three assignments, ma''am.  You can choose Storm Squadron in the Tatooine system, Black Epsilon in the Corellia system, or the Imperial Inquisition in the Naboo system.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 47, 's_b89f31b', 'Imperial Inquisition is a special unit located in the Naboo system, ma''am.  They tend to deal in highly classified missions, so I''m afraid there''s not a lot I''m authorized to tell you.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 48, 's_b945b46a', 'Yes, ma''am.  I can''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their own recruiter to your datapad.  If you''ll speak with this officer in the Imperial Base on Talus, he will get you squared away.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 49, 's_c2c89e35', 'Yes, ma''am.  Black Epsilon is stationed at the Imperial Base on Talus, as Corellia itself is officially neutral... for now.  There are reports of considerable Rebel activity in the area, as you can imagine.  They could really use more pilots there, ma''am.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 50, 's_c8bbb089', 'I won''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their recruiting officer to your datapad.  You can find him in the Imperial Base on Talus, in the Corellia system. Use the travel terminal here to reach Corellia. From there - take a transport to Talus.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 51, 's_cc37bca4', 'Yes, sir.  I can''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of their own recruiter to your datapad.  If you''ll speak with this officer in the Imperial Base on Talus, he will get you squared away.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 52, 's_cd41504a', 'Yes, ma''am.  I can''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add this location to your datapad.  Talk to the trainer in the Bestine Pilot''s Club, near the capitol building on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 53, 's_d0f9b54', 'I won''t release any specific details about their current engagements, but I will add the location of the Storm Squadron pilot trainer to your datapad.  You''ll find him in the Bestine Pilot''s club on Tatooine, next to the capitol building. Use the travel terminal to reach Tatooine. Select the Bestine Township location.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 54, 's_d28bda49', 'Would you be interested in either Black Epsilon or the Storm Squadron, ma''am?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 55, 's_d78c7ec0', 'Ma''am!  Yes, ma''am!  Are you here to sign-up?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 56, 's_df2917b1', 'Tell me more'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 57, 's_e0db13e8', 'Storm Squadron is one of the Empire''s finest military units, in space or otherwise.  They''re the very model of the sort of hard-core, dedicated, soldiers that secure the Empire throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 58, 's_e671e2ef', 'You don''t look like much of a pilot to me. You''re not what we call, ''properly equipped'', if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 59, 's_ed23ffff', 'Are you interested in either Black Epsilon or the Storm Squadron, sir?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 60, 's_ee369d68', 'What can you tell me about Black Epsilon?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 61, 's_f202ee89', 'I can''t tell you anything. It''s highly classified. However, I can add the location of the unit''s pilot trainer to your datapad.  You may speak to him in the main plaza association hall in Kaadara, on Naboo. Use the travel terminal here to reach Naboo. Choose the Kaadara starport as your landing site.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 62, 's_f4792d0c', 'Good hunting!'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 63, 's_f4f79047', 'Greetings, citizen! Would you like to learn about exciting opportunities for pilots in the Imperial Navy?'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 64, 's_f5f50ae3', 'Of course.  My mistake.'),
('string/en/conversation/tutorial_imperial_broker.stf', 65, 's_fda95628', 'Yes, ma''am!  How may I be of assistance?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (veezatt.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 3, 's_10b2159c', 'Okay. Then, please come back when you do have some time... or when you get more nerve.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 4, 's_1cbc0c17', 'I will help you. What do I need to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 5, 's_1fd7266f', 'I detest those Black Sun pirates. How can I help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 6, 's_24472ebb', 'Please run down to the starport. It''s just around the corner. See our friend Gustan, and he will give you a starship. I will call him now and let him know you are coming. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 7, 's_2e18346d', 'I don''t have time right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 8, 's_3154c310', 'Who is this Ace pilot you speak of?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 9, 's_363caa24', 'Black Sun pirates have been giving us no end of trouble... destroying our spice transports at their leisure! They''ve whittled down our fighter cover to just a handful of pilots. Our last hired Ace pilot has gone missing... we hope she hasn''t been bribed by the Black Sun. That would be disastrous!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 10, 's_3712dfcf', 'This sounds a bit out of my league. I''ll have to pass.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 11, 's_3899d19b', 'I can''t help you with this right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 12, 's_3c79e34f', 'Who is this Ace pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 13, 's_3e4203de', 'No. Not right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 14, 's_4040e35d', 'Okay. I''d like to get started. Where do I find my starship?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 15, 's_4ac11e07', 'Gustan is an old friend. He''s a Chevin. Good friend of Ephant Mon, actually... although they don''t speak much these days. He is our starship supplier and will be glad to give you a vessel if you''ll agree to help us out. What do you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 16, 's_5047264d', 'Who is Gustan?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 17, 's_54a4045a', 'She doesn''t scare me. What can I do to help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 18, 's_5c84cdea', 'What sort of trouble are you in?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 19, 's_5cf80479', 'Don''t give me that! I''m saving lives by recruiting trainees like you! So, are you going to help us or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 20, 's_5da68d90', 'Okay! Just run down to the starport and see our friend Gustan. He''s our ship supplier and will give you a starship... so long as I call him now and let him know you are coming. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 21, 's_5efdddd9', 'Yes. I would be interested.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 22, 's_6a7bd77f', 'No, I''m sorry. I must be going, now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 23, 's_6b489d90', 'Sounds easy enough. Where can I get a starship?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 24, 's_6bbbaca8', 'Just run down to the starport and see our friend Gustan. He''s our ship supplier and will give you a starship... so long as I call him now and let him know you are coming. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 25, 's_6fb85199', 'That''s fine. Then let''s let someone else have a go, okay?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 26, 's_7094042b', 'You got the guts to fly a starfighter? I hope so. We''re in a tight spot and could really use a courageous pilot to zip into space and save some lives. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 27, 's_7402e1fc', 'Yes. I would be happy to help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 28, 's_7c425918', 'What''s the catch?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 29, 's_8a3477e', 'Tell me more about your operation.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 30, 's_8f2b06d', 'That sounds good. I''d like to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 31, 's_980adff3', 'Great! Then go down to the starport and meet with our starship supplier. He''s a Chevin named Gustan, and he will give you a starship if I tell him to. In fact, I will call him now and let him know you are coming. Come back here and see me when you''re done!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 32, 's_987ab7a3', 'Okay. Come back when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 33, 's_9a2ca5b5', 'Then I wish you good fortune.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 34, 's_9c07d9bd', 'So... what''s wrong? Aren''t you going to pick up your starfighter from Gustan and help us out?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 35, 's_9da7df62', 'I cannot help you right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 36, 's_a2f12b45', 'You may have heard of her: Yena Ak''Naad. A very gifted Zabrak pilot. She was a good friend of ours for a long time. Helped us set up this operation. But something happened recently... something in her personal life. I really don''t know too much about it, although our ship supplier, Gustan may know more.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 37, 's_af50b7f6', 'You bet. Let me at ''em!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 38, 's_b05428f8', 'Not at this time, thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 39, 's_b1c5cc33', 'Wonderful! In that case, I''ll need you to fly to the Merchant Station in quadrant IV. Help them get their transports to the checkpoint. If you do well, I''ll have other work for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 40, 's_bb1caf4a', 'This is a simple operation. Just my husband, Gustan, a few fighter pilots, and fewer transport ships. We move weapon components, spice, starship parts, and popular sundries all over the Outer Rim. But recently, the Black Sun have been giving us a lot of grief. We need brave pilots to help us get back on our feet... financially. Will you help us?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 41, 's_bc19cda3', 'Yena Ak''Naad. A very gifted pilot. She was a good friend of ours for a long time. Helped us set up this operation. But something happened recently... something in her personal life. I really don''t know too much about it, although our ship supplier, Gustan may know more.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 42, 's_bd50e620', 'So! Things wen''t pretty well, did they? I''m very impressed. Are you interested in doing more work for us?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 43, 's_beff139a', 'That''s a shame. I hope you find some courage and come back... we could really use the help!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 44, 's_c233103f', 'Excellent! Then here is QUEST 2! Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 45, 's_ce01ef1d', 'There are lives at stake? What are you doing down here, then?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 46, 's_d98de4ec', 'I can''t help you right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 47, 's_d9db5117', 'Okay. Then please come back when you are ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 48, 's_dacc6adc', 'Yes, I will. What do I need to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 49, 's_e43b57e4', 'I am willing to help you. What do I need to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 50, 's_eb28bc24', 'We used to be a part of the Hutt family - but now we are trying to start our own shipping business. Sure it would be helpful to have their protection... but that cuts into profit like you wouldn''t believe!'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 51, 's_ecefa4c', 'Can''t you get help from the Hutts?'),
('string/en/conversation/veezatt.stf', 52, 's_f067a84d', 'Well... sorry to hear that things didn''t go so well for you out there. However, if you''re willing to give it another try, I would be happy to get you back in the cockpit! What do you say?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (victor_questn_cantina.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 3, 's_19d90991', 'I don''t have that kind of money.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 4, 's_3665cc86', 'Can'' ya''see I''m busy? Get ya'' lost!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 5, 's_36fef8c1', 'Go away then. I''ve got things to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 6, 's_51ac4991', 'Hmm. Here you go.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 7, 's_62bf3631', 'No, I haven''t made room yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 8, 's_6307f85c', 'Can y''see I''m busy? Get ya'' lost!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 9, 's_89278f85', 'Bah, yer back. Ye ''ave enough room yet?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 10, 's_8a0cf969', 'An'' here is yer paper--Uh... ye don'' ''ave enough room. Get rid o''yer junk first an'' come back fer yer paper.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 11, 's_90ec63e0', 'Yes, I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 12, 's_ac84b134', 'An'' here is yer paper. Now, go ''way.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 13, 's_c70282a3', 'What, yer back? I already gave ya what y''need. If ya ain''t gonna put it ta use, don''t come cryin'' ta me.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 14, 's_dcb68f7c', 'Yeh, I ''ave what y''need. Y''lookin'' fer some sort o''evidence against that Victor Vis''ilis? Wh''evah his name is. He''a been ignorin'' our ''illegal'' activites fer some time now. He even made''a agreement wit'' us, wrote it on''a paper even! Daft, I says. I''ll give it to ya iffin'' ye pay me... two hunnerd credits.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 15, 's_f7347f40', 'Ye still don''t ''ave enough room. Stop wastin'' ma''time!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_cantina.stf', 16, 's_ff29a83c', 'Yer a cheapskate. Get ya'' lost.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (victor_questn_capitol.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 2, 's_0', '');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 3, 's_11cdd7b1', 'And it would be best, for your health, not to come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 4, 's_42deb08e', 'Wasting my time is not a smart idea...'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 5, 's_496168b6', 'I need your help...'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 6, 's_4d313a', 'You''re not suppose to be hanging around here, citizen. Move along.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 7, 's_6ddb06b2', 'And here you are. Now... get lost.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 8, 's_7dcdb445', 'There is an election going on at the capitol. You should  participate. Otherwise... move along, citizen.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 9, 's_90ec63e0', 'Yes, I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 10, 's_99ef56dc', 'No, you don''t. Again, come back when you do. And next time, you''d better not waste my time.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 11, 's_b9b27823', 'Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 12, 's_c1bf1629', 'You''d be wise to join the Empire. The Rebel Alliance and its members have spiraled out of control. We''re going to stomp them out of existence.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 13, 's_ce8d51fb', 'Look-oh? Looking for evidence, are you? I may be able to help with that. It would be a perfect opportunity to get even with that Victor fellow. Never mind the details. Here, you might find this... ''list'' entertaining. Be sure to say that you ''found'' it.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 14, 's_d2df4599', 'I could help you... if you had enough room. Come back when you do and we''ll talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 15, 's_d638d2ec', 'Move along.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 16, 's_da9a29e9', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 17, 's_e50dbfc0', 'Fine. I''m leaving.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 18, 's_f62e5a7d', 'Ah, you''re back. Do you have enough room this time to get your precious evidence?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questn_capitol.stf', 19, 's_f688af52', 'Move along... oh, it''s you again. Why haven''t you used that list I gave... er... I mean, that you found... against Victor? Arrrgh! I was in a good mood after giving that to you, but now I''m upset again. Just go take care of it already.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (victor_questp_hospital.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 3, 's_23306eeb', 'With the help from Victor Visalis, the orphanage is safe from the constant Sand People attacks. You should help by defending the people of Bestine.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 4, 's_23ac5f59', 'Victor Visalis. He''s truly a great man. I wish I could help him in some way for being so generous.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 5, 's_2dc62c40', 'Uh... bye! Come back soon! And be sure to make a donation next time!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 6, 's_34c66631', 'Okay. Here you are. Complete registry and everything. I really hope this helps you in voting for Victor. I wish you well! Tell him I said ''thank you'' again.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 7, 's_46462c3d', 'No, unfortunately, you do not. Please come back when you have enough room to receive the evidence.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 8, 's_4c7aa64d', 'Are you here to make a donation to the orphanage? No? I hear there''s an election going on at the capitol. You should go and vote. I know I did.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 9, 's_58411386', 'No, I''m not. Good bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 10, 's_67a10ef6', 'Who was the politician?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 11, 's_67e6df55', 'Okay.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 12, 's_705d8e7c', 'I wish you well, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 13, 's_7651d151', 'Are you here to make a donation to... oh, I remember you. I gave you a copy of my list of all the donations we''ve received. Please be sure to let the governor see that... I want her to know about Victor''s generosity.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 14, 's_90c73952', 'Excellent! Here you are. Be sure to thank Victor for me. Good day!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 15, 's_90ec63e0', 'Yes, I do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 16, 's_abdf450b', 'Oh, okay. Come back when you do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 17, 's_ad2e138', 'I know how you can.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 18, 's_b06dcd05', 'Here you are--Oops! Looks like you don''t have enough room for this. Please come back when you do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 19, 's_da9a29e9', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 20, 's_dafadce6', 'Yeah. Anyway, I have to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 21, 's_e0a4222c', 'You do? I''m all ears. Hmm... really? I have just the perfect thing for your evidence. I always keep a sort of personal receipt system for all the donations I''ve received just so no one will wonder where I keep getting all this money from. Let me make a copy. Hold on a second, will you?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 22, 's_e4d6a9f4', 'Oh, you''re back! Do you have enough room to receive your evidence now?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_hospital.stf', 23, 's_f2a042d2', 'Are you here to make a donation to the orphanage? We received a huge donation just the other week from a respectable politician. It is truly exciting. Our children can finally get the care they need because of him.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (victor_questp_slums.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 3, 's_222d159b', 'Listen closely. The Sand People have been attacking the outskirts of the city. For some reason, the Empire has hidden this fact from those who do not live in the slums... not to panic everyone else, I guess. It''s hard to live here. One particular night, a couple of months back, the Tuskens came. They killed several of us here. They took my son. I--I just don''t want to think about it... about what could have happened that night.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 4, 's_22977a6d', 'Done! Please take this written testimony. I hope it helps you and, most of all, helps Victor. I hope you have a good day.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 5, 's_4117e563', 'Why are you back? I''ve already given you my testimony. Why haven''t you shown it to the governor? What are you waiting for? She needs to know this.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 6, 's_41330c9c', 'I will help you as well as I can. What do you need? Oh? I would do anything for Victor. I''d be happy to write my account of the happenings for you. Luckily, I know how to write. Victor funded my education as well. He''s done so much for us. Give me a second..'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 7, 's_41e66644', 'I''m just a poor woman. I''m not significant in this life, or to this city. But Victor Visalis heard of my misfortune and took pity on me. He took his own soldiers and destroyed the Tuskens. He returned my son to me! Can you believe that? I''m so grateful.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 8, 's_4f9d0087', 'Please take this written testimony--oh wait. You don''t have enough room to accept it. Hmm... you should come back when you do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 9, 's_540ac7e9', 'Continue.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 10, 's_585b9214', 'Oh no. You don''t have enough room again. Please come back when you do. I hope to see you soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 11, 's_5a5e0913', 'That''s sad. It''s a good one. Come back when you''re ready to hear it.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 12, 's_67e6df55', 'Okay.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 13, 's_6ec1e03e', 'Okay then, come back later when you have more room.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 14, 's_76cc19da', 'No, I still don''t have room.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 15, 's_76f08368', 'I''m glad you liked it! I hope you are well today.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 16, 's_8611417a', 'What story?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 17, 's_a9ac4d51', 'Nice story. I must be going.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 18, 's_aa91e763', 'No time for stories.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 19, 's_b6d2944c', 'I''m glad you''ve returned. Did you want your evidence now? I hope you have enough room.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 20, 's_b8dac377', 'I''m so glad! Please take this testimony. I wish you well in your life!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 21, 's_d5f19466', 'I need your help.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 22, 's_dcb207ac', 'I don''t recognize you. You don''t belong in this part of town. I hear there''s a lot of commotion at the capitol. Something about an election. You should go and see what it''s all about.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 23, 's_ee6997ba', 'I do, thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 24, 's_f25283c7', 'I knew you''d come. The story should be told to everyone. It has a good moral to it, I think.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_questp_slums.stf', 25, 's_f8cdce4', 'I can barely go outside anymore to do my chores. I fear for my child. I don''t want him to be kidnapped again. An election should be coming up soon. I''d choose Victor Visalis. He would keep us poor citizens safe.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (victor_visalis.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 3, 's_113169f8', 'You? What could you do? I-ugh. Very well. You may help us. I need for you to go to the Fortress. Our spies have witnessed a power never seen before and it lurks there. A ''brand'' of Sand People never mentioned in any book. We think it may be the leading power in the Tusken community, if one could call it that. Kill it. Bring back some significant proof that you''ve killed it, yes?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 4, 's_1285849e', 'I''ve decided to vote for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 5, 's_177e9cb7', 'Yes! I will help you!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 6, 's_1a50f0d3', 'Tell me more about the Tuskens.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 7, 's_1b6edbfe', 'Here you are. You''ll need evidence in order for your vote to be registered. It is my understanding that my secretary receives letters from the people of Bestine, thanking me for my assistance. She may know the information you seek. I must return to my duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 8, 's_1c1db559', 'Stones? Hmm... They seem to be valuable. Rare, you say? I heard that there are merchants looking for such things over in the city''s new market place. However, I hear that those particular merchants are rare. You may have to keep an eye out for them. That is all I know, really.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 9, 's_23e4ded2', 'Um.. no.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 10, 's_24f8534b', 'Greedy, are you? You already received a ''reward'' from me. I must return to my duties. Now, be gone.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 11, 's_26684a50', 'Very well. Be safe, my friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 12, 's_269510f1', 'You must travel to the site of the Sand People Fortress and search it for a very powerful Tusken Raider. The Sand People place significance on this particular leader. It has never been seen before, has never been mentioned in any book. We can only assume that, with its destruction, the Sand People will leave the people of Bestine alone for good. My contacts have mentioned an extensive cave system below the Fortress. Search there first.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 13, 's_26e91e91', 'I see that you have joined the campaign of my opponent. I am disappointed.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 14, 's_28586fd5', 'Very well.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 15, 's_30e8118', 'Just checking up on things. Bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 16, 's_3516c87', 'I see that you''re a coward. Very well.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 17, 's_380817dd', 'I found these weird stones.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 18, 's_390b2857', 'Let me help!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 19, 's_41012fd2', 'You can speak with my secretary on the subject. She will know all the details for what you seek.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 20, 's_42c394e0', 'I''m lost. What do I need to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 21, 's_435f07d4', 'Hey wait! What about my reward for voting for you in the last election?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 22, 's_486664dd', 'To make it short and clear, my proposed changes for Bestine would be to increase the number of Storm Troopers within Bestine. I plan to establish a special force of Troopers to eradicate the more... dangerous of scum from the city.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 23, 's_4e29a0ab', 'I see that you are eager to join my campaign. Do you have the proper evidence against Sean Trenwell? Without it, you''ll not be able to join my campaign.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 24, 's_52a836a3', 'If you''re serious about joining my campaign, you''ll stop wasting my time and go find the evidence I seek. Again, talk with my secretary for more details.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 25, 's_540ac7e9', 'Continue.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 26, 's_5492e753', 'I wish to join your campaign.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 27, 's_57218e96', 'I am much too occupied at the moment. You may return when the election begins again. Speak with Bestine''s citizens. They usually speak of it.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 28, 's_572eae57', 'Good. You are wise to agree with my views regarding Bestine and its state of defense. As I may have mentioned, I will give you a diskette to explain anything you may have missed. As for evidence, you will need to speak with several others. It is my understanding that my secretary receives letters from the people of Bestine, thanking me for my assistance. She may know the information you seek. I must return to my duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 29, 's_578e3372', 'Of course, and I thank you for voting for me. I greatly appreciate it. If I win, come back and speak to me so that I can reward your loyalty.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 30, 's_59c941ec', 'Time is running out and I have too much to do to explain the intricacies of politics with you. If you decide to join my campaign, I will offer you a diskette that will further explain the process.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 31, 's_5bccff58', 'That is my intention, though I''m surprised to discover that you already voted for Sean Trenwell. I don''t see how anyone could justify doing that, but apparently you found his ideas palatable. I can''t imagine what had to happen to make that possible, and frankly, I don''t want to know.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 32, 's_5c46daeb', 'I''ve changed my mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 33, 's_6641e79e', 'I have destroyed the intended target.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 34, 's_66e44ee', 'I''m surprised you voted for Sean Trenwell in this election. I don''t see how anyone could justify doing that, but apparently you found his ideas palatable. I can''t imagine what had to happen to make that possible, and frankly, I don''t want to know.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 35, 's_6775ddea', 'Stressful.  I will use my place in office to my advantage during this dangerous time. We must strike at the heart of the Sand People resistance. I have sent some of Bestine''s toughest soldiers to the Tusken Fortress. Unfortunately, they have not returned to us. I fear for the worst. For the first time in my life, I am at a loss...'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 36, 's_67dbab18', 'Sorry, I have to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 37, 's_6ac98e49', 'I have it, yes.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 38, 's_6c1a2811', 'Regardless... if you are serious about the whole ordeal, I suggest you speak with others within the capitol and throughout the city. I am sure I have touched a few lives in my passing, but I do not remember such frivolous things. Should you decide to join my opponent''s campaign and uncover the dirt that''s bound to be in his past, bring it to me. It is the only way I''ll let you back into my campaign if you decide to help him instead.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 39, 's_6cf7afee', 'I should go.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 40, 's_700330a5', 'I can''t find any evidence.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 41, 's_70973a58', 'The city of Bestine is severly lacking when it comes to defense. It is my main concern. The Tusken Raiders have become more daring and have constantly tried to launch attacks against the outer walls of the city. Several people have died. The Empire has kept it quiet, preventing it from reaching the common folk of Bestine. I fear the Tuskens will launch a more devastating attack in the days to come. Several of my sources have confirmed my suspicions.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 42, 's_72a766a9', 'Good. Leave with haste. Our target may leave for a more... safe place soon. We must strike when it least expects it and when it is most vulnerable. Travel to Fort Tusken and search there. I wish you luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 43, 's_73f65b89', 'Thank you. Soon, Bestine will be safe again. I thank you for your support. If I win the election, return to me and you will be greatly rewarded.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 44, 's_798f58f7', 'Yes and I voted for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 45, 's_7c4e7b68', 'Ahh, excellent. I am satisfied. You have proven your worth and want to join my campaign. Are you sure you want to join us?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 46, 's_7ce36b97', 'I am disappointed. Very well. You have been released from your mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 47, 's_81eb46c0', 'I see that I have already given you your reward for this particular task. Unfortunately, I cannot give you another. I wish you well. Please continue to serve Bestine. Our city is already in debt to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 48, 's_82af0027', 'Hey wait! What about my reward for voting for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 49, 's_82dcbdca', 'Ah, thanks for voting for me in this election. I really appreciate it. If I win, come back and speak to me so that I can reward your loyalty.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 50, 's_87b97dc', 'I need to go. I''m sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 51, 's_8999ec9b', 'I decided not to vote for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 52, 's_8d1a9cd2', 'Odd. I''ve never seen objects like these before. However, they do seem to be very valuable. You may be able to find more information regarding these stones in the new market place. A merchant may know what to do with them. I hear that many of the merchants come and go regularly so you may not be able to find this particular merchant immediately. Keep your eye out though. Merchants can be fickle about their business hours.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 53, 's_9201d81b', 'I have to go. Bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 54, 's_9e0196ed', 'Yes, I am sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 55, 's_a19e3981', 'I am now in office, this much is true. However, I have matters on my mind to which I must attend. Is there something you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 56, 's_a58217e0', 'You''ll need to come back when you have more room.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 57, 's_a76ad142', 'I''m going to vote for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 58, 's_aa1a9de6', 'Can you feel that? The Sand People are getting restless. I can sense it from here. Bestine will not be safe unless we recruit more Imperial Troopers to defend the city. If my... opponent wins the election, I am afraid of what may happen to the people of Bestine. But enough of this. How may I help you?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 59, 's_adc1f0dc', 'Return when you have more room. I must return to my duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 60, 's_b0c249bb', 'You are wise to agree with my views regarding Bestine and its state of defense. As I may have mentioned, I will give you a diskette to explain anything you may have missed. As for evidence, you will need to speak with several others. It is my understanding that my secretary receives letters from the people of Bestine, thanking me for my assistance. She may know the information you seek. I must return to my duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 61, 's_b826b85a', 'I want to join your campaign.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 62, 's_bae6b22d', 'What are your proposed changes for Bestine?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 63, 's_c135d871', 'That''s unfortunate. I suppose you care more of museums, historians and new market places than the lives of others. Very well.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 64, 's_c2b746c2', 'You have returned. Did you find the proper evidence the governor requires?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 65, 's_c34a7f30', 'A wise choice. However, I know that words do not weigh much in this life. It is action that makes or breaks a nation. The governor has ridiculous restrictions on the voting process. By her words, you will need evidence in order to vote -- evidence of a good deed I have done. Childish.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 66, 's_c74fd908', 'I am a bit suspicious... Thank you, then, for your vote. I must get back to work. Good day.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 67, 's_c82e9a2f', 'Yes, please.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 68, 's_ca4e3819', 'I see you have returned. Last we spoke, you didn''t have room for the diskette. Would you like it now?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 69, 's_cbb4f307', 'I''m still looking for our target.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 70, 's_cc9cab18', 'Oh yes! It almost slipped my mind. Here you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 71, 's_ce06af62', 'Things are going extremely well. Thank you for your help earlier. Bestine is now a safer place. Is there anything I can help you with?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 72, 's_cf6147b3', 'That is a pity. And to think I thought you were the intelligent sort... Very well. Good day.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 73, 's_d041eb82', 'I don''t want to join your campaign.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 74, 's_d6a9a15d', 'I''m here to vote for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 75, 's_d987b9fe', 'Very well, then. Be sure to return when you''ve seen that our views are the right path.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 76, 's_da9a29e9', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 77, 's_dcd4d8d5', 'What is there to tell... The Tuskens have become more and more restless with each passing day. New cities have sprung up from the sand literally overnight, backing the Sand People into a small corner of the planet. I fear Bestine is next on the chopping board, so to speak. I have sent several scouts to keep an eye on them. '),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 78, 's_de1eacb3', 'Now that another election has begun, are you planning to get re-elected?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 79, 's_dea56128', 'I have to go.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 80, 's_df711673', 'Ah yes! Indeed you have. Perhaps now the Sand People will leave the people of Bestine alone. I am grateful. Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 81, 's_e52ed44', 'It is my hope that my soldiers will return. I must return to my duties. Good day.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 82, 's_e6a20ca5', 'Unfortunately, you cannot just change your mind when the time is only convenient for you. To prove yourself, you''ll need to find evidence that will prove my rival is as ruthless as I think he is. Again, talk with my secretary. I have too much to do at the moment to explain it to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 83, 's_e8aff3cd', 'Absolutely. I fully intend to win over Mr. Trenwell once again. We need to keep his meddlesome ideas out of Bestine. Bestine needs more defense and it is defense that I shall give them! Keep me in office and vote in the next election with the governor.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 84, 's_e955e18', 'Our ''target'' is in the Fortress. I am unsure of the direct location of where it may be hiding. Most likely,  it could be within the cave system beneath the actual Fortress. Return to me when you have succeeded in your task. Remember, I need proof you have eliminated the target.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 85, 's_e9a49e3', 'Sounds like a tough deal.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 86, 's_eafac099', 'I''m glad you have agreed to join my campaign. However, in order to receive the diskette, you''ll need more room. Please come back when you do.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 87, 's_edafb11b', 'How goes your work now that you''re in office?'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 88, 's_ee26e33e', 'No thanks!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 89, 's_f594d753', 'Everything''s going well. I am awaiting word from Fort Tusken. Excuse me. I must return to my work.'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 90, 's_f70821a3', 'I quit!'),
('string/en/conversation/victor_visalis.stf', 91, 's_fc5485d3', 'My opponent will put the city''s money into worthless things--markets, hiring historians, a museum--which will severely reduce our defenses. I cannot have that happen. We need to increase the defense... or many will die.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_elder.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 3, 's_199fe2af', 'I sense you already have a crystal and do not need another.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 4, 's_4dfe3937', 'Yes, you might at that. Do you have any skills we might be in need of?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 5, 's_688b65', 'Hello, I am Elgin Seropf, elder of this village. What brings you to our home?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 6, 's_7d804cc7', 'You would be looking for Captain Sarguillo. He is about 30 meters to the Southeast from here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 7, 's_7f56b89c', 'You will want to visit out Chief Engineer. He lives along the south wall near out communications and sensor array.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 8, 's_85e90557', 'I seem to have misplaced my Force crystal, may I have another?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 9, 's_a9e1f5c2', 'I can help provide security for your village.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 10, 's_ba08eb80', 'Ahh, you are looking for Fyona our doctor. She is right over there under the medic tent.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 11, 's_bdd3bae5', 'Here you are.  Remember you may use the crystal to view your progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 12, 's_d931cb17', 'I am a medic, I was wondering if you needed any assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 13, 's_efefc64f', 'I am a craftsman. I would be able to help you rebuild some of this.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder.stf', 14, 's_fb95fc83', 'I was sent here by an old man that seemed to think I had some kind of destiny here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_elder_1.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 3, 's_199fe2af', 'I sense you already have a crystal and do not need another.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 4, 's_22163d24', 'I can help defend if they come back..'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 5, 's_2eaf06cc', 'I can help treat the wounded.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 6, 's_3c6f20b4', 'I will find the captives for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 7, 's_43fe619a', 'Thank you. There has been enough loss of life already without their blood being spilled as well. Speak to Whip just South of here near the front entrance.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 8, 's_455d6edc', 'They aren''t real Sith. They just have some strange devotion to that evil race. '),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 9, 's_47f6c42', 'Many of our best defenders fell in the battle. We could certainly use the help. Check with Captain Sarguillo right over there.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 10, 's_5357267d', 'The Sith have been extinct for ages. Their fire has gone out of the galaxy.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 11, 's_55273aaf', 'Did you see them?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 12, 's_72752682', 'Those Sith animals! They destroyed our village! They came out of nowhere... overwhelmed our defenses. We thought we were protected... but, we stood no chance.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 13, 's_7587a16a', 'Thank you, that would be very helpful. Our medic has some droids to help her, but I am sure she would appreciate your help. Her name is Sivarra Mecheaux, and she can be found at the healers tent West from here along the wall.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 14, 's_83ac5888', 'I''m not too bad with a hydrospanner and power mallet.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 15, 's_854985e0', 'I can help defend if they come back.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 16, 's_858f16f4', 'I am a good scout, maybe I can locate these gangers for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 17, 's_959b429b', 'What we really need is someone to find our captured villagers. '),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 18, 's_9ce75ab2', 'We were actually quite well defended. But they burned right through our shield. The turrets couldn''t stop them and were destroyed. Then they reached the walls near the entrances. After that, all that was left was the pillaging and looting.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 19, 's_9dc8bf5d', 'I seem to have misplaced my Force crystal.  May I have another?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 20, 's_a43672b0', 'They aren''t Sith, but they are certainly ruthless and powerful.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 21, 's_ab969608', 'Our sensor array was damaged in the attack and our chief engineer was killed. Maybe you could see if you could fix it. It''s East of here, against the wall.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 22, 's_b6101821', 'Did I see whom?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 23, 's_bdd3bae5', 'Here you are.  Remember you may use the crystal to view your progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 24, 's_ded598ce', 'Yes we do. Our sensor array was damaged in the attack and our chief engineer was killed. Maybe you could see if you could fix it. It''s East of here, against the wall.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 25, 's_e477ab86', 'What kind of defenses are you talking about? This looks like a lost agro-colony.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 26, 's_f0d5416', 'That they are and the ruins you see here bear witness to that statement.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 27, 's_f0e7a84', 'Ah, I see. real or not, from the looks of things they certainly were out for blood.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_1.stf', 28, 's_f8ff425b', 'They sure got it. We''re devastated. Most everything is in ruins, and many of our people are hurt.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_elder_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 3, 's_1414eb3a', 'It sure couldn''t hurt. Thank you for your help. We need both craftsmen and supplies. What would you prefer to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 4, 's_1607b22e', 'Those supplies are key to everything else.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 5, 's_199fe2af', 'I sense you already have a crystal and do not need another.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 6, 's_278134b4', 'I am sure the people would be very appreciative for whatever you could find. Please speak to Eozlin to the northwest.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 7, 's_2f1f1ed', 'Yes... yes, maybe they will be too busy defending themselves to attack us again. Please speak to Dageerin as soon as possible. He is over by the communal buildings A few meters west of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 8, 's_4ecdf473', 'We need to take the fight to them.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 9, 's_57c6f33', 'Great, you need to speak with Quharek. You can find him at the construction site to the north along the wall..'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 10, 's_5bdbe99a', 'I''d like to help rebuild the defenses.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 11, 's_5d7558d4', 'Thanks for those supplies. They really are coming in handy.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 12, 's_5e0af20b', 'You bet. Anything else I can do to help?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 13, 's_70509760', 'Sounds like you need better defenses. I can help you rebuild them.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 14, 's_70a99316', 'Very logical. We are in desperate need of those supplies. Whip can get you set up for that. He''s by the front gate just a few meters south of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 15, 's_7471e00a', 'That''s the spirit! Show them we won''t lay down for this injustice. Speak to Dageerin to the west, over by the communal buildings.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 16, 's_8caad960', 'What supplies? I didn''t bring you any supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 17, 's_96bf47c1', 'Oh, excuse me then. There''s been so many coming and going lately I have lost track. We''re rebuilding after a recent attack.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 18, 's_9940e942', 'You need to find them and stop them at their source.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 19, 's_9dc8bf5d', 'I seem to have misplaced my Force crystal.  May I have another?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 20, 's_a601e626', 'Good idea. We wouldn''t stand up to any attack in our current shape. Talk to Quharek. He''s at the construction site north of here along the wall.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 21, 's_a60bdc2c', 'You have a point. I think you should talk to Whip by the front gate south of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 22, 's_bd4cef4a', 'Yes, please. That Sith Shadow gang is still trying to destroy us. We''re running low on supplies because our convoys can''t get through, and we''re sitting ducks right now if they decide to attack.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 23, 's_bdd3bae5', 'Here you are.  Remember you may use the crystal to view your progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 24, 's_c3add11e', 'A gang called the Sith Shadows. They are still out there, planning their next attack I am sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 25, 's_c7c2a3b0', 'I''d like to help gather supplies and resources.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 26, 's_c8f614a1', 'Thank you so much. Our supplies are running dangerously low. Our first priority was to rebuild the dwellings that got destroyed in the attack, so now we are short on both building materials and supplies. Please check with Eozlin on what you can help with. You can find him to the northwest outside his hut.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 27, 's_cc6522f9', 'Who would attack an agro-colony?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_2.stf', 28, 's_d6a8b96b', 'That''s an excellent idea. Perhaps if we attack them directly we can take some of their attention away from their attacks on our supply convoys. They have been either destroying or turning back all of the convoys that have been headed to us.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_elder_3.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 3, 's_199fe2af', 'I sense you already have a crystal and do not need another.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 4, 's_32705167', 'What are phase relay filaments?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 5, 's_4d973713', 'That''s what we''re doing. Well, building one from scratch really. We''ve got the beginnings of a Mark 4 shield generator right over there.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 6, 's_5d8d739e', 'How are you getting the resources for such a massive project? '),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 7, 's_6857cea2', 'You''re kidding. I''ve got to get in on this! where do I sign up?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 8, 's_6acff81', 'I like your enthusiasm. Speak to Quharek near the shield generator construction site. I am sure he will appreciate the help.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 9, 's_6aefa2ce', 'Well, I could see about finding resources. What do you need?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 10, 's_78eeb91e', 'Phase relay filaments? They are only used for repairing starship shields.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 11, 's_893aaeea', 'Usually I''d laugh at that, friend. No, we actually do have need of it. We were recently assaulted by a gang calling itself the Sith Shadows. They killed many of our people and destroyed our crops and much of the village.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 12, 's_9dc8bf5d', 'I seem to have misplaced my Force crystal.  May I have another?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 13, 's_abd57d77', 'That would be most helpful. Speak to Dageerin to the west over by the communal huts.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 14, 's_ac2de13b', 'Mostly resources for the shield. Speak to Eozlin to the northwest of here. He should be able to tell you the specifics.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 15, 's_afcc98d2', 'A shield generator for an agro-colony? You must grow really juicy Maroj Melons.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 16, 's_b77f095d', 'Watch out! Someone dropped a box of phase relay filaments around here. They can get into your electronics and short them out. '),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 17, 's_bdd3bae5', 'Here you are.  Remember you may use the crystal to view your progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 18, 's_cc50daed', 'We''re building a Mark 4 shield generator to defend our village. They are used in that.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 19, 's_cf4025df', 'I''d be willing to sweep the area for their spies and outposts.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 20, 's_e1b39e83', 'Well you don''t need a shield for that. You just need me! '),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 21, 's_efa47d4e', 'Your confidence is impressive. I hope it''s not empty bravado. Speak to Captain Sarguillo right over there. He''ll give you all the blood and guts you can stand.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_3.stf', 22, 's_f5d9b5d4', 'Supply convoys mostly. When they can get through the Sith Shadow attacks that is. The margin between what we have and what we need always stays slim, however.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_elder_4.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 3, 's_12b92ec4', 'I sure hope so, but I think we''re going to need more help than just the shield generator and blaster turrets.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 4, 's_17446822', 'I am tough enough to pull the ears off a gundark.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 5, 's_199fe2af', 'I sense you already have a crystal and do not need another.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 6, 's_448b67d0', 'They seem to be our bane. For some reason they assaulted our village many days ago. We''ve been rebuilding and reinforcing our village ever since.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 7, 's_48fd623', 'Speak to our new chief engineer, he is new and a bit frazzled. You would be a great help to him. You can find him to the East at his hut near the sensor array.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 8, 's_4d4da25b', 'I am a medic. I could help heal your soldiers.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 9, 's_8aa931e3', 'Be careful, we''ve received information that the Sith Shadows will attack soon.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 10, 's_8c109ae0', 'I am sure Sivarra will need all the help she can get. You can find her at the medic tent to the Northwest.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 11, 's_97092ac2', 'I''m a crafter, what can I do in a battle?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 12, 's_9dc8bf5d', 'I seem to have misplaced my Force crystal.  May I have another?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 13, 's_a098d669', 'Again? Haven''t they learned their lesson?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 14, 's_aba5c1a8', 'You look pretty well defended.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 15, 's_ae755ac3', 'Well we need good skirmishers to meet them head on. Speak to Captain Sarguillo, right over there.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 16, 's_bdd3bae5', 'Here you are.  Remember you may use the crystal to view your progress.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 17, 's_d1431da3', 'Apparently not. I think they are looking to finish us off this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 18, 's_de1f69ee', 'Well they are going to have a tough time with all the new defenses.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 19, 's_e0741a0c', 'Captain Sarguillo has need of good soldiers like you. He''s right over there.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 20, 's_e5a75b57', 'Who are the Sith Shadows?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_elder_4.stf', 21, 's_f24ae96', 'I''m a crack shot with a blaster.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_quharek.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 3, 's_16cc0ae1', 'What are you waiting for? Go get that sensor array repaired!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 4, 's_1b7f8e6d', 'Good! You''d better get to work then. The sooner we get that thing back online, the better!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 5, 's_27808b0b', 'Good show! If you help us out with this, I will help you learn to use the Force to enhance your assembly skills.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 6, 's_4beb938f', 'Yes, I suppose I am.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 7, 's_52acc0', 'That''s a shame. If you find someone who will... send ''em over.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 8, 's_5ec4a1e', 'Alright, well if you see someone who is... send ''em over.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 9, 's_6a934b47', 'Master... I must find the master.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 10, 's_75cdc0ad', 'On second thought, I don''t think that I can help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 11, 's_8459377a', 'Yes, I will go repair the sensor array.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 12, 's_8abf86da', 'You want me to take a look at the sensor array?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 13, 's_8d878ba7', 'That''s a shame. If you find someone who can... send ''em over.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 14, 's_9ae334e4', 'I think that I can handle that.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 15, 's_9cdcc110', 'That''s it exactly. You catch on quick. If you will, take a look at the damage, see what needs to be repaired, and fix it up for us.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 16, 's_a4a9c8e0', 'Oh, in that case I''d rather not do it.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 17, 's_ac061a6f', 'That sounds fine to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 18, 's_b2dd509a', 'Great. Our sensor array was damaged in the last attack on this village by the Sith Shadows. It needs to be repaired, but unfortunately, our chief engineer was also killed in the attack.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 19, 's_be3bc184', 'Hey! You got that all fixed up, didn''t you? And just in time. You''re all right, you know that?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 20, 's_c9f1dbdc', 'That doesn''t sound like something that I can do.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 21, 's_e05cc4d4', 'What''s going on here? I''m all confused! I don''t know what''s going on!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 22, 's_e26f0607', 'Of course you understand that this job will take a while, and if you agree to fix this thing, you won''t be able to help anyone else with anything for a while, right?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 23, 's_ebabb0f8', 'You there! Are you handy with a set of tools?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 24, 's_f1a421d', 'Say, I know you. They tell me you''ve been a great help. Good job.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 25, 's_f474ed78', 'Not really no.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 26, 's_fae10418', 'What are you doing here? You shouldn''t be here!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_quharek.stf', 27, 's_faf1fbe4', 'You there! Are you handy with a set of tools? Eh... looks like you''re too busy to help me anyway. Nevermind.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_sarguillo_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 3, 's_1cf74704', 'No. Kind of busy here coordinating patrols. What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 4, 's_55d76f7', 'Are you talking to me?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 5, 's_59b666a8', 'I''ve already talked to the Elder. I want to help with combat.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 6, 's_7c5b4636', 'You should speak to the Elder. He can give you all the help you need.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 7, 's_c96d6885', 'I''m here to offer my assistance.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 8, 's_ee7d6b1f', 'Good. Glad to have you aboard, but you''ll need to speak with Dageerin for your assignment. He''s over by the communal huts northwest of here. He has temporarily assumed command of the assault groups while I organize the defense.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_sarguillo_2.stf', 9, 's_ffe08b69', 'Check sector 4. The sensor array is indicating movement in that area. Probably just more brackasets.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (village_whip.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 3, 's_106cd909', 'I understand. Just come back if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 4, 's_1dac49d2', 'I hope you find them soon. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 5, 's_22a5c907', 'Hello.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 6, 's_22d4c864', 'I think that I can help with that.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 7, 's_24aab8ee', 'Right! I''ll get back to it!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 8, 's_2fdb8fbd', 'On second thought, I don''t think I can help right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 9, 's_321d7941', 'I see. Well come back if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 10, 's_32360540', 'Now is not really a good time. If you''re looking for some way to help, you should go talk to Captain Sarguillo.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 11, 's_33b9135e', 'As do I. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 12, 's_34ea67b6', 'Yes, that is fine.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 13, 's_35ee8c91', 'Blast it all, the count is still coming up short. Oh, I''m sorry, hello.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 14, 's_39f2cf64', 'Our struggle against the Sith Shadows has waged for many moons. We just recently repelled an attack against our village, but not without some losses, I''m afraid.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 15, 's_3c9eddca', 'Master... I must find the master...'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 16, 's_3e543459', 'Wonderful. You may want to begin by finding where the Sith Shadows went after we drove them away from the village. Our trackers have found a set of tracks leading off in this direction. That would be a good place to start.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 17, 's_40681425', 'I took a head count of both the survivors and the casualties, and the number came up short of what was expected. I fear the worst has happened.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 18, 's_455e077f', 'I''m sorry, I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 19, 's_4d0a11ef', 'You failed? That is disappointing, but we shouldn''t dwell on it. There are still more that are missing. Our trackers have found a new set of tracks leading in this direction.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 20, 's_4d59f240', 'It seems like it''s one thing after another around here.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 21, 's_54d57caf', 'I don''t think that I can help with this task.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 22, 's_550396aa', 'Well, we haven''t received a shipment in some time, and we are in dire need of supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 23, 's_551d5a8f', 'No one noticed they were taken captive?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 24, 's_5d0073c6', 'I''m sorry to hear that. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 25, 's_5d4ac8af', 'The Sith Shadows have been raiding our village for some time now. And now they''ve taken to attacking our supply transports from Endor.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 26, 's_6862142d', 'Excellent work, but I still count %DI still missing. Our trackers have found a new set of tracks in this direction. This might help you find the next Shadow camp.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 27, 's_6bd93e78', 'Oh, I see. Well come back if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 28, 's_6fb14c74', 'There is, in fact. We are low on manpower and we need someone to go get those supplies for us. We are tracking the emergency beacons from the transports, we just need someone to go there and try to salvage some supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 29, 's_74140308', 'Forgive my distraction. It seems we have quite a serious problem on our hands.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 30, 's_77e48d5b', 'What do you mean?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 31, 's_7b35cfbc', 'What is the problem?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 32, 's_7e76f08e', 'I will not deceive you. If the villagers have been captured by the Sith Shadows, there will undoubtedly be guards there. I''m sure they wouldn''t let you go without a fight.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 33, 's_8ccc4e47', 'That is excellent news. I appreciate all the help that we can get. There are five people missing from the village. If you can bring them all back alive, I will help you learn to use the Force to enhance your survival skills.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 34, 's_8dace66', 'I hope they turn up. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 35, 's_9129fd1b', 'That sounds like a job for someone else.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 36, 's_91bf5d37', 'I think that I can help you.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 37, 's_9359f893', 'Some of the higher ranking Sith Shadows are gifted in the ways of the Force. It is not unlikely that they were able to influence a few of the weaker members of our village.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 38, 's_981b299f', 'I understand. Good day to you.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 39, 's_a1ba7ed2', 'What''s the matter?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 40, 's_a32ebe9e', 'Very well. Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 41, 's_a767cb3c', 'Is there anything that I can do to help?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 42, 's_a80d9308', 'Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 43, 's_a984d976', 'You got all the supplies! That''s just great. You have no idea how badly they were needed. You have my eternal thanks.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 44, 's_ab0312ab', 'You rescued all the villagers! That''s fantastic. There are many families that owe you a debt of gratitude.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 45, 's_af518049', 'You lost the supplies? Those supplies are vital to the survival of the village, now more than ever. Here, we''ve located another lost transport, try to be more careful this time.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 46, 's_b8360516', 'I don''t mean to be rude, but you''re getting in my way.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 47, 's_bf15feab', 'Would that be dangerous?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 48, 's_bfc5a85d', 'Uh oh... it looks like something happened during the transmission of the emergency beacon location. Here, let me try again...'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 49, 's_bfdaca25', 'Say, could you... oh, it looks like you''re already pretty busy. On your way, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 50, 's_c2db6878', 'Good-bye.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 51, 's_cc5225b7', 'Excellent work! Supplies! Hey, we''ve got supplies over here! This is great, but there are still %DI more shipments that we were expecting. We''ve located another lost transport. Good luck, friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 52, 's_ccc7b5db', 'Uh oh... it looks like something happened during the transmission to your datapad. Here, let me try again...'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 53, 's_d18b8c00', 'That sounds like something that I could do.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 54, 's_d29a29d0', 'That doesn''t sound like something I can do.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 55, 's_d38b8e62', 'I understand. I will find the missing villagers.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 56, 's_d7ce4a0d', 'Oh, in that case I''d rather not.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 57, 's_d9ea288b', 'Yes, I will go find the missing supplies.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 58, 's_dc446bf8', 'How does that affect the village?'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 59, 's_dc8490a', 'I''ve got my responsibilities here at the village that I need to look after. What we really need is someone that can go out and find the missing people, and bring them back if possible.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 60, 's_dcf4498e', 'I need a new beacon location.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 61, 's_de007d6', 'Hey there. I heard you''ve been a big help around here. Great work!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 62, 's_e46c2ff7', 'I don''t need anything right now, but if you''re looking for something to do, I think that Dageerin could use some help.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 63, 's_e591b8a3', 'That''s great! If you help us get those supplies, I will help you learn to use the Force to enhance your vehicle control skills.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 64, 's_e780d201', 'I understand. Those emergency beacons aren''t as reliable as they probably should be. And those Sith Shadows are probably salvaging the last transport as we speak. There, I''ve loaded a new beacon location for you. Now hurry to Endor before it''s too late!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 65, 's_e9a9130f', 'I''m afraid that the missing people have been taken prisoner by the Sith Shadows during the last raid on the village. To make matters worse, we don''t have enough manpower right now to mount an effective search party to go look for them.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 66, 's_ea9470bd', 'Go on now! You''ve got to go find those missing villagers!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 67, 's_ed25aceb', 'Go on now! You''ve got to go find the missing supplies!'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 68, 's_edb238bc', 'Go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 69, 's_edfab808', 'OK. Here is the location of one of the emergency beacons from a supply transport. Go there, see what you can find, and try to salvage some supplies. But be careful, there are likely to be some Sith Shadows still hanging around.'),
('string/en/conversation/village_whip.stf', 70, 's_eefb2830', 'You must realize that this is not a task to be taken lightly. If you help me with this, you will not be able to assist anyone else for a while. Do you understand?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (wookiee_sidequest.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 3, 's_134245b0', '(in Shyriiwook) Your nerves of steel will prove to be an asset. I expect you to succeed. I have entered all the information, as I know it, into your datapad. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 4, 's_19bc1717', '(in Shyriiwook) I''m glad to see you well, my friend. It is an honor to see you again. I have heard of your success. Very well done! I thank you as do the former slaves. However... happy moments must come with the ill-favored. I have more sad news.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 5, 's_1a7fb36b', '(in Shyriiwook) It is nice to see that such a young tree dweller hold such respect for others. Yes, you and I will get along very well. On to more important news... There is rumor that a ship, filled with wookiee slaves, is en route to where the ''cargo'' will be dropped off and practically left for dead. We cannot let this pass. It will mean suffering for our fellows. You will need to patrol and keep your senses keen for signals from the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 6, 's_1bd5f568', '(in Shyriiwook) This undoubtedly depresses me. However, there is still time. Please try again. For the sake of our own. You will, correct?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 7, 's_1e97d877', '(in Shyriiwook) Oh yeah! Sorry.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 8, 's_1fefaaf', '(in Shyriiwook) The very fibers of your being disgust me. You will only help for a pinch of credits?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 9, 's_220e79bb', 'There is rumor that a ship, filled with wookiee slaves, is en route to where the ''cargo'' will be dropped off and practically left for dead. We cannot let this pass. It will mean suffering for our fellows. You will need to patrol and keep your senses keen for signals from the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 10, 's_226ffd3d', '(in Shyriiwook) Be safe, my young friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 11, 's_24e34e5a', '(in Shyriiwook) I am disappointed. Let us hope I will find another one of us to aid in this situation.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 12, 's_26343911', '(in Shyriiwook) Oh, yes. Our species is a strong one. This you know. However, with a certain mix of chemicals, we can fall much like the mightiest tree in a single blow. With help, I was able to track down a squadron of ships transporting such a chemical. We must intervene. It is the same chemicals used by the slavers to capture our people. It is imperative that we find the squadron and destroy them and find the chemicals.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 13, 's_2934a8b2', '(in Shyriiwook) Then go. I have uploaded the information to your datapad.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 14, 's_2a6fa56e', '(in Shyriiwook) I see.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 15, 's_2aa249ad', '(in Shyriiwook) Just as I suspected. You are a disgrace to our species. Be gone with you!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 16, 's_361ea065', '(in Shyriiwook) I need more information about my mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 17, 's_37ce251c', '(in Shyriiwook) I see. More of our people will suffer then. Pity.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 18, 's_3a2c3dd4', '(in Shyriiwook) Surely I deserve something for my efforts.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 19, 's_3a2e34', '(in Shyriiwook) You truly are a role-model for our young brethren. Thank you for your assistance during these hard times. I have no more tasks for you, but hope you''ll come visit often.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 20, 's_3c52272b', '(in Shyriiwook) There is a shipment of chemicals that can render even the toughest Krayt Dragon unconcious. We must not let it be duplicated or destributed. It is your duty to find the squadron transporting the chemicals and correct the situation.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 21, 's_40a86cc7', '(in Shyriiwook) Pretty much, yeah.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 22, 's_418bd43b', '(in Shyriiwook) I am honored to have you fighting for us, my friend. I have entered the necessarily information into your datapad. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 23, 's_4273039a', '(in Shyriiwook) For our people.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 24, 's_474df52d', '(in Shyriiwook) Of course not. Thank you for helping us in these dark times. I hope to see you again in the future.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 25, 's_5264aa09', '(in Shyriiwook) Go then and be victorious!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 26, 's_550c3e6c', '(in Shyriiwook) I am encouraged by your steel composure and concentration of the tasks at hand. I have entered the necessarily information into your datapad. If you require additional information or help, I will be glad to answer your questions and help you. Good luck!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 27, 's_5a73125d', '(in Shyriiwook) I am saddened by this news. But if it is your wish.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 28, 's_5c3cf25c', '(in Shyriiwook) It is a possibility that the ship was abandoned in hostile space. Perhaps our fellows were strong enough to overrun the slave trader ship and have no need for our assistance. It is all uncertain. I respectfully suggest keeping your mind clear and wits about you. There''s no telling what may happen. Space can be a trecherous place, indeed. '),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 29, 's_5ca1856a', '(in Shyriiwook) I will help our friends, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 30, 's_5f70e035', '(in Shyriiwook) And the day grows bleak. It truly is a sad day.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 31, 's_621bb7c1', '(in Shyriiwook) I will. Good bye!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 32, 's_62be250f', '(in Shyriiwook) I was quite disappointed when you refused to aid our brethren. But... I am grateful for the assistance, but be sure you want to help us.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 33, 's_6420b547', '(in Shyriiwook) I was successful in freeing the slaves.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 34, 's_65c23663', '(in Shyriiwook) I see. I am quite disappointed. Perhaps I will be able to find another to help us. Pity. You held such promise.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 35, 's_66c52109', '(in Shyriiwook) Your hungry response gives me hope. Go then, rescue our brethren from the clutches of despair!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 36, 's_69e4801e', '(in Shyriiwook) No. I have other matters to which I must attend.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 37, 's_6c34509e', '(in Shyriiwook) Ah, a fellow wookiee. It is good to meet you. And yet... it seems you are not a pilot. There is a certain manner in which commanders of their own ships hold their head. You do not possess such poise. Nonetheless... if you do happen to learn the skills of space, please come see me. I may have work for you to do. Carry on, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 38, 's_7164f5e', '(in Shyriiwook) You will soon anger me. Will you help those of our species in need or not?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 39, 's_77603222', '(in Shyriiwook) I''m glad to see that one of my own has dared to brave the vastness of the galaxy. I trust your skill in piloting has been honed by the best teachers? You could very well need it if you agree to help me.. or should I say, ''us''. Members of our species are in trouble and could use someone like you to be their hero.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 40, 's_7c2446cd', '(in Shyriiwook) What''s your story?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 41, 's_7c2995a9', '(in Shyriiwook) For our species.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 42, 's_7f997ce7', '(in Shyriiwook) Be on your way. Make me proud, young friend. Adn thank you for taking an interest in an old wookiee like me. It warms my heart.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 43, 's_8462e1e2', '(in Shyriiwook) If you''re paying, I''m listening.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 44, 's_8a54c987', '(in Shyriiwook) I must refuse.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 45, 's_8dac9978', '(in Shyriiwook) I will help!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 46, 's_8dae50e8', '(in Shyriiwook) Indeed. Be safe and keeps your wits about you, my friend.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 47, 's_915d2cbf', '(in Shyriiwook) Now.. what was this about another mission?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 48, 's_98c8d9d0', '(in Shyriiwook) That''s horrible! You must be devastated.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 49, 's_9bcffeac', '(in Shyriiwook) This mission sounds as if it would exceed my skills.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 50, 's_a1689abe', '(in Shyriiwook) Please tell me more, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 51, 's_a5415008', '(in Shyriiwook) I see. If you must refuse, I have no choice but to accept your decision.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 52, 's_a6b8e0dd', '(in Shyriiwook) Go on.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 53, 's_a74d5cf4', '(in Shyriiwook) Such a harsh answer. You would rather see our fellows suffer if not for a bit of monetary reward?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 54, 's_a8f54dbe', '(in Shyriiwook) I am sure you enjoyed refusing to help. Leave now. I cannot bear to look upon your face.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 55, 's_ac48a861', '(in Shyriiwook) We must intervene. It is the same chemicals used by the slavers to capture our people. It is imperative that we find the squadron and destroy them and find the chemicals. Will you find these shipments and return?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 56, 's_ac9e5091', '(in Shyriiwook) I didn''t hear anything mentioned about a reward.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 57, 's_aedac34b', '(in Shyriiwook) You know my requirements. Nothing is for free.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 58, 's_b01c946e', '(in Shyriiwook) Yes, sir!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 59, 's_b20f0149', '(in Shyriiwook) I''m going to pass on this mission.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 60, 's_b269d401', '(in Shyriiwook) Yes, I do. Thank you for the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 61, 's_b5ee0393', '(in Shyriiwook) My story? Why would you take such an interest in me? It is a request I am not quite used to. I am merely a fellow wookiee, trying to find his place in such a vast galaxy. I was trained to be a pilot as soon as I can remember. I had a great life until my accident which tore my wings from me. I am blind, you see. Sparks erupted from the damage my ship took during one mission. I haven''t been able to see since.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 62, 's_b674edb2', '(in Shyriiwook) I''m sure.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 63, 's_b6b02065', '(in Shyriiwook) Very well. I have no choice. It has been desperate times and I will accept the help of anyone. Even you. Let me go on... Our species is a strong one. This you know. However, with a certain mix of chemicals, we can fall much like the mightiest tree in a single blow. With help, I was able to track down a squadron of ships transporting such a chemical. '),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 64, 's_b9bff63b', '(in Shyriiwook) Mmm.. I''ll get back to you on that.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 65, 's_ba31d7f4', '(in Shyriiwook) I do not like your attitude. Our species is respectful to all beings, including our own. Have you not learned that? *sigh* No matter. There is rumor that a ship, filled with wookiee slaves, is en route to where the ''cargo'' will be dropped off and practically left for dead. We cannot let this pass. It will mean suffering for our fellows. You will need to patrol and keep your senses keen for signals from the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 66, 's_bcd42bbd', '(in Shyriiwook) May fortune shine upon you.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 67, 's_c089c686', '(in Shyriiwook) I cannot bear to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 68, 's_c65fb1ba', '(in Shyriiwook) Ah! Good to see you, my honorable friend. Alas, I have no more work for you but appreciate the visit. Indeed, I must return to my work. I must teach my fledgling pilots the art of formations via pictrol images and demonstration from my teaching assistants. Be safe and honorable.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 69, 's_c8950314', '*enter correct wookie jarble here*'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 70, 's_c9c583c7', '(in Shyriiwook) All is not lost. There''s still time. Go out there and try again. There is no such thing as ''too late''.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 71, 's_caa1385e', '(in Shyriiwook) Our brethren have been captured on a ship en route to a prison in which they will, no doubt, suffer. It is your mission to find the ship before it reaches its destination. I have given you a point in which you must start looking. Keep your senses and systems open. It is likely they may try to send a distess signal to aid you. Do you understand?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 72, 's_ce7c2b5d', '(in Shyriiwook) I want the job you mentioned earlier.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 73, 's_d1b602c1', '(in Shyriiwook) Sure, I guess.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 74, 's_d4017dcd', '(in Shyriiwook) It is a possibility that the ship was abandoned in hostile space. Perhaps our fellows were strong enough to overrun the slave trader ship and have no need for our assistance. It is all uncertain. I respectfully suggest keeping your mind clear and wits about you. There''s no telling what may happen. Space can be a trecherous place, indeed. What say you, fellow?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 75, 's_d6d7f320', '(in Shyriiwook) Please! Do not pity me. I have since been elevated to a senior position. I am able to teach young pilots by words alone. I am still very happy. But yes, I do miss being able to fly; seeing the stars whiz past as I hurry into battle. Those were good days. I hope to see you earn the honor and reputation you deserve one day. Bah! I''m babbling. Do you not have a mission to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 76, 's_da183c96', '(in Shyriiwook) Good. I have entered the necessarily information into your datapad. If you require additional information or help, I will be glad to answer your questions and help you. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 77, 's_dc3b96b5', '(in Shyriiwook) I am too disappointed to try again.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 78, 's_dd0ad352', '(in Shyriiwook) Your intent stare is unnerving. But if you can fly, then by all means, I am honored to have you aboard! There is rumor that a ship, filled with wookiee slaves, is en route to where the ''cargo'' will be dropped off and practically left for dead. We cannot let this pass. It will mean suffering for our fellows. You will need to patrol and keep your senses keen for signals from the ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 79, 's_dd1be097', '(in Shyriiwook) Thank you and goodbye.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 80, 's_de93f602', '(in Shyriiwook) Of course!'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 81, 's_dfbfa15d', '(in Shyriiwook) That''s terrible! I''m interested in hearing more, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 82, 's_dff4891', '(in Shyriiwook) Thank you.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 83, 's_e2942645', '(in Shyriiwook) I''m listening.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 84, 's_e305d81d', '(in Shyriiwook) Nah, I think I''m gonna pass.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 85, 's_e34cea4e', '(in Shyriiwook) You are a true testament to our people! Your enthusiasm brings me hope. The information has been uploaded to your datapad. May fortune shine upon you.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 86, 's_e3ae04b5', '(in Shyriiwook) I cannot bear to speak with you. I will find someone else to help our fellows. You are not fit to do so.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 87, 's_e5d57a18', '(in Shyriiwook) Of course! How thoughtless of me. I present you with gratitude and a token of my appreciation.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 88, 's_e5e0f00d', '(in Shyriiwook) Good! Please try again. I am counting on you.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 89, 's_e6017d65', '(in Shyriiwook) Thank you for the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 90, 's_e68cd354', '(in Shyriiwook) I see you have returned. What is your status? Can you offer me any updates?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 91, 's_e88fac47', '(in Shyriiwook) Our species is a strong one. This you know. However, with a certain mix of chemicals, we can fall much like the mightiest tree in a single blow. With help, I was able to track down a squadron of ships transporting such a chemical. We must intervene. It is the same chemicals used by the slavers to capture our people. It is imperative that we find the squadron and destroy them and find the chemicals.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 92, 's_e8d13d8a', '(in Shyriiwook) I guess not. So you''ve got my interest.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 93, 's_ee27bc0d', '(in Shyriiwook) Yeah?'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 94, 's_ef2d67f1', '(in Shyriiwook) Continue, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 95, 's_f24156ae', '(in Shyriiwook) I failed to free the slaves.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 96, 's_f584a39', '(in Shyriiwook) No, now that I think about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 97, 's_f6c0338f', '(in Shyriiwook) That''s correct.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 98, 's_f83c0824', '(in Shyriiwook) I failed to recover the shipments of spice.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 99, 's_f8a39ed7', '(in Shyriiwook) I was successful in securing the shipments of spice.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 100, 's_fbb5fd3a', '(in Shyriiwook) I suppose.'),
('string/en/conversation/wookiee_sidequest.stf', 101, 's_fd24ad6b', '(in Shyriiwook) Aren''t you forgetting something?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 1, 'do_not_edit', 'The English version of this file (yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf) is automatically generated by the SwgConversationEditor.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 2, 's_0', ''),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 3, 's_11e0bfe9', 'Bah, I want action. Any duties?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 4, 's_12a5eddf', '[gripe about last mission]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 5, 's_14086bc1', 'That woman is vital to Alliance interests. You''re going back out there, stat.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 6, 's_14bcd839', 'Not for long he doesn''t. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 7, 's_15192b9e', 'Aw. Sorry it''s been so rough on you. Come back once you''ve caught up on your damn beauty sleep.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 8, 's_154b642e', 'We know now why the Empire is so interested in Yavin. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 9, 's_1583743c', 'Do you have any missions I could fly?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 10, 's_1591adc2', 'My ship''s ready to go. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 11, 's_165db597', 'I want mission 1.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 12, 's_166e7e70', 'Not in the shape I''m in.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 13, 's_18ac5f05', 'Turns out the Death Star section didn''t burn up in the freighter explosion. It fell to Lok - and Nym''s got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 14, 's_1a163be3', 'Maybe you''ll have better luck at another post. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 15, 's_1a1b1cf0', 'Move along. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 16, 's_1b4c2d5d', 'I''d rather be shooting down some Imperials.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 17, 's_1bab5480', 'Sorry to hear that I''m not your top priority, soldier! I''ll remember this.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 18, 's_1c128099', 'That''s right. Suit up. You''re heading back to Lok. Get the Death Star section from Nym. He''s charging a fee. Don''t worry about it; the Alliance will pay.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 19, 's_1f02f56b', 'How about now?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 20, 's_1f1b512d', 'Pass? Who passes on training? I hope whatever else you''re doing is just as useful.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 21, 's_214de988', 'It''s been my honor and privilege Major.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 22, 's_21bdbf0f', 'Imperial forces don''t own Yavin.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 23, 's_22bd4bdf', 'When I want your opinion, soldier, I''ll tell you what it is. She''s ready to go, and WE''RE ready to help her in any way we can. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 24, 's_241bc364', 'My ship''s no match for TIE fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 25, 's_252b3bf5', 'I''ll give it another shot. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 26, 's_25670467', 'You''ve earned it. Hit the cantina.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 27, 's_2588496a', 'Lok? I thought you said they are taking the debris to Naboo!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 28, 's_260761cf', 'I''m not the one for the job. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 29, 's_27ad3073', '%NU! Get over here. I''ve got a job for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 30, 's_27b3d1b3', 'Plenty. Take a look.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 31, 's_2857391a', 'He has to charge us, or they''ll kick him out of the pirate guild. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 32, 's_287ec62a', 'No harm meant, sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 33, 's_29b7d74a', 'Sounds like you need a new ship.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 34, 's_2a29add6', 'Nice job out there. It''s not every day I see a pilot outrun a TIE Interceptor.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 35, 's_2bc43dfd', 'Come again?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 36, 's_2bf9b1f7', 'Oh yeah.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 37, 's_2dec7766', 'Why is the Empire going after Yavin?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 38, 's_2e17432d', 'If she wants to stay, why force her to leave?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 39, 's_2e8799ad', 'See you around, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 40, 's_2eef8e0e', 'I''m counting on you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 41, 's_2f0a6ba8', 'What could these dregs possibly teach me?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 42, 's_2f9e3b7b', 'Maybe later.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 43, 's_308630ef', 'You will do well in the Rebel Navy pilot. Now you are to report to a Bothan named Arnecio Ulvaw''op in a science outpost on the planet of Dathomir. Be careful there %TU, that''s a dangerous place. Now get out of here and remember everything you''ve learned!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 44, 's_30e8e9e0', 'Unless you''re here to request a transfer, I''d suggest you get back to your unit.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 45, 's_313aff7d', 'Why did she stay behind?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 46, 's_31f57362', 'Give the job to a more experienced pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 47, 's_32146025', 'Then what?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 48, 's_329b2195', 'We haven''t made any arrests, because we don''t have any details  - yet. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 49, 's_32a7abcd', 'They''re passing through Lok. Nym and his space pirates run that system with an iron fist. In exchange for some services they have provided us with some coordinates that the freighter will pass through.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 50, 's_32c8e4da', 'I don''t know where you think you''re going. There''s work to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 51, 's_354d9179', 'Take a walk. Clear your head. I''ll be here when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 52, 's_35783339', 'She''s not just any refugee, and the Empire knows it.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 53, 's_36b1d069', 'Be on your way then.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 54, 's_38bfb556', 'Hm. Good point. I''ll just use you for the easy jobs.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 55, 's_38e4c8a3', 'For some other pilot, maybe.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 56, 's_38f14bb8', 'And that''s where I come in.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 57, 's_393047f3', 'Get going.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 58, 's_3938bdfc', 'You could have fooled me.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 59, 's_39acc227', 'Pirates don''t do anything for free.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 60, 's_3c468733', 'You heard me. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 61, 's_3c4ff185', 'Reactor Engineering Algorithms'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 62, 's_3c9ecbe9', 'I didn''t expect those Imperial rescue squads to respond so quickly.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 63, 's_3d2dd8e2', 'Is this a joke? When are they going to start sending me some REAL pilots?...Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 64, 's_3d419bc4', 'NYM''s got it? Why hasn''t he sent it here?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 65, 's_3de0965c', 'Such as?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 66, 's_3e7eb818', 'It''s on Lok. Nym''s got it. And he''s ready to hand it over - if the price is right. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 67, 's_3f00169', 'That''s the one?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 68, 's_418a4a24', 'Sorry, %TU.  You''re on report.  That means no more missions for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 69, 's_434cf40e', 'Good news, soldier. One of my best pilots has volunteered to train new recruits - and that includes you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 70, 's_4431cbae', 'You feeling all right? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 71, 's_44584a57', 'Our spy droids have located a database within the Death Star debris listing many of the Imperial spies operating within the Alliance. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 72, 's_4471d2b', 'All that work- for nothing.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 73, 's_44d689b7', 'Well, sorry.  Nothing I can do about it.  If you want to get your wings back you''ll have to do SOMETHING to improve your standing in the eyes of the Alliance.  ''Show ''em you''re still on OUR team.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 74, 's_450abd55', 'You lost the battle - but the war''s not over. The Alliance still needs you. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 75, 's_45b2289f', 'That''s your choice?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 76, 's_468ab4d3', 'Reporting for duty.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 77, 's_46fb1c35', 'I''m ready to blast some pirates out of the sky.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 78, 's_47003e68', 'We have to stop them!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 79, 's_47a389f6', 'I''ll be right back.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 80, 's_4c6d0461', 'Yeah right. Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 81, 's_4ca03ddb', 'How so?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 82, 's_4cc5f79c', 'No one ever tells me anything.  Maybe Alliance Intelligence found out something about you they didn''t like.  You haven''t been doing anything they might take the wrong way, have you?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 83, 's_4e2c42f1', 'I guess you''re right.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 84, 's_5018d177', 'The Empire''s done a good job covering their tracks. However, our spy droids have located a database within the Death Star debris listing many of the Imperial spies operating within the Alliance. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 85, 's_5242f9d0', 'Since you''re not a member of my unit, I can''t assign you missions. Why don''t you scuttle back to your own commanding officer?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 86, 's_535a48bf', 'Is that right?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 87, 's_53de9d8f', 'Like what?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 88, 's_5494c458', 'Right. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 89, 's_564211e6', '[not interested]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 90, 's_56b0632', 'A Rebel pilot, eh? But you don''t fly with the Phoenix? What are you doing here, soldier?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 91, 's_591601b8', 'They won''t shoot me down again. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 92, 's_5ab73a77', 'Double-time, soldier! I''ve got a job for you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 93, 's_5c4ab8c9', 'It won''t be easy. An Imperial Recovery team is transporting the database section to Naboo right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 94, 's_5e5b4379', 'The Eker that defected from the Empire. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 95, 's_5e7c5f7b', 'I wonder why.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 96, 's_5fdfb6c3', 'You''re to take your ship to the Massassi temple, pick her up at the extraction point, and bring her back to base.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 97, 's_61b35d7b', 'Come again? I''d think very carefully about what comes out of your mouth next, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 98, 's_62b1a1d0', 'Give me the droid.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 99, 's_62f0f943', 'Better give the job to another pilot.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 100, 's_643292f4', '%TU! Just the person I wanted to see. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 101, 's_64b6ea44', 'I want mission 2.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 102, 's_65c36194', 'On second thought, no.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 103, 's_6673b556', 'Give me a job.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 104, 's_67a197b0', 'Will do, but it''s going to have to happen later.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 105, 's_67c78480', 'Unknown - although I have a theory. Are you ready to go?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 106, 's_6a18240d', 'It''s just my way of teaching. Anyway, you are to report to a Bothan named Arnecio Ulvaw''op in a science outpost on the planet of Dathomir. Remember what you''ve learned during your time here and be careful %TU!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 107, 's_6a1944ad', 'I knew you would.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 108, 's_6a1c47d9', 'Yes SIR.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 109, 's_6aacd1f1', 'Why not? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 110, 's_6b158a0e', 'I''m a Developer/Tester and want missions.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 111, 's_6b8fc506', 'You''re a real go-getter, you know that?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 112, 's_6bb0cb94', 'Correct.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 113, 's_6c251948', 'You got it.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 114, 's_6c872984', 'Go back to Lok, get the Death Star section from Nym, and bring it to the Rebel space station in the Lok system. And the sooner you leave, the better.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 115, 's_6d00e51e', 'Bring it on.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 116, 's_6d80a4d8', 'Are you ready for duty? There''s plenty of work to be done around here.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 117, 's_6dccb496', 'That''s nice to hear. Her safe arrival is now your top priority. You''re to take your ship to the Massassi temple, pick her up at the extraction point, and bring her back to base.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 118, 's_6deac9a2', 'Let me just tie up some loose ends, and I''ll be ready to report for duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 119, 's_6fe71f0c', 'Get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 120, 's_7065e138', ' Any chance we''ll see some action?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 121, 's_7115a155', 'No thanks, I''d rather not.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 122, 's_71bb443b', 'Where are the spies?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 123, 's_71f6ca11', 'Good to see you %TU! I''m afraid that our time of service together has come to an end. The Navy has requested your presence at a different location. I just wanted to let you know that even though I''ve been hard on you now and then, you''ve been one of my best pilots ever %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 124, 's_72c594c9', 'Fraid not, sir. I''ve got some things to take care of.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 125, 's_73c783f8', 'Stealing Imperial ships? Sounds like fun.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 126, 's_73ccefde', 'Space Combat Techniques'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 127, 's_753a307b', 'Very well. Escort mission in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 128, 's_76473360', 'They used to say that about me too. Don''t let me down.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 129, 's_76491b38', 'Unknown. But we don''t leave anyone behind. Do you copy, pilot?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 130, 's_78bae101', 'Send someone else to get that database.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 131, 's_7b2f5e99', 'Make it quick. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 132, 's_7b3f9583', 'Good. I''m ready to rumble.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 133, 's_7b4382cf', 'I''m ready to blast that thing.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 134, 's_7b57442', 'You''ve got to find those pirates. They know where that Imperial freighter is. We HAVE to find it. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 135, 's_7f93598d', '[shrug, start to turn away]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 136, 's_7f9b8387', 'Why not?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 137, 's_80d8485c', 'I''m on it.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 138, 's_80e4843e', 'I''ll help escort some smugglers.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 139, 's_813ee7df', 'Thanks for giving me a chance.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 140, 's_816055e2', 'I want mission 4.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 141, 's_81fb32f3', 'At this point, we can''t afford NOT to buy it. Go back to Lok. Pay Nym his fee. And bring back that Death Star!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 142, 's_82844140', 'What you need is some discipline. I advise you to take on some duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 143, 's_82b46acf', 'You sure you can handle it?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 144, 's_837615b6', 'That was a hell of a fight for one refugee. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 145, 's_841d27db', 'Why?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 146, 's_851cc47', 'Lok? I thought you said the recovery team is heading to Naboo!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 147, 's_8650827b', 'Is that right? Well in that case, why are you still standing here? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 148, 's_865fdc7d', 'Alliance forces are rounding up the Imperial spies as we speak.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 149, 's_8740fd1', 'I''m too busy to deal with you now... whatever you are.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 150, 's_877ef2c8', 'I know a good soldier when I see one.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 151, 's_8786e77c', 'Come back. I expect my soldiers to be in top condition. And you need the exercise.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 152, 's_88179ade', 'That''s a negative. We''ve got a holdout down there. A female. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 153, 's_895e16f4', 'Good choice. Come back when you''re done. We''ve got work to do.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 154, 's_8a4cdaa1', 'All I want to do is take out some Imperial fighters. Any duties?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 155, 's_8bdbd90b', 'Where are the Empire forces?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 156, 's_8bea99a9', 'Watch their maneuvers. Imperial forces are predictable. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 157, 's_8c839067', 'Very well. Inspect mission in Lok sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 158, 's_8d0a5ef4', 'I don''t know! Why don''t we find out?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 159, 's_8d66b6a5', '[Crack about Eker''s Empire ties]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 160, 's_8e571bd6', 'Extraction is my specialty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 161, 's_8e9d0848', '[nod]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 162, 's_8efa75c2', 'It won''t be easy; you''ll have to smuggle it past Imperial patrols. Keep your eyes peeled. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 163, 's_8f0eb0e', 'This uniform comes off, you know.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 164, 's_8f4bcc2b', 'You''re passing up a good offer here.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 165, 's_8f9a3bf4', 'Never mind. My mistake. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 166, 's_908b2b2c', 'Watch your six. There are plenty of experienced TIE fighters up there. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 167, 's_91156160', 'Recovery duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 168, 's_91746e6', 'Very well. Inspect mission in Yavin sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 169, 's_918115be', 'Apparently there''s sections of the space station there that are still intact... And have important information.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 170, 's_92310551', 'You''re not...THE Eker, are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 171, 's_928a5ee3', 'I''m Major Eker. I am your commanding officer.  You are going to do what I say, when I say it. Do we understand each other?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 172, 's_94dbed1a', 'I''m still waiting on your mission report, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 173, 's_9525ae41', 'It is. But first it has to pass through Lok. And Nym and his men know everything about that system. You can''t cut a fart in Lok without Nym hearing about it. He''s SURE to know the location of the Imperial freighter.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 174, 's_954c43bb', 'Escort duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 175, 's_97073639', 'Good. I look forward to seeing what you''re capable of. Get settled in and return to me when you are ready for your first duty mission. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 176, 's_9777c464', 'Good work, soldier. With this information, we''ll be able to run rings around those Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 177, 's_97f7a201', 'What''s her problem? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 178, 's_98361f2c', 'You''re not the first person to say that to me. It''s all right. I''ll find another pilot. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 179, 's_98d991e7', 'Weapons B, Intermediate Alliance Starship Ordnance'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 180, 's_998c6a73', 'Well in that case, get out of here, and don''t talk to me again until you''re ready to work.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 181, 's_9b34069d', 'No wait, let me think about this.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 182, 's_9b43a7ee', 'Yes sir.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 183, 's_9bcf9c5b', 'You''re to take your ship to the Massassi temple, pick her up at the extraction point, and bring her back to base.  Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 184, 's_9c34f0ad', 'I know you. You better get out of here if you know what''s good for you. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 185, 's_9d95a0f8', 'Very well. Escort mission in Yavin sector. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 186, 's_9ddb6cf8', 'Right now, her problem is that her pilot''s got a negative attitude.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 187, 's_9ec42807', 'Nice to see you again, %TU. They tell me you''ve been a great help to the Alliance since you I last saw you. Looks like you turned out alright.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 188, 's_a0412756', 'That would explain their heavy presence in the debris field.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 189, 's_a10e0cd4', 'The war''s not over yet. The Empire''s going to respond with force. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 190, 's_a1f998fd', 'Correct. We need you to travel to Lok and steal that data before the shuttle reaches a safe location.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 191, 's_a35edd6c', 'I''m going to be your worst nightmare, if you keep talking to me. Now get out of here.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 192, 's_a57083c1', 'Are you kidding me? Just what the galaxy needs, another cowboy. Get out of here! '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 193, 's_a6e1c30a', 'Very well, what does this pilot think he can ''teach'' me?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 194, 's_a7558b8', 'Proceed to the Lok system and we will supply you with the coordinates we got from Nym. Search the nearby area there, if the freighter is not in sight, wait near the point to ambush him when he arrives.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 195, 's_a760a737', 'An Imperial Spy shuttle has malfunctioned in our area. We think it''s carrying data on the Imperial Navy''s patrol routes. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 196, 's_a86a8807', 'Looks like I was right about you after all.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 197, 's_a99ad4e8', 'Sounds easy enough. Where do I find them?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 198, 's_a9d63a81', 'I''m ready for duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 199, 's_aaf61b87', 'Fine, what tasks are available right now?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 200, 's_ae785ffa', '[ask for more info]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 201, 's_af144418', 'I don''t think I can fight for a man who once served the Emperor.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 202, 's_affe46cc', 'Give me something to do. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 203, 's_b030df0f', 'Looking for people who are aligned with the Empire. Should I send someone over here to take you into custody?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 204, 's_b0753766', 'It is. But first it has to pass through Lok. Nym and his men know everything about that system and have provided us with coordinates that it will pass through. You can''t cut a fart in Lok without Nym hearing about it.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 205, 's_b130ff0a', 'My ship needs repairs.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 206, 's_b1df084d', '[ask for information]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 207, 's_b2e340f6', 'What''s that?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 208, 's_b2e9d505', 'He''s CHARGING us? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 209, 's_b532b4dc', 'I hate the Empire. I hate it more than anybody else you''ll ever meet. With me, you will have the chance to hit Imperial forces like never before. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 210, 's_b54697f', 'Sounds good to me. What''s available?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 211, 's_b585598c', 'It''s pretty hairy up there.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 212, 's_b601ca9f', 'I don''t know. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 213, 's_b685e199', 'Congratulations, soldier. You did good today.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 214, 's_b6af2b98', 'I want mission 3.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 215, 's_b6cf63f0', 'Two reasons. One, he doesn''t want Imperial patrols to spot him. Two, he wants us to pay his fee.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 216, 's_b9adf734', 'I''m more used to shooting TIE fighters.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 217, 's_bb25f9e7', '[look away in disgust]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 218, 's_bb847e4c', 'I''m just saying.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 219, 's_bc57b086', 'Sounds good to me.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 220, 's_be61c03c', 'Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 221, 's_bf176a8f', 'I''ve read your report. I know what kind of pilot you are. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 222, 's_c1015a4d', 'You sound like an Imperial officer.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 223, 's_c3c8f385', '[silence]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 224, 's_c3e68b1f', 'I need a drink.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 225, 's_c4480fc5', 'We''re uploading coordinates to your navigation system now. You''re clear to leave our airspace.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 226, 's_c48841', 'Until they reroute their patrols.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 227, 's_c4f8041b', 'Immediately. Coordinates are already in your ship database. You''re to take your ship to the Massassi temple, pick her up at the extraction point, and bring her back to base.  '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 228, 's_c551ea96', 'Looks that way.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 229, 's_c56973bf', 'Done. The coordinates are already in your nav system.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 230, 's_c6c91897', 'Multi-Role Craft'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 231, 's_c909e899', 'What do you think this is %TU?! You will do as you''re told or you will be put under arrest!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 232, 's_c928423d', 'The Imperial Recovery team seized the Death Star section before we could get the data. It''s en route to Naboo as we speak. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 233, 's_c9846d38', 'That won''t happen - not for a while. The Empire doesn''t exactly  turn on a dime. Good work, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 234, 's_ca47d528', 'Sounds good. What is there to do?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 235, 's_ca4d37ba', 'When do I leave for Yavin?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 236, 's_ca776e30', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 237, 's_cc00d56b', 'I don''t have any missions, but I do have several elective duty tasks if you''d like to take one of those?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 238, 's_cc34a699', 'Which Eker is that?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 239, 's_cd0a60d4', 'I''ll get it.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 240, 's_cd41219', 'They''re all trained the same way. Once you''ve learned their rules, you can break them. Good luck.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 241, 's_cdb6a148', 'You look like your dog just died.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 242, 's_ceb818e1', 'You can count on it. Imperial TIE fighters are patrolling the area. The Empire''s taken a serious interest in this system.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 243, 's_cec991df', 'If we can get that information, we can protect our ships. I need you get out there and shoot a spy droid into the shuttle''s hull, so that we can extract the information.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 244, 's_d24a2285', 'Will do.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 245, 's_d270ae31', 'You come see me when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 246, 's_d2acb60b', 'Take on some duties.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 247, 's_d3b6ccb7', 'You can count on it. Dismissed.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 248, 's_d5609495', 'That''s serious.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 249, 's_d583db1d', 'I signed up to shoot TIE fighters, not this kind of stuff.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 250, 's_d5b4ea09', 'Because I told them to come here. They''re my old friends after all. That''s your point, isn''t it?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 251, 's_d5c526b8', 'Dismissed, soldier. As of NOW.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 252, 's_d6896b', 'You''ll get your chance, soldier - unless they hit you first. Move into position, and we''ll tell you more over your comlink.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 253, 's_d6f036fd', 'That''s what I thought you''d say. Get moving, we''ll update you once you''re airborne. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 254, 's_d757b665', 'Whenever you''re ready.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 255, 's_d76c93fd', 'Take it to the Rebel space station in Lok. And keep it out of sight of those Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 256, 's_d80e99ca', 'You''re to take your ship to the Massassi temple, pick her up at the extraction point, and bring her back to base.  We''re uploading coordinates to your ship now. Get going.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 257, 's_d8db54f6', 'Send me back out there!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 258, 's_d8fef41', 'Perhaps not...'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 259, 's_d8ffe780', 'Sitrep is as follows: we''ve got a VIP down on the surface. She resisted the first evacuation, but now she''s ready for exfil. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 260, 's_d931ff32', 'Never better! Good news, soldier. The Death Star section didn''t burn up in the explosion.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 261, 's_d945a469', 'No attitude problem, sir. I''m ready to go. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 262, 's_d9c145dd', 'The sooner the better.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 263, 's_d9cced1f', 'Absolutely.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 264, 's_dd0cb0d4', 'Why are you telling me this?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 265, 's_dd2fd70', 'What can he teach me?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 266, 's_dd3bf8f6', 'You''re going to have a lot more than your ship to worry about if we don''t get that database!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 267, 's_dede1eae', 'Do I have to pay them for the training?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 268, 's_dee42d5e', 'If that''s the way you feel. See you around, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 269, 's_df72e251', 'They didn''t want me to give you this mission, you know. Said I couldn''t trust you.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 270, 's_e015a069', 'No. It''s carrying information on Imperial spies. We need that data.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 271, 's_e0651b79', 'I know what''s at stake. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 272, 's_e18f6059', 'I can''t think of one good reason for you to be talking to me, can you? On your way, then.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 273, 's_e23e884f', 'I''ll be more useful somewhere else.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 274, 's_e39ec30', 'Do you still need me?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 275, 's_e53c5017', 'What mission do you want?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 276, 's_e58651c5', ' I thought Yavin had already been evacuated. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 277, 's_e641a3d8', 'I have a few different duty missions available. Help steal Imperial ships, destroy pirate patrols or help escort Alliance smugglers. Take your pick pilot. I want you to assist with these duties until you feel you have enough experience to proceed with training. They are voluntarily missions and can be aborted at any time.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 278, 's_e6f59343', 'So will we. So long, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 279, 's_e8a0555b', 'Some other time, soldier.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 280, 's_e93cc431', 'What are all these Rebel forces doing here?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 281, 's_ec5b15d1', 'Destroy duty.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 282, 's_ec739555', 'Move it! '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 283, 's_ee36cca8', 'I''m not going to beg, soldier. If you can''t do it, I''ll find someone else. Dismissed. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 284, 's_ee574fb3', 'That is correct, soldier. And if you''ve got a problem with that, then you can transfer to another unit right now. Otherwise, you can rest assured that I now serve the Alliance, 100%. And we will not speak of this again.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 285, 's_ee790f5c', 'I can''t travel to Lok right now.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 286, 's_ef170270', '[nod, satisfied]'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 287, 's_f2142cc7', 'It''s free, soldier. An Alliance perk.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 288, 's_f39da193', 'Wait.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 289, 's_f3cbd30c', 'Very well. If you find any errors or have suggestions, report them to Niklas at njohansson@soe.sony.com'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 290, 's_f4862cb7', 'What does he know?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 291, 's_f5427310', 'Of course not!'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 292, 's_f685a04e', 'Loud and clear.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 293, 's_f7f3ab80', 'Duty reports show you''ve already got an assignment. Finish what you''ve started, then we''ll talk.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 294, 's_f88289a7', 'There''s work to do on Yavin. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 295, 's_f930a587', 'Where is it?'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 296, 's_f9855bf1', 'Closing in. An Imperial rescue squad is en route. Suit up and get out there ASAP.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 297, 's_fabecb04', 'I appreciate the offer, but some other time.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 298, 's_faf96c0a', 'I need another way to fight the Empire. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 299, 's_fcfc8bbb', 'What are you doing here? '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 300, 's_fd00fedc', 'Because I want you to understand something about me. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 301, 's_fd447981', 'Sounds like a great opportunity, sir, but I''m going to have to pass for now.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 302, 's_fddb83ca', 'I''ve got news, %NU.'),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 303, 's_fe82187', 'I''m going to tell you something, before you hear it from somebody else. I am a former Imperial officer. I defected. Now I fight for the Alliance. '),
('string/en/conversation/yavin_rebel_trainer_2.stf', 304, 's_ff0af3bc', 'What? You''re not my pilot? I''ve had it with this sloppy Rebel paperwork!...Dismissed, soldier.'),
