('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 2, 'pirate_crate_2', 'You can''t just say it''s yours.  We already said it''s ours.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 3, 'pirate_crate_3', 'There''s no sense arguing til we open it up and see what''s inside it.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 4, 'pirate_crate_4', 'No, really, our friend will be along with the key any minute now...'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 5, 'pirate_crate_5', 'You can see where I scratched my name in it, right there on the side.  See?  See?'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 6, 'pirate_crate_6', 'Just another bunch of imperials trying to keep us down!'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 7, 'pirate_crate_7', 'We dropped it.  It fell out of our ship.  We''re just here to pick it up.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 8, 'pirate_crate_8', 'Isn''t it obvious that it''s not an imperial crate?  I mean it''s not whining like a baby now is it?'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 9, 'pirate_crate_9', 'You''ll have to kill us if you want it.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 10, 'pirate_crate_10', 'Nobody''s taking our crate!'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 11, 'stormtrooper_crate_1', 'This is imperial property.  Back away from the container please.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 12, 'stormtrooper_crate_2', 'Just give us a minute to call it in, and if it''s yours you can have it.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 13, 'stormtrooper_crate_3', 'You don''t really expect us to believe that this is your crate do you?'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 14, 'stormtrooper_crate_4', 'The serial code is burned off, that''s a strict violation.  You''ll have to wait here.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 15, 'stormtrooper_crate_5', 'No one is to touch that crate and that is an order.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 16, 'stormtrooper_crate_6', 'I don''t see any papers identifying this as your crate yet.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 17, 'stormtrooper_crate_7', 'Can you think of any reason for us to believe you''re not lying?'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 18, 'stormtrooper_crate_8', 'There''s a containment team on the way to haul this thing off.  I suggest you leave before you get arrested or shot.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 19, 'stormtrooper_crate_9', 'Our orders are to make sure that no one moves this crate.'),
('string/en/crate_dialog.stf', 20, 'stormtrooper_crate_10', 'You will not touch this!'),
('string/en/creature_tradein.stf', 1, 'cant', 'This system is reserved for non creature handlers only.  Please consult "Pet Trade-In" in your Holocron for details.'),
('string/en/creature_tradein.stf', 2, 'store', 'Please store any active creatures before attempting to trade a pet.'),
('string/en/creature_tradein.stf', 3, 'notacreature', 'That does not appear to be a creature.  You cannot trade that item.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 1, 'greeting_nodance', 'Good day to you, friend.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 2, 'greeting', 'Hello, friend. Say, I''ve seen you around. You''ve got some interesting new moves. If you like, I might be able to teach you a few new steps?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 3, 'greeting_r0', 'Sure, I''d like to learn something new.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 4, 'greeting_r1', 'Not right now. Thank you, though.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 5, 'offer', 'Tell me what you''re interested in and I''ll see what I can teach you.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 6, 'offer_r10', 'On second thought, I''d rather not right now.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 7, 'offer_r0', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 8, 'offer_r1', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 9, 'offer_r2', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 10, 'offer_r3', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 11, 'offer_r4', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 12, 'offer_r5', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 13, 'offer_r6', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 14, 'offer_r7', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 15, 'offer_r8', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 16, 'offer_r9', 'Can you teach me anything for the %TO style?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 17, 'cant_teach', 'Ah, I''m afraid there''s nothing I can teach you now. Maybe some other time, eh?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 18, 'goodbye', 'Good day to you, then.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 19, 'not_enough_xp', 'I can teach you some new steps for that dance, but you don''t have enough %TO experience to learn them. You must be able to spend at least %DI %TO experience.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 20, 'confirm', 'I can teach you some new steps for that dance, but you will need to spend some %TO experience to learn them. Do you want to spend %DI %TO experience to learn the new steps?'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 21, 'confirm_r0', 'Yes, I will spend the experience to learn the new steps.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 22, 'confirm_r1', 'No, I''d rather not learn the new steps right now.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 23, 'cant_teach_yet', 'I could teach you some new steps, but you need to practice that dance a little more first. Keep practicing and come back later.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 24, 'success', 'There you go! Enjoy the new moves, and remember, keep practicing!'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 25, 'sysmsg_success', 'You have successfully learned the %TO dance style.'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 26, 'title', 'a choreography teacher'),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 27, 'sui_prompt0', 'You have become proficient at performing the '),
('string/en/dance_advancement.stf', 28, 'sui_prompt1', ' style dance. You may be ready to learn some advanced steps.'),
