('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 50, 'computer_one', 'The screen is filled with number crunching.  Probably the hyper drive analysis.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 51, 'computer_two', 'This screen shows irregularities with the fuel intake valves.  They are currently functioning normally.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 52, 'computer_three', 'Gold Screen Of Doom: Software has caused a general protection fault @ 64x11300314\n\nUnknown Error 55113-s.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 53, 'bridge_code', 'Bridge Code Updated:'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 54, 'reboot', 'This computer needs to be rebooted.  Please insert Operations Disk #4 into the terminal.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 55, 'sliced', 'The computer was down, but your slicing skill allows you to reboot it without the disk.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 56, 'insert_disk', 'You insert the disk into the drive and the machine reboots.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 57, 'journal', 'Journal Entry #334: We''ve found a strange glitch with the engines and the new fuel type we''re using.  Apparently if you set the hyperdrive settings lower than the fuel intake, then drop the engines to their lowest power level, it''s only a matter of time before the fuel pressure causes a catastrophic failure.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 58, 'officer_port', 'Printing Out Security Code for Officer Quarters, Port Side:'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 59, 'officer_starboard', 'Printing Out Security Code for Officer Quarters, Starboard Side:'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 60, 'pdroid_congrats', 'Oh he did it!  Good work!'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 61, 'pdroid_instructions', 'I''m afraid my counterpart here is missing his maintenance module.  If you could retrieve it he could make his way across the room and shut off the power surge.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 62, 'pdroid_excellent', 'I can''t tell you how happy we were to have served you.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 63, 'prison_code', 'Printing Out Security Code for Prisoner quarters:'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 64, 'escape_pods', 'You have completed your assignment!  Make your way to the escape pods before time expires and get off this ship!'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 65, 'reward', 'You have done well.  Return to the person who gave you this assignment and receive your reward.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 66, 'droid_explanation_rebel', 'I knew this would be worth it.  We''ve found nothing but evidence of the Alliance''s treachery since we boarded and took this ship.  The engine room''s even filled with illegal battle droids.  An electrical surge down there has made them all aggressive so I''m keeping non-essential personnel away from the area.  These Rebels have got to be stopped!'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 67, 'droid_explanation_imperial', 'I tried to convince the Lieutenant that the battle droids were a bad idea, but he got such a good deal on them from the merc''s that it was hard to turn down.  Now they''re all over the place though.  I think the engine room is full of them.  Some kind of malfunction or short circuit.  As soon as we get near a base I''ll call for a commando squad to come in and deactivate them...'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 68, 'does_nothing', 'Nothing happens.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 69, 'escape_pod_message', 'WARNING!  Using the escape pods will remove you from the Corvette with no method of returning!'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 70, 'hyperdrive_settings', 'Select Power setting for the Hyperdrive: Exiting without setting the Hyperdrive power setting will force it to its default state.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 71, 'hyperdrive_title', 'HYPERDRIVE SETTINGS'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 72, 'engine_title', 'ENGINE SETTINGS'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 73, 'engine_settings', 'Select Engine settings for the Corvette: Exiting without making a selection will force the engine to its default setting.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 74, 'fuel_settings', 'Select Fuel Intake settings for the Corvette: Exiting without making a selection will force the fuel intake to its default setting.'),
('string/en/dungeon/corvette.stf', 75, 'fuel_title', 'FUEL SETTINGS'),
