('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 113, 'complete_eventimp1', 'Turn this in to a faction by dragging and dropping it on a faction recruiter.\n\nThis disk contains a partial file titled ''Project Dead Eye'' containing an ordinally encoded message fragment:\n\n'),
('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 114, 'complete_eventreb1', 'Turn this in to a faction by dragging and dropping it on a faction recruiter.\n\nThis disk contains a partial file titled ''Project Dead Eye'' containing an ordinally encoded message fragment:\n\n'),
('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 115, 'response_eventimp1_imperial', 'How did you manage to get this information?  This is a top secret transmission...it must have been intercepted by the Rebellion at some point.  Thank you for finding this and returning it to me, your dedication to ensuring the security of the Empire will be remembered.'),
('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 116, 'response_eventimp1_rebel', 'Hmm...an Imperial transmission...encoded...  I''ll have a team begin work on this right away.  It appears to have originated from Moff Jerjerrod.  Very interesting.  Thank you for assisting the Rebellion.  Without dedicated work from those such as yourself, we wouldn''t have much of a chance.'),
('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 117, 'response_eventreb1_imperial', 'Interesting.  This encoded Rebel message refers to a top secret project.  The Rebel spies are more skilled than I had suspected.  Thank you for turning this in.  Maybe with the names in this transmission, my security team will be able to track down the spies involved.'),
('string/en/encoded_disk/message_fragment.stf', 118, 'response_eventreb1_rebel', 'Where did you find this?  This is a highest channel transmission.  I can''t believe that you were able to happen upon it.  There must be a leak in our spy network...  Thank you for turning in this information.  If the Empire had gotten their hands on this, many important operatives would have been placed at risk.'),
