('string/en/engine.stf', 1, 'desktop_not_32bit', 'The application could not run in windowed mode because the desktop is not set to 32-bit color depth.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 3, 'desktop_too_small', 'The application could not run in windowed mode because the desktop resolution is smaller than the game resolution. '),
('string/en/engine.stf', 5, 'desktop_same', 'The application could not run in windowed mode because the desktop resolution is too low to fit the game window with its border.  You may consider using the "Borderless Window" option available in the external options settings from the Launch Pad.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 6, 'desktop_too_small_not_32', 'The application could not run in windowed mode because the desktop resolution is smaller than the game resolution, and your desktop is not set to 32-bit color depth.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 7, 'desktop_same_not_32', 'The application could not run in windowed mode because the desktop resolution is too low to fit the game window with its border, and your desktop is not set to 32-bit color depth.  You may consider using the "Borderless Window" option available in the external options settings from the Launch Pad.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 8, 'screenshot_failed_off_desktop', 'The application could not sucessfully create a screen shot because the game window is not completely contained within the desktop.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 9, 'screenshot_failed_unknown', 'The application could not sucessfully create a screen shot due to a DirectX failure.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 10, 'screenshot_failed_wrong_format', 'The application could not sucessfully create a screen shot because the rendering target is not set to 32bit color depth.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 11, 'screenshot_failed_write_problem', 'The application could not sucessfully write the screen shot out to disk.   The disk may be full.'),
('string/en/engine.stf', 12, 'screenshot_failed_unknown_format', 'The application could not sucessfully write the screen shot out to disk.   The screen shot format is not supported.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 1, 'em1', 'So you''re the new guy, huh?  My name is Ephant Mon, and you''ll be working for me for a while.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 2, 'em2', 'What do you need done?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 3, 'em3', 'What do you do around here?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 4, 'em4', 'A friend of mine named Tash Kolt sent me a distress call that was jammed at the source. I don''t know how serious the situation is, but I want you to find out.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 5, 'em5', 'Where should I start?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 6, 'em6', 'What do you suspect?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 7, 'em7', 'Start by talking to Hazir Gam''mur in Wayfar.  If anyone knows where Tash is, it will be Hazir.  I''ll mark a location on your datapad where Hazir usually hangs out.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 8, 'em8', 'I''ll get right on it.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 9, 'em9', 'I need to do some things first.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 10, 'em10', 'I used to be a smuggler for Jabba, but I''m getting too old for that now.  What I do now is advise Jabba in certain situations.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 11, 'em11', 'What do you advise him on?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 12, 'em12', 'Can you introduce me to Jabba?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 13, 'em13', 'Well, this and that.  He and I used to be partners a long time ago.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 14, 'em14', 'Can you introduce me to him?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 15, 'em15', 'Who lives in the palace?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 16, 'em16', 'You''re going to have to get a bit more reputation before Jabba will pay any attention to you.  If you can get some work done you''ll be well on your way.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 17, 'em17', 'It''s hard to say with Tash.  He may be in some trouble with the empire, or it may be someone he''s annoyed.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 18, 'em18', 'You don''t seem particularly worried.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 19, 'em19', 'What can I do to help?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 20, 'em20', 'Well, Tash is in and out of trouble all the time.  It could just be a misunderstanding, but I''d like to know for sure.  Can you help me out?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 21, 'em21', 'Well, ok.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 22, 'em22', 'Maybe later.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 23, 'em23', 'That''s fine, come back and see me when you have some time.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 24, 'em24', 'Well, there''s Max Rebo, Barada, Bib Fortuna, Jabba, of course, and the Gamorrean Guards.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 25, 'em25', 'Tell me about Max.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 26, 'em26', 'Tell me about Barada.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 27, 'em27', 'Tell me about Bib Fortuna.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 28, 'em28', 'Tell me about Gamorrean Guards.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 29, 'em29', 'Tell me about Jabba.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 30, 'em30', 'Max is an Ortollan.  He''s the band leader.  He seems to spend all his time thinking about his next meal, even when he''s playing music.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 31, 'em31', 'Barada is Jabba''s chief mechanic, and he also handles some of the mercenary work in the palace.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 32, 'em32', 'Bib is Jabba''s Majordomo.  Everyone has to deal with him before speaking to Jabba directly.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 33, 'em33', 'The Gamorreans are fiercely loyal to Jabba, but not the brightest creatures in the galaxy.  They do their job well though, keeping out the riff-raff.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 34, 'em34', 'Jabba is a Hutt.  He''s a powerful crimelord, and can be a useful ally.  Never cross him though.  No one has ever done so and lived long to talk about it.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 35, 'em35', 'How can I help you?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 36, 'em36', 'I''m a friend of Ephant Mon.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 37, 'em37', 'Do you know where I can find Tash Kolt?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 38, 'em38', 'Ephant Mon?  Did he send you to see me?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 39, 'em39', 'Yes he did.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 40, 'em40', 'No, but he''s mentioned you.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 41, 'em41', 'Is there something I can do to help?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 42, 'em42', 'He''s looking for Tash Kolt.  Do you know where he is?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 43, 'em43', 'Tell me where Tash Kolt is now!'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 44, 'em44', 'Not at the moment.  I know he was having some problems.  Perhaps I can help you...'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 45, 'em45', 'How?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 46, 'em46', 'Doesn''t sound like it.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 47, 'em47', 'I know he was planning on moving, and that some thugs were looking for him.  If you find him, and those thugs are there, maybe you can help him out.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 48, 'em48', 'Great!  Tell me where!'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 53, 'em53', 'Here.  I''ll add the location to your datapad.  Good luck.\n'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 54, 'em54', 'I don''t know anyone by that name.  Are you sure you''re in the right place?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 55, 'em55', 'It''s Ok.  I''m a friend of Ephant Mon.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 56, 'em56', 'I think you''re lying.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 57, 'em57', 'Mentioned me in what context?  As a friend?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 58, 'em58', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 59, 'em59', 'Just as a contact.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 60, 'em60', 'You have quite the attitude don''t you?  Well if you do know Ephant Mon then tell him that I don''t deal with your sort.  Perhaps he has other friends he can send to talk to me.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 61, 'em61', 'If you''ve come to apologize then maybe I can help you.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 62, 'em62', 'You''re right.  I acted rudely.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 63, 'em63', 'Apologize?  Forget it.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 88, 'em88', 'Wow!  You unloaded on those guys.  I''ve never seen anything like it!'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 89, 'em89', 'Ephant Mon sent me to see how you were doing.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 90, 'em90', 'What are you doing?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 91, 'em91', 'Good thing you showed up then.  Think you can hang around and keep the thugs off me while I load up my stuff and move out?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 92, 'em92', 'Sure thing.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 93, 'em93', 'Well, I am kinda busy...'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 94, 'em94', 'I''m loading up everything I own in the world.  Gotta keep one step ahead of these nerfherders.  I could use your help.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 95, 'em95', 'What do you want me to do?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 96, 'em96', 'I''m not loading boxes!'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 97, 'em97', 'Could you just hang around and make sure nobody bothers me while I''m packing?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 98, 'em98', 'Sure thing.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 99, 'em99', 'Well, I am kinda busy...'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 100, 'em100', 'Well, I understand.  Tell Ephant Mon he was a good friend.  I hope he won''t miss my funeral.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 101, 'em101', 'Ok, ok, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 102, 'em102', 'Will do.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 103, 'em103', 'What does it say?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 104, 'em104', 'Where is his home?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 106, 'em106', 'Thanks.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 107, 'em107', 'Thanks for nothing.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 108, 'em108', 'See you later.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 109, 'em109', 'Bye!'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 110, 'em110', 'Well, I''m done packing.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 111, 'em111', 'Thanks for helping my friend.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 112, 'em112', 'No problem.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 113, 'em113', 'Here is your reward...'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 114, 'em114', 'What should I do now?'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 115, 'em115', 'Go and see Max Rebo.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 116, 'em116', 'Go and see Barada.'),
('string/en/ephant.stf', 117, 'em117', 'Go and speak to Bib Fortuna again.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'I can''t be a mercenary any more. I have to quit... but I can''t face my captain (we''ve been friends for so long). Would you deliver my resignation for me?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Thanks. I''ve got a unique Disruptor Particle Beam cannon that I won''t need anymore. I''ll give it to you when you return.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Fine.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Blood for money. Money for blood. It all seems so stupid now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thanks. Please take my disruptor particle beam cannon. It doesn''t work - but the parts may be worth something.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Yes. I will deliver your resignation.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'No. I have no time for this.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Why do you want to quit?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, come back when you''re done.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Okay. Have a good life.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Looks like you''re too busy to help me. Come back when you''re free.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I can''t talk now -- I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you delivered my resignation yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Messenger! Over here!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 105, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'So... Kwin''s resigning again? Fine. He''ll be back.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 106, 'notyet', 'Sorry. The love of my life left me because I''m a mercenary... If there was some hope of her ever taking me back, I would leave this life and become a decent man.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/disruptor/kwin.stf', 107, 'good', 'I can''t believe it! She still loves me! I can''t possibly continue in this line of work. I must go to her...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'How ya doin''?  So you wanna talk with Borvo? Well, he''s a busy Hutt and he don''t know you.  Got it?  Heyyyyy... you might be able to help, though.  Look, we''ve got a situation, you see?  We need you to go rescue one of our guys before he gets caught.  You do that for us, then maybe I''ll tell Borvo that you''re clean. So, you wanna help?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Hey, you wanna ''nother job?  Dagorel has said that the gun deal was a big setup.  Get this, he said it was an inside job, too.  It seems that Frangee, one of our guys, was some undercover police guy.  Dagorel says that Frangee is high-tailing it off planet right now, even as we''re yappin''.  You wanna make sure he never makes it?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Okay, look... Dagorel''s been shot, so he''s lost a lot of fluid.  Get out there and lend him a hand while you guys limp back here.  Make sure the police don''t catch sight of you.  And if you lead security back here... well, Borvo''s gonna be a lot angrier than he already is, got it?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Yeah, I told Borvo you''d do it.  Get out there and make sure that Frangee doesn''t make it to his ship.  Make sure it hurts, too.  If it weren''t for all the cops around right now, I''d do it myself.  Oh yeah, while you''re at it, bring back everything he''s got on him in case he''s got some more evidence on us.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Then what are you wasting our time for?  Get outta here before we do a little Image Design job on your face!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I thought you had some nerves on you.  Never mind then.  Oh yeah, never mind about talking with Borvo, either.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, you see, Borvo had one of his biggest gun sales in a long time to some guys on Corellia.  It turns out it was a setup by the CorSec cops.  Most of our guys are either dead or in jail now, except for Dagorel, Borvo''s right hand guy.  He managed to escape, but he''s been shot, so he can''t make it back here on his own.  That''s where you come in.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Frangee was here even longer than me!  He''s the one who showed me the ropes around this place.  He was one of Borvo''s most trusted guys! To think, he was nothing but a low-down, rotten, womprat snitch!  AARGGG!!!!  Wait a minute.... you''re not a cop, are you?  You know what... you take out Frangee and I''ll know you ain''t one.  Got it?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good, you got him back safely.  We''ll get him patched up right now.  In the meantime, stick around, got it?  Borvo''s gonna find out what went down at that sale, and he may need you to do something else for us.  Here''s a little something to show you our thanks.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'So, did he scream? Serves him right. So, these are the records he was keeping on us, huh?  Ahhh... look here... his badge.  Hey.  Heeeeyyyy.... I''ve got an idea here.... Yeahhhh, this''ll be sweet.  Take this badge, and you head to Corellia.  According to this, it seems that Frangee was going to report back to his Captain at Corsec.  I think he''ll still make it.  Isn''t that right, Detective Niksel?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Sure, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'I hate a snitch.  I''ll do it for free.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'No thanks, it''s not that important to me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I''m not going against the law.  No thanks.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'What''s this ''situation''?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'How long was Frangee working for Borvo?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Sorry, but I can''t do this for you.  You''ll need to send one of your own guys.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, I had to give the police the slip.  I''ll still get him.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'That''s good that you didn''t lead them here.  Now get out there and give Dagorel a hand!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Then what are you wasting our time for?  Get outta here before we do a little Image Design job on your face!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Look, if you don''t have any business here, then scram!  This ain''t no cafe!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh, I thought you were the cops.  Nevermind.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Where''s Dagorel?  Did you get him back safely?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'So did you get him in the back or shoot him in the face?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'I thought I gave you police the slip.  Oh well.  I guess you caught me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Borvo sent you, right?  I also take it you''re going to resist arrest as well.  Sorry it has to be this way.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'Nah, this isn''t something Frangee would''ve had on him.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'What are you waiting for?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'I thought you had some nerves on you.  Never mind then.  Oh yeah, never mind about talking with Borvo, either.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I''ve changed my mind.  I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'I haven''t found him yet.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Borvo sent you?  You a new guy? No time for that, I guess.  Well, then let''s get out of here before the police follow my trail of blood.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Nevermind, I don''t know what got into me.  Move along.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 109, 'otherescort', 'Nope, you''ve got the wrong guy.  You may be looking for the other guy nearby who''s wounded and dying.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_1', 'You let him get killed?  Aarrgh!  Borvo''s not gonna be happy when he hears this.  You know, I think you just might get to talk to him after all.  I don''t think you''ll like what he''s gonna say.  Let me go tell Borvo what you did, then I''ll let you know.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard.stf', 113, 'next', 'I haven''t had time to check up on you, but if you''re finished with that work on Corellia you can go see the boss.  Otherwise, get back to work!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 1, 'npc_1', 'Can''t let you in.  Not unless you''re willing to do me a favor.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 2, 'player_1', 'What kind of favor?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 3, 'player_2', 'Maybe I''ll try your buddy there.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 4, 'npc_2', 'Borvo needs to get his antique bowl back.  One of our ex-partners took it and took off.  You get it back, give it to me, I''ll let you in.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 5, 'npc_3', 'Yeah, he''ll send you back over.  Like you pointed out, he''s MY buddy.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 6, 'player_3', 'Where''d this guy take it?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 7, 'player_4', 'Why don''t I just give it to Borvo?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 8, 'npc_4', 'Corellia.  Try the CorSec offices in Coronet.  I think he got busted.  It''s probably in their property stash there.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 9, 'npc_5', 'Cause without going through me, you don''t get to see Borvo.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 10, 'player_5', 'What do you need?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 11, 'player_6', 'We''ll just see about that.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 12, 'npc_6', 'I need somebody to go to Coronet and get something back from the CorSec properties.  A bowl of Borvo''s that was stolen.  It''s an antique.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 13, 'npc_7', 'Yeah, I guess we will.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 14, 'npc_8', 'Bring me Borvo''s Bowl?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 15, 'player_7', 'Yeah, I got it.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 16, 'player_8', 'I''m not ready to give it up yet.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 17, 'npc_9', 'Great.  I''ll take that, and you can go on in.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 18, 'npc_10', 'Come back when you are.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 19, 'player_9', 'Ok, I have to go.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_guard2.stf', 20, 'npc_11', 'Talk to you later.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Well, well... you''ve helped out old Borvo and brought back his money, have you?  You''ve got moxy, kid, and I like that.  Not too smart, but bold. *Ho ho ho* You''ve riled up that officer a good one, though.  He has the Imperials tracking you down, leading them here.  You''ll show some respect and clean up your mess, isn''t that right?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Look, kid, I like you, but I can''t have you on my payroll with the police after you.  I still have something I can use you for, though.  I''ve had my main man, Dagorel, look into who sent Frangee to us.  It seems it''s one of my old partners, who retired from this business a bit back.  I need you to make sure he has a permanent retirement.  Understand?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Good.  I knew you wouldn''t disappoint me.  I like you kid.  Now, go out there and take out those Imperials before they even get a sniff of these swamps.  But hey... you already knew that, didn''t you?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Yeah, I thought you would. I''ve asked him to meet me so we can discuss a new venture I''m getting into.  Instead of me meeting him, why don''t you introduce him to the business end of your weapon, huh? Do me right, kid, and I might have a little special something for you as a going away present. Hey, while you''re at it, get his necklace I gave him when he ''retired''. There''s no need for him to have that anymore.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', '*Ho ho ho* Kid, that was cute.  Did you hear that everyone?  That was cute.  So... where''s the punchline, eh?  Because I know you weren''t serious........ '),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'You''re not turning me down, are you?  I think something might be in my ears, because I think I just heard you say you were turning me down.  That''s not true, is it?  I''d hate to see what would happen if I actually heard that...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Heh.  As if you didn''t know the CorSec Captain called on Imperial help to take care of you.  It seems I''ve got a hitman running around on Corellia, ain''t that right?  I''ve made this easier for you by having their assault shuttle shot down out of the sky. I even made it look like the Rebels took it out.  But that''s a different story.  Ready to leave?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'I don''t want to believe it myself, but it''s the sad truth.  You work with a guy doing a little of this and a little of that, then *BAM*, he turns on you.  What happened to respect? All I ask is for a little respect, but do I get it?  No.  You, on the other hand, you''ve shown me respect. Let him see what happens when people don''t respect me, got it?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', '*Ho ho ho* You took them out all by yourself, heh?  You''ve got the stuff I''m looking for, kid.  You brought me my money, you salvaged the gun deal, got rid of witnesses, and helped to get the cops off my back.... That puts a big smile on my face.  Good job, kid.  You''re what I''m looking for.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', '*Crushes the necklace* I can''t believe he double-crossed me. Either way, you''ve done me good, kid.  I like that, but I can''t hire you any longer. In addition to selling guns to interested parties, I keep a few classics for myself. I want you to have an old gun settlers used on Tatooine a long time ago. I got this from my pal, Jabba.  Look, keep in touch kid, okay?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'You know I will, Borvo.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Yeah, I think I know what you mean.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Haven''t I done enough?  No, Borvo, I''m not going to.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'No, I''m done with this business.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'What mess are we talking about here?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'You think your old partner set you up?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t think I can handle this anymore.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Not yet.  I''m about to head out to the swamps right now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good.  Now do it already.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', '*Ho ho ho* Kid, that was cute.  Did you hear that everyone?  That was cute.  So... where''s the punchline, eh?  Because I know you weren''t serious........ '),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'You wanna talk to me, you talk to my guards.  I don''t pay them to let people I don''t know bother me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'You don''t match the description.  Move along.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'So, have those Imperials been taken care of?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Why haven''t you left yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'You fit the description!  You''re under arrest!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Oh no.... he found out, didn''t he?  Well, I''m not going out without a fight!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'This isn''t the necklace I  gave him. Who did you kill?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I like to see a professional in action. I''ll step out of your way, because I know you''ll get the job done. And you''ll get it done in a timely manner, won''t you?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'You''re not turning me down, are you?  I think something might be in my ears, because I think I just heard you say you were turning me down.  That''s not true, is it?  I''d hate to see what would happen if I actually heard that...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I''ve changed my mind, Borvo.  I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'Sorry, Borvo, but I was getting my equipment together.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Nevermind.  I thought you were someone else. '),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 108, 'notyet', 'You wanna talk to me, you talk to my guards.  I don''t pay them to let people I don''t know bother me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/borvo_the_hutt.stf', 109, 'next', 'I''m done with you for now.  Come back some other time and see how I''m doing.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Ah, there you are.  Feels good to wear the badge again, doesn''t it, Niksel?  How long has it been for you undercover?  6 years now, if I read the report correctly?  Well, I''m glad to finally meet you in person.  Lets cut the banter and get this case closed for you.  I''ll send a message over to Aldalad so that he can arrange a pickup point.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Okay, our friend Maerzen has landed in a remote location to throw off Borvo''s hitman.  Go out there and pickup the evidence he uncovered, then bring it back to me.  I''ll get it over to HQ.  Again, since you''re the only person who knows what all of Borvo''s men look like, you''re the only one we can trust to this.  Are you ready?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Okay, you head out to meet him, then bring him back. Since you''re the only one who would be able to recognize Borvo''s crew, keep your eyes open.  Aldalad is risking a lot to testify against that Hutt, and I don''t want to see him take a hit.  Bring him my way so I can send him down to HQ where it will be safer.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Good.  He''s landed a ways from here, so you''ll have a bit of a hike.  Fortunately since you''ve been in contact with him, he''ll recognize you on sight, so you don''t have to worry about using your codewords.  Once you get the evidence, bring it back right away.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Why?  I know you want to be done with this as much as I do, but it''s just about over.  Once we get Aldalad''s testimony, we can incarcerate Borvo''s scum, then get authority from CorSec and the Queen of Naboo to get rid of that gun-running Hutt!  What''s the delay, Niksel?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, I''ll see if I can get some cadet to pick it up. Hrm...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'The same dang thing he was doing when you were ''Frangee''.  After you got him to agree to testify against his company for buying all those illegal weapons, he''s been holed up.  Now that you''re back, he''ll come into the station, but only with you escorting him here, remember?  Ahhhh... you''re still in ''role''.  Got it now.  So, you ready?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Detective Maerzen, not Lt. Maerzen.  Ah... still playing the role, eh?  Well, this is serious business and we have no time for that now.  Maerzen has some of the weapons and money we raided during the deal you set up.  For now, you''ll just need to pick up the money and bring it back here, so I can get it to HQ.  Got all that?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'He was dead when you got there!?  Blast it!  Without him, we barely have a case against Borvo.  *Sigh*  Well, let me think.  Maerzin is about to land with all of the guns and money we recovered from that bust.  I''ll have to let him know to land elsewhere, just to be on the safe side.  With that evidence, we may still have a case.  Check back with me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Okay, let me check this.  Yep... looks like it''s all here.  Whoa... that is one heck of a lot of money.  Okay, Detective, we have a change in plans.  Maerzen isn''t responding back to any calls, and I feel that Borvo''s guy got to him after you did.  I''m going to take care of this guy once and for all.  In the meantime, you need to get this money back to HQ.  Whatever you do, don''t let Borvo get his hands on it!!!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Uhh.. yeah, sounds good.  I''ll go pick him up.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'I''m ready, Captain.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Oh.  Um... actually, I''ll have to do that later.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'No, I''m afraid he''ll sho... er... Borvo''s hitman will shoot me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Aldalad, yes... so... what''s he been up to lately?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What evidence was Lt. Maerzen able to recover?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I.. uh... something came up.  I''ll meet him later.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, not yet.  I''m out of here right now, though.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, get a leg on.  We don''t want him out there by himself after Borvo knows what''s going on.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Why?  I know you want to be done with this as much as I do, but it''s just about over.  Once we can get Aldalad''s testimony, we can incarcerate Borvo''s scum, then have get authority by CorSec and the Queen of Naboo to get rid of that gun-running Hutt!  What''s the delay, Niksel?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Go ahead and get out of that silly thug suit and back into uniform, Niksel.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh... I''m sorry.  Wrong person.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you left yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Yeah, what?  And why aren''t you gone yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Wait a second... you''re not Frangee!  Oh no!  You''re a hit man!!!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Niksel, is that you? Huh?? Hey... Oh no!  What have you done to Niksel!!?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'Stop kidding around, Niksel!  I need the evidence.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'The get a move on!  If Borvo''s man gets to Maerzen before you... well, I don''t even want to think what''ll happen to him.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'What?  I don''t know what your blathering about, but it''s not funny.  You know, maybe you should stop by the cantina to ease up on your nerves.  Get back to me when you''ve gotten yourself together.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want to do any of this anymore.  I feel real bad about this.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'Sorry, I forgot what I wanted to ask you.  I''ll get out there on the double.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Keep your nose clean.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 110, 'notyet', 'I don''t know who you are, or what you want, but I don''t have any time to waste on you.  Be on your way, and keep your nose clean.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 111, 'npc_noloc', 'Something''s fishy here.  I''ll call over to CorSec HQ to find out what''s going on.  Check back with me in a few.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_1', 'What do you mean he left the planet?!  That''s ridiculous!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_2', 'What do you mean you couldn''t find him! How did you manager to stay undercover for so long?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 114, 'npc_backtowork', 'Don''t just stand there, get moving! We don''t have time to waste!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/corsec_captain.stf', 115, 'next', 'What? Oh, it''s you Niksel. Sorry, no time to talk right now. Don''t you have something else you should be doing?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 1, 'npc_1', 'Sorry, Huff''s not seeing anyone today.  You''ll have to move along.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 2, 'player_1', 'How come he''s not seeing anyone?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 3, 'player_2', 'Who is Huff?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 4, 'npc_2', 'He''s very upset about a Tusken Rifle.  It was an antique, and someone''s taken it off the planet.  He wants to get it back, but isn''t sure how to go about it.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 5, 'npc_3', 'Huff Darklighter?  The head of the Darklighter estate?  He''s only the biggest business magnate on Tatooine.  Where have you been?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 6, 'player_3', 'Where have you looked for the rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 7, 'player_4', 'What do you know about the rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 8, 'npc_4', 'We''ve checked everywhere on Tatooine.  Huff tried some of his contacts on Corellia but they were no help.  Personally I think it''s on Naboo.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 9, 'npc_5', 'I hear some criminals got hold of it.  The criminal element has lots to do with these things, when stuff disappears you know?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 10, 'player_5', 'Don''t know him.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 11, 'player_6', 'Oh, that guy.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 12, 'npc_6', 'Well, I suggest you take your head out of the sand and look around you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 13, 'npc_7', 'Yeah, that guy.  Get it together.  You won''t survive long on Tatooine if you can''t keep up.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 14, 'npc_8', 'Did you bring the rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 15, 'player_7', 'Yeah, I got it.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 16, 'player_8', 'I''m not ready to give it up yet.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 17, 'npc_9', 'Go on in then, and talk to Huff.  He''ll be glad to see you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 18, 'npc_10', 'Come back when you are.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 19, 'player_9', 'Ok, talk to you later.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 20, 'npc_11', 'Take it easy.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard.stf', 21, 'notyet', 'Huff doesn''t want to be disturbed.  He''s waiting for his shipment with a Tusken Rifle, and he''s not talking to anyone until he finds out what happened to it.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 1, 'npc_1', 'We''re not letting anyone in until the boss gets what he wants.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 2, 'player_1', 'What is it that he wants?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 3, 'player_2', 'Know any rumors?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 4, 'npc_2', 'He''s looking for a tusken Rifle.  Some antique owned by the first king of the Tuskens or something.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 5, 'npc_3', 'Some thieves were arrested in Bestine the other day, claimed to be employees of Borvo the Hutt''s.  You know Borvo?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 6, 'player_3', 'Why does Huff want this rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 7, 'player_4', 'Where was the rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 8, 'npc_4', 'It''s an antique.  I think he wants it as an heirloom to hand down to one of his kids.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 9, 'npc_5', 'It was stolen in a shipment that was on it''s way to Tatooine.  That''s about all I know.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 10, 'player_5', 'Don''t know Borvo.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 11, 'player_6', 'He''s a Hutt?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 12, 'npc_6', 'He''s a gangster.  Lives on Naboo, I hear, though no one seems to know where.  I would guess the swamps myself.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 13, 'npc_7', 'Just like Jabba.  I hear he and Jabba are friends.  They''re always exchanging gifts from what I hear.  I think it''s a Hutt thing.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 14, 'npc_8', 'Did you bring the rifle?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 15, 'player_7', 'Yeah, I got it.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 16, 'player_8', 'I''m not ready to give it up yet.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 17, 'npc_9', 'Go on in then, and talk to Huff.  He''ll be glad to see you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 18, 'npc_10', 'Come back when you are.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 19, 'player_9', 'Ok, I have to go.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/dl_guard2.stf', 20, 'npc_11', 'Talk to you later.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'How are you doing, friend.  I want to thank you for recovering my grandfather''s gun. I don''t know how you got it, and I don''t want to know how, either.  I do need your help, though.  About 10 minutes back I got an emergency call from my niece, and she needs help.  I can''t run out there, with my leg and all, but will you do it?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'I can''t believe that slug thinks he can get away with this! If his other activities weren''t enough, now he''s kidnapping and selling people? Grrr!!!! Okay, friend, even after all you''ve done, I need your help again. There''s a slaver who''s waiting for kidnapped people to be shipped off planet that I want you to put a stop to.  Can you do that for me?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Thank you, friend.  Okay, she''s out in the desert right now waiting for me to pick her up.  Give her this codephrase ''Biggs is Alive in Spirit'', and she''ll know I sent you.  From what I understand, she''s being hunted down, so keep your eyes peeled.  I''ll be here waiting.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Okay, from what my niece has told me, he''s out at a designated meeting spot waiting for both the shuttle and the other batch of slaves. He should be caught unawares, so kill him before any of his friends show up. This won''t stop Jabba, but it will buy me time to contact the Rebellion for more help.  Good luck, friend.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I can''t do it, friend.  I was wounded by a Tusken Raider attack, and my leg is still healing. I hope you''ll change your mind, condering how resourceful you are and all.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Are you telling me that you''re going to stand aside as Jabba starts up a slavery ring?  I can''t believe you''d let that happen!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, I don''t really understand. She used a special commlink that was for emergency use, but had to cut the conversation short. From what I understand, she and others were kidnapped by some thugs earlier today. She helped the others escape, but she needs help herself.  Will you help, friend?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'What doesn''t he do is the question you should be asking! What he''s doing now is starting up a slave ring. Instead of being content with every other illegal activity, he''s kidnapping and selling people as cheap labor!  No one deserves that... heck, not even his own thugs!  Well, some of them... but even still - So, are you going to help?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Again, I have to thank you.  You''ve helped out with family matters again.  I need to talk with my niece after she is able to calm down from the incident. From her crying, I don''t like the sound of what I heard. Stick around a bit, if you don''t mind.  I may have need of your help even again.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Friend, you''ve been very helpful, and you''ve had no reason to. You just walked up and helped someone in need. I greatly admire that. Since you were able to bring me my grandfather''s gun, I''d like you to have one of the last things he killed with it. Here''s one of my family heirlooms, which is now yours - the skull of the Krayt Dragon that did my old grandpappy in.  The old guy refused to die until it was dead too.  It''s yours now, friend.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Absolutely!  Anything for a Darklighter!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'I''ll take care of the slaver.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I think this is something you should do.  No.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Sorry, I don''t interfere with Jabba''s plans.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Who is she in trouble with?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What''s Jabba doing that''s angered you so much?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Sorry Huff, but I can''t do this.  Go save her yourself.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Not yet, but I''m leaving now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, if you could, try to hurry it up, friend.  You are her only hope.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'I can''t do it, friend.  I was wounded by a Tusken Raider attack, and my leg is still healing. I hope you''ll change your mind, condering how resourceful you are and all.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Thanks for your help, friend.  It is fully appreciated.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'You didn''t know Biggs, did you?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you left yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Why haven''t you stopped Jabba''s slaver yet?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'How can we go on without Biggs?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'This is none of your business.  Sorry it''s gotta be this way...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Hurry, friend. If he makes it offplanet with those slaves, we''ll never be able to rescue them.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Are you telling me that you''re going to stand aside as Jabba starts up a slavery ring?  I can''t believe you''d let that happen!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Because I''m not going to.  I''m not doing this anymore.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''m about to right now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Yes, that was the codephrase.  Uncle sent you, then?  Thank you so much.  Let''s get out of here before Jabba''s goons find us.  I need to tell Uncle what Jabba''s doing now!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I wish we could have had time to chat, but I''m busy. Maybe another time.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 109, 'notyet', 'Sorry, but I don''t know you.  And I don''t talk to people I don''t know.  It''s just not safe anymore now-a-days.  You want to chat, then talk to my guards.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 110, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh no..... first Biggs, and now her.... I don''t know if I can go on doing this when everyone around me dies....'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 111, 'npc_failure_2', 'He managed to make it off planet with the slaves? *sigh* So many innocent lives lost...'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 112, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Hold on.  Let me check my maps to see where she should be.  Ask me again in a moment, please.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 113, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me see if I can track down where he''ll be.  Check with me in a few minutes again.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 114, 'next', 'You are a good friend to my family, and I appreciate your concern, but there''s nothing I need you to do for me right now.  Perhaps you should enjoy this pleasant day, hm?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 115, 'thats_it', 'Yes!  This is my rifle!  I can''t believe you''ve found it.  You''ve certainly earned a place as a friend of the Darklighter family today.  Thank you very much.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 116, 'dontknowyou', 'I wish we had time to chat, but I''m busy.  Maybe another time.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 117, 'good', 'Ah, my rifle!  I am amazed that somone has brought it back to me.  You have my friendship and my respect.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_darklighter.stf', 118, 'notit', 'Please, I don''t need this.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Well, I''ll be!  This is Huff''s grandfather''s gun, initials and all!  I don''t know how you got this back fr- unless...hey - ummm.. I mean - Hey, that''s great!  Ummm... Mr. Darklighter has a job that we can''t do for him right now.  Do you think you can take these important documents to a contact for us?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Good!  Okay, look.  These are important blueprints, passcodes, and bank account access numbers for the Darklighter estate.  I''ll need you to take this to a friend of Mr. Darklighter''s whose waiting for them. Jabba would love these plans, but we trust you. Make sure the good guy -er- right guy gets them, okay?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Yeah, that''s what I thought.  Well, have a good day.  Hope a Tusken doesn''t get ya!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Oh... I... um... have this problem, you see.  I''m... umm... not good with talking to people and when you brought this gun back, I was so overjoyed that Huff will be pleased that I umm... uh, where was I?  Oh, yeah.  I stuttered when I thought you worked for... er... I mean, wanted to work for Huff.  So, are you going to take this te-- do this or not?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'I got word already.  Sorry to have to put you through that, but I thought you were working for those Hutts.  I hope you can understand our need for this test.  Anyways, thank you for the gun.  I''ve let Huff know that you checked out, and he wants to thank you as well.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Sure, I''ll take them.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I won''t do your work for you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Why did you stutter a moment ago?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I''ve changed my mind.  I don''t like where this is going.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''m about to leave right now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Oh, okay.  Sorry about being rude.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Yeah, that''s what I thought.  Well, have a good day.  Hope a Tusken doesn''t get ya!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Sorry, friend, but this is private property.  You''re not going to be allowed to walk around here.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Obviously you don''t.  You''re not the guy we''re testing.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'What are you hanging around for?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Do you have all of the super secret documents?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Yes, these are the documents.  Hey, will you look at that... you never opened them.  Good.  Well, glad to meet ya, friend. I''ll let Huff know that we can trust you after all.  You passed the test.  Head back to Huff''s guard, so he can let you in.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 108, 'gotowork', 'You don''t have them?  Yeah, that''s what we thought... If you don''t have the documents, then '),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 109, 'notyet', 'Sorry, buddy, but you can''t just walk in there and talk to Huff.  You need to show him that you''re the kind of guy he can trust, which is no easy task.  Maybe if you can get him his grandpappy''s gun that was stolen a while back, he might listen.  Last we heard, it was sold to some gun-runner on Naboo.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 110, 'npc_failure_1', 'He''s dead?  How did he die?  That''s impossible!!!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 112, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Darn!  I can''t seem to remember where he''d meet you.  Hold on while I find out, then ask me again.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/krayt_skull/huff_guard.stf', 113, 'next', 'Huff will see you now.   Now that we know we can trust you.  Give him the rifle and you''ll have made a very powerful friend.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 1, 'omg_dont_kill_me', 'Oh no! They sent you to kill me didn''t they?! I knew that those bloodthirsty thugs would catch up to me some day.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 2, 'what_thugs', 'What bloodthirsty thugs are you talking about?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 3, 'make_me_a_bomb', 'I want you to make something for me. A special weapon.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 4, 'just_passing', 'Relax, old man. I''m just passing through.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 5, 'where_is_jowir', 'Where can I find Jowir on Tatooine?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 6, 'sarlacc_bile', 'How do I get bile from a Sarlacc?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 7, 'on_my_way', 'I''ll be on my way, then.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 8, 'bombs_are_cool', 'Oh so my life is worth something to you, yes? (Just like the old days) If you mean the Zicx bug bomb, I can make it for you. It requires the bile of a mature Sarlacc, and a hearty measure of live Zicx. But... heh... there are no Zicx and no Sarlacc on this planet. You must visit my friend Jowir Ar''Lensa on Tatooine. Give him one of my calling cards and he can help you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 9, 'in_wayfar', 'Like me, he has made many powerful enemies on both sides of the war. Fortunately, his research is valuable to the Hutts - so they''re protecting him. He is apparently working on some special process that drastically improves the effectiveness of certain varieties of spice. He lives somewhere in the town of Wayfar... I think.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 10, 'no_idea', 'No idea. Like almost everyone else who gets close to the Sarlacc... you''ll likely be killed. However, my friend Jowir knows some other researchers who''ve managed to survive prolonged contact with the Sarlacc. I have to imagine that they have some special equipment that allows them to get close to it without being destroyed outright. Ask him about them.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 11, 'good_luck', 'Return with the Zicx and a jar of Sarlacc bile and I will craft the weapon for you... provided that I''m still alive... and so long as you mention me to no one - anywhere.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 12, 'yes_please', 'Yes, I''ve changed my mind.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 13, 'no_thanks', 'No, thanks for offering though.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 14, 'need_more_time', 'I need some more time to get this done.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 15, 'i_quit', 'Sorry, I can''t keep doing this work.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 16, 'ill_get_bile', 'I''ll go get the Sarlacc Bile for you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 17, 'ill_get_bugs', 'I''ll go get the zicx for you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 18, 'gimme_the_bomb', 'Can I have the weapon?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 19, 'what_weapon', 'What is this weapon?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 20, 'still_passing', 'No thanks. Like I said, I''m just passing through.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 21, 'sounds_good', 'Sounds good. Where do I start?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 22, 'go_away_then', 'Don''t waste any more of my time then, please.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 23, 'hurry_up', 'Please, don''t take too long.  I''m worried that someone will find me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 24, 'fine_quit_then', 'I don''t care what you do, just stop bothering me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 25, 'bring_me_the_bile', 'Ah! The Zicx. What mysterious creatures. Did you know that they cannot be killed? Baffling. Now you must acquire the Sarlacc Bile and return with it!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 26, 'bring_me_the_bugs', 'Hideous. Just hideous. Zicx will live forever in this fluid... and they''ll hate it! When released, they will wreak havoc on anyone in the area. Return with the Zicx bugs, and be quick!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 27, 'heres_your_bomb', 'It''s ready, now! Here you go... Remember - you don''t know me. You''ve never heard of me... and you definitely did not get this special weapon from me. Farewell.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 28, 'dont_say_nothing', 'Many thanks, friend. Be well... and please forget about me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 29, 'zicx_bomb', 'The infamous Zicx grenade. Outlawed by the Empire, reviled by the Alliance... and coveted by the Hutts and Black Sun. I still have many of the original explosive case prototypes. The critical components are missing, though. I need a bunch of live Zicx and a jar of Sarlacc bile. Together with the special firing mechanism and casing, I''ll craft an outstanding weapon for you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 30, 'dont_tell_anyone', 'Good. Please don''t tell anyone that you know of me. I can exchange a very powerful and rare weapon for your silence. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 31, 'see_jowir', 'Go see my friend Jowir Ar''Lensa on Tatooine. You''ll find him hiding out in Wayfar - protected by the Hutts. He is researching insects to help enhance spice production... so they keep him safe. Give him my calling card. Tell him that you want the Zicx and he will help you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 32, 'its_ready', 'Here you go... Remember - you don''t know me. You''ve never heard of me... and you definitely did not get this special weapon from me. Farewell.\n'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 33, 'all_thugs', 'The Empire, the Rebellion, the Hutts, the Black Sun... my enemies are everywhere. Seems everyone has a vibro-axe to grind for one thing or another that I did in my youth. What are you here for if not to kill me?'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 34, 'are_you_done', 'Have you found all the ingredients we need?  When you get them, just hand them to me.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 35, 'more_info', 'The Zicx Bug Bomb requires the bile of a mature Sarlacc, and a hearty measure of live Zicx. But... heh... there are no Zicx and no Sarlacc on this planet. You must visit my friend Jowir Ar''Lensa on Tatooine. Give him one of my calling cards and he can help you.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 36, 'need_help', 'I need to be reminded what I''m doing...');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 37, 'good_work', 'I''ve added the Zicx and the Sarlacc bile to the explosive casing. It''s ready for you now.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 38, 'please_begone', 'Please... begone! I can''t keep making these weapons for you. People will find out about me - and then I''ll make weapons for NO ONE! Goodbye.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 39, 'change_your_mind', 'So you''ve changed your mind about the weapon? Or... have you aligned yourself with those bloodthirsty thugs?!'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 40, 'get_the_bile', 'You gave me the Zicx, but I still need the Sarlacc bile in order to make your weapon.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 41, 'get_the_bugs', 'You gave me the Sarlacc digestive fluid, but I still need the Zicx to complete your weapon.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 42, 'what_is_this', 'What is this? I can''t use this. I only need the Zicx bugs and the Sarlacc bile to make the weapon.'),
('string/en/epic_quest/zicx_bug_bomb/rori_goru_rainstealer.stf', 43, 'give_a_minute', 'Give me a minute to combine the ingredients...'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 1, 'add_only', 'You cannot remove items from this container.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 2, 'bad_clone_location', 'You must be inside a cloning facility to perform this command.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 3, 'bad_insure_request', 'Unable to process insure item request.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 4, 'bank_deposit', 'There has been an error during an attempt to deposit funds to your bank account. Verify you have sufficient funds for the desired transaction.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 5, 'bank_error', 'An unknown error occurred during your banking transaction. Please contact a GM.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 6, 'bank_menu_open', 'Your transaction request has been denied because you have a bank menu open.'),
('string/en/error_message.stf', 7, 'bank_null_transaction', 'Your banking transaction request must be for an amount greater than zero.'),
