('string/en/faction_recruiter.stf', 155, 'on_leave_complete', 'You are now on leave. You will not be attacked by enemy NPCs or players. Be careful as enemy crackdown troops can expose you as a member of the enemy faction. This will turn you back into a combatant.'),
