('string/en/guild.stf', 102, 'make_leader_d', 'You are about to transfer leadership of this Player Association! Once you take this action, you will be made a normal member and your leader permissions will be revoked. Enter the name of the person you wish to give leadership to. This person must be a guild member, must be standing by the PA terminal, and must have enough slots free to accept ownership of the PA hall.'),
