('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 1, 'house_1', 'You''re the one I''ve been waiting for, aren''t you?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 2, 'house_2', 'Wait, I''ve heard this one before.  The chosen one?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 3, 'house_3', 'Why would anyone be waiting for me?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 4, 'house_4', 'Are you ok?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 5, 'house_5', 'What do I look like, some kind of Jedi mind reader?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 6, 'house_6', 'You''re going to help me get rid of those imperials who are forcing me to leave my ancestral home.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 7, 'house_7', 'Never better.  Now that you''re here to help.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 8, 'house_8', 'Sorry.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 9, 'house_9', 'It certainly is a nice home.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 10, 'house_10', 'I''m still not sure what it is you want.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 11, 'house_11', 'Ok, here''s what we do.  You go out there and distract the stormtroopers, and I''ll get the rest of the spices off the planet in the transport.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 12, 'house_12', 'Anyone who can afford it can have a home like this.  Even you.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 13, 'house_13', 'You''re going to distract the imperials while I get my spices into the transport right?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 14, 'house_14', 'That sounds like a suicide mission.'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 15, 'house_15', 'Wow.  Ok, what do I do?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 16, 'house_16', 'Do they have any heavy artillery?'),
('string/en/house_e3_convo.stf', 17, 'house_17', 'Just trust me, get out there and distract those troops and I''ll handle the rest.'),
