('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 1, 'imp_1', 'Hello.  My name is Prefect Talmont.  Would you like to join the Empire?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 2, 'imp_2', 'Yes, I would.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 3, 'imp_3', 'No.  I don''t think so.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 4, 'imp_4', 'Do you have any questions about anything?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 5, 'imp_5', 'What does the Empire do?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 6, 'imp_6', 'What would I be doing?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 7, 'imp_7', 'Can I be a stormtrooper?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 8, 'imp_8', 'We fight the rebel scum all through the galaxy.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 9, 'imp_9', 'Would you like a mission?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 10, 'imp_10', 'Yes, please, that would be great.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 11, 'imp_11', 'Um...not right now.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 12, 'imp_12', 'I think I know everything I need to know.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 13, 'imp_13', 'Perhaps you''d better just move along then.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 14, 'imp_14', 'Come back when you''re ready for a mission.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 15, 'imp_15', 'No, our stormtroopers are handpicked, but you could be a pilot, or a soldier, or whatever else you wanted. You could drive an AT-AT even.'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 16, 'imp_16', 'Are you ready to perform a mission now?'),
('string/en/imperial_e3_convo.stf', 17, 'imp_17', 'Get out of here REBEL SCUM!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 1, 'scan_greeting_imperial', 'Attention citizen! By Imperial directive number 10774b, you are subject to search for contraband items. If illegal goods are located on your person, you will be punished according to Imperial action directive number 121X-421c. Your cooperation in this matter is required.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 2, 'return_request_imperial', 'Halt! You are carrying suspected contraband! Remain at your current location! You have ten seconds to comply!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 3, 'return_thank_imperial', 'Wise decision citizen. Remain as you are until we have finished our investigation.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 4, 'neutral_turn_over_imperial', 'Citizen the use of contraband has been noted in your file under governor directive 74b. Your cooperation in this matter is appreciated. Future use of contraband materials will result in further disciplinary action. Report any other citizen in posession of contraband materials to your local authority immediately, failure to do so is also a crime under judicial code 9-330a.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 5, 'neutral_faction', 'Your failure to comply with directive 74b has been noted in your file. Your status as an Imperial citizen is in jeopardy if you continue to abuse contraband directives. These actions are viewed as an act of rebellion against the Empire. You have been warned.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 6, 'imperial_turn_over', 'As an Imperial citizen, you know better than the standard rabble that contraband materials are forbidden under Imperial law. Your use of contraband goods has been noted and you are hearby warned that use of forbidden materials will result in negative standing in the eyes of the Empire.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 7, 'imperial_faction', 'As a nobel member of the Empire, you well know that the possession and use of contraband goods is illegal under Imperial law. Your actions have been recorded and your standing within the Empire has been updated. Any further illegal activity can seriously affect your rights as an Imperial citizen.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 8, 'warning_imperial', 'Your payment of the fine has been received. Be warned that the Empire does not look kindly on those who violate the law, especially when the violator claims to be loyal to the Emperor. Now get out of my sight.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 9, 'rebel_turn_over', 'The use of contraband has been noted in your file under governor directive 74b. The Empire is watching you and will not tolerate any further infraction of Imperial law on your part. You have the look of someone who has no respect for the security that the Empire offers it''s citizens and we will be watching your future activities. Now move along...move along.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 10, 'rebel_faction', 'Your failure to comply with the contraband directive has left us no choice but to effect your standing within the Empire. '),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 11, 'jedi_pass', 'This citizen is free of contraband items and is free to resume their activities. There is no need for us to investigate this matter further.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 12, 'jedi_fail', 'There is no use trying to talk your way out of this citizen. We will conduct our search of your person for contraband. Please remain at your current location until we have finished our search. Your compliance in this matter is required.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 13, 'bribe_pass', 'I see that we are able to reach an agreement that is beneficial for both sides. There is no need to further hamper this honest citizen''s activities. You are free to go.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 14, 'bribe_fail', 'Are you trying to bribe an officer in the service of the Empire? I certainly hope that was not your intention since that is a crime under Imperial directive 334-7b. You are to remain at your current location until we have completed out search of your person.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 15, 'probe_scan', 'The probot begins to conduct a scan on you.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 16, 'contraband_scan_imperial', 'The Imperial agents begin to conduct a search on you.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 17, 'spice_found', 'Contraband spice has been discovered by the investigation. Your faction standing with the Empire has been decreased.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 18, 'slice_found', 'Contraband sliced items has been discovered by the investigation. Your faction standing with the Empire has been decreased.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 19, 'discovered_imperial', 'The investigation has revealed that you are a member of the Rebel Alliance. You will be open to attack from Imperial NPCs until you speak with an Alliance recruiter.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 20, 'discovered_chat_imperial', 'This one is a Rebel! Die Rebel Scum!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 21, 'probe_scan_fly', '* Scanning... *'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 22, 'probe_scan_done', 'The scan is complete.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 23, 'probe_scan_positive', 'The scan is complete. Contraband has been discovered.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 24, 'probe_scan_negative', 'The scan is complete. No contraband was discovered.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 25, 'return_false_imperial', 'Failure to comply with the orders of an Imperial agent is a crime. Your decision to disobey with this directive will effect your standing in the eyes of the Empire.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 26, 'clean_target_imperial', 'This one is clean. Move along citizen.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 27, 'sorry_sir', 'I apologize %TO! We didn''t recognize you at first. We will continue with our patrol and leave you to your business. '),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 28, 'business_imperial', 'There is no need to scan a fellow Imperial. You are obviously on Imperial business. All hail the Emperor! Carry on...'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 29, 'fined_imperial', 'Our scans have located contraband in your possession. Under Imperial action directive number 121X-421c, we have seized enough credits to cover your fine. Future infractions of the contraband directive will result in further punishment. Move along.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 30, 'failure_to_pay_imperial', 'Our scans have located contraband in your possession. Under Imperial action directive number 121X-421c you are subject to a fine for the possession of contraband. However, our records show that you do not have the credits to pay such a fine. The Empire does not look favorably on criminals, especially destitute ones. Move along before we decide to haul you in.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 31, 'pay_fine_imperial', 'Our scans have discovered contraband in your possession. As a member of the Imperial army, you should know that contraband is forbidden. You will be fined under Imperial action directive number 121X-421c. Failure to pay this fine will sorely affect your standings within the Empire.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 32, 'discovered_officer_imperial', 'Wait...I recognize this Rebel from the security holonet feeds...It''s %TT %TO. Blast''em!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 33, 'imp_fine_title', 'Contraband Fine'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 34, 'imp_fine_text', 'For violation of local contraband law, a fine of '),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 35, 'imp_fine_text2_imperial', ' credits has been issued. Failure to pay this fine will result in negative standing within the Empire.\n\n\nDo you wish to pay this fine and avoid the loss of Imperial faction?'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 37, 'punish_imperial', 'So you refuse to pay the fine? We will be forced to report this incident to your superior officer. If you are planning on moving up higher into the ranks of the Empire, you might wish to reconsider such foolish decisions in the future. Now get out of my sight before I decide to bring you up on insubordination charges.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 38, 'sorry_sir_name', 'I apologize %TT %TO! We didn''t recognize you at first. We will continue with our patrol and leave you to your business.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 39, 'report_activities', 'The probot sent out an alert on your rebellious activities.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 40, 'probot_support_fly', '*Alert...*'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 41, 'probot_distress_fly', '*Distress Signal...*'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 42, 'jedi_mind_trick', 'You don''t need to scan me.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 43, 'not_search_you', 'I don''t need to scan this one.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 44, 'jedi_mind_trick_dark', 'You should leave. You are making me angry.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 45, 'not_search_you_dark', 'I should leave before this one gets angry.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 46, 'jedi_mind_trick_novice', 'Don''t search me.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 47, 'not_search_you_novice', 'Maybe I shouldn''t search this one.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 48, 'dont_search', 'We don''t need to scan this citizen. Move along.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 49, 'dont_search_dark', 'We better not search this citizen. Lets get back to our patrol.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 50, 'dont_search_novice', 'I don''t think there is a reason to search this citizen. Move along, move along.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 51, 'ran_away_imperial', 'Failure to comply with a direct Imperial order has lowered your standing with the Empire.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 52, 'failure_to_pay_imp', 'Under Imperial action directive number 121X-421c, you are subject to a fine for the possession of contraband. However, our records show that you do not have the credits to pay such a fine. The Empire does not look favorably on criminals, especially destitute ones. Move along before we decide to haul you in.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 53, 'dismount_imperial', 'You are being stopped for a contraband search by the Empire. Remain at your current location until the scan is completed. Failure to comply may effect your standing with the Empire.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 54, 'dismount', 'Dismounting now.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 55, 'return_request_rebel', 'Stop! This is merely a routine check! Running from an officer of the law is a crime! You have ten seconds to return!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 56, 'return_false_rebel', 'Republic law requires citizens to submit to routine scans during times of war, when requested to do so by a security officer. Disobedience will not reflect well on your record.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 57, 'dismount_rebel', 'You are being stopped for a security search by local police forces loyal to the Rebellion. Remain at your current location until the scan is complete.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 58, 'business_rebel', 'I was going to submit you to a scan, before I recognized you as a Rebel soldier. You may carry on.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 59, 'scan_greeting_rebel', 'I need you to submit to a brief scan. This is only a routine check and it will only take a few seconds. With the war against the Empire going on, we have to keep security tight. I apologize for the inconvenience.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 60, 'contraband_scan_rebel', 'The local security agent begins to conduct a search on you.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 61, 'return_thank_rebel', 'If you run, I''d have to put out a search and detain order. Remain as you are until the scan is complete. This won''t take much longer.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 62, 'clean_target_rebel', 'Everything checks out. Sorry to trouble you. Have a good day.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 63, 'discovered_rebel', 'The investigation has revealed that you are a member of the Empire. You will be open to attack from Rebel NPCs until you speak with an Imperial recruiter.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 64, 'discovered_chat_rebel', 'What the...he''s a known Imperial collaborator! Bring him in!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 65, 'ran_away_rebel', 'You have been repoted to the Rebellion for suspicious activity!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 66, 'pay_fine_rebel', 'Our scans have discovered contraband in your possession. You are also a Rebel officer. I know things have been hectic with the war againts the Empire, but that is no excuse. You need to set an example for our ideals. I''m going to have to fine you.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 67, 'fined_rebel', 'Our scans have located contraband in your possession. This kind of thing might have been tolerated under the Empire, but not any more. We''re working hard to clean things up and make the cities safe for all citizens. I''m going to have to fine you. If I catch you again, I''ll have to bring you in.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 68, 'failure_to_pay_rebel', 'Our scans have located contraband in your possession. This kind of thing might have been tolerated under the Empire, but not any more. I would fine you, but you apparently don''t have any credit to pay with. Looks like you''ll get by with a warning. I suggest you get a job and clean up your act.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 69, 'discovered_officer_rebel', 'Hold on, I recognize you from the most wanted Imperial officers list! You''re %TT %TO!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 70, 'neutral_turn_over_rebel', 'I''ve recorded your infraction and have submitted the appropriate forms. Future use of contraband material will result in harsher action. We have enough trouble with Imperial agents in our midst, we don''t need good people like you making stupid decisions. Clean up your act. You may go.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 71, 'imp_fine_text2_rebel', ' credits has been issued. Failure to pay this fine will result in negative standing within the Rebellion.\n\n\nDo you wish to pay this fine and avoid the loss of Rebel faction?'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 72, 'warning_rebel', 'Payment of the fine has been received. I don''t want to see this kind of behavior again. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 73, 'punish_rebel', 'You won''t pay the fine? I will be forced to report this incident to your superior officer. The Rebellion might not be as organized as we could be, but we don''t tolerate direct acts of insubordination. Clean up your act or you''ll find yourself in solitary. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 74, 'containment_team_imperial', 'Containment team has arrived. Target identified. Beginning neutralization.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 75, 'containment_team_rebel', 'This is Response Team Alpha. We have identified the target and are moving to intercept. There''s the Imperial! Take him out!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 76, 'discovered_jedi_imperial', 'By the Emperor, a Jedi! Command, this is security patrol. Code black! I repeat: code black! Dispatch containment team to my location!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 77, 'discovered_jedi_rebel', 'By the force, a Sith! Command, I have a problem. Dispatch hunt team four to my location. Yes, I said four! Do it now!'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 78, 'containment_team_jedi_imperial', 'Protocol: Zero one active. Jedi: Identified. Containment protocol: Engaged. Directive: Employ maximum force to terminate Jedi.'),
('string/en/imperial_presence/contraband_search.stf', 79, 'containment_team_jedi_rebel', 'I have a visual on the Sith. Fan out and assault! Avenge your brothers! For the glory of the Old Republic!'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 1, 'regen_wait', 'You are still recovering from your last regeneration. Command available in %DI seconds.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 2, 'regen_active', 'You feel your blood course through your veins as your body begins to regenerate.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 3, 'roar', 'roar'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 4, 'vit', 'vitalize'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 5, 'equil', 'equilibrium'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 6, 'regen', 'regeneration'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 7, 'vit_wait', 'You are still recovering from your last vitalization. Command available in %DI seconds.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 8, 'vit_active', 'You feel adrenaline pour into your bloodstream as you become more vitalized.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 9, 'equil_active', 'Through sheer willpower, you force yourself into a state of equilibrium.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 10, 'equil_wait', 'You are still recovering from your last equilization. Command available in %DI seconds.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 11, 'roar_wait', 'You are still recovering from your last roar. Command available in %DI seconds.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 12, 'roar_active', 'You let out a mighty roar.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 13, 'innate_wait', 'Innate ability: %TT unavailable. Command available in %TO.'),
('string/en/innate.stf', 14, 'innate_na', 'Innate command parameter ''%TO'' is not available for your species.'),
