('string/en/item_n.stf', 360, 'starmap_piece', 'Torn Star Map'),
('string/en/item_n.stf', 361, 'syren1_locked_datapad', 'A Heavily Encrypted Datapad'),
('string/en/item_n.stf', 362, 'syren1_warning', 'Datapad From Corpse'),
('string/en/item_n.stf', 363, 'syren2_datapad', 'A Black Sun Member''s Datapad'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 1, 'jvc1', 'I have some supplies that I need manufactured. Are you worthy of doing so?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 2, 'jvc2', 'What kind of supplies?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 3, 'jvc3', 'Yes, most humble Jabba.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 4, 'jvc4', 'My gammorean guards have a tendency to break their axes, considering the zealoutry with which they carry out their functions.  I need more of them made as soon as possible.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 5, 'jvc5', 'I''ll get right on it.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 6, 'jvc6', 'How many do you need?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 7, 'jvc7', '50, for now.  Do you think you can handle acquiring those?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 8, 'jvc8', 'I''ll get right on that myself.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 9, 'jvc9', 'I have a friend who specializes in that kind of thing.  I''ll get him to work right away.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 10, 'jvc10', 'Excellent.  When the axes arrive I will make sure you are rewarded.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 11, 'jvc11', 'Good.  I need 50 axes for my gammorean guards right away.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 12, 'jvc12', 'I''ll get on it myself.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacraftone.stf', 13, 'jvc13', 'I have a friend who specializes in that kind of thing.  I''ll get you those axes.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 1, 'jvc14', 'My associates are running short on supplies.  Are you capable of manufacturing some things for me? \n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 2, 'jvc15', 'Yes. What kind of supplies?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 3, 'jvc16', 'Not me, but I think know someone who can. What do you need?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 4, 'jvc17', 'Many of my smugglers are in need of blasters.  They''re becoming difficult to acquire with the Empire being more stringent.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 5, 'jvc18', 'I''ll get right on it.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 6, 'jvc19', 'How many do you need?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 7, 'jvc20', 'I need 50.  Do you think you can handle acquiring those?\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 8, 'jvc21', 'I''ll get right on that myself.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 9, 'jvc22', 'I have a friend who specializes in that kind of thing.  I''ll get him to work right away.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 10, 'jvc23', 'Excellent.  When the blasters arrive I''ll make sure you are rewarded handsomely.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 11, 'jvc24', 'Great!  I need 50 blasters as soon as possible.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 12, 'jvc25', 'I''ll get right on that myself.\n'),
('string/en/jabbacrafttwo.stf', 13, 'jvc26', 'I have a friend who specializes in that kind of thing.  I''ll get you those blasters.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 1, 'jab01', 'Ah... new scum. I can put you to work right away... if you''re not a coward.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 2, 'gp01', 'The Great Jabba bids you welcome. He is very impressed with your abilities, and asks if you would perform a simple task for him.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 3, 'jab02', 'So, fool - have you learned respect? Are you ready to work for me?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 4, 'gp02', 'The Mighty Jabba welcomes you again and asks if you are now ready for work.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 5, 'pl01', 'Yes, I am ready.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 6, 'pl02', 'No. I am not ready yet.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 7, 'jab03', 'Good. You will travel to a safe-house in the Dune Sea. There you will find the human called Scrib Leras. He used to be a bookkeeper for my long-time enemy, Lady Valarian. He has decided to work me now.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 8, 'gp03', 'His Greatness asks that you travel to the Dune Sea and retrieve a human named Scrib Leras. Convey him safely to the palace and you will be rewarded.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 9, 'jab04', 'WHAT! Insolent bantha fodder! You ARE ready. Go to our safe-house in the Dune Sea. Find the human Scrib Leras and bring him to me. He was once the bookkeeper for Lady Valarian - an old enemy of mine.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 10, 'gp04', 'But Jabba insists that you do this favor. And, I beg you to comply. Go to the Dune Sea, find the safe-house and retrieve a human named Scrib Leras. Bring him back to the palace... please!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 11, 'pl03', 'I will find Scrib Leras for you. Goodbye.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 12, 'pl04', 'Maybe you didn''t hear me. I''m not interested.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 13, 'pl05', 'Who is Lady Valarian?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 14, 'pl06', 'What does the all-powerful Jabba want with a bookkeeper?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 15, 'jab05', 'I will be surprised if this ignorant fool survives the trip...\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 16, 'gp05', 'The Mighty Jabba wishes you fair weather and good fortune on your quest. And please do return with haste!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 17, 'jab06', 'I heard you, moron. Now get out of here! Come back when you''ve learned some respect!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 18, 'gp06', 'Jabba respects your decision, and asks that you leave now and return when you are better prepared.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 19, 'jab07', 'Lady Valarian thinks she has a great criminal mind and that one day she will overtake this palace and put me to death. In truth, she is an arrogant coward... nothing more than a deluded parasite.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 20, 'gp07', 'Lady Valarian is an enemy of the Hutts. She plots to overthrow Jabba someday - but Jabba is not concerned. She does not have the power to damage our operations on Tatooine... or anywhere else.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 21, 'jab08', 'Scrib Leras the bookkeeper ran to the Hutts when Valarian put a death mark on his head. It would appear that he knows something important. If he does not - then we''ll throw him back to Valarian... as one throws a bone to a Narglatch.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 22, 'gp08', 'The Great Jabba believes that this bookkeeper may have important information about Valarian''s activities - since he came to our Hutt friends for sanctuary. Should he have valuable information, we want it. Otherwise, we have no need of him.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 23, 'pl07', 'Why did Valarian put a death mark on his head?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 24, 'pl08', 'Why would the bookkeeper run to the Hutts for protection?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 25, 'jab09', 'I hear that this bookkeeper made an accounting error that cost Valarian four or five credits. She put a death mark on him because she confuses leadership with villainy. She will never inspire people as I do.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 26, 'gp09', 'The bookkeeper Scrib Leras made an error that cost Valarian a great deal of hardship. She is incapable of forgiveness - and thus the death mark was given. This shows how inferior she is when compared to the all-powerful Jabba.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 27, 'jab10', 'You think he would run to the Empire?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 28, 'gp10', 'Only the Hutts can offer reliable protection here on Tatooine. Out in the open, Scrib Leras would be immediately arrested by the Empire and sent to work in the mines... or worse.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 29, 'jh_aq129', 'Blast! That bookkeeper must be more valuable than I originally believed. Vurs Kavak is an interrogator - the most vile extractors in the Outer Rim. Go to Kavak''s location, liberate the bookkeeper and await further instructions!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 30, 'jh_aq130', 'Go to Vurs Kavak''s location, free the bookkeeper and await further instructions!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 31, 'jh_aq131', 'It is too dangerous for you to bring Scrib Leras to the palace. I will send a transport to your location. Protect him if Valarian''s soldiers show up.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 32, 'jh_aq132', 'The all-powerful Jabba no longer wishes you to bring Scrib Leras back to the palace. He will send a transport to your location, instead. Protect him from Valarian''s soldiers if they find you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 33, 'jh_aq133', 'We will hide Scrib Leras at your association hall on <Planet Name>. Go there now! When he arrives, you and your comrades must protect him until I send further instructions. If I know Valarian she will send MOST of her forces to recapture this little snake...\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 34, 'jh_aq134', 'Great Jabba wishes that you go to your association hall on <Planet Name> and wait for Scrib Leras to arrive. There, we will hide him - while you defend him against attack from Valarian''s enforcers. Jabba bids you make haste to your association hall.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 35, 'jh_aq135', 'Your contact is waiting outside!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 36, 'jh_aq136', 'Oh dear! Hide me, please! We were followed on our way here. A huge gang of Valarian''s thugs are coming right now!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 37, 'jh_aq137', 'What a vicious display of combat prowess! Valarian''s losses are legendary! Bib Fortuna was right, you are truly my kind of scum. For this accomplishment, you and your friends will be awarded a RANCOR PIT! Return to the palace when you can and I will give you more lucrative tasks.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_1.stf', 38, 'jh_aq138', 'The Mighty Jabba is very impressed! For your trouble, you have been awarded a RANCOR PIT that may be installed in your association hall. Jabba hopes that it serves you well, and he bids you return to the palace when you are interested in more work.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 1, 'jaq1', 'My henchmen seem to have problems working together so you will put your own team together to work my next task.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 2, 'jaq2', 'I can do that.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 3, 'jaq3', 'What is my next mission?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 4, 'jaq4', 'Lady Valarian has acquired a valuable Rantok Sword, and I will possess it.  Go see Belshu Dadar at the Mos Eisley Cantina for more information.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 5, 'jaq5', 'Yes, Lord Jabba.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 6, 'jaq6', 'Do you know where the sword is?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 7, 'jaq7', 'That is why I''m sending you to see Belshu.  He knows more about the sword.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 8, 'jaq8', 'Yes, Gracious Master.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 9, 'jaq9', 'I need time to put my team together.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 10, 'jaq10', 'Then come back when you have them gathered.  Careful that you don''t waste too much time.  If I don''t get my hands on that blade I will be very disappointed.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 11, 'jaq11', 'So, you''re Jabba''s new errand boy, eh?  What do you need to know?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 12, 'jaq12', 'I need to know where Valarian''s keeping this Rantok sword.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 13, 'jaq13', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 14, 'jaq14', 'I don''t know exactly where the sword is, but I know someone who might.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 15, 'jaq15', 'Who would know such things?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 16, 'jaq16', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 17, 'jaq17', 'There''s a slicer in Mos Eisley named Sliv Jurek.  He owns Jurek Security.  He may have some ideas about where the sword is.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 18, 'jaq18', 'Why would he know?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 19, 'jaq19', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 20, 'jaq20', 'He helped her put together some of her security countermeasures, so he probably knows where she''d keep such a thing.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 21, 'jaq21', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 22, 'jaq22', 'Ok.  I''ll go see him.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 23, 'jaq23', 'I know that Sliv is probably the guy she hired to install it, so he''s the man to see.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 24, 'jaq24', 'You must be Bib Fortuna''s friend.  I''ve heard about you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 25, 'jaq25', 'Well, how bout you do me a favor then?'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 26, 'jaq26', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 27, 'jaq27', 'Don''t assume just because you''re Bib''s friend you get free advice.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 28, 'jaq28', 'I am working for Bib Fortuna...\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 29, 'jaq29', 'True enough.  How bout we work out a deal?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 30, 'jaq30', 'Tell you what, you slip me, say a hundred credits, and I''ll tell you everything you ever wanted to know about Valarian''s security.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 31, 'jaq31', 'A hundred?!?  How bout ten?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 32, 'jaq32', 'Sure thing.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 33, 'jaq33', 'Ten?  I could get eighty for it by just grabbing the next guy off the street.  Make it 75.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 34, 'jaq34', 'Grab a guy off the street then, cause I''m not giving you more than 20.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 35, 'jaq35', '75 it is.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 36, 'jaq36', 'Shrewd businessman that you are, I''ll make you a deal.  Everything I know for 50.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 37, 'jaq37', 'I can go as high as 30.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 38, 'jaq38', 'For 50 you''ve got a deal.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 39, 'jaq39', 'Sorry, I''m not going any lower than that.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 40, 'jaq40', 'Fine, I''ll come back when you''ve come to your senses.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 41, 'jaq41', 'Ok, ok, here''s 50.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 42, 'jaq42', 'Do you want to do business or do you want to argue?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 43, 'jaq43', 'Ok, let''s do some business.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 44, 'jaq44', 'Let''s argue.  How bout you tell me what I want to know or I''ll kill you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 45, 'jaq45', 'Ok, what would you like to know?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 46, 'jaq46', 'What do you know about Valarian''s security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 47, 'jaq47', 'Do you know where Valarian is keeping the Rantok sword?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 48, 'jaq48', 'I know that Valarian recently ordered enough components to put together two brand new turrets for base defense.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 49, 'jaq49', 'Just two?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 50, 'jaq50', 'What else?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 51, 'jaq51', 'Two is plenty to rip a team of thieves to ribbons.  Besides, that won''t be the only thing stopping you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 52, 'jaq52', 'How can I get past the security?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 53, 'jaq53', 'What else?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 54, 'jaq54', 'You''d better take a damn good slicer with you, I know that for sure.  She has a tendency to use lower level security on the crates but the turrets will require top notch slicing.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 55, 'jaq55', 'Why use the lower level security on the crates?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 56, 'jaq56', 'What else?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 57, 'jaq57', 'She likes to let the thieves get in, boost their confidence, and then gun them down with the turrets.  Cuts down on repeat customers that way.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 58, 'jaq58', 'Sounds evil.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 59, 'jaq59', 'What else?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 60, 'jaq60', 'Oh, she is.  And you''d better believe there will be guards around, making sure that if you do try to hack the turrets it won''t be without distractions.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 61, 'jaq61', 'Do you know where Valarian is keeping the Rantok sword?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 62, 'jaq62', 'Anything else?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 63, 'jaq63', 'Guards, electronic countermeasures, the turrets, you name it, she''s bought it.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 64, 'jaq64', 'No, but I can tell you exactly who will.  A wookiee named Daracca is the guy you''d take to appraise that too.  I''ll bet she dragged him out there to check it out, wherever it is.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 65, 'jaq65', 'Where can I find this Daracca?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 66, 'jaq66', 'I''d say we''re pretty much done talking now.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 67, 'jaq67', 'Daracca hangs out at the Rockribbon Cantina in Mos Espa.  He''s very into the dancers there.  If he''s not around try his friend Cora, she may know where he is.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 68, 'jaq68', 'So you''re looking for Daracca?  He''s a nice enough fellow.  Always eager to impress us.  He tells us lots of things.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 69, 'jaq69', 'Do you know where I can find him?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 70, 'jaq70', 'What kinds of things?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 71, 'jaq71', 'Not so fast, hot stuff.  Daracca''s off planet for a while, but I probably have the information you''re looking for if you want to trade.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 72, 'jaq72', 'What would you like to trade?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 73, 'jaq73', 'Do you know where Valarian might be keeping a Rantok sword?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 74, 'jaq74', 'I need someone to retrieve something very valuable for me.  Daracca would normally do it, but like I said, he''s out of the loop.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 75, 'jaq75', 'What is this item?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 76, 'jaq76', 'You want me to do your dirty work?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 77, 'jaq77', 'It''s a necklace that''s very special to me.  A bith stole it from me last night, and I need someone to get it back for me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 78, 'jaq78', 'Where can I find this bith?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 79, 'jaq79', 'Why would this bith steal your necklace?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 80, 'jaq80', 'He usually hangs out down by Fasser''s Pawn shop.  He''ll probably be trying to sell my necklace as soon as he gets up the nerve.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 81, 'jaq81', 'All right, I''ll bring you the necklace and you tell me what you know.  Deal?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 82, 'jaq82', 'I have enough jobs already.  I don''t need another one.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 83, 'jaq83', 'Good enough for me, sweetie.  See you soon.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 84, 'jaq84', 'Well, he tells me where he goes, who he sees, where certain people keep certain things.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 85, 'jaq85', 'Like, maybe where Valarian might keep a stolen Rantok sword?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 86, 'jaq86', 'Sounds like Daracca''s quite the talker.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 87, 'jaq87', 'Yeah, I know that one.  You want to find out for yourself then you have to do me a favor.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 88, 'jaq88', 'What kind of a favor?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 89, 'jaq89', 'I''ve had enough of doing people favors.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 90, 'jaq90', 'Well, then you can find out what you want on your own can''t you?  See you later.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 91, 'jaq91', 'Don''t think of it as dirty work, honey, think of it as the necessary means to an end.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 92, 'jaq92', 'Ok, what''s the item?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 93, 'jaq93', 'Sounds like dirty work to me.  I''m not interested.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 94, 'jaq94', 'He''s a failed musician.  He keeps coming around here trying to get a job, but he''s terrible!  So he hates everyone here.  He was looking for a little revenge.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 95, 'jaq95', 'How did he get the necklace?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 96, 'jaq96', 'Where can I find this bith?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 97, 'jaq97', 'He punched me in the face last night as I was heading home.  Snatched if off my neck and ran off.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 98, 'jaq98', 'What a jerk!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 99, 'jaq99', 'Where can I find this bith?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 100, 'jaq100', 'Tell me about it.  So can you help a girl out?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 101, 'jaq101', 'I''ve had enough of doing people favors.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 102, 'jaq102', 'Where can I find this Bith?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 103, 'jaq103', 'Well, he likes to impress people, like I said.  Especially us dancers.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 104, 'jaq104', 'How can I help out?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 105, 'jaq105', 'What do you want?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 106, 'jaq106', 'I just want to talk to you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 107, 'jaq107', 'Where''s Cora''s necklace?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 108, 'jaq108', 'What could we possibly have to talk about?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 109, 'jaq109', 'Oh, this and that.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 110, 'jaq110', 'How bout we discuss Cora''s necklace?\n');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 111, 'jaq111', 'How bout we discuss how much pain I''m going to cause you!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 112, 'jaq112', 'Thank you.  All right.  Daracca told me where he was examining the sword, and that that''s where she''s keeping it.  I hope you''re not planning on breaking in alone.  I''ll add the location to your datapad.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 113, 'jaq113', 'Thanks for your help.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 114, 'jaq114', 'Don''t worry about me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 115, 'jaq115', 'Handling a bith musician is one thing, and don''t think I don''t appreciate it, but Valarian''s compound is something else entirely.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 116, 'jaq116', 'I have friends.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 117, 'jaq117', 'I''m not worried.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 118, 'jaq118', 'Be sure to take them with you.  It''d be dangerous otherwise, and I think I''m starting to like you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 119, 'jaq119', 'Aw...shucks.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 120, 'jaq120', 'Thanks for the warning.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 121, 'jaq121', 'Well, just be careful, that''s all.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_2.stf', 122, 'jaq122', 'You''ve done very well!  Very well indeed!  My retainers have prepared a special gift for you on this fine occasion.  This statue will link you to us here at the palace.  You can place it in your Association Hall, or your home, and use it to find work at any time, day or night.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 1, 'jaq3_2', 'There are sensitive matters to discuss.  Meet me in my private chambers.  Here is the access code.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 2, 'jaq3_3', 'I''ll be right there.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 3, 'jaq3_4', 'Not right now.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 4, 'jaq3_5', 'Do not waste my time.  Return to me when you are ready for a very important job.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 5, 'jaq3_6', 'You were slow. Come quicker next time.  Are you ready for an important mission?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 6, 'jaq3_7', 'Yes.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 7, 'jaq3_8', 'Not right now.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 8, 'jaq3_9', 'You fool!  Valarian''s spy must not suspect you are working for me.  Go!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 9, 'jaq3_11', 'There is a spy in the Palace working for Lady Valarian. Find out who it is.  You are to go to work for Lady Valarian.  Tell her you are not happy with the Hutts.  Do what you must to earn her trust, and find the identity of this spy.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 10, 'jaq3_12', 'Ok\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 11, 'jaq3_13', 'How do I convince her to trust me?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 12, 'jaq3_14', 'I need some time to prepare before I can take this mission for you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 13, 'jaq3_15', 'Do not waste time.  Return to me in the main Audience chamber when you are ready then.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 14, 'jaq3_16', 'Take an Imperial Patrol schedule to her and tell her that you stole it from me.  Then do whatever she asks of you.  Make her believe you are loyal to her.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 15, 'jaq3_17', 'Ok.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 16, 'jaq3_18', 'Where can I get an Imperial Patrol Schedule?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 17, 'jaq3_19', 'I will give you the coordinates of an Imperial Patrol.  Ambush them and take their schedule to Lady Valarian.  Now go!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 18, 'jaq3_21', 'What do you want?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 19, 'jaq3_22', 'I have a special delivery for Lady Valarian.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 20, 'jaq3_23', 'Nothing.  Nevermind.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 21, 'jaq3_24', 'Then get away from here before we shoot you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 22, 'jaq3_25', 'Then take it to her immediately.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 23, 'jaq3_27', 'My Enforcer says you have a special delivery for me, but I know that you work for Jabba the Hutt.  So what is it?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 24, 'jaq3_28', 'I don''t work for Jabba any more.  I want to work for you.  As a token of good faith, I stole this Imperial Patrol Schedule from Jabba to give to you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 25, 'jaq3_29', 'I have an Imperial Patrol Schedule for you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 26, 'jaq3_30', 'This is useful, no doubt.  But why would Jabba send this to me?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 27, 'jaq3_31', 'He didn''t.  I stole it for you.  I don''t work for Jabba any more.  I want to work for you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 28, 'jaq3_32', 'That''s very bold of you, to steal from Jabba.  Then I have a mission for you if you want to work for me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 29, 'jaq3_33', 'I''ll do it.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 30, 'jaq3_34', 'What''s the mission?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 31, 'jaq3_35', 'I am expecting a shipment to land... out in the desert away from prying eyes.  But sandpeople might attack the shipment out there.  You go there and ensure that the shipment is safe while my people transfer it from the ship to their transport.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 32, 'jaq3_37', 'Soon as that ship lands, we''ll start transferring the cargo.  You keep an eye out for sandpeople!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 33, 'jaq3_39', 'Excellent!  You protected the shipment.  You deserve this reward.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 34, 'jaq3_40', 'Thanks!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 35, 'jaq3_41', 'Is there anything else I can do for you?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 36, 'jaq3_42', 'I have a dangerous mission for you, if you think you can handle it.  I want you to abuse Jabba''s trust to acquire Notsub shipping information from him.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 37, 'jaq3_43', 'Leave it to me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 38, 'jaq3_44', 'Couldn''t I steal it from Notsub shipping instead?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 39, 'jaq3_45', 'Don''t be foolish.  If you steal it from Notsub shipping, they''ll change their schedule.  Jabba has managed to steal the information without them knowing about it.  Besides, he trusts you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 40, 'jaq3_46', 'I see your point.  Leave it to me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 41, 'jaq3_47', 'No time to waste, then.  On your way!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 42, 'jaq3_49', 'I hear you are to steal some shipping information from me.  Excellent!  I''ll make it easy for you.  I''m sending you the coordinates of some expendable men I''ve sent outside the palace with the information.  You can dispose of them for me, and take the shipping information for Valarian so that she will trust you more.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 43, 'jaq3_50', ''),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 44, 'jaq3_51', 'Fantastic!  Jabba is a fool to let someone as talented as you are slip away from him!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 45, 'jaq3_52', 'Yes, I am quite good.  Here''s the shipping information.  Anything else I can do?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 46, 'jaq3_53', 'Nothing to it.  Here''s the shipping information.  Anything else I can do?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 47, 'jaq3_54', 'Yes, I feel I can trust you with a very important mission.  I have a spy in Jabba''s Palace.  Go there and he will contact you.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 48, 'jaq3_56', 'Find out who the spy is and bring me the information he has stolen.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 49, 'jaq3_58', 'You are the man Valarian sent.  Here, take this information back to her.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 50, 'jaq3_60', 'Where are you going?  I told you to bring that data to me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 51, 'jaq3_61', 'What''s this, a trick?  This disc is blank!  The fool must have given you the wrong one.  Go back and get the right disc this time!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 52, 'jaq3_63', 'So, you have discovered who the spy is.  Well done.  I think it''s time for our unwelcome visitor to take a ride on the Sail Barge.  Get aboard the Sail Barge if you want to see what happens to those who cross me.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 53, 'jaq3_64', 'It is time to go for a ride on the Sail Barge!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 54, 'jaq3_66', 'Attention please!  The Majestic Jabba the Hutt would like to announce his great pleasure with the accomplishments of one of his most trusted and distinguished colleagues.  And his fearsome displeasure with the SPY in our midst.\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 55, 'jaq3_67', 'A spy!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 56, 'jaq3_68', 'Who would dare to spy on Jabba?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 57, 'jaq3_69', 'Amazing!  A spy in Jabba''s Palace!?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 58, 'jaq3_70', 'Jabba wishes for you to now reveal to all assembled, who is this foolish spy?\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 59, 'jaq3_71', 'You will die now!  Throw him into the Sarlacc pit!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 60, 'jaq3_72', 'No! No!  It''s not true!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 61, 'jaq3_73', 'Shoot him!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 62, 'jaq3_74', 'Jabba commands that you shoot the spy... knocking.... Knocking him into the pit!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_advanced_quest_3.stf', 63, 'jaq3_75', 'Back to the Palace!\n'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 1, 'JCM1_1', 'An Imperial Officer is in deep with me due to some gambling debts that he has acquired.  I want you to collect the money or use him as a message.  It''s your choice.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 2, 'JCM1_2', 'Who is this officer?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 3, 'JCM1_3', 'Where can I find him?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 4, 'JCM1_4', 'How much does he owe you?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 5, 'JCM1_6', 'The fool''s name is Andrew Herk.  He''s a lieutenant in the Imperial Navy.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 6, 'JCM1_7', 'Somewhere on Dantooine.  He''s investigating a rebel base that used to be there.  Make sure he understands that if he doesn''t pay up now, he forfeits his life to me.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 7, 'JCM1_8', 'About 1000 credits.  I want the money or his life.  I leave that choice to you.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 8, 'JCM1_13', 'There is a strict penalty for disloyalty among my staff.  You are to take care of a discipline problem that I''m having.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 9, 'JCM1_14', 'Who is the target?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 10, 'JCM1_15', 'Where can I find him?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 11, 'JCM1_16', 'What did he do?'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 12, 'JCM1_18', 'His name is Sl''ekyinn.  An abyssin smuggler who''s been working for me off and on for the last few months.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 13, 'JCM1_19', 'He is hiding out on Borleias with his rebel friends, trying to avoid me.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 14, 'JCM1_20', 'He decided to deliver his cargo to the rebels instead of bringing it to me as he should have. Now he must learn the price of doublecrossing a Hutt.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 15, 'JCM1_5', 'Ok, I''ll take care of this guy.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 16, 'JCM1_9', 'Good.  You will be paid upon your return.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 17, 'JCM1_10', 'Congratulations.  You have once again served me well.  Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 18, 'JCM1_11', 'Thank you, Gracious Lord Jabba.'),
('string/en/jabba_veteran_combat.stf', 19, 'JCM1_12', 'Perhaps you can come back later and I''ll have more work for you.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 1, 'greeting', '...'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 2, 'cant_understand', 'You do not understand what this Jawa is saying.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 3, 'understand', 'Your skill in understanding languages allows you to decipher what this Jawa is saying.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 4, 'greeting_thought_01', 'It seems that this Jawa is interested in buying assorted goods and is willing to pay pretty good prices for them. Maybe I have something that he would be willing to buy. I wonder if I should take him up on his offer?'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 5, 'trade', '...'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 6, 'yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 7, 'no', 'No.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 8, 'start_trading', 'He is going to look at what I have to sell and see if there is anything that he wants to buy. He will make me an offer on anything he is interested in. I better keep a keen eye on him, things seem to have a way of disappearing when Jawas are around.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 9, 'bye', '...'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 10, 'goodbye', 'The Jawa wishes me safe journey and told me to come back if I come across anything that he would be interested in.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 11, 'greeting_thought_02', 'It would seem that this Jawa is actually looking to purchase weapons that cannot be traced. That is sort of odd. I have never heard of Jawas trying to get into the arms business before. They better not let Jabba get wind of their little operation. I wonder if I should sell to them or not?'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 12, 'greeting_thought_03', 'This Jawa is interested in buying clothes and jewelry. Probably a pretty good market for used clothing but not too sure about the jewelry. Oh well, Jawas generally don''t buy something that they cannot turn around and sell for twice what they paid for it. Maybe I should see if I have anything that they would like to buy.'),
('string/en/jawa_trader.stf', 13, 'greeting_thought_bounty', 'The Jawas have been having a lot of trouble with Sand People lately. The Tuskens have been hitting a number of their trading centers and have even tried attacking a few of their crawlers. This one wants me to help with the Tusken problem and in exchange the Jawas will purchase any Tusken equipment as proof that I have been helping. I wonder if I have any Tusken equipment on me right now that they would like to buy?'),
('string/en/jedi_spam.stf', 2, 'no_damage_heal_self', 'You have no damage of that type.'),
('string/en/jedi_spam.stf', 3, 'no_damage_heal_other', 'Your target has no damage of that type to heal.'),
('string/en/jedi_spam.stf', 25, 'heal_other_self', 'You heal %TT for %DI points of %TO.'),
('string/en/jedi_spam.stf', 26, 'heal_other_other', 'You are healed for %DI points of %TO by %TT.'),
('string/en/jedi_spam.stf', 27, 'heal_self', 'You heal yourself for %DI points of %TO.'),
