('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 1, 'resources', 'Star Wars Galaxies includes an extensive and diverse Resource Tree.  These resources are used to craft various kinds of items by the skills artisans throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 2, 'classesandtypes', 'A tangible, instantiated, and ready-to-use resource in the game is a resource type. Resource types are transported in resource containers and in a specific number of units. All the resources in the game are organized into groups called classes. A resource class is inclusive of all the resource classes and types that inherit from it. For example, class Metal is under class Mineral, so metals are minerals with additional specifics attached to them. Anything that demands a higher-level class such as ''mineral'' will also accept anything that inherits from that class, such as ''metal''.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 3, 'attributes', 'All resources have attributes. Resource attributes are quantified on a 1-1000 scale. Higher means more.\n\nThe complete list of resource attributes used in the game is as follows:\n\n    Cold Resistance\n    Conductivity\n    Entanglement Resistance\n    Flavor\n    Heat Resistance\n    Malleability\n    Overall Quality\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n    Shock Resistance\n    Toughness\n\nA resource type will never have all the possible resource attributes, and what attributes it does have is determined by what class it is. The values of those attributes are determined by random selection from a possible range, again determined by the class.\n\nDon''t make assumptions about what is important to a particular schematic and what isn''t. The draft schematic itself is the single source of information on what specific resource attributes are important to it, and how important they are\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 4, 'resourcetree', 'The following is a tree of all the available resource classes that can be found throughout the galaxy.  \n\nRemember whenever you find yourself in need of a specific resource class for crafting an item any of the sub-classes can also be used.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 5, 'organic', 'Organic Resources includes all types of creature and flora derived resources.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 6, 'creature', 'Creature Resources are the types of resources that come from animals.  \n\nThere are two major sub-classes of Creature Resources: Creature Food and Creature Structural.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 7, 'creaturefood', 'Creature Food includes all types of animal meat, milk and eggs.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 8, 'milk', 'Milk comes in two varieties, Domestic Milks and Wild Milks.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 9, 'milkdomestic', 'Domestic Milk'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 10, 'milkwild', 'Wild Milk'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 11, 'meat', 'Meat resources are collected by harvesting the meat off of the corpses of recently killed creatures.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are several sub classes of meat reasources that can be found: Wild Meat, Domestic Meat, Herbivore Meat, Carnivore Meat, Reptilian Meat, Avian Meat and Insect Meat.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 12, 'meatdomestic', 'Domestic Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 13, 'meatwild', 'Wild Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 14, 'meatherbivore', 'Herbivore Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 15, 'meatcarnivore', 'Carnivore Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 16, 'meatreptilian', 'Reptilian Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 17, 'meatavian', 'Avian Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 18, 'meatinsect', 'Insect Meat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 19, 'egg', 'Eggs \n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 20, 'seafood', 'Seafood can be collected by fishing.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are three different sub classes of seafood reasources: Fish, Crustacean and Mollusk.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 21, 'fish', 'Fish'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 22, 'crustacean', 'Crustaceans'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 23, 'mollusk', 'Mollusks'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 24, 'creaturestructural', 'Creature Structural resources include animal bones, horns and hide.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 25, 'bone', 'Bones are collected by harvesting them from the corpses of recently killed creatures.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two basic categories of bones: Mammal Bones and Avian Bones.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 26, 'boneavian', 'Avian Bones'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 27, 'horn', 'Horns are collected by harvesting them from the corpses of recently killed creatures.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 28, 'hide', 'Hides are collected by harvesting them from the corpses of recently killed creatures.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are several sub classes of hides: Wooly Hides, Bristly Hides, Scaly Hides and Leathery Hides.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 29, 'wooly', 'Wooly Hide'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 30, 'bristly', 'Bristly Hide'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 31, 'scaly', 'Scaly Hide'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 32, 'leathery', 'Leathery Hide'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 33, 'flora', 'Flora Resources contains every type of plant based resource.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 34, 'florafood', 'Flora Food includes all of the eatable plant resources.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 35, 'cereal', 'Cereal resources include various kinds of grains.  They can be collected with a Flora Survey Tool or a Flora Farm.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are four primary sub classes of ceareal resources: Corn, Rice, Oats and Wheat.  Each of these comes in a wild and domestic strain.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 36, 'corn', 'Corn'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 37, 'corndomestic', 'Domestic Corn'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 38, 'cornwild', 'Wild Corn'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 39, 'rice', 'Rice'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 40, 'ricedomestic', 'Domestic Rice'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 41, 'ricewild', 'Wild Rice'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 42, 'oats', 'Oats'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 43, 'oatsdomestic', 'Domestic Oats'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 44, 'oatswild', 'Wild Oats'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 45, 'wheat', 'Wheat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 46, 'wheatdomestic', 'Domestic Wheat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 47, 'wheatwild', 'Wild Wheat'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 48, 'seed', 'Seed resource include many different kinds of seeded plants.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 49, 'vegetable', 'Vegetables resources can be collected with a Flora Survey Tool or a Flora Farm.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are four primary sub classes of vegetable resources: Greens, Beans, Tubers and Fungi.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 50, 'greens', 'Greens'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 51, 'tubers', 'Tubers'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 52, 'fungi', 'Fungi'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 53, 'fruit', 'Fruits can be collected with a Flora Survey Tool or a Flora Farm.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Flavor\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are three primary sub classes of fruit resources: Fruits, Berries and Flowers.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 54, 'fruitfruit', 'Fruit'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 55, 'berry', 'Berry'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 56, 'flower', 'Flower'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 57, 'florastructural', 'Flora Structural resources include various kinds of woods which are useful for building things.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 58, 'hardwood', 'Hard Wood resources can be collected with a Flora Survey Tool or a Flora Farm.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 59, 'softwood', 'Soft Wood resources can be collected with a Flora Survey Tool or a Flora Farm.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nSoft Woods also includes the sub class of Evergreens.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 60, 'evergreen', 'Evergreens'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 61, 'inorganic', 'Inorganic Resources includes all types of non-organic materials including metals, gases, chemicals, rocks and many other types.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 62, 'chemical', 'Chemical Resources include many different kinds of natural chemicals as well as their manufactured by-products.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 63, 'liquidpetrochem', 'Liquid Petrochem Fuels can be collected with a Chemical Survey Device or a Chemical Extractor.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are seven main classes of liquid petrochemicals plus many unidentified ones.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 64, 'inertpetrochem', 'Inert Petrochemicals can be collected with a Chemical Survey Device or a Chemical Extractor.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two sub classes of inert petrochemicals: Lubricating Oils and Polymers.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 65, 'lubricatingoil', 'Lubricating Oils'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 66, 'polymers', 'Polymers'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 67, 'fiberplast', 'Fiberplasts are made by collecting certain raw chemical resources and refining them into multi-purpose materials.  Fiberplasts can be collected with a Chemical Survey Tool or a Chemical Harvester.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 68, 'water', 'Water Resources include water collected in vapor form.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 69, 'vapor', 'Mineral rich water vapors can be collected on many different planets and are useful for many different application.  Water Vapor can be collected with a Water Survey Device or Moisture Vaporator.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Resistance to Decay\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 70, 'minerals', 'Mineral Resources include many different types of solid raw and refined resources.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 71, 'solidpetrochem', 'Solid Petrochem Fuels can be collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are seven main classes of solid petrochemical fuel plus many unidentified ones.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 72, 'radioactives', 'Radioactives can be collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Potential Energy\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are seven main classes of radioactive materials plus many unidentified ones.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 73, 'metals', 'Many differnt kinds of metals can be found throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 74, 'ferrous', 'Ferrous Metals are collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Cold Resistance\n    Heat Resistance\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Conductivity\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two main classes of ferrous metal: Iron and Steel, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 75, 'steel', 'Steel'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 76, 'iron', 'Iron'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 77, 'ferrousunknown', 'Unknown Ferrous Metals'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 78, 'nonferrous', 'Non-Ferrous Metals are collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Cold Resistance\n    Heat Resistance\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Conductivity\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two main classes of non-ferrous metal: Aluminum and Copper, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 79, 'aluminum', 'Aluminum'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 80, 'copper', 'Copper'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 81, 'nonferrousunknown', 'Unknown Non-Ferrous Metals'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 82, 'lowgradeore', 'Low-Grade Ores include many different kinds of rock ores that are useful for all kinds of applications. '),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 83, 'igneous', 'Igneous Ores are collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Cold Resistance\n    Heat Resistance\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two main classes of igneous ores: Extrusive and Intrusive Ores which each have several specific sub-classifications, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 84, 'extrusive', 'Extrusive Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 85, 'intrusive', 'Intrusive Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 86, 'igneousunknown', 'Unknown Igneous Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 87, 'sedimentary', 'Sedimentary Ores are collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Cold Resistance\n    Heat Resistance\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two main classes of sedimentary ores: Carbinate and Siliclastic Ores which each have several specific sub-classifications, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 88, 'carbinate', 'Carbinate Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 89, 'siliclastic', 'Siliclastic Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 90, 'sedimentaryunknown', 'Unknown Sedimentary Ores'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 91, 'gemstone', 'Gemstones are collected with a Mineral Survey Device or Mineral Mining Installation.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Malleability\n    Cold Resistance\n    Heat Resistance\n    Toughness\n    Shock Resistance\n    Entanglement Resistance\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are two main classes of gemstones: Amorphous and Crystalline which each have several specific sub-classifications, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 92, 'amorphous', 'Amorphous Gemstones'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 93, 'crystalline', 'Crystalline Gemstones'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 94, 'gemstoneunknown', 'Unknown Gemstones'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 95, 'gas', 'There are many different kinds of inert and reactive gases that can be found throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 96, 'reactive', 'Reactive Gases are collected with a Gas Pocket Survey Device or Gas Processor.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are several major classifications of reactive gases, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 97, 'inert', 'Inert Gases are collected with a Gas Pocket Survey Device or Gas Processor.\n\nResource Attributes\n    Overall Quality\n    Resistance to Decay\n\nThere are several major classifications of inert gases, plus many unknown types.\n'),
('string/en/kb/kb_resources_d.stf', 98, 'beans', 'Beans'),
