('string/en/lastquest.stf', 1, 'hail', 'How are you?  Don''t you just love this shirt?'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 2, 'who', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 3, 'lunatic', 'I''m just a fashion conscious wookiee.  Why don''t you go talk to that bothan girl over there?  She may have something for you to do.'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 4, 'ooh', 'I hear you''ve got a jacket I might be interested in.  I''d take it, but it''s really the Calamari''s.'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 5, 'take', 'Why don''t you just take it?'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 6, 'other', 'Sorry.  It''s for someone else.'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 7, 'know', 'I know.  But perhaps she doesn''t want it.  If not, bring it back to me, please!'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 8, 'cant', 'I couldn''t do that in good conscience.  I know it''s someone else''s jacket.'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 9, 'goody', 'Rumor has it you''re going to offer me that jacket I want.'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 10, 'cash', 'Not so fast....what do I get?'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 11, 'money', 'Here.  Here''s a deed to a moisture vaporator.  Now let me have that jacket!  <YOINK!>'),
('string/en/lastquest.stf', 12, 'nothing', 'You don''t even have the jacket anymore!'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 1, 'station_corellia', 'Landing Station: Corellia Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 2, 'station_dantooine', 'Landing Station: Dantooine Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 3, 'station_dathomir', 'Landing Station: Dathomir Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 4, 'station_endor', 'Landing Station: Endor Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 5, 'station_lok', 'Landing Station: Lok Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 6, 'station_naboo', 'Landing Station: Naboo Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 7, 'station_rori', 'Landing Station: Rori Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 8, 'station_talus', 'Landing Station: Talus Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 9, 'station_tatooine', 'Landing Station: Tatooine Station'),
('string/en/launch_names.stf', 10, 'station_yavin4', 'Landing Station: Yavin IV Station'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 1, 'slice_hound', 'The slice hound''s name derives from the spikes that cover its body. But even deadlier are its jagged teeth and its shrewd ways of hunting.\n\nSlice hounds attack anything smaller than they are. When they''re hungry enough, nothing is safe.\n'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 2, 'coronet', 'Coronet City is the capital city of Corellia and the nexus of the entire Corellian system. "The Jewel of Corellia" is a bustling metropolis that attracts entrepreneurs, merchants, tourists -- and smugglers -- from all five worlds of the Corellian system and across the galaxy.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 3, 'tyrena', 'Tyrena is popular among adventurers because it is relatively close to many of Corellia''s most exciting attractions. Tyrena serves as an excellent staging ground for slice-hound hunting expeditions and trips to the planet''s stunning Gold Beaches.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 4, 'bela_vistal', 'Nestled in a serene mountain valley, Bela Vistal is considered to be an ideal tourism destination for those on a modest budget.  Its isolation and tall mountains have made it a favorite for hikers and climbers, but the fresh air and clean valleys surrounding it are refreshing to many other types of adventurers and travelers.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 5, 'corellia', 'The legendary homeworld of Han Solo, Corellia is at the center of galactic travel -- many travellers stop over on Corellia in their journey towards remote planets. Some of the world''s beauties are exceedingly dangerous, such as the famous Agrilat Crystal Swamps. Few adventurers dare journey there.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 6, 'agrilat_swamp', 'A dangerous yet beautiful crystal swamp in the remote regions of Corellia, the Agrilat Swamp is home to many dangerous creatures and a sanctuary for smugglers.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 7, 'corellian_butterflies', 'Beautiful yet vicious winged creatures that come in a wide variety of castes: drones, workers, warriors, defenders, and monarchs.  Woe to the adventurer who mistakes a group of drones for a pack of defenders, as some types of butterflies are particularly powerful.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 8, 'drall', 'The Drall are a species of people native to the planet Drall in the Corellian system. Though they are generally reclusive and peaceful, some Drall visit or live on Corellia, and some have shown hostility towards native Corellians. '),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 9, 'razor_cat', 'The razor cat is a vicious creature that hunts in the remote grassy plains of Corellia. Razor Cats can be found alone, with mates, or in packs. Adventurers are discouraged from engaging a pack for they aid each other in combat.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 10, 'lord_nyax_cult', 'A cult surrounds the ancient figure of Lord Nyax. Not much is known about these fanatics except that they are rare, remote, and dangerous.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 11, 'beldonna_mercenaries', 'A group of mercenaries formed by Liiria Beldonna.  Sometimes these mercenaries help keep the peace, but they always act at the bidding of their current employer, who may have violent aims.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 12, 'kor_vella', 'Despite its transformation into a thriving economic hub, Kor Vella still maintains a rustic charm.  Many of the settlement''s original buildings still stand, and the residents maintain historic areas throughout the city.  Kor Vella also lacks the huge skyscrapers that dominate the skyline of most other Corellian cities.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 13, 'selonians', 'These serious-minded natives of Selonia in the Corellian system live in extended families called septs. A single fertile female rules the sept, while sterile females maintain the burrows. Because they regard the outside world as dangerous, only specially trained sterile females have contact with outsiders.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 14, 'rebel_hideout', 'With the Empire''s strength felt across the galaxy, independent-minded Corellia has provided a temporary shelter for the Rebel Alliance. At this safe house Princess Leia Organa of Alderaan makes plans to take advantage of the Alliance''s recent victory at the Battle of Yavin.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia.stf', 15, 'dalyrake', 'This carnivorous arachnoid can grow up to two meters tall. It eats fish (it can survive underwater indefinitely), small reptavians, and tabages. Suspicious and defensive, the dalyrake attacks with strong claws and ink-like venom. Connoisseurs consider its meat delicious.'),
('string/en/loading/corellia_n.stf', 1, 'slice_hound', 'Slice Hound'),
