('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 1, 'loam1', 'A prisoner has escaped.  Go to the cantina in Moenia and speak to the locals.  Find out who helped the prisoner escape.'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 2, 'loam1_reply1', 'Will do!'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 3, 'loam2', 'Good luck.'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 4, 'thug1', '*hic* What do you want?'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 5, 'thug1_reply1', 'I am looking for an escaped prisoner.  Tell me where he is or else!'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 6, 'thug2', 'Well how should I know where he is?  I bet that rebel camp outside town had something to do with his escape.'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 7, 'thug3', 'I''m feeling.... sick.'),
('string/en/loam_redge_1.stf', 8, 'thug3_reply1', 'Maybe you shouldn''t drink so much of that stuff.'),
