('string/en/loot_endr_d.stf', 5, 'charal_q1_needed', 'A spleen taken from the chest of a healthy Ewok. A precious item, considering how bad the Ewok refused to hand it over. What Charal plans to do with it is better left unknown.'),
('string/en/loot_endr_d.stf', 6, 'charal_q4_needed', 'A commlink used by a group of survivalists. A hairline fracture runs across the base of the device, which may get worse if not repaired in time.'),
('string/en/loot_endr_d.stf', 7, 'morag_q2_needed', 'A crystal used in the crafting of lightsabers.'),
