('string/en/loot_rori_d.stf', 6, 'indintra_imbru_q1_needed', 'Restuss socialite Indintra Imbru Yerevan''s suggestion to her friend, Briska Gil, to invite Narmle scholar Ingon Lakbo to a dinner party -- that happens to coincide with the previously scheduled "Great Conversation" debate among Rori''s philosophers.'),
