('string/en/mission/mission_generic.stf', 116, 'west', 'West'),
('string/en/mission/mission_generic.stf', 117, 'wrong_item', 'Well? You''re supposed to be making me an item.. Come back after you''ve built it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_generic.stf', 118, 'yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'An Imperial engineer of high standing has redesigned an overdrive ion flux cooling system. Go and acquire the components you need to build your part of this device. Complete its assembly and deliver it with all haste.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'May I see your work orders? Ah, you''re part of the cooling system team. Here are the components you need for your part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1r', 'Got your part assembled already, eh? Good. Once the rest arrive, I can finally assemble it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm1s', 'You were not the last person to finish your part of this project. No punitive action will be taken.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'This Calls for Hyper Speed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Ship production is on the rise, which is good news for you. You are assigned the task of assembling this delicate part. What''s it for? I wouldn''t ask such questions if I were you. Just get it made and let us worry about where it goes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'Here are the components to build your part in the...what''s your clearance? Ah. Here are your components. Be careful putting it together, it''s very delicate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm2r', 'You have the part made, I see. I only wish somebody would tell me what I''m supposed to do with it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm2s', 'You have completed your assignment satisfactorily. Reveal the details of this assignment to no one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm2t', 'Somebody Must Know What It''s For'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm3d', 'Scientists have designed a more efficient ion cannon that should wreak havoc with Rebel deflector shields. You are commissioned to go make this part, integral to the new ion cannon''s delivery system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'You must be the Moff''s special pet, to be assigned a high-profile project like this one. Here are the components you need, don''t muck it up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm3r', 'Let''s have a look at this. Very well. Everything seems to be according to spec. Good job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm3s', 'The entire engineering team''s work on this project was adequate. You are thanked accordingly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm3t', 'War, What is it Good For?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm4d', 'Imperial Survey has informed us that we now have funding to begin construction on a new series of industrial mining droids. You will be constructing this prototype part, used in the droids'' plasma drills. You are expected to complete this assignment quickly and efficiently.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'Building parts for mining droids, are you? Here are the components you''ve been authorized.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm4r', 'Interesting how Imperial Survey always seems to have the resources for the equipment they need. I''d better get this droid finished before they come looking for it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm4s', 'Your service to the Empire has been noted. Payment has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm4t', 'More Mining Droids Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm5d', 'You are assigned construction of a part to be used in equipment so classified that even the scientists designing it aren''t sure what it''s for. Go and get the components you need for your piece. Anyone asking the nature of this project should be reported immediately.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'Here are the components required for you part of the device. Deliver it to these coordinates when you''ve completed assembly, and be circumspect about it. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm5r', 'Did you observe anything unusual in the course of creating this item? No? Excellent. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm5s', 'The discretion of all involved in this project has been noted. You are now ordered to forget anything you may recall about this assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm5t', 'Don''t Ask, Don''t Tell');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm6d', 'Every part in an inertial compensator needs to be made with the utmost care, due to the immense amount of stress put upon it. Construct your part of this important piece of equipment with that in mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'Did they give you the speech about the "utmost care"? Yeah, like you guys are usually so slipshod in your construction. Don''t worry about it, he just likes the sound of his own voice. Here are the components you need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm6r', 'This is the completed piece? I''ll put it with the others and put together the unit later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm6s', 'Your participation in this project is now complete, and you are to be commended for your diligence.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm6t', 'Assemble This Carefully'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm7d', 'Imperial Security is having us build parts for a new, more sensitive security scanner. The part you have been assigned was completed incorrectly by the previous engineer. I encourage you to finish your work quickly, as all the other pieces have been turned in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'I thought these components had already been put together. None of my business, I suppose. Your orders check out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm7r', 'I hope you did a better job with this part than your predecessor. Yes, that does seem to be the case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm7s', 'Imperial Security has determined that the delay in the completion of this project was not directly attributable to you. Payment has been made.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm7t', 'Clean Up a Mess'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm8d', 'Security is being tightened throughout the Empire. This means we must keep replacement parts for an array of security devices at all times. Go and get the components for the assigned part, manufacture it, and you will be informed of where to deliver it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'Parts for security devices? More like random "crucial parts" to pad the security budget. Not that you heard that from me, mind you. Here are the components you need. Bring the part to these coordinates when you''re finished.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm8r', 'I understand the supply officer was speaking of things that don''t concern him. I''m sure we can find him a job where he isn''t so overwhelmed with free time that he tries to balance departmental budgets. I trust you won''t make any such foolish mistakes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm8s', 'You have performed admirably, and a commendation has been added to your record praising your discretion. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm8t', 'Someone is Paying Attention'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm9d', 'One of the great things about Imperial technologies is how many of the parts are used in a variety of devices. Your current assignment is to built this part to be used in a hyperdrive capacitor, although it is also used in a solar ionization reactor. Go and get what you need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'These components? I thought they were for bacta tank temperature controllers. Oh well. Get them assembled and over to these coordinates as soon as you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm9r', 'Part for a hyperdrive capacitor? We don''t need a part for a hyperdrive capacitor -- Oh, you mean this part! I didn''t realize these could be used in one of those.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm9s', 'Your skill in constructing these kinds of items is beyond reproach. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm9t', 'Which Part Goes Where'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm10d', 'An Imperial shipyard has commissioned parts to be used in a new Star Destroyer prototype. You are charged with the production of this part, a vital component in the power coupling of a deflector shield. Go to the supply officer, who will furnish you with the components you need. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'So you''re one of the techs working on the starship components, huh? Got the parts you need right here waiting for you. Bring ''em to these coordinates when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm10r', 'Another part for the deflector array already? You''re a fast worker. It checks out, so I guess you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm10s', 'The speed with which you have completed your assignment has been noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm10t', 'Your Piece of a Star Destroyer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm11d', 'Execute this urgent assignment with all haste. A vital part of an energy coupler cooling grid is defective. You are to replace this part with one that is functional. Build it and deliver it personally to the officer in charge. A second failure by our department would look very bad and would bode poorly for your career.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'I was told to have the components waiting for you. Somebody very important must want this. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm11r', 'What? For the energy coupler cooling grid? Too late, that grid blew sky-high. Took out a company of stormtroopers, too. Oh well, there are always more troopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm11s', 'Your participation in this distasteful episode has been reviewed. You have been found innocent of wrongdoing. The commander who gave you this assignment is now undergoing appropriate discipline. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm11t', 'Keeping It Cool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm12d', 'The latest assignment we have received is straight from the Imperial Department of Military Research. All you need to know is that you will be building this small part used in a discharge modulator. The necessary components will be made available to you at this location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'Your authorization for these components is all in order. Bring your completed part to these coordinates when you have finished its construction.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm12r', 'Very well, your task has been discharged, and you are free to continue with other projects.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm12s', 'Everything was turned in on schedule and within acceptable construction parameters. Payment has been authorized.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm12t', 'A Cog in a Machine'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm13d', 'You are required to aid completion of a new model of beamdrill. These drills are vital to the resource-gathering abilities of the Empire. Therefore, treat this seemingly lowly assignment with the same reverence you would give to parts for a TIE fighter. Collect your components and deliver your completed part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'It looks like you''re building a part for some kind of engine. Everything you need is right here. If you need anything else, bring me proper authorization and it''s yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm13r', 'We''ve been making a lot of these drills lately. Imperial Survey must have found a major new source of minerals somewhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm13s', 'Imperial Survey was very pleased with our work on the new drills. Congratulations are sent to all teams who worked on them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm13t', 'The Importance of Drilling in Earnest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm14d', 'Exciting new advances have been made in power carrier pulse generators. This department is implementing this new technology. You have the honor of assembling an important part for the prototype. Make the Empire proud!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'I just need to double-check your identification. It''s routine on such an important project. All in order, and I believe these are the components assigned to your project. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm14r', 'Good, you''re here. These new pulse generators are going to make the old ones seem antiquated by comparison! '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm14s', 'The new generators are 15% less efficient than the old models. This was evidently due to a design flaw rather than poor construction. These results are now classified. Tell no one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm14t', 'On the Cutting Edge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm15d', 'An Imperial Star Destroyer in orbit requires replacement parts for one of the docking suspension field projectors. You are instructed to complete this part in a timely fashion. It would be the height of foolishness to annoy the captain by dawdling.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'These are the components you need. A pity you don''t get to deliver the completed part to the ship personally. That would be something to see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm15r', 'I''d better get these up to the ship right away. The captain is not a patient man.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm15s', 'The arrival of your part proved timely. The captain was on the verge of executing an innocent bystander. You have done well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm15t', 'This is a Rush Order'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm16d', 'All the systems that make up an Imperial cruiser are vital. Therefore, this assignment -- to make a replacement part for a garbage disposal unit -- is vital. If you have a problem with that, pretend you''re making something for one of the blaster cannons.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'Here are the components on your manifest. Don''t feel bad -- the galaxy needs garbage disposal too. The installation engineer is waiting for your part at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm16r', 'That''s what I was waiting on. Don''t feel too bad; the technician before you had to make a part for the toxic waste disposal system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm16s', 'Every part on a vessel is considered to be of equal importance. To question this is to question Imperial leadership.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm16t', 'We''re All Equal in the Eyes of the Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm17d', 'Congratulations, you have been chosen to work on a highly classified project. You do not have the security clearance to know what you are making parts for, but be assured that they are imperative to the cause of our beloved Emperor. Make this part and secure your place in Imperial history. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'This is a set of "priority" components. There will be no record of these components, nor of the part you construct. Bring it to this location once complete.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm17r', 'I trust you spoke of this part to no one. Excellent. Go about your business as though this never occurred.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm17s', 'A small number of credits has been added to your account. This is a random bonus and was not earned for any services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm17t', 'As Though It Never Happened'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm18d', 'The Imperial Department of Military Research is improving old droid technology. We have been give a schematic for a new prototype. You are assigned the task of creating this component. Head to supply and get the components you need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'You must be quite well respected to be working on a project like this. Here are your components; bring them to these coordinates when you''ve finished.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm18r', 'Good work. At this rate we''ll have this droid assembled in no time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm18s', 'Due to the untimely demise of the field test team, this project has been shelved until the aggression circuits have been redesigned.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm18t', 'Still Need to Work Out a Few Details'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm19d', 'You build things, correct? Excellent. Heed my instructions: You are to build an essential part to be used for diagnostics of the next Imperial Star Destroyer tractor beam system. Yes, I thought you''d be flattered. Go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'Tractor beams can be difficult. This device will ensure that the beam works effectively without shaking the target to bits. Deliver your completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm19r', 'For the tractor beam diagnostics? Very well. I shall consign the task of calibrating and diagnosing the beam''s performance to some junior officer. You may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm19s', 'I am informed you discharged your duty correctly. However, should the tractor beam prove unstable and destroy a target, the Empire will know who is responsible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm19t', 'Calibrating Tractor Beams is Such a Nuisance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm20d', 'Ships captured by tractor beam and pulled into a Star Destroyer''s main hangar are held in place with an electromagnetic paralyzing pincer crane. This office finds the state of current research in this field quite sad. For our improved crane prototype this office requires a certain part. Secure the components and build that part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'Ah, excellent! This office takes the position that research in paralyzing pincer cranes is unduly neglected. Here are the components. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm20r', 'A dismal epoch in paralyzing pincer crane research will shortly end. That is my own opinion, which of course echoes that of my superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm20s', 'This office''s consistent advocacy for paralyzing pincer crane research will see the Empire to still greater glory! '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm20t', 'Paralyzing Pincer Crane Stance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm21d', 'The Kuat shipyard is preparing a new, grander class of Imperial military cruisers. Details are classified. To train personnel for this new ship, we shall use dummy prototypes of the new equipment. We require you to build a certain part for the latest prototype. Pick up the components at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'Here are the components for the prototype part. Don''t worry if it is not functional; that is not its purpose. Deliver the completed part to the personnel trainer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm21r', 'For a training display it is crucial that this not actually work. Let me test it -- yes! Nothing! Well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm21s', 'You may rest assured that building nonfunctional equipment serves the Empire''s larger purpose. Be proud, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm21t', 'We Don''t Want It to Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'm22d', 'Umm-hmm-hm -- what? You wish to build something? Ah. Well, in fact the Empire has entrusted this office to build a prototype for -- this will impress you -- a service gantryway retractor for a TIE fighter hangar. Yes, I share your obvious astonishment at this high honor. Pick up the components and build a certain part we need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'What excitement I feel, giving you these components for the TIE hangar service gantryway retractor! All those years of training at the Academy have paid off. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 108, 'm22r', 'It is of course a wonderful honor to assemble the new prototype service gantryway retractor. Don''t tell anyone in the Empire that I ever said differently.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 109, 'm22s', 'For your worthy aid in constructing the TIE hangar service gantryway retractor, you no doubt feel the same thrill shared by all in this office. Your payment is attached.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 110, 'm22t', 'Know the Thrill of a Gantry Retractor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 111, 'm23d', 'A very high clearance project is getting under way elsewhere in the galaxy. Very high clearance. Prototype part design is being scattered across the Empire for security. It falls to you to build one particular part. It may appear innocuous, but believe me -- this is of signal importance. Pick up the components. Tell no one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'We''ve been shipped strange components for this classified project. Very advanced. Oops, I''d better not say any more. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 113, 'm23r', 'I have been informed of your assignment. I shall relay the prototype to the assembly staging area.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 114, 'm23s', 'Payment is attached. Tell no one of your work, or it will go badly for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 115, 'm23t', 'Part for Highly Classified Project'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 116, 'm24d', 'We require you to build a part for an atmosphere processing substation. Here are the schematics. The purpose is classified, but you need to know that it is for a -- well, a large battle cruiser. A very, very large cruiser. Build the part with appropriate tolerances. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'I can''t believe the tolerances on these components! You''d think they were building another Death Star or something. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 118, 'm24r', 'The soldier who gave you these components has been court-martialed for loose talk and removed offworld. Attempt to avoid that fate yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 119, 'm24s', 'Perhaps I failed to stress the need for confidentiality in this assignment. Let that be your watchword in any Imperial assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 120, 'm24t', 'Part for a Very, Very Large Cruiser'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 121, 'm25d', 'This office supervises sector-wide production of landing alignment markers for spacecraft docking bays. Not glamorous, I grant you, but important. The machine that produces these parts has broken, and the replacement part is on Coruscant. We prefer to commission you to build the required part. Get the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'Docking bay alignment markers, eh? It never occurred to me that anyone actually needed to make those. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 123, 'm25r', 'I''ll dispatch this to the repair droids soon. I''d hate to cripple sector-wide production of -- um -- landing alignment markers. Heh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 124, 'm25s', 'Citizens seldom appreciate the details involved in running a galaxy-wide Empire. You have helped with one such detail. Expect more work soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 125, 'm25t', 'Docking Bay Alignment is Important Too'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 126, 'm26d', 'We require you to build a prototype part. Note that in this schematic it goes in an ion sublight engine. You are not to regard or comment on the unusually large size of the ion engine. You are not to speculate on the size of the craft propelled by this engine. That is classfied. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 127, 'm26p', 'Note that I am specifically not commenting on the size of the engine implied by the tolerances in these components. I am in no way violating secrecy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 128, 'm26r', 'What is this? For an ion engine? Don''t be absurd. An ion engine that needs a part like this would be big enough to move a small moon!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 129, 'm26s', 'It appears that certain members of the supply chain were not adequately briefed on security. This shortfall has been remedied. Tell no one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 130, 'm26t', 'Who Needs an Ion Engine That Big?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 131, 'm27d', 'Restrain your excitement as I commission you to create a vital part for the prototype trash compactors aboard a space battle station now being planned. I am not clear what spacecraft these trash compactors are for. Ah well, it is not for a mere line officer to question the Empire. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 132, 'm27p', 'The battle station in question must have unusual functions. This schematic indicates an extremely high volume of garbage. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 133, 'm27r', 'This is satisfactory. Tell no one of the new prototype trash compactor, or it will go badly for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 134, 'm27s', 'I am belatedly informed that this matter is highly classified. Tell no one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 135, 'm27t', 'Prototype Trash Compactor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 136, 'm28d', 'The Empire is preparing a new -- let me see here -- a new induction hyperphase generator for some sort of new battle cruiser. Prototype parts for this device are being produced all over the galaxy, for security reasons. Pick up the components and create a part for this generator. Meanwhile, I will try to identify the battle cruiser.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 137, 'm28p', 'All the tolerances for this induction hyperphase generator seem several orders of magnitude too high. Oh well. Deliver the part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 138, 'm28r', 'Did anyone discuss the destination of this part? Oh, that officer did, did he? I must see about that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 139, 'm28s', 'Attention! I have been informed, beyond any possibility of ambiguity, that you are absolutely not to discuss the new battle cruiser! That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 140, 'm28t', 'Some Sort of New Battle Cruiser'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 141, 'm29d', 'In vain this office has tried to build an acceptable prototype for a new laser firing field amplifier. Imperial Center rejected our previous attempts as "inadequate." But they will certainly accept this new design! Pick up the components at these coordinates and build a vital part for this absurdly massive device.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 142, 'm29p', 'I don''t understand why our previous designs were rejected. Now this field amplifier is so ridiculously overpowered, it could have blown up Alderaan. Well, deliver the part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 143, 'm29r', 'Another part for yet another field amplifier. The power tolerances required by this latest design are absolutely outlandish. Well, I shall forward your part as required.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 144, 'm29s', 'I cannot believe this! Once more Imperial Center has rejected our design as "underpowered"! Well, this office may contact you again with another assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 145, 'm29t', 'Absurdly Overpowered Amplifier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 146, 'm30d', 'I am pleased that this office -- my office -- has received orders to construct prototype parts for the next generation of TIE Interceptor spacecraft. Thank you, thank you. But rather than dwelling on the high honor this represents, I am commissioning you to pick up components at these coordinates and build a certain vital part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 147, 'm30p', 'Here are the components. It must be so glamorous working on the new TIE Interceptor project! Can I get your autograph?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 148, 'm30r', 'Ah, the TIE Interceptor project is already proceeding apace. This will reflect very well on us. I shall have this piece installed at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 149, 'm30s', 'Rather than dwell on this project''s opportunities for advancement, let me congratulate you on your good fortune in becoming involved. Onward to victory!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 150, 'm30t', 'Think of the Prestige'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 151, 'm31d', 'Are you skilled at microminiaturization? Well, it doesn''t matter -- the prototype is one thousand times actual size. You are building a vital prototype part for the next-generation macrobinocular viewplate to be built into each stormtrooper helmet. Weight and size will be paramount issues. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 152, 'm31p', 'I wondered how a stormtrooper helmet could hold all of this equipment, until I saw the "1000x" on the prototype schematic. They do make things small nowadays.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 153, 'm31r', 'I''m glad this new viewplate prototype is a thousand times actual size. We built the earlier design actual size, and a soldier sneezed and destroyed it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 154, 'm31s', 'I''m told the new viewplate prototype was rejected as "unacceptably large." It seems we must try to coordinate our communications better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 155, 'm31t', 'One Thousand Times Actual Size'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 156, 'm32d', 'You have seen an Imperial AT-AT walker? You understand that the cockpit access tube flexes like a creature''s neck? The neck flexes using a ringed electromagnetic system. This office is preparing a prototype for a new ringed system. Pick up components at these coordinates and build the indicated part for this system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 157, 'm32p', 'I hear that the top ranks don''t like the AT-AT cockpit access referred to as a "neck." It sounds too -- organic. Anyway, deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 158, 'm32r', 'Is it true? That officer referred to the AT-AT cockpit access as a "neck"? You''re sure? Very well, I shall look into the matter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 159, 'm32s', 'In regard to our earlier conversation, disregard all uses of the term "neck" to mean "cockpit access." I have been authoritatively informed that this term is incorrect.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 160, 'm32t', 'Control System for AT-AT Neck'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 161, 'm33d', 'The Imperial Army is redesigning the AT-ST scout walker to handle more varied terrain. The legs will require new shock absorber systems that feed data directly to the nav-computer. For the prototype system we require you to build a part of the compression sensor assembly. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 162, 'm33p', 'This part will go right above the shin stabilizer on the AT-ST, so build it for durability. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 163, 'm33r', 'Not a moment too soon. The current prototypes are falling over at an egregious rate. Quite undignified. I shall have this part installed at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 164, 'm33s', 'I am told that the new AT-ST is expected to safely navigate even dense forest. Soon the Empire''s reach will know no bounds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 165, 'm33t', 'New AT-ST Walks Smoothly'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 166, 'm34d', 'To sense terrain, an Imperial AT-AT walker uses impulse sensors built into each footpad. The current sensors function in an insufficiently wide range of temperatures. Pick up components at these coordinates and build a part for the replacement prototype. This assignment is, of course, classified.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 167, 'm34p', 'These schematics specify an impulse sensor that can function in extreme cold. As if anyone would fight a battle on some frigid snowball planet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 168, 'm34r', 'We will install this part in the prototype shortly. Say nothing to anyone about this assignment, do you understand? Nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 169, 'm34s', 'Remember, you are not to say, imply, or indicate to any party the temperature range at which this sensor optimally functions. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 170, 'm34t', 'Low-Temp AT-AT Footpad Sensor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 171, 'm35d', 'Our stormtroopers frequently pilot speeder bikes for fast transport. These vehicles have forward gyroscopes that occasionally malfunction. Consequences are usually fatal. This office is preparing a new gyroscope for which we require one vital part. Secure the components for this part at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 172, 'm35p', 'I saw one of those speeder bikes malfunction once. The pilot started spinning like a rotor blade, zizz-zizz. I think he survived three, possibly four seconds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 173, 'm35r', 'This is the speeder bike gyroscope part? We will install it in the prototype at once. Testing begins as soon as we draft volunteers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 174, 'm35s', 'So far the survival rate among stormtrooper test subjects is acceptable. The new speeder bike gyro will be a great success!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 175, 'm35t', 'Speeder Bike Gyro is Vital'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_imperial_easy.stf', 176, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Some customer had the gall to complain about the quality of my acceleration compensators. I''ll have you know they''re the best in the galaxy! Well, just to be on the safe side, I made some tweaks to the design. I need you to build this part for me so I can hand it to my testing division. Take this schematic to my supplier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'I kept telling the "engineering genius" that those designs were flawed. We''ll be lucky to avoid criminal prosecution. Here''s what the new schematic calls for, friend. Hope this one works. Take the finished part to our lead tester.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1r', 'What? Not another incarnation of the "ultimate acceleration compensator"? Okay, my people will get right on it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm1s', 'Heard everything looked pretty good, friend. Nice work. You ever consider opening a shop, you just let me know!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Build a Better Valve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'I certainly could use your help, friend. I''ve received a schematic for a new MSE-6 droid motivator. I''ve never seen anything like it. Way too complex for a simple mouse droid, I can tell you that. Anyway, if you think you can put this part together, I''d compensate you for your time. You need to see my partner for the components.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'These specs are pretty sophisticated. Mouse droids don''t have the computing power to take advantage of these bad boys. But it''s not my project. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm2r', 'Thanks, friend. I know this must seem kinda strange, but trust me, it''s for a good cause. Next time you see a mouse droid, don''t be so quick to dismiss it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm2s', 'My customer was quite happy with your work, citizen. You seem to have a knack for this sort of thing. Come see me again some time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm2t', 'Build a Better Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm3d', 'One of my buyers has had some problems with the TT-8L''s optical photoreceptors. For some reason certain comlink frequencies create static in the image. An associate redesigned the optics, but I haven''t assembled all the parts yet. Can you build one? Take this schematic and pick up the components from my supplier.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'I keep waiting for Serv-O-Droid to upgrade the Y7 models. I''m sure it''ll happen when there''s enough demand. Here you go. Take it to our disgruntled buyer when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm3r', 'I hope this clears up the problem. Nothing is worse than having your hologram scrambled right in the middle of a really interesting encounter. Oh, I''m into, uh, private surveillance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm3s', 'Well done, friend. Apparently you''ve got the magic touch. You keep this up and you''ll make a name for yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm3t', 'Build a Better Photoreceptor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm4d', 'These owners of older-model airspeeders! All those models have defective anti-theft sensors. Either you live with the risk of your vintage vehicle being stolen, or else you get a new airspeeder. Why don''t they see that? Gaah. Take yet another sensor redesign schematic to my parts supplier and assemble this part. If it doesn''t work this time, I''m giving up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'Well, they say third time''s a charm. Or does this make five attempts? Hmm, not sure. Good luck with that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm4r', 'I''m certain this new design will fix the problem. Plus, I''m convinced it wasn''t a fault in the design in the first place. Shoddy workmanship was to blame.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm4s', 'With any luck, this will keep this customer off our backs. I''ve never understood the attraction of restoring junked airspeeders anyway. You did well, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm4t', 'Theft-Proof a Vintage Airspeeder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm5d', 'It may not be the most difficult or prestigious engineering work in the galaxy, but building a sturdy magnetic clamp is still important work. Think you can help me get this latest design together? I need a part assembled for it. My partner just put the finishing touches on some of those components, so everything should be ready to go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'I reshaped some of the widgets to be a bit more pleasing to the eye. Maybe that work is wasted on magnetic clamps, but I take pride in my work. I''m sure you understand.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm5r', 'This is for a magnetic clamp, huh? Looks more like a sculpture. Well, as long as it works, I suppose I really don''t care. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm5s', 'We should all take pride in our work, eh, friend? The product''s delivered and the customer seems happy. I''ve gladly deposited your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm5t', 'Make a Nifty Magnetic Clamp'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm6d', 'These new cruiser reactors are generating too much heat. We need to constantly upgrade the coolant pumps to compensate. I wish the corporate engineers who designed these reactors worried about practical issues instead of pleasing Imperial masters. Take this new pump schematic to my supplier and build this part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'Those hotshot pilots rarely take the time to appreciate the delicate inner workings of a thermal sink. Most of them just want a big on-off switch. If only it were that easy. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm6r', 'Nothing vexes a pilot like an overheated engine, friend. I sure hope this new design reduces such incidents. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm6s', 'Product was delivered and seems to work. Job well done. Enjoy your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm6t', 'Coolant Pumps Are Fun'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm7d', 'About time someone decided to take a look at these old radiation funnels. They''re notorious for spewing out all sorts of noxious gases. This new design should eliminate this problem. We still have some electrocution issues to work out, but progress takes time. If you want to put some components together, pick them up from my partner.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'Air dissociators are tricky things to put together. The problem was not the size of the funnel but its shape. Hopefully you can solve that. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm7r', 'Personally, it never really bothered me that the old radiation funnels were polluting the air. Isn''t it the Empire''s job to worry about that sort of thing? Thanks anyway, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm7s', 'Yeah, I know -- Alzoc pearls before Ugnaughts, right? But at least you built your part well and delivered it on time. Your pay has been deposited. See me again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm7t', 'The Beauty of a Radiation Funnel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm8d', 'There''s nothing worse than a leaky power cell. Weight is a limiting factor for any vessel, so you want to make your load as light as possible. If we could redesign these older power cells then pilots could reduce the number they need to stock to insure a safe journey. If you think you can assemble some of the components, take this schematic to my partner for the parts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'The problem really only arises in the high-intensity cells. The ordinary ionized cryogenic cells are fine. In any case, good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm8r', 'So you''re sure this will fix the problem, eh? Okay, I''ll test it out and send reports back in. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm8s', 'Great! You got it there. I''ll just hope for the best and see how that new power cell performs. Good work, by the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm8t', 'Fix the Leaky Power Cell'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm9d', 'Power surge regulators are a crucial component of all ionization blasters. Last thing you want is your blaster overheating and frying your limbs. These regulators need to be upgraded on a regular basis, especially since the new blasters keep upping their power output. Take this regulator redesign and assemble the part I need. See my partner for the components.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'I''ve actually seen what happens when one of those babies overloads. Not pretty. Fortunately it happened to a Trandoshan, and he didn''t seem to mind much. Here you go. When you''re finished, drop the part off with our tester.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm9r', 'Another power surge regulator? I sure hope this one works. I''m running out of volunteers to test these blasted things. Well, try and try again, I suppose. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm9s', 'Sounds like everything is in order. Good work, friend. I''m sure you''ve solved all those safety issues with this new redesign.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm9t', 'Safety Is Important'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm10d', 'One of my clients is headed for Iskallon and wants to commission a custom sonic weapon. This rifle will need a specialized amplification chamber. I''ve got the specs for it right here, but I don''t have the time to assemble all the parts. If you think you can lend a hand, I''d reward your service. Pick up the components from my supplier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'Iskallon is a water world, I believe. Makes sense. These sonic weapons are much more effective underwater. Here are the parts. When you''re finished assembling the part deliver it to the customer. Good luck with it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm10r', 'Excellent work, citizen. I think this will aid my mission rather well. Tell the engineer I''ll deliver a status report when I get back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm10s', 'Sounds like you did a fine job. I''ve deposited your fee, and I think you''ll find it quite generous. I hope you look me up in the future if you need work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm10t', 'Sonic Weapons Are Loud'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm11d', 'A bounty hunter is not happy with the power of current wrist rockets. I don''t know the target, but I''ve been asked to design a more effective magnetic accelerator. I''ve got the design but I need someone to assemble a vital part. Think you can help me out? Get the components from my associate, who specializes in magnetics. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'The rockets fired by this launcher will be able to penetrate most armor, which I''m sure was the point. I just hope the power pack doesn''t burn out. Take the finished part to the bounty hunter when you''re done. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm11r', 'This might make the weapon a little bulky. I''ll pay you a visit if the weapon does not perform as promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm11s', 'Got that to our customer, I see. I wouldn''t give too much credence to any threats that might have been sent your way. That''s just standard bounty hunter talk. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm11t', 'Build a Deadlier Wrist Rocket'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm12d', 'We get quite a few bounty hunter customers -- not surprising given the nature of their work and our discretion policy. One wants a larger stun net. I''ve redesigned the housing and firing mechanism to handle the larger volume. If you can assemble a part for me, I''ll pay you. Get the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'The thinness of these new canisters worries me. They''ll be easier to puncture. Drop the part off with the customer, would you? Oh, and don''t mention my name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm12r', 'Hmm, it does seem heavier. We''ll see how it performs. These nets better be strong enough to immobilze an enraged gundark, or there''ll be trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm12s', 'I''m quite pleased with your handiwork, citizen. I hope this wonderful partnership continues. Enjoy your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm12t', 'Need a Bigger Stun Net'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm13d', 'Moisture farmers certainly seem to enjoy their work. Can''t say as I''d find any satisfaction doing that. But I do enjoy redesigning hardware to be more efficient. This time it''s a humidity sensor. Here''s the schematic. Could you pick up the components at these coordinates and build the part I need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'Make sure the sensor pads are wiped clean before installation. And use the C-sized hydrospanner when assembling it. The larger ones tend to scratch the pads. The eager customer waits for the finished product at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm13r', 'Thank you so much. This looks great. I can''t wait to assemble this new sensor. Moisture farming is such a joy, don''t you agree?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm13s', 'Looks like you made one moisture farmer very happy. Good work, friend. I''ve transmitted your fee. See me again if you want more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm13t', 'Moisture Farming Made Easy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm14d', 'A blaster collector has asked me to redesign the power surge dampener for the Defender sporting blaster. Apparently the goal is to make these blasters pack more of a punch. I''ve got the schematic here, but I need a part assembled. If you could pick up the components and take care of that, I''d pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'Why would a collector want to change the specs of an older blaster? Doesn''t that defeat the purpose of collecting? Anyway, here are the parts. Drop the part off at these coordinates when you''re done. Good luck.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm14r', 'These look good, citizen. I''ll start assembling the new dampener right away. I''ll let our engineer know you do good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm14s', 'Everything went smoothly, friend. Our blaster mechanic was impressed by you. Feel free to see me for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm14t', 'Upgrade the Sporting Blaster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm15d', 'I''ve been asked to modify the power pack of an old beam tube. Now as you know, these things are not exactly legal, so this work needs to be kept confidential. If you''d like to help, take this schematic and assemble the indicated part. Pick up the components from these coordinates. And remember, this is hush-hush.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'Here you go, friend. I hope your boss knows the score if word of this gets out. When you''re done, take the finished piece to these coordinates. Best of luck. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm15r', 'I was starting to wonder if that sly engineer had had a change of heart. I suppose not. I''ll take it from here, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm15s', 'Good work, friend. Everything went off without a hitch, and no authorities seemed the wiser. I''d work with you again. Your pay''s been desposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm15t', 'Questionable Technology'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm16d', 'How do you feel about disruptors, friend? I just had a bounty hunter request some modifications to his Tenloss DXR-6. I''ve agreed to do the redesign but I need some help getting a particular part. Think you can build it? You can get the components from my business associate. Take the schematic with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'Bounty hunters do seem to love their disruptors. Here are the parts. When you''ve assembled the components, take the finished product to our weapon specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm16r', 'I''ve seen the redesign, citizen. Do you have any idea what the destructive capability of this weapon will be when it''s assembled? I hope this bounty hunter never comes after me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm16s', 'Handled like a true professional, citizen. I''ve transmitted your pay and would gladly work with you again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm16t', 'One Mean Disruptor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm17d', 'A Corporate Sector Authority security representative has asked me to increase the firepower of their Golan Arms flechette launchers. I''ve made some modifications to the launch activators that I think should do the trick. However, I need a part for the final product. If you can do that for me, pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'I think these weapons are powerful enough as they are. But I don''t get paid for my opinions, just my craftsmanship. Here are the components. Take the finished part to our specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm17r', 'This new design will easily penetrate stormtrooper armor plate. I wonder if the Empire knows the CSA is asking for these changes? Oh well. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm17s', 'It''s important in our business to maintain confidentiality. I''m sure you understand. Good work. Your pay has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm17t', 'Keep This Confidential'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm18d', 'A client wants a thermal detonator with a dummy timer that sets to three seconds regardless of what the user tries to do. Yes, I know this sounds like a booby-trap, but I do what I''m paid to do. I need someone to assemble a part, and that''s where you come in. If you wish to help, pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'Doesn''t sound like the client intends to use this thing himself, eh? Here are the components. I''d take extra care with assembling them, if I were you. Take the finished part to our demolitions expert.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm18r', 'A three-second dummy timer, huh? I feel sorry for the being that tries to use this weapon. Okay, I''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm18s', 'Thanks for your help, friend. I see you understand how important it is in our business to get rid of moral judgments. Come see me for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm18t', 'A Very Short Fuse'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm19d', 'When you work in my field for as long as I have, you learn not to ask questions. I''ve made some modifications to an Evasive-13 individual field disruptor. I need a part assembled for the finished product but don''t have time to attend to it myself. Think you can lend a hand? Get the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'Hmm, aren''t these devices used to slip past energy fences? Well, none of my business, I''m sure. Here are the components. Take the part to our assembly facility when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm19r', 'Ah yes, the field disruptor. We''ll get right on it. This is good work, friend. Where did you get your training?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm19s', 'Our client will be quite pleased. I appreciate your level of professionalism and skill. We should work together again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm19t', 'A New Field Disruptor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm20d', 'Some clients want to up the yield of these new proton torpedoes, so they''ve asked me to redesign the energy envelope projector. As you know, there are lots of specialized parts for these things. Could you help me get one together? Here''s the schematic detailing what I need. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'Here you go. I understand this design is going to some "very important beings," so I''d be extra careful if I were you. When you''re done, take it to our assembly manager. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm20r', 'This looks quite acceptable. We''ll get right on it. A good proton torpedo can be a pilot''s best friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm20s', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. My clients will undoubtedly be satisfied. Look me up again for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm20t', 'Build a Better Proton Torpedo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm21d', 'Space mines need to be more deadly, apparently. My clients want a redesign of the proximity sensors to increase their range and sensitivity. I need one part to complete the prototype. Take this schematic and pick up the components from my supplier. Look at this as your contribution to interstellar travel security.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'Space mines are a nuisance, but hey, who am I to judge? I just order and ship components. Take the finished part to the engineer''s assembly chief.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm21r', 'I hope this redesign doesn''t make the mines too sensitive or else we might create more problems than we solve. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm21s', 'Excellent work, friend. The space lanes will be much safer thanks to our efforts. At least I hope they are. Your fee''s been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm21t', 'Make Space Mines More Sensitive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm22d', 'As sensor arrays get more sophisticated, we''re called on to redesign sensor jammers to match those advances. I need one part assembled for my newest jammer design. The components can be picked up from my supplier at these coordinates. Think you can help me out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'The problem is probably in the jamming projector. You know that, right? Here are your components. Take the finished part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm22r', 'People rarely appreciate the hard work we sensor technicians do. But I''m sure you understand that better than most. I''ll assemble this jammer as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm22s', 'All''s well that ends well, eh, citizen? A pleasure working with you. Your fee''s been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm22t', 'Need a Better Sensor Jammer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm23d', 'I got an order in for a redesign of a sensor beacon''s motion sensor assembly. Not the most glamorous work but it does pay the bills. I need one more part to finish building the prototype. Could you assemble it for me? You can pick up everything you need at these coordinates. Here''s the schematic.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'I think the sensor beacons we have now are just fine. Why is someone always trying to fix something that ain''t broke? Here are the components. Take your work over to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm23r', 'Good craftsmanship on these components, friend. Do you do this professionally? I''ll get right on that sensor assembly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm23s', 'Well handled, citizen. I enjoy working with professionals such as yourself. Feel free to see me for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm23t', 'Now That''s a Sensor Beacon!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm24d', 'There''s a call for increased security measures when sending subspace messages. I''ve been asked to redesign the encryption modules for subspace transceivers. One vital part must be assembled in order to test the prototype. If you wish to put it together, head to these coordinates for the components. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'Here you go. Make sure your tools are clean before you assemble these, or that may interfere with the prototype''s performance. Take the finished part to our testing facility.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm24r', 'We''ll finish assembling the prototype and start the testing procedure. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm24s', 'Nice work, friend. Now I just have to wait and hear whether the prototype performs to spec. A pleasure working with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm24t', 'A Listen-Proof Subspace Transceiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm25d', 'It may be questionable work, but a client wants me to modify an electronic lock breaker''s key-code replicator jack. The money is good, so I''ve agreed to do it. I need a part for the final design. If you''re interested, take this schematic and pick up the components from my supplier. I''ll make sure you''re well paid.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'Here you go. Don''t want to know what these are being used for. Take the whatever-it-is you assemble to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm25r', 'This is gonna be one heck of a lock-breaker, I can tell you! I bet a top-notch data slicer asked for this redesign. I''ll get it built lickety-split.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm25s', 'My tester gave you way more information than was prudent or necessary. I think I''ll have to get a new lead assembly tester. Your fee''s been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm25t', 'A Gadget For Better Access'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'm26d', 'The humidity on this world -- not even the whole world, just one particular farmer''s land -- anyway, there''s something in that air that doesn''t love this fellow''s vaporators. They all break down. I''ve designed an improved ion dampener that may solve the problem. Can you build this part for it? Pick up the components from my supplier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 127, 'm26p', 'I had to search the sector for the right minerals you''ll need to make this. That blasted ion dampener is a weird design, completely out there in terms of dampener philosophy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 128, 'm26r', 'Thanks, I''ll install this part in the dampener. I sure do hope this solves the vaporator problem on my land. In cold weather they tend to explode.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 129, 'm26s', 'Excellent crafting job, friend. With luck my piece may open a new era in the realm of dampener design.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 130, 'm26t', 'Something Doesn''t Love Vaporators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 131, 'm27d', 'Not many starships put stress on their ion turbines like those Corellian Corvettes. I know, I know -- you''ll say that nowadays those Corvettes are just smuggling vessels and blockade runners. I don''t get into politics. Please just make this part for a new ion pre-cycle impeller control. Pick up the goods you need from my supplier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 132, 'm27p', 'This material has been specially hardened using a new process just developed on Coruscant. It''s tough stuff, but very pricey.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 133, 'm27r', 'I expect the completed impeller to bump up performance by upwards of three-point-seven percent. If you can run hotter, you can run faster. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 134, 'm27s', 'I don''t expect my customer had any illegal intent in asking for an impeller control. At least, I hope not. But that''s not really our business, you know?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 135, 'm27t', 'Don''t Question Your Customers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 136, 'm28d', 'High-performance starships need high-pressure fuel cells. These cells require a robust yet exquisitely sensitive regulator. A true aficionado of good design has commissioned me to prepare a schematic. I offer a skilled craftsbeing the chance to produce an excellent part for this remarkable custom piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 137, 'm28p', 'This is a magnificent selection of materials: sturdy, yet malleable; finely adjusted, yet authoritative. I envy you the chance to work with these components!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 138, 'm28r', 'Ah, a splendid piece, composed with diligence and a rarefied attention to detail. The aroma of quality positively wafts from this regulator part!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 139, 'm28s', 'If I do say so myself, my design is exceptional -- at once functional and elegantly compelling. Thank you, thank you for your part in bringing this effort to fruition.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 140, 'm28t', 'A Truly Fine Fuel Cell Regulator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 141, 'm29d', 'After twenty years of practical starship engineering experience, I''m reduced to this. Some rich flyboy needs a new motor to rotate the exhaust panels on his Corellian Corvette to maximize their heat discharge. Well, I''ve risen to this tremendous challenge and prepared the schematic. Can you pick up the components and build a part I need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 142, 'm29p', 'What supplier doesn''t dream of being part of an effort to build a heat exhaust panel rotator? Be still, my heart. Sorry, I''m just funning you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 143, 'm29r', 'What''s this thing? What? Part of an exhaust panel rotator? Okay, if you say so. I''ll forward it to my boss.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 144, 'm29s', 'Now I''ve been given an assignment to design some even more trivial and gratuitious gimcrack. Where did my life go wrong?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 145, 'm29t', 'Culmination of a Career'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 146, 'm30d', 'If the fuel in a starship''s maneuvering jet is insufficiently concentrated, the jet sputters -- the ship falters -- wham, you''ve hit the asteroid! It falls to you and me to ensure that fuel is concentrated correctly. I have the design, and I''ve lined up a supplier for the components. The task of crafting a vital part of this concentrator is on your shoulders.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 147, 'm30p', 'I''ve worked day and night to get these materials. They''re the very best I could find. It''s all up to you now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 148, 'm30r', 'Is this your piece of the concentrator? Is it up to the task? Tell the truth: If it''s going to fall short, I need to know. Tell me! All right, I''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 149, 'm30s', 'It keeps me awake at night, that "wham!" as my customer hits the asteroid. This job is too stressful. I need to find a less momentous line of work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 150, 'm30t', 'Can You Stand the Pressure?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 151, 'm31d', 'This regulator controls the rotation bearings on starship sensor arrays. No, it doesn''t regulate the rotation, it regulates the bearings that control the rotation. No, look, it''s simple: Without this regulator, the bearings would allow the array to spin out of control. No, you don''t understand, it''s -- look, can you just pick up some components and build the part I need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 152, 'm31p', 'Now, wait, these things don''t look like sensors. What? Bearing regulators? These aren''t bearings either. I don''t get it. Bearing rotation regulator, you say? Oh well, if you say so. Here, take the stuff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 153, 'm31r', 'Oookay, let''s see if I understand -- the completed piece, of which this is a part, controls the bearings that control the rotation of the starship sensor array, is that it? Why do you need to control bearings again? Oh well, never mind, I''ll have it installed soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 154, 'm31s', 'This isn''t that hard a concept! "Put machine on ship, or you can''t see!" Maybe I need to install a protocol droid brain on each regulator, so it can explain itself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 155, 'm31t', 'What Am I Building Again?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 156, 'm32d', 'Excuse me, have you been approached by a designer about building --? No, never mind. No, forget it. Here, I have this design for a -- let''s see -- an ion drive turbine regulator, and I''d like you to build a part for it. You haven''t seen this schematic before, right? Never mind, just curious. Oh, pick up the components from, uh -- this supplier here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 157, 'm32p', 'Funny, didn''t I just give over these same materials for a turbine regulator component? That''s odd, I could have sworn -- no, must be imagining it. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 158, 'm32r', 'This is for a turbine regulator? But I just got one. Do I need two? Is something wrong with the first one? I''m confused. I''ll pay you and straighten it out with the designer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 159, 'm32s', 'Thanks. I just got paid too. If you hear any slanderous accusations that I stole that schematic, I assure you they''re completely false.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 160, 'm32t', 'Yet Another Ion Drive Turbine Regulator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 161, 'm33d', 'Hhuk! Hk-hkaakhhk-k-k! Excuse me. I''ve inhaled vapors from liquid metal fuel. I''ve been testing my new design for an atomization regulator. But my medical droid tells me to avoid further exposure. So I''d like you to get the components I ordered and put together an important part. I''ll pay you, if I''m not in the bacta tanks when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 162, 'm33p', 'Here are the materials the designer requested. I hope you''re not actually going to work with the fuel itself. That stuff''s as toxic as a dead mynock.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 163, 'm33r', 'Kaff! Hk-kaff! Okay -- ahukk-k-k! -- just leave it there. K-kehhk! I -- I''ll get it installed right away! Now clear out!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 164, 'm33s', 'I hope you executed this project without adverse consequences. The lesson is, never underestimate the importance of good safety equipment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 165, 'm33t', 'Fuel Atomization is Dangerous Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 166, 'm34d', 'The Corporate Sector Authority just opened a new mine on a desert planet in the Mid Rim. They''ve shipped in reconditioned sandcrawlers left over from the mining rush on Tatooine. Their tread units are breaking down from sand buildup. I''ve designed a new electrostatic repeller. I''d like you to pick up some components and build a part for it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 167, 'm34p', 'I heard about the Tatooine mining rush. Turns out the metal they mined wasn''t much good. Turns magnetic unpredictably, and we all know how bad that can be.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 168, 'm34r', 'Thanks. These sandcrawlers have the most bizarre modifications. No standard repeller will fit the modified treads. I''ll get this part installed in the prototype right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 169, 'm34s', 'It''s hard to imagine what the previous owners put those sandcrawlers through in all the centuries since the mining rush. Oh well, it ended up giving us some work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 170, 'm34t', 'Sandcrawler Tread Electrostatic Repeller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 171, 'm35d', 'My friend was heading into this system when pirates attacked. He tried to escape in his escape pod -- the bolt wouldn''t blow! He was stuck! He''s furious. He commissioned me to design a foolproof custom bolt controller. I need one custom part; here''s a schematic. Get the components and deliver the part to my friend''s agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 172, 'm35p', 'You know what''s worse than an escape pod bolt that won''t blow? One that blows way too soon! Haha, old joke. Well, I think it''s funny. Here''s your materials.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 173, 'm35r', 'I''ll have this piece installed in the new controller. The client is quite intent on getting it installed before he lifts off.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 174, 'm35s', 'Did my supplier try to tell you some "joke" about escape pods? I never got that joke at all. Some of these suppliers live in a galaxy of their own.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 175, 'm35t', 'Escape Pod Explosive Bolt Controller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 176, 'm36d', 'A friend of mine is a big dejarik player, but he runs long space missions alone, without opponents. He wants to integrate a droid brain into his dejarik board. That should provide a good contest. He''s building a board-brain interface. Here''s the schematic for an important part. Can you pick up the components and build it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 177, 'm36p', 'So you connect the board to the droid brain. Fine. My question is, who programs the droid to play good dejarik? You''ve already got the coordinates for the delivery to the customer''s agent, right? Good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 178, 'm36r', 'Project''s off, I''m afraid. The droid brain gloats excessively when it wins, which is always. Very annoying -- just like the master dejarik player who programmed it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 179, 'm36s', 'Sorry to put you to that work for nothing. I''m paying you anyway for your effort. Anything involving droid brains can become potentially tricky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 180, 'm36t', 'Dejarik Playing Droid Interface'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 181, 'm37d', 'My customer is involved in the starship racing scene. He placed at the back of the pack this year at Ord Mantell, so for next year he''s customizing every piece of his ship. Money is no object, he says -- music to a designer''s ears! I have a schematic. I''d like you to pick up the components, make the part, and drop it off to the client''s agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 182, 'm37p', 'Some of this stuff was hard to find, but when the money is flowing like water, I can make things happen. This is the most lucrative contract I''ve ever had!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 183, 'm37r', 'I''ll take this part to my client at once. He''s paid me well -- very well -- to get all equipment to him quickly. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 184, 'm37s', 'You''re not satisfied with your payment? Sorry. Turns out the customer went bankrupt shortly after I gave you the assignment. I''m paying you out of my own pocket. Better luck next time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 185, 'm37t', 'Big-Money Assignment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 186, 'm38d', 'S-threads are HoloNet signals transmitted through hyperspace. A homing beacon sends coded locator signals across the HoloNet whenever the beacon crosses an S-thread. This schematic describes a part for a controller that amplifies the beacon''s sensitivity a hundredfold. Get the materials and make it for me, and together we''ll sell it to the Imperial Navy for a fortune!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 187, 'm38p', 'People asked an awful lot of questions when I was putting together these materials. I got the impression that the Empire doesn''t like a lot of interest in S-threads. Your call, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 188, 'm38r', 'You are the manufacturer of this controller part? I''ll take that. The individual who was to receive this device is now in custody. Tell no one about this technology, or your life will take a sudden brief turn for the worse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 189, 'm38s', 'Greetings. I am protocol specialist RT-3P0. My owner commissioned you to develop a part for the S-thread sensor controller. I regret to report that my owner is now in Imperial custody. I''m sure it''s only temporary. I am authorized to release your payment, with my owner''s fervent request that you never mention this matter again to anyone at any time hereafter, forevermore. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 190, 'm38t', 'Improve Your Homing Beacon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 191, 'm39d', 'Please help me! I''m in trouble with a Hutt gang. They want a new thrust monitor for the repulsorlift on one of their vehicles. It''s a huge luxury vehicle called a sail barge. I''ve spent two sleepless days finishing the schematic and lining up a supplier. You must get the materials and put together a vital part of this monitor! Please hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 192, 'm39p', 'No, please, I beg of you -- uh, I mean -- wait, you''re not with the Hutts, are you? The crafter! Wonderful! Please take these materials and make the piece. Hurry! Please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 193, 'm39r', 'At last! Where have you been? Do you know what kind of threats they''ve been -- well, never mind. I have to hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 194, 'm39s', 'All right. I believe Lord Jabba is satisfied, for the moment. I also believe it''s time for me to look into other lines of work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 195, 'm39t', 'Sail Barge Thrust Monitor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 196, 'm40d', 'Life support transponders on your typical starship are no good for low-temperature species. Some ammonia-breather from the Outer Rim is laid up here with equipment failure, and -- he? It? I couldn''t tell -- needs a new transponder. This is the design for one crucial part. I''ve lined up the supplies you need. Will you make it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 197, 'm40p', 'I never got a look at this ammonia-breathing alien. Apparently it never leaves its ship. Talks to everyone by comlink. Maybe that''s just as well, huh? Must be an ugly thing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 198, 'm40r', 'This is the piece for the transponder? All right, I''ll install it and take the device to the ship airlock. Sorry, I have no idea how the creature intends to pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 199, 'm40s', 'The ammonia-breather sent me some kind of odd jewels, which I''ve sold on the commodities market. I''m paying you good Imperial credits from my profits. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 200, 'm40t', 'Life Support System Transponder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 201, 'm41d', 'A customer who owns a vintage SoroSuub cloud car has been having trouble with sudden gains in altitude. I spotted this at once as a problematic altimator. You can''t get standard parts for those old models any more, so I''ve designed a new schematic. Can you get the components and build this particular part to my order, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 202, 'm41p', 'Here''s what you want for that altimator piece. These owners of vintage cloud cars need to understand the importance of proper maintenance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 203, 'm41r', 'Great! I can hardly wait to get flying again. And this time I won''t have to worry about accidentally leaving the atmosphere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 204, 'm41s', 'Thanks. I appreciate vintage vehicles as much as anyone, but if your car is threatening to leave the planet, something is wrong, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 205, 'm41t', 'Cloud Car Leaving Atmosphere = Bad!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 206, 'm42d', 'My grandmother is still spry after all these years. No, "spry" isn''t the word -- try "crazy." She''s planning a solo jaunt across the Outer Rim in her old starship. But Grandma finds it hard to read sensors nowadays, so I''ve designed a better interference filter. Can you pick up the materials I ordered and build this important part for it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 207, 'm42p', 'I''ve heard about this jaunting grandma. I hope the old fuselage is up to that kind of bombardment. Here. Take the completed part to my delivery agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 208, 'm42r', 'Is this for the old grandma? Okay, I''ll ship it off right away. She''s probably raring to get out into the spacelanes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 209, 'm42s', 'I tried to politely suggest to Grandma that she take a companion on her trip. She just about bit my head off. I have to admit, I like her spirit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 210, 'm42t', 'Grandma Hitting Spacelanes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 211, 'm43d', 'I don''t know who sent me this design commission, or what device it goes into. The device induces very small current changes in delicate electrical systems. Can you get the components from my agent and put together the last part I need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 212, 'm43p', 'Whoever wanted me to get these components for you has been very secretive. I wonder what the device is for?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 213, 'm43r', 'Is this for the gadget my mysterious correspondent has been waiting for? Ugh, it looks like the current controller on a nerve disruptor. But that''s silly. I''m sure it couldn''t be a torture device!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 214, 'm43s', 'Did you deliver the part safely? I still haven''t learned what the device is for. I hope the anonymous customer can put it to good use.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 215, 'm43t', 'Mysterious Microcurrent Inducer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 216, 'm44d', 'I never knew this. Lamproids don''t buy medical cocoons, at least not off the shelf. A Lamproid I know has been trying to get one custom-made, and I have plans here for an endocrine regulator. Can you make the particular part I need from my supplier''s materials?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 217, 'm44p', 'I guess there aren''t enough Lamproids in this sector to offer a lucrative market for the cocoon makers. Or else the Lamproids that are here aren''t very rich.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 218, 'm44r', 'Does this go in the endocrine regulator? Excellent. I''ll pass it along to my Lamproid friend. She''d take the delivery herself, but she doesn''t have arms, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 219, 'm44s', 'The medical cocoon is shaping up nicely. Kind of a snaky shape, actually. I appreciate your help, and so does the Lamproid!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 220, 'm44t', 'Lamproids Need Endocrine Regulators Too'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 221, 'm45d', 'My latest customer was sailing along in a vintage SoroSuub cloud car, ran into heavy turbulence, and almost crashed. Turns out the car''s freeze-floating control dates back to the Republic. I''ve adapted current designs to fit that old classic, and I need you to pick up some components and put together a particular part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 222, 'm45p', 'Here are the materials you need for that freeze-float part. Those old cloud cars still hold up real well, but you have to keep up with scheduled maintenance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 223, 'm45r', 'Great! I can hardly wait to get flying again. And this time I won''t have to worry about downdrafts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 224, 'm45s', 'Thank you. Not many good crafters will spend time on vintage equipment. New, new, new, that''s the usual attitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 225, 'm45t', 'Cloud Car Falling = Bad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 226, 'm46d', 'Don''t ask me why, but some mysterious customer has asked me to produce a locator for GNK-series power droids. I threw together this schematic, and I''ve lined up a components supplier. Can you put together the last part I need and deliver it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 227, 'm46p', 'Who needs a locator for gonk droids? Like you can''t just see them lumbering around! Weird.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 228, 'm46r', 'Thanks. No, I''m not trying to locate power droids myself. I got this pickup assignment from an anonymous party over the HoloNet. All very hands-off. I''m going to get delivery instructions soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 229, 'm46s', 'Did you mention that the locator plugs into any standard datapad readout? Oh well, I''m sure whoever-it-is will figure it out. There''s some weird customers out there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 230, 'm46t', 'GNK Power Droid Locator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 231, 'm47d', 'I''m excited! A wealthy Moff in the Mid Rim is restoring a vintage Old Republic star yacht as his personal luxury craft. It needs a new custom reactant flow controller. I was up all last night designing it. Feverish! But I need one part custom-made. Can you pick up the components and build it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 232, 'm47p', 'Here you go. Those Moffs always want high-quality work, so good luck. Take the completed part to our shipping agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 233, 'm47r', 'Does this go in the reactant flow controller? I haven''t seen one of those in -- well, ever. Looks like a museum piece. I''ll forward it to the Moff at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 234, 'm47s', 'Thanks! The Moff told me he might swing by this world in his new yacht and give me a joyride. I''m still flustered!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 235, 'm47t', 'Help Restore Moff''s Luxury Yacht'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 236, 'm48d', 'A certain anonymous pilot has crash-landed on this world and wants to make repairs without undue attention. This individual''s customized Corellian Engineering YT-1300 stock freighter needs a new hyperdrive coolant regulator of unusual design. Here are the plans. Pick up the parts and build the indicated part for the regulator. Tell no one!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 237, 'm48p', 'Did you see any suspicious characters following you? Well, here are the materials. Work quickly. Tell no one!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 238, 'm48r', 'This will do. Were you followed? Excuse me, I must go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 239, 'm48s', 'Thank you. If anyone mentions the name "Tenloss Syndicate," you never heard of it. Remember, spies are everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 240, 'm48t', 'Anonymous Corellian Stock Freighter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 241, 'm49d', 'A government official is making a diplomatic visit to a world in Wild Space. Apparently the natives use some means of vocalization that his protocol droid can''t duplicate. He needs a new custom-designed droid vocabulator. Here''s the schematic for the last remaining piece. Can you pick up the materials and build it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 242, 'm49p', 'I saw that design. Seems to vocalize in the high ultrasonic. Here are the components you need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 243, 'm49r', 'I''ll install this and deliver the vocabulator to the diplomat''s droid. Hope it won''t put up too much fuss over the installation. I guess we can just shut it down first.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 244, 'm49s', 'The official is also ordering special earphones that hear ultrasonic sounds. This will be some trip!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 245, 'm49t', 'Protocol Droid Vocabulator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 246, 'm50d', 'An official from this world is visiting Wild Space on a diplomatic mission. The natives he''s meeting with vocalize in the high ultrasonic range. He needs a special transponder and earphone to hear them. Can you make an important piece for the transponder from this design? Pick up the materials from my supplier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 247, 'm50p', 'This is the stuff you''ll need. After you rig up the transponder, deliver it to the coordinates you''ve been given.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 248, 'm50r', 'Here, let me install your piece and try out this transponder -- wow! Who knew all this ultrasonic noise was going on all around us? Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 249, 'm50s', 'That diplomat also has to get his protocol droid refitted. Quite a trip he''s planning.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 250, 'm50t', 'Ultrasonic Speech Transponder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_neutral_easy.stf', 251, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Alliance researchers are working on a design for a new kind of fighter called an A-wing. Although it''s a long way off from actual production, we''d like you to make a specific part we need to run some stress tests. When you have a little free time, go and get the components you need at this location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Sorry you had to come all this way to get these. I''ve been running all over the place lately. When you''re finished, bring the part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1r', 'You finished the part already? I guess we can start testing a little earlier than planned.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm1s', 'We really appreciate your zeal in producing this item. It''s enthusiasm like your that will make the Alliance successful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Designing for the Future'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'A certain well-respected, tall, furry member of the Alliance needs a part made so he can repair his bowcaster. The components needed to craft the part have already been purchased and can be picked up at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'I don''t get many requests for bowcaster repair, so I don''t keep the part in stock. Here''s what you need to make it, though. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm2r', 'This the bowcaster part? Great! I''ll see that it gets where it''s going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm2s', 'The bowcaster is working smoothly, thanks to you. I don''t know why he doesn''t get a blaster, but to each his own, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm2t', 'An Uncommon Weapon Needs Repairs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm3d', 'Do you know anything about droid parts? Great. We need you to make a part for an R2 unit that has a defective recharge coupling. The pilot who uses the droid is waiting for the part, so grab what you need. As soon as you''re finished, drop it off at the specified location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'There are a lot of droids that need replacement parts right now, but fortunately I have the components you need. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm3r', 'You made my part? Thanks a million, chum. The sooner one of the techs installs it, the sooner I can get off this dirtball. No offense.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm3s', 'Thanks for getting that part done so quickly. The pilot was really eager to rejoin the squadron.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm3t', 'Help a Pilot Get Airborne'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm4d', 'One of our covert operatives needs a replacement part for a holographic image disguiser. Please fashion this part as soon as you can, so the operative can return to duty. We''d appreciate it if you move fast on this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'I had a heck of a time getting these components on such short notice. Don''t expect me to do this every time. Bring the package to this location once you''ve finished.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm4r', 'Just in time, friend. I''d better get back to work. I''ll see you around, though you may not recognize me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm4s', 'Thanks to your speed in this matter, our operative was able to make it to a rendezvous at the Emperor''s private retreat. Thanks for your good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm4t', 'Keeping In Character'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm5d', 'The Alliance has made some improvements to the long-range sensor array of the X-wing fighter. Here''s the schematic for the new part. You can pick up the components you need at this location. A ship in one of the hangers that needs the upgrade; you''ll be told where to go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'These have to be components for some kind of sensor, am I right? I thought so. I had big trouble getting these, believe me. The part gets delivered to these coordinates. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm5r', 'Thanks. With all these upgrades they keep making, I doubt there''s much of the original ship left.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm5s', 'Excellent work on the part for the sensor array. We''re really glad to have you with us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm5t', 'Keep Upgrading Until They Rename It'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm6d', 'We''ve got a lot of work for you if you''re looking. We replaced some parts in the realspace compensator of a hyperdrive system only to discover that one part was faulty. We were lucky the ship wasn''t destroyed when it came out of hyperspace. Can you rebuild the part so it functions properly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'Here are the components salvaged from the old part. See if you can get them back together, and bring them to the engineer over in this area when you have a working part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm6r', 'This is it? It looks a lot like the last one -- oh wait, I see what you did here. That should make all the difference. Thanks friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm6s', 'They did a test run with a droid pilot. The ship reverts from hyperspace with no problems now. Well done!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm6t', 'Slowing Down is Important Too'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm7d', 'A Mon Calamari light cruiser is in orbit for repairs after a skirmish with Imperials. They have requested some unusual parts that will have to be custom made. Go to our quartermaster and pick up the components for the part in this schematic. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'There''s nothing like a custom job to keep you on your toes, is there? The components you need are right here. I hope you know what they''re for.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm7r', 'I hope you didn''t have too much trouble with this part. I''ll take it off your hands and get it up to the ship with the others.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm7s', 'Thanks for your hard work helping the Mon Calamari! Their ship left the system better than new.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm7t', 'Parts for a Light Cruiser');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm8d', 'Imperial spies are everywhere. We just lost a remote outpost because some observer called in a battalion of stormtroopers. We''re trying to repair a captured Imperial signal beacon; its signal means, basically, "Long live the Empire, don''t attack us." Can you pick up the components and craft the part we need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'Components to repair an Imperial beacon? There''s something new every day in this job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm8r', 'Good work. With this part I should have the beacon up and running in no time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm8s', 'Thanks, but it seems the Imperial signal beacon also translates as, "Here we are, beloved Emperor!" We had to junk the beacon, very suddenly. Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm8t', 'Repair an Imperial Signal Beacon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm9d', 'We''re waiting on some components to make a part for an old Corellian corvette. Would you go to this location to see if the smuggler has arrived with the components yet? He was well paid in advance, so don''t let him try and fool you. Once you''ve made the part, bring it to our engineer for installation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'I have what you need, but do you have my creds? What?! I was never paid in advance! Okay, don''t get excited -- let me check my datapad. Oh, I guess the payment has gone through. Here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm9r', 'That smuggler tries that same trick every time. I wonder if it ever worked? I''ll get this part installed immediately.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm9s', 'We''re very impressed with your work. Let us know if you need any more jobs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm9t', 'Working the Angles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm10d', 'Have you got the time to slap a part together for me? We were making parts for fusion disks. Once we started assembling them, we discovered there was one item missing. Go and grab the components you need for the part. Bring it to these coordinates when you''ve finished so we can ship them all off.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'These last few components were somehow left out of the big order. Very sorry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm10r', 'Glad this part is here. Now we can get the rest of this order to wherever it''s going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm10s', 'I''m grateful you were able to help out. I would have been very embarrassed if I''d shipped an unfinished order.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm10t', 'The Missing Piece'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm11d', 'The Alliance needs parts for a large ion cannon. They tell me it''s a really, really big ion cannon. We''re swamped, can you help out by building one of these parts for us? We''d appreciate it. Head over to the officer in charge of supplies and get what you need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'At the rate you lot are asking for these components, you''ll have me cleaned out soon. The finished parts are all going to these coordinates. I hope there''s room left.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm11r', 'Another one? I hope there aren''t too many more of these parts on the way. Storage is bursting at the seams.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm11s', 'You have our extreme gratitude. People who care are the most valuable resource in the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm11t', 'Build Parts for Something Big'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm12d', 'The Alliance is trying to infiltrate bugged mouse droids into the offices of COMPNOR. A miniaturized jamming device will keep our droids from alerting Imperial sniffers. Will you make this part for the device? Pick up the components you need at this location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'Working in miniature, I see. You tech people are always doing something new. I wish I''d get to see the finished product for once. What? A mouse droid? Oh, everybody''s seen those.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm12r', 'This mouse droid prototype is starting to get kind of expensive. I''m not sure whether this idea is practical.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm12s', 'The prototype mouse driod has been inserted successfully. Your work was flawless. We greatly appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm12t', 'Build a Bugged Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm13d', 'The Alliance has purchased the plans for a new Imperial encryption module for a subspace transceiver. Once it''s assembled, we''ll be to keep up with Imperial transmissions, at least until they revise the module. Please assemble this part of the device from this schematic. Components are available at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'I tell you, if I had a credit for every time I doled out components, I''d buy my own fleet. Bring the part to these coordinates once you''ve built it. Blah blah, I always have to say that. You builders should know the routine by now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm13r', 'I hope this module isn''t replaced as quickly as the last one. I''d better get cracking on the next stage of this operation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm13s', 'Keeping up with Imperial advances is difficult given our limited resources. Thanks for making it a little easier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm13t', 'Here Today, Obsolete Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm14d', 'The Alliance wants to develop a more cost-effective proton torpedo. It''s fallen to us to build the new prototype. We need you to make this part for the guidance system. Components are waiting for you at this location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'Lucky thing you only have to work on a part for the guidance system instead of the ignition charge. You know where to deliver it, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm14r', 'These babies pack quite a punch. I hope the tests go smoothly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm14s', 'Testing of the new device went extremely well. Your efforts will help many Alliance starfighters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm14t', 'A More Cost-Effective Torpedo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm15d', 'One of our more trustworthy -- I use that term loosely -- smugglers needs our help. The sublight drive exhaust system got damaged. This replacement part should get it running again. Get the components you need to assemble it at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'The Alliance must have a lot of faith in this smuggler. Normally we don''t trust these guys as far as we can throw them. Take the part to this location when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm15r', 'You have my part? Great! Looks like I owe you guys one. The next job will be free of charge -- after expenses, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm15s', 'Your skills have proved invaluable. The Alliance needs the good will of smugglers -- at least the good smugglers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm15t', 'A Smuggler Needs Your Help'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm16d', 'One of our surveyors has requested a custom-made fusion cutter. We need a special part made for the retractable fusion drill bit. Do you think you could pick up the components you need and make this part for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'I don''t know why everybody is always wanting some kind of custom part, but I guess it keeps you tech types working. Drop it off at this location when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm16r', 'Is this the part for the hydrospanner? Oh, for the fusion cutter. Thanks, pal.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm16s', 'Our surveyor was thrilled with the new cutter. Nice work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm16t', 'Custom Fusion Cutter Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm17d', 'A shipment of Imperial breath masks was recently "misrouted" straight to our supplier. We thought we''d to use them for our pilots, but then discovered that this model has a defective part in the filter controls. Could you create this prototype replacement part so we can adapt the masks? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'I''ve got the components you need right here. Bring the part to this location once you have it put together. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm17r', 'This is exactly what we needed. I''ll have this part duplicated and we''ll be all set. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm17s', 'You''ve helped save the life of every Alliance pilot who puts on one of those breath masks. We are in your debt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm17t', 'An Ounce of Prevention'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm18d', 'We haven''t located an ideal site for our High Command base, but we know it will need major protection. We''re preparing a large weapon -- I''d better not say what kind -- that requires a lot of custom parts. Here''s the schematic for one part. Will you pick up the components from our "procurement specialist" and build it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'I''m gonna get paid for these components, right? Right? Because I just about got my tail blown off running them through the blockades. Oh yeah, you''re supposed to deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm18r', 'Is this for the High Command base weapon? That''s fine. I''ll get it installed right away. Looks like a great job!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm18s', 'That was terrific work. We need more parts, maybe a few hundred thousand! So there''s plenty of work for you ahead.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm18t', 'High Command Base Weapon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm19d', 'We''re exploring new sites for bases. Our scouts have gone to worlds that don''t even have names. The range of temperatures in these places is amazing. We need better temperature control units, and for that we need parts like this one. We''d like you to pick up some components and build this part for us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'I ran these components through some of the worst blaster fire I''ve ever seen, so be grateful. Oh, and drop off the completed part at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm19r', 'I think this should fit fine in our new prototype temperature units. We''ll be stress-testing them soon. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm19s', 'I hope you followed that schematic closely. The temperature tolerances in the design show that this unit is going into some heavy-duty environments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm19t', 'Heading for Extreme Temperatures'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm20d', 'I guess it''s no secret that the new High Command base, wherever it is, will have a heavy-duty shield generator. Big surprise, huh? I''m looking at the plans for this generator right now. It needs a lot -- a LOT -- of parts. Here''s a schematic. Can you pick up the components and craft a part for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'I''ve been sitting on these components so long, I''ve got calluses on my -- well, never mind. Take them. Drop off the completed part at these coordinates. And make sure I get paid!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm20r', 'You''re right on schedule. This part is all ready for installation in the testbed. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm20s', 'We have a lot of parts to build yet before we can even start assembling a prototype shield generator. Check back with us for more work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm20t', 'High Command Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm21d', 'Alliance High Command says we have to adapt our speeders to new environments. I say, wait until we know the new base''s environment, then adapt the speeders. But no! This schematic describes a part for a temperature adjustment unit for a speeder repulsorlift. Can you pick up the components and build the part for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'These are the components. A pretty credit I had to pay offworld, too, and then risk my neck to get them here. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm21r', 'I have to say, adapting speeders to different environments seems like a low priority right now. We''re pretty busy. But thanks for the part anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm21s', 'Can''t say when we''ll get around to adapting our speeders. It seems to me we''ll have time once we arrive at the new base, wherever that is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm21t', 'Why Adapt Speeders Now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'm22d', 'Our commander''s ship has had the worst kind of yaw trouble. I''ve narrowed it down to the power coupling on the negative axis. I know, I know -- isn''t it always the negative axis? Anyway, I want you to pick up some components at these coordinates and build a part I need for a general maintenance overhaul.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'I looked at this list of components and said, "Yep, it''s another negative axis problem." Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 108, 'm22r', 'If I had a credit for every negative axis malfunction on my ship, I''d buy a new ship! Thanks for the part. I''ll get it installed right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 109, 'm22s', 'Seems to me the shipbuilders should enforce higher quality control on the negative axis. But maybe with a name like that, it''ll always have problems.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 110, 'm22t', 'Power Coupling on Negative Axis'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 111, 'm23d', 'One of our smugglers almost got stranded in the next sector. The ship''s hyperspace transfer circuits went fuzzy and, well, that smuggler was looking longingly at the escape pod. But now the ship is docked, and we need you to help with repairs. Pick up some components and build the part in this schematic.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'I remember once when my ship''s transfer circuits started to short out. Smelled like death. Deliver the part to the smuggler when you''re done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 113, 'm23r', 'At last! I expect I can get my ship moving pretty quickly. Thanks for your help, I couldn''t have made these repairs without you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 114, 'm23s', 'That smuggler is going through the preflight check already. Whatever supplies the Alliance is waiting on, they must be pretty important.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 115, 'm23t', 'Hyperspace Transfer Circuits'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 116, 'm24d', 'We''ve turned up an old pleasure yacht built long ago by the Alderaan Royal Engineers. We plan to hide surveillance devices throughout the ship and then allow some Moff to "discover" it. But this old ship needs all kinds of parts you can''t get any more. If you could pick up some components and build one, we''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'Here''s the components. I like the symbolism -- using an Alderaan Royal ship to spy on the scum who destroyed Alderaan. Drop off the finished part to our engineer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 118, 'm24r', 'The yacht is actually holding up real well for its age. Some folks say the Alderaan Royal Engineers were the best. It''s a shame, isn''t it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 119, 'm24s', 'Before long we''ll strand the yacht where the Moff''s forces are sure to find it. After that, we''ll hope for the best.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 120, 'm24t', 'Alderaan Royal Yacht Needs Repair'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 121, 'm25d', 'One of our fighter pilots had modified his old Y-wing so heavily, no one else could ever get it off the ground. He''s even got his R2 unit tuned to that specific ship. Crazy, but he''s an ace pilot. He needs a new part for a repair, and of course it has to be custom-built. Can you pick up the components and make it from this schematic?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'Here are the components. When you''ve made the part, deliver it to the pilot''s commander.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 123, 'm25r', 'I worry a little about the heavy modifications he''s made to that Y-wing. But I tell you, it moves faster than anything else I''ve seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 124, 'm25s', 'Thanks! You''ve helped us get that customized Y-wing back into space. Too bad the price of speed is endless maintenance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 125, 'm25t', 'Wild Y-Wing Customizations'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 126, 'm26d', 'Our informants within the Imperial Navy report the Empire is working on a new gravity well projector. That would be bad news for Alliance ships in hyperspace. Our engineers are working on a prototype well detector. Can you help? Pick up the components and build the part to the specs given in this schematic.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 127, 'm26p', 'Gravity well projector? Hoo boy, that sounds like dangerous stuff. When you make the part from these components, drop it off at the prototype staging area.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 128, 'm26r', 'Is this for the well detector? Good. We can''t very well test the prototype on this world -- it''s a gravity well itself! But we''ll get your part delivered, soonest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 129, 'm26s', 'We''ve taken your prototype part offworld to our testbed in deep space. We hope this will work, but it''s incredibly advanced stuff without Empire-level resources.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 130, 'm26t', 'Gravity Well Projection Detector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 131, 'm27d', 'We took out an Imperial escort ship recently. On the bridge we found a device that lets them -- well, we''re not sure. It''s incredibly advanced, whatever it does. We''re reverse engineering it now. To build our own prototype, we''ve cobbled together various schematics. Please pick up the components and build this particular piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 132, 'm27p', 'I hear that the Imperial device controls unusual adjustments to the fabric of hyperspace. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates for testing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 133, 'm27r', 'If the Empire is making breakthroughs so advanced we can''t even understand what they do, it means we''ll have to redouble our efforts. Thanks for doing your part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 134, 'm27s', 'The Imperial device may turn out to be some kind of decoy, a way to make us waste our resources. But I hope your work won''t be in vain. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 135, 'm27t', 'Mysterious Imperial Device'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 136, 'm28d', 'Kuat Drive Yards is designing a new Star Destroyer bridge for the Empire. Our informants got us the prototype, and we''re altering it before delivering it to its proper Imperial destination. To make room for the bugs, we need you to refashion this part using our revised schematic. Pick up the components, and work fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 137, 'm28p', 'I hope my pay arrives soon. I''m all for working as an Alliance "procurement specialist," but I gotta pay bills too. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 138, 'm28r', 'Nice work. We''ll try to get the altered prototype back into the Kuat delivery channel before anyone notices.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 139, 'm28s', 'With luck, we''ll soon overhear every word said on every new Star Destroyer bridge. And you helped! Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 140, 'm28t', 'Star Destroyer Bridges Need Bugs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 141, 'm29d', 'One of our "procurement specialists" got hit during a blockade run. We''re doing repairs on the ship now, but we''re short a particular part that is only available offworld. We need you to rig up a temporary replacement using components from the smuggler''s own cargo. Can you read this schematic all right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 142, 'm29p', 'I run these components to you guys all the time, but I never thought I''d need my cargo to get my own ship fixed. Listen, do a good job on that part, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 143, 'm29r', 'I''m working on the repairs to the smuggler''s ship right now. I''ll install this part quick, just to stop the victim''s constant whining!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 144, 'm29s', 'These "procurement specialists" do good work, but some aren''t the kind of people you want to be around for long. Thanks for sending this one on the way reasonably quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 145, 'm29t', 'Smuggler Needs Own Cargo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 146, 'm30d', 'Incom Corporation built a lot of Alliance X-wings, but since the Empire took them over, they''ve stagnated. Still, a few Incom engineers sympathize with us, and they''ve leaked a prototype to us. To make room for our surveillance devices, we need you to pick up components at these coordinates and build a new part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 147, 'm30p', 'That Incom prototype is supposed to be a new low-end Imperial patrol ship. Incom sure has fallen from its glory days. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 148, 'm30r', 'This prototype is only for a patrol ship, that''s true. But those are usually the first ships that detect Alliance activity. Then the Empire sends in Star Destroyers!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 149, 'm30s', 'We hope this Incom patrol ship prototype will become standard. Then, when Imperial patrols detect our bases, we''ll know as soon as they themselves do. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 150, 'm30t', 'Incom Patrol Ship Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 151, 'm31d', 'Lots of Imperial starships use SoroSuub parts. A SoroSuub engineer sympathetic to our cause has smuggled us a prototype for a new turbolift. To make room for our covert surveillance device, we need you to refashion a certain part. Pick up the components, build the part, and deliver it to our engineer. Okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 152, 'm31p', 'Imagine being able to overhear Imperial officers arguing policy in the turbolifts. Whole different side to the Empire, I''ll bet. Anyway, deliver the part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 153, 'm31r', 'We''re aiming for constant eavesdropping on every Imperial officer above commander rank. I''ll get your part installed in the prototype turbolift. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 154, 'm31s', 'Once the Empire''s droid factories get our revised prototype, they''ll insert our bug automatically in each new turbolift. It''s crazy, but this idea might work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 155, 'm31t', 'Planting Bugs in the Turbolift'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 156, 'm32d', 'Captain Han Solo is visiting this world at a secret location. His ship, the Millennium Falcon, is down for repairs. Apparently that happens a lot. He needs a particular part for the sensor processing subsystem, and you''re our best choice. Pick up the components at these coordinates and build the part for delivery to Captain Solo.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 157, 'm32p', 'I''ve seen the Falcon. I absolutely don''t know how he keeps that junkheap in the air. Oh well, deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 158, 'm32r', 'I hope you built the part to the high tolerances shown in the schematic. That Millennium Falcon is quite the hot rod. I''ll forward this part to Captain Solo. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 159, 'm32s', 'Captain Solo passes along this message: "Thanks for the part. If you ever see me in a cantina, say hello and I''ll buy you a drink."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 160, 'm32t', 'A Part for the Millennium Falcon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 161, 'm33d', 'Princess Leia Organa of Alderaan has stopped here en route to a diplomatic mission. Her blockade runner''s shield projector is malfunctioning. The parts onboard got damaged in a skirmish with Imperials, so we need you to build a replacement from this schematic. Pick up the components and go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 162, 'm33p', 'Your part is for a Corellian Corvette, one of the good old hand-built kind. Do good work, and deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 163, 'm33r', 'I''ll have this part taken to orbit for delivery to Princess Leia''s starship. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 164, 'm33s', 'Princess Leia sends this message: "You have my gratitude for your excellent work. May the Force be with you."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 165, 'm33t', 'Repair Leia''s Blockade Runner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 166, 'm34d', 'We''ve got sympathetic contacts inside SoroSuub''s new escape pod project. They can hide our own homing beacons in every Imperial escape pod. But we need to give them modified components for their prototype, so they''ll have room to insert the beacon. Can you pick up the components and build the part for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 167, 'm34p', 'It beats me why the Alliance wants to track Imperial escape pods. But no one tells me anything. Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 168, 'm34r', 'If we can track Imperial escape pods, we can find the sensitive intelligence materials they jettison when a ship is endangered. That''s vital to our war effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 169, 'm34s', 'Your work has helped us develop a vital intelligence resource in a completely overlooked niche. The Imperials will never suspect. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 170, 'm34t', 'Escape Pod Modification Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 171, 'm35d', 'This is an amazing opportunity. A highly placed informant in the Imperial Navy has a chance to slip a homing beacon aboard Lord Vader''s personal TIE Advanced X1! But we need to conceal it among some other parts, and they''re all custom-built. We want you to build a replica of one part. Pick up the components at these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 172, 'm35p', 'If this works, we can track Darth Vader all over the galaxy. That sounds both exciting and scary, doesn''t it? Deliver the completed part to these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 173, 'm35r', 'Never mind. Lord Vader uncovered our informant and strangled him. But please take this payment for your effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 174, 'm35s', 'The sacrifices our Imperial informants have made will be the unsung legacy of victory. They''re all heroes, and no one will ever know them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 175, 'm35t', 'Bug Darth Vader''s Personal TIE'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_crafting_rebel_easy.stf', 176, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'One of our many spies, who are everywhere, report that a new dance craze called "The Funky Droid" is all the rage. You are to go to these coordinates and do this dance. It will be recorded and later analyzed by the Imperial Board of Culture for possible censure. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'You are required to forget this dance for reasons of Imperial security. No other action need be taken.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'The Funky Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'The Moff is dispensing the remaining funds from the arts budget, and they must be spent before the beginning of the next fiscal cycle. You are to make haste to this venue and perform some sort of -- of -- well, some kind of Imperially significant dance. Choose your dance wisely. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'I''m sure you did just fine. I don''t really care for these sorts of things myself. I was merely clearing out the budget.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'Significant Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'Does every move of your dance venerate our beloved Emperor? An Imperial talent scout is seeking holos of lesser-known dancers for possible participation in the Imperial Opera. Go to this location, where a holo will be made of your performance. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'They didn''t choose you for the final audition, but you did well enough to merit these credits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'Imperial Opera Audition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'I gather you dancers are quite popular with the local troops. It''s not surprising really; they come back from those horrible combat situations and there you are, all clean and limber, your supple limbs flailing vigorously, full of such... is it warm in here? Anyway, you are to go to the designated venue and perform for the droidcams. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'I observed your dance closely via holocam. I''m sure when the troopers see it they''ll be pleased.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'Flailing Vigorously'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'The Moff is a close personal friend of mine, you know, always asking me about how the arts budget should be spent. I''ve recommended a series of holos, a tribute to those we''ve lost fighting the Rebellion. Go to this venue and you''ll be paid to dance. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'Greetings. My predecessor was "reassigned" -- very permanently -- for using the Moff''s name with excessive familiarity. Records indicate you are to receive payment for some sort of entertainment. This fee has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'Friends in High Places'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'The Moff has managed to lure away the favorite dancer of a chief rival and is accepting recordings from young dancers to fill out the rest of her troupe. Go to these coordinates and give your best performance. If you get noticed by the Moff, you could really go places. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'You weren''t chosen for the dance troupe, but the Moff, being quite happy with the new dancer, is giving a small stipend to everyone who auditioned. Enjoy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'The Moff''s New Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'The Moff is furious! A rival has hired away the local troupe''s leading dancer. With the Imperial Board of Culture annual gala coming up, you can imagine the crisis. They''re recording emergency auditions at this venue. If you hurry, you might get there in time to perform. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'They wound up going with someone with more experience, but they were impressed with your dance. They sent this small incentive so you''d keep at it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'The Moff''s Lost Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'The "Citizens for Fair Treatment of Aliens" -- hah! -- have been lobbying for dance recitals that would be less exclusive toward nonhuman species. Apparently we are to appease these troublemakers until resources permit a purge. Go to this venue and perform some dance routines that those filthy alien lovers might enjoy. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'Imperial Security decided to round up all members of the CFTA on their way to your recital and detain them for questioning. That seems fair.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'Fair Treatment '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'A directive from Imperial Center gives results of recent psychological tests. Apparently observation of dancers can have salutary morale effects. This strikes me as shoddy reasoning, but this office has been given funds to commission morale-raising dance performances. Hence you must perform at the designated venue. Go! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'In my view an Imperial soldier needs no morale-raising dances. He lives to fight and die for our beloved Emperor. But it is not for me to question Imperial Center directives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Morale-Raising Effects of Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'COMPNOR has updated its current propaganda message. All public communications and performances are required to stay on-message until further notice. The current message is, once again, "The Empire Keeps You Safe." At the designated venue you are to perform a dance indicative of Imperial safety guarantees. Go. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'Until further notice the message "The Empire Keeps You Safe" will remain the subtext of all dances commissioned by Imperial offices. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Imperial Dances Keep You Safe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'The Imperial Board of Culture has chosen you to participate in its "Celebrations of the Empire in Dance" series. Go to the appointed venue and give a morally appropriate dance that celebrates the Empire. How should I know what that means? You''re the blasted artist! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'Your dance has been reviewed and conditionally approved, pending further investigation. Your fee has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'Celebrate the Empire in Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'A new directive from COMPNOR replaces the current propaganda message. Henceforward, until further notice, all public communications and performances are to relay the message "The Empire Eradicated Old Republic Corruption." At the designated venue, perform a dance conveying this worthy sentiment. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'COMPNOR mistakenly released the message update "The Empire Eradicated Old Republic Corruption" prematurely. This message is not yet to be conveyed. However, you were not informed prior to your performance. When entered in your permanent record, this report will include the mitigating circumstances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'Eradicating Old Republic Corruption'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'COMPNOR''s current propaganda message, "Human Beings Light the Way," is apparently under debate at Imperial Center and has been tabled. The performers we had enlisted to promote the message have no other dance ready. It falls to you to substitute for them at the designated venue. Say nothing regarding "Human Beings." Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'This office is still awaiting word regarding the "Human Beings Light the Way" message. We will contact you again should we require further stopgap performances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Stopgap for a Cancelled Message'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'The Imperial Board of Culture wishes to popularize our beloved Emperor''s favorite music, Mantooine minuets. The IBC is now auditioning dancers to perform these minuets as part of galaxy-wide cultural programs. Perform at the designated venue, where IBC droidcams will record your dance for later judgement. You will be compensated. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'Your dance is considered to show, at best, only a glancing resemblance to Mantooine minuets. The IBC rejects your audition without future prejudice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', 'Mantooine Minuet Audition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'Mondegrene''s "Uncompleted Universe" is the Imperial Ballet Company''s next production. For an authentic touch in Scene 4 they wish to import unsophisticated native dancers from outside the Core Worlds. You are to audition for this high honor at the designated venue, where holocams will record and transmit your untutored motions. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'Your motions were deemed somewhat too sophisticated for a supposedly primitive dancer. You must work on that. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'Uncompleted Universe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'Imperial Intelligence reports that a Rebel leader on this world is said to be attracted to dancers. You will become the bait in a scheme to lure this leader into a local venue. As you perform, our spies, who are everywhere, will identify and subdue the Rebel. Tell no one, or you will see an end to both your career and your legs. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'The Rebel leader we hoped to snare was apparently forewarned. Be apprised that we shall be closely examining our records of your recent movements. If you had an encounter with the Rebel, you will certainly wish to relocate offworld at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'Snare for a Rebel Dance Lover'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'For reasons that are lost on a line officer like myself, our Moff grants money for "encouragement of local musical arts" -- to include dance, it says. You, therefore, an admitted dancer, will receive this remarkably generous stipend if you commit some sort of dance at the grant committee''s designated venue. You''d be foolish to refuse. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'I shall report to the planetary authority that you have discharged the obligations of the grant without provoking untoward remarks. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Moff''s Grant to Encourage Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'Though the entertainment professions are invariably linked to debauched conduct, Imperial Center requires this office to take a constructive approach to reform. We commission you to perform a dance of an uplifting, morally rigorous nature in the designated venue, to increase morale among our soldiers. Go. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'Your dance was acceptable. Note that conduct indicative of debauchery or scandal will be met with the harshest punishment. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Debauchery-Free Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'Another of the Imperial Ballet Company''s frequent scouting missions has arrived on this world. If this office provides a talented dancer for the company, the Emperor himself may bestow honors upon us. Therefore, you are to perform in an animated, dazzlingly virtuosic manner for the scout at the designated locale. At once! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'Once again, it seems, the Imperial Ballet Company scout has been waylaid before arrival on this world. These artistic people have no social responsibility.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Dance for Imperial Ballet Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'Sector headquarters has issued another memo reminding us to maintain Imperial standards of moral righteousness. This directive is prompted by recent reports of scandalous dancing in venues frequented by Imperial soldiers. To remediate this offense, go to the designated venue and dance in a wholesome, upstanding manner. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'No reports have reached me that you engaged in untoward conduct. Therefore I shall report the "scandalous dancing" incident closed. You may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'Intolerably Scandalous Dancing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'Owing to our recent good efforts in teaching the aliens their proper place, our spies, who are everywhere, have noted a decline in human citizens'' morale. I find this inexplicable, but we do maintain a modest budget for the hire of dancers to increase morale. This office commissions you to perform a delightful, high-spirited dance at the designated venue. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'Your compensation for the performance is attached. I will shortly review our spies'' reported assessments of your level of high spirits, and debriefing may follow. Be ready.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'High-Spirited Dance is Mandatory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'Rebel factions have been clandestinely staging ballets banned by the Imperial board of culture. We are staging approved ballets with dancers of such great skill that nobody will want to go see amateurish Rebel productions. Your name was among those chosen to audition. It is a great honor for you to be chosen. Do your best! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'Your dancing was considered worthy by the casting director, but he didn''t feel your height was quite right for his vision. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'Skilled Dancers Required'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'This office''s budget is classified "Secret." An item in that budget allots funds for a certain purpose, also classified. To achieve that purpose, you are to go to the designated venue and execute a dance performance of the required duration. Tell no one! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'That is acceptable. Compensation is attached. Tell no one!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Dance Classification SECRET'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'Imperial Center has assigned this office to coordinate local production of a new ballet composed by the Imperial Security Bureau, "The Empire Moves Ever Upward." Certain problems have arisen in the production. To fulfill the contract with the chosen venue, we shall send you instead. Go, and say nothing of the reason. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'You show an admirable willingness to rise to the emergency. So long as you told no one of the reason for your performance, this will reflect well on you. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'Substitute Dance Emergency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'COMPNOR has enlisted an Imperial Ballet star to visit this world on a performance tour. Whether this extravagant move produces the desired increase in local morale, we shall never know -- the dancer has been delayed offworld. Therefore, to fulfill a contract, we are sending you instead. Do not disappoint us. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'If reports reach this office of licentious or immoral implications conveyed by your dance, we will pass the accusations to COMPNOR. Otherwise, all appears well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'COMPNOR Dance Initiative Goes Astray'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'The Moff plans an entertaining diversion for a certain celebrity scheduled to visit the planetary headquarters. The celebrity''s identity is classified. Because this occasion is specified to be merry and bumptious, the Moff is auditioning dancers. Perform at the designated venue, and your motions will be recorded for submission to the Moff''s office. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'The spies report that your dance failed to meet the Moff''s high standards. You may address complaints to the Imperial Security Bureau. I suggest that complaints are inadvisable.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Moff''s Diversion Audition');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'Your dossier indicates that you are currently not suspected of Rebel activity. Perhaps the dossier must be updated; perhaps not. Regardless, we select you to perform at the designated venue in a casual, anti-authoritarian manner, while identifying individuals who express to you anti-Imperial sentiments. We shall debrief you afterward. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'The initiative to use dancers to identify Rebel sympathizers has been predictably ineffective. The program is cancelled, as is your debriefing. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'Dance to Identify Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'Though the Empire of course protects all its citizens, we do enforce a sensible social arrangement regarding alien species. One notorious alien performer has attracted significant attention and espouses anti-Imperial views -- publicly! We are pre-empting this troublemaker''s next performance by scheduling you instead. Go and dance. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'Intelligence indicates that the troublemaking alien has now vacated this world. Good riddance, I say. You may be proud of your part in this, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Replace Troublemaking Alien'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm3o', 'COMPNOR has issued a directive for certain uplifting dances to be performed in an effort to keep public spirits high. Dances that do not cause sufficient increase in morale and productivity will be scrutinized meticulously and may result in a re-evaluation of your loyalty to the Empire. Go. Perform. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm3s', 'Morale and productivity are adequate. Credits have been transferred to your account.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm3t', 'Show Your Loyalty'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm4o', 'Some prudish citizens think the arts are decadent. But what better way to thank our beloved Emperor for the peace and prosperity he has brought us than to spread joy and beauty? I''ll even put my credits where my mouth is. Go and dance at this venue, and I''ll give you a nice fee. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm4s', 'Here are your credits. Doesn''t it feel good to uplift people with your art?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm4t', 'Spread Joy and Beauty'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm5o', 'I hear that you artists are always starving. Well, if you''d get a real job instead of prancing around for stray credits, you might be able to eat more regularly. Still, I hear that this venue is recording holos of dancers to entertain Imperial troops. Maybe if you go there you can scrape up enough money for a decent meal. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm5s', 'They paid you that much? That ought to keep you in crispic for a while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm5t', 'Starving Artists'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm6o', 'A squad of stormtroopers frequents a local establishment. Their commanding officer wishes to reward them for their excellent performance. You are to go there and dance in a way that thanks them for service to the Empire. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm6s', 'The stormtroopers were recalled to duty before you got there, due to an increase in the Rebel terror alert level. Payment has been made for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm6t', 'Perfomance Excellence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm7o', 'COMPNOR''s latest inspiration is for dancers to incorporate the message "Your First Loyalty is the Empire" in all performance pieces. You are to go forth and dance this message at the designated venue. Note and observe anyone who seems to find this message distasteful. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm7s', 'COMPNOR changed the loyalty message again right after you left. This is for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm7t', 'Performance Art'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm8o', 'Mondegrene''s great classic "Fugue in K" is being performed, replete with a host of dancers, for the annual Imperial Board of Culture annual gala. Auditions are being held via droidcam at these coordinates. This would be a good opportunity for you to be noticed. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm8s', 'Better luck next time. Perhaps with a bit more practice you''ll be chosen for the next gala.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm8t', 'Get Noticed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm9o', 'Do you dream of one day dancing before our beloved Emperor? Well, don''t get above your station, citizen; you''re still pretty new at this. The good news is that they still need dancers to soothe battle-weary troopers. They''re recording dancers at these coordinates. Go and do your best. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm9s', 'Good news! They''ve decided to use your dance among those they''ll show the troops. Maybe you really will dance for the Emperor one day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm9t', 'Dance for the Emperor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'As an agent of the Exotic Entertainers'' Union, I find promising talent and nurture its growth. Our organization provides entertainers for select clientele such as Imperial dignitaries, influential Hutt entrepreneurs, and Corporate Sector Authority Viceprexes. To sign on, first prove yourself worthy. Entertain the patrons at this establishment and we''ll talk further. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'You have some modicum of talent. Keep this up and I may just sign you on as one of my regular dancers. Your fee has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'A Promising Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'As an agent of the Exotic Entertainers'' Union, I get approached by all sorts of beings who claim they''re dancers. Many prove to be shining examples of non-talent. Before I even consider booking you for important gigs, I have to make sure I''m not wasting my time and money. Go here and do your thing. If you''re good, I''ll be in contact. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'So -- you''re not a complete waste of time, but you sure do need a lot of polish. I''ll pay you for your time and invite you to see me again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'Only the Strong Survive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'I used to book quality acts for the Exotic Exhibit on Nar Shaddaa. Look at me now -- talking to two-credit dancers in some unknown dive. Take my advice, friend, never cross a Hutt. Well, I still need to make a living. Okay, go to these coordinates and try to charm the crowd with your moves. I hope there''ll be a reason for us to speak again. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'Okay, so I don''t feel completely unjustified in paying you this fee. But if you want my advice, friend, you''d better practice more than you apparently have been.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'Practice Makes Perfect'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'Can you speak Huttese? Well, do you at least know that the Huttese word "whirlee" means dancer? Great. Go to these coordinates, point to yourself, say "whirlee," and start dancing. If anyone tries to stop you, just point at him and yell "stoopa!" Don''t stop dancing after that, unless they physically throw you out. Good luck. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'Excellent! And you didn''t even get thrown out. Your performer fee has been transmitted. Look me up again if you want more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'Learn Some Huttese'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'Dancing gigs, eh? Yeah, I can help you with that. I supply Max Rebo''s boys with dancers from time to time. Head to the following establishment and put on a show. If you''re good, then I''ll hear about it, and you''ll get paid. If not, then don''t bother me again. We have a deal? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'My contacts confirmed it -- you''re pretty decent. You and I might be able to make quite a bit of money. I''ll keep looking for gigs for you, while you continue to practice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'Dancing is a Good Career'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'Fancy yourself a Swamp Maiden, eh? We''ll put that to the test soon enough. Head to this establishment and use those dancing skills to ease the cares of hardworking beings. If you  help them forget their troubles, even if for a short while, then you just might have a career in this business. Don''t wear anything... complicated. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'You obviously had quite an impact on someone, because I was told to give you the full dancer''s fee. Congratulations. Come see me again for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'Dancing Eases Cares Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'Combat fatigue can be a terrible thing, which is where performers such as yourself come in. Without your talents, the galaxy would be filled with disabled neurotics and dangerous psychotics. Hmm, come to think of it, it is like that, isn''t it? Well, in any case, go to these coordinates and do your part to relieve galactic mental stress. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'Well done. Those hardened spacefarers are just a little less hardened today thanks to you. Enjoy your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'Help Care for the Galaxy''s Mental Health'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'The bad news is the galaxy can be a rough place, friend, as I''m sure you well know. But the good news is that gives you and your kind a very important responsibility: bringing calm and well-being to an otherwise hectic existence. Go to these coordinates and spread some of that love, friend. It''s rewarding work, on so many levels. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'Behold, one of those rewarding levels I was referring to -- your fee! Don''t spend it all in one place.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'Calm the Stressed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'Dancers are the physicans of the soul, friend. Without your talents, half those adventurers out there couldn''t even crawl out of bed each morning. Be proud of your profession. You bring hope to those who have none! Peace of mind to those who need it! I need you to apply your healing touch at this establishment. Can you handle that? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'I can hear the sighs of contentment all the way over here. Good job, friend. Your fee, minus my commission, has been deposited. See me for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Heal the Soul'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'Yeah, I got a dancing job for you. Know any Twi''leki veil dances? Those are always popular. How about Bothan tangos? Heck, even some Wookiee tribal dances would be acceptable. Well, whatever you know, go perform it at this establishment. And I''d stay away from Gamorrean slam dances if I were you. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'You may end up joining the galaxy''s roster of legendary dancers. Maybe you''ll get to perform for the Imperial court some day. Enjoy your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Variety is the Spice of Life'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'You a dancer? Well, I''m always on the lookout for fresh talent. As a matter of fact, there''s a soiree in the works that I think you''d be perfect for. Take those rhythmic skills of yours over to these coordinates and impress the heck outta those party animals. Remember, the better the show, the more promising your career. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'Sounds like a good time was had by all. I understand you have some pretty slick moves. Your fee has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'Shake Your Booty'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'One of my patrons just requested a dancer trained in the sensual arts of Zeltronian belly dancing. Fortunately for both of us, this patron has never seen a Zeltronian belly dance and wouldn''t know one from a Gamorrean slam dance. So head to these coordinates and do your best impersonation of an exotic Zeltron dancer. Good luck. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'Looks like the patron bought it. In fact, he may request you specifically next time he''s in town. Check back with me just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'Zeltronian Belly Dancing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'Art, like beauty, is in the eyes of the beholder, friend. If someone likes what you''re doing and is willing to pay for it, then it''s art. If he isn''t, then it''s garbage. I hope for your sake that your dancing falls into the former category. Go to this establishment and give them a taste of art. With luck, they''ll approve. If not, don''t tell them I sent you. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'Luck was with us this day, eh, friend? I''ve deposited your "artist''s" fee. With luck, this will become a regular habit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Be an Artist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'If music soothes the savage bantha, then it follows that dancing has a similar effect on more sentient species. I have an opportunity for you to practice those soothing skills, assuming you''re up to the task. Pay is decent, as long as you entertain. And who knows? This gig may lead to bigger and better things. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'I got word that you put a major soothing spell over the entire joint. That''s entertainment! If you can repeat that performance, there''s more credits where these came from.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', 'Dance Their Cares Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'You wanna know why our galaxy is in the state it''s currently in? Not enough dancers out there entertaining the masses. And you can apparently do something about that, friend. Go to this establishment and remove some of the galaxy''s woe. I''d guess that the more you shake it, the more cares you help ease. But that''s just me. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'If there''s hope for us, friend, it''s because of performers such as yourself. Well done. I take pride in paying such a caring galactic citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'While the Galaxy''s Cares Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'These are truly dark times. It is the solemn duty of every performer in the Empire to help ease galactic suffering. And nothing lightens the burden of responsibility and the stress of combat more effectively than the mesmeric moves of a trained dancer. So get on out there and do your thing, citizen! Here are the coordinates. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'Bravo! The reviews that have been coming back have mostly been positive. One fellow thought you had caught on fire, but could be a compliment on his world, who knows?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'Mesmerize the Crowd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'They say Twi''leks are the most graceful dancers in the galaxy. Think you can either prove or disprove that? Head to this establishment and give it a shot, if you''d like. I''ll pay if the crowd is reasonably entertained, minus my finder''s fee, of course. Are you interested? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'The crowd was not horrified, which is saying something these days. Your fee has been deposited. See me for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Who Is the Best Dancer?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'This is bad! I had another dancer lined up to perform today -- now! -- at a local establishment. Now she''s called it off because her "internal aura needs realignment." I swear, my fist is going to realign that witch''s nose. Can you dance? I need a dancer at this joint right now! I''ll pay well, just go and dance! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'That was a life-saver, friend. Keep going out and dancing like that, and you''ll come back a star. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Last-Minute Replacement'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'Don''t get too close because my screeching may burst your eardrums. My lead dancer has cancelled again! Sure, she''s got people lining up to see her dance, but no, she has to stay home with a sick voorpak! Okay, I''ll have to -- wait! You can dance, right? Will you dance in her place? Pleeease! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'Whew! You bailed me out at the last nanosecond, friend. You were a pretty snappy dancer yourself. Maybe not totally star quality yet, but you don''t cancel your gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Replacement for Voorpak Nurse'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'My star dancer has run off for a romantic vacation with a handsome spacer from the Core Worlds. How thrilling -- except that she had a gig with me, now, and she only just called from offworld to say she can''t make it! Argh! You can dance, I know it. You can go in her place and save my rep! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'I just had another call from my lead dancer telling me how sorry she was. I have to say, it''s hard to resist her stellar reputation. We''ll work this out somehow. Meanwhile, thanks, and here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'Dancer Runs for the Stars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'The act I had lined up for today, Bando Labutan''s Dancing Guarlaras, just cancelled. I wasn''t feeling good about booking them anyway -- cleanup issues, you know. I need a backup, quick. Can you fill in? The manager wanted you to put on a guarlara suit, but I told him no. Please, just go, just dance! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'Thanks. Trust me, you''ll look back someday and laugh at having replaced Bando Labutan''s Dancing Guarlaras.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'Dancing Guarlara Replacement'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'I''ve always got assignments for good dancers, friend. Notice I did use the word "good." If you think that describes you, then head on over to these coordinates and wow the crowd with your dazzling moves. The patrons include tips in your fee if they''re really impressed, so break a leg. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'Nice, friend, nice. My sources tell me you were light on your feet and as graceful as a gualama. I''ve included your tips in your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'Impress the Crowd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'A local manager just installed dance machine games. You know, you follow the moves on a holo, and the game scores you by how well you do. Very popular -- except when a drunken Aqualish scores low and destroys the machines. The Aqualish is in custody, but the manager needs a dancer, now! Can you fill in? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'Thanks. Those dancing games are popular, but nothing beats a trained professional. People feel better just watching you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Dance Machine Games Destroyed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'Can you lead a dance exercise routine? A bunch of Toong tourists off the cruise liner are looking to lose weight in "a fun musical way." That''s what the job says. Go where they''re staying, do your dance, and they''ll follow along to whatever music is playing. Look, give it a try, okay? It''s a paying gig! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'The spaceliner had to leave early, so the Toongs had already vacated before you arrived. Sorry, friend. But the manager liked your dancing anyway, so here''s your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'Lead Toong Dance Exercise Routine'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'A friend tells me that a high-placed HoloNet talent scout is in the area, checking out the dancers at local venues. This could be a break for you! Go and dance, and who knows? Maybe you''ll wind up on a broadcast galaxy-wide! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'Apparently that so-called HoloNet scout was lying to my friend. I don''t want to guess what he was angling for. But you still did well at your gig, so don''t be too disappointed, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'HoloNet Talent Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'I don''t suppose you know Iktotchi sense-dancing? Well, it was worth asking. I had an engagement for a troupe of dancers doing colorful primitive dances from across the galaxy. But today is some kind of abstinence holiday in their religion, so they''re out. Can you dance but try to look sort of -- well -- primitive? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'Well, nobody complained, so your dancing must have been primitive enough. Dear me, what a business. This is your fee, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Abstinence Holiday Prevents Dancers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'An acquaintance is setting up a dance school in this sector and is scouting for instructors. I told him you''d be performing locally, which is my sneaky way of getting you to take this gig. Do your stuff, throw in some nice flourishes if you know any, and with luck, you may land a steady job. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'Turns out the guy''s protocol droid mistranslated "martial arts academy" as "dance school." Stupid droids. Sorry about that, friend. I hear you did a good job anyway!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'Dance Instructor Audition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'As I understand it, a specialty manufacturer of dance outfits in this sector is looking for performers who can show off its new clothing line. Scouts are all over right now. Go and dance in some way that would look good on a HoloNet commercial, and remember, keep your clothes on. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'I''m waiting to hear from the dance clothing manufacturer, but if I haven''t heard by now... A commercial contract would have been nice -- all the free outfits you can wear! But don''t get your hopes up. Keep plugging away, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Dance Outfit Endorsement Deal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm36o', 'Some low-budget theatrical ensemble is looking for dancers for an upcoming production called -- let me check my notes -- well, I can''t find the title. I told the producers you''ll be dancing, and they can look in to see you. Interested? I''ll tell them you''ll be there. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm36s', 'The deal''s off. I found the title of that low-budget production -- "The Imperial Follies." Apparently a savage satire of the Emperor. I heard the producers have already been arrested. Curtains for that show. Thanks anyway, and here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm36t', 'Low-Budget Theatrical Audition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm37o', 'I got word from a contact over at the -- well, maybe I''d better not say where. Seems the manager and his current love interest had a major falling-out, and somehow the whole booking schedule got destroyed. I know -- it''s a fun business. You''ve got an ideal opportunity to go over right now and dance. Quick, before someone takes the gig! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm37s', 'That was convenient, wasn''t it? Here''s your fee. Maybe we should hope for more fights in venue management, not that there''s a shortage of fights now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm37t', 'Enraged Manager Destroys Gig Book'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm38o', 'A local venue has gotten in trouble with the law over safety standards. The act they''d planned today was going to use a ton of pyrotechnics, some kind of glimmik-music performance art piece where they blow up droids onstage -- I don''t know. Anyway, the law cancelled that act, so this place is desperate for a replacement. You? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm38s', 'Thanks for filling in. I don''t know what glimmik band decided to destroy droids in a public place, but I expect that fad to vanish pretty soon. With any luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm38t', 'Glimmik Music Act Banned'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm39o', 'I just got some sad news from the wilderness. Apparently local gangsters wiped out most of a settlement, and the survivors are arriving here shortly. They''re understandably traumatized, so I promised some entertainment to lighten their mood. Would you be willing to dance today, to bring mental clarity to these victims? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm39s', 'That was kind of you. I don''t think most of the refugees have made it into town, so there may be more work for you soon. Please accept this modest fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm39t', 'Traumatized Refugees'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm3o', 'Anyone can flail his limbs about while music plays, but it takes a special kind of being to be a true dancer. Anyone that tells you otherwise is a tried and true flailer. If you think you fall into the "special" category, then head on over to these coordinates and strut your stuff. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm3s', 'Not too shabby, friend. You may flit your way into bigger and better things yet. I''ve transmitted your payment. I believe it reflects your audience''s feelings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm3t', 'A True Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm40o', 'Friends of mine travelling outside town ran afoul of some predators, and their trip got, shall we say, cut short. They''re all right physically, but very shaken. If you''re willing to dance, I''ll tell my friends to look you up there. Watching you will make them feel better. Okay? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm40s', 'My friends actually got diverted -- some lawman wanted them to file reports on the creature attack. Yeah, that''ll make my friends relax. Well, anyway, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm40t', 'Survivors of Predator Attack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm41o', 'Some aristocrat from the Naboo countryside is visiting town, looking to assuage her grief after some predator swallowed her pet voorpak. Wow, what a crisis. But if you''re dancing when she drops by, you might lessen her trauma and earn a big tip. Interested? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm41s', 'I don''t know why the noble lady didn''t show. She may have decided to go buy another voorpak instead. Voorpaks -- mmm, tasty!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm41t', 'Heal a Noble Lady''s Trauma'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm42o', 'I don''t want to get political, but we have a talent scout from the Imperial Ballet on Coruscant here in town. Maybe you like the Imperial Ballet, maybe you don''t, but impressing this scout would be a good career move just on general principles. The scout is travelling incognito, so don''t ask. Just dance. I''ll let you know how it turns out. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm42s', 'Sorry, friend. Apparently the Imperial Ballet talent scout, uh, defected to the Rebel Alliance. It seems Imperial Security is purging the Ballet. Hope you weren''t seen with anyone suspicious.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm42t', 'Imperial Ballet Talent Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm43o', 'Some local chef got trapped in a food-poisoning scandal. He says it''s extortion, blackmail, Rebel treachery. He''s gotten so jittery, he''s asked me to send a dancer to soothe his nerves. By happy chance I''d already lined up a paying gig at that place. You could hit two voorpaks with one stone. Interested? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm43s', 'Didn''t meet the chef? They''re very temperamental, those chefs. Got to wonder what they do alone in the kitchen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm43t', 'Soothe the Chef''s Nerves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm44o', 'Hutt gangsters scouting for good predators let loose a pack of rancors. Is "pack" the word for a group of rancors? Maybe "a devour of rancors." I think the Hutts wanted to see what ate the rancors. As you might imagine, folks in that area are jittery now. A dancer could do that neighborhood some good. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm44s', 'Thanks, a wonderful performance! I understand that local adventurers took care of the rancor problem. Hmm, they could probably use a good dancer about now too!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm44t', 'Rancor-Caused Anxiety'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm45o', 'Did you hear the rumor? There''s an Imperial bounty hunter in the area, hunting a Jedi Knight! Apparently there''s already been a battle in town. It''s got people quite flustered. I sense that if you go to my favorite place right now and dance your heart out, you''ll earn a small fortune in tips from worried patrons. Are you up to it? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm45s', 'Well, that seems to have worked out well. Maybe whenever business slows down, I''ll start spreading rumors about bounty hunters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm45t', 'Bounty Hunters Provoke Anxiety'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm46o', 'Some children at the edge of town were attacked by some kind of offworld monster. Evidently a local collector imported this thing for his collection, and it got loose. People are tense and anxious. It''s your task to restore calm and civility through your art. Will you go and dance? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm46s', 'An outstanding performance! I hope someone tracks that creature and kills it before any more children get hurt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm46t', 'Monster Attacks Promote Unease'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm47o', 'You missed an exciting time last night. A band of glimmik musicians wrecked a place and set loose some exotic animals caged in the lobby. Always a happening place there. The owner has cleaned up, but he wants a performer who can lure patrons back in. Go there and dance something soothing. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm47s', 'Did you have any trouble with the wrecked cages? Good, he must have cleaned those up. Why do these places keep hiring glimmik bands?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm47t', 'Glimmik Vandalism Means Gigs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm48o', 'Some HoloNet producers from Coruscant blew into town to film a segment of "Against Wild Worlds!" I don''t know what happened -- some kind of bar fight -- but they got mad, called in the Empire, and now there''s blaster battles everywhere. Folks are jumpy. Places are willing to pay for dancers who can settle their customers'' nerves. Go! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm48s', 'I understand the HoloNet producers blew back out of town as fast as they arrived. Hope we don''t see them again for a while. Nice performance, by the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'm48t', 'HoloNet Producers Cause Tension'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 127, 'm49o', 'Lots of farmers are taking refuge in town because of the Periodic Overland Migration -- some kind of big movement of dumb animals, I think. They''re lounging around the joints looking jumpy and out-of-place. If you could do a nice dance for them, it might calm them down. They might have spending money, who knows? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 128, 'm49s', 'I hope that worked out well for you. Did you dance some kind of quaint rural dance? That could play well with farmers, I imagine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 129, 'm49t', 'Farmers in Town Need Refreshment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 130, 'm4o', 'A good dancer knows how to read an audience. A truly good dancer is adaptable. A great dancer knows all sorts of dance variations and can switch seamlessly from one to another. If any of those describe you, then head to these coordinates for an assignment. Best of luck to you. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 131, 'm4s', 'Looks like my faith was not misplaced. You seemed like someone who had "the gift." It''s a pleasure to pay your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 132, 'm4t', 'The Dancing Gift'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 133, 'm50o', 'I have grant money from the Galactic Chirgotta Awareness Council. Chirgotta is an intestinal parasite that causes illness in species across the galaxy. The money goes to hire a dancer who will make a short announcement before and after the performance, urging good intestinal hygiene. Look, it''s a gig. Are you interested or not? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 134, 'm50s', 'Did you make the announcement about the chirgotta? Both before and after the dance? Well, we''ll just say you did. Nobody checks on these grant awards.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 135, 'm50t', 'Chirgotta Awareness Council Grant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 136, 'm5o', 'A dancer can help work a crowd into a real party frenzy. And I''m not just talking about a simple sway of the hips or twirling of the arms, I mean a truly artistic combination of graceful and powerful moves that leaves the crowd speechless! So, you want a dancing job? Go here and shake it till it hurts. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 137, 'm5s', 'The reports have come back mostly positive. Looks like you really entertained that crowd. Your fee has been transmitted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 138, 'm5t', 'A Dancing Job'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 139, 'm6o', 'There may be dozens of alien species in the galaxy but they all have one thing in common -- they all like to have a good time. Well, all except the insects, maybe. Anyway, if you''re a graceful being who can enthrall an audience with your dancing moves, head to this establishment and strut your stuff. If you''re good, I''ll use you again. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 140, 'm6s', 'Well, who would have thought that you''d possess that much rhythm? You''ve earned your fee, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 141, 'm6t', 'Strut Your Stuff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 142, 'm7o', 'Music is the universal language, friend, and it inspires beings from all walks of life to move to its beat. I''m always in the market for a talented new dancer, so if you think you''ve got the groove, then I''ve got a job for you. The more you shake it, the more the patrons will appreciate it, and the better your tips will be. Interested? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 143, 'm7s', 'You definitely added to the ambience, friend, which is always a good thing. And the tips you received were indeed generous, as you''ll see from your deposited fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 144, 'm7t', 'Let the Music Move You'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 145, 'm8o', 'Dancing as a form of entertainment has been around since the discovery of fire. An art form as ancient and distinguished as this takes a lifetime of diligent study to master. But we''ve all got to start somewhere, eh? If you can move to a beat with some degree of consistency, then I''ve got an assignment for you. Care to try? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 146, 'm8s', 'The bad news is that a few patrons thought you were suffering a seizure. The good news is that it didn''t affect your fee all that much. Decent work, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 147, 'm8t', 'Feel the Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 148, 'm9o', 'Are you a dancing fool? Do you astound and impress others with your moves? Do beings clear a space around you when you decide to shake your groove thing? Then you might be the performer I''m looking for, friend. Head to these coordinates and give them a taste of your talent. If it''s impressive, your fee will be generous. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 149, 'm9s', 'Well done. As your fee will demonstrate, you fell short of impressive but were still rather entertaining. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 150, 'm9t', 'Be a Dancing Fool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_neutral_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'A local establishment that frequently caters to stormtroopers is holding an open call for dancers. We would like you to try out, while keeping your ears open for any interesting snippets of conversation you might catch. Report back to us everything you hear. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'That''s what you heard, eh? Well, it may not be of much use this time, but as we get these reports we''re sometimes able to glean useful information. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'Keep an Ear Open'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'We need a dancer to go and make such a spectacle that nobody will be looking at anything else, while one of us picks up valuable information from one of our undercover operatives. Are you up for it? A 10 minute performance will be necessary. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'Nice work! Nobody could take their eyes off of you, so the pick up was no trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'Make a Spectacle of Yourself'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'I''ve heard it said that all the worlds are stages. We need you to go to this venue and perform one kind of dance, while we perform another one behind the backs of the Imperials. Dance your finest, and make every second count. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'You did very well. Come back and see me again. I may have more work for you later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'All the Worlds Are Stages'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'A local venue is looking for dancers to soothe some battle-weary Alliance soldiers. If you''re willing to work your craft to help them, I know it would be much appreciated. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'No doubt you did a fine job. Here are some credits, a little token of our appreciation. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'Weary Alliance Soldiers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'One of COMPNOR''s recent artistic horrors was to incorporate the message "The Empire Keeps You Safe" into all dance performances. We would like you to go to this venue and incorporate the more accurate message "The Empire is More Corrupt Than The Hutts" as the subtext of your dance. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'Very clever -- subtle, yet straight to the point. We''ll replay it on tonight''s holo.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'A Subversive Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'I hear you''re a dancer who''s willing to take risks. An Imperial courier is going to a certain venue to retrieve some high-security documents. We want you to provide a distraction while our data slicer removes the information from the courier''s data pad. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'The courier was a no-show, but we really appreciate you putting your art on the line for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'Helping a Data Slicer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'Unlike the Empire, we try to embrace alien art forms. We''ve brought one of the more popular Twi''lek ballets here. Unfortunately both the lead and the understudy are down sick with Corellian Tanamen Fever, and we need someone who can fill in quickly so that our show doesn''t turn into a total carbon flush. Can you help? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'We still have a long way to go to repair the damage those blasted Imperials have done among the species, but every little bit helps. The Twi''lek dancers are recovering fine, by the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'The Show Must Go On'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'The Alliance is putting on a show to help cheer up some of the soldiers who are on the inactive list due to severe injuries. It''s a great way to earn some credits while helping out those who''ve given so much to our cause. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'Thanks so much for going out there. The soldiers who were well enough to attend no doubt appreciated it greatly. The rest can watch the droidcam recording later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'Spreading Some Cheer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'Certain Imperial offices have an arts budget for the support of local artistic endeavors. We want you to go and apply for one of these grants by performing for the head of the local Imperial Dance Comitee. With any luck we''ll be able to use some of the Empire''s own funds to aid us in its downfall. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'Unfortunately, the local arts budget had already been spent for this fiscal session. We''ll keep trying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Imperial Funds for the Allied Cause'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'It''s always hard to say how the war is going at any moment, but I have to say, our soldiers have had a tough time lately. Morale is still fine. A more committed group I''ve never seen. But you can see in their eyes, they''re tired -- mentally tired. If you perform at this venue, we''ll send some of them to watch you. You''ll make them feel better. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'That was great! We don''t know how many of our soldiers made it to see you, but it must have helped. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Battle-Shocked Fighters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'A squad of Alliance fighter pilots are throwing a birthday party for one of their buddies, and they''ve requested a dancer.If you''ll go to this location and give them a really energetic show, I''m sure the tips will be great. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'I''m sure you put on a great show, but those pilots wound up going out to another place. Those flyboys! But don''t worry, you still get paid.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'Birthday Party');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'Against the Empire, every little victory is important to maintain morale. We just had a lucky encounter with a squad of stormtroopers in the wilderness -- lucky for us, I mean -- and our fighters are in the mood to celebrate. If you go to their hangout and dance, you''ll add to the atmosphere and help them heal the scars of battle. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'I understand you went over real well. Not everyone was actually present, but they watched you through a droidcam. Now they''re ready for more victories. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'Celebrate a Small Victory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'We know an Imperial Security Bureau agent is canvassing this world, looking for our agents. We know where he''ll be next. We know what he''s looking for. Unless you''re there to distract him, he might well find it. It''s up to you to stage the most dazzling performance of your career. Make sure his gaze never leaves you. Are you up for it? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'Good news! We managed to take out the spy, permanently.Your performance didn''t go to waste -- you distracted the folks who might have warned him. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Distract an Imperial Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'A legendary soldier has arrived on-planet. He''s seen more war alone than any five of us together. He''s exhausted. I promised him a nice dinner at a quiet venue, and live entertainment to relax him. I hope that will be you. Are you willing? I''ll meet you there; if I''m late, just start dancing. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'On our way to see you, we got into a scrap with stormtroopers. Our fighter did his job, I''m proud to say, but we''ve decided it''s safer for him to get offworld for now. Sorry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', 'Veteran Fighter in Town'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'We''ve arranged to meet with a spy who has information about Imperial battle maneuvers. He''s extremely wary, so we told him to meet our representative in the alley outside a particular venue. He can spot the venue by the dancer inside. We gave him your description. If you''ll dance there, we can go ahead with our rendezvous. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'Everything went exactly as planned. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'Prearranged Encounter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'We constantly have to recruit "procurement specialists" to bring goods past Imperial blockades. One specialist seems ready to work with us, but he needs convincing. We''ve arranged to meet him at a safe spot outside a certain venue. He''ll recognize the venue because you''re dancing there -- at least, we hope you''ll dance there. Quickly! A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'The "procurement specialist" was understandably nervous, but we brought him around. One more blockade runner for the Alliance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'Lure a Wary Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'The Empire is throwing its weight around in a neighborhood with, it says, "undesirable numbers of aliens." Everyone there is running scared from COMPNOR, the ISB, and the Army. We want you to help us keep these folks from cracking up. A nice light dance to calm their wounded spirits, right? Please help them. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'We knew we could count on you. Those people are feeling better now -- even the ones who just watched from outside the area. Nice work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Imperial Oppression Drains Morale'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'We''re about to receive the schematic for a new Imperial weapon prototype. Unfortunately, the ISB is suspicious, and their spies are everywhere. As a workaround we want you to perform where the transfer will take place. Do a high-stepping dance, get everyone watching, and we''ll work the transfer quietly. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'Okay, that worked out well enough. Lots of distractions there, not even counting your fine performance. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Distract from Passing a Schematic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'The Empire promotes anti-alien sentiment in bigots across the galaxy. We fight this battle as hard as the rest, and you''re our soldier. Try to find nonhuman dancers to join you in the performance we''ve arranged for you. Dance together in friendship. If you can''t find anyone else, dance alone, and spread the idea of tolerance. Okay? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'That was fine. We''ll work on getting whole groups together, aliens and humans, to perform for people who might otherwise listen to the Empire''s hatred.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Encourage Human-Alien Friendship'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'With maximum terror the Committee for the Preservation of the New Order continues to impose Imperial values on the civilian population. Alliance sympathizers are getting "disappeared" in the night. People are rattled. If you can help restore tranquility through a pleasant dance, you''ll help us beat COMPNOR. Will you do it? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'If the Alliance can restore folks'' confidence, we''ll defeat COMPNOR more effectively than any blaster battle. Thanks for doing your part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'COMPNOR Sweep Damages Morale'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau is executing another of its frequent purges. Anyone who looks cross-eyed at a statue of the Emperor is liable to be hauled off to Dathomir. Folks are terrified. We need dancers to perform for them, quiet their nerves, and help them remember what we''re fighting for. Will you help? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'That was terrific! I hope you realize you calmed folks a lot in a panicky time. We have to maintain clear heads if we''re to restore the Republic. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'ISB Purge Frightens Citizens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'An Imperial dance troupe is performing yet another propaganda ballet. We want you to go to these coordinates and show people just how joyous dance can be, when it''s about movement instead of some spirit-crushing political agenda. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'Wow, you were really cooking! I wish we had more like you working with us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'Show Them How It''s Done'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'With so many blaster battles right in the streets of our cities, it''s a wonder we haven''t all cracked. The local venues are full of folks who haven''t got a mark on them, but they stare like they''ve just been through the Battle of Yavin. It''s up to entertainers like you to raise their morale. Otherwise the Empire will already have won. Will you dance for them? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'You did good work, but there is plenty more to do. The disruption of the Civil War guarantees that professional dancers will always have an important role to play. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Chaos of War Requires Mental Healing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'An Alliance sympathizer in the Core Worlds has anonymously published a new ballet, "Hutts." It got past the Imperial censors because it''s supposedly about criminals. They missed the real symbolism -- it''s about them, the censors! We''d like to stage this ballet on this world. If you''d care to audition, go to the designated venue and dance. Good luck! A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'Bad news. Imperial censors belatedly figured out the hidden meaning of "Hutts" and banned it. But here''s a small payment for your time and talent. Thanks anyway!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'Morale-Building Ballet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'We''re exploring the idea of infiltrating an Alliance informant within the Imperial Ballet Company on Coruscant. Don''t laugh -- those dancers get into close contact with a lot of high Imperial officials. They hear a lot. If you''re interested in trying out for a dangerous job, audition at this venue. Our holocams will record you, and we''ll let you know. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'We''re still trying to arrange an "in" at the Imperial Ballet. When and if that happens, who knows? You may get a call from us. We appreciate your talent and courage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'Imperial Ballet Infiltration'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'A stormtrooper attack on one of our bases went badly astray, and collateral damage almost killed an innocent civilian family. They''re recuperating in the care of one of our sympathizers, but they''re still very shaken. If you''d soothe them with a beautiful dance, we''d be happy to pay you a small honorarium. Interested? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'That was delightful, but unfortunately the family got called away when one of the children had to go into the bacta tanks. They''re all still grappling with what happened, poor wretches. Thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Perform for Wounded Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'We''re smuggling plans for a new weapon system offworld, but the Empire knows exactly who and what to look for. We need a diversion. You look a great deal like the agent they''re searching for. If you''re out dancing in public, they might mistake you for their quarry. Don''t worry, they won''t tackle you. We hope. Will you help the Alliance? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'Didn''t work. We had a tough time getting the plans offworld, and some of us didn''t make it. But you did your part. We appreciate that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'Decoy Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'A squad of Alliance pilots just landed after a tight scrape with some Star Destroyers. They''re all right, mostly, but they''re feeling badly shaken. These folks recover quickly, but anything we can do to help will -- well, it will help, right? So if you''ll dance in this venue, we''ll send the pilots your way to watch and relax. Okay? A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'The pilots decided to "relax" in a more raucous way. I won''t go into details. These flyboys! It''s like herding rancors!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Crew Just in From Tough Space Battle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm3o', 'We have a coded message to send to a spy we have planted in the Imperial Security Force. The code is in the form of certain specific dance moves. Go to this location and perform this dance. Our spy will know what it means, while you''ll be unaware so that you can''t be compromised. Good luck! A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm3s', 'Perfect! It''s people like you who will make the Alliance a success.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm3t', 'Coded Message'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm4o', 'Imperial propaganda is wreaking havoc with our public image. The very people we''re trying to free from the tyranny of the Empire are starting to eye us suspiciously. We want you to go to these coordinates and perform a dance that will make people see us in a more sympathetic light. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm4s', 'The droidcam caught it all. That will make people think twice before believing that Imperial drivel.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm4t', 'Dance Against Propaganda'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm5o', 'A well-known commander is visiting this world. He''s a big supporter of the arts, and he wants a skilled dancer to entertain for a private gathering he''s throwing.Go to this location and give it everything you''ve got. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm5s', 'The commander couldn''t make it, but your performance was recorded. The commander was very impressed with your skills. He may want your services again in the future. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm5t', 'Private Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm6o', 'The Imperial Ballet Company is holding tryouts. We want you to go to this location and audition. We want to get someone on the inside to forewarn us of what their propaganda machine is up to. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm6s', 'I guess the officials smelled a womp rat. You didn''t get the job. Here''s a little something for your effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm6t', 'Join the Imperial Ballet '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm7o', 'Alien species are having a hard time under the boot heel of the Empire. Go to this venue and perform a dance that will exemplify the plight of these poor citizens. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm7s', 'Magnificent! They replayed your dance on one of the holos. I''m sure there wasn''t a dry eye in the entire system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm7t', 'Raise Alien Awareness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm8o', 'Jizz Town, a Max Rebo cover band that we use to send coded messages to Alliance agents, is looking for energetic dancers for their upcoming tour. If you''d like to audition for them, go to this venue and give it your best. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm8s', 'Sadly, the Jizz Town tour has been cancelled due to intense Imperial scrutiny. Here''s some consolation, though -- your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm8t', 'The Jizz Town Dancers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm9o', 'The Empire''s destruction of Alderaan is still causing nightmares among local folks. Please go to this venue and use all your skills in a dance that will help soothe heartache over this attrocity. Make your movements an offering to the memory of the lost. A 10 minute performance will be necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm9s', 'I''m sure your performance was a wonder to behold. I hope people sleep a little easier now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm9t', 'A Memorial in Dance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_dancer_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Imperial Security has delivered a new cargo for use in the forthcoming Operation Masterstroke. Bring it here at once. Because of this mission''s critical importance, you must meet all assaults on your person with maximum force. Under no circumstances allow this cargo to fall into enemy hands!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Operation Masterstroke -- the high-ups have been planning that one a long time. I advise you to be careful with this latest cargo. Don''t go near intense magnetic fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Excellent. This warhead represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Proton Torpedo Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Operation Masterstroke will paralyze the Rebellion in a single unexpected blow. With the cargo shipments that arrive ever more frequently, we will soon achieve victory. You must retrieve the latest shipment and hand-deliver it here, letting no one know of your mission. Guard the cargo with your life!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'I wonder when Imperial leadership is going to get around to finally executing Operation Masterstroke. I''ve been hearing about it forever.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Superb. This weapon mount represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Heavy Weapon Stabilizing Mount'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Operation Masterstroke Materiel Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_mount_heavy_stabilization_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'At last our long planning for Operation Masterstroke is bearing fruit. The shipments of cargo grow more frequent each day. You must go at once and fetch the latest addition to this ingenious scheme. Tell no one of your mission, and protect the equipment with your life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'It''s amazing how much materiel the Empire has been accumulating for this Operation Masterstroke. They''ve been working on it for ages.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'All is going as planned. This capacitor represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Capacitor Bank'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Operation Masterstroke Delivery Assignment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\structure\\capacitor_bank.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We have received new materiel to serve as a linchpin in the upcoming Operation Masterstroke. You are to bring it here immediately, overcoming all hostile force en route. Never, never let any item intended for Operation Masterstroke fall into the hands of the Rebellion!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Another Operation Masterstroke delivery. They must have warehouses full of stuff by now -- cities -- planets full of stuff. When does this operation actually happen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'Splendid. This drilling pump represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Drilling Pump'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Required'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\fluidic_drilling_pumping_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'We are administering the development of an improved blaster battery. Be still, my pounding heart. I expect you, too, will thrill to participate in this magnificent undertaking. Bring us the battery prototype for testing. No hurry, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Here it is, the new battery. You wouldn''t believe how much education I absorbed to become an Imperial scientist. And what do I get to work on? Batteries.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Ah, the key to victory. After my excitement subsides, I''ll have the staff begin testing. You can imagine their eagerness to undertake this glamorous assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Improved Battery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'Power Storage Breakthrough'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'battery\\battery.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'Our long-term effort to design an improved probot droid may finally be bearing fruit. After many travails, we now have schematics for a droid that can survey Rebel activity from a longer distance than ever before. Pick up the revised schematics and bring them here at once, so that we may begin prototyping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'These schematics avoid the previous model''s rangefinding flaw. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. It set out for the target, but accelerated far too quickly. It inadvertently achieved escape velocity, flew into the sky, and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'No doubt many obstacles remain before the probot will be perfected. But we must push on, against all odds!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Revised Probot Schematics'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Redesigned Probot Dooms Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm7o\nWe have faced many vicissitudes in our attempts to design an improved probot droid. Yet the need to eavesdrop on Rebel plans drives us ever onward. We have received word from the lab that the new plans are ready for prototyping. Bring them here, and the Empire will reward you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm7p', 'We believe these plans correct a programming error in the previous model. We ordered that droid to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid apparently interpreted this as 1500 light-years. It flew into the sky and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm7c', 'The many vagaries we have encountered in the probot-redesign program are not endearing us to Imperial High Command. Yet we must persist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm7i', 'Redesigned Probot Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm7t', 'Rebellion Will Fall Before Improved Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm8o\nOur probot droid redesign program has encountered a certain number of problems. But this droid''s ability to monitor Rebellion activity at extreme long range will put the Empire''s eyes everywhere! The corrected schematics for the latest model are now ready for prototyping. Bring them here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm8p', 'These schematics correct the previous model''s lack of judgment in determining auditory ranges. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid instead overheard a different commander''s orders given, we now believe, a thousand kilometers distant. The droid flew into the sky and was lost. Mysterious.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm8c', 'We must endeavor to correct the errors of previous droids. This probot will be the one that succeeds. I feel sure!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm8i', 'Probot Schematics (Revised)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm8t', 'Rebels Quail Before New Probot Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm8f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm9o\nDespite development obstacles, we are continuing our program to redesign the standard probot droid. Its enhanced tracking abilities at range will spell doom for the Rebellion. The probot''s latest plans await prototyping. Bring them here, and exercise all possible secrecy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm9p', 'The redesigned probot corrects an earlier model''s trouble discriminating at extreme distances. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away, and it instead targeted the sun, flew up, and was lost in the sky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm9c', 'The probot program has much to make up for. I hope this next model proves effective.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm9i', 'Corrected Probot Droid Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm9t', 'New Probot Spells Doom for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm9f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm10o\nIn reading disciplinary reports from one of our units, I note that one officer was caught with excessive quantities of illicit Corellian Double-Brandy. The Empire tolerates a certain specified amount of alcohol per soldier, dependent on rank, but this was beyond the limit. Bring the excess Double-Brandy here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm10p', 'I have already disciplined the erring officer and was planning to dispose of the Double-Brandy myself. Don''t you think that would be more efficient? No? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm10c', 'I had planned to dispose of the illicit liquor myself, but now a Moff has taken an interest in proper disposal techniques. I must forward this to him at once. Ah, well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm10i', 'Corellian Double-Brandy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm10t', 'Illicit Liquor Needed for Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm10f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_drink_corellian_double_brandy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm11o', 'Our lab has made a breakthrough in a new miniaturized hyperdrive. It will permit even Lambda-class shuttles to far surpass lightspeed. What a tremendous achievement! Bring this wonder to us at once, and be sure to spread the news far and wide of the Empire''s technological supremacy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm11p', 'Wouldn''t the Rebels love to get their hands on this device! It guarantees our victory! Spread the word, and watch our foes quail before us!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm11c', 'Wh-what? You arrived safely? Drat. We had hoped a Rebel would steal this from you, or from your body. It contains a tracking beacon and a charge of high explosive. Well, that scheme has failed -- for now. But expect more delivery missions in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm11i', 'Prototype Miniaturized Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm11t', 'Breakthrough Miniature Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm11f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm12o', 'Our Star Destroyer reactors use ultra-dense hypermatter. The Navy has delivered a new annihilation reactant sample to this world to test its effects in a gravity field. Bring us this sample and we shall commence testing. Don''t worry, the sample presents no danger.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm12p', 'This reactant is quite heavy. If you list a bit to one side, think nothing of it. I suggest you avoid space travel and intense gravity fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm12c', 'Ah, the hypermatter. Did you happen to notice any odd phenomena -- for example, a strange warping of spacetime in your vicinity? No? Oh. Well, all right. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm12i', 'Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm12t', 'Candidate for Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm12f', 'component\\chemistry\\dye_hair.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm13o', 'I understand a research lab has made a breakthrough in a new vehicle-mounted shield generator design. Supposedly it represents a completely revolutionary approach to shield generation. We cannot afford to let the Rebellion learn of this. Therefore I require you to go and get these designs, and hand-deliver them to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm13p', 'Revolutionary? I believe there''s some mistake. These designs originate from a remote Imperial lab in the Outer Rim Territories. We are only making copies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm13c', 'Outer Rim lab? Pah! Who could imagine that this titanic breakthrough would come from some obscure lab in the hinterworlds? I expect this innovation, which originated entirely under my command here, will make my reputation. You would do well to echo these sentiments, if asked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm13i', 'Vehicular Shield Generator Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm13t', 'Design for Speeder Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm13f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_vehicular.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm14o', 'I am pleased. Our armor-testing laboratory reports that the recent laser-resistant stormtrooper armor passed testing with minimal casualties. The trooper volunteers are no doubt breathing easier now! I need you to pick up the design and hand-deliver it here, so that the Rebels see nothing of this breakthrough.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm14p', 'Apparently my report got corrupted in transit. "Minimal casualties" was actually "maximal casualties." As in previous tests, none of the troopers survived testing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm14c', 'Maximal casualties? Oh. Well, there are always more stormtroopers. We will analyze and redesign the laserproof armor, and recommence testing shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm14i', 'Laser-Resistant Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm14t', 'Testbed for Energy-Resistant Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm14f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_energy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm15o', 'In our past efforts to improve the acid resistance of stormtrooper armor, we have encountered technical obstacles. Now, though, the deaths of the troopers in our previous experiments have inspired us to greater heights! A new design is ready for prototyping, and we require you to bring it to us at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm15p', 'This armor design looks better than earlier versions, but I doubt any more stormtroopers will volunteer to test it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm15c', 'Stormtroopers are all volunteers, whether they like it or not. I shall have the prototype created at once, and drafting of volunteers will commence thereafter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm15i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm15t', 'New Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm15f', 'component\\armor\\heavy_armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm16o', 'Again there are problems with our tests of anti-acid protection for stormtrooper armor. Again we have lost several stormtroopers, messily, when the prototype''s protection failed. Our lab has retained a piece from the most recent catastrophe. You are ordered to fetch this piece and bring it here -- in a safe container, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm16p', 'Here''s the container with the armor fragment. We''re still cleaning up the remains of the last stormtrooper testers. What a stench!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm16c', 'Losing a few stormtroopers is a small price to pay for improved armor. We shall commence analysis of this fragment at once. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm16i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Fragment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm16t', 'Critical Failure of Anti-Acid Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm16f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence has let it be known that there may be action on an icy world in the Outer Rim. We have no other details. This unit is charged with designing the stormtrooper -- excuse me, "snowtrooper" -- armor for the campaign. Pick up the armor designs and bring them here by hand, in order to avoid alerting Rebel spies!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm17p', 'These preliminary designs feature a heat-retaining helmet modification that may interfere somewhat with our stormtroopers'' famed targeting accuracy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm17c', 'Far better to protect against frostbite than to worry excessively over details of weapon targeting! That is what I say!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm17i', 'Snow Armor Modification Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm17t', 'Snow Armor Design Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm17f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_cold.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm18o', 'We recently destroyed yet another Rebel base, and we believe this assault killed a valued Rebel leader. The victim''s datapad survives. WIth its information, we can verify the leader''s identity and, in all likelihood, learn vital intelligence. You must retrieve this datapad from the assault leader and return it here for decryption.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm18p', 'I''d prefer not to idly speculate about the leader''s identity. We haven''t positively identified the charred remains. Here''s the datapad.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm18c', 'Excellent. Once we decrypt this information, we''ll learn whether we''ve finally disposed of Princess Leia Organa!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm18i', 'Datapad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm18t', 'Rebel''s Last Message Awaits Decryption'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm18f', 'datapad\\character_datapad.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm19o', 'For many years Imperial researchers have sought to duplicate the amazing qualities of ancient Mandalorian armor. We recently occupied an Outer Rim world that failed to show proper respect, and from a museum there our troops took a fine Mandalorian specimen. You are to retrieve this armor and return it here for close analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'm19p', 'It''s a piece from the upper arm -- presumably of a bipedal species. I don''t know if the Mandalorians ever created armor for, say, tentacled blobs. Here you are.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 107, 'm19c', 'I''ll have our top scientists examine this for as long as it takes. Eventually every stormtrooper will have armor as fine as this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 108, 'm19i', 'Rare Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 109, 'm19t', 'Uncover Mandalorian Armor''s Secret'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 110, 'm19f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bicep_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 111, 'm20o', 'Given our incessant need for materials, the Empire constantly researches new survey techniques. A scientist reports that his unit has finished testing a new prototype surveying tool. You will retrieve the tool and bring it here, so that we can analyze the rate of wear and tear due to fieldwork.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 112, 'm20p', 'We had no better luck with this unit than with current models. But it''s not politically desirable to report this to my superiors, who include the unit''s designer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 113, 'm20c', 'Once this unit has proven its worth, the Empire will be pleased to order enough units to survey the galaxy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 114, 'm20i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 115, 'm20t', 'Empire''s Mineral Needs Assured'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 116, 'm20f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_mineral.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 117, 'm21o', 'It remains a demanding task to locate and concentrate valuable atmospheric gases. A researcher reports that he has made a breakthrough in gas mining. Personally, I doubt that any scientist on this world has the resources to produce such a "breakthrough." Nonetheless, you should fetch the item that excites him and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 118, 'm21p', 'This unit offers a 13% efficiency improvement. But my commander has invested heavily in a company that makes the existing model. If this new one works, he''s out of business, so he''ll make sure it won''t. Of course, you never heard that from me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 119, 'm21c', 'Hmph. I can see just by looking at it -- this is mere industrial trash. Thank you, I shall dispose of -- I mean, handle this item from this point onward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 120, 'm21i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 121, 'm21t', 'Gas Mining Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 122, 'm21f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 123, 'm22o', 'A patrol around Yavin 4 found the remains of a stormtrooper from the destroyed Death Star. It is in the Empire''s interest to enshrine and publicize these martyrs. By mistake the remains were shipped to this world. Retrieve this hero with all speed and return his body here for proper shipment to Coruscant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 124, 'm22p', 'Body? Well -- it''s part of one, I guess. Apparently all they found were these, uh, boots. I hope they''ll do. They smell odd, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 125, 'm22c', 'Boots? Umm. Well. All right, thank you, go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 126, 'm22i', 'Trooper''s Last Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 127, 'm22t', 'Hero of the Empire Heads for Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 128, 'm22f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_boots.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 129, 'm23o', 'Evidently a stormtrooper, somehow more inventive than his fellows, has devised an improved utility belt. How unusual! My superiors think this would make an intriguing HoloNet propaganda feature. "Stormtrooper Doesn''t Let Duty Interfere With Creative Service to His Empire." Bring the trooper here, or at least his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 130, 'm23p', 'The trooper was showing dangerous mental instability due to a radiation accident. He grew insubordinate, and we had him terminated. Here is his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 131, 'm23c', 'Oh. Hmm. Well, the belt doesn''t appear remarkably improved. My superiors will have to judge whether the human-interest story remains satisfying. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 132, 'm23i', 'Improved Utility Belt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 133, 'm23t', 'Stormtrooper''s Creative Service'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 134, 'm23f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_utility_belt.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 135, 'm24o', 'Incredibly, a Rebel spy infiltrated a Star Destroyer supply depot and placed listening devices in many TIE pilot helmets! A commander on this world uncovered the atrocity. You must go at once and retrieve an example of the compromised helmets. Tell no one of this embarrassment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 136, 'm24p', 'I don''t even handle TIE fighters. I got shipped these helmets by mistake. Typical snafu. I planned to cannibalize them for parts, and that''s how I found the bugs. Here, take one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 137, 'm24c', 'This is the bugged helmet, eh? Listen: The Empire triumphs over all such minor obstacles. Do you hear? Never think, or speak, otherwise. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 138, 'm24i', 'Sabotaged TIE Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 139, 'm24t', 'TIE Helmet Investigation Improves Security'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 140, 'm24f', 'wearables\\helmet\\helmet_tie_fighter.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 141, 'm25o', 'Symbolizing his boundless love for the entire galaxy, our Emperor collects colorful primitive paraphernalia from many worlds. A recent purge of hostile savages on this world has brought us many items -- I mean "treasures" -- of this kind. I''d like you to fetch a choice item from this hoard and bring it here for forwarding to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 142, 'm25p', 'When my commander made this request, I pulled everything I could from the bodies and sorted through a huge pile. Here''s the choicest item that''s still intact, a piece of bone armor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 143, 'm25c', 'Hmm. Well, who am I to say whether some native gimcrack has value? I shall submit this bone spur to the Emperor''s staff for consideration. I do hope it reflects well on me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 144, 'm25i', 'Alien Savage Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 145, 'm25t', 'Souvenir for Emperor''s Retreat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 146, 'm25f', 'wearables\\armor\\bone\\armor_bone_s01_bracer_r.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 147, 'm26o', 'A Moff in another system wishes to present a gift to a very close friend. His friend apparently enjoys the jewelry of a craftswoman on this world. For safety and convenience we have confined the craftswoman at her home. You are to obtain her most elaborate piece and bring it here. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 148, 'm26p', 'We were forced to destroy the craftswoman and her home when she expressed violent support for the Rebellion. This single piece of her work survived the blast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 149, 'm26c', 'Blown up? Um. Well. This seems an adequately lovely piece. I shall forward it without comment, and let my superiors explain matters to the Moff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 150, 'm26i', 'Moff''s Jewelry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 151, 'm26t', 'Gift for Moff''s Good Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 152, 'm26f', 'wearables\\tiara\\tiara_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 153, 'm27o', 'We have been pursuing deflector shield component research project on this world. As I understand it, magnetic conditions at the test site are exactly right. A test official says a prototype is done, and they need a courier to bring it here for fuller testing. That courier would be you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 154, 'm27p', 'This is an improved ion feed for the deflector shields on Marauder-class corvette ships, such as those used by the Corporate Sector Authority. Guard it carefully!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 155, 'm27c', 'Corporate Sector Authority? You mean they''ve been squandering Imperial research dollars on a CSA project? Gad! I must alert my superiors. This will stop at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 156, 'm27i', 'Deflector shield ion feed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 157, 'm27t', 'Prototype Deflector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 158, 'm27f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_ion_feed_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 159, 'm28o', 'Our researchers continue to break new ground in stormtrooper shield technology. I''ve been given happy news of a new personal shield prototype -- quite the breakthrough, says the report. Bring me this prototype, and allow no one to steal or damage it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 160, 'm28p', 'Work proceeds quite well. The current model still delivers a lethal heat burn to any trooper who wears it, but the time before destruction is now extended to over a minute!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 161, 'm28c', 'Over a minute. How glorious. I must admit, I expected better. I shall look into the matter of that researcher''s funding. Thank you, you may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 162, 'm28i', 'Personal Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 163, 'm28t', 'Empire''s Shields Grow Ever Stronger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 164, 'm28f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_personal.iff');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 165, 'm29o', 'You! I need a loyal agent to retrieve a prototype device -- some kind of biochemical equipment. I have the name here: "bionetic reagent analyzer." It remains to be seen what this device actually does, but it sounds important. Fetch it at once, and allow no one to see it en route. This mission is classified!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 166, 'm29p', 'Yes, the bionetic reagent analyzer! Its purpose and operation are too hard to describe to a layperson, but rest assured: This is a landmark day in the history of transformative introversional bionetics!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 167, 'm29c', 'Ah yes, the bionetic, um, reagent ... analyzer. Well. There it is. I shall pass this breakthrough along to -- to someone who will certainly appreciate its, ah, grandeur.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 168, 'm29i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 169, 'm29t', 'Imperial Chemistry Means Better Living'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 170, 'm29f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 171, 'm30o', 'A Core World laboratory has shipped us a prototype release timer suitable for gas bombs. We are to test it and report its efficacy. The prototype is ready for you to pick up and bring here. So you''d best get moving, correct?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 172, 'm30p', 'The lab recommends testing this timer using a gas volume sufficient to blanket this hemisphere to a depth of two meters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 173, 'm30c', 'A hemisphere of gas! Ah, I see the mistake. It appears the Core lab shipped us a prototype actually intended for mining operations in the Corporate Sector. (Whew!)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 174, 'm30i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 175, 'm30t', 'Gas Dispersion Weapon to Defeat Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 176, 'm30f', 'component\\chemistry\\release_mechanism_duration.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 177, 'm31o', 'The Empire is experimenting with the use of assassin droids against major Rebel leaders. One attempt recently failed, but a soldier salvaged the droid''s brain. We hope to read its memory banks for useful data on Rebel defense tactics. Retrieve the brain from the soldier and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 178, 'm31p', 'The droid was from Holowan Laboratories. Took out a Rebel squad before a cloud car rammed it at supersonic speed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 179, 'm31c', 'Ah, Holowan Technologies -- "the Friendly Technology People." I doubt this droid made friends easily. Thank you, that is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 180, 'm31i', 'Assassin Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 181, 'm31t', 'Salvage Last Memories of Imperial Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 182, 'm31f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 183, 'm32o', 'We''ve spent a fortune purifying a sample of denaric, one of the more potent poisons in the Outer Rim Territories. Fast, effective, and said to be untraceable. Now we''re ready to use it against select Rebel leaders, as soon as you retrieve the sample from our researcher.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 184, 'm32p', 'Looks like sugar, doesn''t it? Don''t touch it!  If you carry it, use this container!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 185, 'm32c', 'Soon a remarkable number of Rebellion agitators will succumb to mysterious "heart failure." You''ve done well. Tell no one of this, or you''ll regret it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 186, 'm32i', 'Pure Denaric Poison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 187, 'm32t', 'Poisonous Present for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 188, 'm32f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_sugar.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 189, 'm33o', 'An indigenous species produces a material useful for improved crowd-control entangler ammunition. The researcher who discovered this has produced a new prototype of the ammunition. Please collect the prototype ammo at once and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 190, 'm33p', 'Yes, a local spideroid produces saliva that makes the entangler ammo even stickier and more cohesive. It''s been a laborious task collecting all that spideroid spit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 191, 'm33c', 'From humble strands, such as this spideroid''s secretion, we weave the web of cumulative power that assures victory! Excellent work, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 192, 'm33i', 'Entangler Ammo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 193, 'm33t', 'Crowd Control Ammo for Misguided Protesters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 194, 'm33f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile_entanglement.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 195, 'm34o', 'The Empire has made heavy use of rylith crystals, which store and release solar energy. We will eventually exhaust natural supplies of rylith found on the world Demophon. We are cultivating the crystals on other worlds, with limited success so far. Please collect the results of the latest trial on this world from our researcher, and bring the samples here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 196, 'm34p', 'Rylith has an uncommonly complex structure. I am investigating using valuable Tasar power crystals as seed crystals. What do you think of these samples?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 197, 'm34c', 'Hmm. Not particularly promising so far, especially with the exorbitant cost of the seed Tasar crystals. Still, we must pursue this matter. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 198, 'm34i', 'Rylith Crystals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 199, 'm34t', 'Key to Improved Blaster Efficiency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 200, 'm34f', 'component\\weapon\\energization_crystals.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 201, 'm35o', 'You there. I need you to drop what you''re doing and handle this problem. My unit is testing an experimental motivator from Talfaglio, but all my men are stuck doing wargames. That''s where you come in. Pick up this device and bring it back to me. My superior is getting impatient.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 202, 'm35p', 'You''re not from the designated test unit, are you? Never mind. Here''s the experimental motivator. Make sure it gets to the commander in one piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 203, 'm35c', 'Thanks. If I don''t get this motivator installed and tested in the next few hours, my commander will have my hide. I wonder how you install this thing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 204, 'm35i', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 205, 'm35t', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 206, 'm35f', 'component\\droid\\droid_motive_system.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 207, 'm36o', 'A well-connected officer was killed by a Rebel assassin. The only witness was a binary load lifter. Our field agents have extracted the droid''s brain. I need you to bring it here so I can pass it on to Imperial Intelligence. This is very important. Do not fail.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 208, 'm36p', 'Here''s the droid brain. Don''t worry, it came from a binary load lifter, so it''s not too heavy. Lifters don''t have the biggest brains in the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 209, 'm36c', 'Very good. I''ll note your work in my report. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 210, 'm36i', 'Binary Load lifter brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 211, 'm36t', 'Retrieve Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 212, 'm36f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 213, 'm37o', 'Imperial Intelligence impounded a privately-owned probot, on the grounds that it was being used by Rebel agents. These are the coordinates where the droid is being held. Bring it back to me immediately. I''ll see if it contains any evidence that may help us locate the Rebels and uncover their criminal plots.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 214, 'm37p', 'I''d keep an eye on this probot, if I were you. It seems resistant to the restraining bolt. It definitely wants to get loose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 215, 'm37c', 'You didn''t have too much trouble, I hope? I knew you were up to the task. Now to see what this droid can tell us about its Rebel masters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 216, 'm37i', 'Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 217, 'm37t', 'Bring back a Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 218, 'm37f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm38o\nRebels are sadistic animals. They killed several of our elite soldiers by poisoning a shipment of medpacks to Calamari. One of these contaminated packs has arrived on-planet. I want you to fetch it back to me. I''ll see if I can find any clues to the perpetrators of this cowardly plot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 219, 'm38p', 'Here''s the poisoned medpack. I know this area can be dangerous, but if anything happens to you on the way back, make sure you don''t use this medpack. Your dying screams would attract scavengers. We''d have a heck of a time finding your corpse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 220, 'm38c', 'This is the poisoned medpack, eh? How strange. I''d swear it was contaminated by Imperial Intelligence, not in some Rebel''s back-room laboratory. I''ll have to be careful who I report this to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 221, 'm38i', 'Contaminated Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 222, 'm38t', 'Transport Incriminating Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 223, 'm38f', 'medicine\\medpack_wound.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 224, 'm39o', 'Remember the stories about Mandalorian warriors? Imperial Intelligence found an old Mandalorian gauntlet with a unique smartrope system. Go get this interesting artifact and bring it back to me. I want to see if we can coopt the technology into some of our political enforcement operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 225, 'm39p', 'Here''s the gauntlet. Looks ridiculous, doesn''t it? What sort of peedunkel would actually wear this old stuff? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 226, 'm39c', 'Excellent. This does look interesting. Those Mandalorians had a real sense of style, didn''t they?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 227, 'm39i', 'Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 228, 'm39t', 'Deliver Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 229, 'm39f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bracer_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 230, 'm40o', 'It''s not well known that the Ubese people produced some of the most advanced personal combat equipment found in the galaxy. My commander recently obtained a bandolier of Ubese weapons from a smuggler in the radiation belt. I want you to fetch this prize and bring it to me. I''ll see if we can make any use of it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 231, 'm40p', 'Are you the courier for this Ubese bandolier? Good. It''s worth a lot of money. Holding it makes me feel like a target. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 232, 'm40c', 'Thank you. I can''t wait to try these weapons out. With luck I''ll get an excellent performance review this year!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 233, 'm40i', 'Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 234, 'm40t', 'Bring Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 235, 'm40f', 'wearables\\armor\\ubese\\armor_ubese_bandolier.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 236, 'm41o', 'They''ve made some kind of new modification to the stormtrooper helmet. I hope it lets you see better. I need to deliver one of the new prototypes to my superior. Can you fetch it from my contact and bring it to me? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 237, 'm41p', 'Here''s the new prototype stormtrooper blast helmet. They say the black quartz visors are thicker, to better repel lasers. Of course that decreases your field of vision, but hey, stormtroopers are so precise they can afford to lose a little peripheral vision, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 238, 'm41c', 'This is an improvement? Well, if they say so. I don''t get how anyone can see through these new visors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 239, 'm41i', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 240, 'm41t', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 241, 'm41f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 242, 'm42o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have a job for you. Moff Kracko of Kreel Sector commissioned a slitherhorn from a local vendor. I had one of my subordinates make the actual purchase, and I need you to bring it to me. I''ll requisition a hyperspace transport to take it to the moff. Yes, this is the New Order''s precision war machine in action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 243, 'm42p', 'I don''t know why my commander is so cranky about this. Personally, after a long day of enforcing galactic security I feel a lot better when I hear someone play a slitherhorn. Anyway, here''s the instrument.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 244, 'm42c', 'I''m sure this task exercised all of your precision-honed skills. Now I can requisition a million-credit Imperial transport to take this slitherhorn to some governor who couldn''t be bothered to buy it in his own system. Once again the Imperial war machine makes the galaxy secure for its citizens.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 245, 'm42i', 'Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 246, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 247, 'm42f', 'instrument\\slitherhorn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 248, 'm43o', 'We''ve had reports of a biological outbreak in this area. I need you to pick up some laboratory equipment so our scientists can work on the problem. Bring the equipment here, and I''ll make sure you get a modest payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 249, 'm43p', 'Here''s the equipment. Be careful with it. There are materials inside more toxic than all the poisons on Ansion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 250, 'm43c', 'Thanks for delivering this. I hope we can contain this biological outbreak. If I were you, though, I''d consider leaving the planet for a while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 251, 'm43i', 'Biolab Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 252, 'm43t', 'Bring In Laboratory Equipment Quickly'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 253, 'm43f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 254, 'm44o', 'Can you believe someone still thinks projectile weapons are a viable alternative to blasters? It''s true. I''m supposed to take possession of some kind of experimental ammunition today. I need you to fetch it from my contact and bring it to me. I''ll do what I''m ordered, of course, but I still think projectile weapons are too archaic to be practical.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 255, 'm44p', 'Here''s the experimental munitions. They say these projectiles can reach near lightspeed. Sounds pretty powerful if you ask me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 256, 'm44c', 'Lightspeed projectiles? That''s ridiculous. I''ll have to test these things for myself. Anyway, thanks for a job well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 257, 'm44i', 'Experimental Projectiles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 258, 'm44t', 'Safeguard Experimental Ammunition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 259, 'm44f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 260, 'm45o', 'We ordered a new cooling sleeve for our laser cannon, but Logistics screwed up the dropoff. Some soldier in the middle of nowhere ended up with it. I need you to get out there and bring back my equipment before the Rebels notice that our perimeter is weakened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 261, 'm45p', 'Thank you for taking this gadget off my hands. I sure can''t use it. I dream of the day I have a laser cannon to play with.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 262, 'm45c', 'I''m glad to see you got the sleeve here in one piece. We''ve had a lot of Rebel trouble around here lately. I need to get my laser cannon back online.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 263, 'm45i', 'Laser Cannon Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 264, 'm45t', 'New Laser Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 265, 'm45f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_cannon_cooling_sleeve.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 266, 'm46o', 'You know, I''ve always said that gambling is a dangerous habit. Now the Imperial Security Bureau has proven my point. They''ve augmented a chance cube with a remote-activated explosive charge, to eliminate a local gang leader. I want you to pick up this nasty little device and bring it back to me. This goes without saying: Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 267, 'm46p', 'Make sure not to take this exploding chance cube too near a signal transmitter. The results could be unpleasant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 268, 'm46c', 'An explosive chance cube. Sometimes the ISB delights me with its creativity. I can''t wait for our inside man to give this to the gang leader. Ah, the thrill of victory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 269, 'm46i', 'Explosive Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 270, 'm46t', 'Unfavorable Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 271, 'm46f', 'dice\\eqp_chance_cube.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 272, 'm47o', 'Imperial Center has some new kind of survey tool that they want us to try out. One of these devices is arriving on the planet any second now. I want you to go to the pickup point, get it, and bring it back to me. I''ll see about calling in one of our surveyors to test it out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 273, 'm47p', 'I think this thing scans for noxious gases. I have no idea how it works, but here you go. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 274, 'm47c', 'Hmm. The sensor went off right when you handed it to me. What does that mean? I guess I''ll have to figure it out myself. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 275, 'm47i', 'New Surveying Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 276, 'm47t', 'Interesting Survey Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 277, 'm47f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 278, 'm48o', 'Finally! Two months ago I ordered a new sighting computer for a turbolaser. Now it''s here. Can you go pick it up for me? I want to break it in shooting down a few blockade runners that have been sneaking around this quadrant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 279, 'm48p', 'Careful now. These computers can be a little imprecise at first, until they calibrate themselves to the equipment. Your turbolaser sighting might be a little off for a couple of days, so make sure you''re not shooting anywhere near friendly combatants.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 280, 'm48c', 'At last! I''ll install this on my turbolaser immediately. Some smugglers have been threading the needle between our blockade ships for two months. Now that my sighting will be back on target, I can pick off their ships without a problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 281, 'm48i', 'Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 282, 'm48t', 'Get My Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 283, 'm48f', 'component\\weapon\\parallel_weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 284, 'm49o', 'I can''t wait to see the camouflage generators they''ve installed on the new stormtrooper armor. I hear that one of the new chest plates is making the rounds not far from here. I don''t suppose you''d want to fetch it for me, would you? I''m dying to see how good it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 285, 'm49p', 'Be very careful with this chest plate. The camouflage circuits are very delicate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 286, 'm49c', 'I don''t get it. This looks like ordinary armor. How does the camouflage work? You didn''t drop this thing on the way, did you? Or get into a firefight or something? I''ll be in deep poodoo if this chest plate is damaged.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 287, 'm49i', 'Camo Trooper Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 288, 'm49t', 'Camouflage Armor Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 289, 'm49f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_chest_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 290, 'm50o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has a new plan. They''re bugging backpacks to distribute to local children. The hope is to catch parents who are also Rebel sympathizers. Maybe we can stop a few treasonous plots. Your task is to fetch one of these backpacks to me so I can ensure its scan signature is adequately low. Go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 291, 'm50p', 'Bugging a child''s backpack. Does that seem right to you? I don''t feel good about this. It''s low, even for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 292, 'm50c', 'Our transceivers allowed us to listen when you picked up the backpack. It seems that the agent who gave it to you was less than loyal to the New Order, wouldn''t you say? I believe it is time to have a long, vigorous chat with him. As for you, thanks and carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 293, 'm50i', 'Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 294, 'm50t', 'Bring Me a Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_easy.stf', 295, 'm50f', 'wearables\\backpack\\backpack_s06.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Imperial Security has delivered a new cargo for use in the forthcoming Operation Masterstroke. Bring it here at once. Because of this mission''s critical importance, you must meet all assaults on your person with maximum force. Under no circumstances allow this cargo to fall into enemy hands!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Operation Masterstroke -- the high-ups have been planning that one a long time. I advise you to be careful with this latest cargo. Don''t go near intense magnetic fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Excellent. This warhead represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Proton Torpedo Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Operation Masterstroke will paralyze the Rebellion in a single unexpected blow. With the cargo shipments that arrive ever more frequently, we will soon achieve victory. You must retrieve the latest shipment and hand-deliver it here, letting no one know of your mission. Guard the cargo with your life!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'I wonder when Imperial leadership is going to get around to finally executing Operation Masterstroke. I''ve been hearing about it forever.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Superb. This weapon mount represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Heavy Weapon Stabilizing Mount'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Operation Masterstroke Materiel Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_mount_heavy_stabilization_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'At last our long planning for Operation Masterstroke is bearing fruit. The shipments of cargo grow more frequent each day. You must go at once and fetch the latest addition to this ingenious scheme. Tell no one of your mission, and protect the equipment with your life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'It''s amazing how much materiel the Empire has been accumulating for this Operation Masterstroke. They''ve been working on it for ages.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'All is going as planned. This capacitor represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Capacitor Bank'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Operation Masterstroke Delivery Assignment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\structure\\capacitor_bank.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We have received new materiel to serve as a linchpin in the upcoming Operation Masterstroke. You are to bring it here immediately, overcoming all hostile force en route. Never, never let any item intended for Operation Masterstroke fall into the hands of the Rebellion!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Another Operation Masterstroke delivery. They must have warehouses full of stuff by now -- cities -- planets full of stuff. When does this operation actually happen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'Splendid. This drilling pump represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Drilling Pump'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Required'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\fluidic_drilling_pumping_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'We are administering the development of an improved blaster battery. Be still, my pounding heart. I expect you, too, will thrill to participate in this magnificent undertaking. Bring us the battery prototype for testing. No hurry, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Here it is, the new battery. You wouldn''t believe how much education I absorbed to become an Imperial scientist. And what do I get to work on? Batteries.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Ah, the key to victory. After my excitement subsides, I''ll have the staff begin testing. You can imagine their eagerness to undertake this glamorous assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Improved Battery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'Power Storage Breakthrough'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'battery\\battery.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'Our long-term effort to design an improved probot droid may finally be bearing fruit. After many travails, we now have schematics for a droid that can survey Rebel activity from a longer distance than ever before. Pick up the revised schematics and bring them here at once, so that we may begin prototyping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'These schematics avoid the previous model''s rangefinding flaw. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. It set out for the target, but accelerated far too quickly. It inadvertently achieved escape velocity, flew into the sky, and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'No doubt many obstacles remain before the probot will be perfected. But we must push on, against all odds!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Revised Probot Schematics'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Redesigned Probot Dooms Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm7o\nWe have faced many vicissitudes in our attempts to design an improved probot droid. Yet the need to eavesdrop on Rebel plans drives us ever onward. We have received word from the lab that the new plans are ready for prototyping. Bring them here, and the Empire will reward you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 37, 'm7p', 'We believe these plans correct a programming error in the previous model. We ordered that droid to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid apparently interpreted this as 1500 light-years. It flew into the sky and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 38, 'm7c', 'The many vagaries we have encountered in the probot-redesign program are not endearing us to Imperial High Command. Yet we must persist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 39, 'm7i', 'Redesigned Probot Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 40, 'm7t', 'Rebellion Will Fall Before Improved Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm8o\nOur probot droid redesign program has encountered a certain number of problems. But this droid''s ability to monitor Rebellion activity at extreme long range will put the Empire''s eyes everywhere! The corrected schematics for the latest model are now ready for prototyping. Bring them here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 42, 'm8p', 'These schematics correct the previous model''s lack of judgment in determining auditory ranges. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid instead overheard a different commander''s orders given, we now believe, a thousand kilometers distant. The droid flew into the sky and was lost. Mysterious.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 43, 'm8c', 'We must endeavor to correct the errors of previous droids. This probot will be the one that succeeds. I feel sure!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 44, 'm8i', 'Probot Schematics (Revised)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 45, 'm8t', 'Rebels Quail Before New Probot Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 46, 'm8f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm9o\nDespite development obstacles, we are continuing our program to redesign the standard probot droid. Its enhanced tracking abilities at range will spell doom for the Rebellion. The probot''s latest plans await prototyping. Bring them here, and exercise all possible secrecy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 47, 'm9p', 'The redesigned probot corrects an earlier model''s trouble discriminating at extreme distances. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away, and it instead targeted the sun, flew up, and was lost in the sky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 48, 'm9c', 'The probot program has much to make up for. I hope this next model proves effective.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 49, 'm9i', 'Corrected Probot Droid Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 50, 'm9t', 'New Probot Spells Doom for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 51, 'm9f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm10o\nIn reading disciplinary reports from one of our units, I note that one officer was caught with excessive quantities of illicit Corellian Double-Brandy. The Empire tolerates a certain specified amount of alcohol per soldier, dependent on rank, but this was beyond the limit. Bring the excess Double-Brandy here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 52, 'm10p', 'I have already disciplined the erring officer and was planning to dispose of the Double-Brandy myself. Don''t you think that would be more efficient? No? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 53, 'm10c', 'I had planned to dispose of the illicit liquor myself, but now a Moff has taken an interest in proper disposal techniques. I must forward this to him at once. Ah, well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 54, 'm10i', 'Corellian Double-Brandy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 55, 'm10t', 'Illicit Liquor Needed for Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 56, 'm10f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_drink_corellian_double_brandy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 57, 'm11o', 'Our lab has made a breakthrough in a new miniaturized hyperdrive. It will permit even Lambda-class shuttles to far surpass lightspeed. What a tremendous achievement! Bring this wonder to us at once, and be sure to spread the news far and wide of the Empire''s technological supremacy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 58, 'm11p', 'Wouldn''t the Rebels love to get their hands on this device! It guarantees our victory! Spread the word, and watch our foes quail before us!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 59, 'm11c', 'Wh-what? You arrived safely? Drat. We had hoped a Rebel would steal this from you, or from your body. It contains a tracking beacon and a charge of high explosive. Well, that scheme has failed -- for now. But expect more delivery missions in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 60, 'm11i', 'Prototype Miniaturized Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 61, 'm11t', 'Breakthrough Miniature Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 62, 'm11f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 63, 'm12o', 'Our Star Destroyer reactors use ultra-dense hypermatter. The Navy has delivered a new annihilation reactant sample to this world to test its effects in a gravity field. Bring us this sample and we shall commence testing. Don''t worry, the sample presents no danger.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 64, 'm12p', 'This reactant is quite heavy. If you list a bit to one side, think nothing of it. I suggest you avoid space travel and intense gravity fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 65, 'm12c', 'Ah, the hypermatter. Did you happen to notice any odd phenomena -- for example, a strange warping of spacetime in your vicinity? No? Oh. Well, all right. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 66, 'm12i', 'Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 67, 'm12t', 'Candidate for Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 68, 'm12f', 'component\\chemistry\\dye_hair.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 69, 'm13o', 'I understand a research lab has made a breakthrough in a new vehicle-mounted shield generator design. Supposedly it represents a completely revolutionary approach to shield generation. We cannot afford to let the Rebellion learn of this. Therefore I require you to go and get these designs, and hand-deliver them to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 70, 'm13p', 'Revolutionary? I believe there''s some mistake. These designs originate from a remote Imperial lab in the Outer Rim Territories. We are only making copies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 71, 'm13c', 'Outer Rim lab? Pah! Who could imagine that this titanic breakthrough would come from some obscure lab in the hinterworlds? I expect this innovation, which originated entirely under my command here, will make my reputation. You would do well to echo these sentiments, if asked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 72, 'm13i', 'Vehicular Shield Generator Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 73, 'm13t', 'Design for Speeder Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 74, 'm13f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_vehicular.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 75, 'm14o', 'I am pleased. Our armor-testing laboratory reports that the recent laser-resistant stormtrooper armor passed testing with minimal casualties. The trooper volunteers are no doubt breathing easier now! I need you to pick up the design and hand-deliver it here, so that the Rebels see nothing of this breakthrough.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 76, 'm14p', 'Apparently my report got corrupted in transit. "Minimal casualties" was actually "maximal casualties." As in previous tests, none of the troopers survived testing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 77, 'm14c', 'Maximal casualties? Oh. Well, there are always more stormtroopers. We will analyze and redesign the laserproof armor, and recommence testing shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 78, 'm14i', 'Laser-Resistant Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 79, 'm14t', 'Testbed for Energy-Resistant Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 80, 'm14f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_energy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 81, 'm15o', 'In our past efforts to improve the acid resistance of stormtrooper armor, we have encountered technical obstacles. Now, though, the deaths of the troopers in our previous experiments have inspired us to greater heights! A new design is ready for prototyping, and we require you to bring it to us at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 82, 'm15p', 'This armor design looks better than earlier versions, but I doubt any more stormtroopers will volunteer to test it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 83, 'm15c', 'Stormtroopers are all volunteers, whether they like it or not. I shall have the prototype created at once, and drafting of volunteers will commence thereafter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 84, 'm15i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 85, 'm15t', 'New Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 86, 'm15f', 'component\\armor\\heavy_armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 87, 'm16o', 'Again there are problems with our tests of anti-acid protection for stormtrooper armor. Again we have lost several stormtroopers, messily, when the prototype''s protection failed. Our lab has retained a piece from the most recent catastrophe. You are ordered to fetch this piece and bring it here -- in a safe container, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 88, 'm16p', 'Here''s the container with the armor fragment. We''re still cleaning up the remains of the last stormtrooper testers. What a stench!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 89, 'm16c', 'Losing a few stormtroopers is a small price to pay for improved armor. We shall commence analysis of this fragment at once. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 90, 'm16i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Fragment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 91, 'm16t', 'Critical Failure of Anti-Acid Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 92, 'm16f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 93, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence has let it be known that there may be action on an icy world in the Outer Rim. We have no other details. This unit is charged with designing the stormtrooper -- excuse me, "snowtrooper" -- armor for the campaign. Pick up the armor designs and bring them here by hand, in order to avoid alerting Rebel spies!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 94, 'm17p', 'These preliminary designs feature a heat-retaining helmet modification that may interfere somewhat with our stormtroopers'' famed targeting accuracy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 95, 'm17c', 'Far better to protect against frostbite than to worry excessively over details of weapon targeting! That is what I say!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 96, 'm17i', 'Snow Armor Modification Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 97, 'm17t', 'Snow Armor Design Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 98, 'm17f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_cold.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 99, 'm18o', 'We recently destroyed yet another Rebel base, and we believe this assault killed a valued Rebel leader. The victim''s datapad survives. WIth its information, we can verify the leader''s identity and, in all likelihood, learn vital intelligence. You must retrieve this datapad from the assault leader and return it here for decryption.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 100, 'm18p', 'I''d prefer not to idly speculate about the leader''s identity. We haven''t positively identified the charred remains. Here''s the datapad.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 101, 'm18c', 'Excellent. Once we decrypt this information, we''ll learn whether we''ve finally disposed of Princess Leia Organa!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 102, 'm18i', 'Datapad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 103, 'm18t', 'Rebel''s Last Message Awaits Decryption'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 104, 'm18f', 'datapad\\character_datapad.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 105, 'm19o', 'For many years Imperial researchers have sought to duplicate the amazing qualities of ancient Mandalorian armor. We recently occupied an Outer Rim world that failed to show proper respect, and from a museum there our troops took a fine Mandalorian specimen. You are to retrieve this armor and return it here for close analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 106, 'm19p', 'It''s a piece from the upper arm -- presumably of a bipedal species. I don''t know if the Mandalorians ever created armor for, say, tentacled blobs. Here you are.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 107, 'm19c', 'I''ll have our top scientists examine this for as long as it takes. Eventually every stormtrooper will have armor as fine as this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 108, 'm19i', 'Rare Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 109, 'm19t', 'Uncover Mandalorian Armor''s Secret'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 110, 'm19f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bicep_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 111, 'm20o', 'Given our incessant need for materials, the Empire constantly researches new survey techniques. A scientist reports that his unit has finished testing a new prototype surveying tool. You will retrieve the tool and bring it here, so that we can analyze the rate of wear and tear due to fieldwork.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 112, 'm20p', 'We had no better luck with this unit than with current models. But it''s not politically desirable to report this to my superiors, who include the unit''s designer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 113, 'm20c', 'Once this unit has proven its worth, the Empire will be pleased to order enough units to survey the galaxy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 114, 'm20i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 115, 'm20t', 'Empire''s Mineral Needs Assured'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 116, 'm20f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_mineral.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 117, 'm21o', 'It remains a demanding task to locate and concentrate valuable atmospheric gases. A researcher reports that he has made a breakthrough in gas mining. Personally, I doubt that any scientist on this world has the resources to produce such a "breakthrough." Nonetheless, you should fetch the item that excites him and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 118, 'm21p', 'This unit offers a 13% efficiency improvement. But my commander has invested heavily in a company that makes the existing model. If this new one works, he''s out of business, so he''ll make sure it won''t. Of course, you never heard that from me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 119, 'm21c', 'Hmph. I can see just by looking at it -- this is mere industrial trash. Thank you, I shall dispose of -- I mean, handle this item from this point onward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 120, 'm21i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 121, 'm21t', 'Gas Mining Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 122, 'm21f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 123, 'm22o', 'A patrol around Yavin 4 found the remains of a stormtrooper from the destroyed Death Star. It is in the Empire''s interest to enshrine and publicize these martyrs. By mistake the remains were shipped to this world. Retrieve this hero with all speed and return his body here for proper shipment to Coruscant.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 124, 'm22p', 'Body? Well -- it''s part of one, I guess. Apparently all they found were these, uh, boots. I hope they''ll do. They smell odd, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 125, 'm22c', 'Boots? Umm. Well. All right, thank you, go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 126, 'm22i', 'Trooper''s Last Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 127, 'm22t', 'Hero of the Empire Heads for Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 128, 'm22f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_boots.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 129, 'm23o', 'Evidently a stormtrooper, somehow more inventive than his fellows, has devised an improved utility belt. How unusual! My superiors think this would make an intriguing HoloNet propaganda feature. "Stormtrooper Doesn''t Let Duty Interfere With Creative Service to His Empire." Bring the trooper here, or at least his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 130, 'm23p', 'The trooper was showing dangerous mental instability due to a radiation accident. He grew insubordinate, and we had him terminated. Here is his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 131, 'm23c', 'Oh. Hmm. Well, the belt doesn''t appear remarkably improved. My superiors will have to judge whether the human-interest story remains satisfying. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 132, 'm23i', 'Improved Utility Belt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 133, 'm23t', 'Stormtrooper''s Creative Service'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 134, 'm23f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_utility_belt.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 135, 'm24o', 'Incredibly, a Rebel spy infiltrated a Star Destroyer supply depot and placed listening devices in many TIE pilot helmets! A commander on this world uncovered the atrocity. You must go at once and retrieve an example of the compromised helmets. Tell no one of this embarrassment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 136, 'm24p', 'I don''t even handle TIE fighters. I got shipped these helmets by mistake. Typical snafu. I planned to cannibalize them for parts, and that''s how I found the bugs. Here, take one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 137, 'm24c', 'This is the bugged helmet, eh? Listen: The Empire triumphs over all such minor obstacles. Do you hear? Never think, or speak, otherwise. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 138, 'm24i', 'Sabotaged TIE Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 139, 'm24t', 'TIE Helmet Investigation Improves Security'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 140, 'm24f', 'wearables\\helmet\\helmet_tie_fighter.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 141, 'm25o', 'Symbolizing his boundless love for the entire galaxy, our Emperor collects colorful primitive paraphernalia from many worlds. A recent purge of hostile savages on this world has brought us many items -- I mean "treasures" -- of this kind. I''d like you to fetch a choice item from this hoard and bring it here for forwarding to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 142, 'm25p', 'When my commander made this request, I pulled everything I could from the bodies and sorted through a huge pile. Here''s the choicest item that''s still intact, a piece of bone armor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 143, 'm25c', 'Hmm. Well, who am I to say whether some native gimcrack has value? I shall submit this bone spur to the Emperor''s staff for consideration. I do hope it reflects well on me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 144, 'm25i', 'Alien Savage Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 145, 'm25t', 'Souvenir for Emperor''s Retreat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 146, 'm25f', 'wearables\\armor\\bone\\armor_bone_s01_bracer_r.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 147, 'm26o', 'A Moff in another system wishes to present a gift to a very close friend. His friend apparently enjoys the jewelry of a craftswoman on this world. For safety and convenience we have confined the craftswoman at her home. You are to obtain her most elaborate piece and bring it here. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 148, 'm26p', 'We were forced to destroy the craftswoman and her home when she expressed violent support for the Rebellion. This single piece of her work survived the blast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 149, 'm26c', 'Blown up? Um. Well. This seems an adequately lovely piece. I shall forward it without comment, and let my superiors explain matters to the Moff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 150, 'm26i', 'Moff''s Jewelry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 151, 'm26t', 'Gift for Moff''s Good Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 152, 'm26f', 'wearables\\tiara\\tiara_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 153, 'm27o', 'We have been pursuing deflector shield component research project on this world. As I understand it, magnetic conditions at the test site are exactly right. A test official says a prototype is done, and they need a courier to bring it here for fuller testing. That courier would be you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 154, 'm27p', 'This is an improved ion feed for the deflector shields on Marauder-class corvette ships, such as those used by the Corporate Sector Authority. Guard it carefully!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 155, 'm27c', 'Corporate Sector Authority? You mean they''ve been squandering Imperial research dollars on a CSA project? Gad! I must alert my superiors. This will stop at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 156, 'm27i', 'Deflector shield ion feed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 157, 'm27t', 'Prototype Deflector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 158, 'm27f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_ion_feed_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 159, 'm28o', 'Our researchers continue to break new ground in stormtrooper shield technology. I''ve been given happy news of a new personal shield prototype -- quite the breakthrough, says the report. Bring me this prototype, and allow no one to steal or damage it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 160, 'm28p', 'Work proceeds quite well. The current model still delivers a lethal heat burn to any trooper who wears it, but the time before destruction is now extended to over a minute!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 161, 'm28c', 'Over a minute. How glorious. I must admit, I expected better. I shall look into the matter of that researcher''s funding. Thank you, you may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 162, 'm28i', 'Personal Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 163, 'm28t', 'Empire''s Shields Grow Ever Stronger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 164, 'm28f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_personal.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 165, 'm29o', 'You! I need a loyal agent to retrieve a prototype device -- some kind of biochemical equipment. I have the name here: "bionetic reagent analyzer." It remains to be seen what this device actually does, but it sounds important. Fetch it at once, and allow no one to see it en route. This mission is classified!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 166, 'm29p', 'Yes, the bionetic reagent analyzer! Its purpose and operation are too hard to describe to a layperson, but rest assured: This is a landmark day in the history of transformative introversional bionetics!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 167, 'm29c', 'Ah yes, the bionetic, um, reagent ... analyzer. Well. There it is. I shall pass this breakthrough along to -- to someone who will certainly appreciate its, ah, grandeur.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 168, 'm29i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 169, 'm29t', 'Imperial Chemistry Means Better Living'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 170, 'm29f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 171, 'm30o', 'A Core World laboratory has shipped us a prototype release timer suitable for gas bombs. We are to test it and report its efficacy. The prototype is ready for you to pick up and bring here. So you''d best get moving, correct?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 172, 'm30p', 'The lab recommends testing this timer using a gas volume sufficient to blanket this hemisphere to a depth of two meters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 173, 'm30c', 'A hemisphere of gas! Ah, I see the mistake. It appears the Core lab shipped us a prototype actually intended for mining operations in the Corporate Sector. (Whew!)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 174, 'm30i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 175, 'm30t', 'Gas Dispersion Weapon to Defeat Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 176, 'm30f', 'component\\chemistry\\release_mechanism_duration.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 177, 'm31o', 'The Empire is experimenting with the use of assassin droids against major Rebel leaders. One attempt recently failed, but a soldier salvaged the droid''s brain. We hope to read its memory banks for useful data on Rebel defense tactics. Retrieve the brain from the soldier and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 178, 'm31p', 'The droid was from Holowan Laboratories. Took out a Rebel squad before a cloud car rammed it at supersonic speed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 179, 'm31c', 'Ah, Holowan Technologies -- "the Friendly Technology People." I doubt this droid made friends easily. Thank you, that is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 180, 'm31i', 'Assassin Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 181, 'm31t', 'Salvage Last Memories of Imperial Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 182, 'm31f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 183, 'm32o', 'We''ve spent a fortune purifying a sample of denaric, one of the more potent poisons in the Outer Rim Territories. Fast, effective, and said to be untraceable. Now we''re ready to use it against select Rebel leaders, as soon as you retrieve the sample from our researcher.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 184, 'm32p', 'Looks like sugar, doesn''t it? Don''t touch it!  If you carry it, use this container!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 185, 'm32c', 'Soon a remarkable number of Rebellion agitators will succumb to mysterious "heart failure." You''ve done well. Tell no one of this, or you''ll regret it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 186, 'm32i', 'Pure Denaric Poison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 187, 'm32t', 'Poisonous Present for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 188, 'm32f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_sugar.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 189, 'm33o', 'An indigenous species produces a material useful for improved crowd-control entangler ammunition. The researcher who discovered this has produced a new prototype of the ammunition. Please collect the prototype ammo at once and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 190, 'm33p', 'Yes, a local spideroid produces saliva that makes the entangler ammo even stickier and more cohesive. It''s been a laborious task collecting all that spideroid spit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 191, 'm33c', 'From humble strands, such as this spideroid''s secretion, we weave the web of cumulative power that assures victory! Excellent work, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 192, 'm33i', 'Entangler Ammo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 193, 'm33t', 'Crowd Control Ammo for Misguided Protesters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 194, 'm33f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile_entanglement.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 195, 'm34o', 'The Empire has made heavy use of rylith crystals, which store and release solar energy. We will eventually exhaust natural supplies of rylith found on the world Demophon. We are cultivating the crystals on other worlds, with limited success so far. Please collect the results of the latest trial on this world from our researcher, and bring the samples here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 196, 'm34p', 'Rylith has an uncommonly complex structure. I am investigating using valuable Tasar power crystals as seed crystals. What do you think of these samples?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 197, 'm34c', 'Hmm. Not particularly promising so far, especially with the exorbitant cost of the seed Tasar crystals. Still, we must pursue this matter. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 198, 'm34i', 'Rylith Crystals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 199, 'm34t', 'Key to Improved Blaster Efficiency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 200, 'm34f', 'component\\weapon\\energization_crystals.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 201, 'm35o', 'You there. I need you to drop what you''re doing and handle this problem. My unit is testing an experimental motivator from Talfaglio, but all my men are stuck doing wargames. That''s where you come in. Pick up this device and bring it back to me. My superior is getting impatient.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 202, 'm35p', 'You''re not from the designated test unit, are you? Never mind. Here''s the experimental motivator. Make sure it gets to the commander in one piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 203, 'm35c', 'Thanks. If I don''t get this motivator installed and tested in the next few hours, my commander will have my hide. I wonder how you install this thing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 204, 'm35i', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 205, 'm35t', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 206, 'm35f', 'component\\droid\\droid_motive_system.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 207, 'm36o', 'A well-connected officer was killed by a Rebel assassin. The only witness was a binary load lifter. Our field agents have extracted the droid''s brain. I need you to bring it here so I can pass it on to Imperial Intelligence. This is very important. Do not fail.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 208, 'm36p', 'Here''s the droid brain. Don''t worry, it came from a binary load lifter, so it''s not too heavy. Lifters don''t have the biggest brains in the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 209, 'm36c', 'Very good. I''ll note your work in my report. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 210, 'm36i', 'Binary Load lifter brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 211, 'm36t', 'Retrieve Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 212, 'm36f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 213, 'm37o', 'Imperial Intelligence impounded a privately-owned probot, on the grounds that it was being used by Rebel agents. These are the coordinates where the droid is being held. Bring it back to me immediately. I''ll see if it contains any evidence that may help us locate the Rebels and uncover their criminal plots.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 214, 'm37p', 'I''d keep an eye on this probot, if I were you. It seems resistant to the restraining bolt. It definitely wants to get loose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 215, 'm37c', 'You didn''t have too much trouble, I hope? I knew you were up to the task. Now to see what this droid can tell us about its Rebel masters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 216, 'm37i', 'Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 217, 'm37t', 'Bring back a Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 218, 'm37f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm38o\nRebels are sadistic animals. They killed several of our elite soldiers by poisoning a shipment of medpacks to Calamari. One of these contaminated packs has arrived on-planet. I want you to fetch it back to me. I''ll see if I can find any clues to the perpetrators of this cowardly plot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 219, 'm38p', 'Here''s the poisoned medpack. I know this area can be dangerous, but if anything happens to you on the way back, make sure you don''t use this medpack. Your dying screams would attract scavengers. We''d have a heck of a time finding your corpse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 220, 'm38c', 'This is the poisoned medpack, eh? How strange. I''d swear it was contaminated by Imperial Intelligence, not in some Rebel''s back-room laboratory. I''ll have to be careful who I report this to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 221, 'm38i', 'Contaminated Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 222, 'm38t', 'Transport Incriminating Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 223, 'm38f', 'medicine\\medpack_wound.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 224, 'm39o', 'Remember the stories about Mandalorian warriors? Imperial Intelligence found an old Mandalorian gauntlet with a unique smartrope system. Go get this interesting artifact and bring it back to me. I want to see if we can coopt the technology into some of our political enforcement operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 225, 'm39p', 'Here''s the gauntlet. Looks ridiculous, doesn''t it? What sort of peedunkel would actually wear this old stuff? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 226, 'm39c', 'Excellent. This does look interesting. Those Mandalorians had a real sense of style, didn''t they?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 227, 'm39i', 'Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 228, 'm39t', 'Deliver Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 229, 'm39f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bracer_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 230, 'm40o', 'It''s not well known that the Ubese people produced some of the most advanced personal combat equipment found in the galaxy. My commander recently obtained a bandolier of Ubese weapons from a smuggler in the radiation belt. I want you to fetch this prize and bring it to me. I''ll see if we can make any use of it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 231, 'm40p', 'Are you the courier for this Ubese bandolier? Good. It''s worth a lot of money. Holding it makes me feel like a target. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 232, 'm40c', 'Thank you. I can''t wait to try these weapons out. With luck I''ll get an excellent performance review this year!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 233, 'm40i', 'Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 234, 'm40t', 'Bring Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 235, 'm40f', 'wearables\\armor\\ubese\\armor_ubese_bandolier.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 236, 'm41o', 'They''ve made some kind of new modification to the stormtrooper helmet. I hope it lets you see better. I need to deliver one of the new prototypes to my superior. Can you fetch it from my contact and bring it to me? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 237, 'm41p', 'Here''s the new prototype stormtrooper blast helmet. They say the black quartz visors are thicker, to better repel lasers. Of course that decreases your field of vision, but hey, stormtroopers are so precise they can afford to lose a little peripheral vision, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 238, 'm41c', 'This is an improvement? Well, if they say so. I don''t get how anyone can see through these new visors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 239, 'm41i', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 240, 'm41t', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 241, 'm41f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 242, 'm42o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have a job for you. Moff Kracko of Kreel Sector commissioned a slitherhorn from a local vendor. I had one of my subordinates make the actual purchase, and I need you to bring it to me. I''ll requisition a hyperspace transport to take it to the moff. Yes, this is the New Order''s precision war machine in action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 243, 'm42p', 'I don''t know why my commander is so cranky about this. Personally, after a long day of enforcing galactic security I feel a lot better when I hear someone play a slitherhorn. Anyway, here''s the instrument.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 244, 'm42c', 'I''m sure this task exercised all of your precision-honed skills. Now I can requisition a million-credit Imperial transport to take this slitherhorn to some governor who couldn''t be bothered to buy it in his own system. Once again the Imperial war machine makes the galaxy secure for its citizens.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 245, 'm42i', 'Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 246, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 247, 'm42f', 'instrument\\slitherhorn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 248, 'm43o', 'We''ve had reports of a biological outbreak in this area. I need you to pick up some laboratory equipment so our scientists can work on the problem. Bring the equipment here, and I''ll make sure you get a modest payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 249, 'm43p', 'Here''s the equipment. Be careful with it. There are materials inside more toxic than all the poisons on Ansion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 250, 'm43c', 'Thanks for delivering this. I hope we can contain this biological outbreak. If I were you, though, I''d consider leaving the planet for a while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 251, 'm43i', 'Biolab Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 252, 'm43t', 'Bring In Laboratory Equipment Quickly'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 253, 'm43f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 254, 'm44o', 'Can you believe someone still thinks projectile weapons are a viable alternative to blasters? It''s true. I''m supposed to take possession of some kind of experimental ammunition today. I need you to fetch it from my contact and bring it to me. I''ll do what I''m ordered, of course, but I still think projectile weapons are too archaic to be practical.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 255, 'm44p', 'Here''s the experimental munitions. They say these projectiles can reach near lightspeed. Sounds pretty powerful if you ask me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 256, 'm44c', 'Lightspeed projectiles? That''s ridiculous. I''ll have to test these things for myself. Anyway, thanks for a job well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 257, 'm44i', 'Experimental Projectiles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 258, 'm44t', 'Safeguard Experimental Ammunition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 259, 'm44f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 260, 'm45o', 'We ordered a new cooling sleeve for our laser cannon, but Logistics screwed up the dropoff. Some soldier in the middle of nowhere ended up with it. I need you to get out there and bring back my equipment before the Rebels notice that our perimeter is weakened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 261, 'm45p', 'Thank you for taking this gadget off my hands. I sure can''t use it. I dream of the day I have a laser cannon to play with.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 262, 'm45c', 'I''m glad to see you got the sleeve here in one piece. We''ve had a lot of Rebel trouble around here lately. I need to get my laser cannon back online.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 263, 'm45i', 'Laser Cannon Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 264, 'm45t', 'New Laser Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 265, 'm45f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_cannon_cooling_sleeve.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 266, 'm46o', 'You know, I''ve always said that gambling is a dangerous habit. Now the Imperial Security Bureau has proven my point. They''ve augmented a chance cube with a remote-activated explosive charge, to eliminate a local gang leader. I want you to pick up this nasty little device and bring it back to me. This goes without saying: Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 267, 'm46p', 'Make sure not to take this exploding chance cube too near a signal transmitter. The results could be unpleasant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 268, 'm46c', 'An explosive chance cube. Sometimes the ISB delights me with its creativity. I can''t wait for our inside man to give this to the gang leader. Ah, the thrill of victory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 269, 'm46i', 'Explosive Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 270, 'm46t', 'Unfavorable Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 271, 'm46f', 'dice\\eqp_chance_cube.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 272, 'm47o', 'Imperial Center has some new kind of survey tool that they want us to try out. One of these devices is arriving on the planet any second now. I want you to go to the pickup point, get it, and bring it back to me. I''ll see about calling in one of our surveyors to test it out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 273, 'm47p', 'I think this thing scans for noxious gases. I have no idea how it works, but here you go. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 274, 'm47c', 'Hmm. The sensor went off right when you handed it to me. What does that mean? I guess I''ll have to figure it out myself. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 275, 'm47i', 'New Surveying Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 276, 'm47t', 'Interesting Survey Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 277, 'm47f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 278, 'm48o', 'Finally! Two months ago I ordered a new sighting computer for a turbolaser. Now it''s here. Can you go pick it up for me? I want to break it in shooting down a few blockade runners that have been sneaking around this quadrant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 279, 'm48p', 'Careful now. These computers can be a little imprecise at first, until they calibrate themselves to the equipment. Your turbolaser sighting might be a little off for a couple of days, so make sure you''re not shooting anywhere near friendly combatants.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 280, 'm48c', 'At last! I''ll install this on my turbolaser immediately. Some smugglers have been threading the needle between our blockade ships for two months. Now that my sighting will be back on target, I can pick off their ships without a problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 281, 'm48i', 'Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 282, 'm48t', 'Get My Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 283, 'm48f', 'component\\weapon\\parallel_weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 284, 'm49o', 'I can''t wait to see the camouflage generators they''ve installed on the new stormtrooper armor. I hear that one of the new chest plates is making the rounds not far from here. I don''t suppose you''d want to fetch it for me, would you? I''m dying to see how good it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 285, 'm49p', 'Be very careful with this chest plate. The camouflage circuits are very delicate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 286, 'm49c', 'I don''t get it. This looks like ordinary armor. How does the camouflage work? You didn''t drop this thing on the way, did you? Or get into a firefight or something? I''ll be in deep poodoo if this chest plate is damaged.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 287, 'm49i', 'Camo Trooper Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 288, 'm49t', 'Camouflage Armor Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 289, 'm49f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_chest_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 290, 'm50o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has a new plan. They''re bugging backpacks to distribute to local children. The hope is to catch parents who are also Rebel sympathizers. Maybe we can stop a few treasonous plots. Your task is to fetch one of these backpacks to me so I can ensure its scan signature is adequately low. Go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 291, 'm50p', 'Bugging a child''s backpack. Does that seem right to you? I don''t feel good about this. It''s low, even for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 292, 'm50c', 'Our transceivers allowed us to listen when you picked up the backpack. It seems that the agent who gave it to you was less than loyal to the New Order, wouldn''t you say? I believe it is time to have a long, vigorous chat with him. As for you, thanks and carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 293, 'm50i', 'Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 294, 'm50t', 'Bring Me a Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_hard.stf', 295, 'm50f', 'wearables\\backpack\\backpack_s06.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Imperial Security has delivered a new cargo for use in the forthcoming Operation Masterstroke. Bring it here at once. Because of this mission''s critical importance, you must meet all assaults on your person with maximum force. Under no circumstances allow this cargo to fall into enemy hands!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Operation Masterstroke -- the high-ups have been planning that one a long time. I advise you to be careful with this latest cargo. Don''t go near intense magnetic fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Excellent. This warhead represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Proton Torpedo Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Operation Masterstroke will paralyze the Rebellion in a single unexpected blow. With the cargo shipments that arrive ever more frequently, we will soon achieve victory. You must retrieve the latest shipment and hand-deliver it here, letting no one know of your mission. Guard the cargo with your life!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'I wonder when Imperial leadership is going to get around to finally executing Operation Masterstroke. I''ve been hearing about it forever.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Superb. This weapon mount represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Heavy Weapon Stabilizing Mount'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Operation Masterstroke Materiel Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_mount_heavy_stabilization_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'At last our long planning for Operation Masterstroke is bearing fruit. The shipments of cargo grow more frequent each day. You must go at once and fetch the latest addition to this ingenious scheme. Tell no one of your mission, and protect the equipment with your life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'It''s amazing how much materiel the Empire has been accumulating for this Operation Masterstroke. They''ve been working on it for ages.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'All is going as planned. This capacitor represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Capacitor Bank'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Operation Masterstroke Delivery Assignment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\structure\\capacitor_bank.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We have received new materiel to serve as a linchpin in the upcoming Operation Masterstroke. You are to bring it here immediately, overcoming all hostile force en route. Never, never let any item intended for Operation Masterstroke fall into the hands of the Rebellion!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Another Operation Masterstroke delivery. They must have warehouses full of stuff by now -- cities -- planets full of stuff. When does this operation actually happen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'Splendid. This drilling pump represents only a fraction of the full power of Operation Masterstroke. Soon, soon, the Rebel Alliance will be crushed!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Drilling Pump'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Operation Masterstroke Cargo Required'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\fluidic_drilling_pumping_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'We are administering the development of an improved blaster battery. Be still, my pounding heart. I expect you, too, will thrill to participate in this magnificent undertaking. Bring us the battery prototype for testing. No hurry, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Here it is, the new battery. You wouldn''t believe how much education I absorbed to become an Imperial scientist. And what do I get to work on? Batteries.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Ah, the key to victory. After my excitement subsides, I''ll have the staff begin testing. You can imagine their eagerness to undertake this glamorous assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Improved Battery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'Power Storage Breakthrough'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'battery\\battery.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'Our long-term effort to design an improved probot droid may finally be bearing fruit. After many travails, we now have schematics for a droid that can survey Rebel activity from a longer distance than ever before. Pick up the revised schematics and bring them here at once, so that we may begin prototyping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'These schematics avoid the previous model''s rangefinding flaw. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. It set out for the target, but accelerated far too quickly. It inadvertently achieved escape velocity, flew into the sky, and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'No doubt many obstacles remain before the probot will be perfected. But we must push on, against all odds!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Revised Probot Schematics'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Redesigned Probot Dooms Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm7o\nWe have faced many vicissitudes in our attempts to design an improved probot droid. Yet the need to eavesdrop on Rebel plans drives us ever onward. We have received word from the lab that the new plans are ready for prototyping. Bring them here, and the Empire will reward you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 37, 'm7p', 'We believe these plans correct a programming error in the previous model. We ordered that droid to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid apparently interpreted this as 1500 light-years. It flew into the sky and was lost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 38, 'm7c', 'The many vagaries we have encountered in the probot-redesign program are not endearing us to Imperial High Command. Yet we must persist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 39, 'm7i', 'Redesigned Probot Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 40, 'm7t', 'Rebellion Will Fall Before Improved Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm8o\nOur probot droid redesign program has encountered a certain number of problems. But this droid''s ability to monitor Rebellion activity at extreme long range will put the Empire''s eyes everywhere! The corrected schematics for the latest model are now ready for prototyping. Bring them here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 42, 'm8p', 'These schematics correct the previous model''s lack of judgment in determining auditory ranges. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away. But the droid instead overheard a different commander''s orders given, we now believe, a thousand kilometers distant. The droid flew into the sky and was lost. Mysterious.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 43, 'm8c', 'We must endeavor to correct the errors of previous droids. This probot will be the one that succeeds. I feel sure!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 44, 'm8i', 'Probot Schematics (Revised)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 45, 'm8t', 'Rebels Quail Before New Probot Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 46, 'm8f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm9o\nDespite development obstacles, we are continuing our program to redesign the standard probot droid. Its enhanced tracking abilities at range will spell doom for the Rebellion. The probot''s latest plans await prototyping. Bring them here, and exercise all possible secrecy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 47, 'm9p', 'The redesigned probot corrects an earlier model''s trouble discriminating at extreme distances. We ordered it to monitor a target 1500 meters away, and it instead targeted the sun, flew up, and was lost in the sky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 48, 'm9c', 'The probot program has much to make up for. I hope this next model proves effective.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 49, 'm9i', 'Corrected Probot Droid Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 50, 'm9t', 'New Probot Spells Doom for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 51, 'm9f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm10o\nIn reading disciplinary reports from one of our units, I note that one officer was caught with excessive quantities of illicit Corellian Double-Brandy. The Empire tolerates a certain specified amount of alcohol per soldier, dependent on rank, but this was beyond the limit. Bring the excess Double-Brandy here at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 52, 'm10p', 'I have already disciplined the erring officer and was planning to dispose of the Double-Brandy myself. Don''t you think that would be more efficient? No? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 53, 'm10c', 'I had planned to dispose of the illicit liquor myself, but now a Moff has taken an interest in proper disposal techniques. I must forward this to him at once. Ah, well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 54, 'm10i', 'Corellian Double-Brandy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 55, 'm10t', 'Illicit Liquor Needed for Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 56, 'm10f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_drink_corellian_double_brandy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 57, 'm11o', 'Our lab has made a breakthrough in a new miniaturized hyperdrive. It will permit even Lambda-class shuttles to far surpass lightspeed. What a tremendous achievement! Bring this wonder to us at once, and be sure to spread the news far and wide of the Empire''s technological supremacy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 58, 'm11p', 'Wouldn''t the Rebels love to get their hands on this device! It guarantees our victory! Spread the word, and watch our foes quail before us!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 59, 'm11c', 'Wh-what? You arrived safely? Drat. We had hoped a Rebel would steal this from you, or from your body. It contains a tracking beacon and a charge of high explosive. Well, that scheme has failed -- for now. But expect more delivery missions in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 60, 'm11i', 'Prototype Miniaturized Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 61, 'm11t', 'Breakthrough Miniature Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 62, 'm11f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 63, 'm12o', 'Our Star Destroyer reactors use ultra-dense hypermatter. The Navy has delivered a new annihilation reactant sample to this world to test its effects in a gravity field. Bring us this sample and we shall commence testing. Don''t worry, the sample presents no danger.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 64, 'm12p', 'This reactant is quite heavy. If you list a bit to one side, think nothing of it. I suggest you avoid space travel and intense gravity fields.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 65, 'm12c', 'Ah, the hypermatter. Did you happen to notice any odd phenomena -- for example, a strange warping of spacetime in your vicinity? No? Oh. Well, all right. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 66, 'm12i', 'Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 67, 'm12t', 'Candidate for Annihilation Reactant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 68, 'm12f', 'component\\chemistry\\dye_hair.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 69, 'm13o', 'I understand a research lab has made a breakthrough in a new vehicle-mounted shield generator design. Supposedly it represents a completely revolutionary approach to shield generation. We cannot afford to let the Rebellion learn of this. Therefore I require you to go and get these designs, and hand-deliver them to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 70, 'm13p', 'Revolutionary? I believe there''s some mistake. These designs originate from a remote Imperial lab in the Outer Rim Territories. We are only making copies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 71, 'm13c', 'Outer Rim lab? Pah! Who could imagine that this titanic breakthrough would come from some obscure lab in the hinterworlds? I expect this innovation, which originated entirely under my command here, will make my reputation. You would do well to echo these sentiments, if asked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 72, 'm13i', 'Vehicular Shield Generator Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 73, 'm13t', 'Design for Speeder Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 74, 'm13f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_vehicular.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 75, 'm14o', 'I am pleased. Our armor-testing laboratory reports that the recent laser-resistant stormtrooper armor passed testing with minimal casualties. The trooper volunteers are no doubt breathing easier now! I need you to pick up the design and hand-deliver it here, so that the Rebels see nothing of this breakthrough.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 76, 'm14p', 'Apparently my report got corrupted in transit. "Minimal casualties" was actually "maximal casualties." As in previous tests, none of the troopers survived testing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 77, 'm14c', 'Maximal casualties? Oh. Well, there are always more stormtroopers. We will analyze and redesign the laserproof armor, and recommence testing shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 78, 'm14i', 'Laser-Resistant Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 79, 'm14t', 'Testbed for Energy-Resistant Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 80, 'm14f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_energy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 81, 'm15o', 'In our past efforts to improve the acid resistance of stormtrooper armor, we have encountered technical obstacles. Now, though, the deaths of the troopers in our previous experiments have inspired us to greater heights! A new design is ready for prototyping, and we require you to bring it to us at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 82, 'm15p', 'This armor design looks better than earlier versions, but I doubt any more stormtroopers will volunteer to test it.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 83, 'm15c', 'Stormtroopers are all volunteers, whether they like it or not. I shall have the prototype created at once, and drafting of volunteers will commence thereafter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 84, 'm15i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 85, 'm15t', 'New Anti-Acid Armor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 86, 'm15f', 'component\\armor\\heavy_armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 87, 'm16o', 'Again there are problems with our tests of anti-acid protection for stormtrooper armor. Again we have lost several stormtroopers, messily, when the prototype''s protection failed. Our lab has retained a piece from the most recent catastrophe. You are ordered to fetch this piece and bring it here -- in a safe container, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 88, 'm16p', 'Here''s the container with the armor fragment. We''re still cleaning up the remains of the last stormtrooper testers. What a stench!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 89, 'm16c', 'Losing a few stormtroopers is a small price to pay for improved armor. We shall commence analysis of this fragment at once. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 90, 'm16i', 'Anti-Acid Armor Fragment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 91, 'm16t', 'Critical Failure of Anti-Acid Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 92, 'm16f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_acid.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 93, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence has let it be known that there may be action on an icy world in the Outer Rim. We have no other details. This unit is charged with designing the stormtrooper -- excuse me, "snowtrooper" -- armor for the campaign. Pick up the armor designs and bring them here by hand, in order to avoid alerting Rebel spies!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 94, 'm17p', 'These preliminary designs feature a heat-retaining helmet modification that may interfere somewhat with our stormtroopers'' famed targeting accuracy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 95, 'm17c', 'Far better to protect against frostbite than to worry excessively over details of weapon targeting! That is what I say!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 96, 'm17i', 'Snow Armor Modification Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 97, 'm17t', 'Snow Armor Design Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 98, 'm17f', 'component\\armor\\armor_layer_cold.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 99, 'm18o', 'We recently destroyed yet another Rebel base, and we believe this assault killed a valued Rebel leader. The victim''s datapad survives. WIth its information, we can verify the leader''s identity and, in all likelihood, learn vital intelligence. You must retrieve this datapad from the assault leader and return it here for decryption.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 100, 'm18p', 'I''d prefer not to idly speculate about the leader''s identity. We haven''t positively identified the charred remains. Here''s the datapad.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 101, 'm18c', 'Excellent. Once we decrypt this information, we''ll learn whether we''ve finally disposed of Princess Leia Organa!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 102, 'm18i', 'Datapad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 103, 'm18t', 'Rebel''s Last Message Awaits Decryption'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 104, 'm18f', 'datapad\\character_datapad.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 105, 'm19o', 'For many years Imperial researchers have sought to duplicate the amazing qualities of ancient Mandalorian armor. We recently occupied an Outer Rim world that failed to show proper respect, and from a museum there our troops took a fine Mandalorian specimen. You are to retrieve this armor and return it here for close analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 106, 'm19p', 'It''s a piece from the upper arm -- presumably of a bipedal species. I don''t know if the Mandalorians ever created armor for, say, tentacled blobs. Here you are.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 107, 'm19c', 'I''ll have our top scientists examine this for as long as it takes. Eventually every stormtrooper will have armor as fine as this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 108, 'm19i', 'Rare Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 109, 'm19t', 'Uncover Mandalorian Armor''s Secret'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 110, 'm19f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bicep_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 111, 'm20o', 'Given our incessant need for materials, the Empire constantly researches new survey techniques. A scientist reports that his unit has finished testing a new prototype surveying tool. You will retrieve the tool and bring it here, so that we can analyze the rate of wear and tear due to fieldwork.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 112, 'm20p', 'We had no better luck with this unit than with current models. But it''s not politically desirable to report this to my superiors, who include the unit''s designer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 113, 'm20c', 'Once this unit has proven its worth, the Empire will be pleased to order enough units to survey the galaxy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 114, 'm20i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 115, 'm20t', 'Empire''s Mineral Needs Assured'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 116, 'm20f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_mineral.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 117, 'm21o', 'It remains a demanding task to locate and concentrate valuable atmospheric gases. A researcher reports that he has made a breakthrough in gas mining. Personally, I doubt that any scientist on this world has the resources to produce such a "breakthrough." Nonetheless, you should fetch the item that excites him and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 118, 'm21p', 'This unit offers a 13% efficiency improvement. But my commander has invested heavily in a company that makes the existing model. If this new one works, he''s out of business, so he''ll make sure it won''t. Of course, you never heard that from me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 119, 'm21c', 'Hmph. I can see just by looking at it -- this is mere industrial trash. Thank you, I shall dispose of -- I mean, handle this item from this point onward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 120, 'm21i', 'Survey Tool Prototype'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 121, 'm21t', 'Gas Mining Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 122, 'm21f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 123, 'm22o', 'A patrol around Yavin 4 found the remains of a stormtrooper from the destroyed Death Star. It is in the Empire''s interest to enshrine and publicize these martyrs. By mistake the remains were shipped to this world. Retrieve this hero with all speed and return his body here for proper shipment to Coruscant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 124, 'm22p', 'Body? Well -- it''s part of one, I guess. Apparently all they found were these, uh, boots. I hope they''ll do. They smell odd, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 125, 'm22c', 'Boots? Umm. Well. All right, thank you, go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 126, 'm22i', 'Trooper''s Last Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 127, 'm22t', 'Hero of the Empire Heads for Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 128, 'm22f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_boots.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 129, 'm23o', 'Evidently a stormtrooper, somehow more inventive than his fellows, has devised an improved utility belt. How unusual! My superiors think this would make an intriguing HoloNet propaganda feature. "Stormtrooper Doesn''t Let Duty Interfere With Creative Service to His Empire." Bring the trooper here, or at least his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 130, 'm23p', 'The trooper was showing dangerous mental instability due to a radiation accident. He grew insubordinate, and we had him terminated. Here is his belt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 131, 'm23c', 'Oh. Hmm. Well, the belt doesn''t appear remarkably improved. My superiors will have to judge whether the human-interest story remains satisfying. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 132, 'm23i', 'Improved Utility Belt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 133, 'm23t', 'Stormtrooper''s Creative Service'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 134, 'm23f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_utility_belt.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 135, 'm24o', 'Incredibly, a Rebel spy infiltrated a Star Destroyer supply depot and placed listening devices in many TIE pilot helmets! A commander on this world uncovered the atrocity. You must go at once and retrieve an example of the compromised helmets. Tell no one of this embarrassment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 136, 'm24p', 'I don''t even handle TIE fighters. I got shipped these helmets by mistake. Typical snafu. I planned to cannibalize them for parts, and that''s how I found the bugs. Here, take one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 137, 'm24c', 'This is the bugged helmet, eh? Listen: The Empire triumphs over all such minor obstacles. Do you hear? Never think, or speak, otherwise. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 138, 'm24i', 'Sabotaged TIE Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 139, 'm24t', 'TIE Helmet Investigation Improves Security'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 140, 'm24f', 'wearables\\helmet\\helmet_tie_fighter.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 141, 'm25o', 'Symbolizing his boundless love for the entire galaxy, our Emperor collects colorful primitive paraphernalia from many worlds. A recent purge of hostile savages on this world has brought us many items -- I mean "treasures" -- of this kind. I''d like you to fetch a choice item from this hoard and bring it here for forwarding to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 142, 'm25p', 'When my commander made this request, I pulled everything I could from the bodies and sorted through a huge pile. Here''s the choicest item that''s still intact, a piece of bone armor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 143, 'm25c', 'Hmm. Well, who am I to say whether some native gimcrack has value? I shall submit this bone spur to the Emperor''s staff for consideration. I do hope it reflects well on me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 144, 'm25i', 'Alien Savage Armor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 145, 'm25t', 'Souvenir for Emperor''s Retreat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 146, 'm25f', 'wearables\\armor\\bone\\armor_bone_s01_bracer_r.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 147, 'm26o', 'A Moff in another system wishes to present a gift to a very close friend. His friend apparently enjoys the jewelry of a craftswoman on this world. For safety and convenience we have confined the craftswoman at her home. You are to obtain her most elaborate piece and bring it here. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 148, 'm26p', 'We were forced to destroy the craftswoman and her home when she expressed violent support for the Rebellion. This single piece of her work survived the blast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 149, 'm26c', 'Blown up? Um. Well. This seems an adequately lovely piece. I shall forward it without comment, and let my superiors explain matters to the Moff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 150, 'm26i', 'Moff''s Jewelry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 151, 'm26t', 'Gift for Moff''s Good Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 152, 'm26f', 'wearables\\tiara\\tiara_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 153, 'm27o', 'We have been pursuing deflector shield component research project on this world. As I understand it, magnetic conditions at the test site are exactly right. A test official says a prototype is done, and they need a courier to bring it here for fuller testing. That courier would be you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 154, 'm27p', 'This is an improved ion feed for the deflector shields on Marauder-class corvette ships, such as those used by the Corporate Sector Authority. Guard it carefully!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 155, 'm27c', 'Corporate Sector Authority? You mean they''ve been squandering Imperial research dollars on a CSA project? Gad! I must alert my superiors. This will stop at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 156, 'm27i', 'Deflector shield ion feed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 157, 'm27t', 'Prototype Deflector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 158, 'm27f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_ion_feed_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 159, 'm28o', 'Our researchers continue to break new ground in stormtrooper shield technology. I''ve been given happy news of a new personal shield prototype -- quite the breakthrough, says the report. Bring me this prototype, and allow no one to steal or damage it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 160, 'm28p', 'Work proceeds quite well. The current model still delivers a lethal heat burn to any trooper who wears it, but the time before destruction is now extended to over a minute!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 161, 'm28c', 'Over a minute. How glorious. I must admit, I expected better. I shall look into the matter of that researcher''s funding. Thank you, you may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 162, 'm28i', 'Personal Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 163, 'm28t', 'Empire''s Shields Grow Ever Stronger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 164, 'm28f', 'component\\armor\\shield_generator_personal.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 165, 'm29o', 'You! I need a loyal agent to retrieve a prototype device -- some kind of biochemical equipment. I have the name here: "bionetic reagent analyzer." It remains to be seen what this device actually does, but it sounds important. Fetch it at once, and allow no one to see it en route. This mission is classified!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 166, 'm29p', 'Yes, the bionetic reagent analyzer! Its purpose and operation are too hard to describe to a layperson, but rest assured: This is a landmark day in the history of transformative introversional bionetics!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 167, 'm29c', 'Ah yes, the bionetic, um, reagent ... analyzer. Well. There it is. I shall pass this breakthrough along to -- to someone who will certainly appreciate its, ah, grandeur.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 168, 'm29i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 169, 'm29t', 'Imperial Chemistry Means Better Living'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 170, 'm29f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 171, 'm30o', 'A Core World laboratory has shipped us a prototype release timer suitable for gas bombs. We are to test it and report its efficacy. The prototype is ready for you to pick up and bring here. So you''d best get moving, correct?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 172, 'm30p', 'The lab recommends testing this timer using a gas volume sufficient to blanket this hemisphere to a depth of two meters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 173, 'm30c', 'A hemisphere of gas! Ah, I see the mistake. It appears the Core lab shipped us a prototype actually intended for mining operations in the Corporate Sector. (Whew!)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 174, 'm30i', 'Chemical Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 175, 'm30t', 'Gas Dispersion Weapon to Defeat Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 176, 'm30f', 'component\\chemistry\\release_mechanism_duration.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 177, 'm31o', 'The Empire is experimenting with the use of assassin droids against major Rebel leaders. One attempt recently failed, but a soldier salvaged the droid''s brain. We hope to read its memory banks for useful data on Rebel defense tactics. Retrieve the brain from the soldier and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 178, 'm31p', 'The droid was from Holowan Laboratories. Took out a Rebel squad before a cloud car rammed it at supersonic speed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 179, 'm31c', 'Ah, Holowan Technologies -- "the Friendly Technology People." I doubt this droid made friends easily. Thank you, that is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 180, 'm31i', 'Assassin Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 181, 'm31t', 'Salvage Last Memories of Imperial Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 182, 'm31f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 183, 'm32o', 'We''ve spent a fortune purifying a sample of denaric, one of the more potent poisons in the Outer Rim Territories. Fast, effective, and said to be untraceable. Now we''re ready to use it against select Rebel leaders, as soon as you retrieve the sample from our researcher.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 184, 'm32p', 'Looks like sugar, doesn''t it? Don''t touch it!  If you carry it, use this container!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 185, 'm32c', 'Soon a remarkable number of Rebellion agitators will succumb to mysterious "heart failure." You''ve done well. Tell no one of this, or you''ll regret it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 186, 'm32i', 'Pure Denaric Poison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 187, 'm32t', 'Poisonous Present for Rebel Leaders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 188, 'm32f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_sugar.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 189, 'm33o', 'An indigenous species produces a material useful for improved crowd-control entangler ammunition. The researcher who discovered this has produced a new prototype of the ammunition. Please collect the prototype ammo at once and bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 190, 'm33p', 'Yes, a local spideroid produces saliva that makes the entangler ammo even stickier and more cohesive. It''s been a laborious task collecting all that spideroid spit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 191, 'm33c', 'From humble strands, such as this spideroid''s secretion, we weave the web of cumulative power that assures victory! Excellent work, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 192, 'm33i', 'Entangler Ammo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 193, 'm33t', 'Crowd Control Ammo for Misguided Protesters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 194, 'm33f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile_entanglement.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 195, 'm34o', 'The Empire has made heavy use of rylith crystals, which store and release solar energy. We will eventually exhaust natural supplies of rylith found on the world Demophon. We are cultivating the crystals on other worlds, with limited success so far. Please collect the results of the latest trial on this world from our researcher, and bring the samples here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 196, 'm34p', 'Rylith has an uncommonly complex structure. I am investigating using valuable Tasar power crystals as seed crystals. What do you think of these samples?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 197, 'm34c', 'Hmm. Not particularly promising so far, especially with the exorbitant cost of the seed Tasar crystals. Still, we must pursue this matter. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 198, 'm34i', 'Rylith Crystals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 199, 'm34t', 'Key to Improved Blaster Efficiency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 200, 'm34f', 'component\\weapon\\energization_crystals.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 201, 'm35o', 'You there. I need you to drop what you''re doing and handle this problem. My unit is testing an experimental motivator from Talfaglio, but all my men are stuck doing wargames. That''s where you come in. Pick up this device and bring it back to me. My superior is getting impatient.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 202, 'm35p', 'You''re not from the designated test unit, are you? Never mind. Here''s the experimental motivator. Make sure it gets to the commander in one piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 203, 'm35c', 'Thanks. If I don''t get this motivator installed and tested in the next few hours, my commander will have my hide. I wonder how you install this thing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 204, 'm35i', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 205, 'm35t', 'Experimental Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 206, 'm35f', 'component\\droid\\droid_motive_system.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 207, 'm36o', 'A well-connected officer was killed by a Rebel assassin. The only witness was a binary load lifter. Our field agents have extracted the droid''s brain. I need you to bring it here so I can pass it on to Imperial Intelligence. This is very important. Do not fail.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 208, 'm36p', 'Here''s the droid brain. Don''t worry, it came from a binary load lifter, so it''s not too heavy. Lifters don''t have the biggest brains in the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 209, 'm36c', 'Very good. I''ll note your work in my report. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 210, 'm36i', 'Binary Load lifter brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 211, 'm36t', 'Retrieve Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 212, 'm36f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 213, 'm37o', 'Imperial Intelligence impounded a privately-owned probot, on the grounds that it was being used by Rebel agents. These are the coordinates where the droid is being held. Bring it back to me immediately. I''ll see if it contains any evidence that may help us locate the Rebels and uncover their criminal plots.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 214, 'm37p', 'I''d keep an eye on this probot, if I were you. It seems resistant to the restraining bolt. It definitely wants to get loose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 215, 'm37c', 'You didn''t have too much trouble, I hope? I knew you were up to the task. Now to see what this droid can tell us about its Rebel masters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 216, 'm37i', 'Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 217, 'm37t', 'Bring back a Rebel Probot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 218, 'm37f', 'mission\\mission_bounty_droid_probot.iff (or the Probot from the Creatures list)\n\nm38o\nRebels are sadistic animals. They killed several of our elite soldiers by poisoning a shipment of medpacks to Calamari. One of these contaminated packs has arrived on-planet. I want you to fetch it back to me. I''ll see if I can find any clues to the perpetrators of this cowardly plot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 219, 'm38p', 'Here''s the poisoned medpack. I know this area can be dangerous, but if anything happens to you on the way back, make sure you don''t use this medpack. Your dying screams would attract scavengers. We''d have a heck of a time finding your corpse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 220, 'm38c', 'This is the poisoned medpack, eh? How strange. I''d swear it was contaminated by Imperial Intelligence, not in some Rebel''s back-room laboratory. I''ll have to be careful who I report this to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 221, 'm38i', 'Contaminated Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 222, 'm38t', 'Transport Incriminating Medpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 223, 'm38f', 'medicine\\medpack_wound.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 224, 'm39o', 'Remember the stories about Mandalorian warriors? Imperial Intelligence found an old Mandalorian gauntlet with a unique smartrope system. Go get this interesting artifact and bring it back to me. I want to see if we can coopt the technology into some of our political enforcement operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 225, 'm39p', 'Here''s the gauntlet. Looks ridiculous, doesn''t it? What sort of peedunkel would actually wear this old stuff? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 226, 'm39c', 'Excellent. This does look interesting. Those Mandalorians had a real sense of style, didn''t they?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 227, 'm39i', 'Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 228, 'm39t', 'Deliver Mandalorian Gauntlet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 229, 'm39f', 'wearables\\armor\\mandalorian\\armor_mandalorian_bracer_l.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 230, 'm40o', 'It''s not well known that the Ubese people produced some of the most advanced personal combat equipment found in the galaxy. My commander recently obtained a bandolier of Ubese weapons from a smuggler in the radiation belt. I want you to fetch this prize and bring it to me. I''ll see if we can make any use of it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 231, 'm40p', 'Are you the courier for this Ubese bandolier? Good. It''s worth a lot of money. Holding it makes me feel like a target. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 232, 'm40c', 'Thank you. I can''t wait to try these weapons out. With luck I''ll get an excellent performance review this year!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 233, 'm40i', 'Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 234, 'm40t', 'Bring Ubese Bandolier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 235, 'm40f', 'wearables\\armor\\ubese\\armor_ubese_bandolier.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 236, 'm41o', 'They''ve made some kind of new modification to the stormtrooper helmet. I hope it lets you see better. I need to deliver one of the new prototypes to my superior. Can you fetch it from my contact and bring it to me? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 237, 'm41p', 'Here''s the new prototype stormtrooper blast helmet. They say the black quartz visors are thicker, to better repel lasers. Of course that decreases your field of vision, but hey, stormtroopers are so precise they can afford to lose a little peripheral vision, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 238, 'm41c', 'This is an improvement? Well, if they say so. I don''t get how anyone can see through these new visors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 239, 'm41i', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 240, 'm41t', 'Prototype Stormtrooper Helmet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 241, 'm41f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 242, 'm42o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have a job for you. Moff Kracko of Kreel Sector commissioned a slitherhorn from a local vendor. I had one of my subordinates make the actual purchase, and I need you to bring it to me. I''ll requisition a hyperspace transport to take it to the moff. Yes, this is the New Order''s precision war machine in action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 243, 'm42p', 'I don''t know why my commander is so cranky about this. Personally, after a long day of enforcing galactic security I feel a lot better when I hear someone play a slitherhorn. Anyway, here''s the instrument.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 244, 'm42c', 'I''m sure this task exercised all of your precision-honed skills. Now I can requisition a million-credit Imperial transport to take this slitherhorn to some governor who couldn''t be bothered to buy it in his own system. Once again the Imperial war machine makes the galaxy secure for its citizens.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 245, 'm42i', 'Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 246, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Moff''s Slitherhorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 247, 'm42f', 'instrument\\slitherhorn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 248, 'm43o', 'We''ve had reports of a biological outbreak in this area. I need you to pick up some laboratory equipment so our scientists can work on the problem. Bring the equipment here, and I''ll make sure you get a modest payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 249, 'm43p', 'Here''s the equipment. Be careful with it. There are materials inside more toxic than all the poisons on Ansion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 250, 'm43c', 'Thanks for delivering this. I hope we can contain this biological outbreak. If I were you, though, I''d consider leaving the planet for a while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 251, 'm43i', 'Biolab Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 252, 'm43t', 'Bring In Laboratory Equipment Quickly'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 253, 'm43f', 'component\\chemistry\\biologic_effect_controller.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 254, 'm44o', 'Can you believe someone still thinks projectile weapons are a viable alternative to blasters? It''s true. I''m supposed to take possession of some kind of experimental ammunition today. I need you to fetch it from my contact and bring it to me. I''ll do what I''m ordered, of course, but I still think projectile weapons are too archaic to be practical.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 255, 'm44p', 'Here''s the experimental munitions. They say these projectiles can reach near lightspeed. Sounds pretty powerful if you ask me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 256, 'm44c', 'Lightspeed projectiles? That''s ridiculous. I''ll have to test these things for myself. Anyway, thanks for a job well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 257, 'm44i', 'Experimental Projectiles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 258, 'm44t', 'Safeguard Experimental Ammunition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 259, 'm44f', 'component\\munition\\ammo_projectile.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 260, 'm45o', 'We ordered a new cooling sleeve for our laser cannon, but Logistics screwed up the dropoff. Some soldier in the middle of nowhere ended up with it. I need you to get out there and bring back my equipment before the Rebels notice that our perimeter is weakened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 261, 'm45p', 'Thank you for taking this gadget off my hands. I sure can''t use it. I dream of the day I have a laser cannon to play with.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 262, 'm45c', 'I''m glad to see you got the sleeve here in one piece. We''ve had a lot of Rebel trouble around here lately. I need to get my laser cannon back online.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 263, 'm45i', 'Laser Cannon Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 264, 'm45t', 'New Laser Cooling Sleeve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 265, 'm45f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_cannon_cooling_sleeve.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 266, 'm46o', 'You know, I''ve always said that gambling is a dangerous habit. Now the Imperial Security Bureau has proven my point. They''ve augmented a chance cube with a remote-activated explosive charge, to eliminate a local gang leader. I want you to pick up this nasty little device and bring it back to me. This goes without saying: Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 267, 'm46p', 'Make sure not to take this exploding chance cube too near a signal transmitter. The results could be unpleasant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 268, 'm46c', 'An explosive chance cube. Sometimes the ISB delights me with its creativity. I can''t wait for our inside man to give this to the gang leader. Ah, the thrill of victory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 269, 'm46i', 'Explosive Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 270, 'm46t', 'Unfavorable Chance Cube'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 271, 'm46f', 'dice\\eqp_chance_cube.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 272, 'm47o', 'Imperial Center has some new kind of survey tool that they want us to try out. One of these devices is arriving on the planet any second now. I want you to go to the pickup point, get it, and bring it back to me. I''ll see about calling in one of our surveyors to test it out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 273, 'm47p', 'I think this thing scans for noxious gases. I have no idea how it works, but here you go. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 274, 'm47c', 'Hmm. The sensor went off right when you handed it to me. What does that mean? I guess I''ll have to figure it out myself. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 275, 'm47i', 'New Surveying Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 276, 'm47t', 'Interesting Survey Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 277, 'm47f', 'survey_tool\\survey_tool_gas.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 278, 'm48o', 'Finally! Two months ago I ordered a new sighting computer for a turbolaser. Now it''s here. Can you go pick it up for me? I want to break it in shooting down a few blockade runners that have been sneaking around this quadrant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 279, 'm48p', 'Careful now. These computers can be a little imprecise at first, until they calibrate themselves to the equipment. Your turbolaser sighting might be a little off for a couple of days, so make sure you''re not shooting anywhere near friendly combatants.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 280, 'm48c', 'At last! I''ll install this on my turbolaser immediately. Some smugglers have been threading the needle between our blockade ships for two months. Now that my sighting will be back on target, I can pick off their ships without a problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 281, 'm48i', 'Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 282, 'm48t', 'Get My Turbolaser Sighting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 283, 'm48f', 'component\\weapon\\parallel_weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 284, 'm49o', 'I can''t wait to see the camouflage generators they''ve installed on the new stormtrooper armor. I hear that one of the new chest plates is making the rounds not far from here. I don''t suppose you''d want to fetch it for me, would you? I''m dying to see how good it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 285, 'm49p', 'Be very careful with this chest plate. The camouflage circuits are very delicate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 286, 'm49c', 'I don''t get it. This looks like ordinary armor. How does the camouflage work? You didn''t drop this thing on the way, did you? Or get into a firefight or something? I''ll be in deep poodoo if this chest plate is damaged.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 287, 'm49i', 'Camo Trooper Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 288, 'm49t', 'Camouflage Armor Chest Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 289, 'm49f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\blast_armor_stormtrooper_chest_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 290, 'm50o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has a new plan. They''re bugging backpacks to distribute to local children. The hope is to catch parents who are also Rebel sympathizers. Maybe we can stop a few treasonous plots. Your task is to fetch one of these backpacks to me so I can ensure its scan signature is adequately low. Go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 291, 'm50p', 'Bugging a child''s backpack. Does that seem right to you? I don''t feel good about this. It''s low, even for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 292, 'm50c', 'Our transceivers allowed us to listen when you picked up the backpack. It seems that the agent who gave it to you was less than loyal to the New Order, wouldn''t you say? I believe it is time to have a long, vigorous chat with him. As for you, thanks and carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 293, 'm50i', 'Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 294, 'm50t', 'Bring Me a Bugged Backpack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_imperial_medium.stf', 295, 'm50f', 'wearables\\backpack\\backpack_s06.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A customer claims to have received five power converters but was charged for ten. Supposedly an electronic invoice proves this. Could you pick up this alleged invoice and bring it to me? I don''t like being cheated.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'You tell that fraud that I don''t take kindly to being cheated. I''ll only pay for what I received! This invoice will prove it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'I''ll scan this disc to make sure the invoice hasn''t been tampered with. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Power Converter Invoice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm1f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Settle Power Converter Dispute'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'A colleague who bought an R2 unit motivator from me says it''s faulty and wants a refund. But I''ve offered to fix it, free of charge. Could you fetch the motivator? I''ll pay you for your time, of course. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'About time this was picked up! What good is an R2 unit with a bad motivator? Hope I can get this fixed fast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Looks okay to me. I''ll take it apart tomorrow and have a better look. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'R2 Unit Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm2f', 'filename_of_object (Small electronic gizmo)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Faulty R2 Motivator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'A friend is giving me the complete "Dance Lords of the Bith" musical recordings as long as I pick them up. Could I get you to do that? I''ll pay you, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Here ya go. I hope my buddy enjoys this collection. Some of the best clak beepbox recordings around. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'Thanks! Can''t wait to listen to these tunes. I love fizz music, don''t you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Dance Lords of the Bith'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm3f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'The Complete Dance Lords Collection'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'I forgot something of sentimental value at an acquaintance''s home. Please be so kind as to pick it up for me. You will be compensated for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Don''t know what the big deal is. They''re just holos of old droids. Guess some folks care a lot about droids. Weird, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'My thanks. I''ve developed quite an attachment to this. I''m sure you have similar items that are dear to you. Did you open the package?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Sentimental Keepsake'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'A Sentimental Journey'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'I''m a vintage weapons collector and have found someone with a rare DDC Defender blaster pistol grip. Been looking for one for years. If you pick it up for me, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'This old thing''s been sitting around my home for years. Almost threw it out half a dozen times. Glad I kept it now. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Excellent! What a wonderful find. This is for your time. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Rare blaster grip'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm5f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Help a Collector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'A customer''s protocol droid has been acting up, so I offered to perform some repairs on its Verbobrain. Could you pick it up for me? I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'I sure hope my buddy can fix this dang droid. He keeps going on about some secret mission -- stolen plans or somesuch. It gets old real fast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Thanks, citizen. I''ll get right to work on this silly droid. Probably just backed up with too much old data.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Droid Verbobrain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm6f', 'filename_of_object (Small electronic gizmo)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Defective Verbobrain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'I had loaned my macrobinoculars to a friend. Now I need them back so my son can go on a field trip. If you pick them up for me, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'Thanks for picking these up. I just couldn''t get away from work. Tell my friend I hope the field trip works well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Wonderful. Now my son will be able to study all that exotic wildlife closely. This is for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Macrobinoculars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'filename_of_object (Macrobinoculars)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Bring My Macrobinoculars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'I''ll be taking a diving trip to the resort world of Kaal soon, and a friend offered to loan me an organic gill. Catch is, I gotta pick it up. If you help me out, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'Bought this thing about a month ago from a Toydarian trader. Hope it''s still good. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Excellent! Now I''ll be able to see all those colorful deep-sea lifeforms. Do you know how long these organic gills last?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Organic Gill'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm8f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Go Get a Gill'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'My supervisor has assigned a Wookiee to my warehouse for a few months, and I need to pick up an AlienEnhancer Voxbox to make sure we avoid any mishaps. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'This has all the Basic phrases needed to keep a Wookiee under control. Good luck, I say.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'Splendid! I sure hope that Wookiee is not typical of his species. Is it true they rip people''s arms out of their sockets when angered?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'AlienEnhancer Voxbox'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm9f', 'filename_of_object (Small electronic gizmo)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Pick Up a Voxbox'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'I just attended a party, and I went wild over the host''s Fricaseed Puff Cake dessert. I forgot to get the recipe. Can you fetch it from my friend? I''ll pay you, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'Oh, the Puff Cake? My secret is to add a drop of repulsorlift engine oil. Here''s the recipe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'Mm, mmm! Repulsorlift oil!');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Fricaseed Puff Cake recipe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm10f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Better You Don''t Know'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'I heard that a friend has a sabacc deck signed by Han Solo, the hero of Yavin. I''m paying a nice price for this collector''s item. And I''ll pay you to pick it up, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Sabacc cards change value during the game. Han Solo autographed one card, but the signature vanished the next time I played. Hope my friend still wants this deck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'Not signed any more? Well, I guess it makes a good story. I''ll pay you, but as for my friend...'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Sabacc Deck'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm11f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Almost an Autograph'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'Psst! I''m interested in trying this stuff called zwil, the Drovian narcotic. I don''t trust the supplier I found. You pick up the sample, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'This zwil stuff might as well be distilled water if you''re not a Drovian. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'This is just distilled water! I''ll pay you, but I''m taking it out of my supplier''s hide! Blast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Zwil Narcotic? Or Water?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm12f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'A Thirst Quencher'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'I need a Y-wing ionization reactor control valve, and I need it fast! Can''t leave this spot, but if you bring it here, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'I guess when you need a reactor control valve, you really, really need it. Here it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'This should keep my ship from blowing itself into atoms. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Y-wing Control Valve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm13f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Parts IS Parts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'Got a special order for, get this, Ychthytonian tunics! I''d never heard of them. But I found someone who has a pattern, and I need you to get it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'Ychthytonians have four arms, so their tunics make good tablecloths. Here''s the pattern.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'Oh, I see. With four arms, the tunic even covers the table legs. Seems like overkill, but I just make the things. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Ychthytonian tunic pattern'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm14f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'It''s Sew Easy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'I''m studying Yavin 4, site of the great Battle of Yavin. I''ve located a map of the ancient tunnels connecting the Massassi ruins. Please fetch it for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'This tunnel map looks like a nerve cluster. One of the most impressive things I''ve ever seen. Can''t wait to go there!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Hmm. I wonder how anyone ever found their way from the Palace of the Woolamander to the Temple of the Blueleaf Cluster? Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Map of Massassi Tunnels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm15f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Military History'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'I need the catalog copy for my new shipment of XP-38 landspeeders. Can you contact the writer and get the text? I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'I don''t exactly have the catalog copy ready, but here''s a lengthy ode I composed to the XP-38 landspeeder. It''s wonderful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'This is why nobody employs poets to write ad copy. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Ode to an XP-38 Landspeeder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm16f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'Ode to a Landspeeder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'A buddy of mine just got a bootleg of 2-RI the Singing Droid''s last concert! If you bring it here, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'Droid music sounds like Aqualiths gargling ground glass in a garbage masher. Here, take it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'This music is so bad it''s hilarious. Wait''ll my next party! People will run from the room screaming!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Music by 2-RI the Singing Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm17f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Party Dance Mix?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'I''ve been exchanging love letters with an anonymous individual. We use pseudonyms and have agreed not to meet face-to-face until we''re sure this is right for both of us. Could you pick up my latest letter?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'You know what my beloved looks like, don''t you? Don''t tell me! I want nothing to spoil my fantasy. Here''s the letter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'The letter at last! And it''s even scented! I hope that doesn''t damage the disc. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Love Letters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm18f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'True Romance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'My nephew has very specific (and expensive) tastes when it comes to celebrating his birthday. I need someone to bring me this little hellion''s wish list. Think you can help? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'Everything the boy wants is on this disc. It''s a long list. The things he wants most are indicated by the flashing stars. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'Thanks. How do you explain to a spoiled five-year-old that they don''t make stormtrooper armor in his size? If you have siblings, make sure they don''t breed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Gift List'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm19f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Next He''ll Want a Wookiee'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'My friend is worried someone will steal a precious baked fleek-eel casserole recipe, and refuses to send it via the HoloNet. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'Make sure this goes straight to the requestor. The disc is encoded, and only my friend knows how to retrieve the information, so don''t get any funny ideas.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'Thanks, citizen. Now I''ll see what all the fuss was about. Wait, is this disc encoded?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Family recipe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm20f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Top Secret'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'A customer wants me to touch up some holographs taken during a recent vacation. Could you pick them up for me? I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'Remind the holo technician that I want more attractive dancers surrounding me. Also, have them give me a better wardrobe. My clothes look sadly unfashionable. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'I hope this customer understands I can''t peform miracles. These "tailored memories" are becoming a habit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Vacation Holographs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm21f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Thanks for the Memories'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'I know it may be in bad taste, but my son really wants a toy lightsaber for his birthday. A friend made one for me using holo technology. It''s really quite clever and harmless. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'Here it is. I would caution the boy not to play with this outside. The Imperials are not likely to think the toy is a cute novelty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'Thank you so much. My son will love playing with this. And yes, I''ll be sure he only plays with it inside our home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Toy Lightsaber'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 131, 'm22f', 'filename_of_object (Small lightsaber-like gadget)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Not So Random as a Toy Blaster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'A friend has sold me a small box of Cardellian mints. What a sweet tooth I have! If you pick them up for me, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'These are quite rich. Warn my friend that eating too many of them in one sitting can cause nausea.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'Oh yummy! Thank you so much. I''d offer you one, but I have so few here. Plus, I am paying you for this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Box of Candy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 137, 'm23f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Sweets for the Sweet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'My kloo-horn is in need of a new double reed. I found one at a very reasonable price. Could I pay you to collect it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I could never get my kloo-horn to sound right. I hope it wasn''t a problem with this double reed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'Thanks, citizen. I''ll compose a solo in your honor. I''ll call it "The Reed Bringer." Gonzo, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Kloo-Horn Double Reed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 143, 'm24f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'Play That Funky Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'A friend of mine makes the most delicious cookies. Could you bring me a plate of those round morsels of scrumptious goodness? I''ll pay you. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'These are nice and fresh. They taste best when dipped in icy cold blerd milk. Mmm, mmm... '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'Thanks, citizen! I''ll enjoy these confectionary delights right now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Plate of Cookies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 149, 'm25f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_dish_desert_plate_of_cookies.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Cookie Monster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'As I''m a specialist, my services aren''t cheap, so I was surprised when a customer asked me to repair a simple mouse droid. Must mean a whole lot to this client -- my bill will likely exceed the cost of the droid. Do you think you could pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Here he is. Tell the technician that money is no object. I want this special little mouse droid fixed at any cost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'It looks like a pretty standard mouse droid to me. Oh well, it''s the client''s money. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 5, 'm1f', 'filename_of_object (Mouse droid)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Like a Member of the Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'My grandfather died recently and left his will on an encrypted datadisc that only I can access. Could you pick this up for me? It''s most important to my family.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Here is the will. The encryption used should prove the document is legitimate. If there are any questions, the family should contact me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Thank you. This has been hard enough without all my cousins squabbling over my grandfather''s properties. This should settle everything.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Last Will and Testament'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 11, 'm2f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Being of Sound Mind'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'I''m under investigation for suspected Rebel activity. I''m innocent, honest, and I''ve identified documents that can clear my name. Please bring them at once. My life depends on it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'I hope these ship logs can save my friend. I send my best wishes along.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'Thank you so much. I''m sure these logs will satisfy the Imperial agents working on my case. I would never betray the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Ship Logs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 17, 'm3f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Loyal to a Fault'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'My daughter is about to make the biggest mistake of her life -- she''s going to marry a criminal. But finally, I found proof of the rogue''s activities. I need you to fetch some holographs and help save my daughter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Some of these holographs are pretty graphic. I''d warn that poor girl before she views these.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'My deepest gratitude! Now my daughter will see the truth and be free of that ruffian for good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Incriminating Holographs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'A Protective Parent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'I''m a legitimate business owner whose enemies have tried to use some doctored holographs to blackmail me. Please pick up the last of these phony images from a collection agent I employed recently.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Tell your patron not to worry about these blackmailers any more, and that I''ll expect the balance of my pay by tomorrow.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Thank you. It''s a shame when honest entrepreneurs like myself are dragged through the mud by jealous rivals. Thank goodness for troubleshooters like yourself. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Doctored Holographs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 29, 'm5f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Blackmail'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'My father has languished in an Imperial prison for months, falsely accused of conspiring with rebels. I finally found definitive proof of his innocence. I''m unable to travel to collect it myself. Could you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'I hope this sets that poor man free, but I wouldn''t count it. The Empire doesn''t like to acknowledge mistakes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Thanks to you, my father will be free again. Here is your just reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Proof of Innocence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 35, 'm6f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Wrongfully Accused'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'My uncle was robbed while vacationing on Nal Hutta and needs a new Imperial identification document to return home. Could you pick up his new doc for me? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'Citizens should be more careful with these. Haven''t you ever heard of identity theft?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Thanks. I cautioned my uncle against vacationing on a system run by Hutts. I hope he learns from this experience.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Imperial ID Document'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Identity Theft'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'I made a large wager that the Boonta Eve Classic podrace on Tatooine was once won by a human boy. I''ve located an old hologram recording of the event that proves this. Think you could pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'This is a multi-generational copy so the quality is not so good. But you can definitely tell that a human boy wins the race.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Thanks! I''ll show those fools they shouldn''t take risky wagers with me. Haha!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Podrace Recording'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 47, 'm8f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Whatever Happened to That Kid?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'A close relative is dying of an ailment hereditary in our line. But I''ve just received word of a cure, a tailored retrovirus. I beg of you, get that cure!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'This retrovirus must be kept sealed and intact until it reaches the victim. Hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'Thank you! A thousand thanks -- and please accept this reward. I''ll have the retrovirus relayed to my relative at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'Tailored Retroviral Cure'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 53, 'm9f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Genetic Defect'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'A scoundrel trifled with my sister''s honor, then fled the planet. A friend has compiled a list of his secret movements. Bring it here, no matter the cost!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'With this data, a good bounty hunter can track the rogue who treated that innocent female so badly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'It warms my spirit to know that the rascal will soon be in custody. Thank you, many thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Record of Scoundrel''s Movements'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 59, 'm10f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'A Roguish Scoundrel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'An acquaintance has compiled data on a certain mining company''s practices in this sector. I need that data, and I''ll pay very well to get it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'The stories here of the mistreatment of miners will chill your forebrain. That mining company must be stopped!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'Thank you! With this information, I can expose this rampant wage-slavery and bring down the company!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Mining Company Personnel Data'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 65, 'm11f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Mistreated Miners'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'Certain data, too sensitive for HoloNet transmission, has become available. I''ll pay you well to be my courier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'A word to the wise: While holding this disc, you''d be well advised to avoid Imperial entanglements.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'I can tell you this much: If this plan works, don''t invest heavily in Imperial tracking devices any time soon. That''s all for now, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Data of Imperial Interest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 71, 'm12f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Avoid Imperials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'Galactic communications will be revolutionized once you bring me the new prototype comlink my researchers developed offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'We''re still having some range problems with this comlink. Treat it carefully, it''s a prototype.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'Hello, hello, can you hear me? Hello? Hmm. Still needs work, apparently. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Prototype Comlink'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 77, 'm13f', 'filename_of_object (Comlink)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Is This Thing On?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'A great Bith musician has passed on. I''ve procured some of his irreplacable memorabilia. Out here, it''s worth a fortune! Can you fetch it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'This is the container that collector wants, but I don''t understand. I opened it, and it was empty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'This was the musician''s last breath, caught in this container! It has religious and ritual significance in certain cultures. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Bith Musician Memorabilia?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 83, 'm14f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Last Gasp'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'Messages transmitted within the Hutt criminal empire use unique codes. My source has cracked one code. Please get that data, but keep it quiet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'With this code my client can stop most of the Hutt criminal traffic in this sector. I hope so. Be careful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Thanks! If this code should find its way back to Jabba the Hutt -- well, I expect I''d get his gratitude and a nice reward. We''ll see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Hutt code'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 89, 'm15f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Crime Stopper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'The infamous Twi''lek adventurer known only as O-i is in this sector. My supplier has found something important of his. I''ll pay you to bring it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'That O-i is the terror of the spaceways, they say. I have his personal tentacle lotion here. Yes, his own lotion!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'I don''t know why, but some folks will pay a bundle for this junk.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Tentacle Lotion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 95, 'm16f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'For Unmanageable Tentacles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'There are poisons, and then there''s the poisonous sliideptra worm of Tel IV. I''ve located a sample of the worm''s poison. Please fetch it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'Poison? No, this is sliideptra saliva. It liquefies the victim slowly for easy ingestion. I hope my client can use it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'Saliva? Liquefies the victim? Hmm. Say, that might work even better. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Sliideptra Worm Saliva'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 101, 'm17f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'As Long as It''s Bad For You'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'An investor has found important financing for my struggling business. Will you play courier and bring the documents here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'Documents? My client has misunderstood. Take this container back. Don''t try to open it, or the contents will vaporize.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'This is -- why, it looks like aurodium! A fabulous half-gram ingot! I''m rich! Wait, what does my investor expect to get out of this? Hmm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Business Financing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 107, 'm18f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'The Big Payoff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'You know Garnib crystals? Brilliant ice sculptures. I''ve finally purchased one, and I need you to bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'Don''t look too long at the light reflecting from the crystals. It''s said to be psychologically addicting.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'I''ve got it at last! Look at the light -- the light --'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Garnib Crystal Sculpture'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 113, 'm19f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Stay Away From the Light'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'I need a courier to retrieve a green diamond from a late friend''s estate. Can you get it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'Don''t open the container. Those green diamonds are valuable, and said to be beautiful, but their radiation kills you in three breaths.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'Thank you. This was something of a going-away present, you might say, for a former friend. Ah well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Green Diamond'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 119, 'm20f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Say it With Diamonds'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'I''m so far from home, I desperately miss my pet voorpak! I don''t trust the shipping services. Can you bring me my beloved Lotti?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'The little thing died of Big Spot Sickness some time back. Here are its ashes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'Oh, poor Lotti! Here, take your money and go! Lotti, Lotti!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Ashes of Voorpak'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 125, 'm21f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Special Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'At last my supplier has located an antique from the time of Xim the Despot. Please bring it to me, and I''ll pay you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'This ancient subspace relay uses the old mytag crystal vertices. It''s fragile, but the container is padded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'This is a tremendous find! I''ll donate it to an Imperial history museum and gain the Empire''s favor. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Antique Subspace Relay'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 131, 'm22f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Built to Last'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'I found someone who owns a Tasari crystal. They were formed in a cataclysmic meteor shower eons ago. Can you fetch the crystal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'An unusual item. The Tasari used to perform blood sacrifices to these crystals, to forestall more meteor showers. I guess it worked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'A Tasari crystal! What an ornament for my collection. Thank you, thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Tasari Crystal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 137, 'm23f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Crystal Collector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'My rich old aunt may like me better if I give her a nice gift. I''ve placed an order with a supplier of exotic art objects. Can I hire you to bring the order here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'Wintrium! It spent ten thousand years solidifying under the Derelkoos Desert, and now it''s a beautiful natural sculpture. A lesson for us all, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'I don''t care what it looks like. I just hope my old aunt does, so she leaves me a nice nest-egg in her will. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Wintrium Sculpture'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 143, 'm24f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'A Thoughtful Gift'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'I do a good business restoring old musical instruments. I need you to bring me a client''s broken Ommni Box. I''ll pay you and bill the client.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'I hate having to ship my instrument all that way, but hardly ten folks in the galaxy can repair an instrument this old and valuable. Formerly valuable, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'Not worth much now that it''s broken, hmm? I expect I can restore it to full working order. They don''t make them like this any more!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Broken Ommni Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 149, 'm25f', 'instrument\\ommni_box.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Don''t Make Them Like They Used To'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Our work in the mines can be dangerous. I need a field cauterizer to treat injuries. My supplier got one very cheap but needs someone to pick it up. If you lend a hand, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'These were supposedly inferior models, but I''ve had no problems with them so far. Make sure it''s kept fully charged at all times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Thank you kindly. Here''s your pay as promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Field Cauterizer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 5, 'm1f', 'filename_of_object (Small medical instrument)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Safety First'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Always like to keep a medpac around the shop, in case of injuries. Used the last one to treat a nasty burn. If you pick up a new one for me, I''ll pay you for the delivery.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Medpacs are quite handy. No such thing as too many of them, you know. Your patron''s a smart being.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Thank you, citizen. I can now rest easy knowing my workers'' needs are covered. Go have a nice meal on me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Medpac'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 11, 'm2f', 'medicine\\medpack_damage.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Medical Needs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'I sold a citizen some field cauterizers. Now it seems they were defective and I have to issue a refund. If you pick them up for me, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Darn things did more harm than good. The laser was malfunctioning and burned the patient severely. That medical supplier should be arrested!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'Thanks. I bet that fool didn''t keep these things fully charged like I said. Brain-dead buyers shouldn''t blame me for their incompetence.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Field Cauterizer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 17, 'm3f', 'filename_of_object (Small medical instrument)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Defective Cauterizers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'My buddy and I have taken a job hunting dangerous predators in the wilderness. We need a DuraShelter for our trip. I found one cheap, but we need it picked up immediately. Can you help? We''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'I''ve been selling quite a few of these DuraShelters to hunters recently. Is this the latest Imperial fad?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'Thanks, pal. This job is supposed to pay a lot of credits. You might want to look into it yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'DuraShelter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Wilderness Survival Gear'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'My partner and I will be undertaking a delicate mission soon and we need reliable comlinks. My partner has a couple of C1''s and insists we use them. Could you pick it up for me so we can test them? We''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Good comlinks are the key to success in secret missions, you know. Make sure my buddy keeps this comlink on at all times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Thanks, friend. We''re gonna be famous some day. You just watch. Oh, right, I was gonna pay you, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Comlink'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 29, 'm5f', 'filename_of_object (Comlink)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Good Equipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'I found a blaster repair kit real cheap on the HoloNet. Can''t get away from my chores right now, so I need someone to pick it up for me. I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'Blaster repair kit? Oh, right. Here you go. Might be missing a few static pulse adapter modules. Why do you think it was so cheap?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Great, thanks. Been looking for a used kit for months. These things aren''t cheap, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Blaster Repair Kit '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 35, 'm6f', 'filename_of_object (Small kit)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'There''s Always a Catch'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'A customer''s vibrodagger recently stopped working. Apparently it was some sort of gift or award for valor, so it has great sentimental value. If you pick it up for me, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'Please take good care of this. It has seen a lot of action and has served me well. I''d hate to lose this excellent weapon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Thanks, citizen. I''ll look at it and see what I can do. I know how attached we can become to our things. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Vibrodagger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 41, 'm7f', 'filename_of_object (Vibrodagger)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Sentimental Value'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'I intend to do some prospecting on Bespin, and I need a good breath mask. Found one on the HoloNet for a very reasonable price, but I need someone to pick it up for me. Could you do that? I''d make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'Here you go. Hope it brings the new owner better luck than the last one. Used to belong to a prospector, I believe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Thanks, citizen. I think the life of a prospector will be much better than a nerf herder, wouldn''t you agree? Here''s your promised payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Breath Mask'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 47, 'm8f', 'filename_of_object (Breath mask)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Full Circle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'I bought a droid from a friend recently, but I forgot to get the caller for the restraining bolt. Could you pick it up for me? I''m waiting on another delivery or else I''d go myself. I''ll compensate you for your time. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'Here it is. Personally, I think my friend should just have put on a new restraining bolt and bought a new caller. They''re cheap!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'Thanks so much. No use in spending more money on a caller when this droid already had one, right? Here''s a little something for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'Droid Caller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 53, 'm9f', 'filename_of_object (Small electronic gizmo)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Frugality'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'My chores are preventing me from picking up some power converters. I need them really badly. Could you pick some up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'I''m fresh out of power converters, but I should be getting some new models later this month. Here''s our newest catalog. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'No power converters? Argh. Well, I suppose this catalog makes your trip worth the pay. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Speeder Catalog'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 59, 'm10f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'The Next Best Thing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'A friend has sold me a couple of peko-peko eggs. I love exotic pets. Could you pick them up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Here they are. Tell my friend they taste better poached than scrambled. Best hurry, though, as I don''t know how much longer those will keep.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'Thank you so much! I''ll put these in my incubator immediately. Hey, don''t these seem a bit cold to you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Peko-Peko Eggs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 65, 'm11f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Pets or Meat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'My friend has collected all of the banned HoloNet stories concerning an amazing little mouse droid. If you pick those up for me, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'Here''s the disc. My friend didn''t happen to suggest I was a data slicer or anything like that? Because that''s not me, nossir. You''re not an Imperial agent, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'Great! Now I can catch up on that daring little droid''s adventures. Thanks for getting this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Mouse Droid Adventures'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 71, 'm12f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'The Legend Lives On'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'Having just purchased a small settlement in the countryside of Naboo, I require the deed to the property. If you collect it for me, I''ll compensate you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'I hope the buyer enjoys fields full of shaaks, because that''s all that''s out there -- nothing but stupid, bleating grazers. Still, it is peaceful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'My thanks. I''ve been looking forward to a nice retirement in a quiet rural location. I''m not really suited to this bustling life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Property Deed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 77, 'm13f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Goodbye, City Life'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'I didn''t realize I needed a license to own a narglatch. Well, I certainly don''t wish to run afoul of the law, so I''ve decided to get one. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'I wish citizens would realize just how dangerous these beasts can be. If I had ten credits for every narglatch owner who''s ended up a meal for their "pet" --'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'Thanks, citizen. Young narglatches are so darn cute, aren''t they? Do you own any exotic pets?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Pet Narglatch License'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 83, 'm14f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Disaster Waiting to Happen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'I''ve managed to get my hands on two tickets to the popular circus "Galactic Menagerie Spectacular Spectacular." If you collect them for me, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'Tell the buyer to expect a treat. I especially love the acrobatic feats of The Flying Twi''lek Octuplets. Great stuff. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Many thanks, citizen. My mate and I will have such a good time. You should go if you ever get the chance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Circus Tickets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 89, 'm15f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Sucker Born Every Minute');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'I want to tell my true love about my feelings, but I''m an incompetent wretch. Fortunately, I know an unemployed poet. Could you pick up my latest batch of love poems for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'Alas, it is my curse to write love poetry for others'' mates and never for one of my own. That''s what comes of having a face only a blind mother would love.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'Thanks. These poems sure do the trick. I was never lucky in love until I started using these sonnets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Love Poems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 95, 'm16f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'Don''t Mention His Nose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'Nobody told me a monkey-lizard would be so much work. I returned mine after one day. Could you pick up my refund certificate for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'This is exactly why we make all potential owners watch our holovid "The Pleasures & Challenges of Monkey-Lizards." I guess this buyer fell asleep during the screening.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'I saw the crummy video, but I just assumed it was farcical entertainment. Who really expects a pet to hurl its own waste?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Refund Certificate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 101, 'm17f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Challenging Monkey-Lizard'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'My investigator has uncovered evidence of the Black Sun criminal syndicate''s operations on this world. Go get it for me, fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'Uhh -- B-black Sun? Never heard of them. No. I just have this nice recording of Wookiee hero-sagas. Here, take it. No Black Sun evidence here!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'This sounds like a chorus of growling stomachs. Those Black Sun crooks got to my investigator before I did (sigh).'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Wookiee Hero-Sagas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 107, 'm18f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'No Such Thing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'A relative turned up legal evidence that will let us reclaim our family homestead from the bank. I''ll pay you to bring it here, fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'The bank said we still owed money on our land, but this receipt proves Great-Grandpa paid it off, way back in Old Republic days.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'This receipt means I can leave this disgusting place and go back home -- once the law courts approve, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Old Bank Receipt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 113, 'm19f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'The Family Estate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'I''ve been informed of a research breakthrough that will make my business famous. Please fetch the data for me, and I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'It almost cost me my life, but I''ve got it at last: the real recipe for the bantha blaster drink served only in Jabba the Hutt''s palace!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'Citizens will come from all over this city to drink this and get totally schnozzled. I''m rich!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Bantha Blaster Drink Recipe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 119, 'm20f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'I''m Sure Jabba Won''t Mind'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'I''m getting back at someone who did me wrong. Nothing dangerous, just clever. I want you to pick up the last item I need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'Can''t understand who would want a dormant swarm of Belvarian fire-gnats. These things are nasty!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'Just a little group of visitors for my enemy''s next formal dinner party. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Belvarian Fire-Gnats (Dormant)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 125, 'm21f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'A Friendly Rivalry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'I''ve learned of evidence that will disrupt Hutt smuggling lanes throughout this sector. This is a big find! Fetch it for me quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'Umm, "Hutt smuggling"? I thought my friend meant "house smuggling." These are records of local residential construction using illegal permits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'Must have been a bad connection. Well, this can still shut down a couple of local crooks. That''s something, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Evidence of Illegal House-Building'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 131, 'm22f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Speak Clearly'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Taxation is driving me to ruin. I just learned I have to get some new forms to avoid an audit. I need them fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'A citizen who has nothing to hide has no reason to avoid submitting these forms.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'Why should any official care how many shoes I own? It makes no sense!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Tax Forms'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 137, 'm23f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Be Thankful They Don''t Take it All'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'Ocean mud imported from Bimmisaari is supposed to have medicinal effects. Can you pick up a supply from my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'Bimmisaari mud is only supposed to help regrow missing limbs. Was my friend missing an arm, maybe?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'This mud is for my little monkey-lizard, Graak. He fell into a garbage masher. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Bimmisaari Ocean Mud'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 143, 'm24f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'A Farewell to Arms'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'I know it''s silly, but I need you to fetch a recording of bad jokes. It''s quite important. Please go quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'I listened to some of these. They''re tasteless and revolting jokes about the Emperor. Why would my friend want them?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'These jokes are told by a Moff who needs a comedown. When this recording gets out, he''ll be relocated to the Outer Rim.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Bad Jokes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 149, 'm25f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Poor Choice of Words'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'An important cannister has just come for me from the planet Umgul. I''ll pay you well if you bring it here promptly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'There''s nothing in this cannister but grayish green ooze. I think the buyer has lost all reason.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 153, 'm26c', 'With these thoroughbred blobs, I''ll establish Umgul blob racing as this world''s next big sport. I''ll get rich making book on these racing blobs!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 154, 'm26i', 'Oozing Blobs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 155, 'm26f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Post Time'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'I''m with local law enforcement, and I''ve just ordered a list of known bounty hunters in the area. Get this list for me, and I''ll put a stop to those scoundrels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'Your patron actually wants that list in order to hire a bounty hunter for some nasty work. I think this should serve better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 159, 'm27c', 'Here''s your fee. Thanks. Hey, wait! This is just a copy of the Bounty Hunter''s Creed! Argh!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 160, 'm27i', 'Bounty Hunter Data'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 161, 'm27f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'Important Information'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'I''ll be travelling to Brubb soon, and etiquette demands that I present a guest-gift to my host. Can you fetch the gift my friend found?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'It''s tricky, the protocol on Brubb. But this might help my friend make a splash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 165, 'm28c', 'I never would have thought of it -- candied butcherbugs! This should work fine, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 166, 'm28i', 'Brubb Guest-Gift'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 167, 'm28f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Say It With Butcherbugs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'My business has had money trouble, but just in time, I''ve lined up financing. I need you to fetch the documents, urgently!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'My friend''s financing relied on certain collateral stored for safekeeping, but the items have vanished. Deliver this message to my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 171, 'm29c', '"I.O.U. -- Sincerely, Lando Calrissian." Who in the galaxy is Lando Calrissian? My smuggling business is ruined!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 172, 'm29i', 'Financing Message'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 173, 'm29f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'A Valuable Autograph'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'I did a favor for a friend in a shady line of work, and now I''m told my reward is ready. I trust you more than my friend, so could you pick it up?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'That "favor" just about brought the Imperials down on me. Here''s a nice gift for my buddy. Go on, it''s not dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 177, 'm30c', 'A first-class ship ticket! Wow! To -- let''s see -- "the Great Pit of Carkoon" on Tatooine. What''s the Great Pit of Carkoon? Any idea?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 178, 'm30i', 'Reward From Shady Buddy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 179, 'm30f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'A Free Vacation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'I''m producing a high-quality map of Chandrila, homeworld of the Alliance leader Mon Mothma. Please bring me the latest map data.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'I had the map data for my friend, but a couple of Imperials took it and told me to pass along this disk instead.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 183, 'm31c', 'It''s -- a tourist map of Coruscant, the Imperial throneworld? Oh. Okay, I take the hint. No Chandrila map!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 184, 'm31i', 'Message to Chandrila Mapmaker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 185, 'm31f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Maybe He Should Reconsider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'I need you to fetch the newly decoded cliffborer worm genome. Yes, I''m paying a lot for it, but humor me. It''s quite important, so be quick.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'Yes, here at last is the -- what did my friend call it? -- the cliff worm genome, yes. It''s very important. Be quick and you''ll be paid well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 189, 'm32c', 'At last! The Imperial -- uh, I mean, the cliffborer worm genome! Thank you, friend of the Alli-- I mean, of Science!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 190, 'm32i', 'Cliffborer Worm Genome'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 191, 'm32f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Espionage For Dummies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'Did you know the Imperial throneworld, Coruscant, has forty-story construction droids? I plan to build one here. Could you get the plans from my supplier?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'I have the construction droid plans here -- along with an estimate of how much it will cost to build the droid.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 195, 'm33c', 'Uhh! Oh my, that''s a lot of money. Hmm. Uh, thanks for your time. Here''s your fee -- unless you''ll settle for less. Hmm, this may not work....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 196, 'm33i', 'Construction Droid Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 197, 'm33f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'The Entrepreneur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'I need the survey results of taste tests of my new beverage, Corelli-Cola. Could you check on whether it''s ready?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'Cola? That stuff could work as repulsorlift engine oil, maybe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 201, 'm34c', 'Gaah! And I''d planned a big product rollout this month! Well, back to the lab.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 202, 'm34i', 'Corelli-Cola Test Results'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 203, 'm34f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 204, 'm34t', 'Blind Taste Tests'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'A local museum needs Krayt Pearls for an exhibit. I''ve found a supplier. Can you fetch the pearls?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'Here you go. They''re not real pearls -- they''re the krayt dragon''s gizzard stones, which it uses to digest its food.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 207, 'm35c', 'Gizzard stones? Oh, yucch! I wonder if the museum knows this?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 208, 'm35i', 'Krayt Pearls'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 209, 'm35f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'The Latest Exhibit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'My supplier has secured a valuable trophy, taken in struggle with some native savage. I''d love to add it to my collection. Would you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'It''s a combat trophy. Made by the Sand People of Tatooine, the Tusken Raiders. Vicious fighters. They''d probably kill me for selling these gloves!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 213, 'm36c', 'Hmm. If anyone found out I own these... I may have to resell them. Quickly. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 214, 'm36i', 'Tusken Raider Gloves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 215, 'm36f', 'wearables\\gloves\\gloves_tusken_raider.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'A Careful Collector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'For a local holiday my people like to celebrate with a mug of Corellian spiced ale. If you''ll bring me a supply, I''ll show my festive spirit by paying you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'The way to drink this during the holiday is to stand on one leg on a table, swallow it all in one gulp, and try not to fall and break your neck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 219, 'm37c', 'What a holiday season this will be! I hope the fatality rate is lower this time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 220, 'm37i', 'Corellian Spiced Ale'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 221, 'm37f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_drink_corellian_spiced_ale.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Holiday Tradition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'My serving droid has started twitching and muttering to itself. A memory wipe hasn''t helped. Can you get a new droid brain from my supplier?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Yeah, if you let a crazy droid go too long, it might start meticulously disassembling itself. Not pretty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 225, 'm38c', 'Not a moment too soon. My droid has been asking for tools so it can remove its foot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 226, 'm38i', 'Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 227, 'm38f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Twitchy the Wonder Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'For a money-making operation here, I need some highly customized equipment. It''s very small but priceless. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'Delicately worked, faultlessly crafted! You won''t find chance cubes this carefully loaded anywhere else in this sector.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 231, 'm39c', 'Thanks! Predictable rolling behavior immensely improves my financial opportunities.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 232, 'm39i', 'Chance Cubes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 233, 'm39f', 'dice\\eqp_chance_dice.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Sapient Needs a New Pair of Shoes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'For my insect collection I''ve just bought preserved specimens of a chiru swarm, from the planet Socorro. I need you to pick them up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'These chiru bugs are vicious. They swarm repulsorlift engines in huge numbers. "Chiru" means "deadly" in Socorran!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 237, 'm40c', 'Uhh -- why is this container buzzing? These chiru bugs are dead, right? I''ll just open it up and check --'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 238, 'm40i', 'Chiru Insect Swarm'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 239, 'm40f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Insect Collection'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'I asked to have a particular genome sequenced, and the results are in. Too sensitive for transmission, though. Can you bring the disc here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'I don''t know why my client paid so much to get this insect''s genome sequenced. It''s a "Karran Mantis," whatever that is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 243, 'm41c', 'The Karran Mantis grows to the size of an Imperial walker. Only one survives, and there''s nothing else like it in the galaxy. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 244, 'm41i', 'Karran Mantis Genome'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 245, 'm41f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Life Is in the Details'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'I have an investigator tracking the whereabouts of Imperial fugitives. I sell this data to bounty hunters. Can you pick up the newest findings?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'Onibald Daykim, a former bank employee on Coruscant, accidentally put the Emperor on a public list of defaulters. You won''t believe where he fled.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 249, 'm42c', 'An entire city of fugitive bureaucrats in the lowest underground levels of the Imperial throneworld! Fascinating, but it does me no good out here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 250, 'm42i', 'Feral Bureaucrat Data'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 251, 'm42f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Mistake In Judgement'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'My brother''s wedding anniversary is coming up and I''d like to give him a bottle of fine Corellian brandy. If you could pick it up for me I''d make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'This is some fine stuff. Tell the buyer to make sure it''s served warm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 255, 'm43c', 'Thanks, friend. My brother will need this if he''s to survive another year with that harridan.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 256, 'm43i', 'Corellian Brandy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 257, 'm43f', 'filename_of_object (Corellian brandy)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'For Medicinal Purposes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'My great aunt died and left me a family heirloom. I''m not quite sure what it is, but I need to pick it up or it''ll be given to another relative. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'It was the aunt''s wish that this be worn by the eldest female member of the family. Make sure to say that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 261, 'm44c', 'The eldest female? Hmm, I wonder what it could be? I know my great aunt was fond of jewelry. Thanks for getting this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 262, 'm44i', 'Family Heirloom'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 263, 'm44f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Family Heirloom'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'I''d found a bunch of old family holovids that had been damaged in storage. I''ve gotten them restored and need them picked up. Think you could help me out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'Some of the data was irrecoverable, unfortunately, but I got most of it. The customer should be pleased.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 267, 'm45c', 'Thanks! Now I''ll finally be able to see what was on those old discs. I think some of them date back to the Old Republic. I hope they mention the Clone Wars.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 268, 'm45i', 'Family Holovids'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 269, 'm45f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Say It With Holovids'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'I have specific tastes when it comes to clothes. Could you pick up some exotic dyes for me? I special-ordered them, but delivery was apparently not included in the price.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'These dyes are highly concentrated so a little goes a long way. Tell the customer to be careful, or else the dyes may damage the fabric.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 273, 'm46c', 'Excellent! Thanks so much. Do you know how hard it is to get nebula blue just right? That luminescent effect isn''t easy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 274, 'm46i', 'Clothing Dye'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 275, 'm46f', 'component\\chemistry\\dye_clothing.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'To Dye For'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'A young musician wants me to listen to an audition. I have some contacts in the music recording industry and might be able to help. Could you pick up this recording for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Here they are, thanks. Make sure that special attention is paid to track three, entitled "The Bantha Boogie."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 279, 'm47c', 'I sure hope this being has some talent. I''ve started to despair for the fate of modern music in the Empire. This is for your troubles.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 280, 'm47i', 'Musical Audition'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 281, 'm47f', 'mission\\mission_datadisk.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'The Next Max Rebo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'I recently ordered a batch of fleek-eel eggs. I''m trying to go into business by breeding them. If you can pick them up, I''d pay you for your kindness.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Here you go. Make sure to open this container in a sealed room while dressed in protective gear. The buyer did want skekfish eggs, right? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 285, 'm48c', 'Skekfish eggs? What the blazes are those? I''d better open this and make sure there hasn''t been a mistake.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 286, 'm48i', 'Exotic eggs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 287, 'm48f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Not For Eating'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'I collect rare crystals, and I found one for a bargain price on the HoloNet. Delivery wasn''t part of the deal, unfortunately. If you pick it up for me, I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Got this from my uncle, who was a prospector working in the Outer Rim. I think he called it an Ilum crystal or something like that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 291, 'm49c', 'Thanks. Can''t wait to identify this crystal. With my luck, it''ll probably end up being something really common.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 292, 'm49i', 'Ilum Crystal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 293, 'm49f', 'filename_of_object (Small sealed container)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Life Can''t Really Be This Cruel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'At long last, a bottle of Whisper perfume has become available. I''ve been looking for this fragrance for months. Could you pick it up for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'This is strong stuff. Just a little dab will do. It is called "whisper" after all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 297, 'm50c', 'A thousand thanks, friend. I''ll be able to resell this to select clientele and make a fortune. This is for your troubles.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 298, 'm50i', 'Bottle of Perfume'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 299, 'm50f', 'filename_of_object (Small bottle)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Just Whisper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_neutral_medium.stf', 301, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'One of our troops apparently collected a trophy off a fallen Imperial soldier. We''re not fighting the Empire to collect souvenirs. I know a few units that allow it, but not this one. Go and get the souvenir, while I prepare a lecture about showing some class.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Why is it wrong to take trophies? They''re bad guys, right? If they''re dead, they can''t use their gear any more, so why not take a nice souvenir? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'If any Alliance soldier is treating civil war like a hunting trip, we have a lot of education to do. Thanks, I''ll have this helmet destroyed as usual.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Stormtrooper Trophy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Alliance Shouldn''t Collect Trophies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Some of our bravest Alliance members are those who infiltrate the Empire''s ranks to bring us vital intelligence. We just had a sad report that one Imperial Navy spy has been caught. The Empire apparently sent his ring to his next of kin, an insolent gesture intended to humiliate them. We have other plans for that ring. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'My friend risked his life every day to help the cause of freedom. After this smug gesture by the Empire, it turns out his ring can still do some good for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'The Empire didn''t discover that this ring conceals a HoloNet receiver. Our spy used it to eavesdrop on a Star Destroyer''s bridge. We hope we can continue his good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Infiltrator''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Proof of Heroism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'The last stormtroopers we defeated were using projectile weapons with insane rates of fire. Our field techs inspected the weapons, and they believe the Empire has developed an improved feed mechanism. Bring us one of these improved mechanisms for analysis, and we''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'I''ve never seen why anyone would use projectile weapons in a galaxy full of blasters, but this engagement changed my mind. Here''s the new feed mechanism.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'We''ll pass this along to the engineers for study. Meanwhile, thanks for your time, and take this for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Projectile Feed Mechanism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Insane Rates of Fire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\weapon\\projectile_feed_mechanism.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We just took out an Imperial armory, but barely. Their defenses seemed unsually powerful. We salvaged a power module from a destroyed weapon, and our lab wants to analyze it for technical breakthroughs. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'This module comes from a Golan Arms DF.9 anti-infantry battery. One shot blew through two landspeeders running side by side. Most powerful bolt I''ve ever seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'It''s possible the anti-infantry battery was just malfunctioning, but we don''t know for sure. Our lab will analyze this power module and see if we can duplicate it. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Weapon Power Module'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Empire''s Weapon Power Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_high_power_module.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'The Empire''s Committee for the Preservation of the New Order is doing more surprise bombings of civilian homes. They steal a family''s droids, then send the droids back bearing implanted tactical warheads. Boom. We''ve discovered one warhead that failed to detonate, and we want to display it to alert the populace. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'It''s bone-chilling to think that the protocol droid serving you dinner could suddenly explode. I hope this provokes a terrible public outcry against COMPNOR.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Until we inform the public of the terrible atrocities their government commits, the Empire will continue to rule through fear and terrorism. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Droid Implant Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'COMPNOR Uses Bomb-Droids on Innocents'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_light.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'We just got news of another Imperial Army chemical attack on a civilian population. The chemical agent is new. We salvaged a warhead and need you to bring it here for analysis, so we can develop an antidote. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'We have no idea why the Army attacked this settlement. Maybe the citizens refused to pay taxes, or someone said the wrong thing to a spy. The destruction was terrible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Nobody deserves to die so horribly as those people did. With the proper antidote in place, we may be able to prevent the next tragedy. Thanks for your assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Imperial Chemical Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Empire Using Chem Weapons on Civilians'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_chemical.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'A "procurement specialist" just delivered a vital shipment of power cores to our bases here. Apparently by getting past an Imperial blockade, she won some kind of bet with headquarters. They''ve set up a special payment for her work. If you can pick it up and bring it here, I''ll forward it to her right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I don''t believe I actually got to hold, however briefly, the original flute played by none other than the famous fizz artist Droopy McCool. That is so fine!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Well. I guess the smuggler we''re paying off is a fizz-music fan. It takes a special kind of person to risk explosive decompression to win a flute. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Droopy McCool''s Flute'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm7t', 'A Procurement Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm7f', 'instrument\\flute_droopy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a special payment she prearranged with headquarters. She just ran a few shiploads of blaster rifles past the worst Imperial blockade I''ve seen in a while, so she deserves the pay, whatever it is. If you''ll pick it up and bring it here, I''ll pass it along to our procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'I had no idea that mere cooking spices could cost such a fortune. But these are some of the costliest spices in the galaxy. I almost stole a taste of them, but one sample would cost more than a year''s pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Spices? I guess our smuggler friend is a cook on the side. Hmm, maybe I''ll ask her to cook dinner sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Rare Spices'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm8t', 'Pay for a Good Smuggling Job'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm8f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a payment he prearranged with headquarters. We just got the medical supplies he ran past the Imperials, so I need you to pick up the payment at our arranged drop point. Bring the fee here, and I''ll pass it on to our smugg-- procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'I have no idea why headquarters needed to transmit us a deed for, of all things, an ore harvester. Any notion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'The smuggler wanted an ore harvester? How odd. Maybe he plans to go into a new line of work. It''s sure to be safer, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'Ore Harvester Deed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm9t', 'Paying a Procurement Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm9f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'The Alliance occasionally revises its code delivery system. Headquarters creates new ways to transmit sensitive messages undetected. I''ve been told a new system is available for pickup. I don''t know what it is, but I''d like you to pick it up and bring it here. Are you willing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'This tree has certain nodules growing in its root structure, under the dirt. The pattern of nodules along each root is the code, like beads on a string.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'Wait a minute -- root nodules? I didn''t even know we used strings of beads, let alone potted trees. Well, I''ll get it into analysis, and someone will explain it to me. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Potted Tree'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm10t', 'New Test for Code Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm10f', 'furniture\\all\\frn_all_tree_potted_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'The Alliance periodically creates new ways to deliver coded messages without arousing Imperial suspicion. The latest breakthrough is available for pickup, but I haven''t been told what it is. If you can pick it up and bring it here, we''ll get it into analysis to figure out the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'The rows of knots of this woven rug are fractionally misaligned. The deviation of each knot from the straight line is an integral value in millimeters. That''s the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'So -- you measure a knot''s position, and its irregularity is the code value? Never mind, I don''t need to know yet. I''ll get this rug to analysis. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Rug'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm11t', 'Code Delivery Needs Further Tests'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm11f', 'furniture\\modern\\rug_rnd_lg_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'The Alliance is testing its code delivery systems again. Someone has figured out yet another way to transmit coded information right under the Empire''s collective nose. I have no idea what you''re supposed to go and pick up this time, but if you can bring it here quickly for analysis, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'If you play this kloo horn, the frequencies of consecutive notes are imperceptibly altered. The integral reduction in wavelength for each note is the code value.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'Codes in live music. That beats all. I''ll never hear a cantina band in quite the same way. Okay, thanks. Time to play this for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Kloo Horn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm12t', 'Code Delivery System Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm12f', 'instrument\\kloo_horn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'From time to time the Alliance tests its code delivery systems. We can''t transmit new codes over the HoloNet, obviously, so we conceal the data in a variety of objects. I don''t know what they''ve managed to insert codes into this time, but I need you to bring me the whatever-it-is for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'The test information is encoded by the size and position of the welds connecting crossbars in this cage. We worked on that one quite a while!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'Well, whaddya know. How do they even think of these things? All right, thanks. I have to get this cage into analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Cage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm13t', 'Test Code Delivery System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm13f', 'parrot_cage\\parrot_cage.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'We think another of our "procurement specialists" got blasted trying to run an Imperial blockade. These smugglers always run silent, so we don''t know much for sure. We found a crash site, but there''s not much left of the ship. To tell whether it''s our smuggler, I need to see something from the remains. Can you bring it here, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'We found this earring on -- we think it was the pilot''s body. Not much else left ofher. Grim duty, this salvage work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'Argh. I recognize this earring. What a bad way to go. Sorry, give me a moment. Okay. I''ll notify her next of kin. Thanks, that''s all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Unidentified Earring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm14t', 'Identify Smuggler Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm14f', 'wearables\\earring\\earring_s04.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'It''s dangerous work running supplies for the Alliance, and it looks like one of our blockade runners paid the last price today. We don''t know for sure, because they always run silent. But our ships salvaged a wreck in space, and they''re shipping the identifiable remains of the pilot down here. Could you bring me what they''ve found? Grisly duy, I know, but it has to be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'What with the explosive decompression, we couldn''t find a body. This necklace got caught on the pilot''s chair, though. Is it our runner''s?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Yes. Yes, that belonged to her. I expect I''ll have to report this to headquarters -- not to mention her next of kin (sigh). Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Blockade Runner''s Necklace'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm15t', 'Remains of Blockade Runner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm15f', 'wearables\\necklace\\necklace_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'We''ve been losing more "procurement specialists" as they try to smuggle supplies to us through Imperial blockades. I''ve had news that a smuggler''s ship crashed near here.  I need to know who crashed; we had no distress reports. If you could bring me some identifying token from the remains, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'We couldn''t find any identifying marks except this ring. This crash was strange, because from down here we saw no evidence of a dogfight. Sabotage, maybe?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'Huh! Yeah, I recognize this. Not from our pilot, but I think now I know who attacked our pilot. Excuse me, I have to contact a certain bounty hunter I know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Smuggler''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm16t', 'Last Ring of a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm16f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'We lose a certain number of smuggling ships to Imperial blockades, but now I''ve received word of that one of our "procurement specialists" got killed even before liftoff. I understand the ship is wrecked, but there may be some identifying mark in the remains. Can you check there and bring back whatever you find?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'You''re here to look over the remains? Here''s what we found -- a vest. Wrong size for the dead smuggler. You should show it to whoever sent you here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'Hmm. A Hutt gang vest. I didn''t expect that. A territorial grab? Maybe we need to bring in some higher-level negotiators. Excuse me, I have to call headquarters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Gangster''s Vest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm17t', 'Identify a Smuggler''s Murderer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm17f', 'wearables\\vest\\vest_hutt_gang_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'Our technicians are looking for vulnerabilities in Imperial AT-AT walker control systems. A salvage agent has just received an intact diagnostic unit that reads telemetry off walker drive systems. If we can crack the unit''s codes, we can deduce many internal details of AT-ATs. Can you bring us this diagnostic unit? The faster, the better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'Our forces downed an AT-AT on Yavin 4 when the Empire set up its blockade. We sent in a spy later to scavenge the wreckage. This beauty is the result.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'All right! Time to get the astromech droid to talk to this thing and see what it likes to hear. We''ll be in touch with you again, thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Walker Control Unit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 107, 'm18t', 'Help Jam Imperial Walker Systems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 108, 'm18f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'We''re hearing scary rumors that the Empire has a way to remotely launch all the escape pods on our ships. They press a button, and boom! We''re stuck. Sounds unlikely, but to make sure, we''re analyzing components on our various escape pods. Another component just arrived for testing. Can you pick it up?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'This is the energy distributor used in the explosive bolts on the Corellian Engineering Class-6 escape pod. Yes, it is set up to receive remote telemetry. Can''t imagine why. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'Those explosive bolts receive remote telemetry so that if the ship systems get damaged, a crew member can launch the pod from a datapad interface. Thanks for the component. We''ll get to it right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Escape Pod Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 113, 'm19t', 'Imperials Triggering Pods Remotely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 114, 'm19f', 'component\\item\\electronic_energy_distributor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'The Alliance needs more eyes in high places. If they''re small, invisible eyes, all the better. We''re working on a microsensor the size of a grain of dust, that can rest invisibly on an Imperial''s uniform. We hope we''ll hear intelligence in places where the Empire doesn''t think to jam sensors. We have a prototype ready for testing. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'This package contains the sensor and the receiving apparatus. Unfortunately, the sensor itself tends to blow around and break when air moves over it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'It breaks when air moves over it? You mean, for example, when someone breathes? Hmm. Sounds like there are still big problems with this design. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Micro Sensor and Receiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 119, 'm20t', 'Dust-Sized Sensor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 120, 'm20f', 'component\\item\\micro_sensor_suite.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some crazy old hermit in the Outer Rim Territories sent us a remarkable redesign of our standard blaster pistol barrel. Our engineers said it looked so bizarre it could have come from another galaxy. But we tried making a prototype, and now it''s ready for testing. Who knows? It might be our salvation. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'The capacitance induction on this barrel works on some completely novel principle -- allegedly. It may run much cooler than existing barrels. Or it may be total trash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'I''m leery of building such a bizarre new barrel. But if I hadn''t ordered this prototype, I''d always wonder. I still wonder who that designer is. Anyway, we''ll start testing soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Unusual Blaster Barrel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 125, 'm21t', 'Odd New Blaster Barrel Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 126, 'm21f', 'component\\weapon\\blaster_pistol_barrel.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'A mysterious hermit in the Outer Rim has been sending us amazing redesigns of our existing equipment. We just got his new version of a flashback suppressor useful on many different weapons. It''s based on weird principles, but apparently this fellow''s designs have showed promise before. So I''ve ordered a prototype. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'This flashback suppressor uses some kind of magnetic self-adjusting feedback loop. It''s quite weird. I have no idea whether this thing will ever work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'This hermit''s designs are hit-and-miss, they say. I don''t know if a magnetic feedback suppressor will change the course of the war, but regardless, thanks for bringing it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Unusual Flashback Suppressor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 131, 'm22t', 'Odd Flashback Suppressor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 132, 'm22f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_magnetic_flashback_supressor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Commander Skywalker destroyed the Death Star without a targeting computer. This shows that our computers still fall short. We don''t object to pilots using gut instinct, but we''d like to give them better tools when guts fail them. Our new prototype computer has just arrived from offworld, and we''re ready to test it as soon as you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'This is a sweet new model. Uses a modified droid brain, I think. I hope it''ll help in the battles ahead as the Empire starts striking back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'This targeting computer uses a modified droid brain? What a terrible idea. I hope it doesn''t start developing a personality. Well, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Improved Targeting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 137, 'm23t', 'Targeting Computer Upgrade'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 138, 'm23f', 'component\\weapon\\weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'We''re getting refugees from Imperial attacks in the countryside. These poor folks had their homes destroyed, their equipment burned -- they have nowhere to turn. We''re setting up relief and relocation efforts, but in the short term, we''ve got some hungry kids who need food. Can you please bring me a food basket from our supplier?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I always have some of these baskets ready to go. The Empire always gives us a use for them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'Thanks. I''ll get the food to the latest refugees. You can be proud you helped today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Provisions'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 143, 'm24t', 'Food for Refugee Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 144, 'm24f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_dish_food_basket.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'The Alliance is still looking for good base sites around the Outer Rim. Each world seems to present problems of its own. Our existing ore harvesters won''t work in some environments, so we''ve had our engineers develop a suitably ruggedized harvester model. We need you to bring us the schematics, because we don''t want the Empire learning the environments we''re targeting.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'It''s a straightforward task, redesigning an ore harvester. Not much glamour, but the war effort rides on this kind of work. That''s what I tell myself, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'Thanks! Remember, don''t mention the ore harvester redesign to anyone. The Empire has spies everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Ore Harvester Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 149, 'm25t', 'Redesigned Ore Harvester'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 150, 'm25f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'We''ve set up an advance base on a remote world -- never mind where -- and no one there has ever heard of a power core. They still need power, so we''re shipping them the latest designs for high-efficiency wind power generators. To prevent the Empire from discovering our supply chain, we need you to hand-deliver the design to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'On some worlds you can generate more from wind power than from a good fusion generator -- if your wind station can stand up in a perpetual hurricane.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 153, 'm26c', 'Great! We''ll get this design shipped off to our advance base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 154, 'm26i', 'Wind Power Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 155, 'm26t', 'New Base Needs Wind Power'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 156, 'm26f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_wind_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'I never thought of such things back when the Alliance was a ragtag band of outcasts, but now we''re experiencing local shortages of uniforms. In big engagements against the Empire, we need to know who''s who. We have designs ready for a new clothing factory. We''d rather not trust them to the HoloNet, for reasons you may learn later. Can you bring the designs here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'I don''t know where they''re building this factory, but the designs show it will make clothing intended for cold climates. Really cold.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 159, 'm27c', 'Yes, we''re making uniforms for a cold climate. But speculating why, or letting anyone know that little piece of data, is a bad idea.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 160, 'm27i', 'Designs for Uniform Factory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 161, 'm27t', 'Alliance Needs Uniforms'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 162, 'm27f', 'deed\\factory_deed\\clothing_factory_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'Our new advance base in the Outer Rim Territories is getting weird feedback from the world''s magnetic field. They''re busy shielding all the computers, but the power generator is getting finicky too. They don''t have the infrastructure to fix that. So we''ve worked up a new design, and we can start construction once you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'The fusion generator in these plans will serve up enough power to re-tune that planet''s magnetic field! You bet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 165, 'm28c', 'This may be an over-specification; no base needs quite this much power. But we''ll sort it out and get the generator offworld soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 166, 'm28i', 'Fusion Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 167, 'm28t', 'Alliance Base With Fusion Problems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 168, 'm28f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_fusion_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'An Imperial spy has compromised the weapon-control protocols we use to remotely fire our turret installations. The Empire could potentially turn our own laser cannons against us! A team of slicers and engineers has developed a retrofit that will secure these turret blocks against outside interference. It''s up to you to bring us the design, quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The old turret block design was already secure, and this one is better. But you can''t control the "human engineering" that lets spies trick our operatives into revealing secret protocols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 171, 'm29c', 'Thanks! We''ll get this turret retrofit into place at top speed. And while we''re at it, I hope we get across some basic education about how to keep secrets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 172, 'm29i', 'Turret Block Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 173, 'm29t', 'Alliance Turrets Compromised'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 174, 'm29f', 'deed\\turret_deed\\turret_block_large_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'Some idiot tourist bought a venomous reptavian offworld and brought it back here as a pet. That "pet" just stung an innocent girl, and we don''t have a suitable antivenin here. One of our labs has just manufactured an antidote. Bring it here, quickly. A girl''s life hangs in the balance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Here''s the antidote. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 177, 'm30c', 'At last! We''ll give this antidote to the girl right now. We destroyed the reptavian, by the way, and gave the tourist a sharp lecture about importing offworld animals.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 178, 'm30i', 'Venom Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 179, 'm30t', 'Deliver Reptavian Poison Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 180, 'm30f', 'medicine\\antidote_sm_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Interesting news. An Alliance slicer has procured the schematics for the Empire''s secure data terminals. If we can crack the encryption scheme, we could theoretically learn every mission the Empire assigns to its followers. Obviously we need to keep this find off the HoloNet, so we''d like you to hand-deliver the schematics to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'I never liked those mission terminals. I hope this breach makes the Empire stop using them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 183, 'm31c', 'With any luck, we''ll know the Empire''s plans as soon as they do! Thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 184, 'm31i', 'Imperial Data Terminal Schematic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 185, 'm31t', 'We Have the Empire''s Data Terminals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 186, 'm31f', 'furniture\\imperial\\data_terminal_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'I''m supposed to pick up some kind of equipment for an upcoming assault, but the transmission was corrupted. I know the pickup point, and it''s supposed to be kept secret and hand-delivered. Other than that, I''m clueless. Welcome to the military. Can you pick up this whatever-it-is and bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'Don''t mind that ticking sound, it''s just a loose interior casing. But if I were you, I''d deliver this thing pretty quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 189, 'm32c', 'A -- what? What kind of warhead? Is it live? Why is it ticking? Okay, I need to make some calls here. See you later, okay? I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 190, 'm32i', 'Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 191, 'm32t', 'Classified Pick-Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 192, 'm32f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We''ve analyzed captured plans from the Empire''s defunct Dark Trooper project, and there''s some interesting technology there. Our lab''s latest prototype adapts a deflector plate from the Stage 1 droid to function as an actual deflector shield projector, worn on the arm. Sounds great, doesn''t it? We need you to bring us the prototype plate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'Here is the plate component. The power consumption for the entire deflector shield is much too steep right now. It would melt your arm! But we''re working on it, we''re working away....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 195, 'm33c', 'We need to set up a testing program for this deflector plate. The Empire''s discarded technology may be the boost we need. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 196, 'm33i', 'Deflector Shield Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 197, 'm33t', 'Deliver Shield Projector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 198, 'm33f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_projector_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'We downed an Imperial transport from low orbit. It crash-landed with no survivors, and our teams scavenged the wreckage. They found an astromech droid brain that appears undamaged -- unlike the droid''s body. We think we can scan the brain at our facility and learn Imperial engineering protocols. Can you bring us the brain?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'If this astromech brain holds current Imperial encryption protocols, we can do some damage to the Empire before their next scheduled code rotation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 201, 'm34c', 'Good job! We''ll have someone look at the brain as soon as we can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 202, 'm34i', 'Astromech Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 203, 'm34t', 'R2 Brain Awaits Analysis'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 204, 'm34f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'Our spies received a manifest of war materiel bound for the Garia system. If we strike those supply ships, we can cripple Imperial operations in that sector. I need you to fetch the manifest datadisc and bring it here. Be careful. Many Bothans died to bring us this information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'Here''s the disc. It was purchased with Bothan blood, so handle it with respect. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 207, 'm35c', 'Good work. I hope the data on this disc is enough to plot some sabotage missions. The Empire''s foothold in the Garia system is very strong.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 208, 'm35i', 'War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 209, 'm35t', 'Retrieve a War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 210, 'm35f', 'datadisc'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'A Mon Calamari war cruiser is cloaked inside a comet cluster on the fringes of the system. It''s ready to drop off some important Alliance dignitaries. Our listening stations have compiled the schedule windows during which the ship can move past Imperial star patrols. I want you to get that list and bring it to me. Do not delay!.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Here''s the list of schedule windows, such as it is. The pilot of that star cruiser had better be good. Flying past the Imperial patrols will be like threading a very small needle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 213, 'm36c', 'These numbers don''t look very promising, but I suppose they''re all we''ve got. May the Force be with us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 214, 'm36i', 'Entry Windows For Alliance Star Cruiser'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 215, 'm36t', 'Analysis of Imperial Star Patrol Schedule'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 216, 'm36f', 'datadisc\n\nm37o\nI need your help. We''ve received a list of the top star pilots who want to join the Alliance. I think I''m being watched by Imperial surveillance, so someone else has to pick up the list for me. Can you handle it? After the Battle of Yavin we seriously need to replenish the ranks of our fighter pilots. This is the first step.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 217, 'm37p', 'Here''s the list of star pilots. There''s some great names on here, like Avan Beruss from the Illodian Officers'' Academy and Nien Nunb from Sullust. If we keep recruiting this caliber of pilots, we''ll be twice as strong as we were at Yavin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 218, 'm37c', 'Hmm. I can''t say I''ve heard of the pilots on this list, but I''ll certainly look into recruiting them. We need every advantage we can get against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 219, 'm37i', 'List of Top Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 220, 'm37t', 'Deliver a List of Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 221, 'm37f', 'datadisc\n\nm38o\nListen up. Our spies inform us that the Emperor''s enforcer, Darth Vader, has commissioned a team of elite bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. We''re not sure what the team is for, but we want one of our agents on the inside. I want you to meet the top candidate and get a list of credentials for me to review. Only our best agent should attempt a mission as dangerous as this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 222, 'm38p', 'Here are my credentials. This sounds like a dangerous assignment, though. What do you think? Could I pass as a top-flight bounty hunter? My mother says I''ve got a mean look about me, when the light hits me just right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 223, 'm38c', 'These are the credentials of our top candidate, eh? Somehow I''m not encouraged. Well, perhaps Vader won''t recognize a well-hidden spy. It''s not like he''s clairvoyant, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 224, 'm38i', 'Alliance Agent Credentials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 225, 'm38t', 'Fetch the Credentials of a Spy Candidate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 226, 'm38f', 'datadisc\n\nm39o\nOkay, here''s the deal. The captain of the Star Destroyer Beleaguer is hosting an officer''s party on his flight deck. We''ve hidden a listening device in the ommni-box that the band will be using. If we''re lucky we might catch some random intelligence. I want you to fetch the bugged instrument from our offworld agent and bring it back to me. Got it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 227, 'm39p', 'Here''s the ommni-box. It''s a little off-key in the fourth septave of the Bith echo minor scale, but the Imperials shouldn''t notice. I think.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 228, 'm39c', 'Ahh, good. I hope the musicians won''t notice the switch. One ommni-box is just like another, I always say.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 229, 'm39i', 'Bugged Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 230, 'm39t', 'Deliver an Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 231, 'm39f', 'instrument\\ommni_box.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 232, 'm40o', 'At last we have evidence to prove Imperial atrocities on Tyshapahl. I want you to pick up the package from our transport pilot and bring it back to me. I understand this evidence is volatile, so waste no time in getting it here. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 233, 'm40p', 'Yeah, so, here it is. Yes, it''s a corpse. Yes, it''s not frozen. They thawed it for an autopsy and never re-froze it. Some genius at High Command didn''t want to risk destroying the evidence. So, now I pass this fragrant burden off to you. Enjoy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 234, 'm40c', 'By the belt of Antilles! Who gave the command to leave this thing rotting like this? It''s sickening! Quick, let me get this refrigerated before I smell as bad as a nerf-herder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 235, 'm40i', 'Victim of Imperial Atrocity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 236, 'm40t', 'Transport Evidence of Imperial Crimes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 237, 'm40f', 'poi\\corellia\\poi_victim_sandpanther.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 238, 'm41o', 'This is great. We actually reprogrammed an Imperial mission terminal. Now we can send New Order activists into traps and away from our sensitive operations. Go pick up the terminal and bring it here so I can deploy it as soon as possible. I can''t wait to watch these Imperials lapdogs chase after phantoms!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 239, 'm41p', 'Are you the one taking possession of the reprogrammed terminal? Excellent. Here it is, then. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 240, 'm41c', 'Terrific! This reprogrammed mission terminal is going to confuse the heck out of the Imperials. I''ve already got an idea to send them on missions to hunt down a prototype war droid based on the MSE-6 model. They''re just dumb enough to fall for that, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 241, 'm41i', 'Reprogrammed Imperial Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 242, 'm41t', 'Retrieve a Reprogrammed Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 243, 'm41f', 'mission\\mission_terminal.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 244, 'm42o', 'A scientist loyal to the Alliance has developed some kind of new wilderness camouflage system. We''ve smuggled it to the planet. I need you to fetch it for me. If this device works, it could prove an immense help in the war against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 245, 'm42p', 'Believe it or not, this is the fabled new camouflage system. A straw hut. Sometimes I wish we had the resources of the Empire. I really do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 246, 'm42c', 'So. Um. This is the new camouflage system, eh? A hut. Well, you can''t say we leave any option untested in the fight against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 247, 'm42i', 'Big Straw Hut'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 248, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Prototype Camouflage System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 249, 'm42f', 'poi\\endor\\poi_ewok_hut.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 250, 'm43o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial overseer. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 251, 'm43p', 'Here are the clothes. They once belonged to an Imperial Inquisitor. I don''t have to explain to you how rare they are, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 252, 'm43c', 'An Inquisitor''s robe? Impressive! I''ve never seen one before. I''m not sure if we would ever disguise an agent as an Inquisitor, but you never know. Thanks for the good work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 253, 'm43i', 'Imperial Inquisitor Robe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 254, 'm43t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 255, 'm43f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_inquisitor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 256, 'm44o', 'Clandestine funding is an important part of Alliance operations. We''re smuggling a shipment of rare avabush spice to one of our backers on the Frontier, in exchange for a hefty donation. I need you to bring the shipment to me so I can pass it along to the next starship in our underground delivery system. Make sure no Imperials catch you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 257, 'm44p', 'Here''s the avabush spice. Did you know it can be used as a truth serum? I wonder what our secret backer is going to use it for? Hmm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 258, 'm44c', 'Thank you. This avabush spice will help us continue the good work of the Alliance. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 259, 'm44i', 'Avabush Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 260, 'm44t', 'Transport a Shipment of Valuable Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 261, 'm44f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 262, 'm45o', 'I''ve got a job for you. There''s a small package I need you to deliver to me. It contains an Imperial Medal of Honor engraved with the name of Governor Tarkin. Contraband scavengers discovered it in the debris field around Yavin. This medal will make a splendid gift for someone in High Command. Can you bring it to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 263, 'm45p', 'It''s kind of perverse, don''t you think, handling an old war medal like some kind of sick trophy? I dunno. I mean Tarkin is dead. Let''s move on, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 264, 'm45c', 'Ahh! Excellent. I can''t wait to give Tarkin''s old medal as a gift to someone in Alliance High Command. My star is rising, my friend, I assure you of that. It was well worth leaving my post in the Imperial military to take up with the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 265, 'm45i', 'Imperial Medal of Valor   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 266, 'm45t', 'Transport an Imperial Medal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 267, 'm45f', 'sealed container\n\nm46o\nWant to help out with some new war technology? Our scientists have developed a hybrid form of the gel insulation used in AT-AT and AT-ST servo joints. This new gel reacts to certain radio frequencies, with explosive results. We''re planning to sneak it into Imperial production facilities. If you''ve got time, I need to have some of the stuff brought to me from a courier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 268, 'm46p', 'You''d think they would transport explosive gel in some kind of container, wouldn''t you? But no, here it is in a nice, handy blob. Careful, it sort of oozes through your fingers when it gets warm. I''d stay away from radio transmitters with this stuff, if I were you. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 269, 'm46c', 'Thanks for the help. I can''t wait to blow the legs off a few Imperial walkers with this stuff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 270, 'm46i', 'Ball of Explosive Gel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 271, 'm46t', 'Deliver New War Technology'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 272, 'm46f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_ball_of_dough.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 273, 'm47o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 274, 'm47p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 275, 'm47c', 'What, this is it? Nothing more than wood ash, by the looks of it. I guess I was wrong. Thank you nonetheless for helping me, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 276, 'm47i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 277, 'm47t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 278, 'm47f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 279, 'm48o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 280, 'm48p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 281, 'm48c', 'Son of a gundark! I knew it! These are the remains of a notorious Imperial torturer, left behind by a strike team I commissioned to destroy that base. See, you can tell by the stim implants in the ash. They melt at a higher temperature than bone. This confirms my hopes that the torturer was killed. Thank you very much for helping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 282, 'm48i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 283, 'm48t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 284, 'm48f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 285, 'm49o', 'I''m glad you''re here. I have a very important mission for you. A secret Alliance operative has brought a very important droid to this planet. I need you to pick it up and bring it to me at once. I cannot overstate the urgency of this mission. Do not, under any circumstances, let this droid fall into Imperial hands. Is that clear? Go now. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 286, 'm49p', 'Sure is a lot of fuss over a mouse droid, don''t you think? Well, far be it from me to second guess High Command. Here it is. Luck to you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 287, 'm49c', 'I can''t believe this is the very droid the Empire has been scouring the galaxy trying to find! I''m humbled. You did well to transport it here without the authorities getting ahold of it. That would have been a disastrous blow to the Alliance. Thank you again. The Force will be with you, always.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 288, 'm49i', 'Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 289, 'm49t', 'Transport an Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 290, 'm49f', 'mouse droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 291, 'm50o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial soldier. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 292, 'm50p', 'Here is the uniform. Do you recognize it? Not many people would. It once belonged to a member of the Imperial Royal Guard. To say these are not easy to come by would be the understatement of the millennium. Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 293, 'm50c', 'Unbelievable! The robe of an Imperial Royal Guard! I know exactly which Alliance agent will be able to use it, too. This may be our biggest break since the Bothans discovered that weakness in the Death Star. Good work, my friend. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 294, 'm50i', 'Robe of the Imperial Royal Guard'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 295, 'm50t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 296, 'm50f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_royal_guard.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'One of our troops apparently collected a trophy off a fallen Imperial soldier. We''re not fighting the Empire to collect souvenirs. I know a few units that allow it, but not this one. Go and get the souvenir, while I prepare a lecture about showing some class.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Why is it wrong to take trophies? They''re bad guys, right? If they''re dead, they can''t use their gear any more, so why not take a nice souvenir? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'If any Alliance soldier is treating civil war like a hunting trip, we have a lot of education to do. Thanks, I''ll have this helmet destroyed as usual.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Stormtrooper Trophy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Alliance Shouldn''t Collect Trophies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Some of our bravest Alliance members are those who infiltrate the Empire''s ranks to bring us vital intelligence. We just had a sad report that one Imperial Navy spy has been caught. The Empire apparently sent his ring to his next of kin, an insolent gesture intended to humiliate them. We have other plans for that ring. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'My friend risked his life every day to help the cause of freedom. After this smug gesture by the Empire, it turns out his ring can still do some good for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'The Empire didn''t discover that this ring conceals a HoloNet receiver. Our spy used it to eavesdrop on a Star Destroyer''s bridge. We hope we can continue his good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Infiltrator''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Proof of Heroism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'The last stormtroopers we defeated were using projectile weapons with insane rates of fire. Our field techs inspected the weapons, and they believe the Empire has developed an improved feed mechanism. Bring us one of these improved mechanisms for analysis, and we''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'I''ve never seen why anyone would use projectile weapons in a galaxy full of blasters, but this engagement changed my mind. Here''s the new feed mechanism.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'We''ll pass this along to the engineers for study. Meanwhile, thanks for your time, and take this for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Projectile Feed Mechanism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Insane Rates of Fire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\weapon\\projectile_feed_mechanism.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We just took out an Imperial armory, but barely. Their defenses seemed unsually powerful. We salvaged a power module from a destroyed weapon, and our lab wants to analyze it for technical breakthroughs. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'This module comes from a Golan Arms DF.9 anti-infantry battery. One shot blew through two landspeeders running side by side. Most powerful bolt I''ve ever seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'It''s possible the anti-infantry battery was just malfunctioning, but we don''t know for sure. Our lab will analyze this power module and see if we can duplicate it. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Weapon Power Module'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Empire''s Weapon Power Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_high_power_module.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'The Empire''s Committee for the Preservation of the New Order is doing more surprise bombings of civilian homes. They steal a family''s droids, then send the droids back bearing implanted tactical warheads. Boom. We''ve discovered one warhead that failed to detonate, and we want to display it to alert the populace. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'It''s bone-chilling to think that the protocol droid serving you dinner could suddenly explode. I hope this provokes a terrible public outcry against COMPNOR.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Until we inform the public of the terrible atrocities their government commits, the Empire will continue to rule through fear and terrorism. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Droid Implant Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'COMPNOR Uses Bomb-Droids on Innocents'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_light.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'We just got news of another Imperial Army chemical attack on a civilian population. The chemical agent is new. We salvaged a warhead and need you to bring it here for analysis, so we can develop an antidote. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'We have no idea why the Army attacked this settlement. Maybe the citizens refused to pay taxes, or someone said the wrong thing to a spy. The destruction was terrible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Nobody deserves to die so horribly as those people did. With the proper antidote in place, we may be able to prevent the next tragedy. Thanks for your assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Imperial Chemical Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Empire Using Chem Weapons on Civilians'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_chemical.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'A "procurement specialist" just delivered a vital shipment of power cores to our bases here. Apparently by getting past an Imperial blockade, she won some kind of bet with headquarters. They''ve set up a special payment for her work. If you can pick it up and bring it here, I''ll forward it to her right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I don''t believe I actually got to hold, however briefly, the original flute played by none other than the famous fizz artist Droopy McCool. That is so fine!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Well. I guess the smuggler we''re paying off is a fizz-music fan. It takes a special kind of person to risk explosive decompression to win a flute. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Droopy McCool''s Flute'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 41, 'm7t', 'A Procurement Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 42, 'm7f', 'instrument\\flute_droopy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a special payment she prearranged with headquarters. She just ran a few shiploads of blaster rifles past the worst Imperial blockade I''ve seen in a while, so she deserves the pay, whatever it is. If you''ll pick it up and bring it here, I''ll pass it along to our procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'I had no idea that mere cooking spices could cost such a fortune. But these are some of the costliest spices in the galaxy. I almost stole a taste of them, but one sample would cost more than a year''s pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Spices? I guess our smuggler friend is a cook on the side. Hmm, maybe I''ll ask her to cook dinner sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Rare Spices'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 47, 'm8t', 'Pay for a Good Smuggling Job'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 48, 'm8f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a payment he prearranged with headquarters. We just got the medical supplies he ran past the Imperials, so I need you to pick up the payment at our arranged drop point. Bring the fee here, and I''ll pass it on to our smugg-- procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'I have no idea why headquarters needed to transmit us a deed for, of all things, an ore harvester. Any notion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'The smuggler wanted an ore harvester? How odd. Maybe he plans to go into a new line of work. It''s sure to be safer, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'Ore Harvester Deed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 53, 'm9t', 'Paying a Procurement Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 54, 'm9f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'The Alliance occasionally revises its code delivery system. Headquarters creates new ways to transmit sensitive messages undetected. I''ve been told a new system is available for pickup. I don''t know what it is, but I''d like you to pick it up and bring it here. Are you willing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'This tree has certain nodules growing in its root structure, under the dirt. The pattern of nodules along each root is the code, like beads on a string.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'Wait a minute -- root nodules? I didn''t even know we used strings of beads, let alone potted trees. Well, I''ll get it into analysis, and someone will explain it to me. Thanks.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Potted Tree'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 59, 'm10t', 'New Test for Code Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 60, 'm10f', 'furniture\\all\\frn_all_tree_potted_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'The Alliance periodically creates new ways to deliver coded messages without arousing Imperial suspicion. The latest breakthrough is available for pickup, but I haven''t been told what it is. If you can pick it up and bring it here, we''ll get it into analysis to figure out the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'The rows of knots of this woven rug are fractionally misaligned. The deviation of each knot from the straight line is an integral value in millimeters. That''s the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'So -- you measure a knot''s position, and its irregularity is the code value? Never mind, I don''t need to know yet. I''ll get this rug to analysis. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Rug'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 65, 'm11t', 'Code Delivery Needs Further Tests'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 66, 'm11f', 'furniture\\modern\\rug_rnd_lg_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'The Alliance is testing its code delivery systems again. Someone has figured out yet another way to transmit coded information right under the Empire''s collective nose. I have no idea what you''re supposed to go and pick up this time, but if you can bring it here quickly for analysis, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'If you play this kloo horn, the frequencies of consecutive notes are imperceptibly altered. The integral reduction in wavelength for each note is the code value.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'Codes in live music. That beats all. I''ll never hear a cantina band in quite the same way. Okay, thanks. Time to play this for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Kloo Horn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 71, 'm12t', 'Code Delivery System Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 72, 'm12f', 'instrument\\kloo_horn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'From time to time the Alliance tests its code delivery systems. We can''t transmit new codes over the HoloNet, obviously, so we conceal the data in a variety of objects. I don''t know what they''ve managed to insert codes into this time, but I need you to bring me the whatever-it-is for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'The test information is encoded by the size and position of the welds connecting crossbars in this cage. We worked on that one quite a while!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'Well, whaddya know. How do they even think of these things? All right, thanks. I have to get this cage into analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Cage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 77, 'm13t', 'Test Code Delivery System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 78, 'm13f', 'parrot_cage\\parrot_cage.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'We think another of our "procurement specialists" got blasted trying to run an Imperial blockade. These smugglers always run silent, so we don''t know much for sure. We found a crash site, but there''s not much left of the ship. To tell whether it''s our smuggler, I need to see something from the remains. Can you bring it here, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'We found this earring on -- we think it was the pilot''s body. Not much else left ofher. Grim duty, this salvage work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'Argh. I recognize this earring. What a bad way to go. Sorry, give me a moment. Okay. I''ll notify her next of kin. Thanks, that''s all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Unidentified Earring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 83, 'm14t', 'Identify Smuggler Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 84, 'm14f', 'wearables\\earring\\earring_s04.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'It''s dangerous work running supplies for the Alliance, and it looks like one of our blockade runners paid the last price today. We don''t know for sure, because they always run silent. But our ships salvaged a wreck in space, and they''re shipping the identifiable remains of the pilot down here. Could you bring me what they''ve found? Grisly duy, I know, but it has to be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'What with the explosive decompression, we couldn''t find a body. This necklace got caught on the pilot''s chair, though. Is it our runner''s?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Yes. Yes, that belonged to her. I expect I''ll have to report this to headquarters -- not to mention her next of kin (sigh). Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Blockade Runner''s Necklace'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 89, 'm15t', 'Remains of Blockade Runner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 90, 'm15f', 'wearables\\necklace\\necklace_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'We''ve been losing more "procurement specialists" as they try to smuggle supplies to us through Imperial blockades. I''ve had news that a smuggler''s ship crashed near here.  I need to know who crashed; we had no distress reports. If you could bring me some identifying token from the remains, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'We couldn''t find any identifying marks except this ring. This crash was strange, because from down here we saw no evidence of a dogfight. Sabotage, maybe?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'Huh! Yeah, I recognize this. Not from our pilot, but I think now I know who attacked our pilot. Excuse me, I have to contact a certain bounty hunter I know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Smuggler''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 95, 'm16t', 'Last Ring of a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 96, 'm16f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'We lose a certain number of smuggling ships to Imperial blockades, but now I''ve received word of that one of our "procurement specialists" got killed even before liftoff. I understand the ship is wrecked, but there may be some identifying mark in the remains. Can you check there and bring back whatever you find?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'You''re here to look over the remains? Here''s what we found -- a vest. Wrong size for the dead smuggler. You should show it to whoever sent you here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'Hmm. A Hutt gang vest. I didn''t expect that. A territorial grab? Maybe we need to bring in some higher-level negotiators. Excuse me, I have to call headquarters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Gangster''s Vest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 101, 'm17t', 'Identify a Smuggler''s Murderer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 102, 'm17f', 'wearables\\vest\\vest_hutt_gang_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'Our technicians are looking for vulnerabilities in Imperial AT-AT walker control systems. A salvage agent has just received an intact diagnostic unit that reads telemetry off walker drive systems. If we can crack the unit''s codes, we can deduce many internal details of AT-ATs. Can you bring us this diagnostic unit? The faster, the better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'Our forces downed an AT-AT on Yavin 4 when the Empire set up its blockade. We sent in a spy later to scavenge the wreckage. This beauty is the result.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'All right! Time to get the astromech droid to talk to this thing and see what it likes to hear. We''ll be in touch with you again, thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Walker Control Unit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 107, 'm18t', 'Help Jam Imperial Walker Systems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 108, 'm18f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'We''re hearing scary rumors that the Empire has a way to remotely launch all the escape pods on our ships. They press a button, and boom! We''re stuck. Sounds unlikely, but to make sure, we''re analyzing components on our various escape pods. Another component just arrived for testing. Can you pick it up?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'This is the energy distributor used in the explosive bolts on the Corellian Engineering Class-6 escape pod. Yes, it is set up to receive remote telemetry. Can''t imagine why. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'Those explosive bolts receive remote telemetry so that if the ship systems get damaged, a crew member can launch the pod from a datapad interface. Thanks for the component. We''ll get to it right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Escape Pod Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 113, 'm19t', 'Imperials Triggering Pods Remotely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 114, 'm19f', 'component\\item\\electronic_energy_distributor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'The Alliance needs more eyes in high places. If they''re small, invisible eyes, all the better. We''re working on a microsensor the size of a grain of dust, that can rest invisibly on an Imperial''s uniform. We hope we''ll hear intelligence in places where the Empire doesn''t think to jam sensors. We have a prototype ready for testing. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'This package contains the sensor and the receiving apparatus. Unfortunately, the sensor itself tends to blow around and break when air moves over it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'It breaks when air moves over it? You mean, for example, when someone breathes? Hmm. Sounds like there are still big problems with this design. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Micro Sensor and Receiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 119, 'm20t', 'Dust-Sized Sensor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 120, 'm20f', 'component\\item\\micro_sensor_suite.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some crazy old hermit in the Outer Rim Territories sent us a remarkable redesign of our standard blaster pistol barrel. Our engineers said it looked so bizarre it could have come from another galaxy. But we tried making a prototype, and now it''s ready for testing. Who knows? It might be our salvation. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'The capacitance induction on this barrel works on some completely novel principle -- allegedly. It may run much cooler than existing barrels. Or it may be total trash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'I''m leery of building such a bizarre new barrel. But if I hadn''t ordered this prototype, I''d always wonder. I still wonder who that designer is. Anyway, we''ll start testing soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Unusual Blaster Barrel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 125, 'm21t', 'Odd New Blaster Barrel Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 126, 'm21f', 'component\\weapon\\blaster_pistol_barrel.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'A mysterious hermit in the Outer Rim has been sending us amazing redesigns of our existing equipment. We just got his new version of a flashback suppressor useful on many different weapons. It''s based on weird principles, but apparently this fellow''s designs have showed promise before. So I''ve ordered a prototype. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'This flashback suppressor uses some kind of magnetic self-adjusting feedback loop. It''s quite weird. I have no idea whether this thing will ever work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'This hermit''s designs are hit-and-miss, they say. I don''t know if a magnetic feedback suppressor will change the course of the war, but regardless, thanks for bringing it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Unusual Flashback Suppressor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 131, 'm22t', 'Odd Flashback Suppressor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 132, 'm22f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_magnetic_flashback_supressor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Commander Skywalker destroyed the Death Star without a targeting computer. This shows that our computers still fall short. We don''t object to pilots using gut instinct, but we''d like to give them better tools when guts fail them. Our new prototype computer has just arrived from offworld, and we''re ready to test it as soon as you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'This is a sweet new model. Uses a modified droid brain, I think. I hope it''ll help in the battles ahead as the Empire starts striking back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'This targeting computer uses a modified droid brain? What a terrible idea. I hope it doesn''t start developing a personality. Well, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Improved Targeting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 137, 'm23t', 'Targeting Computer Upgrade'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 138, 'm23f', 'component\\weapon\\weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'We''re getting refugees from Imperial attacks in the countryside. These poor folks had their homes destroyed, their equipment burned -- they have nowhere to turn. We''re setting up relief and relocation efforts, but in the short term, we''ve got some hungry kids who need food. Can you please bring me a food basket from our supplier?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I always have some of these baskets ready to go. The Empire always gives us a use for them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'Thanks. I''ll get the food to the latest refugees. You can be proud you helped today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Provisions'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 143, 'm24t', 'Food for Refugee Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 144, 'm24f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_dish_food_basket.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'The Alliance is still looking for good base sites around the Outer Rim. Each world seems to present problems of its own. Our existing ore harvesters won''t work in some environments, so we''ve had our engineers develop a suitably ruggedized harvester model. We need you to bring us the schematics, because we don''t want the Empire learning the environments we''re targeting.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'It''s a straightforward task, redesigning an ore harvester. Not much glamour, but the war effort rides on this kind of work. That''s what I tell myself, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'Thanks! Remember, don''t mention the ore harvester redesign to anyone. The Empire has spies everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Ore Harvester Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 149, 'm25t', 'Redesigned Ore Harvester'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 150, 'm25f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'We''ve set up an advance base on a remote world -- never mind where -- and no one there has ever heard of a power core. They still need power, so we''re shipping them the latest designs for high-efficiency wind power generators. To prevent the Empire from discovering our supply chain, we need you to hand-deliver the design to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'On some worlds you can generate more from wind power than from a good fusion generator -- if your wind station can stand up in a perpetual hurricane.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 153, 'm26c', 'Great! We''ll get this design shipped off to our advance base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 154, 'm26i', 'Wind Power Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 155, 'm26t', 'New Base Needs Wind Power'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 156, 'm26f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_wind_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'I never thought of such things back when the Alliance was a ragtag band of outcasts, but now we''re experiencing local shortages of uniforms. In big engagements against the Empire, we need to know who''s who. We have designs ready for a new clothing factory. We''d rather not trust them to the HoloNet, for reasons you may learn later. Can you bring the designs here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'I don''t know where they''re building this factory, but the designs show it will make clothing intended for cold climates. Really cold.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 159, 'm27c', 'Yes, we''re making uniforms for a cold climate. But speculating why, or letting anyone know that little piece of data, is a bad idea.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 160, 'm27i', 'Designs for Uniform Factory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 161, 'm27t', 'Alliance Needs Uniforms'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 162, 'm27f', 'deed\\factory_deed\\clothing_factory_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'Our new advance base in the Outer Rim Territories is getting weird feedback from the world''s magnetic field. They''re busy shielding all the computers, but the power generator is getting finicky too. They don''t have the infrastructure to fix that. So we''ve worked up a new design, and we can start construction once you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'The fusion generator in these plans will serve up enough power to re-tune that planet''s magnetic field! You bet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 165, 'm28c', 'This may be an over-specification; no base needs quite this much power. But we''ll sort it out and get the generator offworld soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 166, 'm28i', 'Fusion Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 167, 'm28t', 'Alliance Base With Fusion Problems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 168, 'm28f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_fusion_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'An Imperial spy has compromised the weapon-control protocols we use to remotely fire our turret installations. The Empire could potentially turn our own laser cannons against us! A team of slicers and engineers has developed a retrofit that will secure these turret blocks against outside interference. It''s up to you to bring us the design, quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The old turret block design was already secure, and this one is better. But you can''t control the "human engineering" that lets spies trick our operatives into revealing secret protocols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 171, 'm29c', 'Thanks! We''ll get this turret retrofit into place at top speed. And while we''re at it, I hope we get across some basic education about how to keep secrets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 172, 'm29i', 'Turret Block Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 173, 'm29t', 'Alliance Turrets Compromised'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 174, 'm29f', 'deed\\turret_deed\\turret_block_large_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'Some idiot tourist bought a venomous reptavian offworld and brought it back here as a pet. That "pet" just stung an innocent girl, and we don''t have a suitable antivenin here. One of our labs has just manufactured an antidote. Bring it here, quickly. A girl''s life hangs in the balance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Here''s the antidote. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 177, 'm30c', 'At last! We''ll give this antidote to the girl right now. We destroyed the reptavian, by the way, and gave the tourist a sharp lecture about importing offworld animals.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 178, 'm30i', 'Venom Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 179, 'm30t', 'Deliver Reptavian Poison Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 180, 'm30f', 'medicine\\antidote_sm_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Interesting news. An Alliance slicer has procured the schematics for the Empire''s secure data terminals. If we can crack the encryption scheme, we could theoretically learn every mission the Empire assigns to its followers. Obviously we need to keep this find off the HoloNet, so we''d like you to hand-deliver the schematics to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'I never liked those mission terminals. I hope this breach makes the Empire stop using them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 183, 'm31c', 'With any luck, we''ll know the Empire''s plans as soon as they do! Thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 184, 'm31i', 'Imperial Data Terminal Schematic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 185, 'm31t', 'We Have the Empire''s Data Terminals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 186, 'm31f', 'furniture\\imperial\\data_terminal_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'I''m supposed to pick up some kind of equipment for an upcoming assault, but the transmission was corrupted. I know the pickup point, and it''s supposed to be kept secret and hand-delivered. Other than that, I''m clueless. Welcome to the military. Can you pick up this whatever-it-is and bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'Don''t mind that ticking sound, it''s just a loose interior casing. But if I were you, I''d deliver this thing pretty quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 189, 'm32c', 'A -- what? What kind of warhead? Is it live? Why is it ticking? Okay, I need to make some calls here. See you later, okay? I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 190, 'm32i', 'Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 191, 'm32t', 'Classified Pick-Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 192, 'm32f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We''ve analyzed captured plans from the Empire''s defunct Dark Trooper project, and there''s some interesting technology there. Our lab''s latest prototype adapts a deflector plate from the Stage 1 droid to function as an actual deflector shield projector, worn on the arm. Sounds great, doesn''t it? We need you to bring us the prototype plate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'Here is the plate component. The power consumption for the entire deflector shield is much too steep right now. It would melt your arm! But we''re working on it, we''re working away....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 195, 'm33c', 'We need to set up a testing program for this deflector plate. The Empire''s discarded technology may be the boost we need. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 196, 'm33i', 'Deflector Shield Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 197, 'm33t', 'Deliver Shield Projector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 198, 'm33f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_projector_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'We downed an Imperial transport from low orbit. It crash-landed with no survivors, and our teams scavenged the wreckage. They found an astromech droid brain that appears undamaged -- unlike the droid''s body. We think we can scan the brain at our facility and learn Imperial engineering protocols. Can you bring us the brain?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'If this astromech brain holds current Imperial encryption protocols, we can do some damage to the Empire before their next scheduled code rotation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 201, 'm34c', 'Good job! We''ll have someone look at the brain as soon as we can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 202, 'm34i', 'Astromech Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 203, 'm34t', 'R2 Brain Awaits Analysis'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 204, 'm34f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'Our spies received a manifest of war materiel bound for the Garia system. If we strike those supply ships, we can cripple Imperial operations in that sector. I need you to fetch the manifest datadisc and bring it here. Be careful. Many Bothans died to bring us this information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'Here''s the disc. It was purchased with Bothan blood, so handle it with respect. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 207, 'm35c', 'Good work. I hope the data on this disc is enough to plot some sabotage missions. The Empire''s foothold in the Garia system is very strong.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 208, 'm35i', 'War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 209, 'm35t', 'Retrieve a War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 210, 'm35f', 'datadisc'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'A Mon Calamari war cruiser is cloaked inside a comet cluster on the fringes of the system. It''s ready to drop off some important Alliance dignitaries. Our listening stations have compiled the schedule windows during which the ship can move past Imperial star patrols. I want you to get that list and bring it to me. Do not delay!.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Here''s the list of schedule windows, such as it is. The pilot of that star cruiser had better be good. Flying past the Imperial patrols will be like threading a very small needle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 213, 'm36c', 'These numbers don''t look very promising, but I suppose they''re all we''ve got. May the Force be with us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 214, 'm36i', 'Entry Windows For Alliance Star Cruiser'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 215, 'm36t', 'Analysis of Imperial Star Patrol Schedule'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 216, 'm36f', 'datadisc\n\nm37o\nI need your help. We''ve received a list of the top star pilots who want to join the Alliance. I think I''m being watched by Imperial surveillance, so someone else has to pick up the list for me. Can you handle it? After the Battle of Yavin we seriously need to replenish the ranks of our fighter pilots. This is the first step.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 217, 'm37p', 'Here''s the list of star pilots. There''s some great names on here, like Avan Beruss from the Illodian Officers'' Academy and Nien Nunb from Sullust. If we keep recruiting this caliber of pilots, we''ll be twice as strong as we were at Yavin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 218, 'm37c', 'Hmm. I can''t say I''ve heard of the pilots on this list, but I''ll certainly look into recruiting them. We need every advantage we can get against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 219, 'm37i', 'List of Top Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 220, 'm37t', 'Deliver a List of Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 221, 'm37f', 'datadisc\n\nm38o\nListen up. Our spies inform us that the Emperor''s enforcer, Darth Vader, has commissioned a team of elite bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. We''re not sure what the team is for, but we want one of our agents on the inside. I want you to meet the top candidate and get a list of credentials for me to review. Only our best agent should attempt a mission as dangerous as this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 222, 'm38p', 'Here are my credentials. This sounds like a dangerous assignment, though. What do you think? Could I pass as a top-flight bounty hunter? My mother says I''ve got a mean look about me, when the light hits me just right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 223, 'm38c', 'These are the credentials of our top candidate, eh? Somehow I''m not encouraged. Well, perhaps Vader won''t recognize a well-hidden spy. It''s not like he''s clairvoyant, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 224, 'm38i', 'Alliance Agent Credentials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 225, 'm38t', 'Fetch the Credentials of a Spy Candidate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 226, 'm38f', 'datadisc\n\nm39o\nOkay, here''s the deal. The captain of the Star Destroyer Beleaguer is hosting an officer''s party on his flight deck. We''ve hidden a listening device in the ommni-box that the band will be using. If we''re lucky we might catch some random intelligence. I want you to fetch the bugged instrument from our offworld agent and bring it back to me. Got it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 227, 'm39p', 'Here''s the ommni-box. It''s a little off-key in the fourth septave of the Bith echo minor scale, but the Imperials shouldn''t notice. I think.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 228, 'm39c', 'Ahh, good. I hope the musicians won''t notice the switch. One ommni-box is just like another, I always say.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 229, 'm39i', 'Bugged Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 230, 'm39t', 'Deliver an Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 231, 'm39f', 'instrument\\ommni_box.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 232, 'm40o', 'At last we have evidence to prove Imperial atrocities on Tyshapahl. I want you to pick up the package from our transport pilot and bring it back to me. I understand this evidence is volatile, so waste no time in getting it here. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 233, 'm40p', 'Yeah, so, here it is. Yes, it''s a corpse. Yes, it''s not frozen. They thawed it for an autopsy and never re-froze it. Some genius at High Command didn''t want to risk destroying the evidence. So, now I pass this fragrant burden off to you. Enjoy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 234, 'm40c', 'By the belt of Antilles! Who gave the command to leave this thing rotting like this? It''s sickening! Quick, let me get this refrigerated before I smell as bad as a nerf-herder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 235, 'm40i', 'Victim of Imperial Atrocity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 236, 'm40t', 'Transport Evidence of Imperial Crimes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 237, 'm40f', 'poi\\corellia\\poi_victim_sandpanther.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 238, 'm41o', 'This is great. We actually reprogrammed an Imperial mission terminal. Now we can send New Order activists into traps and away from our sensitive operations. Go pick up the terminal and bring it here so I can deploy it as soon as possible. I can''t wait to watch these Imperials lapdogs chase after phantoms!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 239, 'm41p', 'Are you the one taking possession of the reprogrammed terminal? Excellent. Here it is, then. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 240, 'm41c', 'Terrific! This reprogrammed mission terminal is going to confuse the heck out of the Imperials. I''ve already got an idea to send them on missions to hunt down a prototype war droid based on the MSE-6 model. They''re just dumb enough to fall for that, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 241, 'm41i', 'Reprogrammed Imperial Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 242, 'm41t', 'Retrieve a Reprogrammed Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 243, 'm41f', 'mission\\mission_terminal.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 244, 'm42o', 'A scientist loyal to the Alliance has developed some kind of new wilderness camouflage system. We''ve smuggled it to the planet. I need you to fetch it for me. If this device works, it could prove an immense help in the war against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 245, 'm42p', 'Believe it or not, this is the fabled new camouflage system. A straw hut. Sometimes I wish we had the resources of the Empire. I really do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 246, 'm42c', 'So. Um. This is the new camouflage system, eh? A hut. Well, you can''t say we leave any option untested in the fight against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 247, 'm42i', 'Big Straw Hut'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 248, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Prototype Camouflage System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 249, 'm42f', 'poi\\endor\\poi_ewok_hut.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 250, 'm43o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial overseer. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 251, 'm43p', 'Here are the clothes. They once belonged to an Imperial Inquisitor. I don''t have to explain to you how rare they are, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 252, 'm43c', 'An Inquisitor''s robe? Impressive! I''ve never seen one before. I''m not sure if we would ever disguise an agent as an Inquisitor, but you never know. Thanks for the good work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 253, 'm43i', 'Imperial Inquisitor Robe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 254, 'm43t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 255, 'm43f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_inquisitor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 256, 'm44o', 'Clandestine funding is an important part of Alliance operations. We''re smuggling a shipment of rare avabush spice to one of our backers on the Frontier, in exchange for a hefty donation. I need you to bring the shipment to me so I can pass it along to the next starship in our underground delivery system. Make sure no Imperials catch you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 257, 'm44p', 'Here''s the avabush spice. Did you know it can be used as a truth serum? I wonder what our secret backer is going to use it for? Hmm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 258, 'm44c', 'Thank you. This avabush spice will help us continue the good work of the Alliance. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 259, 'm44i', 'Avabush Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 260, 'm44t', 'Transport a Shipment of Valuable Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 261, 'm44f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 262, 'm45o', 'I''ve got a job for you. There''s a small package I need you to deliver to me. It contains an Imperial Medal of Honor engraved with the name of Governor Tarkin. Contraband scavengers discovered it in the debris field around Yavin. This medal will make a splendid gift for someone in High Command. Can you bring it to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 263, 'm45p', 'It''s kind of perverse, don''t you think, handling an old war medal like some kind of sick trophy? I dunno. I mean Tarkin is dead. Let''s move on, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 264, 'm45c', 'Ahh! Excellent. I can''t wait to give Tarkin''s old medal as a gift to someone in Alliance High Command. My star is rising, my friend, I assure you of that. It was well worth leaving my post in the Imperial military to take up with the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 265, 'm45i', 'Imperial Medal of Valor   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 266, 'm45t', 'Transport an Imperial Medal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 267, 'm45f', 'sealed container\n\nm46o\nWant to help out with some new war technology? Our scientists have developed a hybrid form of the gel insulation used in AT-AT and AT-ST servo joints. This new gel reacts to certain radio frequencies, with explosive results. We''re planning to sneak it into Imperial production facilities. If you''ve got time, I need to have some of the stuff brought to me from a courier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 268, 'm46p', 'You''d think they would transport explosive gel in some kind of container, wouldn''t you? But no, here it is in a nice, handy blob. Careful, it sort of oozes through your fingers when it gets warm. I''d stay away from radio transmitters with this stuff, if I were you. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 269, 'm46c', 'Thanks for the help. I can''t wait to blow the legs off a few Imperial walkers with this stuff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 270, 'm46i', 'Ball of Explosive Gel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 271, 'm46t', 'Deliver New War Technology'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 272, 'm46f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_ball_of_dough.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 273, 'm47o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 274, 'm47p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 275, 'm47c', 'What, this is it? Nothing more than wood ash, by the looks of it. I guess I was wrong. Thank you nonetheless for helping me, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 276, 'm47i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 277, 'm47t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 278, 'm47f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 279, 'm48o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 280, 'm48p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 281, 'm48c', 'Son of a gundark! I knew it! These are the remains of a notorious Imperial torturer, left behind by a strike team I commissioned to destroy that base. See, you can tell by the stim implants in the ash. They melt at a higher temperature than bone. This confirms my hopes that the torturer was killed. Thank you very much for helping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 282, 'm48i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 283, 'm48t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 284, 'm48f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 285, 'm49o', 'I''m glad you''re here. I have a very important mission for you. A secret Alliance operative has brought a very important droid to this planet. I need you to pick it up and bring it to me at once. I cannot overstate the urgency of this mission. Do not, under any circumstances, let this droid fall into Imperial hands. Is that clear? Go now. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 286, 'm49p', 'Sure is a lot of fuss over a mouse droid, don''t you think? Well, far be it from me to second guess High Command. Here it is. Luck to you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 287, 'm49c', 'I can''t believe this is the very droid the Empire has been scouring the galaxy trying to find! I''m humbled. You did well to transport it here without the authorities getting ahold of it. That would have been a disastrous blow to the Alliance. Thank you again. The Force will be with you, always.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 288, 'm49i', 'Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 289, 'm49t', 'Transport an Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 290, 'm49f', 'mouse droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 291, 'm50o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial soldier. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 292, 'm50p', 'Here is the uniform. Do you recognize it? Not many people would. It once belonged to a member of the Imperial Royal Guard. To say these are not easy to come by would be the understatement of the millennium. Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 293, 'm50c', 'Unbelievable! The robe of an Imperial Royal Guard! I know exactly which Alliance agent will be able to use it, too. This may be our biggest break since the Bothans discovered that weakness in the Death Star. Good work, my friend. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 294, 'm50i', 'Robe of the Imperial Royal Guard'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 295, 'm50t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 296, 'm50f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_royal_guard.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'One of our troops apparently collected a trophy off a fallen Imperial soldier. We''re not fighting the Empire to collect souvenirs. I know a few units that allow it, but not this one. Go and get the souvenir, while I prepare a lecture about showing some class.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Why is it wrong to take trophies? They''re bad guys, right? If they''re dead, they can''t use their gear any more, so why not take a nice souvenir? Oh well, here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'If any Alliance soldier is treating civil war like a hunting trip, we have a lot of education to do. Thanks, I''ll have this helmet destroyed as usual.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 4, 'm1i', 'Stormtrooper Trophy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 5, 'm1t', 'Alliance Shouldn''t Collect Trophies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 6, 'm1f', 'wearables\\armor\\stormtrooper\\armor_stormtrooper_helmet.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'Some of our bravest Alliance members are those who infiltrate the Empire''s ranks to bring us vital intelligence. We just had a sad report that one Imperial Navy spy has been caught. The Empire apparently sent his ring to his next of kin, an insolent gesture intended to humiliate them. We have other plans for that ring. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'My friend risked his life every day to help the cause of freedom. After this smug gesture by the Empire, it turns out his ring can still do some good for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'The Empire didn''t discover that this ring conceals a HoloNet receiver. Our spy used it to eavesdrop on a Star Destroyer''s bridge. We hope we can continue his good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Infiltrator''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 11, 'm2t', 'Proof of Heroism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 12, 'm2f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'The last stormtroopers we defeated were using projectile weapons with insane rates of fire. Our field techs inspected the weapons, and they believe the Empire has developed an improved feed mechanism. Bring us one of these improved mechanisms for analysis, and we''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'I''ve never seen why anyone would use projectile weapons in a galaxy full of blasters, but this engagement changed my mind. Here''s the new feed mechanism.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 15, 'm3c', 'We''ll pass this along to the engineers for study. Meanwhile, thanks for your time, and take this for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 16, 'm3i', 'Projectile Feed Mechanism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 17, 'm3t', 'Insane Rates of Fire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 18, 'm3f', 'component\\weapon\\projectile_feed_mechanism.iff');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'We just took out an Imperial armory, but barely. Their defenses seemed unsually powerful. We salvaged a power module from a destroyed weapon, and our lab wants to analyze it for technical breakthroughs. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'This module comes from a Golan Arms DF.9 anti-infantry battery. One shot blew through two landspeeders running side by side. Most powerful bolt I''ve ever seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 21, 'm4c', 'It''s possible the anti-infantry battery was just malfunctioning, but we don''t know for sure. Our lab will analyze this power module and see if we can duplicate it. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 22, 'm4i', 'Weapon Power Module'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 23, 'm4t', 'Empire''s Weapon Power Breakthrough?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 24, 'm4f', 'component\\structure\\weapon_high_power_module.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'The Empire''s Committee for the Preservation of the New Order is doing more surprise bombings of civilian homes. They steal a family''s droids, then send the droids back bearing implanted tactical warheads. Boom. We''ve discovered one warhead that failed to detonate, and we want to display it to alert the populace. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'It''s bone-chilling to think that the protocol droid serving you dinner could suddenly explode. I hope this provokes a terrible public outcry against COMPNOR.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 27, 'm5c', 'Until we inform the public of the terrible atrocities their government commits, the Empire will continue to rule through fear and terrorism. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 28, 'm5i', 'Droid Implant Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 29, 'm5t', 'COMPNOR Uses Bomb-Droids on Innocents'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_light.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'We just got news of another Imperial Army chemical attack on a civilian population. The chemical agent is new. We salvaged a warhead and need you to bring it here for analysis, so we can develop an antidote. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'We have no idea why the Army attacked this settlement. Maybe the citizens refused to pay taxes, or someone said the wrong thing to a spy. The destruction was terrible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 33, 'm6c', 'Nobody deserves to die so horribly as those people did. With the proper antidote in place, we may be able to prevent the next tragedy. Thanks for your assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 34, 'm6i', 'Imperial Chemical Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 35, 'm6t', 'Empire Using Chem Weapons on Civilians'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 36, 'm6f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_chemical.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'A "procurement specialist" just delivered a vital shipment of power cores to our bases here. Apparently by getting past an Imperial blockade, she won some kind of bet with headquarters. They''ve set up a special payment for her work. If you can pick it up and bring it here, I''ll forward it to her right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I don''t believe I actually got to hold, however briefly, the original flute played by none other than the famous fizz artist Droopy McCool. That is so fine!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 39, 'm7c', 'Well. I guess the smuggler we''re paying off is a fizz-music fan. It takes a special kind of person to risk explosive decompression to win a flute. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 40, 'm7i', 'Droopy McCool''s Flute'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 41, 'm7t', 'A Procurement Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 42, 'm7f', 'instrument\\flute_droopy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a special payment she prearranged with headquarters. She just ran a few shiploads of blaster rifles past the worst Imperial blockade I''ve seen in a while, so she deserves the pay, whatever it is. If you''ll pick it up and bring it here, I''ll pass it along to our procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'I had no idea that mere cooking spices could cost such a fortune. But these are some of the costliest spices in the galaxy. I almost stole a taste of them, but one sample would cost more than a year''s pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 45, 'm8c', 'Spices? I guess our smuggler friend is a cook on the side. Hmm, maybe I''ll ask her to cook dinner sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 46, 'm8i', 'Rare Spices'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 47, 'm8t', 'Pay for a Good Smuggling Job'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 48, 'm8f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is asking for a payment he prearranged with headquarters. We just got the medical supplies he ran past the Imperials, so I need you to pick up the payment at our arranged drop point. Bring the fee here, and I''ll pass it on to our smugg-- procurement specialist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'I have no idea why headquarters needed to transmit us a deed for, of all things, an ore harvester. Any notion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 51, 'm9c', 'The smuggler wanted an ore harvester? How odd. Maybe he plans to go into a new line of work. It''s sure to be safer, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 52, 'm9i', 'Ore Harvester Deed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 53, 'm9t', 'Paying a Procurement Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 54, 'm9f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'The Alliance occasionally revises its code delivery system. Headquarters creates new ways to transmit sensitive messages undetected. I''ve been told a new system is available for pickup. I don''t know what it is, but I''d like you to pick it up and bring it here. Are you willing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'This tree has certain nodules growing in its root structure, under the dirt. The pattern of nodules along each root is the code, like beads on a string.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 57, 'm10c', 'Wait a minute -- root nodules? I didn''t even know we used strings of beads, let alone potted trees. Well, I''ll get it into analysis, and someone will explain it to me. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 58, 'm10i', 'Potted Tree'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 59, 'm10t', 'New Test for Code Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 60, 'm10f', 'furniture\\all\\frn_all_tree_potted_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'The Alliance periodically creates new ways to deliver coded messages without arousing Imperial suspicion. The latest breakthrough is available for pickup, but I haven''t been told what it is. If you can pick it up and bring it here, we''ll get it into analysis to figure out the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'The rows of knots of this woven rug are fractionally misaligned. The deviation of each knot from the straight line is an integral value in millimeters. That''s the code.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 63, 'm11c', 'So -- you measure a knot''s position, and its irregularity is the code value? Never mind, I don''t need to know yet. I''ll get this rug to analysis. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 64, 'm11i', 'Rug'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 65, 'm11t', 'Code Delivery Needs Further Tests'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 66, 'm11f', 'furniture\\modern\\rug_rnd_lg_s01.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'The Alliance is testing its code delivery systems again. Someone has figured out yet another way to transmit coded information right under the Empire''s collective nose. I have no idea what you''re supposed to go and pick up this time, but if you can bring it here quickly for analysis, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'If you play this kloo horn, the frequencies of consecutive notes are imperceptibly altered. The integral reduction in wavelength for each note is the code value.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 69, 'm12c', 'Codes in live music. That beats all. I''ll never hear a cantina band in quite the same way. Okay, thanks. Time to play this for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 70, 'm12i', 'Kloo Horn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 71, 'm12t', 'Code Delivery System Testing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 72, 'm12f', 'instrument\\kloo_horn.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'From time to time the Alliance tests its code delivery systems. We can''t transmit new codes over the HoloNet, obviously, so we conceal the data in a variety of objects. I don''t know what they''ve managed to insert codes into this time, but I need you to bring me the whatever-it-is for analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'The test information is encoded by the size and position of the welds connecting crossbars in this cage. We worked on that one quite a while!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 75, 'm13c', 'Well, whaddya know. How do they even think of these things? All right, thanks. I have to get this cage into analysis.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 76, 'm13i', 'Cage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 77, 'm13t', 'Test Code Delivery System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 78, 'm13f', 'parrot_cage\\parrot_cage.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'We think another of our "procurement specialists" got blasted trying to run an Imperial blockade. These smugglers always run silent, so we don''t know much for sure. We found a crash site, but there''s not much left of the ship. To tell whether it''s our smuggler, I need to see something from the remains. Can you bring it here, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'We found this earring on -- we think it was the pilot''s body. Not much else left ofher. Grim duty, this salvage work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 81, 'm14c', 'Argh. I recognize this earring. What a bad way to go. Sorry, give me a moment. Okay. I''ll notify her next of kin. Thanks, that''s all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 82, 'm14i', 'Unidentified Earring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 83, 'm14t', 'Identify Smuggler Remains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 84, 'm14f', 'wearables\\earring\\earring_s04.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'It''s dangerous work running supplies for the Alliance, and it looks like one of our blockade runners paid the last price today. We don''t know for sure, because they always run silent. But our ships salvaged a wreck in space, and they''re shipping the identifiable remains of the pilot down here. Could you bring me what they''ve found? Grisly duy, I know, but it has to be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'What with the explosive decompression, we couldn''t find a body. This necklace got caught on the pilot''s chair, though. Is it our runner''s?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 87, 'm15c', 'Yes. Yes, that belonged to her. I expect I''ll have to report this to headquarters -- not to mention her next of kin (sigh). Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 88, 'm15i', 'Blockade Runner''s Necklace'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 89, 'm15t', 'Remains of Blockade Runner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 90, 'm15f', 'wearables\\necklace\\necklace_s02.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'We''ve been losing more "procurement specialists" as they try to smuggle supplies to us through Imperial blockades. I''ve had news that a smuggler''s ship crashed near here.  I need to know who crashed; we had no distress reports. If you could bring me some identifying token from the remains, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'We couldn''t find any identifying marks except this ring. This crash was strange, because from down here we saw no evidence of a dogfight. Sabotage, maybe?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 93, 'm16c', 'Huh! Yeah, I recognize this. Not from our pilot, but I think now I know who attacked our pilot. Excuse me, I have to contact a certain bounty hunter I know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 94, 'm16i', 'Smuggler''s Ring'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 95, 'm16t', 'Last Ring of a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 96, 'm16f', 'wearables\\ring\\ring_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'We lose a certain number of smuggling ships to Imperial blockades, but now I''ve received word of that one of our "procurement specialists" got killed even before liftoff. I understand the ship is wrecked, but there may be some identifying mark in the remains. Can you check there and bring back whatever you find?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'You''re here to look over the remains? Here''s what we found -- a vest. Wrong size for the dead smuggler. You should show it to whoever sent you here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 99, 'm17c', 'Hmm. A Hutt gang vest. I didn''t expect that. A territorial grab? Maybe we need to bring in some higher-level negotiators. Excuse me, I have to call headquarters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 100, 'm17i', 'Gangster''s Vest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 101, 'm17t', 'Identify a Smuggler''s Murderer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 102, 'm17f', 'wearables\\vest\\vest_hutt_gang_s03.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'Our technicians are looking for vulnerabilities in Imperial AT-AT walker control systems. A salvage agent has just received an intact diagnostic unit that reads telemetry off walker drive systems. If we can crack the unit''s codes, we can deduce many internal details of AT-ATs. Can you bring us this diagnostic unit? The faster, the better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'Our forces downed an AT-AT on Yavin 4 when the Empire set up its blockade. We sent in a spy later to scavenge the wreckage. This beauty is the result.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 105, 'm18c', 'All right! Time to get the astromech droid to talk to this thing and see what it likes to hear. We''ll be in touch with you again, thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 106, 'm18i', 'Walker Control Unit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 107, 'm18t', 'Help Jam Imperial Walker Systems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 108, 'm18f', 'component\\item\\electronic_control_unit.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'We''re hearing scary rumors that the Empire has a way to remotely launch all the escape pods on our ships. They press a button, and boom! We''re stuck. Sounds unlikely, but to make sure, we''re analyzing components on our various escape pods. Another component just arrived for testing. Can you pick it up?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'This is the energy distributor used in the explosive bolts on the Corellian Engineering Class-6 escape pod. Yes, it is set up to receive remote telemetry. Can''t imagine why. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 111, 'm19c', 'Those explosive bolts receive remote telemetry so that if the ship systems get damaged, a crew member can launch the pod from a datapad interface. Thanks for the component. We''ll get to it right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 112, 'm19i', 'Escape Pod Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 113, 'm19t', 'Imperials Triggering Pods Remotely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 114, 'm19f', 'component\\item\\electronic_energy_distributor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'The Alliance needs more eyes in high places. If they''re small, invisible eyes, all the better. We''re working on a microsensor the size of a grain of dust, that can rest invisibly on an Imperial''s uniform. We hope we''ll hear intelligence in places where the Empire doesn''t think to jam sensors. We have a prototype ready for testing. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'This package contains the sensor and the receiving apparatus. Unfortunately, the sensor itself tends to blow around and break when air moves over it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 117, 'm20c', 'It breaks when air moves over it? You mean, for example, when someone breathes? Hmm. Sounds like there are still big problems with this design. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 118, 'm20i', 'Micro Sensor and Receiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 119, 'm20t', 'Dust-Sized Sensor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 120, 'm20f', 'component\\item\\micro_sensor_suite.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some crazy old hermit in the Outer Rim Territories sent us a remarkable redesign of our standard blaster pistol barrel. Our engineers said it looked so bizarre it could have come from another galaxy. But we tried making a prototype, and now it''s ready for testing. Who knows? It might be our salvation. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'The capacitance induction on this barrel works on some completely novel principle -- allegedly. It may run much cooler than existing barrels. Or it may be total trash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 123, 'm21c', 'I''m leery of building such a bizarre new barrel. But if I hadn''t ordered this prototype, I''d always wonder. I still wonder who that designer is. Anyway, we''ll start testing soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 124, 'm21i', 'Unusual Blaster Barrel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 125, 'm21t', 'Odd New Blaster Barrel Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 126, 'm21f', 'component\\weapon\\blaster_pistol_barrel.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'A mysterious hermit in the Outer Rim has been sending us amazing redesigns of our existing equipment. We just got his new version of a flashback suppressor useful on many different weapons. It''s based on weird principles, but apparently this fellow''s designs have showed promise before. So I''ve ordered a prototype. Can you bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'This flashback suppressor uses some kind of magnetic self-adjusting feedback loop. It''s quite weird. I have no idea whether this thing will ever work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 129, 'm22c', 'This hermit''s designs are hit-and-miss, they say. I don''t know if a magnetic feedback suppressor will change the course of the war, but regardless, thanks for bringing it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 130, 'm22i', 'Unusual Flashback Suppressor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 131, 'm22t', 'Odd Flashback Suppressor Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 132, 'm22f', 'component\\weapon\\laser_magnetic_flashback_supressor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Commander Skywalker destroyed the Death Star without a targeting computer. This shows that our computers still fall short. We don''t object to pilots using gut instinct, but we''d like to give them better tools when guts fail them. Our new prototype computer has just arrived from offworld, and we''re ready to test it as soon as you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'This is a sweet new model. Uses a modified droid brain, I think. I hope it''ll help in the battles ahead as the Empire starts striking back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 135, 'm23c', 'This targeting computer uses a modified droid brain? What a terrible idea. I hope it doesn''t start developing a personality. Well, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 136, 'm23i', 'Improved Targeting Computer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 137, 'm23t', 'Targeting Computer Upgrade'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 138, 'm23f', 'component\\weapon\\weapon_targeting_computer.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'We''re getting refugees from Imperial attacks in the countryside. These poor folks had their homes destroyed, their equipment burned -- they have nowhere to turn. We''re setting up relief and relocation efforts, but in the short term, we''ve got some hungry kids who need food. Can you please bring me a food basket from our supplier?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I always have some of these baskets ready to go. The Empire always gives us a use for them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 141, 'm24c', 'Thanks. I''ll get the food to the latest refugees. You can be proud you helped today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 142, 'm24i', 'Provisions'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 143, 'm24t', 'Food for Refugee Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 144, 'm24f', 'food\\crafted\\meal_dish_food_basket.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'The Alliance is still looking for good base sites around the Outer Rim. Each world seems to present problems of its own. Our existing ore harvesters won''t work in some environments, so we''ve had our engineers develop a suitably ruggedized harvester model. We need you to bring us the schematics, because we don''t want the Empire learning the environments we''re targeting.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'It''s a straightforward task, redesigning an ore harvester. Not much glamour, but the war effort rides on this kind of work. That''s what I tell myself, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 147, 'm25c', 'Thanks! Remember, don''t mention the ore harvester redesign to anyone. The Empire has spies everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 148, 'm25i', 'Ore Harvester Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 149, 'm25t', 'Redesigned Ore Harvester'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 150, 'm25f', 'deed\\harvester_deed\\ore_harvester_heavy_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'We''ve set up an advance base on a remote world -- never mind where -- and no one there has ever heard of a power core. They still need power, so we''re shipping them the latest designs for high-efficiency wind power generators. To prevent the Empire from discovering our supply chain, we need you to hand-deliver the design to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'On some worlds you can generate more from wind power than from a good fusion generator -- if your wind station can stand up in a perpetual hurricane.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 153, 'm26c', 'Great! We''ll get this design shipped off to our advance base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 154, 'm26i', 'Wind Power Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 155, 'm26t', 'New Base Needs Wind Power'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 156, 'm26f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_wind_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'I never thought of such things back when the Alliance was a ragtag band of outcasts, but now we''re experiencing local shortages of uniforms. In big engagements against the Empire, we need to know who''s who. We have designs ready for a new clothing factory. We''d rather not trust them to the HoloNet, for reasons you may learn later. Can you bring the designs here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'I don''t know where they''re building this factory, but the designs show it will make clothing intended for cold climates. Really cold.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 159, 'm27c', 'Yes, we''re making uniforms for a cold climate. But speculating why, or letting anyone know that little piece of data, is a bad idea.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 160, 'm27i', 'Designs for Uniform Factory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 161, 'm27t', 'Alliance Needs Uniforms'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 162, 'm27f', 'deed\\factory_deed\\clothing_factory_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'Our new advance base in the Outer Rim Territories is getting weird feedback from the world''s magnetic field. They''re busy shielding all the computers, but the power generator is getting finicky too. They don''t have the infrastructure to fix that. So we''ve worked up a new design, and we can start construction once you bring it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'The fusion generator in these plans will serve up enough power to re-tune that planet''s magnetic field! You bet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 165, 'm28c', 'This may be an over-specification; no base needs quite this much power. But we''ll sort it out and get the generator offworld soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 166, 'm28i', 'Fusion Generator Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 167, 'm28t', 'Alliance Base With Fusion Problems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 168, 'm28f', 'deed\\generator_deed\\power_generator_fusion_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'An Imperial spy has compromised the weapon-control protocols we use to remotely fire our turret installations. The Empire could potentially turn our own laser cannons against us! A team of slicers and engineers has developed a retrofit that will secure these turret blocks against outside interference. It''s up to you to bring us the design, quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The old turret block design was already secure, and this one is better. But you can''t control the "human engineering" that lets spies trick our operatives into revealing secret protocols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 171, 'm29c', 'Thanks! We''ll get this turret retrofit into place at top speed. And while we''re at it, I hope we get across some basic education about how to keep secrets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 172, 'm29i', 'Turret Block Redesign'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 173, 'm29t', 'Alliance Turrets Compromised'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 174, 'm29f', 'deed\\turret_deed\\turret_block_large_deed.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'Some idiot tourist bought a venomous reptavian offworld and brought it back here as a pet. That "pet" just stung an innocent girl, and we don''t have a suitable antivenin here. One of our labs has just manufactured an antidote. Bring it here, quickly. A girl''s life hangs in the balance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Here''s the antidote. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 177, 'm30c', 'At last! We''ll give this antidote to the girl right now. We destroyed the reptavian, by the way, and gave the tourist a sharp lecture about importing offworld animals.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 178, 'm30i', 'Venom Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 179, 'm30t', 'Deliver Reptavian Poison Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 180, 'm30f', 'medicine\\antidote_sm_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Interesting news. An Alliance slicer has procured the schematics for the Empire''s secure data terminals. If we can crack the encryption scheme, we could theoretically learn every mission the Empire assigns to its followers. Obviously we need to keep this find off the HoloNet, so we''d like you to hand-deliver the schematics to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'I never liked those mission terminals. I hope this breach makes the Empire stop using them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 183, 'm31c', 'With any luck, we''ll know the Empire''s plans as soon as they do! Thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 184, 'm31i', 'Imperial Data Terminal Schematic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 185, 'm31t', 'We Have the Empire''s Data Terminals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 186, 'm31f', 'furniture\\imperial\\data_terminal_s1.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'I''m supposed to pick up some kind of equipment for an upcoming assault, but the transmission was corrupted. I know the pickup point, and it''s supposed to be kept secret and hand-delivered. Other than that, I''m clueless. Welcome to the military. Can you pick up this whatever-it-is and bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'Don''t mind that ticking sound, it''s just a loose interior casing. But if I were you, I''d deliver this thing pretty quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 189, 'm32c', 'A -- what? What kind of warhead? Is it live? Why is it ticking? Okay, I need to make some calls here. See you later, okay? I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 190, 'm32i', 'Warhead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 191, 'm32t', 'Classified Pick-Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 192, 'm32f', 'component\\munition\\warhead_heavy.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We''ve analyzed captured plans from the Empire''s defunct Dark Trooper project, and there''s some interesting technology there. Our lab''s latest prototype adapts a deflector plate from the Stage 1 droid to function as an actual deflector shield projector, worn on the arm. Sounds great, doesn''t it? We need you to bring us the prototype plate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'Here is the plate component. The power consumption for the entire deflector shield is much too steep right now. It would melt your arm! But we''re working on it, we''re working away....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 195, 'm33c', 'We need to set up a testing program for this deflector plate. The Empire''s discarded technology may be the boost we need. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 196, 'm33i', 'Deflector Shield Plate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 197, 'm33t', 'Deliver Shield Projector Component'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 198, 'm33f', 'component\\armor\\deflector_shield_projector_plate.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'We downed an Imperial transport from low orbit. It crash-landed with no survivors, and our teams scavenged the wreckage. They found an astromech droid brain that appears undamaged -- unlike the droid''s body. We think we can scan the brain at our facility and learn Imperial engineering protocols. Can you bring us the brain?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'If this astromech brain holds current Imperial encryption protocols, we can do some damage to the Empire before their next scheduled code rotation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 201, 'm34c', 'Good job! We''ll have someone look at the brain as soon as we can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 202, 'm34i', 'Astromech Droid Brain'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 203, 'm34t', 'R2 Brain Awaits Analysis'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 204, 'm34f', 'component\\droid\\droid_brain.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'Our spies received a manifest of war materiel bound for the Garia system. If we strike those supply ships, we can cripple Imperial operations in that sector. I need you to fetch the manifest datadisc and bring it here. Be careful. Many Bothans died to bring us this information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'Here''s the disc. It was purchased with Bothan blood, so handle it with respect. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 207, 'm35c', 'Good work. I hope the data on this disc is enough to plot some sabotage missions. The Empire''s foothold in the Garia system is very strong.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 208, 'm35i', 'War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 209, 'm35t', 'Retrieve a War Materiel Manifest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 210, 'm35f', 'datadisc'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'A Mon Calamari war cruiser is cloaked inside a comet cluster on the fringes of the system. It''s ready to drop off some important Alliance dignitaries. Our listening stations have compiled the schedule windows during which the ship can move past Imperial star patrols. I want you to get that list and bring it to me. Do not delay!.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Here''s the list of schedule windows, such as it is. The pilot of that star cruiser had better be good. Flying past the Imperial patrols will be like threading a very small needle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 213, 'm36c', 'These numbers don''t look very promising, but I suppose they''re all we''ve got. May the Force be with us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 214, 'm36i', 'Entry Windows For Alliance Star Cruiser'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 215, 'm36t', 'Analysis of Imperial Star Patrol Schedule'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 216, 'm36f', 'datadisc\n\nm37o\nI need your help. We''ve received a list of the top star pilots who want to join the Alliance. I think I''m being watched by Imperial surveillance, so someone else has to pick up the list for me. Can you handle it? After the Battle of Yavin we seriously need to replenish the ranks of our fighter pilots. This is the first step.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 217, 'm37p', 'Here''s the list of star pilots. There''s some great names on here, like Avan Beruss from the Illodian Officers'' Academy and Nien Nunb from Sullust. If we keep recruiting this caliber of pilots, we''ll be twice as strong as we were at Yavin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 218, 'm37c', 'Hmm. I can''t say I''ve heard of the pilots on this list, but I''ll certainly look into recruiting them. We need every advantage we can get against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 219, 'm37i', 'List of Top Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 220, 'm37t', 'Deliver a List of Star Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 221, 'm37f', 'datadisc\n\nm38o\nListen up. Our spies inform us that the Emperor''s enforcer, Darth Vader, has commissioned a team of elite bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. We''re not sure what the team is for, but we want one of our agents on the inside. I want you to meet the top candidate and get a list of credentials for me to review. Only our best agent should attempt a mission as dangerous as this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 222, 'm38p', 'Here are my credentials. This sounds like a dangerous assignment, though. What do you think? Could I pass as a top-flight bounty hunter? My mother says I''ve got a mean look about me, when the light hits me just right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 223, 'm38c', 'These are the credentials of our top candidate, eh? Somehow I''m not encouraged. Well, perhaps Vader won''t recognize a well-hidden spy. It''s not like he''s clairvoyant, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 224, 'm38i', 'Alliance Agent Credentials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 225, 'm38t', 'Fetch the Credentials of a Spy Candidate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 226, 'm38f', 'datadisc\n\nm39o\nOkay, here''s the deal. The captain of the Star Destroyer Beleaguer is hosting an officer''s party on his flight deck. We''ve hidden a listening device in the ommni-box that the band will be using. If we''re lucky we might catch some random intelligence. I want you to fetch the bugged instrument from our offworld agent and bring it back to me. Got it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 227, 'm39p', 'Here''s the ommni-box. It''s a little off-key in the fourth septave of the Bith echo minor scale, but the Imperials shouldn''t notice. I think.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 228, 'm39c', 'Ahh, good. I hope the musicians won''t notice the switch. One ommni-box is just like another, I always say.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 229, 'm39i', 'Bugged Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 230, 'm39t', 'Deliver an Ommni-Box'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 231, 'm39f', 'instrument\\ommni_box.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 232, 'm40o', 'At last we have evidence to prove Imperial atrocities on Tyshapahl. I want you to pick up the package from our transport pilot and bring it back to me. I understand this evidence is volatile, so waste no time in getting it here. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 233, 'm40p', 'Yeah, so, here it is. Yes, it''s a corpse. Yes, it''s not frozen. They thawed it for an autopsy and never re-froze it. Some genius at High Command didn''t want to risk destroying the evidence. So, now I pass this fragrant burden off to you. Enjoy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 234, 'm40c', 'By the belt of Antilles! Who gave the command to leave this thing rotting like this? It''s sickening! Quick, let me get this refrigerated before I smell as bad as a nerf-herder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 235, 'm40i', 'Victim of Imperial Atrocity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 236, 'm40t', 'Transport Evidence of Imperial Crimes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 237, 'm40f', 'poi\\corellia\\poi_victim_sandpanther.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 238, 'm41o', 'This is great. We actually reprogrammed an Imperial mission terminal. Now we can send New Order activists into traps and away from our sensitive operations. Go pick up the terminal and bring it here so I can deploy it as soon as possible. I can''t wait to watch these Imperials lapdogs chase after phantoms!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 239, 'm41p', 'Are you the one taking possession of the reprogrammed terminal? Excellent. Here it is, then. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 240, 'm41c', 'Terrific! This reprogrammed mission terminal is going to confuse the heck out of the Imperials. I''ve already got an idea to send them on missions to hunt down a prototype war droid based on the MSE-6 model. They''re just dumb enough to fall for that, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 241, 'm41i', 'Reprogrammed Imperial Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 242, 'm41t', 'Retrieve a Reprogrammed Mission Terminal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 243, 'm41f', 'mission\\mission_terminal.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 244, 'm42o', 'A scientist loyal to the Alliance has developed some kind of new wilderness camouflage system. We''ve smuggled it to the planet. I need you to fetch it for me. If this device works, it could prove an immense help in the war against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 245, 'm42p', 'Believe it or not, this is the fabled new camouflage system. A straw hut. Sometimes I wish we had the resources of the Empire. I really do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 246, 'm42c', 'So. Um. This is the new camouflage system, eh? A hut. Well, you can''t say we leave any option untested in the fight against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 247, 'm42i', 'Big Straw Hut'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 248, 'm42t', 'Fetch a Prototype Camouflage System'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 249, 'm42f', 'poi\\endor\\poi_ewok_hut.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 250, 'm43o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial overseer. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 251, 'm43p', 'Here are the clothes. They once belonged to an Imperial Inquisitor. I don''t have to explain to you how rare they are, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 252, 'm43c', 'An Inquisitor''s robe? Impressive! I''ve never seen one before. I''m not sure if we would ever disguise an agent as an Inquisitor, but you never know. Thanks for the good work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 253, 'm43i', 'Imperial Inquisitor Robe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 254, 'm43t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 255, 'm43f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_inquisitor.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 256, 'm44o', 'Clandestine funding is an important part of Alliance operations. We''re smuggling a shipment of rare avabush spice to one of our backers on the Frontier, in exchange for a hefty donation. I need you to bring the shipment to me so I can pass it along to the next starship in our underground delivery system. Make sure no Imperials catch you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 257, 'm44p', 'Here''s the avabush spice. Did you know it can be used as a truth serum? I wonder what our secret backer is going to use it for? Hmm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 258, 'm44c', 'Thank you. This avabush spice will help us continue the good work of the Alliance. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 259, 'm44i', 'Avabush Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 260, 'm44t', 'Transport a Shipment of Valuable Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 261, 'm44f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_spices.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 262, 'm45o', 'I''ve got a job for you. There''s a small package I need you to deliver to me. It contains an Imperial Medal of Honor engraved with the name of Governor Tarkin. Contraband scavengers discovered it in the debris field around Yavin. This medal will make a splendid gift for someone in High Command. Can you bring it to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 263, 'm45p', 'It''s kind of perverse, don''t you think, handling an old war medal like some kind of sick trophy? I dunno. I mean Tarkin is dead. Let''s move on, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 264, 'm45c', 'Ahh! Excellent. I can''t wait to give Tarkin''s old medal as a gift to someone in Alliance High Command. My star is rising, my friend, I assure you of that. It was well worth leaving my post in the Imperial military to take up with the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 265, 'm45i', 'Imperial Medal of Valor   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 266, 'm45t', 'Transport an Imperial Medal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 267, 'm45f', 'sealed container\n\nm46o\nWant to help out with some new war technology? Our scientists have developed a hybrid form of the gel insulation used in AT-AT and AT-ST servo joints. This new gel reacts to certain radio frequencies, with explosive results. We''re planning to sneak it into Imperial production facilities. If you''ve got time, I need to have some of the stuff brought to me from a courier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 268, 'm46p', 'You''d think they would transport explosive gel in some kind of container, wouldn''t you? But no, here it is in a nice, handy blob. Careful, it sort of oozes through your fingers when it gets warm. I''d stay away from radio transmitters with this stuff, if I were you. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 269, 'm46c', 'Thanks for the help. I can''t wait to blow the legs off a few Imperial walkers with this stuff.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 270, 'm46i', 'Ball of Explosive Gel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 271, 'm46t', 'Deliver New War Technology'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 272, 'm46f', 'component\\food\\ingredient_ball_of_dough.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 273, 'm47o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 274, 'm47p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 275, 'm47c', 'What, this is it? Nothing more than wood ash, by the looks of it. I guess I was wrong. Thank you nonetheless for helping me, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 276, 'm47i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 277, 'm47t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 278, 'm47f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 279, 'm48o', 'Our agents recovered some interesting debris from the ruins of a destroyed Imperial outpost. I want you to take possession of this material from our courier and bring it here. I have a sneaking suspicion I know what it is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 280, 'm48p', 'Here you go. Looks like a bunch of ashes to me, but maybe someone on this planet can make use of it. Take care. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 281, 'm48c', 'Son of a gundark! I knew it! These are the remains of a notorious Imperial torturer, left behind by a strike team I commissioned to destroy that base. See, you can tell by the stim implants in the ash. They melt at a higher temperature than bone. This confirms my hopes that the torturer was killed. Thank you very much for helping.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 282, 'm48i', 'Suspicious Ashes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 283, 'm48t', 'Deliver Suspicious Debris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 284, 'm48f', 'camp\\campfire_logs_ash.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 285, 'm49o', 'I''m glad you''re here. I have a very important mission for you. A secret Alliance operative has brought a very important droid to this planet. I need you to pick it up and bring it to me at once. I cannot overstate the urgency of this mission. Do not, under any circumstances, let this droid fall into Imperial hands. Is that clear? Go now. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 286, 'm49p', 'Sure is a lot of fuss over a mouse droid, don''t you think? Well, far be it from me to second guess High Command. Here it is. Luck to you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 287, 'm49c', 'I can''t believe this is the very droid the Empire has been scouring the galaxy trying to find! I''m humbled. You did well to transport it here without the authorities getting ahold of it. That would have been a disastrous blow to the Alliance. Thank you again. The Force will be with you, always.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 288, 'm49i', 'Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 289, 'm49t', 'Transport an Innocuous Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 290, 'm49f', 'mouse droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 291, 'm50o', 'A Zabrak spy has stolen the clothes of a high-ranking Imperial soldier. They will provide an excellent disguise for one of our agents. The spy was killed shortly afterward, but she managed to pass off the clothes to one of our civilian contacts. An Alliance pilot has flown them here. The Empire is on the lookout, so I need you to sneak to the rendezvous point, collect the package and make sure it gets back to me. Are you up to the job, my friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 292, 'm50p', 'Here is the uniform. Do you recognize it? Not many people would. It once belonged to a member of the Imperial Royal Guard. To say these are not easy to come by would be the understatement of the millennium. Handle it with care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 293, 'm50c', 'Unbelievable! The robe of an Imperial Royal Guard! I know exactly which Alliance agent will be able to use it, too. This may be our biggest break since the Bothans discovered that weakness in the Death Star. Good work, my friend. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 294, 'm50i', 'Robe of the Imperial Royal Guard'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 295, 'm50t', 'Transport an Imperial Disguise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_deliver_rebel_medium.stf', 296, 'm50f', 'wearables\\robe\\robe_royal_guard.iff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Our efforts to stamp out the Rebellion has created some additional problems for law enforcement. Refugees are being recruited by local swoop gangs and other criminal organizations. This has led to a rise in violent crimes. We need enterprising agents to help keep peace and order in the Empire. Think you can help us out, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Good work, citizen. One by one, we''ll get all these wretched hives of scum and villainy. Have a drink on us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Keep the Empire Safe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Certain slavers are not content to stick to the Imperial list of approved species. Indeed, these slavers feel they must enslave humans, and that''s something we can''t tolerate. Through the help of Imperial Intelligence, we''ve located the lair of a group of slavers that have been dealing exclusively in humans. We need a small strike team to assault this base and blast it into rubble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Humans shall not be enslaved while the Empire governs the galaxy. Well done, agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Protect Imperial Citizens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'We have pinpointed the coordinates of a ground-based tractor beam used by area pirates. For a percentage the owners use the beam to trap merchant ships so that space pirates can board them. We need a civilian strike team to take out the weapon.  The site is heavily guarded, so be prepared for a fight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Now the merchants who fly through local space have one less worry. Well done. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Save the Merchants'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Our informants have assured us that quite a number of wanted pirates frequent an obscure little cantina at these coordinates. Enterprising freelancers are encouraged to remove this blight from the planet. A substantial reward is available. These are hardened criminals and will be well-armed. The cantina is billed as a "private club," so don''t expect a warm welcome.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Here is your reward. The star lanes are safer thanks to your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Blast a Wretched Hive of Scum and Villainy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'We have the coordinates of a secret depot where pirates buy contraband food supplies without notifying the authorities that they have landed. We need some experienced freelancers to blast the site to smoke and rubble. There are usually one or two armed pirate crews in the area, so destroying this depot entails some danger.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Excellent. Those space scum need to understand that their cutthroat ways are not welcome in this system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'No Pirate Meals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'An enterprising pirate captain recently stole a cargo of Imperial probe droids. With a little reprogramming these droids have become his scouts in the area, monitoring the local spaceports and alerting him when a rich freighter takes off. Our own probots have tracked his droids to a well-fortified terminal off the beaten path. We need you to stage an assault on the terminal and blast it into oblivion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Good work. Without his fleet of probe droids, that pirate will have to track down his quarry the old-fashioned way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Blast the Far-Seeing Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Pirates are a plague on interstellar shipping and end up costing the Empire millions of credits each year. We can hit those pirates hard by cutting their access to safe ports and hideouts. It''s not easy to hide a spaceship, even the smaller fighters employed by some of these rogues. We know of several suspicious outposts big enough to contain landing bays and need you to blast these outposts to pieces.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'Good work, citizen. Keep at it and we''ll keep paying you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Take Out Pirate Landing Bays'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'If pirates don''t have working ships, they can''t practice their despicable trade. We''ve learned of several small storage facilities in the area that house a wide assortment of spare ship parts. We''re certain that these are pirate stashes. We need someone to blast these facilities to atoms. You may encounter some armed resistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Pirate ships floating uselessly in space is an image we like, citizen. Good work in helping us to ground those marauding vessels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Incinerate Pirates'' Spare Parts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Ever wonder where pirates store their ill-gotten goods, citizen? We''ve discovered a few places and we need them destroyed. Our agents are too busy pursuing Rebels to attend to this matter themselves so we''ve decided to turn to you. We''ll compensate you for every storage facility on our list that you blast to atoms.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Job well done, citizen. The money is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Blast Pirates'' Stash'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'A group of known pirates has started hanging around an abandoned settlement. That place is beginning to attract all manner of scum. We''re fairly certain they deal glitterstim spice out of there and no telling what else. We need you to blast that den of thieves into oblivion. Do you think you can help us keep the Empire free of these parasites?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'That''s showing them, citizen. Those space slugs will think twice about crossing our path. You''ve earned your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Demolish the Pirates'' Hangout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Those thieving pirates wouldn''t be able to operate if it weren''t for their fences. After all, those rogues can''t just traipse down to the local market with all their stolen goods, now can they? We''ve tracked down a few of these "blood money traders" and want their operations terminated. Many of these fences are former pirates themselves. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'If we make piracy unprofitable, perhaps it will end. You''re certainly doing your part, citizen. Congratulations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Take Out the Fences'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'Like all vermin, pirates need holes they can crawl down into when they''re in danger of being exterminated. We''ve located some of these safehouses in our area and want these places blasted into oblivion. We''re offering a decent reward to any agent who can help us get rid of these vermin-infested places. Do you think you have what it takes?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'As an Exterminator for Justice, citizen, you shine like a supernova. Keep up the excellent work and remember that your children will inherit the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Blast Pirates'' Hideout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'We''ve discovered a secret refueling depot that pirates have built to aid in attacks from this system. We''re in need of a professional problem solver to get rid of this refueling station so those criminals stop visiting our planet. There will be adequate compensation for the being who succeeds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'That should discourage those thieving vermin to steer clear of this system. Good work, citizen. Hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Take Out Refueling Depot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'We''ve been getting reports of suspicious activity around an old starship repair shop. After an investigation, we discovered that the owner of the shop is actually a former smuggler who now serves as a mechanic to well-known pirates. Can you help us put this criminal out of business, citizen?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Good job, citizen. Justice is served today. We hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Take Out Pirates'' Repair Shop'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'Some local glitterstim pusher and a group of thugs has set up shop in a nearby neighborhood and we want them out. We know where they hang out and need someone to go in there and redecorate the place -- preferably with blaster). There''s a decent reward in it. Can you help the Empire do this? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'That''s showing those poison-pushers who''s boss. Good work, citizen. The Empire could use more upstanding folk like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Blast the Drug Dealers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'An ingenious slicer gang calling themselves ReFormat has altered our outgoing supply orders to re-route an entire base''s resupply schedules to their own base. How clever! It''s so delightfully audacious, I almost hate to order you to destroy their base and kill them all. But of course, duty must be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'All destroyed? Very well. A shame, really, to annihilate a group so obviously clever and resourceful. Ah well, such regrets are part of an Imperial soldier''s every day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Slicer Gang With Admirable Nerve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'Yet another local slicer gang has taken the name ReFormat. This new gang has somehow contrived to give our TIE Fighters falsified flight plans that send them in tight formation directly over the gang''s stronghold. This seems to be pure mischief, but for safety''s sake we cannot permit this to continue. Go to the stronghold and wipe them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Apparently the name ReFormat has become something of a standard among data slicers. No doubt we shall continue to see new gangs with the same name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'ReFormatting TIE Flight Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'Informants have pinpointed a facility where smugglers have stored their illicit goods. These goods often wind up in Rebel hands. To forestall this, we shall allow you to distinguish yourself by destroying this facility and all goods stored therein. You may commence at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'This is a worthy service to your Empire. You may claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Smuggler''s Storage Facility'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations has found a hideout of notorious smugglers. To achieve favorable trends in a forthcoming report on crime statistics, the Office will avoid dedicating department resources to eradicating these smugglers. Instead, you may take care of this yourself, and the Office will compensate you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Excellent work, and executed on a budget far smaller than the Office would require. Here is your payment. Check back for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Criminal Investigations Contract'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'The behavior of the local criminal element resembles that of vermin. Destroy one infestation, and inevitably a new lair spawns in its place. The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations has located a new warehouse of contraband goods. You must destroy it, as well as all criminals residing there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'A thorough job. Now we may hope for a brief respite from further criminal infestations. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Smuggler Infestation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations continues to confront major budget shortfalls. To gain a more favorable ratio of goals achieved versus resources expended, we are offering you, an independent contractor, a purchase order to eradicate a newly detected facility storing contraband goods. Destroy all smugglers present as well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'You have successfully completed the contract. Contact me for future assignments of this kind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Compensate for Budget Shortfall'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Smugglers flit from base to base as quickly as flies. The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations remains alert, but our procedures make it difficult to move quickly. We have better success commissioning independents such as yourself to eradicate smugglers as they light at a new base. Will you wipe out the latest base for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'The Office is glad you were fast enough to catch those particular flies. You''ll make a fine law enforcement agent yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Catch Smuggler Flies on the Wing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'Due to an increasing workload and reduced efficiency, the Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations is giving out more independent contracts to destroy smuggling bases and storage facilities. This gives you the chance to blast felons with the full authority of the law. Tell me you cannot resist this opportunity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'The Office is pleased at your demonstrated bloodthirst. You may contact us again for further assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Reduce Increased Imperial Workload'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'The Empire could have crushed the Rebellion by now if not for the smugglers who supply it. Imperial Intelligence has located yet another of these nuisances, a base that must be stamped out like all the rest. What do you say? Will you help us strike at the very roots of the Rebellion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Perhaps in describing smugglers as "the roots of the Rebellion," I misspoke. Possibly "the circulatory system" might be more appropriate. At any rate, here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Strike the Roots of the Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Smugglers in this area have been recruiting new members from local disgruntled youth. We have taught the parents of these wayward youths a stern lesson, but the smugglers themselves remain untouched. We require you to go to their base and wipe it out. If there are youths there, well, they will become a negative example to others.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Fine work. It is perhaps sad that young people perished in your assault, but really, being already inclined to criminality, what better fate would they have found?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Forestall Corruption of Local Youth'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'The Empire''s welfare obviously depends on the welfare of its soldiers. I have had an altercation with certain criminals, and they have threatened my life. Obviously this threat must be met with deadly force, but I would prefer to avoid worrying my superiors. Therefore I commission you to destroy these criminals. Tell no one of this assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'An excellent job. Here is your pay. I advise you to let this matter rest quietly, rather than stir up controversy that could only prove harmful to all involved.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Altercation With Criminal Element'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'My commander''s lady friend had an unwise encounter with a local smuggler. The commander is dealing appropriately with the lady, but he also wishes someone to prevent further unwise encounters by destroying the smuggler and everyone in his stronghold. Leave no one alive there, especially any charming young men you may find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'Very well. This payment is given on the condition that you treat this matter with absolute confidentiality. My commander would be displeased to hear his personal life noised about.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'A Commander''s Wayward Lady'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'As the current morals crisis continues -- what do you mean, "what crisis?" I mean the Rebellion, of course. As it continues, legitimate pilots are seduced away from honest work to become smugglers for the traitorous Rebels. Wiping them all out requires independent help. Are you willing to destroy the latest lair of corrupted pilots?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'That was acceptably effective. You can expect more employment opportunities from us. Tell that to any unemployed pilots you know, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Pilots Seduced Into Smuggling'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'It defies comprehension that ordinary citizens continue to drift into smuggling. No sooner do they build their strongholds than we destroy them! Despite their high fatality rate, the Empire''s workload continues to grow. For efficiency''s sake, we wish you to destroy the newly discovered base at these coordinates. You will be well paid, don''t worry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'We are pleased that you employed your weapon skill so efficiently. You well deserve this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Increase Smuggler-Destruction Efficiency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'The Rebellion is now using smugglers to distribute anti-Imperial propaganda. Do these traitors have no shame, continuing to rely on such blatant criminals? The offense must be stopped. We have located several distribution points on this world, and we now assign you to destroy one. Leave no one alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'The propaganda distribution continues. We shall have more work for you along the same lines shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Smugglers Distributing Propaganda'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'Smugglers hired by the Rebellion are distributing holograms purporting to show the destruction of Alderaan at the hands of the Empire. As you know, that paranoid accusation has long been disproven. Luckily we''ve tracked down a facility where this libelous material is being distributed. You must destroy it at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'Excellent. However, our work is only beginning. We shall alert you as we discover new facilities distributing these foul lies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Stop the Lies About Alderaan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'Local gangsters, no doubt prodded by the Rebellion, are harassing a local recruiter for the Imperial Navy. The Imperial Security Bureau has located the gang''s headquarters. You are to visit this gang and recruit them into the local cemetery. Destroy the headquarters while you''re at it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'A fine job. Our recruiters should be above harassment by ordinary citizens, let alone criminals. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Protect Local Imperial Recruiter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'A group of local data slicers has defrauded Imperial supply depots across this planet of millions of credits. The slicers work from the sanctuary of a gang headquarters, in return for a cut of the proceeds. These slicers cause much trouble for the Empire. We would appreciate it if you would kindly obliterate them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'I suspect the slicer community on this world will think again before attempting to defraud the Empire. Your work deserves this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Slicers Taking Shelter With Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'A cunning gang of smugglers was planting illicit cargo in the Empire''s own vessels for secret transport off this world. They had an inside accomplice, who has now divulged all after gentle questioning by the Imperial Security Bureau. We have the coordinates of the gangster base, and we require you to destroy it in exhaustive detail.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'The destruction was perhaps not so thorough as it might have been -- but I shall overlook the shortfall this time. Here is your payment. Return again for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Smugglers With Imperial Accomplice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have new orders for you. A band of space pirates recently stole a shipment of hyperdrive motivators from an Imperial transport. We followed the motivators'' tracking beacon to a small installation. I need you to raze the place to the ground. These vermin need to recognize that the Empire deals no mercy to outlaws.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'I''m pleased with your efficiency. You are an excellent asset to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Blast a Pirate Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'Imperial Customs has given me the coordinates of a suspected smuggler encampment. We don''t have time to investigate every petty infraction. I need you to find the place and blast it to atoms. That will free up my men for more important tasks, like political enforcement.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'It sure sounds like those guys were smugglers. If not, I''ll blame Imperial Customs. I''m an enforcement officer, not an intelligence agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Eliminate a Suspected Smuggler Encampment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'In the name of galactic security, I need your assistance! There are reports of a gang of illegal slavers at the coordinates on my datapad. I want you to level their operation. These unlicensed slavers are a blight on seven sectors and I want to put a stop to them here and now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'You have a knack for destruction. Excellent. I''ll have no unauthorized slavers in my sector!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Gang of Rogue Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Recent raids on Abraxas have driven pirates out of their hiding places. Imperial Intelligence has tracked some of those pirates to this planet. A spike in waste emissions in the wilderness is decidedly suspicious. We need you to check this area out and destroy any illegal operations you find. We can''t let them slip through our fingers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'It pleases me to hear reports of smokingruins and dead pirates. You have earned this generous reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Those Dirty Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'The sign of the Blazing Claw has been used by pirates since the days of the Old Republic. One of our probots observed a ship that bore this sign on its hull. The ship did not seem headed toward any known starports, and we believe it landed at these coordinates. Check them out. If it''s pirates, destroy them. We must not let them get comfortable.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'Would you say that was a difficult mission for you? Because we''re always on the lookout for civilian talent like yours. Consult the mission terminals in town and look for my name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'The Blazing Claw'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'If you''ve never heard of the Black Hole pirate gang, then you''re about to find out more. Recon reports that they''ve got a small installation in my patrol sector. Go out there and burn it to the ground. Can''t let these scum get comfortable, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'The Black Hole pirates are feared in many sectors, but not by me and not by you. I guess they won''t be back here anytime soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'Eliminate Notorious Space Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'I''ve got a lead on an underworld operator named Talon Karrde. I''ve tracked him to a little dive not far from here. I need you to blast the place to atoms. We''ll nab him as he flees. If I can lay my hands on him, I''m sure I''ll come away with leads to some of the big players in the galactic underworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'You did good work, but we couldn''t lay our hands on Talon Karrde. I''m following his trail, though. He won''t escape me for long.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Smoke Out an Underworld Operator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'There''s something shady going on. Some of my men have been spending their off-hours at a seedy little joint they call a cantina. I think it''s more suspect than that. We can''t have members of the Imperial military consorting with criminals and low-lifes. Do me a favor and burn the place down. That will put a stop to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'Excellent. Our investigators will sift through the ashes of the place. I am quite confident they''ll find evidence of criminal activity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Raze a Seedy Joint'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'I require your assistance. A group of distinctly unsavory individuals has stolen a schedule memo addressed to me. I dread the thought of missing the next meeting of the Preliminary Exploratory Action Planning Committee. Would you ask them to give my memo back? If they offer you any trouble, of course you may defend yourself, but I don''t want to cause a scene. I simply want to do my job. Is that asking too much?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'Oh, dear! You had to burn their place to the ground? What a bother. Now I shall have to submit a Form 12-3E/9 to the Collateral Damage Oversight Committee. And I didn''t even get my memo back. Well, I do appreciate that you did your best to avoid violence. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Get My Memo Back'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'Imperial Intelligence has reported high smuggler activity in this system. Our probe droids have narrowed the area where smugglers might have set up a base. We need you to check out these coordinates and eliminate any operations you find there. We''ll not let these dogs make a mockery of Imperial law.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'Well done, citizen. Smugglers are known to conspire with the Rebellion. We must always keep the pressure on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Smack the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'Black Sun believes itself untouchable, even by Imperial law. Our job is to shatter this belief. We think we know where one of these Black Sun gangs have set up shop. It''s your job to show them we won''t abide their kind here. Leave nothing but ashes. Is that clear?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'Gangsters make a living by extorting and terrorizing innocent civilians. The Empire won''t abide that kind of behavior without authorization. You have made that point very clear. Well done, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Crush the Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'Yes, I lost another shipment of TIE solar array support frames. I don''t deny it. But instead of threatening to tell my superiors, what if you visit the thieves who stole the frames and blow their den to pieces? You''ll destroy the evidence of my mistake, I''ll write you a commendation for service to the Empire, and my superiors won''t be bothered by these petty logistical details. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'Thanks for helping me out. I''ll file an Imperial commendation for you under some pretext that has nothing to do with lost TIE solar array support frames.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Earn an Imperial Commendation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'Nothing personal, but I''ve just about had my fill of aliens. Used to be, a man of my species could enjoy the company of his own without stepping on someone''s tail or tentacle or furry hoof. Anyway, a band of alien gangsters has set up shop outside of town. I want you to level their operation. The Empire hates criminals and especially alien ones.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'Not bad. I''ll call in some TIE bombers to finish off the place. Set an example to the other alien scum in this area.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Destroy Some Unsavory Aliens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'Have you ever seen a lightsaber? Me, I''ve only heard about them in the old stories. But a civilian informant reported seeing one of them at a small installation some distance from here. That smacks of Rebel activity. Head over there and dismantle the place for me. I''m very interested to see if any lightsabers are employed in its defense.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'Too bad none of these so-called Jedi showed up to defend the place. However, your destruction of the building was quite impressive. I''ll remember your name the next time I''m putting together a civilian strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'Lightsaber Claim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'We''ve been surveying some land believed to be rich in alantium but have detected some strange ion emissions in that area. Could you scout it out and make sure no squatters have moved into the area? If they have, get rid of them and burn down their facility. We don''t want to waste Imperial troop time on these mundane affairs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'Those don''t sound like miners. Those sound like smugglers. All the better that you got rid of them. Good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Check For Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'A new slicer gang has taken the traditional name ReFormat. This gang enjoys turning HoloNet broadcasts of the local governor''s loyalty speeches into gibberish -- which is, it goes without saying, a strong contrast to the unaltered speeches. It is idle mischief, really, but nonetheless we must be stern. Destroy the ReFormat installation, if you will.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'The governor will be quite relieved to know that the HoloNet speeches will now sound more intelligible -- or at least unaltered. You have done well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'ReFormatting Governor''s Speeches'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A major Black Sun glitterstim lab has been located by Imperial Intelligence. These crooks are so well-connected, however, that any signs of an organized attack by the Imperial Military would scatter them throughout the sector. We need to insure this facility is hit hard and put out of commission for good. A select team of highly skilled independent agents ought to be able to take this refinery out. Do you accept?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Bravo, agent! Your results never cease to impress us. We''re glad to employ an agent as effective as you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Help the Empire Clean Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'An illegal weapons manufacturing facility has been located by Intelligence. We believe it may be run by Black Sun. Many of the weapons bought and sold by gunrunners come from facilities just like this one. We need an experienced strike team to go in there and blast that installation into so much space debris. Can you help us close this case?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Wonderful! Less deadly weapons in the hands of criminals means less risk for our Imperial agents. We need more agents like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Smash the Gunrunners'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'The vicious group of criminals behind one of Black Sun''s major protection rackets has been identified by Intelligence. They operate out of a well-guarded stronghold and fear nothing short of a full Imperial Military strike. They''d get away long before such a strike could be organized and executed, however, so we would rather employ a small but experienced strike team to take care of those rogues for us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Excellent work, agent. This victory will make life easier for hundreds of merchants in this sector. Always a pleasure to work with a professional like yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Remove the Protection Racket'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Black Sun maintains several medical facilities for use by their operatives. Assassins, gangsters, and other criminals have a hard time getting medical attention at legitimate facilities after a battle with Imperial authorities. We''ve located one of these centers and need it removed. We cannot afford to let these criminals patch themselves up after a scrape with our agents. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Good work. These criminals must understand the cost of breaking the Empire''s laws. You''ve earned this reward, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Take Out the Crime Doctor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Intelligence has managed to pinpoint the location of one of Jabba''s major munitions depots. These weapons supply gunrunners in this and several adjoining sectors. Jabba''s spies are scattered throughout local law enforcement, however, so stealth is important. We need a small team of agents to infiltrate that depot and blow it to bits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'You certainly are fearless, aren''t you? You''ve gained a powerful enemy, we fear, but also a very influential friend. Congratulations on your success.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Wipe Out Jabba''s Guns'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'One of the galaxy''s most notorious and bloodthirsty band of pirates has fallen for our trap. They took some bait we offered and raided a ship full of bugged cargo. Now the pirates have led us right back to their lair. Their base sensors are rather sophisticated, however, so they would detect the approach of Imperial cruisers. We need a team of agents to land near their base and take it out. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'An excellent strike. The Empire is indebted to you, agent. Perhaps you should contact us about helping to crush the Rebellion. We could use agents like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Blast the Notorious Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Ion cannons are the ideal weapon for space pirates.  The Empire is very careful to restrict the movement of artillery-class ion guns, yet inevitably some of them fall into the wrong hands.  Fortunately less experienced pirates fail to disable the tracking circuits, allowing us to locate and disable the cannons.  The preferred method for such action is a swift ground strike. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'The Empire appreciates a reliable agent.  Here is your payment.  Please contact us again for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'No More Ion Cannons'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'With so many of our resources handling political offenses, sometimes the Empire must hire independent agents to deal with ordinary crimes such as piracy. We have the coordinates of a small habitation suspected to harbor a dangerous crew of notorious pirates.  We need a team to reconnoiter the area and destroy all buildings and collateral assets they find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'You are an efficient agent and loyal Imperial citizen.  We have noted this in our records.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Teach Pirates a Lesson'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'A confidence artist managed to walk out of our armory with a supply of field disruptors. Tracking beacons in the disruptors led to a pirate stronghold before moving offworld. This stronghold is well defended, a target suited to the most experienced strike teams. While we track the stolen equipment, will you dispose of these pirates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Excellent, but we still have much to do. With those Aeramaxis Evasive-13 individual field disruptors, the pirates can move through our shields as if through soap bubbles. As the situation develops, we may call you again. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Field Disruptors Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'Inexplicably, a large gang in a remote location has stolen large numbers of Imperial GNK-series power droids. They take these common droids, at great risk to their own lives, then simply release them in the countryside. It defies comprehension. We have located one of the gang''s installations, and we ask you to exterminate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'That is fine, for now. We must still penetrate the baffling mystery of why these gangsters are interested in GNK droids in the first place.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'GNK Droid Thieves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'We recently suffered alarming losses at a training base. A gang of thugs attacked with unusual cunning and bravery, led by a Twi''lek adventurer. The alien''s code-name is said to be "O-i." An informant places this criminal and his gang at these coordinates. Assemble a strike team and destroy the base -- especially the Twi''lek.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Did you see a Twi''lek there? Very well. We shall hope this cavalier "O-i" met a sudden and harsh death in the wreckage. That is all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Twi''lek Adventurer Raids Training Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'A stock of Evasive-13 individual field disruptors, stolen from an Imperial armory, has apparently arrived at a pirate lair on this world. We must not let these criminals use the disruptors to simply walk through our defensive shields. You must assemble your strike team and destroy the base forthwith. Expect heavy opposition!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Evidently these pirates transported the field disruptors offworld before your assault. Regrettable, but the task was well executed regardless. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Pirates Receive Field Disruptors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'The Office of Criminal Investigations has tracked a stolen shipment of Pacnoral Sg-82 sonic rifles to a gangster stronghold on this world. Those sonic rifles can shatter bone at short range -- an ideal weapon for close conflicts with law enforcement. We''d like you to assemble a strike team and destroy the stronghold. Be wary of sonics!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Did you not see any sonic rifles? Or hear them? Well, they may be elsewhere on this world. We shall continue investigating. Meanwhile, here is your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Sonic Rifles in Gangster Hands'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Smugglers are shipping in an alarming quantity of E-Web heavy repeating blasters, no doubt for the Rebellion. Our informants, who are everywhere, have located the stockpile. We wish you to lead an experienced strike team in an assault on this formidable stronghold. Destroy everything, especially the blasters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Excellent work. We could not afford to salvage those blasters, for who knows how the gangsters may have sabotaged them? Report back for further assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'E-Web Blasters in Gang Stockpile'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'It is perhaps a long shot, but we have discerned that a particular outpost is obtaining large quantities of focusing coils. These coils are used primarily in light repeating blasters. We suspect gangsters are assembling their own weapons now. You must investigate and, if there is hostile activity, annihilate the outpost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Anyone stockpiling focusing coils was probably up to no good. They do have legitimate uses, but it pays to be careful. You are doing a fine job in our service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Focusing Coils for Sinister Purpose?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'I am livid with rage. My personal Merr-Sonn C-22 flame carbine has been stolen. I have deployed every probot and hovercam in the Imperial armory, and have located the offenders, a sophisticated ring of thieves. I could send in a column of AT-AT walkers, but for budgetary reasons I prefer to send you. Destroy the thieves'' stronghold, but not my valuable flame carbine!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'It has developed that those thieves did not steal my flame carbine after all. My lady friend took it to show at a party. Still, I shall honor the terms of payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Flame Carbine Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'The local Golan Arms representative informs us that thieves stole a supply of FC1 flechette cartridges. Pirates favor flechette weapons to avoid puncturing starship hulls. I promised the Golan salesman the Empire would look into it. Just now we are preoccupied with more significant matters, so I commission you to locate and destroy the thieves.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Yes? What can I do for you? Oh, the flechette mission. You destroyed the thieves, then? Fine, fine. Here is your fee. Now please excuse me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Flechette Cartridges Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'It is time once again to kill many Bothans! They''ve set up another SpyNet installation to support the Rebellion. We have detected their eavesdropping, triangulated their location, and are ready to smash them. For this purpose we appoint you. Kill everyone and destroy the outpost. Nothing could be more straightforward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'What? Not a Rebellion outpost? I gravely fear we are victims of a counter-intelligence deception. Drat those Bothans! Well, I shall reward you anyway. So, out of curiosity, who was it that you destroyed?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Bothan SpyNet Eavesdroppers?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'An ingenious pirate slicer apparently has learned to jam the coded S-thread hyperspace signals from Imperial homing beacons. The Security Bureau has apprehended the slicer and is quietly reasoning with him. So far he has only divulged the location of his gang''s stronghold. Please dispose of the gang while we work on the more interesting question of the jamming technology.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'How unfortunate. It appears the stronghold held the jamming technology that roused our interest. Ah, well. You may be sure that the Imperial Security Bureau will not think the worse of you for your impetuous behavior. That would be beneath them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Beacon Jamming Technology'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'One of the principal masters of the Empire''s training programs in the Mid-Rim Territories has apparently bolted his high position and taken refuge on this world with a band of hirelings. Apparently he had offended a superior officer. The hopeless dolt! Your strike team must teach him a lesson. Destroy his fortification and kill all inside.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'My recent information indicates that the weaponmaster had attempted to assassinate his superior officer with a long-range sniper attack. This is frowned on in the higher circles of Imperial leadership. You did well to dispose of this renegade.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Weaponmaster Turns Fugitive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'A two-time champion of the Empire''s marksmanship contests at the Academy on Carida has abandoned his home and fled his Imperial duties. Our spies, who are everywhere, traced him to a remote installation on this world. Ordinarily we would capture and interrogate him. In the circumstances, we believe it more prudent to send your team to simply destroy him. Consider attacking from extreme range.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'The marksman apparently grew disillusioned with his role in the Empire''s struggle to bring order to the galaxy. It often happens in these idealistic types. No great loss, really.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Traitorous Marksmanship Champion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'The Empire''s senior demolitions engineer at the advance outpost on Bhurnell has blown up the entire outpost and fled! Our ever-watchful spies have traced him to this world, where he is consorting with gangsters. His grave offense requires immediate reprisal, despite the installation''s heavy defenses. We commission you to destroy the installation and the engineer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'That was good work. The demolitions engineer apparently plundered vast quantities of Imperial munitions, intending to sell them here on the black market. Tragic, the loss of all those munitions.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Demolitions Expert Joins Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The merchant families who run Kuat''s Drive Yards are indispensible to Imperial shipbuilding. Kuat''s emissary to this world has been kidnapped, though fortunately not while under Imperial protection. We have located the gangsters and wish you to destroy their installation. The hostage''s life is not important, because -- to repeat -- he was not under our protection.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'The Kuat emissary''s death is regrettable, of course. But he had insulted the exhaustive nature of our surveillance, and he refused further protection. Not a wise move.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Kuat Drive Yards Exec Kidnapped'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'Our informants, who blanket the galaxy, have discovered the whereabouts of the notorious navigator who attempted to hijack his Star Destroyer and then escaped capture. He has made his way to this world, dwelling with the most contemptible criminal scum. It would almost be fitting to leave him in this squalid extreme -- but no. Find the base and kill everyone there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Excellent. We never learned why the mutinous navigator wanted a Star Destroyer. Then again, who doesn''t?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Imperial Navigator Gone Fugitive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'A quartermaster in the local supply depot has disappeared. Reports from his fellows convince us that he has defected to the Hutt organization, where his knowledge of Imperial supply procedures will help them steal our goods. We believe he resides in the criminal stronghold at these coordinates. Go there and reduce the base to slag.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'It appears the quartermaster did not defect. He was knocked unconscious in an accident and has only now been found. All is well. Never mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Quartermaster Suspected Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_hard.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Our efforts to stamp out the Rebellion has created some additional problems for law enforcement. Refugees are being recruited by local swoop gangs and other criminal organizations. This has led to a rise in violent crimes. We need enterprising agents to help keep peace and order in the Empire. Think you can help us out, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Good work, citizen. One by one, we''ll get all these wretched hives of scum and villainy. Have a drink on us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Keep the Empire Safe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Certain slavers are not content to stick to the Imperial list of approved species. Indeed, these slavers feel they must enslave humans, and that''s something we can''t tolerate. Through the help of Imperial Intelligence, we''ve located the lair of a group of slavers that have been dealing exclusively in humans. We need a small strike team to assault this base and blast it into rubble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Humans shall not be enslaved while the Empire governs the galaxy. Well done, agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Protect Imperial Citizens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'We have pinpointed the coordinates of a ground-based tractor beam used by area pirates. For a percentage the owners use the beam to trap merchant ships so that space pirates can board them. We need a civilian strike team to take out the weapon.  The site is heavily guarded, so be prepared for a fight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Now the merchants who fly through local space have one less worry. Well done. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Save the Merchants'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Our informants have assured us that quite a number of wanted pirates frequent an obscure little cantina at these coordinates. Enterprising freelancers are encouraged to remove this blight from the planet. A substantial reward is available. These are hardened criminals and will be well-armed. The cantina is billed as a "private club," so don''t expect a warm welcome.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Here is your reward. The star lanes are safer thanks to your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Blast a Wretched Hive of Scum and Villainy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'We have the coordinates of a secret depot where pirates buy contraband food supplies without notifying the authorities that they have landed. We need some experienced freelancers to blast the site to smoke and rubble. There are usually one or two armed pirate crews in the area, so destroying this depot entails some danger.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Excellent. Those space scum need to understand that their cutthroat ways are not welcome in this system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'No Pirate Meals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'An enterprising pirate captain recently stole a cargo of Imperial probe droids. With a little reprogramming these droids have become his scouts in the area, monitoring the local spaceports and alerting him when a rich freighter takes off. Our own probots have tracked his droids to a well-fortified terminal off the beaten path. We need you to stage an assault on the terminal and blast it into oblivion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Good work. Without his fleet of probe droids, that pirate will have to track down his quarry the old-fashioned way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Blast the Far-Seeing Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Pirates are a plague on interstellar shipping and end up costing the Empire millions of credits each year. We can hit those pirates hard by cutting their access to safe ports and hideouts. It''s not easy to hide a spaceship, even the smaller fighters employed by some of these rogues. We know of several suspicious outposts big enough to contain landing bays and need you to blast these outposts to pieces.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'Good work, citizen. Keep at it and we''ll keep paying you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Take Out Pirate Landing Bays'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'If pirates don''t have working ships, they can''t practice their despicable trade. We''ve learned of several small storage facilities in the area that house a wide assortment of spare ship parts. We''re certain that these are pirate stashes. We need someone to blast these facilities to atoms. You may encounter some armed resistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Pirate ships floating uselessly in space is an image we like, citizen. Good work in helping us to ground those marauding vessels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Incinerate Pirates'' Spare Parts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Ever wonder where pirates store their ill-gotten goods, citizen? We''ve discovered a few places and we need them destroyed. Our agents are too busy pursuing Rebels to attend to this matter themselves so we''ve decided to turn to you. We''ll compensate you for every storage facility on our list that you blast to atoms.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Job well done, citizen. The money is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Blast Pirates'' Stash'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'A group of known pirates has started hanging around an abandoned settlement. That place is beginning to attract all manner of scum. We''re fairly certain they deal glitterstim spice out of there and no telling what else. We need you to blast that den of thieves into oblivion. Do you think you can help us keep the Empire free of these parasites?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'That''s showing them, citizen. Those space slugs will think twice about crossing our path. You''ve earned your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Demolish the Pirates'' Hangout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Those thieving pirates wouldn''t be able to operate if it weren''t for their fences. After all, those rogues can''t just traipse down to the local market with all their stolen goods, now can they? We''ve tracked down a few of these "blood money traders" and want their operations terminated. Many of these fences are former pirates themselves. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'If we make piracy unprofitable, perhaps it will end. You''re certainly doing your part, citizen. Congratulations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Take Out the Fences'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'Like all vermin, pirates need holes they can crawl down into when they''re in danger of being exterminated. We''ve located some of these safehouses in our area and want these places blasted into oblivion. We''re offering a decent reward to any agent who can help us get rid of these vermin-infested places. Do you think you have what it takes?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'As an Exterminator for Justice, citizen, you shine like a supernova. Keep up the excellent work and remember that your children will inherit the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Blast Pirates'' Hideout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'We''ve discovered a secret refueling depot that pirates have built to aid in attacks from this system. We''re in need of a professional problem solver to get rid of this refueling station so those criminals stop visiting our planet. There will be adequate compensation for the being who succeeds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'That should discourage those thieving vermin to steer clear of this system. Good work, citizen. Hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Take Out Refueling Depot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'We''ve been getting reports of suspicious activity around an old starship repair shop. After an investigation, we discovered that the owner of the shop is actually a former smuggler who now serves as a mechanic to well-known pirates. Can you help us put this criminal out of business, citizen?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Good job, citizen. Justice is served today. We hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Take Out Pirates'' Repair Shop'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'Some local glitterstim pusher and a group of thugs has set up shop in a nearby neighborhood and we want them out. We know where they hang out and need someone to go in there and redecorate the place -- preferably with blaster). There''s a decent reward in it. Can you help the Empire do this? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'That''s showing those poison-pushers who''s boss. Good work, citizen. The Empire could use more upstanding folk like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Blast the Drug Dealers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'An ingenious slicer gang calling themselves ReFormat has altered our outgoing supply orders to re-route an entire base''s resupply schedules to their own base. How clever! It''s so delightfully audacious, I almost hate to order you to destroy their base and kill them all. But of course, duty must be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'All destroyed? Very well. A shame, really, to annihilate a group so obviously clever and resourceful. Ah well, such regrets are part of an Imperial soldier''s every day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Slicer Gang With Admirable Nerve'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'Yet another local slicer gang has taken the name ReFormat. This new gang has somehow contrived to give our TIE Fighters falsified flight plans that send them in tight formation directly over the gang''s stronghold. This seems to be pure mischief, but for safety''s sake we cannot permit this to continue. Go to the stronghold and wipe them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Apparently the name ReFormat has become something of a standard among data slicers. No doubt we shall continue to see new gangs with the same name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'ReFormatting TIE Flight Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'Informants have pinpointed a facility where smugglers have stored their illicit goods. These goods often wind up in Rebel hands. To forestall this, we shall allow you to distinguish yourself by destroying this facility and all goods stored therein. You may commence at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'This is a worthy service to your Empire. You may claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Smuggler''s Storage Facility'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations has found a hideout of notorious smugglers. To achieve favorable trends in a forthcoming report on crime statistics, the Office will avoid dedicating department resources to eradicating these smugglers. Instead, you may take care of this yourself, and the Office will compensate you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Excellent work, and executed on a budget far smaller than the Office would require. Here is your payment. Check back for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Criminal Investigations Contract'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'The behavior of the local criminal element resembles that of vermin. Destroy one infestation, and inevitably a new lair spawns in its place. The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations has located a new warehouse of contraband goods. You must destroy it, as well as all criminals residing there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'A thorough job. Now we may hope for a brief respite from further criminal infestations. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Smuggler Infestation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations continues to confront major budget shortfalls. To gain a more favorable ratio of goals achieved versus resources expended, we are offering you, an independent contractor, a purchase order to eradicate a newly detected facility storing contraband goods. Destroy all smugglers present as well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'You have successfully completed the contract. Contact me for future assignments of this kind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Compensate for Budget Shortfall'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Smugglers flit from base to base as quickly as flies. The Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations remains alert, but our procedures make it difficult to move quickly. We have better success commissioning independents such as yourself to eradicate smugglers as they light at a new base. Will you wipe out the latest base for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'The Office is glad you were fast enough to catch those particular flies. You''ll make a fine law enforcement agent yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Catch Smuggler Flies on the Wing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'Due to an increasing workload and reduced efficiency, the Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations is giving out more independent contracts to destroy smuggling bases and storage facilities. This gives you the chance to blast felons with the full authority of the law. Tell me you cannot resist this opportunity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'The Office is pleased at your demonstrated bloodthirst. You may contact us again for further assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Reduce Increased Imperial Workload'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'The Empire could have crushed the Rebellion by now if not for the smugglers who supply it. Imperial Intelligence has located yet another of these nuisances, a base that must be stamped out like all the rest. What do you say? Will you help us strike at the very roots of the Rebellion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Perhaps in describing smugglers as "the roots of the Rebellion," I misspoke. Possibly "the circulatory system" might be more appropriate. At any rate, here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Strike the Roots of the Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Smugglers in this area have been recruiting new members from local disgruntled youth. We have taught the parents of these wayward youths a stern lesson, but the smugglers themselves remain untouched. We require you to go to their base and wipe it out. If there are youths there, well, they will become a negative example to others.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Fine work. It is perhaps sad that young people perished in your assault, but really, being already inclined to criminality, what better fate would they have found?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Forestall Corruption of Local Youth'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'The Empire''s welfare obviously depends on the welfare of its soldiers. I have had an altercation with certain criminals, and they have threatened my life. Obviously this threat must be met with deadly force, but I would prefer to avoid worrying my superiors. Therefore I commission you to destroy these criminals. Tell no one of this assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'An excellent job. Here is your pay. I advise you to let this matter rest quietly, rather than stir up controversy that could only prove harmful to all involved.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Altercation With Criminal Element'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'My commander''s lady friend had an unwise encounter with a local smuggler. The commander is dealing appropriately with the lady, but he also wishes someone to prevent further unwise encounters by destroying the smuggler and everyone in his stronghold. Leave no one alive there, especially any charming young men you may find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'Very well. This payment is given on the condition that you treat this matter with absolute confidentiality. My commander would be displeased to hear his personal life noised about.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'A Commander''s Wayward Lady'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'As the current morals crisis continues -- what do you mean, "what crisis?" I mean the Rebellion, of course. As it continues, legitimate pilots are seduced away from honest work to become smugglers for the traitorous Rebels. Wiping them all out requires independent help. Are you willing to destroy the latest lair of corrupted pilots?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'That was acceptably effective. You can expect more employment opportunities from us. Tell that to any unemployed pilots you know, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Pilots Seduced Into Smuggling'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'It defies comprehension that ordinary citizens continue to drift into smuggling. No sooner do they build their strongholds than we destroy them! Despite their high fatality rate, the Empire''s workload continues to grow. For efficiency''s sake, we wish you to destroy the newly discovered base at these coordinates. You will be well paid, don''t worry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'We are pleased that you employed your weapon skill so efficiently. You well deserve this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Increase Smuggler-Destruction Efficiency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'The Rebellion is now using smugglers to distribute anti-Imperial propaganda. Do these traitors have no shame, continuing to rely on such blatant criminals? The offense must be stopped. We have located several distribution points on this world, and we now assign you to destroy one. Leave no one alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'The propaganda distribution continues. We shall have more work for you along the same lines shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Smugglers Distributing Propaganda'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'Smugglers hired by the Rebellion are distributing holograms purporting to show the destruction of Alderaan at the hands of the Empire. As you know, that paranoid accusation has long been disproven. Luckily we''ve tracked down a facility where this libelous material is being distributed. You must destroy it at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'Excellent. However, our work is only beginning. We shall alert you as we discover new facilities distributing these foul lies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Stop the Lies About Alderaan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'Local gangsters, no doubt prodded by the Rebellion, are harassing a local recruiter for the Imperial Navy. The Imperial Security Bureau has located the gang''s headquarters. You are to visit this gang and recruit them into the local cemetery. Destroy the headquarters while you''re at it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'A fine job. Our recruiters should be above harassment by ordinary citizens, let alone criminals. Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Protect Local Imperial Recruiter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'A group of local data slicers has defrauded Imperial supply depots across this planet of millions of credits. The slicers work from the sanctuary of a gang headquarters, in return for a cut of the proceeds. These slicers cause much trouble for the Empire. We would appreciate it if you would kindly obliterate them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'I suspect the slicer community on this world will think again before attempting to defraud the Empire. Your work deserves this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Slicers Taking Shelter With Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'A cunning gang of smugglers was planting illicit cargo in the Empire''s own vessels for secret transport off this world. They had an inside accomplice, who has now divulged all after gentle questioning by the Imperial Security Bureau. We have the coordinates of the gangster base, and we require you to destroy it in exhaustive detail.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'The destruction was perhaps not so thorough as it might have been -- but I shall overlook the shortfall this time. Here is your payment. Return again for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Smugglers With Imperial Accomplice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have new orders for you. A band of space pirates recently stole a shipment of hyperdrive motivators from an Imperial transport. We followed the motivators'' tracking beacon to a small installation. I need you to raze the place to the ground. These vermin need to recognize that the Empire deals no mercy to outlaws.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'I''m pleased with your efficiency. You are an excellent asset to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Blast a Pirate Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'Imperial Customs has given me the coordinates of a suspected smuggler encampment. We don''t have time to investigate every petty infraction. I need you to find the place and blast it to atoms. That will free up my men for more important tasks, like political enforcement.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'It sure sounds like those guys were smugglers. If not, I''ll blame Imperial Customs. I''m an enforcement officer, not an intelligence agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Eliminate a Suspected Smuggler Encampment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'In the name of galactic security, I need your assistance! There are reports of a gang of illegal slavers at the coordinates on my datapad. I want you to level their operation. These unlicensed slavers are a blight on seven sectors and I want to put a stop to them here and now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'You have a knack for destruction. Excellent. I''ll have no unauthorized slavers in my sector!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Gang of Rogue Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Recent raids on Abraxas have driven pirates out of their hiding places. Imperial Intelligence has tracked some of those pirates to this planet. A spike in waste emissions in the wilderness is decidedly suspicious. We need you to check this area out and destroy any illegal operations you find. We can''t let them slip through our fingers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'It pleases me to hear reports of smokingruins and dead pirates. You have earned this generous reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Those Dirty Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'The sign of the Blazing Claw has been used by pirates since the days of the Old Republic. One of our probots observed a ship that bore this sign on its hull. The ship did not seem headed toward any known starports, and we believe it landed at these coordinates. Check them out. If it''s pirates, destroy them. We must not let them get comfortable.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'Would you say that was a difficult mission for you? Because we''re always on the lookout for civilian talent like yours. Consult the mission terminals in town and look for my name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'The Blazing Claw'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'If you''ve never heard of the Black Hole pirate gang, then you''re about to find out more. Recon reports that they''ve got a small installation in my patrol sector. Go out there and burn it to the ground. Can''t let these scum get comfortable, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'The Black Hole pirates are feared in many sectors, but not by me and not by you. I guess they won''t be back here anytime soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'Eliminate Notorious Space Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'I''ve got a lead on an underworld operator named Talon Karrde. I''ve tracked him to a little dive not far from here. I need you to blast the place to atoms. We''ll nab him as he flees. If I can lay my hands on him, I''m sure I''ll come away with leads to some of the big players in the galactic underworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'You did good work, but we couldn''t lay our hands on Talon Karrde. I''m following his trail, though. He won''t escape me for long.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Smoke Out an Underworld Operator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'There''s something shady going on. Some of my men have been spending their off-hours at a seedy little joint they call a cantina. I think it''s more suspect than that. We can''t have members of the Imperial military consorting with criminals and low-lifes. Do me a favor and burn the place down. That will put a stop to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'Excellent. Our investigators will sift through the ashes of the place. I am quite confident they''ll find evidence of criminal activity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Raze a Seedy Joint'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'I require your assistance. A group of distinctly unsavory individuals has stolen a schedule memo addressed to me. I dread the thought of missing the next meeting of the Preliminary Exploratory Action Planning Committee. Would you ask them to give my memo back? If they offer you any trouble, of course you may defend yourself, but I don''t want to cause a scene. I simply want to do my job. Is that asking too much?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'Oh, dear! You had to burn their place to the ground? What a bother. Now I shall have to submit a Form 12-3E/9 to the Collateral Damage Oversight Committee. And I didn''t even get my memo back. Well, I do appreciate that you did your best to avoid violence. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Get My Memo Back'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'Imperial Intelligence has reported high smuggler activity in this system. Our probe droids have narrowed the area where smugglers might have set up a base. We need you to check out these coordinates and eliminate any operations you find there. We''ll not let these dogs make a mockery of Imperial law.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'Well done, citizen. Smugglers are known to conspire with the Rebellion. We must always keep the pressure on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Smack the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'Black Sun believes itself untouchable, even by Imperial law. Our job is to shatter this belief. We think we know where one of these Black Sun gangs have set up shop. It''s your job to show them we won''t abide their kind here. Leave nothing but ashes. Is that clear?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'Gangsters make a living by extorting and terrorizing innocent civilians. The Empire won''t abide that kind of behavior without authorization. You have made that point very clear. Well done, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Crush the Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'Yes, I lost another shipment of TIE solar array support frames. I don''t deny it. But instead of threatening to tell my superiors, what if you visit the thieves who stole the frames and blow their den to pieces? You''ll destroy the evidence of my mistake, I''ll write you a commendation for service to the Empire, and my superiors won''t be bothered by these petty logistical details. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'Thanks for helping me out. I''ll file an Imperial commendation for you under some pretext that has nothing to do with lost TIE solar array support frames.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Earn an Imperial Commendation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'Nothing personal, but I''ve just about had my fill of aliens. Used to be, a man of my species could enjoy the company of his own without stepping on someone''s tail or tentacle or furry hoof. Anyway, a band of alien gangsters has set up shop outside of town. I want you to level their operation. The Empire hates criminals and especially alien ones.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'Not bad. I''ll call in some TIE bombers to finish off the place. Set an example to the other alien scum in this area.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Destroy Some Unsavory Aliens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'Have you ever seen a lightsaber? Me, I''ve only heard about them in the old stories. But a civilian informant reported seeing one of them at a small installation some distance from here. That smacks of Rebel activity. Head over there and dismantle the place for me. I''m very interested to see if any lightsabers are employed in its defense.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'Too bad none of these so-called Jedi showed up to defend the place. However, your destruction of the building was quite impressive. I''ll remember your name the next time I''m putting together a civilian strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'Lightsaber Claim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'We''ve been surveying some land believed to be rich in alantium but have detected some strange ion emissions in that area. Could you scout it out and make sure no squatters have moved into the area? If they have, get rid of them and burn down their facility. We don''t want to waste Imperial troop time on these mundane affairs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'Those don''t sound like miners. Those sound like smugglers. All the better that you got rid of them. Good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Check For Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'A new slicer gang has taken the traditional name ReFormat. This gang enjoys turning HoloNet broadcasts of the local governor''s loyalty speeches into gibberish -- which is, it goes without saying, a strong contrast to the unaltered speeches. It is idle mischief, really, but nonetheless we must be stern. Destroy the ReFormat installation, if you will.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'The governor will be quite relieved to know that the HoloNet speeches will now sound more intelligible -- or at least unaltered. You have done well.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'ReFormatting Governor''s Speeches'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_imperial_non_military_medium.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'How many times do we have to exterminate these pests? Hiring professional hunters is getting expensive. Could you go in and clear out that creature lair for us, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Looks like you might have a career in extermination, friend. Thanks for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'New Career Opportunity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Some former tenants never disposed of their garbage properly. Now vermin have begun nesting in it. You''d do me a favor if you could blast that place to smithereens.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Much obliged. Folks round here will be much safer because of your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Cleanup Crew Wanted'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'That condemned shelter is nothing but a breeding ground for bloodsucking parasites. I bet a couple of well-placed blaster shots would take care of the problem. Can you help, friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Well done, citizen. This ought to make the wet season much more pleasant.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Breeding Ground'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'There''s a den of vermin out there that is gonna kill some youngster some day. Local kids love playing in that area. Be a friend and demolish that lair for us, would you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'I''ll be able to sleep peacefully at night now. Thank you kindly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Den of Vermin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Those wretched creatures go crazy at night, keeping this entire neighborhood awake. Could you please find these beasts and shut them up for good?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Bless you, citizen. Our community will actually be able to get some sleep now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 15, 'm6t', 'Help People Get to Sleep'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'The last thing I want to hear when I settle down to bed are the mating calls of blasted vermin! Please silence those love-sick beasts and help me get some peace and quiet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'My gratitude knows no bounds, citizen. Well, actually it does, as this payment will prove. But I''m still quite pleased.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 18, 'm7o', 'My precious little kittle -- she liked to be called Woopywoopums -- was snatched by a horrible predator while slithering playfully in my yard. Please avenge my angel for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 19, 'm7c', 'You are most gallant, citizen. What is your name again? I want to name my new kittle in your honor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 20, 'm7t', 'Avenge Woopywoopums'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 21, 'm8o', 'Some darn predator ate my good luck kima! I think those beasts have a lair near here. If you can find them and blast them to atoms, I''d certainly reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 22, 'm8c', 'Thanks, friend. Here you go. I''ll sure miss that kima. I bet this breaks my incredible sabacc winning streak. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 23, 'm8t', 'Lost Good Luck Charm'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 24, 'm9o', 'My poor little durni, it wandered away and got lost. The tiny helpless thing can''t see, you know. A neighbor saw a wild predator pounce on my darling and devour him. Oh horror! Please avenge my poor little Blinky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 25, 'm9c', 'This sets my mind at ease, citizen. Many thanks. I hope I can mourn Blinky and move on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 26, 'm9t', 'Mourning Blinky'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 27, 'm10o', 'I''ve been contracted to do some construction near here. Help me out by cleaning up the nest at these coordinates, and I''ll cut you in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 28, 'm10c', 'Nice work. Here''s your fee. I''ve never seen the need for a professional exterminator. Those guys get the big money.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 29, 'm10t', 'No Professional Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 30, 'm11o', 'I''ve trained many apprentices in the worthy profession of pest extermination. I may be willing to initiate you into this ancient pursuit. Go, and show me your ability!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 31, 'm11c', 'Pah! Sloppy work. When you have slaughtered creatures for twenty years, then you may truly say, "I am an exterminator!" Until then, take this trivial fee and seek a lesser career.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 32, 'm11t', 'Ancient Profession of Exterminator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 33, 'm12o', 'Do you, my friend, have the wherewithal to become a professional pest exterminator? Take this modest assignment, and I shall assess your performance with an eye toward apprenticeship.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 34, 'm12c', 'No, no! It is not the exterminator''s way to be so slack and lackluster. Other so-called exterminators espouse lax and sloppy standards, but not I! Go and seek lighter work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 35, 'm12t', 'The Instructive Mentor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 36, 'm13o', 'Though many seek apprenticeship in the demanding profession of pest extermination, few are equal to the challenge. Are you? Venture into yon lair and kill all its beasts, and I shall rate your performance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 37, 'm13c', 'Umm. You had best seek some less technical career. Only a few can legitimately stand forth and say with just pride, "I exterminate!" Tut, tut, it is no shame to fall short of such a forbidding standard.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 38, 'm13t', 'Say With Pride, "I Exterminate!"'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 39, 'm14o', 'I took off my ceremonial Jadagga necklace to bathe. When I went to put it on again, I saw some creature running off with it! It ran to that lair over there. If you can kill the thing and bring back my necklace, I''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 40, 'm14c', 'No necklace? Well, here''s your reward anyway. I don''t need the money. It''s an offworld custom -- without the necklace, I''m forbidden from holding money. Now I''ve got to become a monk. Argh!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 41, 'm14t', 'The Lost Necklace'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 42, 'm15o', 'I''be gaught sub kide of allergy thad ztimpacks can''d cure. I thig it''s the fur, or hair, or feathers blowing here frub thad lair dearby. Dell you whad, you kill the creatures there ad I''ll bay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 43, 'm15c', 'Thags very buch. Here''s your paymed. Excuse be, I hab to go fide a bedical droid or subthig.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 44, 'm15t', 'Allergy Trouble'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 45, 'm16o', 'My poor pet voorpak! That foul beast absolutely gulped him up like a cheap hors d''oeuvre! I beseech you to go to this creature''s lair and avenge my beloved Zotti!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 46, 'm16c', 'The beast is dead? Good! It deserved no less for destroying Zotti. Take your money, go, leave me to mourn alone!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 47, 'm16t', 'Zotti''s Revenge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 48, 'm17o', 'An Imperial senator sent his servants here looking for exotic beasts for a menagerie. They were set to ship them out when the beasts escaped. We''re trying to mop up the strays right now. Can you check this lair and eliminate whatever you find?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 49, 'm17c', 'My thanks. We''ll get this Senate menagerie calamity stopped before long, I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 50, 'm17t', 'Escaped Wild Creatures'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 51, 'm18o', 'I just knew it was a bad idea to come to this planet! There''s some kind of filthy creature lurking on the path to my new home. I don''t suppose you''d be able to kill it for me, would you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 52, 'm18c', 'Thank you ever so much! I suppose every planet will seem dangerous after leaving my poor, beautiful Alderaan.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 53, 'm18t', 'A Safe Path Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 54, 'm19o', 'I''m lodging a group of Bith musicians in my villa, but they''re skittish about some of the local wildlife. I''d be willing to pay if you could remove some of the more dangerous creatures from the area and put these Bith at ease.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 55, 'm19c', 'Splendid. Now my Bith guests can relax and practice their music. I do enjoy their fizz lilting through my villa on a lazy evening.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 56, 'm19t', 'The Tourists are Restless'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 57, 'm20o', 'I''m looking to run some power conduits across an area not far from here, but there''s a couple of pesky animals getting in the way of my spooling droids. Do you suppose you might take that weapon of yours and exterminate these pests?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 58, 'm20c', 'Thanks, buddy. You earned these credits. It''s getting so you can''t earn a decent living without a blaster these days.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 59, 'm20t', 'A Spool Droid for the County'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 60, 'm21o', 'My crazy old grandmother claims there''s some kind of wild beasts on her property. I need you to make sure it''s all clear, if you''re willing to earn a few creds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 61, 'm21c', 'What do you know? My crazy old grandmother really did see something. Thanks for helping her out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 62, 'm21t', 'Respecting Your Elders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 63, 'm22o', 'Do you know how rare Chimbak wine is since Alderaan was destroyed? My cloud car lost a motivator outside of town yesterday and I had to dump a crate of vintage Chimbak to stay aloft. Now there''s wild animals sniffing around. I need someone to get rid of them for me so I can retrieve my precious nectar!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 64, 'm22c', 'You have my heartfelt thanks. These credits should settle my debt to you. I shall drink a glass of Chimbak wine in your honor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 65, 'm22t', 'Imperilled Vintage of Chimbak Wine '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 66, 'm23o', 'I was working on a drogue lift station not far from here when my Gungan employee dropped an expensive laser wrench. He refuses to go look for it until some of the more inquisitive wild animals are removed from the area. Can you handle that job, so this cowardly Gungan can fetch my tool back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 67, 'm23c', 'Thanks. Those creatures were definitely beyond the skill of a Gungan to dispose of. Remind me to review my hiring policies soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 68, 'm23t', 'Blame the Gungan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 69, 'm24o', 'I was testing my new electrobinoculars when I spotted a few toothy-looking beasts roaming around my land. If you want to earn a few credits, why don''t you haul your weapon out there and take out those nasty creatures?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 70, 'm24c', 'I watched you working through my electrobinoculars. You''re not bad with that weapon. Here are the credits I promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 71, 'm24t', 'Make His Land Safe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 72, 'm25o', 'I know, it''s not exactly legal to keep dangerous pets. But I did and now I''m paying the price. Some of my cages turned out defective, and now my old pets are on the loose. They''re implanted with tracking circuits. Can you eliminate this problem? I''ve got a few credits to defray the cost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 73, 'm25c', 'Much obliged, stranger. If the authorities had picked up my escaped pets, I would have been hit with a fine much larger than this very reasonable fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 74, 'm25t', 'Kill Escaped Beasts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 75, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'There''s an abandoned settlement near here that''s being used by a local gang to store glitterstim spice. I need someone to wipe that poison factory out and save our children from that addictive substance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'You''ll be a hero to these kids, take my word for it. This system needs more folks like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Glitterstim Gang Storage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Thefts are on the rise in this neighborhood. I think I know where these thieves are hiding and storing their stolen goods. Could you drive them out of this area?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Much obliged. Folks round here will be able to sleep easier because of your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Neighborhood Watch'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'That condemned shelter has been taken over by a group of thugs. I bet a couple of well-placed blaster shots would encourage them to go away. Can you help, friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Well done, citizen. If we don''t keep our communities free of these criminals, who will? This is for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Thugs Need a Lesson'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'A dilapidated settlement near here is a death trap. Not only does it attract all sorts of criminals who use it as a hangout, but it''s likely to collapse some day and injure bystanders. Be a friend and demolish that structure for us, would you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'I''ll be able to sleep peacefully at nights now, citizen. Thank you kindly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'An Unsafe Criminal Lair'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'There''s only one language criminals understand clearly - the searing sounds of blaster fire! A group of violent thugs have muscled into our neighborhood and need to be driven off. If you can help us do that, I''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Bless you, citizen. You''re a true hero. Here''s your promised pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Blaster Fire -- the Universal Language'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Unrest in the Empire is never a good thing. All it does is encourage smugglers to ply their criminal trade. An old warehouse near here is being used to store illicit goods. Could you rid us of that place?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Many thanks, citizen. It''s a shame that decent folk sometimes need to resort to such violent remedies to solve the crime problem. This is for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Contraband Storage Space'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Local young women have been harassed by thugs that have been plaguing our neighborhood. I fear these threats may escalate into physical violence soon. Can you help us prevent such a calamity by driving these rogues away?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'You''re brave and noble, citizen. Claim your just reward. The local ladies will think quite highly of you now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Thugs Need Etiquette Lesson'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Swoopers are trying to entice our youngsters to join their gang. We need to show our children that this criminal life is not glamorous but rather dangerous and violent. Could you run these swoopers out of town and make this point for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'A thousand thanks, citizen. Our kids need more positive role models like yourself. This is for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Drive Out Swoopers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Ever heard of lesai, citizen? It''s a highly addictive drug and it''s being stored in an abandoned settlement near here. Please help us make sure this drug will not make its way to our streets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Now those are results we''re happy with, citizen. Good work. Here''s a small reward for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Say No to Drugs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'The last batch of Gizer ale we got around here made us sick! The smuggler who brought it in needs a good lesson. I''ll pay you to teach that lesson, hard.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'It''s something you don''t treat lightly, that Gizer ale, you know? I''m glad you showed that smuggler. Blasted scoundrel. I need a drink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Quality Assurance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'I paid that smuggler a fortune for genuine Barnaba mist-pudding, like those aristocrats eat. What did I get? K-18 starship rations! I''ll throw good money after bad, by paying you to make that smuggler find a new career.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Guess that smuggler doesn''t have to worry about a new career ever again. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Retire a K-18 Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'I was headed for the top of the fizz charts with my surefire hit, "Hurlothrumbic Baby Blues." But some lousy pirates stole my recordings and all my equipment! I found out where the crooks went, and I''ll pay you to teach them a hard lesson.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'You didn''t get my recordings back? Gaah! I have to start over. Let''s see, how did that line go? "''Til you used that hurlothrumbic, wasn''t nothing that I feared...."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'A Musician''s Revenge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'Some thief stole my mummified Givin skeleton! The hidden tracking device puts them at these coordinates. Can you go there and stop the thief? I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Didn''t find the skeleton? Too bad. That Givin was gonzo. They can survive in total vacuum, you know -- bones on the outside of the body. Oh well, thanks for your effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Catch a Thief -- and Kill Him'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'My one-of-a-kind Old Republic gladiator droid is gone! But the thieves didn''t know about its hidden tracking device. I''m hiring you to find it and destroy those thieves!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'No droid? Didn''t think so. After I sent you off, the tracker showed the droid moving away from the thieves. I expect that it escaped and is now on the loose. Great. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Gladiator Droid On the Lam'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'I can''t believe it! I just got mugged by some crooks accompanied by -- get this -- an Old Republic gladiator droid. I think. They went that way! Can you stop them?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Good thing those thieves didn''t get all my credits. Here, thanks for your time. What, no gladiator droid? Hmm, it sure looked like one. Where could it have gone?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Someone Has to Pay'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'I went out to maintain my old GNK power droid, and my neighbors told me some thieves heisted it. Who would steal a power droid? Can you find the thieves and get it back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'My gonk droid plodded home on its own. I feel baffled by this whole incident. Maybe the thieves thought I hid something valuable inside the droid...?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Track Down Gonk Thieves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'Strangest thing. Some crooks barged into my home and said, "There is no treasure of D-ar Komar, so stop saying there is!" They broke some stuff and left. I''ve never heard of D-ar Komar. Can you find these creeps and commit some justice or something?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'That was the strangest bunch of crooks. They must have mistaken me for someone else. "D-ar Komar." Ever hear of it? What could that be?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'D-ar Komar Justice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'They killed my sweet vir virs! Those pelt smugglers have gone too far this time. Someone has to make them pay! Can you help me avenge my pets?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'Thank you so much! It''s about time someone taught those pelt smugglers a lesson.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Pelt Poachers Need a Lesson'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'With all the hidden spots on the planet to operate a smuggling ring, those filthy wampas had to set up shop in my neighborhood. Well, I won''t stand for it! I''ve got some credits for you if their den is demolished by this time tomorrow.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'You''re all right, kid. Glad to have you in the neighborhood.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Clean Up Our Neighborhood'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'Are you an angel? Have you come to help us? I think you have. The gangsters in that fizz bar have terrorized us for months. They''re the ones you must defeat. Go now, quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Thank you for defeating those gangsters. At last we have our revenge. Yippee!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Gangsters Must Be Defeated'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'Say, can we talk for a second? I got a little job for ya. There''s this sleazy dive not far from here that could use some redecorating, you know what I mean? You blast the place apart and I''ll see that you get a nice Boonta Eve present. We got a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'You''re pretty handy in a scrap. Here''s an early gift for Boonta Eve. Keep in touch, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Redecorate a Dive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'You look like a respectable person, unlike others I know. I just had an awful experience. A filthy Duro made indecent advances toward me, and the entire cantina cheered at my humiliation! Someone ought to take a laser to that sleaze hole and teach them manners. Hey, you look brave enough. Will you bust up the cantina for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'You did it! That was amazing. Here''s a few credits to show my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Teach a Cantina Compassion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'My friend and I have a bet. When I saw you earlier, I said you look like you''d be handy enough with a blaster to face down a couple of low-class toughs. My friend bet you couldn''t. How''d you like to settle our wager? I''ll cut you in on my winnings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'I told my friend you could do it. You''ve got a future in killing and mayhem. Here''s your cut of my winnings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Settle a Wager'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'Sorry if I seem a bit touchy right now. I haven''t gotten much sleep. There''s a glitz band in my neighborhood that practices at all hours of the night. A respectable citizen does not stand for such discourtesy! If you can be discreet, I''d like to hire you to pulverize their half-baked studio. A sleepy community will be grateful for the service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Such should be the fate of all bad musicians. Remember, don''t tell anyone who hired you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Bad Musicians Must Be Punished'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Hey, you look like a gun-for-hire, just like me. Do you want in on my latest contract? I''ve been hired to bust up a spice den near here. You approach from this side, I''ll sneak up from the other side, and we''ll catch them in a crossfire. We can split the earnings down the middle. Interested?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Whoa, that was great work. Myself, I got turned around and couldn''t find the place. Anyway, here''s your half of the ... wait, wait, put that weapon away. Fine, you can have all of money, Your Worshipfulness. You should fix that short temper of yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'The Team Supreme'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_easy_npc.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Some creatures are simply abominations -- nightmares given life by a cruel and sinister universe. If only these beasts would remain in shadow, we would have no problems. But they do not. Will you help me force some of these monsters back into the shadow?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'A thousand thanks, my friend. You are brave and strong -- a beacon of light in an otherwise murky universe. Take this reward, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Abominations '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'I''ve warned the Imperial Environmental Preservation & Refocusing Authority that their activities would throw delicate ecosystems out of balance. Their efforts have deprived dangerous predators of their natural food source, and now the locals must get help to eliminate the predators. Will you help? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'I don''t know what our community would have done without you. You''re a stalwart hunter, make no mistake. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Balance of Nature'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'Feel like a challenge, citizen? Several hunters have already tried to wipe out a particularly dangerous creature lair near here. The lucky ones gave up. If you can accomplish this feat, I''ll make sure you''re properly compensated.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'I am most certainly impressed. How''d you pull that off? Resourceful type, aren''t you? As promised, here''s your generous reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Amateurs Need Not Apply'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'If you''d like to tackle a mission that would make even the toughest Trandoshan go greener with envy, try taking out the monsters that have been plaguing nearby communities. These beasts are killers! If you pull this off, you''ll rake in the credits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Good work, mighty hunter! I bet those creatures didn''t have any idea who they were messing with. To the victor go the spoils. Enjoy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'A Plague of Monsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Having tourists eaten by savage predators is sooo bad for business. The local tourism association has raised a generous reward, payable to the hunter that can rid us of these vicious beasts. Is that hunter you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'You''re not secretly a Jedi, by any chance? Only a being of exceptional strength and skill could have done what you did. Congratulations. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Promote Tourism'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Bleeding heart conservationists prevented the legitimate hunting of several dangerous predatory species. Now there are too many of them, and they''re encroaching on our settlements. We sure could use your help in controlling their numbers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Well done, friend! You''re a champion of the people. This should be proof of our gratitude. Ever consider doing this for a living? Or do you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Predator Population Control'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'I run a trophy business and am always in need of exotic and dangerous beast heads to mount. I hear tell of a lair of savage brutes not far from here. I''ll pay you if you can kill a few for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'I hope you didn''t blast them in the head or neck. It''s a pain to patch up these stinking carcasses, you know. Anyway, here''s the pay I promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Exotic Trophies '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Despite all my efforts to stop them, the savage monsters that murdered my family months ago continue to plague this area. Help me stop them, citizen. You''re my only hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Someone finally did it! Those beasts are finally destroyed and our community is safe. You''ve earned this reward, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Avenge a Family'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'I offer you this task only because you clearly have impressive skills. A long while ago, certain creatures damaged me severely, in personal ways I will not describe. Since then I have hired select teams of adventurers to eradicate that species from this area. I have located a large lair, and I will pay well for your good effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'I thank you. The task is daunting, and by some lights never-ending. But my resolve remains firm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Xenocide in Action'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'All right, you''ll do. The HoloNet program "Against Wild Worlds!" is looking for heroic hunters. Hovercams will be waiting above a creature lair our scouts have located. Your job is to go there and kill everything, preferably with dramatic flair. You can meet our schedule if you assemble your team and leave now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'Right, all the recordings came through fine. This fee buys all rights. Look for the show sometime next season. Thanks, love ya.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'HoloNet Star'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'The Periodic Overland Migration is on again. Predators are already gathering to follow the herd. The community council wants to hire you to eliminate a pack of them before they menace this area. Can your team take care of this?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Excellent. The Migration will continue for some time, so I expect folks around here will have more assignments for your team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Protect the Herd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'I hate this Periodic Overland Migration! Never mind all these dumb animals lumbering across the region -- it''s the predators following them I hate. They''re going to destroy property values unless homeowners take firm action. We want to hire your team to stop a pack of these things. Can you do it? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'This Periodic Overland Nuisance will keep raising problems and lowering property values for a while. There may be more jobs once we replenish our finances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Predator Elimination'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'The chirgotta intestinal parasite, which causes illness in species across the galaxy, lives one part of its life-cycle in the skin membranes of large indigenous predators. We can stop the spread of chirgotta through control of predators. If your team can eliminate the chirgotta-infested predators at this location, we''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'This fee comes from a local grant provided by the Galactic Chirgotta Awareness Council. Thank you for your help in making the galaxy chirgotta-free!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Intestinal Parasite Awareness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Natives have a bizarre adulthood rite. They confront large packs of local predators in their lair, try to touch each one, and escape alive. This barbaric custom causes many native deaths each year. I''d like to protect these natives by eradicating the predators. I wish to hire your team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Though some would disapprove of my strategy to protect the natives, my motives are pure. Once the predators are gone, the foolish custom will go too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Protect the Foolish'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'Smugglers are using a new tactic: land in the wilderness, force-feed their goods to wild animals, and stampede the beasts into a town. Locals kill the animals, and the smugglers'' accomplices are there to extract the goods. We have word of an imminent stampede, and we''d like your team to destroy the predators well outside town.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Thank you. This is an unusually barbaric smuggling tactic, and I hope the smugglers will soon abandon it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'New Way to Smuggle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'I''m relaying a desperate cry for help. My friend made an extended hike across the wilderness. He just called to tell me a pack of predators was closing in on him, and that he wanted to say goodbye! It was heartbreaking. I beg you: Can you go to his location and see if he lives? Or at least kill whatever killed him?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'No sign of my friend? Oh no, how horrible! That''s -- well, you did your best. Please accept this. Now I must inform his family.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'A Cry for Help'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'A colleague and I took refuge on this world after a skirmish with certain government officials. We went our separate ways, and now I''ve lost contact with him. I have his last known coordinates. I''ll pay you to go there and -- not "rescue" him, exactly -- but destroy his trail, and the surrounding area, and anything else you see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Sounds like those creatures destroyed the evidence, and you destroyed the creatures. Good job. Takes care of that last loose end.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Loose Ends'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'Whatever is terrorizing my homestead, it''s big enough and mean enough to kill three hired guards and dismantle a platoon of security droids. I need someone with your particular expertise to track it down and wipe it out. Take whatever associates you need for the job. I''ll defray the costs, just get the job done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'I can''t believe you actually managed to wipe that thing out. Amazing. Take this payment with my heartiest thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Terror of the Homestead'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Lo, have I been searching for the Galactic Questing Beast for many ages, as reckoned in this system! At last I have tracked the fell monster to this very planet. I must engage your services to dispatch this legendary creature. I shall remain in yonder cantina, drinking a quaff of jawa juice and boldly awaiting your return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Your deed is most valiant. Alas, I have determined that yon fell beast was not actually the Galactic Questing Beast, but nevertheless I shall pay for your most excellent service. Huzzah!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Destroy a Legend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'It took nearly all my resources, but I finally located the murderous creature that took my parents from me! I''m willing to pay you all I have left if you''ll take whatever armaments you need and kill that hellish beast once and for all!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'You have done more than just kill a wild animal. You have avenged two good people. Here is all I have left. I would give you more, if only I had more. At last I shall rest easy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Avenge My Parents'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'The planetary ecosystem is in a shambles after some disruptive animals were set loose. The authorities will pay a considerable bounty to anyone who can blast these dangerous creatures into component muscle fibers. And I''ll get a finder''s fee myself. You look like you''re up to this job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'Incredible! You took care of the problem far quicker than anyone expected. You earned this bounty with style. And thanks for bagging me the finder''s fee, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Creature Bounty'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Business is bad, and it''s the Empire''s fault. Their "xenobiologists" dumped a load of dangerous monsters on the land near my shipping terminal. I''m dropping hoversleds and load lifters faster than grumph scales in molting season. I''ll pay you handsomely if you can obliterate these creatures so I can get back on schedule.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'At last my business can get back on schedule. Nice work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Bad for Business'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'I run a brisk export business, and lately animal hides are moving well. I''ve spotted a few prize animals that I''d love to harvest, but they''re not exactly going to roll over and let me skin them. Only the toughest hunters stand a chance of bringing them down, but you look like a veteran. Care to take the job?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'Very nice. Unfortunately, my taxidermy droids have broken down, so you can take what you want from the creatures. I''ll let you know if any more opportunities like this one arise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Animal Trophies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'You''ve got to help me! Awful creatures have migrated into the area around my settlement. If someone doesn''t handle them soon, we could be overrun! We''re a peaceful settlement. We have no weapons. Please, can you do something to save us? We can pay you, though we don''t have much to spare.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'How wonderful! You have given hope to those who have none! We emptied our village medical funds to pay you, but you have more than earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Protect the Weak'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'My studies show that the planet''s natural radiation shielding has been damaged by the gaseous emissions of certain large carnivores in the wild. In the interest of the planetary environment, I shall pay you a large sum of credits to remove some of these unwholesome creatures from the ecosystem. Interested?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Most satisfactory. I could never have accomplished that myself. Perhaps I''ll be in touch with you again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Reduce Dangerous Emissions'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I''ve heard of you. You help people take care of problems, don''t you? Care to tackle a gang of some of the meanest scum in the galaxy? I know what you''re worth, and I''ll definitely reward you at that rate. Deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'I must confess, I never thought you''d pull it off. You are one tough being. Take your pay, you''ve more than earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Tackle Mean Scum'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'You haven''t seen swooper violence until you''ve seen this gang''s handiwork. They keep the surrounding neighborhoods terrified and under their cruel control. Can you help free these innocents?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'I have a feeling your name will be remembered in galactic history, friend. I hope you always choose to use your formidable powers for good. Please take this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Swooper Violence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'You really want to make a name for yourself, citizen? Try taking out one of the largest spice refining operations in this sector. It''s guarded by some of the galaxy''s most vicious killers. Think you can take them on?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'I can''t believe you survived that. You a Jedi or something? Here''s the reward on those vile gangsters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Vicious Spice Refiners'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Would you believe me if I told you that a vile gang of murderers has decided to form a cult devoted to the worship of the ancient Sith? They''re right here on this world and intend to carry out human sacrifices. Could you please help us destroy this cult? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'You''re a true hero of the people, friend. Please accept this generous reward from a very appreciative community.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'A Sith Cult'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'There''s a gang that has decided to adopt the Tusken Raider''s Bloodrite practice as a form of initiation for new members. Recruits must capture and torture a sentient being to death over a period of weeks. Please help us put a stop to this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Those loathsome criminals were trained killers and must have put up an incredible fight. Please accept this token of our esteem. You have saved our community.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Tusken Bloodrites');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Rumor has it that a Dathomir Nightsister has claimed leadership of a gang of cutthroats and is training them in the use of the dark side of the Force. Can you help us stop this gang before it becomes an unstoppable force?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Excellent job, citizen. Your skills will forge a place in history for you, no doubt about it. Please accept this reward for your services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Dark Side Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Slavers have set up a base of operations on this planet and conduct their vile business from this stronghold. They''ve already captured several local non-humans and sold them off to various buyers across the galaxy. Can you help us stop these rogues? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'We are forever in your debt, citizen. A hero such as yourself is desperately needed in these dark times. Take this reward'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Vile Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Does the Black Sun organization scare you, citizen? Do you shrink from the idea of entering a den of assassins and blasting it to bits? If you think you can tackle a major crime syndicate and live to boast about it, then help us get rid of this vicious gang of criminals.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'I thought you seemed like a being with no fear. Your exploits will become the stuff of legends, citizen. Your prowess will be amply rewarded. Here is an example.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'A Major Crime Syndicate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Interesting gossip from the planetary security forces. A well-funded criminal group has stolen plans for the Empire''s w-165 planetary turbolaser and intends to sell them to the highest bidder. We suspect inside assistance within our agency, so we''re covertly hiring an outside team to take out the criminal base. Is your team up to it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Did you locate the plans? Very well, we''ll hope they''ve been destroyed. If not, we''ll certainly hear about it, more''s the pity. You did well, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Recover the Stolen Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'I can''t tell you how I know this, but criminals keep infiltrating planetary security forces. They''ve been funneling new starship sensor arrays onto the local black market. If the law mounts an assault operation, the insiders will tip off the smugglers. If your team can destroy the criminal base, you''ll be well rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'That was a brilliant operation, and you displayed great courage. Powerful people have taken notice. Here''s your reward; don''t mention that you got it from me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Corrupt Planetary Security Force'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Heard the gossip? Criminals have sabotaged planetary security''s entire line of portable scanners. The alteration makes their own activities invisible. Until it''s fixed, planetary security is commissioning local strike teams to take out trouble spots. Want an assignment?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Good job. No telling how long it will take to sovle this portable scanner sabotage, so more work should be coming up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Invisible Criminals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'A smuggling group is selling modified Hanx-Wargel SuperFlow IV computers for subspace transceivers. Problem is, they''re bugged with homing beacons, which send sweet come-hither calls to pirates. Planetary security forces are compromised, so they need an independent strike team to stop this pirate-smuggler scheme.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Your reputation is growing among powerful officials. Planetary security has authorized me to pay you for your excellent work. Don''t ask why, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Pirate-Smuggler Scheme'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'Planetary security has learned of a dangerous compromise of local HoloNet satellite transceiver encryption. Pirates could decrypt spaceport traffic to locate prime victims. The security agency itself is rife with infiltrators, so an independent strike team needs to take out this pirate operation. There''s a nice reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'The HoloNet is safe again, because of your efforts. Please accept this reward, and be confident that your reputation is growing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Decrypting Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Thugs duped me into receiving a shipment. I only belatedly learned its nature: Thalassian security collars -- slaving collars! I had no idea slavery was still practiced in these enlightened times. I take personal responsibility for involvement with these scoundrels. In restitution, I''ll pay you to destroy that slaver base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'My conscience is now somewhat ameliorated. Thank you for your assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Thalassian Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'Ever been tortured by an Arakyd Agonizer-6 nerve disruptor? No, I can see you haven''t. You still walk well and don''t tremble. I won''t go into my personal history with these devices. But when I learned that gangsters outside town are manufacturing these evil things, I resolved to hire a strike team to take them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Did you destroy the nerve disruptors? Very well, here''s your money. I suspect those "gangsters" were actually selling to the Empire, but that''s a problem for another day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Torture Devices'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'My employer arranged with a certain supplier to obtain a shipment of propellant cylinders, but has not received satisfaction. What kind of propellant? No, I don''t think you need to know that. You need to know that my employer will pay you well if you visit the supplier''s base and terminate it. That''s all you need to know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'You have performed as my employer wished. Suppliers must learn that it''s not wise to promise proton torpedo propellant and then avoid delivery. That''s all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Failed Delivery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'A certain criminal organization has allegedly obtained schematics for Imperial Star Destroyer tractor beams. Personally, I doubt this. But as a precaution, I''m willing to pay your strike team to destroy the base that may possibly contain these alleged plans. What? I''d prefer not to explain why this is a precaution. Will you take the job?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Your success makes me believe the tractor-beam rumor to be false. An organization with the resources to steal from the Empire would certainly have put up a bigger fight against you. Here''s your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Stolen Schematics'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'Can we talk? My entire smuggling fleet got wiped out by Captain Tannhauser and his pirate armada. I''m the last survivor, so revenge is up to me. I need to hire someone to hit Tannhauser''s landing bay, hard and fast. You look experienced enough to do the job. Better call the toughest friends you''ve got, though. Tannhauser is anything but a pushover.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'Revenge is sweet. You more than earned this money. I only hope my fallen comrades were watching from beyond.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Tannhauser Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'You''re looking at the scar on my face, aren''t you? It''s my badge of shame. My starship was captured by a pirate frigate. Fighting back got me nothing but disfigured. I''d give anything if someone could smash those Sithspawn and flatten their den. I''m not strong enough to do it myself. I know that now, to my shame.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'I can''t believe you helped me with no promise of reward! But a reward you shall have for your heroic action. Take it with my utmost humility. At last I can rebuild my dignity again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Smash the Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'My friend and I have a bet. When I saw you earlier, I said you look like you''d be handy enough with a blaster to face down a couple of low-class toughs. My friend bet you couldn''t. How''d you like to settle our wager? I''ll cut you in on my winnings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Unbelievable! You really pulled it off, even after we told you it was just a couple of low-class toughs. Remind me not to get on your bad side! I won big money on you, so I figure you''ve earned a big share. Enjoy it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Settle a Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'I don''t mean to rant, but someone''s got to stop these big-league gangsters! They''ve bribed the courts to let them get away with murder. I''ll pay a team of hardened fighters to return some murder in kind. Their lair is fortified like a citadel, but I know a well-coordinated strike team could take them down. Say, you look like you''d be up to the challenge!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'Yes! It warms my heart to see a plume of smoke over that wretched hive of scum. I said I''d pay for the service and I honor my agreements. Enjoy these credits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Big-League Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Just look at me! A year ago I was counted among the wealthiest people on the planet, and now I''m reduced to this! The gangster Tweeny Fogg robbed me of everything, except just enough credits to pay a hit squad to wipe out his filthy operation. Would you happen to know anyone interested in the contract? I don''t want any names. I just want results.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'Tweeny Fogg won''t be so bold with his organization in ruins. You''ve done very well. When I regain my fortune I may look you up again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Bad Bad Tweeny Fogg'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'Greetings. I thought you might show up here. Don''t ask my name. I work for an important client in this star system. I''m offering you a delicate job. A rival of my client runs a well-defended smuggling depot in the area. I want it pounded into dust. Your reputation is renowned. I know you can assemble a hit team for the job. The pay is quite fair.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'My client is most pleased with your performance. We shall be in touch with other jobs in the future. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Rival Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'I''m glad you''ve come. The authorities don''t believe me, but I''ve discovered a murderous cult on this very planet. Their temple is disguised, but their evil is undeniable. Lawful punishment seems impossible, so I''m hiring a strike team to demolish the temple. Be careful. They''re very well armed for a religious cult.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Thanks to you, there will be no more evil sacrifices of innocent gnorts and kittles. Hurray!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Evil Cult'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Lucky I ran into you. I''m an undercover agent for planetary law enforcement. We''re assembling covert civilian strike teams to make surprise assaults on a few well-entrenched gangsters. These crooks are the toughest of the tough, so we need real veterans. I know your reputation, and I want to include you on our mission roster. What do you say?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Yours was one of five successful strikes in the last two days. Seven other civilian teams were massacred, sadly, but that''s the risk we take. This should be enough money to defray your costs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Conduct a Covert Strike'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_hard_npc.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I''ve been tracking some genetically altered predators stolen from an Imperial research facility. Some apparently ended up here. If I could get your help in disposing of them, I''d make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Hmm, those don''t sound like the beasts I was tracking, but thanks for getting rid of dangerous predators anyway. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Predators Stolen From Research Facility'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'I run a trophy business and am always in need of exotic beast heads to mount. I understand a lair of such creatures exits not far from here. I''ll pay you if you can kill a few for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'I hope you left their heads intact. They''re not worth much to me if you didn''t. Anyway, here''s your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Trophy Business Needs Inventory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'My goal of breeding exotic pets didn''t go as planned. I''ve heard some of my "failed experiments" are now terrorizing the locals. Think you could take care of this problem for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Thanks. Here''s your pay. I''d sure appreciate it if you didn''t mention this to anyone, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Exotic Pet Breeding Gone Wrong'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'My friends and I want to hold some speeder races outside of town, but there''s some sort of creature lair out there that''s holding us up. If you wipe it out, I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Thanks! You''re a pal! Here you go. Don''t forget to come back in a few months and check out the races.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'We Wanna Hold Speeder Races'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'I lost something of great sentimental value in the wilderness several years ago and I''m determined to get it back. I''ve isolated the area where I think this treasure may lie, but there''s a den of predators keeping me from performing a thorough search. Think you can get rid of it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Thanks, friend. This is for your trouble. Uh, you didn''t happen to dig around, did you? Didn''t find any precious stones? Good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Great Sentimental Value'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Some kids have disappeared in this area over the last few weeks. Some folk think it''s the work of wild predators. I want to make sure my child is safe. I''ll pay you to check these coordinates and drive away any monsters you encounter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Good work, citizen. The neighborhood children will compose a song in your honor. Oh, and here''s the pay I promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Disappearing Children'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'How will I ever become a legitimate shaak herder if my shaaks keep getting eaten? Please help me achieve my dream. Kill these dangerous pests for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'Bless you! These herd animals are tough to care for, but I''m on the road to my dream -- being a genuine real-life shaak herder! This is for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'My Dream is to Herd Shaaks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Home remedies will always cure what ails you, citizen. I''m running short on pygmy albino rancor livers, which are crucial for my excellent laxatives. Could you go to these coordinates and bring me some more? And don''t worry, these rancors are small and harmless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'What? Those don''t sound like pygmy albino rancors to me. I could have sworn they were there. Well I suppose I should pay you for your time in any case. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Pygmy Albino Rancor Livers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'My dying grandfather has one last wish -- to eat the flesh of the creatures that killed his beloved wife. I''ve tracked down a lair of the beasts and need you to kill some for me. Think you could do that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Excellent! I''ll send my droids out to collect the carcasses. Don''t worry if you didn''t leave much meat -- my grandfather has hardly any teeth left.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Dying Grandpa''s Last Wish'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'I''d like to start a vegetable garden for my family and even have a plot of land, but it hasn''t been cleared of dangerous pests. If you do that, I''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'Good, thanks. Now my family can enjoy good wholesome food, thanks to you. I''m especially fond of charbote, aren''t you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Clear a New Vegetable Garden'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'I perform tests of the groundwater, but my meters seem to attract all manner of vermin. It''s the vibrations, I think. Could you please make sure there aren''t any bothersome beasts hanging around my workstations?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Thank you. It''s always nice to know I can go to work in relative safety. Here''s something for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Groundwater Meters Attract Vermin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'My mother is sick and loves a certain flower that grows near here. I''d pick some for her, but there''s some sort of creature lair near there, and I''m afraid those beasts might hurt me. Could you chase them away for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Thank you so much. I''m sure those flowers will help my mother get better. Take this reward for your services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Flowers for Sick Mother'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'My little daughter''s beloved bearded jax was killed by some sort of wild beast recently. The darling just won''t be consoled until those horrible pests are disposed of. Do you think you could do this for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Thanks, friend. This should cover your inconvenience. I''m sure you understand just how important it is to keep our little angels happy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Daughter''s Beloved Bearded Jax'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'There are far too many wild critters around here and it''s bad for business. I want to make this community more attractive to tourists. If you can help me deal with some of these bothersome beasts, I''d make it worth your while. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Thanks, citizen. I wish more of the folks around here were as eager to improve business. You''ve worked hard for your money and it''s well-deserved.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Annoying Critters Bad for Business'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'These blasted animals won''t stay out of my gardens. Do you know how hard it is to grow millaflowers? I rely on them to supplement my income. Please help me make sure my family does not starve. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Bless you, citizen. You have a good heart. This is for you. You wouldn''t also happen to have a green thumb, by any chance? I need all the gardening advice I can get.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Animals Trample Millaflowers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'Ever since my HyperGym broke down, I''ve taken to jogging outside the city. But the presence of wild beasts has recently rendered my favorite route useless. Could you get rid of these pests for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'Thanks, friend. Here''s some credits to cover expenses you incurred while blasting those creatures. Now I''ll be able to stay in shape.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'HyperGym Replacement Exercise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'The Imperial Zoological Agency claimed to have cleared these areas of dangerous beasts. I beg to differ. We''ve had a few attacks on children in the last couple of days. Could you get rid of whatever is threatening our kids?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'A thousand thanks, citizen. Perhaps you should seek a job with the Imperial Zoological Agency. Seems like you could show them how these things should be done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Zoological Agency Messed Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'I hear Gamorreans keep pet parasites, which they let feed on their own fluids. Urrgh. A few Gamorreans passed by a while back, and now we''re seeing little furry things scurrying around here. I think they''re cohabiting with some predators near here. I''ll pay you to wipe out the whole infestation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'Bloodsucking parasites always have a bad effect on property values. Thanks for cleaning them up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Gamorrean Parasitic Pets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Hutt gangsters are looking here for good predators to capture. I hear they like rancors. They set loose a pack of fierce creatures, then watch to see if something fiercer eats the first pack. The pack they set loose is bad enough. Can you go and kill them before they do serious damage?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Thank you. I''m sure the Hutts won''t mind your killing their pack. Just in case, though, you may want to visit other parts of this world.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Idle Hutt Amusements'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'I imported some ghhhks from Clak''dor VII. I heard their skin makes a healing salve. Well, it didn''t do anything for me, and then the ghhhks got loose. Now they''re breeding, and the scent has attracted a pack of hungry predators. I''d like you to destroy the predators before anything really bad happens.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Thanks. I was afraid my neighbors were about to sue me for biological infestation. I hope the predators ate all the ghhhks before you killed them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Ghhhks From Clak''Dor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'For a particularly scrumptious dish, my chef requires several livers of -- oh, what was the name -- anyway, the livers of creatures in the lair at these coordinates. I''ll pay you to dispatch the creatures, leaving the livers intact so that my chef can recover them later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'I''ve belatedly learned that my chef requires the livers ripped whole, on the spot, from living animals. Grisly, I know. Well, I suppose I owe you this fee anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Scrumptious Local Livers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'My chef is developing a new dish involving fried thinwhillets. They''re harmless local rodentians. I''ll pay you to go to this lair he''s located and blast all the thinwhillets, or axe them, or whatever it is you violent types do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'No thinwhillets? That''s bad news for my chef. I''m afraid predators got to the yummy things before you did! Well, I''ll pay you anyway for wiping out the beasts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Fried Thinwhillets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'I''ve commissioned a holosculptor to model several local beasts for a new dejarik board I''ll be selling. She needs specimens, so I''ve located some at these coordinates. Please dispatch everything in this lair, but try to leave the bodies intact.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'Never mind. The holosculptor found adequate models on the HoloNet. Thanks anyway for your work, and here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Dejarik Piece Models Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'For next season''s nuna-ball championship parade, my buddies and I are doing something special. Everything for the project has to be organic, so we want some carcasses. We''ve found a lair near here, a bunch of ferocious things that this world would be better off without. Can you kill them, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Thank you, a lot! I''ll send my buddies out to get whatever you didn''t already salvage. All of it''s going on our giant dianoga parade float!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Nuna-Ball Championship Float'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Some offworld things escaped from the recent Livestock Exhibition, and they''ve been terrorizing this community ever since. We''ve collected some money and found the likeliest spot where they lair. Can you go in and take out the whole pack, quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Those don''t sound like offworld creatures. Blast, that means they''re still on the loose. Well, you did the job we asked for, so here''s your money.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Livestock Exhibition Escapees'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'Some Imperial Senator sent his servants through here, looking for beasts for his menagerie. The incompetent louts accidentally let loose every creature they''d bought, right here in our area. We''d like you to mop up a lair of them before our animal trouble gets out of hand.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'Citizen, this whole community thanks you. We''ll try to get that Senator to reimburse this fee, but I''m not holding out hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Senatorial Menagerie Loose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'This town''s streets are filthy, and I''m not talking about litter. We''ve got predators coming in from the countryside, killing local pets and leaving little presents behind. Can you take out a lair or two?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'The streets smell a bit cleaner already, citizen. Thanks for your effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Predators Stinking Up the Place'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'A killer beast is on the loose. Oh, it may look harmless. You may laugh and say, "It''s just a drooling Gungan blarth." But I tell you, that blarth''s pure deathstar! It''s taken out a squad of stormtroopers and two assassin droids! It''s the killer blarth you always feared! I think I know where it is, so go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'Not a blarth? Oh. Well, it may have been what you killed instead. When I saw it, my goggles were clouded. Okay, here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'That Blarth''s Pure Deathstar!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'At our latest animal protection society chapter meeting, all board members agreed that our biological systems are badly out of balance. The world''s, I mean. To correct this infirmity, we voted to commission talented hunters to reduce the local predator population. If you are willing, I shall enter your name in our club minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'Thank you, that''s splendid. I''m afraid I can''t talk now. I''m working up a new official anthem for our club.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Committee Resolution'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'We''ve got reptavian hawkbats roosting on our building eaves. Not a problem for us -- they feed on the silica parasites, you know -- but they attract predators from outside town. The building society has raised funds to eliminate this nuisance. You eliminate it, you get the funds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'Our building will be safer now, thanks to you. If you need affordable housing, think of us. On second thought, never mind; we don''t allow weapons here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Reptavian Hawkbats Attract Predators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'You smell that? That stinking dust on the wind? It''s egg seeds, spewed by the shadow barnacles that infest the buildings around here. Never mind that this means more silica parasites on our buildings -- what''s worse, the egg seeds attract beasts from hither and yon. There''s a new lair nearby. Please go and destroy it, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'You ever smell anything like that? What a stink. It''s so frustrating. What, you''re done already? Okay, here''s your money. I''d better find a fungicide or something.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Shadow Barnacle Egg Seeds'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'I hear weird animal noises from my neighbor''s dwelling. I think he''s running some illicit animal trade from the Core Worlds. He had some big beast get loose not long ago, and now I''m getting scared it''ll eat me in my sleep. I saw its lair, so I''m willing to pay you a fair fee if you''ll destroy it. Be careful, it''s a big one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'Sounds like you found nothing but native animals. I don''t know where that exotic beast has gone. It''s an unexpected situation, because this town isn''t all that big.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Illicit Core Worlds Animal Trade'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'Some ill-bred cur of a greysor has been getting into my kennel at night and fathering mongrel litters upon my purebred darlings. The sale value of these litters is, as you may well imagine, negligible. I desire you to go to the creature''s home, or lair, or what-you-may-call-it, and destroy it. I shall, of course, pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'You did not find that mongrel greysor? I can''t understand it. The problem still remains, and I must protect my kennel. What? Money? Oh, here, take it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Ill-Bred Mongrel Greysor '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'I''m convinced I know the origin of the vicious pack animals now attacking children in this neighborhood. Some local Imperial bigwig imported them for his stupid menagerie, and they got loose! The police won''t stop the beasts yet, because someone high up likes to make the Empire look bad. Can you destroy this menace?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'What a relief! All the parents in this neighborhood thank you. You''ve done us a great service and earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Local Imperial Menagerie Loose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'I''ve heard a lot of complaints about a crazy old wizard in the wilds who surrounds himself with ravenous beasts.  The locals asked me to do something about these dangerous creatures, so I sent a range droid to find out where the old man lives. Now I want you to exterminate his animals. I can pay you, don''t worry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'Well done. Those animals won''t bother anyone now. The old wizard probably ran away when he saw you coming. I hope that teaches him a lesson.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Crazy Old Wizard''s Beasts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'Something''s been killing the young from my herd of gualamas. Now I have to keep my livestock indoors. I need a hunter to take care of this predator before I lose any more profits. If you can do the job, I''d love to hire you today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'I sure didn''t expect to find that particular species feeding on my gualamas. Thanks to you, I won''t have to worry about it anymore.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Poaching of Young Gualamas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'My cousin just bought a used T-65 Starfighter, but for obvious reasons he doesn''t want to land an X-wing at an Imperial-patrolled spaceport. I''ve got a few acres where he can touch down, but I need some nasty creatures removed to make it safe. If you''re as good with that weapon as you look, maybe you can help me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'Thanks, friend. Now my cousin can land his T-65. I can''t wait to get a look at that starfighter''s hyperdrive!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Clear an X-Wing Landing Strip'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'They looked so cute when they were little, but my pets grew too big to keep. Now they''ve been feral for a year. The planetary authorities have warned me that they''ve become dangerous. I''ve got to get rid of them somehow. Would you be able to find my old pets and blast them into pieces?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'I still miss those poor little devils. Perhaps now they''re in a better place. Thank you for the help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Dangerous Feral Pets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'My veterinary bacta experiment didn''t quite work out. The test subjects grew unusually ill-tempered and, alas, I used some potentially dangerous animals. Of course they broke loose into the wild, and now I''ve got a big problem on my hands. I don''t suppose you''d want to go take care of this headache for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'Now the Empire won''t pull my bacta license. I can''t express how grateful I am. Here''s the payment for your work. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'Bacta Experiment Didn''t Work Out'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'I''m not obsessed with old religions, but I think some land I just bought is strong with the Dark Side of the Force. At least it is infested with some very unpleasant animals. You look tough enough to remove them from my property. Care to earn a few credits today?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'You have much skill and courage. The Force must be strong with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'Infestation by Dark Side of Force?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'I''m clearing some land for a switching depot, but I''m stuck with a few wild animals that are slowing me down. Their dens and nests foul the treads on my freight droids. Are you a hunter? I''m looking for someone to kill these beasts and destroy their lairs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'Outstanding. I may get back on schedule now. If I need more animals destroyed, I''ll find you again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Switching Depot Needs Clearing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'I used to like the beebleberries that grow on my property. They attract all sorts of dazzling avians and insects. But these animals have tempted predators to the area and I can''t enjoy my own land any more. If you have the time, I want you to go there for me and wipe out any dangerous animals you find. I''ll be most grateful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'Exquisitely done. My beebleberries are safe again. Here is a little something to compensate for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Make Beebleberries Safe Again'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'Cloning tests are fun, but I made the mistake of turning loose several test subjects. Not that these cloned animals can''t defend themselves in the wild. Quite the opposite -- they have mauled several travellers through the area. How would like to help me clean up this mess by blasting these animals into atoms?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'Thanks. Of course, the thing about clones is that it''s hard to stop making them after just ten or twenty. I may need your services again. Soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Cloning Tests Are Fun'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'Remember the Techno Union? Of course you do. I think there might be an old outpost of theirs not far from here. I want to investigate further, but the area is home to some distinctly hostile species of fauna. I''d love to hire you to remove these creatures. Then I can get on with my search for the outpost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'Capital job! Now I can keep searching for that old Techno Union outpost. Who knows what they might have left behind?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Infested Techno Union Outpost'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'I''ve found an excellent spot to set up an electro-telescope. I like to watch the big ships docking in orbit. But the last time I set up my rig, I was chased off by a couple of ugly, unpleasant creatures. I''ll pay good money if you could get rid of those beasts for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'You''ve done me a great favor. Here''s your payment. Now I can monitor the activities of Imperial warships to report to the Alli-- um, I mean, I can watch the big ships docking in orbit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Telescope Site Needs Clearing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'I''ve been seeing the most gorgeous Twi''lek you''ll ever find, but she''s been having problems with wild creatures when she travels between cities. Her safety is my top priority. I want you to find the animals at the coordinates I give you and make sure they can''t threaten my sweetheart again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'Terrific! You did well. Now those creatures won''t harm a single tentacle on my sweetheart''s head.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Make Twi''lek Beauty Safe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'Glimmik music! It''s the bane of hotel owners across the galaxy. A troupe of Bith and Twi''lek performers wrecked my establishment last night and set loose some exotic animals I had caged in the lobby. Now the animals are contaminated with local bacteria and need to be eliminated. Can you travel outside of town and do the job?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'Thanks. I can''t believe I lost a perfectly good exhibit of wild animals. That''s the last time I''ll let glimmik musicians into my hotel!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Glimmik Music Is Galaxy''s Bane'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'The Star Destroyer Accuser has just reached the system. A certain Lieutenant Drex on board is due to inspect local properties I''ve been keeping for him. He won''t be happy to see the vicious creatures that have moved in. Can you wipe out those toothy intruders?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'You''ve saved my job. My children thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'Lt. Drex Won''t Be Happy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'My droid popped his restraining bolt and wandered somewhere outside the city. I''ve got his coordinates. Would you be willing to fetch him back for me? Be careful. That area is a little dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'Wild animals but no droid? I fear that little robot has beeped his last. Thanks for taking care of the creatures, though. I''ll pay you for that, at least.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Fetch My Errant Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'I need help. I was transporting a data cartridge between cities when I was attacked by some kind of vicious animal. I threw the cartridge in the creature''s face and ran. But now I need that data back. I''ve got the exact coordinates of the place. Can you skewer the beast for me so I can go back and retrieve my cartridge?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'The data on that cartridge will save my business. I owe you much, stranger. Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'Missing Data Cartridge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_creature.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Due to the Empire''s higher recruitment standards, many thugs who would have ended up serving in planetary security forces are turning to crime instead. Could you help us get rid of some of these troublemakers? We''d make it worth your while. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Our community thanks you, citizen. I''d normally suggest you join the military, but I think you could do more good as an independent agent. Get richer that way too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'High Recruitment Standards'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Our community is sick of putting up with criminals and their vile antics. We''ve put together a collection to hire a skilled troubleshooter to get rid of these swoop gangs and spice dealers. Would you be interested in trying for that money, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Now that''s how you deal with that Sithspawn! You''ve definitely earned this reward. Come see me again if you''d like more work. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Vile Antics of Criminals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'Hey, buddy, you care about keeping the streets clean, right? I hear there''s some lowlife peddling inferior grade glitterstim spice. Can you believe this worm''s nerve? Sure could use someone like you to run this bum out of business. You ready to earn some credits? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Good job. No one deals spice in this neighborhood without my say-so. And don''t even think about pushing that inferior-grade sludge. This is for you, pal. ');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Inferior Glitterstim Spice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Gunrunners have stolen a shipment of deadly disrupter weapons. These thieves are like no other, however, for they are led by an amazingly canny mouse droid. Yes, you heard correctly! If you stop these rogues and end this mechanical menace''s career, you''ll become a legend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'You have done well, my young apprentice! Did you see the mouse droid? No? Hmm, the clever fiend probably had an escape plan. All masterminds do. Do you know how I know that? Because I''m the Emperor! Mwahahaha! Anyway, this is for your troubles.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Amazingly Canny Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'All these jerks strutting around here think bravery resides in a blaster. But when push comes to shove, they turn tail and run. Are you one of those, or can you really stand up to the thugs menacing this area? You ready to prove it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'I had a sense about you, citizen. True courage should always be rewarded. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Bravery Is More Than a Blaster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'You gotta help me, citizen! I testified against a swoop gang and got their leader sent to a labor camp on Berea. Now his followers have sworn vengeance and intend to burn my settlement to the ground. I''ll pay you to get rid of these brutes. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Your heroics will be an example to others, citizen! I think more folks will stand up to these animals now. Claim your just reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Witness Protection Program'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'I''m trying to go straight, honest. I walked away from these spice smugglers, but now they claim I know too much about their operation and need to be silenced. Can you help protect me and my family? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'Many thanks, friend! My family and I can now get on with our lives. This should demonstrate my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Can''t Walk Away From Former Life'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'I should know better than to get drunk at the cantina with my friends. We all got to boasting, and I claimed I''d run the local swoop gang out of town. The swoopers got wind of it and now plan to murder me. If you get rid of them, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Well done, citizen! Here''s your well-earned pay. If you ever get the fancy to knock back some cold ones with us, let me know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Unwise Bar Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'This community is being terrorized by a mindless gang of cutthroats whose only means of communication is wanton violence and destruction. If you put a stop to their vile activities, we''ll pay you a handsome reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'You''re a hero to our people, friend. Take this reward and our unending gratitude. You should do this for a living.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Mindless Gang of Cutthroats'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'A few young women have disappeared recently, and I suspect slavers. Those rogues have a base near here, from which I''m certain they''re shipping these girls offworld. Can you put a stop to this despicable activity?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'It''s good to know there are still heroes like you left in the galaxy. Please accept this payment as a token of our appreciation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Despicable Slaver Rogues'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Bullying helpless citizens requires very little courage, so I''m not sure why these thugs are so proud. You want to impress everyone? Then go after the thugs and drive them out of this area. That takes true courage!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Citizen, you showed those bullies the true meaning of courage. Please accept this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'You Can Show True Courage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'It was an accident that I killed one of those thugs. I had to do something, they were killing my pet! But now they''re coming after me. You have to go there and stop them!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'When a thug is killing my pet, I just get so steamed! Thank you so much for rescuing me. Please, accept this payment!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Thug Was Killing My Pet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'I wrote a play lampooning local crooked politicians. Turns out one didn''t have a sense of humor, and he''s hired thugs to burn down my house. But if you go to their hangout and stop them first, I''ll pay you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'That''s a relief. I''m going to write another play about this intimidation attempt, and you''ll be in it. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'The Price of Satire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Those pirates are planning to take out an Alliance smuggling ship! I overheard them at the cantina. I can''t go to the Imperials, and I don''t know how to reach the Alliance, so I''ll pay you to stop those pirates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Well done! I expect the Alliance ship got through all right. It''s a shame they have to rely on smugglers, but the Empire controls the space lanes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Keep Pirates Off Alliance''s Back'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'My little child is crying in her creche because a local gang has stolen this community''s entire supply of infant formula. Now that''s low! We''ve all raised money to hire some goon like you to stop those other goons!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Sorry I called you a goon. I was feeling tense. Thanks for freeing up the supply of infant formula. It''s the only kind my species can tolerate, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Some Goon Like You'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'I broke up badly with an old flame, and my former sweetheart enlisted a bunch of lowlife thugs to harrass me. It''s been torture! I can''t reach my former love, so for now I want to hire you to stop the gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'Since I hired you, I found my old flame, and we''ve patched things up. A little. Anyway, thanks for stopping that gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Bad Breakup With Old Flame'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'With my life''s savings I bought a beautiful Corellian Jumpmaster 5000 starship. In orbit, pirates attacked me, and I had to get out in the escape pod. But I''ve tracked the pirates, and now I''m hiring you to go in and destroy them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Great! I sure showed those pirates -- or, I mean, you did! Here, take your reward. It''s all I have left, but now I can recover my ship and start over.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Corellian Jumpmaster 5000'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'I had no idea one gang could stink up the air so much. No one can even sleep, it''s so bad. All the folks who miss clean air have put together some money to hire someone like you to clean out that gang. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'What in the galaxy were they doing, to create such a stench? Whatever it was, it was illegal, and you''ve put a stop to it. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Boy, Does It Stink Here'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'A gang of thieves has been stealing ordinary GNK power droids all over this community. Nobody knows why; power droids aren''t particularly valuable. But we''ve traced the thieves, and we''ve raised funds to hire a thu-- I mean, an adventurer or two to face them down in their lair. Go for it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Thank you. Right now we''re trying to figure out why the thieves wanted all those gonk droids. Apparently they would steal them, then turn them loose. Senseless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Who Wants GNK Droids?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'A gang of crooks broke into my restaurant, stole my liquor, and shot three innocent bystanders! Is there no law in this town? I''ve had it! I know right where those thieves live. If you go and take care of them, permanently, I''ll reward you. Be careful, they''re tough.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'I''ve been waiting for the authorities, but no one has shown. It''s about time someone stood up to those crooks the way you have. Great job! I wonder if they took my liquor because I flavor it with ground-up bounty hunters?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'They''re Stealing My Liquor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'You! You look like you could pull the ears off a gundark. I''ve got a pile of credits waiting if you can attack a certain criminal lair and thoroughly dispose of it. They''re up to no good in there, let me assure you. I''ll wait here until you succeed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'Fine job. I needed that territory cleared for my new cantina-casino, and you''ve taken care of it in the most active way. Here''s your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Clear The Area'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'I''m preparing a civil defense report on optimal assault techniques. I have placed hovercams around a fortified criminal base in this vicinity, and I invite you to destroy the base in whatever fashion you deem fit. I shall reward you upon your success, and include pertinent observations in my report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'A useful and instructive assault. Here is your fee. Your Imperial taxpayer dollars at work! Thank you, that will be all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Test Civil Defense Techniques'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'My business rival has stolen my repair shop''s entire supply of gyro-balance circuits. If I don''t get them back, every droid I repair will wobble like a drunk. That''s what I call trouble. I know where these hoodlums hang out, so I''m paying you to go and dispense equal justice. Permanently!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'Okay, I feel better now. For a while there I got a little out of balance myself. You certainly earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Droids Wobbling Like Drunks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'Our community council spent many days raising charity funds for the Holy Children of Asrat. Then the funds vanished. One of our youngsters traced the unauthorized withdrawal, and found a slicer gang spending our money in a frenzied party! If you can stop that heartless gang, we''ll reward you with a portion of the stolen funds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Thank you! The Holy Children would thank you too. If they could ever leave their monastery, that is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Holy Children of Asrat Burgled'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'I stupidly said, aloud in the cantina where everyone could hear, that Hutts stink. Immediately, a gang attacked and destroyed my home. They''ve been hunting me ever since. But I''ve found them first, and I still have credits. Will you stop that gang?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Please accept this fee with my thanks. Now I have to get offworld, and preferably as far as possible from Hutt space.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Never Say Hutts Stink'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'I''m a love junkie, I admit it! I fell in with a gang member -- I like nice eyes, what can I say? -- but I had to end it. Now the whole gang has destroyed my home and promises to "make me their droid." I need help! I''ve got money; you''ve got weapons; let''s work together. Take out the gang nest, and let me live a loving life again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'Thanks, hero! That was impressive. Here''s the money, call me sometime. I like your eyes. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Love Junkie'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'I contracted with another party to carry certain cargo past Imperial checkpoints. Matters went awry, I had to dump the cargo, and now the other party is making my life very, very hard. I offer you a fair reward for going to the other party''s headquarters and removing this obstacle to my future happiness.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'Thank you. I don''t see why a few dozen Imperial turbolasers were worth all this fuss, but there you are.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Matters Have Gone Badly Awry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'A business colleague asked me to obtain an Imperial code cylinder. I refused, strongly. Because of past indiscretions on my part, my colleague was in a position to insist on my cooperation. To avoid infiltrating an Imperial base, I seek a more direct solution: disposing of my colleague and all associates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'That was the outcome I had in mind for this situation. You have earned your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Paying for Past Indiscretions'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'As a harmless hobby I collect maps of Imperial freight complexes and customs checkpoints. An acquaintance saw my map collection and wishes to purchase it for an insultingly low sum. He suggests it is an offer I cannot refuse. I wish to prove otherwise. Will you go to his place of business and resolve this trouble, permanently?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'There is no such thing as an offer that cannot be refused. I''m glad you helped teach my acquaintance this valuable lesson.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Any Offer Can Be Refused'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'I''m a respectable importer of medical instruments. It happens that an item in my stock, the ion beamer, can function as a weapon. A criminal gang has threatened my life if I don''t give them all my ion beamers. Could you tolerate such extortion? I won''t! I''d like you to eliminate this threat at its source.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'This comeuppance serves them right, after they refused my perfectly fair price for those ion beamers. Here, accept this with my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Ion Beamers Are Not Weapons'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'My latest receiving manifest had odd discrepancies. I checked and found that smugglers had infiltrated my entire staff! My investigator located the smuggling base, but it''s too well defended for him. I''ve gone to the law, with no luck. If you''ve got a good blaster, I have an offer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'Too many smugglers on this world. I''ve had to fire whole departments. Those unemployed workers will probably turn to smuggling too (sigh).'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Odd Manifest Discrepancies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'See this mole right here, the one that oozes? What, you don''t want to look? It''s the last trace of a disgusting illness I contracted from a local gang. They got their paws on a tailored virus and tried extortion, infecting folks and then selling the antidote. But I found my own antidote, and now I want you to wipe out this criminal infestation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'Thanks for your "civic antidote" work, citizen. Take this reward. Do you notice that this oozing mole is already smaller? Here, look closer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Look at My Oozing Mole'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'I''ve been planning a run for local office. Yesterday an Arakyd Mark VII seeker remote entered my HQ and tried to kill me. I managed to knock it out, and my staff has traced its origin -- a band of thugs employed by my opponent. This isn''t the first time this happened, but I want you to make sure it''s the last.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'I don''t suppose you found evidence at the site incriminating my opponent? Too bad. Well, I hope I can count on your vote!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Political Shenanigans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'In the cantina one night I casually mentioned I was considering a cyborg implant. The next night, my home got bombed by local anti-cyborg fanatics. I happened to be out, which means that hate-gang has made its last attack. Have you got the weapons and the will to take out a well-defended hideout?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'These hate crimes will only stop when ordinary citizens like you and me take action. Now I''m more interested than ever in that BioTech biocomputer.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Local Anti-Cyborg Hate Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Listen to me, quickly! I tracked the notorious criminal Gorme Felson to a hideout not far from here. Felson is no easy mark, though, despite the fact that he comes from an uppercrust Naboo family. I need hired muscle to blast the place apart before he and his cronies get away. Can you help me in a hurry?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'Gorme Felson is a disease in the galaxy. He got away, but we put his gang out of commission for awhile. Nice work on such short notice!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Gorme Felson Must Be Stopped'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'I''m in a bind. A friend of mine tangled with the wrong crowd, and now they''re holding him captive in their thieves'' den. If I call the authorities, those filthy gundarks will see trouble coming from a long way off. Someone needs to hit the place secretly and rescue my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'Terrific! My friend escaped just after you arrived at the thieves'' den. He transmitted these credits to my account, and now they belong to you. Good job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Friend Tangled With Wrong Crowd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'I can''t name names, but a certain politician would like to put a stop to a plot by another politician. Parliamentary procedure being what it is, this dispute is best handled outside the usual channels. I must hire you to blow up the criminals perpetrating this scheme.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'The politician who employs me will be delighted to hear that the esteemed colleague''s plot has been foiled. Interplanetary politics can be very satisfying, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Spat Between Esteemed Colleagues'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Hey, kid. You know those droids you see repairing broken windows around the city? They belong to me. Another fellow is trying to steal my contracts. I need a dangerous individual to explain to my competitor that his organization will not benefit from this course of action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'Nice, kid. You explained the situation to my competitor in no uncertain terms. I''m a little concerned that his people fought back as well as they did, though. I get the feeling this isn''t over yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Broken Window Repair Firm'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'I found out a local swoop gang has put a price on my head! What did I ever do to them? My only hope is for someone to wipe this gang off the face of the planet, so the bounty will become invalid. Surely a rough-and-ready person like you can help a desperate, wronged citizen in my time of need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'Here''s your fee. That will teach the other swoopers around here to tangle with innocent, harmless citizens like me. Unfortunately they''re not a bright bunch. That''s the third time this season I''ve had to put out a hit on swoop lairs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'Harmless Innocent Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'Is something wrong with me? Why did my sweetheart leave me to join that band of blaster-toting, worm-ridden nerf-herders? I won''t stand for it. If you dismantle the place where my darling''s new friends spend their time, maybe I can put the relationship back together.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'You did your job well, but my sweetheart is madder than ever! What have I done wrong? Am I ugly, is that it? Well, am I?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'What''s Wrong With Me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'Do you smell that? It''s waste gases from a little ore refinery not far from here. A bunch of roughnecks built it to sidestep guild fees. Well, we locals don''t plan to let them poison our air. We''re willing to pay you to knock that place out of operation once and for all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'What a difference. Smell that clean air! Well, cleaner than it was, anyway. You did your job and here''s your payment. I''ll bet you''ve done this kind of work before, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Roughnecks Exude Waste Gas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'The time has come, my friend. A band of space pirates robbed me of an expensive idol from the Onderon moon of Dxun. I can''t make them give it back, but I can pay to have them punished. Aim those killer instincts of yours at their planetside den and don''t look away until every one of them is dead.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'Thanks, my friend. I knew you would finish them off with little trouble. I''ll head over and see if my stolen Dxun idol is somewhere in the rubble. It''s almost indestructible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Dxun Idol Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'It''s so embarrassing that I can only tell a stranger like you. I was just kicked out of my swoop gang because -- get this -- an MSE-6 mouse droid framed me! It tricked my buddies into thinking I was going to turn them in. Now I''m upset. Can you incinerate my ex-buddies'' hangout to vent my anger? And make sure that blasted mouse droid gets pulverized!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'Sithspit! No, I''m not mad at you. You did your job well and I''m going to pay you. But I just learned that the mouse droid who framed me left the place before you arrived. It hopped a spice freighter to another system. Can you believe it? Who programmed that blasted thing, anyway?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Framed by a Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'I''m not who you think I am. People say I look like an announcer from the local newsfeed, but I''m just a loyal Imperial citizen. I''m hiring someone to assault a local spice gang. Make it flashy. There could be, I don''t know, hovercams or something in the area. I''d like to set an example to other lawbreakers. Also, can you wear something eye-catching?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'What a show! The hovercams captured the whole attack. I especially enjoyed the part where that gangster cursed you before dying. This is going to make great ratings for ... um, for whatever newsfeed sent those hovercams to film it. Not that I know anything about that. Ahem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'I''m Not a Newsfeed Announcer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'You must help me! I''m trying to transport my neice off-planet, to save her from a criminal. But he''s got word of my plan, and his gang intends to kidnap the poor child! Please, you must attack the cantina where they always drink, to provide a distraction so I can rescue the girl. Hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'We did it! The girl is safely off to an Outer Rim planet, and her father''s gang is crippled. You''re a good person. I''m happy to pay you this money.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'A Mother Stops at Nothing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'At last I''ve found you! Years ago you served my father in the Clone Wars. Now he begs you to help him in his struggle against ... what did you say? You didn''t serve my father? Oh. Well, you''ll do anyway. How''d you like to pick up a few credits by blasting apart a den of gas thieves near here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'You did it! You don''t need to be paid, do you? I know there''s more to you than just money. Right? Oh. Well, you''ve got to follow your own path. No one can choose it for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Help Me, You''re My Only Hope'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'It''s an outrage! A crewman of mine was murdered by a gang of local cutthroats. Now they''re keeping his body for who-knows-what reason. I''m a spacer, not a fighter, but I can contract a tough guy like you to pay back those filthy gundarks! You pound them into rubble, and I''ll give you whatever I have.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'You''ve honored my late crewman and rid this planet of some dangerous scum. If you decide to join a freighter crew, let me know, eh? I may someday have an opening.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Thugs Have My Crewman''s Body'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'Do I look like a simpleton to you? Then explain to me why malodorous hoodlums would extort money from me. Me! Do they imagine I have no resources to pursue retaliation? On that topic, you look like you''ve killed men before. Would you please do so again?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'Most splendid indeed! Despite your looks, you are a being of the highest caliber. From now on, those crooks will think twice before accosting someone of my particular refinement and resources. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'Do I Look Like a Simpleton?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'Say, friend, give me a moment of your time. There''s a tough guy holed up near here whom I have instructed to leave the planet. He''s refused to listen to me. I''m a fair man, so I want to hire you as an intermediary in this dispute. Would you blow him to pieces for me? Be careful, he has the death sentence on twelve systems.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'Now that''s what I call fine work, friend. You showed class and style by handling his friends, too. Here, buy something nice with these credits. You earned them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Death Sentence on Twelve Systems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'Ever seen a golden bantha? They''re rare and spectacular creatures. I owned one until yesterday, when a band of pelt smugglers killed it for the fur. I can''t get my bantha back, but I can get retaliation. I know where they keep their contraband. I''d like to contract you to level the place. WIpe them out, all of them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'I''ll always remember the scent of that smoke lingering over the ashes of those smugglers. You''re very good, there''s no denying that. Here''s your payment. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'The Spectacular Golden Bantha'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_neutral_medium_npc.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'The Empire''s draconian tactics have created an influx of refugees, many of which are recruited by swoop gangs. This has increased violent crimes. We have plenty of work for agents who want to lend a hand to keep peace and order in our communities. We know where these gangs gather and we need those places cleared out. Think you can help? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Good work, citizen. One by one, we''ll get all these wretched hives of scum and villainy. Have a drink on us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Clean up the streets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Our agents have uncovered a major glitterstim dealer''s lair. We need to put this scum out of business and we need your help to do it. The dealer has hired some muscle to protect their precious goods. A quick, stealthy strike, however, ought to get the job done. We always reward results too. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Nothing quite as sweet as the smell of burning spice in the morning, eh? Good job, citizen. Keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Destroy Spice Dealer''s Stash'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'I shouldn''t be doing this, but I need your help. My son was implicated in a murder but released for lack of evidence. He didn''t kill anyone but I know who did. The thugs he hangs out with are thieves and murderers. My son is currently offworld. I need you to blast that gang''s hideout while he''s gone. Teach those animals never to bother us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'My superiors had ordered me to let local law enforcement handle this situation but I''m sure you know that would have resulted in the loss of my son. I''m a dedicated member of the Alliance but also a devoted parent. My thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'A Desperate Parent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Four fatal beatings have taken place in the last six weeks. A new gang has moved into the neighborhood and is announcing its presence. The local authorities have their hands full assisting the Empire in tracking us down. So we''re taking matters into our own hands. We need you to march into that gang''s hangout and blast those murderers to atoms.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Being a member of the Alliance does not mean we turn our backs on our communities. That''s what we''re fighting to protect. Good work, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Smash the Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'A swoop gang has been terrorizing the area. Their recent "fun" consists of zooming down streets and sniping citizens through windows. The body count so far is nine dead and six others wounded. We want these animals stopped. We''ve acquired the coordinates to this swoop gang''s hideout. Will you rid these good people of this terrible menace? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'You''re alright, buddy. Good to see that someone cares enough about other people to lend a hand. All the better that the hand is being paid for those efforts, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Stop the Swoop Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Some slavers have been operating in this area. Indeed, these slavers have been known to take humans as well. Through the help of Intelligence, we''ve located their lair. We need a small strike team to assault this base. Can you help the Alliance put a stop to this despicable practice? The reward will be well worth it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Handled like a true professional. We hope you consider working for us again. Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Stop the Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'A group of dangerous criminals is using an old halfway house in our area as a hideout and refuge from authorities. We want this place wiped out and those murderers run off or brought to justice. We can''t ignore their activities any longer. We''ll pay a reward to anyone willing to undertake and complete this task. Are you the citizen we''re looking for?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'We''re glad to see you share our enthusiasm to create safe neighborhoods for our children. You deserve this reward, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Clean Out the Halfway House'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'An illegal weapons lab has been supplying the local gangs with homemade explosives, which they''ve gladly used in recent attacks. This lab is being run by a particularly vicious gang of killers. We need to take this lab out of commission, especially since it''s attracting disgruntled weapons specialists from around the galaxy. Can you help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Nicely done, citizen. Take your reward and remember that there''s plenty more where that came from.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Blow Up the Explosives Lab'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Local thugs have been harassing the people of this area. They loiter around an abandoned settlement and get high on glitterstim. We''re offering a reward to any agent that''ll go in there and blast that wretched hive to pieces. That would certainly get the point across, eh? Most of these thugs are bullies and cowards so you shouldn''t have too much trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Told you those creeps wouldn''t put up much of a fight. Bet they don''t come around here no more. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Scare the Thugs Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'There''s been an increase in break-ins around here recently. We know who''s behind it but the local authorities are turning a blind eye because most of the victims are sympathetic to the Alliance. It''s time we got involved. We need you to run the criminals behind those thefts out of town. Blasting their hideout to atoms ought to get the point across.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'Those citizens will sleep easier at night now. Good job, agent. Come see us again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Stop the Thieves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'A bunch of criminal slugs have been harassing the women of this neighborhood. We''ve heard of these guys. They were run out of another town after they assaulted a young woman. We feel these predators will repeat that pattern soon. We know where these creeps have set up shop and are certain they''d vacate the premises if their lair were blasted to pieces. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Well struck, citizen! You''ve made this area safer for women. Enjoy the reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Get Rid of Slimy Predators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'A shyster has been cheating older retired folks out of their life savings. This creep goes around selling bogus cruises on luxury starliners that don''t exist. Further, this slimeball has hired some local toughs, thinking that their presence will scare away any citizens seeking to get their money back. It''s time we put a stop to this activity. Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Good work! No one has the right to cheat decent folk out of their life savings. You''ve made sure that point was made, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Smash the Shyster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'The same brutish thugs have mugged half a dozen decent people in the last month, one of which died last night as a result of the injuries. We''d prefer to handle these animals on our own terms rather than get the local authorities involved. Slime like this want us to believe that life in the universe is cheap. Well we''ve got news for those slugs - life is not cheap. Can you help us make that point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Thank you, citizen. Take the reward, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Stop the Murderous Muggers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Have you ever heard of the Vibrodagger Killer? We think we''ve finally tracked this heinous murderer down. He''s hiding in a small abandoned settlement near here. We believe there may be other murderers hiding there as well. The time for justice is at hand. We need someone to go in there and wipe that place out. You up to that task?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'That should put an end to these horrible crimes. Assuming it was the actual Vibrodagger Killer in that settlement, that is. You''ve earned your reward in any case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Stop the Vibrodagger Killer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'A gang of hooligans has been terrorizing this neighborhood for months now. Their favorite tactic is hurling homemade firebombs at passing speeders. So far three people have been killed by these attacks. The local authorities are swamped and can''t devote the time necessary to stop these criminals. We need an independent agent to take up the cause of justice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Looks like you gave those thugs a taste of their own medicine. Good job! This neighborhood could use more folks like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Stop the Firebombers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'A gang has decided to set up a protection racket in our area. The local merchants have been forced to pay protection money after one shop was blown to pieces with the shop owner and his family still inside. The gang is paying bribes to the local law enforcement authorities so they ignore these criminal activities. We need you to put a stop to this gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'Looks like the gang forgot to pay their own protection money. Good work, citizen. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Stop the Protection Racket'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'A local glitterstim dealer got my son addicted to that poison and now my boy is rotting in an Imperial prison while the dealer continues to pedal his filth. It''s time we put a stop to this criminal''s activities. I''m offering a reward to anyone that goes into that dealer''s lair and blasts everything in sight. That nest of silica parasites needs to be cleaned out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'You''re an effective agent of justice, citizen. You''ve made the streets safer for our youth. This is one reward I am happy to pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Stop the Glitterstim Dealer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'The Alliance employs smugglers to procure supplies, but we don''t work with just every smuggler that comes along. A particularly crooked gang has set up a stronghold to fence stolen goods offworld. We want that smuggling gang stopped. Getting goods past Imperial blockades in a good cause is one thing, but crooks are crooks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'This world could use a lot more straight-shooting folks like you. Thanks, and here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Crooks are Crooks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Our approved "procurement specialists" smuggled some weapons to us past the Empire, landed, and promptly got robbed at blaster-point! Some completely different smugglers have taken our weapons to their depot. This stinks! Will you go wipe out those crooks -- I mean, the second gang of crooks, the one who stole from our crooks?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'What a revolting development that was. Isn''t there any honor among thieves? Well, forget I asked that. Thanks for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Smugglers Stole From Our Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'A strong criminal element is part of life around here, but now thugs are actually barging into innocent people''s homes and robbing them in their beds. It has to stop. We know of one stronghold where the thugs especially like old people -- "like" them the way the Empire likes slave races. If you take out that stronghold, we''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Nice work. It''s only one step in a long project, but it''s a step. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Criminals Robbing Citizens at Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'Settlers in this area who have children are complaining about criminals hanging around and chatting with their kids. No doubt they''re recruiting for a life of crime. Fortunately, the parents tracked these crooks to their hideout, and they asked us for help. The task falls to you to wipe out these crooks and burn their stronghold. We''ll have a reward for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'This reward actually comes from the grateful parents. You can be proud of your work today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Crooks Recruiting Children'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'I don''t want to get too personal here, but my true love fell in with a criminal element and deserted me. Things must have gone wrong in the underworld, because now we''re back together -- at least, I hope so. But my sweetheart told me horror stories about a particular criminal lair. I want you to go there and wipe it out. Trust me, you''ll be doing good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'Thanks. My sweetheart and I pooled our savings to pay you this reward. We''re pooling our lives, too -- we''re getting married. Wish us better luck!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Sweetheart Returns From Life of Crime'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The Alliance is forced to work with smugglers, so it sort of makes sense that I fell in love with one. "Makes sense" in a generally stupid way, I mean. I regret it now, and I see that my true love was just using me. I can''t do anything about that. But I can hire you to destroy the criminal lowlifes who pretended loyalty to the Alliance. That ought to send a message!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'Thanks. I''m pretty sure my love got that message loud and clear. It''s never a good idea to fall in love with criminals, even the attractive ones. Especially the attractive ones!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Jilted Lover Commissions Revenge');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'The Alliance tried to open negotiations with a smuggling gang to get supplies past Imperial blockades. That is, we thought they were smugglers. They''re gangsters, the ruthless kind, and they sent back our negotiator in six pieces. We want you to take a team and wipe out that base. Our fallen member deserves that much.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Thanks. This has been a lousy business all around. At least we can give you this reward for your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Gangsters Killed Alliance Negotiator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'One of our pilots went to arrange transport of some power cores that a "procurement specialist" just smuggled on-planet. He got ambushed by a pirate gang that killed the smuggler to get the power cores. Our pilot barely escaped, without the cores. We expect the cores are already gone. But we want you to wipe out the pirates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Thanks. Your work is the the only good that has come out of this mess. Now where are we supposed to get more power cores, let alone another smuggler?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Smuggler Ambushed by Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'I''m a transport captain by trade. I''ve been arguing for a major offensive against the local pirate gangs. If these thugs attack Imperials, the Empire destroys them, but if the pirates go after us, local law enforcement sees no trouble. Alliance HQ has given me a budget to commission operators like you to take out these pirates. Go to it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'Good job. You''d probably make a pretty good transport pilot yourself. From me that''s high praise!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Transport Captain Hates Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'I joined the Alliance because gangsters kept pushing me around, and the corrupt Imperials wouldn''t do anything about it. Maybe the cause of freedom doesn''t necessarily need a vaporator merchant, but I try to help. You can too, if you''ll root out the gangsters that shook me down. Go to these coordinates and shoot everyone, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'Thanks. I sort of miss my old life selling vaporators, but I''m glad to work with good folks like yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Former Seller of Vaporators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'A local farm family has been hit by droid rustlers. Gangsters stole all their working droids at blaster-point. It burns me that the local Imperial goons won''t send even a droid to help them. When the Empire sits down, the Alliance needs to stand and act. We want you to -- well, you''re probably way ahead of me. Go to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'Some farmers say stealing their droids is a worse crime than kidnapping their spouse or children. Let''s hope you''ve prevented it from happening again. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Farming-Droid Rustlers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'A scout has located the Carbanti United starship sensor arrays that pirates stole from us. With those sensor arrays the pirates have their choice of ships to pick off -- including ours. We need you to take these coordinates and give those pirates a violent lesson about stealing from the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'Good thing those pirates didn''t use their sensors to see you coming. Great work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Pirates Holding Carbanti Sensors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'A pirate gang stole a subspace frequency encryptor. The Alliance had high hopes to use this device to talk over the Imperial HoloNet without detection. A scout located the pirate stronghold for us. It''s your job to shoot pirates and take names, and don''t worry much about the "taking names" part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'Thank you. Now our next step is to locate that frequency encryptor. Who knows? We may have more work for you soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Pirates With Subspace Transceiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'A scout located a local gang that stole some kind of construction equipment -- it says here, a Karflo Corporation G2-GE beamdrill. Apparently this thing can punch through anything short of an Imperial walker. Wow, I guess we''d better destroy that gang quick. Wait, this report says that''s your assignment. Okay then. Go to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'Did you find a beamdrill? Well, I hope it''s in ruins inside that stronghold. I don''t want the Alliance to see that in battle. Okay, I''m supposed to thank you and give you the reward. Here you go. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Beamdrill Pirate Stronghold'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'A gang stole an Industrial Automaton heavy construction droids. These things are as big as buildings; I guess the gang wanted to cut it up for parts. Our scout tracked the gangsters, but didn''t see the droid. We''ll find the droid somehow, but for now, we''d like you to take care of the little matter of the gang. As in, wipe them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'We learned that the construction droid was shipped offworld, intact. We don''t know where or why. Maybe we''ll find out and let you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Gangsters With Construction Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'We always hate hearing about slavers, but a scout just reported a gang installation full of Thalassian Slavers Guild collars. The slave runners are well defended, but you can take them if you look sharp and shoot straight. We don''t have any reports of slaves yet, so you can attack without fear of endangering hostages.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'It''s a relief to hear those slave collars won''t be put to use. At least, I''m assuming you destroyed them with the stronghold. You didn''t see them? Hmm. Well, then, we may have more work for you soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Gangsters Running Slave Collars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'I spotted an executive of BlasTech, the weapons manufacturer, meeting with some shady customers in a cantina. I followed them into the wilderness to a gangster outpost. That BlasTech is dealing with criminals doesn''t surprise me a bit. But they''ll be surprised when you assault and level their outpost. Are you up for the task?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'That''s terrific! I hope you got the BlasTech executive too. It would be sweet irony if those wartime profiteers died by bolts from their own blasters. But that''s just my own view.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'BlasTech Exec Deals With Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Black-market crooks are selling counterfeit Alliance military medals. For a few credits you can get a ribbon for service at the Battle of Yavin. Trouble is, they have hidden Imperial bugs -- the Empire uses them to track sympathizers. We want you to put a stop to these black-market Imperial stooges, in the most violent way you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'That was an insidious scheme even by the Empire''s standards, but you put a stop to it. Thanks for your work helping the Alliance. Here''s your reward!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Black-Market Alliance Medals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'A fraudulent "import agency" promises cheap shipments from offworld. This band of piratical con artists has been taking local residents for a fortune. Ten fortunes! It''s time to show citizens that the Alliance stands not only against the Empire, but against thievery everywhere! --Sorry, I''m getting carried away. I got taken myself. So I''d really like you to destroy these pirates, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'That''s a very satisfying piece of news. I feel somehow redeemed. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Fraudulent Import Agency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'This is the lousiest swindle I ever heard. Pirates con survivors of Alderaan into taking memorial capsules to the Graveyard of Alderaan. Then the pirates kill the passengers, rob the bodies, and dump them in the Graveyard. These crooks are right here on this world! You have to stop them, comprehensively and permanently.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'Thank you. Someone had to stop those sleemos from desecrating the memory of the Empire''s worst atrocity. Please accept this payment for your excellent work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Pirates Running Alderaan Scam'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Gangsters are running a scam selling milkstone rings to newly engaged couples. The milkstone is fake, and highly radioactive to boot. Stopping hazardous engagement rings is not the Alliance''s core mission, but we can offer you a decent reward for stopping these gangsters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'Newly engaged couples across the planet are safer today because of you. My hero! Sorry, just kidding. Here''s your payment, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Milkstone Ring Scam'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'A local Alliance supporter''s daughter started dating a gangster. The father went to the gang stronghold to, I guess, give everyone involved a good talking-to. That worked about as well as you''d expect. The gang beat up the father and threw out the daughter. Now they want us to destroy the gangsters. Can you take this off our hands? There''s a reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'We don''t like gangsters, obviously. But this kind of knuckleheaded distraction just gets in the way of our real work. Thanks for disposing of the matter for us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'Father-Daughter-Gang Triangle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'The community elders at a remote settlement have approached us for help. A group of gangsters has set up a base in their area, and the elders seem to find a lot of the gang''s activities to be of dubious morality. Who could have guessed? Well, they offered us a reward to destroy the gang, and we''ll pass it along to you if you''ll take the job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'The community elders send their thanks. I wonder if you get the community elder job automatically if you just live long enough? I don''t think I''ll ask. Here''s their reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'Elders Warn of Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'A landowner sympathetic to the Alliance is having trouble with his current tenants. Basically, they''re -- how to put this delicately? -- they''re pirates. Our friend has tried to get local law agencies to oust the pirates, but they''re hardly better than crooks themselves. He asked our help. We''re asking yours. Can you take out the pirates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'Thanks. The landowner sends along this reward with his thanks, too. The view will be a lot better out on that land without that pirate base messing up the terrain.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Landowner Wants Pirates Evicted'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'Jabba the Hutt keeps trying to extend his slimy reach. His swoop gang leader, Big Gizz, is setting up a new gang near here. Gizz fired a warning shot off our bow, so to speak, by buzzing one of our speeders. Well, we want to fire a shot right back -- not a warning, a termination. And we want you to fire that shot -- as many as you need to wipe out the gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'That gang sounds tougher than some I''ve seen. I guess Jabba is really interested in that territory. Or maybe it''s a franchise. Anyway, nice job!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Jabba''s Latest Swoop Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'Our scouts have discovered slavers selling Twi''lek women to settlers in remote areas. The slave trade has got worse lately, particularly the Twi''lek trade. Imperial Security is doing nothing, of course. We''re hiring you to assemble an experienced strike teams that can handle a challenge. Interested?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'The Twi''lek women will thank you for removing that threat. There are always more slavers, though, so expect to hear from us again. Meanwhile, here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Twi''lek Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'Rumors say some old medicine man or shaman from the Outer Rim is on this world, trafficking in weird medicines and organs of local animals. He''s got a smuggling gang that''s poaching the local herds. Farmers have complained to the Empire, but no luck. It''s up to us to stop this shaman''s strange gang. Are you willing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'On behalf of the local farmers, thanks. That shaman apparently comes from a remote world called Omwat. Don''t suppose you saw him? We''ll probably hear from him again, is my guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Strange Shaman''s Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'We''ve learned what happened to those Locris Syndicated Securities mobile prisoner cages that we lost a while back. Turns out slavers are using them to transport Twi''lek slave women. That''s a stinking business, and we want you to stop it. Destroy the slavers, and if you see any cages, destroy those too. Free the slaves, if there are any.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'We didn''t think you''d find any slaves there. Slavers tend to sell those Twi''leks as fast as they can kidnap them. "Can''t keep ''em in stock," I guess! Sorry, that was tasteless. Honestly, we''re glad you stopped them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Mobile Prisoner Cages Found'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'Bad news. An Alliance testing facility was working with a prototype Miradyne sensor jamming system. Corporate espionage agents broke into the facility and stole the prototype. But the prototype had a hidden tracking beacon, and we''ve found the thieves. They''ve probably already disposed of the prototype, but we want you to make sure they never steal from anyone again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'The loss of that prototype hurts. But we''ll get another eventually. Next time we''ll plant it with 30 or 40 hidden beacons, just cover the thing in hidden beacons. Yeah, that''ll work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Sensor Jamming Prototype Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'An Alliance engineer was travelling here to report the Imperial Security Bureau''s use of poison gas against our fighters on Cularin. Gangsters with an implausibly close knowledge of his itinerary ambushed his landspeeder. We found his body soon after, and tracked the gang to these coordinates. We want you to terminate that gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'You resolved that gang problem efficiently -- just like the Empire managed to resolve its problem with our engineer. The war goes on. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Engineer''s Murderers Sought'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'The Alliance has commisioned Incom to design an experimental new starfighter, the "A-wing." They were hand-delivering a refinement to the current schematics, but industrial saboteurs stole the plans. We traced the thieves to an installation outside town. Get to the base and blow it up before they can move the plans offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'Thank you. The A-wing could be the fastest starfighter in the galaxy, once we clean up all the designs. That should be, oh, four or five years maybe. Let''s hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'A-Wing Plans Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'The Empire is scheming to release an airborne virus during Core Worlds protests against the Emperor. Thousands could die. We developed a retrovirus and were delivering it for transport offworld, but thieves ambushed our courier and killed him. We''re synthesizing a replacement antidote, but meanwhile, we want you to clean up that thief problem by blowing up their base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'The replacement retrovirus is being delivered. Hope the new courier has better luck. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Retrovirus Courier Murdered'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'An Alliance fighter of remarkable courage infiltrated the Imperial Security Bureau on Coruscant. He sent us priceless intelligence that saved many lives. But the Empire discovered him, and he fled to this planet. That wasn''t far enough to escape the ISB''s hired thugs, who killed him on our doorstep. But we know where the thugs live. We want you to go there and make sure they don''t any more -- live, I mean.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'Our agent in the ISB deserved a better fate. I wish he''d lived long enough to see the Republic restored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'Alliance''s ISB Agent Murdered'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A major Black Sun glitterstim lab has been located by Intelligence. These crooks are well-connected and have local law enforcement in their pockets. We need to hit this facility hard and put it out of commission for good. A team of highly skilled agents ought to be able to accomplish this mission. Think you''re up to the task, agent?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Bravo, agent! Your results never cease to impress us. We''re glad to employ an agent as effective as you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Destroy Glitterstim Lab'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'We''ve located the hideout of a local branch of the notorious swoop gang, the Shadow Angels of Dathomir. These creeps move fast so this is a job for a small group of skilled and dedicated agents. The right strike team can blast this hideout and all of those vicious criminals to pieces before they had a chance to even look around. Can we count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'These gangs are always braver in packs and even then they can''t put up a good fight when confronted with talent like yours? Job well done, agent. That reward is going to the right individual.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Raid the Shadow Angels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'A cadre of Black Sun assassins has converted an abandoned mining installation into a stronghold that specializes in training killers. We can''t afford to let this assassin academy continue to operate. We''re offering a substantial reward to the strike team that can pull this off. Attacking this facility is no small matter. You feel like making history, agent?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'Now that was something. You should be working for SpecForces, agent. Excellent job. You''ve definitely earned this reward. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Smash Assassin''s HQ'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'It has been brought to our attention that a group of trusted couriers is also selling information to Imperial Intelligence. We need these couriers removed and their records destroyed. Here are the coordinates to their base. The Empire has tried to infiltrate our organization with these sorts of agents before. It always leads to a tragic loss of life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Your actions were those of an exemplary agent. War is a terrible thing and the sooner we end this one the better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Take Out Imperial Moles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Jabba''s swoopers think they can move into any system they like and stake their claim. Well not while we have something to say about it. Big Gizz is wanting to expand his organization beyond Mos Eisley. We need a hardy band of skilled agents to show these new "branches" that the galaxy is a dangerous and treacherous place. Think you can help?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'Well done, agent. It''s bad enough that we have to take on the Empire. These vicious criminals are certainly taking advantage of this civil war.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Take On Jabba''s Swoopers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Deathsticks in a decent community! Is nowhere safe from the corruption of this vile drug? We''ve learned from our sources that a so-called "esteemed businessman" is secretly fronting a distribution center for this contemptible substance. The villain pays the local Moff huge bribes so the Empire has refused to interfere. Can you stamp out this blight on galactic decency?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Well struck, citizen. Our fight is not only against the Empire but also against the corrupt system that supports it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Stamp Out the Deathstick Dealer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Vile pirates in our very own sector! These despicable cutthroats have raided one of our freight ships and stolen a precious cargo of TDL nanny droids headed for orphanages in the Outer Rim. We need a team of agents to lay waste to these loathsome murderers. We have the coordinates to their secret den. We must fight back for the sake of goodness.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'Those poor orphans will never get their nanny droids, but at least they can lay down their little heads at night knowing that the villains who robbed them died a horrible, fiery death.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Stop the Thieving Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Piracy is a major concern for the Alliance. Our ships in particular draw those predators like skettos to a sleeping dewback. We''ve discovered that many of these pirates have banded together to form some sort of "Brotherhood." We''ve used our resources to pinpoint the locations of some of the busiest spaceports used by these rogues. Can you knock these ports out of commission?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Good work. Remember there''s plenty more of those havens out there. We''ll continue to pay as long as you continue to produce results.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Smash the Pirates'' Haven'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'You may have heard that a Viceprex of the Tagge Company, the big shots of the Corporate Sector, got kidnapped by pirates. They just returned him for a huge ransom, but they didn''t find the tracking beacon in the payment. We tracked the pirates to a stronghold on this world. Get out there with a team and hit them hard. There''s a big reward!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'We know most Corporate Sector Viceprexes don''t like the Alliance much -- bad for business, they think -- but we still don''t like seeing executives kidnapped. Thanks, and here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Ransom for Tagge Viceprex'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'Apparently the Black Sun criminal organization is doing the Empire''s dirty work, not that the Empire would shy away from dirty work. Black Sun gangsters are burning the homes of Alliance sympathizers. The thugs are suspiciously well armed, and their remote base is heavily defended with Imperial-grade weaponry. Can you assemble a team and take out the Black Sun base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'That was quite an undertaking. You pulled it off with aplomb, and in this job I don''t get to use the word "aplomb" often enough, believe me. You deserve this reward!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Black Sun Doing Empire''s Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'A remarkably well equipped smuggling gang has been stealing Alliance supplies of rock ivory. To keep our repulsorlift engines running well, we have to stop this theft. The smuggler base is protected with some heavy hardware, so make sure your team is loaded for krayt. This is a big job, with a big reward. Hope you''re up to the task.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'The rock ivory wasn''t in the base, was it? We had a hovercam observing, but we didn''t spot it. You did a great job, thanks -- but we need to find that rock ivory soon. We''ll be in touch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Rock Ivory Thieves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'A bizarre criminal plastic-surgery operation is taking known felons, changing their faces, and putting them in new jobs -- sometimes government jobs. This crazy scheme will make us all paranoid. Maybe that''s the point. We''d like you to destroy the criminal base; it''s at these coordinates. Expect heavy opposition.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Good thing you took out that face-changing operation. Otherwise you couldn''t even be sure this was me! Haha! Hey, I was only kidding. It''s me. All right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Face-Changing Criminal Operation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'We''ve discovered a gang of smugglers who extract illicit data that Core Worlds slicers have encoded into droid brains. The smugglers are ruining the droids in the process, so we want to shut them down. They have a very well defended operation, so I suggest you put together a good strike team to take them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Thanks for your smooth handling of a tough assignment. This place needs all the droids it can get, without corrupted brains. Take this reward with the Alliance''s thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Smugglers Coding Droid Brains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Can you believe that a criminal syndicate is passing messages coded into HoloNet entertainment programs? Our slicers decoded their scheme and learned of a major glitterstim shipment due to arrive on this world. We have the coordinates, and we want you to destroy the crooks before the drugs arrive. Careful -- they sound pretty tough.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'Thanks. The Alliance wants to restore freedom to the galaxy, but not freedom to ship in stupid drugs to get our kids hooked. You deserve this reward, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Criminals Coding HoloNet Messages'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'My sister was running medical supplies to an Alliance hospital on this world when she ran into some gangsters. Or rather, the gangsters ran into her -- rammed her speeder into a mountainside and shot her. I had a scout locate the gang hideout, and now I need someone to go in and commit some serious revenge. Are you willing to help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Thanks, I feel a little better. It''s not just revenge, you know -- it''s keeping this whole area safe for innocent folks. I didn''t think about that when I hired you, but it''s still true.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Vengeance for a Slain Sister'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'Pirates stole one of our smuggling freighters. It''s not the kind of crime you can report to local law enforcement, so we''ve located the crooks ourselves. We had a scout look over the defenses -- turns out they''re pretty tough. If you''re up to it, we''d like you to assemble a strike team and assault the pirate base. Destroy the whole works, if you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'That was an extraordinary performance. I''ll have to tell Alliance headquarters about your efforts. Glad we don''t have to worry about that particular gang any more.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Pirates Steal Smuggling Freighter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'A local teacher who sympathizes with our cause has turned her students into Imperial observers. They go out in the wilderness and report on the strength of the Empire''s bases. One student just discovered a well-defended gangster base, apparently involved in fencing power cores. We want you to take that base and blow it up good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'Thanks! By the way, the student got extra credit for that assignment. Here''s your own version of extra credit -- a nice reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Student Discovers Gang Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'A lot of droids from our local bases are getting lost. A directional beam is bathing this whole complex with a coded signal that messes with the programming of certain droid brain models. We think gangsters are reprogramming our droids to wander right into their stronghold. We located the place, and now we want you to destroy it. Be ready for a tough fight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'Thanks. The droids seem to be finding their way back home now. Here''s a reward for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Droids Getting Really Lost'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'You probably don''t want to hear about my troubled adolescence, so I''ll just say that a particular bunch of gangsters has been following me from planet to planet for the last three years. I don''t want anything to do with them now that I''m in the Alliance, but they won''t leave me alone. Can you take care of this ongoing problem once and for all?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'Thanks! I had too much history with that gang, and they didn''t want to let me forget it. It''s better for me and for the Alliance that you got rid of them. I''m glad to pay this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Troubled Past Has Returned'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'Some former friends got me to invest in a "mining operation" in the countryside. Turns out they started a smuggling gang -- a real growth industry there -- and they''re not interested in helping the Alliance. So, with me out a lot of credits, and the Alliance facing trouble from these new smugglers, it makes sense to hire you to destroy their base. Are you okay with that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Thanks. I thought about alerting my former friends to get out before you arrived, and then said, "Naah." I made the right choice, and you did the right thing. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Former Friends Turned Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'We''ve learned of a pirate gang that somehow got its hands on a few Imperial TIE fighters. Very bad news. We found the likely location, and we need a large, experienced strike team to take out the base, especially the TIEs -- assuming the ships are still there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'No TIE fighters there? Good. It would be a crazy galaxy if ordinary criminals could get state-of-the-art Imperial ships. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Pirates with TIE Fighters?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Local droid repair merchants are complaining that smuggled chromium plating is undermining their business. It''s not our "procurement specialists" doing the smuggling, so someone new has entered the field. The merchants hired a scout to locate the smuggling base, and they''ve asked us to destroy it. Can we hire you to do the job?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'Thanks. The merchant association was getting quite insistent about this. And anyway, we like to help them out when we can. Here''s the reward they offered.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Help Chromium Merchants'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The Hutt criminal syndicate is using strongarm tactics to corner the local market for Lowickan firegems. The scout report we have indicates a well fortified installation as the center for the gang enforcers. We''d like to keep Hutt activity on this world to a minimum, as hard as that sounds. Can you put together a strike team and assault the place?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'It''s impossible to keep Hutts from leaving a moist trail on nearly every civilized world, but we try. Your efforts today certainly helped! This is your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Hutts Cornering Lowickan Firegems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'To restrict local hyperdrive repair operations, the Corporate Sector has bribed local Imperials to blockade durelium imports. One of our "procurement specialists" just made it through with a good supply, but Black Sun gangsters promptly hijacked it and took it offworld again. This has to stop. Destroy the Black Sun base!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Good job, against tough odds. We''re lining up another supplier for durelium now, but it''s hard work flying past Star Destroyers. We''ll manage somehow, I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Black Sun Stealing Durelium'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'A local smuggling gang has murdered law enforcement officials using dart shooters tipped with Devaronian blood-poison. Usually the officials are in the Empire''s pocket, but we still don''t want smugglers taking the law into their own hands. The assignment for your strike team is to hit the smuggling base and destroy its stocks of Devaronian poison. If you don''t see the poison, just destroy everything.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Smugglers who use poison just give our "procurement specialists" a bad name. Glad you were able to take them out. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Smugglers Using Devaronian Poison\n\n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_hard.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'The Empire''s draconian tactics have created an influx of refugees, many of which are recruited by swoop gangs. This has increased violent crimes. We have plenty of work for agents who want to lend a hand to keep peace and order in our communities. We know where these gangs gather and we need those places cleared out. Think you can help? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 2, 'm1c', 'Good work, citizen. One by one, we''ll get all these wretched hives of scum and villainy. Have a drink on us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Clean up the streets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Our agents have uncovered a major glitterstim dealer''s lair. We need to put this scum out of business and we need your help to do it. The dealer has hired some muscle to protect their precious goods. A quick, stealthy strike, however, ought to get the job done. We always reward results too. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 5, 'm2c', 'Nothing quite as sweet as the smell of burning spice in the morning, eh? Good job, citizen. Keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Destroy Spice Dealer''s Stash'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'I shouldn''t be doing this, but I need your help. My son was implicated in a murder but released for lack of evidence. He didn''t kill anyone but I know who did. The thugs he hangs out with are thieves and murderers. My son is currently offworld. I need you to blast that gang''s hideout while he''s gone. Teach those animals never to bother us again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 8, 'm3c', 'My superiors had ordered me to let local law enforcement handle this situation but I''m sure you know that would have resulted in the loss of my son. I''m a dedicated member of the Alliance but also a devoted parent. My thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'A Desperate Parent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Four fatal beatings have taken place in the last six weeks. A new gang has moved into the neighborhood and is announcing its presence. The local authorities have their hands full assisting the Empire in tracking us down. So we''re taking matters into our own hands. We need you to march into that gang''s hangout and blast those murderers to atoms.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 11, 'm4c', 'Being a member of the Alliance does not mean we turn our backs on our communities. That''s what we''re fighting to protect. Good work, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Smash the Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'A swoop gang has been terrorizing the area. Their recent "fun" consists of zooming down streets and sniping citizens through windows. The body count so far is nine dead and six others wounded. We want these animals stopped. We''ve acquired the coordinates to this swoop gang''s hideout. Will you rid these good people of this terrible menace? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 14, 'm5c', 'You''re alright, buddy. Good to see that someone cares enough about other people to lend a hand. All the better that the hand is being paid for those efforts, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Stop the Swoop Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'Some slavers have been operating in this area. Indeed, these slavers have been known to take humans as well. Through the help of Intelligence, we''ve located their lair. We need a small strike team to assault this base. Can you help the Alliance put a stop to this despicable practice? The reward will be well worth it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 17, 'm6c', 'Handled like a true professional. We hope you consider working for us again. Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Stop the Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'A group of dangerous criminals is using an old halfway house in our area as a hideout and refuge from authorities. We want this place wiped out and those murderers run off or brought to justice. We can''t ignore their activities any longer. We''ll pay a reward to anyone willing to undertake and complete this task. Are you the citizen we''re looking for?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 20, 'm7c', 'We''re glad to see you share our enthusiasm to create safe neighborhoods for our children. You deserve this reward, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Clean Out the Halfway House'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'An illegal weapons lab has been supplying the local gangs with homemade explosives, which they''ve gladly used in recent attacks. This lab is being run by a particularly vicious gang of killers. We need to take this lab out of commission, especially since it''s attracting disgruntled weapons specialists from around the galaxy. Can you help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 23, 'm8c', 'Nicely done, citizen. Take your reward and remember that there''s plenty more where that came from.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Blow Up the Explosives Lab'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Local thugs have been harassing the people of this area. They loiter around an abandoned settlement and get high on glitterstim. We''re offering a reward to any agent that''ll go in there and blast that wretched hive to pieces. That would certainly get the point across, eh? Most of these thugs are bullies and cowards so you shouldn''t have too much trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 26, 'm9c', 'Told you those creeps wouldn''t put up much of a fight. Bet they don''t come around here no more. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Scare the Thugs Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'There''s been an increase in break-ins around here recently. We know who''s behind it but the local authorities are turning a blind eye because most of the victims are sympathetic to the Alliance. It''s time we got involved. We need you to run the criminals behind those thefts out of town. Blasting their hideout to atoms ought to get the point across.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 29, 'm10c', 'Those citizens will sleep easier at night now. Good job, agent. Come see us again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Stop the Thieves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'A bunch of criminal slugs have been harassing the women of this neighborhood. We''ve heard of these guys. They were run out of another town after they assaulted a young woman. We feel these predators will repeat that pattern soon. We know where these creeps have set up shop and are certain they''d vacate the premises if their lair were blasted to pieces. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 32, 'm11c', 'Well struck, citizen! You''ve made this area safer for women. Enjoy the reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Get Rid of Slimy Predators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'A shyster has been cheating older retired folks out of their life savings. This creep goes around selling bogus cruises on luxury starliners that don''t exist. Further, this slimeball has hired some local toughs, thinking that their presence will scare away any citizens seeking to get their money back. It''s time we put a stop to this activity. Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 35, 'm12c', 'Good work! No one has the right to cheat decent folk out of their life savings. You''ve made sure that point was made, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Smash the Shyster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'The same brutish thugs have mugged half a dozen decent people in the last month, one of which died last night as a result of the injuries. We''d prefer to handle these animals on our own terms rather than get the local authorities involved. Slime like this want us to believe that life in the universe is cheap. Well we''ve got news for those slugs - life is not cheap. Can you help us make that point?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 38, 'm13c', 'Thank you, citizen. Take the reward, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Stop the Murderous Muggers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Have you ever heard of the Vibrodagger Killer? We think we''ve finally tracked this heinous murderer down. He''s hiding in a small abandoned settlement near here. We believe there may be other murderers hiding there as well. The time for justice is at hand. We need someone to go in there and wipe that place out. You up to that task?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 41, 'm14c', 'That should put an end to these horrible crimes. Assuming it was the actual Vibrodagger Killer in that settlement, that is. You''ve earned your reward in any case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Stop the Vibrodagger Killer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'A gang of hooligans has been terrorizing this neighborhood for months now. Their favorite tactic is hurling homemade firebombs at passing speeders. So far three people have been killed by these attacks. The local authorities are swamped and can''t devote the time necessary to stop these criminals. We need an independent agent to take up the cause of justice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 44, 'm15c', 'Looks like you gave those thugs a taste of their own medicine. Good job! This neighborhood could use more folks like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Stop the Firebombers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'A gang has decided to set up a protection racket in our area. The local merchants have been forced to pay protection money after one shop was blown to pieces with the shop owner and his family still inside. The gang is paying bribes to the local law enforcement authorities so they ignore these criminal activities. We need you to put a stop to this gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 47, 'm16c', 'Looks like the gang forgot to pay their own protection money. Good work, citizen. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Stop the Protection Racket'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'A local glitterstim dealer got my son addicted to that poison and now my boy is rotting in an Imperial prison while the dealer continues to pedal his filth. It''s time we put a stop to this criminal''s activities. I''m offering a reward to anyone that goes into that dealer''s lair and blasts everything in sight. That nest of silica parasites needs to be cleaned out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 50, 'm17c', 'You''re an effective agent of justice, citizen. You''ve made the streets safer for our youth. This is one reward I am happy to pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Stop the Glitterstim Dealer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'The Alliance employs smugglers to procure supplies, but we don''t work with just every smuggler that comes along. A particularly crooked gang has set up a stronghold to fence stolen goods offworld. We want that smuggling gang stopped. Getting goods past Imperial blockades in a good cause is one thing, but crooks are crooks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 53, 'm18c', 'This world could use a lot more straight-shooting folks like you. Thanks, and here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Crooks are Crooks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Our approved "procurement specialists" smuggled some weapons to us past the Empire, landed, and promptly got robbed at blaster-point! Some completely different smugglers have taken our weapons to their depot. This stinks! Will you go wipe out those crooks -- I mean, the second gang of crooks, the one who stole from our crooks?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 56, 'm19c', 'What a revolting development that was. Isn''t there any honor among thieves? Well, forget I asked that. Thanks for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Smugglers Stole From Our Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'A strong criminal element is part of life around here, but now thugs are actually barging into innocent people''s homes and robbing them in their beds. It has to stop. We know of one stronghold where the thugs especially like old people -- "like" them the way the Empire likes slave races. If you take out that stronghold, we''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 59, 'm20c', 'Nice work. It''s only one step in a long project, but it''s a step. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Criminals Robbing Citizens at Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'Settlers in this area who have children are complaining about criminals hanging around and chatting with their kids. No doubt they''re recruiting for a life of crime. Fortunately, the parents tracked these crooks to their hideout, and they asked us for help. The task falls to you to wipe out these crooks and burn their stronghold. We''ll have a reward for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 62, 'm21c', 'This reward actually comes from the grateful parents. You can be proud of your work today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Crooks Recruiting Children'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'I don''t want to get too personal here, but my true love fell in with a criminal element and deserted me. Things must have gone wrong in the underworld, because now we''re back together -- at least, I hope so. But my sweetheart told me horror stories about a particular criminal lair. I want you to go there and wipe it out. Trust me, you''ll be doing good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 65, 'm22c', 'Thanks. My sweetheart and I pooled our savings to pay you this reward. We''re pooling our lives, too -- we''re getting married. Wish us better luck!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Sweetheart Returns From Life of Crime'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The Alliance is forced to work with smugglers, so it sort of makes sense that I fell in love with one. "Makes sense" in a generally stupid way, I mean. I regret it now, and I see that my true love was just using me. I can''t do anything about that. But I can hire you to destroy the criminal lowlifes who pretended loyalty to the Alliance. That ought to send a message!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 68, 'm23c', 'Thanks. I''m pretty sure my love got that message loud and clear. It''s never a good idea to fall in love with criminals, even the attractive ones. Especially the attractive ones!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'Jilted Lover Commissions Revenge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'The Alliance tried to open negotiations with a smuggling gang to get supplies past Imperial blockades. That is, we thought they were smugglers. They''re gangsters, the ruthless kind, and they sent back our negotiator in six pieces. We want you to take a team and wipe out that base. Our fallen member deserves that much.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 71, 'm24c', 'Thanks. This has been a lousy business all around. At least we can give you this reward for your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Gangsters Killed Alliance Negotiator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'One of our pilots went to arrange transport of some power cores that a "procurement specialist" just smuggled on-planet. He got ambushed by a pirate gang that killed the smuggler to get the power cores. Our pilot barely escaped, without the cores. We expect the cores are already gone. But we want you to wipe out the pirates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 74, 'm25c', 'Thanks. Your work is the the only good that has come out of this mess. Now where are we supposed to get more power cores, let alone another smuggler?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Smuggler Ambushed by Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'I''m a transport captain by trade. I''ve been arguing for a major offensive against the local pirate gangs. If these thugs attack Imperials, the Empire destroys them, but if the pirates go after us, local law enforcement sees no trouble. Alliance HQ has given me a budget to commission operators like you to take out these pirates. Go to it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 77, 'm26c', 'Good job. You''d probably make a pretty good transport pilot yourself. From me that''s high praise!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Transport Captain Hates Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'I joined the Alliance because gangsters kept pushing me around, and the corrupt Imperials wouldn''t do anything about it. Maybe the cause of freedom doesn''t necessarily need a vaporator merchant, but I try to help. You can too, if you''ll root out the gangsters that shook me down. Go to these coordinates and shoot everyone, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 80, 'm27c', 'Thanks. I sort of miss my old life selling vaporators, but I''m glad to work with good folks like yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Former Seller of Vaporators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'A local farm family has been hit by droid rustlers. Gangsters stole all their working droids at blaster-point. It burns me that the local Imperial goons won''t send even a droid to help them. When the Empire sits down, the Alliance needs to stand and act. We want you to -- well, you''re probably way ahead of me. Go to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 83, 'm28c', 'Some farmers say stealing their droids is a worse crime than kidnapping their spouse or children. Let''s hope you''ve prevented it from happening again. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Farming-Droid Rustlers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'A scout has located the Carbanti United starship sensor arrays that pirates stole from us. With those sensor arrays the pirates have their choice of ships to pick off -- including ours. We need you to take these coordinates and give those pirates a violent lesson about stealing from the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 86, 'm29c', 'Good thing those pirates didn''t use their sensors to see you coming. Great work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Pirates Holding Carbanti Sensors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'A pirate gang stole a subspace frequency encryptor. The Alliance had high hopes to use this device to talk over the Imperial HoloNet without detection. A scout located the pirate stronghold for us. It''s your job to shoot pirates and take names, and don''t worry much about the "taking names" part.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 89, 'm30c', 'Thank you. Now our next step is to locate that frequency encryptor. Who knows? We may have more work for you soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Pirates With Subspace Transceiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'A scout located a local gang that stole some kind of construction equipment -- it says here, a Karflo Corporation G2-GE beamdrill. Apparently this thing can punch through anything short of an Imperial walker. Wow, I guess we''d better destroy that gang quick. Wait, this report says that''s your assignment. Okay then. Go to it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 92, 'm31c', 'Did you find a beamdrill? Well, I hope it''s in ruins inside that stronghold. I don''t want the Alliance to see that in battle. Okay, I''m supposed to thank you and give you the reward. Here you go. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Beamdrill Pirate Stronghold'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'A gang stole an Industrial Automaton heavy construction droids. These things are as big as buildings; I guess the gang wanted to cut it up for parts. Our scout tracked the gangsters, but didn''t see the droid. We''ll find the droid somehow, but for now, we''d like you to take care of the little matter of the gang. As in, wipe them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 95, 'm32c', 'We learned that the construction droid was shipped offworld, intact. We don''t know where or why. Maybe we''ll find out and let you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Gangsters With Construction Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'We always hate hearing about slavers, but a scout just reported a gang installation full of Thalassian Slavers Guild collars. The slave runners are well defended, but you can take them if you look sharp and shoot straight. We don''t have any reports of slaves yet, so you can attack without fear of endangering hostages.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 98, 'm33c', 'It''s a relief to hear those slave collars won''t be put to use. At least, I''m assuming you destroyed them with the stronghold. You didn''t see them? Hmm. Well, then, we may have more work for you soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Gangsters Running Slave Collars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'I spotted an executive of BlasTech, the weapons manufacturer, meeting with some shady customers in a cantina. I followed them into the wilderness to a gangster outpost. That BlasTech is dealing with criminals doesn''t surprise me a bit. But they''ll be surprised when you assault and level their outpost. Are you up for the task?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 101, 'm34c', 'That''s terrific! I hope you got the BlasTech executive too. It would be sweet irony if those wartime profiteers died by bolts from their own blasters. But that''s just my own view.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'BlasTech Exec Deals With Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Black-market crooks are selling counterfeit Alliance military medals. For a few credits you can get a ribbon for service at the Battle of Yavin. Trouble is, they have hidden Imperial bugs -- the Empire uses them to track sympathizers. We want you to put a stop to these black-market Imperial stooges, in the most violent way you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 104, 'm35c', 'That was an insidious scheme even by the Empire''s standards, but you put a stop to it. Thanks for your work helping the Alliance. Here''s your reward!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Black-Market Alliance Medals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'A fraudulent "import agency" promises cheap shipments from offworld. This band of piratical con artists has been taking local residents for a fortune. Ten fortunes! It''s time to show citizens that the Alliance stands not only against the Empire, but against thievery everywhere! --Sorry, I''m getting carried away. I got taken myself. So I''d really like you to destroy these pirates, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 107, 'm36c', 'That''s a very satisfying piece of news. I feel somehow redeemed. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Fraudulent Import Agency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'This is the lousiest swindle I ever heard. Pirates con survivors of Alderaan into taking memorial capsules to the Graveyard of Alderaan. Then the pirates kill the passengers, rob the bodies, and dump them in the Graveyard. These crooks are right here on this world! You have to stop them, comprehensively and permanently.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 110, 'm37c', 'Thank you. Someone had to stop those sleemos from desecrating the memory of the Empire''s worst atrocity. Please accept this payment for your excellent work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Pirates Running Alderaan Scam'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Gangsters are running a scam selling milkstone rings to newly engaged couples. The milkstone is fake, and highly radioactive to boot. Stopping hazardous engagement rings is not the Alliance''s core mission, but we can offer you a decent reward for stopping these gangsters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 113, 'm38c', 'Newly engaged couples across the planet are safer today because of you. My hero! Sorry, just kidding. Here''s your payment, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Milkstone Ring Scam'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'A local Alliance supporter''s daughter started dating a gangster. The father went to the gang stronghold to, I guess, give everyone involved a good talking-to. That worked about as well as you''d expect. The gang beat up the father and threw out the daughter. Now they want us to destroy the gangsters. Can you take this off our hands? There''s a reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 116, 'm39c', 'We don''t like gangsters, obviously. But this kind of knuckleheaded distraction just gets in the way of our real work. Thanks for disposing of the matter for us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'Father-Daughter-Gang Triangle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'The community elders at a remote settlement have approached us for help. A group of gangsters has set up a base in their area, and the elders seem to find a lot of the gang''s activities to be of dubious morality. Who could have guessed? Well, they offered us a reward to destroy the gang, and we''ll pass it along to you if you''ll take the job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 119, 'm40c', 'The community elders send their thanks. I wonder if you get the community elder job automatically if you just live long enough? I don''t think I''ll ask. Here''s their reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 120, 'm40t', 'Elders Warn of Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'A landowner sympathetic to the Alliance is having trouble with his current tenants. Basically, they''re -- how to put this delicately? -- they''re pirates. Our friend has tried to get local law agencies to oust the pirates, but they''re hardly better than crooks themselves. He asked our help. We''re asking yours. Can you take out the pirates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 122, 'm41c', 'Thanks. The landowner sends along this reward with his thanks, too. The view will be a lot better out on that land without that pirate base messing up the terrain.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Landowner Wants Pirates Evicted'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'Jabba the Hutt keeps trying to extend his slimy reach. His swoop gang leader, Big Gizz, is setting up a new gang near here. Gizz fired a warning shot off our bow, so to speak, by buzzing one of our speeders. Well, we want to fire a shot right back -- not a warning, a termination. And we want you to fire that shot -- as many as you need to wipe out the gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 125, 'm42c', 'That gang sounds tougher than some I''ve seen. I guess Jabba is really interested in that territory. Or maybe it''s a franchise. Anyway, nice job!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'Jabba''s Latest Swoop Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'Our scouts have discovered slavers selling Twi''lek women to settlers in remote areas. The slave trade has got worse lately, particularly the Twi''lek trade. Imperial Security is doing nothing, of course. We''re hiring you to assemble an experienced strike teams that can handle a challenge. Interested?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 128, 'm43c', 'The Twi''lek women will thank you for removing that threat. There are always more slavers, though, so expect to hear from us again. Meanwhile, here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Twi''lek Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'Rumors say some old medicine man or shaman from the Outer Rim is on this world, trafficking in weird medicines and organs of local animals. He''s got a smuggling gang that''s poaching the local herds. Farmers have complained to the Empire, but no luck. It''s up to us to stop this shaman''s strange gang. Are you willing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 131, 'm44c', 'On behalf of the local farmers, thanks. That shaman apparently comes from a remote world called Omwat. Don''t suppose you saw him? We''ll probably hear from him again, is my guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Strange Shaman''s Gang'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'We''ve learned what happened to those Locris Syndicated Securities mobile prisoner cages that we lost a while back. Turns out slavers are using them to transport Twi''lek slave women. That''s a stinking business, and we want you to stop it. Destroy the slavers, and if you see any cages, destroy those too. Free the slaves, if there are any.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 134, 'm45c', 'We didn''t think you''d find any slaves there. Slavers tend to sell those Twi''leks as fast as they can kidnap them. "Can''t keep ''em in stock," I guess! Sorry, that was tasteless. Honestly, we''re glad you stopped them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Mobile Prisoner Cages Found'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'Bad news. An Alliance testing facility was working with a prototype Miradyne sensor jamming system. Corporate espionage agents broke into the facility and stole the prototype. But the prototype had a hidden tracking beacon, and we''ve found the thieves. They''ve probably already disposed of the prototype, but we want you to make sure they never steal from anyone again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 137, 'm46c', 'The loss of that prototype hurts. But we''ll get another eventually. Next time we''ll plant it with 30 or 40 hidden beacons, just cover the thing in hidden beacons. Yeah, that''ll work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Sensor Jamming Prototype Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'An Alliance engineer was travelling here to report the Imperial Security Bureau''s use of poison gas against our fighters on Cularin. Gangsters with an implausibly close knowledge of his itinerary ambushed his landspeeder. We found his body soon after, and tracked the gang to these coordinates. We want you to terminate that gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 140, 'm47c', 'You resolved that gang problem efficiently -- just like the Empire managed to resolve its problem with our engineer. The war goes on. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Engineer''s Murderers Sought'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'The Alliance has commisioned Incom to design an experimental new starfighter, the "A-wing." They were hand-delivering a refinement to the current schematics, but industrial saboteurs stole the plans. We traced the thieves to an installation outside town. Get to the base and blow it up before they can move the plans offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 143, 'm48c', 'Thank you. The A-wing could be the fastest starfighter in the galaxy, once we clean up all the designs. That should be, oh, four or five years maybe. Let''s hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'A-Wing Plans Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'The Empire is scheming to release an airborne virus during Core Worlds protests against the Emperor. Thousands could die. We developed a retrovirus and were delivering it for transport offworld, but thieves ambushed our courier and killed him. We''re synthesizing a replacement antidote, but meanwhile, we want you to clean up that thief problem by blowing up their base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 146, 'm49c', 'The replacement retrovirus is being delivered. Hope the new courier has better luck. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Retrovirus Courier Murdered'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'An Alliance fighter of remarkable courage infiltrated the Imperial Security Bureau on Coruscant. He sent us priceless intelligence that saved many lives. But the Empire discovered him, and he fled to this planet. That wasn''t far enough to escape the ISB''s hired thugs, who killed him on our doorstep. But we know where the thugs live. We want you to go there and make sure they don''t any more -- live, I mean.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 149, 'm50c', 'Our agent in the ISB deserved a better fate. I wish he''d lived long enough to see the Republic restored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'Alliance''s ISB Agent Murdered'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_destroy_rebel_non_military_medium.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Rebel slicers have made it necessary to hand-deliver certain communiques from Imperial Intelligence. One of our couriers was attacked by Rebel terrorists a short time ago but managed to transmit coordinates before communications were cut off. We need you to bring him, or the encoded orders, back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Thank the Emperor you''ve arrived! I managed to drive the Rebels away but was certain they''d return with reinforcements. We should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Well done, trusted agent. Now that the Rebels know we''re using couriers to deliver orders, we may need your skills again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'You''re a dedicated servant of the Empire, citizen. These orders were of the highest priority and from Lord Vader himself. My thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Get the Courier Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'One of our agents is carrying Corporate Sector Authority security codes. We need these codes to investigate the flow of credits to and from the CSA. We suspect that a large sum of credits has been funneled to the Rebels. We cannot risk another assassination attempt and so need you to escort our agent back here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Your bold approach identified you as a friend and not another assassin. We must get these codes to my superiors at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Job well done, citizen. It''s the Empire''s pleasure to reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'I don''t think I would have made it without your help, citizen. The Empire appreciates your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Secure the CSA''s Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'An agent has vital intelligence regarding the movements of suspected Jedi, which needs to be delivered to the top ranks of Imperial Intelligence. Rebel assassins have made several attempts to eliminate our agent. You must make sure he and his information arrive here intact. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Careful, friend. Rebel snipers have been targeting me. They''ve kept me pinned down for the past few hours and might still be out there. But I suppose that''s a chance we''ll have to take. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Good. Now Imperial Intelligence will be able to hunt down those rogue Jedi. This will please the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Your reputation must precede you, citizen, for those Rebel snipers certainly seemed to make themselves scarce after you found me. I''m proud to have met you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Secure Vital Intelligence for Imperial Intelligence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'An engineered virus was on its way to us for use against anti-Imperial demonstrations. Our courier''s party was attacked by Rebel terrorists. We do not know if anyone survived, but these were the last coordinates sent to us. Collect the virus and any survivors and bring them back to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Praise the Empire! You''ve found me! I''ve got the virus and all the Rebel scum who attacked us are dead. More are sure to come, however, so we should hurry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Excellent, agent. You''ve surpassed our expectations. This reward is but a taste of things to come if you continue serving the Empire faithfully.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Thanks to you, this virus will perform the function it was engineered to do. Many Rebel sympathizers will understand what it means to betray their Emperor!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Save the Deadly Virus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A trusted courier was delivering a warrant and dossier on a citizen suspected of possessing Sith artifacts. We have reasons to believe that citizen is on this planet. The attacks on our courier further seem to confirm this. These coordinates are the courier''s last known location. Go there and see if he still lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'I''m so pleased you''ve come! At first I thought you were another hired assassin and almost blasted you. I still have the dossier, so we should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Most excellent, agent. Now we can carry out the will of the Emperor. Your reward is well earned.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Thanks, friend. It''s good to know the Empire has competent fighters such as yourself working for the Emperor''s glory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Collect the Emperor''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'An Imperial courier was delivering important transfer orders when he fell victim to a vicious gang. We believe the courier was able to escape. We then received these coordinates from an unknown source, using an Imperial code. We need you to go and retrieve the courier, if he truly is alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'I was hoping my superiors got my coded message.  Sorry it was so brief, but I had only seconds to send it. Let''s get out of here before that gang finds us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'The Empire is grateful, agent. Your actions inspire other Imperial servants to strive harder to please their Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'You got me here safe and sound. I''ll be sure to mention your name to my commanding officer. My thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Recover the Courier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Recently a Moff was accused of plotting to assassinate the Emperor. A special courier was delivering the arrest warrant to be served on the Moff and his family, but agents of the Rebellion attempted to waylay the courier. These coordinates are the origin point of his last transmission. Find him and provide an escort back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'It''s a good thing you came when you did. I had run out of ammo, and it was only a matter of time before those Rebels caught up with me. Let''s get out of here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'A fine job, agent. We''ll make sure this Moff pays for his traitorous act against our august Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Many thanks, friend. This Moff has many friends in high places, and I was beginning to suspect my life wasn''t worth a credit''s purchase.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Recover an Arrest Warrant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'Rebel scum hit one of our transport repair stations. We received a final distress signal that originated at the following coordinates. We''d like you to check this area and bring back any survivors. We need information on the Rebel strike team that pulled off this operation. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'About time they sent someone. I''m the only survivor. Let''s get back so I can inform my superiors and we can begin hunting these Rebel dogs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'Your services to the Empire shall not be forgotten, agent. Here''s your reward. Use it wisely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'Thanks, friend. Sorry I was so short with you earlier. I was just mad and eager for revenge. But you''re right, we need to stick together in these times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Find the Survivors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'An ISB interrogation compound was bombed by an X-wing patrol. We believe there were survivors, as we received a distress call that originated not far from the facility. Go to these coordinates and bring back any survivors you find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'An ally! Thank the New Order! My comlink ceased to work shortly after I sent my distress call. I was afraid that Rebel patrol would return to look for survivors. We should hurry as they still might.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'Thanks to your efforts, we will be able to identify the Rebel starfighters involved in this dastardly attack. The Empire is grateful. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'I will not rest until every single one of the Rebels involved in this attack is in our custody and at my mercy. I''m not called the Professor of Pain for nothing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Rescue the Torturer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'One of our agents was in the process of delivering a case of durindfire gems to a loyal financier when a group of Rebels bandits attacked. Our troopers managed to kill the Rebels, but at the cost of their lives. We need you to escort our agent and those gems back to us before the Rebels can attempt another attack. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'The gems are safe, but we must hurry. Getting these gems safely back to my superiors would be the best way to honor those fallen troopers. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Your efforts have benefitted the Empire, agent. Gems such as these help finance the construction of our fleet. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'You are a true champion of the Empire, friend. I hope we can work together again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Rescue the Gems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'One of our operatives went to negotiate a deal with a swoop gang. We use these criminals to spy on the Rebels from time to time. It turns out, however, that these swoopers were actually Rebels in disguise. Our operative was taken captive but managed to escape. We need you to find him and escort him safely back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Those Rebels will be on us in no time. We must get moving now! I hope you''re handy with that blaster.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'The Empire is pleased with your performance, agent, as this reward will demonstrate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Thanks, friend. Serving our Emperor is sometimes perilous but always satisfying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Rescue the Swooper Recruiter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'An Imperial Intelligence agent was escorting a valuable Kubaz spy to a nearby garrison when the spy was killed by a Rebel sniper. The Imperial agent sent a distress call and has been exchanging blaster fire with the sniper for over thirty minutes. You must hurry to these coordinates and rescue the agent. Returning here would be best.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'You might want to identify yourself next time, friend. I almost blasted you. The sniper ceased firing about ten minutes ago. It''s been awfully quiet. I think I got the Rebel dog. Let''s get out of here. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, agent. It''s too bad you couldn''t verify the sniper''s death. We''ll send patrols out to search the area for bodies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'That Kubaz was valuable to us. Those Rebels will pay for murdering him. Death to all Rebels!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Retrieve the Kubaz Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'An Imperial convoy transporting hibridium ore was destroyed by Rebel saboteurs. Fortunately our cloaking device engineer, who was supervising the operation, survived the attack and has sent us a distress call. Go to these coordinates and make sure the engineer is returned safely to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'Over here! Thank the Empire you''ve arrived. We lost an entire shipment of hibridium, no thanks to those Rebel scum. We''ll make them pay. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'This engineer is very valuable to us, agent. The Empire is grateful for his safe return. Claim your reward. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'This has inspired me to try and create cloaking devices for smaller land-based speeders and transports. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Retrieve the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'The Rebels attacked one of our water-processing plants, on the pretext that we were drugging the water supply. One of our chief chemists was making an inspection of the plant at the time. Miraculously he escaped harm by hiding inside a reinforced tank. Right now he''s trying to get out of the area. Go and collect him so we can begin our investigation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'Those damn Rebels! Someone on the inside must have tipped them off. How else could they know we were introducing sedatives into the water supply?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, agent. We will begin our investigation immediately. This is for your time and effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thank you for your help. I suppose we''ll have to up the dosage to keep these people pacified.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Rescue the Chemist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'An agent was dispatched to investigate rumors of Jedi activity. Not only did he witness a Jedi in action against a swoop gang, he also briefly engaged the Jedi in combat. Fortunately for our agent, the sudden appearance of more swoopers distracted the Jedi. You must go to these coordinates and escort our agent back here safely. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'I must get word of this to Imperial Intelligence at once. If I hadn''t seen it with my own eyes, I would not have believed it. The Empire has very good reason to worry about these Jedi.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'We will inform the Inquisitorius of your actions. I''m certain they will wish to call upon your services again in the future. Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'Thanks, friend. Keep your eyes open for more Jedi activity. Report anything you encounter, even rumors, to Imperial Intelligence at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'A Jedi Witness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'One of our couriers was shot down by Rebels but managed to survive the crash-landing. He transmitted his coordinates to us before going down. He carries important communiques from Lord Vader warning of a possible Rebel attack on the Fondor shipyards. Go and retrieve our courier or the communiques and return here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'I''m battered but basically intact. We should get going, though. The Rebels that shot me down might return to make sure they got the job done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Well done, agent. These communiques were of the greatest importance. We shall send Lord Vader word of your deeds. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'Many thanks, friend. Have you ever considered becoming an Imperial courier? Seems like your skills would be suited to that prestigious position.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'Recover Lord Vader''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'An undercover agent acquired the coordinates to a Rebel colony that houses many high-profile Rebel leaders and their families. As he was about to rendezvous with a Star Destroyer, the hated Rogue Squadron crippled our agent''s shuttle. He used an escape pod to evade destruction and landed near here. Go and recover him before the Rogues finish the job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'I still have those coordinates! Let''s get moving. I''m banged up but I can still run. Hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Now we will be able to dispense some long overdue Imperial justice to these Rebels. Good work, agent. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'Much appreciated, friend. Those Rebels will rue the day I escaped their lethal ambush. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure Important Coordinates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'A team of Army engineers went into the wilderness to test some new prototype walker. They were due back hours ago. Nothing on the comm. I suggest you get out to their coordinates and herd them in.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'We had an operational contingency. The walker disintegrated. I''m the only survivor. I can''t say any more until I debrief my commander.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'Oh, fine. One more walker gone. I hope we don''t find the main Rebel base soon, because we''re not even remotely ready for a full assault.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'A certain number of contingencies are to be expected in the development of new hardware. I don''t see why one explosion would damp the Empire''s enthusiasm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'AT-AT Walker Engineer Walking'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'Some local do-gooder is making noise because our artillery practice destroyed some of his livestock. Boo-hoo. We sent a squad out to his farm to teach him some manners. They haven''t reported back, but one agent''s distress beacon went off. Check out the coordinates and bring back any survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'It was a trap! My squad surrounded the farmhouse. I happened to be hanging back from the doorway because I stopped to take potshots at the farmer''s vaporators. When my unit broke down the do-gooder''s door, a booby-trap blew up the house and the whole squad! I got out on foot, because the vehicles were torched.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'These Rebels are getting more desperate by the day. If they''re destroying their own homes to get us, they must be truly scared. Be proud you''re on the winning side!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I don''t know why I shot those vaporators. I guess I should be glad I did. Sometimes petty vandalism can keep you alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Imperial Artillery Specialist Stranded'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'We blew up a Rebel fuel dump. Local civilians started cleaning up the mess without permission. Intelligence says no cleanup until they''ve inspected the wreckage, so we sent out a squad to stop the locals. They haven''t reported in. Go bring ''em back!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'An ambush! When we closed on the civilians, our speeders hit a mine emplacement. Then they opened fire from hard cover. I''m the only one alive! I need an escort back to my sarge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Ambush, huh? That about fits on this miserable world. Okay, get back to whatever it is you do. And keep this quiet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'It''s hard bringing order to the galaxy when there''s so many civilians who don''t like order.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Fuel Dump Cleanup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some bounty hunter took a wild shot at a local businessman and winged one of our agents nearby. Imperial Security is making a full investigation with the Bounty Hunters'' Guild, and you can be sure someone''s Guild license is about to expire, hard. But we need someone to get the wounded agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'I did some first aid, and I''m feeling better. But nobody around here would help me at all. It makes me angry when the locals treat us like we''re the villains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'Word is, they''ve identified the bounty hunter and put out a bounty on him. That''s a nice irony. Thanks for the retrieval.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'These local civilians should be glad the Empire is here, keeping the streets safe from scum like that bounty hunter!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Bounty Hunter''s Near-Miss Needs Pickup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'These Rebels are crafty. They infiltrated a covert agent into one of our loyalty enforcement squads. When the squad was about to demolish the house of some old local woman, the Rebel broke cover and destroyed our squad. One of our people escaped and is stranded in what is clearly enemy territory. The rescue falls to you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'That Rebel was an amazing shot. Took out five of us, bam-bam-bam, in about six shots. Pushed me into a ditch. The fall knocked me out. I''m still woozy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'The Imperial Security Bureau will certainly be interested in this evidence of porous recruitment procedures. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I can''t even remember why we had to destroy that old woman''s house. She didn''t look like much threat. But then, those Rebels hardly ever do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Survivor of Undercover Agent''s Betrayal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Following orders from Imperial Intelligence, we sent a loyalty enforcement squad to destroy a local leader''s home. Due to a mischievous slicer''s alteration of message data, we inadvertently assaulted a covert Imperial Security Bureau installation. They returned fire, and both sides were wiped out save for one survivor. You need to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'We knew something was wrong when a protocol droid shouted, "Hahaha, you lame suckers!" Then we checked the credentials on the bodies. Oops!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Good work. Remember, we have jurisdiction to recover and debrief the survivor. Ignore any ISB claims otherwise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'What can I say? We were following orders. The orders don''t say across the top, "This order hopelessly messed up by villainous data slicers, so you''d be a total idiot to follow it!"'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Rebel Slicer Misdirected Recon Squad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'The Corporate Sector Authority requisitioned more prisoners for conscript labor. We dispatched a carrier of prisoners to the spaceport, but it hasn''t reported. The tracking beacon showed the vehicle moved out to the wilderness. Then it went silent. Check it out. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I''m the last surviving guard. The prisoners improvised a weapon and got the drop on us. They hijacked the speeder, dumped me here, and destroyed the tracking beacon. I need you to take me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Another prisoner revolt. We have to get more funding for security. We''re looking like amateurs!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'Thanks. I hate it when prisoners revolt. "Revolting" is the word for CSA conscripts, all right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'CSA Conscript Vehicle Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'An undercover agent has information on local business people and their family members. We''ve arranged a rendezvous in the remote wilderness to avoid detection. To avoid suspicion when travelling with you, he''s been instructed to change into an Imperial uniform. Escort him here, and avoid blowing cover at all costs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'The Alliance is making headway in recruiting local business leaders. I''ve got data here worth a pretty credit to your superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Thanks. We''ll have the agent interrogated too, just so we don''t miss anything. Sometimes these agents like to play both sides against the middle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 149, 'm25e', 'Hey, why is he looking so threatening? Doesn''t he know I''m on his side?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Rendezvous with Undercover Informant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'Got a report of another prisoner labor gang rioting and killing the guards. One survivor. Go and bring the guard here for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'They stole a blaster and used it to blow up a transport. The explosion took out most of my unit, and they got the rest of us while we were surprised. It was awful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'These riots are getting more frequent. Shows a lack of alertness training among new guard recruits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'I guess they didn''t kill me because I used to give them extra water. The other guards called me soft for that. Huh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Prisoner Riot Leaves Wounded Guard Alive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'The Emperor ordered the assassination of a treasonous Imperial dignitary. We sent an agent to do the deed using a Scarab assassin droid. But the droid went crazy, and the agent is stranded in the middle of nowhere. It''s your job to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'That droid hit some kind of radioactive mineral deposit and bam! It started firing at me! Blew up my speeder before I could bring it down. I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Never send a droid to do a Star Destroyer''s job, I say. Your service to the Empire is noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I usually have much better luck with Scarab models. I can requisition another if I can line up another job. Need anyone assassinated?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'Scarab Assassin Droid Malfunction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We located -- well, we thought we located -- a Bothan SpyNet installation, an op-front. The cover was a rural HoloNet receiver. Headquarters sent a squad to storm the house, but it was a trap. We need you to survey the damage and bring back survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'A droid saw us and said, "Oh dear." It turned and stumbled away. For kicks, somebody shot the droid. It fell over onto some kind of switch. Next thing -- boom! I was the only one outside the blast radius. I need you to escort me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'I tell you, Bothans are the most cunning creatures in the galaxy. Makes me shiver to think we''re supposed to eradicate that SpyNet, and all the time the Bothans are listening to our every word.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'I sure hope that in the future, HQ doesn''t jump at every Bothan SpyNet eradication operation. That''s what I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bothan SpyNet Base Assault Gone Wrong'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'That traitorous defector Crix Madine is leading more Rebel raids against the very soldiers who once fought beside him. Makes my blood burn. We''ve just got word that one of his covert strike teams blew up a listening post in the wilderness. Go out and bring back the survivors for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The Rebels lured us out in a classic decoy-and-close maneuver. Right out of Imperial small-formation tactics. I can''t believe we fell for it. I''m the only one left. Can you escort me back to my dispatch point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'That sounds like Crix Madine, all right. There''s a special interrogation droid waiting for that man when we finally catch him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I don''t think we ever saw Crix Madine himself, but I''m pretty sure someone good was handling Rebel tactics today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Madine''s Covert Team Strikes Again'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'The Empire has been looking for the Procurement and Supply base used by the Rebel leader known as Targeter. Our scout reported a sighting of Targeter''s forces at rest, but then something jammed the signal. Check the coordinates of the last transmission and escort the scout back here. Don''t waste time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'I was looking through my electrobinocs when something big moved in front of me. Before I could look up, wham! When I woke up, I was alone. I need you to escort me back to operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'That Targeter is supposed to have unusually good recon. Maybe some special kind of droid? But we''ll sneak up on that Rebel someday, count on it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'I''m looking forward to debriefing. With the data from my report, I expect we can close in on Targeter before long.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Imperial Scout Found Targeter Base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Imperial Intelligence put us onto a Rebel research facility. We carried out the assault beautifully, if I do say so. But we just got a call that some knucklehead trooper got left behind. I don''t really care about one stupid agent, but go and bring back the idiot before some Rebel gets his hands on our gear.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'We were moving into the base when this weird-looking X-Wing swooped out past us. The backwash knocked me out, and when I woke up, everyone was gone and the base was destroyed. I lost all my directional gear, so I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'That''s fine. I''ll give this nincompoop a good talking-to, and then he''ll be one more warm body for detention-cell duty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I couldn''t help what happened. I''m not an idiot, just unlucky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Straggler from Rebel Research Base Assault'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'A probe droid spotted a refueling base used by the Rebel starfighter unit called Rogue Squadron. We hit it hard and took it out. But in all the smoke, some dimwit agent of ours went missing. Now we''ve got his distress call to handle, and I don''t have the time. Get this dolt back here safely, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'The smoke was everywhere, and my IR heatsights fritzed out. I kept calling for help over the comm, but nobody showed up. They just left me! After you escort me back, I''m gonna let fly at someone, you watch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'That''s all I need, more namby-pamby agents moaning about being left behind. It''s war! Live with it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My squad never liked me. They treated me like some, some -- droid! I''m filing a report that''ll raise blisters on their collective backside.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Leftovers from Assault on Refuel Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We found a Rebel facility housing fugitive Wookiees from a failed slave revolt on their homeworld, Kashyyyk. We wiped out the facility without much problem, but in the assault we lost track of a reconnaissance agent. Round up the straggler so Imperial Intelligence can complete its debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It was horrible. Those Wookiees are savage killers, just like you''ve always heard. I found some evidence in the wreckage that may interest the Security Bureau.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'That evidence should help us track and close down the "Cloaking Transit" network that smuggles Wookiee rabble-rousers off Kashyyyk. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It''s only a matter of time before Kashyyyk is completely subdued, no matter how savage its natives can be.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Assault on Wookiee Fugitives Left One Behind'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'Our speeder convoy was ferrying bacta tanks to a supply post when Rebels attacked. One survivor has called in, asking for an escort back here. If you can take care of the retrieval, that''s less hassle for me while I work out where to get new bacta.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I got wounded in the attack, but then bacta splashed all over me when a tank ruptured. Now I feel fine. I need you to escort me back so I can report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'We''ve lined up a backup bacta shipment from offworld. Those Rebels ought to know by now they''ll never break the Empire''s supply chains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'The Rebels seemed just as dismayed as we were when that bacta tank ruptured. But they got away with the other tanks. I expect we''ll see it on the black market soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 204, 'm34t', 'One Survivor from Bacta Convoy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'An ace pilot from a top TIE squadron has arrived on the planet. I have secret orders for his team. I need you to rendezvous and escort him to me. Be wary. Criminals and Rebel spies are everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'You''re my contact? Nice. I thought I rated higher than some half-trugut lackey. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 208, 'm35c', 'We meet again, captain. Charming as always, I see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 209, 'm35e', 'Thanks for the escort, junior. Me and Captain Blasterbritches have some work to do now, so run along.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Rendezvous with an Ace TIE Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'One of the few survivors of the Yavin disaster is on the planet to give me a secret deposition. This could be an important step in my career. Make sure no one causes any trouble on the way. Arm yourself, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Are you the person I''m supposed to give a deposition? Are you sure? Because I''ll tell you everything. You sure you don''t want to hear it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'This secret deposition will earn me a promotion for sure. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Secret? Was this supposed to be secret information? Because I told the whole story on the public transport from Togoria. There was a Twi''lek on board who sounded very interested. Is that bad?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Escort a Yavin Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'I need you to bring a captured traitor to me. The bounty hunter put a slave transmitter in his neck and dropped him off at these coordinates. Don''t worry. One false move and the transmitter will explode, so he shouldn''t cause you any problems.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I promise not to tell anyone if you remove my slave transmitter. No? It was worth a try. Let''s go, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'I told you there wouldn''t be any trouble. The Empire will reward you generously.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'So if I just run for it right now, my head will explode? Just checking. It doesn''t hurt to ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Escort a Captured Traitor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'We brought in an expert scout from Lambda Sector to assist us with a few operations, but he''s already gotten himself lost. Can you find this laserbrain and point him back to me? I''ve got a few choice words I need to convey.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Hey, you found me! Well, um, thank goodness. I kinda thought my superiors had forgotten about me. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'So this is the "expert scout," eh? I can spot a fake just by looking at him. We''ll see what his commander in Lambda Sector has to say about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'I wasn''t lost! I was, um, scouting new paths across unfamiliar terrain. I''d better get back out there and check my markers. There''s wild animals in that area, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Find a Lost Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'I know this isn''t a pleasant assignment, but we just commissioned a nerf herder into the military. The Corvette Intruder has need of a junior officer. Can you bring the herder to me? Some hygienic adjustment is in order before deployment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'Why don''t people like us nerf herders? The smell isn''t all that bad, is it? Here, smell my hand. No, really, just smell it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Let''s get you a new uniform, soldier. You''ll curdle the fuel cells with that reek.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Come on! The smell isn''t that bad. I used to work with thranta dung. You talk about stench, that stuff would singe a Wookiee''s nostrils!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Yes, An Imperial Nerf Herder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'I am scheduled to debrief a witness to possible Jedi activity. Lord Vader will want this information as soon as possible. The Jedi may know about the witness, so you must ensure that he arrives here safely. Do not delay!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'I''ll tell the whole story in the debriefing, but I know it was a Jedi I saw. She had a lightsaber and everything. She was deflecting blaster bolts with the whole buzz! and the whoosh! thing. It was amazing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Lord Vader will be happy to hear these details. Let''s get to the debriefing room, soldier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 239, 'm40e', '... and the Jedi hid behind a vaporator, waited for the bounty hunter to pass, and then leapt out and cut him down from behind. Unbelievable!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort a Witness to Jedi Activity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'Our relay station has needed a transpacitor shunt for two weeks. Finally we get a technician ferried from Duros orbit and what happens? They dump the poor nerf in the middle of nowhere. I want you to fetch him so our relay station can get back on line.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'I can''t believe that shuttle pilot dumped me way out here. What kind of operation do they run on this dirt ball? I''m glad at least one of you is lucid enough to solve this problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'I''m sorry for the trouble. Those gundarks in Sector Command have asteroids for brains.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Thanks for the escort. Next time I come here, I''ll make sure you''re on the shuttle that picks me up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Fetch a Shunt Technician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'A blasted Rebel sniper put a laser hole in my shuttle''s fuel bay. When I landed, I sent a tech with a crystal pump to clean up the acid spill. But the acid dissolved the pump''s motivator and now the tech is stuck without a transport. I want you to go out there and help him get back to me. I''ll see what I can do about the Rebel sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'I''m glad you found me. I think there are Rebels out here. Let''s get back so I can make a report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Rebels, you say! Tell me more. This could be the lead I require to track down that sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'I appreciate your assistance. Now I can report about those Rebels I saw while I was out there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist a Shuttle Tech'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'Look, I''ll be blunt. We''ve had a microbial containment breach in this area. There''s an expert on the planet who can set the matter straight, but there are some unsavory characters between here and there. You must fetch this expert and provide him an armed escort back to this location. You''re infected now, too, so don''t waste any time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I heard the report of a microbial containment breach. Take me there quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Well, it turns out we didn''t spill a microbial solution. It was a flask of zaffa oil for my synthsteak tonight. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 257, 'm43e', 'This agent helped me get here as fast as I could! Where is the microbial containment breach?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Imperial Microbe Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'One of our patrol speeders was hit by a Rebel ambush. There''s one survivor who needs rescuing right away. Get out there immediately and I''ll see what I can do about providing you some aerial cover.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'Boy, am I glad to see you. I''m well enough to run, but we need to clear out before the Rebels come back. Let''s go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'I agree. That was expertly done. You''ll receive a bonus for this, I assure you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I can''t thank you enough for the rescue. I wouldn''t have made it without you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Extract an Injured Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'One of our stealth operatives tracked a rogue transmission straight into a Rebel trap. The speeder patrols will take awhile to scramble. In the meantime, get out there as fast as you can and lend a hand!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'Watch out! Those Rebels are out here somewhere, and they know my blaster is drained. Let''s get moving before more of them show up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'Our speeder patrols bagged a few Rebel stragglers, but most of them got away. Traitorous cowards.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'You probably saved my life. I can''t thank you enough for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Extract a Wounded Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'We sent the deadliest assassin under Sector Command to eliminate a threat to planetary security. Unfortunately, getting back here is not as easy as murdering someone. I want you to travel to the kill site and retrieve him at once. Hail the New Order!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'Oh, thank heaven! Are you here to guide me back? I''m most dreadfully embarrassed about losing my way. This usually doesn''t happen to me, I assure you. Come along, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'We must be discreet. I would not presume to tarnish the reputation of Sector Command''s most valuable assassin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'How terribly awkward of me to lose my way like that! I certainly hope no one else will hear about my embarrassing mistake. That would vex me awfully. Is that understood, my excellent friends?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Retrieve a Master Assassin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'I''ve got an embarrassing problem. One of my subordinates has fallen in with some kind of cult from the Tatooine outskirts. I want you to fetch this true believer back to me, so I can make it plain that I don''t approve of "spiritual vision quests" on the Imperial clock. Understood? Good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Greetings, fellow spiritual traveler! Have you come to lead me home? Good. The Shrub is generous and giving to all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'We''ll see what "rains down" when Sector Command hears about this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'Thank you for guiding me, fellow pilgrim! The Shrub will rain down its leaves to the willing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Retrieve a Spiritual Traveller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'Ever heard of an archeological engineer? Me, either, but one has been assigned to my unit. Apparently an old Vulture Droid star fighter is rotting away somewhere on the planet. This engineer of mine is investigating the site. I guess he''s not good with maps, because now he needs a guide to report back to me. Please go out there and handle this. I''ve got more important things to worry about than droid historians.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Oh good, you''ve come to take me back. I wandered away from the wrecked Vulture Droid and seem to have lost my way. I''ve got a lot to report to my superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''ve just been ordered to put you on a transport, engineer. Someone named Lord Vader has heard of your work and wants to discuss the future of your research.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'Thank you. I''ve got much to report. If my theories are correct, the Trade Federation''s droid armies played a much larger role in the creation of the Empire than has previously been suspected.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Assist a Droid Historian'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'I''ve got an Imperial biologist in the field investigating a possible kouhun infestation. But someone short-circuited the maintenance droids at my shuttle depot an hour ago. I can''t call for an extraction. I need you to escort the biologist back here. Make sure you take a weapon. You don''t want to meet one of those assassin bugs unarmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Ow. I got a little insect bite here. I think a kouhun might have stung me. I need to get medical attention as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'How convenient that our shuttle depot was sabotaged when this "biologist" had a perfect alibi. Come with me, professor, and we''ll get to the bottom of this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'Thanks for bringing me back. But you know what? I''m not dead, so it couldn''t have been a kouhun that stung me. Maybe a mace fly or a shauput.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Assassin Bugs On the Loose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'We put a tracer beacon on the ship of a suspected smuggler. I sent an operative out to track it down. He found the ship, but it had jettisoned its cargo. I need you to find our man in the field and help him search in a line from his position to this position. You should find some contraband along the way so we can lock this smuggler up once and for all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'There you are. I''m afraid I had to let the suspect and his ship go. No evidence to hold him. But let''s search for that jettisoned cargo between here and my superior. Maybe we''ll get the guy yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'We''ll keep an eye on this Twingo creep. He''s bound to make a mistake soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'I could have sworn he jettisoned his contraband somewhere out there. Guess I was wrong. Thanks for the help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_easy.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Help Apprehend a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Rebel slicers have made it necessary to hand-deliver certain communiques from Imperial Intelligence. One of our couriers was attacked by Rebel terrorists a short time ago but managed to transmit coordinates before communications were cut off. We need you to bring him, or the encoded orders, back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Thank the Emperor you''ve arrived! I managed to drive the Rebels away but was certain they''d return with reinforcements. We should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Well done, trusted agent. Now that the Rebels know we''re using couriers to deliver orders, we may need your skills again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'You''re a dedicated servant of the Empire, citizen. These orders were of the highest priority and from Lord Vader himself. My thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Get the Courier Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'One of our agents is carrying Corporate Sector Authority security codes. We need these codes to investigate the flow of credits to and from the CSA. We suspect that a large sum of credits has been funneled to the Rebels. We cannot risk another assassination attempt and so need you to escort our agent back here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Your bold approach identified you as a friend and not another assassin. We must get these codes to my superiors at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Job well done, citizen. It''s the Empire''s pleasure to reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'I don''t think I would have made it without your help, citizen. The Empire appreciates your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Secure the CSA''s Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'An agent has vital intelligence regarding the movements of suspected Jedi, which needs to be delivered to the top ranks of Imperial Intelligence. Rebel assassins have made several attempts to eliminate our agent. You must make sure he and his information arrive here intact. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Careful, friend. Rebel snipers have been targeting me. They''ve kept me pinned down for the past few hours and might still be out there. But I suppose that''s a chance we''ll have to take. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Good. Now Imperial Intelligence will be able to hunt down those rogue Jedi. This will please the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Your reputation must precede you, citizen, for those Rebel snipers certainly seemed to make themselves scarce after you found me. I''m proud to have met you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Secure Vital Intelligence for Imperial Intelligence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'An engineered virus was on its way to us for use against anti-Imperial demonstrations. Our courier''s party was attacked by Rebel terrorists. We do not know if anyone survived, but these were the last coordinates sent to us. Collect the virus and any survivors and bring them back to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Praise the Empire! You''ve found me! I''ve got the virus and all the Rebel scum who attacked us are dead. More are sure to come, however, so we should hurry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Excellent, agent. You''ve surpassed our expectations. This reward is but a taste of things to come if you continue serving the Empire faithfully.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Thanks to you, this virus will perform the function it was engineered to do. Many Rebel sympathizers will understand what it means to betray their Emperor!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Save the Deadly Virus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A trusted courier was delivering a warrant and dossier on a citizen suspected of possessing Sith artifacts. We have reasons to believe that citizen is on this planet. The attacks on our courier further seem to confirm this. These coordinates are the courier''s last known location. Go there and see if he still lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'I''m so pleased you''ve come! At first I thought you were another hired assassin and almost blasted you. I still have the dossier, so we should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Most excellent, agent. Now we can carry out the will of the Emperor. Your reward is well earned.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Thanks, friend. It''s good to know the Empire has competent fighters such as yourself working for the Emperor''s glory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Collect the Emperor''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'An Imperial courier was delivering important transfer orders when he fell victim to a vicious gang. We believe the courier was able to escape. We then received these coordinates from an unknown source, using an Imperial code. We need you to go and retrieve the courier, if he truly is alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'I was hoping my superiors got my coded message.  Sorry it was so brief, but I had only seconds to send it. Let''s get out of here before that gang finds us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'The Empire is grateful, agent. Your actions inspire other Imperial servants to strive harder to please their Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'You got me here safe and sound. I''ll be sure to mention your name to my commanding officer. My thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Recover the Courier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Recently a Moff was accused of plotting to assassinate the Emperor. A special courier was delivering the arrest warrant to be served on the Moff and his family, but agents of the Rebellion attempted to waylay the courier. These coordinates are the origin point of his last transmission. Find him and provide an escort back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'It''s a good thing you came when you did. I had run out of ammo, and it was only a matter of time before those Rebels caught up with me. Let''s get out of here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'A fine job, agent. We''ll make sure this Moff pays for his traitorous act against our august Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Many thanks, friend. This Moff has many friends in high places, and I was beginning to suspect my life wasn''t worth a credit''s purchase.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Recover an Arrest Warrant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'Rebel scum hit one of our transport repair stations. We received a final distress signal that originated at the following coordinates. We''d like you to check this area and bring back any survivors. We need information on the Rebel strike team that pulled off this operation. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'About time they sent someone. I''m the only survivor. Let''s get back so I can inform my superiors and we can begin hunting these Rebel dogs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'Your services to the Empire shall not be forgotten, agent. Here''s your reward. Use it wisely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'Thanks, friend. Sorry I was so short with you earlier. I was just mad and eager for revenge. But you''re right, we need to stick together in these times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Find the Survivors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'An ISB interrogation compound was bombed by an X-wing patrol. We believe there were survivors, as we received a distress call that originated not far from the facility. Go to these coordinates and bring back any survivors you find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'An ally! Thank the New Order! My comlink ceased to work shortly after I sent my distress call. I was afraid that Rebel patrol would return to look for survivors. We should hurry as they still might.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 51, 'm9u', '');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'Thanks to your efforts, we will be able to identify the Rebel starfighters involved in this dastardly attack. The Empire is grateful. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'I will not rest until every single one of the Rebels involved in this attack is in our custody and at my mercy. I''m not called the Professor of Pain for nothing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Rescue the Torturer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'One of our agents was in the process of delivering a case of durindfire gems to a loyal financier when a group of Rebels bandits attacked. Our troopers managed to kill the Rebels, but at the cost of their lives. We need you to escort our agent and those gems back to us before the Rebels can attempt another attack. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'The gems are safe, but we must hurry. Getting these gems safely back to my superiors would be the best way to honor those fallen troopers. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Your efforts have benefitted the Empire, agent. Gems such as these help finance the construction of our fleet. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'You are a true champion of the Empire, friend. I hope we can work together again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Rescue the Gems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'One of our operatives went to negotiate a deal with a swoop gang. We use these criminals to spy on the Rebels from time to time. It turns out, however, that these swoopers were actually Rebels in disguise. Our operative was taken captive but managed to escape. We need you to find him and escort him safely back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Those Rebels will be on us in no time. We must get moving now! I hope you''re handy with that blaster.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'The Empire is pleased with your performance, agent, as this reward will demonstrate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Thanks, friend. Serving our Emperor is sometimes perilous but always satisfying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Rescue the Swooper Recruiter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'An Imperial Intelligence agent was escorting a valuable Kubaz spy to a nearby garrison when the spy was killed by a Rebel sniper. The Imperial agent sent a distress call and has been exchanging blaster fire with the sniper for over thirty minutes. You must hurry to these coordinates and rescue the agent. Returning here would be best.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'You might want to identify yourself next time, friend. I almost blasted you. The sniper ceased firing about ten minutes ago. It''s been awfully quiet. I think I got the Rebel dog. Let''s get out of here. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, agent. It''s too bad you couldn''t verify the sniper''s death. We''ll send patrols out to search the area for bodies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'That Kubaz was valuable to us. Those Rebels will pay for murdering him. Death to all Rebels!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Retrieve the Kubaz Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'An Imperial convoy transporting hibridium ore was destroyed by Rebel saboteurs. Fortunately our cloaking device engineer, who was supervising the operation, survived the attack and has sent us a distress call. Go to these coordinates and make sure the engineer is returned safely to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'Over here! Thank the Empire you''ve arrived. We lost an entire shipment of hibridium, no thanks to those Rebel scum. We''ll make them pay. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'This engineer is very valuable to us, agent. The Empire is grateful for his safe return. Claim your reward. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'This has inspired me to try and create cloaking devices for smaller land-based speeders and transports. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Retrieve the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'The Rebels attacked one of our water-processing plants, on the pretext that we were drugging the water supply. One of our chief chemists was making an inspection of the plant at the time. Miraculously he escaped harm by hiding inside a reinforced tank. Right now he''s trying to get out of the area. Go and collect him so we can begin our investigation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'Those damn Rebels! Someone on the inside must have tipped them off. How else could they know we were introducing sedatives into the water supply?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, agent. We will begin our investigation immediately. This is for your time and effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thank you for your help. I suppose we''ll have to up the dosage to keep these people pacified.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Rescue the Chemist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'An agent was dispatched to investigate rumors of Jedi activity. Not only did he witness a Jedi in action against a swoop gang, he also briefly engaged the Jedi in combat. Fortunately for our agent, the sudden appearance of more swoopers distracted the Jedi. You must go to these coordinates and escort our agent back here safely. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'I must get word of this to Imperial Intelligence at once. If I hadn''t seen it with my own eyes, I would not have believed it. The Empire has very good reason to worry about these Jedi.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'We will inform the Inquisitorius of your actions. I''m certain they will wish to call upon your services again in the future. Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'Thanks, friend. Keep your eyes open for more Jedi activity. Report anything you encounter, even rumors, to Imperial Intelligence at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'A Jedi Witness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'One of our couriers was shot down by Rebels but managed to survive the crash-landing. He transmitted his coordinates to us before going down. He carries important communiques from Lord Vader warning of a possible Rebel attack on the Fondor shipyards. Go and retrieve our courier or the communiques and return here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'I''m battered but basically intact. We should get going, though. The Rebels that shot me down might return to make sure they got the job done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Well done, agent. These communiques were of the greatest importance. We shall send Lord Vader word of your deeds. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'Many thanks, friend. Have you ever considered becoming an Imperial courier? Seems like your skills would be suited to that prestigious position.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'Recover Lord Vader''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'An undercover agent acquired the coordinates to a Rebel colony that houses many high-profile Rebel leaders and their families. As he was about to rendezvous with a Star Destroyer, the hated Rogue Squadron crippled our agent''s shuttle. He used an escape pod to evade destruction and landed near here. Go and recover him before the Rogues finish the job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'I still have those coordinates! Let''s get moving. I''m banged up but I can still run. Hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Now we will be able to dispense some long overdue Imperial justice to these Rebels. Good work, agent. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'Much appreciated, friend. Those Rebels will rue the day I escaped their lethal ambush. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure Important Coordinates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'A team of Army engineers went into the wilderness to test some new prototype walker. They were due back hours ago. Nothing on the comm. I suggest you get out to their coordinates and herd them in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'We had an operational contingency. The walker disintegrated. I''m the only survivor. I can''t say any more until I debrief my commander.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'Oh, fine. One more walker gone. I hope we don''t find the main Rebel base soon, because we''re not even remotely ready for a full assault.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'A certain number of contingencies are to be expected in the development of new hardware. I don''t see why one explosion would damp the Empire''s enthusiasm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'AT-AT Walker Engineer Walking'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'Some local do-gooder is making noise because our artillery practice destroyed some of his livestock. Boo-hoo. We sent a squad out to his farm to teach him some manners. They haven''t reported back, but one agent''s distress beacon went off. Check out the coordinates and bring back any survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'It was a trap! My squad surrounded the farmhouse. I happened to be hanging back from the doorway because I stopped to take potshots at the farmer''s vaporators. When my unit broke down the do-gooder''s door, a booby-trap blew up the house and the whole squad! I got out on foot, because the vehicles were torched.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'These Rebels are getting more desperate by the day. If they''re destroying their own homes to get us, they must be truly scared. Be proud you''re on the winning side!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I don''t know why I shot those vaporators. I guess I should be glad I did. Sometimes petty vandalism can keep you alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Imperial Artillery Specialist Stranded'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'We blew up a Rebel fuel dump. Local civilians started cleaning up the mess without permission. Intelligence says no cleanup until they''ve inspected the wreckage, so we sent out a squad to stop the locals. They haven''t reported in. Go bring ''em back!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'An ambush! When we closed on the civilians, our speeders hit a mine emplacement. Then they opened fire from hard cover. I''m the only one alive! I need an escort back to my sarge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Ambush, huh? That about fits on this miserable world. Okay, get back to whatever it is you do. And keep this quiet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'It''s hard bringing order to the galaxy when there''s so many civilians who don''t like order.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Fuel Dump Cleanup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some bounty hunter took a wild shot at a local businessman and winged one of our agents nearby. Imperial Security is making a full investigation with the Bounty Hunters'' Guild, and you can be sure someone''s Guild license is about to expire, hard. But we need someone to get the wounded agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'I did some first aid, and I''m feeling better. But nobody around here would help me at all. It makes me angry when the locals treat us like we''re the villains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'Word is, they''ve identified the bounty hunter and put out a bounty on him. That''s a nice irony. Thanks for the retrieval.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'These local civilians should be glad the Empire is here, keeping the streets safe from scum like that bounty hunter!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Bounty Hunter''s Near-Miss Needs Pickup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'These Rebels are crafty. They infiltrated a covert agent into one of our loyalty enforcement squads. When the squad was about to demolish the house of some old local woman, the Rebel broke cover and destroyed our squad. One of our people escaped and is stranded in what is clearly enemy territory. The rescue falls to you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'That Rebel was an amazing shot. Took out five of us, bam-bam-bam, in about six shots. Pushed me into a ditch. The fall knocked me out. I''m still woozy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'The Imperial Security Bureau will certainly be interested in this evidence of porous recruitment procedures. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I can''t even remember why we had to destroy that old woman''s house. She didn''t look like much threat. But then, those Rebels hardly ever do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Survivor of Undercover Agent''s Betrayal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Following orders from Imperial Intelligence, we sent a loyalty enforcement squad to destroy a local leader''s home. Due to a mischievous slicer''s alteration of message data, we inadvertently assaulted a covert Imperial Security Bureau installation. They returned fire, and both sides were wiped out save for one survivor. You need to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'We knew something was wrong when a protocol droid shouted, "Hahaha, you lame suckers!" Then we checked the credentials on the bodies. Oops!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Good work. Remember, we have jurisdiction to recover and debrief the survivor. Ignore any ISB claims otherwise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'What can I say? We were following orders. The orders don''t say across the top, "This order hopelessly messed up by villainous data slicers, so you''d be a total idiot to follow it!"'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Rebel Slicer Misdirected Recon Squad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'The Corporate Sector Authority requisitioned more prisoners for conscript labor. We dispatched a carrier of prisoners to the spaceport, but it hasn''t reported. The tracking beacon showed the vehicle moved out to the wilderness. Then it went silent. Check it out. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I''m the last surviving guard. The prisoners improvised a weapon and got the drop on us. They hijacked the speeder, dumped me here, and destroyed the tracking beacon. I need you to take me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Another prisoner revolt. We have to get more funding for security. We''re looking like amateurs!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'Thanks. I hate it when prisoners revolt. "Revolting" is the word for CSA conscripts, all right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'CSA Conscript Vehicle Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'An undercover agent has information on local business people and their family members. We''ve arranged a rendezvous in the remote wilderness to avoid detection. To avoid suspicion when travelling with you, he''s been instructed to change into an Imperial uniform. Escort him here, and avoid blowing cover at all costs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'The Alliance is making headway in recruiting local business leaders. I''ve got data here worth a pretty credit to your superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Thanks. We''ll have the agent interrogated too, just so we don''t miss anything. Sometimes these agents like to play both sides against the middle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 149, 'm25e', 'Hey, why is he looking so threatening? Doesn''t he know I''m on his side?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Rendezvous with Undercover Informant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'Got a report of another prisoner labor gang rioting and killing the guards. One survivor. Go and bring the guard here for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'They stole a blaster and used it to blow up a transport. The explosion took out most of my unit, and they got the rest of us while we were surprised. It was awful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'These riots are getting more frequent. Shows a lack of alertness training among new guard recruits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'I guess they didn''t kill me because I used to give them extra water. The other guards called me soft for that. Huh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Prisoner Riot Leaves Wounded Guard Alive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'The Emperor ordered the assassination of a treasonous Imperial dignitary. We sent an agent to do the deed using a Scarab assassin droid. But the droid went crazy, and the agent is stranded in the middle of nowhere. It''s your job to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'That droid hit some kind of radioactive mineral deposit and bam! It started firing at me! Blew up my speeder before I could bring it down. I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Never send a droid to do a Star Destroyer''s job, I say. Your service to the Empire is noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I usually have much better luck with Scarab models. I can requisition another if I can line up another job. Need anyone assassinated?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'Scarab Assassin Droid Malfunction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We located -- well, we thought we located -- a Bothan SpyNet installation, an op-front. The cover was a rural HoloNet receiver. Headquarters sent a squad to storm the house, but it was a trap. We need you to survey the damage and bring back survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'A droid saw us and said, "Oh dear." It turned and stumbled away. For kicks, somebody shot the droid. It fell over onto some kind of switch. Next thing -- boom! I was the only one outside the blast radius. I need you to escort me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'I tell you, Bothans are the most cunning creatures in the galaxy. Makes me shiver to think we''re supposed to eradicate that SpyNet, and all the time the Bothans are listening to our every word.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'I sure hope that in the future, HQ doesn''t jump at every Bothan SpyNet eradication operation. That''s what I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bothan SpyNet Base Assault Gone Wrong'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'That traitorous defector Crix Madine is leading more Rebel raids against the very soldiers who once fought beside him. Makes my blood burn. We''ve just got word that one of his covert strike teams blew up a listening post in the wilderness. Go out and bring back the survivors for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The Rebels lured us out in a classic decoy-and-close maneuver. Right out of Imperial small-formation tactics. I can''t believe we fell for it. I''m the only one left. Can you escort me back to my dispatch point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'That sounds like Crix Madine, all right. There''s a special interrogation droid waiting for that man when we finally catch him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I don''t think we ever saw Crix Madine himself, but I''m pretty sure someone good was handling Rebel tactics today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Madine''s Covert Team Strikes Again'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'The Empire has been looking for the Procurement and Supply base used by the Rebel leader known as Targeter. Our scout reported a sighting of Targeter''s forces at rest, but then something jammed the signal. Check the coordinates of the last transmission and escort the scout back here. Don''t waste time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'I was looking through my electrobinocs when something big moved in front of me. Before I could look up, wham! When I woke up, I was alone. I need you to escort me back to operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'That Targeter is supposed to have unusually good recon. Maybe some special kind of droid? But we''ll sneak up on that Rebel someday, count on it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'I''m looking forward to debriefing. With the data from my report, I expect we can close in on Targeter before long.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Imperial Scout Found Targeter Base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Imperial Intelligence put us onto a Rebel research facility. We carried out the assault beautifully, if I do say so. But we just got a call that some knucklehead trooper got left behind. I don''t really care about one stupid agent, but go and bring back the idiot before some Rebel gets his hands on our gear.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'We were moving into the base when this weird-looking X-Wing swooped out past us. The backwash knocked me out, and when I woke up, everyone was gone and the base was destroyed. I lost all my directional gear, so I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'That''s fine. I''ll give this nincompoop a good talking-to, and then he''ll be one more warm body for detention-cell duty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I couldn''t help what happened. I''m not an idiot, just unlucky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Straggler from Rebel Research Base Assault'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'A probe droid spotted a refueling base used by the Rebel starfighter unit called Rogue Squadron. We hit it hard and took it out. But in all the smoke, some dimwit agent of ours went missing. Now we''ve got his distress call to handle, and I don''t have the time. Get this dolt back here safely, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'The smoke was everywhere, and my IR heatsights fritzed out. I kept calling for help over the comm, but nobody showed up. They just left me! After you escort me back, I''m gonna let fly at someone, you watch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'That''s all I need, more namby-pamby agents moaning about being left behind. It''s war! Live with it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My squad never liked me. They treated me like some, some -- droid! I''m filing a report that''ll raise blisters on their collective backside.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Leftovers from Assault on Refuel Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We found a Rebel facility housing fugitive Wookiees from a failed slave revolt on their homeworld, Kashyyyk. We wiped out the facility without much problem, but in the assault we lost track of a reconnaissance agent. Round up the straggler so Imperial Intelligence can complete its debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It was horrible. Those Wookiees are savage killers, just like you''ve always heard. I found some evidence in the wreckage that may interest the Security Bureau.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'That evidence should help us track and close down the "Cloaking Transit" network that smuggles Wookiee rabble-rousers off Kashyyyk. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It''s only a matter of time before Kashyyyk is completely subdued, no matter how savage its natives can be.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Assault on Wookiee Fugitives Left One Behind'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'Our speeder convoy was ferrying bacta tanks to a supply post when Rebels attacked. One survivor has called in, asking for an escort back here. If you can take care of the retrieval, that''s less hassle for me while I work out where to get new bacta.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I got wounded in the attack, but then bacta splashed all over me when a tank ruptured. Now I feel fine. I need you to escort me back so I can report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'We''ve lined up a backup bacta shipment from offworld. Those Rebels ought to know by now they''ll never break the Empire''s supply chains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'The Rebels seemed just as dismayed as we were when that bacta tank ruptured. But they got away with the other tanks. I expect we''ll see it on the black market soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 204, 'm34t', 'One Survivor from Bacta Convoy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'An ace pilot from a top TIE squadron has arrived on the planet. I have secret orders for his team. I need you to rendezvous and escort him to me. Be wary. Criminals and Rebel spies are everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'You''re my contact? Nice. I thought I rated higher than some half-trugut lackey. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 208, 'm35c', 'We meet again, captain. Charming as always, I see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 209, 'm35e', 'Thanks for the escort, junior. Me and Captain Blasterbritches have some work to do now, so run along.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Rendezvous with an Ace TIE Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'One of the few survivors of the Yavin disaster is on the planet to give me a secret deposition. This could be an important step in my career. Make sure no one causes any trouble on the way. Arm yourself, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Are you the person I''m supposed to give a deposition? Are you sure? Because I''ll tell you everything. You sure you don''t want to hear it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'This secret deposition will earn me a promotion for sure. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Secret? Was this supposed to be secret information? Because I told the whole story on the public transport from Togoria. There was a Twi''lek on board who sounded very interested. Is that bad?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Escort a Yavin Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'I need you to bring a captured traitor to me. The bounty hunter put a slave transmitter in his neck and dropped him off at these coordinates. Don''t worry. One false move and the transmitter will explode, so he shouldn''t cause you any problems.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I promise not to tell anyone if you remove my slave transmitter. No? It was worth a try. Let''s go, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'I told you there wouldn''t be any trouble. The Empire will reward you generously.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'So if I just run for it right now, my head will explode? Just checking. It doesn''t hurt to ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Escort a Captured Traitor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'We brought in an expert scout from Lambda Sector to assist us with a few operations, but he''s already gotten himself lost. Can you find this laserbrain and point him back to me? I''ve got a few choice words I need to convey.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Hey, you found me! Well, um, thank goodness. I kinda thought my superiors had forgotten about me. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'So this is the "expert scout," eh? I can spot a fake just by looking at him. We''ll see what his commander in Lambda Sector has to say about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'I wasn''t lost! I was, um, scouting new paths across unfamiliar terrain. I''d better get back out there and check my markers. There''s wild animals in that area, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Find a Lost Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'I know this isn''t a pleasant assignment, but we just commissioned a nerf herder into the military. The Corvette Intruder has need of a junior officer. Can you bring the herder to me? Some hygienic adjustment is in order before deployment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'Why don''t people like us nerf herders? The smell isn''t all that bad, is it? Here, smell my hand. No, really, just smell it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Let''s get you a new uniform, soldier. You''ll curdle the fuel cells with that reek.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Come on! The smell isn''t that bad. I used to work with thranta dung. You talk about stench, that stuff would singe a Wookiee''s nostrils!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Yes, An Imperial Nerf Herder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'I am scheduled to debrief a witness to possible Jedi activity. Lord Vader will want this information as soon as possible. The Jedi may know about the witness, so you must ensure that he arrives here safely. Do not delay!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'I''ll tell the whole story in the debriefing, but I know it was a Jedi I saw. She had a lightsaber and everything. She was deflecting blaster bolts with the whole buzz! and the whoosh! thing. It was amazing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Lord Vader will be happy to hear these details. Let''s get to the debriefing room, soldier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 239, 'm40e', '... and the Jedi hid behind a vaporator, waited for the bounty hunter to pass, and then leapt out and cut him down from behind. Unbelievable!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort a Witness to Jedi Activity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'Our relay station has needed a transpacitor shunt for two weeks. Finally we get a technician ferried from Duros orbit and what happens? They dump the poor nerf in the middle of nowhere. I want you to fetch him so our relay station can get back on line.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'I can''t believe that shuttle pilot dumped me way out here. What kind of operation do they run on this dirt ball? I''m glad at least one of you is lucid enough to solve this problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'I''m sorry for the trouble. Those gundarks in Sector Command have asteroids for brains.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Thanks for the escort. Next time I come here, I''ll make sure you''re on the shuttle that picks me up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Fetch a Shunt Technician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'A blasted Rebel sniper put a laser hole in my shuttle''s fuel bay. When I landed, I sent a tech with a crystal pump to clean up the acid spill. But the acid dissolved the pump''s motivator and now the tech is stuck without a transport. I want you to go out there and help him get back to me. I''ll see what I can do about the Rebel sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'I''m glad you found me. I think there are Rebels out here. Let''s get back so I can make a report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Rebels, you say! Tell me more. This could be the lead I require to track down that sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'I appreciate your assistance. Now I can report about those Rebels I saw while I was out there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist a Shuttle Tech'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'Look, I''ll be blunt. We''ve had a microbial containment breach in this area. There''s an expert on the planet who can set the matter straight, but there are some unsavory characters between here and there. You must fetch this expert and provide him an armed escort back to this location. You''re infected now, too, so don''t waste any time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I heard the report of a microbial containment breach. Take me there quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Well, it turns out we didn''t spill a microbial solution. It was a flask of zaffa oil for my synthsteak tonight. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 257, 'm43e', 'This agent helped me get here as fast as I could! Where is the microbial containment breach?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Imperial Microbe Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'One of our patrol speeders was hit by a Rebel ambush. There''s one survivor who needs rescuing right away. Get out there immediately and I''ll see what I can do about providing you some aerial cover.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'Boy, am I glad to see you. I''m well enough to run, but we need to clear out before the Rebels come back. Let''s go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'I agree. That was expertly done. You''ll receive a bonus for this, I assure you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I can''t thank you enough for the rescue. I wouldn''t have made it without you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Extract an Injured Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'One of our stealth operatives tracked a rogue transmission straight into a Rebel trap. The speeder patrols will take awhile to scramble. In the meantime, get out there as fast as you can and lend a hand!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'Watch out! Those Rebels are out here somewhere, and they know my blaster is drained. Let''s get moving before more of them show up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'Our speeder patrols bagged a few Rebel stragglers, but most of them got away. Traitorous cowards.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'You probably saved my life. I can''t thank you enough for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Extract a Wounded Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'We sent the deadliest assassin under Sector Command to eliminate a threat to planetary security. Unfortunately, getting back here is not as easy as murdering someone. I want you to travel to the kill site and retrieve him at once. Hail the New Order!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'Oh, thank heaven! Are you here to guide me back? I''m most dreadfully embarrassed about losing my way. This usually doesn''t happen to me, I assure you. Come along, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'We must be discreet. I would not presume to tarnish the reputation of Sector Command''s most valuable assassin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'How terribly awkward of me to lose my way like that! I certainly hope no one else will hear about my embarrassing mistake. That would vex me awfully. Is that understood, my excellent friends?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Retrieve a Master Assassin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'I''ve got an embarrassing problem. One of my subordinates has fallen in with some kind of cult from the Tatooine outskirts. I want you to fetch this true believer back to me, so I can make it plain that I don''t approve of "spiritual vision quests" on the Imperial clock. Understood? Good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Greetings, fellow spiritual traveler! Have you come to lead me home? Good. The Shrub is generous and giving to all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'We''ll see what "rains down" when Sector Command hears about this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'Thank you for guiding me, fellow pilgrim! The Shrub will rain down its leaves to the willing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Retrieve a Spiritual Traveller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'Ever heard of an archeological engineer? Me, either, but one has been assigned to my unit. Apparently an old Vulture Droid star fighter is rotting away somewhere on the planet. This engineer of mine is investigating the site. I guess he''s not good with maps, because now he needs a guide to report back to me. Please go out there and handle this. I''ve got more important things to worry about than droid historians.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Oh good, you''ve come to take me back. I wandered away from the wrecked Vulture Droid and seem to have lost my way. I''ve got a lot to report to my superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''ve just been ordered to put you on a transport, engineer. Someone named Lord Vader has heard of your work and wants to discuss the future of your research.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'Thank you. I''ve got much to report. If my theories are correct, the Trade Federation''s droid armies played a much larger role in the creation of the Empire than has previously been suspected.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Assist a Droid Historian'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'I''ve got an Imperial biologist in the field investigating a possible kouhun infestation. But someone short-circuited the maintenance droids at my shuttle depot an hour ago. I can''t call for an extraction. I need you to escort the biologist back here. Make sure you take a weapon. You don''t want to meet one of those assassin bugs unarmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Ow. I got a little insect bite here. I think a kouhun might have stung me. I need to get medical attention as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'How convenient that our shuttle depot was sabotaged when this "biologist" had a perfect alibi. Come with me, professor, and we''ll get to the bottom of this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'Thanks for bringing me back. But you know what? I''m not dead, so it couldn''t have been a kouhun that stung me. Maybe a mace fly or a shauput.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Assassin Bugs On the Loose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'We put a tracer beacon on the ship of a suspected smuggler. I sent an operative out to track it down. He found the ship, but it had jettisoned its cargo. I need you to find our man in the field and help him search in a line from his position to this position. You should find some contraband along the way so we can lock this smuggler up once and for all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'There you are. I''m afraid I had to let the suspect and his ship go. No evidence to hold him. But let''s search for that jettisoned cargo between here and my superior. Maybe we''ll get the guy yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'We''ll keep an eye on this Twingo creep. He''s bound to make a mistake soon.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'I could have sworn he jettisoned his contraband somewhere out there. Guess I was wrong. Thanks for the help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_hard.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Help Apprehend a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Rebel slicers have made it necessary to hand-deliver certain communiques from Imperial Intelligence. One of our couriers was attacked by Rebel terrorists a short time ago but managed to transmit coordinates before communications were cut off. We need you to bring him, or the encoded orders, back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Thank the Emperor you''ve arrived! I managed to drive the Rebels away but was certain they''d return with reinforcements. We should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Well done, trusted agent. Now that the Rebels know we''re using couriers to deliver orders, we may need your skills again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'You''re a dedicated servant of the Empire, citizen. These orders were of the highest priority and from Lord Vader himself. My thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Get the Courier Home'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'One of our agents is carrying Corporate Sector Authority security codes. We need these codes to investigate the flow of credits to and from the CSA. We suspect that a large sum of credits has been funneled to the Rebels. We cannot risk another assassination attempt and so need you to escort our agent back here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Your bold approach identified you as a friend and not another assassin. We must get these codes to my superiors at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Job well done, citizen. It''s the Empire''s pleasure to reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'I don''t think I would have made it without your help, citizen. The Empire appreciates your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Secure the CSA''s Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'An agent has vital intelligence regarding the movements of suspected Jedi, which needs to be delivered to the top ranks of Imperial Intelligence. Rebel assassins have made several attempts to eliminate our agent. You must make sure he and his information arrive here intact. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Careful, friend. Rebel snipers have been targeting me. They''ve kept me pinned down for the past few hours and might still be out there. But I suppose that''s a chance we''ll have to take. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Good. Now Imperial Intelligence will be able to hunt down those rogue Jedi. This will please the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Your reputation must precede you, citizen, for those Rebel snipers certainly seemed to make themselves scarce after you found me. I''m proud to have met you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Secure Vital Intelligence for Imperial Intelligence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'An engineered virus was on its way to us for use against anti-Imperial demonstrations. Our courier''s party was attacked by Rebel terrorists. We do not know if anyone survived, but these were the last coordinates sent to us. Collect the virus and any survivors and bring them back to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'Praise the Empire! You''ve found me! I''ve got the virus and all the Rebel scum who attacked us are dead. More are sure to come, however, so we should hurry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Excellent, agent. You''ve surpassed our expectations. This reward is but a taste of things to come if you continue serving the Empire faithfully.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Thanks to you, this virus will perform the function it was engineered to do. Many Rebel sympathizers will understand what it means to betray their Emperor!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Save the Deadly Virus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A trusted courier was delivering a warrant and dossier on a citizen suspected of possessing Sith artifacts. We have reasons to believe that citizen is on this planet. The attacks on our courier further seem to confirm this. These coordinates are the courier''s last known location. Go there and see if he still lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'I''m so pleased you''ve come! At first I thought you were another hired assassin and almost blasted you. I still have the dossier, so we should get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Most excellent, agent. Now we can carry out the will of the Emperor. Your reward is well earned.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Thanks, friend. It''s good to know the Empire has competent fighters such as yourself working for the Emperor''s glory.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Collect the Emperor''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'An Imperial courier was delivering important transfer orders when he fell victim to a vicious gang. We believe the courier was able to escape. We then received these coordinates from an unknown source, using an Imperial code. We need you to go and retrieve the courier, if he truly is alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'I was hoping my superiors got my coded message.  Sorry it was so brief, but I had only seconds to send it. Let''s get out of here before that gang finds us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'The Empire is grateful, agent. Your actions inspire other Imperial servants to strive harder to please their Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'You got me here safe and sound. I''ll be sure to mention your name to my commanding officer. My thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Recover the Courier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Recently a Moff was accused of plotting to assassinate the Emperor. A special courier was delivering the arrest warrant to be served on the Moff and his family, but agents of the Rebellion attempted to waylay the courier. These coordinates are the origin point of his last transmission. Find him and provide an escort back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'It''s a good thing you came when you did. I had run out of ammo, and it was only a matter of time before those Rebels caught up with me. Let''s get out of here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'A fine job, agent. We''ll make sure this Moff pays for his traitorous act against our august Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Many thanks, friend. This Moff has many friends in high places, and I was beginning to suspect my life wasn''t worth a credit''s purchase.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Recover an Arrest Warrant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'Rebel scum hit one of our transport repair stations. We received a final distress signal that originated at the following coordinates. We''d like you to check this area and bring back any survivors. We need information on the Rebel strike team that pulled off this operation. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'About time they sent someone. I''m the only survivor. Let''s get back so I can inform my superiors and we can begin hunting these Rebel dogs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'Your services to the Empire shall not be forgotten, agent. Here''s your reward. Use it wisely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'Thanks, friend. Sorry I was so short with you earlier. I was just mad and eager for revenge. But you''re right, we need to stick together in these times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Find the Survivors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'An ISB interrogation compound was bombed by an X-wing patrol. We believe there were survivors, as we received a distress call that originated not far from the facility. Go to these coordinates and bring back any survivors you find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'An ally! Thank the New Order! My comlink ceased to work shortly after I sent my distress call. I was afraid that Rebel patrol would return to look for survivors. We should hurry as they still might.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 51, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'Thanks to your efforts, we will be able to identify the Rebel starfighters involved in this dastardly attack. The Empire is grateful. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'I will not rest until every single one of the Rebels involved in this attack is in our custody and at my mercy. I''m not called the Professor of Pain for nothing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Rescue the Torturer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'One of our agents was in the process of delivering a case of durindfire gems to a loyal financier when a group of Rebels bandits attacked. Our troopers managed to kill the Rebels, but at the cost of their lives. We need you to escort our agent and those gems back to us before the Rebels can attempt another attack. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'The gems are safe, but we must hurry. Getting these gems safely back to my superiors would be the best way to honor those fallen troopers. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Your efforts have benefitted the Empire, agent. Gems such as these help finance the construction of our fleet. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'You are a true champion of the Empire, friend. I hope we can work together again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Rescue the Gems'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'One of our operatives went to negotiate a deal with a swoop gang. We use these criminals to spy on the Rebels from time to time. It turns out, however, that these swoopers were actually Rebels in disguise. Our operative was taken captive but managed to escape. We need you to find him and escort him safely back to us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Those Rebels will be on us in no time. We must get moving now! I hope you''re handy with that blaster.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'The Empire is pleased with your performance, agent, as this reward will demonstrate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Thanks, friend. Serving our Emperor is sometimes perilous but always satisfying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Rescue the Swooper Recruiter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'An Imperial Intelligence agent was escorting a valuable Kubaz spy to a nearby garrison when the spy was killed by a Rebel sniper. The Imperial agent sent a distress call and has been exchanging blaster fire with the sniper for over thirty minutes. You must hurry to these coordinates and rescue the agent. Returning here would be best.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'You might want to identify yourself next time, friend. I almost blasted you. The sniper ceased firing about ten minutes ago. It''s been awfully quiet. I think I got the Rebel dog. Let''s get out of here. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, agent. It''s too bad you couldn''t verify the sniper''s death. We''ll send patrols out to search the area for bodies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'That Kubaz was valuable to us. Those Rebels will pay for murdering him. Death to all Rebels!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Retrieve the Kubaz Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'An Imperial convoy transporting hibridium ore was destroyed by Rebel saboteurs. Fortunately our cloaking device engineer, who was supervising the operation, survived the attack and has sent us a distress call. Go to these coordinates and make sure the engineer is returned safely to us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'Over here! Thank the Empire you''ve arrived. We lost an entire shipment of hibridium, no thanks to those Rebel scum. We''ll make them pay. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'This engineer is very valuable to us, agent. The Empire is grateful for his safe return. Claim your reward. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'This has inspired me to try and create cloaking devices for smaller land-based speeders and transports. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Retrieve the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'The Rebels attacked one of our water-processing plants, on the pretext that we were drugging the water supply. One of our chief chemists was making an inspection of the plant at the time. Miraculously he escaped harm by hiding inside a reinforced tank. Right now he''s trying to get out of the area. Go and collect him so we can begin our investigation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'Those damn Rebels! Someone on the inside must have tipped them off. How else could they know we were introducing sedatives into the water supply?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, agent. We will begin our investigation immediately. This is for your time and effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thank you for your help. I suppose we''ll have to up the dosage to keep these people pacified.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Rescue the Chemist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'An agent was dispatched to investigate rumors of Jedi activity. Not only did he witness a Jedi in action against a swoop gang, he also briefly engaged the Jedi in combat. Fortunately for our agent, the sudden appearance of more swoopers distracted the Jedi. You must go to these coordinates and escort our agent back here safely. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'I must get word of this to Imperial Intelligence at once. If I hadn''t seen it with my own eyes, I would not have believed it. The Empire has very good reason to worry about these Jedi.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'We will inform the Inquisitorius of your actions. I''m certain they will wish to call upon your services again in the future. Here is your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'Thanks, friend. Keep your eyes open for more Jedi activity. Report anything you encounter, even rumors, to Imperial Intelligence at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'A Jedi Witness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'One of our couriers was shot down by Rebels but managed to survive the crash-landing. He transmitted his coordinates to us before going down. He carries important communiques from Lord Vader warning of a possible Rebel attack on the Fondor shipyards. Go and retrieve our courier or the communiques and return here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'I''m battered but basically intact. We should get going, though. The Rebels that shot me down might return to make sure they got the job done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Well done, agent. These communiques were of the greatest importance. We shall send Lord Vader word of your deeds. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'Many thanks, friend. Have you ever considered becoming an Imperial courier? Seems like your skills would be suited to that prestigious position.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'Recover Lord Vader''s Orders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'An undercover agent acquired the coordinates to a Rebel colony that houses many high-profile Rebel leaders and their families. As he was about to rendezvous with a Star Destroyer, the hated Rogue Squadron crippled our agent''s shuttle. He used an escape pod to evade destruction and landed near here. Go and recover him before the Rogues finish the job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'I still have those coordinates! Let''s get moving. I''m banged up but I can still run. Hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Now we will be able to dispense some long overdue Imperial justice to these Rebels. Good work, agent. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'Much appreciated, friend. Those Rebels will rue the day I escaped their lethal ambush. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure Important Coordinates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'A team of Army engineers went into the wilderness to test some new prototype walker. They were due back hours ago. Nothing on the comm. I suggest you get out to their coordinates and herd them in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'We had an operational contingency. The walker disintegrated. I''m the only survivor. I can''t say any more until I debrief my commander.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'Oh, fine. One more walker gone. I hope we don''t find the main Rebel base soon, because we''re not even remotely ready for a full assault.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'A certain number of contingencies are to be expected in the development of new hardware. I don''t see why one explosion would damp the Empire''s enthusiasm.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'AT-AT Walker Engineer Walking'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'Some local do-gooder is making noise because our artillery practice destroyed some of his livestock. Boo-hoo. We sent a squad out to his farm to teach him some manners. They haven''t reported back, but one agent''s distress beacon went off. Check out the coordinates and bring back any survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'It was a trap! My squad surrounded the farmhouse. I happened to be hanging back from the doorway because I stopped to take potshots at the farmer''s vaporators. When my unit broke down the do-gooder''s door, a booby-trap blew up the house and the whole squad! I got out on foot, because the vehicles were torched.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'These Rebels are getting more desperate by the day. If they''re destroying their own homes to get us, they must be truly scared. Be proud you''re on the winning side!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I don''t know why I shot those vaporators. I guess I should be glad I did. Sometimes petty vandalism can keep you alive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Imperial Artillery Specialist Stranded'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'We blew up a Rebel fuel dump. Local civilians started cleaning up the mess without permission. Intelligence says no cleanup until they''ve inspected the wreckage, so we sent out a squad to stop the locals. They haven''t reported in. Go bring ''em back!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'An ambush! When we closed on the civilians, our speeders hit a mine emplacement. Then they opened fire from hard cover. I''m the only one alive! I need an escort back to my sarge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Ambush, huh? That about fits on this miserable world. Okay, get back to whatever it is you do. And keep this quiet!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'It''s hard bringing order to the galaxy when there''s so many civilians who don''t like order.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Fuel Dump Cleanup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'Some bounty hunter took a wild shot at a local businessman and winged one of our agents nearby. Imperial Security is making a full investigation with the Bounty Hunters'' Guild, and you can be sure someone''s Guild license is about to expire, hard. But we need someone to get the wounded agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'I did some first aid, and I''m feeling better. But nobody around here would help me at all. It makes me angry when the locals treat us like we''re the villains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'Word is, they''ve identified the bounty hunter and put out a bounty on him. That''s a nice irony. Thanks for the retrieval.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'These local civilians should be glad the Empire is here, keeping the streets safe from scum like that bounty hunter!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Bounty Hunter''s Near-Miss Needs Pickup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'These Rebels are crafty. They infiltrated a covert agent into one of our loyalty enforcement squads. When the squad was about to demolish the house of some old local woman, the Rebel broke cover and destroyed our squad. One of our people escaped and is stranded in what is clearly enemy territory. The rescue falls to you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'That Rebel was an amazing shot. Took out five of us, bam-bam-bam, in about six shots. Pushed me into a ditch. The fall knocked me out. I''m still woozy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'The Imperial Security Bureau will certainly be interested in this evidence of porous recruitment procedures. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I can''t even remember why we had to destroy that old woman''s house. She didn''t look like much threat. But then, those Rebels hardly ever do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Survivor of Undercover Agent''s Betrayal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'Following orders from Imperial Intelligence, we sent a loyalty enforcement squad to destroy a local leader''s home. Due to a mischievous slicer''s alteration of message data, we inadvertently assaulted a covert Imperial Security Bureau installation. They returned fire, and both sides were wiped out save for one survivor. You need to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'We knew something was wrong when a protocol droid shouted, "Hahaha, you lame suckers!" Then we checked the credentials on the bodies. Oops!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Good work. Remember, we have jurisdiction to recover and debrief the survivor. Ignore any ISB claims otherwise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'What can I say? We were following orders. The orders don''t say across the top, "This order hopelessly messed up by villainous data slicers, so you''d be a total idiot to follow it!"'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Rebel Slicer Misdirected Recon Squad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'The Corporate Sector Authority requisitioned more prisoners for conscript labor. We dispatched a carrier of prisoners to the spaceport, but it hasn''t reported. The tracking beacon showed the vehicle moved out to the wilderness. Then it went silent. Check it out. Move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'I''m the last surviving guard. The prisoners improvised a weapon and got the drop on us. They hijacked the speeder, dumped me here, and destroyed the tracking beacon. I need you to take me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Another prisoner revolt. We have to get more funding for security. We''re looking like amateurs!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'Thanks. I hate it when prisoners revolt. "Revolting" is the word for CSA conscripts, all right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'CSA Conscript Vehicle Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'An undercover agent has information on local business people and their family members. We''ve arranged a rendezvous in the remote wilderness to avoid detection. To avoid suspicion when travelling with you, he''s been instructed to change into an Imperial uniform. Escort him here, and avoid blowing cover at all costs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'The Alliance is making headway in recruiting local business leaders. I''ve got data here worth a pretty credit to your superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Thanks. We''ll have the agent interrogated too, just so we don''t miss anything. Sometimes these agents like to play both sides against the middle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 149, 'm25e', 'Hey, why is he looking so threatening? Doesn''t he know I''m on his side?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Rendezvous with Undercover Informant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'Got a report of another prisoner labor gang rioting and killing the guards. One survivor. Go and bring the guard here for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'They stole a blaster and used it to blow up a transport. The explosion took out most of my unit, and they got the rest of us while we were surprised. It was awful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'These riots are getting more frequent. Shows a lack of alertness training among new guard recruits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'I guess they didn''t kill me because I used to give them extra water. The other guards called me soft for that. Huh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Prisoner Riot Leaves Wounded Guard Alive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'The Emperor ordered the assassination of a treasonous Imperial dignitary. We sent an agent to do the deed using a Scarab assassin droid. But the droid went crazy, and the agent is stranded in the middle of nowhere. It''s your job to make the rescue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'That droid hit some kind of radioactive mineral deposit and bam! It started firing at me! Blew up my speeder before I could bring it down. I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Never send a droid to do a Star Destroyer''s job, I say. Your service to the Empire is noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I usually have much better luck with Scarab models. I can requisition another if I can line up another job. Need anyone assassinated?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'Scarab Assassin Droid Malfunction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We located -- well, we thought we located -- a Bothan SpyNet installation, an op-front. The cover was a rural HoloNet receiver. Headquarters sent a squad to storm the house, but it was a trap. We need you to survey the damage and bring back survivors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'A droid saw us and said, "Oh dear." It turned and stumbled away. For kicks, somebody shot the droid. It fell over onto some kind of switch. Next thing -- boom! I was the only one outside the blast radius. I need you to escort me back to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'I tell you, Bothans are the most cunning creatures in the galaxy. Makes me shiver to think we''re supposed to eradicate that SpyNet, and all the time the Bothans are listening to our every word.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'I sure hope that in the future, HQ doesn''t jump at every Bothan SpyNet eradication operation. That''s what I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bothan SpyNet Base Assault Gone Wrong'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'That traitorous defector Crix Madine is leading more Rebel raids against the very soldiers who once fought beside him. Makes my blood burn. We''ve just got word that one of his covert strike teams blew up a listening post in the wilderness. Go out and bring back the survivors for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'The Rebels lured us out in a classic decoy-and-close maneuver. Right out of Imperial small-formation tactics. I can''t believe we fell for it. I''m the only one left. Can you escort me back to my dispatch point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'That sounds like Crix Madine, all right. There''s a special interrogation droid waiting for that man when we finally catch him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I don''t think we ever saw Crix Madine himself, but I''m pretty sure someone good was handling Rebel tactics today.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Madine''s Covert Team Strikes Again'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'The Empire has been looking for the Procurement and Supply base used by the Rebel leader known as Targeter. Our scout reported a sighting of Targeter''s forces at rest, but then something jammed the signal. Check the coordinates of the last transmission and escort the scout back here. Don''t waste time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'I was looking through my electrobinocs when something big moved in front of me. Before I could look up, wham! When I woke up, I was alone. I need you to escort me back to operations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'That Targeter is supposed to have unusually good recon. Maybe some special kind of droid? But we''ll sneak up on that Rebel someday, count on it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'I''m looking forward to debriefing. With the data from my report, I expect we can close in on Targeter before long.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Imperial Scout Found Targeter Base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'Imperial Intelligence put us onto a Rebel research facility. We carried out the assault beautifully, if I do say so. But we just got a call that some knucklehead trooper got left behind. I don''t really care about one stupid agent, but go and bring back the idiot before some Rebel gets his hands on our gear.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'We were moving into the base when this weird-looking X-Wing swooped out past us. The backwash knocked me out, and when I woke up, everyone was gone and the base was destroyed. I lost all my directional gear, so I''m glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'That''s fine. I''ll give this nincompoop a good talking-to, and then he''ll be one more warm body for detention-cell duty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I couldn''t help what happened. I''m not an idiot, just unlucky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Straggler from Rebel Research Base Assault'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'A probe droid spotted a refueling base used by the Rebel starfighter unit called Rogue Squadron. We hit it hard and took it out. But in all the smoke, some dimwit agent of ours went missing. Now we''ve got his distress call to handle, and I don''t have the time. Get this dolt back here safely, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'The smoke was everywhere, and my IR heatsights fritzed out. I kept calling for help over the comm, but nobody showed up. They just left me! After you escort me back, I''m gonna let fly at someone, you watch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'That''s all I need, more namby-pamby agents moaning about being left behind. It''s war! Live with it!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My squad never liked me. They treated me like some, some -- droid! I''m filing a report that''ll raise blisters on their collective backside.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Leftovers from Assault on Refuel Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'We found a Rebel facility housing fugitive Wookiees from a failed slave revolt on their homeworld, Kashyyyk. We wiped out the facility without much problem, but in the assault we lost track of a reconnaissance agent. Round up the straggler so Imperial Intelligence can complete its debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It was horrible. Those Wookiees are savage killers, just like you''ve always heard. I found some evidence in the wreckage that may interest the Security Bureau.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'That evidence should help us track and close down the "Cloaking Transit" network that smuggles Wookiee rabble-rousers off Kashyyyk. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It''s only a matter of time before Kashyyyk is completely subdued, no matter how savage its natives can be.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Assault on Wookiee Fugitives Left One Behind'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'Our speeder convoy was ferrying bacta tanks to a supply post when Rebels attacked. One survivor has called in, asking for an escort back here. If you can take care of the retrieval, that''s less hassle for me while I work out where to get new bacta.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I got wounded in the attack, but then bacta splashed all over me when a tank ruptured. Now I feel fine. I need you to escort me back so I can report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'We''ve lined up a backup bacta shipment from offworld. Those Rebels ought to know by now they''ll never break the Empire''s supply chains!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'The Rebels seemed just as dismayed as we were when that bacta tank ruptured. But they got away with the other tanks. I expect we''ll see it on the black market soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 204, 'm34t', 'One Survivor from Bacta Convoy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'An ace pilot from a top TIE squadron has arrived on the planet. I have secret orders for his team. I need you to rendezvous and escort him to me. Be wary. Criminals and Rebel spies are everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 206, 'm35p', 'You''re my contact? Nice. I thought I rated higher than some half-trugut lackey. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 208, 'm35c', 'We meet again, captain. Charming as always, I see.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 209, 'm35e', 'Thanks for the escort, junior. Me and Captain Blasterbritches have some work to do now, so run along.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Rendezvous with an Ace TIE Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'One of the few survivors of the Yavin disaster is on the planet to give me a secret deposition. This could be an important step in my career. Make sure no one causes any trouble on the way. Arm yourself, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Are you the person I''m supposed to give a deposition? Are you sure? Because I''ll tell you everything. You sure you don''t want to hear it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'This secret deposition will earn me a promotion for sure. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Secret? Was this supposed to be secret information? Because I told the whole story on the public transport from Togoria. There was a Twi''lek on board who sounded very interested. Is that bad?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Escort a Yavin Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'I need you to bring a captured traitor to me. The bounty hunter put a slave transmitter in his neck and dropped him off at these coordinates. Don''t worry. One false move and the transmitter will explode, so he shouldn''t cause you any problems.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I promise not to tell anyone if you remove my slave transmitter. No? It was worth a try. Let''s go, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'I told you there wouldn''t be any trouble. The Empire will reward you generously.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'So if I just run for it right now, my head will explode? Just checking. It doesn''t hurt to ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Escort a Captured Traitor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'We brought in an expert scout from Lambda Sector to assist us with a few operations, but he''s already gotten himself lost. Can you find this laserbrain and point him back to me? I''ve got a few choice words I need to convey.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Hey, you found me! Well, um, thank goodness. I kinda thought my superiors had forgotten about me. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'So this is the "expert scout," eh? I can spot a fake just by looking at him. We''ll see what his commander in Lambda Sector has to say about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'I wasn''t lost! I was, um, scouting new paths across unfamiliar terrain. I''d better get back out there and check my markers. There''s wild animals in that area, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Find a Lost Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'I know this isn''t a pleasant assignment, but we just commissioned a nerf herder into the military. The Corvette Intruder has need of a junior officer. Can you bring the herder to me? Some hygienic adjustment is in order before deployment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'Why don''t people like us nerf herders? The smell isn''t all that bad, is it? Here, smell my hand. No, really, just smell it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Let''s get you a new uniform, soldier. You''ll curdle the fuel cells with that reek.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Come on! The smell isn''t that bad. I used to work with thranta dung. You talk about stench, that stuff would singe a Wookiee''s nostrils!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Yes, An Imperial Nerf Herder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'I am scheduled to debrief a witness to possible Jedi activity. Lord Vader will want this information as soon as possible. The Jedi may know about the witness, so you must ensure that he arrives here safely. Do not delay!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'I''ll tell the whole story in the debriefing, but I know it was a Jedi I saw. She had a lightsaber and everything. She was deflecting blaster bolts with the whole buzz! and the whoosh! thing. It was amazing!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Lord Vader will be happy to hear these details. Let''s get to the debriefing room, soldier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 239, 'm40e', '... and the Jedi hid behind a vaporator, waited for the bounty hunter to pass, and then leapt out and cut him down from behind. Unbelievable!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort a Witness to Jedi Activity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'Our relay station has needed a transpacitor shunt for two weeks. Finally we get a technician ferried from Duros orbit and what happens? They dump the poor nerf in the middle of nowhere. I want you to fetch him so our relay station can get back on line.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'I can''t believe that shuttle pilot dumped me way out here. What kind of operation do they run on this dirt ball? I''m glad at least one of you is lucid enough to solve this problem.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'I''m sorry for the trouble. Those gundarks in Sector Command have asteroids for brains.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Thanks for the escort. Next time I come here, I''ll make sure you''re on the shuttle that picks me up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Fetch a Shunt Technician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'A blasted Rebel sniper put a laser hole in my shuttle''s fuel bay. When I landed, I sent a tech with a crystal pump to clean up the acid spill. But the acid dissolved the pump''s motivator and now the tech is stuck without a transport. I want you to go out there and help him get back to me. I''ll see what I can do about the Rebel sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'I''m glad you found me. I think there are Rebels out here. Let''s get back so I can make a report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Rebels, you say! Tell me more. This could be the lead I require to track down that sniper.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'I appreciate your assistance. Now I can report about those Rebels I saw while I was out there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist a Shuttle Tech'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'Look, I''ll be blunt. We''ve had a microbial containment breach in this area. There''s an expert on the planet who can set the matter straight, but there are some unsavory characters between here and there. You must fetch this expert and provide him an armed escort back to this location. You''re infected now, too, so don''t waste any time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I heard the report of a microbial containment breach. Take me there quickly!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Well, it turns out we didn''t spill a microbial solution. It was a flask of zaffa oil for my synthsteak tonight. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 257, 'm43e', 'This agent helped me get here as fast as I could! Where is the microbial containment breach?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Imperial Microbe Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'One of our patrol speeders was hit by a Rebel ambush. There''s one survivor who needs rescuing right away. Get out there immediately and I''ll see what I can do about providing you some aerial cover.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'Boy, am I glad to see you. I''m well enough to run, but we need to clear out before the Rebels come back. Let''s go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'I agree. That was expertly done. You''ll receive a bonus for this, I assure you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I can''t thank you enough for the rescue. I wouldn''t have made it without you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Extract an Injured Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'One of our stealth operatives tracked a rogue transmission straight into a Rebel trap. The speeder patrols will take awhile to scramble. In the meantime, get out there as fast as you can and lend a hand!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'Watch out! Those Rebels are out here somewhere, and they know my blaster is drained. Let''s get moving before more of them show up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'Our speeder patrols bagged a few Rebel stragglers, but most of them got away. Traitorous cowards.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'You probably saved my life. I can''t thank you enough for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Extract a Wounded Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'We sent the deadliest assassin under Sector Command to eliminate a threat to planetary security. Unfortunately, getting back here is not as easy as murdering someone. I want you to travel to the kill site and retrieve him at once. Hail the New Order!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'Oh, thank heaven! Are you here to guide me back? I''m most dreadfully embarrassed about losing my way. This usually doesn''t happen to me, I assure you. Come along, then.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'We must be discreet. I would not presume to tarnish the reputation of Sector Command''s most valuable assassin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'How terribly awkward of me to lose my way like that! I certainly hope no one else will hear about my embarrassing mistake. That would vex me awfully. Is that understood, my excellent friends?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Retrieve a Master Assassin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'I''ve got an embarrassing problem. One of my subordinates has fallen in with some kind of cult from the Tatooine outskirts. I want you to fetch this true believer back to me, so I can make it plain that I don''t approve of "spiritual vision quests" on the Imperial clock. Understood? Good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Greetings, fellow spiritual traveler! Have you come to lead me home? Good. The Shrub is generous and giving to all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'We''ll see what "rains down" when Sector Command hears about this!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'Thank you for guiding me, fellow pilgrim! The Shrub will rain down its leaves to the willing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Retrieve a Spiritual Traveller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'Ever heard of an archeological engineer? Me, either, but one has been assigned to my unit. Apparently an old Vulture Droid star fighter is rotting away somewhere on the planet. This engineer of mine is investigating the site. I guess he''s not good with maps, because now he needs a guide to report back to me. Please go out there and handle this. I''ve got more important things to worry about than droid historians.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Oh good, you''ve come to take me back. I wandered away from the wrecked Vulture Droid and seem to have lost my way. I''ve got a lot to report to my superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''ve just been ordered to put you on a transport, engineer. Someone named Lord Vader has heard of your work and wants to discuss the future of your research.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'Thank you. I''ve got much to report. If my theories are correct, the Trade Federation''s droid armies played a much larger role in the creation of the Empire than has previously been suspected.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Assist a Droid Historian'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'I''ve got an Imperial biologist in the field investigating a possible kouhun infestation. But someone short-circuited the maintenance droids at my shuttle depot an hour ago. I can''t call for an extraction. I need you to escort the biologist back here. Make sure you take a weapon. You don''t want to meet one of those assassin bugs unarmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Ow. I got a little insect bite here. I think a kouhun might have stung me. I need to get medical attention as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'How convenient that our shuttle depot was sabotaged when this "biologist" had a perfect alibi. Come with me, professor, and we''ll get to the bottom of this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'Thanks for bringing me back. But you know what? I''m not dead, so it couldn''t have been a kouhun that stung me. Maybe a mace fly or a shauput.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Assassin Bugs On the Loose'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'We put a tracer beacon on the ship of a suspected smuggler. I sent an operative out to track it down. He found the ship, but it had jettisoned its cargo. I need you to find our man in the field and help him search in a line from his position to this position. You should find some contraband along the way so we can lock this smuggler up once and for all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'There you are. I''m afraid I had to let the suspect and his ship go. No evidence to hold him. But let''s search for that jettisoned cargo between here and my superior. Maybe we''ll get the guy yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'We''ll keep an eye on this Twingo creep. He''s bound to make a mistake soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'I could have sworn he jettisoned his contraband somewhere out there. Guess I was wrong. Thanks for the help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_imperial_medium.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Help Apprehend a Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I''ve managed to locate a retired master Balved sculptor. I''ve offered a generous stipend if this master takes me on as a pupil. Could you see to it that this patron of the arts is safely escorted here? I will of course reward you for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Are you my escort? Very well then. Are you interested in the arts? I think sculpture is the highest form of artistic expression. The collapse of the arts was the collapse of the Old Republic. A shame.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'A Master Sculptor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Thank you, thank you. Now I can finally realize my dream of being an artist. Moisture farming had just become so tedious, after all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'I found your company quite pleasant. You should consider taking up some form of art. I hear holosculpting is all the rage these days. Ah, these youngsters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm2o', 'I''m taking on a friend''s cousin as a carpentry apprentice. I hope I''m not making a mistake. I hear this cousin is lazy and gets lost easily. Could you bring this would-be apprentice to my shop?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'Do I gotta go? What do I know about wood? Carpenters are dumb, anyway. I''d rather be a TIE pilot. ''Cept I prolly couldn''t pass the Academy''s entrance exams. Story of my life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'A Carpentry Apprentice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Well, I''ll try to make the best of it, I suppose. Thank you for your time, you''ve been very helpful. Hmm, maybe courier duty would be a more appropriate apprenticeship.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm2e', 'Thanks for making sure I didn''t get lost or nothing. I prolly coulda made it without you. Maybe I can make you a stool or something. When I get good.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm3o', 'We lost one of our friends in a speeder accident. His best friend moved to a different city last year and wants to return for the funeral. Could you provide safe escort? The wilderness can be dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'Thank you for escorting me. Please forgive me if I don''t feel much like chatting.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm3t', 'A Grieving Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm3c', 'Our thanks for escorting our friend. This has been a difficult time for all of us. We appreciate your understanding.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm3e', 'You have my gratitude, friend. I hope you never have to experience what I''m going through.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm4o', 'My boss wants me to take in her cousin for a while. Seems this relative is getting involved with a "bad" crowd. Could you make sure this cousin gets here in one piece? Those thugs might not like someone leaving their gang.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'I don''t want to move to a new city. I like it here just fine. And I''m not getting involved with a swoop gang. My parents just worry too much is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm4t', 'A Wayward Cousin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm4c', 'Thanks for the escort duty. I hope my boss''s cousin won''t get into trouble here. That would make for tricky office politics.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm4e', 'You were pretty cool. Thanks for putting up with me. Maybe I do need to straighten my life out. I''ll work on it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm5o', 'I''ve just taken on a new mandoviol student, who shows great promise and may flower into a virtuoso. Could you escort this prodigy here to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'I''m very grateful for your help. Being taken on as a student by a mandoviol master is truly an honor. Do you play any instruments? Music is in my blood.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm5t', 'Music Student'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm5c', 'A thousand thanks, my friend! I would hate for my skill to have died with me. Now I can pass it on to another generation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm5e', 'Thanks for seeing me safely here. You were very brave. I never once feared for my life. Honest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm6o', 'I''m planning to show an old friend around town. My friend lives a rather sheltered life out in the country and hasn''t seen much of the world. Could you provide a safe escort back here? I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'I''m ready to go. I certainly appreciate the escort to town. The world is a dangerous place and can swallow someone like me whole.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm6t', 'A Naive Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm6c', 'Thanks for looking out for my friend. I''ll start the education in the ways of the world. First stop, a cantina!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm6e', 'I appreciate your efforts on my behalf. I''ll work on making myself much more self-sufficient, I promise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm7o', 'My chief investor has decided to become my partner and wants to tour the premises. I need to provide an escort as I''m a bit busy and can''t do it myself. If you can take care of it, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'There''s no telling what sorts of horrors lurk out there in the wilds. A being can be gobbled up by all sorts of vicious predators. Thank goodness you''re here to make sure that doesn''t happen to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm7t', 'Protect the Partner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm7c', 'Thanks, friend. It looks like my new partner is a nervous type. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm7e', 'I wish I was as brave as you. I''m afraid of my own shadow, honestly. Thanks for your generous display of courage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm8o', 'Years ago my friend was attacked by a pack of ravenous anoobas and since then refuses to travel alone, even over short distances. If you could provide a safe escort for my companion, I would make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'I don''t know why the Empire doesn''t simply blast all dangerous predators into atoms. I don''t believe all this scientific claptrap about delicate ecosystems. If a species is dangerous to citizens, then it should be exterminated.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm8t', 'A Squeamish Traveller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm8c', 'Hope you didn''t go through too much grief, citizen. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm8e', 'If you see any dangerous predators in the wild, do us all a favor and blast them to pieces. We need to make sure the galaxy is safe for our children.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm9o', 'A colleague wishes to show me some samples of jewelry with semi-precious stones. Safety, however, is a factor during transport. Could you escort this nervous individual to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'One can''t be too careful with works of art like this. The wilderness is filled with all sorts of thieves and opportunistic gangsters. I long for the days when we were free of such fears.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm9t', 'A Nervous Artisan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm9c', 'My thanks, citizen. I sure hope my colleague doesn''t expect this sort of escort all the time. That could get expensive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm9e', 'I''m glad you turned out to be a respectable sort. I must admit, I had my doubts about my safety when I first laid eyes on you. But you proved me wrong.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm10o', 'I can''t believe one of the principal engineers of the classic Void Spider TX-3 landspeeder is here on this world! I look forward to hosting this genius, if you will serve as escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'Uh, I didn''t design the Void Spider. I exaggerated my record because I kinda need help finding my way around here. Can you take me to the one I talked to?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm10t', 'A Speeder Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm10c', 'Not a landspeeder designer? I wondered why this citizen asked for a ride. Well, I need someone to oil repulsorlift casings, so maybe this fraud can help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm10e', 'I did almost buy a Void Spider once, so I wasn''t absolutely lying. Anyway, thanks for getting me here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm11o', 'My pet jubba bird won''t sing. I''ve found a local "bird talker" to persuade it to pour forth once more its mesmerizing song. Bring me that talker!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'The secret with jubba birds is that they get bored with their owners'' prattle and just want to discuss deeper topics. Lead me to the owner, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm11t', 'The Pet Talker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm11c', 'Rapture! I shall soon enjoy again the hypnotic sussurus of that divine jubba song. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm11e', 'I appreciate your guidance, thanks. I didn''t want to keep this client waiting -- these jubba owners can get pretty intense.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm12o', 'I''ve just been in contact with my business partner, who''s returned from the Corporate Sector worlds. It''s a long way to go, but I need you to escort my partner back here. Be careful, because gangsters may want my partner''s cargo.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'I have with me a genuine purchase order from the Bonadan government in the Corporate Sector Authority. Yes, it''s true! I know you''re impressed. If you can get me back safely, the rewards will be rich for both of us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm12t', 'A Corporate Sector Hopeful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm12c', 'I can''t believe it. You can''t imagine how many restraining bolts those recycling droids use. We''re rich! Thank you, thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm12e', 'Now that we''re here, I''ll confide in you: We''re providing restraining bolts for every single Gyrowheel 1.42.08 Recycling Droid on Bonadan for the next fiscal year! This is the kind of deal that passes into legend. Ahh, prosperity....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm13o', 'My real estate agent has been scouting locations for my new home. I just got a call. There''s a prime site! But my agent needs a lift, if you''re willing to give one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'This place may not look like much, but a visionary architect could build something wonderful here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm13t', 'A Real Estate Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm13c', 'Oh. I had the idea the site itself was pretty. Should beauty really be dependent on the architect? Well, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm13e', 'Clients usually takes a bit of convincing, but we agents know best. Thanks for getting me here!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm14o', 'I''ve had so much trouble sleeping at night, I need a specialist. I''ve invited one here who happens to be vacationing outside town. Can you bring me that specialist?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'Me? A sleep specialist? Well, that''s a left-handed compliment if ever I heard one. But take me to your patron, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm14t', 'A Sleep Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm14c', 'I read that this poet''s published work provided a beautiful cure for insomnia. Didn''t that mean--? Oh, I get it. Sorry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm14e', 'The plight of the struggling poet can never be easy. Anyway, it was a nice journey here, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm15o', 'My long-lost cousin Neeblook is on this world! I just got the message. Can you guide good old Neeblook here for me? I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'It will be so good to see cousin Dennwater after all this time. I didn''t even know Dennwater was on this world. Funny, isn''t it? Lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm15t', 'Neeblook & Dennwater'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm15c', 'This isn''t my cousin Neeblook! It''s a big galaxy, I guess. I wonder where our actual cousins Dennwater and Neeblook live?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm15e', 'This isn''t my cousin Dennwater!  Is there more than one Neeblook in the galaxy with a cousin Dennwater?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm16o', 'A friend is visiting my new home from outside town. Can you go out and guide my friend here? There''s credits in it for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'I just got HoloNet news of another escapade by that Twi''lek adventurer, O-i. This guy could take on an Imperial garrison! I have to tell my friend all about it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm16t', 'A HoloNet Enthusiast'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm16c', 'I thought my friend wanted to visit to see my new home. I guess gossip about O-i is more interesting. Not that I''m bitter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm16e', 'And then O-i stampeded the bantha herd so they demolished the guard outpost! He sailed right through and rescued the ambassador! It was great!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm17o', 'I''ve had so much trouble staying awake at work, I need a specialist. I''ve invited one here who happens to be vacationing outside town. Can you bring me that specialist?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'Yes, I can keep citizens awake through the most boring meetings. I have an elaborate technique, which I shall describe when we arrive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm17t', 'Attention Disorder Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm17c', 'I dozed off while I was waiting for you. I sure am looking forward to this new waking life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm17e', 'I stand behind the client and, when sleep threatens, I shout loudly and drop large objects. It works beautifully. Thanks so much for bringing me here!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm18o', 'Probably it''s an urban legend, but I heard that somewhere out there is a piece of a destroyed Imperial spacecraft. I hired someone to go look, but haven''t heard back. Can you check and escort my researcher back here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'This may look like a hunk of rusted metal, but I swear it''s a piece of the Death Star! Really! What, you don''t believe me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm18t', 'A Piece of the Death Star'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm18c', 'Hmph. This is a rusty bolt off a landspeeder, or maybe a droid''s restraining bolt. Tell you what, I''m going to pay you the fee I would have given to this "researcher."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm18e', 'This bolt could have been the very one that held the superlaser in place as it blew up Alderaan! Why won''t you believe me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm19o', 'The Galactic Miner''s Guild is confirming a vein of ionite I discovered near here. I''m too busy to handle this right now. Can you track down their agent for me and find out what was learned?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'That miner is too busy to come here in person, eh? The Guild disapproves of such treatment, especially after a bogus mining claim. Take me to this impolite individual and I''ll set ''em straight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm19t', 'Miner''s Guild Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm19c', 'Uh-oh, I didn''t expect you to bring the guild agent back to me. I''ve got a bad feeling about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm19e', 'Thank you for showing me here. This inconsiderate miner and I have a lot to talk about.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm20o', 'I''ve decided to propose marriage to my beloved, but the two of us are very different. To be honest, I''m afraid of rejection. Can you deliver my proposal for me? You may save me a lot of embarrassment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'Marriage! How shy can a person be, sending someone else to propose for them? Show me where my darling is and I''ll answer in person.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm20t', 'A Marriage Proposal'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm20c', 'Didn''t I send you to ask on my behalf, instead of bringing my precious darling here? Thank you for helping me with my fear of rejection.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm20e', 'Thank you for showing me to this no good, scruffy-looking gundark. I prefer to say in person that I wouldn''t marry such a spineless gullipud for all the credits in the sector!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm21o', 'I''ve hired a transport to take me offworld, but my contact seems to have gotten lost. I''m in a bit of hurry. Can you fetch this spacer for me? I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'Thanks for meeting me. My passenger didn''t show up at the arranged place. The captain of my ship was going to get angry if I didn''t hear anything soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm21t', 'Fetch the Spacer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm21c', 'For someone who promised to ask no questions, this spacer sure grumbles a lot. Anyway, thanks for helping me out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm21e', 'Passengers who demand secrecy should always make their rendezvous. Lucky thing you were here to lend a hand.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm22o', 'I''m supposed to audition a new singer for my cantina, but apparently I''m not easy to find. That''s what I get for soliciting offworlders. Can you find this person for me and bring them here? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'Really, you''d think a cantina owner would bend over backward to accommodate a singer of my stature. Instead I get stuck with a paid messenger. Well, take me there and let''s get this audition over with.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm22t', 'Find the Diva'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm22c', 'I solicit singers from three sectors and this backwater diva is what I get? Just my luck. At least you''re a reliable sort. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm22e', 'I travel halfway across the sector and this ... person ... is going to audition me? I''m going to have a talk with my agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm23o', 'At last, my blind date has arrived on the planet! Can you provide an escort while I get myself ready? My heart is thundering like a tympanic pulser!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'I can''t believe I came all this way for a blind date. I just know it''s a waste of time. Too late to back out now, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm23t', 'The Odd Couple'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm23c', 'I expected so much better. I''d rather date a droid than this ugly narglatch. Don''t you agree? But thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm23e', 'I can''t believe it! What a vision of beauty I see before me! Thank you for bringing me to this wondrous creature!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm24o', 'I''m having trouble with my droid. It keeps running away from me. Would you be so kind as to bring my technician back here? I need to get this fixed soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'You fix somebody''s droid once and they think you''re some kind of personal servant. Take me there and I''ll straighten this out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm24t', 'Fix My Naughty Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm24c', 'I appreciate your help. Technicians seem to run from me as often as droids do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm24e', 'Thanks. Now I can tell this busybody that restraining bolts do not have to be changed daily. If I was a droid I''d run away, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm25o', 'I just picked up my client''s package from offworld, but I can''t leave it sitting here. How would you like to earn a few creds and track down my client for me? I''ll stay here and watch the box.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'Thank you for finding me. I''ve been waiting all season for that package. Can you show me where it is?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm25t', 'Help Deliver a Package'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm25c', 'I don''t care if my clients are scruffy, as long as their money is good. Thanks for helping out. Here''s the creds I promised you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm25e', 'Yippee! My R-10 household droid is finally here! My room has been buried in dust and old clothes since my last R-10 short-circuited. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My friend is now homeless due to debt. I promised a place to stay until things settle down. My friend can''t afford fancy transports, as you might imagine. Could you provide safe escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Thanks for coming to get me. Things are looking pretty bleak for me right now. At least I still have friends to help me out of this financial slump.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'A Friend in Need'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Thank you. You are indeed a noble citizen. Not too many folks care about their fellow beings these days. It gives me hope for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'I appreciate your efforts on my behalf. I''ll give you a piece of advice: Don''t ever put all your credits on one podrace. If it looks too good to be true, it probably is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 6, 'm2o', 'My best friend flew in for my wedding but unfortunately landed at the wrong starport. Being an optimistic sort, my buddy decided to walk here, not realizing how far it was. Could you provide an escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'Hi. You must be here to make sure I get into town safely. Thanks for coming to get me. Things sure are far apart here, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Eager Wedding Guest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Glad to see you made it safe and sound. It was very important to have my best friend at this wedding. This should demonstrate my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 10, 'm2e', 'Much obliged, friend. I''ll be sure to consult maps a little more closely next time I travel to another system.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 11, 'm3o', 'I recently lost my father in a tragic vaporator accident. His best friend just arrived for the funeral but, due to a miscommunication, has been stranded far from here. Could you safely escort my guest here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'Blasted couriers! Never entrust an important message to a total stranger! You''re a good friend of the family''s, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 13, 'm3t', 'Lost Funeral Attendee'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 14, 'm3c', 'Thanks so much. This means a lot to my family. Allow me to pay you for this valuable service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 15, 'm3e', 'They entrusted my safety to a total stranger? What is this galaxy coming to? Maybe it''s best my good friend left it when he did.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 16, 'm4o', 'An old friend of the family claims to have discovered some buried treasure out in the wilderness. I''ve received a transmission instructing me to hire an escort to help bring this treasure safely back. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'Hope you''re ready to defend me with your life, friend. If we''re lucky, no one will suspect I know the whereabouts of precious treasure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 18, 'm4t', 'Protect Lost Treasure'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 19, 'm4c', 'Your help is much appreciated. Allow me to pay you for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 20, 'm4e', 'Thanks, friend. You fancy flame opals? Then hit the local markets in a few weeks and you may find some beauties for sale. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 21, 'm5o', 'My aged father is developing Bitter Winter disease. I need a specialist escorted here to attend to him. I''ll pay you handsomely if you can bring me the specialist in one piece.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'Well, there''s no time to waste. I assume you''re my escort, yes? Good. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 23, 'm5t', 'Bitter Winter Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 24, 'm5c', 'Thank you ever so much. You''ve earned this reward, friend. Come, Doctor, my father awaits your inspection.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 25, 'm5e', 'Your courage is unusual for someone of your size. I hope you fare well in the future. Thanks for getting me here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 26, 'm6o', 'A strange old hermit contacted me recently. This individual claims to be a friend of my late father and wants to present me with some sort of archaic weapon, something my father wanted me to have when I was old enough. Could you escort this hermit here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'You have been chosen to act as my Imperial guard? Do you feel anger? Good! Take me to my young apprentice, minion, and be quick! '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 28, 'm6t', 'Provide an "Imperial" Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 29, 'm6c', 'Uh, this is the hermit? I think I''ve heard of this lunatic. Okay, here''s your money. I have a feeling this will not end well for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 30, 'm6e', 'Excellent, minion! You have brought me safely to my destination. Now, apprentice, I shall see if you are ready to take your father''s place at my side!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 31, 'm7o', 'A Zanazi teacher has agreed to join our community and help enlighten the locals. The teacher has just finished a purification ritual in the wilderness and now needs safe escort here. Can you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'Let us begin our journey. This one will be short, unlike the journey we must all undertake to embrace the Cosmic Balance. Chant with me. Ehhhnh--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 33, 'm7t', 'Find the Enlightened One'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 34, 'm7c', 'Thanks for delivering our teacher. This payment can only begin to express our appreciation. The path to Balance awaits us all! Ehhhnh--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 35, 'm7e', 'No, the sound is more nasal. Ehhhhnh. Try it again. Deeper breath. Oh, we''re here? Remember, true enlightenment begins in your nose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 36, 'm8o', 'I have a kind of, um, droid emergency here. I''d rather not go into the details, but the parts I need are custom-made by some specialist out in the wilderness. No, I don''t know why. No, I''d prefer not to explain. I''ll pay you to go there and bring the parts back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'Droid parts? For the problem your patron is having, there are no parts. There''s just me. Please lead the way back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 38, 'm8t', 'Droid Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 39, 'm8c', 'If you must know, some slicer prankster secretly reprogrammed my droids. They barricaded themselves in my bedroom. Apparently this citizen can negotiate with them. Here''s your fee. Please don''t tell anyone about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 40, 'm8e', 'Here at last. I''ll begin negotiating with the droids immediately. I appreciate your guidance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 41, 'm9o', 'My friend''s cloud car has crashed! I''ve just received news that the pilot survived, but is stranded a long way from here. I''m counting on you to escort my friend back here before it''s too late.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'I was scouting this terrain for mineral deposits, when something fired on my vehicle. I think I got too close to a smuggling base, or pirates. I''m really, really glad to see you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 43, 'm9t', 'Lucky Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 44, 'm9c', 'Oh, no! This poor citizen looks awful. I''ll contact the appropriate authorities. It''s an honor to have had your help. Please accept this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 45, 'm9e', 'Don''t I know your name? You''re famous for something -- the Alliance? The Empire? I can''t think too well right now. I''m just grateful you saved my life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 46, 'm10o', 'I''ve heard of you! Everyone around here knows you. I''ve got a friend waaay out in the countryside who''d love to meet you and get your autograph. I''ll pay you for the journey, don''t worry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'Why, this is a treat! That''s so nice of my friend to think of me all the way out here. Tell you what, take me back with you. That''ll give me something to talk about down at the cantina.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 48, 'm10t', 'You Must Have Me Confused'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 49, 'm10c', 'You brought my friend here! Now that''s service. I didn''t expect such thoughtfulness. Please accept this token of my great gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 50, 'm10e', 'I''ll be sure to tell my friend all about your exploits. I''ll remember this trip for a long time, believe me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 51, 'm11o', 'That blasted idiot! I gave warning after warning -- "Don''t go out there," I said. And now look! Can you go out and fetch this nincompoop?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'I was looking for something cute. Now I think I hear growling and hissing out there, and I''m a little scared.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 53, 'm11t', 'An Unlucky Explorer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 54, 'm11c', 'Help me convince this numbskull: Baby predators, bad-bad! Because they have parents! Is that so hard to understand, even for a droid-headed dimwit?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 55, 'm11e', 'I''m glad you brought me back. I just wanted to pet some nice little baby animals.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 56, 'm12o', 'I''ve had a call that a diplomat, who is trying to stop a war between two nearby worlds, has crash-landed far from here. Can you escort the official here, while I arrange safe transport offworld?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'Ah. Yes. All will go well now that you''ve arrived, I''m sure. Please escort me to our destination, using all due caution, and I''m sure you will be suitably rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 58, 'm12t', 'Bewildered Diplomat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 59, 'm12c', 'I''ve arranged another ship for our official friend here. Thank you so much for helping during this emergency.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 60, 'm12e', 'You have my profoundest thanks for your diligent and courageous service. The cause of intergalactic peace will not perish this day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 61, 'm13o', 'I have a friend with a cybernetic nerve implant, but it''s malfunctioning. My friend has been behaving a little, well, strangely, wandering off into the wilderness. I have a new replacement for the implant, but I need you to rescue my friend. Please hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'You''re an Imperial walker! No, wait, that''s wrong. Sith lord! No. Hold on. Must steady myself. I think you''ve arrived just in time. Please get me back to my friend.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 63, 'm13t', 'Very Confused Individual'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 64, 'm13c', 'That implant was supposed to cure a nervous condition. Instead, when it fritzes out, it makes things worse. Thank you for this brave rescue!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 65, 'm13e', 'Scout walkers everywhere! No, it''s a superlaser! Aaah! No, no -- I must stabilize -- all right. I think I''ll be better now that my friend is here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 66, 'm14o', 'My droid popped its restraining bolt and headed out into the wilderness. My friend went to catch it while I hunted down a new bolt. They''ve both been gone a long time. I''ll pay you to go and bring them back safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'Nothing is left of the droid but this burned-out motivator. Looks like predators started playing with it. I have no idea how the thing made it this far from home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 68, 'm14t', 'Tenacious Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 69, 'm14c', 'My droid, destroyed? Argh, what a nuisance. Well, thanks for rescuing my friend, at least. By rights I should only owe you half -- well, never mind, here''s your full reward. Unless you''d like this nice restraining bolt instead?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 70, 'm14e', 'Thanks for bringing me back. I expect my friend had insurance on that droid. So don''t worry, your reward won''t do any lasting financial damage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 71, 'm15o', 'Some kind of military activity has stranded my employees out in the wilderness. I don''t know the details. The distress call was garbled. Please, can you perform a rescue?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'We were driving along, when wham! A giant explosion blew up our landspeeder and killed everyone else. I was thrown clear. I think it was the Empire. My friends (sob)--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 73, 'm15t', 'A Tragic Accident'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 74, 'm15c', 'Hmm. Are my competitors stooping to brutal tactics, using the galactic civil war as cover? That seems the safest assumption, if you know what I mean. Please don''t tell anyone what happened here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 75, 'm15e', 'Imperial artillery practice, that''s what it was, I''m sure! I won''t let my boss cover up this atrocity, you hear? Citizens must know!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 76, 'm16o', 'Our local Youth Explorer troop was due back from a field trip, but I just got an automated distress call. Please, go out there, find what happened, and bring everyone back!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'I''m the field trip organizer. The kids ate some kind of local bush and, I don''t know, went native. They all ran off. Please get me back to town so I can call in a search party.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 78, 'm16t', 'Going Native'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 79, 'm16c', 'The kids must have eaten wanderweed blooms. Now they''re probably all convinced they''re Shistavanen wolfmen or something. I''ll organize a patrol.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 80, 'm16e', 'Thanks for getting me back here alive. Yes, I lead these field trips, but I personally never managed to earn the Survival merit badge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 81, 'm17o', 'Both my business partners are prospecting the countryside for minerals. One just sent an automated distress call. I want to hire you to find out what''s going on out there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'Murrgen -- the third partner in our business -- knocked me out and absconded with our records! I don''t know why, but I want that treacherous thief arrested!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 83, 'm17t', 'Find the Prospectors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 84, 'm17c', 'No! Murrgen must have found some rich site, and greed drove him to try killing my partner. And that means he''ll be after me next....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 85, 'm17e', 'Not much can drive one crazy faster than greed. After all those years together! Well, Murrgen''s days are numbered now. I''m hiring a bounty hunter!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 86, 'm18o', 'Listen, this should be simple. There''s a certain spacer who owes me money and is many credits behind on the payments. Bring me my money or bring me the spacer. Either way, I''ll pay you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'Heavens, I don''t have the money to pay you! Please don''t hurt me. Take me to the one who hired you, and I''ll see if we can settle this account face-to-face.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 88, 'm18t', 'Collect a Debt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 89, 'm18c', 'So, the spacer didn''t have the credits to pay me, eh? I''m sure I can extract some other kind of payment instead. Thanks for the help, buddy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 90, 'm18e', 'Oh, dear. Since I don''t have the money, I hope my family and I will be safe. At least you were kind to me. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 91, 'm19o', 'I had my purchasing agent take a refurbished military-surplus landspeeder for a test drive. I''ve heard no word for quite some time, and I''m worried. Can you investigate? For a fee, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'Oh, boy, am I glad you found me. The wreck is way back there somewhere. It started babbling about "hostile terrain" and "taking evasive action," and then I lost control and crashed! Please take me back so I can report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 93, 'm19t', 'A Refurbished Jalopy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 94, 'm19c', 'I think the salesman did mention that the vehicle had a reconditioned 5th-Class droid brain. Scary thought, really. I thank you for your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 95, 'm19e', 'These are sad times when you have to worry about your own landspeeder getting contrary. Thanks for saving my life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 96, 'm20o', 'I heard there''s a bounty out for Imperial TIE pilot DS-61-4, nicknamed Dark Curse. He''s supposed to be hiding out on this world. I sent a scout looking for him, but haven''t heard back. Did Dark Curse get my scout? I''d like you to check it out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'I''ve tromped all over this stupid world without finding Dark Curse. Did burn out my comlink, though. I''m glad to see you; let''s go back together, shall we?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 98, 'm20t', 'Find the Imperial Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 99, 'm20c', 'It turns out I may have misread the name on the wanted notice. It appears Dark Curse isn''t wanted, after all, that I know of. Oh well, here''s your fee anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 100, 'm20e', 'That Dark Curse is supposed to be a tough customer -- survived the battle of Yavin, they say! -- but I never did find a reason why anyone would put a bounty on him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 101, 'm21o', 'Any news about that crashed drone barge? Wait, aren''t you --? Oh, sorry. Listen, I need you to check the status of an employee out in the wilderness. I''ll pay well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'My boss heard reports that a drone barge loaded with ditanium crashed on this world. I was supposed to look for it. A swoop gang attacked me, I lost my comlink, and the day went downhill from there. Please, take me home!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 103, 'm21t', 'Drone Barge Accident'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 104, 'm21c', 'Well, is there a crashed drone barge or isn''t there? I''ll have to send this slacker out again to check!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 105, 'm21e', 'Oh, I''m so glad to be back home. I hope I don''t have to leave again for a long, long time. Thanks so much for saving my life!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 106, 'm22o', 'The Empire has offered a fat reward for information about a rumored Rebel command headquarters on this world. I sent out many scouts to locate it, but found nothing. One scout has yet to report back. I''m hiring you to find out whether those filthy rebels captured my agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'No command HQ to be found out here. What? Any Alliance activity? Oh, no, no-- Why don''t you lead me back to my employer?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 108, 'm22t', 'Confirm Imperial Rumors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 109, 'm22c', 'This scout looks suspicious somehow. Subversion, do you think? Perhaps I should call Imperial Security, just to be sure. Thanks, you can go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 110, 'm22e', 'Do we really know that those Alliance people are awful traitors? Wouldn''t it make sense to look at their position before turning them in to the Empire for a quick reward? I''m just asking, that''s all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 111, 'm23o', 'I hired an agent to search for a sentimental keepsake I lost near here. I keep hearing field reports from further and further away, and my requests to call off the search don''t seem to get through. Can you please go tell this citizen to stop searching?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'It seems a local herbivore swallowed the keepsake, a pair of electrobinoculars. Then the animal started travelling across the landscape on a migratory route. I was happy to follow, because I''m paid by the hour. But if my employer wants me back, let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 113, 'm23t', 'Find a Sentimental Keepsake'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 114, 'm23c', 'Egad, what a bill! I didn''t expect this when I wanted to recover my father''s old electrobinocs. And now there''s your fee as well. Here, take it and go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 115, 'm23e', 'Thanks for accompanying me back here. I appreciated having someone else around to do the guard work. I''ll present my bill to my employer now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 116, 'm24o', 'Is it true that HoloNet star Ando Blast is on this world? My fan club news service is reporting he''s at these coordinates. Can you go and invite him here, pleeease?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'I''m obviously not Ando Blast, but a producer scouting locations for the next Blast mega-epic. Ando himself is in fact computer-generated. But I''d like to meet the fan who sent you out here. Lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 118, 'm24t', 'Find Ando Blast'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 119, 'm24c', 'Wow, Ando Blast''s producer! Not as good as Ando, but -- here, you''ve earned your fee. Wow, maybe my home will show up in Ando''s next epic!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 120, 'm24e', 'Well, that was a longer trip than I figured. But I did get a lot of good location info. I also like to beat the bushes locally to drum up ratings. Thanks, you''re great.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 121, 'm25o', 'I have a very important meeting scheduled, but my business contact inadvertantly landed on the other side of the planet. If you can provide a safe escort back to me, I will compensate you from my operating funds.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'Most curious that my contact did not meet me in person. Very well, take me to this meeting place and we''ll determine what game is afoot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 123, 'm25t', 'Find the Business Contact'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 124, 'm25c', 'I''m sorry I used you, but I had to catch my old enemy off guard. Here''s the payment I promised you. Now run along. My old enemy and I have much to discuss.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 125, 'm25e', 'I might have known that my "business contact" was actually my old arch-nemesis! Which explains the trouble we had getting here. I''m sorry you''re caught in the middle of this, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_hard.stf', 126, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My daughter gets married next week and insists on having a minstrel perform at the wedding. I found someone suitable, whom I need escorted here safely. I don''t want to risk anything ruining my daughter''s wedding.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'I appreciate the escort, my friend. Do you like music? Perhaps I could sing you a song as we travel? Do you have any favorites?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'A Happy Bard'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'Much appreciated, citizen. I hope this minstrel is worth what I''m paying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'Farewell, friend. I feel we''ve shared something during our travels together. I hope our paths cross again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 6, 'm2o', 'As it weren''t bad enough that I''m having to spend thousands of credits on my daughter''s wedding, now she''s insisting on a cook skilled in the preparation of spicy Nabooian dishes. Could you escort this chef safely to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 7, 'm2p', 'It''s good to see that my patron has taken such an interest in my safety. I shall endeavor to prepare some of my finest dishes for their daughter''s nuptials.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'The Durasteel Chef'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 9, 'm2c', 'Many thanks, citizen. I suppose having decent food at the wedding couldn''t hurt, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 10, 'm2e', 'A fine guardian you''ve been, good citizen. If you attend the wedding, please try my specialty, yobshrimp and daggerts in a Nabooian wine sauce. It''s exquisite!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 11, 'm3o', 'After my best friends'' death, I took in their only child to raise as my own. Now this teenager has entered a "rebellious" phase, running away every three months or so and needing an escort home. Think you can help me out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 12, 'm3p', 'You look much tougher than the escorts that are usually sent to bring me back. You a bounty hunter or something? Am I in trouble?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 13, 'm3t', 'A Tough Tyke'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 14, 'm3c', 'Thanks, friend. Hopefully they''ll get over this phase soon. It''s starting to cost me a bundle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 15, 'm3e', 'If I take off again, will they send you after me? I kinda liked you. You''re pretty cool.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 16, 'm4o', 'We hired a dancer for a friend''s birthday celebration. Supposed to be one of the best in this region. We need someone to escort this rare beauty back to us. Think you can handle that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 17, 'm4p', 'You looking for a dancer? That''s me. What''s wrong? Am I not what you expected?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 18, 'm4t', 'A Private Dancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 19, 'm4c', 'Is this the dancer? Uh, okay. Well, thanks. I''m sure my friend will be thrilled when he sees just how rare this "beauty" is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 20, 'm4e', 'Thanks for bringing me safely here. You''re kinda cute. If you ever need a dancer, please look me up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 21, 'm5o', 'My son is suffering some rare malady and needs the attention of a medical specialist. Could you please escort this physician safely to our home? This may be my only chance to save my poor son. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 22, 'm5p', 'Are you my escort? Good. We should hurry if we''re to give that boy a fighting chance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 23, 'm5t', 'A Medical Specialist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 24, 'm5c', 'Thank you so much! I''ll be forever grateful to you if my son''s life is spared. Please hurry, doctor!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 25, 'm5e', 'A pleasure traveling with you, citizen. The best of luck in your future endeavors. Now, where''s that boy?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 26, 'm6o', 'A retired dejarik grandmaster has agreed to teach me in return for lodging. I readily agreed, of course. I need someone to escort this master safely to me. Can you do that for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 27, 'm6p', 'Well I don''t have all day, let''s get going. I''m not much on conversation so keep your thoughts to yourself, youngster. My sharp mind should not be wasted on idle chitchat.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 28, 'm6t', 'A Dejarik Grandmaster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 29, 'm6c', 'A thousand thanks, citizen. I''ll dedicate my first tournament victory to you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 30, 'm6e', 'Learn to play dejarik. Only then will your life find purpose. Farewell.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 31, 'm7o', 'My friend responded to a HoloNet ad looking for experienced hunters, and wound up lost in the wilderness and afraid to come back without an escort. Some hunter, eh? Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 32, 'm7p', 'You''re here, good. There''s a pack of vicious predators stalking me. I''m sure you''ll see them soon enough. Be on your guard.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 33, 'm7t', 'A Cowardly Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 34, 'm7c', 'Thank you for getting my friend back safely. Hunting was not an ideal occupational choice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 35, 'm7e', 'A good thing we were both alert. Those slavering beasts would have had us for sure had we let our guards drop but for a moment. I salute you, fellow hunter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 36, 'm8o', 'I made a dumb joke about my friend''s courage, and so my friend decided to prove me wrong by going out into the wilderness and, of course, promptly getting lost. Could you bring this poor lunkhead back to civilization?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 37, 'm8p', 'I''m so glad you''ve arrived. It''s really scary out here! Perhaps my friend was right -- I am a coward! '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 38, 'm8t', 'A Test of Courage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 39, 'm8c', 'Thank you, friend. I hope my apology for the joke will settle everything, so I don''t need to call on you again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 40, 'm8e', 'You saved my life. Do you know that? I''m sure I would''ve been devoured by nightmarish monsters if you hadn''t come when you did. Thank you so much!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 41, 'm9o', 'My partner has found a deposit of what may be berubian. We need the samples analyzed, but there might be claim-jumpers. Could you escort my partner and the samples safely to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 42, 'm9p', 'Ah, good. I believe these samples will be safe as long as you''re around. Let''s get going, shall we?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 43, 'm9t', 'A Hopeful Prospector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 44, 'm9c', 'Well done, citizen. You''ve earned this reward. Now to get those samples analyzed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 45, 'm9e', 'Thank you for your efforts, friend. Your courage and skill have inspired me to study marksmanship. I will no longer live in fear.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 46, 'm10o', 'A zoology student studying the migration patterns of local insects decided to go off alone into the wilderness. Now I''ve just had a distress call from the worried parents. Could you locate and return this junior scientist?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 47, 'm10p', 'Are you here for me? I suppose I should return with you to keep my friends from worrying. I''ve learned so much about these delicate creatures. The insects, I mean.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 48, 'm10t', 'A Lost Zoologist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 49, 'm10c', 'Thanks, citizen. This student''s family can rest easier now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 50, 'm10e', 'You''ve been most helpful in getting me back. I was quite safe out there, but returning was something of an adventure. Take care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 51, 'm11o', 'A friend recently lost a pet neek when the little sauropod wandered off one night. My friend went searching for it and managed to get lost. Could you bring my friend back safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 52, 'm11p', 'Glad you showed up. I was starting to get worried. I''ll really miss that little neek. His name was Silky because his skin was so smooth. Do you have any pets?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 53, 'm11t', 'A Neek Owner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 54, 'm11c', 'Thanks for your help, friend. I guess I''ll have to buy my friend a new neek.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 55, 'm11e', 'Make sure you know where your pets are, my friend. Don''t let them wander away, and make sure they''re always happy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 56, 'm12o', 'My assistant was collecting herbs for me in the wilderness -- I only use the freshest ingredients in my dishes. The coward claims to have seen some predators lurking about and now refuses to come back unescorted. Could you be the escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 57, 'm12p', 'My life is worth more than the lousy wage I''m getting from this so-called chef. I didn''t want to come out here in the first place. Why can''t these chefs just buy herbs at the store like everyone else?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 58, 'm12t', 'Disgruntled Assistant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 59, 'm12c', 'My thanks, dear citizen. I''m afraid I''ve lost many assistants this way. But I just can''t bring myself to cook with store-bought herbs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 60, 'm12e', 'Thanks, friend. I think I''m going to look for another job. Cooking is just way too dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 61, 'm13o', 'My not-so-bright friend decided to impress the local Imperial recruiters by finding a Rebel outpost. All that was discovered was my friend''s lousy sense of direction. Could you bring Darth Compass back here in one piece?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 62, 'm13p', 'Did my friend send you to find me? Sheesh! How am I supposed to impress the Empire when my so-called "friends" keep embarrassing me like this?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 63, 'm13t', 'Darth Compass'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 64, 'm13c', 'Thanks for the safe escort. I hope my friend might reconsider military service. Moisture farming is a more likely future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 65, 'm13e', 'I''ll show them someday, you just watch. I''ll be accepted into the ranks of the Imperial scout troopers, and then they''ll all be sorry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 66, 'm14o', 'My buddy owed money to a swoop gang and fled town before the gangsters came to collect. Problem is, my buddy hid too well and got lost. Could you bring my friend home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 67, 'm14p', 'You haven''t been sent by that swoop gang, have you? I suppose you wouldn''t tell me if you were. Seems I have no choice. Okay, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 68, 'm14t', 'Hiding Out Too Well'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 69, 'm14c', 'Thanks much, citizen. I hope this will teach my buddy not to borrow money from less reputable sorts -- or anyone, for that matter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 70, 'm14e', 'I guess you were trustworthy after all. Thanks for seeing me safely home. Can I borrow fifty credits? I''m good for it, I swear.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 71, 'm15o', 'My friend crashed my T-16 out in the wilds somewhere. I believe it was in preparation for an Academy flight exam. My friend may be hurt. Could you find my buddy and act as escort back here?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 72, 'm15p', 'Wow! That was one heck of a thrill ride! I''m fine, really, but I appreciate the escort home. You ever fly a T-16? It''s quite an experience. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 73, 'm15t', 'Eager Academy Hopeful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 74, 'm15c', 'Thank goodness my friend is alive and well. You have my gratitude, citizen. Here''s a just reward for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 75, 'm15e', 'Thanks for accompanying me, friend. It''s good to know there are still good citizens out there. Take care.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 76, 'm16o', 'A xenoarchaeologist went searching for some ruins several days ago. Hunters claim to have seen dangerous predators in that same vicinity. We don''t want to be blamed for this scientist''s death. Could you escort this researcher back here?   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 77, 'm16p', 'I don''t see why they need me escorted back, I''m perfectly safe as you can see. But inasmuch as I didn''t find any Sith ruins, I suppose I might as well return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 78, 'm16t', 'Intrepid Archaeologist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 79, 'm16c', 'It''s good to see the scientist is still in one piece. Thanks for your help. This is for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 80, 'm16e', 'Thank you for the company. Have you ever considered going into xenoarchaeology? It''s very rewarding. Well, in some ways.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 81, 'm17o', 'A prospector went missing several days ago. We just received a distress call that might have come from this missing individual. Could you go out there and bring back anyone you find alive?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 82, 'm17p', 'Greetings, fella. Glad to see someone got my distress call. I think I found a vein of ash ore out here, and I needed someone to guard me and my samples on the way home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 83, 'm17t', 'Adventurous Prospector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 84, 'm17c', 'Thanks for finding the missing prospector, citizen. Let me pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 85, 'm17e', 'Thank you kindly, friend. If this turns out to be ash ore, I''ll make sure to have a drink in your honor when I sell my first shipment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 86, 'm18o', 'I''ve just received a distress call from a friend who''s gotten lost way outside town. The call came from these coordinates. If you''ll make the rescue, I''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 87, 'm18p', 'One moment I was tootling along, admiring the scenery -- the next, bewilderment! Mystery! Danger! Thank you, thank you for retrieving me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 88, 'm18t', 'Mystery! Danger!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 89, 'm18c', 'My friend can get lost on the way to the corner mission terminal. It''s a chore to keep up, but I''m glad people like you are around to do such chores.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 90, 'm18e', 'I feel more relaxed now. In fact, I''m getting hungry. I think I''ll visit a great new place I heard about, just a few klicks outside town.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 91, 'm19o', 'My child vanished long ago. Ever since, I''ve looked for clues. My investigator has just called from the wilderness. Will you escort the detective back here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 92, 'm19p', 'The child was lost in this vicinity, and now I''ve found evidence that Imperial stormtroopers were practicing marksmanship nearby. There might have been an accident.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 93, 'm19t', 'An Imperial Coverup'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 94, 'm19c', 'Imperial stormtroopers! They can''t hit the broad side of a battle cruiser! Oh, my poor child....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 95, 'm19e', 'Thank you for escorting me here. Sad, isn''t it? This kind of tragedy drives citizens who remember the Old Republic to take extreme measures.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 96, 'm20o', 'I''ve received a distress call from a lost child in the wilderness. Can you rescue the poor thing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 97, 'm20p', 'It''s true I''m not a child, but I figured saying so would get me faster service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 98, 'm20t', 'Don''t Cry Gundark'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 99, 'm20c', 'Is this the right person? I hate to see such frivolous attitudes toward emergency services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 100, 'm20e', 'It''s true I wasn''t in distress, but I did want a safe escort. I''m sure this person will pay you for your time, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 101, 'm21o', 'I''ve found a witness to the legendary exploits of the Twi''lek adventurer O-i. This will make my O-i documentary the sensation of HoloNet. Bring me the witness, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 102, 'm21p', 'I saw O-i float down the central air shaft of a Tibanna gas mine, firing as he went! He landed on a maintenance platform and took out a squad of stormtroopers! And then--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 103, 'm21t', 'A Tall Tale'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 104, 'm21c', 'I guess my friend talked your ear off the whole trip, eh? That O-i inspires fervent enthusiasm. Thank you, here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 105, 'm21e', 'And then O-i pulled a blaster and shot the AT-AT right in the forward sensor, blinding it. Then he climbed up on top and detached the head! You won''t believe what happened next--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 106, 'm22o', 'My buddy has worked out a scheme to clean up in the Mega-Millions Lottery on Trastino. I want in! I''ll pay you to bring my friend here so we can work out the details.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 107, 'm22p', 'My scheme involves -- well, I won''t give it all away here. But those lottery winnings are as good as ours!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 108, 'm22t', 'A Perfect Scheme'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 109, 'm22c', 'If you want to get in on this, just say the word and cough up the credits. Let''s see, 12,000 credits profit split three ways--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 110, 'm22e', 'I just need two million credits in seed money to buy a big bunch of tickets. Statistically, we''re likely to win at least 2.012 million!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 111, 'm23o', 'The recharge processes in my power cores have gone crazy. I hired a famous specialist, who got lost on the way here. Can you play guide? I''ll pay you. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 112, 'm23p', 'Each power core has its own idiosyncrasies -- its "personality," if you will. I shall endeavour to convey proper action to these cores.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 113, 'm23t', 'Power Core Whisperer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 114, 'm23c', 'Ah, you''ve brought the Power Core Whisperer! Thank you for being the guide. Here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 115, 'm23e', 'I thank you for guiding me on my mission to bring to all worlds the inner wisdom of power cores.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 116, 'm24o', 'At last the hunter I hired has brought down the anooba that plagued my lands. I hear the beast may have inflicted a wound or two, so please escort the wounded hero here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 117, 'm24p', 'Fortunately, I''m unwounded. That anooba''s dying scream was high and blood-curdling, but strangely satisfying, like the sound of landspeeder body welds popping as the garbage masher presses down.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 118, 'm24t', 'A Poetic Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 119, 'm24c', 'A fine effort -- by you and the hunter both! I look forward to hearing all about the creature''s death throes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 120, 'm24e', 'The beast''s carcass crashed to the ground with a wet thump, like a flowerpot cracking in a garbage masher. What a splendid sound.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 121, 'm25o', 'My hired researcher is ready to complete a report on the local flora, but the poor fool has got lost. Can you provide an escort -- or perhaps a rescue?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 122, 'm25p', 'I''ve found new evidence of the offworld origin of the perennial stinking gasbladder. Take me to my patron at once, if you please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 123, 'm25t', 'Gasbladder Researcher'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 124, 'm25c', 'With this data I can get a grant from the Imperial Environmental Preservation & Refocusing Authority to destroy all these noxious weeds. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 125, 'm25e', 'Too long has this world suffered under the onus of off-planet weeds and vermin. Soon, soon we shall be free of this blight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 126, 'm26o', 'My scout has finally surveyed the route of a new podracing course I want to build. I''ll pay you to escort the surveyor here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 127, 'm26p', 'This is not ideal terrain for podracing, to put it mildly. But sometimes you report what the client has hired you to report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 128, 'm26t', 'Podracing Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 129, 'm26c', 'I''m glad to see my podracing course is still "on track." Ha ha! I''ll relay the good news to my investors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 130, 'm26e', 'I expect only minimal fatalities from the new track. Of course, in podracing, that''s not really a good thing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 131, 'm27o', 'I hired a researcher to place weather sensors across the landscape, but now there''s too much equipment to carry alone. Can you offload some of the gear and bring it here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 132, 'm27p', 'I lost all my gear in a freak windstorm. The sensors probably predicted it, before they got blown away. Mind if I follow you back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 133, 'm27t', 'Help the Researcher'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 134, 'm27c', 'The art of weather prediction still awaits a breakthrough. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 135, 'm27e', 'With an influx of capital I could plant a whole new array of sophisticated weather sensors. Interested in investing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 136, 'm28o', 'I heard rumors of a crashed meteorite nearby. The scout I hired to find it has called in, but the transmission broke up. Please go to these coordinates and find the scout.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 137, 'm28p', 'I found the meteorite, or what was left of it. But residual radioactivity fried my comlink. Please take me back to my patron, and we''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 138, 'm28t', 'Scout for the Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 139, 'm28c', 'Radioactive meteorite? Hmm, that could be lucrative. I''ll send another scout. Maybe two. And some shielded droids.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 140, 'm28e', 'I think this mission shortened my life. I hope you weren''t caught in the danger zone yourself. Thanks, my patron has your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 141, 'm29o', 'A friend has been taking holographs of the countryside for an upcoming HoloNet release. I just got a distress call. I''ll pay you to get out there and rescue my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 142, 'm29p', 'The light has changed. Bah. Terrible. I''m frustrated, take me back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 143, 'm29t', 'Find the Artiste'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 144, 'm29c', 'My friend takes a rather cavalier attitude toward distress calls. Thanks, and sorry for the urgency.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 145, 'm29e', 'Distress calls are perfectly appropriate for an artist when work becomes impossible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 146, 'm30o', 'My friend, who went out into the wilderness several days ago, is now babbling over my comlink. Can you see if everything is all right, and if not, do escort duty back here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 147, 'm30p', 'Mother. Make the hurting stop. Bright lights, no, dark, it hurts my eyes. Where am I now? You. I follow you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 148, 'm30t', 'Heart of Darkness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 149, 'm30c', 'This was an ill-advised experiment in vision-questing, like the natives of some offworld cultures. I''ll take care of my trance-walking friend. Thanks for the rescue!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 150, 'm30e', 'Tired. Wanna sleep now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 151, 'm31o', 'I''m preparing a case in a high Imperial court about the detestable conditions in the countryside. My researcher has reported in, calling for an escort. Can I hire you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 152, 'm31p', 'My employer''s case involves deep legal principles that govern the demarcation of property. I expect this case will launch us into the legal history books!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 153, 'm31t', 'Aid Legal Principles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 154, 'm31c', 'Bad news. I''ve just learned the Emperor''s latest decree nullifies my argument. This is very bad for the Empire, I feel, but in the short term worse for my finances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 155, 'm31e', 'Well, it was a pleasant trip, tromping around the wilderness. I''ll submit my bill shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 156, 'm32o', 'My botanical researcher has just called from the wilderness with exciting news. If this discovery holds true, my fortune is assured! Please guard the discovery as my researcher conveys it here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 157, 'm32p', 'A chemical in these humble-looking plants promises to extend Wookiee lifespan by a decade or more. I shall be a hero to Wookiees everywhere!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 158, 'm32t', 'Assist Botanical Research'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 159, 'm32c', 'Uhh -- extending Wookiee lifespan? Don''t they already live for centuries? And how much of a market is there? Looks like my fortune isn''t yet assured (sigh).'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 160, 'm32e', 'Just you wait, those Wookiees will be tearing people''s arms off to get at this chemical!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 161, 'm33o', 'I''ve had droids out prospecting for mineral deposits, and one reported a good find, but then went silent. I hired someone to fix it, and now this person has just called, asking for an escort. Argh! Can you pick up my lost mechanic?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 162, 'm33p', 'The droid''s direction finders blew out, apparently in response to local radioactivity. I have its data records here, but I want an escort in case I get ambushed by greedy claim-jumpers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 163, 'm33t', 'Protect the Find'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 164, 'm33c', 'Hmm. Radioactivity! That might mean -- hmm. Yes. Well, in any case, here is your fee, goodbye.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 165, 'm33e', 'If I were you, I''d think about buying land somewhere around that area. You never know when it might become valuable. Thanks for the escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 166, 'm34o', 'My neighbor, a cruel savage, drove my purebred pet greysor out into the wilderness. I forced the barbarian to track it down and rescue it. But now it seems the rescuer needs rescuing, too. Can I trust you to bring back my greysor, and incidentally the fiend who drove it away?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 167, 'm34p', 'I found the animal, but it was kind of, uh, eaten. Partly eaten. Can you take me back now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 168, 'm34t', 'Poor Little Greysor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 169, 'm34c', 'This beast in sentient form has destroyed my beloved Whotti! Mark me, there will be a reckoning. To start with, this scoundrel will pay your rescue fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 170, 'm34e', 'Boy, you tie one little flaming torch to the tail of your neighbor''s pet, just for fun, and folks treat you like some kind of pariah. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 171, 'm35o', 'Listen, friend, I really need your help. A fellow soldier-of-fortune was separated from me as we daringly escaped the clutches of Trandoshan spies. But we must rendezvous once more, to continue our derring-do. Can you bring my stalwart companion back to me? Have a care, enemy agents are everywhere!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 172, 'm35p', 'Oh, you found my patient! I''m afraid I''m a better psychiatrist than I am a jailkeeper. Can you take me there? This delusion about derring-do has caused me no end of trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 173, 'm35t', 'Prolong the Derring-Do'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 174, 'm35c', 'At last I am reunited with my brave and noble companion! You have an air of adventure about you, as well. Care to join us as we travel the galaxy, righting wrongs?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 175, 'm35e', 'Excellent. Thanks for your help. I''ll get this "soldier-of-fortune" back to the mental infirmary right away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 176, 'm36o', 'Maybe you can help me. I just bought an R2 unit, but the darn thing won''t listen to anyone but its former owner. I can''t afford to have its memory flushed. Can you fetch the person who sold it to me so I can get it to obey me now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 177, 'm36p', 'My old R2 unit is still acting up, eh? That little droid has caused me a lot of trouble. I''ll see what I can do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 178, 'm36t', 'Ornery Little Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 179, 'm36c', 'I sure hope we can set that little droid straight. I''m about ready to blast it into a million pieces.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 180, 'm36e', 'I''ll see if I can convince my old R2 unit to obey its new master. These older-model astro-droids can get out of hand.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 181, 'm37o', 'A reporter from the local newsfeed is interviewing me today, but to discourage eavesdroppers I''ve arranged for a secret meeting. I need you to bring the reporter back here. If anyone tries to follow you, see if you can lose them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 182, 'm37p', 'A secret meeting. How exciting! I''ve been promised details about covert Imperial operations. This could be my big break!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 183, 'm37t', 'A Big Scoop'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 184, 'm37c', 'Now that I see what I''m getting into, I''m starting to have second thoughts. Thank you for the help, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 185, 'm37e', 'This interview could give a big boost to my career as a reporter. I hope it''s worth all this trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 186, 'm38o', 'My friend''s landspeeder broke down a fair distance from here. I''m afraid this is an unfamiliar area. Can you escort my poor, lost buddy to me? I can pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 187, 'm38p', 'Thanks. I should have known that old X-34 was on its last legs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 188, 'm38t', 'Unreliable Landspeeder'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 189, 'm38c', 'X-34 speeders run just fine, if you maintain them regularly. I''ll have to explain that to my friend. Thanks for the assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 190, 'm38e', 'Thanks for showing me the way. That''s the last time I buy a SoroSuub speeder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 191, 'm39o', 'My friend, who''s trying to become a public speaker, has practiced orating out in the wilderness. I''ve lined up a speaking job, but it''s very soon! Can you retrieve my friend in time for the engagement?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 192, 'm39p', 'I''ve vinn duffig by chigs iv tohnz to rrn ha to peeg mur keery. Oh-geh, lez guh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 193, 'm39t', 'Summon the Orator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 194, 'm39c', 'Wow, with cheeks swollen like that, the great orator looked like a voorpak preparing a nest for the winter. There''s still time to make the engagement. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 195, 'm39e', 'I said, I''ve been stuffing my cheeks with stones to learn how to speak more clearly. I may still need some practice. Thank you for the escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 196, 'm40o', 'I''ve been raising some offworld animals out in the wilderness, and my caretaker just sent a distress call. I don''t know what the problem is, but it sounds like someone needs to get out there and bring back an injured worker. Can you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 197, 'm40p', 'I started out on my own, then got weak and had to stop. I got bit by a dinko, nasty little thing with poisonous secretions. Can you get me to an antidote? Quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 198, 'm40t', 'Questionable Offworld Animals?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 199, 'm40c', 'Eh heh heh -- sounds like my worker is a bit delirious! I certainly expect nothing bad will happen here, haha! Please, take this fee with my compliments. Goodbye!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 200, 'm40e', 'We got those dinkos from Mytus IV, and should have left them there. Raising them on this world probably violates Imperial law. My head hurts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 201, 'm41o', 'I''ve sent a scout to look for sites for my new villa, but there''s been some kind of accident. Can you go out and bring back the scout? I''ll pay, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 202, 'm41p', 'My implanted directional locator got messed up when some kind of rogue bantha, or something, attacked me. Without the implant, I have no idea where I am.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 203, 'm41t', 'Those Pesky Rogue Banthas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 204, 'm41c', '"Rogue bantha"? I doubt that. I quarreled with this scout over service charges, and I suspect this little stunt is a way to get revenge. But thank you, anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 205, 'm41e', 'Glad you were around to get me back here. I''ll have to raise my rates to cover insurance against rogue bantha attacks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 206, 'm42o', 'I''m getting vague reports of some calamity out in the wilderness. I don''t know what to make of it. Can you investigate? If you find any survivors, can you bring them here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 207, 'm42p', 'I had a home right here! Some explosion blew it up while I was out walking -- maybe Empire artillery practice. I''ve lost everything! You want me to go where? Oh, okay, what have I got to lose?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 208, 'm42t', 'Wilderness Calamity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 209, 'm42c', 'I can interview this poor soul and sell the recording to a HoloNet broadcaster. The public loves these disaster stories. Don''t worry, I''ll split my fee with the subject.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 210, 'm42e', 'I don''t know where I''ll get the credits to rebuild that home. Where are we, the city? Hmm, maybe this is where I can rebuild my life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 211, 'm43o', 'My neighbor went hiking outside town to honor the 111th anniversary of the birth of some local wilderness guy. It''s been a while since we heard anything. Can you fetch back the happy wanderer before the weather turns real bad?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 212, 'm43p', 'This is the birth anniversary of Haum Chodah, who brought Imperial environmental regulations to this world. Seemed like a good excuse for a hike. But I''ll go back with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 213, 'm43t', 'Honor a Pioneer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 214, 'm43c', 'Haum Chodah. Whatever. I''m sorry to put you to this trouble, but I was worried about my neighbor, who can be scatterbrained. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 215, 'm43e', 'Haum Chodah started the local bureau of the Imperial Environmental Preservation & Refocusing Authority. His birth anniversary deserves commemoration, I say!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 216, 'm44o', 'I don''t know why my neighbor went out looking for mash-fungus, but the long absence is worrying me. I''ll pay you to go and rescue or escort my neighbor, as the case may be.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 217, 'm44p', 'I had a piercing pain behind my eye, and only extract of mash-fungus helps. Thank you for fetching me. I''m ready to go back now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 218, 'm44t', 'A Definitive Cure'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 219, 'm44c', 'Piercing pains are only part of my neighbor''s ailments. You''d be surprised there''s still a heartbeat, to listen to the recitation of ailments. Thank you for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 220, 'm44e', 'The pain is still throbbing behind my eye. And my ankle has a sharp, intermittent ache. And my feet are hurting like fire, but that''s only to be expected. And--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 221, 'm45o', 'Some of us tenants played a prank on our landlord, luring the heartless greedhead into the wilderness with a trumped-up story. Now we''re sorry, and we''d like to hire you to retrieve the wandering villain.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 222, 'm45p', 'They said the Empire had left a cache of power cores just lying in the dirt. And I believed them, the liars! When I get back home, grrr--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 223, 'm45t', 'A Prank Gone Sour'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 224, 'm45c', 'All the tenants chipped in to give you this fee. I expect it was badly spent, but most of us were planning to move anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 225, 'm45e', 'That''s it! The rent doubles starting tomorrow! Now I''m going home for a nice hot bath, and I don''t wish to be disturbed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 226, 'm46o', 'All the workers here hate our boss, so we sort of played a practical joke. It went wrong, and now the boss is lost outside town. Could you escort our boss back here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 227, 'm46p', 'I got a memo saying the Empire had accidentally left a supply cache out here, free for the taking. Well, I discovered something else my employees might not expect. Take me back to them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 228, 'm46t', 'A Mean Boss'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 229, 'm46c', 'Wow, the boss looks remarkably even-tempered. I figured we''d probably all be fired by now. Well, we''ll see. Thank you for your work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 230, 'm46e', 'I think this episode indicates a fundamental disconnect in my management style. Maybe I''ll hire a consultant to advise on how to open lines of communication.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 231, 'm47o', 'I got home and found that my roommate has gone out into the wilderness. Why? The note didn''t say. It''s unlike my roomie to do this, so could you go out and check what''s going on?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 232, 'm47p', 'I''ve been sampling environmental ambience for my new soundscape, "Bequeath the Skies to Ages Hence." I''m planning rapturous harmonies. But for now, I''m hungry, so you can lead me home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 233, 'm47t', 'A Musical Genius'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 234, 'm47c', 'Oh, one of those soundscapes. They sound like a gaggle of rawwks in a blast furnace. I''m glad it was nothing serious. Here, please accept this with my thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 235, 'm47e', 'My next project, "Noisy Latitudes of Imperial Ire," will use sounds sampled from the destruction of the Death Star! Ah, we''re home. Thank you, I must go compose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 236, 'm48o', 'My landlord went out hunting, but then got into danger. The distress call came in a while back, but I had to wash up and check my mail, so I''m a little late hiring someone to make the rescue. Are you interested? If not, I''ll keep checking around.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 237, 'm48p', 'I was training my new pack of purebred hunting nashtahs, imported from the finest kennel on Dra III. They stumbled on prey of unmitigated savagery, and I barely escaped with my life. What took you so long? Take me home!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 238, 'm48t', 'Rescue the Purebreds'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 239, 'm48c', 'You got back awfully fast. Hmm, no hunting beasts left? That''s a real shame. Is my landlord okay? Oh. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 240, 'm48e', 'I''m so glad to be back safe and sound! I swear, the predators here are fierce enough to chill a bounty hunter''s blood. I must order a new pack of nashtahs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 241, 'm49o', 'So? Is there any news? What, you aren''t from the research group? Sorry. I hired a group of young scholars to search the wilderness for native antiquities. They seem to have lost their datapads, or at any rate they''re not calling in. I''ll pay you to check on their last known coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 242, 'm49p', 'Well, you know, we just got to partying? And the next thing you know, we''re all going off together to be alone, you know? And I guess the rest are, uh, lost? Maybe you could take me back and, you know, work up a search party.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 243, 'm49t', 'Lovesick Young Scholars'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 244, 'm49c', 'That''s what I get for sending out young scholars without adequate supervision. I''ll arrange a search party. Meanwhile, here''s your fee, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 245, 'm49e', 'Hey, it''s great to get home, you know? I mean, alive?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 246, 'm50o', 'Where''s my surveyor? That lazy drifter was supposed to map out my new land purchase, but I''ve heard nothing for days. Can you check my land and see what''s happened?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 247, 'm50p', 'I mapped this whole area, but when I slept here overnight, something made off with my datadiscs and datapad. I''m glad you''ve come to lead me back to my patron.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 248, 'm50t', 'Lost Surveyor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 249, 'm50c', 'I feel like a teacher hearing, "The narglatch ate my homework." Will I never get this land surveyed? Here, you''re paid, go away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 250, 'm50e', 'Ahh, good to be back. Anything you need surveyed? I work cheap, except I''ll need an advance to buy new equipment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_neutral_medium.stf', 251, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A vital munitions depot was hit by an Imperial strike team. We sent an agent out to assess the damage but storm commandos were lying in wait. The timely arrival of Rogue Squadron allowed our wounded agent to escape. We need you to find this brave soldier and insure a safe return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Good to see you, friend. I was starting to think I was done for. I''m hit but it''s not bad. Let''s get back home as quickly as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'You helped save a fellow freedom fighter, citizen. Tha Alliance is proud to have agents like you. Accept this reward with our compliments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'Thanks, buddy. Not sure I would have made it without your help. Here''s hoping Rogue Squadron wiped out all those storm commandos.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Rescue the Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'The Imperials bombed one of our mining facilities. Fortunately the installation''s supervisor escaped with our security protocols and codes before probe droids could search the ruins. If you could locate the superivisor and get those codes back here safely, we''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Fancy meeting you here. Glad to see the Alliance hasn''t forgotten us lowly miners. Don''t worry, the codes are safe and sound. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Good work, citizen. We must make sure our codes are never compromised or else dozens of our bases would be sitting ducks for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'Thanks, friend. I hope next time we meet it''s under very different circumstances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Protect the Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'We intercepted an Imperial transmission warning of an imminent attack on an automated communications array. Fortunately, an engineer servicing a broken transponder was able to set the facility to self-destruct. We need you to make sure our engineer makes it back here safely.   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Hiya. Glad to see a friendly face. Looks like I underestimated the force of that explosion. Well, a trashed speeder bike is better than a trashed engineer, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Thanks for your help, citizen. Every single member of the Alliance is precious to us. Claim your just reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Much obliged for the escort, friend. Hope to see you again sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Collect the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'A newly formed cell wishes to personally discuss a recent supply request with our Procurement & Supply officer. They''re asking for an escort for their representative. Could you meet this individual and provide this service? The Alliance would be grateful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'My thanks for providing this escort. You never can be too careful with all these Imperial spies running around. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Our thanks, citizen. A job well done deserves a reward, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Allow me to thank you and congratulate you on being such an excellent escort. What was your name again, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Escort the Nervous Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A group of youngsters was targeted for termination by Imperials because the spunky youths had defaced some Imperial statues. We''ve managed to relocate most of them to various colonies but one of them wants to join our cell. Could you make sure this brave youngster makes it here with minimal distractions?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Hiya! Are you a pilot? Ever flown an X-wing? I''d like to do that someday. I''d be pretty good too. I bet I could even bring down Baron Fel.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Thanks, citizen. We appreciate your efforts. Like it or not, you serve as an example to many people. We hope you keep that in mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Hey thanks, friend. I hope we get to serve together someday. When next we meet, I''ll probably be a full fledged X-wing pilot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Inspire the Young'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'A local merchant refused to cooperate with Imperials and lost a nice shop as a result. We''ve offered asylum and need someone to escort this unfortunate back here. Think you could help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'Greetings. Thank you for escorting me. I suppose I see the need for disguise but I sure do feel strange in these clothes. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'We''ll put this citizen to good use, thanks. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'I appreciate the escort, citizen. I''ll do my part to make sure the Empire collapses and the Republic is restored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Help the Former Shopkeeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Our contacts within the Corporate Sector Authority helped us secure the release of an important Alliance officer who had been sent to the spice mines of Kessel. Our officer was reported killed during a mining accident. We need you to make sure this "deceased" ally gets here without attracting too much attention. Think you can handle that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I look pretty lively for a corpse, huh? Let''s hope you can get me back before I start to stink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll make sure our officer receives a funeral with full military honors. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Thanks, buddy. I hope you''ll stick around for the wake. There''s bound to be plenty of spirits in attendance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Transport a Living Corpse'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'A former senator wanted by Imperial Intelligence has managed to elude patrols and now needs to be escorted back here to be reunited with family. This dignitary will be in disguise, of course, so be on the lookout. Can the Alliance count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'Are you from the Alliance? I suppose that''s a dumb thing to ask a stranger. Sorry, I''m new to all this. If you''re my escort, then lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'We appreciate your prompt return, citizen. The senator has information vital to our survival. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'I do hope I didn''t come across as a complete buffoon. You have my deepest thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Protect the Senator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'We need someone with patience and a sense of humor for this mission. We''ve decided to grant asylum to a harmless lunatic who claims to be the Emperor. The Imperials have already tried to assassinate this poor wretch multiple times. Perhaps fortunate favors the mad? Think you can collect this individual and return here? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'It''s about time you arrived, my young apprentice. It is not good to keep your Emperor waiting. As you can see, I have adopted an appropriate disguise. And now, lead me to the very heart of the Rebellion where I can assure it will be crushed and you will become one of us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'We appreciate your patience, citizen. We''ll take "His Imperial Highness" from here. Here''s a little something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'You have done well, my young apprentice. In time, I will seek you out and then you shall come before me. I have foreseen it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Escort the Emperor (honest)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'A former Black Sun operative has decided to share privileged information with the Alliance in exchange for asylum. We need you to collect this individual and return here. The operative is disguised so you shouldn''t have too much trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'How do I know you''re really from the Alliance? Tell you what, you lead the way and I''ll follow close behind. Don''t forget I have a blaster and I know how to use it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Thank you, citizen. We appreciate your patience and professionalism. Collect your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'Well I guess you turned out to be okay. In my line of work, you never can be too careful. Know what I mean?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Protect the Black Sun Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'Some old droidekas fell into our hands not long ago. Not many techs have worked with them before so we called in an expert in antique technology. We need you to pick up and escort this specialist back here. Can you do that for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Yeah, I''ve worked with a lot of older model droids. Bit of a hobby for me, I suppose. But I tell you, they sure don''t make droidekas like they used to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'Thanks, citizen. We can''t really afford to treat anything we get as junk. If it still works, we''ll find something to do with it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Are you interested in older technology? I sure would like to get my hands on a lightsaber. Let me know if you ever hear about one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Fix the Droidekas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'We''ve gotten word of another pilot wishing to make contact with the Alliance. This individual has been cleared by Intelligence and now we need you to provide an escort back here. Can the Alliance count on you?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'Thanks for serving as my guide. I didn''t think it was necessary but the Alliance felt transmitting the coordinates to me via the HoloNet was too risky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. Pilots are worth their weight in Jorallan pearls to the Alliance. Here''s a reward for your services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'I appreciate your help, citizen. People like you make it clear that I''ve made the right decision.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Guide the Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'One of the agents we planted deep within the Imperial Security Bureau recently had their cover blown. We''ve managed to get this agent this far without alerting Imperial Intelligence and now need you to escort this individual back here. Keep alert for the presence of suspicious folk. They will likely be Imperial spies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'I appreciate your assistance, citizen. I have quite a few secrets to share with High Command. Let''s get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'Good work, citizen. This agent spent years inside the ISB and possesses information of significant value. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'I was glad we managed to avoid any major Imperial entanglements. You sure do know your stuff, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Save the ISB Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'One of our agents has information regarding a possible Imperial strike against Mon Calamari. We need you to escort this courier back here safely so we can conduct a debriefing and get this information to Admiral Ackbar as soon as possible. Please hurry. Millions of Mon Calamari lives are depending on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'The sooner we get back to base, friend, the better. The Empire intends to make the Mon Calamari pay for their aid to the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, citizen. We''ll get this information to our Mon Calamari contacts immediately. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thanks for getting me here safely. I''ll mention your role in all of this to Admiral Ackbar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Save the Mon Calamari'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'A Corporate Sector Authority Viceprex who has aided the Alliance has just arrived on the planet. The Empire is now aware of this individual''s activities and we have to ensure the Viceprex''s safety. Please serve as an escort and return this patriot unharmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'My thanks, citizen. I knew it was only a matter of time before Imperial Intelligence sniffed me out. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. This Viceprex was responsible for saving many lives and helping fund over a dozen Alliance operations against Imperial targets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'I would do it all the same, citizen, if I had it to do over again. I just wish I''d been able to save a few more lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Rescue the Viceprex'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'An Alliance courier carries an important message for Commander Skywalker that must be hand-delivered. We need you to escort the courier back here safely so we can make sure the rest of their journey goes swiftly and uneventfully. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'Let''s get moving, citizen. Commander Skywalker needs to know that Lord Vader himself searches the galaxy for him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll take it from here. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'I''ll mention your role in this to Commander Skywalker, citizen. Courage should never go unrewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'An Important Message for Commander Skywalker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence uses biological agents to combat anti-Imperial demonstrations. A physician''s assistant has arrived on this planet carrying a newly engineered retrovirus against these biotoxins. Please make sure this individual gets back here safely and make sure nothing happens to that retrovirus.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'Glad you could make it, friend. We have no time to lose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Congratulations, citizen. I knew we could count on you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'The Empire is not above poisoning an entire planet just to prove a point. Their monstrous tactics will prove their undoing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure the Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'The Bothans have set up SpyNet installations for us all over this world, under various "op-front" disguises. We just heard that the Empire took out an op-front in the wilderness. One staffer got away and needs safe escort back here. I''d like you to go. Don''t necessarily expect a Bothan; all kinds of folks staff those listening posts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'A squad of assault troopers fell from the sky and blew up the listening post. It took about six seconds. I happened to be offsite walking my greysor. The greysor ran off. Now I''m really depressed. Let''s go back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'The Empire has been cracking down on SpyNet installations. We''ll need to find better camouflage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'Many Bothans died to build that op-front. I need a drink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'Bothan SpyNet Post Attacked'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'One of our agents on Coruscant has been compromised and is now fleeing Imperial pursuit. The latest report we have is that stormtroopers killed the agent''s Alliance escorts, but the troopers all died as well. Please get out there and rescue that agent, who''s wandering alone. We don''t like to leave our people helpless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'Thank you for rescuing me. I''m not scared. I knew the risks when I infiltrated the ISB. If I die, I know I''ve spent my life well, doing good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'It''s an amazing feat, sending us inside data about Imperial Center under the very noses of the Imperials. This agent deserves to live to see better times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I think the strain of the last few years has already shortened my life, but I''m not eager to cut it even shorter. Thanks for helping me out of a bad spot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Evacuate Coruscant Infiltrator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'A former senator has unfailingly aided the Alliance. Now the Empire has targeted him and his family for termination. We''ve smuggled each of the family members off their homeworld individually, and we''ll reunite them later. One has just made landfall here. The report I got doesn''t name the family member. Can you escort him or her here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'I miss my family, but I''m not worried. I''m glad to see that the Alliance recruits such obviously capable supporters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Thanks, that''s good. We''ll handle the debriefing from here. Please don''t tell anyone about this, because the Empire is still hunting the whole family.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'Will I get to see the rest of my family soon? I haven''t even learned where we''re all going. When do I find out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Rescue Senator''s Family Member'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'After a close brush with an Imperial termination squad in the Corporate Sector Authority, a Viceprex sympathetic to the Alliance has gone on the run. The Viceprex has just arrived here, ahead of a bounty hunter, and wound up way out in the wilderness. We''d like you to bring the executive here safely. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'Thank you! I never expected to see a friendly face out here -- or, well, ever again. I used to run whole planets, but now my CSA career is blown. I still don''t know if I did the right thing. Well, you''d better get me to safety before this Alliance uniform starts to chafe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'The few CSA Viceprexes who help the Alliance have brought us priceless access to cargo and Imperial intelligence. We need to protect them all as best we can. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'I just realized I lost all my retirement accounts too. Well, I suppose there are still business opportunities in the Outer Rim. Aren''t there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Escort Corporate Viceprex Ally'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'The Empire plans to release a deadly airborne virus during Core World protests against the Emperor. Alliance scientists have developed a retrovirus that could prevent thousands of deaths. An agent carrying the retrovirus needs a safe escort here for transport offworld. Can you go quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'I''m carrying the retrovirus in a subcutaneous implant. I''m itching like crazy! We should go fast before I break out in a rash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'This brave agent will bring vital protection to ten thousand innocent opponents of the Emperor. Thank you, thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I feel like I''m getting hives. Or shingles. I sure hope I reach the Core Worlds before I get an allergy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Alliance Agent Carrying Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'An Imperial official from Coruscant has defected to the Alliance. I don''t know anything yet about this official''s identity or position -- it''s all hush-hush. The official has arrived here, landing in the wilderness to evade pursuit. I''d like you to retrieve this Imperial defector and escort him or her, or it, safely here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'I was the Empire''s Deputy Assistant Restraining Bolt Replacement Procurement Officer for Outer Rim Territory 2445-C. I couldn''t stand one more moment being an instrument of evil (sob)! At least I''ve got these new clothes now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Well, I suppose any information about Imperial procedures may help our cause. Somehow. Thanks, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'I''ll supply you with every detail of the Imperial restraining bolt replacement procurement process. I''m helping to fight for freedom! May the Force be with me!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Pick up Imperial Defector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'Incom has designed an experimental new starfighter called the "A-wing." Supposed to be a seriously interesting ship. A courier was carrying the plans to our secret factory, but crash-landed here while trying to shake the Imperial Security Bureau. We need you to bring back the courier safely. Fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'Oh, am I glad to see you! The ISB would pull an Alderaan to get their hands on this design. Can you escort me now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Good job! I''ll arrange transport offworld for our courier friend -- with appropriate security, you can be sure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'The A-wing will be the fastest starfighter in the galaxy, once we lick the stabilizer-wing problem. And about three thousand other problems, actually. Thanks for the escort!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'A-Wing Plan Carrier Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'We''re mounting a raid on an Imperial supply depot. The strike team commander has just gotten briefed at a secret location and is ready to lead the raid. But first we need to get the commander here safely. Can you be the escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'I''m supposed to fly some complicated new flight plan we just got from Intelligence. If you could run interference on the way back while I study the maneuvers, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Wouldn''t that have been embarrassing, if a top Alliance pilot got taken out on the way to liftoff. Thanks for preventing that particular setback.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 149, 'm25e', '"Then Red Team executes an Ackbar Slash through the enemy''s center line..." Wow, I hope the Force is with us today... Are we here? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Strike Commander Heading to Depot Raid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'An Alliance Psychological Operations officer is working on fomenting more tension among Lord Vader''s admirals. The more dissension and distrust we create, the less effective the Imperial Navy becomes. We need you to escort the Psych Ops officer here for transport to an offworld training facility.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'You''re a little short for an Alliance soldier. Are you sure I''m the one you''re here to meet? Wait, I know you -- I heard your friends say that you -- no, never mind. No, not important. Really. Let''s go. --No, really, you don''t want to know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'You look a little rattled -- did the Psych officer decide to practice on you during the trip? Thanks, we''ll take over from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'By the way, you''ve got something sticky on your foot. Ha, made you look! Just kidding. Thanks, and you know I mean that sincerely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Psych Operations Officer Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'General Carlist Rieekan has been searching for a new Alliance base site since the Empire blockaded Yavin 4. His aide has assembled scouting reports for this world and the surrounding sector. Due to the sensitivity of this data, the aide is hand-delivering it to General Rieekan. Your job is to escort the aide here for safe departure offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'Yes, I''m General Rieekan''s aide. Before joining the Alliance, I used to scout worlds for the Corporate Sector Authority. I must say, this world has some interesting features. Shall we go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Whatever this officer has to say, I''m sure General Rieekan will be interested. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I''m seeing possibilities on this world, not just for an Alliance base, but in the longer term, a tourist resort. What do you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'General Rieekan''s Staffer Requests Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We have a report that the Imperials found one of our undercover agents. The agent jumped a shuttle in an escape pod and landed here in the wilderness. The bad news is, there''s apparently a bounty hunter on the trail, sent by the Empire. We need to get the agent back here to safety. Can you move quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'Lord Vader has assembled an elite group of bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. I don''t know much about it. But I think one of them is after me, so we should go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'Well, bounty hunter or not, this agent needs to be smuggled offworld pronto. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'Okay, I''ve calmed down. I think the Scourge Column is supposed to hunt really tough targets. I don''t see how that would include me. Maybe I was imagining things.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bounty Hunter Pursuing Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'A local community leader is apparently being hunted by stormtroopers. The report I got is light on details -- apparently this person organized anti-Imperial sentiment among local youth organizations. Can you check out this report? Maybe you should just bring the leader back here, and we''ll decide what to do next.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'I distributed Alliance-issue cannisters of enamel to local children, who used it to paint mustaches on the Emperor''s statues. Those stormtroopers didn''t like that. I barely escaped my house before they blew it up!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'Like I didn''t have enough to worry about already. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I also distributed stinkbombs, issued straight from your Alliance, mind you, for the locals to throw at COMPNOR loyalty parades. I deserve protection!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Community Leader Escaping Stormtroopers');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'We had a lot of shipping mistakes and communication errors a while back. It took us a while to trace them to a rogue slicer out to have fun. Well, guess what -- we recruited that talented slicer into the Alliance. We need you to retrieve the slicer from the wilderness rendezvous point and provide escort duty back here. Okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Wild. I never went offworld before. It was juicy. Of course, I used to screw up shipping manifests and passenger lists, just for grins. Wow, I''m really a Rebel now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'One more valiant warrior in the battle for freedom. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'Now that I''m a Rebel, I can still mess up the shipping schedules, right? Only just the bad-guy ships now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Data Slicer Joining Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'The local Imperial garrison just granted extended leave for many stormtroopers. Our agents plan to get close -- very close -- to these off-duty soldiers. One agent is returning from a mission in the wilderness and needs an escort. Can you go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'Okay, you''re here to take me to a cantina full of drunken troopers. Gee, look at me tremble with anticipation. Lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'Thanks. This isn''t the noblest Alliance endeavour, but you have to find intelligence where you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I''m not looking forward to this, but it should be productive. After a few drinks these troopers tell you their mission, their defenses, and their sarge''s middle name. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Agent Needs Escort to Off-Duty Imperials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'There''s trouble. An Imperial TIE fighter engineer is defecting to our side. The escort team crash-landed on this planet to escape a Star Destroyer, and a stormtrooper ground patrol attacked them. We lost everyone except the engineer. Quick, head out and find the engineer, then give safe escort back here. Please hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'This has been a nightmare. But even if the Empire gets me, I don''t regret my decision. I''m willing to die for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'This is great work! Our new friend has volunteered to tell us a great deal about Lord Vader''s experimental TIE fighter and other advanced ships. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My work has indirectly led to the oppression of billions. I can''t live with that any more. I want to undo the evil I''ve helped perpetuate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Sienar Systems Defector Requires Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'With the Imperial Army refusing to enlist nonhuman species, the Alliance has a chance to turn this bigotry to good effect. One of our diplomats has been meeting with Duro leaders, trying to get them to join us. The diplomat is stopping here en route to High Command to make a report. Will you bring the official here from the landing point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It''s been a challenging trip, with Imperial ships dogging us all along. I had to leave my ship via escape pod to reduce the danger to my allies. I appreciate your escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'These diplomatic missions can be dangerous. Thanks for bringing the official here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It remains to be seen whether the Duro will join the Alliance. I suspect they are too diffuse and independent. But we must keep trying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Alien Affairs Diplomat Delivering Report'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'General Airen Cracken''s smugglers -- I mean "procurement specialists" -- are getting jumpy because of Imperial attention. One of them plans to deliver medical supplies here, but wants to scout out the place first. The "specialist" asked for just one escort, not a squad. Can you do the job? Try to, uh, look harmless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I asked for just one guard. I want to be sure there''s no funny business here. As in "those funny Imperials." Get me? Okay, lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'Once this procurement specialist sees there''s nothing to worry about, we should get the medical supplies pretty soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'Hold on -- I just want to check over that way -- okay, okay -- and anything under here? No. Okay, this may work, this may work. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 204, 'm34t', '"Procurement Specialist" Wants Guide'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'A special Alliance operative is hiding beyond the city borders. I need you to deliver these new, coded instructions: "Echo Roger Bravo dash Twelve." It''s urgent that you get there immediately. Go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 206, 'm35p', '"Bravo dash Twelve?" That''s outrageous! This is a "dash Eleven" situation if there ever was one. Take me back to your contact. We''ve got to have a chat about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 208, 'm35c', '"Dash Twelve," "dash Eleven," what''s the difference? At least we''re not saying "dash Thirteen." That would have been absurd.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 209, 'm35e', '"Bravo dash Twelve" indeed! What kind of operation is this? It''s "dash Eleven" or I''m off the case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Secret Instructions for a Field Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'We''ve got an agent in the field investigating claims of an Imperial massacre. We dare not send any shuttles or transmissions to the area. Can you sneak out there and check up on our investigator''s progress? Alliance High Command is very interested in this information. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Good, you''re here. I''ve found blaster scorching on the ground all around here. I''d estimate the Empire executed twenty or thirty civilians, not more than a week ago. I need to report this to Alliance High Command. Can get me back undetected?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'You did well. I''ll mention you by name in my report to High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Thank you greatly. Now I can get this evidence of the Imperial massacre to Alliance High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Check Up on an Alliance Investigator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'We''ve set up a portable listening station away from the city, to eavesdrop on Imperial communications. I want you to get out there and relieve the current operator for awhile. Try not to send any transmissions along the way. We don''t want the authorities to find us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I''m glad you''re here. The Imperial patrols started using an unknown scramble code less than an hour ago. I think they know about my listening device. We''ve got to get back to safety before they track us down. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'And thanks from me as well. The Alliance needs good agents like you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'That was close. I was afraid we might get nabbed by Imperial patrols. Thanks for the help, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Assist an Alliance Eavesdropper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'One of our transports had a close call with some TIE fighters. The ship crashed but the pilot ejected to safety in time. You''d better get out there and bring''em back before the planetside Imperial forces start combing the area. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Thank goodness you found me. I can''t believe I was shot down by a couple of junk-heap TIE fighters. Let''s get out of this place before we''re caught.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'Sometimes the Empire will get the upper hand. It happens. Both of you did your jobs well. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'Thank you for the escort. I still can''t believe I couldn''t dodge those TIE fighters. My dogfighting skills are getting rusty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Retrieve a Stranded Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'There''s an Imperial mine field outside of town. We sent an agent to neutralize these hidden explosives, but all we''ve heard back is a distress signal. Can you head out there to see what''s going on? Oh, and be careful where you step. We suspect it''s a very dense mine field.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'I can''t believe you just crossed the mine field with no scanning equipment! I had a power surge in my comlink that fried my sensor and I''ve been afraid to move for an hour. Well, no sense postponing it any longer. Let''s get out of this mess before the Imperial patrols fly over. If you pray to any deities on your homeworld, now''s the time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Good work. You''ve got a future in mine sweeping, if you would care to join our ranks. We''ve always got new openings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Unbelievable! We made it through the mine field without a scratch. That''s twice you managed it. Are you sure you''re not Force-sensitive?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Extract an Alliance Minesweeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'An Alliance spy has arrived from offworld to debrief us about some findings on Klatooine. A secret transport dropped the spy far from the city''s sensors. I want a clandestine extraction. The task falls to you. Bring our spy back here and let''s find out what''s happening on Klatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'You''re my escort? Good. Let''s move quietly. I''ve got some interesting information that I''m sure the Empire wants to stifle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Droid bombs? Very interesting. I wonder if the Alliance could undercut the Empire and get ahold of them?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 239, 'm40e', 'I''m glad we made it here alive. Thanks. Now I can tell you about the droid bombs that some Klatooinan engineers are trying to sell to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort an Alliance Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'We sent two agents to sabotage an Imperial orbital refinery. They were supposed to rendezvous with us afterward for debriefing, but our pickup team did not find them. I need you to go to the meeting point and see if they''ve arrived yet. Be on the lookout for Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'Sorry for the delay. We were nearly caught by an Imperial boarding crew. My partner died, but we wiped out those dogs! Now I just want to get back home, make my report and have a long rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'No rest yet, I''m afraid. Alliance Command says we need to hit another refinery. Don''t worry, the Force will give you strength.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Boy, am I glad to be back. Our sabotage was successful. The Imperial Navy in this system will be short on stellar fuel for awhile. Now I just want to get some rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Escort a Rebel Saboteur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'We''ve got a meeting with an artillery expert, but Imperial patrols have stepped up in this area. The expert is stuck between cities. Go out there, make sure there''s no Imperial trouble and let''s get this meeting back on schedule.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'Let''s not waste any time. This area is crawling with stormtroopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Ion cannons against Star Destroyers? That is interesting. We could use that kind of artillery support for planetary evacuation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'That was too close. Thank you for the help. I''ve got some interesting information about the effectiveness of ion cannons against Star Destroyers. Time for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist an Alliance Artillery Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'One of our new operatives came from a slicing background. We took advantage of this expertise to sabotage an experimental droid project that the Empire has started on Klatooine. Reprogrammed droids can be a powerful ally. Our slicer has just returned and I need you to provide an escort back here. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I can''t wait to make this report. I reprogrammed an experimental droid starfighter for independent thought. Now that crazy robot is winging through the galaxy, evading TIE fighters and hunting down the scientists who built it. Boy, do I love my work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Sometimes slicers are a little too creative. Never mind, I''ll reserve judgment until I hear the full report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 257, 'm43e', '... and after the droid starfighter wipes out the scientists who created it, I programmed it to fly to the outlying systems and help fight Imperial expansion forces. I can''t wait to hear how well it does.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Alliance Slicer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'We''ve lost an intelligence agent! The Imperials must have learned about this secret mission. Get out to the rendezvous point as fast as you can and see if there''s any sign of what happened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'I thought you''d never get here! I''ve been hiding from Imperial squads for the last three hours. Lucky for us, the coast is clear right now. Let''s get out of here before they come back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'Excellent work. You''re a true asset to the Alliance, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I thought I was a goner out there. Thanks for bringing me back safely. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Find an Alliance Intelligence Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'We''ve got trouble. An engineer of ours just landed on the planet. An Imperial patrol has the whole area pinned down and I fear the worst. Aerial support is on the way, but they won''t get there for awhile. Do you think you''re skilled enough to lend a hand?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'The Imperials just left! I don''t know what happened. One second they were firing at me and the next all was clear. Something''s going on. I don''t want to stick around to find out what it is. Let''s move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'That was too close. High Command is really interested in this report. Say, do you smell something strange? Ah, it was probably nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'I''m glad we got out of there in one piece. I sure hope the Imperials didn''t track us or something. Anyway, now I can make my report about the ISB''s use of poison gasses against Alliance troops on Cularin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Escort a Rebel Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'A secret Alliance transport came down outside the city. We sent a crew to clean up the mess, but we had to leave quick when the authorities showed up. Unfortunately we left one of the rescue team behind. Our scanners give us the all clear, but we don''t want to risk flying in just yet. Can you hoof it out there and make sure our comrade gets back safely? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'I thought I''d left combat behind when I signed up for the rescue team. Now here I am on the battlefield again. Just my luck. Let''s get back and I''ll buy you a drink to thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'Yes, you guessed it. Another transport came down just before you two got here. The rescue crew is heading out again. The struggle for galactic freedom never ends.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'Uh-oh. I recognize that look in my commander''s eyes. Guess we''ll have to save that drink for another day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Escort Alliance Rescue Personnel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'We have a project underway to map hyperspace supply lines between major Alliance star clusters. A logistics expert has arrived on the planet to confer about this matter. How would you like to rendezvous with this newcomer and bring them back here? I''m not even sure what they look like, but I do have the coordinates of their secret dropoff point. Better arm yourself for the trip, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Hi. I''m the logistics expert. Are you my escort? Good. I was worried that the Empire might have discovered these coordinates and sent a spy. Please take me to your commanders now. Long live the Rebellion! Um, I mean, the Alliance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'But of course! What a pleasure it is to meet such a courteous and motivated agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'So this is one of your larger bases in the star system? Excellent. Please show me everything. I am most interested to see your operation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Help Out an Alliance Logistics Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'We''re honored to have one of the Alliance''s top pilots pay us a visit. I want you to head out to the rendezvous point and provide an escort back here. I''ll show the captain around. Maybe we''ll get a new star pilot for our local squadron!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Dropped off in the middle of nowhere. What a welcome this is. If you''re my contact, I hope you''ve got something good to show me about Alliance operations in this system. So far I''m not very impressed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''m very excited to meet such a famous star pilot! Please, captain, if there''s anything I can do to make you feel at home, just ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'The operation isn''t much to see, I grant you, but you never told me there were such dashing and attractive officers here! I don''t suppose you can introduce us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Retrieve an Ace Fighter Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'Some kind of huge Imperial gunship had us pinned down outside of town! I''ve never seen that kind of vessel before. Nearly blasted us to pieces. I got separated from my buddy and barely made it back here. My friend is still out there. I have the coordinates from the distress beacon, but I''m too banged up to manage a rescue. Can you handle it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Am I glad to see you! That weird Imperial gunship has buzzed the area every half hour since the fight. Let''s get out of here before it comes back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'The report can wait. I''m just glad to see you alive. And thank you, my new friend, for performing the rescue I couldn''t.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'I could swear that new gunship looks like it''s amphibious. What''s the Empire up to, anyway? I''ll have to file a report on this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Rescue a Stranded Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'When a turbolaser explodes, the results are not pretty. We lost some mercenaries outside of town when a stolen turbo blew up without warning. Their Alliance liaison is still alive, though. I need to you get out there quickly and fetch our agent back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'Thank goodness you''re here. I couldn''t get much farther on my own. Imperial patrols are bound to investigate the turbolaser explosion and I want to be as far away from the blast site as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'I''m just glad that you got back alive. We can find other turbolasers, but there''s only one of you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'The more I think about it, the more I believe the Empire must have rigged that turbolaser to explode. Why else would it blow up like that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_easy.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Fetch an Alliance Liaison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A vital munitions depot was hit by an Imperial strike team. We sent an agent out to assess the damage but storm commandos were lying in wait. The timely arrival of Rogue Squadron allowed our wounded agent to escape. We need you to find this brave soldier and insure a safe return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Good to see you, friend. I was starting to think I was done for. I''m hit but it''s not bad. Let''s get back home as quickly as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'You helped save a fellow freedom fighter, citizen. Tha Alliance is proud to have agents like you. Accept this reward with our compliments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'Thanks, buddy. Not sure I would have made it without your help. Here''s hoping Rogue Squadron wiped out all those storm commandos.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Rescue the Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'The Imperials bombed one of our mining facilities. Fortunately the installation''s supervisor escaped with our security protocols and codes before probe droids could search the ruins. If you could locate the superivisor and get those codes back here safely, we''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Fancy meeting you here. Glad to see the Alliance hasn''t forgotten us lowly miners. Don''t worry, the codes are safe and sound. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Good work, citizen. We must make sure our codes are never compromised or else dozens of our bases would be sitting ducks for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'Thanks, friend. I hope next time we meet it''s under very different circumstances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Protect the Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'We intercepted an Imperial transmission warning of an imminent attack on an automated communications array. Fortunately, an engineer servicing a broken transponder was able to set the facility to self-destruct. We need you to make sure our engineer makes it back here safely.   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Hiya. Glad to see a friendly face. Looks like I underestimated the force of that explosion. Well, a trashed speeder bike is better than a trashed engineer, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Thanks for your help, citizen. Every single member of the Alliance is precious to us. Claim your just reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Much obliged for the escort, friend. Hope to see you again sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Collect the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'A newly formed cell wishes to personally discuss a recent supply request with our Procurement & Supply officer. They''re asking for an escort for their representative. Could you meet this individual and provide this service? The Alliance would be grateful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'My thanks for providing this escort. You never can be too careful with all these Imperial spies running around. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Our thanks, citizen. A job well done deserves a reward, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Allow me to thank you and congratulate you on being such an excellent escort. What was your name again, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Escort the Nervous Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A group of youngsters was targeted for termination by Imperials because the spunky youths had defaced some Imperial statues. We''ve managed to relocate most of them to various colonies but one of them wants to join our cell. Could you make sure this brave youngster makes it here with minimal distractions?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Hiya! Are you a pilot? Ever flown an X-wing? I''d like to do that someday. I''d be pretty good too. I bet I could even bring down Baron Fel.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Thanks, citizen. We appreciate your efforts. Like it or not, you serve as an example to many people. We hope you keep that in mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Hey thanks, friend. I hope we get to serve together someday. When next we meet, I''ll probably be a full fledged X-wing pilot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Inspire the Young'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'A local merchant refused to cooperate with Imperials and lost a nice shop as a result. We''ve offered asylum and need someone to escort this unfortunate back here. Think you could help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'Greetings. Thank you for escorting me. I suppose I see the need for disguise but I sure do feel strange in these clothes. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'We''ll put this citizen to good use, thanks. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'I appreciate the escort, citizen. I''ll do my part to make sure the Empire collapses and the Republic is restored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Help the Former Shopkeeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Our contacts within the Corporate Sector Authority helped us secure the release of an important Alliance officer who had been sent to the spice mines of Kessel. Our officer was reported killed during a mining accident. We need you to make sure this "deceased" ally gets here without attracting too much attention. Think you can handle that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I look pretty lively for a corpse, huh? Let''s hope you can get me back before I start to stink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll make sure our officer receives a funeral with full military honors. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Thanks, buddy. I hope you''ll stick around for the wake. There''s bound to be plenty of spirits in attendance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Transport a Living Corpse'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'A former senator wanted by Imperial Intelligence has managed to elude patrols and now needs to be escorted back here to be reunited with family. This dignitary will be in disguise, of course, so be on the lookout. Can the Alliance count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'Are you from the Alliance? I suppose that''s a dumb thing to ask a stranger. Sorry, I''m new to all this. If you''re my escort, then lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'We appreciate your prompt return, citizen. The senator has information vital to our survival. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'I do hope I didn''t come across as a complete buffoon. You have my deepest thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Protect the Senator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'We need someone with patience and a sense of humor for this mission. We''ve decided to grant asylum to a harmless lunatic who claims to be the Emperor. The Imperials have already tried to assassinate this poor wretch multiple times. Perhaps fortunate favors the mad? Think you can collect this individual and return here? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'It''s about time you arrived, my young apprentice. It is not good to keep your Emperor waiting. As you can see, I have adopted an appropriate disguise. And now, lead me to the very heart of the Rebellion where I can assure it will be crushed and you will become one of us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 51, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'We appreciate your patience, citizen. We''ll take "His Imperial Highness" from here. Here''s a little something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'You have done well, my young apprentice. In time, I will seek you out and then you shall come before me. I have foreseen it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Escort the Emperor (honest)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'A former Black Sun operative has decided to share privileged information with the Alliance in exchange for asylum. We need you to collect this individual and return here. The operative is disguised so you shouldn''t have too much trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'How do I know you''re really from the Alliance? Tell you what, you lead the way and I''ll follow close behind. Don''t forget I have a blaster and I know how to use it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Thank you, citizen. We appreciate your patience and professionalism. Collect your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'Well I guess you turned out to be okay. In my line of work, you never can be too careful. Know what I mean?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Protect the Black Sun Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'Some old droidekas fell into our hands not long ago. Not many techs have worked with them before so we called in an expert in antique technology. We need you to pick up and escort this specialist back here. Can you do that for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Yeah, I''ve worked with a lot of older model droids. Bit of a hobby for me, I suppose. But I tell you, they sure don''t make droidekas like they used to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'Thanks, citizen. We can''t really afford to treat anything we get as junk. If it still works, we''ll find something to do with it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Are you interested in older technology? I sure would like to get my hands on a lightsaber. Let me know if you ever hear about one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Fix the Droidekas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'We''ve gotten word of another pilot wishing to make contact with the Alliance. This individual has been cleared by Intelligence and now we need you to provide an escort back here. Can the Alliance count on you?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'Thanks for serving as my guide. I didn''t think it was necessary but the Alliance felt transmitting the coordinates to me via the HoloNet was too risky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. Pilots are worth their weight in Jorallan pearls to the Alliance. Here''s a reward for your services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'I appreciate your help, citizen. People like you make it clear that I''ve made the right decision.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Guide the Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'One of the agents we planted deep within the Imperial Security Bureau recently had their cover blown. We''ve managed to get this agent this far without alerting Imperial Intelligence and now need you to escort this individual back here. Keep alert for the presence of suspicious folk. They will likely be Imperial spies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'I appreciate your assistance, citizen. I have quite a few secrets to share with High Command. Let''s get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'Good work, citizen. This agent spent years inside the ISB and possesses information of significant value. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'I was glad we managed to avoid any major Imperial entanglements. You sure do know your stuff, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Save the ISB Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'One of our agents has information regarding a possible Imperial strike against Mon Calamari. We need you to escort this courier back here safely so we can conduct a debriefing and get this information to Admiral Ackbar as soon as possible. Please hurry. Millions of Mon Calamari lives are depending on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'The sooner we get back to base, friend, the better. The Empire intends to make the Mon Calamari pay for their aid to the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, citizen. We''ll get this information to our Mon Calamari contacts immediately. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thanks for getting me here safely. I''ll mention your role in all of this to Admiral Ackbar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Save the Mon Calamari'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'A Corporate Sector Authority Viceprex who has aided the Alliance has just arrived on the planet. The Empire is now aware of this individual''s activities and we have to ensure the Viceprex''s safety. Please serve as an escort and return this patriot unharmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'My thanks, citizen. I knew it was only a matter of time before Imperial Intelligence sniffed me out. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. This Viceprex was responsible for saving many lives and helping fund over a dozen Alliance operations against Imperial targets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'I would do it all the same, citizen, if I had it to do over again. I just wish I''d been able to save a few more lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Rescue the Viceprex'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'An Alliance courier carries an important message for Commander Skywalker that must be hand-delivered. We need you to escort the courier back here safely so we can make sure the rest of their journey goes swiftly and uneventfully. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'Let''s get moving, citizen. Commander Skywalker needs to know that Lord Vader himself searches the galaxy for him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll take it from here. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'I''ll mention your role in this to Commander Skywalker, citizen. Courage should never go unrewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'An Important Message for Commander Skywalker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence uses biological agents to combat anti-Imperial demonstrations. A physician''s assistant has arrived on this planet carrying a newly engineered retrovirus against these biotoxins. Please make sure this individual gets back here safely and make sure nothing happens to that retrovirus.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'Glad you could make it, friend. We have no time to lose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Congratulations, citizen. I knew we could count on you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'The Empire is not above poisoning an entire planet just to prove a point. Their monstrous tactics will prove their undoing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure the Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'The Bothans have set up SpyNet installations for us all over this world, under various "op-front" disguises. We just heard that the Empire took out an op-front in the wilderness. One staffer got away and needs safe escort back here. I''d like you to go. Don''t necessarily expect a Bothan; all kinds of folks staff those listening posts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'A squad of assault troopers fell from the sky and blew up the listening post. It took about six seconds. I happened to be offsite walking my greysor. The greysor ran off. Now I''m really depressed. Let''s go back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'The Empire has been cracking down on SpyNet installations. We''ll need to find better camouflage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'Many Bothans died to build that op-front. I need a drink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'Bothan SpyNet Post Attacked'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'One of our agents on Coruscant has been compromised and is now fleeing Imperial pursuit. The latest report we have is that stormtroopers killed the agent''s Alliance escorts, but the troopers all died as well. Please get out there and rescue that agent, who''s wandering alone. We don''t like to leave our people helpless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'Thank you for rescuing me. I''m not scared. I knew the risks when I infiltrated the ISB. If I die, I know I''ve spent my life well, doing good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'It''s an amazing feat, sending us inside data about Imperial Center under the very noses of the Imperials. This agent deserves to live to see better times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I think the strain of the last few years has already shortened my life, but I''m not eager to cut it even shorter. Thanks for helping me out of a bad spot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Evacuate Coruscant Infiltrator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'A former senator has unfailingly aided the Alliance. Now the Empire has targeted him and his family for termination. We''ve smuggled each of the family members off their homeworld individually, and we''ll reunite them later. One has just made landfall here. The report I got doesn''t name the family member. Can you escort him or her here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'I miss my family, but I''m not worried. I''m glad to see that the Alliance recruits such obviously capable supporters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Thanks, that''s good. We''ll handle the debriefing from here. Please don''t tell anyone about this, because the Empire is still hunting the whole family.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'Will I get to see the rest of my family soon? I haven''t even learned where we''re all going. When do I find out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Rescue Senator''s Family Member'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'After a close brush with an Imperial termination squad in the Corporate Sector Authority, a Viceprex sympathetic to the Alliance has gone on the run. The Viceprex has just arrived here, ahead of a bounty hunter, and wound up way out in the wilderness. We''d like you to bring the executive here safely. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'Thank you! I never expected to see a friendly face out here -- or, well, ever again. I used to run whole planets, but now my CSA career is blown. I still don''t know if I did the right thing. Well, you''d better get me to safety before this Alliance uniform starts to chafe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'The few CSA Viceprexes who help the Alliance have brought us priceless access to cargo and Imperial intelligence. We need to protect them all as best we can. Thanks.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'I just realized I lost all my retirement accounts too. Well, I suppose there are still business opportunities in the Outer Rim. Aren''t there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Escort Corporate Viceprex Ally'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'The Empire plans to release a deadly airborne virus during Core World protests against the Emperor. Alliance scientists have developed a retrovirus that could prevent thousands of deaths. An agent carrying the retrovirus needs a safe escort here for transport offworld. Can you go quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'I''m carrying the retrovirus in a subcutaneous implant. I''m itching like crazy! We should go fast before I break out in a rash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'This brave agent will bring vital protection to ten thousand innocent opponents of the Emperor. Thank you, thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I feel like I''m getting hives. Or shingles. I sure hope I reach the Core Worlds before I get an allergy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Alliance Agent Carrying Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'An Imperial official from Coruscant has defected to the Alliance. I don''t know anything yet about this official''s identity or position -- it''s all hush-hush. The official has arrived here, landing in the wilderness to evade pursuit. I''d like you to retrieve this Imperial defector and escort him or her, or it, safely here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'I was the Empire''s Deputy Assistant Restraining Bolt Replacement Procurement Officer for Outer Rim Territory 2445-C. I couldn''t stand one more moment being an instrument of evil (sob)! At least I''ve got these new clothes now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Well, I suppose any information about Imperial procedures may help our cause. Somehow. Thanks, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'I''ll supply you with every detail of the Imperial restraining bolt replacement procurement process. I''m helping to fight for freedom! May the Force be with me!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Pick up Imperial Defector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'Incom has designed an experimental new starfighter called the "A-wing." Supposed to be a seriously interesting ship. A courier was carrying the plans to our secret factory, but crash-landed here while trying to shake the Imperial Security Bureau. We need you to bring back the courier safely. Fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'Oh, am I glad to see you! The ISB would pull an Alderaan to get their hands on this design. Can you escort me now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Good job! I''ll arrange transport offworld for our courier friend -- with appropriate security, you can be sure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'The A-wing will be the fastest starfighter in the galaxy, once we lick the stabilizer-wing problem. And about three thousand other problems, actually. Thanks for the escort!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'A-Wing Plan Carrier Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'We''re mounting a raid on an Imperial supply depot. The strike team commander has just gotten briefed at a secret location and is ready to lead the raid. But first we need to get the commander here safely. Can you be the escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'I''m supposed to fly some complicated new flight plan we just got from Intelligence. If you could run interference on the way back while I study the maneuvers, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Wouldn''t that have been embarrassing, if a top Alliance pilot got taken out on the way to liftoff. Thanks for preventing that particular setback.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 149, 'm25e', '"Then Red Team executes an Ackbar Slash through the enemy''s center line..." Wow, I hope the Force is with us today... Are we here? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Strike Commander Heading to Depot Raid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'An Alliance Psychological Operations officer is working on fomenting more tension among Lord Vader''s admirals. The more dissension and distrust we create, the less effective the Imperial Navy becomes. We need you to escort the Psych Ops officer here for transport to an offworld training facility.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'You''re a little short for an Alliance soldier. Are you sure I''m the one you''re here to meet? Wait, I know you -- I heard your friends say that you -- no, never mind. No, not important. Really. Let''s go. --No, really, you don''t want to know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'You look a little rattled -- did the Psych officer decide to practice on you during the trip? Thanks, we''ll take over from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'By the way, you''ve got something sticky on your foot. Ha, made you look! Just kidding. Thanks, and you know I mean that sincerely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Psych Operations Officer Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'General Carlist Rieekan has been searching for a new Alliance base site since the Empire blockaded Yavin 4. His aide has assembled scouting reports for this world and the surrounding sector. Due to the sensitivity of this data, the aide is hand-delivering it to General Rieekan. Your job is to escort the aide here for safe departure offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'Yes, I''m General Rieekan''s aide. Before joining the Alliance, I used to scout worlds for the Corporate Sector Authority. I must say, this world has some interesting features. Shall we go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Whatever this officer has to say, I''m sure General Rieekan will be interested. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I''m seeing possibilities on this world, not just for an Alliance base, but in the longer term, a tourist resort. What do you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'General Rieekan''s Staffer Requests Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We have a report that the Imperials found one of our undercover agents. The agent jumped a shuttle in an escape pod and landed here in the wilderness. The bad news is, there''s apparently a bounty hunter on the trail, sent by the Empire. We need to get the agent back here to safety. Can you move quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'Lord Vader has assembled an elite group of bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. I don''t know much about it. But I think one of them is after me, so we should go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'Well, bounty hunter or not, this agent needs to be smuggled offworld pronto. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'Okay, I''ve calmed down. I think the Scourge Column is supposed to hunt really tough targets. I don''t see how that would include me. Maybe I was imagining things.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bounty Hunter Pursuing Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'A local community leader is apparently being hunted by stormtroopers. The report I got is light on details -- apparently this person organized anti-Imperial sentiment among local youth organizations. Can you check out this report? Maybe you should just bring the leader back here, and we''ll decide what to do next.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'I distributed Alliance-issue cannisters of enamel to local children, who used it to paint mustaches on the Emperor''s statues. Those stormtroopers didn''t like that. I barely escaped my house before they blew it up!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'Like I didn''t have enough to worry about already. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I also distributed stinkbombs, issued straight from your Alliance, mind you, for the locals to throw at COMPNOR loyalty parades. I deserve protection!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Community Leader Escaping Stormtroopers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'We had a lot of shipping mistakes and communication errors a while back. It took us a while to trace them to a rogue slicer out to have fun. Well, guess what -- we recruited that talented slicer into the Alliance. We need you to retrieve the slicer from the wilderness rendezvous point and provide escort duty back here. Okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Wild. I never went offworld before. It was juicy. Of course, I used to screw up shipping manifests and passenger lists, just for grins. Wow, I''m really a Rebel now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'One more valiant warrior in the battle for freedom. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'Now that I''m a Rebel, I can still mess up the shipping schedules, right? Only just the bad-guy ships now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Data Slicer Joining Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'The local Imperial garrison just granted extended leave for many stormtroopers. Our agents plan to get close -- very close -- to these off-duty soldiers. One agent is returning from a mission in the wilderness and needs an escort. Can you go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'Okay, you''re here to take me to a cantina full of drunken troopers. Gee, look at me tremble with anticipation. Lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'Thanks. This isn''t the noblest Alliance endeavour, but you have to find intelligence where you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I''m not looking forward to this, but it should be productive. After a few drinks these troopers tell you their mission, their defenses, and their sarge''s middle name. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Agent Needs Escort to Off-Duty Imperials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'There''s trouble. An Imperial TIE fighter engineer is defecting to our side. The escort team crash-landed on this planet to escape a Star Destroyer, and a stormtrooper ground patrol attacked them. We lost everyone except the engineer. Quick, head out and find the engineer, then give safe escort back here. Please hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'This has been a nightmare. But even if the Empire gets me, I don''t regret my decision. I''m willing to die for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'This is great work! Our new friend has volunteered to tell us a great deal about Lord Vader''s experimental TIE fighter and other advanced ships. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My work has indirectly led to the oppression of billions. I can''t live with that any more. I want to undo the evil I''ve helped perpetuate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Sienar Systems Defector Requires Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'With the Imperial Army refusing to enlist nonhuman species, the Alliance has a chance to turn this bigotry to good effect. One of our diplomats has been meeting with Duro leaders, trying to get them to join us. The diplomat is stopping here en route to High Command to make a report. Will you bring the official here from the landing point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It''s been a challenging trip, with Imperial ships dogging us all along. I had to leave my ship via escape pod to reduce the danger to my allies. I appreciate your escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'These diplomatic missions can be dangerous. Thanks for bringing the official here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It remains to be seen whether the Duro will join the Alliance. I suspect they are too diffuse and independent. But we must keep trying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Alien Affairs Diplomat Delivering Report'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'General Airen Cracken''s smugglers -- I mean "procurement specialists" -- are getting jumpy because of Imperial attention. One of them plans to deliver medical supplies here, but wants to scout out the place first. The "specialist" asked for just one escort, not a squad. Can you do the job? Try to, uh, look harmless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I asked for just one guard. I want to be sure there''s no funny business here. As in "those funny Imperials." Get me? Okay, lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'Once this procurement specialist sees there''s nothing to worry about, we should get the medical supplies pretty soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'Hold on -- I just want to check over that way -- okay, okay -- and anything under here? No. Okay, this may work, this may work. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 204, 'm34t', '"Procurement Specialist" Wants Guide'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'A special Alliance operative is hiding beyond the city borders. I need you to deliver these new, coded instructions: "Echo Roger Bravo dash Twelve." It''s urgent that you get there immediately. Go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 206, 'm35p', '"Bravo dash Twelve?" That''s outrageous! This is a "dash Eleven" situation if there ever was one. Take me back to your contact. We''ve got to have a chat about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 208, 'm35c', '"Dash Twelve," "dash Eleven," what''s the difference? At least we''re not saying "dash Thirteen." That would have been absurd.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 209, 'm35e', '"Bravo dash Twelve" indeed! What kind of operation is this? It''s "dash Eleven" or I''m off the case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Secret Instructions for a Field Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'We''ve got an agent in the field investigating claims of an Imperial massacre. We dare not send any shuttles or transmissions to the area. Can you sneak out there and check up on our investigator''s progress? Alliance High Command is very interested in this information. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Good, you''re here. I''ve found blaster scorching on the ground all around here. I''d estimate the Empire executed twenty or thirty civilians, not more than a week ago. I need to report this to Alliance High Command. Can get me back undetected?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'You did well. I''ll mention you by name in my report to High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Thank you greatly. Now I can get this evidence of the Imperial massacre to Alliance High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Check Up on an Alliance Investigator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'We''ve set up a portable listening station away from the city, to eavesdrop on Imperial communications. I want you to get out there and relieve the current operator for awhile. Try not to send any transmissions along the way. We don''t want the authorities to find us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I''m glad you''re here. The Imperial patrols started using an unknown scramble code less than an hour ago. I think they know about my listening device. We''ve got to get back to safety before they track us down. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'And thanks from me as well. The Alliance needs good agents like you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'That was close. I was afraid we might get nabbed by Imperial patrols. Thanks for the help, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Assist an Alliance Eavesdropper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'One of our transports had a close call with some TIE fighters. The ship crashed but the pilot ejected to safety in time. You''d better get out there and bring''em back before the planetside Imperial forces start combing the area. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Thank goodness you found me. I can''t believe I was shot down by a couple of junk-heap TIE fighters. Let''s get out of this place before we''re caught.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'Sometimes the Empire will get the upper hand. It happens. Both of you did your jobs well. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'Thank you for the escort. I still can''t believe I couldn''t dodge those TIE fighters. My dogfighting skills are getting rusty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Retrieve a Stranded Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'There''s an Imperial mine field outside of town. We sent an agent to neutralize these hidden explosives, but all we''ve heard back is a distress signal. Can you head out there to see what''s going on? Oh, and be careful where you step. We suspect it''s a very dense mine field.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'I can''t believe you just crossed the mine field with no scanning equipment! I had a power surge in my comlink that fried my sensor and I''ve been afraid to move for an hour. Well, no sense postponing it any longer. Let''s get out of this mess before the Imperial patrols fly over. If you pray to any deities on your homeworld, now''s the time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Good work. You''ve got a future in mine sweeping, if you would care to join our ranks. We''ve always got new openings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Unbelievable! We made it through the mine field without a scratch. That''s twice you managed it. Are you sure you''re not Force-sensitive?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Extract an Alliance Minesweeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'An Alliance spy has arrived from offworld to debrief us about some findings on Klatooine. A secret transport dropped the spy far from the city''s sensors. I want a clandestine extraction. The task falls to you. Bring our spy back here and let''s find out what''s happening on Klatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'You''re my escort? Good. Let''s move quietly. I''ve got some interesting information that I''m sure the Empire wants to stifle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Droid bombs? Very interesting. I wonder if the Alliance could undercut the Empire and get ahold of them?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 239, 'm40e', 'I''m glad we made it here alive. Thanks. Now I can tell you about the droid bombs that some Klatooinan engineers are trying to sell to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort an Alliance Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'We sent two agents to sabotage an Imperial orbital refinery. They were supposed to rendezvous with us afterward for debriefing, but our pickup team did not find them. I need you to go to the meeting point and see if they''ve arrived yet. Be on the lookout for Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'Sorry for the delay. We were nearly caught by an Imperial boarding crew. My partner died, but we wiped out those dogs! Now I just want to get back home, make my report and have a long rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'No rest yet, I''m afraid. Alliance Command says we need to hit another refinery. Don''t worry, the Force will give you strength.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Boy, am I glad to be back. Our sabotage was successful. The Imperial Navy in this system will be short on stellar fuel for awhile. Now I just want to get some rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Escort a Rebel Saboteur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'We''ve got a meeting with an artillery expert, but Imperial patrols have stepped up in this area. The expert is stuck between cities. Go out there, make sure there''s no Imperial trouble and let''s get this meeting back on schedule.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'Let''s not waste any time. This area is crawling with stormtroopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Ion cannons against Star Destroyers? That is interesting. We could use that kind of artillery support for planetary evacuation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'That was too close. Thank you for the help. I''ve got some interesting information about the effectiveness of ion cannons against Star Destroyers. Time for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist an Alliance Artillery Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'One of our new operatives came from a slicing background. We took advantage of this expertise to sabotage an experimental droid project that the Empire has started on Klatooine. Reprogrammed droids can be a powerful ally. Our slicer has just returned and I need you to provide an escort back here. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I can''t wait to make this report. I reprogrammed an experimental droid starfighter for independent thought. Now that crazy robot is winging through the galaxy, evading TIE fighters and hunting down the scientists who built it. Boy, do I love my work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Sometimes slicers are a little too creative. Never mind, I''ll reserve judgment until I hear the full report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 257, 'm43e', '... and after the droid starfighter wipes out the scientists who created it, I programmed it to fly to the outlying systems and help fight Imperial expansion forces. I can''t wait to hear how well it does.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Alliance Slicer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'We''ve lost an intelligence agent! The Imperials must have learned about this secret mission. Get out to the rendezvous point as fast as you can and see if there''s any sign of what happened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'I thought you''d never get here! I''ve been hiding from Imperial squads for the last three hours. Lucky for us, the coast is clear right now. Let''s get out of here before they come back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'Excellent work. You''re a true asset to the Alliance, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I thought I was a goner out there. Thanks for bringing me back safely. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Find an Alliance Intelligence Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'We''ve got trouble. An engineer of ours just landed on the planet. An Imperial patrol has the whole area pinned down and I fear the worst. Aerial support is on the way, but they won''t get there for awhile. Do you think you''re skilled enough to lend a hand?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'The Imperials just left! I don''t know what happened. One second they were firing at me and the next all was clear. Something''s going on. I don''t want to stick around to find out what it is. Let''s move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'That was too close. High Command is really interested in this report. Say, do you smell something strange? Ah, it was probably nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'I''m glad we got out of there in one piece. I sure hope the Imperials didn''t track us or something. Anyway, now I can make my report about the ISB''s use of poison gasses against Alliance troops on Cularin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Escort a Rebel Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'A secret Alliance transport came down outside the city. We sent a crew to clean up the mess, but we had to leave quick when the authorities showed up. Unfortunately we left one of the rescue team behind. Our scanners give us the all clear, but we don''t want to risk flying in just yet. Can you hoof it out there and make sure our comrade gets back safely? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'I thought I''d left combat behind when I signed up for the rescue team. Now here I am on the battlefield again. Just my luck. Let''s get back and I''ll buy you a drink to thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'Yes, you guessed it. Another transport came down just before you two got here. The rescue crew is heading out again. The struggle for galactic freedom never ends.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'Uh-oh. I recognize that look in my commander''s eyes. Guess we''ll have to save that drink for another day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Escort Alliance Rescue Personnel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'We have a project underway to map hyperspace supply lines between major Alliance star clusters. A logistics expert has arrived on the planet to confer about this matter. How would you like to rendezvous with this newcomer and bring them back here? I''m not even sure what they look like, but I do have the coordinates of their secret dropoff point. Better arm yourself for the trip, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Hi. I''m the logistics expert. Are you my escort? Good. I was worried that the Empire might have discovered these coordinates and sent a spy. Please take me to your commanders now. Long live the Rebellion! Um, I mean, the Alliance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'But of course! What a pleasure it is to meet such a courteous and motivated agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'So this is one of your larger bases in the star system? Excellent. Please show me everything. I am most interested to see your operation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Help Out an Alliance Logistics Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'We''re honored to have one of the Alliance''s top pilots pay us a visit. I want you to head out to the rendezvous point and provide an escort back here. I''ll show the captain around. Maybe we''ll get a new star pilot for our local squadron!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Dropped off in the middle of nowhere. What a welcome this is. If you''re my contact, I hope you''ve got something good to show me about Alliance operations in this system. So far I''m not very impressed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''m very excited to meet such a famous star pilot! Please, captain, if there''s anything I can do to make you feel at home, just ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'The operation isn''t much to see, I grant you, but you never told me there were such dashing and attractive officers here! I don''t suppose you can introduce us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Retrieve an Ace Fighter Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'Some kind of huge Imperial gunship had us pinned down outside of town! I''ve never seen that kind of vessel before. Nearly blasted us to pieces. I got separated from my buddy and barely made it back here. My friend is still out there. I have the coordinates from the distress beacon, but I''m too banged up to manage a rescue. Can you handle it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Am I glad to see you! That weird Imperial gunship has buzzed the area every half hour since the fight. Let''s get out of here before it comes back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'The report can wait. I''m just glad to see you alive. And thank you, my new friend, for performing the rescue I couldn''t.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'I could swear that new gunship looks like it''s amphibious. What''s the Empire up to, anyway? I''ll have to file a report on this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Rescue a Stranded Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'When a turbolaser explodes, the results are not pretty. We lost some mercenaries outside of town when a stolen turbo blew up without warning. Their Alliance liaison is still alive, though. I need to you get out there quickly and fetch our agent back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'Thank goodness you''re here. I couldn''t get much farther on my own. Imperial patrols are bound to investigate the turbolaser explosion and I want to be as far away from the blast site as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'I''m just glad that you got back alive. We can find other turbolasers, but there''s only one of you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'The more I think about it, the more I believe the Empire must have rigged that turbolaser to explode. Why else would it blow up like that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_hard.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Fetch an Alliance Liaison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'A vital munitions depot was hit by an Imperial strike team. We sent an agent out to assess the damage but storm commandos were lying in wait. The timely arrival of Rogue Squadron allowed our wounded agent to escape. We need you to find this brave soldier and insure a safe return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 2, 'm1p', 'Good to see you, friend. I was starting to think I was done for. I''m hit but it''s not bad. Let''s get back home as quickly as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 3, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 4, 'm1c', 'You helped save a fellow freedom fighter, citizen. Tha Alliance is proud to have agents like you. Accept this reward with our compliments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 5, 'm1e', 'Thanks, buddy. Not sure I would have made it without your help. Here''s hoping Rogue Squadron wiped out all those storm commandos.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 6, 'm1t', 'Rescue the Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 7, 'm2o', 'The Imperials bombed one of our mining facilities. Fortunately the installation''s supervisor escaped with our security protocols and codes before probe droids could search the ruins. If you could locate the superivisor and get those codes back here safely, we''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 8, 'm2p', 'Fancy meeting you here. Glad to see the Alliance hasn''t forgotten us lowly miners. Don''t worry, the codes are safe and sound. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 9, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 10, 'm2c', 'Good work, citizen. We must make sure our codes are never compromised or else dozens of our bases would be sitting ducks for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 11, 'm2e', 'Thanks, friend. I hope next time we meet it''s under very different circumstances.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 12, 'm2t', 'Protect the Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 13, 'm3o', 'We intercepted an Imperial transmission warning of an imminent attack on an automated communications array. Fortunately, an engineer servicing a broken transponder was able to set the facility to self-destruct. We need you to make sure our engineer makes it back here safely.   '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 14, 'm3p', 'Hiya. Glad to see a friendly face. Looks like I underestimated the force of that explosion. Well, a trashed speeder bike is better than a trashed engineer, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 15, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 16, 'm3c', 'Thanks for your help, citizen. Every single member of the Alliance is precious to us. Claim your just reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 17, 'm3e', 'Much obliged for the escort, friend. Hope to see you again sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 18, 'm3t', 'Collect the Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 19, 'm4o', 'A newly formed cell wishes to personally discuss a recent supply request with our Procurement & Supply officer. They''re asking for an escort for their representative. Could you meet this individual and provide this service? The Alliance would be grateful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 20, 'm4p', 'My thanks for providing this escort. You never can be too careful with all these Imperial spies running around. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 21, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 22, 'm4c', 'Our thanks, citizen. A job well done deserves a reward, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 23, 'm4e', 'Allow me to thank you and congratulate you on being such an excellent escort. What was your name again, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 24, 'm4t', 'Escort the Nervous Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 25, 'm5o', 'A group of youngsters was targeted for termination by Imperials because the spunky youths had defaced some Imperial statues. We''ve managed to relocate most of them to various colonies but one of them wants to join our cell. Could you make sure this brave youngster makes it here with minimal distractions?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 26, 'm5p', 'Hiya! Are you a pilot? Ever flown an X-wing? I''d like to do that someday. I''d be pretty good too. I bet I could even bring down Baron Fel.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 27, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 28, 'm5c', 'Thanks, citizen. We appreciate your efforts. Like it or not, you serve as an example to many people. We hope you keep that in mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 29, 'm5e', 'Hey thanks, friend. I hope we get to serve together someday. When next we meet, I''ll probably be a full fledged X-wing pilot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 30, 'm5t', 'Inspire the Young'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 31, 'm6o', 'A local merchant refused to cooperate with Imperials and lost a nice shop as a result. We''ve offered asylum and need someone to escort this unfortunate back here. Think you could help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 32, 'm6p', 'Greetings. Thank you for escorting me. I suppose I see the need for disguise but I sure do feel strange in these clothes. Well, lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 33, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 34, 'm6c', 'We''ll put this citizen to good use, thanks. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 35, 'm6e', 'I appreciate the escort, citizen. I''ll do my part to make sure the Empire collapses and the Republic is restored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 36, 'm6t', 'Help the Former Shopkeeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 37, 'm7o', 'Our contacts within the Corporate Sector Authority helped us secure the release of an important Alliance officer who had been sent to the spice mines of Kessel. Our officer was reported killed during a mining accident. We need you to make sure this "deceased" ally gets here without attracting too much attention. Think you can handle that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 38, 'm7p', 'I look pretty lively for a corpse, huh? Let''s hope you can get me back before I start to stink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 39, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 40, 'm7c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll make sure our officer receives a funeral with full military honors. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 41, 'm7e', 'Thanks, buddy. I hope you''ll stick around for the wake. There''s bound to be plenty of spirits in attendance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 42, 'm7t', 'Transport a Living Corpse'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 43, 'm8o', 'A former senator wanted by Imperial Intelligence has managed to elude patrols and now needs to be escorted back here to be reunited with family. This dignitary will be in disguise, of course, so be on the lookout. Can the Alliance count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 44, 'm8p', 'Are you from the Alliance? I suppose that''s a dumb thing to ask a stranger. Sorry, I''m new to all this. If you''re my escort, then lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 45, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 46, 'm8c', 'We appreciate your prompt return, citizen. The senator has information vital to our survival. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 47, 'm8e', 'I do hope I didn''t come across as a complete buffoon. You have my deepest thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 48, 'm8t', 'Protect the Senator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 49, 'm9o', 'We need someone with patience and a sense of humor for this mission. We''ve decided to grant asylum to a harmless lunatic who claims to be the Emperor. The Imperials have already tried to assassinate this poor wretch multiple times. Perhaps fortunate favors the mad? Think you can collect this individual and return here? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 50, 'm9p', 'It''s about time you arrived, my young apprentice. It is not good to keep your Emperor waiting. As you can see, I have adopted an appropriate disguise. And now, lead me to the very heart of the Rebellion where I can assure it will be crushed and you will become one of us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 51, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 52, 'm9c', 'We appreciate your patience, citizen. We''ll take "His Imperial Highness" from here. Here''s a little something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 53, 'm9e', 'You have done well, my young apprentice. In time, I will seek you out and then you shall come before me. I have foreseen it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 54, 'm9t', 'Escort the Emperor (honest)'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 55, 'm10o', 'A former Black Sun operative has decided to share privileged information with the Alliance in exchange for asylum. We need you to collect this individual and return here. The operative is disguised so you shouldn''t have too much trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 56, 'm10p', 'How do I know you''re really from the Alliance? Tell you what, you lead the way and I''ll follow close behind. Don''t forget I have a blaster and I know how to use it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 57, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 58, 'm10c', 'Thank you, citizen. We appreciate your patience and professionalism. Collect your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 59, 'm10e', 'Well I guess you turned out to be okay. In my line of work, you never can be too careful. Know what I mean?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 60, 'm10t', 'Protect the Black Sun Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 61, 'm11o', 'Some old droidekas fell into our hands not long ago. Not many techs have worked with them before so we called in an expert in antique technology. We need you to pick up and escort this specialist back here. Can you do that for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 62, 'm11p', 'Yeah, I''ve worked with a lot of older model droids. Bit of a hobby for me, I suppose. But I tell you, they sure don''t make droidekas like they used to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 63, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 64, 'm11c', 'Thanks, citizen. We can''t really afford to treat anything we get as junk. If it still works, we''ll find something to do with it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 65, 'm11e', 'Are you interested in older technology? I sure would like to get my hands on a lightsaber. Let me know if you ever hear about one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 66, 'm11t', 'Fix the Droidekas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 67, 'm12o', 'We''ve gotten word of another pilot wishing to make contact with the Alliance. This individual has been cleared by Intelligence and now we need you to provide an escort back here. Can the Alliance count on you?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 68, 'm12p', 'Thanks for serving as my guide. I didn''t think it was necessary but the Alliance felt transmitting the coordinates to me via the HoloNet was too risky.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 69, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 70, 'm12c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. Pilots are worth their weight in Jorallan pearls to the Alliance. Here''s a reward for your services.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 71, 'm12e', 'I appreciate your help, citizen. People like you make it clear that I''ve made the right decision.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 72, 'm12t', 'Guide the Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 73, 'm13o', 'One of the agents we planted deep within the Imperial Security Bureau recently had their cover blown. We''ve managed to get this agent this far without alerting Imperial Intelligence and now need you to escort this individual back here. Keep alert for the presence of suspicious folk. They will likely be Imperial spies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 74, 'm13p', 'I appreciate your assistance, citizen. I have quite a few secrets to share with High Command. Let''s get going.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 75, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 76, 'm13c', 'Good work, citizen. This agent spent years inside the ISB and possesses information of significant value. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 77, 'm13e', 'I was glad we managed to avoid any major Imperial entanglements. You sure do know your stuff, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 78, 'm13t', 'Save the ISB Insider'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 79, 'm14o', 'One of our agents has information regarding a possible Imperial strike against Mon Calamari. We need you to escort this courier back here safely so we can conduct a debriefing and get this information to Admiral Ackbar as soon as possible. Please hurry. Millions of Mon Calamari lives are depending on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 80, 'm14p', 'The sooner we get back to base, friend, the better. The Empire intends to make the Mon Calamari pay for their aid to the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 81, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 82, 'm14c', 'Good work, citizen. We''ll get this information to our Mon Calamari contacts immediately. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 83, 'm14e', 'Thanks for getting me here safely. I''ll mention your role in all of this to Admiral Ackbar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 84, 'm14t', 'Save the Mon Calamari'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 85, 'm15o', 'A Corporate Sector Authority Viceprex who has aided the Alliance has just arrived on the planet. The Empire is now aware of this individual''s activities and we have to ensure the Viceprex''s safety. Please serve as an escort and return this patriot unharmed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 86, 'm15p', 'My thanks, citizen. I knew it was only a matter of time before Imperial Intelligence sniffed me out. Lead on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 87, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 88, 'm15c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. This Viceprex was responsible for saving many lives and helping fund over a dozen Alliance operations against Imperial targets.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 89, 'm15e', 'I would do it all the same, citizen, if I had it to do over again. I just wish I''d been able to save a few more lives.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 90, 'm15t', 'Rescue the Viceprex'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 91, 'm16o', 'An Alliance courier carries an important message for Commander Skywalker that must be hand-delivered. We need you to escort the courier back here safely so we can make sure the rest of their journey goes swiftly and uneventfully. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 92, 'm16p', 'Let''s get moving, citizen. Commander Skywalker needs to know that Lord Vader himself searches the galaxy for him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 93, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 94, 'm16c', 'Good job, citizen. We''ll take it from here. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 95, 'm16e', 'I''ll mention your role in this to Commander Skywalker, citizen. Courage should never go unrewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 96, 'm16t', 'An Important Message for Commander Skywalker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 97, 'm17o', 'Imperial Intelligence uses biological agents to combat anti-Imperial demonstrations. A physician''s assistant has arrived on this planet carrying a newly engineered retrovirus against these biotoxins. Please make sure this individual gets back here safely and make sure nothing happens to that retrovirus.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 98, 'm17p', 'Glad you could make it, friend. We have no time to lose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 99, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 100, 'm17c', 'Congratulations, citizen. I knew we could count on you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 101, 'm17e', 'The Empire is not above poisoning an entire planet just to prove a point. Their monstrous tactics will prove their undoing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 102, 'm17t', 'Secure the Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 103, 'm18o', 'The Bothans have set up SpyNet installations for us all over this world, under various "op-front" disguises. We just heard that the Empire took out an op-front in the wilderness. One staffer got away and needs safe escort back here. I''d like you to go. Don''t necessarily expect a Bothan; all kinds of folks staff those listening posts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 104, 'm18p', 'A squad of assault troopers fell from the sky and blew up the listening post. It took about six seconds. I happened to be offsite walking my greysor. The greysor ran off. Now I''m really depressed. Let''s go back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 105, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 106, 'm18c', 'The Empire has been cracking down on SpyNet installations. We''ll need to find better camouflage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 107, 'm18e', 'Many Bothans died to build that op-front. I need a drink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 108, 'm18t', 'Bothan SpyNet Post Attacked'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 109, 'm19o', 'One of our agents on Coruscant has been compromised and is now fleeing Imperial pursuit. The latest report we have is that stormtroopers killed the agent''s Alliance escorts, but the troopers all died as well. Please get out there and rescue that agent, who''s wandering alone. We don''t like to leave our people helpless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 110, 'm19p', 'Thank you for rescuing me. I''m not scared. I knew the risks when I infiltrated the ISB. If I die, I know I''ve spent my life well, doing good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 111, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 112, 'm19c', 'It''s an amazing feat, sending us inside data about Imperial Center under the very noses of the Imperials. This agent deserves to live to see better times.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 113, 'm19e', 'I think the strain of the last few years has already shortened my life, but I''m not eager to cut it even shorter. Thanks for helping me out of a bad spot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 114, 'm19t', 'Evacuate Coruscant Infiltrator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 115, 'm20o', 'A former senator has unfailingly aided the Alliance. Now the Empire has targeted him and his family for termination. We''ve smuggled each of the family members off their homeworld individually, and we''ll reunite them later. One has just made landfall here. The report I got doesn''t name the family member. Can you escort him or her here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 116, 'm20p', 'I miss my family, but I''m not worried. I''m glad to see that the Alliance recruits such obviously capable supporters.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 117, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 118, 'm20c', 'Thanks, that''s good. We''ll handle the debriefing from here. Please don''t tell anyone about this, because the Empire is still hunting the whole family.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 119, 'm20e', 'Will I get to see the rest of my family soon? I haven''t even learned where we''re all going. When do I find out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 120, 'm20t', 'Rescue Senator''s Family Member'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 121, 'm21o', 'After a close brush with an Imperial termination squad in the Corporate Sector Authority, a Viceprex sympathetic to the Alliance has gone on the run. The Viceprex has just arrived here, ahead of a bounty hunter, and wound up way out in the wilderness. We''d like you to bring the executive here safely. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 122, 'm21p', 'Thank you! I never expected to see a friendly face out here -- or, well, ever again. I used to run whole planets, but now my CSA career is blown. I still don''t know if I did the right thing. Well, you''d better get me to safety before this Alliance uniform starts to chafe.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 123, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 124, 'm21c', 'The few CSA Viceprexes who help the Alliance have brought us priceless access to cargo and Imperial intelligence. We need to protect them all as best we can. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 125, 'm21e', 'I just realized I lost all my retirement accounts too. Well, I suppose there are still business opportunities in the Outer Rim. Aren''t there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 126, 'm21t', 'Escort Corporate Viceprex Ally'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 127, 'm22o', 'The Empire plans to release a deadly airborne virus during Core World protests against the Emperor. Alliance scientists have developed a retrovirus that could prevent thousands of deaths. An agent carrying the retrovirus needs a safe escort here for transport offworld. Can you go quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 128, 'm22p', 'I''m carrying the retrovirus in a subcutaneous implant. I''m itching like crazy! We should go fast before I break out in a rash.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 129, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 130, 'm22c', 'This brave agent will bring vital protection to ten thousand innocent opponents of the Emperor. Thank you, thank you for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 131, 'm22e', 'I feel like I''m getting hives. Or shingles. I sure hope I reach the Core Worlds before I get an allergy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 132, 'm22t', 'Alliance Agent Carrying Retrovirus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 133, 'm23o', 'An Imperial official from Coruscant has defected to the Alliance. I don''t know anything yet about this official''s identity or position -- it''s all hush-hush. The official has arrived here, landing in the wilderness to evade pursuit. I''d like you to retrieve this Imperial defector and escort him or her, or it, safely here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 134, 'm23p', 'I was the Empire''s Deputy Assistant Restraining Bolt Replacement Procurement Officer for Outer Rim Territory 2445-C. I couldn''t stand one more moment being an instrument of evil (sob)! At least I''ve got these new clothes now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 135, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 136, 'm23c', 'Well, I suppose any information about Imperial procedures may help our cause. Somehow. Thanks, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 137, 'm23e', 'I''ll supply you with every detail of the Imperial restraining bolt replacement procurement process. I''m helping to fight for freedom! May the Force be with me!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 138, 'm23t', 'Pick up Imperial Defector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 139, 'm24o', 'Incom has designed an experimental new starfighter called the "A-wing." Supposed to be a seriously interesting ship. A courier was carrying the plans to our secret factory, but crash-landed here while trying to shake the Imperial Security Bureau. We need you to bring back the courier safely. Fast!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 140, 'm24p', 'Oh, am I glad to see you! The ISB would pull an Alderaan to get their hands on this design. Can you escort me now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 141, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 142, 'm24c', 'Good job! I''ll arrange transport offworld for our courier friend -- with appropriate security, you can be sure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 143, 'm24e', 'The A-wing will be the fastest starfighter in the galaxy, once we lick the stabilizer-wing problem. And about three thousand other problems, actually. Thanks for the escort!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 144, 'm24t', 'A-Wing Plan Carrier Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 145, 'm25o', 'We''re mounting a raid on an Imperial supply depot. The strike team commander has just gotten briefed at a secret location and is ready to lead the raid. But first we need to get the commander here safely. Can you be the escort?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 146, 'm25p', 'I''m supposed to fly some complicated new flight plan we just got from Intelligence. If you could run interference on the way back while I study the maneuvers, I''d appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 147, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 148, 'm25c', 'Wouldn''t that have been embarrassing, if a top Alliance pilot got taken out on the way to liftoff. Thanks for preventing that particular setback.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 149, 'm25e', '"Then Red Team executes an Ackbar Slash through the enemy''s center line..." Wow, I hope the Force is with us today... Are we here? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 150, 'm25t', 'Strike Commander Heading to Depot Raid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 151, 'm26o', 'An Alliance Psychological Operations officer is working on fomenting more tension among Lord Vader''s admirals. The more dissension and distrust we create, the less effective the Imperial Navy becomes. We need you to escort the Psych Ops officer here for transport to an offworld training facility.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 152, 'm26p', 'You''re a little short for an Alliance soldier. Are you sure I''m the one you''re here to meet? Wait, I know you -- I heard your friends say that you -- no, never mind. No, not important. Really. Let''s go. --No, really, you don''t want to know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 153, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 154, 'm26c', 'You look a little rattled -- did the Psych officer decide to practice on you during the trip? Thanks, we''ll take over from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 155, 'm26e', 'By the way, you''ve got something sticky on your foot. Ha, made you look! Just kidding. Thanks, and you know I mean that sincerely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 156, 'm26t', 'Psych Operations Officer Needs Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 157, 'm27o', 'General Carlist Rieekan has been searching for a new Alliance base site since the Empire blockaded Yavin 4. His aide has assembled scouting reports for this world and the surrounding sector. Due to the sensitivity of this data, the aide is hand-delivering it to General Rieekan. Your job is to escort the aide here for safe departure offworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 158, 'm27p', 'Yes, I''m General Rieekan''s aide. Before joining the Alliance, I used to scout worlds for the Corporate Sector Authority. I must say, this world has some interesting features. Shall we go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 159, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 160, 'm27c', 'Whatever this officer has to say, I''m sure General Rieekan will be interested. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 161, 'm27e', 'I''m seeing possibilities on this world, not just for an Alliance base, but in the longer term, a tourist resort. What do you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 162, 'm27t', 'General Rieekan''s Staffer Requests Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 163, 'm28o', 'We have a report that the Imperials found one of our undercover agents. The agent jumped a shuttle in an escape pod and landed here in the wilderness. The bad news is, there''s apparently a bounty hunter on the trail, sent by the Empire. We need to get the agent back here to safety. Can you move quickly?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 164, 'm28p', 'Lord Vader has assembled an elite group of bounty hunters called the Scourge Column. I don''t know much about it. But I think one of them is after me, so we should go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 165, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 166, 'm28c', 'Well, bounty hunter or not, this agent needs to be smuggled offworld pronto. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 167, 'm28e', 'Okay, I''ve calmed down. I think the Scourge Column is supposed to hunt really tough targets. I don''t see how that would include me. Maybe I was imagining things.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 168, 'm28t', 'Bounty Hunter Pursuing Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 169, 'm29o', 'A local community leader is apparently being hunted by stormtroopers. The report I got is light on details -- apparently this person organized anti-Imperial sentiment among local youth organizations. Can you check out this report? Maybe you should just bring the leader back here, and we''ll decide what to do next.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 170, 'm29p', 'I distributed Alliance-issue cannisters of enamel to local children, who used it to paint mustaches on the Emperor''s statues. Those stormtroopers didn''t like that. I barely escaped my house before they blew it up!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 171, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 172, 'm29c', 'Like I didn''t have enough to worry about already. Okay, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 173, 'm29e', 'I also distributed stinkbombs, issued straight from your Alliance, mind you, for the locals to throw at COMPNOR loyalty parades. I deserve protection!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 174, 'm29t', 'Community Leader Escaping Stormtroopers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 175, 'm30o', 'We had a lot of shipping mistakes and communication errors a while back. It took us a while to trace them to a rogue slicer out to have fun. Well, guess what -- we recruited that talented slicer into the Alliance. We need you to retrieve the slicer from the wilderness rendezvous point and provide escort duty back here. Okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 176, 'm30p', 'Wild. I never went offworld before. It was juicy. Of course, I used to screw up shipping manifests and passenger lists, just for grins. Wow, I''m really a Rebel now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 177, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 178, 'm30c', 'One more valiant warrior in the battle for freedom. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 179, 'm30e', 'Now that I''m a Rebel, I can still mess up the shipping schedules, right? Only just the bad-guy ships now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 180, 'm30t', 'Data Slicer Joining Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 181, 'm31o', 'The local Imperial garrison just granted extended leave for many stormtroopers. Our agents plan to get close -- very close -- to these off-duty soldiers. One agent is returning from a mission in the wilderness and needs an escort. Can you go?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 182, 'm31p', 'Okay, you''re here to take me to a cantina full of drunken troopers. Gee, look at me tremble with anticipation. Lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 183, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 184, 'm31c', 'Thanks. This isn''t the noblest Alliance endeavour, but you have to find intelligence where you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 185, 'm31e', 'I''m not looking forward to this, but it should be productive. After a few drinks these troopers tell you their mission, their defenses, and their sarge''s middle name. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 186, 'm31t', 'Agent Needs Escort to Off-Duty Imperials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 187, 'm32o', 'There''s trouble. An Imperial TIE fighter engineer is defecting to our side. The escort team crash-landed on this planet to escape a Star Destroyer, and a stormtrooper ground patrol attacked them. We lost everyone except the engineer. Quick, head out and find the engineer, then give safe escort back here. Please hurry!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 188, 'm32p', 'This has been a nightmare. But even if the Empire gets me, I don''t regret my decision. I''m willing to die for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 189, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 190, 'm32c', 'This is great work! Our new friend has volunteered to tell us a great deal about Lord Vader''s experimental TIE fighter and other advanced ships. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 191, 'm32e', 'My work has indirectly led to the oppression of billions. I can''t live with that any more. I want to undo the evil I''ve helped perpetuate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 192, 'm32t', 'Sienar Systems Defector Requires Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 193, 'm33o', 'With the Imperial Army refusing to enlist nonhuman species, the Alliance has a chance to turn this bigotry to good effect. One of our diplomats has been meeting with Duro leaders, trying to get them to join us. The diplomat is stopping here en route to High Command to make a report. Will you bring the official here from the landing point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 194, 'm33p', 'It''s been a challenging trip, with Imperial ships dogging us all along. I had to leave my ship via escape pod to reduce the danger to my allies. I appreciate your escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 195, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 196, 'm33c', 'These diplomatic missions can be dangerous. Thanks for bringing the official here safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 197, 'm33e', 'It remains to be seen whether the Duro will join the Alliance. I suspect they are too diffuse and independent. But we must keep trying.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 198, 'm33t', 'Alien Affairs Diplomat Delivering Report'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 199, 'm34o', 'General Airen Cracken''s smugglers -- I mean "procurement specialists" -- are getting jumpy because of Imperial attention. One of them plans to deliver medical supplies here, but wants to scout out the place first. The "specialist" asked for just one escort, not a squad. Can you do the job? Try to, uh, look harmless.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 200, 'm34p', 'I asked for just one guard. I want to be sure there''s no funny business here. As in "those funny Imperials." Get me? Okay, lead the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 201, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 202, 'm34c', 'Once this procurement specialist sees there''s nothing to worry about, we should get the medical supplies pretty soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 203, 'm34e', 'Hold on -- I just want to check over that way -- okay, okay -- and anything under here? No. Okay, this may work, this may work. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 204, 'm34t', '"Procurement Specialist" Wants Guide'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 205, 'm35o', 'A special Alliance operative is hiding beyond the city borders. I need you to deliver these new, coded instructions: "Echo Roger Bravo dash Twelve." It''s urgent that you get there immediately. Go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 206, 'm35p', '"Bravo dash Twelve?" That''s outrageous! This is a "dash Eleven" situation if there ever was one. Take me back to your contact. We''ve got to have a chat about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 207, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 208, 'm35c', '"Dash Twelve," "dash Eleven," what''s the difference? At least we''re not saying "dash Thirteen." That would have been absurd.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 209, 'm35e', '"Bravo dash Twelve" indeed! What kind of operation is this? It''s "dash Eleven" or I''m off the case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 210, 'm35t', 'Secret Instructions for a Field Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 211, 'm36o', 'We''ve got an agent in the field investigating claims of an Imperial massacre. We dare not send any shuttles or transmissions to the area. Can you sneak out there and check up on our investigator''s progress? Alliance High Command is very interested in this information. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 212, 'm36p', 'Good, you''re here. I''ve found blaster scorching on the ground all around here. I''d estimate the Empire executed twenty or thirty civilians, not more than a week ago. I need to report this to Alliance High Command. Can get me back undetected?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 213, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 214, 'm36c', 'You did well. I''ll mention you by name in my report to High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 215, 'm36e', 'Thank you greatly. Now I can get this evidence of the Imperial massacre to Alliance High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 216, 'm36t', 'Check Up on an Alliance Investigator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 217, 'm37o', 'We''ve set up a portable listening station away from the city, to eavesdrop on Imperial communications. I want you to get out there and relieve the current operator for awhile. Try not to send any transmissions along the way. We don''t want the authorities to find us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 218, 'm37p', 'I''m glad you''re here. The Imperial patrols started using an unknown scramble code less than an hour ago. I think they know about my listening device. We''ve got to get back to safety before they track us down. Lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 219, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 220, 'm37c', 'And thanks from me as well. The Alliance needs good agents like you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 221, 'm37e', 'That was close. I was afraid we might get nabbed by Imperial patrols. Thanks for the help, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 222, 'm37t', 'Assist an Alliance Eavesdropper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 223, 'm38o', 'One of our transports had a close call with some TIE fighters. The ship crashed but the pilot ejected to safety in time. You''d better get out there and bring''em back before the planetside Imperial forces start combing the area. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 224, 'm38p', 'Thank goodness you found me. I can''t believe I was shot down by a couple of junk-heap TIE fighters. Let''s get out of this place before we''re caught.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 225, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 226, 'm38c', 'Sometimes the Empire will get the upper hand. It happens. Both of you did your jobs well. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 227, 'm38e', 'Thank you for the escort. I still can''t believe I couldn''t dodge those TIE fighters. My dogfighting skills are getting rusty.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 228, 'm38t', 'Retrieve a Stranded Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 229, 'm39o', 'There''s an Imperial mine field outside of town. We sent an agent to neutralize these hidden explosives, but all we''ve heard back is a distress signal. Can you head out there to see what''s going on? Oh, and be careful where you step. We suspect it''s a very dense mine field.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 230, 'm39p', 'I can''t believe you just crossed the mine field with no scanning equipment! I had a power surge in my comlink that fried my sensor and I''ve been afraid to move for an hour. Well, no sense postponing it any longer. Let''s get out of this mess before the Imperial patrols fly over. If you pray to any deities on your homeworld, now''s the time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 231, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 232, 'm39c', 'Good work. You''ve got a future in mine sweeping, if you would care to join our ranks. We''ve always got new openings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 233, 'm39e', 'Unbelievable! We made it through the mine field without a scratch. That''s twice you managed it. Are you sure you''re not Force-sensitive?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 234, 'm39t', 'Extract an Alliance Minesweeper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 235, 'm40o', 'An Alliance spy has arrived from offworld to debrief us about some findings on Klatooine. A secret transport dropped the spy far from the city''s sensors. I want a clandestine extraction. The task falls to you. Bring our spy back here and let''s find out what''s happening on Klatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 236, 'm40p', 'You''re my escort? Good. Let''s move quietly. I''ve got some interesting information that I''m sure the Empire wants to stifle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 237, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 238, 'm40c', 'Droid bombs? Very interesting. I wonder if the Alliance could undercut the Empire and get ahold of them?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 239, 'm40e', 'I''m glad we made it here alive. Thanks. Now I can tell you about the droid bombs that some Klatooinan engineers are trying to sell to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 240, 'm40t', 'Escort an Alliance Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 241, 'm41o', 'We sent two agents to sabotage an Imperial orbital refinery. They were supposed to rendezvous with us afterward for debriefing, but our pickup team did not find them. I need you to go to the meeting point and see if they''ve arrived yet. Be on the lookout for Imperial patrols.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 242, 'm41p', 'Sorry for the delay. We were nearly caught by an Imperial boarding crew. My partner died, but we wiped out those dogs! Now I just want to get back home, make my report and have a long rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 243, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 244, 'm41c', 'No rest yet, I''m afraid. Alliance Command says we need to hit another refinery. Don''t worry, the Force will give you strength.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 245, 'm41e', 'Boy, am I glad to be back. Our sabotage was successful. The Imperial Navy in this system will be short on stellar fuel for awhile. Now I just want to get some rest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 246, 'm41t', 'Escort a Rebel Saboteur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 247, 'm42o', 'We''ve got a meeting with an artillery expert, but Imperial patrols have stepped up in this area. The expert is stuck between cities. Go out there, make sure there''s no Imperial trouble and let''s get this meeting back on schedule.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 248, 'm42p', 'Let''s not waste any time. This area is crawling with stormtroopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 249, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 250, 'm42c', 'Ion cannons against Star Destroyers? That is interesting. We could use that kind of artillery support for planetary evacuation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 251, 'm42e', 'That was too close. Thank you for the help. I''ve got some interesting information about the effectiveness of ion cannons against Star Destroyers. Time for debriefing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 252, 'm42t', 'Assist an Alliance Artillery Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 253, 'm43o', 'One of our new operatives came from a slicing background. We took advantage of this expertise to sabotage an experimental droid project that the Empire has started on Klatooine. Reprogrammed droids can be a powerful ally. Our slicer has just returned and I need you to provide an escort back here. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 254, 'm43p', 'I can''t wait to make this report. I reprogrammed an experimental droid starfighter for independent thought. Now that crazy robot is winging through the galaxy, evading TIE fighters and hunting down the scientists who built it. Boy, do I love my work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 255, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 256, 'm43c', 'Sometimes slicers are a little too creative. Never mind, I''ll reserve judgment until I hear the full report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 257, 'm43e', '... and after the droid starfighter wipes out the scientists who created it, I programmed it to fly to the outlying systems and help fight Imperial expansion forces. I can''t wait to hear how well it does.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 258, 'm43t', 'Help an Alliance Slicer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 259, 'm44o', 'We''ve lost an intelligence agent! The Imperials must have learned about this secret mission. Get out to the rendezvous point as fast as you can and see if there''s any sign of what happened.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 260, 'm44p', 'I thought you''d never get here! I''ve been hiding from Imperial squads for the last three hours. Lucky for us, the coast is clear right now. Let''s get out of here before they come back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 261, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 262, 'm44c', 'Excellent work. You''re a true asset to the Alliance, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 263, 'm44e', 'I thought I was a goner out there. Thanks for bringing me back safely. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 264, 'm44t', 'Find an Alliance Intelligence Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 265, 'm45o', 'We''ve got trouble. An engineer of ours just landed on the planet. An Imperial patrol has the whole area pinned down and I fear the worst. Aerial support is on the way, but they won''t get there for awhile. Do you think you''re skilled enough to lend a hand?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 266, 'm45p', 'The Imperials just left! I don''t know what happened. One second they were firing at me and the next all was clear. Something''s going on. I don''t want to stick around to find out what it is. Let''s move!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 267, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 268, 'm45c', 'That was too close. High Command is really interested in this report. Say, do you smell something strange? Ah, it was probably nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 269, 'm45e', 'I''m glad we got out of there in one piece. I sure hope the Imperials didn''t track us or something. Anyway, now I can make my report about the ISB''s use of poison gasses against Alliance troops on Cularin.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 270, 'm45t', 'Escort a Rebel Engineer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 271, 'm46o', 'A secret Alliance transport came down outside the city. We sent a crew to clean up the mess, but we had to leave quick when the authorities showed up. Unfortunately we left one of the rescue team behind. Our scanners give us the all clear, but we don''t want to risk flying in just yet. Can you hoof it out there and make sure our comrade gets back safely? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 272, 'm46p', 'I thought I''d left combat behind when I signed up for the rescue team. Now here I am on the battlefield again. Just my luck. Let''s get back and I''ll buy you a drink to thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 273, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 274, 'm46c', 'Yes, you guessed it. Another transport came down just before you two got here. The rescue crew is heading out again. The struggle for galactic freedom never ends.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 275, 'm46e', 'Uh-oh. I recognize that look in my commander''s eyes. Guess we''ll have to save that drink for another day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 276, 'm46t', 'Escort Alliance Rescue Personnel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 277, 'm47o', 'We have a project underway to map hyperspace supply lines between major Alliance star clusters. A logistics expert has arrived on the planet to confer about this matter. How would you like to rendezvous with this newcomer and bring them back here? I''m not even sure what they look like, but I do have the coordinates of their secret dropoff point. Better arm yourself for the trip, just in case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 278, 'm47p', 'Hi. I''m the logistics expert. Are you my escort? Good. I was worried that the Empire might have discovered these coordinates and sent a spy. Please take me to your commanders now. Long live the Rebellion! Um, I mean, the Alliance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 279, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 280, 'm47c', 'But of course! What a pleasure it is to meet such a courteous and motivated agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 281, 'm47e', 'So this is one of your larger bases in the star system? Excellent. Please show me everything. I am most interested to see your operation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 282, 'm47t', 'Help Out an Alliance Logistics Expert'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 283, 'm48o', 'We''re honored to have one of the Alliance''s top pilots pay us a visit. I want you to head out to the rendezvous point and provide an escort back here. I''ll show the captain around. Maybe we''ll get a new star pilot for our local squadron!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 284, 'm48p', 'Dropped off in the middle of nowhere. What a welcome this is. If you''re my contact, I hope you''ve got something good to show me about Alliance operations in this system. So far I''m not very impressed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 285, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 286, 'm48c', 'I''m very excited to meet such a famous star pilot! Please, captain, if there''s anything I can do to make you feel at home, just ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 287, 'm48e', 'The operation isn''t much to see, I grant you, but you never told me there were such dashing and attractive officers here! I don''t suppose you can introduce us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 288, 'm48t', 'Retrieve an Ace Fighter Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 289, 'm49o', 'Some kind of huge Imperial gunship had us pinned down outside of town! I''ve never seen that kind of vessel before. Nearly blasted us to pieces. I got separated from my buddy and barely made it back here. My friend is still out there. I have the coordinates from the distress beacon, but I''m too banged up to manage a rescue. Can you handle it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 290, 'm49p', 'Am I glad to see you! That weird Imperial gunship has buzzed the area every half hour since the fight. Let''s get out of here before it comes back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 291, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 292, 'm49c', 'The report can wait. I''m just glad to see you alive. And thank you, my new friend, for performing the rescue I couldn''t.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 293, 'm49e', 'I could swear that new gunship looks like it''s amphibious. What''s the Empire up to, anyway? I''ll have to file a report on this one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 294, 'm49t', 'Rescue a Stranded Alliance Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 295, 'm50o', 'When a turbolaser explodes, the results are not pretty. We lost some mercenaries outside of town when a stolen turbo blew up without warning. Their Alliance liaison is still alive, though. I need to you get out there quickly and fetch our agent back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 296, 'm50p', 'Thank goodness you''re here. I couldn''t get much farther on my own. Imperial patrols are bound to investigate the turbolaser explosion and I want to be as far away from the blast site as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 297, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 298, 'm50c', 'I''m just glad that you got back alive. We can find other turbolasers, but there''s only one of you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 299, 'm50e', 'The more I think about it, the more I believe the Empire must have rigged that turbolaser to explode. Why else would it blow up like that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escorttocreator_rebel_medium.stf', 300, 'm50t', 'Fetch an Alliance Liaison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My team struck a Rebel medical supply depot. The facility''s security was much tougher than Intelligence had indicated. My team was wiped out, but I made it out alive. I need you to escort me back to base. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'A find job, citizen. The Empire could use more loyal, hardworking individuals. I''ll mention you in my report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Escort the Strike Team Commander'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Greetings, loyal citizen. I''m hoping you can assist a fellow Imperial. I was part of a strike team that assaulted a Rebel refugee outpost not far from here. We didn''t realize the Rebels had so many armed Wookiees protecting that camp. My team was a bit unprepared. I need an escort back to base to report. Can you do that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Many thanks, citizen. I''ll make sure that next time we strike that camp, we have enough firepower to overcome a horde of howling Wookiees.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Strike Team Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'I need your help, citizen. I''m an Intelligence agent sent to destroy a Rebel indoctrination camp. I succeeded in my mission, but not before a Rebel sniper got in a few good shots. I''ve treated my wound, but I need to get back to base for more extensive repairs. Can the Empire count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'The Empire is grateful to you, citizen. Take this reward, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Save the Imperial Saboteur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'I''m an ISB agent, citizen, and had been on a reconnaissance mission to determine whether a droid repair facility was actually a Rebel sleeper terrorist cell. Well, it was, and I barely escaped with my life. I need you to make sure I get safely back to headquarters so I can report what I''ve seen.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'You have my gratitude, citizen. Allow the Empire to reward your service. Long live the Emperor!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Save the Imperial Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'I''m on special assignment to silence a Sienar Fleet Systems engineer who defected to the Rebellion. I tracked him here and was about to terminate him when a Rebel strike team intervened and whisked him to safety. I need you to escort me to my base before the Rebels return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'My thanks, citizen. I''m not sure I would have made it without your help. My blaster was damaged during my encounter with the Rebels, and I would have been defenseless had they chosen to return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Help the Imperial Assassin'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'I''ve managed to get my hands on a particularly heinous piece of Rebel propaganda. It''s a doctored holorecording that purports to show the destruction of Alderaan by the Empire. Preposterous piece of Rebel filth! I need to get this back to base, but I fear I am being pursued by Rebel agents. Can you provide an escort, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'Thanks, citizen. I''ll show this to my superiors so we can start tracking down the data slicer that put this together.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Stomp the Rebel Propaganda'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'I''ve discovered a Rebel strike team''s base. I suspect that Rebel assassins are closing in on me and need your help to get back to my base in one piece. Can you aid the Empire in this way?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'Your timely arrival saved my life. Now I can organize a storm commando strike on that Rebel base. Here''s a reward for your services.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Help Wipe Out the Rebel Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'I''m an Imperial covert operative on a secret reconnaissance mission. I''ve discovered a Rebel SpecForces training facility and need to get word back to base so they can organize a strike. I may have been seen while reconnoitering the base. Can you provide me with a safe escort back to base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm8u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'As long as the Rebellion continues to gain support, our work as loyal Imperial citizens will never be done. My thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Protect the Covert Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'I believe I''ve located the Rebel Procurement and Supply command center housing the Rebel known as Targeter. We can''t transmit this information via comlink as it will alert the Rebels. Could you please escort me back to headquarters so I can get this information to Imperial Intelligence?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'The Empire rewards those who serve its interests, as this will demonstrate. You have my thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'Secure Vital Information'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'I think I may have discovered a starfighter refueling station used by the infamous Rogue Squadron. I need you to make sure I can get this vital information back to my superiors. Rebel assassins are everywhere, and carrying this type of message makes me an obvious target. Can you help me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. I hope we can work together again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Secure Information About Rogue Squadron'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'I''ve discovered who''s been smuggling high-grade Thyferran bacta to the Rebellion. Iwas on my way back to base when I was attacked by the smugglers. I barely escaped with my life. Could you escort me back to base, so my superiors can deal with this situation?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'Taking the Rebels'' source of bacta away will certainly be a crippling blow to those scum, eh, citizen? Here''s a reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Stop the Flow of Rebel Bacta'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'One of our garrisons was just attacked by a large Rebel force. I managed to escape, and I''m on my way to get reinforcements. I need you to provide me with an escort to the next garrison. Can you serve your Emperor in this way?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'My compliments on a job well done, citizen. Now those Rebel scum will learn the true meaning of "Imperial justice."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Avenge a Garrison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'I was escorting Moff Torgaren to Imperial Center when his shuttle was attacked by Rogue Squadron. Moff Torgaren was killed, but I managed to make my escape in a pod that landed near here. Could you please provide me an escort to the nearest garrison so I can report this tragedy?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'I will mention your invaluable aid in my report, citizen. Moff Torgaren was close the Emperor himself. Allow me to reward you for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Avenge the Moff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'I was on my way to meet one of our contacts who claimed that the Rebellion was conducting bizarre experiments involving Force-sensitive individuals. My contact never showed, but a group of Rebel assassins did. I managed to fight them off. Now I need your help to get back to base. Can I count on you, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'Peformed like a true and loyal citizen of the Empire. Your actions will be mentioned in my report to Imperial Center. Please accept this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'Protect Information Regarding the Force'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'Although it cost the lives of my entire team, I managed to learn that Mon Mothma will be visiting a Rebel refugee outpost in a few days. I must get this information back to Intelligence so that proper measures can be taken. I''m being pursued by Rebel killers. Can you escort me back to base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'The Rebellion would suffer a crushing blow if Mon Mothma were to be removed. Your help may mean the end of the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Help Crush the Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'You ever been clubbed by a Wookiee? Well, it hurts. Lucky for me I have a thick skull. I need you to make sure I get back to the local garrison. You see, the reason the Wookiee clubbed me was that I overheard these smugglers making plans to deliver cargo to the Rebellion. That''s a no-no, citizen. Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'Much obliged, citizen. I owe that Wookiee a clubbing, wouldn''t you agree? Let''s see how effectively a squad of stormtroopers can do that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Spank the Wookiee'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'My transport was hijacked by Rebel terrorists. I managed to escape by feigning death. You must make sure I get back to base so I can report this theft and we can organize a retrieval mission. Those Rebel scum will pay for this dastardly attack.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'Well done, citizen. Accept this reward for your services. I''m off to punish some Rebels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Punish the Rebel Hijackers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'My squad was participating in a military exercise, and I was providing AT-ST support. This was my first time as a solo pilot, but I always did fine in the simulators. I don''t know what happened -- maybe I hit a mine -- but next thing I know, I fell. Onto the rest of my squad. It was bad. I need an escort back to HQ to make my report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'Thanks. I''m not looking forward to making this report. Maybe I''ll stop at the mess for a last meal.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'AT-ST Walker Pilot Stranded'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'I was delivering a shipment of binary load lifters for a military exercise when my vehicle hit some big creature. I wasn''t paying close attention because one of the droids distracted me. Kept asking "Are we there yet?" I got so irritated -- at any rate, I left the wreck way back there. I need an escort. Are you available?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'Nothing more annoying than a pushy droid. Now please excuse me, I have to fill out a stack of reports.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'Imperial Droid Transport Pilot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'My squad raided a wretched hive of Corellian Route pirates. We surrounded the base and marched in -- but the mines! The whole surrounding area, and the walls, and the inner courtyard, all mined! The entire installation was one big trap. We found no pirates. I''m the only one left. Can you escort me back to my HQ?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'It won''t be much fun filing this report. Sometimes I think pirates have it easier than we do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Survivor of Imperial Pirate Base Raid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'Those Hutt gangs are still a threat to Imperial dominion. Following an informant''s tip, we raided a gangster installation -- but there were trapdoors all over. We couldn''t take a step without falling down into a pit full of rancors. Everyone got ripped to shreds, except me. I was, uh, standing watch outside. I need to report back, can you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'Thank you. I''ve had this whole trip to think of reasons why I was standing watch outside instead of inside. This debriefing should go all right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Last Soldier from Gangster Assault'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'An informant pinpointed a smuggler base near here. The Empire made a major assault. I got separated from the rest when my speeder broke down. When I finally arrived, the whole company had been wiped out by some kind of acid-gas. Dissolved straight through armor! It got my comlink, too. I need you to escort me back to HQ.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'It''s a sad day for the forces of order when common criminals have better armaments than we do. Excuse me, I must go make my report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Smugglers Killed Imperial Company'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'Oh! I -- I hadn''t expected to meet anyone here. My commanding officer took me out here to, uh -- to have a discussion. My commander? He''s gone. Um, I mean -- he took off. No, I don''t know why. Or where. Look, can you just take me where I want to go? And not ask questions?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'Thank you. It''s best not to mention this to anyone. I expect to be promoted very soon, and I can be an influential friend -- or a bad enemy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Imperial Returning from Errand'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'A rescuer! Good! A filthy Rodian bounty hunter captured me and threatened my life unless I paid him a fortune. At least he said he was a bounty hunter -- I never saw his license. He dumped me out here. Escort me back home, please!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'I can''t think who would put out a bounty on me. I shall check at once with the Guild. Mark me, there are troubled times ahead for all the Rodians on this world.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Victim of Rodian Bounty Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'Only a few of us survived a Rebel air assault on our ISB interrogation center. We were waiting out here for rescue, but we started arguing. We had a -- a disagreement. With blasters. Now I''m the only survivor of the survivors. Can you escort me to my headquarters?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'Thank you for not giving in to dissension. I must say, I''m not looking forward to making my report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'ISB Agent Betrayed by Peers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'If only I''d thought ahead! I sent my squad into a cave said to be a Rebel hideout. They marched in, obedient and trusting as pets, and then -- a trap! The cave was rigged to explode! If I''d had two brain cells to rub together, I would have -- but enough. I must get back to headquarters and report. Will you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'Whatever fate the Empire decrees for me, whatever punishment they give -- it''s less than I deserve.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Officer Prone to Self-Loathing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'I''ve been out here for -- seems like a season -- I think. Lots of empty wilderness. Scouting for -- I forget -- oh! Rebels! Yes! I didn''t find anything. I''ve been out here a long time. Loooong. I think -- it''s crazy, but -- somebody forgot about me. Maybe. Can you -- you think -- take me back? Home, I mean? HQ? Okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'I''m back. I''m back! I never thought I''d be glad to see this place. I mean -- don''t tell anyone I said -- anyway. I have to find someone to report to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'Forward Observer Reporting Back'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'I was out here with my buddy practicing with the Merr-Sonn missile tube. I walked away from our camp for a moment -- got back -- there he was, dying! His last words were something like, "Oh, I --" I thought I saw some Twi''lek running in the distance, but I couldn''t catch him. It was strange. I -- I need to get back to HQ. Escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 110, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'You know, thinking about it, I remember crazy rumors about some Twi''lek adventurer called "O-i." If that was him -- naah. I won''t put that in my report!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'Weapons Tester Getting Jumpy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'I''ll say this once, and I''m not looking for backtalk. I was piloting a cloud car out here, scouting for Rebels. I ran into a flock of birds, got a little distracted -- that''s all it was, simple distraction, could happen to anyone -- flipped the car, and fell out. There''s no reason to laugh about a simple mistake. Just escort me back to base, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 114, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'You can laugh about falling out of a cloud car, but wait until it happens to you. It could, you know. Any kind of laughter here is completely out of line, that''s what I say.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Soldier Not Putting Up With Any Guff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'I was out scouting. For Alliance fighters -- I mean, Rebel scum. I found one, a woman, setting up a datapoint. I took her prisoner and was marching her in -- but we got to talking -- she was so -- well, somehow she got me into a, uh, vulnerable position -- and she got away. I didn''t let her go! Don''t think that! Look, I need an escort back to base, and no funny talk.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 118, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'The Alli-- Rebellion must be, hey, pretty desperate, you know? Recruiting some beauty queen as a fighter. Huh! Gorgeous women won''t stand a chance against us! Right? I mean -- uh, I have to go report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Imperial Who Denies Infatuation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'Great out here, isn''t it? I''ve been taking a little target practice on camps and huts over in the distance. They blow up big, whoom! What? Rebels? I don''t know. But face it, everyone out here is probably some kind of lawbreaker. Right? Listen, I''m way low on ammo, so can you give me safe escort back to base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 122, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'Thanks. I need to hit the supply room for a weapon recharge. Then it''s back out for more target practice!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Imperial Doing Some Joy-Shooting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'I''m out here on a classified mission. Very hush-hush. I can see you''re impressed. I''d tell you about it, but we military-intelligence types are taught secrecy above all. What? Well, yes, it is my first mission. But it''s very important, and I can''t talk about it. I''m finished now, so can you escort me back to Intelligence for my un-briefing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 126, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'Thanks. Uh, it occurs to me that when I said "un-briefing" earlier, you might have thought I''d used that term mistakenly for the correct "debriefing." I was just testing you, that''s all. Goodbye, I''m off on more secret business!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Agent on Important Secret Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'Heard reports that someone out here was making fun of the Emperor. Dispatch likes to send one or two of us out into the countryside every so often, just to keep folks in line. Kind of lonely work, though. Want to travel with me back to base, just to have someone to talk to?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 130, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'I couldn''t think of much to say, but it was pleasant having company on the trip. Well, back to work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Soldier Asking for Company'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'My orders were to spread the good news about the Empire''s New Order, and I''m doing that with enthusiasm! I think more folks need to know how our Emperor has brought stability and honesty to the galaxy after the corruption of the Old Republic. Help me do the Empire''s good work by escorting me to my next lecture.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 134, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'Thank you, agent! I''m just going for a bite to eat, and then it''s on to another crowd eager to hear how their Empire is helping them live a better life! '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'The Emperor''s Biggest Fan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'I''ve just received some interesting news from Yavin. Apparently salvage freighters are smuggling space debris to Rebel engineers. I must get this information to my superiors. Do you know your way around here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 138, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'Thanks for the help. We''ll put a stop to these salvage freighters who dare lend aid to the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'News of Rebel Salvage Freighters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'I''ve uncovered plans for an illegal power relay station. I''m sure it''s for the Rebellion, but I think the Rebels are onto me. Can you help me get this information to Sector Command?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 142, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'Am I glad you showed up to help me! The Rebels were stalking me like a wounded shaak. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'Relay Important Information'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'You find the strangest things on the HoloNet. I got ahold of some vids of what looks like the Death Star exploding. That can''t be, right? The Rebellion could never destroy a space station that big. Anyway, I thought I should get the data tapes to my superiors so they can check it out. Can you help me get there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 146, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'Thanks for coming along. Some unsavory looking people were following me. Now I can get these holovids to my superiors.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'Guard Some Unusual Data Tapes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'Sometimes I hate this assignment. A couple of jokers have set up a mynock incubator a couple of valleys over. You know the Rebels use mynocks to sabotage Imperial transports, right? So I''ve got to make a report. Those clowns did have some blasters lying around, though. Can you escort me back to my station, in case they start any trouble?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 150, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'Thanks for the help. You never know what these lowlifes will do when the light of the law shines on them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'Mynock Breeders Can Be Trouble'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'I''m testing some new contact lenses. They''re made of the same black quartz as stormtrooper visors. Unfortunately I seem to be having some trouble seeing where I''m going. Can I convince you to lead me back to my station, so I can report this problem? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 154, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'Thanks for the help. These black quartz contact lenses should have given me the same keen vision as a rank-and-file stormtrooper. I don''t understand what went wrong.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Black Quartz Lenses'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'Uhhh -- where am I? What planet? My transport got hijacked. Somebody said the hijacker was some dr-- no, they can''t have said it, that''s too crazy. I''m hallucinating. I got to the escape pod before the ship blasted back into hyperspace. I landed hard. Can you take me to the Imperial authorities on whatever world this is?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 158, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'Thanks. I''m still woozy. That''s the only explanation. No way a little mouse droid would be capable of hijacking an Imperial transport.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Transport Hijack Trouble'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'You there! Stop! I need you to take me to the nearest Imperial station. I''ve learned the identity of one of the Rebellion''s top leaders. I must make my report before those Rebel scum track me down. Quickly, lead on!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 162, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'I''m glad you were able to help me. Soon we shall crush those Rebel dogs once and for all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Reveal the Identity of a Rebel Leader'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'I know it''s hard to believe, but I''m pretty sure I''ve discovered an actual Jedi Knight. I have to report this to my superiors at once. But Jedi are supposed to be extremely dangerous, so I sure could use some extra eyes and weapons along the way. Are you available to come with me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 166, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'Thanks for coming along with me. I was afraid that Jedi might track me down. The Jedi''s name is ... um ... that''s odd. I can''t seem to remember. Suddenly I feel weak-minded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Identity of a Jedi'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'I need your help! I''m a field medic. I''m supposed to medicate an injured covert agent, but I seem to have gotten myself turned around. Can you point me the way to these coordinates? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 170, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'Excellent. I''m supposed to meet the covert agent here so I can give her some medication. You''d better move on or it might look suspicious. Thanks for your aid.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Escort a Medic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'I''ve found a length of Mandalorian smartrope that''s rumored to have come from a Jedi''s armor. I''m trying to get back to my superiors to make a report, but I''m not very familiar with this area. Give me a hand, would you? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 174, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'Thanks, my friend. My superiors will want to investigate this smartrope. I''ll look you up if I get lost again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'Deliver Mandalorian Smartrope'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'Will you look at what happened to my navpad? I loaned it to a Gamorrean mercenary, and he gave it back all gummed up with slobber. Now I can''t find my way back to my station. Can you help me out here? I''d much appreciate it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 178, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'Thanks for the help. And take my advice: If you loan equipment to a Gamorrean, make sure it''s sealed up tight. Their saliva is like molecular glue.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Undone by a Gamorrean'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'I''ve got information about a possible new source of phobium ore. I think some gangsters from the Gargon system might be tracking me, though. I guess they want to maintain their monopoly. Do me a favor and take me to the Imperial station at these coordinates. With both of us along, maybe we won''t get any trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 182, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'I appreciate the help. Couldn''t have done it without you. Maybe this lead on a new source of phobium ore will turn into something solid. Hey, you think I might get a promotion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'New Source of Phobium Ore'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'Ooohhh, I don''t feel so good. I came into this system on a droid transport. Since there was no life support on board, they had to freeze me for the trip. Now I think I''ve got hibernation sickness. If you can see me to the coordinates of my new post, I will be very grateful. Just don''t walk too fast, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 186, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'I can''t thank you enough for the help. I thought this hibernation sickness would have worn off by now, though. This is the last time I tell my commander that I''ll travel by any available transport.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'Unwell Imperial Operative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'Never trust a Weequay! That''s all I''m saying. I hopped a private shuttle piloted by one of them. That ugly son of a gundark robbed me blind and dumped me out here. I need to get to my destination as soon as possible. That Weequay will regret crossing me!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 190, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'Thank you, my friend. Now to see about that Weequay sleemo who robbed me! Maybe there''s an AT-ST around here that I can borrow ...'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Wronged by a Weequay'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'I can''t believe it! My unit just ran into a rancor! That horrible beast slaughtered everyone but me! Please, get me back to my station so I can report this at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 194, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'Oh, did I say it was a rancor? Actually I just got separated from my unit. It''s not like I''m the first guy to get lost way out there. This is a big planet, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Rancor Horror'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'Gundarks. Filthy creatures. I drew the joyous assignment of tromping out here to eliminate a nest of them. Now that the work is done, I realize I lost my navpad in their nest. I''m sure not going to root around in their filth just to find it again. I don''t suppose you''d want to show me the way back to my post? I''ll buy you a drink for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 198, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'Hey, I really appreciate it. Look me up when I''m off duty and I''ll buy you that drink.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_imperial_easy.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Gundarks Eliminated'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My friends claim I have the worst sense of direction of anyone they know. They bet me I couldn''t find my way back to town without the aid of navigational devices. Guess they were right. If you get me back safely, I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1t', 'Galaxy''s Worst Sense of Direction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Please don''t mention this to anyone, huh? I hate when my friends are right. And they seem to be right far too often for my tastes. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'I heard a bounty hunter had come into town looking for me so I decided to hide out here. He might still be looking for me. Would you mind escorting me back into town just in case?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm2t', 'Bounty Hunter Looking for Me'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm2c', 'Thanks, you''re a pal. Can I offer some free advice? Never double-cross a Hutt. This is for your aid. See ya!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'I was supposed to meet a secret admirer out here, but it looks like I was stood up. I''m so embarrassed I don''t dare call any of my friends to pick me up. Could you safely escort me back into the city? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm3t', 'Secret Admirer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm3c', 'Thanks for your kindness. It''s good to see there are some decent folk left in the galaxy. Never trust anyone whose face you haven''t seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'I drove out here to get my young son. He likes to play out here, and folks say they''ve seen predators roaming this area. Turns out my son was home and my speeder needs a new repulsorlift engine. Care to escort me back to the city, friend?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm4t', 'Wasted Rescue Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm4c', 'Thanks for your help. Here''s a little something for you. I''m a bit embarrassed that I needed an escort in the first place. I think some practice with my blaster is in order, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'I believe there''s a stranger following me. I''m afraid he might be a swooper. I''ve heard they''re very dangerous. Could you escort me safely into the city? I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm5t', 'Stranger on My Trail'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm5c', 'Did you see that suspicious fellow that kept just out of sight? He followed us the whole way. Thanks so much for seeing me safely here. Here''s your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'My speeder broke down not too far from here. I had to flee some large predators that were drawn by the crash, and I fear they might have followed me. Could I get your help in getting back to civilization?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm6t', 'Large Predators Following Me'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm6c', 'Thanks, citizen. This is for your troubles. I''ll be sure never to travel without my blaster in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'My friends claimed they were taking me to see my new speeder bike. They thought it''d be funny to leave me out in the middle of nowhere with no means to defend myself. Care to help me get home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm7t', 'Friends Played Practical Joke'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm7c', 'Thanks, buddy. Here you go. First thing I''m gonna do is find a new group of friends. Then I''m gonna plot a fairly elaborate revenge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'I''m so absentminded! It''s going to be the death of me yet. I''m an inventor, you see, and I got to thinking about how to improve my droid''s AA-1 verbobrain. Next thing you know, I''m out here. Please help me get home safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm8t', 'Absentminded Inventor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm8c', 'Many thanks, citizen. It''s good to see not everyone suffers from my malady. What? Of course, your payment! How forgetful of me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'My malfunctioning R2 unit was seen headed out in this direction, so I decided to try and find it. All I did was get myself lost. Care to escort me back into town? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm9t', 'Never Follow an R2 Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm9c', 'Thanks, friend. I was really fond of that little droid, but it''s not worth risking my life over. Here''s something for your troubles.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'I bought this bantha meat fresh from a herder. But I''m hearing strange noises around here, and I''m getting worried. Can you guard me on the way home? I''ll pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm10t', 'Trouble Buying Fresh Bantha Meat'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm10c', 'Thank you! Now I must get cooking. My family enjoys bantha loin with my special dioche sauce. Mmm! My secret ingredient is a drop of repulsorlift engine oil.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'I didn''t know figdas even grew on this world. But I''ve got enough for a fine batch of candy. I''d like an escort on the way back home, though. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm11t', 'Candy Ingredient Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm11c', 'Thanks, have a figda. I didn''t want to come home alone because the odor of fresh figda makes me giddy. Oh, and here''s a little something for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'I think I''m the victim of a prank. An Ugor friend of mine sent me out here looking for the ingredients of free-floating fungal fondue, but there''s no fungus here and I''m lost. I''ll pay you to guide me back home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm12t', 'Free-Floating Fungal Fondue'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm12c', 'What a relief. I expect I wouldn''t have found ingredients for mitochondrial crunchy surprise, either. Those Ugor! Thanks, please accept this payment for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'Last night I followed a strange floating light, and it led me here, far from home. I''ve been here ever since. Can you please guide me back home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm13t', 'Watch Out for Floating Lights'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm13c', 'Watch out for those floating lights. The rumors that they indicate treasure are probably false. Please accept this fee, with my thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'I went out here looking for my sister, who was harvesting figdas for candy. Now she''s called to say she''s already home! I don''t want her to know I''m lost, so could you guide me home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm14t', 'Sister Left Me in the Wilderness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm14c', 'If my sister had found out I got lost looking for her, I''d never hear the end of it. I thank you for being my guide.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'I''m putting down markers for the historic Green Lump Trail. Can you keep watch for danger while I read the map? I''ll pay you for your time, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm15t', 'Green Lump Trail Markers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm15c', 'That''s the end of the Green Lump Trail, unless I read the coordinates wr-- um, actually -- wait -- oh, drat, never mind. Maybe another time. Here, thank you for guiding me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'Is this the way to the local HoloNet station? No? I didn''t think so. I''m from offworld. Can you guide me to the square where I arrived? There''s credits for you if you do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm16t', 'Offworld Tourist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm16c', 'Thank you. I had an interview lined up to plug my new cookbook, "Tasty Mecolar Briddlings in One Day or Less." But I''ve missed it now. Oh well, here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'I was looking out here for a weapon that -- uh -- my friend dropped. But I''m not finding it, and the noises around here are making me nervous. Can you escort me home safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm17t', 'Dropped a Weapon, That''s All'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm17c', 'Okay, here''s the truth: When I escaped from a swoop gang out there, one of them dropped an electro-jabber. I didn''t find it, so I hope it''s shorted out by now. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'I''m afraid to travel alone around here, but you look strong and trustworthy. Please, I''ll pay you to walk with me to my sister''s neighborhood. I could use the company.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm18t', 'You Look So Trustworthy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm18c', 'You''re very kind. I hope life treats you well. Here are the credits, just like we agreed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'I never got lost back home in Sky City, but I just can''t find my way around this place. Can you show me the way to my lodgings? I''ll dig a few credits out of my luggage for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm19t', 'This Is Nothing Like Sky City'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm19c', 'Kindness is not dead in the galaxy, no matter what they say. I can''t thank you enough. See, I knew I had a few credits around here. Take them with my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'I hope you don''t mind my saying, but I have the hardest time with Wookiees. One of them changed the coordinates of our meeting place at the last minute. Can you guide me there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm20t', 'Hard Time With Wookiees'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm20c', 'It figures. There''s still no sign of the Wookiee I''m supposed to meet. You understand, don''t you, that I can''t complain to his face? Of course you understand, silly question.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'I''m having trouble with my droid. It''s wandered off and I need to get it back. I''ve got the coordinates from its tracking beacon, but I need someone to help me get there. Are you available?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm21t', 'Can''t Track Annoying Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm21c', 'Blast, now my droid has moved to some other coordinates. I''ve got to recalibrate my signal receiver and try again later. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'A crystal dealer has promised to sell me a nugget of hyperbaride, but I can''t seem to find his shop. Can you help me out? I''ll make it worth your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm22t', 'Hyperbaride Crystal Dealer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm22c', 'This is the place! Thanks. The profit from selling a hyperbaride nugget should more than replace the expense of a paid guide.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'When you''re as beautiful as I am, it''s easier if you walk with someone else. Otherwise the rabble think you''re available. So I''d like you to accompany me to an appointment with my beautician droids. Aren''t you the lucky one?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm23t', 'It''s Hard to Be Beautiful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm23c', 'Thank you for warding off all my admirers. Otherwise I''d be assailed with propositions. Would you like to meet my beautician droids? You could certainly benefit from their guidance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'I''ve come all this way to see my mother, who''s down with petal fever, but I can''t find her neighborhood. I can pay if you''ll guide me there. I want to help her ever so much.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm24t', 'Mother With Petal Fever'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm24c', 'What, you say petal fever is rarely fatal? I came all the way to see my sick mother and there will be no inheritance? I should have researched the problem more carefully. Well, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'I''m very excited about my new designs for a next-generation ion cannon! But I need someone to take me to the Imperial patent office. Can you help me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm25t', 'Next-Generation Ion Cannon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm25c', 'This is the place I was told to come, but it doesn''t look like a patent office to me. Does it to you? Well, thank you for your assistance in any case.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My old jalopy of a speeder finally gave out on me -- right in the middle of nowhere, it seems. I have some important documents that I must get to my employer as soon as possible. If you get me there, I''ll reward you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'm1t', 'Old Jalopy Gives Out'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Thanks, friend. Here''s your well-earned reward. Never buy used.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'I was left out here to meditate upon the wisdom of the great Zanazi teachers and achieve "understanding." All I got was a burning desire not to be out in the middle of nowhere without a blaster. Can you help me get home, friend?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 5, 'm2t', 'Great Zanazi Wisdom'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 6, 'm2c', 'I appreciate your help. This should cover your lost time. I don''t think the Cosmic Balance is for me. I''ll stick to the safer path of the "unbeliever."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'Could you help me? I was kidnapped by a swoop gang but managed to escape. I think I''m very far from home and those swoopers are still looking for me. I need someone to escort me home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 8, 'm3t', 'Swoop Gang Kidnap Victim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 9, 'm3c', 'Thank you so much. My family is wealthy. We know how to show our appreciation, as this reward will demonstrate. I must ensure those swoopers don''t try this again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'I thought running away from my family was the answer to my problems. At least now I know you can''t really do that. I''ll pay you if you can get me back home safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 11, 'm4t', 'Runaway Ran Too Far'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 12, 'm4c', 'My thanks. Do you have a family? You should cherish them while you can. You never know when tragedy will strike, friend. Take this with my blessing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'I just arrived for my brother''s wedding and fell victim to an unscrupulous tour guide. That rogue took off with all my luggage and left me stranded out here! If you escort me into the city, I''ll pay you for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 14, 'm5t', 'Unscrupulous Tour Guide'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 15, 'm5c', 'Thank you kindly, friend. Here you go. You''ve given me hope that not all beings on this planet are scoundrels. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'I was part of a tour that was beset by swoopers. Only I managed to survive. Could you get me to my home safely? I''ll pay you when we get there. It''s really scary out here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 17, 'm6t', 'Swoop Gangs Killed My Tour'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 18, 'm6c', 'Thanks, buddy. I''ve got some scores to settle now. No one kicks me out of a swoop gang! What tour? Oh, that was just a story to get you to escort me here, in case my former comrades decided to come back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'You know what happens when you decide to take the cheapest safari available? You end up abandoned in the middle of nowhere, that''s what. If you can get me home, I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 20, 'm7t', 'Discount Safari Victim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 21, 'm7c', 'Thanks, friend. This is for you. Now to find the owner of "Mcgrrr''s Mobile Menageries."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'My son claims I''m suffering from Bitter Winter disease. I don''t recall how I got out here. Maybe he''s right. Could you please help me? I know where I live but I don''t know how to get there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 23, 'm8t', 'Bitter Winter Disease'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 24, 'm8c', 'Am I home? Thank you for your kindness. Please let me give you a little something, to pay you for your troubles on my behalf. Who are you again?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Please help me! I''ve got evidence that will put the entire Voidspider gang in a detention cell. But I need to get to town before they get me. Can you guard me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 26, 'm9t', 'Voidspider Gang Evidence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 27, 'm9c', 'Thanks, here''s some money. This evidence will lock up the Voidspiders for days. Then the Flaming Fist will rule this town. Go Flaming Fist!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'Please help me! I''ve got evidence that will put the entire Voidspider gang in a detention cell. But I need to get to town before they get me. Can you guard me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 29, 'm10t', 'Voidspider Gang Evidence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 30, 'm10c', 'Thanks for your aid, citizen. With this evidence of murderous gang battles, law enforcement can prosecute both the Voidspiders and their rivals, the Flaming Fist.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Please help me! I''ve got evidence that will put the entire Voidspider gang in a detention cell. But I need to get to town before they get me. Can you guard me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 32, 'm11t', 'Voidspider Gang Evidence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 33, 'm11c', 'Wow, we never expected you to get here alive. Friend, you''re almost good enough to join the Voidspiders. Look us up some time. Here, have a few credits. Haw!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'The pirates took my sister for their slave ring! You must get me to town so I can get help. I''ll pay you everything I have (sob).'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 35, 'm12t', 'Pirate Slavers Kidnap Sister'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 36, 'm12c', 'Wh-what? What am I doing here? Pirates, you say? Oh no, did I have another hallucination? What -- do I owe you this? Oh. Well, here. Now where am I? I''d better call my doctor.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'Did you see the gangsters leave? They just held a summit out here, and I''ve got the exclusive recording! If you can get me to town alive and intact, I can sell this on the HoloNet and make a fortune. I''ll cut you in, let''s go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 38, 'm13t', 'Amazing Gangster Recording'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 39, 'm13c', 'I''ve been talking to news producers. Nobody wants my recording! I think the gangsters have them too scared. Well, I''ll pay you now and keep trying. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Supposedly some crazy wizard living near here used to be a Jedi Knight. I wanted to meet him, but I won''t find anything here. I can''t find my way back home -- it''s a long way. Can you help me? I''ll pay you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 41, 'm14t', 'Jedi Out Here? That''s Crazy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 42, 'm14c', 'It''s strange, now that I think on it. While I was looking around, this voice in my head said, "You won''t find anything here." I wonder if I remember it right? Anyway, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'I got dumped from a shuttle with nothing but a repulsorchute. I''d prefer not to go into details. Now I''m stranded. I''ll pay you well to get me to my destination.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 44, 'm15t', 'Dumped From a Shuttle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 45, 'm15c', 'Here is your fee. I''ll report to my superiors now.  The other agents on my shuttle said some Twi''lek adventurer called "O-i" took over the craft. If that''s true, Imperial Intelligence will track him down, believe me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'A certain person hired me to track a certain other person. I completed the contract out here. But my vehicle got destroyed, and all my ammo is gone. I''ll pay you to escort me back to my client.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 47, 'm16t', 'A Certain Person''s Contract'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 48, 'm16c', 'Thanks. Here''s your fee. I advise you not to mention this to anyone. I have a reputation to protect.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'Hello, friend. I''m on the last leg of a rather long trip, and I need an escort who can handle a weapon. Don''t want to alarm you, but everyone I traveled with so far has died. I''d prefer not to answer questions.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 50, 'm17t', 'Hyper-Dangerous Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 51, 'm17c', 'At last. All right, I can tell you now: I''ve finally delivered the secret formula for new improved Slipthroat Grizmallt Liquor! "If it''s Grizmallt, it slips down your throat." The local bottling operation thanks you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'I need someone to protect me while I transport this little MSE-6 mouse droid across the planet. It''s just myself, the droid and no questions asked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 53, 'm18t', 'Transport a Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 54, 'm18c', 'You may not realize it, but you''ve done a great service to the freedom-loving peoples of the galaxy. Take your reward and spend it with pride.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'I warn you, I have the worst luck of anyone I know. Thieves, gundarks and dune biters can''t resist me. Now I need to travel across the planet and I dare not go alone. Are you brave enough to be my guard?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 56, 'm19t', 'This World''s Unluckiest Traveller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 57, 'm19c', 'Well, that wasn''t so bad. Not like the time I dropped a box of Jorallan opals down a maintenance grate. And once I got a messy haircut from a rampaging hawk-bat. Now that was a rough day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'I made some enemies in Hutt Space, and now I need bodyguards whenever I travel. I''d like to hire you for a trip across the planet. I''ll tell you where I need to go, and you can pick the route to get there. It pays to be unpredictable when you have enemies like mine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 59, 'm20t', 'Never Annoy a Hutt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 60, 'm20c', 'You''re pretty good at this. I may seek you out again. I certainly haven''t seen the last of my enemies.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'I won''t go into the details, but I once shut down a slaver operation in the Styx system. Now I''ve got some people looking for me, and I doubt they want to play holochess. I need a tough escort for a cross-planet trip.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 62, 'm21t', 'You Look Tough Enough'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 63, 'm21c', 'Nice. You''re a good hand to have around. I might be able to use you again in the future. Have a drink on me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Do you like my jewels? They''re made of durindfire gems. Very valuable. I''d like to show them to my aunt, but she lives on the other side of the planet and I need an escort. Can you help? I know you''re a trustworthy sort. I''m a flawless judge of character.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 65, 'm22t', 'Durindfire Gem Escort'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 66, 'm22c', 'See here. I saw the way you were eyeing my jewels during the trip. Take your fee and don''t let me catch you sniffing around anymore!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'I''m selling a brand new hadrium-plated blaster to a bounty hunter in another city. Trouble is, I can''t fire it or the value goes way down, and odds are good I''ll need to protect myself on the trip. Can I hire you to watch my back along the way? I''ll pay you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 68, 'm23t', 'Hadrium-Plated Blaster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 69, 'm23c', 'You probably saved my neck just by coming along. Take these credits, you''ve earned them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'Assassin droid are nasty business, but I''ve got to make a living somehow. I know the specs on the old DX-series droids and plenty of shady characters would love to get hold of me. I''ll pay you to escort me to an appointment, if you''re available.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 71, 'm24t', 'Engineer Leads Life of Danger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 72, 'm24c', 'I''m glad we made it in one piece. I appreciate your help. Here''s a tip: If you ever face a DX assassin droid, aim for the lumbar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'Something big is happening on the Jade Moon of Loronar. I''ve got to get this information to my superiors, but I need an escort. I hope you know how to use that weapon, because it''s likely we''ll meet danger along the way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 74, 'm25t', 'Jade Moon of Loronar'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 75, 'm25c', 'I don''t know if I could have made it without you. Accept this payment and the gratitude of the freedom-loving peoples of the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_hard.stf', 76, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'You know what I discovered? That I''m not ready to take part in swoop races. I''m lucky to be alive, actually. I think I''m okay, but just to be sure could you see to it that I get home safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 2, 'm1t', 'A Repentant Swoop Racer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Thanks, friend. This is for your trouble. I''m off to find a really good medical droid. I think I may have suffered some internal injuries.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Some miners claim this area was rich in ardanium but Sithspit if I can find it! Further, and I know you''ll be shocked by this, my speeder finally died on me, the Sithspawn! If you could make sure I get back to civilization, I won''t hate you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 5, 'm2t', 'An Angry Miner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 6, 'm2c', 'You turned out to be okay, fella. I guess a reward is in order. I''m gonna go have me chat with those miners, the bags of bantha poodoo!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'I learned something about gravsleds today - don''t try to use an old one to travel across a planet. I sure could use your help getting back to civilization, friend. I''ll compensate you for lost time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 8, 'm3t', 'Gravsled Woes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 9, 'm3c', 'Much obliged, friend. You continue to do good deeds like this and folks might start considering you some sort of hero. Here you go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'I''m performing research on the relationship between krayt dragons and Star Dragons. Unfortunately for me, my speeder blew a power regulator. Could you escort me home? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 11, 'm4t', 'Aid Star Dragon Research'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 12, 'm4c', 'Thank you, friend. Here''s something for your trouble. I''ll mention you in the book I''m writing about the origins of krayt dragons.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Could you help me? My mate and I were taking a vacation and had a bad fight. It resulted in me being unceremoniously dumped out here in the middle of nowhere. I sure could use an escort home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 14, 'm5t', 'Quarreling Lovers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 15, 'm5c', 'Thanks, citizen. This is for your trouble. By the way, if you and your mate are having problems, don''t think you can patch everything up by taking a romantic trip together.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'The transport I was on crashed in the wilderness. I was the only survivor. Could you please take me back to the city so I can report this? I don''t know if I can make it alone.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 17, 'm6t', 'Accident Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 18, 'm6c', 'Many thanks, friend. Let me repay your kindness. I certainly don''t look forward to straightening this mess out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'I''m determined to prove that there are still guardians of peace and justice in the galaxy even without the Jedi. Problem is, I need to train a bit more before I go on another one of my "quests." Could you help me get home? Please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 20, 'm7t', 'A Disillusioned Questor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 21, 'm7c', 'You sure are brave, citizen. When I''ve practiced with my blaster some more, do you think we could go on heroic quests together? Oh, and this is for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'I like to get far away from civilization sometimes and think through my troubles. I just need to make sure I have a way to get back there when I''m done. Think you can help me with that, friend? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 23, 'm8t', 'Some Time Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 24, 'm8c', 'I certainly do appreciate your help. Let me pay you for your trouble. I''ll try to make sure I don''t strand myself next time I''m pondering my woes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Every time something is going well for me, something else always messes up. Why is that? I win a local lottery and the new speeder bike I buy ends up having a defective thrust engine. Think you can get me back to town safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 26, 'm9t', 'Not So Lucky'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 27, 'm9c', 'Thanks, buddy. I hear tell of some hokey religion called the Cosmic Balance that says all good must be balanced out with bad. Maybe it ain''t so hokey, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'You ever heard of the fabled treasure of D''ar Komar? No? Well apparently that''s because IT DOESN''T EXIST! Sorry. Uh, do you think you could get me back to a city? I''ll pay you if you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 29, 'm10t', 'A Bogus Rumor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 30, 'm10c', 'Thanks, bud. Here you go. I''ll be sure to be more selective about the rumors I choose to believe in the future. I knew that story was too good to be true.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'This is the lousiest map I''ve ever seen. It says here that the Aqualish Aquatic Arena is supposed to be right here. Do you see anything like that? How about showing me back to civilization, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 32, 'm11t', 'A Disenchanted Fan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 33, 'm11c', 'You''re a pal. Make sure you never buy any Rond & Mcgrrr brand maps. Here''s something for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'I''m on a secret mission and need your help! If I don''t get to my destination on time, the entire galaxy might be doomed! Can you help me? Please, trillions of sentient beings are counting on you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 35, 'm12t', 'The Fate of the Galaxy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 36, 'm12c', 'Thanks, you were really swell.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'I bet you''re wondering what I''m doing out here all alone, huh? I told my best friend that if he left his shrewish wife, I''d walk to his home and congratulate him personally. Bet you can guess what happened. Can you make sure I get there in one piece?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 38, 'm13t', 'Honoring a Promise'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 39, 'm13c', 'A thousand thanks, friend. Here''s a little something for your trouble. And take my advice - don''t make bold statements you don''t intend to keep.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'How long have you been watching me? Did you see me doing anything besides standing here? I, uh, sure could use your help getting back to town. I was sorta stranded out here. Think you can help me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 41, 'm14t', 'A Suspicious Individual'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 42, 'm14c', 'Thanks, pal. Don''t mention to anyone you saw me, okay? And these aren''t blood stains on my arms or anything, I just spilled some Blicci juice on myself. You believe me, right? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'A friend of mine said this area was haunted by the ghosts of dead Jedi. I spent the night out here but I haven''t seen anything. Think you could escort me back home. My blaster seems to be malfunctioning.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 44, 'm15t', 'A Ghost Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 45, 'm15c', 'Thanks for seeing me safely home. This should cover the use of your time. I sure hope I get to see a Jedi ghost someday.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'Okay, I won''t lie to you. I was left out here as part of a swoop gang initiation ritual. Well, Sithspit on them! If you get me safely home, I''ll turn over a new leaf. I promise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 47, 'm16t', 'A Change of Heart'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 48, 'm16c', 'Thanks, friend. I don''t know what I was thinking. Swoop gangs are for chumps and losers. I''m neither. Thanks for helping me see that. Here''s something for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'I thought I saw a Skyhopper go down in this area but I can''t find any wreckage. I was so eager to get out here, I didn''t notice my fuel cells were almost depleted. Can I get you to take me back home safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 50, 'm17t', 'A Rescuer Needs Rescuing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 51, 'm17c', 'Much appreciated, friend. Here''s something for your trouble. Now to recharge those fuel cells.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'Look at this! This stupid bolt is all that''s left of my binary loadlifter! It blew up, practically in my face, leaving me shaken and, in all likelihood, injured. I''d like you to escort me home, and possibly sign an affidavit admissible in civil court.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 53, 'm18t', 'A Shaken Droid Owner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 54, 'm18c', 'I can already feel early symptoms of whiplash. Here''s your fee. Please sign this affidavit that you saw the remains of the exploded droid that injured me. You won''t? Scoundrel! I''ll see you in court!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Very funny. I followed a trail of chewstick wrappers out here, and the last one said, "You''re lost, haha!" I know just who''s responsible, but I don''t know the way to his home from here. Can you guide me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 56, 'm19t', 'Victim of a Prank'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 57, 'm19c', 'Thank you. Here''s your fee. Now! I''ve come here to beat up a prankster and chew some chewsticks, and I''m fresh out of chewsticks. Goodbye.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'My speeder crashed way back there. Some little creature jumped up on the hood, slipped into the engine, and blam! I need to get back to town. Will you be my guard?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 59, 'm20t', 'The Trouble With Speeders'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 60, 'm20c', 'When I go back for my speeder, I''ll check on that little creature. After the explosion, its body smelled delicious! Could be a toasty taste treat.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'Mmm, yes-- Oh, hello. This territory could make for an unusual sporting field, don''t you think? Droidball, perhaps. Please escort me to my backer''s offices, and I''ll gladly pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 62, 'm21t', 'A Little Droidball'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 63, 'm21c', 'A good game of droidball can be so bracing. I hope my backer can find the funds for a nice field there. Thank you so much for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'For seven days I have meditated on the Cosmic Balance, and I am now ready to return to what is laughably called civilization. Guide me on my true path, dubious one!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 65, 'm22t', 'An Enlightened One'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 66, 'm22c', 'Let your spirit reach the Balance through the chant of the nose: Ehhhnh-- Try it: "Ehhnh--" No, more nasal. Wait, we''re here. Our paths now part. Seek the Balance!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'My studies on the indigenous festering swellmouth vine are nearly complete. It seems, however, my exuberance has led me astray. I am, in short, lost. Please guide me home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 68, 'm23t', 'An Absent-Minded Scientist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 69, 'm23c', 'How could I have lost my way so easily? The cause of science can produce a heady, even intoxicating intensity. Now I must go review my notes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'I''ve found the perfect setting for my HoloNet extravaganza, "Moons Over Masposhani." But I''m inconveniently far from the starting point of this scouting trip, so can you guide me to another settlement?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 71, 'm24t', 'HoloNet Producer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 72, 'm24c', 'Stupendous! Look at this scenery! I believe this place, too, will figure in my masterwork, if I ever get it produced. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'I''m tracking a master thief, a droid called 4-LOM. Don''t laugh. The trail went cold here; actually, I think I''ve been following a decoy. I''m lost. I''ll pay you to guide me home safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 74, 'm25t', 'Looking for 4-LOM'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 75, 'm25c', 'I hear this 4-LOM partners with a Gand tracker named Zuckuss. If you see either of them, give me a call. There''s a bounty! Meanwhile, here''s your fee, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'Nope, no agrinium deposits around here. None, sorry. What? You''re not searching for agrinium? Oh. Okay, can you guide me to the nearest assay office? Just curious to see it, that''s all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 77, 'm26t', 'A Simple Sightseer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 78, 'm26c', 'Thanks! I''ll just wander into the assay office and see if anyone has, I don''t know, claimed agrinium deposits recently. Just making conversation, you understand.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'I''ve been travelling a long time to get to the city. I need some medication for a sick relative. If you can escort me there, I''ll pay you. I don''t get to town often.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 80, 'm27t', 'In Need of Medicine'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 81, 'm27c', 'Thank you. My older brother ate a strange weed and is now delirious. He''s convinced he''s the Emperor. The medicine I get here should clear his fuddled mind.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'A Corellian light stock freighter touched down here recently. I suspect smugglers. I hoped they left something behind, but I''ve found nothing. I''m tired and nervous. Can you guard me on the way home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 83, 'm28t', 'A Lost Scavenger'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 84, 'm28c', 'Home at last! No more of this scavenging stuff for me. Next time I''ll just go straight to the smugglers and make an offer. Here, please accept this payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'I don''t hold with all this thievery and smuggling out here! I''ve got a weapon -- well, some rocks, anyway -- and I aim to show those crooks what for! But it''s way past my mealtime, and I''m lost. Can you get me back home, please?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 86, 'm29t', 'A Tough Vigilante'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 87, 'm29c', 'Thank you kindly! A quick stop for a meal, and then those rascals out there will be sorry they ever saw me and my rocks coming!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'My droid''s infrared tracking unit just got fixed. To test it, I wandered out here and told him to follow me. And-- I''ve been waiting. Creatures out there are starting to smell me, I''m afraid. Can you guard me on the way back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 89, 'm30t', 'A Test Gone Sour'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 90, 'm30c', 'Thank you. Now to find that droid. It''s not just the infrared detector, I think. That old E-series model is getting senile, that''s all. Time for the junkheap.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'You''d never know this whole area used to be a glacier, would you? At least, that''s my theory. As soon as I get back home with my evidence, I''m pretty sure to be admitted to the Galactic Geological Society. Can I hire you for guard duty on the way back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 92, 'm31t', 'A Geologist Hopeful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 93, 'm31c', 'My thanks to you. I predict another episode of glaciation here some time in the next 20,000 years. Better get ready.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'Little yellow flower. Bright leaves. Bitter. Glaaahh-- No, bad, mud thoughts. Head all wrong. It''s bad. Home. Bring me home home. Nrrgh--'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 95, 'm32t', 'Dazed and Confused'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 96, 'm32c', 'I think it''s going away. Oh my. Splitting headache. Here. Thank you. Don''t eat leaves out there. I have to lie down.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'You haven''t seen my sweetie, have you? I was supposed to meet my true love here, where we hope to build our dream house. I''m confused on how to get to the part of town where my honeybunch lives. Can you guide me there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 98, 'm33t', 'Lost Paramour'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 99, 'm33c', 'Okay, I have to sort things out with my little nubbly-cheeks and find out why I got stood up. Here, please take this for your time, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'All the fellows said I''d be in the club if I went snope-hunting with them. I was supposed to wait here with a net, and they''d send the snopes toward me. But it''s been a long time. Can you guide me home?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 101, 'm34t', 'A Snope-Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 102, 'm34c', 'Boy, I''m glad to be back. I guess I''m not in the club yet. Say, what exactly is a snope anyway?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'My datapad is infected with a nasty circuit virus and I can''t find my way around. Can you show me the way to a maintenance shop? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 104, 'm35t', 'Broken Datapad'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 105, 'm35c', 'Finally I''ll be able to connect this datapad to the HoloNet again. It''s my primary source of income, you know. Have you tried the HoloNet lately? Lots of money to be made.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'I finally found a place that serves decent blood chowder! The place a bit far from here, though, and it''s a little dangerous to travel alone. Would you care to you join me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 107, 'm36t', 'Chowder Connoisseur'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 108, 'm36c', 'After traveling all that way, I think I''ve decided to dine alone. Your conversational skills are lacking. Here are a few credits. Go buy yourself dinner somewhere else.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'I need to take my rock tabbit to a special breeding facility, but I''m afraid someone will try to steal poor Fleeflee from me! Can you protect me while I''m taking her there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 110, 'm37t', 'Help Poor Fleeflee'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 111, 'm37c', 'What would I have done without you? Little Fleeflee thanks you so much for helping her reach the breeding facility. Here''s a little bit to pay for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'I''ve got to deliver this bottle of shaak ambergris to a perfume manufacturer, but the distance is not inconsiderable. Would you join me on the trip and protect me from any unscrupulous perfume pirates who might attempt to waylay me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 113, 'm38t', 'Protect Shaak Ambergris'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 114, 'm38c', 'That was close, wasn''t it? The villains were pressing us from all sides! But this ambergris has safely reached its new home. These credits are yours for a job well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'A client of mine bought a hand-held enzymer for his import business. I need to get it to him before his next shipment from Dantooine. This is an expensive tool, though, so I could use a strong guard like you on the trip. Care to come along?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 116, 'm39t', 'Help the Importer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 117, 'm39c', 'Thanks for the help. Here''s the money I owe you. Now if I can find my client around here, I''ll get paid myself.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'I''ve made a few enemies over the years, so I don''t take long-distance travel lightly. You look like someone who can handle a blaster. I could use you in a fight. Join me on a little journey and I''ll reward you well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 119, 'm40t', 'Old Enemies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 120, 'm40c', 'I appreciate having you and your blaster to accompany me. Here''s the reward, just as I promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'A bet''s a bet, and I lost mine. Now I''ve got a considerable pile of credits to deliver to my friend in another city. Trouble is, transporting that kind of money on this planet is a gamble in itself. I''d like to hire you as a bodyguard for the trip, if you''re available, to make sure I get there with my money and my life.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 122, 'm41t', 'Settle a Bet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 123, 'm41c', 'You''d think betting on the Death Star versus the Rebels would be a brain-dead gamble. That''s what I get for being cocky, I suppose. Hopefully when I pay my friend, he''ll stop gloating. Anyway, thanks for lending a hand.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'I sold a vintage Tempest-class Corvette to a business partner of mine in another city. Now I''ve got to deliver the security codes so he can take possession of the starship. But with so many scoundrels and Rebels about, I dare not make the trip alone. I''ll pay you to safeguard me between here and there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 125, 'm42t', 'Help Deliver Security Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 126, 'm42c', 'Well done. My old Corvette is safe. You have my gratitude and these credits for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'I''m buying an old STAP repulsorlift, which is quite exciting for a collector like me. But the dealer is in another city and it''s not safe to travel alone with so much money. I could use an experienced fighter like you as a traveling companion. Are you interested in making a few credits?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 128, 'm43t', 'Help the Collector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 129, 'm43c', 'Thanks greatly. Here''s your payment. I can''t wait to fly my new STAP! I wonder if the laser cannons are still operational?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'You would think legal documents could be transmitted electronically, but of course the really important ones are entrusted to poor hand-carriers like me. Even when said documents indict infamous criminal leaders in the region. So I need someone handy with a blaster to make sure I get to my destination in one piece. Are you available?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 131, 'm44t', 'Deliver the Legal Documents'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 132, 'm44c', 'I was afraid I''d be blasted to ashes before I got these documents here, but thanks to you I survived. I''ll look you up again if I''m forced to carry any more criminal indictments.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'I''ve crafted this lovely planter out of a proton torpedo pod. I need to deliver it to another city, but I''m afraid some scoundrel will try to take it and activate the nucleonic igniter. That could be dangerous, don''t you think? Would you escort me so that no rogues will abscond with my lovely creation?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 134, 'm45t', 'An Odd Sculptor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 135, 'm45c', 'Thank you so much. This planter is quite a unique creation. I wonder if the proton fuel cell will help dorva vines to grow larger?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'Did you know a starfighter''s particle shield can be converted into a hand weapon? Very effective against armored personnel. The authorities don''t approve, of course, but that''s life. I''ve got to transport these conversion plans to another city, but I have to make sure the authorities don''t stop me. Can you escort me there and keep me out of trouble?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 137, 'm46t', 'Transport the Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 138, 'm46c', 'Thanks. I stand to make a fortune from this particle blaster, if I can figure out how to manufacture them secretly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'I''ve got a Rodian bounty hunter hot on my trail! I need to travel to another city to pay my debts and get that slimy piece of worm-ridden filth off my back. Can you and your well-used weapon give me some backup on the way? I don''t want to find a throwing razor in my back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 140, 'm47t', 'Watch Out For Rodians'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 141, 'm47c', 'Thanks for the escort, friend. I thought that Rodian bounty hunter might be waiting around every corner. I guess he had good reason to be scared of you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'When I''m on Coruscant, I love to watch the garbage pit races. I want to buy a set of race-wings so I can start practicing, and maybe enter the garbage pits myself one day. But traveling to another city to buy my race-wings is too scary to do alone. Can I pay you to come with me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 143, 'm48t', 'Brave Little Garbage Pit Racer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 144, 'm48c', 'We made it! Those race-wings are almost mine. Thrills and danger, here I come! If I can only manage the rather frightening trip back home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'I want to apply to the Academy for next season, but I don''t know how to get to the next city, where the recruitment office is. Can you show me the way?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 146, 'm49t', 'Academy Hopeful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 147, 'm49c', 'Thanks for the assistance. I can''t wait to get off this greaseball of a planet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'I have on my person some first-generation copies of the famous Ch''hosk cave drawings. I need to transport them to a museum in another city, but I don''t want to risk hopping a shuttle. Pressurized air is bad for the drawings. Would you be kind enough to accompany me on the long, dangerous journey to the museum?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 149, 'm50t', 'Protect the Cave Drawings'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 150, 'm50c', 'Splendid work! I never felt imperiled with you at my side. Here is your payment. Now to find that museum.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_neutral_medium.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I sure could use your help, citizen. I''d intercepted an encoded datadisc from an Imperial courier and was in the process of decoding the thing when it blew up in my hand. Totally destroyed my datapad, and almost my hand too. Could you make sure I get back to a medical droid and don''t pass out?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Thanks, friend. I need to make sure other Alliance operatives know about these explosive datadiscs. Imperial Intelligence must be getting desperate, huh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Scout in Need of Medical Aid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Our cell leader was contacted by a man claiming to be a representative of a miner''s guild that wished to aid the Alliance. I was sent to meet him, despite having a bad feeling about the whole deal, and got ambushed by a squad of stormtroopers. I just barely escaped. Could you make sure I get back to base okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm2u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Always trust your instincts, citizen. Thanks for your help. This is for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Aid an Ambushed Alliance Contact'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'Hey there, buddy! Oh, sorry, thought you were someone else. But you look like a friendly face all the same. Can you help a citizen in need? I was doing some holorecordings of an Imperial arrest of "suspected Rebels" when a stormtrooper smashed my holocam and gave me a merry chase. Get me back home and I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm3u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'Thanks, friend. You turned out to be all right in the end. Here''s that "worth your while" I promised.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Help the Friendly Reporter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'I saw an Empire probe droid scouting our munitions depot. When I tried to fry it, the droid attacked me and chased me all over the wilderness. I finally blew it up, but I think it alerted the Empire first. Now I''m low on ammo, and I need to get back to base to report. Can you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm4u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'That munitions depot may be under attack already. I have to get fixed up and go back to help my buddies. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Chased by Probe Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'I was trying to recruit for the Alliance at a Mining Guild facility near here. Suddenly Imperials attacked and blew up the whole works! I''m not sure if I''m the only survivor, but I haven''t seen anyone else. All those poor people... Anyway, I have to get back to base and report, and I need an escort. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm5u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'If anyone else survived that Imperial attack, I expect they''re joining the Alliance right now. The Empire is its own worst enemy sometimes. Thanks, I have to go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Survivor of Mining Guild Attack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'I was administering bacta at a medical facility when the Empire attacked! They seemed to think it was an Alliance depot for medical supplies. Troopers were gunning down patients in their beds! I got out -- I think I was the only one. I need to get back and report this atrocity. Can you accompany me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm6u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'I wonder if the Empire thought that was an Alliance depot just because someone saw me there. That would be horrible. Oh, no. I have to go report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Empire Destroys Hospital'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'The Alliance has been helping refugees who escaped the Empire''s slave worlds. We had a processing outpost near here, but Imperials just destroyed it. I wouldn''t have believed those soldiers could be so ruthless! I don''t think anyone else got out alive. I need you to help me get back to base so I can report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm7u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'We were just trying to help homeless folks find safe, free places to live. I can''t believe the Empire''s evil. I''m with the Alliance forever.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Imperials Destroy Alien Refugee Outpost'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'I took in my landspeeder for repair at the Alliance''s local transport depot. I was under the speeder, checking the repulsorlift calibration, when the hood exploded above me. Imperials attacked the depot. They overlooked me, under the vehicle -- I think I''m the only survivor. Escort me back to base so I can report!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm8u', '');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'How are we going to repair our vehicles now? If this goes on, we''ll have to carry our supplies on our backs. Thanks, I have to report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Survivor of Transport Depot Attack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'The Alliance operated a facility near here to heal victims of Imperial torture -- what the Empire calls "aggressive re-education." A company of stormtroopers just destroyed the facility, on the pretext that it was an "indoctrination camp." I''m the last survivor. I need you to escort me back to base so I can relay the terrible news.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm9u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'One more brutal Imperial gesture, the kind that just drives more folks to our cause. Thanks for your help; please take this as a token of my gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm9t', '"Indoctrination Camp" Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'They blew up a droid maintenance facility! How in the galaxy could a droid maintenance dome present any threat to the Empire? It''s totally senseless. But I guess an Empire that can blow up Alderaan is capable of anything. Maniacs! Please -- you have to help me get back to base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm10u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Those stormtroopers seemed to think that droid facility was a major target. Weird, huh? Thanks for your help. I have to get my wounds treated and make a report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Droid Maintenance Dome Survivor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'A scientist friend of mine was recording the activity of small predators in the local ecosystem, so a few of us were guarding his observation outpost. Suddenly a platoon of stormtroopers swept in and destroyed the post, killing my friend and everyone else. I''m the only one left. Please escort me to base, because my ammo is low.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm11u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'The Empire will destroy anyone and anything if some Imperial commander thinks a "Rebel" is involved. Sheesh. We have to stop the Empire before they kill everyone.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Imperials Destroy Science Outpost'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'I was delivering food to one of our Alliance slicers -- he never liked to go outside, just sliced the HoloNet all day and all night. I was approaching his home when a group of TIE fighters swooped down and blew it up! It was monstrous! I got hurt in the blast, so I need you to escort me back to base. Can you do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm12u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'Thanks. The Imperials never worry about collateral damage -- just "maximum force" all the time. That''s going to hurt them in the long run. I have to make my report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Food Delivery to Slicer Went Wrong'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'I was pulling some IR-5 "Intimidator" blast pistols from an Alliance weapons cache when I heard this humming. I looked up and saw a squadron of TIE fighters! I barely got clear before they bombed the cache into dust. It was the closest I''ve got to death. I''m really shaken. Can you escort me back to base so I can report?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm13u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'Thanks for the escort. We really could have used that cache of blaster pistols. I wonder how the Empire found out about them? We''ll have to work even harder now. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Raided While Getting Intimidators'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'We just set up a hospital station for local bystanders injured in Imperial attacks. Apparently the Empire tracked our MD medical droids to the station, and -- oh, it was terrible. Everything gone, everyone killed. It was -- Look, I have to get back to base to report this, but I don''t think I''m up to going alone. Can you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm14u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'It would be just like the Empire to wipe out a building full of innocents to take out one MD droid. I have to report this to my captain. Here, take this, and thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'Hospital Station Destroyed by Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'The Alliance was building a new refueling station. We used some laser cutters we stole from an Imperial operations depot. Apparently the cutters had tracking beacons, because a platoon of stormtroopers homed in on us like magnets. I''m the last survivor. I have to report to base, but I''m low on ammo. Can you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm15u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'It''s a tricky business, fighting to restore the Republic when you have to worry about tracking beacons in laser cutters. I''ll report that to my superiors. Thanks for the escort!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Bugged Laser Cutters Prompt Attack'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'Imperials just struck the mining depot near here. This is bad! We were hoping to refit some LIN Demolitionmech droids at that depot for use against the Empire. Now we''ll have to start over. I shot most of my energy packs in the battle -- can you escort me back to base? Command will want to hear about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm16u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'That Demolitionmech plan was sweet. We were going to disguise them to look like R3 units. Might have worked. Might still work. Okay, thanks, I have to report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Demolitionmech Mining Depot Hit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'Our transport and repair depot near here was modifying civilian A-A5 speeder trucks as armored personnel carriers. Sweet idea, but the Empire found out somehow. We just got hit, hard. I don''t think anyone else got out. I''m shaky myself, and low on ammo, so could you help me get back to make my report?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm17u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'There''s always more speeder trucks, and the refit into APCs is pretty straightforward. We''ll get back on track soon enough. Thanks for the escort!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'A-A5 Speeder Truck Depot Hit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'I was out here scouting Imperial installations, when something small leaped from under a rock and bit me. Now my ankle is changing color, and nothing in my medkit helps. I don''t think I''m in critical danger, but I''d like to get back to base. Can you escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm18u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'Getting woozy. Need to see a medic. Thanks. Later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'Alliance Fighter Needs Antidote'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'I was just visiting an old wreck. I like to visit it every so often, to renew my commitment to the Alliance. I wasn''t interested in the Civil War at all, until the Empire''s artillery practice blew up my home and killed my family. And they didn''t even apologize! Makes me angry even now. Well, I need to go back. Want to escort me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm19u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'I feel better than ever about the choice I made. I hope you do too. I''ll see you on the front lines sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'Last Survivor of Imperial Artillery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'It sounds funny, but I was out here looking for my pet greysor. He''s my best friend. I just got a call from Alliance HQ that he''s been spotted elsewhere, so I''d like you to escort me back. Why, yes, the Alliance is helping me look. You might say it''s Alliance business. But we''ll talk about that later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm20u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'Thank you. I didn''t want to say this before in case Imperials caught us, but my greysor''s collar had a data cylinder of Imperial codes for this world. We''ll search hard, believe me!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Alliance Member Missing Pet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'Some nobody I met in a cantina offered to show me a buried cache of Imperial weapons. So like an idiot, I went out here with him. Then he pulled a blaster and, well, let''s just say I left his body way back there. I feel like a nitwit. I don''t know if his Imperial buddies might be tracking me, so can you escort me back to base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm21u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'I should have spotted that guy as an Imperial when he kept talking about "the Rebellion" instead of the Alliance. Ah, we''re here. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Victim of Covert Imperial Treachery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'Most awful was it! I passed along here, very fast, with business of nobody but me to mind. Big Empire car, it come racing down, zoom! Push me in ditch! I get so angry, I go right out and join Alliance. Show them. I come back here many times now to think. I am always glad it happen, you know? Look you, can you go with me back safe?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm22u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'Pardon me, I do not speak the Basic so well. I am from, what you say, Wild Space. But I learn. Also, I fight good! Hah! I am glad for you to help me, thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Empire Hit My Swoop, Push in Ditch'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'HQ sent me out here looking for a stolen GNK power droid. I searched all over and finally found its tracking beacon. Then HQ calls and says the droid already wandered back on its own. Who steals a power droid? Why? I''m baffled. I''m also hot and tired and very dirty. Travel with me back to base? I could use an escort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm23u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'We''ve had the strangest rash of gonk-droid thefts. Someone steals them and then lets them go. It makes no sense. Okay, I''m here, I''m hitting the showers. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Agent in Serious Need of Hot Bath'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'I thought Nibbi was due to touch down out here hours ago. I can''t understand why he''s so late. Maybe Imperials. I told him a hundred times, upgrade your sensors or they''re all over you, man! Well, I''m tired of waiting. You Alliance guys need that medicine, but you also need your smugglers awake and alert. I need an escort back, OK?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm24u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'It''s getting tougher to slip goods down here through the Empire''s orbital patrols. I may need a bigger cut of the goods as time goes on. Just a word to the wise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Alliance Procurement Agent on the Job'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'Ah, how pleasant! I was out and about, mulling whether the local bi-lobate perennials might offer an antidote to new Empire toxins. I''m a botanist, you know. Then these Imperial scoundrels raced down from the sky, strafing me with intent to kill! I took refuge in a nearby crevasse, but now I''m quite rattled. Can you escort me back, in case these blackguards return?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm25u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'Ah! Well done! I took note of many interesting flora on the route back, and I believe a potential antidote may well be at hand. Farewell, my friend!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'Botanical Expert Attacked by Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'I was training several new recruits in long-range sniper fire when an Imperial light assault vehicle fired on us. I shot off the LAV''s laser cannon and both stabilizers, causing a crash -- but not before all my recruits had died. Terrible business. I''m out of charges, so I''d appreciate your help in getting back safely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm26u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'Very sad affair, a civil war. I''m sorry, I''m not ready to instruct new students as yet. But thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Marksmanship Trainer Attacked'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'I may not look like much, but I''m a big part of Alliance morale maintenance on this world. I was heading back from a gig at a remote outpost when some pack of Imperial glatch-breaths made my life hard. I crashed my speeder and played dead ''til they left. Tell you what, friend, would you take me back to base safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'm27u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'And the one in the shroud said -- wait for it -- "I''m not the Emperor, I''m his dear old mother!" Heyo! I want to tell you, honestly, you''ve been great. I mean that. Gotta go, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'Alliance Entertainer Stranded'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'I got an instructional text about this Bunduki martial art, Teras Kasi. I went out here to practice -- didn''t want my friends to see me. When you''re just starting, this text makes you move like a wounded nerf. I kind of twisted my wrist, I think. I can''t shoot now, so I''d like you to escort me back, if you''re willing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 110, 'm28u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'Thanks. I may need to find a teacher for this Teras Kasi stuff, before I break my neck. Now I need to lie down a while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'Teras Kasi Novice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'For their orienteering practice, I gave my commando training student directions to find me in the wilderness. I''ve been waiting out here in one place for way too long. I don''t know where he went wrong. I''ve been hearing suspicious noises out here, so I''d like to hire you to escort me on the way back home.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 114, 'm29u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'Well, that was a wasted training exercise. I expect my student has gotten so hopelessly lost, he''s on another planet by now. I''d better track him down!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Commando Training Gone Awry'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'I saw a mouse droid tootling off into the wilderness. It moved with what I''d call intense purpose. I didn''t even know mouse droids could move in this kind of terrain. I got curious and followed it. I lost it somewhere around here -- well, way back there, actually -- and then got lost myself. Can you bring me back home safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 118, 'm30u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'You know, there are rumors about some special mouse droid that fights the Empire. Do you think...? Naah. Okay, we''re here, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Alliance Member Tracking Mouse Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'I got orders to shadow a COMPNOR officer''s speeder as he visited remote settlements. I found he''s been shaking down small businesses for "back taxes," based on some centuries-old law everyone''s forgotten. What a slime. To stop his scam, I "accidentally" rammed his speeder with mine. He confiscated both. I''m stranded. Can you escort me back to base?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 122, 'm31u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'Not very heroic, tracking a corrupt tax collector. But it helps the Alliance if we can cut off the Empire''s financing, a credit at a time. Thanks, I have to report now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Tracking the Empire''s Lackey'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'There was a recent battle with the Empire near here. I shot images of the battlefield for a morale-building news report, "Tyranny Must Fall." We deliver these reports by courier, or coded over the Empire''s own HoloNet, to Alliance bases everywhere. I''m ready to get back, but the area looks unsafe. Can you escort me? Do it for Alliance morale.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 126, 'm32u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'Thanks, friend. I expect this report will help buck up our fighters in these tough times. Now I have to get this data to a courier before deadline.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Morale-Building News Reporter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'What? Did you say something? Sorry! I''ve been testing a new weapon! New kind of siren! I said "siren"! Play it loud, and the amplifier circuits in stormtrooper helmets make it even louder! What? I said "louder"! Anyway, the test is done! At least, I can''t even tell if the siren works any more! I need to get back! Can you escort me? What?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 130, 'm33u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'Okay, I can almost hear again! Thanks for getting me back here safely! I think the siren weapon is worth pursuing! What? Did you say something? What?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Siren Researcher'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'That showed the Empire! My buddy calls, goes, "Stormtroopers are leveling my house!" I go, "I''ll be right there!" I rush out here, throw a couple of thermal detonators, fire my blasters, and their speeder blows up! ''Course, the explosion took out my friend''s house. And my speeder. But man! That''s fighting for freedom! Anyway, reinforcements may be on the way. Can you escort me back safely?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 134, 'm34u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'I gotta go explain to my commander why I took those detonators. And the speeder. And then I have to find a new house for my friend. Woo, busy day.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'Alliance Fighter Won''t Brook Imperial Guff'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'Thank goodness I ran into you! I''ve got some important intelligence about the Empire''s new hyperwave warning systems. I need to get to my contact without delay. Can you give me a hand?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 138, 'm35u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'Thanks for helping me get here. Even though the New Order promises us security, they never quite deliver, do they?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'Safeguard new intelligence'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'An Imperial troop transport landed a couple of miles from here. I''m pretty sure a new garrison is being built. I need to warn my superiors. Can you come along in case there''s trouble?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 142, 'm36u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'I appreciate the help. Let me know if you ever need a hand. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'Report a new Imperial garrison'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'It''s outrageous! The Empire is recruiting young hoodlums to fill out their planetside security forces. As if the ordinary troops aren''t brutal enough! I''ve got a list of the officers behind this scheme that Alliance High Command will be interested in reviewing. Can you escort me to my contact point?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 146, 'm37u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'I''m most grateful for your assistance. You never know when these brutal, young Imperials will set up an ambush.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'The Empire is recruiting hoodlums'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'We''ve got to hurry! An Imperial probe droid came down not far from here. I had to move quickly to avoid detection. Now I''m a little turned around. I need to transmit a report about the probe droid to my commander, as soon as possible. Can you show me the way to my signal transmitter? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 150, 'm38u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'I couldn''t have made it here without you. Thanks. Now to transmit a report about that probe droid. I hope I''m not too late!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'Report an Imperial probe droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'The Empire has dispatched a new prefect to this sector. The man is a sadist and a torturer. I''ve got to report this to Alliance High Command. I''d like you to escort me to my hidden signal transmitter, in case the Imperial Security Bureau has heard about my intelligence gathering. If they have, there''s bound to be trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 154, 'm39u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'Splendid. Now to transmit my report about the new Imperial prefect. If this man gets his claws into this star system, it''s going to become an unfriendly place for Alliance agents.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Report a sadistic Imperial prefect'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'I think I lost them, but I can''t be sure. The Empire recruited some mercenary assassins to track me down. They''ve been tailing me for three days. I don''t suppose I can convince you to help me get to my destination safely? There''s some important Alliance work I must see to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 158, 'm40u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'Boy, am I glad you were there to help me. That could have gone a lot worse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Tracked by mercenary assassins'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'Imperial Intelligence won''t let me be. I''ve used so many cover stories that they''re no longer buying what I''m selling. I''ve had three firefights with Imperial soldiers, just in the last few days. I sure could use a hand to get to my Alliance contact in town. I need to hop a transport off this ball before it gets any hotter than it already is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 162, 'm41u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'You were a great help. Hopefully we''ll cross paths again, once this planet becomes a little more hospitable for me. Until then, may the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Imperial Intelligence is on the case'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'Sure is nice to see a friendly face. This area''s not safe for an Alliance agent to be traveling alone. I''ve got to get back to town to do some maintenance work on a couple of X-wings that were smuggled in last night. Join me on the trip and put in a good word for you with High Command.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 166, 'm42u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'This is good, thanks. I can handle it from here. I''ll pass your name on to High Command. The Alliance needs good operatives like you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Escort an X-wing technician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'This planet isn''t nearly as safe as I was led to believe. Can you escort me to my contact point? I''ve got some information about a clan of Gotals who are interested in joining our cause.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 170, 'm43u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'Thanks. Hopefully the Gotals can lend some aid against the New Order. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Gotals want to help the Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'I''ve got stormtroopers after me! Quick, let''s get to safety before they get all Alderaan on us. Haul jets, kid!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 174, 'm44u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'I''m glad you came along, kid. Nice work. Pure sabacc.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'Haul jets!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'I''m tired of this poodoo. I came to this buzz-infested mudball to help the Alliance, but you nerf-herders couldn''t tell an asteroid from a Sarlacc pit. So let me make this plain. You''re going to take me to my extraction coordinates in town and I''m going to leave this gnardly chunder-pool once and for all. Think you can handle that, you half-credit choobie?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 178, 'm45u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'Time to get off this wagyx of a planet. Thanks for nothing, sleemo.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Escort a cranky agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'Ever wonder how Incom Industries supplies us with X-wings and still keeps the Empire at bay? I''m the guy who arranges that. The Alliance pays graft to some Imperial insiders of mine, in exchange for sparing Incom. But I don''t like to drop off a payment without an armed escort. Can you help me with today''s delivery?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 182, 'm46u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'That could have turned out much worse if I hand''t run into you. Thanks. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'Graft for X-wings'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'What a drag. My protocol droid is in dire need of a lubrication bath and I''m stuck out here in this Force-forsaken stretch of nowhere. Can you show me the way back? I''ve got a meeting with Admiral Ackbar tomorrow and I want my droid to be in peak condition.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 186, 'm47u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'Thank you ever so much. I do want my protocol droid to be at its when we meet Admiral Ackbar. I''ll give him a lubrication bath at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'Droid needs a lubrication bath'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'I lost the retraining bolt from one of my droids. I was using him to transport secret data tapes to Alliance outposts, but now he''s gone. I''ve looked all over this area. I need to get back to town and rethink my strategy. Can you give me an escort? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 190, 'm48u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'I appreciate it. Now I have to figure out how to scan for that droid before the authorities pick him up.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Lost a restraining bolt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'Listen up. The Empire has scheduled a planetside tractor beam in this area. If they finish the project, they''ll be able to snatch Alliance blockade runners right out of orbit. I need to get this information to Alliance High Command, quickly. Some Imperials spotted me out here, so I could use another hand to make sure I get back in one piece. Want to come?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 194, 'm49u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'You''re good, my friend. Thanks. I''ll make my report to High Command at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Planetside tractor beam?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'I have contacted someone who may be invaluable to the Alliance. I''m pretty sure it was an actual Jedi Knight. I''m a little afraid that this information might make me a target, though, so I''d be very glad if you could escort me back to town. Do you have time?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 198, 'm50u', ''),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'Thank you for bringing me here. I know the Alliance often pays agents in trade goods, but credits will do fine. Credits will do fine.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Possible Jedi ally'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'number_of_entries', '8'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1t', 'Exterminate these pests!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1o', 'I''ve had it. These vermin have been bothering my family for a long time. Go thin out their herd. Kill 15 of these creatures.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'I''ve spent 40 years of my life working as a trapper, and I''ve run into hard times my friend.  Lately, these knees aren''t happy at getting up in the morning, my speeder broke down, and the last treatment from the driod doc emptied out my savings.  \n\nMy boss pays top dollar, but I''ve got to make a payment soon if I want to keep my house.  If you can head out there and collect 15 pelts for me, I''ll split the profits with you.  I can take a few days off to give my tired body a rest, and you get some easy cash.  We all come out winners.  Whadyasay?  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm2t', 'Help an old trapper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm3o', 'All right, all right, I admit it was a terrible idea.  I had a durni problem around the farm, and I thought introducing a new type of critter would take care of the problem.  What a disaster!\n\nThere isn''t much I can do at this point other than kill them off.  There are about 15 out there.  For a big time hunter like you this should be no problem.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm3t', 'Eliminate reproductive menace'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm4o', 'I''m part of the Empire, and am often away from home for long periods of time.  I sent my little sister a couple critters to play with and remind her of me.  Little did I know the reproductive menace they would become.  \n\nThese things have spread out of control.  My parents have completely lost it and don''t know what to do.  I think the right thing for the family is to hire someone to eliminate these overly reproductive pets.  They are out of town for the weekend so now is the time.  Be sure you get all 15, ok?\n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm4t', 'Wipe out critter pets'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm5o', 'I can''t stand these pests!  They get into everything and are everywhere!  I''ll pay anyone who can figure out a way to keep these horrible, horrible.THINGS away!  If you have the stomach to deal with these meddlesome things, I will pay.  You must kill at least 15 creatures.  I''ll accept no less!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm5t', 'Kill meddlesome creatures'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm6o', 'When I was younger, these awful creatures attacked and mutilated me.  Some call me bitter, but I don''t care!  I have sworn revenge on these nasty brutes.  I now offer a handsome price to anyone who goes out and takes care of these critters in the most brutal way.  \n\nI want them to hurt.  I want them to suffer.  I want them to pay!  Go out there and kill them all!  I pay in 15 critter lots, so don''t come back until 15 are eliminated.  15 I say! \n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm6t', 'Take vengeance for a bitter old man'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm7o', 'Let me tell you what it''s like to live with a woman who is scared of everything when you work all the time.  It''s not fun, ok?  Day in and day out I get calls about this little hurt, this latest injury, or random who knows what kind of event.  Blah, blah, blah, I''m sick of it, ok?  \n\nHer latest problem is an infestation of critters on our land.  Now, they aren''t actually a problem.  I''ve already had an exterminator check out the place, and he couldn''t find anything.  I''m hiring you to get me some insurance, ok?\n\nIt doesn''t matter where you get these corpses from, I really don''t care.  If I can get her to shut up for a minute about it, I might have a chance at getting some sleep.  Just go out there and eliminate 15 of the critters.  That will show her my ''true'' love and devotion.  I need some sleep, help me out, ok?\n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm7t', 'Help a tired man get some rest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm8o', 'I married the most horrible slob of a husband.  He is literally the most useless human in the galaxy.  I bust my but down at the shipyard factory day in and day out.  I have grease stuck in my hair.  I have clothes that always need a wash.  I feel like I always need a bath.  And for what?  So that slug of a husband can sit at home and do what?  Nothing!  His latest adventure is sitting in the room trying to move things with his mind.  That wacko is convinced he can feel the force.  Now I haven''t seen everything, but I wasn''t born yesterday.  I''ve been all around and never seen any ''evidence'' of some all powerful energy field controlling everything.  It''s kids stuff, that force nonsense.  \n\nMy slob of a husband now complains on a regular basis about the animals, making noise, disturbing his mental concentration, etc.  This Jedi thing of his is a fad, just like all his other crazy ideas.  Go ahead and round up 15 animals so I don''t have to hear his whining anymore.  \n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm8t', 'Restore marriage harmony'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'number_of_entries', '8'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'm1t', 'Exterminate these pests!'),
