('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 12, 'm6o', 'When I was younger, these awful creatures attacked and mutilated me.  Some call me bitter, but I don''t care!  I have sworn revenge on these nasty brutes.  I now offer a handsome price to anyone who goes out and takes care of these critters in the most brutal way.  \n\nI want them to hurt.  I want them to suffer.  I want them to pay!  Go out there and kill them all!  I pay in 30 critter lots, so don''t come back until 15 are eliminated.  15 I say! \n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 13, 'm6t', 'Take vengeance for a bitter old man'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 14, 'm7o', 'Let me tell you what it''s like to live with a woman who is scared of everything when you work all the time.  It''s not fun, ok?  Day in and day out I get calls about this little hurt, this latest injury, or random who knows what kind of event.  Blah, blah, blah, I''m sick of it, ok?  \n\nHer latest problem is an infestation of critters on our land.  Now, they aren''t actually a problem.  I''ve already had an exterminator check out the place, and he couldn''t find anything.  I''m hiring you to get me some insurance, ok?\n\nIt doesn''t matter where you get these corpses from, I really don''t care.  If I can get her to shut up for a minute about it, I might have a chance at getting some sleep.  Just go out there and eliminate 30 of the critters.  That will show her my ''true'' love and devotion.  I need some sleep, help me out, ok?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 15, 'm7t', 'Help a tired man get some rest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 16, 'm8o', 'I married the most horrible slob of a husband.  He is literally the most useless human in the galaxy.  I bust my but down at the shipyard factory day in and day out.  I have grease stuck in my hair.  I have clothes that always need a wash.  I feel like I always need a bath.  And for what?  So that slug of a husband can sit at home and do what?  Nothing!  His latest adventure is sitting in the room trying to move things with his mind.  That wacko is convinced he can feel the force.  Now I haven''t seen everything, but I wasn''t born yesterday.  I''ve been all around and never seen any ''evidence'' of some all powerful energy field controlling everything.  It''s kids stuff, that force nonsense.  \n\nMy slob of a husband now complains on a regular basis about the animals, making noise, disturbing his mental concentration, etc.  This Jedi thing of his is a fad, just like all his other crazy ideas.  Go ahead and round up 30 animals so I don''t have to hear his whining anymore.  \n'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_hunting_neutral_medium.stf', 17, 'm8t', 'Restore marriage harmony'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'Imerial Security has captured a Rebel spy posing as a wandering musician. Go to the venue he was known to frequent. Play his usual list of pieces. We will quickly and quietly intercept anyone who might approach you. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'Excellent work! We found some suspicious looking characters lurking around the periphery and have brought them in for interrogation. Your service has been noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'Intercepting Rebel Spies');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'Are you really giving your all for the Empire? It is the responsibility of all Imperial citizens -- most especially its artists! -- to support the Empire. I might also add, the Moff has authorized small stipends for artists who extol the virtues of Imperial rule. Yes, I thought that might get your attention. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'Loyalty is rewarded. Disloyalty is...well, in this case there''s no need to go in to that. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'Virtues of The Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'All intelligent beings know that Imperial musicians have superior technique compared to those Rebel amateurs. As the populace at large are well known to be a bit on the dim side, the Imperial Board of Culture is making funds available for Imperial performers to demonstrate their superiority to all. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'I assume you gave a worthy performance. Funds have been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'Superior Skill'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'Certain parties in this office have spent most of the arts budget on, shall we say, extracurricular activities. It now behooves us to quiet auditors'' suspicions. Go to these coordinates, which happen to be on the path of a city inspection tour, and give an exceptional performance, so the arts will be seen to flourish. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'As it happens, the inspection was cancelled. It seems that higher-ups deemed the inspection frivolous. The news arrived too late to prevent depositing your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'The Arts Budget'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'The music of Dobi Deene is making a comeback. Personally, I think that Old Republic stuff is about as enjoyable as last year''s flatbread, but COMPNOR doesn''t seem to have a problem with it. If you know some Dobi Deene tunes and are willing to play them, go to it. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'COMPNOR has determined that the music of Dobi Deene represents a decadent and corrupt period in our history. This incident will be noted on your permanent record. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'Old Republic Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'A talent scout for the Imperial Symphony Orchestra is on this planet searching for undiscovered artists. There is an open call for musicians to go to this venue and record a demonstration. A small fee is to be paid for your time. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'Audition demo received. You may be contacted later if your submission suits Imperial needs. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'Symphony Talent Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'The flagging moral standard of the music community is under scrutiny by Imperial Security. Too many musicians are far more concerned with "popularity" than with how they reflect the Empire''s grandeur. I hope you are not one of these. Go to this location at once and provide a music sample for analysis. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'All is well. Your music was found to be sufficiently inoffensive that it will not need further scrutiny. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'Musical Scrutiny'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'Who doesn''t love an Imperial marching band? The sound of a jangler, the blare of a woot horn -- with that fanfare it''s no wonder children across the Empire want to  grow up to be stormtroopers. In that spirit, you are to go this venue and inspire people with your music. Perhaps someone will join up one day because of you. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'Very well. Official policy is that we each serve the Empire in our own way. The principal servants fight, but lesser lights can still use their talents to inspire the soldiers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'Inspire the Young'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'A new grant from the planetary authority is earmarked for "encouragement of local musical arts." It is not for me to question the dictates of our Moff. Hence, we are offering a rather too-generous stipend for a musical performance at the venue designated by the grant committee. Go there and do -- whatever it is you do. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'I shall report to the planetary authority that you have discharged the obligations of the grant without provoking untoward remarks. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Moff''s Grant to Encourage Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'It is undeniable that the musical professions are noted for scandal and debauchery. That said, a certain judicious tolerance of music is valuable in encouraging morale among our soldiers, not to mention the citizens. A line item in our budget requires us to commission performers like yourself to perform in a designated venue. Go. Play. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'Your performance was acceptable. Note that conduct indicative of debauchery or scandal will be met with the harshest punishment. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Play Without Debauchery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'I have a report from one of our spies, who are everywhere, that you fancy yourself a musician. Is this true? It had better be. You are being hired to go to the designated location and play inspiring and patriotic songs for anyone in that area. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'How did your performance go? No matter. Payment has been made for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'You''re Hired'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'The Imperial Ballet Company is sending scouts to this world in search of potential musicians. I am told that providing a talented musician may prompt favorable attention from our beloved Emperor himself. To that end, I order you to perform in a duly virtuosic and sprightly manner for the scout at the designated locale. At once! A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'The scout appears to have been waylaid before arriving on this world. Apparently some kind of scandal involving a Twi''lek dancer. How typical.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'Imperial Ballet Talent Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'A memo from sector headquarters reminds us of the imperative need to maintain Imperial standards of decorum. Recently, licentious "fizz music" has been performed in a venue frequented by Imperial soldiers. Remediation of this offense falls to you. Go to this venue and provide a finer, more upstanding example of Imperial music. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'I have heard no reports associating your performance with unusually immoral behavior. Hence I shall report the "fizz incident" closed. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Intolerable Incident of Fizz Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'I am in possession of a recording -- "Dance Lords of the Bith" -- confiscated from a junior Imperial officer who should know better. The officer is being sharply disciplined, of course, but the incident indicates a scandalous laxity in musical practice. You will go to a designated venue and perform music more suitably Imperial. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'So long as no reports reach this office associating your performance with impure alien ideas, we shall consider this "Dance Lords" matter closed. Tell no one, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', '"Dance Lords" Recording Confiscated'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'Owing to a recent purge of Rebel sympathizers, our spies, who are everywhere, have noted a decline in citizens'' morale. I regard such issues as minor, but in fact a line item in this office''s budget does go toward hiring musicians to increase morale. Therefore, you are hereby commissioned to perform at the designated venue. Go. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'You are hereby compensated for the performance. I suppose a happy populace means greater security for our soldiers, so all is probably well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'Line Item to Increase Morale'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'This office''s budget is classified "Secret." An item within that budget allots funds for a certain purpose, also classified. To achieve that purpose, you are to go to the designated venue and execute a musical performance of the required duration. Tell no one! A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'That is acceptable. Compensation is attached. Tell no one!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'Performance Classification SECRET'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'A fugitive Rebel sympathizer is known to prefer the type of musical performance that you execute. I am laying a trap for this sympathizer, with you as the bait. Perform at the designated venue for the designated duration. Our spies, who are ubiquitous, will note the sympathizer''s presence and report. Tell no one, or it will go badly for you. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'Our spies did indeed identify the sympathizer. You may expect any future audience for your work to be reduced in size by one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Trap for Rebel Sympathizer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'This office is assigned to arrange the local performance of a new composition commissioned by the Imperial Ballet Company, "Forward to Greater Grandeur." Certain problems have arisen; these problems are classified. To fulfill the contract with the chosen venue, we shall send you instead. Go, and do not disappoint us. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'You show an admirable willingness to rise to the emergency. So long as you told no one of the reason for your performance, this will reflect well on you. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Emergency Musical Substitution'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'COMPNOR''s current morale-building initiative calls for an Imperial Center musician to tour designated venues on this world. It is not for me to question the wisdom of the substantial resources invested in this project. However, the musician has been delayed offworld. Our venue requires a performer. That will be you. At once! A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'You have fulfilled your duty to the Empire, insofar as this relates to musical performance. Never forget: Imperial duty also dictates the highest moral conduct. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Replacement for COMPNOR Initiative'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'The Moff plans an entertaining diversion for a certain celebrity scheduled to visit the planetary headquarters. The celebrity''s identity is classified. The Moff wishes this office to audition suitable performers in a natural venue. You are to perform for the designated duration at the designated coordinates. Our spies will rate your performance. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'The spies report that your performance failed to meet the Moff''s high standards. You may address complaints, if any, to the Imperial Security Bureau. I consider complaints inadvisable.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'Audition for Moff Diversion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'The Rebellion is known to attract many lowlife show-business performers. You, however, are above suspicion for the moment. Therefore we wish you to perform at the designated venue, in a casual, anti-authoritarian manner, and note the identities of all individuals who express to you anti-Imperial sentiments. We shall debrief you later. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'Our commander has ruled the initiative to identify Rebel sympathizers through musical performance ineffective. Debriefing is cancelled. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'Identify Rebels Through Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'I hear that fizz music is very popular. Do you play fizz music? We are looking for musicians who can play fizz-like music, but with a higher moral standard. Songs about our beloved Emperor or the end of Old Republic corruption would be best. Go to these coordinates and play. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'Fizz music and all variants have been declared inappropriate by the Imperial Board of Culture, and no further attempts to render it acceptable will be made.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'All That Fizz'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'A particular alien musician has attracted so much attention, it is advancing into the upper reaches of respectable society. Aliens are well and good in their place, but this one must be stopped. You are to perform at the designated venue; we have arranged that this will pre-empt the performance by the undesirable alien. Go now. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'We have reliable reports from our spies that the alien performer has now moved offworld. Now we may relax. Job well done, agent!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Pre-Empt Alien Musician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'Ponder the dynamics of Imperial budget allocation. Credits are alloted to me for "encouraging local morale through artistic performance." Should I fail to spend them in this period, my next budget will be reduced -- not only in this preposterous item, but even in significant ways. Therefore I commission you to perform at the designated venue. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'For the record, I acknowledge that through your performance this office has encouraged local morale. In the future, get out of my sight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'Budgetary Requirement for Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'A certain disreputable element is manifesting in venues patronized by Imperial soldiers. This is perhaps inevitable where musicians flourish. However, this office has a budget for disseminating proper Imperial culture. Go and perform at the designated venue. Work to elevate the cultural level of the wretched hive. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'I am still consolidating our spies'' reports on your performance. Until I assess the verdict, I shall conditionally congratulate you and release your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'Raise Culture to Imperial Levels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'The Empire is vigilant for signs of corrupt, decadent art. We purge decadent performers mercilessly. However, we must also show a constructive, even pleasant aspect, encouraging decent, patriotic entertainment. This improves morale. Therefore, we commission you to perform at the designated venue. Refusal is a sign of decadence. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'Reports have reached this office of a disturbing whiff of corruption in your recent performance. You will receive payment this time, but understand: We shall watch you more closely in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Stamp Out Decadent Art'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'A Moff in a nearby sector fancies himself a composer. Our own Moff, as a favor, has agreed to have his composition "My Imperial Heart" performed widely on this world. We have not yet received the music for this piece. Ergo, we order you to perform a piece of your choice at the designated venue. Be sure to call it "My Imperial Heart." A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'Did you announce the title of the piece as "My Imperial Heart"? Do not prevaricate, for our spies are everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'My Imperial Heart'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'This office has been ordered to test the acoustics of public buildings on this world. I believe this is to assess the theoretical effectiveness of sonic weapons in indoor battles. Fear not -- we won''t be firing weapons in this test! Rather, you must perform your music in the designated venue, and our spies will collect the acoustic readings. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'You are of course aware that the reason for your performance is classified. If you have told anyone, it will go badly for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Public Building Acoustics Test'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm3o', 'Imperial Security personell have been frequenting places that play music encouraging lascivious behavior. We want you to go to this venue and play the kind of music that will remind people of their moral obligations. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm3s', 'People need to be reminded of their duty. A certain level of Imperial dignity must be maintained. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm3t', 'Lascivious Behavior'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm4o', 'A famous travelling band will be playing at an establishment popular with the local troopers. The venue needs you to play before the band arrives so they can test the acoustics. If you can play the -- let me see here -- the "synth-harmonica," that would be even better. What? Don''t tell me, tell them. Go! A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm4s', 'Perhaps one day you''ll be headlining and entertaining the troops with your own music. For whatever that may be worth.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm4t', 'Sound Check'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm5o', 'Some musicians suspected of being Rebel sympathizers gather locally and have a regular jam session. We want you to go and sit in with these wretches. Play along and find out what you can. You will be debriefed later. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm5s', 'It turns out the musicians were all Imperial spies, posing as Rebel sympathizers. The sessions have been cancelled, as they serve no useful purpose.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm5t', 'Rebel Musicians'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm6o', 'Imperial Security is recording soothing music to play in public turbolifts. The music will include subliminal messages encouraging patriotism. Hurry to this venue and play some song you think appropriate. You may find your fee quite soothing as well. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm6s', 'The next time you''re in a turbolift, you may only have yourself to blame for the quality of music.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm6t', 'Subliminal Turbolift Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm7o', 'Evidently a musical band exists calling themselves the "Dead Rebels." The Moff is having them play a social event, but their touchboard player has fallen ill and they need someone to fill in. Go to the appointed venue and record tunes for evaluation. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm7s', 'The Dead Rebels apparently heard your recordings. They have paid you to stay away from their engagement. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm7t', 'Dead Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm8o', 'When troopers come back from a combat zone, they''re ready to relax. This is not optimal. A purchase order from the morale budget requires you to go to this establishment and play songs that will encourage zealous enthusiasm for the battles ahead. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm8s', 'Not many troopers there? Well, no matter. The morale budget had no better use anyway. Foolish idea, a "morale budget."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm8t', 'Morale Budget Purchase Order'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm9o', 'COMPNOR suspects the Rebels may be coding messages into popular music. Go to these coordinates and play some popular songs. Our spies, who are everywhere, will be watching your performance in hopes of catching anyone who might cavort or sway in a suspicious manner. A 10 minute performance is necessary.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm9s', 'No arrests have been made at this time. You have been paid for your part in this matter and should not inquire further.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm9t', 'Popular Coded Message Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'Tatooine Blues music is all the rage these days. Can''t say that I care for it much myself, but I''m not paid to be a music critic. I need a musician that''s familiar with some of these recent trends to play at the following coordinates. If you don''t know any Tatooine Blues songs, don''t worry - fake it like most of them do. I''ll pay you when the gig is over. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'You never told me you could perform some Blaster Rays tunes. I gotta keep you in mind for some of my more "eclectic" patrons. Enjoy your credits, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'Play the Blues'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'If you ask me, a musician''s goal is to be banned by the Imperial Board of Culture. Take Deeply Religious, for example. Do you think you''d actually know who that band was if it hadn''t been for the actions of the IBC? I got a gig coming up where you can make your mark. Head to these coordinates and start offending the Empire, friend. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'Keep that up and the Empire will ban you for certain. I''ll watch your career with great interest. Come see me again for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'Offend the Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'Dusk music is so overrated. Anyone can do dark and moody. If you really want to impress people, try doing something uplifting and moving. But it''s gotta have a great beat, something you can dance to, ya know? If that describes your style, then I''ve got a gig lined up that you could really take advantage of. Go to these coordinates and do your thing. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'You never know when the mood to dance will strike someone, friend, so I wouldn''t worry too much about that. Good job overall, I''d say. I''ve included a generous tip in your pay. Enjoy!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'Dance the Night Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'I''ve met a few aubade masters in my day, and let me tell you those musicians get all sorts of perks - money, suitors, influential patrons, you name it. But they all had to start somewhere and here is where they usually did it. I got a gig for a musician that aspires to rise to such heights. If you''re interested, head to these coordinates. Your pay comes after the gig is over. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'You just might have master potential in you. Practice makes perfect, as they say. Your fee has been deposited. See me again for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'Become a Master Musician'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'Can''t say as I understand glimmik music all that well. Maybe I lack the appropriate auditory senses to truly appreciate it. You a fan of that sort of music, friend? Can you play it? Or at least fake it? Head to this establishment and give those patrons a performance of glimmik music. Or whatever you happen to know. I bet most of them won''t be able to tell the difference. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'See? Glimmik music is either the most misunderstood form of music in the galaxy or else no one really knows what it is. Good show. Your fee''s been transmitted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'Play That Glimmik Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'You wanna know a great band? Hyperspaze and the Jump Lanes! Now that was a great band! You put together a band like that and you''ll carve your name in galactic history. But first, you gotta practice. Head to these coordinates and show them that you''ve got what it takes to become a musical legend. I''ll pay you after you''ve made your point. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'The patrons were fairly amused, which is all that counts, really. Enjoy the fruits of your labors. And come see me for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'The Next Great Band'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'A kloo horn can make a good weapon in a pinch. Not that you have to have a kloo horn for this gig or that you would need to use it as a weapon if you did. So you still interested in peforming at this joint? If so, head to these coordinates. Remember, if the crowd starts to get a bit... rowdy, keep your eyes on the exits. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'All went well, I see. Excellent! I knew that joint was a safe place to play. So no hazard pay needed. Your fee''s been deposited. Come see me again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'A Tough Crowd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'Ludurian nose flutes are quite hard to master. Have you ever tried playing those? I get lots of requests for nose flutists, for some reason. But failing that, I gotta send what I have at hand, right? So the gig is yours if you want it. Play your heart out and the proprietor will show appreciation by including a generous tip for you. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'I understand you made sounds quite similar to those made by nose flutes, which is pretty close to what was asked for. Your fee has been deposited, and yes, it includes the proprietor''s tip.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'The Melodic Sounds of Nose Flutes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'The rules of fame are easy: Play turbolift music and the galaxy will ignore you; play offensive music and you''ll go down in the annals of musical history. The band Red Shift Limit is living proof of this, friend. If you think you can offend with as much finesse as these beings, then I''ve got a gig for you. Head to these coordinates and offend away. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'Well, it does seem you managed to offend some patrons. I suppose you need to work on refining that skill, but overall it was well done. Enjoy your credits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Fame'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'One day you''ll look back fondly on these days of playing every seedy joint in the galaxy just to scrape together a living. Fame has its price and it usually involves "losing" who you really are to the screeching crowds, the millions of credits, the opulent lifestyle. So when you play tonight, friend, think of that. Who knows it might improve your performance. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'Looks like fame and fortune is still a ways off for you, friend. Good work out there today. Come see me for more career-building gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Remain True To Your Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'You know how to play a Bontormian Klesplong? Well, it doesn''t really matter. If you can play any sort of instrument, I got a gig for you. Head over to these coordinates and work your magic, friend. I want that crowd up on its feet (or the equivalent) and swaying to the music. I take care of the money, you worry about your performance. Go to it! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'Is it safe to say that you have rhythm in your soul? Nah, probably not. But a decent job nonetheless. I''ve deposited your credits, friend. See me again for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'Rhythm In Your Soul'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'Everyone''s a music critic. This particular proprietor has not been happy with the last few musical acts I''ve booked for his establishment. I''m desperate and need someone of rare talent to play this venue and show the crowd that I can still pick a winner. You willing to do that, friend? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'Do I still got it or do I still got it? I knew you''d pull through for me. It''s a pleasure to work with such talent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'Impress the Music Critics'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'Looking for venues for your musical skills? I can help you out, friend. Head to these coordinates and entertain the crowd. I don''t need to know what instrument you play or what style of music. If you''re good, I can use you and this gig will determine that. Good luck. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'Okay, so you''re pretty decent. I can use more musicians like you. Your fee''s been desposited. I''m sure you''ll find it fair given your performance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Search For Musical Venues'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'The galaxy would be a much darker place without music, don''t you agree? I''m glad the Empire has not stamped out all originality in music. Would your music be classified as original, friend? ''Cuz I have some great gigs for original artists. Head to these coordinates and show the Empire that they''ll never be able to crush the soul of music. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'Your performance was full of soul, friend, as it moved several patrons to tears. You''ve earned your pay. See me for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', 'Soul Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'You may not get rich with me or even be remembered in a few years, but you''ll be able to make ends meet. I got a gig at these coordinates. Head there, play your set, and you''re done. I''ll pay you if the crowd appreciates your efforts. That''s how this business works, kid. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'The fact that your pay was deposited should indicate to you that the crowd was mostly appreciative of your talent. Come see me again, I got more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'Pay the Bills'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'There are a lot of unscrupulous agents out there, friend, just waiting to take advantage of an up-and-coming talent such as yourself. You gotta keep focused and alert and make sure no one is exploiting you. This gig I got lined up for you here, for example, is a clean establishment with decent clientele. Entertain those folks and you''ll get paid. Simple, huh? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'Well, well, well, if that wasn''t a grand performance. Nice job, kid. I can nurture talent like yours and make sure you get rich quick. Come back and see me soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'A Helpful Musical Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'A friend of mine insists that yerk music cubes will replace live musicians. I keep telling him he''s gone soft in the head. You ever heard one of those things play? It sounds like screeching Jawas. Anyway, I got a gig that doesn''t call for a music cube but for a live musician instead. Head to these coordinates and show the crowd you won''t become obsolete anytime soon. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'Hmm, maybe my friend had a point there. Well, you certainly entertained the crowd, such as it was. Your fee''s been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Live Music Is Best'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'Love your look, kid! You got star quality written all over you, and I don''t say that to just everybody. You need to play, right? I got a gig. You won''t find a better gig anywhere else, so trust me, kid. I got the coordinates, I got the payment arranged. You just go there, play your set, and check back with me. Hokey dokey? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'I admire your style, kid. That was fine, fine. And I don''t say that to just everybody. Here''s your fee, minus my reasonable commission of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Star Quality Written All Over You'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'I''ve worked with the best in the business, kid. Now I''m offering you a chance at the big time. You''ve got to take advantage of this gig right now, or it''s off. I need a decision here and now. Money? Location? Just trust me, it''s all taken care of. I need a yes right now. What do you say? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'Glad you could take care of that little gig. Three others bailed on me before you. Musicians! You''re all alike! Here you go, look me up when you need more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Limited-Time Engagement Only'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'I can''t believe this opportunity! The Modal Nodes are looking for an opening act, and you''re standing right here! I need you, kid! Get over to these coordinates, and don''t get shy at the enormous crowd. This is your big break! Go for it! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'Sorry, the Modal Nodes had to cancel. What, I didn''t tell you? Sorry, I''ve been busy. Here''s your fee, minus my cut. Stardom, that''s an elusive goal, kid. You''ve got to keep plugging.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'Opening Act'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'True, my rise to power in the music business has left a few bruises on the people under me. But you shouldn''t worry about rumors and reputation -- a trusting relationship between artist and manager is the key to success. I can make you a star, just like I made stars out of those ingrates before. But it''ll be different! What do you say? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'You''re not bad, kid. I expect this will develop into something nice. Don''t go working for others, now. That only ruins a trusting relationship.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'Need Talented Newcomers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'They say only Bith can really play an Ommni Box. Do you think that''s true? If you think you can prove something either way, head to this location and entertain the crowd. If you don''t have an Ommni Box, then settle the matter with whatever instrument you do happen to have. I''ll pay you when you''ve finished your set. Knock ''em dead, kid. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'I''m not sure if you settled anything in regards to the Bith question, but you did entertain. Enjoy your credits, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'Can You Play Better Than a Bith?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'Listen when I tell you, there''s a star in the galaxy for every broken heart in the entertainment field. But you, kid, you have real potential. I have a gig that''ll test your ability to rise in this line without getting your heart burned. Interested? I can give you the coordinates here and now. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'A stellar performance, kid. But remember, talent is only part of what it takes to succeed in this heart-deadening business. Good luck, and dream of success!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Rising Star in Musical Firmament'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'A guy I know knows a guy who''s in with big-league talent management. You''ve got my word, if you just show up and play your heart out, you''ll move your career up to the next level. This is potentially a big break, kid! Go for it, and I''ll handle the booking details. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'The guy who knows the guy I know says you did great, kid. I''m passing along the fee, minus a small commission of course. Come on back for more work, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'A Guy I Know Knows a Guy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'You''re not wrapped up in any current litigation, are you? I''ve got a gig from a local manager who''s a little wary due to previous legal entanglements. No, I didn''t ask. In this biz, kid, you don''t ask questions you shouldn''t ask. Are you up for this gig? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'That was fine, kid. The manager says you did absolutely nothing to inspire litigation, at least not that he saw. Guess we''d know by now, huh? Here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'No-Litigation Performance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'The buzz is, there''s a big nostalgia revival that''s building up strength. It''s just your kind of music, kid! You could make a big comeback like what''s-his-name did a few years back. Okay, so you haven''t got anything to come back from yet, but the point is, take this gig! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'That''s the ticket! You must have seen some old folks soaking up that good-ol''-days nostalgia. Takes me back a little myself. What an old manager I''ve become....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Old-Style Nostalgia Revival'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'No one delivers the gigs like I do! Does anyone else deliver? No! You tell me, kid, who delivers like I do? "Nobody," that''s right. Here''s my latest present to you, a great gig handed to you on a silver platter. Go, play, change the galaxy! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'Here''s your fee, kid. And remember, who delivers for you? That''s right, that''s right. Don''t you forget that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'Who Delivers For You?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'You got any problems with pyrotechnics during a performance? I ask because for this latest gig -- I should warn you -- the manager may want to occasionally fire off big flashes during your show. Flash grenades, I think. No, look, don''t worry, "grenades" is the wrong word. He''s got permits and everything. Just go play. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'I guess the manager ran out of flash grenades, huh? No, I didn''t say "grenades," stupid me. Personally, I think that flash stuff is out of style, but that''s just me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Pyrotechnics OK by You?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm36o', 'You know, you''ve got a bit of the Max Rebo charisma to you. I dunno, something about your general look, your attitude.... Okay, you may do. I wouldn''t give this gig to just anyone, but listen, Max Rebo got his start in this very same place where I''m sending you. Yes! That''s what I''m doing for you! Go, play! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm36s', 'That was great! Here''s your fee. I hope you don''t mind my little fib about Max Rebo playing in that dive. I just wanted to get your emotions running high. You play better that way.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm36t', 'The Next Max Rebo?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm37o', 'It makes me foam at the mouth when I work to build up a new band, work my heart out to make them big, and then they dump me and sign with some big corporate label. You won''t do that, will you, kid? I''m starting you out small with this gig, but you can ride with me all the way to the top. Do it! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm37s', 'You were fine, kid. But I just got a call from my old group, asking me back. I think I''m going with them. Been nice working with you, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm37t', 'Loyalty! Loyalty!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm38o', 'I have to warn you, this place where I''m sending you is -- well -- it''s a little on the shady side. I wouldn''t say actual blaster fights -- at least as such -- but let''s just say it attracts a really vigorous clientele. Are you okay with that? Because if you''re not, I can always find some band hungrier than you to do this gig. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm38s', 'Hey, kid, I''m glad you made it back alive. --No, no, I''m only joking! I''m a kidder, see? Here''s your fee, look me up when you want another gig.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm38t', 'A Really Vigorous Clientele'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm39o', 'This owner sank, I dunno, thousands of credits into this new sound system. State of the art. Then his sound guy starts tinkering with it -- nearly burns the joint down. It''s back in business now, but no sound system to speak of. Are you all right with that? Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm39s', 'No problems with the lack of a sound system, I see. Personally, I think a good a-capella sound can really move a crowd. Here''s your fee, check back later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm39t', 'Sound System Burns Down Venue'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm3o', 'Kloo horns are overrated. My apologies if that happens to be your instrument of choice. I have a gig that asks for a kloo horn player, but personally I think what they really need is a quality musician - one of those can entertain with any instrument. Am I right? Well you can prove me right by heading to this location and expressing yourself. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm3s', 'It seems you certainly did, uh, express yourself. The crowd was stunned into silence by your performance. But I think that''s a good thing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm3t', 'Stun the Crowd'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm40o', 'I hear that an influential young A&R rep -- that''s Artist & Repertoire -- will be in a certain place today, checking out new talent. Is that a gleam of interest I see in your eye? I thought so. Kid, you could make yourself a nice new career if this guy likes your sound. Go and play your heart out! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm40s', 'What? The A&R guy? Oh, he had to leave town. An arrest warrant, or some silly business like that. I didn''t ask. In this business you learn not to ask.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm40t', 'A&R Rep in a Certain Venue');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm41o', 'I''ve been feuding with a particular manager over blatantly illegal charges for "holograph permits." Some local fan takes your picture, and whoa, suddenly the club gets a cut? He''s pulled that on me twice, and I just about pulled his tusks out. Keep an eye out when you play there, in case he tries to shake you down for "permit fees." Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm41s', 'Okay, good to hear you weren''t charged for "holograph permits." I think that manager and I have patched up our rocky relationship. In this biz relationships are everything.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm41t', 'Holograph Permit Fees'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm42o', 'Look good on stage at this next gig, kid! I''ve got a promo holographer in the audience, waiting to shoot you so you look good-good-good. This guy can make canned meat look glamorous. For you -- well, I dunno -- aw, I''m just kidding you! Am I a kidder? You know I''m a kidder. Go and play, and just wait ''til this guy makes you look great! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm42s', 'The holographer couldn''t make it, kid. Sorry I didn''t tell you about that little mess-up. Seems he got married a couple of times to two different women, and they both showed up in town wanting an explanation. These holographers -- worse than musicians, sheesh.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm42t', 'Promo Holographer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm43o', 'A very influential industry person will be watching at this gig. I can''t say who. What? How is he influential? Well, I can''t really go into that. Let''s just say he makes things happen in a lot of ways. A -- lot -- of ways. It''s something you ought to keep in mind as you play. Try to sound -- I don''t know -- authoritative. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm43s', 'I hope your gig made an impression on our influential friend. Who knows? We may be on the road to stardom together. You and me against the galaxy, huh, kid?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm43t', 'Influential Listener'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm44o', 'A rep for one of the galaxy''s leading instrument manufacturers will be hanging out at your next gig, kid. If she likes what she sees, she may offer you an endorsement contract. "I play nothing but Klonsbon Fizz Horns, they''re the best!" Play your heart out, but don''t sign anything without consulting me first. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm44s', 'I see by your downcast expression that nobody offered you an endorsement contract. Ah, kid, those instrument reps, they''re delicate. Your time will come, don''t worry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm44t', 'Potential Endorsement Contract'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm45o', 'At this next gig, keep an eye out. Some creep has been spotted around there recording secret concert bootlegs, and selling them across the galaxy over the HoloNet. This is blatant interference with your intellectual property, kid. If you see him recording you, you''re legally entitled to blow him up with a thermal detonator. Remember that! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm45s', 'Didn''t see the bootleg guy? Okay, maybe the enforcers I hired ran him out of town. We''ll hope he''s crawled off to some other planet. Sheesh, what a business.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm45t', 'Bootleg Concert Recordings'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm46o', 'An artist friend of mine said she might be showing up at this gig. This could lead somewhere for you, kid. She''s big! Her artwork on your first holo could add an extra ten percent to your bottom-line sales. When you play, try to look kind of -- vibrant. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm46s', 'Turns out my friend had a bad headache and had to cancel, kid. That''s okay, she hangs out a lot in cantinas. She''s an artist, you know -- that''s what they do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm46t', 'Look Vibrant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm47o', 'This is very hush-hush, but I hear that a major Corporate Sector company is scouting locations in this vicinity for a promotional holo. They might want musicians. This gig -- this very one! -- could be the one that lands you a big-big contract, kid. Don''t blow it! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm47s', 'No word yet from the Corporate Sector. Well, keep plugging away, and maybe they''ll see you eventually. As the Mon Calamari say, chin up!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm47t', 'Corporate Sector Location Scout'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm48o', 'You weren''t bad-mouthing me to some of the other managers, were you, kid? Naw, I didn''t think so. No, I never really thought that. It''s just -- you hear things -- everybody is always angling -- aw, what am I saying? You and me, kid! We''re together against the stars! I tell you what, take this gig, and everything''s fine between us. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm48s', 'That''s just what I wanted to see happen, kid. Here''s your fee, minus my cut. Glad we could straighten out that little friction between us.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'm48t', 'Not Bad-Mouthing, Right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 127, 'm49o', 'It''s possible you may see a gent at this next gig who looks pretty well-travelled. That''s because he''s a booking agent for a space cruise line! You get on this guy''s good side, and you''ve got a tour gig on the next luxury spaceliner out of this hole! Go on, do your best, and hope he''s in the audience! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 128, 'm49s', 'Apparently that guy blew town two days before I even knew he was here. I have got to work on the whole social network thing. Don''t be downcast, there''s always another gig.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 129, 'm49t', 'Tour Opportunity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 130, 'm4o', 'Do you remember Miracle Meriko? Now that was a musician''s musician. I wonder whatever happened to that old music man? If you want to leave your mark on the galaxy, friend, you gotta study the works of the masters who came before you. If you think you''re ready to perform, then I''ve got a gig for you. Here are the coordinates. Give it a shot, kid. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 131, 'm4s', 'Could this be another Miracle Meriko in the making? I guess only time will tell. Your pay''s been deposited. Come see me again for more gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 132, 'm4t', 'A Musical Legend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 133, 'm50o', 'Here''s a sweet gig, kid, but there are certain conditions you need to know going in. Whatever you do, don''t mention the situation on Drall. No, I don''t know what situation -- it''s just what the manager told me. It''s a dealbreaker, so just don''t mention Drall at all, okay? Also, no spitting. But you''d never do that anyway. Go, play! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 134, 'm50s', 'You didn''t mention the Drall thing, right? Okay, I didn''t think that particular obstacle would be hard to avoid. I''m not even quite sure where Drall is, actually.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 135, 'm50t', 'Manager With Idiosyncrasies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 136, 'm5o', 'Take a lesson from Billi B. and the Paradise Gang - if your music and lyrics offend the Empire then everyone will know who you are. No such thing as bad publicity, right? Plus, the Empire wants to strip all the life and soul out of music. If you think you''d like to take a stab at enraging Imperial censors, head to these coordinates and work your magic. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 137, 'm5s', 'Judging by the reviews I got from the proprietor, it seems you''re well on your way to a fulfilling career in offensive music. Congratulations! Come see me for future gigs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 138, 'm5t', 'Make Your Musical Mark'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 139, 'm6o', 'Have you heard the song "Death Star Diva?" Now that''s a perfect example of how not to write a song. And who thought "Dead Rebels" was a good name for a band? If your musical style is nothing like those guys, then I''ve got a gig for you. The patrons at this establishment want to be entertained, so give them what they want. Good luck! Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 140, 'm6s', 'Your material was apparently a far cry from the Dead Rebels. Good show, friend. I''ve deposited your fee, minus my commission. See me again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 141, 'm6t', 'Is That Music?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 142, 'm7o', 'If you ever have a hope of being as popular as the Modal Nodes, then you''ve got to play every available venue and take every gig that comes your way. You never know who might be listening to your material. I got one such gig lined up for you right now. Head to this location and belt out a few tunes. Don''t be shy. I''ll contact you when the gig is over. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 143, 'm7s', 'Word is you weren''t at all shy about performing your material. That''s a good start. Stick with me and you just may get famous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 144, 'm7t', 'Destined For Stardom'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 145, 'm8o', 'Ever heard a Mantooine Minuet? I understand the Emperor is crazy about them. I happen to find them stodgy and monotonous. In any case, if Imperial music is not what you aspire to perform, then I got a gig you might be interested in. Head to these coordinates and play something decidedly un-Imperial. We''ll talk again when your show is over. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 146, 'm8s', 'There''s something about the way you played, friend. It inspired enough of your listeners that the owner of the establishment included a generous tip. I''ve transmitted your pay into your account. Check back with me for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 147, 'm8t', 'Who Loves Minuets?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 148, 'm9o', 'I get all kinds of musicians coming to me for gigs, friend. Half of them aspire to be this century''s Mondegrene, the other half doesn''t even know who Mondegrene was. Which are you? Well never mind that, if you want a job, I got one for you. Mosey on over to these coordinates and show the patrons there that they''re in the presence of greatness. Perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 149, 'm9s', 'Mondegrene would have been proud, friend, especially given that he went tone deaf later in his life. Your pay''s been deposited. I''d work with you again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 150, 'm9t', 'Join the Ranks of the Musical Masters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_neutral_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm10o', 'We''ve made arrangements to meet a data slicer who says he has information of great importance to the Alliance. We would like you to put on a rousing show at these coordinates. We will meet with him and assess his information while spies are distracted by your performance. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm10s', 'He tried to sell us plans for a Death Star! Under what rock has this guy been hiding?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm10t', 'Covering a Meeting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm11o', 'A famous conductor is producing concerts featuring the music of different alien cultures. His current production is focusing on the works of Dembaline, a Mon Calamari composer. If you''re interested in auditioning, head to this venue immediately. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm11s', 'The alien composers series has been deemed unsuitable by the Imperial Board of Culture. Blast them and their constant censorship!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm11t', 'The Works of Alien Composers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm12o', 'Some of our soldiers recently skirmished with Imperial troops. Their casualties were light, but unfortunately the commanding officer was killed. The whole squad is feeling pretty down and need something to lift their spirits. They''ve requested a musican to play the commander''s favorite song as a memorial. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm12s', 'That was very moving. I''m sure the commander would have been pleased.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm12t', 'Remembering the Fallen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm13o', 'There''s a lot of great alien music out there, but you hardly ever hear any, thanks to the Imperial Board of Culture. Help raise awareness of alien music. Pick a piece you like, go to the designated venue, and play it. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm13s', 'All that alien talent being ignored by the Imperials. Shameful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm13t', 'Hidden Talent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm14o', 'We have a message we need to send to a covert operative. Please go to this venue and play this set list in this order. Our operative will understand what it means. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm14s', 'The message was received, and your performance was quite good too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm14t', 'A Hidden Message'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm15o', 'The Alliance has captured an Imperial spy who loves music. We want you to go to this venue and play in the most discordant, awful way you can. We''ll record you and play your work repeatedly in his cell before he is questioned. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm15s', 'Wow, that was truly awful. Nice work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm15t', 'Play Your Worst!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm16o', 'We''re trying to help a courier get out of the city, and we''re asking musicians to go to venues around town and play really rousing shows. Get the audience really riled up. We want the Imperials distracted by so much rowdiness, they won''t be able to keep to close an eye on our man. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm16s', 'That was some lively show you put on. Nobody paid any attention to the courier.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm16t', 'Play a Rousing Show'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm17o', 'People in the city have been very troubled by our conflict. We''re very concerned about this even if the Empire isn''t. We''d like you to play for the folks at this venue. Try and set their minds at ease. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm17s', 'It''s wonderful how music helps people through their troubles. I sometimes wish I were a musician. Fortunately, sanity always returns.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm17t', 'Help Calm the City'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm18o', 'Certain heroes of the Alliance are coming to the city, and we''ve arranged a small reception. Go to the appointed venue, where you will have the privilege of playing for these legendary figures. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm18s', 'Imperial Security got word of our arrangements. For their own safety, we took the visitors to another world. I suppose we had better tighten our security.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm18t', 'Heroes of the Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm19o', 'Intelligence wants to test an idea for passing coded messages. We''ve keyed messages to particular songs -- playing one song might mean "Imperials are watching," say. We know your playlist. If you''ll play at the venue we''ve arranged, our people will listen and report messages. That''ll test whether the idea can even work. Okay? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm19s', 'Well, it was a pretty mixed result, I have to say. I don''t know that we''ll throw out this idea, but we definitely need more testing. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm19t', 'Musical Codes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm1o', 'The Imperials are constantly telling musicians what they can and cannot play. One of the things we''re fighting for is freedom of artistic expression. Go to the designated venue and perform whatever music moves you. I''m sure it will move others too. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm1s', 'Much better than having to go play a bunch of songs about Imperial glory, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm1t', 'Songs of Freedom'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm20o', 'The Imperial Army just drop-shipped a battalion of stormtroopers in the wilderness, and the fighting out there is fierce. Our fighters are returning to the local venues feeling like they''ve run fifty kilometers. Help them recover by playing something soft and pleasant. Or make it bouncy. Whatever you want. Just play, and help them, okay? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm20s', 'These soldiers have been through a lot, but they tell me they liked hearing you play -- even as they walked by outside the building. That''s talent. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm20t', 'In From the Field, Battle-Scarred'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm21o', 'Can you play loud? I mean really loud? We need a big distraction in a particular venue, so we can stage a covert and unauthorized demolition project in the vicinity. You don''t need to know the project. You can help by bringing all your musician friends in on this gig. Play long and, especially, play loud! You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm21s', 'That was really loud. Good job. Yes, everything went just fine. You didn''t hear anything? Well, as I say -- you were really loud.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm21t', 'Can You Play Loud?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm22o', 'The Empire is pushing all kinds of propaganda music in local venues. Maybe the worst was "The Triumph of Our Spirit," though "In Our Emperor''s Footsteps" was also pretty ghastly. I''m meeting some friends at one of the worst offenders, and I''ll pay you -- out of my own credits! -- to play something peppier. Interested? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm22s', 'Sorry I couldn''t make it to your performance. My friends wanted to head elsewhere, and we ended up listening to "Glorious Coruscant." Serves them right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm22t', 'Rescue Me From Imperial Music'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm23o', 'Reports have been coming back about the latest battle against the Empire. I don''t want to go into detail, but it looks bad. Some good folks died. The survivors are wandering back now, and they look beat. If you perform at this venue, we''ll try to point them your way, and you''ll cheer them up. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm23s', 'Thanks. It''s so important for these fighters to remember what they''re fighting for -- the beauty that the Empire would stamp out. You helped them remember.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm23t', 'Survivors of the Latest Battle'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm24o', 'We had a lucky break when some of our soldiers ran into stormtroopers in the wilderness. We fought well. A lot of stormtroopers ran for cover -- like, to another planet, that''s how far they ran! Now our fighters want to celebrate. They want to hear you play something festive. Can you perform for them? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm24s', 'We had a lot of soldiers listening to you through a droidcam. It was great to see -- they all danced to your beat. That was good work, thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm24t', 'Celebrate Our Latest Victory!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm25o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has sent another agent on a canvassing mission, looking for us. We expect he''ll be lurking around the local entertainment venues, and so we''re sending folks like you there to keep an eye out. Do your performance, play your music, but check for suspicious characters. We''ll debrief you later. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm25s', 'One of our fighters managed to take out the spy before he got to your venue. Your performance distracted the folks who might have warned him. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm25t', 'Imperial Spy Lurks in Cantinas'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm26o', 'A famous Alliance commander -- I''d better not say who -- is visiting this world. He likes to have a good time, they say, so we''re showing him around the local venues. We want to make sure the entertainers there don''t suddenly turn out to be Imperials. To help, we want you to take one of the scheduled gigs. Interested? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm26s', 'Thanks! It was good, not needing to watch our backs to make sure the band didn''t suddenly take a pot-shot at us. As it happened, Commander Solo didn''t make it to your venue, but he had a good time elsewhere. Who knows? You may see him around.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm26t', 'Alliance Commander Likes a Good Time'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm27o', 'We''ve arranged a rendezvous with a potential Imperial defector. He was an officer aboard a Star Destroyer when the Death Star blew up his homeworld, Alderaan. That can change a person''s outlook. We told him to meet us outside a particular venue; he can recognize it because you''re playing inside. At least, we hope. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm27s', 'The defector spotted you from the description we gave, and we carried off the meeting nearby. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm27t', 'Imperial Defector Recruitment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm28o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is trying to contact us despite heavy Imperial surveillance. The pre-arranged emergency rendezvous calls for contact outside a particular venue that he can spot according to the kind of music being played inside. Specifically, your kind of music. Will you help us? Move quickly! You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm28s', 'We couldn''t connect with our smuggler this time. They''re often nervous types. We''ll try again later.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm28t', 'Play a Smuggler Rendezvous'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm29o', 'The newest Imperial Security Bureau purge is "disappearing" folks who have expressed pro-freedom sentiments, plus extra folks disliked by the anti-freedom types. It''s a nervous time. People are feeling strained. To keep them from cracking, we need entertainers like you to go to that area and play something tranquil. Sound good? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm29s', 'We wanted you to perform something calming, and you did the job better than we''d hoped. We''ll probably need you again for this, more''s the pity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm29t', 'New ISB Purge Jangles Nerves'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm2o', 'The Imperial propoganda machine has been really down on fizz music recently. In an effort to annoy the Empire in as many ways as possible, we are asking you to go to this venue and bring down the house with some really wailing fizz tunes. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm2s', 'Not every battle is fought with a blaster. Good job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm2t', 'Annoy the Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm30o', 'The Committee for the Preservation of the New Order continues its good works. Lots of terrified folks are telling us about alien purges, homes of sympathizers being destroyed, people vanishing... Someone needs to get these people calmed down, or they''ll riot. If you can play something to soothe them, do it fast! You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm30s', 'COMPNOR relies on keeping the people scared, because scared people gladly give them the power they crave. You help us fight COMPNOR by calming people. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm30t', 'Another Terrifying COMPNOR Sweep'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm31o', 'The Empire promotes anti-alien sentiment across the galaxy. We fight this battle as hard as the rest, and you''re our soldier. Try to find nonhuman musicians to join you in the performance we''ve arranged for you. Play together in friendship. If you can''t find anyone else, play alone, and spread the idea of tolerance. Okay? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm31s', 'Nice job. We''ll work on getting whole groups together, aliens and humans, to perform for people who might otherwise learn the Empire''s hatred.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm31t', 'Human-Alien Musician Group Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm32o', 'We''re passing important data to a blockade runner who''s taking it offworld. Can''t risk it going over the HoloNet. We''re meeting outside a particular venue, but the ISB is tracking our smuggler relentlessly. We want you to distract the Imperials. Can you play, and maybe also do something unusually interesting while you''re there? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm32s', 'I don''t know what you did at the venue, if anything, but it looks like you distracted the Imperials. We got the data to the blockade runner. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm32t', 'Do Something Unusual'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm33o', 'I was walking the streets like any ordinary citizen, and blaster battles erupted left and right! It was chaos! To think that the Civil War has brought us to this. Folks are so nervous, they''re not thinking straight. You need to play something calming and uplifting -- get them back to normal. Can you do it? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm33s', 'I heard your music from a distance. It calmed me, and a lot of others around me. It was a nice moment. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm33t', 'Bring Calm to the Chaos'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm34o', 'A Core Worlds writer has managed to sneak a hilarious musical comedy past Imperial censors. They think it''s about dumb crooks, when anyone outside Coruscant can see it''s about dumb Imperials. We want to stage a production to boost morale. If you''d like to audition, go to this venue and play your heart out. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm34s', 'Imperial censors finally caught on and banned the work. We don''t want to risk staging it now. But please, take this token payment for your efforts. Thanks anyway!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm34t', 'Anti-Imperial Musical Comedy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm35o', 'We''d like to infiltrate an Alliance agent into the Core Worlds. A good cover would be a travelling musician -- they visit formal Imperial functions and can overhear a lot. If you''re interested, we''re holding auditions at a particular venue, and we want every talented Alliance sympathizer to give it a try. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm35s', 'Thanks for the audition. We don''t know how we''ll work this infiltration, or even whether it will happen. But if it does, you may hear from us. Good luck!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm35t', 'Infiltrate the Core Worlds'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm3o', 'It''s been pretty hard on the Alliance recently. Soldiers and citizens alike are feeling overwhelmed by the uncertainty and fear that permeates our lives. If you were to go to this venue and play some soothing music, I think it might make everybody feel a little better. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm3s', 'I think we all look forward to a time when these constant battles with the Empire are behind us. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm3t', 'We Live in Uncertain Times'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm4o', 'Some young Alliance soldiers have a kind of haunted look in their eyes. They''ve experienced horrors they''d never imagined. They can look so lost when they return from battle. Go to this venue and help lighten their heavy hearts. Remind them how much there is to live for. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm4s', 'It makes my heart ache to think how much damage this war does to our spirits. I hope it ends soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm4t', 'The Horrors of War'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm5o', 'You would not believe the kind of mindless turbolift music that COMPNOR is encouraging musicians to play. It behooves all Alliance musicians to get out there and play as much politically relevant music as they can. Go to this venue and play music that will really make people think. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm5s', 'You''re out there making people open their eyes and ears. Keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm5t', 'Protest Songs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm6o', 'There''s a lot of good people out there, putting it all on the line for the Alliance. With the Empire breathing down our necks we''re not always able to give them the thanks they deserve. Go out to this venue and play. Let''s hope people in our cause will understand that our hearts are with them. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm6s', 'Did you put on a good show? I feel certain that you did.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm6t', 'Giving Thanks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm7o', 'The Alliance is putting together a touring company to entertain the troops to keep morale high. If you''re interested and think you have what it takes, auditions are being held at these coordinates. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm7s', 'A touring company may be a little hard to keep hidden from the Empire. We''re still considering the idea, but it''s been shelved for the moment. Sorry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm7t', 'Touring the Troops'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm8o', 'A famous dancer, who must remain nameless, is going to perform at a secret new Alliance installation. She will require a small group of discreet musicians to accompany her performance. Hurry to the designated location and record a holo to send her. You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm8s', 'You weren''t one of the musicians chosen, but she did comment that your work showed a great deal of promise. She sent you a small sum of credits to encourage you to keep practicing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm8t', 'Famous Dancer Needs Accompaniment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm9o', 'We''re meeting an Alliance covert operative, but an Imperial spy is looking for him. A specific song will warn him the meeting is compromised. Our problem is that the song has been moved to COMPNOR''s banned list. Would you be willing to go and play this banned song anyway and risk arrest, so we can warn our operative? You must perform for 10 minutes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm9s', 'The meeting was cancelled successfully. I''m glad you made it out of there before the Imperials caught up with you. Watch your back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm9t', 'Play a Banned Song'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_musician_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'number_of_entries', '35'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Rebel activity has been increasing in this area. We suspect that a new cell may have recently formed near here. We require the skills of a loyal Imperial citizen to scout out the area and report back to us. Can you handle this assignment, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Just as we suspected. You have served the Empire well, citizen. You can take partial credit for every single Rebel our stormtroopers bring down.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Rebel Hunting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Imperial Intelligence has reported high smuggler activity in this system. Our probe droids have narrowed the area where smugglers might have set up a base. If they search any more closely, however, the smugglers will be warned. We need you to scout this area and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Well done, citizen. We''ll monitor the activities of these smugglers closely. Perhaps they''ll lead us to some Rebel bases.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Follow the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'Black Sun believes itself untouchable, even by Imperial law. Our job is to shatter this belief. We believe we know where one of these Black Sun gangs have set up shop. If you could scout the area to give us an understanding of their numbers and resources, then report back here, we could organize an effective strike.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'Sounds like we may need to call in some stormtrooper reserves. The Empire thanks you for your intelligence, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Scope Out the Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'A deadly new swoop gang, the Shadow Angels, has been trying to establish itself on this planet. Many recent attacks on remote settlements have been attributed to these vile gangsters. We need you to scout out an area investigated by our probe droids. We know the gangsters are there; we just need intelligence on their strength. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'We''ll have to take care of these swoopers before their numbers overwhelm our garrison. We are grateful for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Find the Shadow Angels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'Recent raids on Abraxas have driven pirates out of their hiding places. Imperial Intelligence has tracked some of those pirates to this planet. A spike in waste emissions in the wilderness is decidedly suspicious. We need you to check this area out and see what is producing those emissions. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'Our suspicions are confirmed. Good work, citizen. You may have a career in Imperial Intelligence.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Those Dirty Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'Intelligence wants to get their hands on a notorious Snivvian pirate named Bakken. We have reasons to believe this individual has been working for the Rebels. One of our contacts has informed us that Bakken has been seen on this planet. He gave us coordinates that we are most interested in having you check out. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'That might indeed be Bakken. We''ll organize a strike. The Empire will compensate you for your service, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Snag the Infamous Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'We may have a lead on tracking down the pirate Leo Bellsfar. One of Bellsfar''s men was taken in an Imperial raid a few days ago and when pressed by interrogators squawked like a Neimoidian neekoflight. He claims that Bellsfar often takes refuge in a base on this planet. Check out these coordinates and report what you find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'That doesn''t sound pirates. Unless Bellsfar has thrown his lot in with those Rebel scum. It would be fitting for a villain like Bellsfar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Recon the Pirate Lair'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'We had believed the Black Hole Gang destroyed but it seems some of of their number managed to escape and have been using a base near here to hide from local authorities. Check out these coordinates and see how formidable a base these pirates have managed to establish. Report back here, and do not engage the enemy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'Excellent, we''ll take it from here. No one escapes the long arm of the Empire, citizen. No one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Is the Gang All There?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'The sign of the Blazing Claw has been used by pirates since the days of the Old Republic. One of our probots observed a ship that bore this sign on its hull. The ship did not seem headed toward any known starports, and we believe it landed at these coordinates. Check them out and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'We didn''t realize those scoundrels had an entire base down there. We''ll have TIE bombers sweep that area until there''s nothing left. Thank you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'The Blazing Claw'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'We''ve been surveying some land believed to be rich in alantium but have detected some strange ion emissions in that area. Could you scout it out and make sure no squatters have moved into the area. These independent miners are becoming far too bold for the Empire''s tastes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Those don''t sound like miners. Those sound like smugglers. We''ll assign a stormtrooper unit to take care of the problem immediately.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Find the Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'It seems that a local gang has been sponsoring illegal podraces on this planet. Our information points to a remote area as the base of operations of this gang. We need you to recoinnoiter the following coordinates. Make sure you''re not seen as this would tip the gangsters off that we''re wise to their setup.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'We need to move fast or these gangsters will head offworld and try to set up shop on another system. Your help will be instrumental in stopping these criminals, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Stop the Podraces'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'Imperial Intelligence has warned us that the so-called "Lady" Valarian is trying to expand her criminal empire. It''s bad enough keeping tabs on the activities of all the Hutts and Black Sun; now we have to monitor the criminal doings of a crazed Whiphid as well. Scout out these coordinates and let us know if these gangsters have already set up a base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'These gangsters are vermin and will be exterminated like vermin. After all, Imperial troops need moving targets to improve their marksmanship. Our thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Curb Valarian''s Enthusiasm'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'A shipment of R2 units was recently stolen by the Rebels during a raid on an Imperial depot. Unbeknownst to those scum, the R2s had been outfitted with undetectable homing beacons. We''ve picked up a signal from one of those transmitters and need you to scout out the area. Report any unusual activity immediately. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'Looks like we''ve found one of those missing droids, citizen. I think a company of Imperial stormtroopers and an AT-AT column can take it from here. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Find the Pesky Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'We intercepted a Rebel transmission believed to be from Airen Cracken to a local Rebel cell. Given the description in the message, we believe we know where this base is hidden. Scout out the area at these coordinates and report your findings back to us. The Empire is counting on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'You''ve done well, citizen. We''ll keep this base under close watch and hope that we can snare Cracken himself. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'Capture Airen Cracken'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'The Imperial Guide to Negative Reinforcement states that all suspected criminal activity should be punished using the harshest means possible. This helps deter similar future activity. To this end, we need you to scout out an area we suspect is being used by smugglers to store illicit goods. Our TIE bombers require accurate surface coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'You have done your part to secure peace and order in the Empire, citizen. You should be proud of your accomplishment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Bomb the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'We think some pirates are engaging in illegal energy mining. We need you to scout out their operation and report on their strength and numbers. Will we have to call in outside help to handle this one, or will our local forces be sufficient to stop these pirates? We need this issue settled immediately. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'I suppose we''ll call in for reinforcements, just in case. It never hurts to have a battalion or two of stormtroopers to bolster your planetary security forces.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Stop the Energy Mining'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'One of our agents was sent to investigate an area thought to contain a Rebel outpost. We lost contact with our agent shortly after they arrived at these coordinates. We need you to ascertain the fate of our agent as well as gather intelligence on the outpost if it is indeed there. Proceed with caution, citizen. We''d hate to lose another agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'It sounds like our first agent fell victim to foul play. Those murderous Rebels will pay for what they''ve done. The Empire thanks you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Sneaky Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'We''ve been seeing an odd alien hanging around this installation -- a little furry thing wearing primitive hide clothing. We think he may be spying, so we planted a tracking beacon on him. Check the coordinates of his destination and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'Rebels, eh? I never did trust that fuzzy, jabbering wretch. We''ll send out a company of stormtroopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'Furry Potential Terrorist');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'I saw a suspicious gathering of aliens. When I passed by, they all went silent. When they headed away as a group, I ordered a probot to follow at high altitude. The signal went dead at these coordinates. Go out, check it, report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'I knew it! You have to watch those aliens all the time. All, all potential Rebels! I''ll send in the troops.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'The Emperor''s Guards suggest that the Emperor himself may visit this world! Our watchwords become "increased vigilance." It falls to you to check a recent report of suspicious activity at these coordinates. Report back at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'This Rebel activity can only discourage an Imperial visit. Then again, perhaps that is not wholly bad news.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Recon for Imperial Visit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'There are continued rumors that the Emperor himself may pay us a visit. Unlikely, I think -- yet this often serves as a pretext to "encourage" greater efforts to hunt Rebels. We have a new report of suspicious actions. Check these coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'Well, whether or not the Emperor visits here, we obviously need to clean up the Rebels. I''ll call in a strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Imperial Visit Requires Recon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'Last night an alien assaulted one of our troops. This cannot be tolerated. We are canvassing the planet for suspicious aliens, preparatory to a full-scale purge. You are to reconnoiter these coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'Rebels. Hmm. Very well, we''ll send in an assault force. And any aliens there will be sorry, for a very brief time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Alien Assault on Stormtrooper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'We apprehended a criminal in the act of stealing weapons from an armory. We have begun to kill him. He has divulged the location of his base. Before we assemble an extermination mission, we wish you to inspect the coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'Excellent. The criminal''s report might have been false, but in these situations we usually obtain good results. We will wipe out the base shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Armory Thief Divulges Base Location'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'Incredibly, we have apprehended one of our own Imperial officers in the act of illicitly transporting war materiel to known gangsters. The errant officer is in custody, but we have not yet determined the destination for his stolen goods. Check the following coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'That sounds like the destination our would-be gangster had in mind. We''ll dispose of them quickly. By the way, I have just been promoted -- the corrupt officer was my immediate superior. Tragic.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'A Corrupt Officer! Can It Be?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'The Empire takes a dim view of glitterstim drug smuggling. This only empowers the Hutts, Black Sun, and other criminal organizations. We have received reports of a drug laboratory in a remote area. We require you to investigate these coordinates and report back. If there are gangsters there, we shall send in a strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'Despite all appearances, it is not a hopeless task to eradicate drug smuggling on this world. We shall triumph! Victory is inevitable!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'Glitterstim Lab Felons'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'An Imperial Navy quartermaster has literally been kidnapped off a Lancer-class frigate in this system. We believe the pirates took the quartermaster to a base in the wilderness. Check these coordinates and report back on what you find. Take no offensive action on your own! These people are obviously dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm26d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'That pirate gang could use the quartermaster''s security codes to have the Empire literally deliver goods to that base. Good job! We shall resolve this matter shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Imperial Quartermaster Kidnapped'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'Disturbing rumors say smugglers have stolen hyperspace dampers from a Star Destroyer! This defies understanding. Only a network of inside accomplices could pull off that feat. We have reports of a smuggler base at these coordinates. Reconnoiter the area, with attention to the presence or absence of hyperspace dampers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 106, 'm27d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'Well, from your sketchy report it appears that base has no hyperspace dampers. It would be a relief to learn that the rumors are false. That is all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'Hyperspace Dampers Purloined?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has deployed surveillance droids over this region. Droids entering one particular region have all failed; their sensors have apparently been burned out. We wish you to investigate these coordinates and report back on the cause.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 110, 'm28d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'Hmm. Those smugglers must have a laser installation that burns out droid visual sensors. We must redesign our sensors accordingly. And we must deal with the smugglers!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'What Burns Droid Sensors?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'Imperial Center has been tracking a notorious Aqualish mercenary who is believed to be building a power base in this sector. A probe droid tracked him to these coordinates, but something provoked the droid to self-destruct before it could identify the structure there. You will go there, identify the structure, and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 114, 'm29d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'A smuggling base? Evidently the Aqualish mercenary is arranging for a shipment of goods -- more weapons, beyond doubt. Very well, we shall continue to track him until we have identified everyone in his plot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Aqualish Mercenary Sighted'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'Too many Rebel sympathizers are escaping our Mid-Rim dragnets. The more we squeeze, the more they slip through our fingers. We suspect the Rebels are setting up a refugee processing center at these coordinates. Journey there, attend to what you see, and report back here with details.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 118, 'm30d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'That doesn''t sound like a refugee processing center. Unless -- could the Rebels stoop so low as to use actual smugglers to smuggle these refugees? Well, that is all for now. You may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Rebel Refugee Processing Center'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'Imperial Center has for some time been concerned with the movements of an infamous Aqualish mercenary. He has returned to this world as part of his effort to build a power base in this sector. The droid tracking him has been destroyed. We wish you to reconnoiter these coordinates and report back on his current contacts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 122, 'm31d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'That mercenary is talking to pirates again, eh? I expect he is assembling a fleet of desperadoes for his plan, whatever it is. Well, we must continue tracking him until we know everyone in his conspiracy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Track the Aqualish Mercenary'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'We confiscate starships of suspected Rebel sympathizers, but too many of these craft escape us. The tighter we weave our blockades, the more ships slip through our net. We believe several Rebel ships have landed at these coordinates. Inspect the area, then report here with your findings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 126, 'm32d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'No Rebel ships? Hmm. Could the ships have been stolen by the pirates you discovered? It seems too simple an explanation. Well, we shall see. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Rebel Starships Escape Confiscation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'A known bounty hunter has been seen consorting with space pirates. This defies Imperial regulations, not that hunters attend closely to such trivia. But if we can document the association, we can embarrass the Bounty Hunters'' Guild, should we need to. Reconnoiter the pirate base. Do not attack anyone. Report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 130, 'm33d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'Never mind. I''ve learned that this hunter was hired by a highly placed aide to the Emperor -- naming no names. He seeks a particular Rebel whose name escapes me. I believe it impolitic to accuse that hunter of anything untoward, for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Bounty Hunter Working With Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'A notorious Aqualish mercenary, who has long been of interest to Imperial Center, has returned to this world to continue building his power base. His purpose and contacts are unknown. We require you to journey to the coordinates where he was last seen, then return here to describe the destination.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 134, 'm34d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'Hmm. It makes a certain evil sense that our mercenary would be consorting again with gangsters. He needs brutal, ruthless folk who will stop at nothing. Well, we shall continue to track him until we know of every malcontent he enlists in his scheme.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'Who Meets the Aqualish Mercenary?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have new orders for you. A band of space pirates recently stole a shipment of hyperdrive motivators from an Imperial transport. We followed the motivators'' tracking beacon to a small installation. I need you to check out the place and report to me what you find. If the pirates are there, we may need to call in some heavy guns.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 138, 'm35d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'That sounds like the pirates, all right. Though from the sound of it, we won''t need any heavy guns after all. Thanks for the recon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'Possible Pirate Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'Imperial Customs has the coordinates of a suspected smuggler encampment. I need you to find the place, sneak in and see what you can learn. Report back to me at once. Try not to let the locals spot you. We don''t want a firefight. If you find any unsavory characters, we''ll order a strafing run and maybe a couple of bombs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 142, 'm36d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'That sounds a lot like smugglers to me. I''ll contact Imperial Customs to run a cleanup sortie on the place. Good work. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'Check Out a Possible Smuggler Encampment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'In the name of galactic security, I need your assistance! There are reports of a gang of illegal slavers at the coordinates on my datapad. I need someone not in uniform to investigate the area. Do this in the name of justice. Report to me what you find. These unlicensed slavers are a blight on seven sectors and I want to put a stop to them here and now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 146, 'm37d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'Apparently you found the rough crowd we were expecting. That''s it, I''m ordering a squad of stormtroopers to mop up the place. I''ll have no unauthorized slavers in my sector!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'Gang of Rogue Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'This is going to sound strange. Some of my men have reported, well, a haunting. They say ghostly apparitions have appeared to them in a certain area on their patrol. I want you to have a look around and find out what they''re seeing. I don''t believe in ghosts, but something sure has my boys spooked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 150, 'm38d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'Rebels, you say! I knew there weren''t any ghosts. They must have set up some kind of holographic projector to frighten away my patrols. They would have gotten away with it, too, if it weren''t for dilligent Imperial spies like you. Excellent work! We''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'Investigate a Haunting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'Listen up. A rare SoroSuub starfighter called "Preybird" was seen flying into this sytem. We''re pretty sure of the coordinates where the pilot landed. I want you to sneak out there and see if that spaceship is on the grounds. I have a suspicion the pilot is delivering it into the proverbial "wrong hands."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 154, 'm39d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'I knew the Rebels had to be behind this operation. No sign of the Preybird starfighter, though, eh? Too bad. Don''t worry, we''ll track it down yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Investigate a Rare Starfighter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'If you''ve never heard of the Black Hole pirate gang, then you''re about to find out more. I''m fairly sure they''ve got a small installation in my patrol sector. I want you to recon the place and let me know what you find. If it looks like trouble, we''ll send out a platoon of stormtroopers. Can''t let these scum get comfortable, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 158, 'm40d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'Aha! Didn''t I tell you it was space pirates? Yes I did; I distinctly recall saying so. I''ll call a platoon of stormtroopers to level the place. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Investigate a Notorious Space Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'I''ve got a lead on an underworld operator named Talon Karrde. I don''t want to tip him off, though. I need you to scout the place and make sure he''s there before I organize a police action. If I can lay my hands on him, I''m sure I''ll come away with leads to some of the big players in the galactic underworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 162, 'm41d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'He wasn''t there! I don''t believe it. Maybe he knew you were coming. In any case it sounds like those people were an unsavory bunch. I''ll send in a patrol unit to break up any illegal goings-on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Spot an Underworld Operator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'There''s something shady going on. Some of my men have been spending their off-hours at a seedy little joint they call a cantina. I think it''s more suspect than that. We can''t have members of the Imperial military consorting with criminals and low-lifes. Do me a favor and check the place out. Be careful, it can get a little rough. Report back to me what you find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 166, 'm42d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'I knew that place was trouble! I''ll send a military police unit to shut it down for good. The brig will be jammed tonight, I can assure you. I appreciate your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Check Out a Seedy Joint'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'Excuse me. The Empire needs your help. Well, that is, I need your help. I sent a patrol team to a new quadrant this morning and I haven''t heard back from them. I can''t leave my post here. Can you go see if anything is wrong? I heard there was some kind of building or settlement out there. Have a look around it. If it seems dangerous, don''t start any trouble. Just report back to me and I''ll handle it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 170, 'm43d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'Blast! Rebels! They must have waylaid my patrol. Thanks for the assistance. I''ll notify the authorities at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Find a Missing Patrol'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'I require your assistance. An Imperial courier was scheduled to hand-deliver a memo to me this morning. It contained critical details about an upcoming Imperial operation. I''m mortified to say I haven''t received it yet. Have a look round the courier''s last known coordinates and see if there''s any sign of that delivery. Then report back to me at once. I dread the thought of missing the next meeting of the Preliminary Exploratory Action Planning Committee. I''m the secretary, after all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 174, 'm44d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'There are Rebels out there? Oh, dear! Something must be done! I shall organize an official committee at once and vigorously debate this problem. We''ll craft a strong warning for those Rebel scum. I can assure you of that!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'An Imperial Courier Is Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'There you are. I''m glad you showed up. I have a job for you. Intelligence has reported a possible Rebel encampment outside of town. I want you to check the place out. Don''t start any trouble, though. Just look around and report back to me. I''ve got a surprise for them if they bring their treason into my jurisdiction!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 178, 'm45d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'You say there were no overt Rebels? Hmm. Well, any spacer whose licenses aren''t in order is a potential Rebel smuggler. I''ll have the planetary authorities raid the place and check out everyone''s credentials. They''re not going to slip any treason under my scanners. You can rely on that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Rebels In My Jurisdiction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'Yes, I lost another shipment of TIE solar array support frames. I don''t deny it. But instead of threatening to tell my superiors, what if you investigate these coordinates where the tracking beacons sent their last transmission? You''ll find my lost frames, I''ll write you a commendation for service to the Empire, and my superiors won''t be bothered by these petty logistical details. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 182, 'm46d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'Sounds like they were smugglers to me. Not good. Maybe I can hire some locals to bring my frames back before my superiors get word of this. In any case, thanks for helping me out. I''ll file an Imperial commendation for you under some pretext that has nothing to do with lost TIE solar array support frames.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'Earn an Imperial Commendation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'Nothing personal, but I''ve just about had my fill of aliens. Used to be, a man of my species could enjoy the company of his own without stepping on someone''s tail or tentacle or furry hoof. Anyway, a band of unsavory-looking aliens has set up shop outside of town. I want you to check out their operation. Don''t let on you''re working for me, though. Just have a look and tell me what you find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 186, 'm47d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'I sure don''t like the cut of that bunch. They sound like outlaws to me. Would you agree? I''ll call this into Orbital Dispatch and see if a couple of TIE flyovers might chase those ugly drifters away from there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'Investigate Some Unsavory Aliens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'Have you ever seen a lightsaber? Me, I''ve only heard about them in the old stories. But a civilian informant reported seeing one of them at a small installation some distance from here. I''d love to get a pair of Empire-friendly eyes inside that place. Care to handle this recon job for me? Come back here when you''re finished.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 190, 'm48d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'Too bad you didn''t see the lightsaber, but an installation full of Rebels is equally interesting to me. Looks like I''ll get to exercise my trigger finger before supper tonight. Good work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Lightsaber Claim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'Listen up. We think some rebels might be smuggling escaped criminals through a facility near here. I need you to check it out for me. Report back when you''ve had a look around the place. And keep yourself out of sight. I just want information, not a firefight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 194, 'm49d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'Very interesting. Maybe that place is the refugee smuggling depot we''ve been looking for. Nice work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Investigate Smuggled Convicts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'I have a matter here that needs attention. Journey to these coordinates to investigate rumors of Rebel activity in the area. Just look; don''t shoot. Oh, and on your return here, bring me a cup of jawa juice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 198, 'm50d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'Very well. But I see you''ve omitted my cup of jawa juice. What went wrong? I''m afraid I''ll have to write this up. Regulations, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Check Rebel Activity and Bring Juice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Rebel activity has been increasing in this area. We suspect that a new cell may have recently formed near here. We require the skills of a loyal Imperial citizen to scout out the area and report back to us. Can you handle this assignment, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Just as we suspected. You have served the Empire well, citizen. You can take partial credit for every single Rebel our stormtroopers bring down.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Rebel Hunting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Imperial Intelligence has reported high smuggler activity in this system. Our probe droids have narrowed the area where smugglers might have set up a base. If they search any more closely, however, the smugglers will be warned. We need you to scout this area and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Well done, citizen. We''ll monitor the activities of these smugglers closely. Perhaps they''ll lead us to some Rebel bases.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Follow the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'Black Sun believes itself untouchable, even by Imperial law. Our job is to shatter this belief. We believe we know where one of these Black Sun gangs have set up shop. If you could scout the area to give us an understanding of their numbers and resources, then report back here, we could organize an effective strike.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'Sounds like we may need to call in some stormtrooper reserves. The Empire thanks you for your intelligence, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Scope Out the Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'A deadly new swoop gang, the Shadow Angels, has been trying to establish itself on this planet. Many recent attacks on remote settlements have been attributed to these vile gangsters. We need you to scout out an area investigated by our probe droids. We know the gangsters are there; we just need intelligence on their strength. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'We''ll have to take care of these swoopers before their numbers overwhelm our garrison. We are grateful for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Find the Shadow Angels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'Recent raids on Abraxas have driven pirates out of their hiding places. Imperial Intelligence has tracked some of those pirates to this planet. A spike in waste emissions in the wilderness is decidedly suspicious. We need you to check this area out and see what is producing those emissions. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'Our suspicions are confirmed. Good work, citizen. You may have a career in Imperial Intelligence.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Those Dirty Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'Intelligence wants to get their hands on a notorious Snivvian pirate named Bakken. We have reasons to believe this individual has been working for the Rebels. One of our contacts has informed us that Bakken has been seen on this planet. He gave us coordinates that we are most interested in having you check out. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'That might indeed be Bakken. We''ll organize a strike. The Empire will compensate you for your service, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Snag the Infamous Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'We may have a lead on tracking down the pirate Leo Bellsfar. One of Bellsfar''s men was taken in an Imperial raid a few days ago and when pressed by interrogators squawked like a Neimoidian neekoflight. He claims that Bellsfar often takes refuge in a base on this planet. Check out these coordinates and report what you find. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'That doesn''t sound pirates. Unless Bellsfar has thrown his lot in with those Rebel scum. It would be fitting for a villain like Bellsfar.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Recon the Pirate Lair'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'We had believed the Black Hole Gang destroyed but it seems some of of their number managed to escape and have been using a base near here to hide from local authorities. Check out these coordinates and see how formidable a base these pirates have managed to establish. Report back here, and do not engage the enemy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'Excellent, we''ll take it from here. No one escapes the long arm of the Empire, citizen. No one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Is the Gang All There?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'The sign of the Blazing Claw has been used by pirates since the days of the Old Republic. One of our probots observed a ship that bore this sign on its hull. The ship did not seem headed toward any known starports, and we believe it landed at these coordinates. Check them out and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'We didn''t realize those scoundrels had an entire base down there. We''ll have TIE bombers sweep that area until there''s nothing left. Thank you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'The Blazing Claw'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'We''ve been surveying some land believed to be rich in alantium but have detected some strange ion emissions in that area. Could you scout it out and make sure no squatters have moved into the area. These independent miners are becoming far too bold for the Empire''s tastes.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Those don''t sound like miners. Those sound like smugglers. We''ll assign a stormtrooper unit to take care of the problem immediately.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Find the Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'It seems that a local gang has been sponsoring illegal podraces on this planet. Our information points to a remote area as the base of operations of this gang. We need you to recoinnoiter the following coordinates. Make sure you''re not seen as this would tip the gangsters off that we''re wise to their setup.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'We need to move fast or these gangsters will head offworld and try to set up shop on another system. Your help will be instrumental in stopping these criminals, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Stop the Podraces'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'Imperial Intelligence has warned us that the so-called "Lady" Valarian is trying to expand her criminal empire. It''s bad enough keeping tabs on the activities of all the Hutts and Black Sun; now we have to monitor the criminal doings of a crazed Whiphid as well. Scout out these coordinates and let us know if these gangsters have already set up a base.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'These gangsters are vermin and will be exterminated like vermin. After all, Imperial troops need moving targets to improve their marksmanship. Our thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Curb Valarian''s Enthusiasm'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'A shipment of R2 units was recently stolen by the Rebels during a raid on an Imperial depot. Unbeknownst to those scum, the R2s had been outfitted with undetectable homing beacons. We''ve picked up a signal from one of those transmitters and need you to scout out the area. Report any unusual activity immediately. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'Looks like we''ve found one of those missing droids, citizen. I think a company of Imperial stormtroopers and an AT-AT column can take it from here. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Find the Pesky Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'We intercepted a Rebel transmission believed to be from Airen Cracken to a local Rebel cell. Given the description in the message, we believe we know where this base is hidden. Scout out the area at these coordinates and report your findings back to us. The Empire is counting on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'You''ve done well, citizen. We''ll keep this base under close watch and hope that we can snare Cracken himself. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'Capture Airen Cracken'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'The Imperial Guide to Negative Reinforcement states that all suspected criminal activity should be punished using the harshest means possible. This helps deter similar future activity. To this end, we need you to scout out an area we suspect is being used by smugglers to store illicit goods. Our TIE bombers require accurate surface coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'You have done your part to secure peace and order in the Empire, citizen. You should be proud of your accomplishment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Bomb the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'We think some pirates are engaging in illegal energy mining. We need you to scout out their operation and report on their strength and numbers. Will we have to call in outside help to handle this one, or will our local forces be sufficient to stop these pirates? We need this issue settled immediately. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'I suppose we''ll call in for reinforcements, just in case. It never hurts to have a battalion or two of stormtroopers to bolster your planetary security forces.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Stop the Energy Mining'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'One of our agents was sent to investigate an area thought to contain a Rebel outpost. We lost contact with our agent shortly after they arrived at these coordinates. We need you to ascertain the fate of our agent as well as gather intelligence on the outpost if it is indeed there. Proceed with caution, citizen. We''d hate to lose another agent.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'It sounds like our first agent fell victim to foul play. Those murderous Rebels will pay for what they''ve done. The Empire thanks you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Sneaky Rebels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'We''ve been seeing an odd alien hanging around this installation -- a little furry thing wearing primitive hide clothing. We think he may be spying, so we planted a tracking beacon on him. Check the coordinates of his destination and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'Rebels, eh? I never did trust that fuzzy, jabbering wretch. We''ll send out a company of stormtroopers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'Furry Potential Terrorist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'I saw a suspicious gathering of aliens. When I passed by, they all went silent. When they headed away as a group, I ordered a probot to follow at high altitude. The signal went dead at these coordinates. Go out, check it, report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'I knew it! You have to watch those aliens all the time. All, all potential Rebels! I''ll send in the troops.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'The Emperor''s Guards suggest that the Emperor himself may visit this world! Our watchwords become "increased vigilance." It falls to you to check a recent report of suspicious activity at these coordinates. Report back at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'This Rebel activity can only discourage an Imperial visit. Then again, perhaps that is not wholly bad news.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Recon for Imperial Visit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'There are continued rumors that the Emperor himself may pay us a visit. Unlikely, I think -- yet this often serves as a pretext to "encourage" greater efforts to hunt Rebels. We have a new report of suspicious actions. Check these coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'Well, whether or not the Emperor visits here, we obviously need to clean up the Rebels. I''ll call in a strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Imperial Visit Requires Recon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'Last night an alien assaulted one of our troops. This cannot be tolerated. We are canvassing the planet for suspicious aliens, preparatory to a full-scale purge. You are to reconnoiter these coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'Rebels. Hmm. Very well, we''ll send in an assault force. And any aliens there will be sorry, for a very brief time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Alien Assault on Stormtrooper'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'We apprehended a criminal in the act of stealing weapons from an armory. We have begun to kill him. He has divulged the location of his base. Before we assemble an extermination mission, we wish you to inspect the coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'Excellent. The criminal''s report might have been false, but in these situations we usually obtain good results. We will wipe out the base shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Armory Thief Divulges Base Location'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'Incredibly, we have apprehended one of our own Imperial officers in the act of illicitly transporting war materiel to known gangsters. The errant officer is in custody, but we have not yet determined the destination for his stolen goods. Check the following coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'That sounds like the destination our would-be gangster had in mind. We''ll dispose of them quickly. By the way, I have just been promoted -- the corrupt officer was my immediate superior. Tragic.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'A Corrupt Officer! Can It Be?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'The Empire takes a dim view of glitterstim drug smuggling. This only empowers the Hutts, Black Sun, and other criminal organizations. We have received reports of a drug laboratory in a remote area. We require you to investigate these coordinates and report back. If there are gangsters there, we shall send in a strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'Despite all appearances, it is not a hopeless task to eradicate drug smuggling on this world. We shall triumph! Victory is inevitable!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'Glitterstim Lab Felons'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'An Imperial Navy quartermaster has literally been kidnapped off a Lancer-class frigate in this system. We believe the pirates took the quartermaster to a base in the wilderness. Check these coordinates and report back on what you find. Take no offensive action on your own! These people are obviously dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 102, 'm26d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'That pirate gang could use the quartermaster''s security codes to have the Empire literally deliver goods to that base. Good job! We shall resolve this matter shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Imperial Quartermaster Kidnapped'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'Disturbing rumors say smugglers have stolen hyperspace dampers from a Star Destroyer! This defies understanding. Only a network of inside accomplices could pull off that feat. We have reports of a smuggler base at these coordinates. Reconnoiter the area, with attention to the presence or absence of hyperspace dampers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 106, 'm27d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'Well, from your sketchy report it appears that base has no hyperspace dampers. It would be a relief to learn that the rumors are false. That is all for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'Hyperspace Dampers Purloined?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has deployed surveillance droids over this region. Droids entering one particular region have all failed; their sensors have apparently been burned out. We wish you to investigate these coordinates and report back on the cause.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 110, 'm28d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'Hmm. Those smugglers must have a laser installation that burns out droid visual sensors. We must redesign our sensors accordingly. And we must deal with the smugglers!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'What Burns Droid Sensors?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'Imperial Center has been tracking a notorious Aqualish mercenary who is believed to be building a power base in this sector. A probe droid tracked him to these coordinates, but something provoked the droid to self-destruct before it could identify the structure there. You will go there, identify the structure, and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 114, 'm29d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'A smuggling base? Evidently the Aqualish mercenary is arranging for a shipment of goods -- more weapons, beyond doubt. Very well, we shall continue to track him until we have identified everyone in his plot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Aqualish Mercenary Sighted'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'Too many Rebel sympathizers are escaping our Mid-Rim dragnets. The more we squeeze, the more they slip through our fingers. We suspect the Rebels are setting up a refugee processing center at these coordinates. Journey there, attend to what you see, and report back here with details.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 118, 'm30d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'That doesn''t sound like a refugee processing center. Unless -- could the Rebels stoop so low as to use actual smugglers to smuggle these refugees? Well, that is all for now. You may go.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Rebel Refugee Processing Center'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'Imperial Center has for some time been concerned with the movements of an infamous Aqualish mercenary. He has returned to this world as part of his effort to build a power base in this sector. The droid tracking him has been destroyed. We wish you to reconnoiter these coordinates and report back on his current contacts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 122, 'm31d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'That mercenary is talking to pirates again, eh? I expect he is assembling a fleet of desperadoes for his plan, whatever it is. Well, we must continue tracking him until we know everyone in his conspiracy.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Track the Aqualish Mercenary'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'We confiscate starships of suspected Rebel sympathizers, but too many of these craft escape us. The tighter we weave our blockades, the more ships slip through our net. We believe several Rebel ships have landed at these coordinates. Inspect the area, then report here with your findings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 126, 'm32d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'No Rebel ships? Hmm. Could the ships have been stolen by the pirates you discovered? It seems too simple an explanation. Well, we shall see. You may go now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Rebel Starships Escape Confiscation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'A known bounty hunter has been seen consorting with space pirates. This defies Imperial regulations, not that hunters attend closely to such trivia. But if we can document the association, we can embarrass the Bounty Hunters'' Guild, should we need to. Reconnoiter the pirate base. Do not attack anyone. Report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 130, 'm33d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'Never mind. I''ve learned that this hunter was hired by a highly placed aide to the Emperor -- naming no names. He seeks a particular Rebel whose name escapes me. I believe it impolitic to accuse that hunter of anything untoward, for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Bounty Hunter Working With Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'A notorious Aqualish mercenary, who has long been of interest to Imperial Center, has returned to this world to continue building his power base. His purpose and contacts are unknown. We require you to journey to the coordinates where he was last seen, then return here to describe the destination.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 134, 'm34d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'Hmm. It makes a certain evil sense that our mercenary would be consorting again with gangsters. He needs brutal, ruthless folk who will stop at nothing. Well, we shall continue to track him until we know of every malcontent he enlists in his scheme.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'Who Meets the Aqualish Mercenary?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'Stop what you''re doing. I have new orders for you. A band of space pirates recently stole a shipment of hyperdrive motivators from an Imperial transport. We followed the motivators'' tracking beacon to a small installation. I need you to check out the place and report to me what you find. If the pirates are there, we may need to call in some heavy guns.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 138, 'm35d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'That sounds like the pirates, all right. Though from the sound of it, we won''t need any heavy guns after all. Thanks for the recon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'Possible Pirate Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'Imperial Customs has the coordinates of a suspected smuggler encampment. I need you to find the place, sneak in and see what you can learn. Report back to me at once. Try not to let the locals spot you. We don''t want a firefight. If you find any unsavory characters, we''ll order a strafing run and maybe a couple of bombs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 142, 'm36d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'That sounds a lot like smugglers to me. I''ll contact Imperial Customs to run a cleanup sortie on the place. Good work. Carry on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'Check Out a Possible Smuggler Encampment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'In the name of galactic security, I need your assistance! There are reports of a gang of illegal slavers at the coordinates on my datapad. I need someone not in uniform to investigate the area. Do this in the name of justice. Report to me what you find. These unlicensed slavers are a blight on seven sectors and I want to put a stop to them here and now!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 146, 'm37d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'Apparently you found the rough crowd we were expecting. That''s it, I''m ordering a squad of stormtroopers to mop up the place. I''ll have no unauthorized slavers in my sector!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'Gang of Rogue Slavers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'This is going to sound strange. Some of my men have reported, well, a haunting. They say ghostly apparitions have appeared to them in a certain area on their patrol. I want you to have a look around and find out what they''re seeing. I don''t believe in ghosts, but something sure has my boys spooked.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 150, 'm38d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'Rebels, you say! I knew there weren''t any ghosts. They must have set up some kind of holographic projector to frighten away my patrols. They would have gotten away with it, too, if it weren''t for dilligent Imperial spies like you. Excellent work! We''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'Investigate a Haunting'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'Listen up. A rare SoroSuub starfighter called "Preybird" was seen flying into this sytem. We''re pretty sure of the coordinates where the pilot landed. I want you to sneak out there and see if that spaceship is on the grounds. I have a suspicion the pilot is delivering it into the proverbial "wrong hands."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 154, 'm39d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'I knew the Rebels had to be behind this operation. No sign of the Preybird starfighter, though, eh? Too bad. Don''t worry, we''ll track it down yet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Investigate a Rare Starfighter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'If you''ve never heard of the Black Hole pirate gang, then you''re about to find out more. I''m fairly sure they''ve got a small installation in my patrol sector. I want you to recon the place and let me know what you find. If it looks like trouble, we''ll send out a platoon of stormtroopers. Can''t let these scum get comfortable, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 158, 'm40d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'Aha! Didn''t I tell you it was space pirates? Yes I did; I distinctly recall saying so. I''ll call a platoon of stormtroopers to level the place. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Investigate a Notorious Space Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'I''ve got a lead on an underworld operator named Talon Karrde. I don''t want to tip him off, though. I need you to scout the place and make sure he''s there before I organize a police action. If I can lay my hands on him, I''m sure I''ll come away with leads to some of the big players in the galactic underworld.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 162, 'm41d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'He wasn''t there! I don''t believe it. Maybe he knew you were coming. In any case it sounds like those people were an unsavory bunch. I''ll send in a patrol unit to break up any illegal goings-on.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Spot an Underworld Operator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'There''s something shady going on. Some of my men have been spending their off-hours at a seedy little joint they call a cantina. I think it''s more suspect than that. We can''t have members of the Imperial military consorting with criminals and low-lifes. Do me a favor and check the place out. Be careful, it can get a little rough. Report back to me what you find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 166, 'm42d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'I knew that place was trouble! I''ll send a military police unit to shut it down for good. The brig will be jammed tonight, I can assure you. I appreciate your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Check Out a Seedy Joint'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'Excuse me. The Empire needs your help. Well, that is, I need your help. I sent a patrol team to a new quadrant this morning and I haven''t heard back from them. I can''t leave my post here. Can you go see if anything is wrong? I heard there was some kind of building or settlement out there. Have a look around it. If it seems dangerous, don''t start any trouble. Just report back to me and I''ll handle it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 170, 'm43d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'Blast! Rebels! They must have waylaid my patrol. Thanks for the assistance. I''ll notify the authorities at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Find a Missing Patrol'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'I require your assistance. An Imperial courier was scheduled to hand-deliver a memo to me this morning. It contained critical details about an upcoming Imperial operation. I''m mortified to say I haven''t received it yet. Have a look round the courier''s last known coordinates and see if there''s any sign of that delivery. Then report back to me at once. I dread the thought of missing the next meeting of the Preliminary Exploratory Action Planning Committee. I''m the secretary, after all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 174, 'm44d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'There are Rebels out there? Oh, dear! Something must be done! I shall organize an official committee at once and vigorously debate this problem. We''ll craft a strong warning for those Rebel scum. I can assure you of that!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'An Imperial Courier Is Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'There you are. I''m glad you showed up. I have a job for you. Intelligence has reported a possible Rebel encampment outside of town. I want you to check the place out. Don''t start any trouble, though. Just look around and report back to me. I''ve got a surprise for them if they bring their treason into my jurisdiction!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 178, 'm45d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'You say there were no overt Rebels? Hmm. Well, any spacer whose licenses aren''t in order is a potential Rebel smuggler. I''ll have the planetary authorities raid the place and check out everyone''s credentials. They''re not going to slip any treason under my scanners. You can rely on that.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Rebels In My Jurisdiction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'Yes, I lost another shipment of TIE solar array support frames. I don''t deny it. But instead of threatening to tell my superiors, what if you investigate these coordinates where the tracking beacons sent their last transmission? You''ll find my lost frames, I''ll write you a commendation for service to the Empire, and my superiors won''t be bothered by these petty logistical details. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 182, 'm46d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'Sounds like they were smugglers to me. Not good. Maybe I can hire some locals to bring my frames back before my superiors get word of this. In any case, thanks for helping me out. I''ll file an Imperial commendation for you under some pretext that has nothing to do with lost TIE solar array support frames.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'Earn an Imperial Commendation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'Nothing personal, but I''ve just about had my fill of aliens. Used to be, a man of my species could enjoy the company of his own without stepping on someone''s tail or tentacle or furry hoof. Anyway, a band of unsavory-looking aliens has set up shop outside of town. I want you to check out their operation. Don''t let on you''re working for me, though. Just have a look and tell me what you find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 186, 'm47d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'I sure don''t like the cut of that bunch. They sound like outlaws to me. Would you agree? I''ll call this into Orbital Dispatch and see if a couple of TIE flyovers might chase those ugly drifters away from there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'Investigate Some Unsavory Aliens'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'Have you ever seen a lightsaber? Me, I''ve only heard about them in the old stories. But a civilian informant reported seeing one of them at a small installation some distance from here. I''d love to get a pair of Empire-friendly eyes inside that place. Care to handle this recon job for me? Come back here when you''re finished.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 190, 'm48d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'Too bad you didn''t see the lightsaber, but an installation full of Rebels is equally interesting to me. Looks like I''ll get to exercise my trigger finger before supper tonight. Good work, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Lightsaber Claim'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'Listen up. We think some rebels might be smuggling escaped criminals through a facility near here. I need you to check it out for me. Report back when you''ve had a look around the place. And keep yourself out of sight. I just want information, not a firefight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 194, 'm49d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'Very interesting. Maybe that place is the refugee smuggling depot we''ve been looking for. Nice work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Investigate Smuggled Convicts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'I have a matter here that needs attention. Journey to these coordinates to investigate rumors of Rebel activity in the area. Just look; don''t shoot. Oh, and on your return here, bring me a cup of jawa juice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 198, 'm50d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'Very well. But I see you''ve omitted my cup of jawa juice. What went wrong? I''m afraid I''ll have to write this up. Regulations, you know.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Check Rebel Activity and Bring Juice'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_imperial_easy.tab.stf', 201, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'We thought we''d wiped out that nest of vermin, but we''ve had more glitterstim on our streets recently. We need you to check that abandoned gangster hangout and let us know if those criminals have moved back in. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Looks like some of those thugs didn''t get the hint. Much obliged. Here''s something for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Determined Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'I believe a local swoop gang is setting up shop near here. Could you go scope out the situation and see what kind of trouble those criminals are up to? We''d make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Oh great, our very own neighborhood swoop gang. That''s all we needed. Blast! We''ll have to keep an eye on those creeps. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Local Swoop Gang Troubles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'I suspect that one of the locals is selling glitterstim spice out of a fortified settlement. We need someone to scout out the area and let us know what''s happening. Is there a gang moving into our neighborhood? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'This bodes ill for our community. With my luck some Black Sun Vigo will move in right next door to me. Appreciate the help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Gang Activity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'Don''t want to alarm you, friend, but I think a Rebel cell is operating right here in our community. I sure could use some help in verifying that, though. Can I count on your help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'I knew it! COMPNOR is gonna want to hear about this, no mistake. Thanks, citizen! Here''s a reward for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Rebel Activity?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'There''s been increased Imperial patrols in this area. I think the Empire is establishing a new garrison here. Could you scout the area for us and let us know what you find?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'This spells trouble for us, I can feel it. The Empire is up to no good, you mark my words, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Imperial Encroachment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'A neighbor mentioned some shady individuals lurking about just outside of the city. We''ve had some troubles with smugglers in the past. Could you reconnoiter the area and let us know if we need to take action?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'Smugglers again? Those rogues just never learn, do they? Thanks, citizen, we''ll have to take care of those scoundrels soon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Who Lurks There?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'I''ve been warned by several friends not to wander too far away from the safety of the city. I want to know what they''re so afraid of. Could you scout the area and report to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'An Imperial outpost? What the blazes could the Empire want? I hope they don''t intend to harass our neighborhood. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'What''s Out There?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'I''ve seen some unusual transport activity near here. We''ve had some problems with gunrunners in the past. Could you check it out and see if those rogues have set up shop again?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'Rebels? In this area? I see. Good job, citizen. This is for your efforts. Kindly keep this information to yourself, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Gunrunners Again?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'Seems like this neighborhood has been attracting more undesirables. I''ve seen some rough folk lurking about. They might have set up a hideout near here. Think you could check on it for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'Pirates! Well, perfect, just what this neighborhood needed. Isn''t it bad enough that we have Rebel terrorists and Imperial goons to contend with?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'New Undesirables'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'A contact on the HoloNet has arranged a rendezvous just outside town to sell me some rare Alderaan antiques. But he didn''t give his HoloNet address, and I''m suspicious. Can you check to make sure it''s legitimate? Be careful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Criminals? So it was a trap! Sorry to put you through that, but thanks for sparing me from kidnapping, or worse.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Shady Antique Dealer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'I''m meeting a -- well, let''s say a friend. But I don''t quite trust -- that is, I want you to check out the area before I go there. Okay with you?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'Sounds like smugglers, all right. Well, I may still go to that meeting, but I''ll carry a blaster. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'A Friend''s Credentials'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'I''m arranging a courier ship to put a shipment of memorial capsules into orbit at the Graveyard of Alderaan. The ship is docked at these coordinates. Can you check for me whether it looks spaceworthy?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'No ship? Pirates? I can''t believe it! Who would try to swindle people who just want to leave a memorial for their dead planet?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Grieve For Alderaan'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'I''d love to give my sweetheart a ring of ancient milkstone, but it''s so hard to find nowadays. I''ve found a possible supplier, but he sounds shady. I''d like you to check out that operation and report back on whether it seems honest.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'I suspected as much when the fellow I talked to wouldn''t leave a HoloNet address. Thank you for protecting me from that seedy bunch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Milkstone Supplier'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'I need to get offworld fast, without a lot of Imperial entanglements. I''ve found an escort, but I don''t even know if he has a ship. I''d like you to covertly scout these coordinates and make sure there really is transport.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'Me? Go offworld? I have no idea what you''re talking about. But I remember I owe you some money, so here it is. Now please go away.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'A Hasty Exit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'Gossip says that local hoodlums have started a new hangout in our community. Will you check out these coordinates? Please be careful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'Will nothing stop the spread of this cancer of lawlessness? I must write an irate note to the city council.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'A Growing Cancer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'People here have noticed more petty theft lately. We''re doing a sweep to find new criminals in the neighborhood. Can you take these coordinates and report back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'Smugglers, hmm? Okay, thanks. The neighborhood vigilance committee will try to show them the error of their ways.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Increased Petty Theft'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'An orbital probe droid reports odd transport activity near here, outside authorized landing areas. We think it could be smugglers. Can you check these coordinates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'Hmm. I expect pirates would find a nice living around here. We''ll see about ways to make their lives less comfortable. Thanks for the reconnaissance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Who Can That Be?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'I''m concerned about my daughter, who has been fraternizing with some shifty types not far from here.  Could you have a look and see what kind of crowd she''s fallen in with?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'What? They look like gangsters? I''m going to set my daughter straight about these new friends of hers!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'A Protective Parent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'Some old acquaintances of mine have been spotted not far from here. I''ll pay you well if you can scope out what those pirates are up to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'Poodoo! Those sleemos must be muscling in on my star lanes. I''ll fix ''em, though. Thanks for the information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'Some Old Friends'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'My company''s delivery logs report that some unauthorized shipments have been transported to these coordinates. Can you see who or what is there? I want to learn who''s been robbing me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'Smugglers! I''ll not have my goods shipped offworld without proper authorization. I could get into big trouble with Imperial Customs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Stolen Delivery Logs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'My droid workers have reported squatters on my land. I need you to find out how many there are and if they''ve built any structures. If you''re willing to earn a few creds, that is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'The Empire has placed an outpost on my land? This must have something to do with those licensing fees I forgot to pay. I''ve got a bad feeling about this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Check Out the Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'Is it just me, or has there been an unusual increase in speeder traffic at a certain land holding near here? I''ll throw you a few creds if you check it out for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'Oh-ho! Rebels right here on our planet! The Imperial Security Bureau should pay me well for this information. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Check Out Speeder Traffic'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'We don''t like the looks of a group of low-lifes who recently moved into the area. Our community elders have instructed me to hire a scout to investigate their goings-on. Are you able to provide this service?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'We suspected those low-lifes were up to no good. We''ll file a report with the planetary authorities and mention your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'A Shady Group'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'I own a small building not far from here. I''m suspicious about my current tenants. Can you check them out for me? Make sure they don''t know I sent you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'Thanks. They sound like some rough customers. I suppose I ought to screen potential tenants more thoroughly in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Questionable Tenants'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'I just hired a small company to ship some cargo offworld for me. I''d like to hire someone to check out these couriers. Can you do that for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'You think they looked like smugglers? That''s encouraging. I don''t want to attract official attention to my cargo.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'Investigate Company'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I''ve heard that a swoop gang, the Shadow Angels of Dathomir, is spreading like a plague through the galaxy. A friend told me they''ve set up a hideout not far from here. Could you check these coordinates and report back to me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'This is terrible news. Now all the surrounding areas will become targets for these fiends. I must find a way to stop them. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Find the Shadow Angels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'I''ve heard Jabba the Hutt''s trying to extend his reach. I believe that a new faction of his dreaded swoop gang has settled near here somewhere. I sure could use someone''s help in finding them. Think you can do it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'If that gangster thinks he can intimidate us into silence, he''s got another think coming. I''ll organize a neighborhood watch and inform the authorities. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Jabba Expands'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'Some former "business associates" decided to renege on some debts. I''ve been tracking them all across the galaxy. Could you check these coordinates and see what sort of mischief these scoundrels are up to? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'So they''ve turned to smuggling, eh? Thanks, citizen. I''ll take it from here. You wouldn''t know the contact data for the Bounty Hunter''s Guild, by any chance?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Shady Business Associates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'I''ve seen some rather unsavory types passing through here. People say they''re here to buy illegal weapons. If gunrunners have set up shop near here, I want to know about it. Could you check these coordinates for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'So there is some sort of illegal activity. I''ll have to think about who best to sell this information to. Good job, friend. You''ve earned your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Unsavory Types'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'Pirates have plagued this system for years. Every time the authorities close in on a suspected pirate lair, the rogues manage to get away. This time, I''m hiring a professional to scout one of these lairs. Think you can handle it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'I''ll have to move fast if the authorities are to capture those murderers. Not a word about this to anyone. Those pirates have spies everywhere. This is for a job well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'The Wily Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'My brother was a freighter captain who was killed by a band of pirates. I think I''ve finally found where these murderers have been hiding. I''ll pay you to scout out the area and confirm it for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'Those filthy criminals will face justice very soon! Thanks, friend. You''ve done this entire system, and my family, a great service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Vengeance Is Mine'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'Increased Imperial patrols have been making some of my business associates a bit nervous. Could you check out these coordinates and see what the Empire is up to? I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'A garrison? I see. Thanks for your help, friend. I need to get some messages to my partners, fast.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Increased Imperial Patrols'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'My neighbors have recently become involved in some sort of "business enterprise" they refuse to talk about. I managed to get the coordinates to an area they''re visiting. Could you check it out and let me know what they''re up to?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'A Rebel outpost? So that''s why they''ve been hiding the truth from me. I think COMPNOR would be very interested to hear this news. Thanks, loyal citizen!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Spy on the Neighbors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'Piracy threatens almost every civilian ship leaving this world. These ruthless killers move around so often it''s impossible to keep up. But we''ve just found the location of what could be a major base. If you scout it and report back, I''ll reward you. But move with extreme caution.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'The base you found may be only a fraction of this operation. We''ll have to move in force against these crooks. Meanwhile, thank you for your exceptional courage.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'Find the Pirate Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'The Black Sun criminal organization moves with impunity through this corrupt section of the galaxy. But if you can recon their current base and report here on its defenses, I can assemble a group strong enough to take it down. Please be cautious -- these gangsters don''t stop at murder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'When they learn the Black Sun''s strength, I suspect my group of vigilantes will find better ways to spend their time. Still, we have to fight when we can. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Gauge Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'Offworld smuggling of rock ivory is reaching crisis proportions. At this rate we won''t have enough ivory to repair our own repulsorlift engines.  I am authorized to offer you a substantial reward for reconnaissance of the main smuggling gang''s location.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'Modern smugglers are frighteningly well armed and equipped. We''ll have to increase our guard details on rock ivory shipments. Thank you for your brave work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Precious Rock Ivory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'I''m researching a speculative land deal. I need a brave, experienced individual to scout out this target area. Report back on what you find, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'An Imperial base? Excellent! I''ve placed a buy order for the land nearby. That will bring a tidy profit when the Empire expands its base. It always does!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'Profitable Land'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'My young apprentice has run off. He left a strange note about "fighting the real slavery in our galaxy." I fear he''s gone to fight pirates or somesuch folly. I''ll pay you to go to his last known coordinates and tell me what''s there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'Oh, so he''s gone and joined the Alliance? Well, all right then. I was worried. "Fighting the real slavery." Heh! Clever, that boy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Fight Real Slavery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'I''m following bizarre reports about a criminal plastic-surgery operation. They take known felons, change their faces, and put them in new jobs. What jobs, I wonder? I''ve heard the operation is at these coordinates. I need you to check it out, but use the utmost caution!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'Pirates, eh? Well, that''s better than putting face-changed thugs into government jobs. Though, for all we know, some operation is already doing that. Who can say? Meanwhile, thank you for your brave action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'A New Face'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'A major criminal syndicate is using coded HoloNet entertainment to arrange drop-points for glitterstim drug shipments. I need to know what kind of equipment they have that infiltrates and alters legitimate broadcasts. It takes stealth and experience to crack their installation. Are you up for danger?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'Good work. These gangsters were getting so bold, they were changing even the Moff''s loyalty speeches. Gutsy! You showed real courage there, and I appreciate it. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Gutsy Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'Almost every droid brain shipped here from the Core Worlds may contain illicit coded programs. Criminal slicers have turned droids into vehicles for smuggled intellectual property. The smuggling base that extracts the data is big and well defended. If you report on its defenses, we can gather the strength to shut it down.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'Did you see large numbers of droid brains? No? Well, perhaps that was only a rumor. Still, we need to get moving on this issue. Thank you, you did well!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'Droid Brains'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'I hired a bounty hunter to find the crook who stole my business records. I haven''t heard from the bounty hunter. Here are his last known coordinates. I''d like you to check what''s there, so I can decide whether to hire another hunter to hunt the first.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'An Imperial installation? Oh! Well, it''s hard to say, but I''m guessing I won''t be getting more reports from that bounty hunter. Argh. Oh, here''s your fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Find the Crook'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'My satellite signals are getting interference from some large installation on the other side of the planet. How am I supposed to do business under these conditions? I need to hire you to investigate the nature of this installation, so I can do something about their unauthorized transmissions. You''ll be well paid, I assure you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'It''s a base for the Rebellion? I''ve got to notify the Imperial authorities at once! We''ll smash those terrorists from the face of the planet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'Inspect the Interference'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'I''ve heard that the Black Sun organization has built a spice trading depot on our very own planet. I want to hire you to check it out, citizen, if you think you''re good enough not to get caught.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'That does sound like a Black Sun depot. Then my sources informed me correctly. Excellent work,citizen. Here''s your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'Check Out the Trading Depot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'The last thing we need is another slaver outpost on this planet. Please check out these coordinates for me and see if my suspicions are correct. The job might be dangerous, but you look like you can handle yourself. I''ll pay you when I get the information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'Definitely a major band of smugglers, but they might not be slavers. Either way, I know some powerful individuals who will want this information. Well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'More Slavers?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'My ship was stolen. The tracking circuit reported these coordinates just before it stopped transmitting. Can you see if my ship is still there? The creeps who stole it were very dangerous, so have a care. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'Oh my, I didn''t realize the pirate gang was that large. This is more than I can handle on my own. I''ll have to formulate a plan. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Find the Missing Ship'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'I''m doing a survey for a student project. Can you go to this distant Imperial installation and count how many guards there are? If I collect enough data, I''m bound to get a good grade.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'Thanks so much! I''m sure to get a good grade with that information. Hey, I get extra credit if I can report how well the guards are armed. Did you happen to notice?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Extra Credit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'My planetary sensors have picked up some rather large power spikes on the other side of the planet. My scientific curiosity compels me to investigate, though I haven''t the time to go there myself. Can you check it out for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'How splendid. It sounds like Alliance activity. They have my blessing. Take this payment in return for your silence in this matter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Satisfy Scientific Curiosity'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'So I found this lost droid the other day, and the serial numbers were erased. Stolen, you know it. So I''m thinking, "Hey, keep it, unless the guy who lost it is some kind of big-league player." So I''m in the market for someone to check out these coordinates from the broken homing circuit, to see who used to own that little robot. I hope it''s nobody special.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'Poodoo! That''s a major player if I ever heard of one. I better get this droid back to them before they get upset. Thanks for the tip.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Missing Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'I''m desperate to get off this hunk of rock! My uncle told me there''s a secret space port a long way from here, where I might get a job on a ship. Can you check it out for me? Maybe this will be my big chance to see the galaxy at last!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Pirate');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'That sounds like a very large pirate base. But hey, a pirate''s life must be a lot of fun, right? I knew it, this is my big chance! The stars will be my playground! I''ll never forget the way you helped me, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'A Pirate''s Life'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_hard.stf', 101, 'number_of_entries', '25'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'My son has been sneaking off late at night, and I have a suspicion he''s up to no good. I''ve narrowed down the area where I think he visits. Could you check it out for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'I knew that good-for-nothing was up to some mischief! Well, I''ll be a Sithspawn if he thinks I won''t put a stop to this activity! No son of mine is going to be a swooper!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'A Timely Intervention'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Some of the local youth have been running errands for a "businessman" who recently moved here. I don''t trust this individual and would like for you to check out this "legitimate operation."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Just as I suspected. Well I for one am going to make sure our community is not taken over by criminals. Thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'A Legitimate Operation?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'My nephew has taken to wearing a black and red jacket and seems eager to own a swoop. I think his new friends are involved in criminal activity. Could you scout out their hangout and see what''s going on?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'I thought gangsters had moved into the area. I certainly hope these aren''t those Shadow Angels I''ve heard about. Those are some fearsome swoopers. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'The Shadow of Angels'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'I found some glitterstim cannisters in my son''s room. I think he''s been getting this poison from a local gang. Could you check out these coordinates and see what those rogues are up to?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'They must be refining the spice. An operation that big could distribute spice to several cities. Thanks for the info, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'A Spice Refinery?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'Rumor has it that smugglers are trying to set up shop somewhere near here. I think I know where they''ve built their hideout, but I need you to verify it for me. I''ll pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'Aha! I knew it! Thanks, friend. Here''s your pay. I can go to the local authorities with this information now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Find the Smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'It seems trouble follows me around the galaxy. Every new neighborhood I come to seems to start attracting more criminals the minute I move in. Could you check these coordinates and let me know what''s going on?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'Figures. Well, I guess you just can''t run away from your past. Maybe I''ll move to Imperial Center next. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'Trouble Magnet'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'Some friends of mine were thinking of starting up a mining operation. I haven''t heard from them in a while and was wondering if you could check them out and see how they''re faring.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'Really? Hmm, that is interesting. Doesn''t sound like a mining operation to me. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Those Aren''t Miners'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'I''ve received several orders for supplies with instructions that they be delivered via droid courier only. One of these droids came back still bearing its destination coordinates. Could you see who I''ve been dealing with all this time?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'Smugglers? I should have known. These deliveries were bringing in way more money than normal. Never trust anything too good to be true.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Too Good To Be True'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'I lost a brother to bloodthirsty pirates, and now I suspect they''ve established a base near here. Could you check out these coordinates and verify my suspicion?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'I''ll get those lousy murderers if it''s the last thing I do. Thanks, friend, you''ve helped me move closer to avenging my dear departed brother.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'You Killed My Brother'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'There''s a rumor that a group of pirates has gotten its hands on several Imperial TIE starfighters. News this bad has to be substantiated. Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'Didn''t see any TIE fighters, eh? I''d better report this to the authorities in any case and get those rogues off our planet.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'Stolen Starfighters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'A friend thinks a band of notorious pirates has established a base near here. He doesn''t want to risk upsetting them, but I''m made of sterner stuff. Could you check it out for me? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'There are pirates there? Oh! We should leave well enough alone, I guess. Thanks for your help. And for the record, we''ve never actually met.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Here There Be Pirates'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'Our neighborhood is quite safe without the Empire sending in additional stormtrooper patrols. They tend to be worse than the criminals, anyway. Could you find out where these patrols are coming from?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'A military outpost? Why do they deem that necessary? I''d better warn all my friends. Thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'More Stormtroopers?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'I warned my contacts in COMPNOR about Rebel activity in this area. They claim it was being taken care of. Could you investigate these coordinates and see what is being done?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'They''ve set up an Imperial garrison? Now that''s what I call results. I''ll have to thank my COMPNOR friends.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'COMPNOR Gets Results'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'There''s been an increase of stormtrooper patrols in this region. I think the Empire is up to something. Could you check these coordinates out and see what''s up? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'The Empire''s setting up a garrison this close to our city? What could they possibly be looking for? They didn''t see you, right?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'That Pesky Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'Convoys in the middle of the night, strange folk hanging about at odd hours -- all this makes me think somebody is up to no good. Could you check it out for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'A Rebel outpost, eh? I think this information will be quite valuable. Thanks for your time. I''ve got some transmissions to send out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Some Valuable Information'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'There''s been some suspicious activity out in the wilderness. I need someone to check these coordinates out and report back to me. Think you can help me, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'An Alliance outpost? You''re sure about this, citizen? Thank you for your time. Please keep this mission confidential.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'A Voice in the Wilderness'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'I''m about to make a life-changing decision, but I need to make sure I''m not heading into a trap. Could you check these coordinates out for me and let me know what you find?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'I see. Say no more, friend. Thank you for your time. I now know what I must do.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'A Grim Decision'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'My daughter ran away some time back, and I''ve only now located the coordinates of her last transmission. Can you report back to me on what''s there now?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'During our last argument, my daughter threatened to run away and join a pirate gang. Sorry to say, it sounds like she followed through. Well, thank you, I guess.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'A Wayward Soul'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'Local droid repair merchants are complaining that smuggled chromium plating is undermining their business. We''re checking several possible drop points. Can you report on what you find at these coordinates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'You''ve found the smugglers! Excellent work. The merchants'' association will take it from here, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'Help the Merchants'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'The Hutt criminal syndicate is trying to corner the local market for Lowickan firegems. We want to compile a full report of their activities for local authorities. Can you check these coordinates and report back here?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'That''s a more substantial Hutt presence than we suspected. This will definitely go in our report. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'What the Hutt?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'I bought a solar panel on the black market, and it''s already broken. I want to complain to the scum who sold me the panel. First I have to find them -- or pay you to do it. Will you check these coordinates?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'Very well. Now I''ll bring in this broken panel and demand a refund. What could go wrong?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Shoddy Goods'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'To restrict local hyperdrive production, the Corporate Sector has bribed local Imperials to blockade durelium imports. Some locals have smuggled in durelium, but they''ve avoided contact since making landfall. I want you to check the prearranged coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'It sounds like all is going well so far. We''ll rendezous with the durelium suppliers shortly, and get around this ridiculous blockade. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Durelium Troubles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'To restrict local hyperdrive repair operations, the Corporate Sector has bribed local Imperials to blockade durelium imports. Some locals have smuggled in durelium, but they''ve avoided contact since making landfall. I want you to check the prearranged coordinates and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'Uh-oh. Sounds like the durelium operation is quashed for now. Thank you for letting us know before we marched into an Imperial stronghold.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Durelium Woes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'I''ve been looking for Spookcrystals from Nam Chorios. They help plants grow. I think I''ve found a source, but the supplier says he''s been taken over by Imperials! Can you check on that and report back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'Why would the Empire care about Spookcrystals? Maybe those rumors are true that they have other uses... Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Secure the Spookcrystals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'This city has seen several murders committed using dart shooters tipped with Devaronian blood-poison. That''s only available offworld. I''m hiring you to check the coordinates I have for the poison''s source on this world. Report back on who''s bringing it in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'All right, thanks for your report. It''s a nasty business, rounding up poisoners. Your efforts will help us stop these terrible killings.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'Find the Poisoner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'Mine-layer droids are a blight on modern warfare. We heard a rumor that the Empire is building a new mine-droid factory near here. Obviously we citizens don''t want to complain publicly, but there are steps we can take -- if this factory is what rumor says. Can you check and report back?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 102, 'm26d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'Those sound like ordinary smugglers, not Imperials. I don''t know whether to feel relieved. They may be bringing in something worse than mine-droids. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Nasty Mine-Droids'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'A local crime cartel is trying to take control of the city''s gambling dens. An informant tells me the cartel''s HQ is outside town at these coordinates. I''ll pay you to recon the area and report back. Be careful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 106, 'm27d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'Excellent! Now Jabba the Hutt will know where to drop-ship a crate of thermal detonators. Thanks for helping Lord Jabba stop those upstarts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'A New Cartel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'A local crime cartel is trying to take control of the city''s gambling dens. An informant tells me the cartel''s HQ is outside town at these coordinates. I''ll pay you to recon the area and report back. Be careful!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 110, 'm28d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'Those crooks are a growing menace to this society. I''m going to notify the authorities and have this cartel raided. Good work, citizen!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'Stop the Cartel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'Our merchant association believes smugglers are raiding inbound shipments of ardanium. We need that metal for our starship fuel canisters. I''m commissioning you to check out the smuggling base and report its defenses to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 114, 'm29d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'Not smugglers? The Alliance? Hmm. I suppose the Alliance needs starship fuel canisters too. Hmm. Well, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Where''s the Ardanium?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'Our merchant association believes smugglers are raiding inbound shipments of ardanium. We need that metal for our starship fuel canisters. I''m commissioning you to check out the smuggling base and report its defenses to me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 118, 'm30d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'Not smugglers? The Allliance? Those scoundrels! I''ll alert the Imperial Security Bureau immediately. Thank you, citizen!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Ardanium Is Precious'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'A collector on this world -- I won''t say where -- owns valuable aurodium ingots from Old Republic days. He''s been getting threats that someone is planning a heist. He''s relayed the coordinates to me, and I''d like you to check them out. Report back if you see anything suspicious.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 122, 'm31d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'Pirates! The threats are true! I''ll have to -- I mean, the collector will have to relocate his aurodium somewhere more secure. Leave me alone now, I have to think.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Protect the Aurodium'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'Black-marketers are now selling counterfeit military medals. It boils my blood to think of local cowards wearing a Kalidor Crescent. An informant told me the factory is at these coordinates. I want you to verify that and report back on its defenses, if any.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 126, 'm32d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'The Empire, making counterfeit Alliance medals? But why? Oh, I see -- they must have hidden trackers. A clever way to locate sympathizers. Okay, thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Find the Fake Medals'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'Pirates are raiding rich ship cargoes almost as soon as they lift off. The pirates must have spies near this city, scouting cargo manifests. I''ve had reports of suspicious activity at these coordinates. I''ll pay you to check out the location, but be careful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 130, 'm33d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'I see. The pirate outpost you found is just what I expected. I''ll plan accordingly before my own cargo goes offworld. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Track the Pirate Spies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'I think local gangsters are impersonating Imperial troops to extort money from merchants. I''ve seen some of them heading toward these coordinates. If you can verify that they''re not Imperials but common thieves, I''ll get the Empire to wipe them out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 134, 'm34d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'Rebels? Do you think they''re really Alliance, or just gangsters impersonating them? I don''t know whether to call in the Empire now. Maybe I''ll find someone else to do some more recon. Thank you, I think.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'Who''s Who?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'I heard a rumor that the authorities are up to something. I don''t suppose you''d be willing to go have a look? I''d go myself, but they might recognize me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 138, 'm35d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'Aha. Imperial authorities, no less. Very interesting. Thanks, I can use that information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'Check Out the Authorities'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'Is it true that the Alliance has an installation on this planet? I''d be willing to join their cause, if I can verify that it''s really them. Can you check it out for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 142, 'm36d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'I knew it! I''ll pack my things and go there at once. At last I can do my part to bring down the Empire!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'Join the Cause'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'A lifter load of my power converters was lost a fair distance from here. I''ll pay you well if you have a look at those coordinates and find out what happened to my goods.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 146, 'm37d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'These gangsters are starting to get on my nerves. I''ll have to see what I can do about it. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'Take a Stand'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'I''m supposed to receive a shipment from offworld, but I''m not sure I trust the "import agency" that was contracted for the job. I''ll pay you to check them out and let me know if they''re dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 150, 'm38d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'Sounds like they''re a bunch of cutthroats! There''s no way I''m going to do business with their kind. Thanks for the warning.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'A Little Investigative Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'I''m supposed to receive a shipment from offworld, but I''m not sure I trust the "import agency" that was contracted for the job. I''ll pay you to check them out and let me know if they''re dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 154, 'm39d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'I thought they sounded like a lawless bunch. Possibly I can make some kind of arrangement with them. Thanks for the opportunity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Scope Out the Agency'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'Supposedly a friend of mine was spirited away by Imperial authorities. Are you brave enough to check out the facility and see if he''s there? His family will be very appreciative.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 158, 'm40d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'Doesn''t sound like that''s the kind of Imperial facility where they keep political prisoners. I''ll have to keep searching for my poor, lost friend. I''m much obliged for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Help Locate a Friend'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'I''m supposed to receive a shipment from offworld, but I''m not sure I trust the "import agency" that was contracted for the job. I''ll pay you to check them out and let me know if they''re dangerous.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 162, 'm41d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'You really think they''re from the Alliance? Why, I''m happy to do business with them. Down with the Empire! Thank you for the information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Who Are They?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'I''ve heard that the Black Sun organization has built a spice trading depot on this very planet. I want to hire you to check it out, citizen, if you think you''re good enough not to get caught.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 166, 'm42d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'That doesn''t sound like a Black Sun operation, though it''s certainly armed heavily enough to warrant notifying law enforcement. I appreciate your service, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Black Sun?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'A cargo of 2-1B medical droids was recently stolen. I think I''ve found the pirates who took them. I need you to verify the location of their lair. Be wary, and tell no one of your mission!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 170, 'm43d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'That sounds like the same pirates, all right. They''ve probably fenced the medical droids already. Don''t worry, they''re going to compensate me and then some.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Find the Medical Droids'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'I was fired from Imperial Customs for letting some notorious smugglers slip through my fingers. But I think I''ve finally tracked them down! If you can verify their location, I''ll take my revenge.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 174, 'm44d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'I knew it! That''s the smuggler gang I''m after. You have my gratitude, friend. I wish you had worked for me at Imperial Customs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'Help Imperial Customs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'I think my brother''s Imperial unit is stationed on-planet, but he won''t confirm or deny it. I have the coordinates of his last transmission. Can you see if he''s there?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 178, 'm45d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'So my brother''s Imperial unit is here. I wonder why he wouldn''t tell me? Anyway, now I can get the money he owes me. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Where''s My Brother?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'Somebody rubbed out my favorite goon, and I got to find out what sleemo did it! Can you check out the individuals at this location? I will be much appreciative and whatnot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 182, 'm46d', 'Rebel'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'Rebels, eh? Well, I don''t care if they got warships and whatnot, they crossed the wrong guy''s path this time. I''ll put the squeeze on those sleemos.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'Find the Sleemos'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'You there! I have obtained the coordinates of a gentleman who, with his companions, treated me unkindly. I require you to investigate whether these coordinates are authoritative. It would be unseemable of you to ignore this behest. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 186, 'm47d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'I say, that does indeed sound like the gentlemen who offended me. Now I shall extract an apology. I do appreciate your very exemplative service.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'A Matter of Honor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'I have a blind date with a certain individual who works at these coordinates. Can you check the place out for me, so I don''t wind up dating the wrong sort? Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 190, 'm48d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'Sounds like pirates to me. How exciting! That''s just the sort of glamorous occupation I''d hoped my date would have! Thank you so much for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Scope Out a Date'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'Three weeks late and my offworld cargo still hasn''t arrived! Do you have time to check out this shipping agency for me? I''m willing to pay well just to find out where my cargo is.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 194, 'm49d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'Ahh, it''s a smuggling operation, eh? That explains it. Imperial patrols are heavy this season in the local star lanes. Guess I''ll just have to be patient.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Late Cargo'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'You give your heart to someone, and it turns out they''re cheating on you! Please go to this location and find out what my sweetheart is doing there. I''ve got some credits for you when you return.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 198, 'm50d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'What? My sweetheart is reporting to an Imperial base? Maybe it''s a covert mission or an espionage ring or something romantic like that. Thank you so much!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Spy on a Sweetheart'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_neutral_medium.stf', 201, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'The Empire is constantly surveying land for new observation posts. Probots, scout troopers, and Imperial Intelligence interrogators soon follow. We need you to head to these coordinates and scout the area. Let us know if the Imperials have moved in.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1c', 'Thanks, citizen, we''ll pass this information along to High Command. We''ll either need to relocate our operation or else organize a strike against that outpost.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm1t', 'Check Imperial Growth'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm2o', 'Some of our sensors have picked up the distinctive energy emissions of the Yellow Demon 100 speeder bike. These craft are swoop gang favorites. The last thing we need in this area is a swoop gang compromising our security. Check it out and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm2d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm2c', 'Just as we feared. Taking them out is not a great concern, but locals are bound to notice the fight and report it to Imperial authorities. Thanks for your help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm2t', 'Lesser of Two Evils'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm3o', 'Surveillance droids have transmitted some interesting aerial pictures. Someone is building a "swoop track" in the wilderness. We don''t know if this is an Imperial operation or something more local. Check out these coordinates and let us know what you find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm3d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm3c', 'Well, that''s not as bad as Imperials, but it could mean Black Sun or Hutts, who present other problems. Thanks for your help, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm3t', 'Let''s Head to the Races'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm4o', 'Youngsters claim to have seen an AT-ST in the wilderness. Our surveillance droids have encountered some sort of jamming field covering a small area at these coordinates. Care to scout out that area and see what it is that someone''s interested in keeping secret?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm4d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm4c', 'The Empire must have discovered our cell. We need to prepare an evacuation at once. You just saved many lives, friend. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm4t', 'Predator at the Door'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm5o', 'Some locals brought in some wreckage yesterday. We''re fairly certain it belongs to an Aratech 74-Z speeder bike. Those are standard issue for Imperial scout troopers. If there is a garrison, their sensors would pick up surveillance droids easily. We need you to scout the area out on foot. Stay out of sight.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm5d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm5c', 'I''m not sure we have the strength to wipe out a garrison that size. I''ll need to check with High Command. Thanks for your help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm5t', 'Scout the Scouts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm6o', 'Surveillance imagery clearly shows a landing platform in the midst of construction. We need someone to scout the area out and determine the size and strength of the garrison, if indeed it is the Empire. If not, then who is building that platform? Think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm6d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm6c', 'So the Imperials have decided to set up shop here. I hope their presence here is simply coincidental and not a result of our activities. There is, after all, a lot of smuggling activity in this area. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm6t', 'A Suspicious Landing Platform'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm7o', 'Some local kids discovered what we think is a reinforced bunker. We''ve had no evidence of the Empire in this area. Scout out the coordinates where the bunker was found. If these are Imperials, we need to take immediate action.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm7d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm7c', 'Those don''t sound like Imperials to me. I wonder if those rogues have cloaking devices. How else could they have escaped our sensors? Thanks for the intelligence, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm7t', 'Who Goes There?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm8o', 'The locals have asked for our help in investigating several disappearances. Most of the missing have been young and aliens. We suspect slavers. Sensors have indicated an unusual amount of activity at these coordinates. Can you check it out for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm8d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm8c', 'Those sound like slavers, sure enough. We''ll organize a strike team and pay those criminals a visit. We must stamp out slavery in the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm8t', 'Investigate Some Disappearances'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm9o', 'A Black Sun representative approached us recently and offered a deal he felt we couldn''t refuse. Well, we refused. I think this might lead to an unpleasant confrontation. We need you to scout out the area believed to be occupied by Black Sun and see what those gangsters are up to. Don''t try to take them on -- they''re tough customers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm9d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm9c', 'We were hoping to avoid voilence, but it seems they''re preparing for some sort of assault. We''ll be ready for them. Thanks for your help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm9t', 'Investigate Gangster Mischief'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm10o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" has decided to up his price for services rendered and feels that he is owed substantial back wages. We suspect this is going to turn ugly. Scout out this smuggler den and see what those scoundrels are up to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm10d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm10c', 'I wish we didn''t have to rely on those rogues, but given our circumstances, we have little choice. We''ll deal with this smuggler.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm10t', 'A Deal Gone Sour'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm11o', 'They say Hutts are excellent negotiators. I have yet to see proof, because the Hutt we deal with is all about threats and posturing. The gang lord is demanding more protection money to avoid drawing Imperial attention. We need to know the Hutt''s strength before we decide to cut him off. Can you help us with that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm11d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm11c', 'Sounds like we''ll have quite a fight on our hands, but truth be told, I''ve been itching to wipe that drool-smeared grin off that Hutt''s face for months. Thanks for your help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm11t', 'Measure a Hutt'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm12o', 'Not all smugglers are created equal. Commander Solo was apparently a diamond in the rough, because my experience with other smugglers has been unpleasant. We''re getting blackmailed by one now. We need you to scout out his lair and see what defenses they have. Looks like we''ll need to terminate this business relationship.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm12d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm12c', 'It''ll be a fight, but I think we can take the base. There''s no telling what you''ll find hidden in a smuggler''s den anyway. Could be quite lucrative for us. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm12t', 'What''s Hidden in a Smuggler''s Den?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm13o', 'As it turns out, one of our contacts is likely a double agent working for ISB. We managed to plant a tracking device on him and found him visiting these coordinates on a fairly regular basis. Not much out there according to our maps. Care to check it out for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm13d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm13c', 'Just as we suspected. This is not good. There''s no telling how much the Imperials know of our operations. We may have to abandon this cell completely. Thanks, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm13t', 'Who Watches?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm14o', 'When you''re fighting for the freedom of the galaxy, you have to make some compromises and work with individuals that you''d rather not. Some of these folks have offered us help, but we need to make sure they''re who they claim to be and not Imperials in disguise. Check out their operation and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm14d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm14c', 'Sounds like good old-fashioned criminals to me. I hate using their services, but the Empire doesn''t leave us much choice.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm14t', 'Check the References'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm15o', 'We''ve been following the activities of one of our informants. It seems our man has some business on the side. We have to make sure he''s not an ISB or Imperial Intelligence agent. Go to these coordinates and see what our friend is up to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm15d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm15c', 'A criminal and a thief we can deal with; an Imperial spy is altogether different. Thanks for your help, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm15t', 'Spy vs Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm16o', 'Well! Give me claws and a tail and call me a rancor, if it doesn''t turn out that one of our trusted informants is an Imperial spy. I just can''t believe this report! You''ve got to scout out these coordinates, friend, and verify for me, once and for all, if our "good buddy" is really working for the Imperials. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm16d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm16c', 'Well, cut off my legs, put me in a robe, and call me a Jawa! I was completely fooled. I had no clue! Looks like it''s time for me to have a nice "heart-to-heart" with my drinking buddy.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm16t', 'He''s Really a Spy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm17o', 'A Black Sun agent claims they have an operation near here that could benefit our cause. If we help them transport glitterstim off the planet, they''ll help us avoid detection by Imperial authorities. I''m not sure I like that deal. Check out their operation and see what kind of a setup they have. Don''t be seen.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm17d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm17c', 'I''ll have to bounce this off High Command. Working with smugglers is one thing, working for criminals who peddle poison is another thing entirely. Thanks for your help, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm17t', 'Check Out the Gangsters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm18o', 'I spotted a fellow in town who looked like this world''s sales executive for Czerka, the Empire''s arms manufacturer. He met with an Imperial goon, and they both headed out of town. I managed to plant a tracking beacon. I want you to check these coordinates to see where they went, then report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm18d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm18c', 'That sounds like a weapons manufacturing plant, no doubt gearing up to produce Czerka armaments for the Empire. All right, we''ll get on that quickly. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm18t', 'Trace the Czerka Executive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm19o', 'A local Alliance leader met secretly with an executive of BlasTech about procuring ion cannons. After the meeting, our man noticed the executive walk close by an Imperial soldier. It looked suspicious. We have a tracking beacon on the exec, so we''d like you to check his current coordinates and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm19d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm19c', 'That''s an Imperial weapons factory. Looks like BlasTech is playing both sides against each other, which is usual for them. I''ll pass this along to headquarters, thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm19t', 'BlasTech Executive Rouses Suspicion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm20o', 'Our informant in customs says a big shipment from Mer-Sonn Munitions arrived on this world yesterday. The destination coordinates don''t match any known installation. We don''t know who''s housing those munitions nor, more important, what''s guarding it. We''d like you to find out and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm20d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm20c', 'Wonder why the Empire is making a secret shipment of munitions. Somehow this makes me nervous. Well, we''ll deal with the problem. Thanks for the report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm20t', 'Secret Mer-Sonn Shipment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm21o', 'The arrival of any official from the Kuat Drive Yards always means bad news. Kuat is the Empire''s most faithful armaments manufacturer. One sales agent arrived on this world not long ago. Fortunately we had a tracking beacon on him every second, from Kuat straight to these coordinates. We''d like you to check out his location and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm21d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm21c', 'The gossip is that the Empire is preparing a new turbolaser, or maybe a planetary ion cannon. Great, that''s all we need. Okay, we''ll take it from here. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm21t', 'Kuat Sales Agent Arrives'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm22o', 'An informant tells us that an ordinary-looking fellow who just arrived from offworld is in fact a leading scientist in the Imperial Department of Military Research. That sounds bad, but maybe it''s an opportunity. If we could persuade him to defect... First things first, though. He''s stationed at these coordinates. Recon the area, don''t let him get killed, and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm22d', 'Imperial');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm22c', 'The information we had was a fake. The Empire wanted to lure a major Alliance force into that deathtrap. Well, good thing you weren''t killed. Sorry for the trouble!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm22t', 'Imperial Military Research Scientist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm23o', 'We''re planning something sneaky. We need to plant marked inventory in an Imperial supply depot. Our inside agents can adjust the records, but we need to know the depot defenses before we go in to make the drop. Look over the installation at these coordinates, then report back here. Don''t try to be a hero and attack the place!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm23d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm23c', 'Good. We have a bunch of stormtrooper helmets outfitted with hidden tracking bugs. We hope to see them dispensed to Imperial troops all over this world. Thanks, nice job!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm23t', 'Check Supply Depot Defenses'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm24o', 'According to an Alliance sympathizer employed by the Borstel Galactic Defense munitions company, Borstel is building a deflector shield generator for the Empire on this world. We have the coordinates, but we don''t know if the target is worth the effort of a full assault. Check the installation and report back, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm24d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm24c', 'Sounds like that shield generator is too small for us to worry about. The Empire can almost shield whole planets now, I hear. Still, we may need to do something. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm24t', 'Borstel Shield Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm25o', 'We suspect an Imperial spy has stolen plans for the SoroSuub ship lasers we plan to install in a new generation of starfighters. We tracked the spy to these coordinates, but we''d like to be sure the plans were indeed compromised before we try an assault. Go, look around, don''t get caught, and report back.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm25d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm25c', 'Didn''t see the plans? All right. We can probably discount that particular danger. There''s plenty more to keep us from resting easy. Thanks for your fine recon effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm25t', 'SoroSuub Ship Laser Plans'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm26o', 'Someone has hijacked one of our shipments of Carbanti United sensor arrays. Luckily we had a tracking beacon on the shipment. We have the coordinates, but we don''t want to move until we know the opposition. Check out this location, don''t get seen, don''t get caught, and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm26d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm26c', 'I see. Pirates could definitely use starship sensor arrays. Well, those sensors won''t be good enough to see us moving in on them. We''ll take it from here. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm26t', 'Carbanti Sensor Arrays Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm27o', 'The Alliance invested much effort to create an encrypted subspace link that could use the Imperial HoloNet without detection. Then someone stole it! We''re, shall we say, miffed. We had a tracking beacon on the subspace transceiver, so we want you to find it and report back on who''s got it. Don''t let the equipment get damaged!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 106, 'm27d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 107, 'm27c', 'We''ll have to do something about this ongoing pirate problem. We''re losing too much equipment to them. Well, thanks for the report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 108, 'm27t', 'Stolen Subspace Transceiver'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 109, 'm28o', 'A pirate gang kidnapped a Viceprex of the Tagge Company, the biggest and wealthiest bunch in the Corporate Sector. We found out they''re hiding him on this world while they negotiate a ransom. If we can rescue him, we''ll earn a nice reward. But we don''t know the pirate''s defenses. Check out these coordinates and report back. Don''t provoke violence, or they''ll kill the hostage!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 110, 'm28d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 111, 'm28c', 'Doesn''t sound like the Viceprex was there. Well, it may have been one more rumor. Thanks for checking, anyway. Please take this for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 112, 'm28t', 'Tagge Viceprex Kidnapped'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 113, 'm29o', 'A ring of thieves is stealing heavy construction equipment. They just took a -- wait, I''ll check my report -- a Karflo Corporation G2-GE beamdrill. Says here this thing could punch through a corvette-size starship. I want to know where it is; how about you? I have some coordinates here I''d like you to check out. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 114, 'm29d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 115, 'm29c', 'Nothing you saw matches the beamdrill description I have. Hope we don''t find that thing''s location the hard way. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 116, 'm29t', 'Beamdrill Gone Missing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 117, 'm30o', 'Some gangster ring is stealing construction equipment. I don''t know why crooks would want an Industrial Automaton heavy construction droid, but we needed it ourselves to build a new base. We''d like you to check the coordinates of the droid''s tracking beacon, then report back. If you see the crooks, try to determine their defenses.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 118, 'm30d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 119, 'm30c', 'You would have seen something as big as that construction droid. Maybe they cut it up and sold it for parts. We''ll have to do something about this crime problem. Thanks for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 120, 'm30t', 'Construction Droid Stolen'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 121, 'm31o', 'We have an informant in customs who tells us that a shipment of Thalassian Slavers Guild collars just made landfall on this world. Where there are collars, there are slavers. That stinks! We want you to check the coordinates of that shipment and tell us about the defenses of whatever you find there. Report back here, and don''t get enslaved, okay?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 122, 'm31d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 123, 'm31c', 'That sounds like slavers. I don''t suppose you saw the collars? Well, doesn''t matter. We''ll take care of this promptly. Thanks, and good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 124, 'm31t', 'Thalassian Slave Collars Arrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 125, 'm32o', 'We have dealings with a "procurement specialist" who brings our medical supplies through Imperial blockades. She''s a great pilot. But now we hear she''s dealing with the Empire. We want you to check the coordinates of her base for signs of an Imperial presence. Don''t destroy anything, don''t get seen, and report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 126, 'm32d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 127, 'm32c', 'All right, sounds like she''s not dealing with the Empire, at least. If she were, we''d be facing major problems. Thanks, and here''s a little something for your work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 128, 'm32t', 'Smuggler Gone to Empire''s Side?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 129, 'm33o', 'We''ve opened tentative negotiations with a known smuggler, trying to line up a new "procurement specialist" to bring us cargo through Imperial blockades. But I don''t trust this guy -- yet. I''d like you to investigate his base, covertly, and report back here. Don''t provoke an incident. In fact, try not to be seen at all. We don''t want to spook him.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 130, 'm33d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 131, 'm33c', 'Well, I don''t hear anything incriminating yet. I hope this fellow turns out to be legitimate. Oh, listen to me -- I''m hoping he''s an honest crook! It sure is a crazy war.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 132, 'm33t', 'Check Out a Candidate Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 133, 'm34o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" just delivered a cargo of power cores -- but not as many as we expected. She said she had to dump some cargo during a tight race with a Star Destroyer. Not that I don''t trust her completely, but would you mind looking around her base, secretly? Don''t let her see you. Report back here.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 134, 'm34d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 135, 'm34c', 'Okay, I expect she was telling the truth. Here''s some credits for your trouble. Now I have to find some extra power cores....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 136, 'm34t', 'Power Cores Missing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 137, 'm35o', 'We spotted a couple of snubships landing at an underground platform near here. None of our X-wings are currently authorized for landfall in this system. Go and check the place out. I''m afraid someone might be selling hijacked starfighters to the Empire. Report back to me after you scout the place.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 138, 'm35d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 139, 'm35c', 'No sign of the landing platform, eh? Something strange is going on here. I think we should pay that place a visit and put some questions to them. I promise I''ll contact you if we have any openings on the strike team.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 140, 'm35t', 'Scout For Stolen Snubships'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 141, 'm36o', 'We''re looking for swampcrawlers to use at a new landing base near Antar. I found a black marketeer who''s willing to sell me some, but I''m not sure I trust the guy. Can you sneak into his compound and see if there''s any evidence of Imperial involvement? Report back to me as soon as you can. I can smell a trap, and my nose is tickling right now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 142, 'm36d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 143, 'm36c', 'No evidence of Imperial involvement, eh? Hmm. Maybe the guy is clean after all. We really do need those mudmaulers he promised me. I guess we''ll take this arrangement to the next level. Thanks for the recon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 144, 'm36t', 'We Need Mudmaulers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 145, 'm37o', 'There''s a small problem. We shut down an old base last year, and now we need to reopen it. Some squatters have taken over the place since then. If you can, I need you to have a look around and let me know what you find. Maybe we can clear the facility with a simple warning.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 146, 'm37d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 147, 'm37c', 'You say the old base is overrun with tough guys? Not good. Looks like we''ll have to send in a well-armed team to negotiate a resolution. Thanks for your help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 148, 'm37t', 'Scout the Squatters'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 149, 'm38o', 'The Empire landed a shipment of tractor beam flux lenses in a small emplacement. See if you can sneak in and get some sense of how large the shipment is. Bring me the information at once. Tell no one else. This could be a chance for us to hobble many Imperial capital ships at the same time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 150, 'm38d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 151, 'm38c', 'Too bad the shipment wasn''t larger than that. I would have loved to drop a thermal detonator in there and stall the maintenance of a dozen Star Destroyers'' tractor beams. Well, in any case, we''ll keep an eye on that facility. Thank you for the recon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 152, 'm38t', 'Size Up Tractor Beam Parts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 153, 'm39o', 'The Empire picked up a couple of our old service droids. I don''t think they''ll divulge sensitive information before their memory gets wiped, but I''d like to make sure. Sneak into the Imperial facility at these coordinates and see if any activity suggests they''re on to us. Report back to me at once. I hope my fears are unfounded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 154, 'm39d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 155, 'm39c', 'Thank goodness the Empire didn''t seem to learn anything from those droids. We''ve got to be more careful. Remember, always wipe your droids before you sell them.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 156, 'm39t', 'Droid Memory Troubles'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 157, 'm40o', 'The black market is tricky business. We ordered a Nordoxicon-38 Anti-concussion Field Generator for one of our clandestine freighters, but someone stole it. Luckily, we think we''ve found it. I need you to infiltrate the thieves'' hideout and see if it''s there. Don''t start any trouble, just report back to me. I''ve got a strike team ready if the generator is there.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 158, 'm40d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 159, 'm40c', 'You did good work. I bet the generator was in one of those crates. I''ll gather my strike team this evening to retrieve it. The Empire is bad enough; we can''t have thieves thinking they can prey on the Alliance, too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 160, 'm40t', 'Find a Stolen Field Generator'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 161, 'm41o', 'I''ve arranged to pick up a small cargo of proton torpedoes. I''ve never worked with this black market supplier before, though, so I''d like someone to check out his operation before I commit any capital offenses with him. Have a look around if you can, and come straight back to me with any information you get. We can''t be too careful.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 162, 'm41d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 163, 'm41c', 'Thanks for the information. I have to say, I don''t like this supplier''s setup. Something tells me there''s more going on here than meets the eye. I''m backing away from those proton torpedoes. It''s not worth the risk.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 164, 'm41t', 'Dubious Black Marketeer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 165, 'm42o', 'We planted a homing beacon on a shipment of AT-ST gyro power cells. Unfortunately a band of thieves stole the cells from our middleman before the Empire took possession. Now we need to turn off the beacon. I''ve loaded your datapad with a proximity deactivation program. Sneak into the thieves'' den. Your waypoint will vanish when the beacon is shut down. Then report back to me at once. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 166, 'm42d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 167, 'm42c', 'Nice work. We didn''t want that homing beacon to tip off any Imperial sympathizers.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 168, 'm42t', 'Deactivate a Homing Beacon'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 169, 'm43o', 'We lost contact with one of our listening outposts. I want you to see what happened. If there''s trouble, find out what you can but don''t reveal your presence. Bring the information back to me at once. We can organize a response appropriate to the situation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 170, 'm43d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 171, 'm43c', 'Blast! The Empire has uncovered too many of our secret operations lately. I''m beginning to suspect a spy in our midst. If I find out who it is, they''re going to be sorry. I knew every one of those men at that listening post! All those lives lost....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 172, 'm43t', 'Lost Contact With a Listening Post'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 173, 'm44o', 'Okay, listen up. If you''re interested in a little danger today, I''ve got a recon mission for you. There''s an Imperial relay post at these coordinates. I want you to sneak in and poke around the place. See what you can find. Try not to be seen, though I know you can take care of yourself if they find you. Good luck, and may the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 174, 'm44d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 175, 'm44c', 'Good job. Sounds like there''s nothing out of the ordinary going on at that Imperial post. Still, we have to keep track of them. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 176, 'm44t', 'Reconnoiter an Imperial Post'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 177, 'm45o', 'We were this close to finalizing a donation from an Ithorian noble, when space pirates kidnapped him. We think we''ve tracked them down, though. Go to these coordinates and see if the pirates are there. If so, verify the presence of a rich Ithorian. Let me know what you find. We could really use that donation.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 178, 'm45d', 'Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 179, 'm45c', 'Blast. No Ithorian hostage. If we could have sprung him, that donation would be as good as ours. Funding a rebellion is not an easy challenge, my friend, take it from me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 180, 'm45t', 'Find an Ithorian Hostage'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 181, 'm46o', 'I''m positive the Empire has paid some outlaws to creep around our supply operations in this area. Go to this smugglers'' depot and see if there''s any evidence of Imperial entanglement. Report back to me with your findings. If we can prove these outlaws are working against us, we''ll save ourselves plenty of headaches down the road.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 182, 'm46d', 'Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 183, 'm46c', 'No Imperials, eh? Maybe my intel is wrong. I''ll double-check my sources. Thanks for the recon.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 184, 'm46t', 'Check Out a Smugglers'' Den'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 185, 'm47o', 'A local gangster has been causing us problems. Sneak around this gangster''s hideout and get me some good intel. Don''t cause any problems, just bring me some inside information. When I show him how easily we can infiltrate his operation, and sabotage it if we want, maybe he''ll think twice about giving us any grief.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 186, 'm47d', 'Gangster'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 187, 'm47c', 'Nice. Thanks to you, that gangster will think twice about threatening us in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 188, 'm47t', 'Teach a Gangster a Lesson'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 189, 'm48o', 'I''m positive the Empire has paid some outlaws to creep around our supply operations in this area. Go to this smugglers'' depot and see if there''s any evidence of Imperial entanglement. Report back to me with your findings. If we can prove these outlaws are working against us, we''ll save ourselves plenty of headaches down the road.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 190, 'm48d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 191, 'm48c', 'I knew that place would be crawling with Imperials! When you deal with outlaws, you''ve always got to watch over your shoulder.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 192, 'm48t', 'Check Out a Smugglers'' Den'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 193, 'm49o', 'I''m telling you this in the strictest confidence. I think one of our own has turned into a double agent. I need you to check out the Imperial facility at these coordinates and see if you can find any Alliance operatives there. I don''t need to tell you how much damage a spy could do to us. Report back to me as soon as you''ve completed the mission.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 194, 'm49d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 195, 'm49c', 'No Alliance operatives there? Good. That makes me breathe a little easier. However, we still need to keep our eyes open for possible double agents. Greed can be a powerful ally, even for the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 196, 'm49t', 'Investigate a Double Agent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 197, 'm50o', 'Our spies claim that the Empire is ready to mount some big operation on Taanab. My family is there! I''m worried the Empire might know about my involvement in the Alliance, so I''m trying to find out anything I can. Will you recon the Imperial base at these coordinates and listen for any mention of Taanab? Report back to me as soon as you can, even if you hear nothing in particular. Thank you very much.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 198, 'm50d', 'Imperial'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 199, 'm50c', 'None of my other spies have heard anything more about Taanab either. Maybe the Empire isn''t planning an operation there after all. Or maybe they''re just keeping it more secret than usual. I''ll have to keep on top of it, just to be sure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_recon_rebel_easy.stf', 200, 'm50t', 'Spy on an Imperial Base'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Citizen, the Empire needs your help finding a certain material that is, at the moment, in short supply. This war with the Rebels has put a strain on resources, and we need you to do your part. Not that the inexhaustible might of the Empire is in a moment''s doubt, of course!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 2, 'm1s', 'Excellent! Come by and see me again, there''s always something in short supply.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'In Short Supply'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'You''re a surveyor looking for work? Good! I''m working on an important project, and it seems my supply manifest lists one resource that I don''t have. Please go and find me a supply so that I can finish my project.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 5, 'm2s', 'That should suit my needs exactly. Good job.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'A Missing Resource'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'The blasted Moff thinks that just because he wants something, the resources to make it will just mystically appear. Can you find me a goodly supply of the following material? If I don''t get him what he wants, it''s the spice mines for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 8, 'm3s', 'You saved my neck on that one. Sometimes the Empire wants the impossible.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'The Trouble With Moffs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'Greetings, citizen. You have been chosen for a survey mission of the utmost importance. You are required to find a source for the following resource with all due haste. Time is of the essence, please hurry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 11, 'm4s', 'Your service to the Empire has been noted.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'A Hasty Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'It is extremely important to the security of the Empire that certain resources are always in good supply. You are being contracted to find an additional source for this material. Projections show it will soon be in short supply, given current production needs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 14, 'm5s', 'Droids will be there to harvest the material shortly. Well done.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'In Short Supply'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'The Imperial Security Bureau has informed us that Rebels are seeking a supply of this material for unknown reasons. It has been decided to send surveyors out to locate sources, so that the ISB can monitor possible Rebel activity.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 17, 'm6s', 'If any Rebels go looking there, they''ll be in for a bit of a surprise.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Stamp Out Rebel Surveying'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Being an Imperial surveyor may not be as glamorous as being in the troopers, but supply lines are crucial in any conflict. The supply we currently happen to be short of is this material. Do your best to find us an additional source.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 20, 'm7s', 'Surveying is vital to the cause of the Empire. The supplies you find are used to manufacture all manner of goods needed to fight the Rebellion. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Vital to the Empire'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'The Prefect has been offered a handsome "gift" by a manufacturer, with the understanding that he will receive a sufficient quantity of this resource which he needs. The Prefect is offering a reward to any surveyor who can find a source of this material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 23, 'm8s', 'The Prefect is very pleased with your work. You will go far if you remain this productive.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'A Prefect''s Reward'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'It seems like some bureaucrat or other is always sending you out into the middle of nowhere, to find some resource that they, no doubt, squandered a perfectly good supply of. Well, today is no exception. Go and find a supply of this material, before someone important finds out we''re running low.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 26, 'm9s', 'Your fee has been deposited. I''ll ask for you again when I need something else.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Squandered Supplies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'Your survey skills are once again required in the service of the Empire. Production is at an all-time high, and it is crucial that our stores be sufficient to meet our needs. You are hired to locate an abundant source of this material. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 29, 'm10s', 'Payment has been deposited to your account. Good work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Help Keep Production High'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'Rather than pay landowners for extraction rights, a highly placed official has devised the idea of surveying for needed materials and arresting any unfortunate landowners who happen to own land with rich deposits of these materials. As party to this ingenious plan, you will be surveying for the indicated material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 32, 'm11s', 'I''m sure the landowner will be released once we''re finished... barring unforeseen circumstances, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Extractions Rights'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'Greetings, citizen! It is with great pleasure that I offer you this assignment of surveying for this material. I feel certain you will find an especially rich source of it. The Empire is counting on you. Make the Emperor proud!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 35, 'm12s', 'You have outdone yourself. Working with you has been a real pleasure.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'An Upbeat Assignment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'Why are you just standing around like a sick bantha? The Empire is in dire need of this material, and all loyal Imperial surveyors are expected to be out looking for it. We need it yesterday. What are you waiting for? Go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 38, 'm13s', 'It''s about blasted time you reported in! Be thankful you''re even getting paid for this.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'The Surly Requisition Officer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'Imperial scientists constantly experiment with new applications of certain resources. They go through such astounding quantities that we''re hard pressed to keep them supplied. Locate a good source for this material, so they can use it to, to -- to clean out the turbine of an ion cannon, or whatever bizarre thing they''re trying now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 41, 'm14s', 'Who knows? Perhaps you''ll be a small part of some wonderous new discovery. Probably not, though.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'New Uses for Resources'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'The Imperial Survey Corps is so understaffed right now, we''re forced to contract with freelance surveyors such as yourself to help us meet our quotas. If you can find us a supply of this material, you will be given a generous finder''s fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 44, 'm15s', 'Good work. Your fee has been credited to your account.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Freelance Surveying'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'Imperial Security has labeled this material as first priority for all current survey missions. I don''t know what they want it for, but they''ve made it clear they want lots of it. We''re putting all other survey assignments on hold for the moment'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 47, 'm16s', 'No doubt Imperial Security has noted the speed with which you finished your assignment.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Priority Material'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'At present Imperial supply depots are overloaded with a certain material. The Imperial Survey Corps, in its wisdom, is contracting for more of it. Go and find an additional source for the Imperial surplus.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 50, 'm17s', 'Thanks to you and others like you, further supply depots are being constructed to contain the additional volume of this material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Imperial Surplus'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'People are whispering that construction is scheduled to begin on some huge secret project. I don''t know what it is, but I do know the sheer quantity of this one requisitioned material would fill a fleet of large freighters. Locate a source for however much you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 53, 'm18s', 'That''s a good start. I think we''re going to need an awful lot of surveyors to fill this requisition.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'Starting Construction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'My commander has ordered me to complete my current project, a blast cannon power feed and modulation control, within a horrendously short time. I have run out of a particular material useful in the processing of the armor cladding. Locate a source at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 56, 'm19s', 'I shall dispatch droids to procure the material at once. Your payment is attached.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Horrendously Short Time'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'A Star Destroyer will shortly dock in orbit around this world for routine maintenance. Our supplies are inadequate to refit all cooling systems pumps on its blaster stations. Locate the needed material promptly, and you will be rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 59, 'm20s', 'The Star Destroyer has been diverted to handle an uprising elsewhere in this sector. Your payment is nonetheless attached. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Upcoming Star Destroyer Maintenance'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'An official from Imperial Center is making an unscheduled stopover on this world for emergency repairs. His spacecraft''s atmosphere tanks require specialized maintenance. We lack a required material. Locate it for us at once.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 62, 'm21s', 'The official has already arrived, commandeered our commander''s own space yacht, and departed again. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Imperial Official''s Emergency Repairs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'I''ve just learned the Imperial Security Bureau is auditing this office! This is -- um -- this is, of course, standard, expected Imperial procedure. This office certainly has nothing to hide, certainly. Do not think that. But it is certainly possible we have fallen short of a certain material. In advance of the inspection, locate a source. Hurry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 65, 'm22s', 'Excellent news. I shall dispatch mining droids immediately. You are not to think this office has been slack or wayward or criminal in its entirely explicable and justifiable shortage of this material. Do not imply that to anyone.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Surprise ISB Inspection'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The Committee for the Preservation of the New Order has requisitioned certain facilities in this office for its latest loyalty audit. COMPNOR''s interrogation droids require specialized maintenance. We lack a certain material for this maintenance. You are required to locate a source immediately.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 68, 'm23s', 'The COMPNOR loyalty audit started early, and some interrogation droids have malfunctioned. However, because you performed adequately, this will not be entered on your permanent record. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'COMPNOR Loyalty Audit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'A company of stormtroopers will shortly be garrisoned near this office. What a logistical nightmare! It seems their blasters use recharging stations that require a specialized material for the power core shielding. It falls to you to locate a source for this material, which we shall mine after receiving your report.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 71, 'm24s', 'The stormtrooper company was accidentally destroyed in an encounter with the Rebellion. You will nonetheless be compensated for adequate performance. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Stormtrooper Garrison Imminent'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'A Star Destroyer in our vicinity reports a temporary shortfall in repairs of TIE fighter solar energy collectors. The shortfall is due to inadequate supplies of a particular material present on this world. Locate a rich source of this material, and you will be rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 74, 'm25s', 'Your fee is attached. The TIE solar collectors have been repaired. The erring procurement officers have been disciplined. All is well.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'TIE Fighter Solar Collector Repairs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'It appears there is an Imperial Ballet Company on Coruscant. They are visiting this world to stage a production of Mondagrene''s "Grand Triumph of Reason." They require me to locate a certain material "useful in their set designs." What nonsense! Rather than waste valuable personnel time, I commission you to locate this material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 77, 'm26s', 'Congratulations on your participation in this pointless task. Personally, I had no idea there even was an "Imperial Ballet Company."'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Bureau of Culture Requires Set Design'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'The droid brain piloting a Sentinel-class landing craft malfunctioned and nearly crash-landed. The ship''s damage is severe but reparable. For the task we require a certain material not normally stored in this facility. Locate a supply and you will be rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 80, 'm27s', 'The Sentinel craft is being repaired. Evidently the droid grew stubborn and demanded to land at high velocity, "for a thrill." Its brain has now been wiped. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Sentinel Craft Droid Malfunction'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'Rebel saboteurs have destroyed a fuel depot of the radioactive gases that fuel TIE fighters. These gases are stored in tanks with special linings. We are bringing in cargo freighters with replacement gas, but we must construct new storage tanks. It falls to you to locate a certain material we need for the tank lining.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 83, 'm28s', 'You have performed adequately. The replacement storage tanks are now under construction. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Sabotage Destroys TIE Fuel Tanks'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'A Rebel agent has somehow destroyed an entire Imperial armory! The guard officers have of course been disciplined, but we face a short-term weapon shortage. We are manufacturing new armaments at breakneck speed, which has exhausted our supply of a certain vital material. Locate a fresh source at once!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 86, 'm29s', 'The new weapon shipments are now arriving. We are seeking the Rebel saboteur with redoubled ferocity. That is all.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'Rebel Saboteur Destroys Armory'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'I''m told a force of Rebel terrorists has bestowed the gift of a thermal detonator on a peripheral vehicle repair facility. Dear me, this is troublesome. That facility stored energizer rods that require highly specialized storage. You must find the material needed for the replacement storage compartments now being constructed.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 89, 'm30s', 'That is acceptable. The Rebellion will soon regret targeting that particular facility, for now I have made it my personal mission to punish them all!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Rebellion Destroys Vehicle Facility'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'A pitched battle with Rebel fighters destroyed the power cores used in a Star Destroyer''s heavy laser batteries. The ship is now in orbit awaiting recharge. Because the cargo freighters servicing the ship will require unusual linings to carry the replacement cores, you must locate a source of the following material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 92, 'm31s', 'You have done well. The Star Destroyer will be recharged shortly and will return to its good work: annihilating the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Star Destroyer Battery Recharge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'We have achieved yet another victory over the Rebellion. The plunder from the seized supply depot includes several radioactive fuels that require special storage facilities. We wish you to locate a source for a particular material required to line the tanks holding these fuels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 95, 'm32s', 'That is indeed acceptable. Your payment is attached. You may spread the word far and wide of our latest victory over the Rebels.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Our Latest Victory Over the Rebellion'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'I am baffled by the Rebels'' ability to maintain their aged Y-wing starfighters well beyond their specified life cycles. I am studying a captured craft, but its coolant system has been repaired so often it is now positively eccentric. To store the altered coolant, I require a tank with an unusual lining. Locate a source for that material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 98, 'm33s', 'The Y-wing shows such haphazard engineering that I fear there is nothing for the Empire to learn from it. How does any Rebel dare fly the thing?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Haphazardly Engineered Y-Wing'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'This office is charged with maintaining the boom racks that unleash waves of assault forces from AT-AT walkers. These racks require an unusual lubricant, which in turn requires a particular substance. You are hereby commissioned to locate a source for this substance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 101, 'm34s', 'Maintenance of the AT-AT boom racks is underway. You may be proud of your efforts when next you hear of waves of stormtroopers launched from a walker.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'AT-AT Boom Rack Lubricant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'An AT-ST two-legged scout walker requires delicate gyroscopes. These rest on delicate bearings, which use a specialized lubricant. This office is charged with reformulating this lubricant. Our formula employs a certain unusual material. You are to locate a source for this material. Go!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 104, 'm35s', 'Very well. I''ll wager you never thought you''d be locating a scout walker gyroscope bearing lubricant. It must make you proud.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_imperial_easy.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Scout Walker Gyro Bearings Need Work'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'Good help is so hard to find these days! Could you lend a hand, citizen? I''m working on a new type of alluvial damper. This baby will revolutionize the hyperdrive industry! This is the fianl material I need to finish my invention on this disc. Your datapad can access it. Remember, citizen, the future is in your hands. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'm1s', 'It''s always a pleasure to meet a devotee of science! Your contributions will help pave the way into the future! Your pay has been deposited.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Help Create New Alluvial Dampers'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'Do you wish to be a part of something that will take the galaxy by storm? I''m working on something that will transform the Empire as we know it. But I''ve underestimated the materials needed to bring my creation to life. Here''s what I need. Think you can find it for me? I''ll pay you, unless you decide to do this prestigious task for free.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'm2s', 'Good work. Still want to get paid? Oh. I see. Very well, your pay has been transmitted. But just wait till you see how my new individual transporter alters your world! You''ll be paying me for the privilege of owning one.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Build a Better Scooter'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'How does that saying go? "Invention is one percent inspiration and ninety-nine percent droid administration?" Well, you''re obviously not a droid, but I still need your services. If I provide you with the information, can you locate the material? I reward efficiency.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'm3s', 'Most efficient, citizen. And I''m true to my word. Enjoy your pay.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'A Generous Inventor'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'As a commodities merchant, I provide aspiring inventors the raw materials they need to birth their creations. Problem is, I''m so busy selling this stuff that I rarely have an opportunity to hunt for it. That''s where you come in, friend. I inform you which material I need, you provide the location. We got a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'm4s', 'I knew I could rely on you. This deposit should demonstrate my gratitude far better than words.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'Assist Commodities Merchant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'Power converter orders have shot through the roof! I''m afraid this craze has caught me a bit unprepared. I need your help, citizen, if you''re willing to give it. I''ll let you know which material I need to continue production if you can find the richest deposit this planet has to offer. And there are certainly credits in it for you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'm5s', 'I can see you know how to get results, citizen! Well scouted! Your fee has been transmitted to your account.  Feel free to seek me out in the future for more jobs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Supply and Demand'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'When will the galaxy realize that the material composing a hydrospanner is just as important, if not moreso, than its design? I have developed the perfect alloy, but I need more of my base material to create it in sufficient quantity to mass-produce hydrospanners. Could you help me find this material? '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'm6s', 'Wonderful! This was better than I was expecting. Of course I''ll still need much more material than this one deposit can provide. See me for more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'A Bigger, Better Hydrospanner'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'Power calibrators are only as effective as their construction, and cheap materials result in cheap products. My special alloy requires a variety of materials to create but results in a superior tool. You can help me create these advanced instruments by finding the richest deposit of the following material. Can I count on you?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'm7s', 'I see you''re a being who appreciates a good, sturdy work tool. Excellent! Your efforts will help greatly in achieving my goal of tool superiority.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Now That''s a Tool'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'I''ve developed a perfect alloy for use in fusion cutters. Most people pay no mind to the material their tools are made of, which I think is a terrible fault. A better fusion cutter would make life so much easier for the common citizen. I need you to help me realize this dream. Can you locate a deposit of this material I need to continue my work?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'm8s', 'You''re a being who knows how to get results, citizen -- a being after my own heart. Keep this up and I just might have a business partner!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Quality Fusion Cutters Are Hard To Find'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'Desperation is the mother of invention, and I''m quite desperate at the moment. I need your help in locating a rich deposit of the following material. Do you think you could assist me? The wheels of progress must keep turning, and it''s up to you to help grease them. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'm9s', 'You must have a knack for this sort of thing, citizen. Did you used to go dowsing as a child? Simply amazing. I''ve compensated you for your time and efforts. Thanks.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Dowsing Can Be Fun'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'Surveying is no easy task, friend. I''m talking about true surveying -- the art of locating the largest deposits of the most precious materials in the dangerous wilds. That is something that only a master can accomplish. The ignorant think all it takes is a survey tool and some patience, but we know better, eh? Go and find this material for me. Prove your mastery of the subject.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'm10s', 'You and I are one of a kind, citizen. We are as rare as some of the materials we seek. I''m proud to pay you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Surveying Is Beautiful'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'I''m sure you''ve read the excellent work "Essentials of Dynamic Crystal Forces." It''s my hope to write the geologic textbooks for the next generation. To accomplish this task, I need to locate more deposits of rich materials. If you could help me find this material, I would be deeply appreciative. Oh, and I''d pay you too.  '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'm11s', 'You have advanced the cause of science, friend. I''ll mention you in my foreword.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Advance the Cause of Science'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'I''ve been given a grant by the Imperial Academy of Science and Methodology to study the distribution of precious ores and materials across this planet. I have employed several surveyors to locate the richest deposits of the following materials, but I still need more for my research. Could you lend a hand? I''d pay you, of course. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'm12s', 'Well done. I do believe that is one of the largest deposits discovered to date. We must keep looking for more, however. If you want more work, you know where to find me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Help a Geologist'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'It''s my goal to learn the distribution of this planet''s natural resources. I spend my time in the lab analyzing the results of geologic surveys, which leaves professionals like yourself to perform those surveys. The pay I offer is generous. All you need to do is find a rich deposit of the following material. Deal?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'm13s', 'Your hard work makes my research possible, citizen. As you can see from the credits you''ve just received, my pay was quite generous. Many thanks. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Aid the Natural Sciences'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'I''ve been sent by an Arkanian science council to perform studies of planetary resources. Some beings may have gotten the wrong impression about the Arkanians, who are actually quite pleasant and a most inquisitive species. If you could help me perform some geologic surveys, I''d gladly pay you. Here is the material I need to locate.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'm14s', 'The Arkanians will be quite pleased, citizen. I feel it''s important to aid the cause of science however we can. I''m glad you could help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Perform Geologic Surveys'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'I am a research assistant for Design Team Beta, and I am desperately in need of help. I''m supposed to determine how rich this planet is in certain materials. But I''m afraid my deadline is looming closer and I still have lots of work to do. Could you perform one of these surveys for me? I''d make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'm15s', 'Thanks, friend, you''ve really saved my neck. Enjoy your credits, and feel free to come see me again if you need more work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Save a Research Assistant'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'It seems like vehicles are breaking down all over the place, and nobody has any replacement parts. If you could locate a source of this material so that I can rig up some spare parts in my workshop, I''d be obliged to you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 47, 'm16s', 'Thanks, friend! Maybe now I can get one of these crates moving again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Parts Is Parts'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'I have an idea that could increase the lifting capacity of the B1 labor droid by as much as 25%. If you can locate a source for this material I need so that I can make the new alloy, I can reward you handsomely.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 50, 'm17s', 'We make a good team! Come back and see me if you need more work. I''m always making new innovations.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Build a Better Labor Droid'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'I''m developing a new line of diagnostic tools for GalStarTech, but my supplier is out of some of the resources he needs to make the components. If you can go find this material, you could probably make a few credits. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 53, 'm18s', 'You''re a life saver! Now I can get back to the lab and finish my work.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'A Developer Needs Help'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'I''m thinking of buying some land for investment purposes, and I need someone qualified to go and survey the area and assess its value. Locate a source of this material for analysis and I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 56, 'm19s', 'Wow, I''m glad I didn''t waste credits on that wasteland. I guess I''ll keep looking. Keep in touch.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Today''s Survey'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'My electrostatic repeller is broken and all the dust is wreaking havoc with my mining equipment. If you will go find a source of this material, I can fashion the replacement part I need on a laser lathe. Do you think you can help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 59, 'm20s', 'I''m glad you''re back! You got exactly what I needed. I guess it''s back to the spice mines now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Back to the Spice Mines'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'I''ve invented a new process that I think will make plasma fusers safer to use. Go and find a source of this material so that I can finish my prototype. I''ll see to it that you make a few credits off of this deal.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 62, 'm21s', 'Oh, you''re back. My lab burned down while you were gone but you''ll be paid from my insurance money. Come see me again when my lab is rebuilt.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Plasma Fuser Safety'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'I''m an avid collector! I travel from world to world looking for new and interesting specimens to add to my collection. People think me a bit odd but I just can''t get enough. I''ve been looking for some material here but have yet to find it. If you discover a source, report it and I''ll pay you for the information.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 65, 'm22s', 'That''s exactly what I was looking for. Here are the credits I promised you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'Avid Collector'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'The surveyor I hired was detained at the spaceport for some reason, and now I''m way behind schedule. If you can survey this arera and locate a source of this material, it would be a huge help.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 68, 'm23s', 'Thanks for your assistance, friend. Turns out that surveyor detained at the spaceport was secretly a Rebel terrorist sympathizer. They''re everywhere nowadays!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'A Survey Behind Schedule'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'Hey buddy, can you help me out? My new boss wants me to survey this area, but I work with crystaplex and don''t know the first thing about surveying. If you can go check it out and locate a source for the material my boss needs, I''ll gladly pay you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 71, 'm24s', 'I''m glad you''re back. The boss has been breathing down my neck about this survey. Here are your credits.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'The Misassigned Worker'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'There''s a plot of land I''ve been wanting to buy, but I can''t find a surveyor to check it out for me. What? You say you''re a surveyor? Well, that is fortuitous. Go and survey the land, locate a source for this material, and I''ll give you the survey fee.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 74, 'm25s', 'Splendid! Now if the bank will just lend me the money to buy it, I''ll be set. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Lord of All You Survey'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'Do you know anything much about liquid metal fuel cooling systems? No, how could you? I''m the galaxy''s greatest authority and I''ve never seen you before, so far as I remember. Never mind. All that prevents me from achieving a new breakthrough is one particular rare material. I have the data here. Will you locate this material for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 77, 'm26s', 'Success! The galaxy will soon know a new era in liquid metal fuel cooling systems, in part because of your humble efforts!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Your Part in a Wonderful Breakthrough!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'If you''re saying to yourself, "Nothing teaches the fundamental perversity of the universe like working with electromagnetic freight barge clamps," then, friend, I know what you mean. I''ve wanted to improve this wilfully perverse mechanism for some time, and all that holds me back is a shortage of one single material. Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 80, 'm27s', 'Now the way lies clear to lasting freedom from the perversity of current electromagnetic freight barge clamp designs! Thank you, thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Fundamental Perversity of the Universe'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'You know how it is. You tinker in your garage, hook up a motivator to a power coupling, and before you know it, you''ve got a new acceleration compensator subsystem. I see your nod of recognition. I''m almost ready with my current compensator design, but I lack a particular material for a chamber lining. Can you find me this material?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 83, 'm28s', 'I''m glad to see you working efficiently. From my humble garage beginnings, I''ll be on the way to acceleration compensator greatness in no time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Humble Garage Tinkerer'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'I''m sure you''ve been hearing the gossip all over: "There''s the deranged inventor working on that hopeless drill-grinder project." No? Oh, you''re just being kind. It''s actually coming along fairly well now, in contrast to the last few years. I just need one rare material to apply as polish to the bearings. Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 86, 'm29s', 'I''m sure I''ll make good progress on my drill grinder now that the bearing coating issue is resolved. Thank you for not patronizing me about this lengthy undertaking.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'The Work of Many Years'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'I''ve got a new prototype for a thermal inducer that will really, you might say, heat up my career! Haha! Sorry. If I can get to burn-in on my latest prototype, it''s sure to set the galaxy on fire. That was a pun, get it? Thermal inducer? Burn-in? Fire? All right, never mind. I need a certain material for the generator coil. Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 89, 'm30s', 'Fine work. With the completed thermal inducer, I''ll blaze a fiery trail across the inventors'' firmament. That was another pun, did you get it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Incorrigible Punster -- Do Not Incorrige'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'Success in the inventing field requries a powerful presentation. I''ve got a terrific new shield-receiver heat sink, but the centerpiece of my presentation is a big sign with little spangly things all over. It''s great. I just need a certain specialized material to make the spangles catch the light just right. Can you find me what I want?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 92, 'm31s', 'I thank you. Next, I must arrange for a powerful shipping executive to view my presentation. I expect the spangled sign will seal the deal.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Spangly Presentation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'My father was an inventor. That little flange you see on the underside of every vaporator telemetry cone? That was his. Now I''m following in his footsteps. To perfect my improved recharge-socket plating formula, I need one last material. Will you find it, and help me carry on my father''s legacy?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 95, 'm32s', 'I''m very pleased. This recharge-socket plating idea may not rival my father''s vaporator telemetry cone flange, but after all, I''m just starting. My whole career lies ahead!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Following in Father''s Footsteps'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'Things can get sticky when you can''t find the right adhesive. My newly invented formula will guarantee a smooth, reliable grip for droid restraining bolts of every type. But to perfect my superglue, I need one specialized material. I''d prefer not to speak the name where my rivals can overhear, but your datapad has the info. Can you find this?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 98, 'm33s', 'Excellent news. I expect we''ll see stickier droid bolts across the galaxy by this time next year!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'A Sticky Adhesive Situation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'I''ve spent years perfecting my crafting skills, and now I''m ready to announce my mastery to the galaxy. I''ve chosen an unusual subject for my masterwork: an obscure religious icon of the Weequay species called the Eye of Mesra. For my design I require a rare material, and I hope you can locate it for me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 101, 'm34s', 'Thank you, but evidently the Eye of Mesra has certain drawbacks as a choice for a masterpiece. I''ll consider another design instead.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Ideal Subject for Crafting Mastery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'You''re not a dejarik purist, are you? I have devised a new dejarik playing surface -- less static generated during hyperspace accidents. But to hear the purists whine, you''d think I tried to double-tamp during a Revised Classic Coruscant opening! Sorry, forgive my dejarik jargon. I need one material to complete my board. Will you find it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 104, 'm35s', 'Thank you. I''ll continue to fight for my improved board, though all the forces of the dejarik-playing galaxy be arrayed against me.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Improved Dejarik Board Invites Scorn'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 106, 'm36o', 'Look at this schematic. Isn''t that the most beautiful thing you''ve ever seen? What do you mean, "what is it?" It''s a turbolift velocity controller, of course. I can''t believe I invented something so perfect. It''s like something was working through me to bring this turbolift controller to life. But I need one more material! Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 107, 'm36s', 'That''s wonderful. Soon I''ll be crafting this beautiful mechanism and sharing it with the galaxy. It''s like giving birth, I suppose -- a true miracle.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 108, 'm36t', 'Beautiful Birth of Turbolift Controller'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 109, 'm37o', 'I''m going for it! At first I thought the galaxy might reject my improved deflector-shield projector. But my friends and family told me, "Go for it!" So I am! Would you like to invest, say, a hundred thousand credits in this beauty? No? Well, all right. I''m undaunted. Tell you what, I need one more material for my prototype. Can you get that?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 110, 'm37s', 'All right! Your success should encourage me! I''m definitely going for it! To show my commitment, I''ll pay you something for your time and effort.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 111, 'm37t', 'Going for the Big Time!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 112, 'm38o', 'Sorry if this sounds like a funny request. I have a notion for a deflector-shield projector, but I must admit I''m a bit out of my depth. I''m still in the early market research phase, you might say. It''s clear that I need a prototype, though, and for that I need one rare material. I''d like you to locate it for me. I''m not clear on where it would be....'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 113, 'm38s', 'Thank you, but after I talked with you, a gentleman from the Imperial Navy dissuaded me, sharply, from my deflector shield idea. It seems that technology is of military interest. Who knew? I believe I''ll return to my main interest, blue milk chemistry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 114, 'm38t', 'Deflector Market Research Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 115, 'm39o', 'To promote my new invention, I''m ready to network my heart out. I''ve got a HoloNet address list of every life-support air-scrubber manufacturing association in the galaxy, and I''m going to wow them all with my new super-scrubber prototype. As soon as I build it. There''s one material I''ve had trouble finding. Can you get it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 116, 'm39s', 'Great! The super-scrubber is now in the works! I''ve got my trade-show travel schedule worked out for the entire year ahead. This will be a sure success!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 117, 'm39t', 'Super-Scrubber Networking'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 118, 'm40o', 'I have "inside" contacts in the freight industry. They tell me that a new boarding-ramp retractor assembly would be a sure-fire success. You can''t ignore feedback like that. With this easy avenue into the entire retractor market, I''d be foolish to miss this opportunity. All I need for my prototype is one more material. Can you get it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 119, 'm40s', 'Is the material suitable for boarding ramps, do you think? Well, never mind, my "inside" contacts will tell me all I need to know. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 120, 'm40t', '"Inside" Contacts = Key to Success'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 121, 'm41o', 'I showed this schematic of a new Tibanna gas purifier to my friends and family, and they raved about it. It''s these sorts of enthusiastic testimonials that carry you to prominence in the Tibanna mining industry. I expect a great response as soon as I finish my prototype. To that end, I want you to find the last material I need.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 122, 'm41s', 'Fine news. My family is encouraging me to go forward with my prototype. It''s interesting how closely their reactions parallel those of the general Tibanna mining industry.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 123, 'm41t', 'Friends and Family All Love It!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 124, 'm42o', 'Hi, friend! Like my hearty and forthright greeting? Every successful inventor knows that first impressions count. Yes! That''s why I''m investing considerable effort in the prototype for my electrode anti-surge sink. When investors see that handsome dark disk, how can they fail to buy it? But I need one more material. Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 125, 'm42s', 'That''s fine news. I''m happy to say that the impression you first made on me has not been in any way borne out, and I mean that as a high compliment. Thank you!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 126, 'm42t', 'First Impressions Count'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 127, 'm43o', 'Are you the product scout? No? Oh, good. I made an appointment to show off my new prototype for an adaptive propulsion-tuning system, but at the last moment the prototype seems to have -- well, never mind. To fix it, I need a certain rare material, and fast. Can you locate a supply for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 128, 'm43s', 'Good. I''ll send out my agent to get a good sample. I''ve contacted the product scout and delayed my appointment, but in the propulsion-tuning biz, every moment counts!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 129, 'm43t', 'Product Scout Appointment Endangered'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 130, 'm44o', 'I''m designing a licensed children''s toy based on an obscure Corellian HoloNet performer, Bop Thrombo the Shaky Droid. I can''t get the internal gyros to malfunction in the correct way to reproduce Bop Thrombo''s characteristic stagger. It looks like I need a particular material for the gyro lining. Can you find a source for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 131, 'm44s', 'I hope this will do the trick. Not a lot of folks have heard of Bop Thrombo, but this toy could make him a galactic star -- if it works right.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 132, 'm44t', 'Bop Thrombo the Shaky Toy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 133, 'm45o', 'I''ve got an interview very soon with a leading starship procurement agent. This fellow knows the ship-buying industry bow-to-stern. I''m rushing to get my prototype radioactivity re-transmuter working, but in my haste I inadvertently, uh -- well, never mind what I did. I just need a certain replacement material, and fast! Can you get it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 134, 'm45s', 'Thanks! I almost burned down my home in my last accident with this prototype, so I''m going to be extra-careful this time.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 135, 'm45t', 'Starship Buying Agent Interview'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 136, 'm46o', 'I have a delicate assignment -- the crafting of a new mandoviol for a very famous musician. Yes, you''ve heard of him. No, I can''t say whom. I''m using a variety of inventive materials in this instrument, and I''m having trouble finding one in particular. Can you locate a source for me? If you help, I might confide my patron''s name.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 137, 'm46s', 'Thank you for finding this source. I consulted with my patron, but sorry, he''s completely unwilling to let his identity be known. I don''t know what it is with these musicians!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 138, 'm46t', 'Fine Mandoviol for Big Star'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 139, 'm47o', 'You know how much work it takes to craft an entire vintage airspeeder in your garage? I''ve had to pull in parts from across this sector. The trouble I''ve had makes me wish I''d never seen that old Desler Gizh Koro-2 schematic. But the project continues. Now I need yet another specialized material. Can you locate a source for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 140, 'm47s', 'Thanks. This is going into the irradiation gas distributor pipe lining. At least, assuming I read the schematic right. I''ve often wondered if, when I finally complete this airspeeder, I''ll have the courage to go up in it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 141, 'm47t', 'Vintage Airspeeders Are a Challenge'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 142, 'm48o', 'How many times have you struggled with your airspeeder''s turbofan suspension modulator? I know, I know -- you''re talking to one who has suffered as you have. But now I have the solution! My new modulator prototype will guarantee a smooth airspeeder ride. All I need is the right material to polish the motivator. Can you find it for me?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 143, 'm48s', 'Brilliant! I intend to make a big, big splash in the hyper-competitive turbofan suspension modulator field, and you''re one of the little people that will help me to the top!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 144, 'm48t', 'An End to Turbofan Modulator Irritation'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 145, 'm49o', 'If there''s anything that gets my dander up, it''s a malfunctioning trash compactor. The stench has made my home unlivable for days! And these stupid maintenance droids can''t fix the old models -- wrong interface, you know. I finally worked up a replacement power converter, except that I need one more material. Can you find a source?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 146, 'm49s', 'Thank you. Now my maintenance droids are acting up too. Maybe it''s some kind of, I don''t know, contagious power-converter rot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 147, 'm49t', 'Trash Compactor on the Blink'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 148, 'm50o', 'Wow, when my cousin''s swoop bike hits top speed, you can feel the skin pulling back from your face. If you have skin, I mean. I ran that bike all over town, way fast. But I burned out the rear impeller, and it turns out this world doesn''t have a replacement. I''m rigging up a solution, but I need one more material. I hope you can find a source!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 149, 'm50s', 'That''s great. I can hardly wait to get that swoop running up and down the streets again.  So what if a few old folks complain?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 150, 'm50t', 'Swoop Bikes Require a Delicate Touch'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_neutral_easy.stf', 151, 'number_of_entries', '50'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'm1o', 'I''m sure glad you''re here! The Alliance is in constant need of resources, and good surveyors are in short supply too. If you could find us a rich source of this material, it would help out a lot.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'm1s', 'Keep up the good work, friend. The Alliance is counting on you.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'm1t', 'Surveyors Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'm2o', 'A recent Imperial raid on one of our hidden supply depots has us scrambling to replace lost resources. Locate a source for this material, and in the meantime I guess we''ll have to build a new place to store it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'm2s', 'Good timing! We''ll send worker droids out to collect what you found.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 6, 'm2t', 'Replace Lost Resources'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 7, 'm3o', 'I hear some of those surveying missions can get pretty hairy. Between dodging Imperial patrols, fighting off raiders, and battling hungry predators, it''s a wonder you find anything at all. See if you can locate this material for us, but be careful. You''re an important resource too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 8, 'm3s', 'You surveyors must have nerves of carbonite. Good work!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 9, 'm3t', 'Praise for Surveyors'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 10, 'm4o', 'You wouldn''t believe the sheer quantity of materials it takes to build or even repair a ship.We''re constantly in need of more sources of virtually everything, but right now one material is in incredibly short supply. Please find some as soon as you can. Our need is great!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 11, 'm4s', 'That''s great! I''ll get the droids out there immediately. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 12, 'm4t', 'In Short Supply'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 13, 'm5o', 'An Alliance freighter will be departing soon with supplies to be used in building a hidden High Command base. Although we''ve managed to load most of the materials needed, we still need more of one certain substance. The sooner you find it, the sooner the freighter can depart.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 14, 'm5s', 'We appreciate your hard work. You are a credit to the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 15, 'm5t', 'Construction Materials Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 16, 'm6o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" was recently boarded by Imperial soldiers who confiscated his cargo. The Alliance needed that material for the construction and repair of hyperdrive sequencer parts. Please locate a new source as soon as you can.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 17, 'm6s', 'Thanks! This will help keep us going untill the heat is off of our smuggler.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 18, 'm6t', 'Replace Confiscated Supplies'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 19, 'm7o', 'In the Alliance we''re forced to find supplies in creative ways. Should you be questioned while surveying, we have forged credentials that identify you as an Imperial survey officer who is surveying sites for hydroponics stations. That should stave off Imperial soldiers while you''re looking for this material.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 20, 'm7s', 'I''m glad your cover wasn''t blown. Maybe we can use it again.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 21, 'm7t', 'Imperial Survey Officer for a Day'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 22, 'm8o', 'Alliance researchers are adapting speeders to extremely cold climates. We need a new alloy that can handle the temperature variations the power generators are forced to endure. We need a major supply of a certain material. See what you can find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 23, 'm8s', 'I''ll say one thing for the Empire: They really inspire us to improve our technology.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 24, 'm8t', 'Developing a New Alloy'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 25, 'm9o', 'This new coolant we use in our Y-wing fighters may be more efficient than the old stuff, but it''s also more corrosive. We''re having serious leakage problems with our coolant storage system. We could use a rich source of a certain substance that can make a more resistant lining. '),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 26, 'm9s', 'That''s good news. The last thing we need is corrosive coolant leaking everywhere.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 27, 'm9t', 'Build a Better Storage Tank'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 28, 'm10o', 'An informant tells us that Imperial Security has hidden droidcams at many untapped sites for planetary resources. We need a rich deposit of a certain material, but you may have to travel off of the beaten track to find one that isn''t being monitored.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 29, 'm10s', 'Thanks! We''ll do a sweep before we send in a work detail, but it looks clear so far.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 30, 'm10t', 'Off the Beaten Path'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 31, 'm11o', 'An ambassador from the Outer Rim informs us that the Empire has stripped his world of a vital resource. The Alliance feels that if we provide a source for this material, they may look favorably on our cause. See what you can find.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 32, 'm11s', 'Typical of the Empire to strip a world of its resources and then leave. Thanks for helping out.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 33, 'm11t', 'Helping Aliens Helps Us'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 34, 'm12o', 'The Empire sometimes discards equipment just because it''s getting a little older. We manged to get our hands on some discarded weapon systems from an Imperial Star Destroyer. With a little reworking, they can help our blockade runners. Find us a supply of this material so our techs can finish adapting the weapons.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 35, 'm12s', 'We can''t afford to waste resources the way the Empire can. We appreciate your help in this matter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 36, 'm12t', 'Recycling at its Finest'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 37, 'm13o', 'We''re forced to scour the debris after major battles to salvage damaged equipment. After a recent engagement we managed to find some items that weren''t irreparably damaged, but we need a good source of a particular material to get started on repairs.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 38, 'm13s', 'Good work. I don''t know how you surveyors scrounge up everything we need to keep the Alliance going, but I''m glad you do!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 39, 'm13t', 'Using the Materials at Hand'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 40, 'm14o', 'I understand you''re someone who can find things. The Alliance can''t seem to beg, borrow, or smuggle enough of a certain material we need. I hope you can come up with an additional source so we won''t be forced to pay black-market rates.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 41, 'm14s', 'You really came through for us, and we won''t forget it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 42, 'm14t', 'Just Can''t Get Enough'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 43, 'm15o', 'Getting everything we need to manufacture fusial ion engines is risky. The Empire is always watching for large shipments of raw materials to unusual places. Fortunately we only need you to find a modest amount of this particular material, so you shouldn''t attract much attention. Ideally.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 44, 'm15s', 'Excellent! Now we just need to extract the stuff and get it offworld without anyone noticing.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 45, 'm15t', 'Material for Ion Engines'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 46, 'm16o', 'The Alliance recently came into posession of a sizable cache of  Old Republic weaponry. In order for us to keep the old HM blasters in good working order, we need a certain material for maintenance and repair. Can you locate it for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 47, 'm16s', 'Good job. Those Old Republic weapons may come in handy. -- Although I wouldn''t mind it if they found a cache of Corellian Double Brandy too.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 48, 'm16t', 'Keep Weapons in Working Order'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 49, 'm17o', 'One of our "procurement specialists" is tripling the price of parts for acceleration compensators. Too risky to transport, it seems. To help us cut costs, we''re sending surveyors in search of basic materials so we can build these parts. Find us a deposit of this material, please.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 50, 'm17s', 'It''s a good thing you found what we needed. Any fool knows you can''t pilot a starfighter without an acceleration compensator.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 51, 'm17t', 'Ever-Increasing Smuggler Costs'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 52, 'm18o', 'The Empire just blockaded one of our smuggling routes in the Outer Rim. We''re dangerously short of the materials we need to maintain our X-wing turbo impellers. If you can locate a source for one of these materials, we can try to rig a home-grown solution.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 53, 'm18s', 'Thanks! We''re trying to trace a new smuggling route now. But somehow there always seem to be more and more Imperial ships around every world.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 54, 'm18t', 'X-Wing Turbo Impeller Supply Crisis'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 55, 'm19o', 'Bad news. We just tried to break an Imperial blockade on an Outer Rim world, but the Empire was stronger there than we realized. We lost ships and good people. Now we''re coping with a shortage of materials, so we need local help. Find us a source for this material so we can send droid workers to mine it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 56, 'm19s', 'Thanks -- you''ve helped us bring our materials shortfall under control. If only it were that easy to replace the men and women we lost against the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 57, 'm19t', 'Blockade Busting Failed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 58, 'm20o', 'One of our pilots redirected half his Y-wing''s life support power into the coolant systems. "Big performance boost!" he said. I say, "Mind-bogglingly crazy!" He''s in the bacta tanks now. He''s burned out the ship''s main coolant pump, and we need a particular material to refurbish it. Can you locate a source for it?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 59, 'm20s', 'That''s fine, we''ll send out the droids to mine the stuff. Meanwhile, that pilot is out of the tanks now, so I''m going to give him a really good talking-to.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 60, 'm20t', 'Never Redirect Your Life Support!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 61, 'm21o', 'Some crazed Y-wing pilot discovered how to modify the pulse electromagnets in his ion jet engines to accelerate fuel injection. I''ve seen the performance statistics -- at those speeds I didn''t think a Y-wing could even hold together! So now we want a lot more of the material he added to the magnets. Can you locate a source?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 62, 'm21s', 'Okay, we''ll move fast to get into production. We need faster Y-wings, because the Empire is apparently rushing out some new improved TIE fighter.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 63, 'm21t', 'Crazed Y-Wing Pilot''s Discovery'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 64, 'm22o', 'Some tech, while fitting an R2 astromech droid aboard an X-wing, accidentally dropped it. The droid seemed fine, so we put it aboard anyway. When the pilot lifted off, the R2 unit accelerated the ship so fast the repulsorlift burned out. The pilot barely managed to land safely. Please locate a source for the material we need to repair the ship.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 65, 'm22s', 'Thank you. We diagnosed the R2 unit''s malfunction, and everything looks fine for now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 66, 'm22t', 'R2 Unit Malfunctions Can Be Nasty'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 67, 'm23o', 'An X-wing pilot got carried away during a battle and burned out his laser generators. He hightailed it back here for repairs. But we''re still waiting on a "procurement specialist" to get past Imperial blockades and resupply us. Can you head into the wilderness and locate a local source for the material we need?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 68, 'm23s', 'That''s good news. We''re proud of our X-wing pilots, but sometimes they get excitable. One burnout is usually all it takes to teach them better.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 69, 'm23t', 'X-Wing Pilot Got Carried Away'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 70, 'm24o', 'One of our outposts just uncovered Imperial tracking beacons planted in a new shipment of R4 astromech droids. They''re evacuating the base, but they have to leave behind some vital materials. We''re hiring surveyors like you to locate a local source of each material so we can restock the new base. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 71, 'm24s', 'Thanks. We''ll send out the worker droids right away, as soon as we screen them for Imperial tracking beacons.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 72, 'm24t', 'Droids Carrying Tracking Beacons'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 73, 'm25o', 'We''ve had to evacuate another base because of increased overflights by Imperial probe droids. We think we can refit some captured Empire "spoofing" devices to block the surveillance. But to do it, we need a certain material that''s in short supply right now. Can you locate a source?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 74, 'm25s', 'Thanks. I expect the problem of spoofing probe droids will be with us for a long time. But we have to try something.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 75, 'm25t', 'Spoofing Probe Droids'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 76, 'm26o', 'The last Imperial assault on one of our power stations left dangerous radioactives scattered across the landscape. We need to decontaminate the area before local wildllife starts dying or, worse, mutating. Our decontamination units need a particular material for optimal effectiveness. Can you locate a source of that material?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 77, 'm26s', 'Thank you. We should begin decontaminating the radioactive area shortly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 78, 'm26t', 'Decontaminate Radioactive Battle Site'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 79, 'm27o', 'The Empire hit us hard at an X-wing pilot training facility. The commander of Rogue Squadron, Wedge Antilles, barely escaped alive. The attack left the landscape contaminated with toxic liquid metal fuel. To decontaminate the area, our droids need a particular substance. We want you to locate a source, quickly.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 80, 'm27s', 'Good work. We''ll get on this fast. That liquid metal fuel can poison whole ecosystems if you don''t stop it quick.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 81, 'm27t', 'Rogue Squadron Pilot Facility Hit'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 82, 'm28o', 'The Empire took out one of our fleet resupply outposts just moments before a High Command leader was due to arrive. We diverted Ackbar in time, thank goodness. But to remedy the shortfall from the loss of the outpost, we need many sources of local raw materials. Can you locate a source for this one?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 83, 'm28s', 'You do good work. We''re sending out droid workers all over this world to mine replacement materials. Must be quite a sight; wish I could see it.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 84, 'm28t', 'Resupply Post Hit; Ackbar Escapes'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 85, 'm29o', 'The Empire took out our SpecForce base before we could blink. What''s worse, that base contained certain chemicals that now endanger the local environment. We need to decontaminate. Our droids require a certain material for the purification process. Can you locate a source of this material?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 86, 'm29s', 'Good. We have to move quickly, before those chemicals poison the wildlife. We had actually intended to poison a Grand Moff. Too late for that now.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 87, 'm29t', 'SpecForce HQ Blown Up'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 88, 'm30o', 'We blew up an Imperial depot that was refueling AT-AT walkers. We can''t celebrate our victory yet, though, because our assault released some kind of toxic Imperial chemicals into the biosphere. We have to decontaminate, because the Empire won''t. For that job, we need a source of a particular material. Can you help us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 89, 'm30s', 'We''ll start the decontamination procedures right away. That was quite an assault. We almost got General Maximillian Veers, but we were seconds too late.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 90, 'm30t', 'Destroyed AT-AT Refueling Depot'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 91, 'm31o', 'We just hit an Imperial factory that constructs Star Destroyer replacement parts. Apparently they have to be built in a gravitational field. We didn''t realize that destroying the factory would release toxic chemicals everywhere. To clean up the mess, our droids need a local supply of a certain material. Can you locate it for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 92, 'm31s', 'Thank you for your timely efforts. We are already starting the decontamination process. Next time we''ll try to measure the consequences of our assault.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 93, 'm31t', 'Star Destroyer Factory Releases Poisons');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 94, 'm32o', 'Someone got overeager and ordered an assault on an Imperial power core storage facility. I can''t think of many targets more likely to release poisonous chemicals when hit. That''s what happened, so we have to decontaminate. The Empire certainly won''t. Our droids need a certain material; can you find a local source for us?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 95, 'm32s', 'That''s certainly "local" enough for our purposes. Anything on this world counts as local to us. Thanks!'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 96, 'm32t', 'Destroyed Power Core Facility'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 97, 'm33o', 'We planned an assault on an Imperial research station doing gravity well experiments. When we arrived, the place was deserted. Everyone had vanished, seemingly in a moment. The place was intact but contaminated with strange radioactives. We have to decontaminate it, and for that we need a particular substance. Can you find a source?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 98, 'm33s', 'Thanks. The scouts at the deserted research station are reporting strange noises and odd visions. We''ll probably blow up the site from orbit.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 99, 'm33t', 'Deserted Imperial Gravity Well Lab'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 100, 'm34o', 'Our Special Forces made a daring capture of a Kuat Drive Yards noble merchant. They seized a prototype experimental hyperdrive. Our techs are looking it over, trying to figure it out. They think we need a specific substance to shield the drive from -- well, I didn''t understand that part. Anyway, can you locate a source of the material?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 101, 'm34s', 'I''m sorry to report that someone accidentally activated the Kuat experimental drive, and it vanished. But we''ll pay you for your time and trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 102, 'm34t', 'Repair a Prototype Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 103, 'm35o', 'Toughest battle I ever saw. We blew up an Imperial Army factory making Czerka Flamestrike flame carbines. The flames are still covering the countryside. We need an extinguishing chemical to handle these fires, fast. Processing the chemical requires a particular substance we''re short on. Can you locate a source?'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 104, 'm35s', 'I''m happy to report that the flames burned themselves out more quickly than we expected. Some chemical in the local foliage seems to function as an extinguisher. But thanks anyway. Your fee is attached.'),
('string/en/mission/mission_npc_survey_rebel_easy.stf', 105, 'm35t', 'Flame Extinguisher Needed'),
('string/en/mission/mission_object.stf', 1, 'destroy_mission', 'Destroy Mission'),
('string/en/mission/mission_object.stf', 2, 'deliver_mission', 'Deliver Mission'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Some local criminals have decided that staging violent protests against the Empire is an acceptable form of political expression. Such protests can sow unrest in a community and, as the Emperor teaches, popular discontent is a festering ground for rebellion and revolution. Sabotage and terrorism will not be far behind. We cannot allow these protesters to start down this path. We must show them the error of their ways. Visit their headquarters and burn it to the ground. No one will dare oppose the Emperor when we demonstrate the harsh repercussions. Can we count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'How could you have let these scum escape you? Now their poisonous discontent will spread throughout the community. These sorts of missions must be handled correctly. We are truly disappointed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Strange, we were certain those criminals were at those coordinates. We''ll check our intelligence on the matter. We appreciate your efforts nonetheless.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'We knew we could count on you. The Empire rewards its loyal servants. And our work is never done. Report to us again if you wish to continue serving the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Take out the violent protestors'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'The most poisonous influence in our society today is the Rebellion and its active sympathizers. Their opposition to the New Order leads to riots and the destruction of public property, in addition to the usual litany of political offenses. The Empire has no choice but to label them the worst form of criminals. Because they believe they serve a cause, Rebel sympathizers imagine themselves to be safe from the Empire''s wrath. You must show them they are not. Destroy their base of operations in the area. Let them know that Imperial justice does not abide outlaws of any kind. Is this something you can do?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'If we do not deal effectively with these sympathizers then their numbers will only increase. This failure is a great disappointment to us. Now we''ll have to hunt these inciters down one by one.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'It seems the location of their base was a bit more difficult to lock down than we had initially thought. We shall investigate this matter further. Your efforts are noted.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'You handled the operation perfectly. Excellent. We could use more agents like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Take out the Rebel sympathizers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Local authorities have reasonable success with common crimes such as vandalism. But when these activities turn against Imperial icons and miliary recruitment offices, the vandals become political offenders and the ISB must step in. The Empire stands for security and stability. We cannot allow these criminals to undermine the people''s faith in the galactic regime. The Empire needs someone to make an example of them, to demonstrate the consequences of such seditious acts. Are you that someone? We hope so.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'For every criminal that goes unpunished, another five are encouraged to act. You have let us down. We hope you will make it up to the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Those vandals are elusive. We''ll try and track them down again and hopefully you can take care of them for good this time. Criminals cannot hope to escape us forever.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Thanks to your decisive action, vandals will think twice before damaging Imperial targets in the future. Well done. The Empire will watch your career with great interest.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Take out the vandals'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'While the Empire appreciates the contribution of non-human species to the galactic labor and service industries, our xenosociologists have written detailed policies concerning the legal rights, cultural restrictions and limits to authority of all alien species. In the New Order, non-humans know their proper role. Unfortunately a group of local activists has been handing out anti-Imperial pamphlets and propoganda denouncing our treatment of alien species. This can only lead to civil unrest, which benefits no one. It must stop. We want this group''s headquarters demolished and their disruptive propaganda halted. Can you take care of this for us? Such a service would go a long way to proving your loyalty to the Empire.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'If the activities of these group are not halted, pro-alien sentiments will continue to sow discontent within the Empire. Do you want this sort of failure on your record, citizen? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Perhaps the group has moved their base of operations. Someone must have tipped them off. We will find both them and the informant and make sure they are punished.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Opposing the well-researched policies of the New Order is the epitome of folly. You have helped demonstrate that most effectively. Well done, citizen. The Empire''s gratitude goes with you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Remove pro-alien demonstrators'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Our youth informants have uncovered a Rebel, positioned as a local school teacher, corrupting our children with anti-Imperial propaganda. Preying upon the innocence of youth is treachery of the most despicable kind. As if this crime were not loathsome enough, credible sources report that he is inciting local delinquents to commit robbery and vandalism against Imperial citizens and property. We''ve located this teacher''s office, which he uses as a meeting place for these young criminals. We need to teach this Rebel parasite and his hoodlums a lesson they will never forget. Can COMPNOR count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Do you realize how dangerous it is to have Rebels in our school systems? This matter needed immediate attention and you have failed to resolve it to our satisfaction. We are highly displeased with your performance.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'The teacher was no doubt alerted by Rebel informants and fled. It disturbs us that the Rebels might have tampered with our intelligence reports. We''ll find this teacher sooner or later. We hope you''ll return and help us solve this issue.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'The Commission for the Preservation of the New Order'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Excellent work, loyal citizen. COMPNOR is immensely pleased and looks forward to employing you in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Save the Empire''s youth'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'A certain deranged citizen has become notorious by mocking the Emperor. This individual has made a career of impersonating our beloved leader, much to the amusement of the locals. His goal is to ridicule the New Order and foment sympathy for the Rebellion. While this behavior in itself is treasonous, reports now indicate that he has been adopted as a mascot by a local swoop gang and is coaxing them to masquerade as Imperial agents. The ISB can no longer allow this charade to continue. We must show this buffoon just how amusing we find his antics. We know the location of the swoop gang''s lair. Do the Empire a favor and blast it to pieces. Demonstrate that loyal citizens will not tolerate any mockery of the New Order. Do you think you can do this for us?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'We are terribly disappointed that you failed to punish this individual. Do you agree that this will encourage others to mock our noble Emperor? And to think the ISB was considering working with you in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'There''s no telling where this lunatic ended up. We believe he moves around quite a bit, which is how he''s escaped us this long. No matter, we''ll find him eventually.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Good work, citizen. Witnesses report that the explosion of the swoop gang''s lair was as bright as the power core of a battle station. This mock Emperor cannot have survived.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Punish an insane citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'The Empire prefers a concensus of support among economic leaders in a given area.  Dissent is bad for business.  However, sometimes gentle pressure is not enough to reclaim a stubborn citizen from his anti-Imperial positions.  When a certain local merchant expressed sympathy for Rebel goals, we ordered a surprise inspection of his place of business.  Imperial Customs performed their job well, immediately discovering several units of contraband in his possession.  We respectfully allowed him his freedom but gave him a clear warning against future infractions.\n\nUnfortunately our generosity did not sway him from his unlawful opinions.  In fact his criticism of the Empire is louder than ever.  This can only polarize local leadership and destabilize the economy.  Therefore we have decided to take punitive action.  As his shop is a proven transfer point for Rebel contraband, it must be destroyed.  Be aware that he has gathered other sympathizers to safeguard him.  Resistance is inevitable.  The action must be swift and merciless.  COMPNOR is generous to the law-abiding citizens of the Empire, but enemies must never be tolerated.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'This task was fairly simple and yet you failed to accomplish it. Perhaps your heart is simply not into this sort of work. Or do you feel some pity for this Rebel sympathizer?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'The Rebels must have warned this citizen. We must spend some time tracking them down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Supporting Rebels can be very dangerous, don''t you agree? Bravo, citizen, and well done. We''ll assist the local authorities in tracking the culprit himself, but it will be difficult to find any clues in all that burned wreckage. Please see us again for future assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Teach Rebel sympathizer a lesson'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'In return for safeguarding the economy of a region, COMPNOR graciously requests from all shopkeepers a courtesy discount for Imperial military personnel.  A certain local merchant has been reluctant to grant this request.  At the ISB this constitutes a warning sign for possible seditious tendencies.  When our agents pressed the merchant on this point, he responded with physical resistance.  Presently he has hired a small gang of local ruffians to surround his shop and decline access to anyone in an Imperial uniform.  His contempt for authority has troubled the military and disrupted the business of other merchants in the area.  The ISB must end this conflict before it escalates further.  The merchant and his ruffians must be eliminated and the shop burned to the ground.  This will restore the confidence of military personnel and assure other shopkeepers that the Empire will not abide disturbances to the business community.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Why did you fail to accomplish this mission? Was it too difficult for you? The ISB is most disappointed. Should we keep an eye on you, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'These shops blur one into another so that after a while we can''t tell them apart. We''ll straighten this out, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Good work, citizen. Now other merchants may continue their proud cooperation with COMPNOR''s gracious requests.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Teach a local shopkeeper a lesson'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Rebel activists are like sand fleas.  You tolerate one or two and soon you''ve got a whole swarm to deal with. Because of this, the ISB has a policy to scratch them out when they first appear in an area. Otherwise they''ll infest a community and disseminate their slander until the whole population is on edge. On other planets we''ve seen them ruin productivity and even incite riots and vandalism. In the Rebel mind, such chaos is a worthy goal. The ISB takes exception with this dangerous philosophy.\n\nYou may have noticed that their propaganda has been popping up in this area, and not just the usual anti-Imperial ravings, either. They''re distributing pamphlets and holograms on datadisc purporting to show the destruction of Alderaan at the hands of the Empire. As you know, that paranoid accusation has long been disproven. Luckily we''ve tracked down the facility where this libelous material is being created. Like the first fleas, they must be scratched out. We need this structure blasted into atoms. Could you take care of this for us? COMPNOR would be most appreciative. We are all working toward the common goal of peace and security in the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'This was not a difficult assignment. Perhaps we must reconsider our association. This is most disappointing.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'It seems we were fed incorrect information regarding the whereabouts of that propaganda office. We''ll have the informants who gave us that information arrested.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'Bravo, citizen, but our work is just beginning. We must find every copy of any libelous materials being used by the Rebellion and destroy it. Come see us again, I''m sure we''ll have more work for you to do.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Destroy Rebel propaganda'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'Children are the Empire''s greatest asset.  We cherish them all, even the unlucky ones orphaned and impoverished by Rebel terrorists. Our social engineers work tirelessly to rescue these unfortunates from the streets and place them in the care of Imperial instruction camps. But the Rebels have more sinister plans for them.  In this area, for example, Rebel informants have forced a gang of young urchins to spy on Imperial installations. Treason, it seems, leads to atrocities like child endangerment.  We cannot allow this to continue.\n\nYou are an upstanding citizen of the Empire, or you would not be reading this.  The ISB needs your help to stop this outrage. We can''t have these terrorists endangering children. We want you to pay a visit to their hangout and vaporize it. COMPNOR will duly reward this service to the community.  Together we can remove this threat and ensure our children a safe and contented future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'Your failure endangers the lives of our children, citizen. How sad that this is the case.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'Someone was assisting this Rebel informants and obviously helped them get away. We''ll put our agents on the job and find this criminal.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'The children may sleep peacefully tonight knowing this terrorist has been removed. You have our thanks, citizen. I''m sure this reward will demonstrate how grateful COMPNOR is for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Remove menace to loyal youth'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'Gangs are a continual source of trouble for local authorities. They endanger and exploit the peaceful citizens of the community. One gang in particular has been harrassing an Imperial recruiter in this area, so the ISB is assisting in the case. Unfortunately we have reason to believe that the Rebels are helping the gang to elude apprehension. A stormtrooper squad was unsuccessful in tracking them down, which is impossible unless the gang received outside assistance. After some work, though, the ISB has found the leader of this gang. I''m sure this individual thinks he has escaped Imperial justice, but he is wrong. We want you to destroy this gang leader''s hideout as an example to the others. Can COMPNOR count on your aid, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'That gang leader was no doubt aiding the Rebels. Your failure could cost us the lives of many loyal Imperial servants. Do you not wish to serve the New Order, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'Now we understand why the stormtrooper squad had such trouble tracking this gang down. It seems they are still receiving help from the Rebels.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Effective work, citizen. We''d hate for our recruiters to start questioning their career choices. Here is a small token of COMPNOR''s gratitude.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Teach a gang a lesson'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Rebel data slicers have caused much trouble for the Empire. They intercept and decode secret communiques, they send bogus reports to Imperial Intelligence, and generally hamper the Empire''s operations. This not only hurts our ability to pursue Rebel terrorists, but it''s also a danger to civilians and Imperial personnel. Happily, a loyal informant has helped us locate one of these slicer hubs. Can you help us by obliterating this hub? We would be ever so appreciative.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'Slicers are a threat to the safety of the Empire. How could you have failed to accomplish this simple mission? The New Order expects loyal citizens to contribute to their own security.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'Who do you think was responsible for supplying us with this false information, citizen? Correct. A Rebel slicer. We''ll find this slippery eel soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'Imperial Security Bureau'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'One less slicer hub to menace the Empire. Hail the Emperor! COMPNOR is very proud of you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Burn the data slicer hub'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_imperial_easy_civilian.stf', 85, 'number_of_entries', '12'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'I don''t have a lot of time to spend trying to sell you on taking this mission. You either need the credits, or you don''t. But here''s the situation: Anchorhead is my home. Or, it''s the closest thing I''ve ever known to a home. I have a good job running the Tosche power station, a great girl, and enough friends to keep me from going stir-crazy. And the folks around here, they look up to me. So, when anyone from Anchorhead has a problem, it becomes my problem too. Recently, my buddy Deak was attacked by womp rats. He barely escaped with his life. In order to protect my people, I''ve vowed to wipe ''em all out. I''ve located quite a few womp rat nests, and now that Deak can finally talk again, he''s told me about a few more. If you''re interested in helping out, I''ll transmit the coordinates to one of these nests. Just destroy it and I''ll slip you a few credits.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'I''m beginning to think that Tatooine''s womp rats are mutating or something... They''re tougher and more vicious than ever. I am sorry you got hurt trying to defend Anchorhead, but it''s your neck. If you didn''t think you could handle the job, you shouldn''t have accepted it. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Deak is on a rampage. He''s so upset at being mauled by the womp rats, he bought himself a new blaster rifle and has taken to hunting them down himself. I think he just destroyed the nest I told you about, so you can give up the chase.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 4, 'm1l', 'Fixer, Anchorhead''s self-proclaimed defender, is hiring mercenaries to kill womp rats on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Fixer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Good job on that nest. Deak would congratulate you himself, but he still hasn''t regained the use of his arms or legs and can''t even hold a datapad. Anyway, I really do appreciate your help here. There are still too many womp rat nests out in the desert, but we''re making progress.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Deak''s Defender'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'The Galactic Pest Authority recognizes the womp rat as Tatooine''s most dangerous predator. Not only does the womp rat attack and kill sentient beings with surprising frequency, the creature also spreads disease, destroys livestock, fouls water supplies, and consumes key crops. When one considers that womp rats breed uncontrollably throughout all areas of Tatooine, it is obvious that the creature poses a significant threat to public safety. In order to control the womp rat populations, we are offering rewards for the destruction of womp rat nests.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'The Galactic Pest Authority is distressed to report that the number of deaths attributed to womp rats has increased dramatically this season. Failure to eliminate key womp rat nests has been cited as the primary factor in this increase.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'The Galactic Pest Authority is pleased to report that a recent womp rat-specific plague has swept through the populations of Tatooine''s most dangerous carnivore. The womp rat population is now at comfortable levels. As a result, your mission has been cancelled.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 11, 'm2l', 'Womp rats pose a significant threat to Tatooine citizens and must be eliminated.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Galactic Pest Authority'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'The Galactic Pest Authority is pleased to report that Tatooine''s womp rat population has been reduced significantly due to the destruction of several key nests. As one of many operatives responsible for this decrease, you will receive a substantial financial reward, along with the thanks of a grateful planet.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Womp Rat Emergency'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nWe Jawas keep to sandcrawlers, except to pull metal, scraps, treasure from the sand... When we travel on foot, our robes dragging on the ground, we become prey for hungry, nasty womp rats. We Jawas will give credits to adventurers, heroes, mercenaries who kill the womp rats before they maul, murder, mutilate us! Destroy, wreck, burn the nest we have spotted from our sandcrawler!\n\nWimateeka, Jawa Clan Leader'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nJawas still bitten, gnawed, mutilated by womp rats in the desert! It is not safe for us to leave the sandcrawler! You did not help the Jawas, you will not receive your credits.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nUgly, diseased womp rats have stopped chewing on Jawas! We can leave the safety of our sandcrawler again, but you were not the Jawa hero. You will not receive our Jawa credits.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 18, 'm3l', 'Jawas are in danger from womp rats'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Wimateeka'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nMost exalted hero of the Jawas! Thank you a hundred times for making the desert sands safe, welcoming, home to the Jawas. We will now pay you a sizable, big reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Jawa Biters'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'Another one of my eopies is dead, dragged down into the dirt and eaten alive by a swarm of evil womp rats. At this rate, the womp rats will have killed by entire herd by next season. The only way to stop them is to kill ''em at the source: their nest needs to be completely destroyed. I found the nest, but I don''t have the weapons to get rid of it. I''ll hire you to do the job for me. Help me keep my eopies safe. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'The womp rats returned and took another of my eopies. A small calf this time. I heard it screaming as they tore it apart, but there was nothing I could do. As long as that nest remains, my eopies will keep dying.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'It''s the strangest thing... The eopie killings have suddenly stopped. Maybe the womp rats have moved on, or maybe they were wiped out by a dune lizard. Whatever the case, my eopies are safe and I won''t be needing you to destroy that womp rat nest.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 25, 'm4l', 'A local rancher has lost several eopies to womp rat attacks. He''s hiring an exterminator to eliminate the dangerous creatures.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 26, 'm4o', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Thank you so much for taking out that womp rat nest. The past few nights, I''ve been unable to sleep, haunted by sounds of my eopies being eaten alive... The crunching bones and womp rat hisses, and the moans from my pour eopies... It''s been terrible. But with their nest destroyed, I doubt the womp rats will be back. Enjoy your reward, friend.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Eopie Emergency'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'By Imperial decree, all able-bodied men, women, and even aliens have been asked to take up arms against the sudden influx of womp rats into civilized areas of Tatooine. These vermin, viewed by many to be the most dangerous creatures on Tatooine, have been sighted throughout the desert, often near major settlements. Womp rat-related deaths have increased three-fold in the past two seasons, and a recent bantha stampede outside Bestine has been blamed on a womp rat attack. Those individuals willing to perform their civic duty will be assigned an identified womp rat nest to locate and destroy. Anyone who serves the Empire and the good people of Tatooine in this manner will be duly rewarded.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Your assigned womp rat nest has not been destroyed. You have failed in your mission and will not receive any payment for your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'Due to an computer error at Imperial Intelligence on Tatooine, you were inadvertently assigned a nest that was first identified over five seasons ago. Since that first sighting, the nest has evidently been destroyed or disappeared. We apologize for the inconvenience, but Imperial regulations forbid us from reimbursing you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 32, 'm5l', 'A rise in womp rat attacks has prompted swift response from local authorities, who are now hiring mercenaries to destroy the creature''s nests.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Bestine Imperial Security Department'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Your assigned womp rat nest has been successfully destroyed, and your duty as a citizen of or visitor to Tatooine has been upheld. You will be rewarded for your civic responsibility. Congratulations on behalf of all Tatooine civilians and Imperials forces stationed on the planet.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Civic Duty'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature_womp_rats_tatooine.stf', 36, 'number_of_entries', '5'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Some local thugs have been harassing the decent people of this neighborhood. They loiter around this abandoned shop and get high on glitterstim. We''re offering a reward to any citizen with the guts to go in there and blast this shop to pieces. That would certainly get the point across, eh? Most of these thugs are bullies and cowards anyway, so we doubt they''d give you much trouble. Do you accept?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Well now all you''ve done is to get them all riled up. They''ll probably go and get some more friends and really make it tough for us. Thanks for nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'They must have moved on. We''ll keep our eyes out for them.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'A Group of Concerned Citizens'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Told you those creeps wouldn''t put up much of a fight. Bet they don''t come around here no more. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Run off the thugs'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'Some local glitterstim pusher and a group of thugs has set up shop in our neighborhood and we want them out. We know where they hang out and need someone to go in there and redecorate the place (preferably with blasters). There''s a decent reward in it for the brave individual that succeeds in driving those slugs away. Will you be our neighborhood''s saviour? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'If these pushers were working for a bigger gang we''ll have plenty of trouble now. Thanks for trying anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'They just moved their hangout. We''re sure they''re still in the neighborhood. Could you check back with us later?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'That''s showing those poison-pushers who''s boss. Good work, citizen. The Empire could use more upstanding folk like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Stop the drug dealers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'There''s been an increase in break-ins around here recently. We know who''s behind it but we can''t collect enough evidence to get the local authorities to make arrests. It''s time we took the law into our own hands. We''re offering a reward to anyone who can run the criminals behind those thefts out of town. Blasting their hideout to atoms ought to get the point across. If you decide to help us out, we''ll send you the coorindates to this wretched hive of scum and villainy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'You don''t run them out of town, you don''t get the reward. Them''s the rules. Better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'These criminals are sneakier than we thought. We''ll have to work harder to track them down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'We sleep easier at night now. Good job, citizen. Hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Stop the thieves'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'A bunch of slimy slugs have moved into the neighborhood and have been harassing our wives and daughters. We''ve heard of these guys. They were run out of another town after they assaulted a young woman. We feel these predators will repeat that pattern soon, especially since many of our fairer family members work late at the factories. We need some of integrity and of true grit to make sure these criminals don''t endanger anyone. We know where these creeps have set up shop and are certain they would vacate the premises if their lair were blasted to pieces. Can you help us? There''s a reward in the offering.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'They''re sure to hang around now. We suppose it was a valiant attempt. Or so we have to assume.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'These shifty womp rats scatter pretty quickly when the light of the law is brought to bear on them. They''ll be back.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Well struck, citizen! Our womenfolk thank you as do we. Enjoy the reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Get rid of slimy predators'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'A shyster has been cheating some older retired folks out of their life savings. This creep goes around selling bogus cruises on luxury starliners that don''t exist. Further, this slimeball has hired some local toughs, thinking that their presence will scare away any citizens seeking to get their money back. It''s time we put a stop to this activity. We''re offering a reward to the brave and honest individual who blasts this scum''s headquarters to pieces and makes sure they don''t plague another town ever again. If you decide that individual is you, let us know and we''ll send you the coordinates to the creep''s lair.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Likely they''ll just move on to another town and ruin even more lives. Maybe you should track them down and finish the job you accepted?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'They may have moved on already. We''ll keep looking for them.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Good work! No one has the right to cheat decent folk out of their life savings. You''ve made sure that point was made, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Smash the shyster'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'The same brutish thug has mugged half a dozen decent people in the last month, one of which died last night as a result of the injuries. That person was my father. I''d prefer to handle this animal on my own terms rather than get the local authorities involved. I''ll pay a substantial reward to any citizen brave enough to help me get justice for my dead father. Slime like this want us to believe that life in the universe is cheap. Well I''ve got news for that slug - life is not cheap and the price of a life is a life. I hope you can help my father''s soul find peace. The coordinates to this predator''s lair await your acceptance of this mission.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'I''m sorry this villain got away. I hope that someone, somewhere eventually puts an end to this piece of filth''s activities.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'This murderer will not escape me. I''ll track them down and make them pay regardless of how long it takes and even if it''s the last thing I do.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'An Enraged Daughter'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Finally, my father''s soul can rest. Thank you, citizen. Take the reward, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Stop the murderous mugger'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Have you ever heard of the Vibrodagger Killer? We think we''ve finally tracked this heinous murderer down. They''re hiding in a small abandoned settlement near here. We believe there may be other murderers hiding there with the killer. The time for justice is at hand. We need someone to go in there and wipe that place out. Burn it and everyone in it to the ground. Those filthy murderers deserve nothing better. A reward awaits the successful agent of justice. Are you that agent?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'The murders will likely continue. We can''t believe you let this animal escape. We are disappointed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'They must have known we were hiring someone to come after them and moved. We''ll track them down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'That should put an end to these horrible crimes. Assuming it was the actual Vibrodagger Killer in that settlement, that is. You''ve earned your reward in any case.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Stop the Vibrodagger Killer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'A gang of hooligans has been terrorizing our neighborhood for months now. Their favorite tactic is to hurl homemade firebombs at passing speeders. So far three people have been killed by these attacks. The local authorities are already swamped with work and can''t devote the time necessary to stop these criminals. We need an independent agent to take up the cause of justice for us. We''re offering a decent reward to anyone that blasts this gang''s hangout to pieces. If the gang members get caught in the blast, so much the better. You willing to help clean up our community, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'The gang will more than likely continue firebombing speeders. More innocent lives will be lost. We wish you''d been able to take care of it, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'They must have gone into hiding. We''ll find them.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Looks like you gave those thugs a taste of their own medicine. Good job! Our neighborhoods could use more folks like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Drive out the destructive gang');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'There''s a gang of space trash that has decided to set up a protection racket in our area. Many of the local merchants have been forced to pay protection money after one shop was blown to pieces with the shop owner and his family still inside. The gang is paying bribes to the local law enforcement authorities so they ignore these criminal activities. We need someone to pay like with like and blow the gang''s hideout to atoms. This agent of justice will be rewarded for their time and efforts, of course. The coordinates await your acceptance.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'The gang will want revenge for us hiring an agent to deal with them. We wish you''d been able to get rid of them for good.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'Maybe the bribes they were paying the local law enforcement agency were not enough and the gang moved on. They may return, though. Check back with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'We guess the gang forgot to pay their own protection money. Hehehe! Good work, citizen. The money is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Stop protection racket thugs'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'A local glitterstim dealer got my son addicted to that poison and now my boy is rotting in an Imperial prison while the dealer continues to pedal their filth. It''s time someone put a stop to this criminal''s activities. I''m offering a reward to any citizen that goes into that dealer''s lair and blasts everything in sight. If the dealer and their thug friends are there, blast them too. If you accept, I''ll transmit the coordinates to the dealer''s hangout. That nest of silica parasites needs to be cleaned out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'The glitterstim will continue to flow through the streets and more kids will get addicted. Your failure is their misfortune.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'The dealer has picked another spot to push their poison. I must track this dealer down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'An Angry Father'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'You''re an effective agent of justice, citizen. You''ve made the streets safer for our youth. This is one reward I am happy to pay.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Stop glitterstim dealer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'My cousin was taken from me by a vicious gang of cutthroats operating in the area. I want someone to attack their hangout and blast every single one of those murderers to bits. Leave nothing standing. This gang''s attacks have claimed many lives and shattered many families. Please help me find justice. I will reward you for your time. And our community will thank you for your service. Will you help me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'The attacks will continue unabated. I must seek another agent of justice, one who will not fail.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'The gang must have been tipped off and gone into hiding. My friends and I will find where they''ve disappeared to.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'A Determined Relative'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Well done, citizen. Now that you''ve killed the gangster that my cousin became, their soul can finally find rest and peace. Ever since my cousin started leading that vicious gang, I knew they were no longer the loving individual I grew up with - that person was truly dead. You''ve earned this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Stop violent gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'A band of crooks kidnapped my young son several weeks ago and demanded a ransom. Before it could be paid, my dear son, who suffered from a rare form of asthma, died while being held by the kidnappers. The band fled the area but I''ve managed to track them down. I know they''ll do this again to some other unlucky parent. Fortunately, I have the means to provide a substantial reward to anyone who can end the careers of these kidnappers and gain justice for my dead son. Will you accept?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'I will not rest until I have justice for my son. These murderers will not escape my vengeance for long.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'They have fled my vengeance yet again. I will find them one way or another.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'A Vengeful Mother'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'You have my eternal gratitude. Now finally my son and I can find peace. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Stamp out the kidnappers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_gangster.stf', 85, 'number_of_entries', '12'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Pirates are a plague on interstellar shipping. Those murderous thieves end up costing the Empire millions of credits each year, not to mention the resources necessary to hunt them down or the terrible loss of life their attacks incur. One way we can hit those pirates hard is by cutting their access to safe ports and hideouts. It''s not easy to hide a spaceship, even the smaller fighters employed by some of these rogues. We know of several suspicious outposts big enough to contain landing bays. We need the help of upstanding citizens to blast these outposts to pieces. We compensate for results not attempts. Do you think you can help keep the star lanes safe?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Wish we could pay you the money but your efforts don''t quite merit that. Come back when you can finish the job.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'We''re constantly updating this list so some of these coordinates may be bogus. Check back with us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Good work, citizen. Keep at it and we''ll keep paying you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Take out the pirates'' landing bays'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'If pirates don''t have working ships, they can''t practice their despicable trade. We''ve learned of several small storage facilities in the area that house a wide assortment of spare ship parts. We''re fairly certain that these are pirate stashes, especially given the shady characters that are often seen guarding these places. Our own personnel are already stretched rather thin but the Empire has granted us additional credits to hire independent agents to help us take care of the pirate problem. We need someone to blast these facilities to atoms. You may encounter some armed resistance, but hey, these are dangerous criminals we''re dealing with after all. Can you help?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Leaving working parts in those structures does not help us stop pirates. No results, no rewards.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Some of these coordinates may be incorrect. Our contacts were not certain which ones were legit and which were bogus. We thought we''d check them all.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Pirate ships floating uselessly in space is an image we like, citizen. Good work in helping us to ground those marauding vessels.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Blow up the pirates'' spare parts'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Ever wonder where pirates store their ill-gotten goods, citizen? We''ve discovered a few places and we need them destroyed. Our agents are too busy investigating murders and violent crimes to attend to this matter themselves so we''ve decided to turn to you - the average upstanding citizen. We''ll compensate you for every storage facility on our list that you blast to atoms. No questions asked, just go in blasting and take out anyone trying to stand in your way. We''ll transmit the coordinates to you as soon as you accept.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Wouldn''t exactly call that "blasting the place to atoms." Guess we weren''t clear, huh? Try again if you''d like.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'We knew some of the coordinates on this list would be outdated. Comes with the territory of investigaion, I''m afraid.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Job well done, citizen. The money is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Blast pirate''s stash'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'A group of known pirates have started hanging around an abandoned settlement. That place is beginning to attract all manner of scum. We''re fairly certain they deal glitterstim spice out of there and no telling what else. Can you imagine what sorts of other criminal activities are going on there even as you read this? We''ve had enough. We want to hire someone to blast that den of thieves into oblivion. Do you think you can help us keep our communities free of these parasites? We''ll send along the coordinates to the settlement as soon as we have your confirmation.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'Ever heard of stirring up a hornet''s nest? You have to completely get rid of those things not just bang them up a bit.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'We''ll check why our coordintes seemed to be bogus. Thanks for your help anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'That''s showing them, citizen. Those space slugs will think twice about crossing our path. You''ve earned your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Demolish the pirates'' hangout'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Those thieving pirates wouldn''t be able to operate if it weren''t for their fences. After all, it''s not exactly as if those rogues could just traipse down to the local market with all their stolen goods, now is it? Those darn fences are just as culpable as the murderers they deal with as far as we''re concerned. We''ve tracked down a few of these "blood money traders" and want their operations terminated. Many of these fences are former pirates themselves who either have grown too old to continue their murderous careers or else suffered enough physical damage to force an early retirement. If we provide you with the locations of these fences, will you make sure they pay the price for dealing with these killers? Help us save innocent lives. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'If fences smell trouble they''ll disappear and become quite difficult to find. You must execute a definitive strike, citizen, which you obviously did not do.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'These fences are slippery characters. Many of them may have paid informants to lie about their whereabouts.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'If we make piracy unprofitable, perhaps it will end. You''re certainly doing your part, citizen. Congratulations.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Take out the fences'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'Like all vermin, pirates need holes they can crawl down into when they''re in danger of being exterminated. We''ve located some of these safehouses in our area and want these places blasted into oblivion. We''re offering a decent reward to any citizen who can help us get rid of these vermin-infested places. If you think you''ve got what it takes, accept this mission and we''ll send you the coordinates to some of these wretched hovels. Help keep our streets clean!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'If you don''t completely destroy their refuge, the vermin just dig in deeper. We wish you could have been more successful, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'Some of those coordinates may be wrong, citizen, it''s true. Just cross off the bad ones and check with us for the good ones. We appreciate your efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'As an Exterminator for Justice, citizen, you shine like a supernova. Keep up the excellent work and remember that your children will inherit this galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Blast pirate''s hideout'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'I lost my beautiful wife in a dastardly pirate raid a year ago. Since that time, I''ve spent every waking moment and my entire fortune tracking down the pirate captain that led that cowardly attack. Now, I''ve finally managed to track that blackguard down. The time for my dead wife''s vengeance is at hand. How I wish I could be the actual instrument of that devil''s demise but alas the attack that robbed me of my wife left me a physical wreck. That''s why I need someone like you. Help me avenge my dear wife. Her voice cries out from beyond oblivion for justice. If successful, you will walk away with both my gratitude and a handsome reward. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'Will no one help my wife find eternal peace? Why is the galaxy so unfair? Why?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'That wretched space slug is more slippery than a fleek eel! I''ll find where they''ve slithered off to. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'A Justice Seeker'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'My thanks, friend. I can now join my beloved wife wherever she may be. You''ve helped two wayward souls find each other again. Farewell.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Avenge a murder'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'Oh, a pirate''s life is a terrible thing. That''s right, I used to run in those villainous circles myself until the treacherous nature of the scum around me brought me to ruin and almost robbed me of my life. Now, as the tragic and tortured soul that I''ve become, I seek only one thing - to make things right with the folks whose lives I so callously ruined. And I''d like to start by bringing my former "partner" to justice. Aye, that womp rat is richly deserving of a painful and gruesome death (for all those innocents that were slaughtered by that devil, of course) and I hope to play some part in making sure those wrongs are redressed. I''d attend to this matter personally, but you see I''ve taken holy vows never again to shed blood again. But seeing as there are others in the galaxy not burdened by this noble stricture, I''ve decided to offer a reward to anyone who can help me achieve my quest. I hope that someone is you, friend. Say aye and the coordinates to this putrid pile''s hideout will be yours. Please, for the sake of the lost little ones, blast away at everything in sight. Bless you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Hark! Do you hear that? Methinks it''s the souls of the darling little ones crying out for vengeance and justice. A shame you couldn''t satisfy their pleas.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Those coordinates were wrong? Well blast! I bet my transmission was sabotaged by that devil. I''ll-- I mean, we''ll make them pay, won''t we?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'A Reformed Soul'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Well struck, friend! Did you burn the place to the ground? Were there any of those murderous pirates inside the struture when it went up? Oh how I wish I could have heard the agonized screams of the unjust. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Help avenge a betrayal'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'There''s been a sudden increase of pirate activity in this sector. We investigated and discovered a secret refueling depot that those rogues had built to aid them in launching attacks from this system. We''re in need of a professional problem solver to get rid of this refueling station so those criminals stop visiting our planet. There will be adequate compensation for the being who succeeds. Can you lend a helping hand, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'If the refueling depot is not gone, those pirates will just keep coming back. We''re sorry you couldn''t take care of this for us, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'We could have sworn that was the location of that depot. We''ll cross-reference those coordinates with satellite control and see why there was an error. Check back with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'That should discourage those thieving vermin to steer clear of this system. Good work, citizen. Hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Take out the pirates'' refueling depot'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'An old starship repair shop was purchased recently by a newcomer. Didn''t think much of it until we started getting reports of suspicious activity around the shop at odd hours of the night. After an investigation, we discovered that the newcomer is actually a former smuggler whose new career consists of serving as a mechanic to well-known pirates. Tragically, the contact who helped us discover this information paid for it with his life - we found him a few days ago stuffed in a crate of alluvial dampers. These murderers must be stopped and justice must be served. Can you help us put this criminal out of business, citizen?  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'This rogue will probably just resettle somewhere else now. A shame you couldn''t have put these criminals out of business for good.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'Our contact sent us those coordinates. Maybe the pirates forced him to send an erroneous transmission before he was killed?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Good job, citizen. Justice is served today. We hope you decide to work for us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Take out pirates'' repair shop'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'In the event of his death, my master instructed me to transmit this request via the HoloNet to all available terminals. I am to send a generous amount of credits to the being that can successfully destroy a small landing bay, the coordinates to which I am to transmit upon receiving someone''s acceptance of this mission. My master was not terribly specific as to why he wished this facility blasted to pieces but I do know that he ran with a rather "dubious" crowd. The security at our home is most impressive, which leads me to conclude he had a reason to fear for his life. A shame this security could not travel with him - he might still be alive had this been the case. In any event, if you think you can accomplish this task, distasteful though it might appear, please respond as soon as possible. Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Oh dear, I do not think I am able to send credits for failed attempts. I''m awfully sorry about this. Perhaps you could try again?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'Did I send the wrong coordinates? Curse my metal body! I must have my memory circuits checked as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'An Obedient Droid'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Wonderful! I am now allowed to transmit the full amount of the reward to your account. My master would be so pleased... if he were still here. Oh dear...'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Help the faithful droid'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Pirates and smugglers are all the same - they should all be spaced! Just when I think it''s safe to trust one of those slug-sucking rogues, they go and break my heart all over again. Well I can break things too, you know. I''ll offer a reward to anyone that blasts that cheating ''s landing bay (with their precious ship still inside) into oblivion. We''ll show those brutes they can''t just walk all over any woman they want. We have feelings and passions, and those can be roused for both good and ill. If you were ever treated this way by someone, I''m sure you''ll lend a hand. I''ll transmit the coordinates to the landing bay as soon as I receive a positive response. Consider this a strike for women all across the galaxy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'I can only imagine that you enjoy the suffering of women otherwise you''d have finished the job. You must be a man. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'I know I sent you the correct coordinates. Are you sure you''re reading them correctly? Wait, you''re not a man, are you?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'A Woman Scorned'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'Not only my gratitude but the gratitude of women throughout the galaxy goes with you. Thank you for helping us stand up to these heartbreaking rogues.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Help avenge a scorned woman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_pirate.stf', 85, 'number_of_entries', '12'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'These darn smugglers think they can stash their ill-gotten goods anywhere they darn please. Well they''re wrong. A concerned group of citizens is willing to put up a reward to be claimed by anyone willing to blast these stashes to smithereens. These smugglers are cowards in any case, doubt they''d put up much of a fight. You willing to give it a try, citizen? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Well if you didn''t blast the illicit cargo, you can''t claim the reward, now can you? Better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Those smugglers are shifty folk. We could have sworn there were stolen goods at those coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'The Empire could use more upstanding folk like yourself. Claim your reward, citizen, you''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Blast illegal stash'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'We''ve found an old abandoned settlement that''s currently being used by some local smugglers to store their stolen goods. The local authorities don''t seem to care (they''re busy chasing "dangerous Rebels"), which leaves this dirty work for us citizens. We''re offering a reward to anyone willing to help get rid of this smugglers'' depot. Don''t leave a single wall standing, citizen. You up for it?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Looks like you left more than a few walls standing. Sorry, citizen - no results, no payoff.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Well you can''t expect us to know all of these smugglers'' hideouts, do you? They''re oily folk, make no mistake.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Now those are results we can appreciate, citizen. Good work! The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Remove smuggler''s depot'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'We''ve seen shady characters loitering around certain locations, and don''t think we don''t know what''s going on. Smugglers have been known to frequent these parts and we all know what they do. We''ve pinpointed one of these so called "warehouses" and need it blown to atoms, and we''re willing to offer a reward to the citizen who''ll take up the challenge. We won''t stand for this sort of activity in our own backyards. Think you can help, citizen? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Well I suppose we can''t expect results from everyone. The reward will wait for the citizen that can carry this out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Hmm, strange. We could have sworn that warehouse was at those coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'That''s showing those hooligans, citizen. I bet those smugglers won''t come around here no more. Don''t spend that reward all in one place.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Take out smuggler''s warehouse'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'I remember when this neighborhood used to be a decent place for citizens to raise their families. Well a bad element has been moving into our community. Smugglers! They sweep in here with their bluster and charm and think we don''t see exactly what they''re up to? I got news for them - we know exactly what they''re up to! I''m willing to put up a reward to get a brave citizen to encourage these criminals to get out of town. There''s a small hideout near here where these smugglers have been meeting. If someone could blast that place to atoms, that''d send a strong signal to those ne''er-do-wells. Think you can lend a hand, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'You didn''t exactly run them out of town, did you? I suppose you get no reward. Thanks for nothing.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'They must have known the citizens were fed up with their shenanigans and moved on. Let''s hope they don''t come back.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'A Concerned Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'That''s giving them what for, citizen! Job well done! The reward money is yours, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Encourage smugglers to leave'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Some smuggler has been hanging about chatting with the neighborhood kids. No doubt they''re encouraging our young ones to turn to a life of crime. We need a brave and upstanding citizen to help us drive this criminal out of our area. Here are the coordinates to this scoundrel''s hangout. Several sustained shots from a heavy blaster ought to get the point across. Burn this hangout to ashes and you''ll drive this womp rat out of its den. A reward awaits the citizen who accomplishes this.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Now this scalawag will continue to lure our innocent ones into the criminal underworld. Thanks for nothing, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'The reprobate probably got wind of our plans and fled like the true coward they are. Well good riddance. Hope they stay gone.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Now our children have a shot at a clean future. Good work, citizen! This reward is but a small token of our esteem.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Get rid of the smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'Why must smugglers always be attracted to areas where decent folk choose to live? I suppose they think they''re less likely to be caught by the local authorities. Well I''m going to prove them wrong. I''m offering a reward to anyone brave enough to blast a local smuggler''s haunt to atoms. I''m a family man with young ones dependent on me, otherwise I''d do the deed myself. Most of these types are cowards anyway and run at the first sign of trouble. Do you think you can help our community out, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'A cowardly smuggler was too much for you, eh? I suppose I can''t expect everyone to be brave. Well, no loss for either of us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'Told you these smugglers were cowards. The criminal obviously has run away.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'An Angry Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'See? Bet that coward gave you no troubles. The reward is yours, good citizen. You''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Scare the smuggler away'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'These cheap smugglers think they can swagger into someone''s life, charm that person with their devilish good looks and winning smile, use that innocent individual to further their own ends, and then dump that poor soul like a sack of bantha fodder when they''re done. Well I have news for these heartbreakers - this is one poor soul that''s striking back! I''m willing to pay a handsome reward to the noble individual who helps defend a woman''s honor. I know where this cheating smuggler has stashed their latest catch. It''s worth quite a bit to them, which is why I want it burned to the ground. Can you take up this cause, citizen? Will you be my very own Jedi knight?  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'Some Jedi you turned out to be. I guess my rich reward will just have to go to someone more worthy. Looks like you miss out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'I''m certain I gave you the correct coordinates. Are you sure you''re just not reading them wrong?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'A Woman Scorned'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Success, my Jedi! That cheating scum will think twice about using another woman again. I''ll gladly pay my Jedi''s reward. Can I see your lightsaber first?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Avenge the scorned lover'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'I''ve tried to reason with my cousin. I''ve pleaded with them. I''ve even threatened to go to the authorities. But all of this has yielded no results. They''re still engaged in smuggling. Now, I must turn to more drastic measures. That''s the only thing that will save my poor cousin''s life. I know where they''re keeping a small shipment of illegal weapons and if someone were to burn this hiding place to the ground, I''m sure my cousin would realize the grave danger they''re in and abandon their life of crime. Can you help me with this, citizen? There''s a reward in it for you. Please try and spare my cousin, however. They''re the handsome one with the winning smile. I''d hate to see any harm come to them.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Now my cousin will only be encouraged to smuggle some more. Pooh! Why did you have to go and fail for?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Maybe my cousin moved their stash? That wily trickster is certainly capable of such a cautious move.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'A Desperate Relative'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Hurray! Now I''m certain my cousin will fly straight. Here''s your reward. Oh, my cousin did survive? Right?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Dissuade a smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'My "partner" has decided to cheat me out of my fair share of a recent haul. Not only did this scoundrel try to turn me in to the authorities, they told our friends that I was trying to sell all of them out. Payback time. I know where my former partner has been hiding out. I''m willing to pay a fairly generous reward to anyone that takes a blaster to this hideout, hopefully while my partner is still inside. You want to help a wronged, hardworking soul even a score, citizen? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'I only said I''d pay a reward for results. This ain''t the "results" I was referring to. Sorry, pal, but no reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'That swindler seems to have made a getaway, eh? I''ll track that slug down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'A Cheated Partner'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'You''re a citizen after my own heart: efficient and ruthless. That reward is already yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Even up a score'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'I''m an even-tempered businessman who made a deal with a respectable transport captain - or so I thought at the time. This captain was to pick up certain valuables from one location and drop them off at another location. Simple, isn''t it? This sort of business has been conducted without a hitch for hundreds of years. Well this "captain" ended up keeping these valuables rather than delivering them to the appointed location - a move which cost me a considerable amount of money. I believe this captain needs a lesson. So much so that I''m putting up my own money as a reward to make sure this lesson is well taught. I have the coordinates to this captain''s hangout and am in need of an enterprising individual with a very large blaster to collect this reward. Any comers?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'The lesson, I think you''ll agree, was hardly "well taught." I''m not in the habit of rewarding failures.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'Looks like I''ll have to spend some more time tracking this captain down. No matter, I''m a patient businessman.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'A Legitimate Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Bravo, citizen. Well struck. I wish we businessmen has more access to honest, dedicated individuals like yourself. Makes for good business.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Teach a lesson'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'I''ve been at this damn smuggling business too long. I want out. But I can''t do it alone. I''m willing to pay someone to help "retire" me from this criminal life. I give the coordinates, you show up blasting away and asking no questions. Leave no evidence behind, no soul alive to talk about it. A simple, clean solution. What do you say? Can you do your part to rid the galaxy of a "notorious space pirate?" Cash awaits you if you do. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Well no one will believe I''m "retired" when my hideout wasn''t blasted to atoms, now will they? Sorry, pal, you missed your chance for some easy money.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'I think I''ve changed my mind about retiring. Sorry to have troubled you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'A Tired Old Pirate'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Good job, citizen. My "retirement" is in effect. Now I can turn my attentions to my real passion - professional dejarik player!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Help retire an old smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_smuggler.stf', 78, 'default', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'I admit, my reputation is a little... tainted. The Imperials don''t trust aliens to begin with, and I''m an ugly Arconan, which only makes it worse. And there''s the rumors that I''m addicted to salt, or spend too much time in the Mos Eisley cantina sipping on juri juice. But I can tell you, I am one of the best scouts in the galaxy. To prove it, I''ve located the lair of a rare and dangerous mutant creature. They don''t get much bigger or meaner than this beast. There''s a reward being offered for the lair''s destruction. I''ll pay you that, and more, if only so I can polish my reputation. But be warned: the creatures you''ll be facing are the deadliest monsters on Tatooine. You might not survive, and even if you do, there''s no telling what shape you''ll be in.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Maybe you''re the one whose reputation needs a little polishing. I thought you were a capable fighter, but I guess my information was incomplete. Now, the Empire suspects me of passing out false scouting data in order to lure unsuspecting victims to their deaths.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Perhaps I''m not the scout I claim to be. Maybe it is time I admitted that my skills have atrophied. Too much time on Tatooine, or too many glasses of juri juice, I''m not sure which. But, I do know that the information I gave you was incomplete, at best. You should stop wasting your time looking for any legendary "giants." I''m not sure they exist.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 4, 'm1l', 'An infamous scout has coordinates to the lair of a particularly vicious creature.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Hem Dazon'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'It seems my information about the monster you''d be facing was inaccurate. I thought it would prove a challenge, and that you''d undoubtedly be killed. I guess I have a great deal to learn about Tatooine''s local fauna, and your skills. But, my information about the lair''s location proved entirely accurate. My instincts have never been sharper. Once the local Imperials hear that my data was on target, I''m certain they''ll be offering me steady work again. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Scout''s Honor'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'EMERGENCY TRANSMISSION!\n\nOrigin: SoroSuub Silicate Mining Crew 76, Tatooine\nPriority: Critical\n\nStumbled across monster lair... Giant mutant creatures on murderous rampage... Entire Crew dead... I am sole survivor! Send help!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'The Executive Board of SoroSuub is aware of the emergency transmission that you recently received from one of our mining crews on Tatooine. We regret to inform you that the entire crew is dead and the monsters responsible for this carnage remain at large. Although we appreciate your concern for our employees, we will be dispatching our own recovery team to investigate the site. This matter is no longer your repsonsibility.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'The Executive Board of SoroSuub is aware of the emergency transmission that you recently received from one of our mining crews on Tatooine. This message was not intended for public consumption; a computer error allowed the distress call to appear on inappropriate channels. However, we can understand if you are concerned about the fate of Mining Crew 76. We can assure you that the crew has been evacuated to safety. We appreciate your concern, but this matter has been resolved without your aid.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 11, 'm2l', 'A mining crew has been attacked by monstrous creatures.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'SoroSuub Silicate Mining Crew 76'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'The Executive Board of SoroSuub would like to thank you for responding to the emergency transmission from Mining Crew 76. We believe that the entire crew is dead, but we are thankful that you have eliminated the threat. Now that the bloodthirsty monsters have been destroyed, we can send Mining Crew 77 to Tatooine to continue our search for valuable silicate ore. We are providing you with a sizable payment for your services, with the understanding that you will keep this entire incident confidential.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Mining Crew Disaster'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'There''s something in the water around here. Maybe it''s all the radiation leaking from crashed starships and seeping into the ground. Whatever it is, it''s causing the creatures to grow larger than should be natural. They''re like monsters; big, violent, terrifying, bent-on-killing-all-of-us monsters. Now, they''re even breeding. If we don''t stop ''em, the monsters will rule the planet. \n\nFortunately, I''ve found one of the irradiated lairs. The creatures pouring out of it are so big, it''s mind-bending. You won''t believe it... But someone with nerves of durasteel needs to face down these monsters. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'The giants are still on the prowl. I think they''re getting larger, and hungrier. I''ve heard stories of them eating whole eopie herds, leaving nothing but a handful of broken bones behind. Tatooine might belong to the monsters soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Maybe it''s radiation poisoning... The monsters have suddenly started dying off. They''re just dropping dead in the sand. In a few days, they should be completely extinct. You can relax now; you won''t be facing down those mutant creatures any time soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 18, 'm3l', 'Giant mutant creatures are running amok!');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 19, 'm3o', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Thank the Force! If you hadn''t destroyed the irradiated lair of those giant mutants, the unnatural monsters would have killed every living creature on the planet. I''m not sure how you managed such a heroic feat, but you should take great pride in your strength and skill.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Mutant Creatures'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'I''m such a fool! I''ve allowed my position as Customs Inspector to be... compromised. I''m not known for trusting anyone, but I need to trust you if I want to stay out of the spice mines. I admit, I can be bribed. I''ve taken a few credits to grease the servomotors at the customs office. Usually, it''s harmless. I''ll let a few blasters or some illegal bacta shipments through, but I try to crack down on anything truly dangerous. But, a few seasons ago, I took a few hundred credits to let a group of Sullustan spacers bring a batch of genetically-engineered seedlings into Mos Eisley. I thought it was harmless: the plants couldn''t hope to survive on Tatooine, the Sullustans were scheduled to depart the very next day, and I sorely needed the credits. Those wretched Sullustans betrayed me, though. They took the seedlings into the desert to see if they would grow, and they did. It wasn''t long before the plants were eaten by local creatures, and those vermin were in turn eaten by other, larger beasts. But the mutant plants caused a genetic malfunction in everything that ate them. Now, the desert is home to dozens of giant, monstrous animals. They can kill virtually anything they encounter.\n\nThis is my mess, and I intend to clean it up. I can''t go to the Imperials, of course, so you''re my only option. We need to destroy the creatures, and their lairs, before they can reproduce. If the Imperials discover the source of these monsters, I''ll be executed, or worse.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'I was a fool for trusting the Sullustans, and an imbecile for trusting you. Those Sullustans released a genetic storm, and you failed to contain it. It''s only a matter of time before the Imperials deduce how these monsters were created. I''m not long for this planet.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'The genetic mishap that created the monsters running rampant on Tatooine has also weakened their genetic code. It''s remarkable, but the creatures are dissolving into pools of bubbling flesh and disintegrating bones. They can hardly attack any cities if they can''t even walk. My future, it seems, is secure. Unfortunately for you, I don''t need any mercenaries to help clean up this mess. You are free to seek other work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 25, 'm4l', 'Genetically-altered monsters are roaming Tatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Putten Beatus, Mos Eisley Customs Inspector'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Nothing is ever as it seems. Those genetically-altered seedlings appeared harmless. The Sullustans appeared trustworthy. And you appeared to be just another worthless mercenary wandering the Outer Rim in search of work. Now, I grudgingly admit that you are much more than you first appeared. You''ve done well. The plague of monsters has been ended, at least for now, and Prefect Talmont will be none the wiser. Your reward is well-earned.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Genetic Mishap'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Tatooine is beset by a new and more terrifying threat. In seasons past, we only had to content with Tusken Raiders, rabid womp rats, and berserk krayt dragons. Now, we face a new species of enormous, mutant creatures. We don''t know where they came from, or why they''ve chosen now to surface, but they have already killed an untold number of moisture farmers and other innocent civilians. Go forth and kill these creatures wherever they might be found! Wipe out their lairs and ensure that none survive to hunt us further!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'The giant creatures continue to be a major threat on Tatooine! No one has come forward to stop these monsters, and their lairs remain intact. Worse still, the death toll continues to climb. By season''s end, these beasts will have claimed well over a hundred lives.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'The Empire, in all its infinite wisdom, has sent a team of highly-trained specialists into the desert to deal with these "monsters." While Imperial forces claim that we are overreacting to the situation, we know that these beasts must be stopped. Fortunately, it appears that the stormtroopers can handle the deed. We''re certain you''ll find other work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 32, 'm5l', 'Unexplained giant monsters are killing innocent victims on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Tatooine Civilian Defense League'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'You''ve vanquished the monsters and avenged so many senseless deaths. Every man, woman, and child who perished in the jaws of those monsters can now rest peacefully, knowing that the creatures will not soon return to plague the planet. Thank you for helping to make Tatooine slightly safer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Marauding Monsters'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_giant_tatooine.stf', 36, 'number_of_entries', '5'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'When I was a boy, my father used to tell me stories about Old Yellow Scale, the largest and most dangerous krayt dragon to ever wander Tatooine. Our land was part of Old Yellow Scale''s territory, and he would sometimes eat our banthas or smash a moisture vaporator. But for the most part, he ignored us, and we left him alone. But all things must eventually become one with the Force, even Old Yellow Scale. He collapsed and died a few seasons ago, and now something even more dangerous has taken his place. \n\nI guess krayt dragons can smell when one of their kind dies. Almost immediately after Old Yellow Scale perished, other krayts began invading his territory. These new krayts are reckless and voracious. They''ve done more damage in just a few short seasons than Old Yellow Scale did in his whole life. I don''t have the weapons or training to go out and kill a krayt dragon, but I have located the lair of at least one of these monsters. In memory of Old Yellow Scale, go out and destroy the interlopers.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Every time one of the invading krayt dragons kills someone, it reminds me how lucky we were to have Old Yellow Scale roaming the area. Sure, he would up and eat a lone traveler or moisture farmer every dozen seasons or so, but these new krayts are out of control. The death toll is rising fast. And I just keep sending "hired heroes" marching right into the jaws of these monsters... But I don''t know how else to stop the creatures.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'I''m not sure what''s happening, but it seems that the krayts are finally turning on one another. I can only assume that the dragons have been fighting over the territory. But looks like one has chased the others away. We''ve started calling him "Black Tongue," and he seems content to hunt banthas and eopies. As long as Black Tongue keeps the other krayt dragons out of the area, we should be safe... '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 4, 'm1l', 'The death of an ancient krayt dragon has opened up his former hunting grounds to reckless and dangerous rivals.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 5, 'm1o', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Thank the Force! I was certain that those of us living in Old Yellow Scale''s territory would be forced to move away. The upstarts were causing far too much death and destruction. At least now the number of dragons in the area has been thinned a bit. Hopefully, one of the survivors will drive the others away and become Old Yellow Scale''s successor.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Interlopers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'It''s my job to take care of Jabba the Hutt''s pets. I feed ''em, and clean their cells, and try to train ''em if they''re smart enough to learn anything. Usually, I don''t get too attached, because sooner or later, all of Jabba''s pets end up dead. But right now, Jabba has a rancor that just seems special. It will attack anyone, except me. I think it knows that it needs me to take care of it.\n\nThe problem is, Jabba likes to see creatures fight. He can invite all of his "friends" to the palace to gamble on the fight. He''s put my rancor up against zucca boars, dune lizards, gundarks, and even another rancor. I didn''t worry about any of these fights: I knew my rancor could take care of almost any challenger. But now, Jabba is talking about dropping a krayt dragon into the rancor pit. That''s one fight I don''t think my rancor can win. Jabba already has a few hunters out looking for a krayt to capture, and I''ll do anything to make it harder for them to find a dragon. I paid Bib Fortuna to tell me where to find the nearest krayt dragon lair. If you destroy it, then those hunters will have to go looking somewhere else, and they might not ever come back. Then my rancor will be safe. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Stupid mynock... How hard is it to destroy a pile of rocks? Or kill a giant lizard? You can''t do anything right. And as long as that krayt dragon cave is still out there, my rancor is in danger.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Jabba has changed his mind about putting my rancor up against a krayt dragon. I guess he''s having more fun feeding slaves and those dumb Gamorreans to the rancor, at least for now. Since he''s called off the hunters looking to capture a krayt, I should probably save my credits and keep you from destroying the krayt lair.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 11, 'm2l', 'Malakili, Jabba''s rancor-keeper, is hiring hunters to help protect his favorite pet from a confrontation with a krayt dragon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Malakili'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Good work. You smashed up that lair pretty good. Now I think my rancor will be safe. At least until Jabba decides to put the rancor up against a giant rock mite, or a Jedi, or something even worse...'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'The Big Fight'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'The Tatooine Civilian Defense League is extremely concerned about reported sightings of krayt dragons near large population centers. The krayts are huge, voracious predators. A grown man can stand upright in their open jaws, and their claws are like swords. Worse still, they continue to grow as they age, becoming more powerful and dangerous with each passing season. Therefore, we need to hunt down these monsters as soon as they are spotted. If we can kill the young krayts before they become a threat, life will be much safer on Tatooine.\n\nThe Tatooine Civilian Defense League has found a krayt dragon lair that might be harboring a young krayt dragon and her offspring. This lair needs to be destroyed immediately, or the krayts will mature and murder scores of innocent beings.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Your mission has failed. You will not be receiving payment from the Tatooine Civilian Defense League.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'The Tatooine Civilian Defense League has learned that the krayt dragon you were hunting has inexplicably disappeared. It may have fallen victim to the elements, another krayt, or hunters hired by Jabba the Hutt. Whatever the case, your services are no longer needed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 18, 'm3l', 'A spike in reports of krayt dragon sightings has prompted Tatooine authorities to hire adventurers to kill the monsters.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Tatooine Civilian Defense League'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Your mission has been completed successfully! The Tatooine Civilian Defense League will transmit payment immediately. Thank you for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Krayt Dragon Hunters'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nGreetings Non-Jawa!\n\nJawa clan is in frightening, terrible, imminent danger! Enormous, huge krayt dragon has attacked Jawa sandcrawlers! Jawas being consumed, eaten, killed by krayt! Some Jawas have been swallowed whole! Jawas on verge of extinction. Please damage and destroy krayt dragon lair before Jawas are all dead!\n\nEet Ptaa, Jawa Clan Leader  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nJawas still killed, mutilated, eaten by krayt dragons! Horrible, violent death awaits us all! You did not help the Jawas, you will not receive any credits!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nVicious, horrible, ugly krayt dragon has suddenly stopped killing Jawas! It has moved away, to kill, mutilate, eat Tusken Raiders! Jawas rejoice, celebrate! But you were not the Jawa hero. You will not receive our Jawa credits.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 25, 'm4l', 'Jawas from a nearby clan are being killed by a krayt dragon and need help battling the monster.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Eet Ptaa'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Transmission Translated from Jawaese for you convenience!\n\nMost exalted hero of the Jawas! We chear your name from First Dawn to Second Dusk! You have made the desert safe, welcoming, home to the Jawas. We will now pay you a sizable, big reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Krayt Prey'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Greetings friend! This is your lucky day! I am Mat Rags, the greatest hunter who has ever lived. Though I may be old, I am still deadly accurate with my Scalphunter 55x projectile rifle, and I can track down any creature, from mutant womp rats to blood-thirsty dewbacks. I have spent most of my life here on Tatooine because the hunting is unparalleled. But, I am getting bored. Fortunately for you, during my last hunt I spotted a krayt dragon lair. I could easily kill this creature myself, but I''m willing to let someone who doesn''t have my sterling reputation take it down. Destroying the krayt''s lair will make your career, if you survive. Good luck! '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Oh, my friend, you have failed miserably! The krayt dragon''s lair is still intact, and now the monster is angry. I would go take care of it myself, but I''m wanted on Corellia to deal with some nasty slice-hounds. Hopefully, someone with skills comparable to my own will step forward and deal with any krayts that you''ve left behind.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'Good news, my friend! I decided that my old bones needed some exercrise, so I struck out into the desert and destroyed that krayt dragon lair. You might hear someone else trying to take credit for the deed, but it was I, Mat Rags, who drove the krayt dragons away. I know I stole your thunder, but I got restless. Better luck next time. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 32, 'm5l', 'A local hunter has identified a krayt dragon''s lair that needs to be destroyed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Mat Rags, Tatooine''s Greatest Hunter'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Congratulations, my friend! You are indeed a fine hunter. Your skills aren''t as impressive as my own, of course, but you have faced the krayt dragon and survived! That is a quite an accomplishment and you should be proud. I''ve already told all my friends about you, my apprentice who killed the desert''s most dangerous monster!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Congratulations, my friend! You are indeed a fine hunter. Your skills aren''t as impressive as my own, of course, but you have faced the krayt dragon and survived! That is a quite an accomplishment and you should be proud. I''ve already told all my friends about you, my apprentice who killed the desert''s most dangerous monster!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature_krayt_tatooine.stf', 36, 'number_of_entries', '5'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'A major Black Sun glitterstim lab, responsible for supplying the dealers of several systems, has been located by Imperial Intelligence. These crooks are so well-connected, however, that any signs of an organized attack by either law enforcement or the Imperial Military would scatter them throughout the sector. We need to insure this facility is hit hard and put out of commission for good. A select team of highly skilled independent agents ought to be able to take this refinery out. It will be heavily guarded and anyone succeeding will likely earn the emnity of Black Sun, but removing the lab would be a huge step in eliminating glitterstim dealing in this sector. Naturally you''ll be generously rewarded for your time and efforts. Do you accept?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Black Sun will not take kindly to one of their interests being attacked. I hope you''re good at keeping an eye out for assassins and bounty hunters. Too bad you can''t claim your reward from us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Black Sun must have bribed someone in Intelligence to give us false coordinates. We''ll have to elevate this issue to a higher authority.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Bravo, agent! Your results never cease to impress us. We''re glad to employ an agent as effective as you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Destroy glitterstim lab'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'We''ve located the hideout of a local branch of the notorious swoop gang, the Shadow Angels of Dathomir. These creeps move fast once word reaches them that the authorities are on their way. This is a job for a small group of skilled and dedicated agents. The right strike team can blast this hideout and all of those vicious criminals to pieces before they had a chance to even look around. We''ll pay a handsome reward for the successful completion of the mission. These gangsters are tough customers, though, so the agents who accept this mission should be highly trained and experienced in dealing with these types of situations. The coordinates will be sent upon the acceptance of the mission. Can we count on you?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'That gang will be spread throughout the Outer Rim by now. It''ll take us months or years to track them all again. It''s too bad you failed, agent.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'Those coordinates were tampered with. We''ll investigate, agent. Please report back to us later.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'These gangs are always braver in packs and even then they can''t put up a good fight when confronted with talent like yours? Job well done, agent. That reward is going to the right individual.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Destroy swoop gang''s hideout'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Jabba''s swoopers think they can move into any system they like and stake their claim, regardless of what other hard-working criminals are already in the area? Not while I have something to say about it. Big Gizz is wanting to expand his organization beyond Mos Eisley at the expense of my interests. I need a hardy band of skilled assassins to show these new "branches" of that cretin''s gang that the galaxy is a dangerous and treacherous place. I transmit the coordinates to the gang''s new hideout when you accept, and I pay a very generous reward when they''re gone. Sound like a deal?  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'You let them live? How am I supposed to convince that slug Jabba that he can''t muscle into someone else''s territory whenever he wishes if my assassins can''t do their jobs properly? It''s hard running a criminal empire sometimes.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'My sources must have gotten those coordinates wrong. Check back with us after I''ve had a "talk" with my sources.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Lady Valarian'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Chew on that, Big Gizz! Way to go, killer. Jabba will soon learn your name. That may be good or bad depending on how spicy you like life to get. Here''s your money. Don''t spend it all in one joint.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Take on Jabba''s swoop gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'An illegal weapons manufacturing facility has been located by Intelligence. We believe it may be run by Black Sun. Many of the weapons bought and sold by gunrunners come from facilities just like this one. We need an experienced strike team to go in there and blast that installation into so much space debris. If you''ve worked for us before, you''ll know that our rewards are very generous but we expect results. These creeps will be well-armed, if nothing else, and will also likely be some of the best muscle Black Sun has to offer. Can you help us close this case?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'They''ll probably abandon the facility and take as many weapons with them as possible. It would have been better for everyone if you''d been able to destroy the facility and the criminals inside. No reward for you, I''m afraid.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'We''re trying to figure out the disconnect. Either Intelligence''s reports were tampered with at the source or once they got to our office. We''ll investigate further.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Wonderful! Less deadly weapons in the hands of criminals means less risk for our law enforcement agents. We need more agents like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Destroy weapons making facility'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'The vicious group of criminals behind one of Black Sun''s major protection rackets has been discovered by Intelligence. They apparently operate out of a fairly well-guarded stronghold and fear nothing short of a full Imperial Military strike. They''d get away long before such a strike could be organized and executed, however, so we would rather hire a small but experienced strike team to take care of those rogues for us. We believe that this group answers to Vigo Green, but cannot verify that information as of this date. We''ll transmit the coordinates to the team leader that accepts this mission. Our standard reward for this type of mission is in the offering as well. Do you think you can tackle this operation?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'The job was for someone to wipe this nest of parasites out. If you didn''t do that, we can''t exactly pay the reward for the job, now can we?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'Those coordinates were not good? Are you sure you read them correctly? We can try to retransmit them if you report back to us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Excellent work, agent. This victory will make life easier for hundreds of merchants in this sector. Always a pleasure to work with a professional like yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Take out protection racket'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'Black Sun maintains several medical facilities that are open to any of their operatives. You can imagine how hard it would be for assassins, gangsters, and other criminals to get medical attention at their local clinics after a battle with local authorities. These facilities were created to answer that particular dilemma. We''ve located one of these centers and need it removed. We cannot afford to let these criminals patch themselves up after a scrape with our agents. These facilities are also used for major procedures like face reconstruction, to hide the identity of various underworld agents, and it''s even suspected that some contain cloning technology. We need someone to gather a small strike team of experienced agents to hit this installation. The standard rewards will be offered for this type of work. Do you think you can undertake this mission? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'I''m afraid the deal called for the destruction of this entire facility. No results, no payoff. It is a darn shame, we know.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'We''re checking why those coordinates were inaccurate. Might have been a glitch in our system.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Good work. The last thing we need are clones of infamous criminals running around causing havoc. Great way for crime lords to create the appearance of being "untouchable." You''ve earned this reward, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Take out criminal hospital'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Intelligence has managed to pinpoint the location of one of Jabba''s major munitions depots. These weapons supply gunrunners in this and several adjoining sectors. Jabba''s spies are scattered throughout our organization, however, and we suspect that any communiques between us and the Imperial Navy would be intercepted and transmitted to Jabba''s people. That would give those thugs plenty of opportunity to vacate the premises. Stealth is important so we need a small team of agents to infiltrate that depot and blow it to bits. It will be very well defended as Jabba makes quite a bit of money off his gunrunning operations. We''ll reward a job well done, of course. Are you the agent we''re looking for? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'We said we''d reward a job well done. We think anyone would agree that your effort was nothing of the sort. We''ll be more careful with our agent selection in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'See what I mean about spies everywhere? Someone sabotaged these coordinates. We have our work cut out for us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'You certainly are fearless, aren''t you? You''ve gained a powerful enemy, we fear, but also a very influential friend. Congratulations on your success.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Wipe out Jabba''s munitions depot'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'One of Black Sun''s cadre of assassins has converted an abandoned mining installation into a stronghold specializing in training future killers. We can''t afford to let this assassin academy continue to operate. We''re offering a substantial reward to the strike team that can pull this off. Attacking a facility like this is no small matter. Some of the galaxy''s deadliest guns are to be found there, not to mention state-of-the-art defenses. However, if you want to make a name for yourself, then wiping this installation out offers a great opportunity to do so. You feel like making history, agent?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'You didn''t pull this one off exactly, did you? Well, we knew it would be hard and many of us suspected it would be too much for you. Too bad you couldn''t prove us wrong.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Makes sense that an assassin''s training fortress would be hard to pinpoint. We''ll see about getting the correct coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Now that was something. You should be working for Imperial Intelligence''s Burea of Operations, agent. Excellent job. You''ve definitely earned this reward. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Take out assassin''s HQ'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Some incredibly shortsighted former members of my organization have decided that they''ve "outgrown" me. As if refining high quality glitterstim spice was child''s play and a career anyone could just jump into. Where do these thugs get their ideas? We need a specialized team of agents to help us teach these misguided rogues a serious lesson. The refining facility must be blown to atoms, and everyone inside must be vaporized. This is the lesson we must teach. Black Sun always makes things "worth someone''s time" so do not worry on that account. Do you wish to get into our good graces?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'Wow, you really blew that, huh? Are you always this incompetent or is this a recent occurrence? We ask this with the greatest of respect, of course.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'Someone is trying to protect these rogues. We''ll get to the bottom of this.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Clezo'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'It''s operatives like you that allow a businessman like myself to sleep peacefully at night. Bravo. The reward and my gratitude are yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Take out spice refiners'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'The Illustrious Jabba wishes to employ a small team of dedicated killers to help him teach a rival an important lesson in courtesy. Mighty Jabba does not consider it courteous for said rival to make attacks on his swoopers, regardless of where they choose to go. My lord''s interests are wherever he chooses to put them and in all cases Jabba''s claims to a region should always take precedence. Now Jabba requires that one of his rival''s strongholds be obliterated, along with everyone inside. If you consider yourself the type of agent Jabba prizes most, fearless and inventive, then you should accept this mission and endeavor to please the powerful Jabba. His generosity extends beyond the money you''ll receive for the completion of this mission. What is your answer?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'Mighty Jabba is most displeased by your failure. There will be no reward and if you''re lucky that will be the end of it. Think carefully before accepting another mission from us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'That stronghold is there, you must look more carefully. What sort of scum are you if you can''t even find a fortress?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Jabba is pleased with your results. The mone is yours. Seek us out again in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Destroy one of Valarian''s strongholds'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'A foolish Vigo''s sublieutenant involved with our profitable glitterstim trade has been skimming credits off the top of all our distribution. I''m not sure exactly why they thought we wouldn''t notice. Needless to say, this matter must be redressed immediately. We don''t want to risk an open war with the other Vigos so this situation must be handled by independent operatives and it must be made to look like a hit by pirates trying to make off with shipments of spice. The reward will be more than adequate for this job but will only come if the sublieutenant''s stronghold is completely obliterated. This scum is tough so whoever accepts better go in blasting. We''ll transmit coordinates when we have your acceptance.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Failure is never rewarded by Black Sun. In fact, in certain situations it is punished harshly. I''d make myself scarce if I were you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'The sublieutenant must have been tipped off. Someone from inside Black Sun helped that slug. We''ll find out who and take care of it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Perit'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Results we can see will always lead to bigger and better assignments. Good work, agent. You may have a future with Black Sun. Perhaps even rise to the level of Vigo yourself.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Take out cheating spice dealer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Independent thought is wasted on assassins. First, they get used to everybody doing what they say. Then they fall victim to the lure of millions of credits passing through their hands. Next thing you know, they think they can run the operation better than their superiors. They get these warped visions of bumping off the boss and lots of smiles and handshaking and pats on the back... The job of a Vigo is not an easy one, my friend. \n\nWe need some skilled assassins to take out some skilled assassins. Unlike your targets, we hope that you and your team know your place in the universe and accept it. Last thing we need is more killers who think they should be running things. A substantial reward awaits the successful removal of these upstarts. You accept the mission and we''ll tell you where you and your team need to go. We hope you won''t mess this up. We''ve had too much of that recently in our organization.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'Didn''t I tell you that the job of a Vigo was not an easy one? Now I have to deal with this failure in addition to still having those rogue assassins to deal with. How I long for the "good old days" when earning a dishonest credit was much easier.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'They weren''t at those coordinates? Hmm, strange. Someone on the inside is helping those slugs out. Report back to us at a later time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Durga'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'Well handled. You and your team are glowing examples of what hired killers should be: obedient and efficient. Claim your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Hit the hitmen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_gangster.stf', 85, 'number_of_entries', '12'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'These pirates are almost as bad as those hotshot smugglers. If any of these rogues get the tiniest drop of notoriety, it goes straight to their heads. Suddenly they think they can set their own rules, do whatever they like, and ignore their benefactors. The result is nothing but headaches and work for us, but it also means good fortune for independent agents like yourself. We need a pirate band taken down. They''ve become too much of a liability for our organization and must now be squashed. A small elite team of troubleshooters ought to be able to take care of this situation with little trouble. If you''ve worked for us before, you know our pay is quite generous. If this is your first time, then prepare to be pleased when all this mess is settled. We''ll send the coordinates to the pirate''s lair upon receiving your acceptance.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Angry pirates are even more of a nuisance than cocky ones. What a bother this has become. Your results have left us quite non-plussed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'We rarely get these sorts of things wrong. Someone must be aiding those pirates, possibly a slicer. Check back with us later and I''m sure we''ll have this cleared up.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Excellently done, agent. Your resourcefulness is most inspirational - a shining example to hired guns throughout the galaxy. Enjoy your lucre.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Remove the thorn'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'When pirates are hired to perform a job, they should stick to it regardless of the consequences. What''s happening to professionalism in our circles? A renegade band of pirates has decided that they can keep the credits given to them for the performance of certain duties regardless of whether those duties were adequately performed or not. It is my responsibility to teach these slugs a lesson. I''m offering a reward to the team of hired killers that can infiltrate this band''s base and blast it (and them) to pieces. If you accept, you''ll be told where to go. These pirates are not likely to go down without a fight, so I''d blast first and ask questions later if I were you. Do you think you could take care of this problem for me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Was the story of the incompetent pirates lost on you? You weren''t trying to go for a sense of irony, were you? Why do I get the galaxy''s clowns working for me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'There was a glitch in our transmission. We''ll get it fixed and you can try again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Clezo'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Good to see that some scum still care about professionalism. Good for you. Come look me up again when you need more work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Help clean out the pirate gene pool'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'I''ve yet to meet someone who got into trouble by sticking to doing what they do best. It''s only when a few malcontents, not happy with the status quo, try to do something different that we get problems. Or at least I do. Pirates aren''t freedom fighters, right? You know that, I know that, everyone knows that. Pirates are thieves and murderers. That''s what they do. And that''s exactly what I need a small team of hired guns to explain to some former associates who''ve got it in their heads to help the Rebellion. Not on my watch. These scum think they can wipe their past clean by helping some moisture-farmers-turned-Rebels get themselves slaughtered by stormtroopers? Their case of sudden conscience is costing me too much money. Accept the job and I''ll tell you where you need to go. Leave no walls standing. I want to make sure this conscience-acquiring is not contagious.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'This is not what you do best, is it? Did you used to cook or fix ships for a living? Maybe you should go back to that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'We sent you the correct coordinates, buddy, I''m sure you''re just reading them wrong. Sheesh, why does this have to be so hard?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Green'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Finally, someone who knows what they''re good at and stick to it. A long, happy life will likely be yours, friend. Come see me again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Destroy pirates with a case of conscience'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'One of the galaxy''s most notorious and bloodthirsty band of pirates has fallen for our trap. They took some bait we offered and raided a ship full of tainted cargo. We planted undetectable homing beacons inside that cargo and now the pirates have led us right back to their lair. Their base sensors are rather sophisticated, however, so they would detect the approach of Imperial cruisers and escape into space before we could strike. We need a team of highly skilled and experienced agents to land near their base and take it out. The pirates would not react to the arrival of a standard transport as they''re used to monitoring that sort of activity in their system. Are you the sort of operative that could assemble such a strike team? The Empire is counting on you, citizen. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'Those pirates will scatter like trash bats before our ships can arrive. This failure is terribly disappointing. We hope this is unusual for you. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'The pirates must have somehow sabotaged our transmission, which means they must know we''ve discovered their base. It will likely be abandoned soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Imperial Navy'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'An excellent strike. The Empire is indebted to you, agent. Perhaps you should contact us about helping to crush the Rebellion. We could use agents like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Smash the notorious pirates'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Normally I wouldn''t care about the activities of pirates but these particular ones happened to strike a slaver ship on its way to deliver a shipment of Twi''lek exotic dancers to me. Even after the pirates discovered who this shipment was intended for, they still decided to sell the slaves on their own and keep all the profits. This matter must be resolved. I cannot allow pirates to seize what I have rightfully stolen - if word of this spreads it could weaken my position with Jabba. I therefore have need of a team of deadly killers to rid me of this embarrassment. One of the Twi''lek girls had a homing chip implanted in her thigh (a special gift intended for one of Jabba''s rivals) which has allowed me to discover where these slugs are hiding. Accept the mission and the coordinates are yours. Leave no witnesses and burn their lair to the ground.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'This is most disappointing. My brutish Gamorrean guards would have fared better. You should make yourself scarce.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'Could the pirates have found the chip? Why were those coordinates incorrect? My slave had better not warned those space rogues.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Well done. Accept this reward and look me up again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Blast the errant pirates'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'Jabba claims he doesn''t want a war and then arranges for pirates to hit ships carrying goods intended for me. If that gargantuan worm thinks I can''t see who''s behind these recent attacks, he''s as stupid as he looks. As much as I know that Jabba is baiting me, I must respond or I risk other pirates trying their hands at plucking my cargo. This mission won''t be easy but it will pay very well. Jabba is known to employ the most ruthless and dangerous pirates in the trade. But a resourceful team of agents, skilled in teamwork and deadly with their blasters, should be able to pull it off. You fancy yourself such an individual? If you think so I''ll send you the coordinates to the pirates'' lair. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'I guess you were lacking in one of those areas I mentioned in my message. Too bad you couldn''t pull this off. I was hoping you would, actually.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'We may have a spy in my network. I''ll have to do some housecleaning.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Lady Valarian'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'I had a hunch about you. You seemed to be the type to get results. Congratulations on a job well done. Enjoy the reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Swat Jabba''s pirates'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Mighty Jabba''s wrath is a powerful and dreadful thing to incur - few rational beings wish to risk it. This band of pirates, it seems, do not share that particular rationality. They have been raiding my lord''s spice shipments with impunity and this must stop. My lord was wise enough to have planted a spy in their midst months ago, suspecting that this particular band might try to double-cross him in the future. Thanks to my lord''s wisdom, we know the location of this band''s hidden base. Illustrious Jabba wishes me to hire the best assassins credits can buy and instruct them to practice their trade on these foolish rogues. Do you wish to take advantage of this opportunity to earn both my lord''s favor and a substantial reward? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'It seems you also do not share a particular rationality. Failure is rewarded with pain and death by Jabba. I shall now probably have to hire another group of assassins to take care of you. Ironic, isn''t it?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'Check those coordinates again - I do not make such mistakes. No one that rises so high in Jabba''s estimation could make such mistakes.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Most effective. You serve my master well and you will be rewarded.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Help a Hutt make a point'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'One of the major areas of concern for the Corporate Sector Authority is piracy. Our ships in particular draw those predators like skettos to a sleeping dewback. Recently we''ve discovered that many of these pirates have banded together to form some sort of "Brotherhood." By sharing information about transport movements, safe spaceports, and Imperial activity, these rogues can insure a higher rate of success for their comrades. We''ve used our resources, mostly in the form of bribes, to pinpoint the locations of some of the busiest spaceports used by this Brotherhood. We offer a substantial reward to anyone who can make sure these ports are knocked out of commission. There''s plenty of work doing that as these criminals have dozens of these havens. Coordinates will be transmitted upon your acceptance. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'If those ports are not completely destroyed, they will continue to be used by the pirates. No results, no reward. That should be pretty obvious.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Some of these havens are bogus, naturally. We have to check all these coordinates just to be sure though.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'The Corporate Sector Authority'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Good work. Remember there''s plenty more of those havens out there. We''ll continue to pay as long as you continue to produce results.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Wipe out the pirates'' haven'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Every successful businessman deserves a luxurious retirement.  No one is denying that.  But a player is expected to settle all bets before cashing out of the game.  That is where a certain ex-employee of mine has failed.  He was one of the most successful pirates on my payroll.  A prolific provider for many standard years.  He retired with my personal blessing.  Unfortunately I have learned that he hid an old debt from me, and has rebuked my requests for payment.  I have extended every courtesy to him, but the time has now come to finalize negotiations.  I require a crack team of assassins to hit him hard and leave no one standing.  Only the deadliest killers need apply.  He knows I''m coming, so he has fortified himself in a stronghold and gathered a small army of the toughest scum in the sector.  Tear the place to the ground and you shall be very well compensated.  Contact me for his coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'To be honest, I didn''t expect you to finish this job.  Conveniently this means I don''t have to pay you.  And now that my ex-employee thinks I have made my move, he will be overconfident when I send a hit team who actually knows how to kill a man.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'You''re right, those were bad coordinates.  That old pirate still has contacts inside my organization.  I''ll have a little chat with the person who gave me those numbers.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Green'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'Very well done.  Have I hired you before?  You have the skill and the guts to be a player yourself.  You would make an excellent asset to my organization.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Retire an ex-pirate for good'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'They say lucre makes the galaxy spin and I have always found that to be true.  My various industrial enterprises have made me one of the most influential Neimoidians in nine sectors.  I have assets spanning a hundred systems.  When you attain such success, however, you become an attractive target for professional thieves.  I am no exception.  I have just discovered that one of my industrial villas has been overrun by several pirate crews.  Luckily a good businessman knows how to distribute resources to safeguard his investments.  I wish to disburse a very large sum of credits to a group of soldiers-of-fortune who have the means and the wherewithal to dislodge these slugs from my property.  Be warned: they are well-equipped and extremely dangerous.  I am paying for the best of the best, so don''t waste my time if you''re anything but elite.  Also, I shall shed no tears if the villa itself sustains heavy damage, as I intend to collect an insurance disbursement and shut the place down anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'A good businessman does not encourage substandard practices.  I hired you on the assumption that you could complete the task at hand.  You shall not see one credit until then.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'I gave you poor coordinates.  Clearly someone has been tampering with my databanks.  I shall investigate further.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'An Influential Neimoidian'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Your work was sloppy in one or two particulars, but you did complete the task at hand.  Good job leveling the villa.  Do enjoy this payment.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Dislodge pirates from my industrial villa'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'Oh, can''t someone please help us?  My family rules a small but beautiful planet in Xappyh Sector.  Long ago we built an outpost to tend the needs of the poor and downtrodden in nearby systems.  But calamity befell us when our outpost was captured by the crew of a large and terribly frightening pirate frigate.  We would like to remove them so that we can resume helping the needy of the galaxy; but the regional governor has refused to lend us aid.  We are a peaceful planet and have no weapons.  We do have money, though, with which we shall gladly part if it means we can have our outpost back.  Are there no stalwart heroes left in the universe who will come to us in our hour of need?  These pirates are a cruel and awful lot and we are frightened that they might do harm to the poverty-stricken areas near them.  Money is no object.  Please, just help us!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Oh, dear, it''s just awful that you couldn''t help us.  You''re very generous for trying.  I''m so sorry I can''t pay you, but I must save our money so we can hire others to try where you failed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'Goodness, did I send you the wrong coordinates?  I''m not very good at operating this input terminal.  I''m so, so sorry.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'A Desperate Princess'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'You did it!  It''s a shame about the outpost being destroyed, but I just know that you did your best to protect it.  Please, take your reward and know that you are always welcome on my planet, where I will treat you to every pleasure my humble palace can provide.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Help us in our hour of need'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Mighty Jabba is always looking for new talent to add to his organization.  After some recent personnel issues, he has decided that all new recruits must prove themselves in a practical demonstration of their skills.  Illustrious Jabba wishes me to provide one such audition for a hit team.  To warrant their abilities, these assassins will be required to break into the landing bay of an especially lethal pirate captain and blast the entire facility into its component atoms.  Upon the completion of this task I shall present a report to the Invincible Jabba, who will render a decision on the worthiness of the applicants.  Wise job seekers should be aware that I do not take my duties lightly.  Only the finest and most despicable assassins deserve my attention; others are highly discouraged from occupying my precious time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'Perhaps I was not clear when I warned applicants not to waste my time.  But I shall make it clear to you in due course.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'I give you the chance to impress Mighty Jabba and you respond by accusing me of giving you the wrong coordinates?  Very displeasing.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'You have demonstrated no small amount of skill.  I shall bring your case before the Illustrious Jabba.  Until you hear from us again, enjoy this well-earned payment.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Audition for the Mighty Jabba'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_pirate.stf', 85, 'number_of_entries', '12'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'These smugglers develop reputations, they think they can get away with anything. What they fail to recognize is that organizations like ours help forge those reputations - and we can destroy them just as easily. One of these smugglers has gotten a bit too greedy for their own good. They think that by surrounding themselves with armed thugs, they can ignore certain rules and tariffs. We''re about to prove them wrong. A substantial reward awaits the operatives who will drive this point home to this errant smuggler. If you''re the type of killer we think you are, this should pose no problem for you. Do you want the job?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'We don''t like when one of these operations doesn''t go as planned. Failure is not really an option with our organization. I''d watch my step if I were you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Seems like this smuggler is employing data slicers to help sabotage our efforts to discipline them. They''re crafty, you gotta give them that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Congratulations. Those are results that make us proud. Stick with us and you''ll go far. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Take out the errant smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'No one cheats a Vigo of Black Sun, especially when that Vigo is Durga the Hutt. Apparently this simple truism has escaped a certain band of smugglers formerly working for the illustrious Vigo on Nar Shaddaa. They''ve made off with a rather large shipment of high-grade glitterstim spice that was supposed to be delivered to Vigo Durga himself. Well no business is without its perils, I suppose. Vigo Durga will pay a handsome reward to anyone who can send these smugglers back to their makers. These are the coordinates to the smugglers'' hideout. Make sure there are no survivors and no witnesses. Can Black Sun rely on your cooperation and discretion?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'You failed to dispatch these smugglers? Oh dear, how distressing. I do hope Vigo Durga is merciful with you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'The coordinates must have been tampered with by agents loyal to those smugglers. We''ll have to clean some house, it seems.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Durga'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Most excellently done. Vigo Durga sends his congratulations and asks that you contact us again in the future. Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Remove a band of smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Spice smugglers can be so untrustworthy. A recent shipment of spice came up dreadfully short. Unfortunately this shipment was under Vigo Clezo''s supervision, which made him look bad in the eyes of the rest of Black Sun. These offending smugglers must be made to pay for this embarrassment with their lives, of course. Nothing less would satisfy the wounded Vigo''s pride. Here are the coordinates to their hideout. Please be efficient and precise. Vigo Clezo likes to run a clean, tight ship. A substantial reward awaits your safe and successful return.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'The least of your worries should be the lost reward. Vigo Clezo''s displeasure is not a good thing to incur. You have my sympathies.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Those smugglers are desperate to evade our wrath and are filling the HoloNet with rumors of their possible locations. We''ll sort it out soon enough.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Clezo'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'A true professional. Now you are the sort of operative Vigo Clezo is proud to employ. The reward is yours to claim.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Help a Vigo get payback'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'It has been recently brought to our attention that a group of trusted couriers is actually a collection of Imperial Intelligence agents. This is most distressing, as you can imagine. We need these couriers removed and are willing to pay well for this service. Here are the coordinates to a base these couriers use most often. The base is to be obliterated and every courier is to be eliminated. We do hope this is very clear. The Empire really should know better than to try and infiltrate our organization with these sorts of agents. It always leads to a tragic loss of life and talent. Are you our agent?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'The couriers were allowed to escape - a situation that both saddens and alarms us. We thought we were dealing with a professional. It seems we were wrong.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Imperial Intelligence is obviously aiding their agents to escape us. Perhaps they''ll be recalled to Imperial Center and no longer plague our business.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Your actions were those of an exemplary agent. Your success will reap rich rewards and lead to a very profitable future with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Take out Imperial moles'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'It is a shame when talented individuals must be eliminated. One of our most experienced smugglers has been convinced to become an informant for the Rebellion. Now normally, we wouldn''t care what the Rebels were up to. They keep the Imperials distracted, which is all we can really ask for from anyone. However, we''ve learned that this smuggler is selling some of our most precious secrets to the Rebels - that we simply cannot have. A generous reward awaits the agent who can take this smuggler and their band of associates out. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Now this smuggler will no doubt ask the Rebels for asylum and they''ll be impossible to track. This failure will cost us time and money - two things you don''t want to cost our organization.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'I wonder if the Rebels are helping to hide these smugglers? It would be like them to do a thing like that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Good form, agent. That was nicely done. Our organization could use more operatives like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Wipe out the smuggler informants'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'The mighty Jabba the Hutt seems to be having a rather bad year in regards to smugglers. It''s not enough that the loathsome pirate, Han Solo, has evaded my master''s attempts to capture him, but now it seems another band of smugglers have been inspired by Solo''s actions to defy the powerful Jabba. For reasons of his own, His Exaltedness has decided not to approach the Bounty Hunters'' Guild with this matter (given their recent troubles) but has instead decided to find some enterprising free agents to settle things. We have the coordinates to the lair of these walking corpses. As always, His Immenseness offers an overly generous reward for the accomplishment of this task. Can the honored Jabba count on you to serve him faithfully?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'My master does not reward failure. In fact, he usually punishes it. I''ll tell Jabba that you were killed trying to carry out his wishes and you can flee the galaxy as swiftly as you''re able. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'I do not make mistakes, agent. Check the coordinates again and accomplish this task.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Well done, agent. Jabba will remember your success next time you come to us for a job. We always reward success.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Help Jabba get even'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'That slug Jabba has done such a good job of convincing the smugglers of the galaxy that they all work for him, that it makes life for the rest of us a bit more difficult. A group of these smugglers, well known gunrunners, made off with one of my weapons'' shipments, thinking they could just sell it to Jabba for more money than they would have gotten for simple smuggling. That notion has got to be corrected. I''m offering a hefty reward to the individual or band that will blast these smugglers into space junk. We have the coordinates to their base, not that they were difficult to acquire - these guys think they''re untouchable. So how about it? You in?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'The formula is simple: smugglers blasted into space junk, get reward; smugglers not blasted into space junk, get zilch. You do the math, genius.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'Not there? How could they have moved their entire base so quickly? I know those coordinates were correct.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Lady Valarian'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Effective. A bit crude, perhaps, but effective. Here are your credits. There are more where those came from if you need more work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Dish out Lady Valarian''s wrath'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'The exalted Jabba seems to have lost some of his most trusted smugglers recently to his rival, Valarian. It seems the wanna-be crime mistress hired thugs to blast some of my master''s loyal servants. The mighty Jabba would like to repay kind with kind. These are the coordinates to a base belonging to some of Valarian''s most trusted couriers. Make sure every one of them is blasted to bits and the base is burned to the ground. We wouldn''t want people thinking that Jabba was less cruel than some mangy Whiphid, now would we? A generous reward waits at the end of a successfully completed mission.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Failure is a word Jabba hates to hear. It will be unfortunate for you that he must hear it in association to your name.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Could Valarian have warned these couriers? How could these coordinates have been wrong?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Excellent. Now the galaxy will understand the lengths Jabba is willing to go to protect his assets. You''ve earned your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Jabba''s revenge'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'The Imperials attempted it so I suppose it shouldn''t surprise us that the Rebels took a stab at it too. We''ve discovered that some of our smugglers are actually Rebel double agents collecting information for the Rebellion and spying on our activities for use as leverage in future negotiations. As you can imagine, we need these agents removed and a clear signal sent to the Rebellion. They of all people should know that if you play with fire, you will get burned. These are the coordinates to this group''s base of operations. Blast it to pieces and wipe out the double agents. Hopefully we''ll only have to do this once. Can you help with this? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'All you''ve managed to do is warn the Rebels that we''re on to them. Most distressing. Our business is now concluded.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'Rebel slicers are sneaky little womp rats, eh? We''ll get the correct coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'Most impressive, agent. Especially given that those smugglers were likely highly trained Rebel commandos. Do see us again for future work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Wipe out Rebel double agents'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'Illustrious Jabba wants to make sure that the smugglers operating in this galaxy answer to him and him alone. Some of these smugglers have been operating exclusively for one of his chief rivals, and the powerful Jabba wishes to make an example of them. He offers a sizable reward to anyone who is brave enough to march into these smugglers'' base and blast it to pieces, along with all the smugglers inside, of course. We''ll supply the base''s coordinates and the reward (should the mission be successful). You must supply the muscle and the blasters. Do we have a deal?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'You''ve failed to make an example of these smugglers, I''m afraid. Perhaps another example must be made of you. I''ll consult with His Mightiness to see how he wishes to proceed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'The coordinates could not have been mistaken. Could we be the victims of sabotage?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'Bib Fortuna'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'What a glorious example this sets. The mighty Jabba is pleased. Claim your reward and do visit His Immensity on Tatooine soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Instruct a rival'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'Some hotshot smugglers have decided to cheat a powerful Vigo and make him lose face in the syndicate. Just because these smugglers have the trust (which they believe translates to "protection") of several other Vigos, they think they can push a smaller Vigo around. We''ll soon see who''s small and who''s not in Black Sun. You mess with any Vigo, you flirt with death - simple as that. A substantial reward is in the offering to anyone who can teach these arrogant scum a lesson. I want those hotheads dead, I want their base burned down to the ground, and I want to spit on the ashes! You think you can help me do that?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Failed? What do you mean failed? You in the pockets of these other Vigos, huh? Are you trying to make me look bad? I better not see you around!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'The other Vigos are plotting against me, I just know it. I gotta watch my back. Always watch your back, buddy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'Black Sun: Vigo Green'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Yeah! That''s what I''m talking about! Let''s see who''s laughing now, huh? Good work, buddy. Take your money and remember who treated you right.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Assuage a Vigo''s paranoia'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_smuggler.stf', 78, 'default', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'PUBLIC EMERGENCY BROADCAST\n\nThe Tatooine Civilian Defense League, in cooperation with Imperial authorities, is reporting the presence of a major vermin infestation on the planet. The infestation represents a significant threat to public health and safety. In an attempt to eliminate the infestation before any more lives can be lost, the Tatooine Civilian Defense League is offering a substantial reward for the elimination of the central lair, hive, or nest.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Your mission has failed. You will not be receiving payment from the Tatooine Civilian Defense League.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Imperial authorities have deemed that the vermin infestation on Tatooine represents a Class A-2 threat to the safety of Imperial citizens. Imperial agents have razed the area to completely eliminate the danger. Your mission has therefore been cancelled.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 4, 'm1l', 'A major infestation has been reported on Tatooine. The lairs contributing to this infestation must be destroyed.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Tatooine Civilian Defense League'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Your mission has been completed successfully! The Tatooine Civilian Defense League will transmit payment immediately. Thank you for your service.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Public Emergency'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'I''m tellin'' you, Tatooine must have some underground network of tunnels that only the creatures know about. They can move without anyone seeing ''em, attack and retreat without being caught, stay out of the heat when the twin suns are right above ''em... Worse still, they can pop up wherever they are most unwanted, building nests or lairs like boils in the sand. And now, all they need to do is connect a few tunnels, and suddenly we have a major infestation on our hands. They''re everywhere at once, spreading out like a plague. Soon, they''ll have infected every part of the desert, eventually moving into the cities. Someone needs to help stop the infestation. The only way to do that is by attacking the central hive; destroy that, and the rest of the lairs will eventually wither and die.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Well, the infestation is still growin'' out of control. It''s takin'' over the rest of the desert. It won''t be long before the cities are overrun too.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'The infestation has up and disappeared. I think maybe a flash fire burned all the lairs to the ground. Whatever the case, it''s gone and the desert is safe again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 11, 'm2l', 'A vermin infestation is threatening to expand into Tatooine''s settled areas.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 12, 'm2o', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Nice work. The infestation seems to be gone. Or, the vermin have retreated into their tunnels. It doesn''t really matter, as long as they''re gone. They''ll be back, I''m sure, but for now the desert is a little safer. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Desert Infestation'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'We, the Dim-U monks of Tatooine, who worship in the shadow of the Great and Mighty Bantha, have seen the next great threat to our powerful idol. The Stalwart Bantha is a natural wanderer, roaming the desert seas in search of peace and wisdom. But this season, the Bellowing Bantha has stumbled into a terrible infestation of chattering, disease-bearing vermin. The infestation is so great, even the All-Knowing Bantha has difficulty avoiding it, and He is often overwhelmed and eaten alive by the creatures. Only the destruction of the infestation''s central lair will cleanse the desert, making the sands pure enough for the Enduring Bantha''s footsteps. We will happily open our coffers for anyone who can clear this infestation. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'The Wandering Bantha remains in grave danger. The sea of vermin that blocks His way remains untouched! The Courageous Bantha will never forget your failure.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'The Wandering Bantha has found another path through the desert. He no longer needs to contend with the terrible infestation that had blocked his path. We, the Dim-U monks who worship at His hairy feet, no longer need your aid.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 18, 'm3l', 'An infestation of vermin is blocking the bantha''s seasonal migrations.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Dim-U Monks of Tatooine'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'The Bellowing Bantha shall roar your name for many seasons to come! You have cleared His path, and He can continue His migrations without fear of attack. The Great and Mighty Bantha is forever in your debt! Our monastery''s coffers have been opened, and you have been rewarded for protecting our hairy idol.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Bantha''s Champion'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'I have traveled Tatooine for many long seasons now, studying it''s peoples and places. I have been to the far reaches of the Dune Sea, where I wandered amid the bones of ancient krayt dragons. I have lurked among the Tusken Raiders as they rallied for war. I have watched in horror as Jabba the Hutt sent another slave to her death in the rancor pit. From Mos Eisley to Wayfar have I traveled, and never before have I encountered such terror. In the desert now, their lurks an immense infestation beyond imagining. It spreads like Death Rot, climbing over the dunes and reaching out towards any who come too close. I have seen the bodies of those that have been overwhelmed by the infestation, their skeletal limbs reaching out for help that would never arrive... Soon, the entire desert might be consumed. Only the bravest warriors can hope to stop this infestation from spreading, and so it is that I plead with you for help. Seek out this creeping, planetary disease and strike at its heart. Kill it quickly, so that no others can be killed! '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'The creeping, living sickness continues to spread. The creatures spread like pus, flowing over the land to bring death. It seems no one can stop this infestation... Tatooine is doomed!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Sometimes, even the most tenacious infestation might suddenly consume itself. It seems that this creeping disease has receeded, the monsters retreating back to their lair. Tatooine is safe, for now.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 25, 'm4l', 'A wandering anthropologist has located a terrifying infestation on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Mammon Hoole'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Although I have traveled many worlds throughout my life, I have seldom come across a hero of your stature. Your courage and strength have driven back the terrifying hordes. The infestation that plagues the desert has recoiled, releasing its hold over the sands. I will add your name to my journals, and when my life''s work is published, all shall know of your heroic deeds here on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Desert Disease'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'It''s been one of my lifelong goals to bring peace to Tatooine. I''m hoping that, one day, the moisture farmers, Jawas, and Sand People can form some kind of alliance, or at least agree to stop attacking each other. I''ve befriended some of the local Jawas, and they''ve agreed to help, but only if I find a way to make the desert a little safer for them. Right now, they''re most concerned with a massive infestation of vermin. I agreed to hire someone to wipe out the infestation as soon as possible, and you seem to be the right hired hand for the job. I''d try to make your way to the central lair and destroy it. If you can manage the job, I''ll sell my treadwell droid and pay you whatever he''s worth.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'The Jawas have pulled out of the peace talks. They think I''m going back on my promise to help with the infestation, since I haven''t been able to find anyone who could wipe it out yet. I don''t think we''ll ever have any kind of understanding between the major tribes on this planet. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'I expected that the Jawas would be flighty. They''ve recently migrated away, before we even had a chance to prove to them that we were willing to help. You can give up on cleaning out the infestation; I don''t think the Jawas will be back. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 32, 'm5l', 'A moisture farmer attempting to bring peace to the desert has a mission for brave adventurers.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Ariq Joanson'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'That infestation was rooted deep in the desert. I didn''t think anyone would be able to completely eliminate it, but it looks like you''ve done that job. I know that the Jawas are going to be grateful. They''ll probably chatter about this for days to come. Maybe now we can move towards peace out here, if we can ever find a way to communicate with the Sand People...'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Peace Plan'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_creature_infestation_tatooine.stf', 36, 'number_of_entries', '5'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'The Empire''s efforts to stamp out the Rebellion has unfortunately created some additional problems for law enforcement. We have more refugees to deal with, many of which are recruited by local swoop gangs or glitterstim dealers. Naturally this means we have to deal with more violent crimes and we''re already rather understaffed. This is where you come in, citizen. We have plenty of work for enterprising agents who want to lend a hand to keep peace and order in our communities. We''ve kept tabs on the activities of these gangs and know where most of them hang out. One by one we need to clean those places out. Most of them are condemned buildings anyway. Think you can help us out, citizen? We''ll pay you for your successful efforts, of course. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Did we emphasize "successful" when we mentioned we''d reward you for your efforts? Good, because we can''t afford to reward non-successful efforts.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Some of these coordinates may be outdated or incorrect. We''ll make a note of the ones that are and cross them off our list.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Good work, citizen. One by one, we''ll get all these wretched hives of scum and villainy. Have a drink on us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Clean up the streets'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'My son has fallen in with a very bad crowd. He was arrested last month on suspicion of murder but the case was dropped for lack of evidence. I know my son didn''t kill anyone but I know who did. Those thugs he hangs out with are thieves, murderers, and worse. They don''t deserve to share the same space as decent citizens. I''ve arranged for my son to spend a few weeks with his aunt in the country. The air will be good for him. What I need is for someone to blast that gang''s hideout to pieces while my son is gone. That will drive those animals away and teach them never to come back and bother us again. I''ve put up a generous reward for the citizen or citizens that can accomplish this important task. Can you help me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'If you don''t get rid of these misanthropes, my son will never be saved. My reward is for the individual that saves my son.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'I could have sworn those were the coordinates to their hangout. I''ve been a bit preoccupied, so forgive me if I made a mistake. Let me double-check those coordinates. Could you check back with me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'A Desperate Mother'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'I just discovered that my son ran away from his aunt''s and is likely staying at the gang''s hideout. Did you destroy it? Did you kill everyone there? Oh no! My dear son! Oh no!!! '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Help save a wayward son'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Our agents have uncovered a major glitterstim dealer''s lair. These criminals supply a majority of the spice for many of this system''s major cities. We need to put this scum out of business and we need your help to do it. The dealer has done well so they''ve hired some muscle to protect their precious goods. A quick, stealthy strike, however, ought to get the job done. Don''t worry about blasting anyone that gets in your way - most of these guys are wanted murderers. If the settlement is left a smoking ruin, we''ll be mighty pleased. We always reward results too. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Too bad you couldn''t finish the job. We can''t leave these things open like this, you know. Better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Did we send you the wrong coordinates? Our apologies. We''re a bit frazzled with all this work piling up. Check back with us again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Nothing quite as sweet as the smell of burning spice in the morning, eh? Good job, citizen. Keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Destroy spice dealer''s stash');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'A series of savage beatings, three of which resulted in fatalities, have taken place over the last six weeks in our community. It seems that a new gang has moved into the neighborhood and they''re announcing their presence. Any citizen who stares at these thugs for too long risks a brutal beating and possible death. The local authorities already have their hands full assisting the Empire in tracking down Rebels; they simply do not have enough men to patrol the streets. We are therefore taking matters into our own hands. We''re offering a reward to any citizen who has the courage to march into that gang''s hangout and blast those murderers to atoms. We must make it clear to these scum that we will not tolerate this sort of behavior in our streets. Are you a courageous citizen? Let us know and we''ll transmit the coordinates to the gang''s hangout to you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'There may be serious repercussions now that you failed to destroy this gang''s hangout. They probably know we''re trying to hire someone to get rid of them. We hope someone comes through for us quick.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Those coordinates should have been correct. We''ll check out what the disconnect was.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'It''s citizens like you that will insure our futures are free of crime and social predators. Hurrah, citizen! You can be our champion any day.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Smash the gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Some slavers are not content to stick to the Imperial list of approved species. Indeed, these slavers feel they must enslave humans, and that''s something we can''t tolerate. Through the help of Imperial Intelligence, we''ve located the lair of a group of slavers that have been dealing exclusively in humans. We need a small strike team to assault this base and blast it into rubble. Humans shall not be enslaved while the Empire governs the galaxy. Can you help the Empire put a stop to this despicable practice? The reward will be well worth it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'The slavers will continue their operations unabated. How is this a success? We think you''d agree that this was a failure. Glad we''re on the same screen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'A clerical oversight resulted in these incorrect coordinates. We''ve fixed it. Please check in with us again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Handled like a true professional. You should consider working for us again in the near future. Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Stop the slavers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'A group of dangerous criminals is using an old halfway house in our area as a hideout and refuge from authorities. They use the halfway house''s former reputation, a place where reformed criminals were reintroduced into society, to mask their current illegal activities, including spice dealing and extortion. We want this place wiped out and those murderers run off or brought to justice. We can''t ignore their activities any longer. We''ll pay a reward to anyone willing to undertake and complete this task. Are you the citizen we''re looking for?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'That place will just keep attracting more undesirables until this entire neighborhood goes to the dump. Hopefully someone will claim this reward soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'We must have sent the wrong coordinates. Our apologies. Please check back with us again soon.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Citizens for a Clean Tomorrow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'We''re glad to see you share our enthusiasm to create safe neighborhoods for our children. You deserve this reward, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Clean out the halfway house'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Someone has been supplying the local gangs with homemade explosives, which they''ve gladly used in recent attacks. We knew it had to be someone in the area and launched an investigation. Finally, after weeks of work, we''ve discovered where these grenades are being constructed. A weapons lab is being run by a particularly vicious gang of killers. Many of them served in planetary security forces in the past but lost their jobs when the Empire began cleaning out these corrupt organizations. We need to take this lab out of commission, especially if it''s attracting disgruntled weapons specialists from around the galaxy. We require a small strike team of agents to go in there and blow that structure sky-high. But best be on your toes as those criminals have had some pretty advanced combat training. Can you help us out? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'We must have very different interpretations of "blowing that structure sky-high." Sorry, but we can''t reward what wasn''t accomplished.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'We''ll track down who sent you those false coordinates. We wonder if these explosives experts might not have a contact inside our department.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Now that''s what we call "blowing a structure sky-high." Nicely done, citizen. Take your reward and remember that there''s plenty more where that came from.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Blow up the explosives lab'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'A swoop gang has been terrorizing several communities. Their recent "fun" consists of zooming past shops or settlements and sniping citizens through windows or portals. The body count so far is nine dead and six others wounded. I want these animals stopped. Problem is, this gang is very mobile and have some insight into the movements of local law enforcement because they disappear before any raids or arrests can be made. Fortunately, I have contacts in the smuggling world (a long story that I won''t go into) and these gangsters have been buying shipments of glitterstim from someone I know (suffice it to say the old pirate owed me a favor). So now I have the coordinates to this swoop gang''s hideout. If I involve the authorities, these murderers disappear. So that''s where you come in. I''ll pay a handsome reward to any being (or beings) that will rid these besieged communities of these animals. My past hasn''t exactly been what you would call "upstanding" but I''m not gonna stand by and watch innocent folks get slaughtered. Not when I can do something about it. What about you?  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'One thing I learned in my youth - you always finish a job you accept. Maybe you''ll learn that one day too. Good luck. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Could my smuggler friend have been paid to protect these gangsters? I can''t believe he''d do that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'A Reformed Smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'You''re alright, buddy. Good to see that someone cares enough about other people to lend a hand. All the better that the hand is being paid for those efforts, eh? Being''s gotta make a living somehow.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Stop the swoop gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Deathsticks in a decent community!  Is nowhere safe from the corruption of this vile drug?  Recently I learned from respectable sources that a so-called "esteemed businessman" is secretly fronting a distribution center for this contemptible substance.  The villain''s business dealings span many star systems and so the local authorities have been reluctant to interfere.  But he underestimates the determination of upright Imperial citizens!  Who among us is bold enough to find this den of evil and stamp out this blight on galactic decency?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'Isn''t it convenient how this "esteemed businessman" always escapes serious harm?  How much did he pay you to spare his operation?  Is there no end to his corruption?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'I told you this "esteemed businessman" is a crafty devil.  Give me some time and I''ll see if I can find out where he moved his despicable operation.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'An Upstanding Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'You actually survived?  Um, excellent work!  Here, take this small token of gratitude for your act of decency.  And please don''t tell anyone who hired you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Stamp out a deathstick dealer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'As an esteemed businessman whose dealings span many star systems, I am in a state of outrage at the no-good meddling of a certain "upstanding citizen."  This rotten muck-leech has hired local muscle to interfere with my honest and legitimate trading operations.  He has blown up my establishments and accused me of certain unlawful actions for which he has no proof that I know of.  He has asked for protection money but a businessman like myself would rather spend the credits to put the squeeze on an enemy.  So I am offering a reward to any toughs or sharpshooters who can take out the office of this low-down nerf-herder and his gang of slugs.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'See?  I knew this "upright citizen" was really a no-good, dangerous thug.  Thanks for trying, pal, but you don''t get the reward for effort.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'Some "upright citizen," sneaking off like a dirty womp rat as soon as someone stands up to him.  Try me later and maybe I can track down this creep.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'An Esteemed Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Say, you''re pretty good at this racket.  You earned these creds.  I hear the "upright citizen" got away, but I''ll blink you when he turns up again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Break up an extortion gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'Killers for hire in the heart of a decent community!  Once again we are plagued by an underhanded villain in the guise of an "esteemed businessman."  This time he has hired a vicious pack of brutal thugs to terrorize upstanding citizens.  Why, these laser-armed ruffians blew apart my very own office!  But upright folk such as ourselves need not involve Imperial authorities to enforce moral discipline.  I have obtained the coordinates of the lair where these despicable savages charge their blasters and sharpen their knives.  Who shall fire the first shot in the name of galactic decency?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'The last group who marched against this "esteemed businessman" took a bribe to let him go.  How "convenient" that you failed, as well!  I''ve got my eye on you, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'This "esteemed businessman" is a slippery worm.  He must have moved his hired thugs to another lair.  I hope I can track them down again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'An Upstanding Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'You''re still alive?  Well done!  Now decent folk like myself can once again conduct our operations in peace.  Take this reward and please, don''t tell anyone who hired you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Purge a lair of professional thugs'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'As an esteemed businessman whose dealings span many star systems, I am shocked and in much distress over the low-down, rotten activities that a certain "upstanding citizen" has perpetrated while pretending that he is not a dirty, lawbreaking creep.  Not only has he stuck his proboscis into my own, completely lawful import business, but now I have learned that he is running a spice racket on the side.  I''ve had enough of that slime-grub and his two-faced meddling.  For any toughs or sharpshooters who have the guts, I have the coordinates of a depot where he stores his goods for shipping.  The Imperial authorities will be happy to see it burn to the ground.  I''ll even throw in a reward for anyone who does the job.  Sometimes a hard-working businessman like myself must play rough with creeps who stand in the way of honest and respectable trading.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'This "upstanding citizen" is nothing but a well-armed gangster.  Thanks for trying.  Better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'Mister "Upstanding Citizen" must have seen my message on the HoloNet and run like a cowardly Jawa.  I''ll find him again, though, don''t worry.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'An Esteemed Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'You''re pretty handy in a fight.  Take the reward and keep your eyes open.  I might have more jobs for you in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Take out a spice depot'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 85, 'm13d', 'Excuse me.  Normally I would not broadcast a message on this frequency, as I am only a protocol droid, but my present circumstances are most intolerable.  Since my master was taken away by the Empire for questionable political statements, I have been forced to deal with a collection of dubious characters who have taken up residence in the condensing station.  Condensed Threll gas is highly combustible, so I believe it is best to have these individuals removed from the premises.  I have a stipend of credits from which I can pay a reward.  Please contact me if you are able to help.  Thank you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 86, 'm13f', 'Oh, my.  It seems that removing these intruders will be more difficult than I thought.  Thank you for trying.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 87, 'm13i', 'I''m sorry, I must have transmitted the wrong coordinates.  I''m only a protocol droid and not very good with maps.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 88, 'm13l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 89, 'm13o', 'L-3PO'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 90, 'm13s', 'Oh, dear!  You destroyed the entire condensing station!  Please, just take these credits and go while I determine how I shall break the bad news to my poor, imprisoned master.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 91, 'm13t', 'Remove intruders from a condensing station'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 92, 'm14d', 'Recent intelligence points to one conclusion: Roughnecks from the frontier have begun to view this sector as a source of salvaged parts for their asteroid loaders.  Unfortunately, some of them have established a sabotage ring to provide a continuous supply of free salvage.  As the resources of the Empire are occupied with Rebels and other political offenders, we have decided to contract outside agents to deal with this new criminal enterprise.  Interested agents are encouraged to contact us for known locations of salvage drops.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 93, 'm14f', 'The Empire cannot waste resources on unqualified agents.  Come back when you can get the job done.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 94, 'm14i', 'We apologize for the incorrect coordinates.  Rebel saboteurs recently hit one of our data annexes.  We''ll sort out the damage soon enough.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 95, 'm14l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 96, 'm14o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 97, 'm14s', 'The Empire thanks you for contributing to the wellbeing of the community.  Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 98, 'm14t', 'Strike against a sabotage ring'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 99, 'm15d', 'It''s not podracing, but who doesn''t enjoy testing his landspeeder on the local drag lanes?  In my career I have collected an assortment of vintage speeders to pit against my fellow repulsorlift enthusiasts.  The problem is, lately the speeder races have been taken over by a gang of shady offworlders.  I have proof that they are foiling their opponents'' turbine filters, which accounts for their undefeated record.  Unfortunately these skettos are so well armed that no one is willing to confront them.  But enough is enough.  I''m down to my last lasercharged X-34.  I''m willing to pay anyone who can blast up their hangout and make them understand that cheating is unacceptable in this old and honorable sport.  Contact me for the coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 100, 'm15f', 'I warned you this wouldn''t be easy.  Maybe someone else can teach these sharks a lesson.  Till then I''ll just keep this reward money.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 101, 'm15i', 'I could swear I had the right coordinates.  I''ll have to double-check them.  Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 102, 'm15l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 103, 'm15o', 'A Speeder Enthusiast'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 104, 'm15s', 'Wonderful job!  Now I can rebuild my landspeeder collection without fear.  Take this reward and please, come out to the drag lanes sometime.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 105, 'm15t', 'Punish a den of landspeeder sharks'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 106, 'm16d', 'As if droid scrap fighting were not seedy enough!  Now the sponsors of these disreputable contests have begun to steal shipments of droids to squander in their oily pits of destruction.  If these criminals disrupt my business any further, I am in danger of losing my Imperial contract.  Therefore I am offering a substantial reward to anyone who has the fortitude and the means to wipe out one of these loathesome scrap fighting arenas.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 107, 'm16f', 'Looks like the arena organizers can fight as well as their pit droids.  Maybe you should try again when you''re better equipped for the job.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 108, 'm16i', 'It''s amazing how several dozen spectators can find the scrap fighting arena every week and I can''t even give you the proper coordinates.  Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 109, 'm16l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 110, 'm16o', 'Yizz the Droid Merchant'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 111, 'm16s', 'Excellent!  I don''t suppose in the mayhem you happened to spare any of my stolen droids?  No?  Well, I had to ask.  Here''s the reward, as promised. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 112, 'm16t', 'Destroy a pit of droid thieves'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 113, 'm17d', 'Do you think Sith Lords are made overnight? No, my young apprentice, they require years of careful grooming and training in the Dark Side. Yes, I''m sure you''ve guessed who I am by now. I am the Emperor! And I require you, my young apprentice, to obliterate some annoying servants for me. They have disturbed me once too often during my clandestine visits to my various systems. I find their pitiful attempts to match the glory of the Dark Side beneath contempt. You will crush them, my young apprentice. Show them the power of the Dark Side. Rewards will be yours and perhaps one day you may rise to the level of a Sith Lord yourself. I will tell you how to find these loathsome servants after you accept. And I know you will. Hahahahaha!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 114, 'm17f', 'You are not shaping up to be a respectable Sith Lord if these are the results I can expect from you. How pathetic! Begone, foul apprentice!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 115, 'm17i', 'You must use the Dark Side to find these miscreants, apprentice. This was part of your test. You''re not impressing me.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 116, 'm17l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 117, 'm17o', 'The Emperor (Honest)'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 118, 'm17s', 'You have done well, my young apprentice. Soon the galaxy shall see the rise of a new Sith Lord. But only if you continue to serve me faithfully.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 119, 'm17t', 'Help a deranged citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_gangster.stf', 120, 'number_of_entries', '17'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Sometimes planetary governments overstep their authority, which can cause headaches for Imperial law enforcement.  Case in point: The king of Malgwen IV has mistakenly issued pardons to a notorious band of pirates who once terrorized the Aparo Sector.  While the Imperial Navy has sent a Star Destroyer to instruct the king in the particulars of galactic law, we must also explain to these pirates that their pardons are incorrect on a few minor points.  For this purpose we are contracting an enforcement team to blast their den into a smoking heap of bodies and microscopic rubble.  Perhaps in the future such mistakes in legal protocol will occur less frequently.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'Perhaps the subtleties of galactic law escape you.  Next time we shall assign you a mission of a less intricate nature.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'I''m afraid any complaints about incorrect coordinates must be filed in person with the Imperial Bureau of Cartographical Precision, Coruscant Division.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'You have a knack for the precise workings of galactic law.  Perhaps you should consider applying to the Imperial Bar.  Your services would be most welcome.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Instruct a band of pirates in Imperial protocol'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'Some women would be ashamed to admit that they married the wrong man, but I''m not one to lie to myself.  Karst Bono charmed his way right into my family inheritance.  Then he took everything he could grab and returned to his wretched hive of pirate friends.  Never trust a gentleman pirate.  I will not deny that I made a mistake, but I am prepared to clean up the mess I made.  All I need are a few skilled hands to visit my delinquent husband and his thieving friends.  The remedy to my problem is simple.  Raze the pirates'' den to the ground and laser the pack of scoundrels into dust.  Extermination is the simplest form of divorce.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'You weren''t successful?  That''s unfortunate.  I hope my husband doesn''t hold this against me at the divorce proceedings.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'They must have known you were coming.  I hope my husband doesn''t hold this against me at the divorce proceedings.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'An Impending Widow'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Thank you.  That was better than alimony.  Here''s your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Raze a pirates'' den'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'I always instruct my freight pilots to cooperate with pirates, because freebooting need not entail bloodshed.  However, one of my ships has just been robbed of something more valuable than mere cargo.  The databanks of a stolen computer included some private business records which need to remain discreet.  My insurance company may not approve of any correlation between my losses to pirates and my contacts with same.  Therefore, much as I am loathe the interfere with the entrepeneurial spirit, I need to hire some agents to infiltrate a certain landing bay and ensure that the stolen computer is destroyed.  Just to be safe, while said agents are on the premises, they should level the place and make sure that none of the pirates escape.  I would not require such severe measures if I did not have the utmost respect for this ancient profession.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'While I have great respect for the time-honored profession of freebooting, I cannot abide agents who fail me.  Come back when you''re prepared to finish the job properly.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'I was assured that the pirates could be found at that coordinates.  I wonder what game their captain is up to?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'A Respectful Merchant'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Such a shame.  Those poor pirates were only trying to make their way in the universe.  Perhaps you should consider filling the void they left behind.  Think of this payment as seed money and let me know what you decide.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Destroy a stolen computer and the pirates who took it'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'A wedding is a beautiful thing, don''t you agree?  My eldest son is engaged to a harem of twelve Ithorian sisters.  They will not make the most graceful of wives, but they do bring a respectable dowry.  Unfortunately a squadron of pirate fighters has been threatening the local star lanes.  I am concerned that the dowry may be stolen.  The wedding would then be cancelled, which would break my poor son''s heart.  Please, can you help a loving father by blasting all trace of these pirate scum from surface of the planet?  Do it for the cause of love, and you shall receive a hefty pile of credits for your trouble.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'My son''s heart will crack when he hears that the dowry is still in danger.  I suppose I need someone more skilled at death and mayhem to safeguard his happiness.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Sometimes pirates are difficult to track down.  I''ll try to get more precise coordinates.  Check back later.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'A Loving Father'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Truly yours was an act of love.  Here are the promised credits to defray the cost of thermal detonators and blaster fuel.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Protect a wedding by eliminating pirates'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Vile pirates in our very own sector!  These despicable cutthroats have raided one of our volunteer freight ships and stolen a precious cargo of Kowakian monkey-lizards headed for orphans on Gamorr.  In response we have sold enough home-baked Horquad cakes to hire a team of assassins to lay waste to these loathsome murderers.  We have the coordinates to their secret den.  Leave no wall standing!  We must fight back in the name of goodness and virtue.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'We didn''t hire you to hear excuses.  Does your mother know what a failure you''ve become?  Honestly, there''s no pride in the galaxy anymore.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'I''m positive those were the proper coordinates.  If you can''t find the place, just say so.  We''re Toydarians; excuses don''t work on us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Toydarian Women''s League'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Those poor orphans will never get their monkey-lizards, but at least they can lay down their little heads at night knowing that the villains who robbed them died a horrible, fiery death.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Pirates have stolen pets from orphans!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'There is a Gamorrean warrior standing beside me.  He seems to want me to broadcast a request for him.  By his grunts and pointing, I''m pretty sure that he wants someone to destroy a pirate cantina not far from here.  At least I think that''s what he wants.  He gave me a bunch of credits, which I suppose are intended to be payment.  Anyway, I''ll transmit the coordinates of the cantina to anyone who''s interested.  Please respond quickly and make sure all the pirates are killed.  This Gamorrean has a very large axe in his hand.  I''m afraid he''s going to hurt me if I don''t get this right.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'I''m afraid the Gamorrean is not happy about this failure.  He''s waving his axe in the air.  Oh no, he''s coming at me!  Wait, please, don''t hurt merfghnjmkjllkkkkk'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'I didn''t think those were the right coordinates, but the Gamorrean kept snorting at me when I entered different ones.  Now he''s even more upset that nothing happened.  I have a bad feeling about this.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'A Cooperative Citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Oh boy.  Now that you''ve destroyed the pirate cantina, I''m not so sure that''s what the Gamorrean wanted.  He sees the smoke and is getting upset.  I don''t suppose you could give me back those credits?  Please?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'A request on behalf of a Gamorrean warrior'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Ion cannons are the ideal weapon for space pirates.  The Empire is very careful to restrict the movement of artillery-class ion guns, yet inevitably some of them fall into the wrong hands.  Fortunately less experienced pirates fail to disable the tracking circuits, allowing us to locate and disable the cannons.  The preferred method for such action is a swift ground strike, killing everyone and utterly razing the pirate installation.  We routinely hire civilian contractors for these tasks.  Interested parties may contact us for the appropriate coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'Private contractors who fail to deliver are guilty of financial fraud.  We shall assign an Imperial inquisitor to audit your case.  Cooperation is cheerfully recommended.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'It seems that someone tampered with the tracking circuit.  We have noted this complication in the case file.  Please contact with us again for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'The Empire appreciates a reliable contractor.  Here is your payment.  Please contact us again for more assignments.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Destroy a pirate''s ion cannon'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'This is going to sound strange, but hear me out.  A band of pirates has set up shop in my district with a peculiar method of operation.  They force ships to land using a small ion cannon, and then employ a stolen AT-AT walker to subdue the survivors and spirit away the cargo.  My problem isn''t that the pirates are active.  Rather their possession of an AT-AT is extremely dangerous to me.  The Empire audits all of my records.  If I send my own security forces to deal with this situation, the reports will wind up in the hands of the military and my planet may become one of the Empire''s famous "examples to others."  So I need to delegate this assignment to an outside force.  Payment will reflect an assumption of discretion.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Lucky for you I can''t report this failure or the Empire will find out about the pirates'' AT-AT.  But I''m going to keep my eye on you, all the same.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'I can''t confirm the coordinates of the pirate base without tipping off the Imperial auditors.  I''ll have to check out the situation personally.  Try me again later.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'Local Prefect C-912'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'My men have confirmed that there''s no trace of the AT-AT on the site.  You may have saved the entire planet.  Good work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Eliminate an unusual pirate gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'There''s a code, you know, among the brotherhood of pirates.  At the top of the list is this: There''s folks you steal from and there''s folks you buy from.  The two don''t mix.  My particular profession, for instance, is historically exempt from piracy.  But a certain newcomer seems to lack historical perspective.  Not long ago he took from me a shipment of Dressellian smoke-rum and has failed to settle the account.  Another customer has provided me with the coordinates of his private villa.  I need a group of toughs to trash the place and explain to him the consequences of flouting tradition.  If he and his crew do not live long enough to apply this lesson, my heart shall not be broken.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'Seems this newcomer put up more of a fight than we bargained for.  I''ll have to re-think my strategy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'My customer gave me the wrong coordinates?  Interesting.  I''ll have to see if it was deliberate or a mistake.  A merchant''s job is never done.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'An Irate Wine and Spirits Merchant'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'It''s a shame that simple ignorance has led to this tragic loss.  That was a particularly nice batch of smoke-rum.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Explain polite behavior to a pirate captain'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'With so many of our resources handling political offenses, sometimes the Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations must hire contractors to deal with ordinary crimes such as piracy. For instance, we have the coordinates of a small habitation which is suspected to harbor a dangerous crew of notorious pirates.  We need a team of civilians to reconnoiter the area and destroy all buildings and collateral assets they find.  Of course "collateral assets" include pirates, suspected pirate sympathizers and those associated with suspected pirate sympathizers.  Efficient execution of these instructions will result in a favorable ranking on our official list of contractors.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'You are an inefficient contractor.  This breach of contract shall be noted in our records.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'It is the responsibility of a contractor to confirm an assignment before accepting it.  Our records will note your failure to verify these coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'You are an efficient contractor and loyal Imperial citizen.  We have noted this in our records.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Routine elimination of pirates and suspected pirate sympathizers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'Unbelievable.  These days anyone thinks they can become a pirate.  A large collection of jizz musicians has bought themselves a stash of weapons and decided to call themselves hardened criminals.  It''s not even worth a real pirate''s time to teach them a lesson.  So on behalf of parties who shall go unnamed, I am hiring some muscle to show these jizz-wailers what real trouble looks like.  Go to their den at these coordinates and show them no mercy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'Can''t even whack a few jizz-wailers, eh?  Then there''s no money for you, my friend.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'I could have sworn those were the right coordinates.  Let me check my map and get back to you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'A Helpful Accomplice'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'Alas, the jizz community shall mourn the loss of these clowns.  The rest of us raise our glasses to a job well done.  Enjoy the reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Whack some wannabe pirates'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Pirates have always interfered with our freighters, but lately a particular captain has become a singular nuisance.  In this sector he is known as the Black Scourge.  An absurd rumor claims that he is a simple MSE-6 mouse droid, but of course that''s ridiculous.  Could a mouse droid make a shambles of all our trade with the Empire?  Could it steal a shipment of tractor beams from under our noses while tricking two squadrons of TIE escorts into attacking each other?  Whoever this devil really is, we now have the coordinates of the secret hangar from which he and his seasoned accomplices plot their next deadly assault.  We require the services of a battle-hardened team to storm this lethal den and eliminate the dangerous murderers within.  Our business with the Empire depends upon success.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'Your failure has resulted in the Black Scourge''s escape!  Our contracts with the Empire are now in serious jeopardy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'Curse that Black Scourge!  He must have sliced into our datanet and changed the coordinates.  We''ll find him yet!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'The Rodian Industrial Consortium'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'Well done!  Our investigators confirm that the only "survivor" was a worn-looking mouse droid, which we left behind in the rubble.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Eliminate the Black Scourge'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 85, 'm13d', 'We have pinpointed the coordinates of a ground-based tractor beam used by area pirates.  For a percentage the owners use the beam to trap merchant ships so that space pirates can board them.  We need a civilian strike team to take out the weapon.  The site is heavily guarded, so be prepared for a fight.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 86, 'm13f', 'We warned you to be prepared for trouble.  Evidently you were not prepared enough.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 87, 'm13i', 'We suspect that our informant provided us with false coordinates.  We are having a long discussion with him about the matter.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 88, 'm13l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 89, 'm13o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 90, 'm13s', 'Now the merchants who fly through local space have one less worry.  Well done.  Here is your payment.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 91, 'm13t', 'Take out a pirate tractor beam'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 92, 'm14d', 'Our informants have assured us that quite a number of wanted pirates frequent an obscure little cantina at these coordinates.  Enterprising freelancers are encouraged to remove this blight from the planet.  A substantial reward is available.  These are hardened criminals and will be well-armed.  The cantina is billed as a "private club," so don''t expect a warm welcome.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 93, 'm14f', 'The Empire does not forgive failure.  This incident shall be noted in your file.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 94, 'm14i', 'We did say the cantina was obscure.  Perhaps our coordinates were in error.  Come back later and we''ll have this sorted out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 95, 'm14l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 96, 'm14o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 97, 'm14s', 'Here is your reward.  The star lanes are safer thanks to your good work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 98, 'm14t', 'Erase a shady cantina from the community'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 99, 'm15d', 'Even pirates have to eat.  We have the coordinates of a secret depot where these space outlaws buy contraband food supplies without notifying the authorities that they have landed.  We need some experienced freelancers to blast the site to smoke and rubble.  There are usually one or two armed pirate crews in the area, so destroying this depot entails some danger.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 100, 'm15f', 'These cutthroats have plagued this system for far too long.  We need someone to complete this assignment and send them a clear message that they''re not welcome here.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 101, 'm15i', 'When you deal with underworld informants, sometimes you get faulty data.  We''ll double-check the coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 102, 'm15l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 103, 'm15o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 104, 'm15s', 'Excellent.  Those space scum need to understand that their cutthroat ways are not welcome in this system.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 105, 'm15t', 'Destroy an outlaw supply depot');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 106, 'm16d', 'An enterprising pirate captain recently stole a cargo of Imperial probe droids.  With a little reprogramming these droids have become his scouts in the area, monitoring the local spaceports and alerting him when a rich freighter takes off.  Our own probots have tracked his droids to a well-fortified terminal off the beaten path.  We would like to contract some freelancers to stage an assault on the terminal and blast it into oblivion.  Survivors are not encouraged.  Contact us for the coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 107, 'm16f', 'We cannot abide these probe droids making life easy for this pirate.  Perhaps you know of someone who is competant enough to finish the job?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 108, 'm16i', 'Our probots must have transmitted the wrong coordinates to us.  We''ll deploy more to determine what went wrong.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 109, 'm16l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 110, 'm16o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 111, 'm16s', 'Good work.  Without his fleet of probe droids, that pirate will have to track down his quarry the old-fashioned way.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 112, 'm16t', 'Blast a pirate droid terminal to oblivion'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 113, 'm17d', 'A good captain likes to challenge his crew every now and then.  I''ve got some brutes in my employ whose mettle needs testing.  To do this I need some handy marksmen to launch a surprise assault on the barracks where they''re currently lodging.  Show them no mercy.  Only the toughest freelancers need apply, and I''ll pay handsomely if you do the job well.  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 114, 'm17f', 'That was a pathetic effort.  You''d never cut it on my crew.  Get lost.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 115, 'm17i', 'I can navigate hyperspace with the best of''em, but I''m not real handy with surface coordinates.  Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 116, 'm17l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 117, 'm17o', 'A Good Captain'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 118, 'm17s', 'Hm.  I expected at least a few of my crew to survive.  Well, I guess they weren''t up to the rigors of the job.  Here''s your payment.  I don''t suppose you''re looking for work?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 119, 'm17t', 'Attack a barracks'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_pirate.stf', 120, 'number_of_entries', '17'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'Spice smuggling and gunrunning has risen dramatically in this sector. With the help of Imperial Intelligence, we''ve managed to locate the hideout of a notorious band of smugglers. We don''t want to bother the Imperial Military with this matter so we thought we''d take care of it locally. There are plenty of loyal and able-bodied citizens willing to help the local law enforcement authorities, after all. This mission will be perilous and therefore we''re offering a compensatory reward. However, a thorough job must be done. The base must be wiped out. Can you lend a hand, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'It seems the mission was beyond your scope, citizen. We''ll try and find some more appropriate agents. Thank you for your time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'We must inform Intelligence that their coordinates might have been tampered with. It must be the work of Rebels.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'Mission accomplished, citizen. We knew we could rely on the brave citizens of the Empire to help keep their systems free of crime. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Help local law enforcement'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'As with any sort of vermin, once you clean out the nest, the infestation will disappear. So it is with smugglers, citizen. We know of a local warehouse being used to store all sorts of contraband, from illegal weapons to glitterstim spice. We need a team of law-abiding citizens to clean this "nest" out. We''re certain that the smugglers will stop coming around here when they see what ordinary citizens are willing to do to their ill-gotten goods. Do you think you could help us out with this, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Maybe you''re not cut out for this sort of work. Thanks for your time anyway, citizen. Good luck.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'There was a miscommunication apparently. Sorry about that. We''ll get those coordinates right.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'That was a thorough job, citizen. I doubt those vermin will be coming around here anymore. Collect your well-earned credits.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Wipe out smuggler den'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'Catching smugglers can be like trying to catch flies with your hand, citizen - you have to be fast and alert if you want to succeed. We''ve certainly been alert, and now we need someone to be fast for us. We''ve tracked down a smuggler''s outpost used to store contraband and harbor criminals. We don''t have the manpower necessary to strike this den of thieves, but we can certainly try to entice enterprising citizens into doing it for us. There''s a juicy reward in it for you if you succeed. Come on, citizen, the Empire could really use your help. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Well I guess you weren''t fast enough. We''ll have to move fast if we still hope to eliminate this outpost. Better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'Hm, perhaps we weren''t as alert as we thought. We''ll have to double-check those coordinates.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Seems like you were fast enough to catch those particular flies, eh, citizen? Good job. You''ll make a fine law enforcement agent yet.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Remove smugglers'' outpost'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'There are smugglers and there are smugglers, if you know what I mean. Some of these second-rate flyboys don''t merit our full attention but neither can we afford to completely ignore them. If they''re contracted for a job, even a small job, and hydrospanner it to pieces then you''ve got to pay the penalty. Our organization is offering a reward to anyone who can settle some of these small matters for us. We have the coordinates to various hideouts used by these smugglers and need someone to make sure they don''t offer their incompetent services to anyone again. Blast their hideouts to pieces. Blast them to pieces too if they''re there. Collect from us when you''re done. See? That''s how all business should be conducted. Simple and easy.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'It was the phrase "simple and easy" that threw you, wasn''t it? We''ll just add you to our list of "incompetent agents." Good-bye.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'These shifty characters move around a lot, as you can imagine. Keep checking back with us, we''ll eventually get you a set of coordinates that are still valid.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Black Sun'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'Handled like a true professional. Very good. Collect your reward and move on to the next one.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Take out some amateurs'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'Smugglers certainly prosper in times of civil crisis. The Rebellion is unfortunately creating many job opportunities for these lowlifes and is in fact attracting more unemployed pilots to the trade. Our job is to wipe them out as fast as we can find them, but we can''t do it alone. We''ll gladly offer a reward to anyone that cares to lend a helping blaster. We have the coordinates to their bases of operation and need them cleaned out. We don''t really care how you do it as long as the bases are left in a shambles. Can you help the Empire with this work, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'Maybe moisture farming is more your speed, eh? This dangerous work should be left to the serious professionals with plenty of nerve. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'Some of these coordinates are old, true. We''ll just cross out the ones that are no longer valid. Thanks for checking that for us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Fairly effective, citizen. We think you may have found a new line of work. Plenty of it these days too. Enjoy your reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Help local law enforcement'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'I don''t know who''s been telling these space slugs that smuggling is glamorous or easy work. Seems like everyone is trying to get in on the action. Just creates more work for us, of course. We''ve been authorized to employ independent agents to help with the workload. You enjoy blasting things? Like doing it with the weight of the law behind you? Well here''s your chance, citizen. We''ll provide you with the coordinates to a known smuggler''s base and your trigger-happy self can have a grand old time. Blast away! When the job''s done we''ll throw in some credits for your trouble. Not a bad job, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'Too bad your skill was not the equal of your enthusiasm. Well that''s how the droid clanks. Thanks for the attempt, though. Too bad we don''t reward attempts.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'We thought some of these locations might be bogus. Good we''re finding out which ones are, eh?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'Imperial Office of Criminal Investigations'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'Well it sure looks like you can use that blaster instead of just wearing it. Good for you! Here''s the credits we promised. Blast more, get more.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Hunt smugglers'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'We have some legitimate complaints concerning some local smugglers. We don''t really want to involve the authorities - you know how messy that can get. Instead we''d like to try and handle this matter in a more discreet manner. We''ll offer a substantial reward to anyone that cares to pay these smugglers a visit and show them the effectiveness of the working end of a blaster. No names are necessary. We''ll provide you the coordinates and insure that payment is made into your account when the job is complete. How about it? You think you could handle some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'Your failure to handle this matter has caused us to rethink our strategy - or at least our choice of agents. The galaxy''s a dangerous place, you know. Hope you can survive out there.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'Wrong coordinates? How embarrassing. Please excuse our small oversight and try checking back with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'A Simple Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Well done. Your account will be credited. Do look us up in the future.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Help a businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'I was warned not to go with the cheapest rate when it came to smuggling, but did I listen? Now I''m in this position of having to pay someone to take care of the problem caused by going with the bargain smuggler. Those are two words that should never go together, huh? "Bargain" and "smuggling." The deal is the usual one, of course. I pay a reward for having someone take this cheap swindler and their base out and you are the someone that either accepts or declines the offer. If you accept, the coordinates to this slug''s base will be transmitted to you. If you decline, our business is concluded. So which will it be?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'It would have been easier if you had simply declined. Guess I''ll keep looking for that "someone."'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'My assistant sent those coordinates. Now it looks like I''ll have to fire him. Why does everything bad always happen to me?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'A Tired Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Good work, good job, and all that. Your reward will be sent to your account. I''m sure you''re thrilled.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Take out the bargain smuggler'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Oh, I hope I''m doing this right. Okay, here goes... \n\nHello. I''m looking for someone brave and enterprising. Oh, and good-looking wouldn''t hurt either. Although it''s not really necessary for this mission. I just prefer good-looking people. Well groomed, at the very least. Anyway, I need someone with the aforementioned qualities to find a very bad person for me. Find them and teach them a good lesson. You can even burn their base to the ground. I prefer that, actually. This scoundrel cheated my family out of a lot of money. Made my father sick, as a matter of fact. My poor father, he''d just die if he knew I was doing this. But it has to be done. I rely on the discretion of whomever accepts this assignment. And if you do accept, I''ll tell you where to find this nerf-herder. I hope you accept. Oh, and you don''t really have to be good-looking or well groomed. I was just being silly. Okay, thanks. Talk to you soon. I hope.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'So you failed to teach this slug a lesson, okay. I can live with that. That''s how it goes, right? You weren''t expecting to be paid, right? Because, I''m not paying you. You failed, remember?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'Oh, gosh, I''m so sorry I gave you the wrong coordinates. This is my first time doing this, in case you couldn''t tell. Check back with me and I''m sure I''ll have it all straightened out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'An Indignant Woman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'Wonderful! I knew you could do it! I''m so happy. My family thanks you. Good job! Oh, I need to pay you now, huh? Okay, I''ll do that. My hero.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Avenge a wronged family'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'Let''s get down to business. I give you the location of some former business associates, you burn their hangout to the ground and make sure no one lives to tell the tale, and I pay you lots of credits for your trouble. Only serious professionals need apply. You in?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'I said only serious professionals need apply. What part of that did you not understand? Beat it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'I was just testing your resolve. Check back with me and I''ll give you the correct coordinates. Can''t be too sure these days, you know what I mean?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'An Impatient Businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Did the job, collect the credits, see you around.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Conclude a small business deal'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 71, 'm11d', 'The Rebellion might have been crushed by now if not for the activities of these smugglers. They''re a thorn in the side of the Empire and must be stamped out. The Imperial Military has their hands full trying to track dangerous terrorists down so we must rely on the loyalty and patriotism of Imperial citizens to help wipe out this smuggler menace. Our contacts with Imperial Intelligence have fortunately allowed us to acquire the locations of several smuggler bases. A substantial reward awaits the successful destruction of these bases. Can the Empire count on your help, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 72, 'm11f', 'We suppose not all Imperial citizens are cut out to perform this sort of duty. Have you considered a career in the custodial engineering field?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 73, 'm11i', 'It seems that some of these coordinates are outdated. We''ll have to amend our list.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 74, 'm11l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 75, 'm11o', 'COMPNOR'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 76, 'm11s', 'A successful strike against the smugglers is a blow against the Rebellion, citizen. Bravo. The reward is yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 77, 'm11t', 'Be a good Imperial citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 78, 'm12d', 'Smugglers? No sir, don''t like ''em. In fact, I don''t like ''em enough to offer a reward to anyone brave enough to wield a blaster against those space slugs. My contacts in the Imperial Transport Authority has given me access to the locations of some suspected smuggler lairs. The Empire''s too busy playing war with those Rebels to really do anything about these bases and we''re terribly understaffed (and underpaid, I might add). So why am I doing this? Well truth be told, I lost my wife to one of these scoundrels. Now I want some payback, ya hear? So, you in or out?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 79, 'm12f', 'No worries, I''m used to seeing incompetence in my office. Deal with it everyday. Too bad in my office it doesn''t mean you don''t get paid. Here it does.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 80, 'm12i', 'Now I never said all those coordinates were accurate, did I? Some are, some aren''t. You gotta work for this reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 81, 'm12l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 82, 'm12o', 'An Angry Civil Servant'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 83, 'm12s', 'That''s showing ''em. I bet those smugglers didn''t know what hit ''em. Way to go. The reward''s yours.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 84, 'm12t', 'Correct an injustice'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 85, 'm13d', 'We''re tired of smugglers posing as legitimate transport captains and taking away our business. So many clients have started relying on organized transport guilds rather than on freelance pilots because they think every independent pilot is actually a smuggler and they don''t want to risk having their shipments seized. Well we''ve followed some of these smugglers and have located several of their bases. We''re not soldiers, though, so we need someone to go into these bases and blow them to atoms. We''ve pooled together a decent amount of credits to serve as a reward. Do you think you have the stomach and the wherewithal to pull off a mission like this?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 86, 'm13f', 'No results, no payment, sorry. We would have thought that was fairly obvious from the start.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 87, 'm13i', 'Those bases get abandoned after a short while, it seems. We''ll just have to keep following those smugglers and see where they nest next.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 88, 'm13l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 89, 'm13o', 'Independent Transport Pilots'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 90, 'm13s', 'Good job, citizen. You ever consider doing this professionally? You''d make a pretty decent crime fighter. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 91, 'm13t', 'Help independent transport pilots'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 92, 'm14d', 'I used to be a Police Prefect on Tatooine. That is until I lost my job due to the activities of several traitorous smugglers. We had a system. It was all worked out. But some people have to buck that system. They''re not happy with the status quo. Well if my career is ruined then so will those smugglers'' careers. I''m offering a generous reward to anyone who will obliterate those smugglers'' bases and make sure they never trouble another prefect again. If you accept, I''ll transmit the coordinates to you. You''d better go in shooting first and asking questions later. If you even get to the questions part, that is.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 93, 'm14f', 'You remind me of some of my law enforcement agents - high on bluster but low on results. Too bad.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 94, 'm14i', 'They won''t escape me for long, trust me. I''ll find them, I swear. Keep checking back with me.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 95, 'm14l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 96, 'm14o', 'A Disgraced Former Prefect'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 97, 'm14s', 'Now those are results you can take to your superiors. Good work! Keep at it. There''s plenty more where this reward came from.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 98, 'm14t', 'Destroy smuggler bases'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 99, 'm15d', 'I was a legitimate businessman, obeying all the Imperial laws and ordinances and working hard to raise a family. Until the day a smuggler, posing as an independent transport pilot, came into my life and ruined everything I had worked so hard to get. I lost my business, my family, and my self-respect. Well I intend to get that last bit back. I''m offering a reward, everything I have left, to anyone who can make sure this smuggler doesn''t ruin any other honest, hard-working businessmen. I know where that damn smuggler hides, you see. They think they''re safe but we''ll soon show them how wrong they are. Can you help a man regain his self-respect, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 100, 'm15f', 'Now I''m sure this smuggler will "disappear" for a while. Damn! Why couldn''t you have just finished the job? Why?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 101, 'm15i', 'That dirty smuggler must have known I was sending folks after them. I must keep trying to track them down.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 102, 'm15l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 103, 'm15o', 'A Desperate Man'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 104, 'm15s', 'Well struck, citizen! Haha! Take that, you dirty, rotten smuggler! Take the reward, citizen, you''ve earned it. My self-respect is restored thanks to you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 105, 'm15t', 'Help the disgraced businessman'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 106, 'm16d', 'I knew you would look at this offer, citizen. You know why? Because I''m the Emperor! Yes, that''s right. And now you are my willing minion. What do I require of you, you ask? Well it seems that some of my minions are not as obedient as you. They have decided it would be amusing to betray their Emperor. Now they will pay the price for their lack of vision. And you, my young apprentice, will be the instrument of their demise. Hahahahaha! You will receive my generous gratitude in addition to some form of lucre. Who knows, if you perform up to my standards, I may call you to Imperial Center and appoint you as one of my advisors. I know that would please you. Will you take your place at my side?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 107, 'm16f', 'Young fool, only now, at the end, do you understand the price of your failure. Turn yourself in to the nearest stormtrooper garrison and demand that you be shot at once! I will be watching you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 108, 'm16i', 'You can''t even follow some simple coordinates? You disappoint me, my young apprentice.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 109, 'm16l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 110, 'm16o', 'The Emperor (Honest)'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 111, 'm16s', 'Excellent! Everything is proceeding exactly as I have foreseen it. You will rise quickly in my estimation, young apprentice. Keep it up.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 112, 'm16t', 'Help a deranged citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_neutral_medium_smuggler.stf', 113, 'default', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 1, 'm1d', 'As if we didn''t have enough problems dealing with the Empire, it seems a local gang of thugs has been harassing citizens sympathetic to the Alliance. We''ve located their hangout - a hive of scum and villainy if ever there was one. We need someone to drive these criminals out and make sure they don''t set up camp in this area again. These creeps are even endangering our children. Someone must stamp this fire out before it becomes an uncontrollable blaze. Is there anyone out there willing to help us?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 2, 'm1f', 'This gang will attract more of its kind. Soon we may have Black Sun operatives muscling into the area. We wish you could have taken care of this, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 3, 'm1i', 'Seems this gang will be harder to pin down than we thought. They''ll probably move around quite a bit, trying to prevent a coordinated attack by brave individuals such as yourself. We''ll keep a sharp eye out for them.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 4, 'm1l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 5, 'm1o', 'A concerned citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 6, 'm1s', 'That mangy pack of neks won''t be coming around here anymore. Good work, citizen! The Alliance could use more folks like you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 7, 'm1t', 'Destroy gang''s hangout'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 8, 'm2d', 'We think COMPNOR has been hiring some good-for-nothings to cause trouble for us citizens who support the Alliance. These thugs are really just petty criminals but they get bold when they assemble in a pack. Wouldn''t take much to scare these slugs off, especially if the shelter they''ve built for themselves were torn down. We certainly could use someone bold and noble to help us out. Someone who could find these guys and show them that not all citizens are easy prey. Is there someone out there like this?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 9, 'm2f', 'Perhaps these slugs were tougher than we thought. It''s a shame you couldn''t drive them away. We''ll have to deal with this situation somehow.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 10, 'm2i', 'They must have moved their shelter. We bet they got word someone tough was on the way. Told you they were cowards. Check back with us, in case they pop up again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 11, 'm2l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 12, 'm2o', 'A concerned citizen'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 13, 'm2s', 'Good job! I bet those slugs ran faster than they ever have before. How we wish we could have been there to see their faces. Glad to see we can rely on you. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 14, 'm2t', 'Destroy troublemakers'' shelter '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 15, 'm3d', 'I''m so darn tired of those COMPNOR bullies! Pushing decent folk around and telling us what to think. Well, I''ve had enough, I tell ya! Enough! I''m offering a reward to any brave soul that wants to take those ruffians down a notch or two. They think that by setting up some sort of propagandy office they can intimidate the rest of us into kowtowing to that blasted New Order? Well I say phooey on the New Order! Phooey! I know my friends warned me not to mention my name, but by golly we gotta start standing up to these Imperial creeps or else we''re doomed. So come on, claim your reward and do us all a huge favor. Get rid of these criminals and burn their propagandy to ashes!'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 16, 'm3f', 'Sorry there, citizen, but I can''t reward ya for something that wasn''t done. Come back when you can finish the job.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 17, 'm3i', 'See? Those COMPNOR clones get word that decent folk are tired of their shenanigans and they run like scared jakrabs! They''ll be back though, you mark my words.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 18, 'm3l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 19, 'm3o', 'Kute D. Geezor'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 20, 'm3s', 'Now that''s what I''m talking about, citizen! Stellar performance. Those COMPNOR slugs won''t come slithering around here no more. Take your credits, youngster, you deserve ''em.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 21, 'm3t', 'Destroy COMPNOR station'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 22, 'm4d', 'Just because some criminals declare loyalty to the Empire and wear COMPNOR badges, they think they can prey on the rest of us without fear of the law. These goons have been breaking into our homes and speeders, taking what they want and laughing in our faces about it. They shout "Hail the Empire!" as they drive by the settlement they robbed the night before. A few folks have even been killed defending their property. We''re offering a reward to anyone who is willing to put a stop to this. These slugs are murderers and thieves. We know where they hang out. Will you be the one who delivers us from this tyranny?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 23, 'm4f', 'We''ll just keep looking for the right champion. We know there''s someone out there who can help us. This reward money is everything we have but we''re willing to part with it if it means we can walk our streets again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 24, 'm4i', 'Maybe the Empire finally chose to put a stop to this criminal activity. No, more likely they moved their hangout so enraged citizens couldn''t burn it in the middle of the night.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 25, 'm4l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 26, 'm4o', 'Desperate citizens'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 27, 'm4s', 'We knew there was an upstanding citizen out there somewhere. Hurray! You have our thanks and the reward. You richly deserve both.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 28, 'm4t', 'Stop the ring of thieves'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 29, 'm5d', 'A local swoop gang has been terrorizing the area. They call themselves the "Shadow Angels of Dathomir" - pretentious, huh? With a little help from our friends in the Alliance, we''ve located the warehouse where they store, repair, and modify their swoops. If someone were to hit that place and burn it to the ground, the "Shadow Angels" would lose many of their bikes and probably leave the area. After all, take away a nek''s claws and fangs and they turn into a mewling voorpak. There''s a reward waiting for anyone that can accomplish this task. Will you be our champion?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 30, 'm5f', 'We knew this wouldn''t be easy. It may be a job for several brave folk. We wish we could offer you something but our reward must go to the champions who defeat this swoop gang.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 31, 'm5i', 'They must have been tipped off and moved. These womp rats are sneaky, that''s for sure. We''ll ask our friends to help us locate them again.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 32, 'm5l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 33, 'm5o', 'Friends of the Alliance'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 34, 'm5s', 'Angels my behind! More like Shadow Barnacles! That''s showing them, citizen! Woohoo! Claim your reward. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 35, 'm5t', 'Run off the swoop gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 36, 'm6d', 'The Empire has been employing local thugs to intimidate and bully citizens who show support for the Alliance or voice displeasure with the New Order. These citizens have sheltered members of the Alliance in the past and now they''re asking for our help. We need a loyal Alliance member to pay those thugs a visit and show them we won''t stand by while decent citizens are harrassed by Imperial goons. Can you help us out, friend? If we lose the support of the public, then our cause is hopeless. We''ll send the coordinates to the thugs'' hangout upon receiving your acceptance of this mission. May the Force be with you. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 37, 'm6f', 'We can''t claim this mission to be a success if those thugs are not driven away. Sorry, friend, better luck next time.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 38, 'm6i', 'Those thugs must have relocated. We''ll try and get a fix on their new location.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 39, 'm6l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 40, 'm6o', 'The Alliance to Restore the Republic'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 41, 'm6s', 'That''s showing them, friend. The Empire will realize they can''t push citizens around without paying the price. Good work.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 42, 'm6t', 'Help the beleaguered citizens '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 43, 'm7d', 'Some of our informants have been having trouble with a local crime lord. Apparently this thug has discovered that our contacts are secretly working for us and is using that information to blackmail them. Further, this scum has hired enforcers to keep the rest of the community under their control knowing that our informants won''t dare involve the Imperial authorities. We need to act quickly and save this community or we may lose some valuable resources. A visit to this crime lord''s headquarters ought to get the point across. Do you think you could lend a hand, citizen?'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 44, 'm7f', 'This scum will continue to keep the neighborhood in the grip of fear. If you can''t stop this then we''ll have to find someone who can. '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 45, 'm7i', 'Maybe the slug moved on? We''ll check with our informants and get an update. Check back with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 46, 'm7l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 47, 'm7o', 'The Alliance to Restore the Republic'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 48, 'm7s', 'Job well done, citizen. You''ve helped us establish our reputation as the champions of this community. That''s certainly worthy of a reward.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 49, 'm7t', 'Run the crime lord out of town'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 50, 'm8d', 'We''ve been tracking the Vibrodagger Killer for months now. We know that this animal used to work for COMPNOR and was given a vibrodagger similar to the ones used by Imperial Security Bureau agents as a reward for service to the Empire. It''s the same weapon that this brute has been using to murder innocent citizens. One of our informants believes he knows where the Vibrodagger Killer has been hiding. There''s an abandoned settlement that''s been co-opted by spice addicts, many of them also known murderers. The Killer has been seen going in and out of this settlement. We need a decent agent to blast that den of evil to pieces, hopefully while the Killer is still inside. Can you help us end this terrible menace?  '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 51, 'm8f', 'Those murderers will likely scatter throughout the galaxy. We should have stopped them while we had the chance.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 52, 'm8i', 'Could those slime have slunk off somewhere else? We''ll have to tap our informants for an update.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 53, 'm8l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 54, 'm8o', 'The Alliance to Restore the Republic'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 55, 'm8s', 'Good riddance. We hope that''s the last we ever hear of the Vibrodagger Killer. Our thanks, citizen.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 56, 'm8t', 'Stop the Vibrodagger Killer'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 57, 'm9d', 'Because their support for our cause makes them vulnerable to criminal elements, we need to protect those citizens who stand against the Empire. One such group has recently come under attack by a local gang. These vile predators think it safe to prey upon these helpless individuals because the Imperial authorities will turn a blind eye to their criminal activities. The sad thing fact is that they''re correct - the Imperial authorities will do nothing to protect these citizens. That''s where we come in. We need brave freedom fighters to stand up to these brutes. We''ll transmit the coordinates to their lair when we receive your acceptance of the mission. May the Force be with you.   '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 58, 'm9f', 'Our supporters must be protected, friend. Without them, we''re nothing. Sorry you couldn''t help us do that.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 59, 'm9i', 'This gang moves around. We''ll track down where they''ve slunk off to. Check back with us.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 60, 'm9l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 61, 'm9o', 'The Alliance to Restore the Republic'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 62, 'm9s', 'Congratulations, citizen. The Alliance is proud to have beings like you working for it.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 63, 'm9t', 'Stop the vicious gang'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 64, 'm10d', 'Some citizens sympathetic to our cause have asked for our help. A rash of break-ins have been plaguing their neighborhood recently. The thieves, having become emboldened by their success, have begun breaking into settlements during the day, while the residents are still at home. This has resulted in the deaths of five innocent citizens. Local law enforcement, resentful of the neighborhood''s political leanings, have failed to bring these thieves to justice. It is up to us to put a stop to these violent home invasions. Our contacts have located the thieves'' hideout and we need an upstanding citizen to blast this place to space dust - that ought to drive those ruffians away. Could you help the Alliance with this problem, citizen? '),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 65, 'm10f', 'The break-ins will continue and perhaps worsen. Your failure to resolve this issue could cost more lives.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 66, 'm10i', 'Either our contact was mistaken or these thieves have moved their base of operations. We''ll check this out.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 67, 'm10l', ''),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 68, 'm10o', 'The Alliance to Restore the Republic'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 69, 'm10s', 'Excellent job, citizen. Those citizens will be told of your bold efforts. May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 70, 'm10t', 'Break up the den of thieves'),
('string/en/mission/special/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_civilian.stf', 71, 'number_of_entries', '10'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 1, 'fuel_petrochem_liquid', 'Liquid Petrochemical Fuel'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 2, 'petrochem_inert', 'Inert Petrochemicals'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 3, 'fuel_petrochem_solid', 'Solid Petrochemicals'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 4, 'radioactive', 'Radioactives'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 5, 'metal_ferrous', 'Ferrous Metal'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 6, 'ore_igneous', 'Igneous Ore'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 7, 'ore_extrusive', 'Extrusive Ore'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 8, 'ore_sedimentary', 'Sedimentary Ore'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 9, 'ore_siliclastic', 'Siliclastic Ore'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 10, 'gemstone_armophous', 'Armophous Gemstone'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 11, 'metal_nonferrous', 'Non-ferrous Metal'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 12, 'gas_reactive', 'Reactive Gas'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 13, 'gas_inert', 'Inert Gas'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 14, 'metal', 'Metal'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 15, 'ore', 'Ore'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 16, 'gas', 'Gas'),
('string/en/mission/survey/survey_resource_names.stf', 17, 'gemstone_crystalline', 'Crystalline Gemstone'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_easy.stf', 1, 'deliver_hutt_easy_5', 'One of our informants needs to get a package to a friend, but doesn''t want to blow their cover, so you''re going to deliver the package.  Go meet the informant and make the delivery.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_easy.stf', 2, 'deliver_hutt_easy_1', 'One of our trusted agents is under surveillance and needs you to deliver a package.  Meet the agent at the location given and help him out.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_easy.stf', 3, 'deliver_hutt_easy_4', 'To keep Imperial security off our backs Jabba has instructed us to make several false deliveries anytime we deliver sensitive packages.  Even we don''t know if the package you''ll be getting is real or not, but chances are it''s fake.  Go see the contact and make the delivery.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_easy.stf', 4, 'deliver_hutt_easy_3', 'We got a message from a contact named Ree-Yees.  It seems a friend of his needs a package delivered.  Go find this friend, get the package, and find out where it needs to go.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_easy.stf', 5, 'deliver_hutt_easy_2', 'It''s important that we get a package delivered soon, in order to keep business running on this planet.  We need you to meet with the individual carrying the package and get information from him as to where it goes.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_hard.stf', 1, 'deliver_hutt_hard_5', 'Due to the increased number of bounty hunters looking for one of our agents the delivery schedule has had to be altered.  Go get the package so the agent can disappear, and make sure it reaches it''s destination.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_hard.stf', 2, 'deliver_hutt_hard_1', 'One of our infiltrators in the Imperial Military has something he needs delivered.  You will be met incognito by the informant or one of his agents and given the package to deliver.  Make sure you''re not followed by Imperials or Alliance agents, who may also want the package.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_hard.stf', 3, 'deliver_hutt_hard_4', 'Jabba himself is aware of this package and it''s importance to the scope of our operations on this planet.  If you fail to make this delivery don''t bother showing your face on Tatooine for a while.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_hard.stf', 4, 'deliver_hutt_hard_3', 'An important package needs to get to the proper individuals in order for a job that is happening imminently.  Get the package from the agent in charge and make the delivery to the field team.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_hutt_hard.stf', 5, 'deliver_hutt_hard_2', 'Due to a death threat against one of our agents all pertinent items to their mission are being re-routed.  We want you to pick up a package and deliver it immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_easy.stf', 1, 'deliver_imp_easy_5', 'An rise in criminal activity on this planet has made it necessary for us to hand deliver certain packages that we would have normally left to local couriers. Report to the listed contact to receive your specific delivery orders.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_easy.stf', 2, 'deliver_imp_easy_1', 'One of our loyal citizens on this planet voiced concerns about recent rebel activity interfering in his trade route. We wish to instill local business owners with confidence in the Empire''s ability to deal with these criminals. You are to ensure the safe delivery of that cargo today.\n'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_easy.stf', 3, 'deliver_imp_easy_4', 'Imperial Stormtroopers recently escorted a large quantity of supplies from one area of this world to another. Unfortunately, during an outbreak of violence created by rebel inciters, one of the items got left behind. Report to the supplier and deliver this last item so we can finish the paperwork.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_easy.stf', 4, 'deliver_imp_easy_3', 'Directive from Imperial Security Bureau, you are to report to the coordinates listed and pick up an important package for transportation. Do not inquire as to the nature or reason of this delivery. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_easy.stf', 5, 'deliver_imp_easy_2', 'There is an Imperial in need of simple assistance. Meet with that individual at the coordinates listed and receive further instructions.\n'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_hard.stf', 1, 'deliver_imp_hard_5', 'Members of the Hutt Cartel have been targeting Imperial citizens transporting goods across this planet. We need you to take over one of these deliveries and report any suspicious activities while en route. It is time we wiped the plague of unregulated crime from this system for good.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_hard.stf', 2, 'deliver_imp_hard_1', 'The Emperor himself commands you to assist in the transportation of top-secret cargo. You will receive the item and further instructions upon meeting with your contact. Long live the Emperor.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_hard.stf', 3, 'deliver_imp_hard_4', 'The rebels are intending to steal valuable imperial cargo from one of our less protected subjects. The subject has been informed and is considered inconsequential. Take his cargo by the order of the Emperor and deliver it to a more secure location.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_hard.stf', 4, 'deliver_imp_hard_3', 'To expose rebel sympathizers, the Emperor has allowed information to leak that you will be transporting a strategically vital package. This is a trap. The cargo your contact will give you is essentially worthless. Eliminate any rebels who try to intercept you. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_imp_hard.stf', 5, 'deliver_imp_hard_2', 'An operative working directly under Lord Vader requires your assistance in transporting a vital package. Rebels may try to intercept you en route. Die before allowing the rebels to take the package or you will assuredly die afterward once Lord Vader finds out about your failure.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 1, 'deliver_neutral_easy_5', 'I have a routine delivery job available. Just meet me and take a package from one part of this miserable planet to another.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 2, 'deliver_neutral_easy_1', 'A friend left a personal item at my house. I am unable to reach them on the comm. link and need someone to return it for me.  Someone will meet you with the item.  Please deliver it to my friend.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 3, 'deliver_neutral_easy_4', 'Easy credits. Quick delivery of goods to one of my customers. No experience necessary. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 4, 'deliver_neutral_easy_3', 'There has been a civilian causality in a recent raid by Stormtroopers. Victim''s belongings need to be delivered to family.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 5, 'deliver_neutral_easy_2', '"I require a skilled courier to handle the delivery of a package to one of my clients.  Discretion is appreciated, as my competitors would love the chance to disrupt my business.  One of my associates will supply you the item and the recipient."'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 6, 'demand_intro_anchorhead', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Anchorhead. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 7, 'demand_entice', '"Hey you! yeah you.. the one with the pants. Cmere, I wanna talk to you!"'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 8, 'demand_intro_no', '"No thanks, not interested"'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 9, 'demand_intro_yes', 'Of course I am. Whatcha got?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 10, 'demand_threat', 'If you know what''s good for you you''ll sell me that disk. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 11, 'demand_threat_no', 'I said no thanks. I will be leaving now'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 12, 'demand_attack', 'Fine. I''ll be taking that disk now. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 13, 'demand_offer', 'I''ll pay you 200 credits for that disk.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 14, 'demand_offer_yes', 'It''s a deal. Here.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 15, 'demand_offer_no', 'No thanks. Not interested. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 16, 'demand_offer_doublecross', '"On second thought, I don''t think i''ll be paying you. I''ll take it off of your corpse"'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 17, 'demand_offer_finish', 'Here ya go. Great doing business with you!'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 18, 'default', ''),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 19, 'demand_intro_wayfar', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Wayfar. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 20, 'demand_intro_bestine', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Bestine. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 21, 'demand_intro_mos_eisley', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Mos Eisley. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 22, 'demand_intro_mos_entha', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Mos Entha.  Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 23, 'demand_intro_mos_espa', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Mos Espa. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 24, 'demand_intro_mos_teike', 'I hear you''re making the delivery to Mos Teike. Interested in making some extra cash?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 25, 'demand_threat_yes', 'It''s a deal. Here.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 26, 'escort_intro_anchorhead', 'You wouldn''t happen to be going to Anchorhead would you? I''ve been traveling for days and was ambushed by bandits. They took all of my supplies. All I want is to get to Anchorhead to visit my mother. She''s in the hospital. Her final wish is to see me before she dies. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 27, 'escort_intro_wayfar', '"You wouldn''t happen to be going to Wayfar would you? I''ve been wandering for days trying to find my way there. My dewback died and bandits stole all of my supplies. I''m supposed to start my apprenticeship there, but If I don''t get there soon the job will surely go to someone else. "'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 28, 'escort_intro_bestine', 'You wouldn''t happen to be going to Bestine would you? I''ve been lost for days trying to find my way there. My Bantha broke it''s leg and fell into a ravine and bandits stole all of my supplies. I need to get there for my brother''s wedding. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 29, 'escort_intro_mos_eisley', 'You wouldn''t happen to be going to Mos Eisley would you? I''ve been traveling for days and was ambushed by bandits. They took all of my supplies. All I want is to get to Mos Eisley to visit my mother. She''s in the hospital. Her final wish is to see me before she dies. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 30, 'escort_intro_mos_entha', '"You wouldn''t happen to be going to Mos Entha would you? I''ve been wandering for days trying to find my way there. My dewback died and bandits stole all of my supplies. I''m supposed to start my apprenticeship there, but If I don''t get there soon the job will surely go to someone else. "'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 31, 'escort_intro_mos_espa', 'You wouldn''t happen to be going to Mos Espa would you? I''ve been lost for days trying to find my way there. My Bantha broke it''s leg and fell into a ravine and bandits stole all of my supplies. I need to get there for my brother''s wedding. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 32, 'escort_intro_mos_teike', 'You wouldn''t happen to be going to Mos Espa would you? I''ve been lost for days trying to find my way there. My Bantha broke it''s leg and fell into a ravine and bandits stole all of my supplies. I need to get there for my brother''s wedding. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 33, 'escort_entice', 'HELP! Please help me!'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 34, 'escort_intro_yes', 'As a matter of fact I am going there. Can I help you?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 35, 'escort_intro_no', 'I''m not going there and I don''t have time to talk to you.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 36, 'escort_request', 'Could you take me with you? I''ll make it worth your while. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 37, 'escort_request_yes', 'I''d be happy to help you. Cmon.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 38, 'escort_request_no', 'I''m sorry but you''re on your own. I don''t have time to help you.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 39, 'escort_end_follow', 'Thank you so much. I''ll follow you. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 40, 'escort_end_no_follow', 'Thanks for nothing.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 41, 'escort_arrival', '"Thank you for helping me. Here is something for your trouble. I''m sorry it''s not much, but it''s all I have."'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 42, 'escort_pre_attack', 'Hey.. Is that a data disk you''re carrying?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 43, 'escort_attack', 'I think I''ve changed my mind. I''ll be taking that data disk now'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 44, 'deliver_attack_single', 'There you are. I''m here to reclaim that data disk!'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 45, 'deliver_attack_group', 'There you area. We''re here to take that data disk from your dead body'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_easy.stf', 46, 'interest_incorrect_player', 'I wasn''t talking to you. Go away.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 1, 'deliver_neutral_hard_5', 'The government of this planet requires the transport of specific goods between its citizens. Be warned that criminal activity has interrupted this trade route before. '),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 2, 'deliver_neutral_hard_1', 'In need of a fast and reliable individual to make an important delivery. Those with fear of danger should not apply.\n'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 3, 'deliver_neutral_hard_4', 'The well being of this entire system could depend on the contents of a package I need delivered to my business partner. Can I trust you to handle it?'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 4, 'deliver_neutral_hard_3', 'I have a package that needs to get to an associate. There are factions that will try to intercept it. You better be willing to face danger for the price I''m paying.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_neutral_hard.stf', 5, 'deliver_neutral_hard_2', 'Important package needs to get to customer. Risk involved. Reliable candidates only.\n'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'deliver_rebel_easy_5', 'The Alliance needs some goods moved from one location to another to prevent Imperial detection. Report to our contact and ensure the package gets safely and discreetly transported.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'deliver_rebel_easy_1', 'The Alliance is indebted to a local of this planet who helped us escape Imperial detection. We wish to return the favor. Please see if there is anything we can do for this person.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'deliver_rebel_easy_4', 'We have received a message from someone claiming to have something of great importance to our cause. Meet with this individual and find out what it is and whom it needs to go to.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'deliver_rebel_easy_3', 'Princess Leia needs you to deliver a very important item from one undercover operative to another.  May the Force be with you!\n'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'deliver_rebel_easy_2', 'General Rieekan needs a package picked up from an Alliance member in the field. Find the operative, get the package and you will be informed where to take it.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 1, 'deliver_rebel_hard_5', 'The Empire is closing in on one of our members who is carrying a package vital to the Rebellion. The Empire must not get their hands on it. We need you to relieve our agent of the package and take it to another Alliance member for safekeeping. May the Force be with you!'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 2, 'deliver_rebel_hard_1', 'The Empire may be becoming aware of one of our pipelines for getting equipment to Alliance members in the field. We need you to help us throw them off the scent by delivering a random and unimportant item from our supplier. They will likely intercept it after you have finished the delivery and hopefully come to the conclusion that the supplier is not involved in the Alliance.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 3, 'deliver_rebel_hard_4', 'We have a vital package that must be picked up and delivered; however that is not your mission. We need you to pick up a decoy package to help throw Imperial spies off the trail of the real delivery. Hopefully, the Imperials will try to follow you. Take care not to be caught.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 4, 'deliver_rebel_hard_3', 'The Alliance needs your help in delivering vital supplies to one of our people. Seek out our contact and get the package. Time is of the essence here.'),
('string/en/mission_deliver_rebel_hard.stf', 5, 'deliver_rebel_hard_2', 'The Bothan Spy Network has an extremely important message that must be delivered to certain alliance members who are staging an attack on the Empire. For safety the message will be disguised in a package. The Bothans have given it to a third party to prevent it from being tracked. Pick it up and deliver it for us.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_hutt_easy_creature_1', 'This location has long been a stopping point for spices being moved around the planet.  An infestation of animals that were attracted to the spices is causing problems for our smugglers.  Exterminate this wildlife right now.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_hutt_easy_creature_2', 'As a favor to a local politician we''re cleaning this area of pests.  Be advised, there may be a lair or nest nearby that will have to be eliminated to keep the population down permanently.  This mission is to be concluded without delay.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_hutt_easy_creature_3', 'Due to the minor wounds inflicted on one of our bounty hunters by the wildlife in this area we are currently initializing a plan of destroying their nests and driving them from the area.  This is to be done immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_hutt_easy_creature_4', 'To drive up the prices of research animals we need to eliminate the wildlife in this area.  All creatures are to be destroyed thoroughly so that no parts of their corpses can be used for any type of research.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_hutt_easy_creature_5', 'This location is to be wiped of animals in order to begin construction of an underground escape tunnel.  All creatures must be eliminated in this area before construction can begin.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_hutt_easy_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy a donut shop.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_hutt_easy_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy a donut shop.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_hutt_easy_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy a donut shop.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_hutt_easy_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy a donut shop.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_easy_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_hutt_easy_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy a donut shop.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_hutt_hard_creature_1', 'One of our underground gambling dens was destroyed last night.  The damage appears to random to be an imperial assault or local law enforcement.  Go out there and find out what''s going on.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_hutt_hard_creature_2', 'In order to grease the political wheels we''ve agreed to do a favor for the local politicians.  They''ll look the other way on some of our illegal activities if we''ll take care of some dangerous animals in the local area.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_hutt_hard_creature_3', 'During a routine raid of a Research Facility some of our thugs managed to let loose some dangerous animals.  We need those animals destroyed before they start drawing attention to our activities.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_hutt_hard_creature_4', 'Some of our enemies are planning on selling some animal parts to a research facility for a profit, and undercutting one of our revenue sources.  We need you to destroy all the dangerous animals in this area to make sure our profits aren''t affected.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_hutt_hard_creature_5', 'One of Jabba''s favorite bounty hunters was killed by a dangerous animal in this area.  Jabba''s in sort of a mood and wants revenge, so it''s up to you to make sure this creature dies.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_hutt_hard_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy a police station.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_hutt_hard_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy a police station.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_hutt_hard_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy a police station.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_hutt_hard_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy a police station.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_hutt_hard_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_hutt_hard_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy a police station.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_imp_easy_creature_1', 'An imperial medical facility is reporting a pest problem.  Apparently the local wildlife has taken a liking to the power generators.  Please exterminate this pest problem.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_imp_easy_creature_2', 'One of our scout patrols indicates that there is an over abundance of animals infesting this location.  That area is designated as a possible site for a forward military location.  We need someone to clear the area before the construction can begin.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_imp_easy_creature_3', 'A number of power cables have been chewed through at an Imperial Detention Facility.  We suspect that the creatures involved have a nest in the area nearby.  This nest must be eliminated without delay.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_imp_easy_creature_4', 'An Imperial Research Facility lost power for a couple of hours, and during the confusion a group of animals escaped the laboratory.  They probably haven''t gone far, but they could be dangerous to the local ecology.  We need these animals destroyed as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_imp_easy_creature_5', 'Scans of this area indicate wildlife that is hazardous to our future development.  We need someone reliable to clear the area of this wildlife.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_imp_easy_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy an alliance ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_imp_easy_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy an alliance ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_imp_easy_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy an alliance ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_imp_easy_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy an alliance ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_easy_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_imp_easy_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy an alliance ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_imp_hard_creature_1', 'A scout patrol has disappeared in this area and hasn''t checked in for some time.  We fear the worst.  Our intelligence indicates there aren''t any rebel patrols in the area, so it must be something else.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_imp_hard_creature_2', 'Something destroyed a power generator at this location.  Our investigators tell us it wasn''t an explosive device, and rebel activity in the area has been limited.  We suspect something large and hungry has decided to try our generators as an alternative food source.  We want you to eliminate this threat.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_imp_hard_creature_3', 'A large predator is terrorizing the loyal imperial citizens who live and work around this area.  We want you to destroy this creature immediately in order to keep our people safe.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_imp_hard_creature_4', 'Our sources tell us that a group of rebel spies has led a dangerous creature to this area in order to disrupt our operations.  Eliminate this creature with extreme prejudice.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_imp_hard_creature_5', 'A deadly animal has been terrorizing this sector, causing problems with stormtroopers who are doing routine drills.  Eliminate the beast so our soldiers can get back to training.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_imp_hard_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy an alliance weapons facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_imp_hard_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy an alliance weapons facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_imp_hard_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy an alliance weapons facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_imp_hard_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy an alliance weapons facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_imp_hard_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_imp_hard_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy an alliance weapons facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_neutral_easy_creature_1', 'The local wildlife in this area is causing problems with the ecology.  There is an overabundance of the specified creatures, which is causing plantlife to falter.  This situation must be dealt with immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_neutral_easy_creature_2', 'The wildlife around this area has blossomed due to the accidental destruction of most of the area''s predators.  In order to balance the wildlife ecology the specified creatures must be eliminated posthaste.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_neutral_easy_creature_3', 'To facilitate the building of a possible new transportation system we need to eliminate the abundant wildlife in this area.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_neutral_easy_creature_4', 'A pest problem is occurring in this area.  Local residents and hunters are wiling to pay to have the area cleansed of the pests.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_neutral_easy_creature_5', 'A particularly virulent strain of disease is progressing through the wildlife in this area.  In order to halt the spread of the virus we need the local wildlife to be depleted, to keep the virus contained to the creatures it''s already affected.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_neutral_easy_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_neutral_easy_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_neutral_easy_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_neutral_easy_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_easy_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_neutral_easy_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_neutral_hard_creature_1', 'There have been many reports of disturbances in this area by locals.  We suspect a creature of some kind has taken up residence and we need you to move it out of the area.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_neutral_hard_creature_2', 'A farmer was attacked and killed last night by some type of dangerous animal.  We''re sending you in to eliminate the monster before it harms anyone else.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_neutral_hard_creature_3', 'The local wildlife has suffered severe ecological setbacks because of a dangerous predator that has taken control of a small area of land.  It''s killing all the other wildlife indiscriminantly.  We want you to take care of cleaning up this problem for us.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_neutral_hard_creature_4', 'A remote satelite dish has stopped transmitting and no one seems to know why.  We''re sending you to find out, though we suspect that it may have to do with local wildlife.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_neutral_hard_creature_5', 'There''s a dangerous animal terrorizing the area, and we need someone to eliminate it.  We hope you are that someone.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_neutral_hard_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy an enemy base.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_neutral_hard_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy an enemy base.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_neutral_hard_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy an enemy base.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_neutral_hard_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy an enemy base.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_neutral_hard_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_neutral_hard_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy a enemy taco stand.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_rebel_easy_creature_1', 'An infestation of animals has us worried about the safety of one of our hidden bases.  The large population is feeding off our trash, and may draw unwanted attention to the location.  It is imperative that this area be cleaned immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_rebel_easy_creature_2', 'Construction crews are prepared to build a landing bay for alliance ships at this location, but are unable due to an infestation of wildlife.  We need someone to clean this area as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_rebel_easy_creature_3', 'We suspect the Empire has planted listening devices on some of the animals in the local area.  There is a large infestation near this location that needs to be exterminated for the safety of the alliance.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_rebel_easy_creature_4', 'Our structures in this area are compromised by the local wildlife.  They''re chewing through power cables, digging around the foundations, and generally causing everyone in the area to be miserable.  Please clean this area out immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_rebel_easy_creature_5', 'Animals in this location appear to be infected with some sort of disease.  In order to maintain the safety of our personnel and any innocent civilians in the area we need someone to clean the area immediately.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_rebel_easy_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy an imperial ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_rebel_easy_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy an imperial ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_rebel_easy_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy an imperial ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_rebel_easy_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy an imperial ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_easy_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_rebel_easy_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy an imperial ice cream facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_creature.stf', 1, 'destroy_rebel_hard_creature_1', 'Local farmers have reported seing a mysterious creature around this location.  It seems to be feeding off the local wildlife, but they''re concerned that it will become dangerous to the citizenry.  Eliminate the creature as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_creature.stf', 2, 'destroy_rebel_hard_creature_2', 'A visiting dignitary has disappeared in this area, and our sources indicate that a large animal has been seen in the area.  As there were no imperial movements nearby we suspect that the creature in question may be responsible.  We want you to eliminate it as soon as possible, before anything else happens.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_creature.stf', 3, 'destroy_rebel_hard_creature_3', 'A transport ship went down in this area sometime ago, and it has come to our attention that they may have been carrying classified cargo.  The cargo in question appears to be some form of dangerous animal.  We want you to find out if the creature is in the area, and if so, make sure it can''t hurt anyone.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_creature.stf', 4, 'destroy_rebel_hard_creature_4', 'A series of unexplained occurrences caused us to send a scout team to the area in question.  We haven''t heard back from them and they should have checked in by now.  We need you to go to the area and check it out.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_creature.stf', 5, 'destroy_rebel_hard_creature_5', 'A local merchant sent a distress signal that was picked up by the alliance scanners.  We have no idea where he was heading, or what sort of distress he''s in, but we feel it''s worth the time and effort it will take to check it out.  Go to the area and see what''s happening.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_structure.stf', 1, 'destroy_rebel_hard_structure_1', 'We need you to destroy an imperial research facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_structure.stf', 2, 'destroy_rebel_hard_structure_2', 'We need you to destroy an imperial research facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_structure.stf', 3, 'destroy_rebel_hard_structure_3', 'We need you to destroy an imperial research facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_structure.stf', 4, 'destroy_rebel_hard_structure_4', 'We need you to destroy an imperial research facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_destroy_rebel_hard_structure.stf', 5, 'destroy_rebel_hard_structure_5', 'We need you to destroy an imperial research facility.  STUB MISSION DESCRIPTION, REMOVE LATER.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_easy.stf', 1, 'escort_hutt_easy_1', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_easy.stf', 2, 'escort_hutt_easy_3', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_easy.stf', 3, 'escort_hutt_easy_2', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_easy.stf', 4, 'escort_hutt_easy_4', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_easy.stf', 5, 'escort_hutt_easy_5', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_hard.stf', 1, 'escort_hutt_hard_1', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_hard.stf', 2, 'escort_hutt_hard_3', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_hard.stf', 3, 'escort_hutt_hard_2', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_hard.stf', 4, 'escort_hutt_hard_4', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_hutt_hard.stf', 5, 'escort_hutt_hard_5', 'Jabba needs you to escort someone somewhere.  This is a stub conversation and should be REMOVED.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_easy.stf', 1, 'escort_imp_easy_1', 'A rebel spy has been captured and needs to be taken to a safe location where an extraction team can make a pickup.  You''re job is to get the spy to that location.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_easy.stf', 2, 'escort_imp_easy_2', 'A downed pilot needs an escort to a safe place where a clean transmission can be beamed to a Star Destroyer.  Get the Pilot somewhere that call can be made.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_easy.stf', 3, 'escort_imp_easy_3', 'One of our spies in the rebel base needs to deliver a report, but needs an escort away from their current location.  Get the spy and follow our instructions to a safe place.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_easy.stf', 4, 'escort_imp_easy_4', 'A visiting dignitary is on the planet and needs an escort to somewhere.  Just take the dignitary wherever it is they want to go, and make sure nothing happens to them.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_easy.stf', 5, 'escort_imp_easy_5', 'One of our couriers needs to make a delivery nearby, but needs an escort in order to make sure nothing happens to the package.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_hard.stf', 1, 'escort_imp_hard_2', 'Someone from Lord Vader''s ship has personally requested an escort for someone on the planet.  Make sure they reach their destination with no problems.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_hard.stf', 2, 'escort_imp_hard_3', 'Someone from Lord Vader''s ship has personally requested an escort for someone on the planet.  Make sure they reach their destination with no problems.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_imp_hard.stf', 3, 'escort_imp_hard_4', 'Someone from Lord Vader''s ship has personally requested an escort for someone on the planet.  Make sure they reach their destination with no problems.'),
