('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 1, 'escort_rebel_easy_1', 'One of the local shopkeepers has had some run ins with the imperials recently and wants to know if we''ll act as an escort for them until they get where they''re going.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 2, 'escort_rebel_easy_2', 'Due to the increased activity by Imperials in the area, we want you to act as an escort for one of our better tacticians.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 3, 'escort_rebel_easy_3', 'The local wildlife in the area has gotten dangerous of late.  We''re still checking on why that is, but for the moment we need someone to act as an escort for a diagnostic technician.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 4, 'escort_rebel_easy_4', 'Radio traffic indicates that an Imperial patrol may be coming through the area sometime soon, so we need someone to escort the linquistics expert to a new location.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_easy.stf', 5, 'escort_rebel_easy_5', 'One of our slicers has managed to get lost and needs someone to give them an escort to the proper location.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_hard.stf', 1, 'escort_rebel_hard_1', 'The location where we were holding an Imperial spy has somehow leaked out of the base.  Get that spy moved to a new location, far away from there.  We''ll tell you where.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_hard.stf', 2, 'escort_rebel_hard_2', 'A friend of the Commanders has been spotted by the Imperials near the hideout, and may be in danger.  We need someone to escort them to a new location.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_hard.stf', 3, 'escort_rebel_hard_3', 'An Imperial Pilot is defecting to the Alliance and we need someone to escort them to a safer spot.  Get right on it!'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_hard.stf', 4, 'escort_rebel_hard_4', 'A friend of the general''s daughter has been seen by the Empire and we fear they may try torture to find out where our bases are located.  Go get this friend and move them to a safe place.'),
('string/en/mission_escort_rebel_hard.stf', 5, 'escort_rebel_hard_5', 'One of our spies has managed to break off from the Imperial Patrol they were scouting with and needs an escort out of the area before the Imperials figure out he''s disappeared.'),
