('string/en/mood_types.stf', 184, 'disdainful', 'disdainful\n~\ndisdainfully\n, full of disdain\nscornfully'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 185, 'contemptuous', 'contemptuous\n~\ncontemptuously\n, full of contempt\nscornfully'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 186, 'diplomatic', 'diplomatic\n~\ndiplomatically\n, always the diplomat\n, in a conciliating tone'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 187, 'wary', 'wary\n~\nwarily\n, looking wary\n, somewhat warily'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 188, 'malevolent', 'malevolent\nangry\nmalevolently\n, full of evil\nevilly'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 189, 'hurried', 'hurried\n~\nhurriedly\n, talking fast\n, words tumbling over each other in haste'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 190, 'patient', 'patient\n~\npatiently\n, showing great patience\nslowly and patiently'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 191, 'firm', 'firm\n~\nfirmly\ndecisively\n, clear and firm\n, brooking no disagreement'),
('string/en/mood_types.stf', 192, 'none', 'none\n~\n**ADVERB FOR NONE***'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 1, 'greeting_1', 'Good day.  And what can I help you with?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 2, 'player_1', 'I''d like to ask you about the cities on Naboo.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 3, 'player_2', 'Is there anything that you need done?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 4, 'player_3', 'What can you tell me about certain people?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 5, 'player_13', 'Can you give me directions?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 6, 'cities_1', 'Which city are you interested in?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 7, 'player_4', 'I''m curious about Theed...'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 8, 'player_5', 'Do you know about Dee''ja Peek?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 9, 'player_6', 'Moenia is the city I want to ask about.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 10, 'player_7', 'What do you know about Keren?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 11, 'player_12', 'Can I ask some more questions?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 12, 'people_1', 'Who do you want to know about?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 13, 'player_8', 'Do you know Boss Nass?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 14, 'player_9', 'Who is Kaja Or''Zee?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 15, 'player_10', 'What do you know of the Emperor?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 16, 'player_11', 'What do you know about the Imperials?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 17, 'mission_1', 'As soon as I know how to hand out missions I''ll give you one.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 18, 'theed_1', 'A beautiful place, and still the capital of Naboo after all these years.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 19, 'deeja_1', 'A wonderful city set in the mountains.  It''s really quite gorgeous.  An outstanding view.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 20, 'moenia_1', 'Moenia is a terribly interesting city...but I can''t tell you why.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 21, 'keren_1', 'Ah, Keren is one of our larger cities.  The bustling center of intergalactic business.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 22, 'nass_1', 'Boss Nass is still the leader of the Gungan people.  A very good ruler I understand.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 23, 'kaja_1', 'She is the Administrative Assistant at the Emperor''s retreat.  You''ll have to talk to her before meeting Lord Vader, or the Emperor.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 24, 'emperor_1', 'The Emperor is the supreme commander of the Empire, and I would not recommend trifling with him.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 25, 'imperials_1', 'Not much to say really.  They are the rulers of the galaxy.  We owe all to the glorious reign of the Empire.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 26, 'sure_1', 'Sure.  What else would you like to ask about?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 27, 'where_1', 'Where would you like directions to?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 28, 'player_14', 'Can you tell me how to get to any of the cities?'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 29, 'player_15', 'I need to get to a specific place.'),
('string/en/naboo_convo.stf', 30, 'player_16', 'I need to see someone...'),
