('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 56, 'player_2_2', 'No way.   I couldn''t care less about politics.'),
('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 57, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here''s your official proclamation.  It won''t be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.'),
('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 58, 'npc_1_3', 'A gang of ruffians stole part of the hyperdrive out of my ship.  Get it back for me and I''ll give you something nice.'),
('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 59, 'npc_2_3', 'Ok.  Just let me know when you''ve got it.'),
('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 60, 'npc_3_3', 'I thought you were a tough one.  I guess not.'),
('string/en/npc_mission/static_noble_fetch.stf', 61, 'player_1_3', 'Sure, I''ll help you out.'),
