('string/en/plant_grow.stf', 47, 'plant_stage_1_d', 'A small Aurilian plant.  These plants are notoriously difficult to grow and maintain.   Each plant is unique in its requirements and these requirements often change over the lifecycle.  When cared for properly, the plants have been known to bear fruit with miraculous properties.'),
