('string/en/player_structure.stf', 466, 'wave2', 'Wave'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 467, 'wear_how', 'Just drag and drop on me whatever piece of clothing you want me to wear, boss.'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 468, 'wear_no', 'That doesn''t fit me.  I''m not going to wear it.'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 469, 'wear_no_ithorian', 'Haha, you expect me to wear that?  It looks a bit too big for me.  I think this is meant for an Ithorian.'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 470, 'wear_no_wookiee', 'Haha, you expect me to wear that?  It looks a bit too big for me.  I think this is meant for a Wookiee.'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 471, 'wear_not_ithorian', 'I can''t wear that. It''s too small. Can''t you find some proper Ithorian clothing?'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 472, 'wear_noway', 'I''m not going to wear something just because you want me to!'),
('string/en/player_structure.stf', 473, 'wear_yes', 'Thanks for the snazzy new threads, boss!'),
