('string/en/player_structure.stf', 486, 'your_structure_prefix', 'Your structure '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'You gotta help me! I swear, I didn''t steal the money from the Hutts, but they say I did. It was my partner, I swear it! But he''s gone and they''re after me. Help me! Please!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'Get outta our way. There''s a bounty on this idiot''s head, and we''re the ones aimin'' to collect. Sold ya some sob story, I bet. Well, you gonna swallow that tripe or you gonna clear on outta here?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'Oh, thank you, thank you. Watch out, they''re tough fighters.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'You heartless jerk! Now what am I gonna do?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'I can''t believe it! You stood up for me, and you don''t even know me. Are you hurt? Oh, I can''t thank you enough.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'Hey, look who''s here. You''re not gonna get in our way, are you, friend? This idiot''s got a bounty on their head.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'By order of the Empire, don''t interfere. This idiot''s got a bounty on their head, and we are aimin'' to collect.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Maybe? Maybe? ...I''m gonna die. Well, when they get here, just talk to them. I''ll run and hide while you distract them.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'On yer head be it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Then you better clear on out. Nothin'' for you to see here.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'You''re thinking you can settle this peacefully? OK, we''ll let you give it a shot. See if you get the Hutt''s money back.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'Sorry, but the Hutts said no deals. Get out of the way or we might have to take you out too.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'Well, I suppose I still have some of the money saved away... a present for my poor old mother. If I must... to stay alive... I could give it back.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'But the money''s gone, I tell you! Gone! My partner took it, vanished offworld... oh, I''m gonna die, I''m gonna die...'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'Not good enough. C''mon gang, let''s get it over with.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'Hmmm. Partial payment? I think the Hutts will be happy with this. For now. Better tell your friend over there to start fundraising.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'What did they say? Are they going to kill me?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Do we really have to fight? Couldn''t we find a way to pay the Hutts back?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'I owe you my life! Tell you what, if I wasn''t soured on the idea of a partner, maybe I''d take you under my wing. Thanks! I think I better get out of here now before they change their minds.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'I am SO tempted to just bolt. But they''ll be here soon, and there''s no point in running, they''d still catch me. Might as well wait and see how it plays out.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There''s the deadbeat. Remember, the Hutts said dead or alive, so let''s get this over with.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'No, wait! Wait! I, uh, I''ve got a friend! With, uh, a thermal detonator!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'Riiight. That one was old twenty years ago when I first heard it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Good riddance to a deadbeat con artist. Thank for yer help. Sorry, but our payment''s only expected on completion so we can''t cut you in.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'Awright, I''m thinkin'' this''ll make the Hutts happy. Money always makes ''em happy. Thanks for squeezing this much out of that whiny loser.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'C''mon, I''m getting bored. Let''s get this over with.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'Can we kill the stranger too?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'I can''t wait to get back to Coruscant.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'Pfaugh. Let''s go.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Let''s get on with it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'So you agreed to help this deadbeat? Too bad. We don''t get a bonus fer killin'' helpers, but there''s no penalty in the contract either.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Well? You gettin'' a move on, or should I just use my trusty weapon here?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'Yer wastin'' my time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'Yeah, I already said thank you. Look, I can''t do much in the way of a reward.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'Get lost. You mostly just stood by, why should I care what you want?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'Alrighty, that''s enough of the jibber-jabber. Let''s do it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'Whyn''t ya just get lost? Hm? This was straightforward until YOU showed up.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'I can''t believe it! I''m saved!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'You... you''re going to let them kill me? Why you double-crossing...'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I can''t give you anything... I have to rely on your kindness. Please?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'thoughtful'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/deadbeat.stf', 52, 'a_accept_offer_act', 'puzzle'),
