('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Help me, please! They''re going to take me away again, and I can''t possibly live as a slave any longer!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'That''s an escaped slave you have there. Not your property. How about handing them over?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'They don''t understand--no, they don''t CARE--that I was kidnapped into slavery. Please, don''t let them take me back!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'You''re just like them, aren''t you? Happy to let another sentient being live out a life as property. You''re pathetic.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'I suppose I''m free now. Free. What a word. Only... now what do I do? I''ve been a slave my whole life.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'That''s an escaped slave you have there. I know, I know, slavery is evil. But we have to keep the local warlords happy or else we Rebllion won''t be able to operate in this area.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'That''s an escaped slave you have there, citizen. I am sure you will promptly hand them over and move along. It''s none of your business.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'They won''t listen to reason, but maybe you can try talking to them. But I''ll kill myself before going back.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'On your head be it, then. I owe my allegiance to my master, and must do as he says.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Then you had better move along and get out of the way. We have a job to do for our master.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'What are we supposed to tell our master, that the slave just disappeared? We''ll be flogged if we return empty-handed. Well, go ahead, try talking to the slave, see if it does you any good.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'We''ll be flogged if we return empty-handed. I value my hide more than that of a puny slave.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'Here... they can have this bracelet... it''s all I have of my mother. Have them tell the master that they found me dead. I died of exposure. He''ll believe them if they have this bracelet.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'It''s hopeless. They''re not going to back down. I just wanted to live a life free of chains...'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'Not good enough. What''s in it for us, eh? What if our master finds out? No, we''re going to have to take care of this our way.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'Died of exposure eh? And this worthless trinket as proof. Alright, I''m willing to give that a try. Always had a soft spot for slaves myself.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Will they let me go free?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Do we have to end this in this way? A slave who wants to be free, what could be more natural than that? Can you see your way to letting them go?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'And now... I''m free. A slave my whole life, and I''m free. Any path is open to me, and they all feel terrifying.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'I could run and hide, but I''m tired of running. After years of beatings, of being insulted and teased for their amusement... oh, they''ll be here soon enough. I''m too good a toy to let slip away.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'You! Slave! We''ve come to return you to your master. He misses his plaything.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'I won''t go back. Kill me if you must. But I won''t go back.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'Our orders covered that contingency. Make your peace, slave.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Another day, another dead slave. Filthy institution, but it''s the way of our Galaxy, isn''t it? Well, I better take this bracelet as proof we killed the poor creature. Back to our master.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'I''m glad you found a way out of this. That poor slave has been a prisoner for at least ten years. It would have felt wrong to kill them.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'I wonder if the master will beat us all tonight?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'If we hurry, the kitchens might still be open.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'Let''s get on with it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'I don''t feel right about this.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Less talking, more killing.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'You''re helping an escaped slave? On your head be it!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'We don''t have all day. The master will send a search party for us if we don''t return soon.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'That''s a useless idea. I''m not going to risk my neck for a slave.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'Go on, get on with your life. We have to go back to our own slavery.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'What, you expect payment or something? Let me tell you something. That carcass down there was a person once. Had feelings. Hoped to live free. You mostly stood by while we killed them. And you think you deserve a reward? Get out of my sight.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'That''s enough. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'I don''t have time for idle chatter. Our master expects either the slave back, or proof that they''re dead. You''re just wasting my time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'I''m free.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'You''re going to just hand me over? Do you know what I go through? The beatings? The scraps of food from the table, sleeping on the stone floor?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I have nothing to give, you know. I''ve lived my whole life thinking I was worthless. Maybe I am.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/escaped_slave.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'sheepish'),
