('string/en/poi/deliverance/lothario_exlovers.stf', 149, 'm_rejected', 'That''s bad.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/lothario_exlovers.stf', 150, 'm_rejected_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/lothario_exlovers.stf', 151, 'm_rejected_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/lothario_exlovers.stf', 152, 'm_rejected_mood', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Hello there. You may want to leave, there''s going to be a fight. I''ll probably be killed.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'There''s our little friend. Now it''s time to show what happens when people abandon our gang!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'Well, I used to belong to a swoop gang. I''ve decided that''s no life for me--too violent and anarchistic. But they say that once you join, you''re in for life. So since I quit, my former friends are coming to kill me. Goes to show that they''re not the sort of group I want to belong to! You want to try to talk them out of it?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'That''s OK. I''m resigned to it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'Did you really have to start a fight? I told you, I''m giving up violence. Everywhere I go, I''m surrounded by thugs. Get away from me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'Hidin'' with a fellow Rebel won''t do ya any good! We all hate the Empire, but that''s nothin'' compared to breakin'' a sworn blood oath!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'Yer hiding out with the Empire, eh? Well, even Imperial law has gotta give way to a forsworn oathbreaker!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Well, maybe they''ll have a change of heart. I doubt it though.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'Look, oathbreakers don''t deserve to live. You''ll regret making this choice.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Get on out of here, then. We''ll settle this amongst ourselves.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'If yer thinkin'' of persuadin'' us not to kill the oathbreaker, then you better start talkin'' fast.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'An oath is an oath. Get out of the way.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'What if I take a second oath to never hurt anyone? Would you leave me alone then? I'' still be a member, just... useless to you.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'I will not violate my beliefs. Violence is evil.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'That''s not near enough to satisfy th'' demands of a blood oath.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'Never hurt anyone, huh? You WOULD be useless. Even more useless than now.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Do I need to prepare myself to die now?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Can we talk about this before any blood is shed?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'Thank you so much! I would have just laid down and died for them, I suppose. But I would have died knowing I did the right thing.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'Well, they should be here soon. They knew where I was going--I practically told them when I left.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There ya are! You can''t just walk away from us that way! You swore a sacred oath, and you know the penalty for breakin'' your word!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t keep on beating up peaceful people for money. It just doesn''t feel right anymore.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'All high ''n'' mighty now are we? You never seemed to mind before. I know, you say ye''ve changed. That''s a load of bantha poodoo if you ask me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Well, that''s an oath satisfied. I''m glad ya know the meanin'' of honor, stranger.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'I''m glad we didn''t have to kill after all. Tell the truth, we usually just rough folks up a bit, take mone credits, ya know? And killin'' a former friend... well, it felt wrong.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'Oathbreaker!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'Let''s get this over with...'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'Do we really have ta do this?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'Once in the gang, always in the gang!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'I say we chop his head off anyway.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'What, are you another one of these pacifist types? Yer in the wrong place at the wrong time!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Time''s movin'' along here... we got swoops ta ride and credits to steal, so let''s get on with it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'What a waste o'' time. Let''s kill the oathbreaker.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'I already said thanks to ya, and that''s enough. No, ya can''t join the gang, we''re full up plus you like talkin'' too much.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'You want a reward? A REWARD? You realize this was a friend of ours? Someone we killed only because they broke their solemn word? I have half a mind ta beat you up... get outta here and leave us be.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'I hate ta do this... you were a friend of ours, before. But it''s time. C''mon, everybody. Attack!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'I''m not in the mood for an interferin'' fool stickin'' their nose in private business.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'And that''s it? I''m safe?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'You... you''re letting them kill me? Just like that? Of all the heartless... you know what, to heck with non-violence. YOU deserve to be beat up.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I can''t offer any payment. If you can talk them out of it, wonderful. Otherwise, I''m resigned to it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'contemptuous'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 52, 'a_accept_offer_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/oathbreaker.stf', 53, 'm_yes_chat', ''),
