('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'You there, I''ve got some Imperials chasing my tail. You''re going to help me fight them off. You understand? If you don''t, I''ll make sure you regret it. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'We''ve been chasing after this no good pirate for several days now. After hijacking a Star Destroyer captain''s personal shuttle, he used it to break into the officer''s home estate on Coruscant. Made a mess of the place and stole a lot of valuables including sensitive documents. I assume you''ll be smart and not help this low life.  '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'You''re smart. They should be here soon. Get your weapon ready.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'Oh you are going to wish you didn''t say that. I''ll deal with you after I''m done with the Imps.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'It is a good thing you decided to help me blast them. Now get out of my sight.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'We''ve been chasing after this no good pirate for several days now. After hijacking a Star Destroyer captain''s personal shuttle, he used it to break into the officer''s home estate on Coruscant. Made a mess of the place and stole a lot of valuables including sensitive documents. I have no problem fighting you too if need be, but I assume you''ll be smart and not help this low life.  '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'We''ve been chasing after this no good pirate for several days now. After hijacking a Star Destroyer captain''s personal shuttle, he used it to break into the officer''s home estate on Coruscant. Made a mess of the place and stole a lot of valuables including sensitive documents. Do your duty to the Empire and let us bring him to justice.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Maybe? You got some plan to help me get away from them? You had better or I''m going to deal with you when I''m done with them.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'So you are just another pirate scum. Get them!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Good choice.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'The captain would definitely prefer having his valuables back. Go see if you can get that pirate to return the goods and pay for damages done.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'The Empire does not negotiate with pirates, ever. This is how we deal with their kind.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'Really? Hmm. I''m done playing with that shuttle anyway. Sure, I''ll return all the stuff. I''ll even pay their damages, but they had better forget they ever saw me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'And ruin my reputation?! What do you take me for? Now help me blast these Imps or else.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'He''s a criminal and he must answer to the Empire for his crimes. There will be no deal.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'Very well, we''ll work out the details with him. He had better return every last item, or he won''t live to regret it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Did your little plan work, or am I going to need to get violent after all?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'If you kill him, you won''t get those documents back. Maybe I can help negotiate this matter? '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'Well, I think I would have rather this ended with me blasting them off the face of this planet, but I suppose clearing my record is worth it this time. Thanks for your quick thinking.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'I think they''re almost here. Do exactly as I say.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'We have you now. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'You got nothing, Imps! You think you can really take us down? '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'Us? I see. Are you really with this good for nothing pirate?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'You''ve done a great service to the Empire today. We''ll rid the galaxy of these unsavory types for good one day.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'The Captain will be very pleased if this deal works out. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'Another worthless pirate. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'The Captain is going to be pleased when we take care of this.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'Are you with him? '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'I was there when he stole the shuttle. He''s definitely bold, but not too smart.  '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Waiting for orders to shoot.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'Pirates! Take them all! '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Hey, I''m talking to you.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'You just can''t negotiate with pirates. It''s not worth it. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'We''ll get a full list of items and damages. If he lives up to his end, we''ll look the other way for now.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'You are lucky the Empire is here to protect you from pirates like him.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'He''s just trying to stall. Get him!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'You are not wanted here anymore.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'Heh, Imps can''t hit nothing. I may get wasted by a bounty hunter someday, but never by anyone working for the Empire, believe me when I say that.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'I warned you. Now I''m going to have to kill you too.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'What are you still doing here? I don''t need you any more. Shove off.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_imperials.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'Content'),
