('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_rebels.stf', 148, 'a_brushoff_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_rebels.stf', 149, 'm_rejected', 'I figured as much.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_rebels.stf', 150, 'm_rejected_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_rebels.stf', 151, 'm_rejected_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/pirate_rebels.stf', 152, 'm_rejected_mood', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Help me, please! They''re out to kill me. They claim I killed someone, and it''s just not true!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'Look, we have proof. The entire family is dead, and they''re the only ones who could have done it. Poison in the food, it was. Don''t stand in the way of justice being done. Are you going to let us take action or not?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'Look, they think I am a poisoner. It''s not true. It must have been food poisoning or something. Talk them out of it, or fight them off, please!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'But they''ll kill me!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'Good work, sucker. Now nobody''s left to carry the tale. Did I mention it was an undetectable poison? I''m scot free, and the inheritance is mine now. All mine.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'The Alliance is after this poisoning scum. They killed their whole family, every one, even the children. You''ve got to help us.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'By order of the Empire. we''re here to arrest this poisoning scum. Murdered their whole family.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'You''ll see, they''re crazed with grief and think I''m responsible, but I''m not. When they get here, talk to them. You''ll see.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'You''re going to help a poisoner??'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Let us handle this. We saw the faces of the dead, and the agony they went through. We know what the punishment should be.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'It seems a waste of time to talk to a poisoner. Be quick about it, if you need to soothe your conscience.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'Marya died with white foam on her lips, choking. The children were fallen askew in their beds. Get out of our way, or we may deal with you as we deal with the murderer.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'I didn''t eat the dinner that night, I tell you it must have been food poisoning. It wasn''t me. Have them test the food for poison.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'You''ll have to fight them. Nothing I can say will change their minds.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'And why not eat the food? I saw the meal myself--if there hadn''t been dead bodies around, I would have eaten it myself. C''mon, let''s avenge Marya and the children.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'Maybe we are being hasty... such a terrible tragedy. I''m willing to go back and test the food to see what caused the death.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Will they test the food?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Can a test of the food be done?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'You''re a pretty fast talker. I appreciate that quality. I''m pretty good at mixing up the poisons, but not so good at persuading others that it wasn''t me. Heh. Well, thanks, sucker.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'They''ll get here any minute now. Watch out, they''re completely maddened by grief.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There you are! Poisoner! You killed Marya and the children!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'No, I swear! It wasn''t me! I didn''t poison them!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'The children, how could you? They died choking in their beds...!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Good riddance to murdering scum.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'I suppose we had better check on the food before doing something we''ll regret. We don''t want to stoop to the murderer''s level. Still, I don''t see how it could be true.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'Murderer!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'Poisoner!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'Kill the scum!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'How many others have you poisoned?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Kill the poisoner!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'You''re helping a poisoner? You must be in league with them!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Look, if you don''t decide something soon, we''re going to lynch this scoundrel.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'That''s the most ridiculous story I''ve ever heard. C''mon everyone, let''s take care of this murderer.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'I have real misgivings about this, but I''ll check out the food based on your word. I just pray that you''re not wrong...'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'Go away, stranger. We have friends and family to bury and mourn.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'That''s enough. In Marya''s memory, scum, DIE!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'Look, just go away. If you had know Marya and the children... you''d be upset too.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'Excellent... I''m saved. The fools. Now nobody suspects me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'So, you don''t believe me either? How very smart of you. Well, I can''t leave any witnesses...!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I have nothing as a reward... please, just help me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/poisoner_one.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'doubtful'),
