('string/en/poi/deliverance/sibling_siblings.stf', 149, 'm_rejected', 'I don''t want to talk about this anymore.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/sibling_siblings.stf', 150, 'm_rejected_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/sibling_siblings.stf', 151, 'm_rejected_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/sibling_siblings.stf', 152, 'm_rejected_mood', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'I need your help. There are a band of thugs coming after me. I don''t know why but they seem to want to kill me. I want you to help me fight them off. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'This is none of your business. We ask that you step aside and let us do what we came here to do. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'You will? Whew, I''m so glad you came along. I would be dead otherwise.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'No? You are just going to stand there and watch me get cut down? You worthless nerf herder.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'Great! Those rebels are always sticking their noses where they don''t belong. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'Listen friend, we need you to step aside. We''ll take care of this scum.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'Get out of our way! Our business is not with you.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'I don''t think they are going to negotiate. You can try talking to them, but they''ll probably just make up some story and kill me anyway.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'You must be a slaver too then. Well, there is no place for your kind in this sector.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Good. Let''s rid the galaxy of this slaver scum.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'What? Do you know who this creep is? He''s a vicious slaver. He doesn''t deserve mercy. Tell you what, you get him to get his gang to release all of their slaves and we''ll let him live.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'Tell that to all the twi''leks he kept as slaves. He and his fellow slavers weren''t interested in fair fights when they beat and killed those poor twi''leks. Now get out of our way.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'Release the slaves? I don''t know if the other members would go for that. I can try, if it will save my hide.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'Ha ha. Release my twi''leks?! Those idiotic rebels aren''t living in the real world. Tell them I''d rather die.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'Try? There is no try. He''s just buying time to escape. He would probably kill his slaves before releasing them. We''ve had enough of his kind.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'He better succeed at freeing those slaves. We''re not going to rest until we put all of slavers in this sector out of business for good.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'What''s it going to be?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Hold on, I can''t let you gang up on this one guy. This is hardly a fair fight. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'I''m not happy with this arrangement. I''m losing a lot of credits here, but I suppose it is better than losing my life.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'Got your weapon ready?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There he is! You can''t run anymore. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'Please don''t hurt me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'How many times did you hear that plea yourself, and then ignore it!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'You''re a good fighter. The rebellion could use more people like you.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'I hope you''re right and he frees those slaves. Maybe there are peaceful ways of ending the injustices in this galaxy. We''ll see. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'We need to put a stop to his kind. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'Let''s get this over with.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'This is exactly why I joined the Alliance; to put an end to the problems of the galaxy. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'I hate having to resort to violence, but unrepentant slavers like this guy make me so angry. We need to send a clear message that slavery should not be permitted anywhere. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Freedom at any price, that''s what I always say.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'Look out, he''s got friends! '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'It''s time to put an end to your little business.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'Talking to his type is just a waste of good breath'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'If he doesn''t free his slaves, we won''t bother talking next time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'Get lost. You obviously don''t care about anything. That guy was a slaver. He kept other people as property. I don''t understand how you can just sit back and do nothing when the galaxy is such a bad state.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'We''ll be a step closer to a free galaxy with one less slaver hanging around.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'What do you want?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'I''m free of them at last. You know, it will be a dark day if the rebellion ever comes to power and infringes on the rights of legitimate property holders like myself. Why they think slaves are worth fighting for is beyond me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'I should have known, just another bleeding heart rebel. My slaves are my property. If you can''t live with that, then I suggest you die.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I would like to compensate you for your help but I seem to be shy of credits right now. Tell you what, if I see you again I''ll cut you a discount on one of my slaves.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'Emphatic'),
