('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 149, 'm_rejected', 'This isn''t what I wanted.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 150, 'm_rejected_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 151, 'm_rejected_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/slaver_rebels.stf', 152, 'm_rejected_mood', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Hey you, I need some help here. I''m in the business of, shall we say, relocating merchandise. I''ve got some Imps hot on my trail. Think you can lend me a hand? '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'Stand aside. We are here to eliminate this criminal. He has been wanted for smuggling contraband items across the galaxy. We''ve finally tracked him down to here. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'Thanks, good to know there are still people who will help a guy out of a sticky situation.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'Fine. Then you may want to stay clear of here. Blaster bolts are gonna fly.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'Nice fighting. I''m glad I could count on you to help me out of that scrap.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'Stand aside, we are only after this smuggler.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'Stand aside. We are here to eliminate this criminal. He has been wanted for smuggling contraband items across the galaxy. We''ve finally tracked him down to here.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Look, unless you want to get involved here, people are gonna die.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'You must be one of his drop-off contacts. Looks like we got here at the right time. Get them!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Take him down!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'We will let him go this time if he provides the name of his contact on Nar Shaddaa. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'He''s been evading capture for long enough. We''re going to make certain he doesn''t escape again.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'My contact? Sure, that Hutt owes me so much money I''d love for it to get some more Imperial heat. My contact''s name is Embra.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'And go from one death sentence to worse than death sentence. I think not.  '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'We know his contracted ended with Embra the Hutt months ago. That was his last chance. Attack!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'That''s the information we needed. However, if we catch him smuggling again there won''t be an opportunity to talk his way out.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Well, what''s it going to be?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Wait, this doesn''t have to end in violence. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'Well I was all prepared for a fight. I guess I should thank you for getting me out of that jam.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'I think I hear them. Get ready.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'You there, stop!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'Easy now, I''m sure we can come to some sort of agreement, gentlemen.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'We are not here to negotiate. You are not escaping this time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'You''ve done well in helping us eliminate that smuggler. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'You''ve helped us gather important information here today. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'We''ve chased him for long enough now.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'That smuggler has evaded us for the last time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'Don''t distract me. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'I''ll make sure he doesn''t have an escape route.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'His smuggling days are over.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'Watch out, there''s more than one of them. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Surround him.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'This smuggler has wasted too much of our time already. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'You''ve served the Empire well.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'Move along.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'He''s going to fire. Take him down!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'Move it.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'Once again, I survive to see another day. Something tells me my luck can''t hold out forever. Maybe I should give up smuggling and try a safer line of work. Naw.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'You''re helping the Imperials?! You''re funeral, pal.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'What are you looking at me for? I''m out of here.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/smuggler_stormtroopers.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'approving'),
