('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Oh please help me. Please, please help me! I''m being hunted down by a mob of people. I''ll be rip to pieces if you don''t protect me! Please! Please!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'This thief has been stealing supplies from us for months. We finally have proof that it was him, but the Empire doesn''t want to waste resources picking him up. So we''re here to deal out some of our own justice. Get out of our way unless you want some too!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'Oh, you are the best thing that has ever happened to me! Thank you! Thank you!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'I think I''m going to cry. Oh why me? Why won''t anyone help me?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'You saved me! Oh, but I got to get out of this area. Find a new home for my droid and me. Thank you for saving me.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'This thief has been stealing supplies from us for months. We finally have proof that it was him, but the lousy Empire doesn''t want to waste resources picking him up. So we''re here to deal out some of our own justice. Get out of our way unless you want some too!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'This thief has been stealing supplies from us for months. We finally have proof that it was him, but your Empire doesn''t want to waste resources picking him up. So we''re here to deal out some of our own justice. Get out of our way unless you want some too!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Please talk to them then, maybe they will listen to you.  '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'You should have gotten out of our way.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Let''s get him! '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'Mostly oil. We''re in short supply of that around here. Yes, we want it back.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'I said get out of our way. You aren''t the law in these parts.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'I needed that oil. My droid has been in terrible shape. He''s. it''s the only friend I have. I just could let him rust to nothing. I stole the oil to keep him alive. I''ll do anything to save him. Ask them if there is a way I can work off my debt.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'I needed that oil. My droid has been in terrible shape. He''s. it''s the only friend I have. I just could let him rust to nothing. I stole the oil to keep him alive.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'He did it for a droid? What kind of lame excuse is that? Come on, let''s teach him a lesson!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'He did it for a droid? Well, I suppose we could give him the opportunity to pay us back. There is a lot of work to be done around here. A free pair of hands would really help us out.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'Well? What did they say? Oh please, let it be good news. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'What did he steal from you? Maybe we can get him to return it. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'Thank you so much. My droid will be so happy when he hears that I''m not going to prison.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'I hear them coming. They found me. Oh no!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There he is! It''s time to bring you to justice, you little thief.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'No, please, don''t. I can''t go to prison. Please just let me go this once and I''ll leave. I won''t come back here, I promise. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'We''re not going to let you steal from us and then just walk away. Come with us now or we''ll make you come.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Let that be a lesson to anyone who even thinks about stealing from us.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'I guess we over reacted a bit there. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'The Empire won''t bother with local disputes, so we gots to take matters into our own hands!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'This thief has stolen thousands of credits worth of oil from my garage. Other people''s too.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'A good beating ought to teach him not to steal.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'He''s an odd one. He lives out in the boonies all by himself. Some people claims he treats his droid like it was a real person. My aunt once saw him crying when his droid''s restraining bolt came loose and it tried to run away. He creeps me out. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'We have got to make an example out of him. I''m tired of people thinking they can take things that don''t belong to them. There is no excuse for stealing. Well, maybe stealing food to feed a starving family, but he doesn''t even have a family!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'Look, that thief has a friend! Get them! '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Well, we''re waiting. This is your last chance to come peacefully.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'You''re wasting our time! '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'We''ll make sure he works off his debt. It is pretty sad that he did it for a droid.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'We don''t need your kind around here. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'All right, you''ve wasted enough of our time. Let''s teach him not to steal from us.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'Get out of here. You aren''t wanted.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'I''m rescued! I''m rescued! Just wait until I tell my droid about this day. He will never believe me. You don''t have any spare oil on you, do you?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'Oh no! Why? Why are you helping them? No, please don''t! Please! That''s it, I''ve got to defend myself and my droid!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'I wish I could repay you, but I don''t have anything. It''s just me and my droid, and he doesn''t even work that well.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 50, 'a_accept_offer_chat', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 51, 'a_accept_offer_mood', 'Uncertain'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 52, 'a_accept_offer_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 53, 'm_yes_chat', ''),
