('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 148, 'a_brushoff_chat', 'Huff'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 149, 'm_rejected', 'Why does this always happen to me?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 150, 'm_rejected_act', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 151, 'm_rejected_chat', 'whine'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/thief_mob.stf', 152, 'm_rejected_mood', ''),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Hey there...! Don''t suppose you could lend me a hand? There''s a pack of thugs about to corner us, and I think they''re liable to kill me if I don''t spill a little secret... I have the coordinates to a valuable wreck that offers thousands of credits worth in salvage money. And they want the money too.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 2, 'a_greet', 'We were partners in a salvage operation. There''s thousands of credits to be made, but we don''t have the coordinates of the wreck. And now, that scum is saying that the partnership is over--after we''ve already sunk our money and time into it? No way! We want a cut!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 3, 'm_yes', 'If you can just shoot at them a bit, get them to run away--that would be great.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 4, 'm_no', 'Darn.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 5, 'm_thank_combat', 'Well, thanks for helping out! But I''m not gonna share the secret with you either. Too many people out for a fast credit these days.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 7, 'a_greet_rebel', 'We were partners in a salvage operation. There''s thousands of credits to be made, but we don''t have the coordinates of the wreck. And now, that scum is saying that the partnership is over--after we''ve already sunk our money and time into it? No way! We want a cut!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 8, 'a_greet_imperial', 'We were partners in a salvage operation. There''s thousands of credits to be made, but we don''t have the coordinates of the wreck. And now, that scum is saying that the partnership is over--after we''ve already sunk our money and time into it? No way! We want a cut!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 9, 'm_maybe', 'Well, try talking to them when they get here. Maybe they''ll see reason. But I doubt it. I didn''t pick them as partners because they were the reasonable type.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 10, 'a_no', 'It''s bad form to doublecross a fellow salvager. You''ll regret this.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 11, 'a_yes', 'Then how about you clear on out of here?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 12, 'a_maybe', 'Well, then, see if you can get the coordinates for the wreck out of that stubborn bantha-brain.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 13, 'a_no_negotiate', 'What, you trying to jump our claim? Get out of here before we blast a nice hole in your head.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 14, 'm_will_negotiate', 'What if I offer to get them back in on it, but at a third share instead of half? After all, they''re only putting up some of the money, I have to deal with smuggling the goods out of the area.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 15, 'm_no_negotiate', 'No way am I going to split the profit with these scruffy idiots.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 16, 'a_decline_offer', 'Not good enough. C''mon, gang, let''s deal with this doublecrosser!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 17, 'a_accept_offer', 'A third, eh? Well, I suppose that point about smuggling is a good one. I wouldn''t like to get picked up by the Empire and interrogated. Alright, we accept.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 18, 'm_negotiate_greet', 'So, did they go for the offer?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 19, 'response_yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 20, 'response_no', 'No.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 21, 'response_maybe', 'Maybe.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 22, 'response_negotiate', 'Are you willing to try to settle this honorably?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 23, 'm_thank_negotiate', 'Thanks for calming them down. They were too mad to shoot straight, probably, but I might have been hurt.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 24, 'm_waiting', 'They should show up any minute, they were hot on my trail.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 25, 'a_greet_m', 'There you are! Look, we want the coordinates to that wreck! A deal''s a deal!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 26, 'm_greet_a', 'After how you were talking about cutting me out of the profits? I don''t think so!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 27, 'a_respond_m_1', 'It was a JOKE. We were ready to do this fair and square. You clearly aren''t!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 29, 'a_thank_combat', 'Figures he''d die without telling us the coordinates. Now we''re out all those credits.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 30, 'a_thank_negotiate', 'Well, we can''t cut you in the deal, but thanks for the help getting the argument settled. I guess we all got a bit hot under the collar there.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 32, 'minion_1', 'How are we going to get back our money?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 33, 'minion_2', 'Mother always told me never to get involved with a smuggler.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 34, 'minion_3', 'I just want to know the coordinates to the wreck.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 35, 'minion_4', 'I''m an orphan. I have been searching long and hard for word of my family. I have high hopes that I am actually a scion of a noble and long-lived line of great nobility, left abandoned by my parents under persecution. I believe that this wreck is the place to find the hidden secrets of my birth, and so I fell in with this motley crew.... actually, I''m just here for the money. Why are you talking to me anyway?'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 37, 'minion_5', 'Let''s kill him! After we get the coordinates, of course.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 38, 'a_greet_mad', 'You''re helping this lying doublecrosser? Well, we can take care of you too!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 39, 'a_waiting', 'Well, what are you going to do? If you don''t do something soon, I''m just going to take out this cheat here and write off the loss in credits!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 40, 'a_negotiate_fail', 'What a waste of time.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 41, 'a_thank_negotiate_again', 'Thanks again for sorting this out. Once we find the wreck, I''m sure we can, uh, re-negotiate the percentages. I have leverage, if you know what I mean. '),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 42, 'a_brushoff', 'Get lost. We''re out a ton of credits now, and it doesn''t make us happy. Be glad we don''t take it out of your hide.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 43, 'a_tired_waiting', 'OK, that''s enough waiting. Tell us the coordinates!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 44, 'a_no_progress', 'Get lost. I don''t have time to waste on you.'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 47, 'm_saved', 'Well, good riddance to them. I would have died before telling them the coordinates. Besides, they never knew the wreck wasn''t really worth anything--I just needed to get there to try to recover some archaelogical data. See, you have to be careful when dealing with thugs!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 48, 'm_betrayed', 'Oh no, you don''t! I might have doublecrossed them, but I won''t let you doublecross me!'),
('string/en/poi/deliverance/treasure.stf', 49, 'm_sorry', 'Well, sorry I can''t offer a reward, but in point of fact the wreck is worthless. I''m an archaeologist, and I just wanted backing for this trip. I kind of tricked them into giving it.'),
