('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 20, 'a_whoareyou_mood', 'mean'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 21, 'm_insult1_response_chat', 'retort'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 22, 'm_insult1_response_mood', 'scornful'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 23, 'm_insult2_response_chat', 'respond'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 24, 'm_insult2_response_mood', 'petulant'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 25, 'm_insult3_response_chat', 'retort'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 26, 'm_insult3_response_mood', 'enraged'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 27, 'a_victory', 'Jabba will be pleased at our victory.  Drink''s on me tonight!'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 28, 'a_victory_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 29, 'a_victory_mood', 'exuberant'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 30, 'm_victory', 'Jabba''s men are just a bunch of fat talk, like their boss.  Loot up and let''s pull out.'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 31, 'm_victory_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 32, 'm_victory_mood', 'mean'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 33, 'a_whatthehell', 'What the...I''m trying to take care of business!  Waste ''em all!'),
('string/en/poi/gangwar/jabba1.stf', 34, 'default', ''),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Well met, traveler.  What brings you to my small and lonely abode?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 2, 'r_m_greet', 'I was adventuring and happened across it.  I came to see who lived here.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 3, 'm_herotalk1', 'Merely an old man.  I keep to myself and tend my books.  I think.  I philosophize.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 4, 'r_m_herotalk1', 'Out here in the wilderness? Alone?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 5, 'm_herotalk2', 'I am able to watch after myself.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 6, 'r_m_herotalk2', 'What do you philosophize about, old man...that is if the winds haven''t scoured your mind clean by now.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 7, 'm_herotalk3', 'Such talk.  Mind your manners child.  I philosophize of the state of our worlds.  Of these dark times.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 8, 'r_m_herotalk3', 'Dark times? What do you know of dark times?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 9, 'm_herotalk4', 'Pirates and criminals travel freely.  The Old Republic has been shattered.  The Jedi have been hunted to all but extinction.  Over all of this hangs the shadow of the Empire.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 10, 'r_m_empiregood', 'You speak boldly of what you know little of.  The Empire has brought justice and peace to much of the civilized galaxy.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 11, 'r_m_empirebad', 'You speak truly.  The Empire rules ruthlessly and unjustly.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 12, 'm_herotalk5', 'I have no interest in bandying words with you, child.  Educate yourself...seek out enlightenment...then perhaps we might have a civilized discussion.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 13, 'm_herotalk6', 'It is my belief that the galaxy is in dire need of heros.  Those individuals who have demonstrated beyond doubt their dedication to the path of light.  You are brash and young, but perhaps one day you will become a hero and bring light to this darkened place.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 14, 'r_m_herotalk6', 'I wish to become a hero.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 15, 'm_herotalk7', 'A noble intent, but intentions in the face of a challenge are as dust upon a Tatooine windstorm.  One must act and through ones actions one might be proven a hero.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 16, 'r_m_herotalk7', 'How do I prove that I am a hero?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 17, 'm_herotalk8', 'Travel the world.  Perform acts that demonstrate your heroism.  Through these actions you will be transformed.  A hero must be honorable, intelligent, courageous, and altruistic.  You must seek to help the world despite the cost.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 18, 'r_m_herotalk8', 'I will do these things.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 19, 'm_herotalk9', 'Return to me when you have proven the measure of your character.  An act of honor.  An act of intellect.  An act of courage.  An act of altruism.  Demonstrate to me these characteristics and I will bestow upon you the Symbol of Heroism.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 20, 'r_m_herotalk9', 'What is the Symbol of Heroism?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 21, 'm_herotalk10', 'I wasn''t always an old man.  Many years ago I won many a campaign against the forces of darkness.  I wore the symbol about my neck as a reminder of my cause.  I would pass this thing to the one I believe capable of continuing my work.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 22, 'r_m_herotalk10', 'I will seek to prove my character.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 23, 'm_herotalk11', 'Go then.  One cannot become a hero by spending all day chatting with a crazed old man...and may the force be with you.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 24, 'm_chatter_1', 'Looks like another storm.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 25, 'm_chatter_2', 'Where did I put that pot at?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 26, 'm_chatter_3', 'Do I know you?  Did I know you?  I often forget things.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 27, 'm_chatter_4', 'I feel tired.  Maybe I''ll lay down for a bit.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 28, 'm_heroreturned', 'Ah!  The hero returns!  It is good to see you are still well.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 29, 'm_youareahero', 'I see the marks you bear.  An act of honor.  An act of courage.  An act of intellect.  An act of altruism.  Can it be?  Have I found the one I have sought for so long?'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 30, 'm_youareahero2', 'You have done great things in the name of the light.  I am honored to be in your presence.  Take my Symbol of Heroism and let it remind you of your cause.  Do not forget why you fight.  Good luck, young warrior.'),
('string/en/poi/heromark/basic.stf', 31, 'r_m_relatestory', 'Relate the tales of your adventures.'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 1, 'm_helpme', 'Help me!  Please help me!'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 2, 'm_pleasehelpme', 'You must help me.  They''ll find me soon.  Please help me...please...'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 3, 'm_greet', 'They''re after me.  Take this, please!'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 4, 'r_m_greet_who', 'Who are you? What is this? What must I do with it?'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 5, 'm_theycome', 'Oh no, its too late!  Take it, run, go! GO!'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 6, 'm_helpme_mood', 'panicked'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 7, 'm_pleasehelpme_mood', 'panicked'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 8, 'm_helpme_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 9, 'm_pleasehelpme_chat', 'beg'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 10, 'm_desperatehelpme', 'I don''t know where to go.  If they find me I''m dead.  You have to help me!'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 11, 'm_desperatehelpme_mood', 'panicked'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 12, 'm_desperatehelpme_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 13, 'a_theresheis', 'There she is, waste her.'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 14, 'a_theresheis_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 15, 'a_nodisk', 'There''s no disk here.  Command must have had the target wrong.'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 16, 'a_hasdisk', 'The disk is here.  Mission complete.'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 17, 'a_lookingfordisk', 'Target down.  Checking for the disk.'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 18, 'itemname', 'Encrypted Datadisk'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 19, 'systemmessage', 'You received an Encrypted Datadisk!'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 20, 'a_nodisk_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 21, 'a_hasdisk_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/mysteriousdisk/basic.stf', 22, 'a_lookingfordisk_chat', 'shout'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 1, 'weakened_wall_name', 'Weakened Wall'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 2, 'm_title', 'Farm Master'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 3, 'a_title', 'Captain'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 4, 'a_minion_1', 'These idiot farmers think they can keep us caged up.  They don''t know what we''ve got.  The smart thing for you to do is talk to the Captain and help us out.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 5, 'a_minion_2', 'Just wait until I get out of here.  I''m going to seriously tear some hides!  I hear the Captain has a plan.  I''m ready.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 6, 'a_minion_3', 'Nobody keeps me in a cage.  We gonna smash our way to freedom like a rancor on yarrock once the Captain gives us the word.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 7, 'a_minion_4', 'You in with these damn farmers?  You better run before we get out or you''ll be running on stumps.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 8, 'a_greet', 'Who are you?  You don''t look like a farmer.  Maybe you can help my brothers and I, falsely imprisoned as we are.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 9, 'r_greet_tellstory', 'Falsely? Who imprisoned you and why?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 11, 'a_mystory', 'My boys and I were out transporting goods when these so called farmers set upon us.  They killed two of my men and threw the rest of us in here.  Bloody massacre it was.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 12, 'r_mystory_howhorrible', 'Sorry to hear you lost people.  You were lucky to have not lost your own life.  Is there anything I can do to help?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 13, 'r_mystory_looklikefarmers', 'Nice story, but I don''t think I believe you.  They look like farmers to me and you look like trouble.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 14, 'a_angrylooklikefarmers', 'Trouble?  When I get out of here, I''ll show you trouble.  Get lost.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 16, 'a_couldusehelp_horrible', 'Yeah, you might be able to help out.  Sure you want to risk it?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 17, 'r_couldusehelp_nohelp', 'Uh, nevermind.  This isn''t any of my business.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 18, 'r_couldusehelp_yeshelp', 'It''s nothing I can''t handle.  What do you need?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 19, 'a_angrynohelp', 'If we get out, I''ll hunt you down and make it your business.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 21, 'a_insulted', 'You had better hope we don''t break out or you''ll die first.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 22, 'a_insulted_nohelp', 'Soon you''ll find out what happens to people who refuse me.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 23, 'a_please_distractguard', 'Confident eh?  Alright then, maybe you can help us.  Listen up.  We gotta bomb that can bust us outta here.  Just need you to distract the guard for a bit.  Do that, an we''ll take care ah the rest.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 24, 'm_minion_1', 'I''m busy going through an equipment manifest.  Talk to the Farm Master...he might be able to use you.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 25, 'm_minion_2', 'I really don''t have time to talk, but the Farm Master might.  He make us do all the work around here.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 26, 'm_minion_3', 'The boss is in the tent.  If you need something, take it up with him.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 27, 'm_minion_4', 'We''re pretty busy out here dealing with the prisoners.  If you need something, take it up with the boss in the tent.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 28, 'm_greet', 'I''m pretty busy at the moment.  Normally I''d just have thirty thousand things to do.  Today I have thirty thousand and one.  Could you come back later?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 29, 'r_m_greet_whatprisoners', 'Sorry to bother, but I''d like to know who you have locked up in that containment grid.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 30, 'm_tellprisoners', 'A load of pirates we caught destroying one of our outlying moisture collectors.  We''re trying to figure out what to do with them.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 31, 'r_tp_whynotkillthem', 'Why not just execute them?  Set them free and they''ll just attack again.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 32, 'r_tp_bettermovethem', 'Turn them over to the authorities.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 33, 'm_nokillthem', 'That''s too harsh.  They didn''t kill anyone.  Look, this isn''t open for discussion.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 34, 'm_cantmovethem', 'I''m the authority on my land.  Maybe I''ll put them to work fixing moisture collectors.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 35, 'm_busy', 'Today twenty four people I don''t know have wandered into my tent asking me if I have any work for them.  I don''t.  Go away.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 36, 'a_attackwall_leader', 'Now is our chance!  Wire up the explosives.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 37, 'a_attackwall', 'Go go go!  Hit it hard!  Yes!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 38, 'a_attackeveryone', 'The wall is down!  Make them pay!  Kill everyone in the camp!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 39, 'a_minion_reportbomb', 'The bomb is set to blow any moment.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 40, 'm_minion_gopee', 'I can''t hold it any longer!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 41, 'm_guard_title', 'Guard'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 42, 'm_minion_guard_1', 'Guard duty is boring.  I''d rather be working on equipment.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 43, 'm_minion_guard_2', 'I can''t talk right now, I''m guarding these prisoners.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 44, 'm_minion_guard_3', 'I''m busy with guard duty.  Why don''t you go talk to the Farm Master?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 45, 'm_minion_guard_4', 'Don''t distract me.  I have to watch these prisoners.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 46, 'r_anywork', 'I''m sure you can handle it.  Have any work I can do?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 47, 'm_checktheguard', 'What is it with you people always wanting work?  I don''t even know you.  Look, go check on the guard I posted.  Make sure everything is quiet and report back to me.  If you can do this without incident, maybe I''ll think about giving you a job.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 48, 'r_noillcheck', 'No, I haven''t checked on him yet.  I''ll go do that now.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 49, 'm_yeahyoudothat', 'How difficult is it to follow simple instructions?  Do I need a protocol droid?  Do I need to write it down so that you don''t forget?  Go check the guard!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 50, 'm_didyoucheck', 'Did you check on the guard yet?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 51, 'r_toldtocheckyou', 'The Farm Master asked me to check up on you.  Everything okay out here?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 52, 'm_guard_allsquiet', 'The prisoners are quiet.  Everything is pretty serene.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 53, 'r_gotellmaster', 'Great.  I''ll go tell the Farm Master.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 54, 'm_guard_needtopee', 'Hey, before you go.  I really need to, ah, relieve myself.  Do you think you could watch my post for a bit?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 55, 'r_pee_goodidea', 'Sure, no problem.  Hurry back.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 56, 'r_pee_badidea', 'That doesn''t sound like a good idea.  You shouldn''t leave your post.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 57, 'm_guard_pee_goodidea', 'Great, thanks, I''ll be right back!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 58, 'm_guard_pee_badidea', 'Okay, but I don''t think I can hold it for very long.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 59, 'r_hesdoingfine', 'He''s doing fine.  Everything is quiet.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 60, 'r_hesonbreak', 'Everything is pretty quiet, so I told the guard to take a break.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 61, 'r_heneedsabreak', 'Everything is quiet, but your guard needs a break.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 62, 'm_excellent', 'That guard usually has trouble with discipline, it''s good to hear he''s taking care of things.  I don''t have anything else for you to do, though.  So kindly remove yourself from my tent.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 63, 'm_whatbreak', 'YOU WHAT?  What are you doing here?  The prisoners are unguarded!  Go keep watch you fool!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 64, 'm_nobreak', 'It''s good to hear everything is quiet, but I can''t let that guard have a break.  Those pirates would probably try something while he''s gone.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 65, 'r_whatshappening', 'How is guard duty going?  Seems pretty quiet.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 66, 'm_minion_guard_peeing', 'I''m sorta busy.  Could you come back later?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 67, 'r_prisonersplanning', 'The prisoners are planning a breakout.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 68, 'm_whatbreakout', 'A breakout?  How?  I don''t see how they would succeed.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 69, 'r_prisonershavebomb', 'They have some kind of detonator.  They are going to wire the wall when I distract the guards.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 70, 'm_abomb', 'Hmm... Thank you for telling me.  I have an idea.  Go ahead and distract the guard...'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 71, 'r_distractanyway', 'What? Why would you want me to help them with their plan?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 72, 'm_theplan', 'When you distract the guard, they''ll think they are free to make an attempt.  When they start to wire the bomb, fire on the wall they are wiring up.  It should surprise them...they''ll know we are on to them and give up.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 73, 'm_distractguard', 'You know the plan.  Distract the guard then shoot the wall they are wiring up.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 74, 'm_soontheypay', 'After this, the prisoners won''t try to escape again.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 75, 'a_minion_dropbomb', 'Damn I dropped the bomb!  HIT THE DECK!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 76, 'a_idiots', 'The idiot nearly killed us all, but the wall is down!  Attack!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 77, 'm_underattack_1', 'We''re under attack!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 78, 'm_underattack_2', 'The prisoners are escaping!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 79, 'm_underattack_3', 'What the hell is going on?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 80, 'm_underattack_4', 'Stop the prisoners!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 81, 'm_minion_leaderdead', 'My master is dead.  Where will I go now?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 82, 'm_minion_minorfailure_1', 'You stopped the pirate''s plan, but the farm master is dead.  What will we do now?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 83, 'm_minion_minorfailure_2', 'The farm master died in the battle.  Leave us alone.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 84, 'm_minion_majorfailure_1', 'You let the pirates escape and the Farm Master is dead!  Is there any more chaos for you to cause?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 85, 'm_minion_majorfailure_2', 'The pirates are dead, but the farm master was killed in the battle.  Why didn''t you try to stop the pirates plan?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 86, 'm_minion_wesurvived', 'Our prisoners rebelled but we survived due to the help of a stranger!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 87, 'm_minion_majorvictory_1', 'You saved us!  If you hadn''t interrupted the pirate bomber, we might all be dead!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 88, 'm_minion_majorvictory_2', 'What heroism!  You stopped the pirates from escaping and saved us.  Thank you.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 89, 'm_minion_minorvictory_1', 'The pirates nearly escaped, but we stopped them.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 90, 'm_minion_minorvictory_2', 'That was close.  If only we had known about the pirate''s plan.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 91, 'm_majorvictory', 'You stopped the pirates plan, we are in your debt.  Please bear this token as a symbol of your honorable act.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 92, 'm_minorvictory', 'That was close, but at least the pirates are dead.  How did they smuggle an explosive into the containment pen?  No matter.  We thank you for your assistance.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 93, 'a_victory_1', 'Those farmers never had a chance.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 94, 'a_victory_2', 'Man what a fight.  We just wasted everyone.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 95, 'a_victory_3', 'Nothing can hold us down for long.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 96, 'a_victory_4', 'Did you see the way I nailed the one that tried to get away?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 97, 'a_minion_attackedwhilebombing', 'Agh! We''ve been found out! Just need a few more seconds...'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 98, 'a_keepitup', 'Keep concentrating until the bomb is set!'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 99, 'a_minion_setbomb', 'Rigging this thing up will only take a few seconds.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 100, 'a_couldusehelp', 'Look, we could use your help with this.  Wanna help break us out?'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 101, 'm_approachchatter_1', 'Lookin'' fer a job?  Maybe the Farm Master eh let ya do guard duty.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 102, 'm_approachchatter_2', 'I think those pirates are plannin'' something.  I can smell it.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 103, 'm_approachchatter_3', 'Mighty hot day.  Wish I could sit in a tent all day like the Farm Master.'),
('string/en/poi/prisonbreak/basic.stf', 104, 'm_approachchatter_4', 'Gonna take two weeks at least ta fix the damage these pirates did.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 1, 'm_greet', 'Great Scott!  You came just in time!  *Gasp*  I''m so relieved!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 2, 'r_m_greet', 'Why? What''s wrong?'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 3, 'm_studying', 'Oh, I apologize!  I forgot to tell you who I am!  I am an Imperial research scientist studying the fauna in this area.  Most interesting creatures, indeed.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 4, 'r_m_studying', 'Yes, but why were you panicking just a moment ago?'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 5, 'm_thebeast', 'AH!  I almost forgot!  I angered one of the nastier species of creature I have been studying and it attacked me!  It nearly killed me before I managed to drive it away.  Its only a matter of time before it comes back to finish the job.  Who knows, it might even bring its pack!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 6, 'r_m_thebeast_help', 'I can help you defend yourself from the creature.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 7, 'r_m_thebeast_nohelp', 'I don''t have any interest in biological research, Imperial or otherwise.  I''m afraid you are on your own.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 8, 'm_hereitcomes_nohelp', 'You won''t help?  Most perturbatory.  Gah!  The beast returns!  HELP!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 9, 'm_hereitcomes_help', 'Just in time too.  The creatures are returning!  HELP!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 10, 'm_help_1', 'Help!  Save me from this thing!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 11, 'm_help_2', 'I''m too intelligent to die!  Help me!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 12, 'm_wesurvived', 'Excelsior!  I am saved!'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 13, 'm_thanks', 'Thank you for your assistance.  I am truly in your debt.  I do not have sufficient funding to reward you, but please, bear my mark as a symbol of your deed.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 14, 'm_chatter_1', 'My work here is very serious.  We need to know more about the life on this planet.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 15, 'm_chatter_2', 'If only the head academician would approve my request for a larger grant.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 16, 'm_chatter_3', 'I wonder what the ecosocial implications of biodiverse herd behavior are?'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 17, 'm_chatter_4', 'Weren''t you supposed to be in the test chamber half an hour ago?  Oh...I''m sorry, I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/poi/rabidbeast/basic.stf', 18, 'm_ididallthework', 'I survived!  Quite excellent.  It seems to me, however, that I did all the work in dispatching the things.  I''m sorry, but I cannot reward you for you seemed rather...ineffective.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 1, 'a_greet', 'Uhm.  Hey...uh, do you know any of these guys?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 2, 'r_a_greet', 'No, I''ve never seen any of them before.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 3, 'a_lookingformark', 'One of them is my mark.  I think.  I''m not sure.  I''ve been tracking him for some time and just now caught up with him in this smuggler camp.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 4, 'r_a_lookingformark', 'So why don''t you arrest him?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 5, 'a_thatstheproblem', 'Arrest him.  Yeah, well...uhm...that''s the problem.  I don''t know which one he is.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 6, 'r_a_thatstheproblem', 'If you''ve been tracking him how can you not know which one he is?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 7, 'a_clues', 'The guy I''m looking for stole some equipment.  Nobody knows what he looks like, but some of the equipment had a transponder signal.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 8, 'r_a_clues', 'So arrest the smuggler with the transponder!'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 9, 'a_imnotdumb', 'Hey now, I''m not stupid!  A little while after I caught up with the signal, it went dead.  He must have found it and turned it off.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 10, 'r_a_imnotdumb', 'Have you questioned the occupants of the camp?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 11, 'a_questioned', 'Uhm...questioned them.  Ah.  Yeah I did that.  Yeahup.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 12, 'r_a_questioned', 'And???'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 13, 'a_questioned2', 'Well...I''m really confused.  I know the smuggler captain.  I trust him.  The other smugglers blame each other and I don''t know what to do.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 14, 'r_a_questioned2', 'Let me question the smugglers.  Maybe I can figure out who your mark is.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 15, 'a_goahead', 'You think I''m stupid don''t you?  I can do this myself.  But...uhm...well...if you want to try go ahead.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 16, 'm_title', 'Smuggler Captain'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 18, 'a_whoisit', 'Did you figure out who my mark is?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 19, 'r_a_whoisit', 'No, I''ll keep looking.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 26, 'm_chatter_1', 'Business is good!  I just moved twice my normal load of wares this week.  Now if that bounty hunter would get lost I''d be a happy man.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 27, 'm_chatter_2', 'Until that bounty hunter moves on, I won''t be able to inspect this new shipment.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 28, 'm_chatter_3', 'The Empire has been pretty busy with the rebellion lately.  Makes it easy to slip past with extra goods.  I would think they sent that bounty hunter to investigate, but he doesn''t seem very smart.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 29, 'm_chatter_4', 'I love my job.  The thrill of a light cruiser pushing past a blockade at full speed!  You never feel that way down here on the surface.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 30, 'm_chatter_5', 'I''ve got a flight path to plan, but that idiot of a bounty hunter keeps interrupting me with questions.  Kinda like you.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 31, 'm_chatter_0', 'Welcome to my camp.  Unfortunately, I''d rather not take on any more assignments with a bounty hunter snooping about.  Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 32, 'r_m_chatter_knowabouttheft', 'Do you know anything about the theft the bounty hunter is investigating?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 33, 'm_busy_0', 'I am quite busy, could you come back later?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 34, 'm_busy_1', 'I wonder how long until that bounty hunter gives up or arrests us all?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 35, 'm_busy_2', 'Look, I really need to think about my next job.  Could you give me some space?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 36, 'a_keeplooking', 'Go ahead, but I doubt you''ll turn anything up.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 37, 'a_wronganswer', '(The bounty hunter listens to your explanation.)  No...that still doesn''t make any sense to me.  I don''t think your answer is correct.  I appreciate your help, but I don''t think you can solve this puzzle.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 38, 'a_rightanswer', '(The bounty hunter listens to your explanation.)  I see!  It makes sense!  I''m going to act on your recommendation and make the arrest.  I don''t have much to reward you with, but please take this.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 39, 'm_criminal', 'You turned me in!  How did you figure out I was the thief?  Did my friends rat me out?'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 40, 'a_thanks', 'Thank you for helping me find my mark.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 41, 'a_notrust', 'You again?  Look, you aren''t going to get another shot at this.  I''ll solve the problem myself.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 42, 'a_chatter_1', 'I''m glad I was able to find my mark.  Now I can go get another job.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 43, 'a_chatter_2', 'This job is tough.  Tracking criminals across wilderness for a meager reward.  Sometimes I wonder why I do it.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 44, 'r_a_ithinkso', 'I think I''ve figured it out.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 45, 'a_greatwho', 'You have?  Explain to me how you figured it out and if it makes sense, I''ll make the arrest.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 46, 'prose_implicate_0', '1. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 47, 'prose_implicate_1', '2. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 48, 'prose_implicate_2', '3. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 49, 'prose_implicate_3', '4. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 50, 'prose_implicate_4', '5. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 51, 'prose_implicate_5', '6. %TO'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 52, 'prose_m_line_1', 'Neither %TO nor I have anything to do with this, leave us alone.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 53, 'prose_m_line_2', 'I know for a fact that the bounty hunter is looking for %TT or %TO.  They are both considered scum, even among smugglers.  I wouldn''t be surprised if one of them stooped to petty thievery.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 54, 'prose_m_line_3', 'Don''t trust %TT and %TO, both of them are lying.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 55, 'prose_m_line_4', '%TT isn''t telling the truth: either %TO or %TU is lying, the other is not.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 56, 'prose_m_line_5', 'What %TO said is a lie.  I''ve been cheated by that that poor excuse for a smuggler enough times to know.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 57, 'prose_m_line_0', 'I don''t see how I can help you, other than this piece of advice.  I know the smugglers in this camp fairly well.  Two of them always lie.  You can only trust the other four.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 58, 'm_chatter_v_0', 'Now I can finally get back to my business.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 59, 'm_chatter_v_1', 'I love my job.  The thrill of a light cruiser pushing past a blockade at full speed!  You never feel that way down here on the surface.'),
('string/en/poi/twoliars/basic.stf', 60, 'm_chatter_v_2', 'Smuggling has been tough with the Empire''s recent crackdown.  The rebels hurt them bad and now everyone''s feeling the effects.'),
('string/en/poi/wounded/template.stf', 1, 'm_1', 'random thing 1'),
('string/en/poi/wounded/template.stf', 2, 'm_2', 'random thing 2'),
('string/en/poi/wounded/template.stf', 3, 'm_3', 'random thing 3'),
