('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 131, 'crafting4_core_current_no_testing', '\n\nThere has not yet been an attempt to reconfigure this computer core.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 132, 'phase1_msg_comp_installed', 'A component is already installed in that socket.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 133, 'tracking_device_not_on_quest', '[Satellite Tracking Device Usage Error]: The tracking device has gone into dormant mode. It will not respond until re-authorized for use.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 134, 'phase1_msg_calibration_aborted', 'You have aborted the calibration process causing the component with which you were working to burn out. You will need to craft and calibrate a new component.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 135, 'name_access_terminal', 'Sensor Array Access Terminal'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 136, 'msg_cant_use_yet', 'You can see no reason to use this right now.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 137, 'phase1_status_operational', 'Operational'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 138, 'phase1_status_damaged', 'Damaged'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 139, 'phase1_status_not_calibrated', 'Not Calibrated'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 140, 'phase1_msg_dont_have_component', 'You don''t currently have that component in your inventory.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 141, 'crafting4_phase_over', 'Unfortunately, you failed to get the replacement computer core to the village in time. \n\nThe Aurilia''s chief engineer was killed during the final attack on the village, but it''s possible the new chief engineer could put your replacement core to use. Once a new chief engineer has been appointed, that is.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 142, 'crafting4_phase_change_title', 'Incorrect Village Phase'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 147, 'crafting4_core_cancel_button', 'Cancel'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 148, 'crafting4_core_destroyed', 'The computer core has been destroyed. You will have to get another one if you wish to complete your mission.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 152, 'crafting4_kit_destroyed', 'The tracking device loot kit has been destroyed. You will have to get another one from a gadget specialist if you wish to complete your mission. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 154, 'crafting4_tracking_device_destroyed', 'The tracking device has been destroyed. You will have to get another kit from a gadget specialist if you wish to complete your mission. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 155, 'crafting4_tracking_device_destroyed_over', 'The tracking device has been destroyed. The chief engineer at Aurilia has been killed. You will have to wait until a new chief engineer has been appointed before you will be able speak with him and then continue by getting a new tracking device kit.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 156, 'crafting4_kit_destroyed_over', 'The tracking device loot kit has been destroyed. The chief engineer at Aurilia has been killed. You will have to wait until a new chief engineer has been appointed before you will be able speak with him and then continue by getting a new tracking device kit.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 157, 'crafting4_core_destroyed_over', 'The computer core has been destroyed.The chief engineer at Aurilia has been killed. You will have to wait until a new chief engineer has been appointed before you will be able speak with him and then continue by seeking the rights to another downed satellite.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 158, 'tracking_device_target_updated', 'Tracking... Updated! The location of the fallen satellite has been updated and the waypoint to it''s location has been corrected in your datapad.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_crafting.stf', 159, 'phase1_msg_schematic_already_loaded', 'You already have a draft schematic for that component.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_defend.stf', 1, 'summary_01', 'Defend the village against Mellichae''s soldiers!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_defend.stf', 3, 'detail_01', 'An overwhelming force of mercinaries and criminals are assaulting the village of Aurilia. The villagers are grossly outnumbered. You are tasked with defeating at least fifty of Mellichae''s hired thugs.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_defend.stf', 4, 'detail_02', 'An overwhelming force of mercinaries and criminals are assaulting the village of Aurilia. The villagers are grossly outnumbered. You are tasked with defeating at least twenty-five of the leuitenants leading Mellichae''s hired thugs.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 1, 'fs_response01', 'HELP ME!! help me... please.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 2, 'fs_response02', 'Ooooooh... It hurts! Doc, you have to give me some pain killers.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 3, 'fs_response03', 'Where is Sasha? SASHA! I have to find her! '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 4, 'fs_response04', 'They... they were everywhere! They killed Obandi right before my eyes. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 5, 'fs_response05', 'Why did they attack us? Why did they have to kill so many of us?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 6, 'fs_response06', 'My arm! I can''t feel my arm! Doc, I can''t feel my arm!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 7, 'fs_response07', 'Wha?... who.. who is that? I can hear you but I can''t see you. I can... I... Ungh. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 8, 'fs_response08', 'momma? MOMMA! I... I don''t want to die! MOMMA!!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 9, 'fs_response09', 'Doc! Doc... you gotta get this letter to my brother. He needs to know what happened to me. Promise me you''ll get it to him if I die.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_lamentations.stf', 10, 'fs_response10', 'no... lightning... no, please don''t... please? No, NOOOOO!!!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 1, 'symptom0', 'fever'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 2, 'symptom1', 'vomiting'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 3, 'symptom2', 'open sores'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 4, 'symptom3', 'pus-filled lesions'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 5, 'symptom4', 'erratic heart rate'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 6, 'symptom5', 'respiratory failure'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 7, 'symptom6', 'lost vision'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 8, 'symptom7', 'partial paralysis'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 9, 'symptom8', 'violent spasms'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 10, 'symptom9', 'bloody cough'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 11, 'symptom10', 'swelling'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 12, 'symptom11', 'internal bleeding'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 13, 'admin_meds', 'Administering medicines to the patient... If you need an updated list of symptoms please let me know.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 14, 'npc_cured', 'This patient appears to be responding to treatments, we should be able to discharge them after a bit more rest. Please let me know when you are ready for the next patient. Resetting protocol for next patient.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 15, 'combat_healing_just_started', 'You just got started, get out there!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 16, 'combat_healing_count_part2', 'times, keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 17, 'combat_healing_count_part1', 'You have helped out'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 18, 'bacta_tank_n', 'A Bacta Tank'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_medic.stf', 19, 'bacta_tank_d', 'This tank contains a large supply of the Bacta fluid, Bacta fluid containing special bacteria capable of healing even seemingly life threatening injuries. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 1, 'fs_response01', 'HELP US!! Help us... please.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 2, 'fs_response02', 'They are coming back to finish us off! I know it!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 3, 'fs_response03', 'AHHHHH!!!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 4, 'fs_response04', 'We''re doomed! DOOMED I SAY!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 5, 'fs_response05', 'We have to get out of here!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 6, 'fs_response06', 'Where did they come from? Why do they want to hurt us!?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 7, 'fs_response07', 'Did you see the leader? I think he was a droid!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 8, 'fs_response08', 'They said they were Sith. Sith! We''re all going to die!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 9, 'fs_response09', 'They blew through the defenses like they weren''t even there!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 10, 'fs_response10', 'The leader was a sorcerer! I saw him shoot lightning from his finger tips!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 11, 'fs_response11', 'What did we do to deserve this?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 12, 'fs_response12', 'What do they want? We''re just farmers.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 13, 'fs_response13', 'Where are my children? Has anyone seen my children?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 14, 'fs_response14', 'Please... no more! I can''t take it anymore!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 15, 'fs_response15', 'Oh, the carnage! So many dead.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 16, 'fs_response16', 'They destroyed everything! Those beasts!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 17, 'fs_response17', 'Where is Seropf? SEROPF!? Where are you!? I have to find him!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 18, 'fs_response18', 'It''s useless! How can we fight them? We should just surrender.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 19, 'fs_response19', 'Are they all gone? How do we know!? They could still be here!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_panicked.stf', 20, 'fs_response20', 'I''ve never seen so much blood! Oh, it''s horrible!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 1, 'small_group1', 'You notice a lone figure left behind from the battle.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 2, 'large_group5', 'You happen upon what seems to be a forming raid party.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 3, 'small_group2', 'the sound of two footsteps that are not your own draws your attention.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 4, 'small_group3', 'three voices carry on the wind, you know you are not alone.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 5, 'large_group6', 'You happen upon what seems to be a forming raid party.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 6, 'large_group7', 'You happen upon what seems to be a forming raid party.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 7, 'large_group8', 'You happen upon what seems to be a forming raid party.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 8, 'fs_village_bannerpole_s01_n', 'an Aurilian Banner'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 9, 'fs_village_bannerpole_s01_d', 'The symbol for the village of Aurilia is emblazoned on this banner.  Oddly the banner moves even with no detectable wind.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 10, 'failed_death', 'Due to your untimely demise, you have failed this patrol.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 11, 'failed_previous_point', 'Unfortunately you did not complete the objective of the previous patrol point, and have failed the patrol.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 12, 'no_objective', 'everything seems calm here...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 13, 'failed_killed_dont_kill_npc', 'You have failed the patrol for violating a direct order and engaging a raid party.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_patrol.stf', 14, 'patrol_point', 'Patrol Point'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 1, 'msg_phase_01_find_theater_waypoint', 'The tracks you are following end here. The Sith Shadows have probably stopped somewhere nearby recently. You might want to search the area for an encampment...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 2, 'msg_phase_01_quest_finished', 'You have rescued all of the missing villagers! You feel your mind open itself to the potential secrets of Survival.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 3, 'msg_phase_01_quest_continue', 'You have rescued a prisoner! But at least %DI more are still missing. You should speak to Whip again for more information...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 4, 'msg_phase_01_quest_failed', 'You failed to rescue the villager. You should return and speak with Whip again before continuing...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 5, 'msg_phase_01_quest_fail_phase_done', 'You have failed to rescue the villagers captured from Aurilia in a timely manner. The missing villagers are presumed dead and the rescue operation has been aborted.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 6, 'msg_phase_02_find_theater_waypoint', 'The last transmission of the transport''s emergency beacon was from here. The ship is probably somewhere nearby...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 7, 'msg_phase_02_quest_finished', 'You have retrieved all of the missing supplies! You feel your mind open itself to the potential secrets of Vehicle Control.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 8, 'msg_phase_02_quest_continue', 'You have retrieved some supplies! But at least %DI more are still missing.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 9, 'msg_phase_02_quest_failed', 'Oh no! The supplies you were carrying have been lost!  You should return and speak with Whip again before continuing...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 10, 'msg_phase_02_quest_fail_phase_done', 'You have failed to retrieve the supplies for the village of Aurilia in a timely manner. The supplies are presumed lost and the retrieval operation has been aborted.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 11, 'msg_phase_02_quest_error_aborted', 'An error has occurred while transferring the emergency beacon location to your datapad.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 12, 'msg_phase_01_quest_error_aborted', 'An error has occurred while transmitting to your datapad.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 13, 'msg_phase_01_quest_fail_incap', 'Quest Failure: You have been incapacitated, your attempt to rescue the captured villager has failed. You should return to Aurilia and speak with Whip to continue.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 14, 'msg_phase_01_quest_fail_logout', 'Quest Failure: You have logged out and aborted your attempt to rescue the captured villager. You should return to Aurilia and speak with Whip to continue.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 15, 'msg_phase_02_quest_fail_incap', 'Quest Failure: You have been incapacitated. The crate of supplies you were carrying has been destroyed. You should return to Aurilia and speak with Whip to continue.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 16, 'msg_phase_01_quest_error_theater_fail', 'It looks like the Sith Shadows made a camp here, but have since packed up and left. You find a new set of tracks leading off into the distance...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_reflex.stf', 17, 'msg_phase_02_got_crate', 'Upon reaching the wreckage of a crashed transport, you pick up a crate of supplies from the debris. It appears to be the only cargo still in usable condition.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 1, 'fs_response01', 'Could you get me that hydro spanner over there?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 2, 'fs_response02', 'This phase relay conduit is shot. We''re going to need another.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 3, 'fs_response03', 'The power regulator is fluctuating on a resonance of 3.6 gigabuels. Can you see if you can lock that down?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 4, 'fs_response04', 'Hey! Do you see that? The meson generator is only .02 nanopulses off of nominal at over 4 gigabuels! We sure got a winner here.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 5, 'fs_response05', 'The buffer power shunt is jammed. Can you hand me the power mallet?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 6, 'fs_response06', 'Great! Every indicator on the master control board just lit up. We''ve got an overload somewhere.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 7, 'fs_response07', 'Ow! Blast it! If I smack my thumb one more time Sivarra is going to think I''m addicted to pain killers.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 8, 'fs_response08', 'We''re going to need more insulation on the power core. I''m reading a class 3 leak.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 9, 'fs_response09', 'Watch how you bundle those phase relay filaments. We don''t have many left after you dropped that box over by Rohak''s place.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 10, 'fs_response10', 'We''ve got switchover at 2.2 gigabuels and holding. Get the phase readings and then we''ll shut down.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 11, 'fs_response11', 'Tune down the power emitter or you''re going to have a burnout.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 12, 'fs_response12', 'The meson dampener is in. We can start power up testing whenever you''re ready.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_shield_repair.stf', 13, 'default', ''),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 1, 'fs_response01', 'Oh... I feel like I''m going to...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 2, 'fs_response02', 'My stomach. It feels like it''s going to burst!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 3, 'fs_response03', 'Doc, why are we so sick? I didn''t even get shot!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 4, 'fs_response04', 'I feel... really... sick.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 5, 'fs_response05', 'They must have used bio-weapons. I''m sure of it! Doc, are you sure you can cure viral agents?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 6, 'fs_response06', 'Better... Better get a bucket I''m going to throw up.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_sick.stf', 7, 'fs_response07', 'I can''t believe they used chemical weapons on us. We''re all going to die!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 1, 'want_task', 'Hello!  Good tidings and all that.  There''s some work I need done, and I need someone to do it.  You look like the kind of person who could take on such a task.  Could you?  Would you?  Are you interested in helping with my work?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 2, 'yes_task', 'I''d be happy to help.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 3, 'no_task', 'Sorry, I''m not interested right now.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 4, 'how_much', 'Can you tell me where I stand on bringing you resources?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 5, 'sample_for_type_one', 'A very important part of the crafting process for the villages defenses requires a metal that is easily molded to our task.  Aluminum!  That''s what we need.  I need you to find me an area that contains a 70% deposit of aluminum.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 6, 'too_bad', 'I''m so sorry to hear that.  I was rather hoping you could get this done.  I''m not sure who else I can get to help me out.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 7, 'this_much', 'Let me see, ah yes, I have the records right here...'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 8, 'sample_for_type_two', 'Energy!  We need power to operate our tools and equipment.  Not to mention the generators as well.  Hm.  Yes.  I need you to bring me energy.  Any kind will do!  As long as you find a 70% or higher deposit.  '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 9, 'sample_for_type_three', 'Do you know what we need?  We need Iron!  Iron is the foundation.  The base.  What we need for all our hard work.  The defenses must have Iron!  Find me a deposit of Iron that is at least at the 70% mark.  That''s what I need.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 10, 'sample_for_type_four', 'We need steel.  We can''t get enough of it.  As soon as we get more we burn through it.  Steel.  70% deposits of steel are hard to find, but I know you can do it.  That''s what I need.  Steel.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 11, 'sample_for_type_five', 'All the plating and wiring we''re going to be doing is going to require copper, and lots of it.  Do you think you can find copper?  I know that you can.  A 70% deposit please.  That''s what will get us up and running.  Copper.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 12, 'sample_for_type_six', 'A very important part of the crafting process for the villages defenses requires a metal that is easily molded to our task.  Aluminum!  That''s what we need.  I need you to find me an area that contains a 70% deposit of aluminum.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 13, 'type_one_2', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Gemstone.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 14, 'type_one_3', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Energy.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 15, 'type_one_4', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Ore.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
