('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 59, 'type_four_1', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Steel.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 60, 'type_five_1', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Copper.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 61, 'type_six_1', 'Your next task is to find a 70% deposit of Aluminum.\n\nRemember to Sample when you find the spot, in order to check for special resources.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 62, 'sample_for_iron', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Iron.  It should have at least a 50% density.  Once you get there, take a sample and try to find some special resources. When you''ve done that, check your journal; it should tell you what to look for next.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 63, 'sample_for_aluminum', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Aluminum.  It should have at least a 50% density. Once you get there, take a sample and try to find some special resources. When you''ve done that, check your journal; it should tell you what to look for next.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 64, 'sample_for_ore', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Ore.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 65, 'sample_for_gemstone', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Gemstone.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 66, 'sample_for_copper', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Copper.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 67, 'sample_for_steel', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Steel.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 68, 'sample_for_energy', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Wind or Solar Energy.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 69, 'sample_for_gas', 'I need you to find an area where we can survey Gas.  It should have at least a 50% density.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 70, 'wrong_phase', 'There''s not really anything I need right now.  Perhaps you should talk to some of the other villagers and see if they need your help.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 71, 'thanks', 'I want to thank you for all your help.  I see you got your new survey tool.  You can use it just like any other survey tool, only it has a modified chip that will allow you to scan for any type of inorganic resource.  It will find energy, gas, ore, chemicals, you name it.  You may want to speak with Noldan who can train you in any of the new skills you''re interested in learning about. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 72, 'explain', 'What is it you want me to do?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 73, 'explanation', 'We need resources.  Resources that will allow us to better the defenses of our village here.  I don''t need you to actually bring me the resources, I have a team for that.  I just need you to find me the best places to set up our harvesting.  I need your surveying skills, and your ability to survive outside this village.  It''s dangerous out there, and some of the villagers just aren''t up to it.  The resources we need may not even be on Dathomir, they could be on any planet.  Can you help us? '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 74, 'sure', 'Yeah, I know how to survey.  Anything else I need to know?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 75, 'last_piece', 'There is one more thing.  If you''re going to work for me you''re not going to be able to help out any of the other villagers while you do it.  This is a commitment.  I need someone focused on finding me the best places to harvest resources.  I also need you to look for some special resources for me.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 76, 'special_question', 'Special Resources?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 77, 'special_answer', 'That''s right.  I''m modifying your survey tools so that when you find the spots with the resources I need you''ll also be able to detect and sample some special resources that we require.  Ostrine, Endrine, Wind Crystals, Rudic, and Ardanium II.  They''re specific metals and energy types that will aid us in creating our village defenses.  You can bring them back to me, or if you have friends who are crafters you let them use the resources to make better defenses for us.  Now, at this point, are you ready to help us?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 78, 'youre_busy', 'I''m sorry, but according to the rumor mill here in the village you already have something to do.  Come back and see me when you have more free time.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 79, 'special_answer_2', 'That''s right.  I''m modifying your survey tools so that when you find the spots with the resources I need you''ll also be able to detect and sample some special resources that we require.  Ostrine, Endrine, Wind Crystals, Rudic, and Ardanium II.  They''re specific metals and energy types that will aid us in creating our village defenses.  You can bring them back to me, but even better would be to give them to your friends who are crafters so they can use the resources to make better defenses for us.  Now, at this point, if you''re ready to help us, I will promise to teach you to use your force powers to survey.  What do you say?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 80, 'special_answer_3', 'That''s right.  I''m modifying your survey tools so that when you find the spots with the resources I need you''ll also be able to detect and sample some special resources that we require.  Ostrine, Endrine, Wind Crystals, Rudic, and Ardanium II.  They''re specific metals and energy types that will aid us in creating our village defenses.  You can bring them back to me, or if you have friends who are crafters you let them use the resources to make better defenses for us.  If you''ll help us I can show you how to use your force powers to make yourself more, well, I guess lucky would be the proper term.  Can you help?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 81, 'no_skill', 'I''m sorry, but I''m looking for someone who is skilled in sampling for resources.  My intelligence reports tell me that you don''t have that particular skill.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_survey.stf', 82, 'gave_resource', 'I''ll make sure this is put to good use.  We''re keeping track of who brings us resources you know.  It''s better to give them to the crafters rather than giving them to me.  But I''ll make sure you get credit for this one.  As soon as I get some free time.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 1, 'fs_response01', 'We''re going to need a power sledge to break up this section of rock.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 2, 'fs_response02', 'Has anyone measured for the new gate yet?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 3, 'fs_response03', 'Where is that binary load lifter with the raw stone?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 4, 'fs_response04', 'The rock cutter is running out of juice. We''re going to need to shut it down to recharge soon.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 5, 'fs_response05', 'I don''t think we''re going to be able to repair this section. Might as well start tearing it down.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 6, 'fs_response06', 'Is there going to be room for the blaster turret there?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 7, 'fs_response07', 'I''m done with the keystone for the main arch. Where do you want it?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/fs_wall_repair.stf', 8, 'fs_response08', 'The new grating is taking longer than expected. We''re running short on metal.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 1, 'oldman_greeting', '%TT, I have an important matter to discuss with you\n'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 2, 'leave', 'The mysterious old man rushes off....'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 3, 'military_threaten', 'I sense the old man has awakened your curiosity, %TT.  I will have that crystal now!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 4, 'crystal_name', 'a Force Crystal'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 5, 'crystal_detail', 'a curious glowing crystal'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 6, 'crystal_journal', 'Display Journal'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 7, 'datapad_detail', 'This appears to contain important data'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 8, 'datapad_name', 'a mysterious Datapad'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 9, 'military_take_crystal', 'I shall return this crystal to its rightful owner.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 10, 'read_disk1', 'The disk contains information about the location of a camp where the soldiers were to report to after completing their assignment.   The disk self-destructs!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 11, 'read_disk2', 'The disk contains a location that is on Dathomir.   Along with the location are orders to investigate this planet, specifically, a village south east of the science outpost.   The disk self-destructs!'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 12, 'crystal_message', 'The Force crystal you have received can be used to open your quest journal.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 13, 'oldman1_sum', 'Talk to the old man.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 14, 'oldman1_detail', 'Talk with the old man and find out why he has sought you out.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 15, 'theater_sum', 'Investigate the location discovered in the datapad.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 16, 'goto_dath_sum', 'Investigate the location mentioned in the datapad on Dathomir.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 17, 'village_sum', 'Go to the Village (location discovered in the datapad).  The exact location is Dathomir: 5306 -4145. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 18, 'crystal_sum', 'Keep the Force crystal safe.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 19, 'dath_woman_sum', 'Speak with the woman on Dathomir.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 20, 'oldman2_sum', 'Talk to the old man again.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 21, 'oldman2_detail', 'Talk with the old man and see if he has anything new for you to do.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 22, 'military_sum', 'Sith Shadow ambush.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 23, 'dath_woman_find_sum', 'Search for someone that can give you more information.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 24, 'read_disk_error', 'You cannot make sense of the information on the disk.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 25, 'woman_greeting', 'Hello %TT.  I am so glad I found you. Do you have a moment?'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 26, 'woman_leave', 'The woman vanishes.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 27, 'waypoint_datapad_name', 'a Waypoint Datapad'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 28, 'theater_retry', 'Your waypoint has been updated.  There does not appear to be a camp here. '),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 29, 'datapad_failure', 'This appears to contain data for another planet.  Try using it on a different planet.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 30, 'datapad_1_sum', 'Defeat the 2 Sith Shadows that ambushed you and examine them for information on where they came from.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 31, 'loot_disk1', 'You must first loot that object before extracting any information out of it.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 32, 'force_sensitive', 'You feel a tingle in the Force.'),
('string/en/quest/force_sensitive/intro.stf', 33, 'datapad_2_sum', 'Defeat the Sith and examine them for more information on what they are up to.'),
