('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 1, 'test1', 'This is the first test string.'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 2, 'test_category', 'Jedi Padawan'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 3, 'sct_category', 'Swg Cui Test Category'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 4, 'sct1_summary', 'Swg Cui Test 1 Summary'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 5, 'sct2_summary', 'Swg Cui Test 2 Summary'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 6, 'sct3_summary', 'Swg Cui Test 3 Summary'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 7, 'sct4_summary', 'Swg Cui Test 4 Summary'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 8, 'sct1_detail', 'Swg Cui Test 1 Detail\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est \nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 9, 'sct2_detail', 'Swg Cui Test 2 Detail\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est \nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 10, 'sct3_detail', 'Swg Cui Test 3 Detail\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est \nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est'),
('string/en/quest/quest_journal/test1.stf', 11, 'sct4_detail', 'Swg Cui Test 4 Detail\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est\nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est \nIpso Lorem defacto Est Ipso Lorem defacto Est'),
('string/en/quest/sampling.stf', 1, 'sample_for', 'You''ve discovered %TU.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 1, 'opening', 'Gah!  You''re not trying to give me that god-awful jacket are you?!?  I won''t take it!'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 2, 'why', 'Why not?'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 3, 'evil', 'It stinks.  Plus, it''s too hot on this planet for a jacket.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 4, 'what', 'What should I do with it?'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 5, 'lunatic', 'Take it to that wookiee over there.  She likes the cut of it, and I hear she''s got a deed to a moisture vaporator she''s been trying to trade for one.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 6, 'goaway', 'Yep.  I''m pretty much done talking to you right now.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 7, 'no', 'Are you sure?'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 8, 'noquest', 'I don''t really have anything to say to you.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 9, 'onthisquest', 'Didn''t I tell you I didn''t want that thing already?'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 10, 'sorry', 'Yeah, Sorry, you''re right.  You did.'),
('string/en/quest2.stf', 11, 'getonwithit', 'Well.  Get on with whatever you''re going to do then, but don''t start bothering me again.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 1, 'greeting', 'Bah!  You waste my time.  The armor crafting techniques I have to offer are far beyond your comprehension.  Come back when you have mastered the armorsmith profession and maybe then you''ll have some chance to understand what I have to teach.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 2, 'quest_1_start', 'You believe you have learned all there is to know about being armorsmith.  You haven''t!  I know far more than you ever will, but still there are a few lessons I could teach you.  Learning these things will not be easy for someone such as you.  It will be expensive in both time and in credits.  Furthermore, I have no patience for insolent students.  You do as I say and don''t bother me with stupid questions!  So what to you say?  Give me %DI credits and we''ll get started.  Be quick about it!  I''m very busy.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 3, 'yes_to_quest_1_start', 'I am ready to begin.  Here are the credits.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 4, 'no_to_quest_1_start', 'Sorry, I''m not interested in your lessons.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 5, 'illegal_response', 'Bah! Trying to pull a fast one over me?  I''m far too intelligent to fall for such a dimwitted scheme.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 6, 'quest_1_start_no', 'Bah!  Then be off with the likes of you!  I have no time for armorsmith lackies!'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 7, 'quest_1_start_yes', 'I suspected you would agree to my terms.  Let''s get started.  I''m going to teach you how to construct my masterpiece invention: R.I.S armor.  This armor has no equal in battle.   Everything else is junk compared to this!  Of course, it is exceedingly difficult to create, especially for a fledgling armorsmith such as you.  But, no matter.  We''ll take it slow so you can comprehend.  Are you with me so far?'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 8, 'quest_1_description', 'As you know, creating armor starts with the armor segment.  That is where we shall start as well.  Like all armor segements, R.I.S. segment require resources which I''m sure you already know how to acquire.  They also, however, require some special components.  For strength, they require bone fragments from a Woolamander Harrower.  For flexibility, they require the hide of a Recluse Gurk King.  Use this schematic to create the armor segment and bring it back to me.  I don''t care how you get the materials, but you must construct the segment yourself.  You can only learn by doing it yourself!  Now go busy yourself with making the armor segment and come back to me when you are done.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 9, 'yes', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 10, 'quest_2_query', 'The student returns!  Show me what you have learned in crafting the %TO.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 11, 'yes_to_quest_2_query', 'I have it right here.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 12, 'no_to_quest_2_query', 'I haven''t yet been able to craft it.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 13, 'no', 'No.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 14, 'quest_2_complete', 'Let''s see how you did... Bah!  Look at these mounting tabs! They aren''t even on straight!  This flexor matrix has the plasticity of carbonite!  I was hoping for a better showing, my student, but I guess this will have to do.  Keep practicing.  If you can''t handle the fundamentals, everything else will suffer!  But no! I''m sure you don''t want to practice.  Just rush onto the next lesson, I bet.  I suppose that''s what you want to do?'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 15, 'quest_2_incomplete', 'Bah!  Then why are you here?  Don''t expect me to do everything it for you.  If you want to learn, but have to be willing to put in the effort!  Now get to work!'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 16, 'yes_to_quest_3_start', 'Yes, am I ready to continue.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 17, 'no_to_quest_3_start', 'No. I''d rather practice what I''ve already learned.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 18, 'quest_3_start', 'Next I will to teach you how to craft the R.I.S armor layer.  A remarkable component this is.  Not only does it add additional protection, it can actually reduce encumbrance if masterfully crafted!  Like all armor layers, it''ll work with any armor segment, making even those inferior armor types better.  Here''s the schematic.  You''ll need some feathers from the rare Peko Peko Albatross... a bit nasty of a critter.  Hop to it!'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 19, 'quest_3_start_no', 'Fine, fine.  Practice up.  Come back when you are ready for the next lesson.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 20, 'quest_4_query', 'You return again.  Okay, let''s see it.  Where''s the %TO you crafted?'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 21, 'yes_to_quest_4_query', 'Here it is.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 22, 'no_to_quest_4_query', 'I haven''t crafted it yet.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 23, 'quest_4_complete', 'Let''s see how you did this time... Bah! The lattice orientation of the absorption medium should be 65.3 degrees off of the axis of principal stress of the reinforcement matrix.  65.3 degrees!  How do you expect this to handle blaster fire any other way?  Still, it isn''t terrible for a first attempt.  Of course, I''d be embarrassed  to put my name on that thing, but that''s why I''m the teacher and you''re the student.  Are you ready for the next lesson?'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 24, 'quest_4_incomplete', 'Well then, go on and get that finished up.  I''m not going anywhere.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 25, 'yes_to_quest_5_start', 'Yes. I am ready to learn more.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 26, 'no_to_quest_5_start', 'No. I''m not ready for the next lesson.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 27, 'quest_5_start', 'You''ve finally managed to learned the basics.  Now I will teach you how to craft the armor, itself.  We''ll start with the boots.  If you can''t get the boots right,  I don''t care how good the rest of the armor is.  If your feet hurt, it just doesn''t matter!  Here''s the schematic for the boots.  In addition to the resources you''ll also need some scales from a Giant Dune Kimogila.  Better pack your desert gear and rocket launcher.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 28, 'quest_5_start_no', 'No ready, huh?  Very well, I''ll be here when you are.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 29, 'armorsmith_quest', 'Welcome back, my student!  There is nothing more I''m willing to teach you about R.I.S. armor crafting.  Practice, practice.  You''ll get it right one of these days.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 30, 'quest_6_query', 'Back again!  Most of my students have quit by this point.  Let''s see the %TO you crafted.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 31, 'quest_6_complete', 'A little small, don''t you think?  Who were you making these for? A Jawa?  Nevertheless, these do look marginally acceptable.  I think you are getting the hang of this.  Tell you what.  I think you''ve learned enough to do this on your own.  Here''s the rest of the schematics.  Don''t make me look bad and don''t forget to practice, practice.  And be sure to come back and visit sometimes.  It''s not every day that I have a student actually complete my lessons.  Now, I''ll be getting back to my work...'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 32, 'yes_to_quest_6_query', 'Here it is.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 33, 'no_to_quest_6_query', 'I haven''t managed to craft it yet.'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 34, 'quest_6_incomplete', 'Don''t let me down now!  Get crafting!'),
('string/en/quest_armorsmith.stf', 35, 'not_enough_money', 'Bah! You don''t even have enough money.  What kind of armorsmith are you?  Go get some work and come back when you can pay my fee.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 1, 'hero_of_tatooine_explosives_crate', 'A large traveling crate.  It looks like it has been here for a very long time, and seems as if it might fall apart at any moment.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 2, 'hero_of_tatooine_rock_crevice', 'There is a small crevice behind this rock.  It looks like there might be enough room to cram a small object in there.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 3, 'hero_of_tatooine_explosives', 'This device contains a large explosive charge that is attached to a smaller timing unit.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 4, 'contract_crate', 'This small crate is used to hold and transport items for a crafting job order. When the crate has been filled with the specified number of items, return to the person that gave you the job order for your payment.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 5, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_intellect', 'The bearer of this mark has proven outstanding intellect when presented with a complex problem.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 6, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_honor', 'The bearer of this mark has proven outstanding honor when faced with difficult decisions.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 7, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_courage', 'The bearer of this mark has proven outstanding courage in the face of imminent danger.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 8, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_altruism', 'The bearer of this mark has proven outstanding altruism against overwhelming odds.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 9, 'fs_craft_puzzle_analyzer', 'This device is capable of analyzing the construction techniques and core materials of an item. The resulting output is a detailed description of the resources needed and the steps required to craft that item. The object being analyzed is destroyed in this process.\n\nBe aware that this device can be used only with the items for which it was designed.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 10, 'fs_craft_puzzle_calibrator', 'This device is used to calibrate the various settings of components that are to be used in precision equipment.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 11, 'fs_craft_puzzle_config_processor', 'This component takes real-time configuration data from a user input terminal and applies it immediately to the equipment into which it is installed. This eliminates the need for slower manual configuration.\n\nThis is a component of a sensor array.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 12, 'fs_craft_puzzle_decryption_chip', 'This component is necessary to decode potentially sensitive data. The chip takes encrypted data and converts it to a usable format.\n\nThis is a component of a sensor array.\n\n'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 13, 'fs_craft_puzzle_gyro_receiver', 'This component includes a broad spectrum receiver unit that is able to be angled to any direction for the most accurate and efficient data reception possible. \n\nThis is a component of a sensor array.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 14, 'fs_craft_puzzle_signal_amp', 'This component boosts the signal of both outgoing and incoming transmissions. Outgoing data is boosted to assist in long range transmission, and incoming data is analyzed for lost information and amplified for usability.\n\nThis is a component of a sensor array.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 15, 'fs_craft_puzzle_solid_state_array', 'This is the main component of any array oriented tramsmission equipment. Solid state transmitters are arranged and alligned for a broad range of communication capabilites.\n\nThis is a component of a sensor array.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 16, 'fs_reflex_supply_crate', 'This is a supply crate that was salvaged from a wrecked transport.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 17, 'fs_crafting4_downed_satellite', 'This satellite fell from the sky and has long since been abandoned by whoever originally owned it. The satellite is quite damaged and beyond repair, but it is possible that some parts may still be worth salvaging.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 18, 'fs_crafting4_computer_core', 'A computer core salvaged from a damaged satellite.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 19, 'crowd_pleaser_dance_reward', 'This document contains the necessary information needed to learn the theatrical style dance.\n\nDue to the difficult nature of this performance, only experienced dancers will find it possible to learn this style of dance.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 20, 'crowd_pleaser_music_reward', 'This document contains the necessary information needed to learn the western style of music.\n\nDue to the difficult nature of this performance, only experienced musicians will find it possible to learn this style of music.'),
('string/en/quest_item_d.stf', 21, 'fs_craft_puzzle_terminal', 'This terminal displays the overal status of the sensor array, as well as providing information about and access to the various components installed in the array.'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 1, 'hero_of_tatooine_explosives_crate', 'an old crate'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 2, 'hero_of_tatooine_rock_crevice', 'a rocky crevice'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 3, 'hero_of_tatooine_explosives', 'a pack of explosives'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 4, 'contract_crate', 'Crafter''s Job Crate'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 5, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_intellect', 'Mark of Intellect'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 6, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_honor', 'Mark of Honor'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 7, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_courage', 'Mark of Courage'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 8, 'hero_of_tatooine_mark_altruism', 'Mark of Altruism'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 9, 'fs_craft_puzzle_analyzer', 'Recursive Analyzer'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 10, 'fs_craft_puzzle_calibrator', 'Multi-phase Calibrator'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 11, 'fs_craft_puzzle_config_processor', 'Configuration Processor'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 12, 'fs_craft_puzzle_decryption_chip', 'Decryption Chip'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 13, 'fs_craft_puzzle_gyro_receiver', 'Gyroscopic Receiver'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 14, 'fs_craft_puzzle_signal_amp', 'Signal Amplifier'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 15, 'fs_craft_puzzle_solid_state_array', 'Solid State Array'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 16, 'fs_reflex_supply_crate', 'Crate of Supplies'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 17, 'fs_crafting4_downed_satellite', 'A Fallen Satellite'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 18, 'fs_crafting4_computer_core', 'A Salvaged Computer Core'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 19, 'crowd_pleaser_music_reward', 'Sheet Music: Western Style'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 20, 'crowd_pleaser_dance_reward', 'Dance Steps: Theatrical Style'),
('string/en/quest_item_n.stf', 21, 'fs_craft_puzzle_terminal', 'Sensor Array Access Terminal'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 1, 'listen', 'Listen'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 2, 'watch', 'Watch'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 3, 'listen_stop', 'Stop Listening'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 4, 'watch_stop', 'Stop Watching'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 5, 'play_instrument', 'Play Instrument'),
('string/en/radial_performance.stf', 6, 'stop_playing', 'Stop Playing'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 1, 'quest', 'Ah, good, a player!  Can you help me with something I''m having a problem with?'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 2, 'yes', 'Certainly!'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 3, 'no', 'As if....'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 4, 'what', 'Um...what appears to be the problem?'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 5, 'good', 'Excellent.  I need you to take this jacket to my good friend the Mon Cal over there.   She has on a white long-sleeve shirt, and she needs her jacket!'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 6, 'bad', 'Well, then get out of my sight!  I''ll find a *REAL* player to help me.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 7, 'explain', 'My friend the Mon Cal lost her Jacket.  I need a player to take it to her so she doesn''t get cold.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 8, 'ok', 'Sure I''ll take it to her.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 9, 'nah', 'Nah.  Sounds dull.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 10, 'excellent', 'Excellent!'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 11, 'sent', 'Have you finished the task I asked you to do?'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 12, 'notyet', 'Um...not yet.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 13, 'go', 'Well get to it then!'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 14, 'newtalk', 'What appears to be the problem?'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 15, 'wont', 'Your friend doesn''t want this.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 16, 'doesnt', 'Well, what did she suggest you do with it?'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 17, 'hermit', 'She said give it to the wookiee.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 18, 'keep', 'She said I could keep it.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 19, 'herm2', 'Well, if the wookiee wants it I don''t mind if you give it to her.'),
('string/en/radial_quest.stf', 20, 'keep2', 'Do what you like with it then.  I have no further need for it.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 1, 'townperson_1', 'Oh, I haven''t paid my taxes...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 2, 'townperson_2', 'It looks like it''s going to be a warm one today.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 3, 'townperson_3', 'What day is it?'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 4, 'townperson_4', 'Nothing interesting ever happens around here.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 5, 'townperson_5', 'I can''t find my chrono.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 6, 'townperson_6', 'What is that smell?...oh.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 7, 'townperson_7', 'I''m not clear on what I should be doing now.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 8, 'townperson_8', 'Lousy stormtroopers...(mumbles)...didn''t do it!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 9, 'townperson_9', 'I hear the alliance is looking for more pilots.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 10, 'townperson_10', 'What a lovely view.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 11, 'townperson_11', 'I''ve never been so tired.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 12, 'townperson_12', 'I need a new book to read.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 13, 'townperson_13', 'I need to use the fresher.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 14, 'townperson_14', 'I feel old.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 15, 'townperson_15', 'I think I might be getting sick.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 16, 'townperson_16', 'My advice is, never gamble with a Hutt.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 17, 'townperson_17', 'Well, this planet''s not so bad.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 18, 'townperson_18', 'I''ve been considering moving to a new city.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 19, 'townperson_19', 'I have too much to do today.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 20, 'townperson_20', 'Have you ever seen the inside of an imperial prison?  Me neither.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 21, 'townperson_21', 'I''d rather be eaten by Rancor''s then pay that guy off.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 22, 'townperson_22', 'My skin is peeling...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 23, 'townperson_23', 'Just need enough credits for one more drink...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 24, 'townperson_24', 'Oh yes, she''s a lovely girl.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 25, 'townperson_25', 'I wonder if I''m supposed to be somewhere...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 26, 'pirate_1', 'I once rode through the Jundland wastes on a bantha with no name.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 27, 'pirate_2', 'I hope our ship is repaired soon...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 28, 'pirate_3', 'I''ve killed men for less than that.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 29, 'pirate_4', 'It''s not robbery if they give you their money freely is it?  Har har!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 30, 'pirate_5', 'Arrr....I think I stubbed my toe.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 31, 'pirate_6', 'It''s like there''s war going on, up there where the stars are.  You know, like a space battle.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 32, 'pirate_7', 'Never steal from an Imperial supply ship.  They say Vader personally hunts down any pirate that does.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 33, 'pirate_8', 'The Hutt''s always pay on time, I''ll give them that.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 34, 'pirate_9', 'Corellian ships are the easiest to board...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 35, 'pirate_10', 'Could I be any better looking?'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 36, 'pirate_11', 'I think that guy''s wearing my chrono...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 37, 'pirate_12', 'I hear Calrissean run''s a high stakes poker game somewhere near Bespin.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 38, 'pirate_13', 'I used to work for Nym.  Nasty one, he is.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 39, 'pirate_14', 'They say Bith are the best musicians, but I think Max Rebo''s my favorite.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 40, 'pirate_15', 'It''s amazing how many people I know with a severed limb...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 41, 'pirate_16', 'Robbed a casino myself once.  Never again, never again...'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 42, 'pirate_17', 'Imperial prisons are by far the cleanest.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 43, 'pirate_18', 'I did some time on Dathomir myself.  You don''t believe me?!?'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 44, 'pirate_19', 'Have I shown you my scars?  Well, you wouldn''t want to see them anyway.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 45, 'pirate_20', 'No one makes good eye-patches anymore.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 46, 'pirate_21', 'Captain says I''m the best first mate he''s ever had.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 47, 'pirate_22', 'Is that Twi''lek cooking I smell?'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 48, 'pirate_23', 'I have cards and dice.  We could do some gambling.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 49, 'pirate_24', 'I''ve seen men killed for saying trite like that.'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 50, 'pirate_25', 'Never let them see you bleed!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 51, 'terrified_1', 'Help us!!!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 52, 'terrified_2', 'Save us from this monster!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 53, 'terrified_3', 'Oh dear, won''t somebody save us?!?'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 54, 'terrified_4', 'Help us!  We''re being attacked!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 55, 'terrified_5', 'Save us from this horrible creature!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 56, 'terrified_6', 'I haven''t made out my will!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 57, 'terrified_7', 'I''ve always loved you!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 58, 'terrified_8', 'We''re about to die!!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 59, 'terrified_9', 'Help!  Help!   We''re going to be eaten!'),
('string/en/random_dialog.stf', 60, 'terrified_10', 'It''s going to kill us!! Help!!!'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 1, 'gotowork', 'I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I understand you''re already working for someone else.  Come back when you''re done with that job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 3, 'not_it', 'No, sorry, that''s not the item I was looking for...'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 4, 'npc_1_1', 'My partner needs to get back here fast.  We''re going to be late for a meeting and I''m all alone.  Can you go get my partner?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Excellent.  We''ll pay you when you get back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 6, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, if you can''t help me I hope I can find someone who can.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 7, 'npc_reward_1', 'Here you go.  It needs some ink, but you''ll never have one better.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 8, 'player_1_1', 'Sure I''ll find your friend.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 9, 'player_2_1', 'Nah, I don''t feel like it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 10, 'npc_1_2', 'My partner was at an auction selling some assets for capital.  I need somone to find and bring my partner back.  can you help?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 11, 'npc_2_2', 'Great.  I''ll make sure the message gets through that you''re coming.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 12, 'npc_3_2', 'That''s too bad.  I''ll find somebody useful.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 13, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here you go.  See I had good seats, and I didn''t let them tear it.  You should be able to get something for it if you want.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 14, 'player_1_2', 'No problem.  I was looking for something to do.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 15, 'player_2_2', 'Sorry, I''m a bit busy at the moment.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 16, 'npc_4_1', 'Merger.  There''s a lot of paperwork to sign and I''m not authorized to do it alone.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 17, 'npc_4_2', 'It''s an autographed trophy from some sports figure.  I don''t know who he is, but apparently it sold well.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 18, 'player_3_1', 'What kind of meeting is it?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 19, 'player_3_2', 'What were you selling?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 20, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Great, you''re here.  We don''t want to be late for this meeting so let''s get back quickly.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 21, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Oh good, you made it.  I got the money transferred to our bank, but I''m lost out here.  Should have hired a guide, huh?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 22, 'escortother', 'I don''t think I''m the person you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 23, 'dontknowyou', 'I don''t know who you are, but I''m not going with you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 24, 'npc_1_5', 'My partner needs to get his briefcase back!  He left for a meeting without it.  If you can take it to him I''ll have him give you some engraved pens from our company business.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 25, 'npc_2_5', 'Excellent.  He''ll pay you when you make the delivery.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 26, 'npc_3_5', 'Well, if you can''t help me I hope I can find someone who can.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 27, 'npc_reward_5', 'Here you go.  It needs some ink, but you''ll never have one better.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 28, 'player_1_5', 'Sure I''ll drop it off.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 29, 'player_2_5', 'Nah, I don''t feel like it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 30, 'npc_1_6', 'My partner was on his way to an auction to sell off some of our assets.  We need the money to keep our business afloat, but he forgot one of the items we were selling.  Can you take it to him?  He''s right outside of town.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 31, 'npc_2_6', 'Great.  I''ll make sure he gets the message that you''re coming.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 32, 'npc_3_6', 'That''s too bad.  I''ll find somebody useful.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 33, 'npc_reward_6', 'Here you go.  See I had good seats, and I didn''t let them tear it.  You should be able to get something for it if you want.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 34, 'player_1_6', 'No problem.  I was looking for something to do.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 35, 'player_2_6', 'Sorry, I''m a bit busy at the moment.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 36, 'npc_4_5', 'All the paperwork that needs to be signed at the meeting.  It''s vitally important that it get there.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 37, 'npc_4_6', 'It''s an autographed trophy from some sports figure.  I don''t know who he is, but I want to get it to him so he can sell it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 38, 'player_3_5', 'What was in the briefcase?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 39, 'player_3_6', 'What is the item exactly?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 40, 'npc_1_3', 'I had a lot of important paperwork in my briefcase, and now it''s gone!  Some thief came by and grabbed it out of my hands.  If you can get it I''ll give you this engraved writing stylus I got when I got my promotion.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 41, 'npc_2_3', 'Thank you...I''ll be waiting anxiously for your return.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 42, 'npc_3_3', 'Surely somebody will be able to help me.  Thanks for nothing, though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 43, 'npc_reward_3', 'Here you go.  It needs some ink, but you''ll never have one better.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 44, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll be back before you know it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 45, 'player_2_3', 'There''s no way.  I''m too tired right now.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 46, 'npc_1_4', 'I had an autographed ball from my favorite player in the league, and somebody took it!  If you can get it back for me I''ll give you this collector''s item ticket from last year''s championships.  It''s worth plenty.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 47, 'npc_2_4', 'Great!  Hurry back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 48, 'npc_3_4', 'That''s too bad.  I''ll find somebody useful.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 49, 'npc_reward_4', 'Here you go.  See I had good seats, and I didn''t let them tear it.  You should be able to get something for it if you want.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 50, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll be right back with your ball kid.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 51, 'player_2_4', 'Nah.  I don''t care about sports.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'It was mostly my personal accounting, but there are some sensitive documents in there that I can''t discuss.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 53, 'npc_4_4', 'Don''t you follow sports at all?  If you did you''d know what I was talking about.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 54, 'player_3_3', 'What kind of documents did you have?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 55, 'player_3_4', 'What league are you talking about?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 56, 'npc_breech_1', 'Did my partner send you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 57, 'npc_breech_2', 'I didn''t want to travel alone with all the cash we made.  Glad you''re here.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 58, 'npc_breech_3', 'This is my briefcase!  You can''t have it!'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 59, 'npc_breech_4', 'You''re not getting this back!  I''m selling it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_5', 'Do you have my briefcase?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 61, 'npc_breech_6', 'Do you have that sports award I''m supposed to sell?'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 62, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'Great!  I don''t know what I''d have done without this briefcase.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_6', 'Thank goodness.  This thing might be valuable.  I appreciate the delivery.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 64, 'return', 'To finish this mission, return to the Businessman who gave you the job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 65, 'player_reset', 'I don''t think I can do this right now.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 66, 'player_sorry', 'Oh, I''ll get back to work right away.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 67, 'npc_reset', 'Ok, well come see me again if you have some time.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 68, 'npc_backtowork', 'Ok.  Well keep me posted, I guess.  Or just get it done...'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 69, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Let me find out where exactly he is, come back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 70, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Let me find out where exactly he is, come back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 71, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me find out where exactly he is, come back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 72, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Luckily, I keep a tracer in my briefcase. Come back in a few minutes and I''ll let you know where the thief is.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 73, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Let me see if I can find out where exactly he is, come back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/random_quest/businessman.stf', 74, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Luckily, I keep a tracer in my briefcase. Come back in a few minutes and I''ll let you know where the thief is.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 1, 'gotowork', 'I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I understand you''re already working for someone else.  Come back when you''re done with that job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 3, 'npc_1_1', 'A friend of mine got mugged by black sun pirates and is too scared to come back to town.  I need someone to go make sure they can find their way back here.  Can you do it?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 4, 'player_1_1', 'Ok, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 5, 'player_2_1', 'Sounds dangerous.  I don''t think I''m up to it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good.  Get back as soon as you can and I''ll get you a shisa.  You can use it in your home as a decoration, or sell it, I don''t care either way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Too bad.  I would have given you a nice gift.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 8, 'npc_reward_1', 'Here''s that shisa I promised ya.  I''ll just put it here in your pack.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 9, 'npc_1_2', 'My partner has all our cash, but got lost in the wilderness.  I need someone to escort them back here to me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 10, 'npc_2_2', 'Good.  As soon as you return I''ll give you something nice.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 11, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, guess I''ll have to find somebody else then.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 12, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here''s the decryptor.  It doesn''t work all the time, but I''m sure you''ll find a use for it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 13, 'player_1_2', 'Yeah, I can do that, no problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 14, 'player_2_2', 'That''s too much work.  I''m not doing it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 15, 'npc_1_3', 'Are you available to help me out with something?  I got somebody new coming in and I need you to bring them straight to me.  Can you do that?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 16, 'npc_2_3', 'You do the work, you get paid.  I''ll be here.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 17, 'npc_3_3', 'Not much I can do about it I guess, if you''re not good enough.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 18, 'npc_reward_3', 'Here they are.  Careful, they have sharp edges.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 19, 'player_1_3', 'Yeah, I can do it.  '),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 20, 'player_2_3', 'Too much work for me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 21, 'npc_1_4', 'My partner was trying to avoid some imperial patrols and managed to get lost outside of town.  Can you go out there and make sure there''s no trouble getting back to me?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 22, 'npc_2_4', 'Great.  I''ve got just the thing for you.  Let me know when you''re back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 23, 'npc_3_4', 'Well, you''ll never be a criminal in this town.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 24, 'player_1_4', 'I can do it.  No problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 25, 'player_2_4', 'Thieves should do their own dirty work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 26, 'npc_reward_4', 'Here you go.  I took this speaker from a cantina I robbed.  It''ll go nicely in your house.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 27, 'npc_4_1', 'No, I think they''ve given up.  There might be some still around, but this should be pretty simple.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 28, 'npc_4_2', 'I don''t think you need to know that just now.  Just bring my friend here.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 29, 'npc_4_3', 'Brand new.  I haven''t even met them.  I don''t even know if it''s a male or a female!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 30, 'npc_4_4', 'No, they''ve given up.  Any imperials you see out there will just be a coincidence.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 31, 'player_3_1', 'Are there still Black Sun Pirates out there?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 32, 'player_3_2', 'How much cash was there?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 33, 'player_3_3', 'How new is this person?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 34, 'player_3_4', 'Are the imperials still snooping around?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 35, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Finally.  I was about to give up and try finding my way in on my own.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 36, 'npc_takeme_2', 'You''re here to take me back?  Don''t worry about the money.  I hid it.  It''s not on me anymore.  Just get me to my friend.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 37, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Great!  I need you to take me to my new boss.  I don''t even know who it is yet.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 38, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Quick, let''s get back before the imperials start looking around for me again.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 39, 'otherescort', 'I think you''re here to take someone else back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 40, 'dontknowyou', 'I''m not sure who you are, but I''m not following you back to town.  No way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 41, 'npc_1_5', 'A friend asked me to get him a Black Sun Medallion to break into their loot stash.  I don''t want to be involved any more than I have to, so can you drop it off?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 42, 'player_1_5', 'Ok, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 43, 'player_2_5', 'Sounds dangerous.  I don''t think I''m up to it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 44, 'npc_2_5', 'Good.  Get back as soon as you can and I''ll get you a shisa.  You can use it in your home as a decoration, or sell it, I don''t care either way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 45, 'npc_3_5', 'Too bad.  I would have given you a nice gift.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 46, 'npc_reward_5', 'Here''s that shisa I promised ya.  I''ll just put it here in your pack.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 47, 'not_it', 'No, sorry, that''s not the item I was looking for...'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 48, 'npc_1_6', 'Some friends need this camera to film a cantina they want to rob.  They''re going to study up on the security.  I''d drop it off, but I have to go do some things.  Can you do it for me?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 49, 'npc_2_6', 'Good.  As soon as you return I''ll give you a decryptor.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 50, 'npc_3_6', 'Well, guess I''ll have to find somebody else then.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 51, 'npc_reward_6', 'Here''s the decryptor.  It doesn''t work all the time, but I''m sure you''ll find a use for it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 52, 'player_1_6', 'Yeah, I can do that, no problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 53, 'player_2_6', 'That''s too much work.  I''m not doing it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 54, 'npc_1_7', 'I found this medallion on a body out near that city with the funny buildings?  You know the one.  Anyway, my, uh...cousin, yeah, cousin, collects these.  Wanna drop it off for me?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 55, 'npc_2_7', 'You do the work, you get paid.  I''ll be here.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 56, 'npc_3_7', 'Not much I can do about it I guess, if you''re not good enough.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 57, 'npc_reward_7', 'Here they are.  Careful, they have sharp edges.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 58, 'player_1_7', 'Yeah, I can do it.  '),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 59, 'player_2_7', 'Too much work for me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 60, 'npc_1_8', 'This electronic key I have, and I''m not saying where it came from, or who it''s going to, but can you take it somewhere and give it to somebody?  I mean without asking too many questions?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 61, 'npc_2_8', 'Great.  I''ve got just the thing for you.  Let me know when you''re back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 62, 'npc_3_8', 'Well, you''ll never be a criminal in this town.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 63, 'player_1_8', 'I can do it.  No problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 64, 'player_2_8', 'Thieves should do their own dirty work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 65, 'npc_reward_8', 'Here you go.  I took this speaker from a cantina I robbed.  It''ll go nicely in your house.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 66, 'npc_4_5', 'They have too many members to know each other, so anyone with a medallion can get into their areas.  Anybody that had one could pass themselves off as a member of their group.  See?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 67, 'npc_4_6', 'Probably just the inside, the front entrance, the guards.  You know.  Pretty typical stuff.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 68, 'npc_4_7', 'Who knows.  I think maybe my cousin''s a little...you know...loony.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 69, 'npc_4_8', 'That sounds suspiciously like a question.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 70, 'player_3_5', 'How will this medallion help?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 71, 'player_3_6', 'What are they going to film?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 72, 'player_3_7', 'Why does your, um, cousin, collect these things?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 73, 'player_3_8', 'What''s this key for?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 74, 'npc_1_9', 'You ever hear of the Black Sun Pirates?  They robbed me and I want to pay them back.  Unfortunately, I need to get one of their medallions to get inside their base.  Can you help me get one?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 75, 'player_1_9', 'Ok, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 76, 'player_2_9', 'Sounds dangerous.  I don''t think I''m up to it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 77, 'npc_2_9', 'Good.  Get back as soon as you can and I''ll get you a shisa.  You can use it in your home as a decoration, or sell it, I don''t care either way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 78, 'npc_3_9', 'Too bad.  I would have given you a nice gift.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 79, 'npc_reward_9', 'Here''s that shisa I promised ya.  I''ll just put it here in your pack.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 80, 'npc_1_10', 'I made a terrible mistake and got busted on camera stealing some credits from a merchant.  The trial''s coming up soon and I need someone to get that camera.  I can tell you where it''s at if you''ll get it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 81, 'npc_2_10', 'Good.  As soon as you return I''ll give you the decryptor.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 82, 'npc_3_10', 'Well, guess I''ll have to find somebody else then.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_10', 'Here''s the decryptor.  It doesn''t work all the time, but I''m sure you''ll find a use for it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 84, 'player_1_10', 'Yeah, I can get that, no problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 85, 'player_2_10', 'That''s too much work.  I''m not doing it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 86, 'npc_1_11', 'I''ve been collecting memorabilia of the Dark Jedi.  I know a guy who has a Medallion that they used.  Get it for me and I''ll give you these broken holocron pieces.  I''ve got tons of holocrons.  They''re bound to be worth something.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 87, 'npc_2_11', 'You do the work, you get paid.  I''ll be here.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 88, 'npc_3_11', 'Not much I can do about it I guess, if you''re not good enough.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 89, 'npc_reward_11', 'Here they are.  Careful, they have sharp edges.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 90, 'player_1_11', 'Yeah, I can do it.  '),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 91, 'player_2_11', 'Too much work for me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 92, 'npc_1_12', 'I need an electronic key to break into this warehouse I''ve been casing, but one of my rivals has it.  Get it for me and I''ll give you some of the loot I got on my last job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 93, 'npc_2_12', 'Great.  I''ve got just the thing for you.  Let me know when you''re back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 94, 'npc_3_12', 'Well, you''ll never be a criminal in this town.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 95, 'player_1_12', 'I can do it.  No problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 96, 'player_2_12', 'Thieves should do their own dirty work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 97, 'npc_reward_12', 'Here you go.  I took this speaker from a cantina I robbed.  It''ll go nicely in your house.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 98, 'npc_4_9', 'They have too many members to know each other, so anyone with a medallion can get into their areas.  If I had one I could pass myself off as a member of the group.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 99, 'npc_4_10', 'I paid off some guys and found out it''s being delivered to a highly secure area today.  You can get it on route before the guy gets there.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 100, 'npc_4_11', 'You could try to put ''em back together.  Or find someone else who collects them and sell them maybe?  I don''t know, but I know they''re worth something.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 101, 'npc_4_12', 'He stole it before I could get to it.  He''ll rob the warehouse instead of me if you don''t get it for me.  I need that key!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 102, 'player_3_9', 'How is a medallion going to help you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 103, 'player_3_10', 'How do you know where the camera is?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 104, 'player_3_11', 'What can I do with broken pieces?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 105, 'player_3_12', 'How did your rival get the key?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'Excellent.  If this goes well I''ll make sure to mail you a little something extra.  Heh heh.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_6', 'That''s great.  Now we just need to find some film...'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 108, 'npc_smuggle_7', 'Oh, my, um, cousin, yeah.  That''s great work.  Thanks a lot.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 109, 'npc_smuggle_8', 'Oh, good, the key.  Yeah, we need that.  I''m not saying why.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 110, 'npc_breech_1', 'Stupid Black Sun.  I hate those guys.  Can you get me back to town?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 111, 'npc_breech_2', 'Well, I''m lost.  Here to help?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 112, 'npc_breech_3', 'You here to take me to see the boss?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 113, 'npc_breech_4', 'You''re not an imperial are you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 114, 'npc_breech_5', 'You looking for me?  Got the medallion?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 115, 'npc_breech_6', 'Hey, is that the camera?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 116, 'npc_breech_7', 'Hey, did my, um, cousin send you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 117, 'npc_breech_8', 'Are you the guy?  With the thing?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 118, 'npc_breech_9', 'Black Sun will destroy you for this!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 119, 'npc_breech_10', 'Hey, this camera''s protected evidence!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 120, 'npc_breech_11', 'What are you doing?  You can''t have my memorabilia!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 121, 'npc_breech_12', 'Who are you?  You can''t have this key!'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 122, 'return', 'Head back to your contact to finish this job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 123, 'player_sorry', 'Oh, yeah, I forgot what I was doing...'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 124, 'npc_backtowork', 'Get this done, all right?  I don''t have time to wait on you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 125, 'player_reset', 'I''m getting out of this now, while I can.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 126, 'npc_reset', 'Let me know if you need anymore work, ok?'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 127, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 128, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 129, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 130, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 131, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 132, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Let me find out where they are. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 133, 'npc_noloc_7', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 134, 'npc_noloc_8', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 135, 'npc_noloc_9', 'Let me find out where it is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 136, 'npc_noloc_10', 'Let me find out where it is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 137, 'npc_noloc_11', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/criminal.stf', 138, 'npc_noloc_12', 'Let me find out where it is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 1, 'gotowork', 'I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I understand you''re already working for someone else.  Come back when you''re done with that job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 3, 'not_it', 'No, sorry, that''s not the item I was looking for...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 4, 'npc_1_1', 'My family has had this heirloom glass for many years, and now it''s been stolen.  I can tell you where the thief is, but I need you to bring back my glass unharmed.  Can you do it?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'You''re a life saver.  I''ll give you this hand woven basket for the glass when you return.  My servants made it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 6, 'npc_3_1', 'I thought you were a mercenary?  Perhaps you''re just a librarian or some such...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 7, 'player_1_1', 'Yeah, I can get it.  I''ll need some form of payment though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 8, 'player_2_1', 'Sounds ridiculous.  Why don''t you just go buy a new glass?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 9, 'npc_reward_1', 'Careful with this thing.  It''s well put together, but if you crush it it won''t be worth as much.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 10, 'npc_1_2', 'I was collecting signatures to get my name on the local ballot when one of my opponents sent a theif to steal my ledger.  If you can get that ledger back for me I''ll write a proclamation declaring you a good citizen.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 11, 'npc_2_2', 'Excellent.  Just let me know when you return, I''ll have the paperwork drawn up.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 12, 'npc_3_2', 'That''s too bad.  I could have done you a lot of favors.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 13, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I''ll get your ledger back.  I need friends in high places.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 14, 'player_2_2', 'No way.   I couldn''t care less about politics.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here''s your official proclamation.  It won''t be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 16, 'npc_1_3', 'A gang of ruffians stole part of the hyperdrive out of my ship.  Get it back for me and I''ll give you something nice.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 17, 'npc_2_3', 'Ok.  Just let me know when you''ve got it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 18, 'npc_3_3', 'I thought you were a tough one.  I guess not.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 19, 'player_1_3', 'Sure, I''ll help you out.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 20, 'player_2_3', 'I thought pilots did their own work.  I''ll be going.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 21, 'npc_reward_3', 'Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 22, 'player_1_4', 'Sounds crazy but I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 23, 'player_2_4', 'Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 24, 'npc_1_4', 'My servants won''t get me the dishes I want.  There''s  a guy who has a bowl that''s the exact one I want.  I don''t care how you do it, just get me that bowl.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 25, 'npc_2_4', 'I thought you looked like the one I wanted.  I''ll reward you nicely for it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 26, 'npc_3_4', 'Just like my servants.  No help at all.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 27, 'npc_reward_4', 'Here''s a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It''s valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 28, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, it''s not much to look at, but I guess because it was in the safe they assumed it was valuable.  It is, but only to me really, they won''t get much for it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 29, 'npc_4_2', 'Actually I don''t remember.  That''s another reason I need that ledger back.  It might have been mayor...or chief of police...hm...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 30, 'npc_4_3', 'Ship parts are expensive.  They''re probably trying to build their own ship, or they''re going to sell it on the black market.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 31, 'npc_4_4', 'A nobleman gets other people to do these things for him.  People like you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 32, 'player_3_1', 'Somebody stole an heirloom glass?  Why?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 33, 'player_3_2', 'What office are you running for?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 34, 'player_3_3', 'Why would they steal parts of your ship?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 35, 'player_3_4', 'Why don''t you just buy your own dishes?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 36, 'npc_1_9', 'My cousin left this camera at my house during a recent visit.  He''s on his way home, but if you could take this to him before he gets there I''ll make sure you get something nice in return.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 37, 'npc_2_9', 'Excellent.  I have some old fireworks that we were saving for my Lifeday, but I''ll let you have them instead.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 38, 'npc_3_9', 'Oh, well, if you don''t need the work...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 39, 'player_1_9', 'Yeah, I can do that.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 40, 'player_2_9', 'Sounds dull.  I''ll wait for something more exciting to come along.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 41, 'npc_reward_9', 'I don''t know that this will actually explode, but boy if it does...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 42, 'npc_1_10', 'One of my neighbors has gone off to the reading of a will, but forgot to take their briefcase.  Can you take it out there before they arrive?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 43, 'npc_2_10', 'Oh good.  I didn''t want to have to do it myself.  I''ll see if I can find something nice for you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 44, 'npc_3_10', 'Well, fine.  I didn''t want to have to do all that walking myself.  These are new shoes...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 45, 'player_1_10', 'I can take it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 46, 'player_2_10', 'No way.  Not unless I''m in the will.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 47, 'npc_reward_10', 'Well, all I had was some fireworks...we were, uh...sort of celebrating...but it has nothing to do with the will, I promise!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 48, 'npc_1_11', 'A friend of mine and I were playing practical jokes on each other, and...well, suffice to say I have a hyperdrive part here...and uh...my friend sort of needs it...can you take it?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 49, 'npc_2_11', 'Great!  I think if I went I''d come back bruised, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 50, 'npc_3_11', 'Oh, I''m not looking forward to delivering this.  My friend''s gonna be mad....'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 51, 'player_1_11', 'Sure, I''ll help you out.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 52, 'player_2_11', 'This sounds dangerous...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 53, 'npc_reward_11', 'Thanks so much.  I''m giving you a picture my friend painted of me.  Isn''t that special?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 54, 'player_1_12', 'Sure.  It''s not a problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 55, 'player_2_12', 'This sounds like a lot of work for a smelly old bowl.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 56, 'npc_1_12', 'My cousin''s on the way to an auction, but forgot the bowl we were going to sell.  Can you take it out there and hand it off?  Please?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 57, 'npc_2_12', 'Perfect.  I have to get things ready here for the stuff that we''re buying to bring back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 58, 'npc_3_12', 'Fine.  I guess I''ll have to do it myself.  Or maybe someone else will come along...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 59, 'npc_reward_12', 'Here''s a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It''s valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 60, 'npc_4_9', 'It''s a family heirloom, this camera.  It doesn''t even work, but we keep it just the same.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 61, 'npc_4_10', 'All the important documentation''s in the briefcase.  There''s not going to be much of a will reading without it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 62, 'npc_4_11', 'Well, see, the practical jokes sort of escalated, and now my friend has to leave so...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 63, 'npc_4_12', 'It''s just a family thing.  Nobody wants the stupid bowl.  I''ll tell you a secret...it smells.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 64, 'player_3_9', 'What''s the deal with the camera?  Is it expensive?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 65, 'player_3_10', 'Why is the briefcase so important?  '),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 66, 'player_3_11', 'How did you end up with your friends hyperdrive parts?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 67, 'player_3_12', 'Why don''t you just buy your own dishes?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 68, 'npc_1_5', 'A good friend of mine has gotten lost outside of town and needs to find a way to get back to me.  Can you help?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 69, 'npc_2_5', 'Good.  I''ll let you in on a little secret...this person''s not exactly a friend, but don''t worry, you''ll get paid for your work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 70, 'npc_3_5', 'Oh.  Well, fine then.  Be that way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 71, 'player_1_5', 'Yeah, I can do it.  I''ll need some form of payment though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 72, 'player_2_5', 'Sounds ridiculous.  I''m outta here.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 73, 'npc_reward_5', 'Careful with this thing.  It''s well put together, but if you crush it it won''t be worth as much.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 74, 'npc_1_6', 'One of my relatives is trying to get to me so that we can go to a reception together, but has managed to get lost outside of town.  Can you help out?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 75, 'npc_2_6', 'Hurry please, I don''t want the party to start without us!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 76, 'npc_3_6', 'You have no idea how much damage I could do to your life.  But begone, and if you''re lucky I''ll forget you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 77, 'player_1_6', 'Sure, I''ll get your friend.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 78, 'player_2_6', 'No way.   I couldn''t care less about this.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 79, 'npc_reward_6', 'Here''s your official proclamation.  It won''t be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 80, 'npc_1_7', 'My friend got lost trying to find his way home.  I think there may have been some Corellian wine involved, you know?  Can you help my friend make it back to me here?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 81, 'npc_2_7', 'Good.  When you get back we''ll work out some payment arrangements.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 82, 'npc_3_7', 'I should have taken the advice of the jawas.  They told me not to trust people like you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 83, 'player_1_7', 'Sure, I''ll help you out.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 84, 'player_2_7', 'I thought rich people had servants to do their work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 85, 'npc_reward_7', 'Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 86, 'player_1_8', 'Sounds crazy but I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 87, 'player_2_8', 'Sounds ludicrous.  Count me out.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 88, 'npc_1_8', 'Sibling rivalry has led to a very severe game of hide and seek, unfortunately one of the players is still hiding and doesn''t realize the game is over.  I need someone to find them and bring them back here to me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 89, 'npc_2_8', 'Very nice of you, I must say.  I thought you looked a little, um...dangerous, but I can see you''re as trustworthy as the day is long.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 90, 'npc_3_8', 'Just like my servants.  No help at all.  Good day.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 91, 'npc_reward_8', 'Here''s a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It''s valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 92, 'npc_4_5', 'Well, this and that.  There''s not much to tell really.  You know.  '),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 93, 'npc_4_6', 'It''s my uncle''s fiftieth birthday, or my aunt''s fortieth birthday, or my grandparent''s wedding anniversary...or...no, I can''t remember.  '),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 94, 'npc_4_7', 'Only when we''re celebrating.  Which is pretty much every day I gues...'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 95, 'npc_4_8', 'Well, when you''re rich you can pretty much do what you want.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 96, 'player_3_5', 'What does this friend of yours do?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 97, 'player_3_6', 'What''s the reception for?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 98, 'player_3_7', 'Does this happen often?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 99, 'player_3_8', 'You guys just play hide and seek out in the desert?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 100, 'dontknowyou', 'I''m sorry but I don''t recognize you and I''m not going to follow you anywhere.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 101, 'otherescort', 'I think you''re here to pick up someone else.  You''re certainly not taking ME anywhere.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 102, 'escortother', 'I think you''re looking for someone else.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 103, 'npc_takeme_5', 'I hope you''re here to get me back to my friend.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 104, 'npc_takeme_6', 'Great!  Let''s go, I don''t want to miss that reception!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_7', 'Somebody told you I was drunk?  Liars.  I don''t drink.  Now let''s get back before I get thirsty.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 106, 'npc_takeme_8', 'Thank you.  I thought I was going to be stuck out here all day.  Let''s get going.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 107, 'npc_breech_1', 'Oh, you want this glass?  You can''t have it!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 108, 'npc_breech_2', 'You''re not getting these signatures!  I won''t let that fool get elected!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 109, 'npc_breech_3', 'You want to buy some hyperdrive parts...hey!  I''ll take care of you!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 110, 'npc_breech_4', 'No!  Not my bowl!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 111, 'npc_breech_5', 'Are you here to help me?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 112, 'npc_breech_6', 'Do you know where the reception is?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 113, 'npc_breech_7', 'I''m not drunk...just lost.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 114, 'npc_breech_8', 'As soon as I get back to town I''m disowning my family.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 115, 'npc_breech_9', 'Do you have my camera?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 116, 'npc_breech_10', 'Is that my briefcase?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 117, 'npc_breech_11', 'Good thing you came instead of my friend.  There would have been bloodshed.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 118, 'npc_breech_12', 'I take it you have the bowl?'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 119, 'npc_smuggle_9', 'Thanks a lot, friend.  This camera is very sentimental to me.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 120, 'npc_smuggle_10', 'Well, I got to get to the reading.  Take care!'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 121, 'npc_smuggle_11', 'I have to get off this planet.  See ya.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 122, 'npc_smuggle_12', 'I sure hope we get what we want out of this bowl.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 123, 'return', 'To finish this mission, return to the noble who gave you the task.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 124, 'npc_reset', 'Ok, Let me know if you can work for me later.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 125, 'npc_backtowork', 'Get to it.  I need this done as soon as you can do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 126, 'player_reset', 'I don''t think I can do this.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 127, 'player_sorry', 'I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 128, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 129, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 130, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me find out where it is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 131, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 132, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 133, 'npc_noloc_7', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 134, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 135, 'npc_noloc_8', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 136, 'npc_noloc_9', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 137, 'npc_noloc_10', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 138, 'npc_noloc_11', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/noble.stf', 139, 'npc_noloc_12', 'Let me find out where he is. Come back in a few minutes and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'I''ve been a museum curator for many years, and on this planet we found the oldest tomb I''ve ever seen.  Unfortunately some grave robbers took the artifact I was studying.  If you would be so kind, perhaps you can get it back?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 2, 'npc_2_1', 'You look like a good man.  I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 3, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, certainly there are other artifacts.  Too bad, this one was really good...'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 4, 'npc_4_1', 'It was an ancient ritual device of some sort.  I need to study it further to find out exactly what it was for.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 5, 'npc_1_2', 'I''ve been researching animals, but an industrial spy stole one of my cages.  It still had some cell structures in it from the creature.  I need it back before he figures out what''s in it.  Can you help me?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Thanks.  I really appreciate it. '),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 7, 'npc_3_2', 'I guess I''m wasting my time with you then.  Do you know anyone who DOES work?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 8, 'npc_4_2', 'That''s highly classified.  That''s why I need that evidence back before someone finds out what I was doing.  You don''t have a problem with this do you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 9, 'npc_1_3', 'There''s an assassin on this planet who''s been killing all the top scientists in the area.  I want him eliminated and I''m willing to pay well for it.  Can you do it?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 10, 'npc_2_3', 'I thought so.  You look like a good person. I''ll make it worth your while.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 11, 'npc_3_3', 'Well, there are other artifacts.  Too bad, this one was really good...'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 12, 'npc_4_3', 'No one knows.  He seems to have some sort of problem with the work that we do, but we don''t know why.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 13, 'npc_1_4', 'One of our assistants has gone mad and is planning on releasing a toxin into the air that would kill all the plantlife on this planet.  He must be stopped.  I can tell you where he is if you can stop him.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 14, 'npc_2_4', 'Thanks.  I really appreciate it.  I''ll find something to give you when you return.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 15, 'npc_3_4', 'Great.  I''m wasting my time with you then.  Do you know anyone who DOES work?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 16, 'npc_4_4', 'It''s a highly classified agent that we were using to destroy poisonous plants, but he''s modified it to kill all vegetable matter.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 17, 'npc_1_5', 'One of my colleagues has managed to get lost just outside of town.  It would be a great help to me if you could get my partner back to this location. Can you do that?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 18, 'npc_2_5', 'Thank you so much.  I''ll make contact so there aren''t any surprises.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 19, 'npc_3_5', 'That''s too bad.  Guess I''m on my own for now.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 20, 'npc_4_5', 'Something''s wrong with the datapad, and it can''t seem to be used to navigate anymore.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 21, 'npc_1_6', 'One of my fellow scientists has damaged navigational equipment and needs someone to bring them back to me here.  Can you help us out?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 22, 'npc_2_6', 'Excellent.  I''ll be waiting here, and when you''ve returned we''ll make sure you get something for your efforts.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 23, 'npc_3_6', 'Too bad.  If you know anyone who can help send them my way.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 24, 'npc_4_6', 'To be honest, scientists can be rather clumsy.  I''m not really going to say anything more than that though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 25, 'npc_reward_1', 'Here you go, these are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 26, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here you go.  I found this nice picture of the creature I was studying.  It''s really all I have to give you though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 27, 'npc_reward_3', 'Here you go, these bugs are very rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 28, 'npc_reward_4', 'Here you go.  I found this great picture of the creature I was studying.  It''s really all I have to give you though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 29, 'npc_reward_5', 'Here you go, these bugs are extremely rare, and could be worth a lot if you can find a buyer.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 30, 'npc_reward_6', 'Here you go.  I found this picture of the creature I was studying.  It''s really all I have to give you though.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 31, 'player_1_1', 'Yeah, I can get it.  I hate graverobbers.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 32, 'player_2_1', 'I don''t care about artifacts.  Forget it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 33, 'player_3_1', 'What was the artifact?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 34, 'player_1_2', 'I''ll get it back.  Industrial espionage is a terrible thing.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 35, 'player_2_2', 'I couldn''t care less about you and your problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 36, 'player_3_2', 'What kind of creatures were you studying?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 37, 'player_3_3', 'Why is he killing scientists?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 38, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll stop this guy before he gets started.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 39, 'player_2_4', 'Oh, my, I couldn''t care less about you and your problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 40, 'player_3_4', 'What is this toxin?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 41, 'player_1_5', 'Sure.  I''ll bring your friend back.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 42, 'player_2_5', 'No thanks.  I''ve got other things to do.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 43, 'player_3_5', 'Why don''t you upload your location to the datapad?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 44, 'player_1_6', 'Sure I''ll find your friend.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 45, 'player_2_6', 'Oh my, I couldn''t care less about you and your problem.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 46, 'player_3_6', 'How did the equipment break?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 47, 'npc_takeme_5', 'Oh, you''ve arrived.  Ok, you lead the way back and I''ll follow you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 48, 'npc_takeme_6', 'Ok, I''m ready to go.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 49, 'not_it', 'No, sorry, that''s not the item I was looking for...'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 50, 'gotowork', 'I need you to finish that task I gave you earlier.  Ok?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 51, 'cantwork', 'I understand you''re already working for someone else.  Come back when you''re done with that job.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 52, 'otherescort', 'I don''t think I''m the one you''re looking for.  Perhaps you should be escorting someone else?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t know who you are and I''m not going to follow you anywhere!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 54, 'player_1_3', 'Sure, I can do it.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 55, 'player_2_3', 'I don''t think I''m up to that.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 56, 'npc_breech_1', 'Did the "curator" send you?  Hah!  Die scum!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 57, 'npc_breech_2', 'My company will pay well for this!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 58, 'npc_breech_3', 'Do you work for the scientists?  Then you''ll die like they do!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 59, 'npc_breech_4', 'You can''t stop me!  I''ll kill everyone!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_5', 'Did my partner send you?'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 61, 'npc_breech_6', 'My navigator''s broken!  Help me!'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 62, 'return', 'The Scientist who gave you this job is eagerly awaiting your return.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 63, 'npc_reset', 'Ok, I''ll let you off the hook.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 64, 'npc_backtowork', 'Get to it then.  I need that job done.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 65, 'player_sorry', 'I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 66, 'player_reset', 'I need a break...'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 67, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Come back in a few minutes and I should have more information for you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 68, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Luckily I put a tracer in the cage. Come back in a few minutes and I should have some coordinates for you.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 69, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me see if I can find out exactly where he is. Come back in a while and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 70, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I''m waiting for his roomate to call me with his location, come back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 71, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Let me see if I can find out exactly where he is. Come back in a while and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/random_quest/scientist.stf', 72, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Let me see if I can find out exactly where he is. Come back in a while and I should have more info.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 1, 'rebel_1', 'Hello, would you like to join the Alliance?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 2, 'rebel_2', 'Absolutely.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 3, 'rebel_3', 'Not at the moment.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 4, 'rebel_4', 'Any questions I can answer for you?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 5, 'rebel_5', 'What does the Alliance do?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 6, 'rebel_6', 'What do you need me to do?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 7, 'rebel_7', 'Can I join Rogue Squadron?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 8, 'rebel_8', 'We fight against the oppressive regime of the Empire.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 9, 'rebel_9', 'Well, I could give you a mission...'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 10, 'rebel_10', 'Sure.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 11, 'rebel_11', 'No thanks.  Not just yet.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 12, 'rebel_12', 'You''ve answered all my questions, thanks.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 13, 'rebel_13', 'I don''t think you should hang around any longer.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 14, 'rebel_14', 'Return to me when you need something to do.'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 15, 'rebel_15', 'Well, Rogue Squadron''s already pretty filled up right now, but we do need some people to pass out leaflets...'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 16, 'rebel_16', 'Are you ready for a mission?'),
('string/en/rebel_e3_convo.stf', 17, 'rebel_17', 'I have no time for Imperial Scum!'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 1, 'hr_1', 'You look like the kind of person that could use some work.  That is, if you aren''t too worried about what the "law" might think about it.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 2, 'hr_2', 'Yeah, I could use some work like that.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 3, 'hr_3', 'I think you have the wrong guy.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 4, 'hr_4', 'I thought you had that look about you.  I work for Jabba the Hutt.  Is that going to be a problem?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 5, 'hr_5', 'Not for me.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 6, 'hr_6', 'Sorry, I can''t work for the Hutts.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 7, 'hr_7', 'Good.  What I want you to do is to find this stang who''s been asking too many questions about Bib Fortuna.  Bib wants him "eliminated" if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 8, 'hr_8', 'Consider it done.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 9, 'hr_9', 'Why does Bib care about this guy?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 10, 'hr_12', 'Ok, I''ll upload his last known to your datapad.  Return here when the deed is done and we''ll talk further about your usefulness.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 11, 'hr_10', 'Bib had some issues with his own people a while back, and he''s sort of been hiding out here on Tatooine.  Anytime someone starts asking questions he "deals with it" as quickly as possible.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 12, 'hr_11', 'Well, as long as you keep our little chat to yourself I''ll let you go then.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 13, 'hr_13', 'You did good work for us there.  Can we count on you to do some more?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 14, 'hr_14', 'You got it.  What''s next?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 15, 'hr_15', 'I''ll be back later.  '),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 16, 'hr_16', 'Bib was very impressed.  He says he may have a place for you at the palace, since they''ve had some...uh...openings...recently.  But we need you to do just a little more to prove yourself.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 17, 'hr_17', 'That''s fine, but don''t take forever.  I got lots of other things to do you know.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 18, 'hr_18', 'What''s my next job?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 19, 'hr_19', 'Really?  Bib was impressed?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 20, 'hr_20', 'Some thugs roughed up one of Jabba''s dancers the other day in town, and Bib wants to make an example of them.  Plus I think he''s trying to get the dancers to like him.  Anyway.  Just teach these guys a lesson.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 21, 'hr_21', 'Who''s crazy enough to do this?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 22, 'hr_22', 'I''ll get right on it.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 23, 'hr_23', 'Jabba''s chief rival is Lady Valarian.  It was some of her thugs trying to act big.  They picked the wrong week cause Jabba''s just been looking for an excuse.  And like I said, Bib loves to look good for the girls.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 25, 'hr_24', 'Good.  Bib''s counting on you to make him look good.   You pull this off and I''ll get you in to see him personally.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 27, 'hr_25', 'Congratulations.  That''s good work that you do.  You''re gonna do well on this planet, I can feel it.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 28, 'hr_26', 'Thanks.  I appreciate it.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 29, 'hr_27', 'Go see Bib upstairs.  He''ll let you in now that he sort of knows who you are.'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 30, 'hr_28', 'Well, as impressed as Bib gets, really.  That is, he didn''t act disappointed or execute anybody when he heard you had killed the target.  But anyway...'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 31, 'hr_29', 'You again?  Have you thought about that work I mentioned earlier?'),
('string/en/recruiting/hutt_recruit.stf', 32, 'seebib', 'Go up and see Bib Fortuna.  My tasks are for less experienced individuals.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 1, 'ir1', 'Good afternoon.  Are you interested in joining the Empire''s armies?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 2, 'ir2', 'Yes, I am.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 3, 'ir3', 'No.  I don''t think so.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 4, 'ir4', 'Are you ready to join right now?'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 5, 'ir5', 'Yes.  Yes I am.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 6, 'ir6', 'At your command, sir.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 7, 'ir7', 'And for what reason would you be joining the Empire?'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 8, 'ir8', 'To bring glory to the Emperor and to crush the Rebel scum!'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 9, 'ir9', 'Wealth, power, and the legitimate excuse to shoot whoever I want!'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 10, 'ir10', 'I don''t think you''re the kind of person we''re looking for.  Good day.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 11, 'ir11', 'Then I expect you to move on.  I have more important things to do than stand around and explain myself to every nerf-herder that tries to chat with me.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 12, 'ir12', 'Congratulations.  You''re now part of something larger.  The Empire!'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 13, 'ir13', 'Good day, and what can I do for you?'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 14, 'ir14', 'I don''t think I''m cut out for military life.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 15, 'ir15', 'Well, it''s not for everyone.  Ok, you''re a civilian again.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 16, 'ir16', 'I don''t think either of us wants any trouble...'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 17, 'ir17', 'Sorry.'),
('string/en/recruiting/imperial_recruit.stf', 18, 'ir18', 'Just go on about your business.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 1, 'rr1', 'The wind whistles in the willows...'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 2, 'rr2', 'But the sun doesn''t shine in the swamps.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 3, 'rr3', 'Uh...I don''t know what you''re talking about.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 4, 'rr4', 'Who gave you the password?'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 5, 'rr5', 'I was just guessing.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 6, 'rr6', 'I heard it from some of the rebel pilots.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 7, 'rr7', 'Are you interested in joining the Rebel Alliance?'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 8, 'rr8', 'Won''t that get me in trouble with the Empire?'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 9, 'rr9', 'I am.  I have no love for the Empire.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 10, 'rr10', 'Good.  I will take your information and inform my commanding officers.  From this point on, you''re officially part of the Rebellion.  Good luck soldier.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 11, 'rr11', 'Well, nevermind then.  I have more important things to do than stand around and explain myself to every nerf-herder that tries to chat with me.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 12, 'rr12', 'If all you''re concerned about is how much trouble you''re going to be in with the Empire then you''re definitely not the kind of person we''re looking for.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 13, 'rr13', 'Hello friend.  What can I do for you?'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 14, 'rr14', 'I''m tired of being shot at by Imperials!'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 15, 'rr15', 'Ok, we''ll let you out of the Alliance.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 16, 'rr16', 'Since I''m not bothering you, why don''t you not bother me?'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 17, 'rr17', 'All right then.'),
('string/en/recruiting/rebel_recruit.stf', 18, 'rr18', 'Thanks for nothing.'),
