('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 1, 'base', 'These items enhance your skills.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 2, 'melee_accuracy', 'This vapor improves your focus and enhances your melee combat accuracy for a short while.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 3, 'ranged_defense', 'The synthesized Muscle Stimulant (or SMS) enhances your ranged defenses for a short period of time.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 4, 'consume', 'You feel enhanced!'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 5, 'unarmed_speed', 'By increasing muscle flexibility you can increase the speed with which you make unarmed attacks.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 6, 'unarmed_accuracy', 'By increasing your focus this chemical makes your unarmed attacks more accurate.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 7, 'twohandmelee_speed', 'By increasing the tension in your muscles you can attack with heavy two-handed weapons faster than normal.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 8, 'twohandmelee_accuracy', 'By enlarging the ligaments of your muscles for a brief time you can hit more accurately with heavy two-handed weapons.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 9, 'rifle_speed', 'By increasing the metacarpal muscles reaction time you can increase the speed with which you can fire a rifle.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 10, 'rifle_accuracy', 'Your accuracy with the rifle is improved by this chemical by allowing your vision to focus at a longer range than normal.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 11, 'ranged_accuracy', 'The accuracy of your attacks with all ranged weapons is improved with this formula that enhances your long range vision for a short time.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 12, 'polearm_speed', 'By expanding different parts of the muscles in specific ways the speed with which you can wield a long weapon (pole-arm) is increased.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 13, 'polearm_accuracy', 'Your accuracy with a polearm is increased with the use of this shot, giving your biceps a temporary boost.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 14, 'pistol_speed', 'By increasing the muscle tension in your fingers you can increase the speed with which you fire a pistol.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 15, 'pistol_accuracy', 'By increasing your focused vision you can become more accurate with pistols using this formula.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 16, 'onehandmelee_speed', 'By increasing the flexibility of your tendons you become faster with one handed weapons.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 17, 'onehandmelee_accuracy', 'With the triceps stretched to above normal standards your accuracy improves with one handed weapons.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 18, 'melee_defense', 'By thickening the skin for a short period of time your defense against melee attacks is increased.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 19, 'mask_scent', 'This liquid contains specially designed pheremones that hide the smells normally produced by a living organism, allowing them to hide from creatures that use scent to track predators and prey.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 20, 'carbine_speed', 'By increasing the muscle mass of the wrist and forearm you can fire a carbine weapon with greater speed.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 21, 'carbine_accuracy', 'By aligning the muscle mass of the wrist and forearm you can fire a carbine weapon with greater accuracy.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 22, 'thrown_accuracy', 'By increasing the vision of your eyes and making it easier to track targets, this solution increases your accuracy with thrown weapons.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 23, 'thrown_speed', 'The Brachii muscles contract faster after an injection of this compound, allowing you to throw weapons faster.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 24, 'heavy_weapon_speed', 'Once the deltoids expand the speed with which you can fire heavy weapons increases.'),
('string/en/skill_buff_d.stf', 25, 'heavy_weapon_accuracy', 'By increasing the focus of your observation power, this supplement increases your accuracy with heavy weapons.'),
