('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 1, 'opt1_1', 'I''m interested in learning a skill.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 2, 'opt1_2', 'What skills will I be able to learn next?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 3, 'opt1_3', 'Skills you have that I do not...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 4, 'opt1_4', 'All of your skills...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 5, 'error_empty_category', 'Sorry, you aren''t quite up to the point where I can teach you anything else.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 6, 'msg1_1', 'Heya. What kind of skills would you like to know about?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 7, 'msg2_1', 'You may learn the following skills right now...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 8, 'msg2_2', 'Here are the skills I can teach you next, if you have gained enough experience...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 9, 'msg2_3', 'Skills that I possess that you do not?! Well, what skill are you interested in?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 10, 'msg2_4', 'All of my skills? Oh well, which one do you want to know about?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 11, 'msg3_1', 'There is nothing more I can teach you!'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 12, 'msg3_3', 'Let me give you some information about this skill...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 13, 'msg3_2', 'You''re an exceptionally bright student!  Perhaps we shall work together again soon.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 14, 'error_grant_skill', 'Hrmm... seems that I cant teach you that skill due to an internal error. TestTrac?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 15, 'back', 'Can we start again?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 16, 'topped_out', 'I''m sorry, but I cannot teach you anymore. You have already learned everything I have to teach.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 17, 'trainer_unarmed', 'Teras Kasi is a way of life.  It is a philosophy for living.  What more would you like to know?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 18, 'trainer_marksman', 'I teach marksmanship.  You won''t even need a targeting system after I''m through with you.  Ready to start?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 19, 'trainer_polearm', 'I teach polearm fighting.  Would you like to learn?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 20, 'trainer_brawler', 'Hullo!  I teach brawlin'' in these parts.  What can I helps you wif?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 21, 'trainer_pistol', 'Good morning, or evening, sir or madam, or blah blah blah.  I teach people how to shoot pistols!  I don''t have to be nice.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 22, 'trainer_carbine', 'Hello friend.  I teach basic use of the carbine.  I assume you''re here to learn?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 23, 'trainer_rifleman', 'Don''t stand so close.  I took up the rifle to keep away from people.  If you''re willing to study, I''ll teach you the same.  Can you handle it?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 24, 'trainer_2hsword', 'Sit down, shut up, and listen!  If you pay attention you''ll be fighting with a two-handed sword even better than me!  Well, not really, but at least you won''t look like a fool when you use it.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 25, 'trainer_1hsword', 'One handed sword style is the epitome of grace and elegance in combat.  Master these techniques I teach you...and nothing will stop you.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 26, 'trainer_entertainer', 'Show business is the only business I know!  Would you like to know about show business?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 27, 'trainer_scout', 'If it''s scouting you''d like to know about, I''m the one you''re looking for.  What can I help you with?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 28, 'trainer_medic', 'If you can stand the sight of blood I can teach you to put it back in the body.  Ready to learn?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 29, 'trainer_artisan', 'Building, crafting, creating.  It''s all in your hands.  How can I help move you along in this profession?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 30, 'trainer_dancer', 'I teach elegance, beauty, grace, and how to get dates in clubs.  Well, actually, you''re on your own with the last one, but I can teach you to dance.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 31, 'trainer_musician', 'Three hours a day!  That''s all it takes.  Take the time to learn the instruments.  Now, are you ready?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 32, 'trainer_doctor', 'Seven years of your life and you''ll be fully qualified.  I''m here to help you get started.  What shall we discuss first?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 33, 'trainer_creaturehandler', 'I''m in a foul mood.  My breakfast was stolen by a gnort, an eopie stepped on my foot, and my kaadu done run off.  What do YOU want?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 34, 'trainer_ranger', 'I can track a bird on a cloudy day.  If you want to even approach my skills you better pay attention.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 35, 'trainer_bioengineer', 'Dustin crops ain''t like flying through hyperspace, boy.  It''s a lot more work.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 36, 'trainer_miner', 'I spent most of my life mining.  Now, I teach other people how to do it.  Well, I try to anyway.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 37, 'trainer_armorsmith', 'There''s nothing more comforting than a solid piece of armor strapped to your back.  Wanna learn how to make some?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 38, 'trainer_weaponsmith', 'There''s nothing more comforting than a solid weapon strapped to your side.  Wanna learn how to make some?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 39, 'trainer_chef', 'Mynock souffle.  Grilled bantha.  Broiled rancor toes.  All of these and more, I will teach you to cook.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 40, 'trainer_tailor', 'The most fabulous clothes in all the world, and for you, I''m willing to show you how it''s done.  Prepare to look fabulous!'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 41, 'trainer_architect', 'I built the biggest houses with the best layouts on every planet from here to Dathomir.  And now my knowledge is yours.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 42, 'trainer_droidengineer', 'There''s nothing like a busted R2 unit to remind you what''s important in life.  C''mon, tell me what you need to know.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 43, 'trainer_industrialist', 'Speed, efficiency, maintenence and management.  These are the buzzwords of a true industrialist.  '),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 44, 'trainer_bountyhunter', 'There''s scum on every planet in every system of the galaxy.  And you can earn big money by showing the authorities where they hide.  Sound good to you?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 45, 'trainer_commando', 'Heavy weapons, grenades, support.  Learn it, live it, love it.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 46, 'trainer_smuggler', 'I''m not really supposed to be showing anyone how to do this, but you''ll keep it to yourself right?  You''d never do anything illegal, I''m sure.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 47, 'trainer_combatmedic', 'Sometimes, when you''re out in the field, your buddy loses his arm.  I''ll show you how to stick it right back on...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 48, 'trainer_imagedesigner', 'Don''t let them laugh at you.  They always give the image designers funny looks, but when they want their hair done, who else are they going to call?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 49, 'trainer_squadleader', 'Fall in soldier!  Are you ready to learn?  I can''t hear you!'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 50, 'success', 'You have successfully learned the skill.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 51, 'yes', 'Yes'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 52, 'no', 'No'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 53, 'confirm', 'Are you sure you wish to purchase this skill?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 54, 'prose_nsf', 'You lack the %DI credits required for training in %TO.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 55, 'prose_pay', 'Processing %DI credit payment for %TO training.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 56, 'prose_skill_learned', 'You successfully train in the %TO skill.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 57, 'trainer_merchant', 'Time is money, friend.  I''ll gladly instruct you in the ways of the Merchant, but you''ll have to pay your dues up front.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 58, 'no_skill_pts', 'How can I teach you when you do not have any available skill points.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 59, 'nsf_skill_pts', 'You must first make %DI skill points available before I can teach you %TO.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 60, 'prose_train_failed', 'You were unable to complete %TO skill training.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 61, 'surpass_trainer', 'WOW! You have learned everything I have to teach... I suppose that now it''s time for you to find your own path. Farewell %TT.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 62, 'no_qualify', 'You do not  qualify for any of my teachings. Come back and speak with me later if you acquire the following skills...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 63, 'no_qualify_prompt', 'You must have, at least, the following skills to learn from this skill trainer.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 64, 'no_qualify_title', 'Trainer Skill Requirements'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 65, 'trainer_unknown', 'Well then... Speak up... What might you be interested in learning about?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 66, 'prose_cost', 'It will cost %DI credits to train in %TO. Would you like to continue?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 67, 'msg_no', 'Too rich for ya? Well, maybe I can help you with something else?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 68, 'msg_yes', 'Excellent! Let''s get started then...'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 69, 'skill_terminal_prompt', 'Choose a new skill to learn:'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 70, 'skill_terminal_title', 'Skill Terminal'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 71, 'skill_terminal_disabled', 'Terminal Disabled.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 72, 'skill_terminal_denied', 'Access Denied.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 73, 'skill_terminal_max_skills', 'You have learned all the skills this terminal can teach.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 74, 'skill_terminal_grant', 'You have learned %TO.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 75, 'trainer_politician', 'Interested in running for public office?  You''ll need my instruction to make your policies succeed!'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 76, 'trainer_fs', 'The secrets of the Force will reveal themselves to those who seek them.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 77, 'trainer_shipwright', 'Greetings. Are you interested in becoming an accomplished Shipwright?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 78, 'trainer_starfighter_engineer', 'I can teach you how to build superior starship components. Are you interested?'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 79, 'too_complicated', 'I can''t teach you anything. Everything I know is entirely too complicated for you.'),
('string/en/skill_teacher.stf', 80, 'requires_jtl', 'You must enable the Star Wars Galaxies: Jump to Lightspeed expansion in order to converse with this npc.'),
