('string/en/skl_d.stf', 316, 'crafting_chef_drink_02', 'Drink skills cover the creation of a large range of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks.  The drink skills introduce four types of alcohol stock that can be mixed with other recipes to enhance their power.'),
