('string/en/skl_d.stf', 945, 'pilot_rebel_navy_weapons_04', 'Heavy Alliance Starship Ordnance'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 946, 'profession_architect', 'The Architect is an invaluable member of industry and commerce.  Without one there would be no factories or shops!  An Architect can design homes for players, mining facilities for resource harvesting, and many other kinds of structures.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 947, 'profession_armorer', 'The Armorer specializes in creating durable yet lightweight armor that is capable of defending its wearer from a blaster bolt or two.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 948, 'profession_armorsmith', 'The Armorsmith specializes in creating durable yet lightweight armor that is capable of defending its wearer from a blaster bolt or two.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 949, 'profession_chef', 'Do you have a taste for adventure?  Or just adventurous taste?  Become a professional Chef and create foods to delight and satisfy patrons across the galaxy!  Good food is invaluable to those who frequently engage in combat.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 950, 'profession_combatengineer', 'The Combat Engineer''s ability to repair weapons, equipment, and even vehicles makes them a welcome addition to any fighting unit.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 951, 'profession_commando', 'The Commando is a well-rounded warrior whose breadth of knowledge in the ways of combat is unmatched.  A player in this profession is dangerous both at range and up close.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 952, 'profession_creaturehandler', 'Famous for their ability to control beasts of all types, Creature Handlers are also moderately capable in combat.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 953, 'profession_droidengineer', 'Do you have a knack for tinkering with high tech equipment?  Think you can improve on the R2 series?  If so, the Droid Engineering profession may be for you.  Droid Engineers can design all aspects of droid hardware from motivators to manipulators.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 954, 'profession_explorer', 'The explorer has one of the most rewarding professions in the Galaxy. Forever venturing in unknown territories, she lives with the satisfaction that she is likely the first to see each valley she enters or mountain that she climbs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 955, 'profession_farmer', 'A farmer can grow his or her own plants and animals in order to provide the foods necessary for keeping adventurers well fed and ready for combat.  An advanced farmer can develop their own strains of crops and even produce new breeds of creatures!'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 956, 'profession_gunsmith', 'The Gunsmith can design ranged weapons of all types as well as their components.  A true friend to any blaster jockey, an accomplished Gunsmith can even design custom one-of-a-kind weapons!'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 957, 'profession_imagedesigner', 'Tired of the same old look?  Need to work on your image?  No problem!  A professional image designer is the key to your bad hair day.  Players in this profession can style hair, change tattoos, design clothing and more!'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 958, 'profession_marksman', 'The Marksman is a master of ranged weaponry, concentrating in blaster technology. '),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 959, 'profession_merchant', 'Merchants specialize in the art of the deal, managing vast quantities of money and inventory in pursuit of building a commercial empire of their own.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 960, 'profession_miner', 'Miners are hardworking people who frequently grow rich off of lucky strikes and rare discoveries.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 961, 'profession_rancher', 'A farmer can grow his or her own plants and animals in order to provide the foods necessary for keeping adventurers well fed and ready for combat.  An advanced farmer can develop their own strains of crops and even produce new breeds of creatures!'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 962, 'profession_ranger', 'The Ranger is a unique combination of the explorer and the creature handler.  A player in this profession can head out on their own in search of adventure, or lead a group of players through the wilderness.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 963, 'profession_smuggler', 'Smugglers are those who rebel against the protectionist and unreasonable laws in restraint of free trade, in order to better lubricate the wheels of progress--and line their own pockets.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 964, 'profession_teraskasi', 'This profession combines skills from the melee combat and melee tactics disciplines. A player in this profession is extremely dangerous in melee combat. Teras Kasi, or "steel hands," is a Bunduki martial arts discipline focusing on weaponless combat.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 965, 'profession_weaponsmith', 'Although seemingly low-tech at first glance, a player who master the melee weaponsmith profession can design the hi-tech and very deadly "vibro" melee weapons.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 966, 'rifle_concealment_chance', 'This skill  mod allows a rifleman to succesfully attack a mobile and only pull that mobile if succesful.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 967, 'science', 'Scientific advancement has led to many startling discoveries in the field of medicine.  The pursuit of knowledge is known to be quite rewarding, by those who seek it.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 968, 'science_combatmedic', 'Combat Medics are invaluable to any fighting unit. Not only can they heal injured combatants in the field, they can hold their own in a firefight.  They continue to gain improved crafting skills, and bonuses to healing large amounts of damage.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 969, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_01', 'Intermediate Precision teaches the Combat Medic improved accuracy for ranged damage healing.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 970, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_02', 'Advanced Precision teaches the Combat Medic improved accuracy for ranged damage healing.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 971, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_03', 'Expert Precision teaches the Combat Medic improved accuracy for ranged damage healing.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 972, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_04', 'Master Precision teaches the Combat Medic improved accuracy for ranged damage healing.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 973, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_speed_01', 'Intermediate Healing Speed improves the Combat Medic''s speed at healing targets at a range.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 974, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_speed_02', 'Advanced Healing Speed improves the Combat Medic''s speed at healing targets at a range.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 975, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_speed_03', 'Expert Healing Speed improves the Combat Medic''s speed at healing targets at a range.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 976, 'science_combatmedic_healing_range_speed_04', 'Master Healing Speed improves the Combat Medic''s speed at healing targets at a range.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 977, 'science_combatmedic_master', 'The Master Combat Medic can heal even the most injured characters from several meters away. They are one of the most invaluable combat support professions.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 978, 'science_combatmedic_medicine_01', 'Intermediate Bacta Crafting conveys the knowledge to craft improved ranged healing medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 979, 'science_combatmedic_medicine_02', 'Advanced Bacta Crafting conveys the knowledge to craft improved ranged healing medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 980, 'science_combatmedic_medicine_03', 'Expert Bacta Crafting conveys the knowledge to craft improved ranged healing medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 981, 'science_combatmedic_medicine_04', 'Master Bacta Crafting conveys the knowledge to craft improved ranged healing medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 982, 'science_combatmedic_novice', 'Combat Medics are invaluable to any fighting unit. Not only can they heal injured combatants in the field, they can hold their own in a firefight.  They continue to gain improved crafting skills, and bonuses to healing large amounts of damage.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 983, 'science_combatmedic_support_01', 'Intermediate Combat Medic Support aids the Combat Medic at getting to their injured comrade faster.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 984, 'science_combatmedic_support_02', 'Advanced Combat Medic Support aids the Combat Medic at getting to their injured comrade faster.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 985, 'science_combatmedic_support_03', 'Expert Combat Medic Support aids the Combat Medic at getting to their injured comrade faster.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 986, 'science_combatmedic_support_04', 'Master Combat Medic Support aids the Combat Medic at getting to their injured comrade faster.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 987, 'science_doctor', 'When your wounds are too serious to be healed on the field, a Doctor''s attention is what you need.  With the proper equipment, resources, and setting, a Doctor can heal all manner of physical wounds and damage.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 988, 'science_doctor_ability_01', 'Intermediate Healing Ability improves the Doctor''s overall healing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 989, 'science_doctor_ability_02', 'Advanced Healing Ability improves the Doctor''s overall healing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 990, 'science_doctor_ability_03', 'Expert Healing Ability improves the Doctor''s overall healing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 991, 'science_doctor_ability_04', 'Master Healing Ability improves the Doctor''s overall healing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 992, 'science_doctor_master', 'The Master Doctor can heal nearly any health or action wound if given the proper equipment and environment. They can also craft highly effective medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 993, 'science_doctor_novice', 'When your wounds are too serious to be healed on the field, a Doctor''s attention is what you need.  With the proper equipment, resources, and setting, a doctor can heal all manner of physical wounds and damage.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 994, 'science_doctor_support_01', 'Intermediate Medicine Crafting allows the Doctor to craft superior medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 995, 'science_doctor_support_02', 'Advanced Medicine Assembly allows the Doctor to craft superior medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 996, 'science_doctor_support_03', 'Expert Medicine Assembly allows the Doctor to craft superior medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 997, 'science_doctor_support_04', 'Master Medicine Assembly allows the Doctor to craft superior medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 998, 'science_doctor_wound_01', 'Intermediate Wound Treatment teaches the Doctor how to heal significant wounds when in a hospital.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 999, 'science_doctor_wound_02', 'Advanced Wound Treatment teaches the Doctor how to heal significant wounds when in a hospital.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1000, 'science_doctor_wound_03', 'Expert Wound Treatment teaches the Doctor how to heal significant wounds when in a hospital.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1001, 'science_doctor_wound_04', 'Master Wound Treatment teaches the Doctor how to heal significant wounds when in a hospital.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1002, 'science_doctor_wound_speed_01', 'Intermediate Wound Treatment Speed enhances the speed at which a Doctor can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1003, 'science_doctor_wound_speed_02', 'Advanced Wound Treatment Speed enhances the speed at which a Doctor can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1004, 'science_doctor_wound_speed_03', 'Expert Wound Treatment Speed enhances the speed at which a Doctor can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1005, 'science_doctor_wound_speed_04', 'Master Wound Treatment Speed enhances the speed at which a Doctor can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1006, 'science_medic', 'The Medic is a critical component of any squad and is vital to a group engaged in combat. Medics can heal combat injuries, allowing others to continue the fight. Medics can evolve into Doctors, or combine their medical skills with the skills of a Marksman to become a Combat Medic better-suited to service on the front-lines of larger battles. If you enjoy helping others and want to be a necessary part of any group, choose the Medic.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1007, 'science_medic_ability_01', 'The Pharmacology skill set improves the Medic''s knowledge of medicine and medicinal applications.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1008, 'science_medic_ability_02', 'The Pharmacology skill set improves the Medic''s knowledge of medicine and medicinal applications.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1009, 'science_medic_ability_03', 'The Pharmacology skill set improves the Medic''s knowledge of medicine and medicinal applications.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1010, 'science_medic_ability_04', 'The Pharmacology skill set improves the Medic''s knowledge of medicine and medicinal applications.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1011, 'science_medic_crafting_01', 'The Organic Chemistry skill set provides the Medic with knowledge of new types of medicinal crafting.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1012, 'science_medic_crafting_02', 'The Organic Chemistry skill set provides the Medic with knowledge of new types of medicinal crafting.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1013, 'science_medic_crafting_03', 'The Organic Chemistry skill set provides the Medic with knowledge of new types of medicinal crafting.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1014, 'science_medic_crafting_04', 'The Organic Chemistry skill set provides the Medic with knowledge of new types of medicinal crafting.  A master of Organic Chemistry has the knowledge of chemistry and biology necessary to persue a profession as a Bio-Engineer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1015, 'science_medic_injury_01', 'The First Aid skill set provides the Medic with new commands for healing wounds and also increases the number of injuries a medic can heal at one time.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1016, 'science_medic_injury_02', 'The First Aid skill set provides the Medic with new commands for healing wounds and also increases the number of injuries a medic can heal at one time.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1017, 'science_medic_injury_03', 'The First Aid skill set provides the Medic with new commands for healing wounds and also increases the number of injuries a medic can heal at one time.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1018, 'science_medic_injury_04', 'The First Aid skill set provides the Medic with new commands for healing wounds and also increases the number of injuries a medic can heal at one time.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1019, 'science_medic_injury_speed_01', 'The Diagnostics skill set improves the Medic''s ability to analyze injuries rapidly.  This has the effect of increasing the rate at which the Medic can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1020, 'science_medic_injury_speed_02', 'The Diagnostics skill set improves the Medic''s ability to analyze injuries rapidly.  This has the effect of increasing the rate at which the Medic can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1021, 'science_medic_injury_speed_03', 'The Diagnostics skill set improves the Medic''s ability to analyze injuries rapidly.  This has the effect of increasing the rate at which the Medic can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1022, 'science_medic_injury_speed_04', 'The Diagnostics skill set improves the Medic''s ability to analyze injuries rapidly.  This has the effect of increasing the rate at which the Medic can heal wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1023, 'science_medic_master', 'The Master Medic completes his or her education in crafting and applying medicines in the field.  From here, the Master Medic is one of the requirement to explore several elite and hybrid professions like Combat Medic and Doctor.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1024, 'science_medic_novice', 'A Novice Medic can heal light wounds and apply medical treatment in the field.  Additionally, the Novice Medic is granted a modest amount of crafting ability to create their field medicines.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1025, 'skill_system_root', 'Skill System Root'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1026, 'social_dancer', 'The Dancer uses their skill to heal the minds of those who watch them perform.  The beginning dancer, though not extremely skilled, can be nearly as entertaining to watch as the Master Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1027, 'social_dancer_ability_01', 'Dancing Ability I improves the Dancer''s ability to perform certain dances, conveying improved healing abilities. A Dancer can use /startdance to see a list of their available dances.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1028, 'social_dancer_ability_02', 'Dancing Ability II improves the Dancer''s ability to perform certain dances, conveying improved healing abilities. A Dancer can use /startdance to see a list of their available dances.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1029, 'social_dancer_ability_03', 'Dancing Ability III improves the Dancer''s ability to perform certain dances, conveying improved healing abilities. A Dancer can use /startdance to see a list of their available dances.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1030, 'social_dancer_ability_04', 'Dancing Ability IV improves the Dancer''s ability to perform certain dances, conveying improved healing abilities. A Dancer can use /startdance to see a list of their available dances.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1031, 'social_dancer_knowledge_01', 'Dancing Knowledge I grants the Dancer a wider variety of dances a flourishes they can perform.  A Dancer can use /startdance to see the list of dances they have available.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1032, 'social_dancer_knowledge_02', 'Dancing Knowledge II grants the Dancer a wider variety of dances a flourishes they can perform.  A Dancer can use /startdance to see the list of dances they have available.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1033, 'social_dancer_knowledge_03', 'Dancing Knowledge III grants the Dancer a wider variety of dances a flourishes they can perform.  A Dancer can use /startdance to see the list of dances they have available.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1034, 'social_dancer_knowledge_04', 'Dancing Knowledge IV grants the Dancer a wider variety of dances a flourishes they can perform.  A Dancer can use /startdance to see the list of dances they have available.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1035, 'social_dancer_master', 'The Master Dancer knows all dances and dancing abilities, and has all the tools to put on a professional dance production.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1036, 'social_dancer_novice', 'The Dancer uses their skill to heal the minds of those who watch them perform.  The beginning Dancer, though not extremely skilled, can be nearly as entertaining to watch as the Master Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1037, 'social_dancer_shock_01', 'Dancer''s Fatigue Healing I improves the effectiveness of the Dancer to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1038, 'social_dancer_shock_02', 'Dancer''s Fatigue Healing II improves the effectiveness of the Dancer to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1039, 'social_dancer_shock_03', 'Dancer''s Fatigue Healing III improves the effectiveness of the Dancer to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1040, 'social_dancer_shock_04', 'Dancer''s Fatigue Healing IV improves the effectiveness of the Dancer to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1041, 'social_dancer_wound_01', 'Dancer''s Wound Healing I improves the Dancer''s ability to heal wounds with their dancing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1042, 'social_dancer_wound_02', 'Dancer''s Wound Healing II improves the Dancer''s ability to heal wounds with their dancing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1043, 'social_dancer_wound_03', 'Dancer''s Wound Healing III improves the Dancer''s ability to heal wounds with their dancing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1044, 'social_dancer_wound_04', 'Dancer''s Wound Healing IV improves the Dancer''s ability to heal wounds with their dancing ability.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1045, 'social_entertainer', 'The Entertainer is a valuable component of the Star Wars Galaxies social landscape. Entertainers interact with virtually all other players, by providing necessary healing services and using skills to change the appearance of other characters. Entertainers can specialize as Dancers, Musicians, or Image Designers. If you want to meet a lot of other people online and become a integral part of the social scene, the Entertainer profession is your calling.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1046, 'social_entertainer_dance_01', 'Dancing I continues to grant the basic knowledge needed to become a professional Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1047, 'social_entertainer_dance_02', 'Dancing II continues to grant the basic knowledge needed to become a professional Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1048, 'social_entertainer_dance_03', 'Dancing III continues to grant the basic knowledge needed to become a professional Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1049, 'social_entertainer_dance_04', 'Dancing IV continues to grant the basic knowledge needed to become a professional Dancer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1050, 'social_entertainer_hairstyle_01', 'Image Design I allows the Entertainer to customize customize facial hair and trim.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1051, 'social_entertainer_hairstyle_02', 'Image Design II allows the Entertainer to further customize hair styles and change eye color.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1052, 'social_entertainer_hairstyle_03', 'Image Design III allows the Entertainer to further customize hair styles and change horn colorings.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1053, 'social_entertainer_hairstyle_04', 'Image Design IV allows the Entertainer to further customize hair styles and and minor facial features.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1054, 'social_entertainer_healing_01', 'Entertainer Healing I allows the Entertainer to use their dancing or music ability with greater efficiency.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1055, 'social_entertainer_healing_02', 'Entertainer Healing II allows the Entertainer to use their dancing or music ability with greater efficiency.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1056, 'social_entertainer_healing_03', 'Entertainer Healing III allows the Entertainer to use their dancing or music ability with greater efficiency.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1057, 'social_entertainer_healing_04', 'Entertainer Healing IV allows the Entertainer to use their dancing or music ability with greater efficiency.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1058, 'social_entertainer_master', 'The Master Entertainer has a strong knowledge of all forms of entertainment and can specialize in one or more advanced entertainment professions.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1059, 'social_entertainer_music_01', 'Musicianship I continues to grant the basic knowledge needed if one wishes to pursue the Musician profession.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1060, 'social_entertainer_music_02', 'Musicianship II continues to grant the basic knowledge needed if one wishes to pursue the Musician profession.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1061, 'social_entertainer_music_03', 'Musicianship III continues to grant the basic knowledge needed if one wishes to pursue the Musician profession.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1062, 'social_entertainer_music_04', 'Musicianship IV continues to grant the basic knowledge needed if one wishes to pursue the Musician profession.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1063, 'social_entertainer_novice', 'At the heart of the Entertainer profession is a sampling of several different disciplines: Dancing, Musicianship, and Image Designing.  From here, the Entertainer can move to one of these disciplines and specialize in it, or become more generalized with a wider range of entertainment skills.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1064, 'social_imagedesigner', 'The Image Designer is skilled in perfecting the appearance of other characters.  The professional hair designer is your solution to a bad hair day - or even a bad face day!  They can change almost any aspect of a character''s appearance, and highly skilled Image Designers gain the ability to use hair styles unavailable to the novice.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1065, 'social_imagedesigner_bodyform_01', 'Bodyform I: Personal Training turns the Image Designer into a personal trainer, giving them the ability to help tone their customer''s bodies.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1066, 'social_imagedesigner_bodyform_02', 'Bodyform II: Body Glamour turns the Image Designer into a personal trainer, giving them the ability to help tone their customer''s bodies.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1067, 'social_imagedesigner_bodyform_03', 'Bodyform III: Alien Bioforms turns the Image Designer into a personal trainer, giving them the ability to help tone their customer''s bodies.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1068, 'social_imagedesigner_bodyform_04', 'Bodyform IV: Body Mastery turns the Image Designer into a personal trainer, giving them the ability to help tone their customer''s bodies.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1069, 'social_imagedesigner_exotic_01', 'Face I: Facial Customization allows the Image Designer to customize facial features of their customer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1070, 'social_imagedesigner_exotic_02', 'Face II: Stage Make Up & Design allows the Image Designer to customize facial features of their customer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1071, 'social_imagedesigner_exotic_03', 'Face III: Alien Faceforms allows the Image Designer to customize facial features of their customer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1072, 'social_imagedesigner_exotic_04', 'Face IV: Face Mastery allows the Image Designer to customize facial features of their customer.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1073, 'social_imagedesigner_hairstyle_01', 'Hairstyling I: Barber improves the Image Designer''s ability to customize hairstyles and colors. This level of skill also allows application of the beehive, brainstorm, Imperial, and Rebel Holo-Emotes.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1074, 'social_imagedesigner_hairstyle_02', 'Hairstyling II: Hair Dresser improves the Image Designer''s ability to customize hairstyles and colors. This level of skill also allows application of the bubblehead, hologlitter, holonotes, and sparky Holo-Emotes.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1075, 'social_imagedesigner_hairstyle_03', 'Hairstyling III: Hair Stylist improves the Image Designer''s ability to customize hairstyles and colors. This level of skill also allows application of the bullhorns, champagne, kitty, and phonytail Holo-Emotes.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1076, 'social_imagedesigner_hairstyle_04', 'Hairstyling IV: Beautician improves the Image Designer''s ability to customize hairstyles and colors. This level of skill also allows application of the blossom, butterflies, haunted, and hearts Holo-Emotes.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1077, 'social_imagedesigner_markings_01', 'Markings I: Tattoos allows the Image Designer to customize features unique to specific races, such as tattoos or spot patterns.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1078, 'social_imagedesigner_markings_02', 'Markings II: Patterns allows the Image Designer to customize features unique to specific races, such as tattoos or spot patterns.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1079, 'social_imagedesigner_markings_03', 'Markings III: Advanced Detail allows the Image Designer to customize features unique to specific races, such as tattoos or spot patterns.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1080, 'social_imagedesigner_markings_04', 'Markings IV: Detail Mastery allows the Image Designer to customize features unique to specific races, such as tattoos or spot patterns.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1081, 'social_imagedesigner_master', 'The Master Image Designer is able to customize everything about a specific character, and apply a Holo-Emote generator capable of displaying any Holo-Emote the user wishes.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1082, 'social_imagedesigner_novice', 'The Image Designer is skilled in perfecting the appearance of other characters.  The professional hair designer is your solution to a bad hair day -- or even a bad face day!  They can change almost any aspect of a character''s appearance, and highly-skilled Image Designers gain the ability to use hairstyles unavailable to the novice. Novice Image Designers are even capable of granting stat migration to their customers.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1083, 'social_language', 'The art of understanding and speaking the languages of different species, from the eloquent words of the Bothan to the harsh gutteral sounds of Shyriiwook, the language of the Wookiee.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1084, 'social_language_basic', 'Basic - A language based on the tongue of the human inhabitants of the Core Worlds. Basic, which first emerged as the Republic''s language of diplomacy and trade, has become common throughout the galaxy.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1085, 'social_language_basic_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the language of the Human species, Basic.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1086, 'social_language_basic_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the language of the Human species, Basic.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1087, 'social_language_bothan', 'Bothan - The Bothan tongue can be typically mastered by other species. Bothans accent their conversations with rippling of fur and often speak in an eloquent manner.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1088, 'social_language_bothan_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the Bothan language.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1089, 'social_language_bothan_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the Bothan language.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1090, 'social_language_lekku', 'Lekku - An intricate part of the Twi''lek language, Lekku involves the slight movement of heal-tails to portray speaking. It is silent and subtle and impossible to be learned, or understood, by other species of the Galaxy.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1091, 'social_language_lekku_comprehend', 'Upon learning this skiil, one can comprehend the silent language of the Twi''lek, Lekku.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1092, 'social_language_lekku_speak', 'Upon learning this skiil, one can speak the silent language of the Twi''lek, Lekku.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1093, 'social_language_mon_calamari_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the language of the Mon Cal.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1094, 'social_language_moncalamari', 'Mon Calamari - A low-pitched, rumbling language spoken by the Mon Cal. Nuances of the language are conveyed through careful changes in pitch and volume, which does not prevent other species from learning the intricacies of the language. 	'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1095, 'social_language_moncalamari_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the language of the Mon Cal.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1096, 'social_language_moncalamari_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the language of the Mon Cal.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1097, 'social_language_rodian', 'Rodese - The language spoken by Rodians. It could also be thought of as a very expressive and dramatic language as Rodian drama is higly regarded (as well as intensely violent) across the galaxy.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1098, 'social_language_rodian_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the expressive language of the Rodian, Rodese.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1099, 'social_language_rodian_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the expressive language of the Rodian, Rodese.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1100, 'social_language_trandoshan', 'Dosh - The Dosh language consists mostly of harsh grunts and growls, emphasizing sibilant sounds and hard consonants. When described by other species, the word "sinister" comes to mind.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1101, 'social_language_trandoshan_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the Trandoshan language, Dosh.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1102, 'social_language_trandoshan_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the Trandoshan language, Dosh.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1103, 'social_language_twilek', 'Twi''leki - The language "Twi''leki" consists of two components, the spoken "Ryl" and the unspoken "Lekku" which employs the headtails. '),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1104, 'social_language_twilek_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the language of the Twi''lek.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1105, 'social_language_twilek_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the language of the Twi''lek.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1106, 'social_language_wookiee', 'Shyriiwook - The name Wookiees give their language. Roughly translated, it means "tongue of the tree people". Wookiees communicate with a special set of sounds, which are subdivided into the following categories: grunts, barks, waa-waas, moans, whimpers, trills, snarls, and growls.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1107, 'social_language_wookiee_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the language of the Wookiee, Shyriiwook.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1108, 'social_language_wookiee_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the language of the Wookiee, Shyriiwook.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1109, 'social_language_zabrak', 'Zabrak - A language spoken by the Zabrak species. The Zabrak language closely resembles that of Basic and can be easily learned by all species because of this smililarity.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1110, 'social_language_zabrak_comprehend', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can comprehend the language of the Zabrak.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1111, 'social_language_zabrak_speak', 'Upon obtaining this skill, one can speak the Zabrak language.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1112, 'social_musician', 'Musicians use their skill to heal and relax the minds of other players.  Skilled Musicians who participate in a band can perform many songs with a wide range of flourishes on several instruments.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1113, 'social_musician_ability_01', 'Musical Ability I improves the Musician''s ability to perform certain songs, conveying improved healing abilities. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1114, 'social_musician_ability_02', 'Musical Ability II improves the Musician''s ability to perform certain songs, conveying improved healing abilities. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1115, 'social_musician_ability_03', 'Musical Ability III improves the Musician''s ability to perform certain songs, conveying improved healing abilities. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1116, 'social_musician_ability_04', 'Musical Ability IV improves the Musician''s ability to perform certain songs, conveying improved healing abilities. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1117, 'social_musician_knowledge_01', 'Musical Knowledge I grants the Musician a wider variety of songs and flourishes they can perform. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1118, 'social_musician_knowledge_02', 'Musical Knowledge II grants the Musician a wider variety of songs and flourishes they can perform. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1119, 'social_musician_knowledge_03', 'Musical Knowledge III grants the Musician a wider variety of songs and flourishes they can perform. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1120, 'social_musician_knowledge_04', 'Musical Knowledge IV grants the Musician a wider variety of songs and flourishes they can perform. A Musician can use /startmusic to see a list of their available songs.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1121, 'social_musician_master', 'The Master Musician knows all the songs and instruments available, and has all the tools to put on a professional performance.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1122, 'social_musician_novice', 'Musicians use their skill to heal and relax the minds of other players.  Skilled musicians who participate in a band can perform many songs with a wide range of flourishes on several instruments.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1123, 'social_musician_shock_01', 'Musician''s Fatigue Healing I improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1124, 'social_musician_shock_02', 'Musician''s Fatigue Healing II improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1125, 'social_musician_shock_03', 'Musician''s Fatigue Healing III improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1126, 'social_musician_shock_04', 'Musician''s Fatigue Healing IV improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal Battle Fatigue.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1127, 'social_musician_wound_01', 'Musician''s Wound Healing I improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal mind wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1128, 'social_musician_wound_02', 'Musician''s Wound Healing II improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal mind wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1129, 'social_musician_wound_03', 'Musician''s Wound Healing III improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal mind wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1130, 'social_musician_wound_04', 'Musician''s Wound Healing IV improves the effectiveness of the Musician to heal mind wounds.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1131, 'social_politician_civic_01', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to install mission terminals in his city.  A city can support up to 3 mission terminals per city rank.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1132, 'social_politician_civic_02', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to recruit and place skill trainers in his city.  A city can support up to 3 skill trainers per city rank.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1133, 'social_politician_civic_03', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to specialize his city in a specific type of healing: Medical or Entertainer.  Healing done in cities with these specializations will show increased results.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1134, 'social_politician_civic_04', 'This skill gives the politician various additional specialization options for the city.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1135, 'social_politician_fiscal_01', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to register his city on the planetary map.  The civic buildings in a city registered this way are also registered with the map and the /find command.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1136, 'social_politician_fiscal_02', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to expand the financial health of his city with the placement of Banks and Shuttleports.  A travel tax can be placed on the shuttleport via the city management terminal.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1137, 'social_politician_fiscal_03', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to set his city to be a Manufacturing Center.  Manufacturing Centers give all crafting attempts within the city a bonus to their success rolls.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1138, 'social_politician_fiscal_04', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to set his city to be a Research Center.  Research Centers give all experimentation attempts within the city a bonus to their success rolls.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1139, 'social_politician_martial_01', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to form and manage his own militia for a player city.  The militia is managed from the city management terminal.  Militia members can /cityban enemies from using public services and grant zoning rights to others with /grantZoningRights.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1140, 'social_politician_martial_02', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to contribute to the health of his city through the placement of a Cloning Facility.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1141, 'social_politician_martial_03', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to turn his city into a Stronghold.  In a Stronghold city, all militia members gain a massive bonus to defense against enemy player attacks.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1142, 'social_politician_martial_04', 'With this skill, the politician gains the ability to place faction aligned mission terminals with the /installMissionTerminal command.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1143, 'social_politician_master', 'This skill gives the politician additional, powerful specializations for the city.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1144, 'social_politician_novice', 'The novice politician has the ability to place and administrate player cities and run for elections.  This is the starting point in a career of mayoral power building.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1145, 'social_politician_urban_01', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to place new types of decorations in the city.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1146, 'social_politician_urban_02', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to place new types of decorations in the city.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1147, 'social_politician_urban_03', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to place new types of decorations in the city.'),
('string/en/skl_d.stf', 1148, 'social_politician_urban_04', 'This skill gives the politician the ability to place new types of decorations in the city.'),
