('string/en/space/droid_commands.stf', 76, 'droidcommand_reactornormalize_description', 'Reactor Stabilization - The primary purpose of this droid program is to allow it to reset a starship''s reactor back to operational settings as close to its manufactured norms as possible, given its current condition and overall ''health''.'),
