('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 1, 'title_ghostship', 'Mystery of the Duskrunner'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 2, 'text_ghostship', '[This document contains a fragment of the book "Mystery of the Duskrunner."  A favorite legend among pirates in the Tatooine sector.]\n\n...\n\nNo one ever saw the Duskrunner again after that fateful day.  The black void just seemed to swallow up the old pirate.  Her captain never launched a distress beacon, most likely consigned to go down with the ship as is the ancient tradition.  The legend, quietly whispered in the back of the more questionable cantinas, says that such a dishonorable old bandit was denied that honorable fate.  They say the Duskrunner still haunts unused Tatooine shipping lanes.  That she appears every once in a while to prey on unsuspecting ships that cross her path.\n\nThis historian does not place any faith in the wild tales of drunken pirates, but the legend is alive and well even today.\n\n[A small subfile also exists in the fragment''s registery.]\n\n"...I know what I saw and I saw the Duskrunner!  I''ve stored the coordinates in this file.  They say she can''t be killed, but that she''ll pay a portion of her loot to any man brave enough to hunt her down and take her on!  A false distress signal in the right place...this is our chance..."'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 3, 'close', 'Close'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 4, 'store_waypoint', 'Retrieve Waypoint'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 5, 'use', 'Use'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 6, 'wrong_planet', 'The coordinates stored in the file don''t refer to any location in this area.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 7, 'stored_waypoint', 'A waypoint to the coordinates in the document has been created.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 8, 'waypoint_exists', 'You already have a waypoint to that location in your datapad.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 9, 'distress_signal', 'Signal Distress'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 10, 'read', 'Read'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 11, 'action_wrong_planet', 'You aren''t anywhere close to the location indicated in the document.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 12, 'need_waypoint', 'You need to read the document and retrieve the waypoint data before you can do that.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 13, 'toofar_ghostship', 'You need to get closer to the waypoint before you try and signal the ghost ship.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 14, 'trigger_ghostship', 'You engage a false distress signal, hoping to attract the attention of the legendary Duskrunner.'),
('string/en/space/encoded_doc.stf', 15, 'event_ghostship', 'A black ship approaches from the void, shields and weapons charged.\nIt unleashes its first attack even as your targeting computer identifies it as the ''Duskrunner.'''),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 1, 'title', 'Escort the Freighter transport to safety'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 2, 'reason_1', 'We need to get this cargo to Yavin4 without incident. Watch our back.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 4, 'failed_protect', 'I''m doomed on my own, I''ll never make it! Your superior will hear of your failure!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 5, 'panic_1', 'Incoming fighter ships, they have spotted my cargo, keep them off me!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 6, 'panic_2', 'Hostile fighters inbound, keep them off me!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 7, 'panic_3', 'Hostile fighter ships attacking, they have spotted my cargo!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 8, 'thanks_1', 'Great job! I see that your superior didn''t put their trust in the wrong pilot.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 9, 'thanks_2', 'Phew, that was a close one. We are almost there, keep your eyes open.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 10, 'thanks_3', 'I thought they would take us out for sure. I will let Command know of your superior skills!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 11, 'shields_depleted', 'My shields are failing! Get them off me quickly!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 12, 'hull_half', 'We''re falling apart over here, do your job pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 13, 'quest_update', 'Escort Command: <%TO>'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 15, 'failed_destroy', 'You let them destroy equipment worth millions! Report to your superior immediately.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 16, 'arrived_at_loc', 'Arrived at rendez-vous. Wait here for Freighter to finish hyper jump.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 17, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 18, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 19, 'complete', 'Mission accomplished. Good job pilot. Report to your superior for further instructions.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 20, 'reason_2', 'We need to get this cargo to Yavin4 without incident. Watch our back.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 21, 'reason_3', 'We need to get this cargo to Yavin4 without incident. Watch our back.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 22, 'found_loc', 'Escort rendez-vous coordinates confirmed. Proceed as planned.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 23, 'goodbye_1', 'Good job pilot! We will take it from here. Beginning descent to surface.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 24, 'goodbye_2', 'Good job pilot! We will take it from here. Beginning descent to surface.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 25, 'goodbye_3', 'Good job pilot! We will take it from here. Beginning descent to surface.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 26, 'goodbye_5', 'Good job pilot! We will take it from here. Beginning descent to surface.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 27, 'goodbye_4', 'Good job pilot! We will take it from here. Beginning descent to surface.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 28, 'taunt_1', 'Cut your engines immediately or be destroyed!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 29, 'taunt_2', 'You are smuggling illegal goods. Cut your engines now or we will open fire!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 30, 'taunt_3', 'Terrorist scum! We will destroy you!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 31, 'taunt_4', 'You''re no match for me, terrorist scum!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 32, 'taunt_5', 'I''m taking you out, we don''t tolerate terrorism on Yavin4!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 33, 'reason_4', 'We need to get this cargo to Yavin4 without incident. Watch our back.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 34, 'reason_5', 'We need to get this cargo to Yavin4 without incident. Watch our back.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 35, 'thanks_4', 'Phew, that was a close one. We are almost there, keep your eyes open.'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 36, 'thanks_5', 'I thought they would take us out for sure. I will let Command know of your superior skills!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 37, 'panic_4', 'Hostile fighter ships attacking, they have spotted my cargo!'),
('string/en/space/escort/corellia_privateer_14.stf', 38, 'panic_5', 'Hostile fighters inbound, keep them off me!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 1, 'abort', 'Abort code recognized. Proceed as normal.'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_loc', 'Coordinates confirmed. Searching for target... ... ...'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 3, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Warning! Warning! Vessels with armed weapon systems detected! Proceed with caution. >'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 4, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < Area clear. Sensors cannot indicate immediate danger. Proceed as normal. >'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 5, 'complete', 'The Freighter has arrived safely. Good job, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 6, 'failed_protect', 'You failed to efficiently escort the Freighter to safety!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 7, 'found_loc', 'Coordinates received and updated. Proceed to designated area for next duty, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 8, 'goodbye_1', 'Ah! The beauty of Lok. I thought I''d never see it again. Thanks, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 9, 'goodbye_2', 'You''re a fine pilot, sir! Thank you for getting us to Lok in one piece!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 10, 'goodbye_3', 'That was close! I''m glad to see we made it out safe. Thanks, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 11, 'goodbye_4', 'Whew! Time to hit the cantina. We''ll raise our glasses in your honor, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 12, 'goodbye_5', 'It was looking a little bleak there, pilot. Thanks for getting us to safety!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 13, 'hull_half', 'Our hull has taken significant damage! We''re gonna need some help over here, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 14, 'panic_1', 'Incoming hostile units! This vessel isn''t equipped for fighting! Keep us safe, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 15, 'panic_2', 'Sensors indicate armed systems! It may get a little hectic around here!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 16, 'panic_3', 'Keep your eyes open! My sensors indicate hostile vessels.'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 17, 'panic_4', 'I hope you know how to handle your vessel, pilot! We''ve got hostiles on our tail!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 18, 'panic_5', 'We''re done for! Their weapon systems are locked on us! Don''t let us die!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 19, 'reason_1', 'You''re going to escort us.. with *that*? It''s just a bucket of bolts! You better keep hostiles off us!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 20, 'reason_2', 'I suspect you''re our escort. Good! We need to get this shipment of weapons to Lok, pronto!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 21, 'reason_3', 'With you as our escort, we''ll be drinking in a Lok cantina soon enough! We have exotic wines on this vessel, ready for consumption!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 22, 'reason_4', 'You better be a good pilot. We have expensive trinkets in here for Queen-something-or-other! Keep an eye on us.'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 23, 'reason_5', 'Finally... what took you so long? Get us to our destination safely, ya hear?'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 24, 'shields_depleted', 'Our shields are failing! Get these hostiles off me, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 25, 'taunt_1', 'Ha! You''ll never get out of this system alive! Let''s get ''em, boys!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 26, 'taunt_2', 'We''ll be takin'' yer freighter''s cargo if ya'' don''t mind! Har har!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 27, 'taunt_3', 'Aim for their weak spot, boys! We''ll take the bounty after we''re done trashing their vessels!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 28, 'taunt_4', 'Easy targets! This will be some fine targeting practice for us!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 29, 'taunt_5', 'I''m going to destroy you with everything I have! You''re in *my* system now!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 30, 'thanks_1', 'That was close! Thanks for saving our tails, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 31, 'thanks_2', 'You know... you''re an okay pilot! We would have been dust back there!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 32, 'thanks_3', 'Man, we owe you a drink for that one! Great job, pilot!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 33, 'thanks_4', 'I could almost feel the heat of that explosion from here! Nice work!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 34, 'thanks_5', 'I gotta say, you sure know how to fly that thing!'),
('string/en/space/escort_duty/corellia_privateer_10.stf', 35, 'title', 'Escort Trade Freighter Vessels'),
