('string/en/space/quest.stf', 49, 'ta_text', 'The documents contained herein are an accurate and complete record of the undersigned pilot''s history with the Imperial Navy. This document confirms the undersigned to be transferred to a new posting as indicated in the contained form 57/G.\n\nAuthorized this day by the Imperial Naval Command.\n'),
