('string/en/space/space_interaction.stf', 266, 'retire_rebel_warning', 'You cannot manually surrender pilot skills.\n\nIf you wish to retire from the Rebel Navy, you should speak to the recruiter for the Rebel Alliance on Corellia. If you need a waypoint to the location of your local recruiter, please press the "Get Waypoint" button below.'),
