('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 674, 'generic_armor_d', 'This is a piece of starship armor plating. This is your second layer of defense behind your shields. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
