('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 679, 'navicomputer_1_d', 'Flight Computers are used to store ship management system parameter profiles that can alter ship power allocation during flight. Some starships use astromechs to perform this function instead of flight computers. Once a flight computer has been initialized, programmed data chips can be transferred to its datapad. When a flight computer is associated with a starship, any programs in its datapad will be useable by the pilot once the ship is in space.'),
