('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 953, 'weapon_incom_disruptor_d', 'Long-range starship disruptor technology has been a staple of the INCOM corporation development repertoire for only a few cycles. Although the newest weapons in this line are rather stable, the older post-experimentation models are notoriously twitchy and unreliable.'),
