('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1095, 'generic_weapon_d', 'This is a ship weapon. It is is used to destroy enemy ships. The weapon is powered by both a capacitor and your ship''s reactor. Every shot will drain energy from your capacitor. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1096, 'generic_engine_d', 'This is an Engine. This component controls your ships flight performance, speed and handling. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1097, 'generic_booster_d', 'This is a booster. It will allow your ship to temporarily accelerate and improve your top speed. By default, the ''B'' key controls your booster. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1098, 'generic_capacitor_d', 'This is a weapon capacitor. Every shot that a weapon fires will drain energy from the capacitor. When this is empty, your weapons will no longer be able to fire until it recharges. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1099, 'generic_droid_interface_d', 'This is a droid interface. This will allow you to equip a flight computer or astromech droid on your starship. These can be used to control your ships subsystems. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1100, 'generic_reactor_d', 'This is a reactor. This component powers all of your other ship components. If your reactor fails any component that consumes power will shut down. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1101, 'generic_shield_d', 'This is a shield generator. Shield generators generate a protective shell of energy around your ship. A single generator will protect both the front and rear of your ship. If your shield is damaged, the geneator will recharge the damage over time. If the generator itself is damaged, it will not regenerate. To equip ship components, go to a starship terminal and click "Manage". This will allow you to equip this item as well as compare attributes with your current components.'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1102, 'conduit_engine', 'Engine Power Conduit'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1103, 'conduit_capacitor', 'High Powered Capacitor Conduit'),
('string/en/space/space_item.stf', 1104, 'conduit_reactor', 'Reactor Conduit'),
