('string/en/spacequest/assassinate/c_darndroidspace.stf', 11, 'failed_escape', 'The ship suceeded in carrying some of the tainted medicinal spice to the galaxy.  You have failed.   Talk to Valance Serth and maybe you can stop another batch.'),
