('string/en/spacequest/assassinate/dathomir_station_imp_storyquest_01_e.stf', 12, 'failed_escape', 'You let him get away! Pray that we can get another fix on his location or this will failure be reflected on your performance review. Report your failure to the station commander.'),
('string/en/spacequest/assassinate/dathomir_station_imp_storyquest_01_e.stf', 13, 'quest_escort_d', 'Make sure that all of the escaping pirate''s escort fighters are destroyed as well. Once you have completed this task return to the station commander.'),
