('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_privateer_tier3_3.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', '\\#pcontrast3 Interdiction Craft: < \\#pcontrast1 [SECURE] A freighter is coming in on this point. They will be throwing out some interference to shield your presence.  Travel with them to get into position, CorSec command will update you when they have more information [SECURE] \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_privateer_tier3_3.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_privateer_tier3_3.stf', 32, 'title', 'Dantooine System: Rendezvous with a CorSec contact'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_privateer_tier3_3.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'Meet with the CorSec operative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'The recon officer should meet you here, transfer the data to him and see if he can spare any help for us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 3, 'arrived_at_pickup', 'The recon pilot should be around here. You should cut your engines and disarm your weapon system to show that you are not hostile.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 4, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 5, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 6, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 7, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 8, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 9, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 10, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Rebel Recon Officer: I will bring the data to my command to see if what we can do to help your fleet.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 11, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'Rebel Recon Pilot: Alright your ship is clean. Transferring coordinates of my officer, he should be able to assist you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 12, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Rebel Recon Officer: I''m going through this as it''s transferred. The fleet this mentions may be the one that is assembling in this sector the last few days.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 13, 'docking_started_pickup', 'Rebel Recon Pilot: I will need access to your ships computer and droid before giving you the location of our recon officer. We have increased security with all the Imperial activity in this sector as of late.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 14, 'failed_destroyed', 'What the heck happened up there pilot?! Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 15, 'found_loc_d', 'Deliver the data to the recon officer at this location. Be careful, apparently this sector has increased imperial activity lately.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 16, 'found_loc_p', 'Contact one of the recon pilots at this location. They will want to dock and check your ships computer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 17, 'hello_d', 'Rebel Recon Officer: I''m told you have some important data from our fleet stranded in the Endor sector. Prepare to dock for transfer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 18, 'hello_p', 'Rebel Recon Pilot: Shut down your engines, transfer ID code and prepare to dock.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_d', 'With the increased Imperial presence in the system, security has been tightened. Let the Recon pilot dock with your ship to do a security scan of it.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 20, 'quest_dock1_t', 'Dock for inspection.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Transmit the information you got from the Hutt smugglers to the Recon officer by docking with him.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 22, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock and transmit data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 23, 'quest_location_d', 'The Lok system usually have a pretty low presence of Imperial ships but with their fleet mobilising in that system, there will be a lot more of them there. You also have to be careful with the numerous pirates that look for lone targets of opportunity.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 24, 'quest_location_t', 'Lok system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', 'Meet up with one of our Recon pilots at these coordinates. He will want to scan your ship as well as receive identification codes to make sure you are who you say you are.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', 'Security scan.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Proceed to these coordinates to meet up with the Recon officer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 28, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet the Recon officer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 29, 'quest_update', 'Rebel Command: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', 'Rebel Command: < We need you back in Endor pilot! Imperial scouts have located our fleet and are sending bombers! >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 32, 'title', 'Lok system: Deliver Recon Data to Rebel HQ in Lok sector.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_2_a.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'The information in the Hutt smugglers computer talks about the Empire mobilising a fleet in the Lok system to attack our fleet in Endor. Travel to Lok, transfer this data to one of their commanders and see what information they can give us on the Imperial fleet in that system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Excellent, prepare to dock and transfer the data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 3, 'arrived_at_pickup', 'Dock with the Nym smuggler and pick up the data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 4, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 5, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 6, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 7, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 8, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 9, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 10, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Alright we got it. Good work pilot. We have another task that need your immediate attention.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 11, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'There ya go, my end of the deal is over. Be careful, there''s Imps all over this sector.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 12, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Downloading data, this will only take a few seconds pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 13, 'docking_started_pickup', 'Starting upload, make yerself comfortable.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 14, 'failed_destroyed', 'How could you let this happen pilot? Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 15, 'found_loc_d', 'Meet the HQ ship at this location. There''s a lot of Imperials in your area, we''re counting on you to be able to take care of them.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 16, 'found_loc_p', 'Meet the smuggler at these coordinates, good luck!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 17, 'hello_d', 'This is Rebel Command ship Starsurfer, initiating docking sequence.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 18, 'hello_p', 'Hey Rebel, I''ve got your goods. Lets dock so I can transfer this and be out of here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_d', 'Dock with the Nym smuggler so that he can transfer over the Intel data about the Imperial fleet to your ship.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 20, 'quest_dock1_t', 'Transfer the Intel data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with our command ship and transfer the data quickly before more of the Imperial menace shows up.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 22, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock and transfer data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 23, 'quest_location_d', 'We have managed to gather more information on the Endor system and unfortunately it seems to be quite crowded with Imperial forces (and more on the way). We are not sure why at this point as the information we have on the forest moon of Endor doesn''t suggest any value.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 24, 'quest_location_t', 'Endor system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', 'The Nym smuggler has provided you with coordinates to meet up with him. Hurry over there and get that data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', 'Meet with Nym smuggler.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Bring the data to our command ship at these coordinates. Be careful, the Imperial presence in this system is increasing more and more.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 28, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Bring data to Rebel command ship.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 29, 'quest_update', 'Rebel Fleet Command: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', 'Rebel Fleet Command: < We have the confirmed location of one of the Empires advanced spy ships and need you to take him out, proceed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 32, 'title', 'Endor system: Bring Intel data to Fleet Command.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'More of the Imperial fleet have arrived to the Endor sector but instead of just trying to hide, we have decided to launch attacks on the Empire while they are not at full strength. Your task is to meet with one of Nym''s smugglers that have brought highly valuable intel data from the Lok Alliance Navy on the Imperial fleet moving this way.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 1, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Secure channel open. You are cleared to dock with the Cloak representative and transmit the false codes.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_pickup', 'Secure channel open. Dock with a CorSec transport here and they will upload some unused security codes.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Warning. Enemy craft inbound.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Enemy threat neutralized.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Good, pilot, good. We will be in touch soon. Now return to your Station, but mention none of this to CorSec Command.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 10, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'Docking clamps are clear. Good luck, pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 11, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Docking request received. Begin your security code transfer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 12, 'docking_started_pickup', 'Transferring security codes. Preparing dock sequence.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 13, 'failed_destroyed', 'Looks like this mission is a wash. Go ahead and come back to the station for debriefing.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 14, 'found_loc_d', 'Secure channel open. Scans are clear. Proceed to this location, dock with the Cloak rep, and transfer the false codes to him.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 15, 'found_loc_p', 'Secure channel open. We have received your mission update. We are sending a CorSec transport to this location. They will transmit false security codes for you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 16, 'hello_d', 'Greetings, CorSec. Have you returned with the security codes? Begin your docking sequence.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 17, 'hello_p', 'Initiating secure channel. Hello pilot. We''ve got some falsified security codes for you. Dock up whenever you''re ready.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 18, 'quest_dock1_d', 'Dock with the transport to acquire the falsified codes. This should also make this operation look belivable to any Cloak ships that may be observing.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_t', 'Dock With the CorSec Transport'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 20, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with the Cloak Representative and transmit to him the falsified security codes.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock With the Cloak Representative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 22, 'quest_location_d', 'The CorSec transport is slated to meet you elsewhere in the Corellia system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 23, 'quest_location_t', 'Remain in the Corellia System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 24, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', 'Travel to the navigation waypoint and meet with the CorSec transport that CorSec Command has sent to meet you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', 'Meet With the CorSec Transport'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Travel to the provided navigation waypoint and await the return of the Cloak Representative.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet With the Cloak Representative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 28, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 CorSec Command: <\\#pcontrast3  %TO\\#pcontrast1  >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 29, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 31, 'title', 'Corellia System: Acquire CorSec Security Codes for the Cloaks'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/corellia_station_mission4_2a.stf', 32, 'title_d', 'As a test of commitment, the Cloak Representative has sent you on a mission to acquire CorSec transport security codes. CorSec Command has been monitoring your communications and has sent a transport to meet you with false codes. You can give these codes to the Cloak representative without fear of compromising CorSec security.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/dathomir_station_priv_storyquest_01_a.stf', 1, 'arrived_at_delivery', '\\#pcontrast3 Nav Computer: < \\#pcontrast1 Designated rendezvous waypoint reached. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
