('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 11, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'Alright, we''re done, have a safe flight to Dathomir, if there is such a thing.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 12, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Initiating docking sequence, prepare to transfer the data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 13, 'docking_started_pickup', 'Hurry up, I''ve got things to do and places to be.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 14, 'failed_destroyed', 'What the heck happened up there pilot? We have lost contact with our ship! Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 15, 'found_loc_d', 'Our commando team will meet you at this location.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 16, 'found_loc_p', 'Meet the Nym smuggler at these coordinates pilot. Hurry up, they are not famous for being patient.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 17, 'hello_d', 'Greetings pilot, prepare to dock so we can get on with the mission.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 18, 'hello_p', 'Hey there chum, I''ve put together what info I could remember for you guys.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_d', 'The smuggler put together what information he has in a data cube. Dock with him and transfer it over, then head for the Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 20, 'quest_dock1_t', 'Dock and transfer information.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_d', 'If the surrounding area is clear of hostile ships, dock with the commando teams ship and transfer the information the smuggler gave you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 22, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock and transfer intel.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 23, 'quest_location_d', 'The Lok system is fairly safe, at least from Imperial forces. They have a bit of respect of Nym''s forces and try not to get tangled up with him. Unfortunately the zone is infested with pirates from other clans than Nym''s and they tend to look for lone targets of opportunity. After you have received the information from Nym''s smuggler you''re heading to the Dathomir system and you know the drill there, trust no one and be ready for anything.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 24, 'quest_location_t', 'Lok and Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', 'The smuggler gave us these coordinates for your meeting. Hurry over there as he won''t wait for you if you''re late.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', 'Meeting with Nym''s smuggler.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'The commando team will meet you at these coordinates. They are travelling in a civilian freighter, model YT-1300.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 28, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Coordinates for meeting with commando team.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 29, 'quest_update', 'Rebel Command: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', 'Rebel Command: < Good work. We are delivering a blow to the Empire by taking out one of their patrols and could use your assistance. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 32, 'title', 'Lok and Dathomir system: Deliver security data to a Rebel commando team.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'There''s a high ranking Imperial officer that is a traitor and have been imprisoned on Dathomir. In Nym''s service there''s a smuggler that have been inside the prison and he''s agreed to give us any information he has about it to assist in breaking free the prisoner. Meet the smuggler in the Lok sector and take the data to one of our Commando teams in the Dathomir sector.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'You are at the correct location pilot. The Vortex operative should be there any second.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 3, 'arrived_at_pickup', 'I''m not sure what the Vortex do for the Alliance but one of their scientists found something on Dathomir that needs to be delivered to Yavin 4 quickly, so we''re helping them out.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 4, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 5, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 6, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 7, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 8, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 9, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 10, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Alright, I got it. I heard some guys on Tatooine say you were good, I guess they weren''t lying. See you around.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 11, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'You have no idea what I had to go through to get that thing. I hope you can get it to Yavin safely.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 12, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Starting dock sequence.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 13, 'docking_started_pickup', 'Lets dock so I can transfer this over to you quickly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 14, 'failed_destroyed', 'What the heck is going on pilot?! When we''re asked for help, the Alliance expect the job to get done. Return to base right away!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 15, 'found_loc_d', 'So far so good. Proceed to these coordinates pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 16, 'found_loc_p', 'A scientist from the Vortex will meet you at these coordinates pilot. Make your way over there, on the double!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 17, 'hello_d', 'Glad to see you made it, lets do this.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 18, 'hello_p', 'You''re here, great. I was afraid no one would be able to help us out.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_d', 'If the area is clear, dock with the spy to transfer the package to your ship. No we didn''t ask what we are delivering and neither should you. As soon as you got the package, head to the Yavin system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 20, 'quest_dock1_t', 'Dock with Rebel spy for pickup.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Clear out hostile fighters in the surrounding area first. When it''s clear, quickly dock with the Vortex agent and transfer the cargo to him.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 22, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock with Vortex agent for delivery.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 23, 'quest_location_d', 'The Dathomir system is always dangerous so stay alert there. You''re meeting up with one of our spies to pick up the package for the Vortex. Make sure you don''t blow his cover by leading any hostile forces to his location. After pickup you are heading to the Yavin system. Although not as dangerous as the Dathomir system it has a heavy Imperial presence so stay sharp and don''t let your guard down!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 24, 'quest_location_t', 'Dathomir and Yavin system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', 'One of our spies will meet you at this location. Again, be sure not to drag any hostile forces to these coordinates as it could mean the end of our spy if he''s spotted.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', 'Coordinates for pickup.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Head to these coordinates quickly. We see several Imperial fighters chasing you, they must have found out about our mission somehow!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 28, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Coordinates for delivery, Yavin system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 29, 'quest_update', 'General Ufwol: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 32, 'title', 'Dathomir and Yavin system: Assist ''The Vortex'' with a quick delivery.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/tatooine_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'Another part of the Alliance has asked us for a favor, knowing that we are the best. Let''s not prove them wrong. They have a important delivery they need taken care of quickly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 1, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Hang on here a bit. The garbage scow is on its way.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_pickup', 'Alright, the scow will show up at any moment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Alright, good job, I''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 10, 'docking_complete_pickup', 'There you go. You better deliver it fast. This stuff smells bad.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 11, 'docking_started_delivery', 'My boys will start to unload the stuff. Hang on a sec.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 12, 'docking_started_pickup', 'That''s it, easy...easy...'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 13, 'failed_destroyed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 14, 'found_loc_d', 'Here''s the waypoint to your drop off point. Dock with the scow there to deliver the garbage.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 15, 'found_loc_p', 'We need you to go meet a garbage scow at this point and pick up her garbage load for transport.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 16, 'hello_d', 'Alright, let''s dock and get this overwith.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 17, 'hello_p', 'You here to take this trash? Dock with me to pick up the load.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 18, 'quest_dock1_d', '4'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 19, 'quest_dock1_t', '4'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 20, 'quest_dock2_d', '6'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 21, 'quest_dock2_t', '6'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 22, 'quest_location_d', '2'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 23, 'quest_location_t', '2'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 24, 'quest_rendezvous1_d', '3'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 25, 'quest_rendezvous1_t', '3'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 26, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', '5'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 27, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', '5'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 28, 'quest_update', 'Garbage Authority: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 29, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 31, 'title', 'Transport the Garbage'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery/test_delivery.stf', 32, 'title_d', '1'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'The Lambda shuttle is on it''s way now. Stand by until it has arrived at your location.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Incoming enemy fighters.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'We have the data from the rebel officer. Command is very excited to get their hands on this information.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Beginning docking procedures in order to get the Rebel officer''s data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', 'You allowed your transfer shuttle to be destroyed? That was an expensive ship. You are going to have to answer to your commander about this failure.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', 'Meet the shuttle at this location. Transfer the data immediately on it''s arrival.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'I understand that you have something that HQ is very interested in taking a look at.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Once the shuttle has arrived, use the /dock command on it in order to transfer the plans. Be on the look out for Rebel fighters who will probably attempt to stop this delivery from happening.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Transfer the Joint Operations Plan'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'Remain in the Yavin system and deliver the joint operations plan to the Imperial Lambda Shuttle. You will receive a navigation waypoint to the arrival location of the shuttle. Travel to this location and wait for the shuttle to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Remain in the Yavin System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'When you arrive at the navigation waypoint to the Lambda shuttle, wait for it to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Wait for the Arrival of the Lambda Shuttle');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 20, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 Black Epsilon Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', 'High command also wants a live body to confirm the rebel officer''s data. You are going to have to capture a rebel officer and bring him back to HQ alive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 23, 'title', 'Yavin System: Deliver the Rebel Data'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'Remain in the Yavin system and deliver the joint operations plan. You will receive a navigation waypoint to a shuttle that will pick up the joint operations plan from you. Travel to this navigation waypoint and wait for the shuttle to arrive. Once the shuttle arrives, use the /dock command with the shuttle targeted to transfer the plans. Enemy fighters will attempt to stop this delivery from taking place. You must keep yourself, as well as, the shuttle alive until you can complete the delivery.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Wait at this location for the arrival of the lambda shuttle.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters detected.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'We have the information. We will return this to command immediately. Oh, and that Insurgent guy wanted to speak with you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Beginning docking procedure now. Stand by.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', 'You allowed your transfer shuttle to be destroyed? That was an expensive ship. You are going to have to answer to your commander about this failure.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', 'Proceed to this location to make the dropoff to a command shuttle.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'Stand by, pilot. We will be ready to begin the transfer shortly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with the shuttle and transfer the data. Once you have completed this task report to your superior.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Transfer the Data'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'Remain in the Dantooine system and travel to the navigation waypoint supplied to you. This will take you to the shuttle''s arrival location.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Remain in the Dantooine System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Travel to the arrival location and wait for the the shuttle.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet the Shuttle'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 20, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 Black Epsilon Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 23, 'title', 'Dantooine System: Deliver the Clues'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_imperial_tier4_2_b.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'Remain in the Dantooine system and transfer the data to a command shuttle. Insurgent needs that information immediately in order to continue his investigation.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', '\\#pcontrast3 CorSec Command: < \\#pcontrast1 Our man should be here soon. Just wait here. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast3 Tactical Computer: < \\#pcontrast1 Enemy craft detected on attack vector. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast3 Tactical Computer: < \\#pcontrast1 Hostile activity has ceased. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Transfer is complete, pleasure doing business with you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'The dock looks good, transfer over the cargo now.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', '\\#pcontrast3 CorSec Command: < \\#pcontrast3 Uploading a waypoint to your Nav Comptuer. Head over there and drop off your recovered cargo. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'Hail Captain.  I need to get this information back to Intelligence on the double. '),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Use the /dock command to link up with and transfer the cargo'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'A rendezvous in the Endor System with freindly craft'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Endor System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Travel to this point to meet with your designated contact'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Rendezvous'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 20, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast3 < \\#pcontrast1 %TO \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 23, 'title', 'Endor System: Transfer the recovered goods to a CorSec Lancer'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_privateer_tier3_4_c.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'Transfer the recovered goods to a CorSec Lancer'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Dock with the smuggler and get out of there quickly before more of the Empire''s goons show up.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Alright I got it. Lets get out of here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Docking, be ready to transfer that data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', 'What are you doing up there pilot? Sleeping? That man was a valuable asset! Return to base, now!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', 'The closest Rebel Smuggler can meet you at this location. Get there as fast as you can.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'G''day. Lets do this quickly, I don''t like lingering around here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Before you dock and transfer the data to the smuggler, make sure that the surrounding area is clear of enemy presence. Both your ships will be very vulnerable during the docking process and hostile fighters can make quick work of you if any of them are around.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock and transfer data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'No time to consider your path. Bolt for our smuggler, quickest route possible. Try to avoid contact with any extra hostile presence if you can but get there fast! The longer you fly around, the more of the Imperial forces will be able to track you down.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Dathomir system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'The Rebel smuggler has sent us these coordinates as your rendez-vous point. Get there quickly!'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Smuggler coordinates.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 20, 'quest_update', 'Worvog Arkon: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 23, 'title', 'Deliver Inquisitor data to Alliance Smuggler.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_rebel_tier4_2_a.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'The wreck of the Imperial Inquisitor you so efficiently terminated had some important data in it. Deliver this to one of our cunning smugglers immediately but be swift, the Empire is chasing you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 1, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Roger that, pilot. Arrival at delivery location acknowledged. Await the drop-off vessel here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 3, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Warning. Enemy craft inbound.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 4, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Enemy threat neutralized.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 5, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 6, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 7, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 8, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'And... you''re clear. Say, I don''t recognize your ship markings. Eh, whatever... my job is done.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 9, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Standing by for docking sequence.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 10, 'failed_destroyed', 'The mission is a wash, pilot. The delivery ship was destroyed. Return to base for debriefing.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 11, 'found_loc_d', 'Transmitting coordinates of delivery location. Proceed to the waypoint and meet the drop-off vessel.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 12, 'hello_d', 'Are you the agent I''m looking for? I''m ready to transfer the package. Do you copy?'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 13, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with the drop-off vessel using the /dock command, and he will transfer the leaked information to your ship. Once you have it, return to the station for debriefing and anaysis.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Receive the Leaked Information'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 15, 'quest_location_d', 'The drop-off is supposed to happen elsewhere in the Corellia system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 16, 'quest_location_t', 'Remain in the Corellia System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 17, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Travel to the coordinates provided by CorSec Command. The drop-off vessel will meet you there.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet the Delivery Ship'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 19, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 CorSec Command: <\\#pcontrast3  %TO\\#pcontrast1  >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 20, 'split_quest_alert', 'Mission successful. Return to CorSec Station.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 22, 'title', 'Corellia System: Intercept the Leaked Information'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission3_2.stf', 23, 'title_d', 'CorSec Command wants you to take the place of the Cloak agent and intercept the leaked information that is being delivered. You should travel to the coordinates provided by Command, dock with the delivery ship, and receive the information he is carrying. Once you have it, return to the station for analysis.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 1, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Roger that. Looks like you''re at the right spot. The Cloak representative should be arriving shortly. Stand by.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 3, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Warning. Enemy craft inbound.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 4, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer: <\\#pcontrast3  Enemy threat neutralized.\\#pcontrast1 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 5, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 6, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 7, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 8, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'I''m glad to hear that you''ve decided to work with us. Of course, you musn''t tell CorSec Command. Now for a small test of your commitment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 9, 'docking_started_delivery', 'You''ve made the right choice, CorSec. Now let me tell you about the Cloaks. I think you''ll find it interesting.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 10, 'failed_destroyed', 'We copy, pilot. Confirming destruction of the Cloak Representative. No love lost, here. Go ahead and come back to the station for debriefing.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 11, 'found_loc_d', 'You should have the coordinates for the meeting location. Go ahead and dock with the Cloak rep if you''re comfortable with going undercover, otherwise just destroy him.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 12, 'hello_d', 'Greetings, CorSec. I''m glad you decided to come. Dock with my ship if you''re interested in what I have to say.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 13, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with the Cloak representative if you wish to go undercover and work with the Cloaks, otherwise just destroy him.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Dock With or Destroy the Cloak Representative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 15, 'quest_location_d', 'The meeting location is set up in the Corellia system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 16, 'quest_location_t', 'Travel to the Corellia System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 17, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Travel to the navigation waypoint and meet the Cloak Representative.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet With the Cloak Representative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 19, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 CorSec Command: <\\#pcontrast3  %TO\\#pcontrast1  >'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 20, 'split_quest_alert', 'Incoming mission. Acquire CorSec Transport security codes and deliver them to the Cloak Representative.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert_fail', 'Cloak Representative destroyed. Acceptable within mission parameters.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 22, 'title', 'Corellia System: Meet the Cloak Representative'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/corellia_station_mission4_1.stf', 23, 'title_d', 'A cloak representative wishes to speak with you personally, possibly about working as a double-agent. CorSec command thinks that this may be a prime opportunity to go undercover, however, this could be a potentially dangerous assignment. You are to travel to the pre-arranged meeting location. Dock with the representative if you wish to go undercover, otherwise just blow him to space dust.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'Very impressive, very impressive indeed. Hold at your current position for the transfer freighter to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters incoming.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'We have the data. You should return back to your superior officer and make a report.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'I will hold my ship steady. Dock with me when you are ready to make the transfer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', 'You allowed your transfer freighter to be destroyed? That was an expensive ship. You are going to have to answer to your commander about this failure.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', 'The transfer freighter will meet you at the location that we sent to your navigation computer. Proceed there with upmost caution.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'Glad to see you, pilot. We will begin docking momentarily.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Once the freighter has arrived, use the /dock command on it in order to transfer the data. Be on the look out for Rebel fighters who will probably attempt to stop this delivery from happening.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Transfer the Data'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'Remain in the Yavin system and deliver the data to the Imperial freighter. You will receive a navigation waypoint to the arrival location of the shuttle. Travel to this location and wait for the freighter to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Remain in the Yavin System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'When you arrive at the navigation waypoint to the freighter, wait for it to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Travel to the Arrival Location'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 20, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 Imperial High Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 23, 'title', 'Yavin System: Deliver the Data to the Imperial Freighter'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_1_b.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'Remain in the Yavin system and deliver the data. You will receive a navigation waypoint to a freighter that will pick up the data from you. Travel to this navigation waypoint and wait for the freighter to arrive. Once the freighter arrives, use the /dock command with the freighter targeted to transfer the data. Enemy fighters will attempt to stop this delivery from taking place. You must keep yourself, as well as the freighter, alive until you can complete the delivery.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 2, 'arrived_at_delivery', 'You have arrived at the drop off location. Stand by for the shuttle''s arrival.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 3, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 4, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters incoming.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 5, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 6, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 7, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 8, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 9, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Docking completed. We are transfering the information now.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 10, 'docking_started_delivery', 'Docking procedure beginning. Please stand by.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 11, 'failed_destroyed', 'You allowed your transfer shuttle to be destroyed? That was an expensive ship. You are going to have to answer to your commander about this failure.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 12, 'found_loc_d', 'Transmitting drop off cordinates to your nav computer now.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 13, 'hello_d', 'Good to see you, pilot. We will begin docking shortly. Your superior wants to talk to you once we are done here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 14, 'quest_dock2_d', 'Dock with the shuttle and transfer the plans.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 15, 'quest_dock2_t', 'Transfer the Plans'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 16, 'quest_location_d', 'A shuttle will meet you in the Naboo system. A navigation waypoint will be sent to you once you enter that system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 17, 'quest_location_t', 'Travel to the Naboo System'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 18, 'quest_rendezvous2_d', 'Follow the supplied navigation waypoint to the shuttle''s arrival location. Wait for the shuttle to arrive.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 19, 'quest_rendezvous2_t', 'Meet the Shuttle'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 20, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 Imperial High Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 21, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 23, 'title', 'Naboo System: Deliver the Plans'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/naboo_imperial_tier3_3_d.stf', 24, 'title_d', 'Travel to the Naboo system and deliver the Rebel plans to a command shuttle that will meet you there.'),
