('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 8, 'docking_complete_delivery', 'Alright. Remember scare those Yavin boys real good. With enough pressure they will be forced to fold their operation. Keep up the good work.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 9, 'docking_started_delivery', 'So everything is on schedule. A few more attacks and then you will reveal yourselves as the return of the...Massassi. Thats funny. Those fools will run for it and we take over mining Yavin.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 10, 'failed_destroyed', 'Vessel destroyed. No information gathered.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 11, 'found_loc_d', 'Corellia Deep Mining vessel located. Stand by for update of location.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 12, 'hello_d', 'Hey, they said you would be flying a strange ship but I didn''t expect this. The Massassi plan is working great...keep it up and Yavin will be ours. Dock with me and I will drop off your payment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 13, 'quest_dock2_d', 'The vessel was expecting mercenaries pretending to be the Massassi. They want to drop off payment for trying to chase the Yavin Mining Company out of the system.'),
