('string/en/spacequest/delivery_no_pickup/stn_yavin4_company_all_massassi_tier2_9.stf', 20, 'split_quest_alert', 'Enemy fighters detected. They must be the ships that were supposed to pick up the payment that was mistakenly given to you. Destroy them before they can get word of this error out.'),
