('string/en/spacequest/destroy/naboo_imperial_tier3_4.stf', 9, 'split_quest_alert', 'Imperial High Command:<We have a situation here! Our Imperial Command shuttle is under heavy assault. Immediately proceed to the following location and intercept the attacking fighters.>'),
