('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/dathomir_station_imp_destroy_duty_tier3.stf', 18, 'level_increase', 'You have done well, but that was just the beginning. The better pilots are still to come.'),
('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/dathomir_station_imp_destroy_duty_tier3.stf', 19, 'quest_d', 'Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.'),
('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/dathomir_station_imp_destroy_duty_tier3.stf', 20, 'quest_destroy_d', 'Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.'),
