('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/dathomir_station_imp_destroy_duty_tier3.stf', 22, 'quest_location_d', 'Some Rebel pilots tried to gain access to Dathomir by using a fake authorization code, but they made the mistake of celebrating while their comm channel was still open. Teach them a lesson.'),
