('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/lok_imperial_ss_1a.stf', 32, 'title_d', 'Travel to the Lok system and destroy Nym''s forces. Storm Squadron has been charged with weakening Nym''s influence in the Lok system. This will cause him to focus more on local security rather then assist the Rebels.'),
