('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/naboo_privateer_6.stf', 10, 'dd_boss_taunt_2', 'To us you''re just a anuiance, about to be squashed!'),
('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/naboo_privateer_6.stf', 11, 'dd_boss_taunt_3', 'Too bad you ran in to me so early in your career, as I mark it''s end!'),
