('string/en/spacequest/destroy_duty/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier4_1.stf', 20, 'quest_location_d', 'The Zynt''aia are not content with their little bit of the system and have spread quite quickly.  Updates to their location will be provided as you complete tasks.'),
