('string/en/spacequest/destroy_surpriseattack/dathomir_station_priv_storyquest_01_e.stf', 7, 'title_d', 'Onslaught: Survive the Kimogila ambush. They planned on some revenge after you defeated one of their leaders. Thwart their revenge and defeat your ambushers!'),
