('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 20, 'goodbye', 'We have all the information we need. I''m heading back to base. I suggest you do the same.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 21, 'goodbye_1', 'We have all the information we need. I''m heading back to base. I suggest you do the same.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 22, 'goodbye_2', 'We have all the information we need. I''m heading back to base. I suggest you do the same.'),
