('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 18, 'goodbye_1', 'The Royal Security Force never lets me down, thank you pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 19, 'goodbye_2', 'Bumpy ride but we made it in one piece thanks to you pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 20, 'goodbye_3', 'After this, I''m putting some defense weapons on my freighter. Thanks again my friend.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 21, 'goodbye_4', 'That was a close one and your the only reason we survived. Accept our gratitude pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 22, 'goodbye_5', 'I''d like to come back in a different ships and teach those scum a thing or two. Anyway, thank you for the help pilot!'),
