('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 36, 'reason_1', 'There you are. I hope you''re good at this...'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 37, 'reason_2', 'Thank you for escorting us pilot. We''ve had trouble out here before so, stay alert!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 38, 'reason_3', 'My job depends on me making this transport on time, so I hope you know what you are doing pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 39, 'reason_4', 'Perfect, a RSF pilot. Last time we didn''t get a escort and those Ay''Nat Legion pirates put my ship in the docks for a month!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 40, 'reason_5', 'Greetings pilot, good to see you. Let''s head for the surface quickly, I don''t want any incidents.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 41, 'shields_depleted', 'Our shields are down! If you don''t get rid of those pilotes, we are done for!'),
