('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 51, 'thanks_3', 'Splendid, finally a RSF pilot that know what he''s doing!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_15.stf', 52, 'thanks_4', 'Hahaha, they will think twice before attacking us again!'),
