('string/en/spacequest/escort/naboo_privateer_tier4_4b.stf', 40, 'split_quest_alert', '\\#pcontrast3 We are sending in an attack force based on the findings from our scanner.  They will need you even more this time, Black Sun activity has been non stop since our last encounter. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
