('string/en/spacequest/escort/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3_b.stf', 39, 'shields_depleted', 'We have lost power to our shields pilot. You''re going to have to ramp it up and take out those TIE''s.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/tatooine_rebel_tier3_3_b.stf', 40, 'split_quest_alert', 'Rebel Command: < You heard them pilot! We will provide you with coordinates where you can make a stand against any pursuers. >'),
