('string/en/spacequest/escort/yavin_rebel_16.stf', 53, 'title', 'Lok system: Escort the smuggler transporting Death Star data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort/yavin_rebel_16.stf', 54, 'title_d', 'Apparently the Death Star section from the freighter in the last mission pummeled through orbit and landed on Lok, still partly intact. Nym has found it and he''s willing to sell it to the Alliance. You have to travel to Lok and escort the Nym smuggler transporting it to the Rebel Space station in the Lok system.'),
