('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_imperial_tier2_escortduty.stf', 48, 'title_d', 'The Rebels have targeted the rich Imperial shipping lanes of Naboo as a good source of supplies. The recent attacks on Imperial cargo vessels has prompted the Emperor to demand all Imperial shipping is to have a fighter escort as it moves through the Naboo system.'),
