('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 11, 'failed_destroy', '\\#pcontrast3 RSF Command: < \\#pcontrast1 I can''t believe these scum destroyed a transport full of innocents. We will need a full report on this tragedy pilot. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 12, 'failed_protect', 'Transport had to escape through a emergency hyperspace jump pilot, there were just too many of the pirates.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 13, 'found_loc', 'We have a request from another transport with important cargo for a safe escort. New coordinates uploaded.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 14, 'goodbye_1', 'The Royal Security Force never lets me down, thank you pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 15, 'goodbye_2', 'Bumpy ride but we made it in one piece thanks to you pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 16, 'goodbye_3', 'After this, I''m putting some defense weapons on my freighter. Thanks again my friend.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 17, 'goodbye_4', 'That was a close one and your the only reason we survived. Accept our gratitude pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 18, 'goodbye_5', 'I''d like to come back in a different ships and teach those scum a thing or two. Anyway, thank you for the help pilot!'),
