('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 34, 'reason_4', 'Perfect, a RSF pilot. Last time we didn''t get an escort and those Black Sun pirates put my ship in the docks for a month!'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/naboo_privateer_7.stf', 35, 'reason_5', 'Greetings pilot, good to see you. Lets head for the surface quickly, I don''t want any incidents.'),
