('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/rori_station_imp_escort_duty_tier3.stf', 46, 'thanks_5', 'I just don''t understand why they would want to attack us like that.'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/rori_station_imp_escort_duty_tier3.stf', 47, 'title', 'Naboo System: Escort the Imperial Freighters Duty'),
('string/en/spacequest/escort_duty/rori_station_imp_escort_duty_tier3.stf', 48, 'title_d', 'The Empire has important supplies for our forces in the Naboo System. Our efforts there are important and should be disrupted by such petty problems as a lack of supplies.  You are to escort the supply freighters as they enter the system.'),
