('string/en/spacequest/inspect/naboo_imperial_tier3_4_b.stf', 11, 'split_quest_alert', 'Imperial High Command:<Looks like that ship had all the information that the colonel leaked to the aliance. We no longer need the rebel command ship intact. Stand by for coordinates to that ship.>'),
