('string/en/spacequest/inspect/naboo_imperial_tier4_1_a.stf', 15, 'title_d', 'A vessel''s signature has been spotted leaving the surface of Dathomir. Capture and inspect this vessel. The Inquisition is very interested to find out what is on board.'),
('string/en/spacequest/inspect/naboo_privateer_tier3_3a.stf', 1, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
