('string/en/spacequest/inspect/stn_dantooine_owner_smuggler_inspect01_tier2_1.stf', 11, 'split_quest_alert', 'The Phasotron Radium is now safely in your possession. Travel to Corellia and capture the Bez''ox Mentzz.'),
