('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_imperial_tier4_3_b.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert', 'Scans indicate a ship bearing the markings of an officer located. Disable and inspect that ship for their order data.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_imperial_tier4_3_b.stf', 13, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_imperial_tier4_3_b.stf', 14, 'title', 'Dathomir System: Patrol the Dathomir System'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_imperial_tier4_3_b.stf', 15, 'title_d', 'The drop ship pilot''s description of the enemy flight leader has peeked Insurgent''s interest. You are to patrol the region and look for any sign of the enemy. Be on the look out for any enemy officers that might have more information on the enemy flight leader.'),
