('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 25, 'quest_patrol_d', 'Waypoints of the search route will be provided to your nav computer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 26, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Patrol Waypoint'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 27, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 28, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 29, 'split_quest_alert', 'Our sensors have picked up one of the transports! Stand by for orders.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 31, 'title', 'Corellia system: Search for lost refugee transports.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_3.stf', 32, 'title_d', 'Search for lost refugee transports. We will provide you with waypoints to possible locations. Follow them and keep your eyes peeled. When you complete this mission, return to Captain Kreezo in Tyrena for your next assignment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 3, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 4, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 5, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 6, 'quest_location_d', 'Moving this massive fleet out of the Yavin system will be very difficult. There''s an enormous Imperial presence in this system. It is our hope that you will clear any small patrols of Imperial ships and the Empire will just take it as a minor attack and not send a big backup before the fleet can sneak out.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 7, 'quest_location_t', 'Yavin system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol_d', 'We are uploading the coordinates of the blockade run on the fly. Follow the waypoints as they appear and terminate any Imperial presence quickly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 9, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Follow the uploaded coordinates.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 10, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 11, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert', 'Rebel Command: < Scans show a Imperial patrol heading in your direction. Take them out before they spot our fleet. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 13, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 14, 'title', 'Yavin system: Clear escape route in front of escaping Rebel fleet.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_1_a.stf', 15, 'title_d', 'Even though the captured the spy, the presence of Imperial fighters shows that he had already managed to contact his contractors. We can''t take any chances and need to do a emergency evacuation of our fleet. You need to help by clearing out any Imperial ships in the escape route. Travel ahead of the fleet and purge any Imperial ships you come across.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 3, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 4, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 5, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 6, 'quest_location_d', 'The Endor system seem to have more Imperial fighters than asteroids lately so it doesn''t take a genius to guess what happened to Magenta squadron but we don''t leave anyone behind if we can help it.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 7, 'quest_location_t', 'Endor system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol_d', 'Search the designated area for any sign of what happened to Magenta squadron.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 9, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Last area of contact from Magenta squadron.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 10, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 11, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert', 'Tactical Computer: < Sensors show several incoming fighter vessels, their targeting systems is trying to lock on this vessel. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 13, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 14, 'title', 'Endor system: Investigate area where Magenta squadron vanished.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/corellia_rebel_tier3_4_a.stf', 15, 'title_d', 'We have lost contact with one of our squadrons and it is our hope that you can find them, or at least find out what happened to them. Search the area where they were last heard from.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 3, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 4, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 5, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 6, 'quest_location_d', 'Travel to the Naboo system and follow the patrol navigation waypoints. As you reach one navigation waypoint, you will get a new waypoint to the next location on the patrol route.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 7, 'quest_location_t', 'Travel to the Naboo System'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol1_d', 'Fly to the first stop on the patrol. This patrol path will lead you by the famed Imperial Intergalatic Lanes. The Lanes are used primarily by dignitaries and officers of the Empire. This area is well patrolled and trouble rarely happens in this region. Once you have reached your location you will receive a new Nav point leading to your next stop.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 9, 'quest_patrol1_t', 'Traveling to the First Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 10, 'quest_patrol2_d', 'Fly to the second stop on your patrol. You will fly past the Green Spaceway on your path to the second Nav point. The Green Spaceway is used primarily by passenger transports and freighter on their way to Naboo. This space lane is slightly less safe then the Imperial Intergalatic Lanes but is still far safer then anywhere along the Outer Rim.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 11, 'quest_patrol2_t', 'Traveling to the Second Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 12, 'quest_patrol3_d', 'Fly to the third stop on the patrol. If there is a rough part of Naboo, then the Undercart is it. Smugglers, pirates, and ne''er-do-wells often use this space lane to reach Naboo in order to bypass Imperial checkpoints. This is the most dangerous part of the patrol.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 13, 'quest_patrol3_t', 'Traveling to the Third Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 14, 'quest_patrol4_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 15, 'quest_patrol4_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 16, 'quest_patrol5_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 17, 'quest_patrol5_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 18, 'quest_patrol6_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 19, 'quest_patrol6_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 20, 'quest_patrol7_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 21, 'quest_patrol7_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 22, 'quest_patrol8_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 23, 'quest_patrol8_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 24, 'quest_patrol9_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 25, 'quest_patrol9_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 26, 'quest_patrol_d', 'When you reach a patrol waypoint you will receive a new one to your next location. Follow each of the patrol waypoints until you reach the end of your patrol.  This is the first of four special assignments given to you by Lt. Barn Sinkko. When you complete this mission, return to Lt. Barn Sinkko in Kadaara for your next assignment.  After you complete these four special assignments, Lt. Barn Sinkko will train you in a new Imperial Pilot skill.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 27, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Follow the Patrol Route'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 28, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 29, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 30, 'split_quest_alert', 'Warning! Enemy ships detected. Destroy the attacking enemy craft.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 31, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 32, 'title', 'Naboo System: Patrol the Naboo System'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_1.stf', 33, 'title_d', 'Run a patrol route in the Naboo system in order to keep a watch out for trouble. Once you arrive in the Naboo system you will receive a navigation waypoint to the first stop on the patrol route. Travel to this waypoint. Once you arrive the navigation waypoint will update to the next stop on the patrol route. Continue following these navigation waypoints until you have completed the patrol. When you complete this mission, return to Lt. Barn Sinkko in Kadaara for your next assignment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 2, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 3, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 4, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 5, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 6, 'quest_location_d', 'Travel to the Naboo system and follow the patrol navigation waypoints. As you reach one navigation waypoint, you will get a new waypoint to the next location on the patrol route.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 7, 'quest_location_t', 'Travel to the Naboo System'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol1_d', 'Travel along the Green Spaceway until you reach your first patrol point. You will receive a second Nav waypoint once you reach this location.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 9, 'quest_patrol1_t', 'Travel to the First Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 10, 'quest_patrol2_d', 'You will be traveling past an unused shipping lane on your way to the second patrol point. This shipping lane was closed down by the Empire to decrease the amount of checkpoints they had to man. This increased traffic along the other space lanes but decreased the cost to the Empire.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 11, 'quest_patrol2_t', 'Travel to the Second Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 12, 'quest_patrol3_d', 'As you travel to the third patrol point you will have to pass through an area in Naboo called Free Space. It is so named because patrols rarely come out this far and it has become a haven for illegal activity. Be on your guard as you pass through this region.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 13, 'quest_patrol3_t', 'Travel to the Third Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 14, 'quest_patrol4_d', 'The fourth Nav waypoint will take you closer to the Rori Lines. The Rori Lines connect commerical shipping between Naboo and it''s moon. A number of ships use this as an arrival location due to it''s relative safety and low traffic.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 15, 'quest_patrol4_t', 'Travel to the Fourth Stop'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 16, 'quest_patrol5_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_3.stf', 17, 'quest_patrol5_t', ''),
