('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_imperial_tier3_2_d.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert', 'Imperial High Command:<Calling all Imperial pilots. 3rd wing has encountered heavy rebel resistance. All available pilots are to proceed immediately to the following location.>'),
