('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_rebel_1.stf', 25, 'quest_patrol_d', 'When you reach a patrol waypoint you will receive a new one to your next location. Follow each of the patrol waypoints until you reach the end of your patrol.  This is the first of four special assignments given to you by V3-FX. When you complete this mission, return to V3-FX in Moenia for your next assignment.  After you complete these four special assignments, V3-FX will train you in a new Rebel Alliance Pilot skill.'),
