('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 31, 'title', 'Endor system: The search for the Blacklight base of operations.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/naboo_rebel_tier3_3.stf', 32, 'title_d', 'Apparently the Blacklight pirates base their operation out of the Endor system. The coordinates we got from the Blacklight pirate in your last mission weren''t exactly accurate though but we have set up a search grid for you to follow and scan.'),
