('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3a.stf', 5, 'quest_location_d', 'Fly an interrupted patrol to learn about the POI''s around the Endor System.  The first stop is the Onyx Beacon, frequented by the Black Light Pirates.'),
