('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3a.stf', 11, 'split_quest_alert', '\\#pcontrast3 Tactical Computer: < \\#pcontrast1 Hostile craft detected on attack vector. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3a.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3a.stf', 13, 'title', 'Endor System: The Grand Tour - Onyx Beacon'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3a.stf', 14, 'title_d', 'A phenomenon in stellar communications, "beacons" are locations in space caused by the interactions of radiation, bodies of high gravity and a few unidentified but key forces are used to collect relayed burst transmissions. These natural relay stations are popular among pirates, smugglers and over the last few years the Rebel Alliance due to the high difficulty in intercepting transmissions.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 1, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 2, 'autorewardbody', 'Completion Bonus: Linear Maisma (5000)'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 3, 'autorewardfrom', 'Endor Station'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 4, 'autorewardsubject', 'The Grand Tour'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 5, 'quest_location_d', 'Fly an interrupted patrol to learn about the POI''s around the Endor System.  The second stop is the Linear Miasma, a space cloud frequented by research scientists.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 6, 'quest_location_t', 'Linear Miasma'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 7, 'quest_patrol_d', 'Travel here to complete this portion of The Grand Tour'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Leg Destination'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 9, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 10, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 11, 'split_quest_alert', '\\#pcontrast3 Endor System: < \\#pcontrast1 Some researchers at the nebula have sent a distress signal, they are under attack by Zynt`aia Guardians.  Travel to their location and help ensure their safety by destroying the Zynt''aia. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 13, 'title', 'Endor System: The Grand Tour - Linear Miasma'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3c.stf', 14, 'title_d', 'The Linear Miasma is a large pocket of space gas comprised mostly of the half million tons of bacta that was released from the destruction of a KDY B-12 Transport ''Suveron''. The cause of detour and subsequent destruction of the transport was reportedly a critical reactor failure. What the Linear researchers study is the unique case of bacta surviving the vacuum of space. Though it is in no way suitable for medicinal use anymore, the cloud is still popular among research communities.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 1, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 2, 'autorewardbody', 'Completion Bonus: Declorian Territory (5000)'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 3, 'autorewardfrom', 'Endor Station'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 4, 'autorewardsubject', 'The Grand Tour'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 5, 'quest_location_d', 'Fly an interrupted patrol to learn about the POI''s around the Endor System.  The second stop is the Linear Miasma, a space cloud frequented by research scientists.'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 6, 'quest_location_t', 'Declorian Territory'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 7, 'quest_patrol_d', 'Travel here to complete this portion of The Grand Tour'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 8, 'quest_patrol_t', 'Leg Destination'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 9, 'quest_target_d', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 10, 'quest_target_t', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 11, 'split_quest_alert', '\\#pcontrast3 Endor Station: < \\#pcontrast1 The Zynt''aia are unlikely to be pleased with your presence in this area. Engage and destroy the pirates. \\#pcontrast3 >'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 12, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 13, 'title', 'Endor System: The Grand Tour - Declorian Territory'),
('string/en/spacequest/patrol/stn_endor_irs_imp_tier3_3e.stf', 14, 'title_d', 'The Declorian Territory is a rather unimportant part of the Endor System; far from any trade lanes it is frequented by the Zynt''aia spice clan. These spice pirates have taken an interest in the Linear Miasma, though the gains of this particular cloud to their spice operations are unknown. The Empire sends patrols to this area on occasion at the behest of the Linear Scientists to keep the pirates in check. Your mission is to make a foray into this are and engage the forces there.'),
