('string/en/spacequest/recovery/naboo_privateer_14.stf', 5, 'arrival_phase_2', '\\#pcontrast3 RSF Command: < \\#pcontrast1 The Ay''Nat Captain''s yacht has arrived. Disable the yacht and eliminate her escort! \\#pcontrast3 >'),
