('string/en/spacequest/recovery/tatooine_imperial_tier4_2_a.stf', 3, 'angry_disable', 'What! What have you done? We will not fall so easily.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/tatooine_imperial_tier4_2_a.stf', 4, 'arrival_phase_1', 'Scanning system for jump location. Once we have the location, proceed to that area, engage, and disable the transport.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/tatooine_imperial_tier4_2_a.stf', 5, 'arrival_phase_2', 'We have a lock. Sending the location to your nav computer. Capture that shuttle and return it to headquarters.'),
