('string/en/spacequest/recovery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_1.stf', 29, 'failed_destroy', 'Bah, we''re going to have to find a different way to infiltrate the fleet.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/tatooine_rebel_tier3_1.stf', 30, 'failed_escape', 'We lost contact with him, he must have reached territory scrambled by the Empire. Return to base pilot.'),
