('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 12, 'capture_complete', 'Tactical Computer: < Scans show target vessel self repairing and powering up. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 13, 'capture_phase_1', 'Rebel Commando Augustson here, we are fighting our way to the cockpit!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 14, 'capture_phase_2', 'We have taken control of the cockpit. Initiating self repair.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 15, 'capture_started', 'Rebel Command: < Capture initiated. Our men are attacking the crew now. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 16, 'complete', 'Alright, we can take it from here. Thanks for the help pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 17, 'escort_remaining', 'Tactical Computer: < Sensors still show armed fighter vessels in immediate area. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 18, 'escort_wiped_out', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 19, 'failed_destroy', 'Our own men were on that ship pilot! Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 20, 'failed_escape', 'They escaped! I hope we can get another chance at this. Report back to base pilot.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 21, 'hull_half', 'We''re falling apart pilot, we need your help!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 22, 'panic_1', 'Crap! Imperial fighters incoming!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 23, 'panic_2', 'TIE fighters heading our way, they don''t look too happy either!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 24, 'panic_3', 'Curse the Empire! TIE ships gunning for us!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 25, 'panic_4', 'I hope you''re good enough because here comes more TIE''s!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 26, 'panic_5', 'And I thought this was going to be a smooth run...'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 27, 'quest_disable_d', 'Disable the officers shuttle and let the Alliance commando team go to work while you protect the ship. To target specific components on a star ship, input the bracket commands ( ] or [ ) to your tactical computer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 28, 'quest_disable_t', 'Disable officers shuttle.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 29, 'quest_escort_d', 'Escort the kidnapped officer and the commando team to safety. The Empire will most likely send reinforcements to try and hunt you down so be ready for a battle!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 30, 'quest_escort_t', 'Escort the kidnapped officer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 31, 'quest_location_d', 'In addition to the dangers of the Imperial shuttles escort you have to try and avoid all the pirates that roam the Lok system. We will continually update the location of the Imperial shuttle as it''s moving but get to it quickly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 32, 'quest_location_t', 'Lok system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 33, 'quest_recover_d', 'The Rebel commando team is currently making short work of the crew on the Imperial shuttle. Protect it while they are fighting.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 34, 'quest_recover_t', 'Rebel commandos at their best.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 35, 'quest_update', 'Rebel Command: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 36, 'recovery_success', 'We got him. Thank you pilot, your service was invaluable, see you back on the ground!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 37, 'shields_depleted', 'Our shields are fried! Hang on everyone!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 38, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 39, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 40, 'target_disabled', 'Tactical Computer: < Scans show target vessel disabled. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 41, 'taunt_1', 'You thought we''d just let you fly out of here with one of your ships? Silly Rebels.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 42, 'taunt_2', 'Only one thing better than shooting down Rebels, shooting down stupid Rebels!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 43, 'taunt_3', 'Crash and burn Rebel fool, crash and burn!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 44, 'taunt_4', 'This day just got a whole lot better. Time to get some Rebel kill marks!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 45, 'taunt_5', 'If you give up now, we''ll spare your life Rebel.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 46, 'thanks_1', 'Way to go pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 47, 'thanks_2', 'We''re almost home free, hang in there pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 48, 'thanks_3', 'Nice work pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 49, 'thanks_4', 'Wohoo! Wish I could be out there with you pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 50, 'thanks_5', 'That will teach those Imperial scum! Keep it up pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 51, 'title', 'Lok system: Kidnap Imperial officer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/viopa_rebel_3.stf', 52, 'title_d', 'We have finished analyzing the data you recovered and have learned of several routes of some sort of vessels that are approaching Lok. The information is vague but can''t be ignored. To get more of an understanding we need you to kidnap an Imperial officer. We have planted some of our spies on the officer''s shuttle,  they need your help in disabling the ship so they can take control of it and then escort it out of the area.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 2, 'abort', 'I can''t abort now, your leaving me to my death...'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 3, 'angry_disable', 'You will not get away with this, Rebel scum!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 4, 'arrival_phase_1', 'The Imperial prison transport should arrive any second now.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 5, 'arrival_phase_2', 'The Imperial prison ship has arrived. Intercept it at this location and disable it!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 6, 'assigned_delayed', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 7, 'attack_notify', 'Tactical Computer: < Incoming fighter vessels. Scans show weapons armed. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 8, 'attack_stopped', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 9, 'autorewardbody', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 10, 'autorewardfrom', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 11, 'autorewardsubject', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 12, 'capture_complete', 'Tactical Computer: < Scans show target vessel self repairing and powering up. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 13, 'capture_phase_1', 'We are overpowering the guards. I''m heading for the bridge!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 14, 'capture_phase_2', 'I''ve taken the bridge with the help of some other prisoners. I''m trying to figure out the flight controls of this baby now.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 15, 'capture_started', 'Tactical Computer: < Hack sequence complete. All prison cells on board target vessel unlocked. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 16, 'complete', 'Navigation course plotted. Initiating jump to lightspeed, heading for Lok. Thank you my friend!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 17, 'escort_remaining', 'Tactical Computer: < Sensors still show armed fighter vessels in immediate area. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 18, 'escort_wiped_out', 'Tactical Computer: < No more fighter vessels within sensor range. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 19, 'failed_destroy', 'The prison transport is destroyed! All those lives... Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 20, 'failed_escape', 'They got away! This might be the end of this operation. Return to base immediately!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 21, 'hull_half', 'We''re taking massive damage! Better get them now pilot, we won''t last long!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 22, 'panic_1', 'Imperial fools incoming! I can''t help much in this ship so you better be good pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 23, 'panic_2', 'I was hoping we could slip away quietly, what was I thinking.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 24, 'panic_3', 'Here they come!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 25, 'panic_4', 'I wonder if they won''t shoot us, since we have some of their own onboard...'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 26, 'panic_5', 'More TIE fighters, help us pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 27, 'quest_disable_d', 'Take out the engines or reactor of the ship to stop it in its tracks. Your droid will then hack the onboard computer and open the prison cells. To target specific components on a star ship, input the bracket commands ( ] or [ ) to your tactical computer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 28, 'quest_disable_t', 'Disable the transport.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 29, 'quest_escort_d', 'Help the prisoners get to the safety of the Rebel base. Escort them and destroy any enemy presence near their ship.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 30, 'quest_escort_t', 'Get the shuttle to safety.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 31, 'quest_location_d', 'The prison ship is travelling through a dangerous part of the Yavin system and it will only get worse the closer to the Imperial fleet he gets.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 32, 'quest_location_t', 'Yavin system.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 33, 'quest_recover_d', 'The prison cells have been unlocked, it''s now in the hands of the prisoners to take control of the shuttle. If any enemy fighters are in the area, try to take them out quickly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 34, 'quest_recover_t', 'Out of your hands.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 35, 'quest_update', 'Brother Vrovel: < %TO >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 36, 'recovery_success', 'The smuggler and the rest of the prisoners are safe. Great job pilot!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 37, 'shields_depleted', 'Well no more shields over here, this is going to get bumpy!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 38, 'split_quest_alert', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 39, 'split_quest_alert_fail', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 40, 'target_disabled', 'Tactical Computer: < Scans show target vessel disabled. Initiating hack sequence to unlock prison cells. >'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 41, 'taunt_1', 'You have 10 seconds to shut down your engines and surrender!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 42, 'taunt_2', 'Imperial law demands your execution.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 43, 'taunt_3', 'Assisting convicted criminals is a crime punishable by death.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 44, 'taunt_4', 'Show no mercy boys!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 45, 'taunt_5', 'You Rebels just made a huge mistake!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 46, 'thanks_1', 'Wohoo! I give this to the Alliance, they sure hire good pilots!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 47, 'thanks_2', 'Not bad, not bad at all...'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 48, 'thanks_3', 'Another score for the good guys!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 49, 'thanks_4', 'Well, you showed them...'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 50, 'thanks_5', 'I owe you a big one pilot, nice job!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 51, 'title', 'Yavin system: Rescue the smuggler.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery/vortex_mission_3.stf', 52, 'title_d', 'The smuggler is currently being transported to the Yavin Imperial fleet for interrogation. It is your duty to make sure that he never gets there. Your first option is to disable the prison vessel and hack it''s computer to open the prisoners cells so they can take over the ship. Your second option, well hopefully it will never come to that.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 2, 'abort', 'That''s right. You had better let us go. We work for very important people.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 3, 'angry_disable', ''),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 4, 'arrival_phase_1', 'Tracking ship using an illegal flight plan. Once we have a lock on it, disable the ship, reset it autopilot, and bring it back into Imperial control.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 5, 'arrival_phase_2', 'Location sent to your nav computer. Proceed as planned.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 6, 'attack_notify', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters detected.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 7, 'attack_stopped', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Enemy fighters eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 8, 'capture_complete', 'Autopilot reprogrammed. Ship heading to Imperial space.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 9, 'capture_phase_1', 'You will be sorry. Once our leaders hear about this they will retaliate.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 10, 'capture_phase_1_1', 'You will be sorry. Once our leaders hear about this they will retaliate.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 11, 'capture_phase_1_2', 'I have a prediction...you are not going to live long for this.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 12, 'capture_phase_1_3', 'Hey, are you sure you want to do this?'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 13, 'capture_phase_1_4', 'Wait a minute...I thought we were the ones who were supposed to be capturing ships.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 14, 'capture_phase_1_5', 'I don''t think that you really want to do this.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 15, 'capture_phase_2', 'You are really asking for it. You won''t know what hit you until it is too late.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 16, 'capture_phase_2_1', 'You are really asking for it. You won''t know what hit you until it is too late.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 17, 'capture_phase_2_2', 'My friends are coming to destroy you.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 18, 'capture_phase_2_3', 'You will never win, so why try?'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 19, 'capture_phase_2_4', 'You might have taken me but keeping me is another story.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 20, 'capture_phase_2_5', 'Time for you to pay for what you have done.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 21, 'capture_started', 'Beginning autopilot reprogramming. Stand by.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 22, 'complete', 'Good job. That should send them a message that we will not remain idle while they attack us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 23, 'complete_1', 'Nice work, pilot. We have recovered some of what the Velocity mercs stole from us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 24, 'complete_2', 'Good job. That should send them a message that we will not remain idle while they attack us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 25, 'complete_3', 'Nice work, pilot. We have recovered some of what the Velocity mercs stole from us.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 26, 'complete_4', 'Good job. That should send them a message that we will not remain idle while they attack us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 27, 'complete_5', 'Good job. That should send them a message that we will not remain idle while they attack us.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 28, 'escort_remaining', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <%DI enemy fighter escorts remaining.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 29, 'escort_wiped_out', '\\#pcontrast1 Tactical Computer:\\#pcontrast3 <Escorts eliminated.>'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 30, 'failed_destroy', 'Your orders were to capture that ship let it be destroyed. Report back immediately.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 31, 'failed_escape', 'You let that ship escape. That is not acceptable. Report back immediately.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 32, 'panic_1', 'Here they come, just like I knew they would.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 33, 'panic_2', 'Time for you to pay for messing with the Velocity.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 34, 'panic_3', 'See you on the other side.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 35, 'panic_4', 'The Velocity never lets anything slip through their fingers.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 36, 'panic_5', 'When will you Imperials ever learn? You cannot control everything.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 37, 'quest_d', 'The Velocity mercenaries have been striking at Imperial supply lines with regularity. Imperial command feels that it is time to return the favor. You are tasked with capturing and returning enemy transport vessels in order to recover what was stolen from the Empire.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 38, 'quest_disable_d', 'Once the smuggler is intercepted, target its engines and disable the vessel. Once its engines are at 0%, move in close to begin the capture process.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 39, 'quest_disable_t', 'Disable the Velocity Smuggler'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 40, 'quest_escort_d', 'Follow and protect the captured Velocity smuggler as it moves to its destination. Keep an eye out for any enemy fighters that might try to destroy or recapture this vessel.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 41, 'quest_escort_t', 'Escort the Velocity Smuggler'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 42, 'quest_location_d', 'Travel to the Dantooine system and capture the Velocity smuggler. A navigation waypoint of the smugglers most recent location will be given to you when you enter the system. This waypoint will update as the smuggler moves through the system. Follow these waypoints and intercept the smuggler.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 43, 'quest_location_t', 'Travel to the Dantooine System'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 44, 'quest_recover_d', 'Move in close to the disabled smuggler and wait for the capture process to start. This may take a few minutes to begin. You will be vulnerable while in this position so it is a good idea to take out any escort fighters the smuggler might have with him first.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 45, 'quest_recover_t', 'Capture the Velocity Smuggler'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 46, 'quest_t', 'Capturing Velocity Supply Vessels'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 47, 'quest_update', '\\#pcontrast1 Black Epsilon Command:\\#pcontrast3 <%TO>'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 48, 'recovery_success', 'Nice work, pilot. You have recovered the Emperor a very nice prize. Report back to your superior for debriefing or wait for another capture assignment.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 49, 'target_disabled', 'The smuggler''s engines are offline. Move in close to the vessel and wait for its autopilot to be reprogramed.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 50, 'taunt_1', 'If we can''t have that freighter, no one will.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 51, 'taunt_2', 'You will pay for that!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 52, 'taunt_3', 'You Imperials are all the same, weak and cowardly.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 53, 'taunt_4', 'How does it feel to be drawing your last breath?'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 54, 'taunt_5', 'Are you crying? There is no crying in space!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 55, 'thanks_1', 'They will be back.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 56, 'thanks_2', 'You are better then you look, I will admit that.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 57, 'thanks_3', 'Your getting worried now, aren''t you?'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 58, 'thanks_4', 'If I were you, I would just give up now. But then again, I have half a brain.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 59, 'thanks_5', '*sniff* *sniff* You reek of fear!'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 60, 'title', 'Dantooine System: Capture the Velocity Smuggler Transports Duty'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/corellia_imperial_tier4_3.stf', 61, 'title_d', 'Travel to the Dantooine system and capture the Velocity Smuggler. Once in the system you will receive a navigation waypoint to the smugglers most recent location. This navigation waypoint will update as the smuggler moves through the system. You must intercept the smuggler before he is able to leave the system. Once you have reached the smuggler, disable it by targeting the vessels engines. After you have the vessel disabled,  move in close and wait for the capture process to begin. Now that the vessel is captured, escort it through the system and back into Imperial hands. After this is completed you will receive a new navigation waypoint to another Velocity smuggler that needs to be captured. This is a duty mission and can be quit at any time. Simply abort the mission or leave the system in order to stop the mission.'),
