('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/naboo_imperial_tier2_recoveryduty.stf', 24, 'complete_2', 'Nice work, pilot. The captured mining vessel is in Imperial hands. Report back to your superior or wait for another target vessel.'),
('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/naboo_imperial_tier2_recoveryduty.stf', 25, 'complete_3', 'Nice work, pilot. The captured mining vessel is in Imperial hands. Report back to your superior or wait for another target vessel.'),
