('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/naboo_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 38, 'quest_escort_d', 'Escort the stolen shuttle to safety. The droid is calculating the jump to hyperspace and you need to keep the Imperial fighters that will undoubtedly chase you, away from the shuttle.'),
