('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/naboo_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 42, 'quest_recover_d', 'The droid is attempting to gain control of the shuttle. While he''s doing that, you need to keep the ship safe from Imperial forces. They will rather blow up their ship than have it stolen.'),
