('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/naboo_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 58, 'title_d', 'The Imperial Inquisition is transporting sensitive data on heavily guarded shuttles across the Endor system. We have some new Space Assault Droids in our possession and if we can steal some of these vessels it will be a major victory in our campaign against the Inquisition. When you feel that you have exhausted your ship, yourself or that you have enough experience to continue your training, you can return to base at anytime.'),
