('string/en/spacequest/recovery_duty/stn_dantooine_owner_smuggler_recoveryduty_tier2_1.stf', 4, 'arrival_phase_2', 'Ok, there it is. Capture it and send it back to Dantooine. I will have another ship to meet it on this side.'),
