('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 33, 'rescue_phase_1_3', 'I thought you were the Empire coming to collect me. Good to see you!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 34, 'rescue_phase_1_4', 'Nice to see you pilot, was starting to get cold out here.'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 35, 'rescue_phase_1_5', 'I''ve been trying to repair this piece of junk for the last four hours. Glad you''re here.'),
