('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 39, 'rescue_phase_2_4', 'I can''t wait to get some ground under my feet.'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 40, 'rescue_phase_2_5', 'Looks like that Imperial prison cell will have to find another customer.'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 41, 'taunt_1', 'You''re not going anywhere Rebels!'),
