('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 45, 'taunt_5', 'By trying to escape, you just sealed your fate Rebels!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 46, 'thanks_1', 'Take that, Imperial filth!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 47, 'thanks_2', 'The Empire just can''t do anything right can they?'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 48, 'thanks_3', 'Wohoo, bring ''em on, we''ll take ''em all!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 49, 'thanks_4', 'That''s the best you got? Imperial scum!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 50, 'thanks_5', 'Glad you''re here pilot, that was hairy!'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 51, 'title', 'Dantooine system: Duty mission: Rescue disabled Rebel ships.'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/corellia_rebel_tier4_1.stf', 52, 'title_d', 'An Imperial ambush nearly decimated a Rebel fleet in the Dantooine system. There are a few survivors out there still drifting and the Empire has sent capital ships to the location to capture them. You and some of the other members of our squad is to proceed to the area and help the disabled ships with repairs and then escort them to safety. When you feel that you have exhausted your ship, yourself or that you have enough experience to continue your training, you can return to base at anytime.'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/naboo_imperial_tier4_4.stf', 1, 'Quest Log Data', 'Text'),
('string/en/spacequest/rescue_duty/naboo_imperial_tier4_4.stf', 2, 'abort', 'You can''t just leave us out here. We need your protection.'),
