('string/en/spacequest/space_battle/corellia_imperial_tier3_2_c.stf', 24, 'title', 'Yavin System: Help the Hutts Battle Nym''s Forces'),
('string/en/spacequest/space_battle/corellia_imperial_tier3_2_c.stf', 25, 'title_d', 'Remain in the Yavin system and help the Hutts beat Nym in a battle. You will receive a navigation waypoint to the place where the battle is going to take place. Travel to this location and wait for the arrival of the Hutts and Nym''s men. When the battle is joined, assist the Hutts on destroying Nym''s men before Nym''s men can wipe out the Hutts. If all of the Hutts die then you will have lost the battle. Be very careful because the Hutts are not friendly and will fire on you.'),
