('string/en/spacequest/space_battle/corellia_imperial_tier4_4_c.stf', 22, 'split_quest_alert', 'Anderlock sent out a distress signal in his last moment. Tracing signal reveals that the vessel that recieved the signal is attempting to leave the sector. Track and destroy this vessel.'),
