('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 1, 'adv_deflector_shields', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA Mark IV deflector shield generator.  Shield generators provide a first line of defense against incoming energy weapons.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 2, 'adv_durasteel_plating', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA Mark IV durasteel alloy plating that provides superior protection for small starfighters like the X-Wing and the Z95 Headhunter.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 3, 'adv_exhaust', 'An advanced exhaust system for a starfighter engine.  A well built exhaust system can significantly affect engine performance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 4, 'adv_fuel_regulation', 'An advanced fuel regulation system for a starfighter engine.  The regulation system affects the fuel mixture burned by the sublight drives, so a well built system will positively affect engine performance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 5, 'advanced_capacitor_battery', 'An advanced starship weapon capacitor battery.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 6, 'advanced_fuel_ignition', 'An advanced booster fuel ignition system.  A component used in the production of high quality starship boosters.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 7, 'advanced_fusion_core', 'An advanced fusion core.  A well built fusion core affects the generation rate of a reactor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 8, 'advanced_power_distributor', 'An advanced reactor power distributor.  As one might expect from the name, this system distributes energy generated by the reactor to the components in a ship that require it.  '),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 9, 'advanced_projector_unit', 'An advanced projector unit.  This is the system that projects the generated shields to the parts of the ship that require it.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 10, 'advanced_recharge_module', 'An advanced recharge module for a starship weapon capacitor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 11, 'analysis_tool', 'This tool is used by Reverse Engineers to analyze starship components.  All looted ship components have a reverse engineering level---placing that number of identical components in this tool, then using the tool, will result in the creation of a starship component superior in quality to the ones consumed in the process.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 12, 'armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 13, 'armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 14, 'armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk3', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 15, 'armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk4', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 16, 'armor_effectiveness_intensifier_mk5', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapons.  This component boosts the armor effectiveness of the weapon, but decreases the shield effectiveness.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 17, 'armor_reinforcement_panel_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter armor.  Using these panels will strengthen the armor, but will make your starfighter heavier.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 18, 'armor_reinforcement_panel_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter armor.  Using these panels will strengthen the armor, but will make your starfighter heavier.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 19, 'armor_reinforcement_panel_mk3', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter armor.  Using these panels will strengthen the armor, but will make your starfighter heavier.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 20, 'armor_reinforcement_panel_mk4', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter armor.  Using these panels will strengthen the armor, but will make your starfighter heavier.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 21, 'armor_reinforcement_panel_mk5', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter armor.  Using these panels will strengthen the armor, but will make your starfighter heavier.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 22, 'awing_chassis_token', 'Alliance RZ-1 A-wing Starfighter \nBy far the fastest starfighter used in the Galactic Civil War, the compact A-wing is the Rebel Alliance''s response to the Empire''s growing number of TIE fighters and TIE variants. Because of its speed, the A-wing excels at hit-and-run missions, long-range patrols and reconnaissance, and surgical strikes against large starships. A stock A-wing''s speed is provided by two powerful Novaldex J-77 "Event Horizon" engines. A combination of adjustable thrust-vector controls built into each engine and thruster-control jets located between the engines supply the vehicle''s famed maneuverability. Unfortunately, the A-wing''s controls are notoriously sensitive and few pilots can handle the craft at top speed. The A-wing relies on its speed and agility in combat. Its armament is relatively weak, consisting of two wing-mounted blaster cannons. A-wings require constant maintenance, and the Alliance has found it extremely difficult to keep a squadron of A-wings operational for any length of time. Despite this, the A-wing is quickly becoming one of the galaxy''s most prominent interceptor fighters.\n'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 23, 'blacksun_heavy_chassis_token', 'TransGalMeg "Rihkxyrk" (rik-zerk) Attack Ship\nBeing a relatively sluggish ship hasn''t made the "Rihkxyrk" a push-over. Quite the contrary. The defenses and weapon load of most "Rihkxyrk" assault fighters is frightening, and is their hallmark. It can be very demoralizing to line up an "Rihkxyrk" in your sights and salvo off missiles and cannon pulses only to see them sloughed off by heavy-duty shielding systems and thick, heavy armor. Most "Rihkxyrk" pilots are an unflappable group, developing a high level of confidence in themselves and their machines after wading through heavy fire and coming through undamaged.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 24, 'blacksun_light_chassis_token', 'TransGalMeg "Kihraxz" (ki-Rax) Assault Fighter\nThe "Kihraxz" Assault Fighter is able to quickly close with and surgically attack its target before they are aware. TransGalMeg''s design emphasis for this ship was on speed, and as a result defenses are at a premium and weapons loadout is reduced. This might be seen as a dire limitation, but the maneuverability of the ship is such that it can normally avoid attacks that would not be able to withstand. Although a cheaper ship, a number of pilots continue to fly the "Kihraxz" even though they could afford something larger, simply because the ship''s performance suits their personal combat style.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 25, 'blacksun_medium_chassis_token', 'TransGalMeg "Ixiyen" (ix-Ehn) Fast Attack Craft\n\nThe "Ixiyen" is designed to be a dominant force in the average fighter-on-fighter confrontation. It is also armed and protected well enough to be able to harry much larger ships. Although not operated in large numbers by any governmental organizations, it isn''t for lack of quality and performance. The "Ixiyen" is a deadly opponent and capable of holding its own against most of the front-line combat craft currently in existence.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 26, 'blaster_deflection_layer', 'A layer in advanced starfighter armor that helps reflect incoming blaster fire off the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 27, 'booster_mk1', 'Equipment Certification Level: 1\n\nA Mark I starship booster.  Boosters can be used for an extra, temporary burst of speed.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 28, 'booster_mk2', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA Mark II starship booster.  Boosters can be used for an extra, temporary burst of speed.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 29, 'booster_mk3', 'Equipment Certification Level: 5\n\nA Mark III starship booster.  Boosters can be used for an extra, temporary burst of speed.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 30, 'booster_mk4', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA Mark IV starship booster.  Boosters can be used for an extra, temporary burst of speed.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 31, 'booster_mk5', 'Equipment Certification Level: 9\n\nA Mark V starship booster.  Boosters can be used for an extra, temporary burst of speed.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 32, 'booster_overdriver_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  An overdriver gives a booster a higher speed and acceleration, but increases the overall mass of the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 33, 'booster_overdriver_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  An overdriver gives a booster a higher speed and acceleration, but increases the overall mass of the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 34, 'booster_overdriver_mk3', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  An overdriver gives a booster a higher speed and acceleration, but increases the overall mass of the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 35, 'booster_overdriver_mk4', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  An overdriver gives a booster a higher speed and acceleration, but increases the overall mass of the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 36, 'booster_overdriver_mk5', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  An overdriver gives a booster a higher speed and acceleration, but increases the overall mass of the ship.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 37, 'bwing_chassis_token', 'B-Wing\nPersonally designed by Commander Ackbar with the help of skilled Verpine shipbuilders as part of the Shantipole Project, the B-wing has proved one the most versatile starfighters in the galaxy. Initially, only one B-wing was produced to test the ship''s unique design. This single starfighter was then sent on a test mission to destroy an entire TIE fighter staging area on Yunkor IX. The B-wing succeeded, and the Rebellion commissioned a full squadron of the starfighters.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 38, 'capacitor_mk1', 'Equipment Certification Level: 1\n\nA Mark I weapon capacitor.  Capacitors are used to the store the energy that powers starfighter weapon systems.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 39, 'capacitor_mk2', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA Mark II weapon capacitor.  Capacitors are used to the store the energy that powers starfighter weapon systems.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 40, 'capacitor_mk3', 'Equipment Certification Level: 5\n\nA Mark III weapon capacitor.  Capacitors are used to the store the energy that powers starfighter weapon systems.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 41, 'capacitor_mk4', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA Mark IV weapon capacitor.  Capacitors are used to the store the energy that powers starfighter weapon systems.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 42, 'capacitor_mk5', 'Equipment Certification Level: 9\n\nA Mark V weapon capacitor.  Capacitors are used to the store the energy that powers starfighter weapon systems.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 43, 'ddi_mk1', 'Equipment Certification Level: 1\n\nA Mark I Droid Interface.  Droid interfaces are the link between the systems of a starfighter and the astromech droid or flight computer installed in them.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 44, 'ddi_mk2', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA Mark II Droid Interface.  Droid interfaces are the link between the systems of a starfighter and the astromech droid or flight computer installed in them.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 45, 'ddi_mk3', 'Equipment Certification Level: 5\n\nA Mark III Droid Interface.  Droid interfaces are the link between the systems of a starfighter and the astromech droid or flight computer installed in them.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 46, 'ddi_mk4', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA Mark IV Droid Interface.  Droid interfaces are the link between the systems of a starfighter and the astromech droid or flight computer installed in them.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 47, 'ddi_mk5', 'Equipment Certification Level: 9\n\nA Mark V Droid Interface.  Droid interfaces are the link between the systems of a starfighter and the astromech droid or flight computer installed in them.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 48, 'decimator_chassis_token', 'VT49 Decimator\n\nThe VT49 Decimator is most correctly classified as an Assault ship. It is heavily armed and armored, and built to carry light to medium loads into dangerous places. Its form follows its function, and its shape offers a relatively small target with no large fins or wings as seen in some of the less combat-oriented craft of the Empire, such as the Lambda-class shuttle. Armor and deflector shielding is particularly heavy, and the weapons load-out is fearsome and includes turrets capable of engaging any target fast enough to out-maneuver the VT49.\n'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 49, 'deflector_shields', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA Mark II deflector shield generator.  Shield generators provide a first line of defense against incoming energy weapons.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 50, 'droid_brain_upgrade_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter droid interfaces.   This upgrade increases the command speed of the interface, but also increases the energy maintenance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 51, 'droid_brain_upgrade_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter droid interfaces.   This upgrade increases the command speed of the interface, but also increases the energy maintenance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 52, 'droid_brain_upgrade_mk3', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter droid interfaces.   This upgrade increases the command speed of the interface, but also increases the energy maintenance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 53, 'droid_brain_upgrade_mk4', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter droid interfaces.   This upgrade increases the command speed of the interface, but also increases the energy maintenance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 54, 'droid_brain_upgrade_mk5', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter droid interfaces.   This upgrade increases the command speed of the interface, but also increases the energy maintenance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 55, 'durasteel_panel', 'An armored panel made of a strong durasteel alloy.  This is the basic component in most starfighter armor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 56, 'durasteel_plating', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nMark II durasteel plating fit for most small starfighters.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 57, 'energy_absorption_layer', 'A layer of material designed to soften the impact of energy weapons on a starfighter''s hull.  '),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 58, 'energy_saver_battery_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapon capacitors.  This battery reduces the energy maintenance of the capacitor, but decreases the amount of energy the capacitor can store.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 59, 'energy_saver_battery_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapon capacitors.  This battery reduces the energy maintenance of the capacitor, but decreases the amount of energy the capacitor can store.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 60, 'energy_saver_battery_mk3', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapon capacitors.  This battery reduces the energy maintenance of the capacitor, but decreases the amount of energy the capacitor can store.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 61, 'energy_saver_battery_mk4', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapon capacitors.  This battery reduces the energy maintenance of the capacitor, but decreases the amount of energy the capacitor can store.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 62, 'energy_saver_battery_mk5', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter weapon capacitors.  This battery reduces the energy maintenance of the capacitor, but decreases the amount of energy the capacitor can store.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 63, 'eng_mk1', 'Equipment Certification Level: 1\n\nA mark I starfighter engine.  Engines of this size are good for rookie pilots not comfortable with high performance models, or for pilots who want to concentrate their resources on higher firepower.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 64, 'eng_mk2', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA mark II starfighter engine.  Bigger and faster than the Mark I models.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 65, 'eng_mk3', 'Equipment Certification Level: 5\n\nA mark III starfighter engine.  This is a midsize engine that can be tweaked for some serious speed.  It is still outclassed in size and speed by higher model engines, but for pilots working with smaller reactors and chassis, the mark III is a good choice.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 66, 'eng_mk4', 'Equipment Certification Level: 7\n\nA mark IV starfighter engine.  A solid-performing midsize engine.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 67, 'eng_mk5', 'Equipment Certification Level: 9\n\nA mark V starfigher engine.  A solid-performing midsize engine.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 68, 'engine_limiter_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter engines.  A limiter decreases energy maintenance, but negatively impacts acceleration and speed.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 69, 'engine_limiter_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter engines.  A limiter decreases energy maintenance, but negatively impacts acceleration and speed.'),
