('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 90, 'extended_life_fuel_cell_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  The extended life fuel cell increases the amount of energy a booster can store, but the energy recharges slower.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 91, 'extended_life_fuel_cell_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  The extended life fuel cell increases the amount of energy a booster can store, but the energy recharges slower.'),
