('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 95, 'fast_charge_fuel_cell_mk1', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  A fast charge fuel cell recharges faster than other fuel cells, but can store less energy overall.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 96, 'fast_charge_fuel_cell_mk2', 'This is a component used in the manufacture of starfighter boosters.  A fast charge fuel cell recharges faster than other fuel cells, but can store less energy overall.'),
