('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 205, 'standard_capacitor_battery', 'A standard grade starship weapon capacitor battery.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 206, 'standard_fuel_ignition', 'A standard booster fuel ignition system.  A component used in the production of starship boosters.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 207, 'standard_fusion_core', 'A standard fusion core.  A well built fusion core affects the generation rate of a reactor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 208, 'standard_power_distributor', 'As one might expect from the name, this system distributes energy generated by the reactor to the components in a ship that require it.  '),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 209, 'standard_projector_unit', 'A standard projector unit.  This is the system that projects the generated shields to the parts of the ship that require it.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 210, 'standard_recharge_module', 'A standard grade recharge module for a starship weapon capacitor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 211, 'std_exhaust', 'A standard exhaust system for a starfighter engine.  A well built exhaust system can significantly affect engine performance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 212, 'std_fuel_regulation', 'An advanced fuel regulation system for a starfighter engine.  The regulation system affects the fuel mixture burned by the sublight drives, so a well built system will positively affect engine performance.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 213, 'texture_kit_s01', 'This kit can change the paint style of a starfighter.\n\nRESTRICTIONS:  Imperial ships may not be re-textured.'),
