('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 257, 'wpn_imagerec_missile', 'A pack of sophisticated Image-Rec missiles. These missiles have an advanced target identification and tracking computer loaded on board. Image-Rec missiles are able to track longer and avoid standard countermeasures. The missile is moderately effective against shields and armor.'),
('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 258, 'wpn_imagerec_missile_mk1', 'A pack of image-rec missiles.  These can be loaded into a missile launcher by dragging them onto the launcher.'),
