('string/en/space_crafting_d.stf', 282, 'wpn_medium_blaster', 'Equipment Certification Level: 3\n\nA mid-grade starship blaster.  Blasters are effective in disabling shield projectors and generators, but are also effective against armor plating on most starships.'),
