('string/en/space_trainer.stf', 1, 'rebel_trainer_1', 'Rebel Trainer'),
('string/en/space_trainer.stf', 2, 'rebel_trainer_2', 'Other Rebel Trainer'),
('string/en/spam.stf', 1, 'loot_item_self', 'You loot %TU from %TT.'),
('string/en/spam.stf', 2, 'loot_item_other', '%TU looted %TT from %TO.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Ah, it is one of your kind. Your species are prone to violent actions more so than mine, thus you may want to be part of this, yes? It will help your people and mine, rest assured. Shall I continue?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'A group of extremists calling themselves the Afarathu have made a pact with the Tribunals. Many of us know that this will soon make the Afarathu cocky, and soon they will begin raiding everyone with their stolen weapons. They need to be shown that might leads to violence. You will show them, yes? Good.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Yes, as are many of our people, as well. Our politics are far more heated than yours are, with the Empire controlling all. A good day to you, pacifist.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Your people have a history according to your historians, if I know correctly. Some of my sisters only understand communication through violence.  Therefore, you would be an excellent moderator. Shall I continue?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'So be it. Farewell.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find the Afarathu Cult lair?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'I''m listening. Go on.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No thanks. I''m a pacifist.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'What do you mean ''prone to violent actions''?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I changed my mind. I''m not going.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am on my way.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'This system of caves house an extremist group of Selonians who are known to raid all manner of people.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_afarathucave.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Afarathu Cave'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Hey you! Have you heard the new song playing in the cantina? "The Empire''s Slave" is a band of musicians who have been singing about bringing down all kinds of government. Do you want to know where they might be playing next?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'They were saying that anyone who wants to help destroy all governments should show up at the Patriots'' base of operations. Watch out, though, because they probably might think you work for either the Empire or the Rebellion.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Yeah, you''re probably one of those Imperials, or worse yet, one of those Rebels. You''re just like those guys they were talking about. Well, you can go off and be a slave to them? I know I''m not!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'There''s a group of guys who call themselves the Patriots, right? They''re a bunch of Drall like me who want to smash every government to the ground, and they formed a band to spread the message! They are sooo wizard!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'So be it. Farewell.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find the Drall Patriots'' hideout?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Sure, tell me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'Nope, not interested.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Who is "The Empire''s Slave"?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'No. I''ve decided not to go there.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am on my way there now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A group calling themselves the Drall Patriots use these caves to stage attacks on people.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_drall_patriot_hideout.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Drall Patriots'' Hideout'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Hey there, kid. You look like you have an eye for detail. Have you ever thought of being a "Professional Eye-Witness"? If so, I have some advice for you. Interested?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'I knew you were that kind of guy. Look... the Empire has set up shop a little ways up the road. Let''s just say they know of me and won''t let me within 1000m of the place. You though can get a good look around there, then one day when I run a story on it, I''ll look you up, got it? Here''s where you can find it.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'What''s wrong, kid? Are you scared of the truth? Or perhaps you just can''t handle it?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, as you can tell by looking at me, I''m a journalist. I write for all of the major News HoloStations throughout the galaxy, and am well known for my surprise exposes. Matter of fact, right now I''m planning one and you can be part of it! Interested?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck to you!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'Well, okay. Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you locate the Imperial Stronghold?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Absolutely! Count me in!!!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'Ummm.. No thanks... I''m leaving now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Hold on. What are you talking about?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'No. I''ve decided to stay away from it for the time being.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'I''m on my way there right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'The Empire has gone to great lengths to construct this outpost, but no one knows what it''s for. Perhaps you might be the one to find out.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_imperial_strongold.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Imperial Stronghold'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Everyone here in town thinks I''ve gone crazy, but I know what I heard! You! You can go out there and prove that I haven''t gone nuts! You need to go out into the wilderness and stop these cultists from bringing back Lord Nyax''s ghost!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'I knew someone would finally believe me! Here''s where I saw them. If you have friends, bring them with you too! Someone has to stop these guys in case they actually know how to bring someone back from the dead!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'You''re just like everyone else here! I swear it''s not just a story to tell kids! These guys are serious! Someone has to stop them before they summon up his ghost!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'What? You''ve never heard of Lord Nyax? He was the worst thing ever seen on Corellia? dressed all in black, choking people with his mind, you name it!Most people think he''s just a story you tell to kids who are misbehaving, but I''m telling you, he''s real!! Or at least these guys think he is!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I sure hope you can verify my story so people stop thinking that I''m crazy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'Perhaps that is for the best.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find the followers of Lord Nyax?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Umm... sure, I''ll help you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No thanks. You sound like you''re one card short of a full Sabbac deck.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Who is Lord Nyax?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I''ve decided not to search for them.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'This is the temple where a group of cultists are trying to bring Lord Nyax back from the dead.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_lord_nyax_cult.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Lord Nyax Cult'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'I can''t believe it!! Aarrrgh! If he weren''t my friend, I''d go do it myself. Huh? Oh, sorry... didn''t see you there. Hey! Are you interested in unofficially helping the remaining "good" CorSec agents?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Here''s where you can find the island all those thugs are using as a "base". If you find you have the time, go show them what happens to traitors!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, at least you''re better than those rogues are. Thanks for your honesty.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'My former partner, and best friend at that, apparently has gone "rogue". He joined up with a group of former agents that have decided to go into business for themselves. Not only that, he stole quite a number of weapons from the armory before he left. GRRrrrr!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck, then.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'That might be wise. But even so - the very idea of wholesome justice dies today... along with your courage.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find the Rogue Corsec encampment?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Sure, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry... I don''t do anything unofficial.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Why are you so angry?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I''ve decided not to look for it.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I''m still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'An island where former members of CorSec have set up a base of operations for their thievery.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_corellia_rogue_corsec.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Rogue Island'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Want to hear a crazy story? This guy last night in the cantina was telling us where there''s this group of people running around moving things with their minds. He says there was this cave filled with crystals where all of them live. Crazy, huh? He even told us where it was, too. Interested in going out there to see if this is real or not?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'It''s your time, not mine. Okay, this is where he said the place was. I''ll warn you that if you find nothing there, it''s your own fault for believing this guy. Good luck.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'That''s what I''m saying! I''m not running out there to find out if he''s telling the truth or not. Then again, what if he was?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Okay, here''s the full story. He says he''s a medic, right? He gets this call from some weird guy who says his brother needs help. The guy goes running out to these caves with the weirdo, finds the brother, then heals him up. While he''s doing that, he says everyone around there were doing crazy things like moving stuff and jumping real high. Go figure. Interested in knowing where?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Then good luck to you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_force_crytsal_hunters_cave.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
