('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'If you are looking for opportunities to help the Empire, then you are speaking with the right person. We are doing preliminary reconnaissance on the native Dantari. Since the Empire has just begun to take control of this planet, any information on the surrounding Dantari will help. Are you interested in helping the Empire?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Very good. Here are the coordinates of an area we suspect the Dantari to have a heavy concentration of their people. All we need you to do is observe the area. When we need the information, we will come to you and ask you for your detailed report.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Helping the Empire should be the most important thing on your list of things to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'The Dantari are a threat to our stormtroopers. At this time, we are devoting all of our efforts to wipe out the remaining Rebel sympathy on this planet. Once the Rebels have been completely stopped, we can then focus our attentions on subjugating the indigenous species, the Dantari.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_dantooine_kunga_stronghold.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
