('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_endor_marauder_orphans.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A group of Marauders have left the safety of King Terak''s Citadel and aren''t expecting company.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_endor_marauder_orphans.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Marauder Settlement'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Ahoy there! Ha ha. Have you ever wanted to be a pirate? I know I sure have. I spent over 20 years in the Imperial Navy combating pirates, blowing up ships, and being struck in the head, I found out something about myself! I want to be a pirate! And I know exactly where I can join up with some! How about you? do you want to be a pirate too?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Good for you! From what I''ve been told, all you need to do is go right up to these Canyon Corsairs and tell them you want to be a pirate and they''ll welcome you with open arms. This is where they have their base! Maybe I''ll see you and we can do pirate things together!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'What could be better than sailing the spacelanes and boarding vessels! HA! It sounds like a great life! Well, you''re missing out, I say!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Hmm? Oh, of course I was hit on the head! What Imperial Naval Captain hasn''t been? All it did was convince me to retire and join up with these rough brigands! I''ll walk right up to them and say, "My name is Boyrake Heapfood and I want to be a pirate!" I''ll be a pirate in no time, just like those other nice pirates! Do you want to be a pirate too?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good for you! From what I''ve been told, all you need to do is go right up to these Canyon Corsairs and tell them you want to be a pirate and they''ll welcome you with open arms. This is where they have their base! Maybe I''ll see you and we can do pirate things together!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_lok_canyon_corsair_stronghold.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
