('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I decided to quit looking because I don''t like your attitude.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A camp of assassins devoted to the former teachings of someone called Darth Maul'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_mauler_encampment.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Mauler Encampment'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Whoohoo...barely made it out of that one today. I found a whole colony of narglatches nestled up in a cave a ways out. To think I was about to walk right inside and rest for a bit. If you''ve got nothing left to live for, I can tell you where to find them.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Well, they''re up thataways a yonder. How about I just mark it down in your datapad, eh? Remember, this isn''t fun and games. They may look all cuddley, but they''ll rip your throat out the first chance they get. Good luck, friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'I don''t blame you. Those narglatches aren''t something I like messing with. Well, good day to you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Don''t you know? Whenever narglatches come together and start settling down, they only pick a place that''s rich in resources. That place they''re at is a virtual bank in resources. Then again...you have to deal with the narglatches first.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, they''re up thataways a yonder. How about I just mark it down in your datapad, eh? Remember, this isn''t fun and games. They may look all cuddley, but they''ll rip your throat out the first chance they get. Good luck, friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'I don''t blame you. Those narglatches aren''t something I like messing with. Well, good day to you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find the narglatch cave?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Sure, where are they?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No thanks.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Why would I care about a narglatch colony?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I decided to stop looking. I have other things to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'The cave is teeming with narglatches who have chosen to make it their home.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_narglatch_cave.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Narglatch Cave'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'You have too many things to do right now. I don''t think you have the time to help me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Go away! I don''t need your help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 4, 'next', 'I have no more work for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 5, 'notit_1', 'No! You did it wrong! Go try again!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 6, 'notyet', 'I''m sorry, but you can''t help me right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'My sister! Where could she be? You! Will you help me? She has been kidnapped by pirates. Please help me, I don''t have enough money to pay their ransom. Will you save her for me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Thank you, my kind friend. Please hurry. I fear she may be in danger. Let me have your datapad. I can enter the information for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Ahh! Someone help me! This pirate is threatening to hurt me!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'I don''t have any other information. Except, you may want to bring your friends with you. Pirates are vile and dangerous.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'At least I still have hope. Please save her as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', 'Where is my sister? I must find my sister! You! Will you go find her? She was captured by pirates! They demand that we pay some sort of ransom for her return. Please help me! You can find the pirate hideout here; I''ve marked it on your map.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', 'No! You were suppose to save her! You''ve failed me.. Please leave.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', 'I have no other information for you except that the hideout can be found in the mountains. Please help me. I''m desperate!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Please come back later. I may have something for you to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'You''re so cruel!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thank you! You saved my sister. I am ever so grateful!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you rescue her?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I will save her for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No, I can''t help you. I''m a pirate too!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'What other information do you have about these pirates?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', 'What other information do you have?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I changed my mind. I really don''t want to rescue your sister.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'The pirates are a bit more difficult than I thought. I plan to try again, though.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A deserted bunker inhabited by vile pirates. Rumors have said that several nobles are held here for ransom.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_noble_pirate_rescue_hanna.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Pirate Bunker'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Go away an'' let a pirate drink. Ye have too many things goin'' on right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Go away! I don''t need your help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 4, 'next', 'I have nothin'' else fer ye today.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 5, 'notit_1', 'No, go back out an'' try again, scrawny kid.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 6, 'notyet', 'Ye can''t help me, go away.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'I be admirin'' the bravery of ''dem pirates. Kidnappin'' nobles, keepin'' ''em locked up fer ransom. Hmm.. I bet yer hankerin'' ta find where they be keepin'' dem nobles.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Fine. Gimme yer datapad. Let me see wha'' I can do wit'' it. I hope I don''t break it. Ha ha!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Yer nothin'' but a coward. Ye couldn''t go up against pirates anyway. Yer a scrawny kid.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Neh. Just that they be kidnappin'' nobles all over Naboo, keepin'' ''em for ransom.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Get ye goin'' then, kid! Don''t waste me time on yer belly-achin''.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', 'Where is my sister? I must find my sister! You! Will you go find her? She was captured by pirates! They demand that we pay some sort of ransom for her return. Please help me! You can find the pirate hideout here; I''ve marked it on your map.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', 'Ye can''t do anythin'' right, can ye?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', 'I have no other information for you except that the hideout can be found in the mountains. Please help me. I''m desperate!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Come back later, I''m busy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'Pah! Get out o'' here an'' let me drink in peace.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'I have nothin'' fer ye. Ye were only suppose ta'' investigate.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Oh, it''s the scrawny kid. What did ye find out?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I am pretty interested.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No, I''m not interested in anything a drunk pirate has to say.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Do you have anymore information about these pirates?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', 'What other information do you have?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I decided to quit looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Nothing. I still have some investigating to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A deserted bunker inhabited by vile pirates. Rumors have said that several nobles are held here for ransom.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_pirate_pirate_rescue_ketter.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Pirate Bunker'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'You have too many other things to do at the moment. Come back when you have more time.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Go away! I don''t need your help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 4, 'next', 'I have nothing else for you to help me with.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 5, 'notit_1', 'Unfortunately, I''m not looking for anything right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 6, 'notyet', 'You can''t help me right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'I''m looking for my master. Have you seen him? I suppose you haven''t unless you''ve visited the pirate hideout. Oh? You haven''t heard? My master was kidnapped. Will you rescue him?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'I''m not exactly sure where this pirate hideout is, but I can enter the information, that I do know, in your datapad.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'You''re not very good at lying.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'I only know the general location of where it might be found. However, I have heard that many treasures can be found in a pirate hideout. Oh, and you may want to bring friends with you. It won''t be easy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve entered the information in your datapad. You should go look for him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', 'Where is my sister? I must find my sister! You! Will you go find her? She was captured by pirates! They demand that we pay some sort of ransom for her return. Please help me! You can find the pirate hideout here; I''ve marked it on your map.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', 'My master? You couldn''t save him? I''m hopeless!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', 'I have no other information for you except that the hideout can be found in the mountains. Please help me. I''m desperate!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Come back later. I may have something for you to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'I will find someone else to help me, then.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'I have no reward for you, unfortunately. But thank you for rescuing my master.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Is he safe?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I will rescue him for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No, I''m allergic to pirates.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'What other information do you have about this pirate hideout?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', 'What other information do you have?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I decided to quit looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'A deserted bunker inhabited by vile pirates. Rumors have said that several nobles are held here for ransom.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_servant_pirate_rescue_demitri.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Pirate Bunker'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Come here, come here. Have you ever heard of the Lost Jandosan Mines? I used to be one of the miners at Jandosan, until those dirty Veermoks decided to make it their home. Do you want to know where the mines used to be?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Well, it''s a ways off from here. Let me just mark it down on your datapad. Why don''t you go out there and give those Veermoks a little whatfor? Those blasted things killed some good men, and I wouldn''t mind seeing them get their just desserts.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Oh, I see. Just a crazy old miner, eh? You don''t have time to list to the stories of those who came before you, eh? You''re just like all the rest of the kids today!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Oh, this was years before you were born, kid! That place was full of all kinds of resources! We would have made a killing were it not for those danged apes! They just came by one day and killed everyone, then made it their new home. It still burns me to this day!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, it''s a ways off from here. Let me just mark it down on your datapad. Why don''t you go out there and give those Veermoks a little whatfor? Those blasted things killed some good men, and I wouldn''t mind seeing them get their just desserts.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_naboo_veermok_cave.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
