('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I decided to stop looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet, sir. I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'An encampment of Rebels have managed to stay out of the eye of the Imperials.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_rebel_military_base.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Rebel Military Base'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'You there! Have I got a deal for you! Have you ever been interested into going into business in the squill industry? How do I do that, you ask? Well, quite easily, I''ll tell you. All you need to do is go out to these caves, kill a bunch of squill, then "presto!"... you''re in business! Interested?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Just sign this contract here... good, and here... excellent! All you need to do is go out here and kill the little buggers! Once you have them down to a manageable level, we''ll move in and take over - er - I mean... help your guide business endeavors.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'How could you pass up an opportunity of a lifetime like this. Something like this just doesn''t fall into your lap everyday! Take intiative! Take a chance! Take my word - squill hides are the future!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Are they popular? Are you kidding me? Every kid from here to Coruscant wants to get their hands on a genuine squill hide jacket! You can''t go wrong with squill! That''s what I always say - you just can''t go wrong! So, you interested or what?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well get out there and get to work!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_tatooine_squill_cave.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
