('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I have decided to pass on this... because you''re too creepy to be giving advice.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am still looking.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'This is where you will find a temple containing a mysterious "power"'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_exarkun.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Ancient Temple'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 1, 'cant_work', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 4, 'next', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 6, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'Hello there! You might be asking yourself why someone like me would be here on a planet like this, aren''t you? Well, I am a representative of Star Tours, a travel agency known Galaxy-wide. We''re conducting surveys on possible future business expansions. Hey! Perhaps you might be able to help? Would you be interested in helping us?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Spectacular! All we need is for you to go to this building and explore the area. We''ll ask other passerbys if they''ll do the same for us as well. Just get a feel of the place, and ask yourself "Is this the type of place I would bring my family on vacation". We''ll eventually meet up again and I''ll then ask you what your opinion of the place is.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Ah, what a shame. To think I had a couple of tickets that I was thinking of giving away for our new cruiseliner, the Tzarina. Well, tickets for whenever it gets back from it''s voyage. Well, ta-ta!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, if you''re familiar with us, you''ll know that we sell exciting tours across the galaxy. We''re looking into offering a new way of exploring the galaxy that we call home, in what we call a "safari". One of the highlights will be to show off indigenous structures to explore? all safely, of course.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good! All we need is for you to go to this building and explore the area. We''ll ask other passerbys if they''ll do the same for us as well. Just get a feel of the place, and ask yourself "Is this the type of place I would bring my family on vacation". We''ll eventually meet up again and I''ll then ask you what your opinion of the place is.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/herald_yavin_temple_of_the_blueleaf_cluster.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
