('string/en/spawning/static_npc/naboo_rsf_surlin_rolei.stf', 244, 'waypoint_name_7', 'Trade Federation Decoys'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'We can''t talk right now. Lady Valarian suspects that there is a spy in our midst. You should take care of your personal business and come back later.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Look. I''m waiting for someone. You''d better not be seen with me. I have the death sentence on twelve systems!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I have no idea what you''re talking about.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Who are you?  Sorry, I''m rather distracted at the moment...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Get away from me.  I''m dangerous'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 6, 'dontknowyou_5', 'You don''t want any part of me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 7, 'dontknowyou_6', 'I''m very busy and very important.  I can''t talk to you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 8, 'gotowork_1', 'Are you kidding? I''m here for the new roster. Not THAT!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 9, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 10, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 11, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 12, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 13, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 14, 'next', 'Sorry I can''t help you. I have a number of new recruits to train. Why don''t you speak with Lady Valarian?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 15, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 16, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 17, 'notit_3', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 18, 'notit_4', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 19, 'notit_5', 'I''m not sure what that is.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 20, 'notit_6', 'This isn''t the egg.  What is this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 21, 'notyet', 'You should chat with Kavas over there. She''s got plenty of work for folks like you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 22, 'npc_1_1', 'Kavas says you''re ready to do some real work. I''ve put your name on a list of new recruits. Deliver it to our chief assassin to avoid getting murdered in the street.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 23, 'npc_1_2', 'Lady Valarian''s compound guard was supposed to deliver lunch some time ago. We haven''t heard anything and we''re starting to worry. Can you go check it out?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 24, 'npc_1_3', 'Rumor has it Jabba hired an off world scientist named Dr. Kaum to come help him develop some weapons technology.  Dr. Kaum doesn''t know any of Jabba''s thugs, so go pick him up before they get there.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 25, 'npc_1_4', 'There''s a murderer on the loose.  Never let it be said that we let something like this happen in our territory.  I want this one killed.  Are we clear?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 26, 'npc_1_5', 'Jabba''s trying to be clever.  He sent someone to taint our water supplies.  Find the one''s responsible and bring back whatever they''re putting in our water.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 27, 'npc_1_6', 'This is it.  This one will get you in to see Valarian herself.  She wants you to steal an expensive avian egg from a delivery guy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 28, 'npc_2_1', 'Good choice. Here''s the updated ledger. You''ll find our Chief Assassin on the outskirts of town.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 29, 'npc_2_2', 'Excellent. Head out toward the edge of town and see if you can escort our friend here.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 30, 'npc_2_3', 'Great.  When you get him back here we''ll take *good* care of him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 31, 'npc_2_4', 'Right.  Murder will not be tolerated.  Not of innocents.  If this guy were killing Jabba''s people, who would notice?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 32, 'npc_2_5', 'I knew I could count on you.  There''s likely to be more than one of them.  Get them all if you can.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 33, 'npc_2_6', 'I had a feeling.  Anyone that''s hung around here as long as you certainly wants to see the boss lady.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 34, 'npc_3_1', 'That''s what I thought. '),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 35, 'npc_3_2', 'Unwise. Lady Valarian expects loyalty. I''ll try to keep your unwillingness a secret.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 36, 'npc_3_3', 'Yeah, you''re right.  Maybe whoever we hire to take your place...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 37, 'npc_3_4', 'You sound more cowardly then you used to.  Are you feeling all right?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 38, 'npc_3_5', 'We don''t have a lot of time on this one so come back as soon as you''re free.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 39, 'npc_3_6', 'Well, don''t keep the boss waiting, she doesn''t like it.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 40, 'npc_4_1', 'Never you mind. If you are not known to our chief assassin you will surely die...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 41, 'npc_4_2', 'Lady Valarian ordered a special Rill casserole. I''m sure she''d share it if it arrives safely.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 42, 'npc_4_3', 'Just tell him Jabba wants to meet him for a drink first.  This guy doesn''t know anything about what''s going on here.  We''re gonna make sure he knows the score.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 43, 'npc_4_4', 'Killers aren''t good business.  Who''s gonna gamble if everyone''s dead?  Who''s gonna pay for protection.  This one has to be taken care of.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 44, 'npc_4_5', 'I don''t know yet.  That''s why I need you to bring it back.  Lots of our customers are getting sick, whatever this stuff is.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 45, 'npc_4_6', 'That''s the joke.  Jabba ordered it special.  His chef, Porcellus, was going to make him a special meal.  We''re gonna annoy Jabba and have a nice dinner all at the same time!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 46, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 47, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 48, 'npc_5_3', 'No one seems to know, though from what I hear Dr. Kaum''s specialty is beam weapons.  Probably just some new kind of rifle.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 49, 'npc_5_4', 'Someone called Roden Venthrall.  A student, apparently, of Dolac Legasi''s.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 50, 'npc_5_5', 'You know what our number one selling drink is at the Despot?  Water.  It''s a desert friend, everybody needs water!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 51, 'npc_5_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 52, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 53, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 54, 'npc_6_3', 'You should have plenty of lead time, but even if you don''t I know you know how to fight...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 55, 'npc_6_4', 'Heh, another murderer serving a life sentence in an imperial prison on Dathomir.  You don''t want to run into that guy, trust me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 56, 'npc_6_5', 'Positive.  We spotted a couple of them near our moisture harvesters.  Don''t get careless, these guys are for real.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 57, 'npc_6_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 58, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Good luck.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 59, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Please hurry.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 60, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Get out there before Jabba''s fiends find him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 61, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Get out there and find that guy!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 62, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Get out there and find these guys, we''re going out of business here!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 63, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'Get it before it goes bad.  Do you know how bad those things smell when they''re ripe?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 64, 'npc_breech_1', 'Over here! You''re the new one, eh?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 65, 'npc_breech_2', 'Great!  I''m glad somebody finally figured out that I needed help!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 66, 'npc_breech_3', 'I''m looking for an escort to, uh...Mr. The Hutt''s palace?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 67, 'npc_breech_4', 'I''ll kill you too!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 68, 'npc_breech_5', 'Heh, something else we can foul up besides water.  Get him boys!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 69, 'npc_breech_6', 'NO!  Do you know who this egg is for?  Bodyguards!  Save me!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 70, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 71, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Thanks for the safe trip!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 72, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Oh, thank you for bringing me safely to the city.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 73, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 74, 'npc_dropoff_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 75, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 76, 'npc_failure_1', 'How could you have failed to deliver a list of NAMES?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 77, 'npc_failure_2', 'Lady Valarian does not tolerate skipping lunch!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 78, 'npc_failure_3', 'You let him get away?!?  Great.  I thought you were more competent than this...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'That guy''s gonna go on a killing spree.  You should be ashamed.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 80, 'npc_failure_5', 'Great, we''re ruined.  All thanks to you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 81, 'npc_failure_6', 'Jabba got his egg?  I can''t believe this!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 82, 'npc_more_1_1', 'No. You have too little blood on your hands. Keep trying, though. See if Ind has more work for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 83, 'npc_more_1_2', 'These guys wouldn''t let me get back to work.  I''m glad you came along.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 84, 'npc_more_1_3', 'Oh, well, that''s fine then.  I hope they have blue milk....'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 85, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 86, 'npc_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 87, 'npc_more_1_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 88, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 89, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 90, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 91, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 92, 'npc_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 93, 'npc_more_2_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 94, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 95, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 96, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 97, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 98, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 99, 'npc_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Wait a minute. I think our Chief Assassin is off-world today. Why don''t you come back in a few cycles?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 101, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Actually - if I remember correctly Kavas said she got a message from the compound guard a few moments ago. Perhaps all is well. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 102, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Hm...it seems the good doctor hasn''t arrived yet.  Come back in a few minutes and I''ll keep you posted.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 103, 'npc_noloc_4', 'When I get a fix on this guy''s location I''ll let you know.  Actually, just come back later and I''ll tell you what''s going on.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 104, 'npc_noloc_5', 'If you ask me again in a few minutes we should be able to figure out exactly where these guys are.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 105, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Wait a sec...you''ll have to come back in a few and I''ll tell you where the delivery guy is.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 106, 'npc_reset_1', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 107, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good to have you on the team. Lady Valarian wants all of her new recruits to use these fresh Republic Blasters. So here you go. Be careful with it...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 108, 'npc_reward_2', 'Perfect, Jabba will be furious! Here, you''ve earned every last one of these credits.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 109, 'npc_reward_3', 'Great.  Now that he''s here we''ll make sure he''s working for the right team.  Here''s some cash to help you along, oh, and we found this on the good doctor.  You can have it too.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 110, 'npc_reward_4', 'I can''t tell you how happy I am that this is taken care of.  Our loyal customers have nothing but good things to say about you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 111, 'npc_reward_5', 'Excellent work once again.  Valarian''s been talking about you lately.  I think she''ll invite you to see her soon.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 112, 'npc_reward_6', 'You got it!  Great.  Valarian''s ready to see you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 113, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Aah. Welcome to the Valarian family.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 114, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 115, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 116, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 117, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 118, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 119, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 120, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Ok, I''m ready to head back to the Despot.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 121, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Where are we going?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 122, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 123, 'npc_takeme_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 124, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 125, 'npc_work_1', 'Are you done already?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 126, 'npc_work_2', 'Why haven''t you found Valarian''s compound guard?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 127, 'npc_work_3', 'Where''s the scientist?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 128, 'npc_work_4', 'Did you take care of that little problem we were having?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 129, 'npc_work_5', 'Did you take care of our little problem?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 130, 'npc_work_6', 'Where''s the egg?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 131, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 132, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m waiting for somebody, and guess what?  It''s not you!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 133, 'otherescort_3', 'I''m waiting for someone, sorry, I can''t talk.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 134, 'otherescort_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 135, 'otherescort_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 136, 'otherescort_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 137, 'player_1_1', 'Sounds good. Sign me up.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 138, 'player_1_2', 'I would be happy to.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 139, 'player_1_3', 'Ok, I''ll go get him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 140, 'player_1_4', 'Got it.  Kill the killer.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 141, 'player_1_5', 'I''ll get right to it.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 142, 'player_1_6', 'I''ll do it.  I''ve been waiting for this...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 143, 'player_2_1', 'I am not ready yet.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 144, 'player_2_2', 'I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 145, 'player_2_3', 'This sounds like something someone else could do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 146, 'player_2_4', 'This sounds dangerous.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 147, 'player_2_5', 'I''m a little busy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 148, 'player_2_6', 'I''ll have to come back later.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 149, 'player_3_1', 'Who is this assassin?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 150, 'player_3_2', 'What''s for lunch?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 151, 'player_3_3', 'Won''t he realize I''m not taking him to Jabba''s?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 152, 'player_3_4', 'Why don''t we just hire this murderer?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 153, 'player_3_5', 'What are they putting in the water?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 154, 'player_3_6', 'Where is it being delivered to?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 155, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 156, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 157, 'player_4_3', 'What kind of weapon are they building?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 158, 'player_4_4', 'Who is this killer.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 159, 'player_4_5', 'Why the water supply?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 160, 'player_4_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 161, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 162, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 163, 'player_5_3', 'What if Jabba''s guys show up?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 164, 'player_5_4', 'Who''s Dolac Legasi?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 165, 'player_5_5', 'You''re sure it''s Jabba''s guys?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 166, 'player_5_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 167, 'player_more_1_1', 'Am I really a member of the family now?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 168, 'player_more_1_2', 'What happened out here?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 169, 'player_more_1_3', 'Uh...Jabba wants to have a drink with you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 170, 'player_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 171, 'player_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 172, 'player_more_1_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 173, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 174, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 175, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 176, 'player_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 177, 'player_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 178, 'player_more_2_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 179, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 180, 'player_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 181, 'player_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 182, 'player_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 183, 'player_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 184, 'player_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 185, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 186, 'player_sorry_1', 'My mistake. I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 187, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot for more quests.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 188, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 189, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot and dropoff Dr. Kaum'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 190, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 191, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 192, 'return_waypoint_description_6', 'Return to Ind at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 193, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 194, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 195, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'LUCKY DESPOT'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 196, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'LUCKY DESPOT'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 197, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'LUCKY DESPOT'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 198, 'return_waypoint_name_6', 'LUCKY DESPOT'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 199, 'waypoint_description_1', 'Deliver the updated employee roster to the Chief Assassin to avoid being murdered.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 200, 'waypoint_description_2', 'Go find the guard who hasn''t brought back lunch yet.  He may be in trouble...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 201, 'waypoint_description_3', 'Find Dr. Kaum and return him to the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 202, 'waypoint_description_4', 'Find the murderer Roden Venthrall and deal with him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 203, 'waypoint_description_5', 'Find the ones polluting the water supply, destroy them, and bring back the poison'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 204, 'waypoint_description_6', 'Find Jabba''s Delivery Boy and retrieve the avian egg from him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 205, 'waypoint_name_1', 'LADY VALARIAN: Valarian''s Chief Assassin'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 206, 'waypoint_name_2', 'LADY VALARIAN: Pick up the Compound Guard'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 207, 'waypoint_name_3', 'LADY VALARIAN: Find the scientist'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 208, 'waypoint_name_4', 'LADY VALARIAN: find the killer'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 209, 'waypoint_name_5', 'LADY VALARIAN: Take care of the poisoners'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 210, 'waypoint_name_6', 'LADY VALARIAN: Get the egg'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 211, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 212, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 213, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 214, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 215, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want to do this anymore.\n'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 216, 'player_sorry_2', 'My mistake. I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 217, 'player_sorry_3', 'My mistake. I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 218, 'player_sorry_4', 'My mistake. I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 219, 'player_sorry_5', 'My mistake. I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 220, 'npc_reset_2', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 221, 'npc_reset_3', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 222, 'npc_reset_4', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 223, 'npc_reset_5', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 224, 'npc_reset_6', 'You''re in too deep now, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 225, 'gotowork', 'Are you kidding?  I''m here for the new roster.  What is this?  Don''t you have it?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_ind.stf', 226, 'player_sorry_6', 'My mistake.  I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Lady Valarian has scheduled a very important meeting. I must prepare for it. Come back when you''re done with your other tasks and I may be able to help you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'That filthy crimeboss Lady Valarian has sent one of her thugs to destroy me. You''d better get out of here if you know what''s good for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'You better get out of here if you don''t wanna die.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'You''re not the one Kavas told me about. Get out of here... or go to the Lucky Despot and drop a few credits. Tell Kavas I said hello.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'You''re not the one Kavas told me about. Get out of here... or go to the Lucky Despot and drop a few credits. Tell Kavas I said hello.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 6, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Who do you think you''re talking to?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 7, 'dontknowyou_6', 'Get away from me, I''m busy.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 8, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 9, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 10, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 11, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 12, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 13, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 14, 'next', 'I appreciate your help. Why don''t you ask Ind over there if he needs any help?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 15, 'notit_1', 'Thank you but... what is this? I can''t use this. You may as well keep it for yourself.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 16, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 17, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 18, 'notit_4', 'Where''s my package?  You don''t have it?  What, did you lose it?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 19, 'notit_5', 'What?  What''s this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 20, 'notit_6', 'What''s this?  This isn''t what we asked for.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 21, 'notyet', 'Who are you? You look crafty enough but I have never heard of you. Come back when you have earned a reputation and I may be able to use your help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 22, 'npc_1_1', 'I would guess that you''re here to earn Lady Valarian''s respect. This is a wise choice, my friend. Work for me first, and I will spread word of your courage and fidelity.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 23, 'npc_1_2', 'We have reliable information that Jabba the Hutt has sent a group of enforcers to patrol the edge of town and eliminate our operatives. Find them and destroy them.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 24, 'npc_1_3', 'Word of your deeds has spread. Many others in the Valarian organization are hearing of your deeds. Are you willing to do another favor for me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 25, 'npc_1_4', 'You''ve made quite a name for yourself here at the despot.  For that you get to slide for a while.  Here, I just need somebody to pick something up for me.  That''s it. '),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 26, 'npc_1_5', 'Jabba sent a thug over to the Despot earlier, and he was harrassing some of our patrons.  I don''t want any misunderstandings, I want this guy killed.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 27, 'npc_1_6', 'There''s not much time for discussion.  Jabba sent an assassin to kill Lady Valarian, but he missed.  He did manage to grab most of our financial records though.  Get them back, at all costs!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 28, 'npc_2_1', 'Joyous! Our ex-friend Cie Vos has decided to liberate a case of rations from our stock. Punish him and bring the rations to me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 29, 'npc_2_2', 'They''ll most certainly be armed - and probably well-trained. So, be cautious.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 30, 'npc_2_3', 'Lady Valarian needs this revised proclamation to be delivered to her advocate just outside of town. He''s an Ithorian... named Ysho... shouldn''t be hard to find.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 31, 'npc_2_4', 'Great.  Go find my friend Ki''shai and get the package.  Make the delivery back to me and you''ll get paid.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 32, 'npc_2_5', 'Good.  I knew I could count on you.  Take care of this and you won''t be forgotten.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 33, 'npc_2_6', 'Good.  If you pull this one off I''ll put in a good word for you myself.  I guarantee you''ll move up for this.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 34, 'npc_3_1', 'You''ll be back. Your kind always comes back.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 35, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, I hope none of our friends get killed.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 36, 'npc_3_3', 'A shame. Please come back when you have some time.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 37, 'npc_3_4', 'It''s just a simple delivery.  What''s you''re problem?  Maybe you aren''t as loyal as I thought.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 38, 'npc_3_5', 'You sure about that?  I''m not sure you want to say that right now.  You''re on the cusp of greatness.  You''re almost part of the family here.  You may want to think about this a bit.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 39, 'npc_3_6', 'I can''t believe I had so much faith in you.  Why now, after all this time, do you finally show your true cowardice?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 40, 'npc_4_1', 'Lady Valarian cares. She can open doors for you, my friend.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 41, 'npc_4_2', 'That filthy slug has been trying to destroy our operation for a very long time. Fortunately, we are smarter and more skilled than Jabba''s rank-and-file.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 42, 'npc_4_3', 'Our friends are hearing that you have great strength and courage... impeccable loyalty. All good things to have said about you, my friend. Will you help me again?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 43, 'npc_4_4', 'You''ll find out.  Don''t worry, it''s nothing illegal.  I mean, not strictly anyway...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 44, 'npc_4_5', 'Respect.  You need it and you get it.  And also, cash.  You''ll get some cash too.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 45, 'npc_4_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 46, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 47, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 48, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 49, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 50, 'npc_5_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 51, 'npc_5_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 52, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 53, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 54, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 55, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 56, 'npc_6_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 57, 'npc_6_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 58, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Perhaps you should try looking just outside of town?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 59, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Keep looking! Our friends are in danger. We can''t have you dawdling!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 60, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You''re looking for Ysho, an Ithorian male... who should be waiting for you just outside of town. Please come back when you''e delivered the proclamation.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 61, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Well don''t keep me waiting.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 62, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Don''t waste time here.  I know he''s not here!  Go find him.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 63, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'For the sake of your own life you better get back to work...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 64, 'npc_breech_1', 'Valarian sells POISON to her patrons! I stole this to prove it to the authorities! Please don''t shoot me!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 65, 'npc_breech_2', 'There''s a Valarian thug come to kill us. ATTACK!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 66, 'npc_breech_3', 'Nice work.  I thought I was going to be in real trouble.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 67, 'npc_breech_4', 'Ho! You better be that friend of Kavas'' I was told to meet.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 68, 'npc_breech_5', 'You got something to say?  Say it with blood!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 69, 'npc_breech_6', 'You''re all Valarian could find to send after me?  Hahahahaha!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 70, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 71, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 72, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 73, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 74, 'npc_dropoff_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 75, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 76, 'npc_failure_1', 'You''re not making such a good impression, my friend. You''ll need to try harder if you are going to earn Lady Valarian''s respect.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 77, 'npc_failure_2', 'Luckily one of our other friends has taken care of the Hutt enforcers. Thanks for nothing. Try to stay sharp the next time I give you something important to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 78, 'npc_failure_3', 'No! No! This will not do. This will simply not do at all!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'Couldn''t make a simple delivery?  Is this the kind of reputation you want?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 80, 'npc_failure_5', 'You look bad.  I mean, not as bad as you made us look, but still...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 81, 'npc_failure_6', 'That''s it, we''re probably ruined now.  It''ll take a miracle for us to stay on our feet after a debacle like this.  Good work.  Oh, in case you can''t tell, that''s sarcasm!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 82, 'npc_more_1_1', 'I don''t TRUST you! Either you let me go or you kill me right here!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 83, 'npc_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 84, 'npc_more_1_3', 'Don''t worry about it.  Just head back to the Despot and have a drink.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 85, 'npc_more_1_4', 'Kavas ordered an old-style camera as a gift for Ind. We mixed it in with a shipment of spice from Aeten II... and there was a whole mess... I don''t have time to go into details.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 86, 'npc_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 87, 'npc_more_1_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 88, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 89, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 90, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 91, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 92, 'npc_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 93, 'npc_more_2_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 94, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 95, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 96, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 97, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 98, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 99, 'npc_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Actually - I believe I need to prepare the private suites downstairs for some visitors. Why don''t you come back later when I have some more time?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 101, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Ind tells me that we''ve got some friends who''ve intercepted a group of Jabba''s enforcers just outside the city. We''ll see if these are the ones we''re looking for. Come back and speak to me later today, please.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 102, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Now that I think about it - we should probably handle this differently. Please give me some time and come back in a little while. I need to sort things out.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 103, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Hang on, there may be trouble.  Come back and see me later, I have to work something out.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 104, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Well, some of our people were keeping an eye on this thug, and now he''s vanished.  Come back later and I''ll see if we can find him again.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 105, 'npc_noloc_6', 'I don''t know where the assassin went, but if you come back in a few minutes I may have a better idea.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 106, 'npc_reset', 'Perhaps you should pay more attention next time. Take some notes perhaps. Ah, well.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 107, 'npc_reward_1', 'Ah, yes. The rations. Good job.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 108, 'npc_reward_2', 'Bravo! You''ve made this a safer place for legitimate businesspeople like us. Here is a small token of our gratitude. Don''t spend it all in one place.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 109, 'npc_reward_3', 'I hear there was some trouble? You did quite well nonetheless. Thank you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 110, 'npc_reward_4', 'Great!  Ind''s gonna love it.  Thanks.  Here''s some creds, don''t spend em anywhere but the Despot, okay?  Haha.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 111, 'npc_reward_5', 'That''s the way we handle things.  Jabba''s steaming on his "throne" right now.  Good work.  Oh, by the way, Ind says she has some work for you, or if you want I have something else for you to do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 112, 'npc_reward_6', 'You did it!  Valarian''s so pleased she''s told me to let you into the inner sanctum.  That means you''ll be dealing with Ind from now on.  Treat her right, and you''ll get the same in return.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 113, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 114, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 115, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'Ah, the proclamation.  I can''t tell you how much easier this is going to make things for us.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 116, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Here you go. The photo capture unit got smashed - but I think that Kavas knows how to fix it. See you around!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 117, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 118, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 119, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 120, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 121, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 122, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 123, 'npc_takeme_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 124, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 125, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you recover what I require?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 126, 'npc_work_2', 'Will you please take care of Jabba''s Enforcers? They could be here at any moment!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 127, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you delivered the proclamation?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 128, 'npc_work_4', 'Hey, did you make that pick up for me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 129, 'npc_work_5', 'How come I haven''t heard about Jabba''s thug dying yet?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 130, 'npc_work_6', 'Where''s the briefcase?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 131, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 132, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 133, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 134, 'otherescort_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 135, 'otherescort_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 136, 'otherescort_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 137, 'player_1_1', 'Let''s get started.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 138, 'player_1_2', 'Sounds like fun.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 139, 'player_1_3', 'Of course. What is it?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 140, 'player_1_4', 'Sure, no problem.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 141, 'player_1_5', 'I''m clear.  He''s gone.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 142, 'player_1_6', 'I''m on my way.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 143, 'player_2_1', 'I can''t help you right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 144, 'player_2_2', 'I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 145, 'player_2_3', 'I''m not available at the moment.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 146, 'player_2_4', 'Sorry, I''m busy right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 147, 'player_2_5', 'This isn''t my type of work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 148, 'player_2_6', 'This is too much work.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 149, 'player_3_1', 'Who cares if you think I''m courageous?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 150, 'player_3_2', 'Why would Jabba do this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 151, 'player_3_3', 'What are people hearing about me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 152, 'player_3_4', 'What''s this thing I''m picking up?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 153, 'player_3_5', 'What''s the payout on this?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 154, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 155, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 156, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 157, 'player_4_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 158, 'player_4_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 159, 'player_4_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 160, 'player_4_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 161, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 162, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 163, 'player_5_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 164, 'player_5_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 165, 'player_5_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 166, 'player_5_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 167, 'player_more_1_1', 'What are you talking about?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 168, 'player_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 169, 'player_more_1_3', 'What is this proclamation for?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 170, 'player_more_1_4', 'What is this thing I''m supposed to retrieve?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 171, 'player_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 172, 'player_more_1_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 173, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 174, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 175, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 176, 'player_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 177, 'player_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 178, 'player_more_2_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 179, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 180, 'player_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 181, 'player_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 182, 'player_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 183, 'player_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 184, 'player_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 185, 'player_reset', 'I couldn''t find the target.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 186, 'player_sorry', 'I am still looking for my target.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 187, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Return the rations to Kavas Urdano at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 188, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Return to the Lucky Despot to receive your reward.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 189, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Return to the Lucky Despot to receive your reward.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 190, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Return to the Lucky Despot to receive your reward.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 191, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Return back to the Lucky Despot and speak to Kavas.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 192, 'return_waypoint_description_6', 'Return to the Lucky Despot and speak with Kavas.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 193, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 194, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 195, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 196, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 197, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 198, 'return_waypoint_name_6', 'Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 199, 'waypoint_description_1', 'Eliminate the thief "Cie Vos" and return the rations to Kavas Urdano at the Lucky Despot'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 200, 'waypoint_description_2', 'Destroy Jabba''s Enforcers who''ve been sent to kill Lady Valarian'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 201, 'waypoint_description_3', 'Find Ysho and deliver the prolcamation.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 202, 'waypoint_description_4', 'Find Ki''shai and recover Kava''s gift for Ind.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 203, 'waypoint_description_5', 'Jabba''s enforcer must be taught a lesson.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 204, 'waypoint_description_6', 'Jabba''s assassin missed Lady Valarian, but stole important financial documents.  Return the briefcase to Kavas.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 205, 'waypoint_name_1', 'VALARIAN: Cie Vos'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 206, 'waypoint_name_2', 'LADY VALARIAN: Jabba Enforcers'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 207, 'waypoint_name_3', 'LADY VALARIAN: Deliver a proclamation for Lady Valarian.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 208, 'waypoint_name_4', 'LADY VALARIAN: Pick up a gift for Ind.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 209, 'waypoint_name_5', 'LADY VALARIAN: Find and kill Jabba''s Enforcer'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_valarian_kavas_urdano.stf', 210, 'waypoint_name_6', 'LADY VALARIAN: Retrieve the briefcase from the assassin.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Sorry. I''m a bit busy right now. You look pretty busy, too. Why don''t you come back later? Thanks.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Get out of here!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 4, 'next', 'I can''t keep giving out Zicx. They''re rare. Did you know they are impossible to destroy? It''s mind-boggling... but true. Good day.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 5, 'notit_1', 'Like I said... I don''t do business with anyone who wanders in out of the sand. If you''re not on official business from Jabba the Hutt - and if you''re not a friend of a friend, I don''t want to waste my time with you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 6, 'notyet', 'Who are you? I don''t do business with just anyone. You need a voucher... or a buy order from Jabba himself! Goodbye.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'So Goru sent you to me? To get your hands on some Zicx bugs, right? That''s fine. Goru is a good friend. What would you say if I asked you to do me a small favor first?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Great! One of Valarian''s thugs knocked off a recent delivery to Jabba''s Palace. A specially processed jar of spice. Return it to me and I will give you a hearty measure of Zicx bugs from my private collection.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, if you see Goru again - tell him he still owes me twelve thousand credits for that stunt he pulled on Rori. (I wonder if he ever got off that rock?)'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Goru probably told you that I''m in the spice business. I''ve used my skills as a biologist to create a spice refinement method that is... astounding! Unfortunately, some of my samples have been stolen. I would like them returned to me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'They should be just outside of town. Thrash them and retrieve my spice and I will give you a jar of fresh young Zicx that you can take back to Goru.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', 'The spice is MINE! Stay away or we''ll destroy you!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', 'Valarian''s thugs made off with my spice. You failed me.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Actually... you might want to come back and see me later on. There is something that I need to do at the moment.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'Fine. Why don''t you come back later? Thanks.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thank you for retrieving the spice. Take this jar of young Zicx... and be very careful if and when you decide to approach the Sarlacc. In fact, you might want to see my friend Palu on the other side of town... she may have something you can use.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find Valarian''s thieves?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'I don''t mind. Just tell me what you want and I''ll be happy to help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'Actually, I''m not interested in doing any favors for you.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'What sort of favor?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'Not yet. I am still looking for them.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Return the spice to Jowir Ar''Lensa to retrieve your reward.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Jowir Ar''Lensa'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'Some of Valarian''s thieves have stolen specially prepared spice. Jowir needs this spice returned to him. In exchange, he will give you a jar of Zicx bugs for use in a special weapon.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_jowir.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Valarian Thieves'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'I''m a little busy at the moment... making disease-resistant clothing and other high-quality garb for Jabba''s elite forces. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Valarian''s thugs told me that if I moved... they would disintegrate me on the spot! Please go! I don''t want them to kill you, too.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 3, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 4, 'next', 'I can''t give you anything else. If Jabba finds out that I gave you special disease-resistant equipment... which is made EXCLUSIVELY for his elite guard... he''ll have us both killed. Now, go on. Goodbye!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 5, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 6, 'notyet', 'Hello. I don''t know you. Why don''t you go to the other side of town and see Jowir Ar''Lensa. He loves meeting new people. Thanks.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 7, 'npc_1_1', 'You want my help? Then you help me, first. The palace scouts say that my sister left to come back here several hours ago... but she hasn''t shown up. I fear the worst. Can you run to the edge of town and see if you can find my sister? Bring her back here to me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 8, 'npc_2_1', 'Thanks. When you return I will reward you with special disease-resistant equipment... none better in the galaxy. Now, please hurry!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 9, 'npc_3_1', 'Are you kidding me? You don''t have TIME to help? You better change your mind!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'Feinu. She runs errands for me. Mostly she delivers new equipment to Jabba''s elite guard. Jabba and I have an agreement of sorts. The road from here to there is pretty dangerous. Valarian is always trying to mess things up. I worry that they have done something bad to Feinu. Will you go find her for me?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 11, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 12, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 13, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'She was supposed to be following the road to the palace... so she could be just outside of town. Please hurry!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 14, 'npc_breech_1', 'Please! Help me!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 15, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'Ahh... thank you so much for helping me! Those thugs would have disintegrated me for sure!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 16, 'npc_failure_1', 'How could you have let this happen?! Oh, no... no... no... What am I going to do, now?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 17, 'npc_more_1_1', 'They caught me on the way back from the palace. My sister says I shouldn''t walk the road to Wayfar by myself. Valarian''s thugs jumped me and told me they were going to hold me for ransom.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 18, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 19, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 20, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Wait a minute. Now that I think about it... maybe we should wait. Feinu has a new friend outside of town. Maybe she''s stopped off for a visit?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 21, 'npc_reset', 'Then I hope, for your sake ... she''s not hurt. Jabba helps me when I need him. I may need him to teach you a lesson. Do you understand?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thank you so much! Here - please take this special suit.  It is resistant to disease. Jabba''s scouts use this type of equipment whenever they''re around the Sarlacc. It keeps them alive.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 23, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 24, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Take me to my sister, please! We''ll get revenge on these Valarian swoopers some day!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you find her?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 26, 'otherescort_1', 'Save yourself! Valarian''s enforcers are trying to kill me!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 27, 'player_1_1', 'Yes. I will find her and bring her back here unharmed.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 28, 'player_2_1', 'No, I have no time to help you now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 29, 'player_3_1', 'Your sister?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 30, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 31, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 32, 'player_more_1_1', 'How did they get a hold of you?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 33, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 34, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 35, 'player_reset', 'I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 36, 'player_sorry', 'I am still looking for her.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 37, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Bring Feinu back to her big sister in town to collect your reward.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 38, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Return to Palu'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 39, 'waypoint_description_1', 'Valarian''s thugs kidnapped Palu''s little sister on her way back from the palace. Rescue her and return her to Palu''s shop.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tato_zicx_palu.stf', 40, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Save Palu''s little sister'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Looks like you''ve got a full plate already. Maybe you should come back later.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 2, 'next', 'Thanks to your brave efforts, we are about ready to move back in. Just planning our attack on the remaining Tusken Raiders. Thank you again for all your invaluable help.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 3, 'notit_1', 'Hm...that''s not exactly what I was looking for.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I''m sorry, I can''t speak with you just yet...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Our village has been attacked by Tusken Raiders! It was horrible, so many of my friends fell so swiftly, so few of us got away...'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Thank you! Thank you!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Nobody cares about anyone but themselves anymore! If you can''t help, you should just get out of here!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'They''re still in the village, looting and burning our homes! Tuskens are cowards when faced with a strong foe though. If you could take out their leader, they won''t stand when we take back what is ours!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 9, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 10, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 11, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'They are still in the village, won''t you do something?!?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 12, 'npc_failure_1', 'You are pathetic! You couldn''t kill a one legged wamp rat without getting knocked down!'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 13, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I''m uh.. wait.. no.. Uh.. Come back later.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 14, 'npc_reset', 'Well, thanks for trying! Maybe you can come back when you are more capable.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'He''s dead? We are forever in your debt. The survivors of our village has gathered what we could to show our appreciation for your heroism. It''s not much, but all we have, please accept it.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 16, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you killed them yet? Have you killed their "King."'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 17, 'player_1_1', 'I will try to help. I''ll go to your village and see what I can do.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 18, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I don''t think I can handle that right now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 19, 'player_3_1', 'I''m so sorry. Is there anything I can do to help?'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 20, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 21, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 22, 'player_reset', 'I don''t think I can handle this job.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 23, 'player_sorry', 'I think I can help you now.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 24, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Pillaged village'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 25, 'waypoint_description_1', 'This village is currently overrun with Tusken Raiders.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 26, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Tolan Nokkar'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 27, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Return and inform Tolan Nokkar that the Tusken King has fallen.'),
('string/en/spawning/static_npc/tusken_village_quest_npc.stf', 28, 'default', ''),
