('string/en/static_npc/corellia/chertyl_ruluwoor.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'I thank you for your interest. Please feel free to return if you change your mind and would like to help me again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/chertyl_ruluwoor.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'I thank you for your interest. Please feel free to return if you change your mind and would like to help me again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 1, 'next', 'I have things under control. I think. I''ll let you know if I need you. Thanks for all your help.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'If you''re like me, then you really shouldn''t be trying to juggle too many tasks at once. Come back when you''ve cleaned some off your plate.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'I can''t afford to leave these matters unresolved. Come back when you think you can help me close these cases.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Where''s that witness? Why didn''t you bring the witness? Wait. Are you my backup from Coronet? Oh, sorry. Captain Coraline Dynes. I''m the head of security around here. I''m a little busy at the moment so I can''t really chat. Unless you''d care to help out? I desperately need someone to escort a witness back here. Do you think you could help me out?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'You''re a lifesaver. The man you''re looking for is a Bothan named Lith K''alis. He''s currently "in hiding." He''s convinced he''s a target of Black Sun assassins. Problem is, he may be right. Have your blaster handy. Good luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Okay, well then welcome to Doaba Guerfel and stay out of trouble.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'The only one in a murder case I''m investigating. Black Sun is involved, which means that witnesses are all but non-existent. This witness only came forward because he thinks he''s next. Can you help him out?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve given you all the info I''ve got. You still interested?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Job well done, friend. I sure could use more like you on my team. Enforcing the law in this town is no easy task. Black Sun has a pretty tight control on the Mining Guild out here. Makes for some messy business.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you bring that witness back yet? I don''t know how much longer that poor Bothan can last out there.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'The witness should transmit his location to me momentarily. Check back with me in a bit.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Looks like I get to add yet another unsolved murder to my pile. Thanks for nothing.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'Go away! I can''t be seen with you!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Go away! I can''t be seen with you!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Psst! Hey! Over here! You from Captain Dynes?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Thank the stars you got here when you did. I''m sure those Black Sun killers are closing in on me. Let''s get out of here!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'You''re a pal and I owe you one. Take my advice: Get out of this town before it''s too late.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What kind of witness?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'If you''ve decided to hang around, I could certainly still use your help. I''ve managed to locate a suspect in an arson case but I don''t have the manpower or the time to go and arrest this criminal myself. He''s an arsonist and not a killer so I doubt he''ll put up a struggle, especially if you brandish a blaster. Think you can bring him in for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Where were you two years ago when I got this assignment, huh? Thanks, I certainly appreciate your help. The suspect is a Rodian named Kalio Uldi. And be on our guard because even though he may be a coward, he''s likely to have friends that are not. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'I was so hoping you''d say yes, but I understand. Not your problem. Excuse me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'A Corellian Engineering Corporation warehouse. No one was in it at the time. It held a lot of shipping manifests, however. I''m sure he was trying to cover something up for someone upstairs.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Did you have further questions or do you wish to reconsider?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'A huge thanks, friend. Here, go treat yourself to a nice dinner somewhere. Vreni Island is lovely this time of year, by the way. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you bring my suspect in? He''s likely to leave the system if we don''t act fast.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'My people will get me Kalio''s coordinates in just a sec. Could you hang on for a bit?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Well, at least it wasn''t a murderer that got away. You have to look at the bright side as often as possible here in Doaba Guerfel.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'Buzz off! I''m busy!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Buzz off! I''m busy!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Everyone knows that liquid is not nearly as flammable as-uh, oh! Looks like trouble!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Okay, okay! I''ll go with you, take it easy. You bounty hunter types are so touchy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'I''d like to say it''s been a pleasure, except it obviously hasn''t. And don''t think they''re sending me to Kessel - I got friends in high places, pal!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What did he burn down?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Just the agent I was hoping to see. Need your help again. I know, big surprise, huh? This time the assignment is pretty straightforward. We just received an anonymous transmission warning us of a potential violent situation. It seems a Black Sun gangster is on his way to a Mining Guild representative''s home to murder him. I''d certainly appreciate it if you were to intercept this Aqualish and prevent a murder. If this Aqualish is the guy I think, arresting him will not be an option. Want to tackle this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'If I get a promotion out of this, I''m taking you to dinner on Vreni Island. Please be careful. This Aqualish, a brute named Blurga Vuto, is one tough customer. If you want to take some friends along, I understand.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'Well, you risked yourself enough on my account. No hard feelings, buddy. Take care.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'The Guild is negotiating with the big Corellian corporations for higher wages for their workers. Black Sun wanted them to drop the issue but this rep refused.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You seem jittery. I understand if you want to back out.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'If law enforcement was not your choice of a career, I think you''ve undersold yourself. You''ve got the looks, the skills, and the nerve to be a top security officer. Best of luck to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you stop that Aqualish killer? I need to know when I can let the Mining Guild representative return to his home.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'My people are tracking Blurga now. I should have his coordinates shortly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'I guess I better get the Mining Guild rep off the planet. We lose more of those guys this way.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Go away! Blurga is in the mood to kill!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Go away! Blurga is in the mood to kill!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Blurga will smash you! That will teach you to interfere in Blurga''s business!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why does Black Sun want to murder a Mining representative?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/coraline_dynes.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', ''),
