('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 1, 'next', 'I don''t have anything for you at the moment. Try me again later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I need your undivided attention. When you''ve finished your current job, I might be able to find some work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'Not quite up to the task yet? See me again when you can handle it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I work for the Corporate Sector Authority. You look like you know how to handle yourself. I need someone to pick up a disc from a data slicer. Do you want to make a few credits? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'My slicer has a bit of a gambling problem, so he''s hiding outside the city at the moment. I''ll let him know you''re picking up the data.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'I guess I was wrong about you being able to handle yourself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'My boss has been altering shipping orders to cover up bribes he''s been accepting. I want you to pick up the original records from my data slicer. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve told you all I can. Are you still going?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'All right. You can be sure I''ll send this record of criminal activity where it can do the most good. You''ve helped me a lot, and I won''t forget it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Why haven''t you got that information for me yet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'My slicer is a little wary of strangers right now, so I''ll have to call him and smooth your arrival. Check with me in a minute.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'The terrain was a little too rough for you, I guess.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m not the person you need to meet.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m waiting to meet somebody else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Did Dannik Malaan send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'I did what he asked me to. He''ll square my debts now, right?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'This isn''t the disc I hired you to bring me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'I''d like to make a lot more than that. What''s involved?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/dannik_malaan.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', ''),
