('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'I understand your situation. I''ve had to abandon many attempts to get these poachers. But I kept trying, and I hope you will too.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/gilker_budz.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'I understand your situation. I''ve had to abandon many attempts to get these poachers. But I kept trying, and I hope you will too.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 1, 'next', 'Hey, nice to see you again. I''m sitting pretty right now, not a care in the world. Talk to you later, maybe.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Hey there. I can''t leave this area just now, but I''d really like it if you dropped by when you''re not so busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'Hey, I understand. I hope you''ll check back with me later, though.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Hey there. I can''t leave this area just now -- I''m waiting on a nice bottle of Corellian Double-Brandy from a new friend -- but I need someone to pick up a payment for an Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit renewal. Can you get it for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Fine. You''re meeting a fellow called "Professor" Minnet, who leads a group of enterprising cargo transit specialists called Sidepocket.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, I''d love to talk, but as I said, I''m waiting on some Double-Brandy. See you around.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'An Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit lets you avoid undue attention from the authorities -- for instance, me -- and take your goods offworld without trouble. Of course, a permit like that requires hefty fees, paid frequently. But don''t worry, those fees keep your local tax rates low. Will you pick up the renewal fee for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Were you hoping to get some of that Double-Brandy I''m waiting for? Sorry, it''s all claimed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Hey, wait -- this isn''t a payment. It''s -- let''s see -- a dossier of past Offworld Transit Permits I granted to smugg -- uh, merchants. Hmm. Well, I''ll pay you for your time. And I think I have more work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'I hope you''re still planning to meet "Professor" Minnet and pick up that Offworld Backchannel Permit renewal fee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Whoa, I''m getting a call about that Double-Brandy I''m expecting. Check with me in a moment, okay? Thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'No renewal fee? Well, that will make life a little tougher for "Professor" Minnet and his Sidepocket group. Hope they don''t blame you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I haven''t got anything much to say to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you from that corrupt sleemo cop, Darjeek?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Tell Darjeek his renewal schedule is about to be cut short. This dossier should convince him to stay out of our way.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'Just deliver the dossier like a good little lackey.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I was expecting an Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit renewal fee from "Professor" Minnet. That isn''t it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What is an Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Hey. I checked into that stuff about Offworld Transit Permits. Someone must be eavesdropping on meetings I''ve had out in the wilderness. Never mind what I was doing at the meetings. I know a Bothan who''s told me many useful things in the past. I want you to bring him in for another report -- though I doubt he''ll follow you willingly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Hey, that''s great. You need to find a Bothan named Siv''rool Linnaie. Bring him back here, and not so heavily wounded that he can''t talk.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'No? Hey, I thought we were friends. Well, maybe later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Hey, I''d love to ramble across the hills looking for this one Bothan. Honest. But I''m stuck here waiting for a gift -- some durindfire gems from a new friend. So you''ll have to get the informant for me. Will you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Are you sticking around to see those durindfire gems? I''d just as soon that you start after that Bothan.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'I expect our friend Siv''rool has a lot to tell me about "Professor" Minnet''s Sidepocket gang, and their source of information about me. Stick around -- I may have another job for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'I don''t see that Bothan informant, Siv''rool. Hope you''ll bring him soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Whoa, I''m getting a call about those durindfire gems I''m expecting. Check with me in a moment, okay? Thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'You didn''t bring that Bothan informant? Well, I''ll get him here one of these days.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m not the one ee-you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I have nothing to say to ee-you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Don''t let him take me, my friends!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Ee-yes, well -- I shall go quietly with ee-you. But my friends from "Professor" Minnet''s Sidepocket gang have not ee-yet forgotten me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Umm. I did not think ee-you would make it here alive. I may be forced to betray my friends, painful as that may be.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why don''t you bring in this Bothan informant yourself?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Hey. That Bothan informant told me what I already knew: Those smugglers, "Professor" Minnet and his Sidepocket gang, have been spying on me at a listening post out in the wilderness. This could be bad for my career. I''d like you to blow up their listening post, but that''s too much trouble.  Just take out the guy with the info.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Great. You''ll find him at these coordinates, assuming that informant told me right. And I think he knows the consequences of telling me wrong.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'What, you''re squeamish about a few smugglers? Man.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Well, out in the wilderness I screen a lot of Offworld Backchannel Cargo Transit Permit applicants. That Sidepockets gang must have wanted to find inside data on how to get a permit. Yeah, that''s it. Anyway, about that guy -- will you kill him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'That guy is out there waiting. I think you should get going.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Great work! And who really cares if there''s a few less smugglers now? On Corellia we''ve got all the smugglers the galaxy will ever need. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Haven''t you destroyed that listening post? I''d help you, but I''m waiting on a delivery of Fricaseed Puff-cakes from a new friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Whoa, I''m getting a call about some Fricaseed Puff-cakes I''m expecting from a new friend. Check with me in a moment, okay?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You didn''t kill that guy? Man, I''m very disappointed. I don''t feel like I can go out in the wilderness any more.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'You won''t stop me!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
