('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'Hey, I understand. I hope you''ll check back with me later, though.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Hey, I understand. I hope you''ll check back with me later, though.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Hey, I understand. I hope you''ll check back with me later, though.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ging_darjeek.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_4', 'Hey, I understand. I hope you''ll check back with me later, though.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''ve been a big help. If you want to get more involved with Black Sun you should speak with Zekka Thyne.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You can''t work for me if you''re working for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'If you think you''re up to it later, check back and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Black Sun is definitely the outfit to get involved with. We have our hand in everything from gambling to smuggling. Are you interested in working for Black Sun?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Welcome to the organization. Go and find Hammond Ballater and bring him to me. He knows better than to think that Black Sun would let him go completely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'You should get out of here before you become a liability.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Right now I need information from someone who used to work for us but now works for Shalera -- the Lady Hutt, as she''s known hereabouts. He hasn''t been cooperative. Could you find him and bring him here?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Is there a problem?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good job. See me again if you need more work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you found Hammond Ballater yet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I need to take an important call. See me in a while and we can get started.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'I had high hopes for you. I''m sorry this didn''t work out.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'My business is not with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'My business is not with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'You must be the one Black Sun sent to get me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'I''ll go with you, I don''t want this to get any worse.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'They never let you go completely. This may be you one day.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What sort of work?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'We''ve had a double agent in the Lady Hutt''s organization for some time now. It turns out that he''s been selling information about Black Sun to her. That''s the problem with double agents -- you just can''t trust them. Would you teach him a lesson for us?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. You''ll meet him in the place where he meets his usual contact. His name is Dev Breeger -- not that it matters any more.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Most people prefer not to say "no" to me. You''ve got guts, I''ll give you that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'The lesson would be: Betraying Black Sun means certain death. Will you make that clear to him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Are you going to ice that traitor or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Black Sun can find further use for you. Speak with Zekka Thyne, my superior. I''ll let him know about you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Were you going to extinguish that traitor any time soon?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Give me a few minutes to find out where his next meeting is supposed to be. See me again shortly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'I take it you ran into some unforeseen difficulties along the way? Well, I guess we''ll find someone else to finish him off.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I hope you find the person you''re looking for soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Awfully quiet here today.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'You''re not my contact -- Uh-oh. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/grobber.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What lesson would that be?'),
