('string/en/static_npc/corellia/hal_horn.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'I understand. Please see me when you want to try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/hal_horn.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'I understand. Please see me when you want to try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/hal_horn.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'I understand. Please see me when you want to try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 1, 'next', 'Can''t talk, I''m busy getting ready for my next race.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I can see you asking yourself, "Is that really Ignar Ominaz, the swoop racer?" Yes indeed, that''s me. I have a job for you when you''re not busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'If I had your lack of ambition, I''d never have become a famous swoop racer. Never give up, friend! Try me again later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I can see you asking yourself, "Is that really Ignar Ominaz, the swoop racer?" Yes indeed, that''s me. I don''t give autographs in person, but you can buy them from my HoloNet site. I''m giving you a chance to help me tune my new swoop. I ordered a custom power converter from Coronet, but the delivery agent is lost somewhere and needs safe escort here. Can you bring him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Excellent! I forget the delivery agent''s name, but he''s a Drall, one of those little furry folks. I expect he must be a young fan eager to get into the world of swoop racing. Bring him here and give him a thrill.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'I don''t think you understand what a rare opportunity it is to work for someone famous. Many of my fans would kill for this chance. Ah well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'What? You never heard of me? I expect you have and just forgot. Everyone in the galaxy followed my career back in the good Old Republic days, when I vied with Sergi-X Arrogantus for the Corulag championship. I''m still in the game, and this bike will carry me to another  championship -- as soon as you bring me that courier. Will you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'We''ve talked this through already. I need to get back to work, and so do you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Well! Ah, um -- I guess this little fellow isn''t quite ready for the racing game just yet. Anyway. Here, here''s a little something for your time. You can tell your grandchildren you got these credits from Ignar Ominaz.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Where''s that courier? I need that power converter soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I''m waiting on that courier to give me his coordinates. Check back with me in a moment. Meanwhile, you might want to check out my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Sorry you couldn''t make it to the finish line, friend. Don''t forget my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Sorry, I''m waiting for someone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you from the customer who ordered this power converter?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'What kind of idiot tries to fine-tune a swoop bike in the Agrilat Swamp? The crystal growth will ruin this power converter. Bring me to this nincompoop, and I''ll tell him where he''s gone wrong.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'Thanks. You, Mister -- wait, let me check my order -- Mister Ominar. I mean Ominaz. If you had the brains of a kenalpa tree, you''d know -- wait. Ominaz. Any relation to that old washed-up swoop racer?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'I gather that you''re famous?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'You know, we professional swoop racers have rivalries that go way back. Why, I remember how many times Sergi-X Arrogantus used to call me a dirty -- well, anyway. My old rival Dinnik Innik is travelling here for a head-to-head race with me, just us, no publicity. He called and said he needs a guide through the swamp. Will you escort him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Good! It''s hard to see Dinnik Innik, ''cause he''s so small, but once you find him, bring him here for the race of the century!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Come on! You''re missing a chance to see racing history here. I''m sure you''ll change your mind soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Oh, for years Dinnik and I have fought for track position like a couple of slice hounds. He''s a wiry little Chadra Fan, so there''s a weight advantage right there. But the old Ignar Ominaz tactical magic brings its own advantages, you know. I expect he wants one last chance to prove he''s still in the game. Poor guy, I pity him. Will you bring him here?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I''ve told you plenty to get you started. It''s up to you from here, friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Uh. Umm. Well. Tell you what, friend, let''s pretend this never happened. Here''s something for your time. And don''t forget the souvenirs available on my HoloNet site.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Haven''t you brought Dinnik Innik here yet? I''m ready to race!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I''m waiting on Dinnik Innik to send me his coordinates. Check back with me in a moment. Meanwhile, you might want to look at my HoloNet site, where you can buy genuine autographed souvenirs of my career.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Where''s Dinnik? No Dinnik? I was all ready to race!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''m waiting for someone, sorry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Did Ignar send you to guide me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'The Agrilat Swamp gives me the chills. I''m glad you''re here to take me to Ignar. I hear some disease is driving all the animals crazy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Thanks, friend. So, Ignar! I''m not racing you today. I''m not racing you ever again. I have a holo showing how you sabotaged my swoop in our last race, and I''m reporting you to the Commission! You''ll never race again, Ignar! I wanted to see the look on your face when I told you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/ignar_ominaz.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why are you and Dinnik Innik rivals?'),
