('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'Follow-through is important in my line of work, buddy. Come back when you can give me that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Follow-through is important in my line of work, buddy. Come back when you can give me that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/luthin_dlunar.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Follow-through is important in my line of work, buddy. Come back when you can give me that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 1, 'next', 'That''s all the work I have for you right now. I''ll keep you in mind if anything else comes my way.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Sorry, I can''t hire you if you''re working for somebody else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'If you think you can handle this job later, come back and see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I like your style. Not everybody has the moxie to walk right up to a Corellian Engineering Corporation bigwig and just start chatting. If you want a little temporary work, I think I could help you out with a few errands. Interested?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Take this datadisc to Banyon Craddok, he''s an investigator I''ve helped a time or two in the past. He''ll know what to do with it. You may want to keep an eye out for Black Sun. I think they may be involved in this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'You know the way out. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'To start with, there''s a delivery you could make for me. Some investigators are looking into some questionable shipping practices and I have some information that could be very valuable to the investigation. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Are you going to make that delivery or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Come see me again if you want to handle another errand for me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'I was hoping you would have delivered that disk by now. Shouldn''t you get on with that?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Come and see me in a little while. I need to find out where I should have him meet you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'That''s not a very good start to our relationship, is it? No matter, I''m sure you''ll do better next time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m waiting here to meet somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m waiting here to meet somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Perfect timing, I just got here myself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'This will put things in a different light. You tell Krast not to worry. It''ll all be taken care of.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'You lost the disk you were supposed to bring me? What happened to it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'That''s not the disk I was told to expect. Look again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What kind of errands do you have in mind?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'The Corporate Sector Authority representative in Coronet has been causing me a lot of difficulties recently and I''m starting to wonder if he''s completely on the up and up. Do you think you could help me out with this? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'I''m glad to hear it. The slicer is known as Fugue. Why is it slicers are never called anything normal?  Like Hank maybe. Just once I''d like to meet a slicer named Hank. But I digress, meet Fugue and bring me his report.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'How disappointing, I thought we were just starting to work well together.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Ha-ha! I really do like your style. Refreshingly straightforward. No, I recently paid a data slicer to examine his records and I just want you to pick up his report. Appointment for pummeling -- ha, ha! I love it! So will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I''ve told you all you need to know. Are you going to go or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'This is good news indeed. It always helps to have a friend in the CSA who''s eager to cooperate.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you met with that data slicer yet? He''s probably wondering where you are.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Come back to see me in a little while. I should get the rendezvous point any time now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'This isn''t working quite like I expected but I''m sure we''ll get past it in time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m sorry, I don''t know where the person you''re looking for is.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'My business is not with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'I think you''re looking for me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'Krast is gonna love this. I totally got the goods on that CSA guy in Coronet. If this got out he''d be finished.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'This is not the item you were supposed to give me. You might want to look again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Am I supposed to make an appointment to pummel him into cooperating or something? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Ah, there''s my go-getter. How would you feel about delivering another message for me? I''m much more confident in your abilities over those of my regular employees. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Jeter Corona is a courier for an associate named Lasha Bindari. Please give him this urgent message to pass on to her.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I guess I should stick with my regular employees.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Entirely correct -- except for the part about the credits. I just want you to deliver a message to a business associate. Can I count on you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Are you going to deliver my message or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'You''re an invaluable aide. I really must see about hiring you on full-time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you delivered that message yet? It really is urgent.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I need to find out where you''ll be meeting the courier. Would you mind stepping outside for a few minutes while I make this call?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'I''m sorry you ran into all that trouble. I hope you''re all right.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I don''t think I''m the one you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m waiting for somebody. Good luck to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Are you the messenger?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'I''ll bring this to Lasha straight away.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'What happened to the message you were supposed to bring? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'That isn''t the message you were supposed to give me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Let me guess. You want me to surreptitiously meet a total stranger out in the middle of nowhere and hand them a stack of credits while beating off angry predators.  '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', ''),
