('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'If you think you can handle this job later, come back and see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'If you think you can handle this job later, come back and see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/noren_krast.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'If you think you can handle this job later, come back and see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''ve been a big help. If I ever need more help, I won''t hesitate to ask.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You''ve already got a job. Come see me when you need some work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'If the job is too tough right now, see me soon and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Hey there, friend, you have a friendly face. Perhaps you can help me with a little problem. I''m a spice trader, and I operate within the law -- mostly. But I was doing a little trading with the Lady Hutt''s associates recently, and I think it might have been recorded. Can you help me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Glad to hear it.  Some guy recorded my transaction and he''s blackmailing me with it.  I want you to take care of him for me.  Can you do that?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'It''s just not my day, is it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Right to the point. I like that. There''s a guy who was hanging out near where I was talking to these, um...associates. I didn''t notice him until my business was already concluded. I want you to take care of him. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You haven''t changed your mind about helping me, have you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'That''s top-flight work, friend. Thanks. Next time I''ll be more careful about where I conduct my business.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you take out that blackmailer yet? I''m a nervous wreck here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Give me a few minutes to get the exact coordinates. I''m a little jumpy today. In a little while I should have them.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You couldn''t take him down, eh? Well, thanks for trying.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'You''re not getting this tape!  It''s mine!  It''ll make me rich!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/palejo_reshad.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'I''m not sure. What do you want me to do?'),
