('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 1, 'next', 'I don''t have anything else for you right now. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You already have a job. I never hire anybody who works for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'You think you can do this later, then come see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Are you looking for work? I got a doozy of a job lined up that I can''t do because the law is keeping a close eye on me. I figure, I get you to do this guy and we split the money. You in?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'I always like working with a shrewd negotiator. There''s a guild mining rep that''s been causing some problems for Black Sun. He''s moral, upright and won''t just do what he''s told and take the money. His name''s Jinz Finzer. Kill him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'You breathe word one of this to anybody and Black Sun will burn you so quickly there won''t even be any smoke.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'That''s fair. How about I offer you 80% and I keep the rest as a finder''s fee? Then I lie about how much money I was offered and give you the same amount I was going to in the first place? Do you want to kill this guy or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'If you''re not gonna go blast this guy, let me know now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Here''s your money, now beat it. I can''t be seen associating with you disreputable types. I have my standards, you know.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Haven''t you taken care of this yet? You''re not going soft on me are you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I have a probe droid following your target. Come back in a few minutes and I should know where you can find him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You didn''t kill him? What am I paying you for -- Oh wait, I guess I''m not.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m sorry, friend, I don''t have any business with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m sorry, friend, I don''t have any business with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'You Black Sun Goons never give up do you? You can''t buy me!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'If I''m doing all the work, shouldn''t I get more of the money?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/scolex_grath.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', ''),
