('string/en/static_npc/corellia/serji_x_arrogantus.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/serji_x_arrogantus.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/serji_x_arrogantus.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'You''re kidding, right? I should have known better than to rely on some stranger. I got nothing for you. Come back if you develop a spine.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/serji_x_arrogantus.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'You''re kidding, right? I should have known better than to rely on some stranger. I got nothing for you. Come back if you develop a spine.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 1, 'next', 'Business is running smoothly. But if I have any more difficulties, you''re my first choice to solve them.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'See me again when you''ve finished with your present employer.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I lack time to talk to you at the moment. Very regrettable, I know. But please talk with one of my lieutenants, Karena Keer. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome. I am Shalera -- some call me the Lady Hutt. You needn''t look so nervous. I never eat my guests -- at least not without tea, and you''ve just missed that. As it happens, I need some short-term help. My regular people are busy with a new project. Do you think you might be willing to deliver a message for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'You have the heart of a Jedi, always willing to aid the cause of peace. Bring my message to the courier waiting outside the city. We tend to conduct these affairs away from places where people might notice.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Perhaps you are wise not to put yourself between rivals such as Black Sun and myself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Recently things have been getting out of hand between my business rivals, Black Sun and I. All that bad blood is not good for business and draws unwanted attention. Will you help me arrange a sit-down?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'That''s all I can tell you right now. Please proceed with the task.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'A thousand thanks, my friend. I have the feeling you and I shall get along very well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Haven''t you delivered my message yet? I''m a patient Hutt, but --'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Now that I think of it, this may not be the best time to deliver such a message. See me about this again later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Regrettable that you weren''t able to succeed, but these things happen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'You and I don''t have any business to discuss'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m here waiting for someone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you here to deliver the message from the Lady Hutt?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'I''ll bring this to the boss right away.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'You didn''t bring the message? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I think you meant to give me something different.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who is getting this message?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'I fear your previous efforts on my behalf bore little fruit. The people in charge of Black Sun let their dislike of me cloud their judgment. Speaking of my illustrious competitors, you might assist me in teaching them a lesson. They''ve been crossing the line recently, and I want to discourage their childish antics.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Ah, so like myself -- willing to negotiate but unafraid of conflict. Black Sun recently shipped a valuable commodity to Corellia that they are temporarily storing at one of their smuggling dens. They''ve hired some offworld specialist mercenary to guard the stuff, but I want that mercenary eliminated.  Understand?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Truly your years belie your wisdom. It would indeed be foolish to get caught up in our struggle.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Petty things, really. Like telling CorSec the location of some of my hidden installations. Will you discourage such escapades on my behalf?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'You know all that you require. Go destroy that merc.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Excellent. Once again you have my gratitude.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Why haven''t you destroyed that mercenary yet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Perhaps we should wait a bit on that job.  I have just received news that may alter the social landscape. Meet with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'What a pity. I thought you''d be able to handle that. Very regrettable.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Not me.  You don''t want to talk to me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'One of the Lady Hutt''s new toys, eh?  You won''t last.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What sort of childish antics?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'I have need of you once more, my friend. One of my employees, an accountant, is away from the hustle and bustle of the city while she cleans up my more frontier accounting practices, but she needs an escort to get back safely. Will you help me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'I knew I could count on you. Her work is very important to me, so please bring her back safely. I''m sure she''s completely out of place in the wilderness.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I admire your sense of self-preservation. It''s dangerous out in the wilderness.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'She was escorted to a hidden location to do her work without any interruptions and now needs an escort back. She''s not really the outdoorsy type, but she likes to get away while she figures out how to clean up my credits.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Please hurry and bring back my accountant. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Where others would fail, you succeed. Well done.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'You mean she''s still waiting out in the wilderness? Well, go get her!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Oh bother! She just called in to tell me she wanted to double-check some new Imperial tax laws. Would you mind waiting a little while and then coming back?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You failed me? Words cannot express my surprise and regret. I''m sure you won''t let it happen again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Sorry, I''m waiting for somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m busy right now and don''t have time to talk.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Did Shalera send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', 'I''m so glad you''re here. I''ve had enough of the wilderness. Take me back to the Lady Hutt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Thanks for getting me here. I never could have made it by myself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why does she need an escort?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'My friend, I need your help in a delicate matter involving my business. One of my lieutenants thinks that because he works for me, he can do anything he wishes. He''s been drawing unwanted attention to my organization. Can you help me deal with him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Deal with him as you think best, of course. I''ve learned to trust your judgment. I warn you, though -- he''s very full of himself and may not be willing to listen to reason.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'Once again your wisdom astounds me. You''re right, this is a family matter, and I should attend to it myself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Demanding money from merchants. Shooting people who annoy him, and then warning witnesses "who his boss is" and how "they''d better keep quiet." Killing the Corsec officer who was investigating his case. Things like that. All very regrettable. Will you help me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'I really need you to attend to this matter with all speed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'That''s one way to keep someone from misbehaving. You should have been born a Hutt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Haven''t you yet shown my lieutenant the error of his ways?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Actually, I''m not sure where he is right now. See me later, and with luck I''ll have the coordinates you need.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'I was so sure you could make him behave. How regrettable.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'I know you''re not here to see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'What are you bothering me for? Get a job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'I work for Shalera the Hutt, you fool! You can''t touch me!'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'How has he been drawing attention to you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', 'This business never gets dull. A pilot known to be friendly to the Alliance has managed to get in trouble with CorSec instead of the Imperials. I''m being paid to smuggle him off-planet. Will you bring him to me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', 'Your loyalty is an inspiration to all who know you. The pilot''s name is Naz Tulos. Bring him to me before CorSec catches up with him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', 'Very prudent of you not to meddle in Rebel affairs. The Empire is not well disposed toward that sort of behavior. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', 'Let''s just say he rashly assumed that a CorSec ship belonged to the Empire. At the time, he was doing something the Imperials wouldn''t like, and so he took action. Very regrettable. Will you bring him to me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Hurry up and bring him to me, or neither of us will make any credits off this situation.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', 'I admire your resourcefulness. You''ve done very well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', 'If you don''t find him soon, then CorSec will.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Actually, things are a little hot for him right now. I''ll send you to find him when things have cooled down a little.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', 'I do so hate to lose an opportunity to make credits. Oh well, no use worrying about what we can''t change.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', 'I don''t know who you''re looking for, but I do know it isn''t me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', 'I''m afraid I don''t have time for idle chitchat. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', 'Did the Lady Hutt send you to find somebody?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_5', 'CorSec, ImpSec. How am I supposed to keep track of all these details? Just help get me off this world.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 106, 'npc_dropoff_5', 'Thanks for getting me here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 108, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 109, 'notit_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 110, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 111, 'player_sorry_5', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 112, 'player_1_5', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 113, 'player_2_5', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 114, 'player_3_5', 'How did he get in trouble with the CorSec?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 115, 'npc_1_6', 'Do you know much about the Berserker Virus? It''s an ailment that has recently been infecting the creatures of Naboo. It makes them unusually aggressive. I''m sending a sample of the virus to Jabba. You''ve been very dependable so far. Will you deliver the sample to his courier?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 116, 'npc_2_6', 'Fine. Black Sun is very keen to take this sample back from us. One of my operatives "found" it on one of their couriers. Be careful that they don''t foul up this delivery. I don''t want anything to upset Jabba, he has a bit of a temper.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 117, 'npc_3_6', 'I completely understand. I too am wary of handling this sort of biohazard.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 118, 'npc_4_6', 'They''ve not yet managed to engineer a strain that works on sapient creatures, so you should be completely safe. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 119, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'I can''t tell you anything more. Please -- just make the delivery.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 120, 'npc_reward_6', 'You''re everything a Hutt could want in an employee. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 121, 'npc_work_6', 'You haven''t delivered it yet? Jabba is waiting.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_6', 'They haven''t paid me, so I don''t want it delivered quite yet. Come back and see me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_6', 'Very regrettable. Jabba will not be happy about this. I''ll try to leave your name out of it when he asks what went wrong.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 124, 'otherescort_6', 'I''m waiting for somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 125, 'dontknowyou_6', 'Sorry, I can''t talk right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_6', 'Hey! Are you the courier from Shalera?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 127, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 128, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 129, 'npc_smuggle_6', 'That''s what I''ve been waiting for. Take care.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 130, 'gotowork_6', 'Where''s my package?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 131, 'notit_6', 'What''s that? You were supposed to give me something different.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', 'Is it safe for me to handle this virus?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_4', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_5', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 142, 'npc_reset_6', 'Sometimes unforeseen difficulties make our work harder. See me again later and try again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 143, 'waypoint_description_1', 'Deliver a message to a courier named Gatt Blanth. He will be awaiting you outside the city at this location.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 144, 'waypoint_description_2', 'Eliminate the Mercenary working for the Black Sun.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 145, 'waypoint_description_3', 'Escort Salya Greeler, a member of Shalera''s organization, to the Lady Hutt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 146, 'waypoint_description_4', 'Neutralize one of Shalera''s lieutenants, Yime Kalulez, who has gotten out of hand and is causing problems for the Lady Hutt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 147, 'waypoint_description_5', 'Rescue Naz Tulos, a pilot, from CorSec and return him to Shalera.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 148, 'waypoint_description_6', 'Deliver a sample of the Berserker Virus to a courier who will take it to Jabba on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 149, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt, and let her know the message was delivered.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 150, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt, and let her know the Mercenary is dead.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 151, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt, with Salya Greeler.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 152, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt and let her know Yime Kalulez has been punished.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 153, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt, with Naz Tulos.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 154, 'return_waypoint_description_6', 'Return to Shalera, the Lady Hutt, and let her know the Berserker Virus is one its way to Tatooine.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 155, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 156, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 157, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 158, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 159, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 160, 'return_waypoint_name_6', 'Shalera the Hutt'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 161, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Deliver a message'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 162, 'waypoint_name_2', 'Kill the Black Sun Mercenary'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 163, 'waypoint_name_3', 'Escort the accountant home'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 164, 'waypoint_name_4', 'Neutralize the trouble-making lieutenant'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 165, 'waypoint_name_5', 'Rescue the pilot'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/shalera.stf', 166, 'waypoint_name_6', 'A gift for Jabba'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 1, 'next', 'I don''t have any more work for you right now. I''ll keep you in mind when something else comes up.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You already have a job. When it''s finished, see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'Check back and see me when you''re a little tougher. I''ll still have a job for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'You were wise to seek me out -- Black Sun is a force to be reckoned with on this world. Are you looking for work? I have a job that''s perfect for a freelancer such as yourself. The Lady Hutt has planted an agent in our midst. We need this agent removed. Will you do the removal?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. It would be best if something happened to her after she leaves town. We''d rather this problem disappeared quietly. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Then I suppose we have no business to conduct with one another.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'A Twi''lek dancer named Kalar''naa. She''s the common link to several information leaks that have troubled us recently. She leaves town to meet her contact every few days. Will you see to it that she doesn''t do that again?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve told you all I can. Are you going to take care of this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'You have served Black Sun well. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'I''d hate for that informant to pass on more information. Were you going to finish this mission soon?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'We have someone keeping an eye on her. He''ll contact me when she leaves town. See me in a little while.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'That''s a bit of a disappointment. I''ll need to find another way to handle this matter.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m not the one you seek.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'I knew they''d figure it out eventually. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who is this agent?'),
