('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'Check back and see me when you''re a little tougher. I''ll still have a job for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/skinkner.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Check back and see me when you''re a little tougher. I''ll still have a job for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''re quite a smooth operator. I don''t have anything worthy of you just now, but I will definitely keep you in mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You and I should talk business once you''ve completed your current job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'If you think you''d like to try this later, come back and see me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'The name is Talon Karrde. I''m in the import/export business and find myself temporarily without an assistant. You seem a likely prospect. Would you be interested in making a few credits? I can use a little help with a pickup run. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'I thought you might be interested. You''ll be looking for Ara Miorri. She''s a little on the eccentric side, doing all her business outside of town -- although I hear that''s becoming more common.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Afraid you might get yourself in trouble? Probably good thinking. Good luck to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'A disk that a data slicer associate of mine has put together to help me with my shipping interests. I need someone to get it in my place, as I seem to have picked up a tail. Don''t ask who''s tailing me -- I don''t know. Will you make the pickup?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You haven''t lost interest in the job already, have you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'A job well done, my friend. Maybe we can do more business later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you picked up that disk yet? I was hoping to get it today.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'She''ll contact me when she''s ready to make the drop. See me in a little while.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Got a little hairy, I take it? That sometimes happens in our line of work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'You''re looking for someone? Sorry, it''s not me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m just waiting for a courier. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Did Karrde send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'You tell Karrde he owes me big-time for this. These are some high-clearance codes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I don''t think this is the disk she told you to give me. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What do you need me to pick up?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Do you recall that Rodian who tried to interfere with our last bit of business? Not long after you left that slicer, Ara Niorri, the Rodian''s partner killed her. Ara was a gifted woman, and I do not take kindly to associates being murdered. Will you be my tool of vengence?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Good, I didn''t think you''d let this offense stand unanswered. The Rodian''s name is Vralla. I''d be careful of her -- you foiled her partner, so she may be looking for you. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'I guess she didn''t impress you very much. I''ll handle it myself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Ah, answering that question is my current priority. I suspect a certain Hutt rival elsewhere on Corellia. She likes to keep her own hands clean nowadays, but she sends others to do the dirtiest possible work. Will you avenge Ara?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I''ve told you what I know. You haven''t changed your mind, have you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'So the lady Hutt was involved in this. Just as I suspected. I believe I''ll have to discourage her from playing in my affairs.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you found that blasted killer yet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'One of my informants will send the Rodian''s location shortly. See me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'I asked too much of you. Thank you for trying.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'Keep looking, you''ll find whoever you seek.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I don''t think I know you. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Well, if it isn''t the little wretch who foiled my partner. Milady Hutt will be most pleased if I kill you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why did the Rodians attack me and kill Ara? Who sent them?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'I''ve been keeping my eye on the Lady Hutt after our recent run-ins. My informants tell me she''s expecting an important delivery from Naboo soon. Will you intercept it for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'I knew I could count on you. The ship just landed in a remote location, and the delivery is being made by hand. Find the courier and take the package. I don''t like doing business this way, but the Lady Hutt must learn the consequences of interfering with me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'All right. Best to stay out of these power struggles if you don''t have a vested interest.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Technically I''m only going against one Hutt, but in truth, the answer to your question is yes. Nobody gets far in this business without taking some risks. Besides, I know a few things they don''t. Trust me on this. So will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'I''ve told you all I can. Will you get that package now?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'You got it? Good. Now I''ll find out what the Lady is mixed up in. Thanks for your good work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Were you going to intercept that courier, or did you subcontract this job?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Once the courier leaves with the package, my informant will contact me. See me soon and I should be ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You weren''t able to get the package? A minor setback. They happen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I don''t think you''re looking for me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m just delivering a message. Nothing to concern yourself with.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'You just made the last mistake of your life.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'Are you sure you didn''t mean to give me something else?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Are you really willing to go against the Hutts?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'I''m always a little horrified at the lengths people in this business will go to. The Lady Hutt has purchased a genetically engineered virus that heightens aggression. There are some things I''m just not willing to be involved in, and engineered viruses are right up there. Will you deliver this virus sample to the Biological Control Bureau for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Good. I''ve arranged for a quiet dropoff with one of the BCB couriers. Just meet him, give him the package, and there''ll be no questions asked. I hope they can get a retrovirus started in case anyone tries something foolish.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'I can''t fault your good sense. Good luck to you. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'I am assured that its current form does not affect sapient races. I wouldn''t be surprised if they try to change that. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Don''t you want to make that delivery for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Thanks. Kind of strange to be helping people for a change. I''ll try not to make it a habit. It might be bad for business. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Were you going to deliver that virus or just wait for it to mutate into something else?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Give me a few minutes to arrange a quiet meeting with a BCB courier. Come back shortly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'No luck? I''ll try to send over another sample.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'Keep looking, friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'I''m just waiting for a delivery.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Are you looking for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Thanks. I''ll get this back to the BCB for analysis right away.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', 'Weren''t you supposed to be bringing me some new virus sample? Where is it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 87, 'notit_4', 'I was expecting a virus sample. What are you giving me this for?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'Umm -- it''s not contagious, is it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/talon_karrde.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', ''),
