('string/en/static_npc/corellia/venthan_chassu.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/venthan_chassu.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_1', 'Your cavalier dismissal of my urgent need for revenge dissatisfies me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/venthan_chassu.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Your cavalier dismissal of my urgent need for revenge dissatisfies me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 1, 'next', 'Your services are very much appreciated. I don''t have anything further for you right now. Perhaps you should speak with the Viceprex.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Finish up your current job and then see me about some work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 3, 'npc_reset', 'I''ll keep the job open for you in case you change your mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 4, 'notyet', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'You want to work for the Corporate Sector Authority? One of the Viceprex''s underlings has had data slicers alter shipping documents to make the Viceprex seem incompetent and corrupt. I need help with damage control. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Bring this disk to Reeve Taggart. He''ll make some changes in this altered report and then upload it to where it belongs.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Don''t you have somewhere else to be?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'He''s not the only one who can employ data slicers to alter records. I want you to take this datadisc to our slicer. Let''s just say when he''s finished, it won''t be the Viceprex who looks like a fool. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Are you going to make that delivery?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Wonderful. Come back and see me later. The CSA may be able to offer you more work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you dropped off that disk yet? It''s something you shouldn''t wait to do.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I need to contact our slicer and see where he wants the drop. Check back in a few minutes after I take care of that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Ran in to difficulties along the way, did you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m waiting for someone else, friend, sorry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m waiting for someone else, friend, sorry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Do you have something for me from the Deputy Viceprex?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'You tell them I''ll take care of this right away. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'What did you do with the disk you were supposed to bring me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'That''s not the disk I was told to expect. Look again. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What are you hiring me to do exactly?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'I''m glad you''re here. We''ve had one of the spice mining union representatives quietly brought to Corellia to negotiate a special deal. Would you mind escorting him here safely? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'These trips aren''t all that uncommon. It''s one of the perks when you''re a union rep who works with the CSA. Try not to draw attention when you escort him back. The fewer folks who know he''s here, the better.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'I''ll look for someone else to help me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'A temporary reduction of shipping rates, as well as other good and valuable considerations for which reciprocal benefits would manifest in due time for those individuals vested in the -- I shouldn''t bore you with details. Will you do it? '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Did you want this job or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'I hope you didn''t have too much trouble. I''ll take care of things from here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Haven''t you even left yet? Get moving.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me call our associates on the other end and make sure everything is clear. See me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'I hate it when unforeseen problems arise. '),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m expecting to meet somebody else here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''m waiting for someone else to meet me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Are you here to bring me to the CSA Deputy Viceprex?'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'I''m glad to see you. For a moment I thought somebody was after me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Good job getting me here. This is a rough place.'),
('string/en/static_npc/corellia/vinya_maysor.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
