('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bab_esrus.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bab_esrus.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bab_esrus.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bab_esrus.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bab_esrus.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 1, 'next', 'I don''t have anything for you just now. If you want more work you should go to Moenia and talk to Borvo. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Talk to me again once you''ve finished with your current employer.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'I''ll keep the job open, so check back when you feel inclined to give it another try.  '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'This isn''t a good time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Very wise, speaking with me. You could do much worse than ally yourself with Borvo the Hutt. I''m his lieutenant. If you''re interested in earning credits, I happen to be missing a courier. That''s the problem with so many beings in this line of work -- they''re unreliable. Interested in making the drop in his place?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Wonderful. You''ll be giving this package to an Imperial courier, so I doubt you''ll have any legal trouble. However, you may run into tedious busybodies from Kritus Morven''s gang. See me once you''ve finished.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'What a fine upstanding citizen you are. Now you''d better run along --people might get the wrong impression about you if they see you talking to me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'If you have to ask... actually nothing too illegal. A certain Imperial official has a taste for Kassoti spice. Borvo wants to meet the needs of all his friends in the Empire.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Did you change your mind about delivering that spice?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good job. I think I could find more work for you soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Were you going to deliver that spice or just hang onto it? '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'The Imperial courier will contact us once he''s set out for the rendezvous. Check back in a while.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You didn''t deliver the spice? Borvo will be sorely disappointed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m waiting for somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Just go on about your business.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you the courier?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Thank you, citizen. I''ll take it from here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'You were supposed to bring me some spice? What happened to it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I''m pretty sure you were supposed to give me a different package.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What sort of delivery is this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'A local official who the boss did a big favor is sending a thank-you gift to him. You''re new to the organization, so nobody would associate you with us yet. Would you mind picking up this package?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Glad to have you working with us. Meet Imperial courier Val Tula. She''ll have a datadisc for you. It''s a valuable item, so watch yourself once you make the pickup. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'You think you can just say no? Is that what you really think? Well -- that''s true. Now get lost. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Just to protect that official. Borvo has a -- reputation, and the authorities tend to keep an eye on his known associates. Nobody will give you a second look. No offense.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Were you going to pick up the goods, or do you just want out?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'You seem to handle yourself pretty well. Keep up the good work and there may be a place for you in our organization.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you pick up that package yet? The boss was wondering where it was.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'The courier will contact us as soon as he leaves. See me again in a while and I should know more.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'I''m sorry you couldn''t finish the job. Don''t worry, though, the boss is a forgiving sort -- at least by Hutt standards.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m waiting here for somebody else. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''m waiting here for somebody else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Are you the courier I''m supposed to meet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'Not to worry. All these codes are squeaky clean.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'This is not the item you were supposed to give me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why is it important that I not be associated with you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'You don''t have a problem dealing with Gungans, do you? Personally I can''t understand a blasted thing they say, but the boss has a soft spot for them. One of them, named Mubarr, owes us a little money and hasn''t been coming around to make his payments. Would you mind collecting for us?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'I figured you could handle this one easy. Just find Mubarr and explain the problem to him. If he doesn''t cooperate -- you do what you have to.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I guess you''re just the softhearted type -- or maybe you can''t understand them either.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Our slicers tell me Mubarr''s bank records show he has the money. Just be sure to get his bank codes so we can extract a late fee and, of course, your payment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Are you going to collect from that Gungan or are you giving up?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Good work. Can you believe how that guy would try to ignore his obligations to the boss? It breaks my heart.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'So did you collect from that Gungan yet, or what?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'We''ve got a guy tailing Mubarr. When he''s somewhere we can meet him privately, he''ll send word. See me in a while.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You didn''t collect? Someone has to collect from him or we''re gonna look like suckers. That''s not good in our business.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Yousa bein'' in da wrong place to meet yousa friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Mesa no liken yous outlaunder. Off wit yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Mesa no liken de interest. Mesa be crunchin'' yous, not be skeered of yousa none.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'How am I supposed to collect it if he doesn''t have it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'You are in a position to do Borvo a great service. His majordomo has been taken captive by his rival, Kritus Morven. We want her back, urgently, and we want you to get her.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Her name is Xan''lac, and she''s a Twi''lek. Feel free to kill any non-Twi''leks in her vicinity. Be careful of her though -- she''s a very valuable resource. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'This is a bad time to turn me down. Certainly not the act of a friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Let''s just say she''s an integral part of our accounting process. The specifics of her job are not pertinent. We just want her back as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You know everything I can tell you. Or were you having second thoughts?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'You have done a great service to our organization. You deserve a vacation -- Moenia perhaps. Borvo lives there. Maybe you might stop in and visit him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'If you were wondering when is the right time to make that rescue -- the answer is "now."'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I need to make some quick back-up arrangements. Check back in a few minutes. I hope to have everything prepared.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'You didn''t rescue her? I guess we move to Plan B.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'I''m not the one you seek. A pity, really.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Don''t you have business of your own to attend to?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Help me! Please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'I''m relieved to see you. You''re good at what you do. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'You''ve been a wonderful companion. Thank you for getting me here safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'What does a majordomo do, exactly?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/bardo_klinj.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', ''),
