('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Yousa goin'' to come backo when yousa job is done, okeyday?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
