('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brass_marshoo.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Okeyday. Yousa comen back when yousa mooie-mooie tough.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 1, 'next', 'Thanks for all your help. I haven''t heard back about my job application but I continue to be hopeful. I''ll let you know when I do.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Put them up! I mean, reach for the star! Well, uh, hmm, you seem fairly busy. Perhaps we could continue this later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'I understand your reluctance to help a miserable sleemo such as myself. If you change your mind, however, you know where to find me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I got nothing to say right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Stand and deliver! I believe that means that you should give me all your valuables. Well, if they''re small and portable, that is. And if it''s not a terrible inconvenience. I can come back. Oh, whom am I kidding? I''m a terrible mugger! Serves me right for squandering my inheritance - gambling is an evil vice! I have no useful skills so I thought I''d try my hand at crime, but I''m as incompetent at that as I was at gambling. Could you do me a favor? I''ve only successfully mugged one person and I feel just awful about it. Could you return this necklace to its rightful owner?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Thank you so very much! I''ve been tortured about this for weeks now. I do hope that sweet old woman can forgive me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'I understand. Why would someone like you wish to help a pitiful wretch like me? I won''t trouble you any further.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Oh, she''s the sweetest old woman, a dear friend of my late grandmother''s, actually. Millaflowers are her passion! In fact, you''ll likely find her tending them in the wild. Please tell her I''m awfully sorry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''m sorry, was I unclear about something? Do you wish to reconsider?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'I cannot thank you enough! Was Mia pleased? I''m truly in your debt. Here, take this. I''m not sure what it is but you might find some use for it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'I hate to be a bother, but have you returned that dear old woman''s heirloom?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I know she tends wild millaflowers at a certain time of day. If you check back with me, I can give you her precise coordinates.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh dear, how dreadful. Not only am I a complete failure in life, I''m also a terrible judge of character. I wonder how difficult it would be to contract a deadly disease?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m sorry, I''m terribly busy at the moment. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m sorry, I''m terribly busy at the moment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Yoohoo! Do you like millaflowers? They''re wonderful this time of year!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Oh, my necklace! How did you get this? I''d given this to my dearly departed friend''s grandson. He''s such a sweet boy and has fallen on hard times. Thank you for returning it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'Can I help you? Were you on an errand of some sort?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I''m not sure what that is or why you''d want to give it to me. I assure you I don''t need it. Thank you anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who did you mug?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'I know you''ve done so much for me already but I was wondering if you could do me one more favor? I''m trying to get back on the right path but I need some help doing it. A friend of mine, and I use the term "friend" in this case to describe someone who loves taking my money when we''re playing sabacc but otherwise ignores me, never made good on an old gambling debt. Could you deliver this payment request for me? He might be more inclined to pay when he sees you delivering it. Especially if you snarl a bit. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Again, I''m ever so grateful for your help. I''m sure good things will come of this. And, by the way, Temir''s a bigger coward than I am so you should be quite safe.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Right, I overstepped my bounds. Terribly sorry! Feel free to ignore me from now on.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'His name is Temir Tonnalo. And I hope you don''t mind but I told him you worked for Black Sun. And that you were a good friend of mine. I apologize.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Are you having second thoughts? I understand if you are.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', '"Kind" does not begin to describe your qualities. My eternal thanks, friend. You don''t mind if I call you friend, do you? You are quite deserving of a reward. This is the best I can do.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you deliver my payment request? I hate to be a bother about this but I am a bit eager to get that money.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'My friend has a bit of wanderlust so it may take me some time to track him down. Please check with me in a bit and I''ll give you his coordinates.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'You didn''t deliver the request? How unfortunate. I''m sure you''re probably very busy. I''m sorry I troubled you with this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I don''t know you, buddy, and I don''t want to.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I don''t know you, buddy, and I don''t want to.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'You looking for me? I''m sure I don''t owe you any money, pal.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'What''s this? A collection request from Doore? You gotta be kidding me! I''m not gonna pay that loser a single credit. Uh, you''re not his friend, are you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', 'Were you looking to give me something, pal? I ain''t got all day.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'Not sure what this is but I know I don''t want it. Maybe you were thinking of giving me something else?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What is your friend''s name?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'I feel like a criminal asking this of you (no pun intended) but I think I''ve finally figured out what I can do with my life. I promise, if you help me out with this, I''ll never bother you again. I know I''ve said that before, but this time I mean it. Could you take this completed job application to the Imperial Preservation & Refocusing Authority''s representative? I''ve heard that department will take anybody and a government job would be the answer to all my problems.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'If I ever have children, I''ll name them all after you. I swear. Pardon me, but I''m getting a little emotional. sorry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'Naturally. How presumptuous of me. I''m a cad. Worse, I''m a dolt! I''m a clueless, worthless, presumptuous worm. Please ignore me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'I''m not sure, but I believe it has something to do with exploiting a planet''s natural resources and making it look like "progress." Sounds like something that''s right up my alley, huh? The man you need to take this application to is named Rille Nuder.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Have I asked too much of you? I have, haven''t I? I understand if you wish to strike me now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'You''re one very special being, do you know that? I''d hug you if I weren''t afraid you''d punch me in the face for it. Here, my friend paid his gambling debt thanks to you. Allow me to reward your gallant deeds. It''s not much, but it''s all I have.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you drop off that application? Please disregard this entire conversation if you had. I can be so pushy sometimes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I''m supposed to receive Nuder''s coordinates shortly. Please check back with me in just a bit.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'I suppose it wasn''t meant to be. I''m sorry to have wasted your time. Now if you''ll excuse me, I''m going to try and will my heart to stop.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I''m terribly busy and can''t be bothered.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m terribly busy and can''t be bothered.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Can I help you? This area is being surveyed by the Imperial Preservation & Refocusing Authority and so is off limits.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'An application. Is this yours? No? I''ll be sure to review this after I''ve finished processing the almost ten thousand applications waiting for me at the office. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'Are you a courier? Were you supposed to give me something? You''re new at this aren''t you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'That doesn''t appear to be an Imperial document, an application, or a generous cash donation. That means I probably don''t want it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'What does the Imperial Preservation & Refocusing Authority do?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/brennis_doore.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', ''),
