('string/en/static_npc/naboo/crider_trant.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'See me again when you''re up to doing the job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/crider_trant.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'See me again when you''re up to doing the job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/crider_trant.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'See me again when you''re up to doing the job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/crider_trant.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'See me again when you''re up to doing the job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/crider_trant.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'See me again when you''re up to doing the job.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''ve been a great help. I''ll keep you in mind for future work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I''m sure I can find some work for you when you''ve finished your current assignment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'I''m sorry to hear that. If you feel like you''re more capable of doing the job later, I''d be happy to work with you in the future.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I''m too busy to talk to just anyone right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Hi! Are you looking for work? I have a little errand I could use help with. A courier is supposed to bring me a datadisk, but he''s having some trouble getting here. He took a minor leg injury when some creature surprised him. Nothing too serious, I assume. Could you bring me the disk?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good, you can help me by meeting Bor Ting and bringing his message back here. Keep aware -- it wouldn''t do for both of you to get hurt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Oh well, I''ll try to find someone else. Thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Dee''ja Peak is a beautiful place to study nature. That''s how I wound up here. I arrived to study wildlife and never left. I think they just gave me this groundskeeper job so I wouldn''t look like a transient. What do you think, can you pick up the disc?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Were you going to meet that courier, or did something else come up?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thanks. Let''s see here -- well! Something called the Berserker Virus is making the wildlife more aggressive. I guess maybe you figured that already. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you picked up that message yet? Shouldn''t you be going then?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I seem to have lost his location coordinates. Come back and see me in a few minutes -- I''ll have found them by then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'How disappointing. I was sure you''d be able to handle this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m sorry, I''m here to meet someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'If you''re looking for someone, I''m pretty sure it isn''t me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'It''s about time you got here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Thanks for meeting me. Here are some important findings from the Ministry of Science in Theed. I''m getting back to town before something else jumps me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'This isn''t the information I was expecting. Don''t you have a datadisk for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/damalia_korde.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What is your job here?'),
