('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Oh. Well, uh, okay. I hope you''ll check back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Oh. Well, uh, okay. I hope you''ll check back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Oh. Well, uh, okay. I hope you''ll check back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Oh. Well, uh, okay. I hope you''ll check back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/dilvin_lormurojo.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Oh. Well, uh, okay. I hope you''ll check back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 1, 'next', 'Hzzznt -- hzzznt -- hzzznt -- hzzznt --'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Hzznt -- ah? Uh? Sorry, I was sleeping. You''re the one they sent to do that job? What''s that? Busy, you say? Well, come back later, then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Hzznt -- uh? What? Can''t do the job? You woke me up to say you can''t do my job? Well, come on back when you can do it, then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Er...can you come back?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Hzznt -- wha? What''s that? I was sleeping. Oh. You. You''re the one they sent looking for a job. Right? Speak up, I can''t hear you. They made me get one of those ear implants, but the thing makes my skull buzz. Where''s my assistant? He can fix my ears. Bring me my assistant. I sent him out somewhere. I forget why.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'What? I can''t hear you. Go find my assistant, Rinto Liprus. I sent him -- where did I send him -- oh! Into the wilderness. Now why did I do that?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'What? I can''t hear you. Where''s my assistant? He''ll fix my ears.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Speak up, I can''t hear a thing. You need to find my assistant. His name''s Rinto Liprus. My great-grandson, I think. Will you go find him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'What? I can''t hear you. Go find my assistant.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Ah, here''s Rinto, and here''s my ears. Ah, that''s better. I can hear now. Take a little something for your time, youngster. Now, what brings you here? Looking for a job, are you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Hzzznt -- nuh? What? Are you back? You''re finished with that job? No? Then don''t bother me until you''re done. I need my sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'What? I need my assistant, Rinto Liprus. I sent him to -- darnit, where did he go? I forget. You come back later, I''ll remember, you''ll see.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'What? I can''t hear you. Where is that assistant? Rinto! Rinto!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I think you''re looking for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I think you''re looking for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hello! I''m Rinto Liprus! Did Ebenn send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Ebenn sent you, I assume? I met the sympathizer and got the Imperial political data. Oh, aren''t you --? Okay. I don''t blame you for being confused -- Ebenn can be crotchety sometimes. He was once a great man, though, long ago.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'Thanks for the escort. You''ll be able to talk to Ebenn now. -- Hello, Great-Grandpa! It''s Rinto! I''m here to fix your ears!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who is your assistant?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'All right, I can hear you now, you don''t have to shout -- Where am I? Oh yes. You''re looking for a job, right? Well, listen: The Republic is falling on hard times, and unless we do something to help Chancellor Valorum, that Pala-- Plapa -- that Senator What''s-his-name will bring ruin on us all. Deliver these funds to set up a commission inquiring into what may be done.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'All right, that''s the kind of vim I used to have myself, eighty or ninety years ago! Take this to -- oh, what''s his name? Name, name -- Tanner Helton! Go. Hope I''m still alive when you get back.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'What? Can''t do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Haven''t got that much time left.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Wha? Me? Oh, I''m just an old man. Used to be on the Royal Council. Traveled, wrote a lot of books. The Galactic Phrasebook, that was mine. Collected folk art of the Hutts -- very interesting, Hutt art, I remember one piece that -- Well, never mind. I need these funds delivered, youngster. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I''m tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'All right then. Here''s your pay. That Chancellor Valorum had better buckle down, or the whole Republic will in trouble. Yes, yes -- Wait, who are you? Looking for a job?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Hzzznt -- nuh? What? Are you back? You''re finished with that job? No? Then don''t bother me until you''re done. I need my sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'What? You say I sent you to deliver funds to Chancellor Valorum? That''s ridiculous! Valorum hasn''t been around since the Old Republic! Go away, let me sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'You got the wrong fellow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'You got the wrong fellow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hey! Did that old man send the money?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'About time. I told that old man those medical supplies wouldn''t budge past the Imperial blockades until I got this money. Okay, I''m off to the Outer Rim.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', 'I was expecting a payment from that old man. Didn''t you bring it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'I was expecting a payment from that old man. This isn''t it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Who are you, anyway?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Wait -- what year is this? This is now, isn''t it? I thought so. I drift away sometimes. Well, want another job, youngster? Some fool of a poet -- young sprat! -- sent me her poems to recommend to my publishers. Hah! Can''t fool an old man! She just wants me to recommend this junk to my publisher! I mean -- uh -- I forget what I meant. Anyway. Take her junk poetry back to her without my recommendation. That''ll show her!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Good, good -- What? You still here? Go, go! You''re looking for that poet -- what''s her name -- Nura Tinall. As if I would ever read her poetry, hah! That''s what I say, Hah!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'What? Can''t do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Haven''t got that much time left.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Me? I''m, I''m -- I forget how old. When was the Trade Federation War? I retired not long after that. Retired to Manda with my wife, Pookie, and we had a miniature bantha named Nuke. Good old Nuke. I never should have outlived them. But here I am. Now, what about that job?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'I''m tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Wha? Who are you? What''s that? Plans? I don''t know anything about any plans. Oh, I remember. I sent you off with that junk poetry. Here, take a little something for your time. Spend it while you can, I say.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Hzzznt -- nuh? What? Are you back? You''re finished with that job? No? Then don''t bother me until you''re done. I need my sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'Didn''t deliver that poetry? Bosh, I could do it myself, and I''m a lot older than you, youngster. Well, I''ll find someone else. Yes I will! Hah!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I don''t think you''re the one I''m supposed to meet.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I don''t think you''re the one I''m supposed to meet.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hello! Did Ebenn send the plans?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'At last! The plans for the Emperor''s Retreat! Princess Leia will be glad to see these. Thanks!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'I was expecting the -- well, a document from Ebenn. Didn''t you bring it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'I was expecting the -- well, a document from Ebenn. This isn''t it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'How old are you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Ah? Oh, you''re back. I remember you from the Clone Wars, don''t I? Good. I have a favor to ask, Master Jedi. Don''t lie to me, I saw you with that Jedi Knight, what''s-his-name. He just called, asked me to send a guide to bring him here for a nice dinner. Won''t that be nice? What do you say, Master Jedi?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Good. Pay the Jedi, Rinto. Rinto? Where is he? Well, Master, I''ll pay you when you bring me your Jedi friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'What? Can''t do it? Well, stop wasting my time then. Very rude for a Jedi Knight to waste an old man''s time!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Ah. Got that "Q3" by undergoing the ceremonial Passage Rite at the semi-summer festival on Vintrus. Wait, was it Vintrus --? No, it wasn''t the Passage Rite, it was -- well, maybe I don''t remember. What about that job? Please don''t keep an old man waiting, Master Jedi.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'I''m tired of talking. I need a nap. You go on now, Master Jedi.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Wha? Who''s this? Some kind of alien thing! Well, I''ll have Rinto take care of this monster. Who are you, youngster? Do I owe you money? I remember now -- you brought me Rinto from the wilderness. Here, take a little something for your time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Hzzznt -- nuh? What? Are you back? You''re finished with that job? No? Then don''t bother me until you''re done. I need my sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Good, good! Now, the coordinates you need are -- uh -- mmm. Mmmnhh. Hzznt -- hzzznt -- Uh? What? Who are you? Go away, let me sleep.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'Wha? Who are you? What? You were doing a job for me? Bosh. Never saw you before in my life. Go away, I need a nap.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'My not knowin'' what you want wit'' mesa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'My not knowin'' what you want wit'' mesa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Heydo! Yousa sent from de Baobab guy?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Issa true? My hearin'' Baobab say mesa Force-sensitive? Is dat bein'' right? Oyi, mooie-mooie! I luv yous! Yousa be takin'' me to Baobab now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'Mooie-mooie tanks! Heydo, Ebenn! Yousa sendin'' mesa to be learnin'' de Jedi mind tricks?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'Why do you have "Q3" in your name?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ebenn_q3_baobab.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', ''),
