('string/en/static_npc/naboo/gavyn_sykes.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Well, I can''t say I didn''t expect that. But you might check with me later nonetheless.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/gavyn_sykes.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Well, I can''t say I didn''t expect that. But you might check with me later nonetheless.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/gavyn_sykes.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Well, I can''t say I didn''t expect that. But you might check with me later nonetheless.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/gavyn_sykes.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Well, I can''t say I didn''t expect that. But you might check with me later nonetheless.'),
