('string/en/static_npc/naboo/graf_zapalo.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Given the gravity of our crisis, I hope you''ll return when you feel able.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/graf_zapalo.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Given the gravity of our crisis, I hope you''ll return when you feel able.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/graf_zapalo.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Given the gravity of our crisis, I hope you''ll return when you feel able.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/graf_zapalo.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Given the gravity of our crisis, I hope you''ll return when you feel able.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/graf_zapalo.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Given the gravity of our crisis, I hope you''ll return when you feel able.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 1, 'next', 'My gotta no more stuff for yousa bein'' doin''. Tanks!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Heydo! Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee. My got a job for yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'There''s nothing I need at the moment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Ello! Yousa got time to hep de Otoh Gunga Zoological Facility? My bein'' Facility director. Wesa got a maxibig problem wit outlaunder tourists comen to Naboo and bringin'' dey pet animals. De animals had gettin'' loose, ruinin'' de ecology. Deysa one beast, a blistmok, comen outen Talus. My needin'' it killed. Okeyday?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Dissen what mesa want hearin''. Yousa go to work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Itsa ittybitty reptavian ting wit maxibig blisters all over. Yousa not be touchin'' dosa blisters, or yousa gettin'' mooie-mooie bombad poison. Yousa takin'' disa job?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Yousa be gettin'' to work soon, mesa hopin''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Mesa so smilen to hearin'' yousa news. Mooie-mooie!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Yousa not findin'' dat blistmok yet? Is a maxibig problem.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Wooah! Mesa datapad just now losin'' de coordinates! Wesa gotten no more blistmok to be findin'' right now. Yousa comin'' back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway. Wesa gonna find dat blistmok, yousa knowin'' it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What is a blistmok?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Ello! Our scientists had figurin'' out whatsa goin'' on wit desa reports. Some virus is drivin'' de animals cawazy. Yousa gotta kill desan latest intruders, duey bocatts outen Tatooine, so wesa can autopsy deysa brains!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Dissa just what my wantin'' to hear. Yousa go puttin'' down deysa bocatts.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'A bocatt, hesa outlaunder reptavian-felinoid hybrid outa Tatooine. Bigga sharp teeth. Dey huntin'' in pairs, usually, trackin'' dere prey wit smellin''. Bombad nasty. So, yousa willin'' to hep de Zoological Facility by killin'' dese bocatts?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Yousa be gettin'' to work soon, mesa hopin''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Hey hey! Mesa busten wit happiness! '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Yousa not findin'' dose bocatts yet? Is a maxibig problem.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Wooah! Mesa datapad just now losin'' de coordinates! Wesa gotten no more bocatts to be findin'' right now. Yousa comin'' back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway. Wesa gonna find dose bocatts, yousa knowin'' it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What is a bocatt?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Ello dere! Desan latest outlaunder intruders bein'' duey monstahs called langlatches. My got no idea where desan stinkowiff tings come from. Yousa mebbe wantin'' to be killin'' dese langlatches for us?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Dissen what mesa want hearin''. Yousa go get ridda deysa langlatches.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Itsa mooie-mooie mean and mooie-mooie ugly.  Desa scavenge dead carcasses and eggs of creatures. Desa nasty!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Yousa be gettin'' to work soon, mesa hopin''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Mesa so smilen to hearin'' yousa news. Mooie-mooie!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Yousa not findin'' dose langlatches yet? Is a maxibig problem.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Wooah! Mesa datapad just now losin'' de coordinates! Wesa gotten no more langlatches to be findin'' right now. Yousa comin'' back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway. Wesa gonna find dose langlatches, yousa knowin'' it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
