('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'What is a langlatch?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Heydo! Some bombad nasty outlaunder ting is makin'' its way t''rough the forest, killin'' just for de joy of killin''. We caught de owner, but de animal had gettin'' away. Disa Corellian slice hound, mooie mooie dangerous beast. Yousa up to de task?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Yousa be careful wit dem slice hounds. Desa mooie mooie dangerous.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Des Corellian slice hound is messa dangerous predator. Desa attack anything... even Gungans... and desa mooie-mooie intelligent. Desa got mooie sharp teeth and spikes. Yousa be careful!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Yousa be gettin'' to work soon, mesa hopin''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Hey hey! Mesa busten wit happiness! '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Yousa not findin'' dose slice hounds yet? Is a maxibig problem.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Wooah! Mesa datapad just now losin'' de coordinates! Wesa gotten no more slice hounds to be findin'' right now. Yousa comin'' back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'Oh, berry bombad. Tanks anyway. Wesa gonna find dose slice hounds, yousa knowin'' it.'),
