('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_4', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/huff_zinga.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Okeyday. Yousa seein'' me when yousa gettin'' more time, mabee.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 1, 'next', 'I have no further need of your services at this time. Check with my aide for future assignments.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'You need to be focused when you work for me. Come back when other more trivial matters do not concern you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Go speak to my assistant, Junelle Astor. She can arrange an appointment for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'So, I see Junelle has cleared you. Good. I need some surveillance equipment delivered to one of my agents. He''s currently investigating a group of Gungans suspected of aiding the Rebellion. Can you do this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. You should depart immediately. I wish the Gungans would realize how badly their actions reflect on the Naboo and our beloved Queen. If they''d only embrace the Empire, life would be easier for all of us.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Are you sure Junelle cleared you? Why go through all that trouble if you had no desire to help?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'The agent is Eevas Drupper. I''ll let him know you''re on your way.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve told you everything you need to know. Do you still wish to do this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Well done. With any luck we''ll bring these malcontents under control soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you deliver that sensor pack? My agent can''t do his job without it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'It seems my agent''s location has been compromised and he must elude a pursuit. Check back with me later for his new coordinates.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Failing to deliver a simple package does not bode well for your future career with me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I don''t think I''m the person you''re looking for. Good luck on your search.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m waiting for someone. I''m afraid I can''t talk right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Did the Governor send you? I''m Eevas Drupper.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Thank you. This will make my work much easier.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'I believe you have something for me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'Are you sure this is what the Governor asked you to give me? It doesn''t seem right.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What''s this agent''s name?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'I''m happy to see you''re so eager to serve me. Good help is hard to find. Take for example one of my agents, a Gungan loyal to the Empire who has been discovered spying on his traitorous fellows. He''s managed to elude his pursuers thus far but fears he will eventually be tracked down. Could you see to it that he makes it back here safely?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Do hurry. Loyal Gungans are hard to come by.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Remember when I said that good help was hard to find? I think you see what I meant now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'The clever Gungan, named Boona Deeks, hid inside the rotting carcass of a bolle bol for a couple of days. So be warned, he might be a touch on the odorous side.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Was something unclear? Why are you standing around?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'You''ve done well. Now I think I need to direct this Gungan to the bathing pools.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you bring that Gungan agent safely back to the palace? I know he''s just a Gungan but I do have need of his services.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'As it turns out, this Gungan agent thinks it''s too dangerous for anyone to approach his position at the moment. Check back with me later for an update.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'That''s most unfortunate. That Gungan knew the names and locations of several terrorist cells. That information is lost. Ah well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'Mesa not for yousa. Yousa looken for other to saven.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Mesa not spek wit yousa. Mesa busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Ex-squeeze me! Yousa lookin for mesa? Mesa Boona Deeks!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Mesa mooie mooie happy yousa showed up. Big bombad waiten for mesa out dere.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Oyi, mooie mooie! Mesa yous humble servant.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'How did he elude his pursuers?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'This next assignment will require some amount of discretion. Mal Sikander is convinced that our beautiful Queen has sympathies for the Rebellion. This notion is completely ridiculous. One of Sikander''s agents has managed to acquire some of Her Majesty''s private correspondence. This is unacceptable. Find this traitor, punish him, and retrieve Her Majesty''s personal property.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'I can see you are a being of breeding and discriminating tastes. Be sure to make an example of this traitor. Away with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'Is it because you feel you can''t be discreet? Well, perhaps this is for the best.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Our beloved Queen is above reproach. That is obvious for anyone to see. A form as graceful and delicate as hers could not harbor such foul treachery. Will you serve her?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Was there something else you wanted from me? Or are you ready to embark upon this mission?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Did the traitor beg for his life? I hope this sends a clear message to Sikander and his goons.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you retrieve the Queen''s private property? This matter must be settled soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'The traitorous thief has gone into hiding. My spies will find him, worry not.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'Her Majesty''s private correspondence should not be passed around like some sort of cheap court gossip. I am most disappointed by your failure to acquire that disc.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Don''t know who you''re looking for, friend, but it isn''t me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I can''t talk right now. I''m on an important mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'I''m on a mission for Mal Sikander. Back off!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why is this notion ridiculous?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Ah good, a trusted agent. I do hope you''ve come ready to perform more duties for me. I''ve managed to discover how Sikander''s agent got his filthy hands on the Queen''s property. A so-called wandering troubadour helped the High Inquisitor spy on Her Majesty after gaining our good Queen''s confidence. I need this criminal apprehended and brought back to me. Can you take care of this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Excellent. The performer''s name is Ryd Rozen. He''s a coward and will not resist arrest. Be on the lookout, however, for Sikander''s agents.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'I hope you''re not refusing for fear of Mal Sikander. I assure you I can shield you from the High Inquisitor''s wrath.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Her Majesty is a kind-hearted patron of the arts. No doubt she felt a great swell of pity after hearing this artist perform and likely took him under her wing. Certain unscrupulous individuals take advantage of such kindness.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'This knave is likely to get away if you dally. Shouldn''t you be going?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'I appreciate your delicate handling of this matter. I''d keep a low profile, just in case Sikander''s agents are lurking about.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you brought in that treacherous troubadour? He is a menace to the court''s security.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'There''s been a complication. My spies have lost track of this scoundrel. Check back with me later. He won''t escape us for long.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'This musician could have provided us with many answers. Your failure to bring him back vexes me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'I''m sure you''re not looking for me. I haven''t done anything wrong.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Now is not a good time. I''m a bit preoccupied.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'You looking for a troubadour? Uh, uh, he went that way! You just missed him! Honest!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'I''m under arrest? But I''ve done nothing wrong! I''m innocent! I''m just a simple musician! Please don''t hurt me! I''ll come along peacefully!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'Remind me never to get involved in court intrigue again! I hope I make it out of this alive.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'How did this troubadour gain the Queen''s confidence?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', 'Just the agent I was hoping to see today. Ready to serve our beloved Queen again? You already know that Her Majesty''s kind heart can create situations that are problematic. You must handle another such situation. Our noble Queen had been aiding some Gungan refugees that have now been implicated in treasonous activities. You must travel to the Gungans'' camp and silence their leader, Yip Kanoos.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', 'Good. If Kanoos has bodyguards, dispose of them as well. We must protect the Queen''s reputation at all costs.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', 'I find you refusal to serve Her Majesty both baffling and deeply insulting. I shall have to think on this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', 'The brute can tarnish Her Majesty''s sterling reputation by making it seem as if she were aiding and abetting Rebel sympathizers. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Your briefing is concluded. What else do you require?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', 'I''m glad that''s been handled. I may need your services again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', 'Have you taken care of that Gungan leader? His existence threatens some very important people.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', 'My spies have just informed me that Yip Kanoos has gone into hiding. We''ll find him soon. Check back later for the villain''s coordinates.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', 'Kanoos should not have been allowed to live. Now many more Gungans shall have to die to insure Her Majesty is shielded from false allegations.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', 'Yousa not lookin for mesa. Yousa be needin someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Mesa not knowen yousa. Now go.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', 'Mesa no like de Empire! Mesa crunchen de oppressors!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 106, 'npc_dropoff_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 108, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 109, 'notit_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 110, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 111, 'player_sorry_5', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 112, 'player_1_5', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 113, 'player_2_5', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 114, 'player_3_5', 'Why must the Gungan leader be silenced?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 115, 'npc_1_6', 'I wouldn''t want to rely on just any agent for this next mission. You have proven yourself trustworthy and capable. One of Captain Dallows'' lieutenants has been under investigation by Sikander''s agents and was observed traveling to the Gungan swamps on unknown errands. My spies tell me that this officer is suspected of being involved with the Naboo Resistance. It is in everyone''s best interest if this officer were to disappear without a trace. Can I rely on you? '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 116, 'npc_2_6', 'Excellent. The officer is Lieutenant Leana Kilnar. It''s my understanding that she''s currently on some mission in the wilds. This is most fortunate, wouldn''t you agree?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 117, 'npc_3_6', 'You aren''t suddenly becoming squeamish, are you? Developing a conscience at this stage is both overdramatic and inconvenient.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 118, 'npc_4_6', 'No, I''ll take care of clearing your name. You''ll be perfectly safe, I assure you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 119, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'This is a pressing matter and needs resolving. Standing there won''t get it done.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 120, 'npc_reward_6', 'You have served me well, agent. You will find that I can be quite generous to those loyal to Naboo. It is my hope that we can work together again in the future.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 121, 'npc_work_6', 'Did you remove that "obstacle" to Her Majesty''s security? I do hope this matter is resolved quickly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_6', 'One moment. It seems that Lt. Kilnar is harder to track down than I had anticipated. Check back with me later for her coordinates.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_6', 'Removing Lt. Kilnar would have quieted things down considerably here at the palace and left Sikander frustrated. Your failure means more work for me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 124, 'otherescort_6', 'I''m not sure who you''re looking for, but it''s not me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 125, 'dontknowyou_6', 'Sorry, I''m on duty at the moment and can''t talk.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_6', 'This is a Royal Security matter! Do not interfere!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 127, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 128, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 129, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 130, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 131, 'notit_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', 'Will this get me in trouble with the Royal Security Force?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/ian_lago.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'How very disappointing. Come back when you can actually finish what you begin.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''ve done a fine job. The Governor would be happy to see you now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I''m sorry, the Governor is occupied. But when you''ve finished your current assignment, see me. I might have a job for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'That''s too bad. If you think you might be up to it later, see me again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Sorry, I need some time to myself for now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I''m Junelle Astor, the Governor''s aide. Are you looking for work? If you do well, the Governor might be willing to meet you. I need you to pick up a disk from a data slicer. He''s nervous about being seen in town at the moment. If you''d sliced into an Imperial Inquisitor''s personal files, you might feel flustered too. Will you go?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. I shall wait for you -- and the datadisc -- here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Enjoy your tour of the palace.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'I really shouldn''t tell you this, but the Governor is concerned that Imperial Inquisitor Mal Sikander distrusts our Queen. He wants to obtain certain correspondence to see if that''s actually the case. Not to worry though -- the slicer is an alien. Nobody pays them much attention around here. Will you get the disk?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Will you pick up that disk for the Governor, or are you too busy?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good work. I trust we can rely on your discretion in this matter. I''m sorry to say the Governor remains busy, but check back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Haven''t you met with the data slicer yet? Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'The slicer will contact us when he''s ready for you. See me in a little while. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'I''m sorry to hear of your failure. The Governor will be very upset.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'If you''re looking for someone, I''m afraid you haven''t found them yet.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I don''t know you. Leave me alone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you the courier from the Governor?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Nobody followed you here, did they? Here''s the disk. Now forget you ever saw me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'This isn''t what I asked you for. Where''s the disk?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Why did this slicer break into the Inquisitor''s files?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'I''m sorry, the Governor is still busy. But I have another assignment for you. I need you to destroy a probe droid that''s following one of the Queen''s personal guard. Mal Sikander sent this droid. Note that if you botch this, you may run afoul of an Imperial Inquisitor. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'I''m glad you''re on board. It''s just not right to set a probe droid on one of the Queen''s guards. It makes her look bad. See me again once you''ve destroyed it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'I''m disappointed, but I understand. I''m sorry to say that the Governor''s schedule is very full for the foreseeable future.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'The High Inquisitor labors under the foolish delusion that the Queen''s staff is secretly supporting Rebel activities. I believe Her Majesty''s aides care about nothing but fashion and makeup. But still, it doesn''t do to have this probe droid following them. Will you destroy it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Are you going to destroy that probe droid?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Very good work, my friend. I know the Governor will be pleased. Unfortunately, he remains busy -- but if you check back later, perhaps I can arrange something.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you destroyed that droid yet? By all means, take your time! !t''s only the honor of the Queen we''re dealing with.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'The guard is in the palace at the moment, and we obviously don''t want you to destroy the droid here. Check back soon, and very likely he''ll have left the palace grounds.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'You were unable to complete your task? Whatever will I tell the Governor?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why is Mal Sikander sending a probe after the Queen''s guard?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Boss Nass is sending a gift to the Queen, but it would be bad timing for Her Majesty to receive a gift from him. I want you to meet this messenger and take possession of this package before he gets here. Will you do it?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Now I know we''re in good shape. Find the Gungan courier before he enters the city and take the package from him -- whether or not he wants to give it to you. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'What a pity -- you seemed so reliable. Goodbye.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Boss Nass is thought to be a Rebel sympathizer. If the Inquisitor found out he was giving presents to Her Majesty, it might cause him to doubt her loyalty. This would be bad for Naboo. Will you help?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Are you going to stop that courier?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Your work has been exemplary. The Governor said he''d like to meet you. Why don''t you speak with him now?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you managed to get that package from the Gungan courier? There''s not a lot of time left.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Our lookout will contact me as soon as the courier has left the Gungan Sacred Place. See me in a while, when I hope all will be ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'We can only hope Mal Sikander doesn''t hear about the Queen receiving this gift.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Mesa no bein'' here for yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Mesa no bein'' here for yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Is''n yous cawazy? Whysa you be crunchin'' on Bungo?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why is it a bad time for the Queen to get a present?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/junelle_astor.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', ''),
