('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Protecting the Senator''s life is not an easy task. I understand if you feel you''re not qualified to do so. Best of luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Protecting the Senator''s life is not an easy task. I understand if you feel you''re not qualified to do so. Best of luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Protecting the Senator''s life is not an easy task. I understand if you feel you''re not qualified to do so. Best of luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Protecting the Senator''s life is not an easy task. I understand if you feel you''re not qualified to do so. Best of luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kima_nazith.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Protecting the Senator''s life is not an easy task. I understand if you feel you''re not qualified to do so. Best of luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 1, 'next', 'You do good work. I''ll keep you in mind for future jobs.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'If you want to make some creds working for me, see me when you''re not so busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Can you find someone else to talk to, please?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I''m Kritus Morven, a local businessman. I make sure Borvo the Hutt isn''t the only one on Naboo making a profit. Speaking of that slimy Hutt, he wants to make some sort of deal. No doubt some opportunity where I take all the risks and he takes all the profit -- but I should at least find out what it is. Will you meet his courier and bring me the offer?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Wonderful. I feel sure we''re going to get on very well. Meet Fekk Trunkel outside the city, where you can conduct your business away from prying eyes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'High time you were leaving then. I have things to do. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'I don''t dislike Borvo -- I find him a worthy adversary. When I''m staring down at his corpse and running all his holdings, I will remember him fondly. It''s nothing personal, just business. So will you go and get that lying Hutt''s offer?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'So were you going to pick up that offer from Borvo?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'I''ll review this, but I''d rather carry him than trust him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Haven''t you picked up that message from Borvo? Why not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'There''s still a lot of time before you need to meet the courier, so come back and see me a little later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Hmm. I hope this doesn''t lead to an all-out war with Borvo. I''m not ready for that yet, quite.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'Sorry, I''m not the one you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m busy at the moment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hey! Are you the courier I''m waiting on?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'You bring this to Morven. See if he''s got the sense to know a good deal when he sees it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'Weren''t you supposed to bring me a message? This isn''t it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Is it my imagination, or do you not like Borvo?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'While you were gone, I hope you weren''t working for that corpulent oozing fool of a Hutt. He thinks he owns Naboo, but I''m about to teach him otherwise. You''re not wanted by the law, are you? I need the services of someone who won''t be shot on sight by security personnel. Is that you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. Find one of the security people looking for Borvo''s spice refinery and give him this disk. The data should help narrow the search.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'You''d better be on your way.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'One of my informants tells me Naboo security forces are looking for Borvo''s spice refineries. As it happens, I know the location of one. Purely as a concerned citizen, I want to offer them this information. So are you in?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'So are you going to deliver this message?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Nice. I almost wish I could see his repulsive, slimy face when he finds out his refinery has been raided.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Haven''t you made the delivery yet? Why not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I need you to wait a while before you tip off security. See me again about this soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'A perfect opportunity to stick it to that oozing sleemo. A perfect opportunity -- lost!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'If you''re looking for someone, look elsewhere.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Sorry, pal. No time for conversation today.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'You''d better have a good reason for being here, citizen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'An anonymous tip, eh? Thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', 'You don''t seem to have any legitimate reason to be here. Get out of here before I put you under arrest.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'What am I supposed to do with this? '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why do you care what the law thinks?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Those stinking security people have no sense of gratitude. After I go to the trouble of giving those security officers the location of Borvo''s spice refinery, they turn around and start looking for mine! That Hutt has to be behind this. I need someone to help fix this for me, fast. I can count on you, can''t I?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Good! I just need you to bring this authorization for credits to security officer Dagrus Rhine. Move fast!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'What a shame. I was just starting to like you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'I made a deal with a security officer who''s been cooperative in the past. You bring him some credits, and he''ll slow up the search long enough for me to get my goods out of there. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'So are you going to drop off those credits?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'You saved me a lot of inconvenience on that one. Thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you made that drop yet? I have a lot riding on this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'See me in a little while. I''ll have all the details by then, I hope. '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You didn''t make the drop? This is going to be highly inconvenient.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I''m not here waiting for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m not here waiting for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Are you the messenger?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'I''ll slow things down as much as I can. Now get out of here before someone spots you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'No credits for me? No help for your boss.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'I believe you were supposed to bring me credits. I have no use for that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'How am I supposed to fix this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'The word on the street is that Borvo the Hutt has his greasy hand in something new. I plan to find out what it is and get in on the action. A couple of Borvo''s boys have been escorting some brainy type on what appear to be hunting expeditions. I need to find out exactly what that bloated slime factory is up to. I want you to get the big brain away from the guards and bring him to me. How about it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Great. I''m sure he''ll be more than happy to tell me whatever I want to know.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'Prefer being small time, do you? Goodbye.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'I''m not sure. I heard something about a disease that drives animals crazy. That''s all I know, but the brain-guy will know more. Will you get him for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You going to get that scientist for me now?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Good work. Now I can find out what''s in this guy''s brain -- either the polite way, or more physically. See me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Where''s Borvo''s scientist? Haven''t you gotten him yet?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'See me later. My informants will let me know when Borvo''s thugs have left the city again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'That blasted Hutt is gaining too much ground. This is not good for my business interests.\n'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'If you''re looking for somebody, I''m afraid it''s not me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Sorry, friend, I can''t help you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'I have a bad feeling about this.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Please don''t hurt me. I''m not even armed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'What did I ever do to deserve this?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'What do you think he''s involved in?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', 'You are not going to believe what that oozing gravity well Borvo has his hand in. Bioweaponry! We''re not going to let that bulging mucus repository make all the credits on this, are we? Of course not. Borvo''s courier is delivering a sample for him to sell to some Corellian buyers. I want you to intercept him and get that sample. You''re with me, aren''t you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', 'Good. Borvo''s courier, Dekker, won''t be willing to just hand over the sample. Take whatever steps are needed to get it. Clear?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', 'Foolish to say no at this point, but it''s your decision.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', 'Borvo''s scientist was quite forthcoming after a little persuasion. There''s some virus that increases aggression. Borvo has been selling it offworld. I need you to get me a sample. Will you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You''re going to fetch that little sample for me, aren''t you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', 'You''ve done very well. You may want to leave town for a while. Borvo may not be too happy with you right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', 'Hurry up and get that sample.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', 'It''s not time for the delivery quite yet. See me later and I''ll let you know then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', 'You couldn''t get it, could you? Blast! That Hutt wins another one.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', 'I''m waiting for somebody else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', 'I''m waiting for somebody else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', 'Die, fool!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 106, 'npc_dropoff_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 108, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 109, 'notit_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 110, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 111, 'player_sorry_5', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 112, 'player_1_5', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 113, 'player_2_5', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 114, 'player_3_5', 'What is this bioweapon?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 115, 'npc_1_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 116, 'npc_2_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 117, 'npc_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 118, 'npc_4_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 119, 'npc_backtowork_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 120, 'npc_reward_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 121, 'npc_work_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 124, 'otherescort_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 125, 'dontknowyou_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 127, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 128, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 129, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 130, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 131, 'notit_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/kritus_morven.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Some days just don''t go so well. Try me again later. I''ll still have work for you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 1, 'next', 'You again? Well then, I guess I can let you look around some more. Go on in.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Sorry, this is a private family retreat. Can''t let you in unless you have an invitation. Funny, you look too busy to enjoy the place.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'All right, I understand. I hope you''ll check back later when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Sorry, I need some time alone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Sorry, this is a private family retreat. You can go in if you have an invitation. Otherwise -- well then, you might make yourself useful. Want a job? A Corellian visitor brought in a pet krahbu -- one of those big, fast mount animals -- and it got loose. Something drove it crazy -- maybe when it ate the local plants. Now this pest is killing local wildlife and livestock. Find the krahbu and kill it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. I''ll wait for you here. Come on back after you''ve put down the krahbu. Be careful.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Well then. I expect you''ll find some nice place to visit, other than here. Goodbye.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'This is the Lake Retreat of the Naberrie family, one of the most honored families in Naboo history. Queen Padme Amidala was a Naberrie, along with several former senators and many high officials. Now, about that job --'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve got nothing more to tell you about that krahbu. Get to it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Sorry to see that animal put down, but it had to be done. Invading species, you know. Here''s a reward. If you have an invitation, go right in. Otherwise -- well then, talk to me about another little job, and after that, I''d be willing to let you in to look around.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Hmm, didn''t expect you back. Not yet done putting down that krahbu, I see. Well then, get to it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'That''s good -- no, wait. I remember, I''ve got a tour group ambling through that area just now. This would be a bad time to kill animals there. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'Couldn''t catch that krahbu, eh? I''m not surprised, they''re fast. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who owns this private retreat?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Interested in more work, are you? Well then, if you take care of one more little matter, I''ll let you into the retreat -- assuming you don''t have an invitation already. I think that krahbu infected a local mott with some Corellian virus. The disease must have driven the thing crazy. You have to put it down before the epidemic spreads.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. I''ll be here waiting, just like before. Come on back after you''ve put down the mott.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'And you made yourself so useful before. Guess that was the exception. Well then, goodbye.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'If you can picture a little garbage masher on four legs and covered with fur and tusks, that''s a mott. Ill-tempered and brusque, in contrast to my own sweet nature. Well then, about this job -- will you take it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I''ve got nothing more to tell you about this mott. Get to it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Thanks. That mott was just a nuisance before, digging up my garden and whatnot. But this could have been a plague. Well then, you''ve proven you have gumption. Go on in, look around -- but don''t tell anyone I let you in.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Hmm, didn''t expect you back. Not yet done putting down that mott, I see. Well then, get to it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'That''s good -- no, wait. I''ve got a tour group ambling through that area just now. This would be a bad time to kill animals there. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Couldn''t catch those mott, eh? I''m not surprised, they''re sneaky. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lareen_dantara.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', ''),
