('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 137, 'gotowork', 'I don''t have time to chat right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_2', 'Very well, please return later when you can help me. Meanwhile, you should look into the imported Rodian Ale at the bar. Delicious!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Very well, please return later when you can help me. Meanwhile, you should look into the imported Rodian Ale at the bar. Delicious!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_4', 'Very well, please return later when you can help me. Meanwhile, you should look into the imported Rodian Ale at the bar. Delicious!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_5', 'Very well, please return later when you can help me. Meanwhile, you should look into the imported Rodian Ale at the bar. Delicious!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/leb_slesher.stf', 142, 'npc_reset_6', 'Very well, please return later when you can help me. Meanwhile, you should look into the imported Rodian Ale at the bar. Delicious!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 1, 'next', 'Well, hello again! I have nothing for you right now. Goodbye!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Well, hello there! I hope we can speak together soon when you''re not busy elsewhere.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Why, I''m disappointed in you. I would have hoped for better. In fact, I still hope for better. It''s in your best interest to see me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I''m trying to remember something.  Can you give me some time?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Well, hello there! I''m Lergo. I''m in shipping, commodities, and personal services. Are you interested in work? A good friend of mine is a pilot who''s currently stranded here on Naboo, due to the unlucky theft of his licenses and permits. I need you to bring him the new permits he needs to launch safely from this planet''s excellent starport facilities. Can you do this for me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good! I''m glad. Return here once you''ve delivered the data to Breggs Ker''tani. Let me hear from you in a timely manner, or I''ll be disappointed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, I''m disappointed. I say that truly. I think it would be unwise of you to return here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, some Naboo busybodies wilfully misinterpret any offworld pilot''s presence as signs of a smuggling operation. I caution you against that misinterpretation. These busybodies might prove a minor threat. So, will you help my friend? I''ll be most disappointed otherwise.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I''ve given you quite enough information to get started. If you shilly-shally around, I shall be quite disappointed -- and that is always bad.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'I welcome this excellent news! I reward you appropriately, and I advise you to find me again when you need more work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'What a surprise! I never expected you''d report back before you finished that delivery. I admit a trace of disappointment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Good. My associates are completing a certain amount of busywork regarding the permits. Please check back with me soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You could not deliver the permits? How very disappointing. I think it would be unwise of you to linger long in Keren.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'You got the wrong guy. Push off.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'You got the wrong guy. Push off.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'You! Have you brought those codes from Brazee?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'These passcodes better work. I''m not gonna try to fly casual through another Star Destroyer blockade.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', 'Are you going to bring me those passcodes from Brazee, or aren''t you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'I''m waiting for passcodes from Brazee. That isn''t them.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What risks might be involved?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Welcome back! Perfect timing. An associate just made a distress call. He was conducting business with Lord Humbonnen at one of his wilderness estates. On his way back, he fell afoul of bandits. He needs a safe escort back here to Keren. I want you to be the escort.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'That''s fine, fine! You''re looking for a Twi''lek named Slyd Shu''ril. He may well suspect you of being a bandit, you being a shady-looking sort, so approach him carefully. And watch out for the bandits!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'I cannot believe you would reject my offer. I advise you to reconsider and check with me again. I dislike rejection intensely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'Lord Humbonnen has made great breakthroughs in enlisting Gungan natives into a productive workforce. My organization equips him to carry out his recruitment programs. With heroic effort he has overcome significant native resistance. All the more reason why my associate deserves safe conduct back from his estate. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'You have been told everything you need to know. I advise you to get started.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Another piece of excellent news! I anticipate that you and I will enjoy a long and productive working relationship, much like Lord Humbonnen and his native workforce.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'What a surprise! I never expected you''d report back without Slyd Shu''ril at your side. I admit my disappointment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I''ll have my people trace the coordinates of my associate''s distress call. Check with me momentarily, and we''ll get you started.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'You could not rescue my associate? How very disappointing. I think it would be unwise of you to linger long in Keren.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'You''ve got the wrong fellow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'You''ve got the wrong fellow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Oh, no, another bounty hunter! No, wait -- did Brazee send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Hope you can handle a blaster, buddy -- I''ve got a Trandoshan bounty hunter on my tentacles, hired by the Gungans who escaped from Lord Humbonnen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Thanks. These Gungan escapees are making too many problems for a profitable operation. Time to teach them a lesson.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', 'Get to work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'What business took him out to Lord Humbonnen''s estate?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'I''m sorry to report that more Gungan agitators are troubling my client Lord Humbonnen. My associate, a Bothan named Linay Sind''ir, was recruiting new workers at one of the Gungan sacred places. Native savages ambushed her slav-- recruitment brigade, killed them all, and are now holding her prisoner. I implore you to rescue Linay.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Excellent. Move quickly to save Linay, before those natives captors do unspeakable Gungan things to her.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I cannot believe you refuse to rescue Linay from an unspeakable Gungan fate. I advise you to leave Keren by the next shuttle. Matters could become very unpleasant for you otherwise.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', '"Slave" is an inappropriate word. My organization expedites a productive relationship between Lord Humbonnen and his native workers. All their needs are provided for, so they need never leave the plantations and stables. And what use has a simple Gungan for money? I suggest that you put such questions out of your mind. Now, will you rescue Linay?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You have been told everything you need to know. I advise you to get started.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Thank you for returning Linay safely. Now if you''ll excuse me, it appears I have a crisis to handle. Check back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'What a surprise! I never expected you''d report back before you rescued Linay. I admit to deep disappointment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I''m still waiting to get current coordinates for Linay and her captors. Check with me soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You could not rescue Linay? That will be a blow to our operation. And, I daresay, a deeper blow to yours. I advise you to leave Keren, quickly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'You really don''t want to be here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'You really don''t want to be here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'At last! Kill these Gungans and get me out of here!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Not a moment too soon. We have to get back to Brazee. I''ve learned something Black Sun needs to know about!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Thanks. -- Vigo Brazee! All the mercenaries are dead, and the natives are planning a raid on Humbonnen''s pens to free the workers. We have to field a squad of agents, quickly!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'Get to work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why would Linay "recruit" Gungans at their sacred places? This sounds like a slave operation.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Welcome back. I have grown confident in your ability and discretion. A notorious Gungan bandit leader is planning a major raid on one of Lord Humbonnen''s estates. The loss of innocent life would be tremendous. I require you to organize a strike team and stop the leader in his tracks!');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Good. Let me see, the leader''s name is -- oh, spare me -- "Big Blismo." According to my report, he typically moves with several guards. Move quickly!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'Does it not wrench your heart to think of the loss of innocent life? Very well. If that is your decision, you would do well to leave Keren by the next shuttle. You will not live long otherwise.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'As I may have mentioned in the past, "slaves" is an ugly and unjust word. I should think that the bandit leader''s interference in lawful food production and gualama breeding operations would be reason enough to stop him. Is that sufficient? Will you, in fact, stop him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You have been told everything you need to know. I advise you to get started.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'My friend! I can count on you for anything, it seems. I shall remember your service to me, and so will the rest of my organization. Now, it is probably best if you leave Keren for a while, until matters quiet down a bit. Goodbye!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'What a surprise! I never expected you''d report back before killing Big Blismo. I suggest you don''t return until you''ve succeeded.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Even now I await a report of the bandit leader''s whereabouts. Consult with me in a minute or two, and I should know more.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'You failed to stop Big Blismo, and as a result, Lord Humbonnen has sustained a significant loss to his labor force. I am genuinely unhappy. For your own safety, I advise you to leave Keren immediately.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'Yousa not workin'' for Lergo Brazee. My not carin'' ''bout yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Yousa not workin'' for Lergo Brazee. My not carin'' ''bout yousa.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Yousa! Yousa workin'' for Lergo Brazee! Mesa Gungans gonna makin'' yousa sorry!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/lergo_brazee.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
