('string/en/static_npc/naboo/palo.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/palo.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/palo.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/palo.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/palo.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 1, 'next', 'Currently we''re allocating Resistance resources elsewhere on Naboo. I have no assignments now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I have matters to discuss with you, once you''re no longer occupied on your current assignment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'Were you sent here by Captain Dallows in Theed? No? Please see him first. It''s safest for us to welcome newcomers based on his reference.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome. I''m Pooja Naberrie, a Senator of the Old Republic and leader of the Naboo Resistance against the Empire. We are pressed hard, but we fight hard. We need your help. An Alliance pilot has arrived on Naboo to deliver an urgent message. The Empire downed her ship in the wilderness, but she survived. I ask you to meet her and bring her here safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. When you find her, Gizda Ramani will speak the recognition code "Sensor Beacon." I caution you that Imperial Security is on her trail. May you both return safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'I understand that you may fear the danger, but I hope you''ll reconsider. We have few agents here, and the pilot''s position is grave.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'The pilot is Gizda Ramani, a human from Coruscant. I believe she''s bringing reports from our infiltrators of Imperial orders of battle for this entire sector. Ramani is an accomplished pilot but only recently joined the Alliance, so we must try not to make her regret it. Will you escort her?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'There''s nothing more I can tell you. You''ll have to get out there and scout out the situation on the ground.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'I see that Captain Dallows was wise to send you here. I trust this success marks the beginning of a long relationship.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'We''re still waiting for the downed pilot, Gizda Ramani. Please bring her here safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I''m still waiting for a report on Ramani''s current coordinates. I should have them shortly, so consult with me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'I hope Captain Dallows knew what he was doing in sending you here. We need all the help we can get, but it''s a dangerous posting, and only the strong survive.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m not the one you''re looking for. Especially if you''re ISB.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m not the one you''re looking for. Especially if you''re ISB.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'You there! Code sign "Sensor Beacon"!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'This is getting too wild. I''m having enough trouble fighting off the animals, and now Imperial Security is on my tail!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'That was great work! I hope it isn''t like this every day in the Alliance.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Who is the pilot?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'That Alliance pilot you rescued brought important news. None other than Herosk Bal''far, an aide to Mon Mothma herself, has smuggled himself onto Naboo. He''s convoking a secret conference here with many local nobles who are quietly sympathetic to the Alliance. It is crucial that Bal''far arrives here safely. Will you escort him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'I knew the Alliance could count on you. Bal''far is a Bothan, middle-aged and heavy-set. He may have attracted Imperial attention, so keep your weapons ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'This is a desperate time for the Naboo Resistance. I hoped we could count on you. Please see me if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'You wouldn''t know Bal''far unless you studied the early history of the Alliance. But he was one of Bail Organa''s first supporters among the Bothans, and has helped recruit many SpyNet installations to our cause. If he falls here, it will harm our struggle in this entire sector. Will you escort Bal''far?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'There''s nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'I appreciate your good work. This conference may prove to be a turning point in the Resistance efforts on Naboo, and we have you to thank.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Haven''t you located Herosk Bal''far yet? We need him here urgently.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I''m expecting Bal''far to relay his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Without Herosk Bal''far here, we may have to cancel our meeting. I hope we can salvage the situation.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m sorry, you have the wrong Bothan.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''m sorry, you have the wrong Bothan.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'I hope you''re here on Senator Naberrie''s business.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Your arrival is the first piece of fortunate news I''ve had today. I suggest we get to Dee''ja Peak with all speed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'My greatest gratitude to you. I hope our meeting proceeds with somewhat less incident.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Who is Herosk Bal''far?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'We are assembling a conclave of Naboo aristocrats who sympathize with the Resistance. One noble has sent her servant to pick up directions and clearance codes. We have arranged a wilderness rendezvous, away from prying Imperial eyes, and would like you to deliver the datadisc to the servant. Will you go?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Very good. You should leave at once. The meeting will start shortly. Imperial Intelligence agents will certainly want this communiqu'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I''m disappointed. This may sound like a simple delivery, but much rides on the noble''s attendance. Let me know if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'I fear I must keep the aristocrat''s identity secret for now. If you fall into the hands of Imperial Security, the less you know, the better. Will you deliver the datadisc?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'There''s nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'I expected good work from you, and I''m happy that you''ve lived up to all expectations. We''ll count on you for future help in tight spots.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you delivered the datadisc to the noble''s servant? I''m counting on you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I''m awaiting confirmation that the servant has reached the rendezvous point. Then we''ll send the disc. Talk with me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'This is unfortunate. If our sympathizer fails to attend our meeting, the other nobles may become skittish. I hope we can bring her here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I''m not here to meet with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m not here to meet with you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Is that the disc for my employer?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'Thank you! I''ll convey this to Madame Paddu right away.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'I was expecting a datadisc from Pooja Naberrie. Don''t you have it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'I was expecting a datadisc from Pooja Naberrie. That isn''t it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Who is the noble who''s sending her servant?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Our secret conference with sympathetic Naboo nobles is about to begin. Captain Dallows in Theed has sent one of his security officers to Dee''ja Peak as a guard for the meeting, but the officer ran into an Imperial patrol on the way. Our reports indicate he may have been wounded. Please escort the officer here safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Good. The RSF officer is named Turon Adala. Use the standard recognition code "Tibanna gas."'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'Would you really walk away from an Alliance member whose life is in immediate danger? I''m very disappointed. Talk to me if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'We have reports that a small squad of stormtroopers tracked the officer using a domesticated tusk-cat. Our officer downed a few of the troopers before he escaped, but the rest are still out there -- as is the cat. Are you up to this escort mission?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'There''s nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Officer Adala has already thanked you, and I''ll add my gratitude. Your presence makes me more confident that this meeting with Naboo''s nobles will succeed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you not found Officer Adala yet? The Imperials are undoubtedly closing in on him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I''m expecting the officer to relay his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'It''s always sad news when the Resistance loses a fighter. We can''t spare any. I hope the meeting will still proceed.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'I''m not the one you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'I''m not the one you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Hey you! Tibanna gas! I''m looking for company!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'That wasn''t the subtlest code-sign I''ve ever given, but it worked. Let''s get to Dee''ja Peak, because I hurt all over. Watch out for a couple of stormtroopers -- I think they''re using a tusk-cat to track me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'I always loved tusk-cats, until now. Thanks for getting me past that one.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'How strong was this Imperial patrol?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', 'Trouble. Stormtroopers have arrested Lim Paddu, the local noble whose invitation you delivered a while back. For the moment, they don''t know who she is -- they think she''s just a suspicious traveller. But once they take her back to the nearest city, High Inquisitor Mal Sikander will identify her and have her executed. Will you rescue Lim and bring her to the conference safely?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', 'I''m glad that Lim Paddu has such a capable rescuer. I recommend a small strike team to handle her captors. Good luck!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', 'I implore you to reconsider. Lim Paddu''s life hangs in the balance. If you change your mind, talk to me again.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', 'Lim Paddu has quietly supported our Resistance since the beginning, first with funds, later by persuading other aristocrats to our cause. She has a gift for cutting through ideological bickering with practical advice. She told one noble, "If you support the Emperor, fine, but you own land on a dozen worlds -- what if he blows them up too?" Will you rescue Lim from certain execution?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'There''s nothing more I can tell you. Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', 'You''ve brought Lim Paddu! This is excellent news. Our meeting is underway, and her comments will inject an element of practicality that is sorely needed among the aristocracy. Thank you!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', 'Have you not rescued Lim Paddu? Much rides on your success. Please hurry.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', 'I''m awaiting new intelligence on Lim Paddu''s exact coordinates. Contact me again soon, when I''ll know more.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', 'You didn''t rescue Lim Paddu? This is bad luck for the Naboo Resistance. We must look for support elsewhere among the aristocracy. Well, thank you for your efforts.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', 'You have the wrong person.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Sorry, you have the wrong person.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', 'Hello! Are you the one Senator Naberrie sent?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_5', 'Good thing I memorized the directions and didn''t have Pooja''s datadisc on me, or the Empire would know all about this secret meeting. I hope you can get me there quickly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 106, 'npc_dropoff_5', 'Ah, looks like you got me to the meeting in time for me to contribute a few choice observations. Thanks very much for saving my life!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 108, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 109, 'notit_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 110, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 111, 'player_sorry_5', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 112, 'player_1_5', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 113, 'player_2_5', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 114, 'player_3_5', 'Who is Lim Paddu, and why is she important?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 115, 'npc_1_6', 'We have a crisis. One of the conference participants brought a servant, a man named Melloc Fitzal. It turns out Fitzal was a covert agent for Imperial Security. We screened all transmission devices before the conference, but Fitzal got out undetected and has met an escort of storm commandos in the wilderness. If he gets back to the city alive, the entire Resistance on Naboo will be finished. Assemble a strike team and stop him!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 116, 'npc_2_6', 'I wish you the best of luck. If you''re facing as many storm commandos as reports indicate, you''ll want to assemble your largest strike team. Good luck!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 117, 'npc_3_6', 'I implore you to reconsider. The Naboo Resistance is depending on you. Please talk to me again if you change your mind.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 118, 'npc_4_6', 'I have only sketchy information about the escort accompanying Fitzal. I''m told it could be as many as four or five storm commandos, which means you''ll need an experienced strike team. Will you destroy the spy and his escort?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 119, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'I have no more to tell you, except to wish you luck. Destroy Fitzal before he reaches a city.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 120, 'npc_reward_6', 'Thanks to you, the conference ended safely and the parties have left. I offer you my profoundest thanks. One noble left you this token of appreciation for your heroism.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 121, 'npc_work_6', 'Have you not destroyed that spy? We''re counting on you, and time is running out!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_6', 'I have every field agent scouting the countryside, tracking Fitzal''s movements. I expect a report of his coordinates shortly. Talk to me again soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_6', 'You didn''t stop the spy? That''s very bad. We''ll try to activate covert agents within the ISB. It''s a major sacrifice, but we must resort to desperate measures.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 124, 'otherescort_6', 'Imperial business. Move along.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 125, 'dontknowyou_6', 'Imperial business. Move along.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_6', 'The Rebels are onto us! Attack!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 127, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 128, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 129, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 130, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 131, 'notit_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', 'How strong a force is escorting the spy?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/pooja_naberrie.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'I understand. We''re all hard pressed to meet the demands of the fight for freedom.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 1, 'next', 'I''m glad to say that no new crises have erupted, so we don''t need help right now. I hope you''ve talked to the Queen in the palace gazebo.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'Hello. I wanted to talk to you about a certain matter, but I see you''re busy. See me later.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I have too much on my plate to deal with you right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Hello. I''m Porro Dolphe, the Queen''s pilot. We have a minor problem with a very minor felon. I''m almost embarrassed to mention such an idiotic problem. A Gungan vandal has defaced one of the Queen''s space yachts. He coated its crest with what appears to be blarth drool. A probe droid witnessed the act. Can you arrest this dunce?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'I copy that. Get the Gungan, and watch out in case he has any friends.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Right, I don''t blame you. This isn''t the kind of job that brings honor for a soldier.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'The Gungans occasionally protest human incursions into their sacred places. Seems to me using drool for the protest makes for confused symbolism, but who understands Gungans? Now, about the job --'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thanks. Here''s a small reward for your trouble. If you want me to keep your role in this matter quiet, I understand perfectly.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I copy that. Now, the Gungan is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You didn''t get the Gungan vandal? Well, that''s pretty -- well -- tell you what, I won''t tell anyone. Goodbye.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'Mesa not spek wit yousa, sorry. Mesa busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Mesa not spek wit yousa, sorry. Mesa busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Aoo! Issa cops!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Awaoo! Yousa got me. My goin'' long quietly. (Stupid queenie.)'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'Mesa goin'' up de swamp-stream for longo time, mesa thinkin''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 21, 'notit_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Why would the Gungan deface the Queen''s yacht?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Nice to see you again. I''m offering you a job much more important, and more dignified, than that last task you did for me. Someone has stolen a vital supply of liquid metal fuel intended for our advanced starfighters. Tracking beacons show the location of the fuel. Arrest the thief and bring him, her, or it here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Copy that. Whoever stole that fuel must have had help, so watch out for accomplices. At least this time they won''t be Gungans, I hope.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'All right, it was worth a try. We''ll find someone else, thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'According to our probe droid images, we think the thief is one Wandila Tatmount, a Corellian smuggler. We''re withholding definite identification pending her apprehension. Are you interested in the job?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Thanks. Now it falls to me to persuade this smuggler to look at brighter career options. Wish me luck!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I copy that. Now, Tatmount is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have her coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Couldn''t find Tatmount? Well, those smugglers are slippery. We''ll keep trying.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'I''ve got nothing to say to you. I''m just seeing the sights.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''ve got nothing to say to you. I''m just seeing the sights.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'It''s the RSF! Fire!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'I don''t know anything about any fuel. I''m just seeing the sights. I''ll go quietly, but wait ''til I get a lawyer!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'Well, I said I was seeing the sights, and that was a lot to see. You watch -- I''ll be out of here in no time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Who is the thief?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Hello again. You remember that smuggler you apprehended, Wandila Tatmount? She''s caused more trouble, and I need your help. One of Tatmount''s fellow Corellian smugglers, Hurn Moeda, got left behind in the wilderness after you caught his boss. We intercepted his distress call. Rescue him and bring him here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Copy that. I''ll arrange a nice prison cell for this smuggler. I hope Tatmount appreciates the trouble you''re taking to rescue her friend.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'All right. I must admit I''m disappointed, after your earlier help.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'His transmission was choppy, but it seems he''s run into some of our colorful native wildlife. That''s one thing about these smugglers -- many of them are city types. So, can you work this rescue mission?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Thanks again. I expect Moeda''s boss, Wandila Tatmount, will see from this that we can be trusted. What? Why do I want a smuggler to trust me? Oh -- never mind, just rambling. Check back if you want more work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I copy that. Now, Moeda is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'Couldn''t bring in Moeda? All right, we''ll keep looking. Check back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Are you the one --? No. I think you''ve got the wrong guy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Are you the one --? No. I think you''ve got the wrong guy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Help me! I''m Hurn Moeda!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', 'What evil place is this planet? Just let me get back safe to friendly old Corellia!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Okay! As soon as I''m out of custody, I''m heading to the nearest starport and off this crazy world!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 65, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why did Hurn Moeda make a distress call?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'Hello again. A delicate matter has arisen. I need help -- discreet help. One of our pilots went out into the wilderness, in plainclothes, to retrieve fuel supplies left by the smuggler you arrested, Wandila Tatmount. The pilot hasn''t reported back, and isn''t responding to hails. Find out what''s going on. If he''s in trouble, bring him back safely.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'Right. The pilot is Girrin Ancero. If he happens to mention anything odd, he''s probably out of his head with delirium, and can safely be ignored. Bring him back safely, assuming he needs help.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'All right. I hope you''ll keep a polite silence on this matter, at least until we''ve rescued the pilot.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'I don''t -- I really couldn''t say why Ancero was out of uniform. Maybe he meant to go sightseeing, after he retrieved -- Well, anyway! What about the mission? Interested?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Look at this poor man! He needs medical help at once! Ignore his crazed ravings. Here''s your reward. We can work together again, I hope -- assuming you recognize the importance of discretion.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I copy that. Now, Ancero is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'Couldn''t bring in Ancero? All right, we''ll keep looking. Check back later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'Are you, uh --? No, no, you''re not. Never mind. I''m waiting for someone else, thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Are you, uh --? No, no, you''re not. Never mind. I''m waiting for someone else, thanks.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Get me away from these vigilante settlers! They think I''m a smuggler!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Thanks. I sent Tatmount''s fuel off to the Alliance. We''ve got to -- wait. Are you, uh --? Argh, the delirium! It''s eating my brain! I don''t know what weird stuff I''m saying!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'At last my brain is clearing. Lieutenant, those fumes made me rave about the craziest things -- Rebels and whatnot. Fortunately, I think my rescuer recognizes senseless delirium.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'Why was the pilot out of uniform?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 93, 'npc_1_5', 'Welcome back. I''ve got another sensitive matter that I''d prefer to handle outside the usual RSF channels. A corrupt COMPNOR agent, Bardent Lourge, has been shaking down rural settlements for extortion money. I want to avoid overt conflict with the Empire. Could you politely but firmly bring Lourge here?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 94, 'npc_2_5', 'Copy that. While you get Lourge, I''ll arrange for his quiet processing on this end. Watch out for mercenaries he hires as muscle. Good luck!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 95, 'npc_3_5', 'Sorry to hear that, after all you''ve done for us. But I recognize that it''s a politically sensitive matter.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 96, 'npc_4_5', 'We''ve gained permission from COMPNOR itself to treat this as a civilian criminal case. They don''t want publicity abaout Lourge''s crimes, any more than we do. I''ll have Lourge taken to the palace police for civilian trial. That is, if you''ll apprehend him --?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 97, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 98, 'npc_reward_5', 'I''m glad you weren''t squeamish about bringing in an Imperial official. If you''re up for other delicate matters of that kind, check back with me soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 99, 'npc_work_5', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_5', 'I copy that. Now, Lourge is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have his coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 101, 'npc_failure_5', 'Didn''t feel up to arresting an Imperial officer? I don''t blame you. We''ll have to find a delicate solution to this problem.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 102, 'otherescort_5', 'I am on Imperial business. Remove yourself from the vicinity at once.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 103, 'dontknowyou_5', 'I am on Imperial business. Remove yourself from the vicinity at once.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 104, 'npc_breech_5', 'I''m Bardent Lourge. What business do you have with me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 105, 'npc_takeme_5', 'You dare to arrest me, even as I investigate Rebel smuggling? What effrontery! I shall go quietly, but this insult will incur the Empire''s harshest justice.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 106, 'npc_dropoff_5', 'I say again, this insult will not stand. You will all incur the Empire''s wrath!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 108, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 109, 'notit_5', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 110, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 111, 'player_sorry_5', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 112, 'player_1_5', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 113, 'player_2_5', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 114, 'player_3_5', 'What do you plan to do with the COMPNOR agent?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 115, 'npc_1_6', 'I''ve learned of another problem with delicate political overtones. You recall arresting the smuggler Wandila Tatmount? We released her for reasons that must remain classified. Now she''s facing trouble from four or five former members of her gang. Please put together a strike team to rescue her and bring her here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 116, 'npc_2_6', 'Good. I expect you''ll need a small strike team to take out Tatmount''s former gang members. They''re skilled marksmen. Be careful.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 117, 'npc_3_6', 'All right, I understand. At this point maybe it''s best that you practice your skills elsewhere.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 118, 'npc_4_6', 'It turns out Wandila Tatmount has become a "procurement specialist" for the Rebel Alliance. Now, I''m not looking for a political argument. I just need her brought here safely, and I need you to trust me that you''re doing the right thing. Will you do it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 119, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'That''s all I can tell you now. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 120, 'npc_reward_6', 'Excellent work. I think you''ve shown a willingness to undertake delicate missions. Her Majesty may wish to reward you. I suggest you meet her in the palace gazebo. I''m sending the coordinates to your datapad. Good luck!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 121, 'npc_work_6', 'I see you''re still at work. I hope you''ll report results soon.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_6', 'I copy that. Now, Tatmount is located at -- hmm -- I don''t seem to have her coordinates right now. Check with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_6', 'You didn''t get Tatmount? Well, all right. We''ll try sending out a larger team for our next attempt.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 124, 'otherescort_6', 'I think you''re looking for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 125, 'dontknowyou_6', 'I think you''re looking for someone else.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_6', 'Hey, Rebel guy! Over here!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 127, 'npc_takeme_6', 'You took your sweet time showing up! I hope you Alliance people are more punctual about payment than about rescues.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 128, 'npc_dropoff_6', 'All right, time to get off this world and past a few Imperial blockades. That''s when I really feel alive.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 129, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 130, 'gotowork_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 131, 'notit_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', 'What are the "delicate political overtones" you mentioned?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_4', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_3', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/porro_dolphe.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Very well. I hope you''ll return when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 1, 'next', 'Why do you return? We have nothing else for you. Away, please, we are occupied!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'What do you seek here? We shall not even talk to you while you are busy doing other work. Away, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'As you wish. Please return when you feel ready to undertake our task.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'One does not approach the Queen directly. You must first talk with our handmaiden, Liane.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'Oh dear! We face a crisis in the court. You, please! On a recent trip to the countryside, we misplaced our special ceremonial makeup. We must have our cosmetics, so as to wear the "scar of remembrance" on our lower lip. Will you bring the kit to us?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'Very well. Bring the makeup case to us here. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Off with you, then. Please.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'It is a reminder of the mass suffering on Naboo before the Time of Peace. Now we suffer as our people once did, lacking our cosmetics! Oh, do go pick them up for us, will you, please?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Why are you still here? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Splendid! We may proceed with our duties. Accept this small token of our thanks. You may also make yourself available for further service to the court.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Why are you back? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Now, where was the camp where we misplaced that kit? Ah, we have forgotten. Return later, and we shall certainly have recalled by then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'You have not brought our makeup kit? Oh, catastrophe! Can no one fulfill this simple request?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'Are you the Queen''s emissary? No, you don''t look like it. I cannot talk with you now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Are you the Queen''s emissary? No, you don''t look like it. I cannot talk with you now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you the Queen''s emissary? Over here!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'At last! I was unavoidably detained when the local wildlife went berserk, for no reason that I can see. Perhaps you will have the courage to carry this makeup kit to the Queen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'This is not our makeup kit! Oh, bother. Can no one fulfill this simple request?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'What is the "scar of remembrance"?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'Oh, bother. Our majordomo has been inexcusably lax. You! Perhaps you will render another service to our throne, please? Our majordomo failed to reply to that lovely Imperial officer''s kind invitation to a sightseeing outing in the wilderness. We command you to deliver our polite refusal wheresoever the officer may currently be.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Very well. The message goes to Imperial Army General Liles Dorond. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Off with you, then. Please.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'We do believe General Dorond has already commenced his sightseeing expedition. If so, you will find him in the wilderness. Do not keep us waiting for your decision, please.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Why are you still here? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'We are relieved to see proper protocol effected. It would not do to anger an Imperial general, would it? Please take this token of our thanks. You may also make yourself available for further service to the court.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Why are you back? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Very well. Now, where did we put that message --? Oh dear, it seems to be misplaced. Consult with us again soon, when all will be well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'You did not deliver our message? Oh, calamity! Can no one fulfill this simple request?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'Leave me, or I''ll have you arrested.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Leave me, or I''ll have you arrested.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Are you the Queen''s emissary? Over here, at once!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'The Queen wouldn''t attend, eh? A remarkably sensible decision by our vacuous monarch. The wildlife here has seemingly gone berserk.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', 'Why are you bothering me? If you have no message from the Queen, then go!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 43, 'notit_2', 'Why are you bothering me with nonsense? If you have a message from the Queen, give it to me. Otherwise, go!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Where is the Imperial officer?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'Oh dear! Wherever is Tedric, our champion guarlara trainer? Ah, you again. Perhaps we may count on you for a further service? We shall miss the procession in honor of the Emperor if our Tedric is not present to groom our champion steed, Roistering Spirit. Of course no one else is permitted to touch the Queen''s mighty guarlara. Will you fetch this feckless servant, please?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'Very well. Bring Tedric to us here. Quickly, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'Off with you, then. Please.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'He has gone into the wilderness to collect nara berries, which he claims provide additional vim for his champion guarlaras. Our staff received his last known coordinates. Would you please seek him there?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Why are you still here? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'To your work, Tedric! Roistering Spirit awaits your ministrations. As for you, friend of the court, please accept this token of our great gratitude. You may go now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Why are you back? Have you not heard our command? Go, please!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Very well. Now, wherever did Tedric say he would go? We cannot recall just now. Return to us later, and all will be well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You did not bring us Tedric? Oh, what a nuisance! Can no one fulfill this simple request?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'Were you sent by the Queen? Sorry, I think there''s been a mistake. Be careful around here -- there are tusk-cats about.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Were you sent by the Queen? Sorry, I think there''s been a mistake. Be careful around here -- there are tusk-cats about.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Did the Queen send you? I''d like to leave, now!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', 'The Queen sent you? What welcome news! I fear that local tusk-cats have smelled the scent of guarlara on me, and now believe me to be prey. Look carefully as we go back!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/queen_kylantha.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Thank you, friend. My Queen, I stand ready to groom your steed to a high gloss. These nara berries will give him abundant vigor.'),
