('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 131, 'notit_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 132, 'player_reset_6', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_6', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 134, 'player_1_6', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 135, 'player_2_6', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 136, 'player_3_6', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'I''m sorry if this was too much for you. You can work for me when you''re a bit more seasoned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'I''m sorry if this was too much for you. You can work for me when you''re a bit more seasoned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'I''m sorry if this was too much for you. You can work for me when you''re a bit more seasoned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'I''m sorry if this was too much for you. You can work for me when you''re a bit more seasoned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/tamvar_senzen.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'I''m sorry if this was too much for you. You can work for me when you''re a bit more seasoned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 1, 'next', 'You''ve served me quite well, thank you. But I''m afraid I have no further need of your services at the moment. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I''m a very particular patron and require your full attention. Come back when you''re not preoccupied.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 3, 'npc_reset_1', 'I thought I''d made the right choice by employing you. Perhaps I misjudged. Come back when you feel you can finish the tasks I give you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 4, 'notyet', 'I''m a bit busy right now...'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 5, 'npc_1_1', 'I hope this day finds you well, citizen. Have you perchance heard of a ridiculous piece of Rebel propaganda that is making the rounds here on Naboo? It''s a holo recording that purports to show the destruction of Alderaan by the brave and noble servants of our Imperial military. Can you imagine a more preposterous piece of claptrap? I''ve managed to locate a copy of this filth and wish to have it analyzed by experts to prove this work a forgery, of course. Could you pick it up for me? '),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 6, 'npc_2_1', 'That''s awfully kind of you. And this kindness will be richly rewarded, I assure you. Try not to spend too much time talking with the unsavory individual who''ll give you the holo recording. I''d hate to stain your doubtless sterling reputation.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, I realize simple courier work is not terribly prestigious, but I thought I''d start with something simple before entrusting you with more perilous work. Ah well.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 8, 'npc_4_1', 'That''s simply ridiculous. Why would the Empire want to destroy a "peaceful" planet? Does that make sense to you? The only reason the Imperial military would deem it necessary to do such a thing would be if the planet were not peaceful and if it posed a serious threat to the security of the Empire and her people. A child could understand that logic, don''t you agree?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 9, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I believe this is the part where you go and get the holo recording. Or was there something else you needed?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 10, 'npc_reward_1', 'Well done, citizen, well done. Now I''ll be able to expose this Rebel propaganda for the deceitful piece of trash it is.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 11, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you got my holo recording? I''m most eager to get my people working on that.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 12, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Half a moment, citizen, my "source" has just informed me that the copy is not quite ready. When it is, I''ll be sure to let you know.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 13, 'npc_failure_1', 'I hope you''ll forgive my impertinence but how can you fail to bring back a holo recording? I understand that there was some trouble on the way back, but was it truly severe enough to prevent a simple delivery? Strange.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 14, 'otherescort_1', 'I''m busy. Buzz off!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 15, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I''m busy. Buzz off!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 16, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hey, buddy! You looking for a certain holo? Did Gormengal send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 17, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 18, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 19, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Here you go. And, uh, don''t mention to anyone you saw me, okay?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 20, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 21, 'notit_1', 'Wait, that''s not the holo recording I was expecting. I certainly hope you''re not trying to cheat me. Kindly get me what I asked for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 22, 'player_reset_1', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 23, 'player_sorry_1', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 24, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 25, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 26, 'player_3_1', 'Isn''t it common knowledge that the Death Star blew up Alderaan?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 27, 'npc_1_2', 'In an effort to better understand this holo recording, I''ve secured the services of one of the finest holo experts on Naboo. However, this individual is currently finishing up an assignment - something to do with a nature show, I believe. He needs an escort back to town. Could you provide that for him?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 28, 'npc_2_2', 'Most excellent. His name is Belson Dool, and he''s a Sullustan. I hear they make excellent technicians so I know I''m getting my money''s worth.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 29, 'npc_3_2', 'Hmm, it seems you have a certain reluctance to complete these tasks. If this work is not prestigious enough for you, I certainly encourage you to look for employment elsewhere.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 30, 'npc_4_2', 'The wilds of Naboo can be quite perilous. I''m surprised you don''t know that. The poor man is likely to get gobbled up by a narglatch or a veermok. Then who would help me with this holo recording?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I believe I''ve told you everything you need to know. Do you wish to help me?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 32, 'npc_reward_2', 'Most effective, citizen. I must say I''m quite pleased with your results. Feel free to seek future employment with me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 33, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you brought my holo expert back from the wilds? The Empire''s reputation is at stake.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 34, 'npc_noloc_2', 'As soon as I receive Belson''s coordinates, I shall hand them over to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 35, 'npc_failure_2', 'Oh dear, where else shall I find an experienced data slicer? Did I say "data slicer?" How strange, I meant holo expert, of course. Silly me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 36, 'otherescort_2', 'Can''t talk now, buddy. I gotta lay low.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 37, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Can''t talk now, buddy. I gotta lay low.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hey! Psst! You looking for a data slicer, uh, I mean a holo expert?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 39, 'npc_takeme_2', 'I''m glad you showed up, buddy. We gotta get outta here. Those gangsters will be here any moment. Gormengal didn''t mention gangster? It''s a long story. Former employer. Deal went bad. Anyway, let''s go.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 40, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'You''re handy to have around in a fight, especially if you''re a coward like me. Oh, and call me Blinkers. All my friends do. Thanks!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 41, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 42, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 43, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 44, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 45, 'player_sorry_2', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 46, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 47, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 48, 'player_3_2', 'Why does he need an escort back to town?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 49, 'npc_1_3', 'You''ll be pleased to know, citizen, that I''ve made a copy of this holo recording and none other than the High Inquisitor Mal Sikander himself has requested it. Can you imagine, someone like me coming to the attention of such an illustrious servant of the Empire? I don''t want to keep the High Inquisitor waiting so could you please deliver this copy to his agent as quickly as possible?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 50, 'npc_2_3', 'I knew you''d understand the urgency of this matter. The courier''s name is Aern Wylup and he knows to expect you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 51, 'npc_3_3', 'I don''t understand how you could fail to see the importance of this matter, citizen. Well, I suppose I shall have to find someone else to help me. Good day.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 52, 'npc_4_3', 'Well I would imagine it''s to do exactly what I''m doing and to verify that this foul propaganda is a Rebel forgery. I hope together we can discover the culprits and make them pay for their heinous crimes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'High Inquisitor Sikander''s agent is waiting, citizen. Is there a problem?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 54, 'npc_reward_3', 'Well done. I''m sure we''ve impressed the right people. And you won''t get far in this galaxy without doing that, citizen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 55, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you delivered the copy of that holo recording to High Inquisitor Sikander''s agent yet? We shouldn''t keep someone as important as that waiting.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 56, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I''ll give you the courier''s coordinates as soon as they are transmitted to me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 57, 'npc_failure_3', 'You didn''t deliver the recording? What will the High Inquisitor think of me? Good gracious, I must contact him immediately and offer my deepest apologies. How could this have happened?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 58, 'otherescort_3', 'I''m expecting someone, but it''s not you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 59, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I''m expecting someone, but it''s not you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 60, 'npc_breech_3', 'Over here! Did Lord Gormengal send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 61, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 63, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'I''ll get this to the High Inquisitor right away. By the way, have you viewed this holo recording? Are you sure? We may call upon you later for further help in this investigation.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 64, 'gotowork_3', 'I believe you were supposed to deliver a holo recording. Where is it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 65, 'notit_3', 'This is not the holo recording Lord Gormengal promised us. Please find that recording and bring it to me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 66, 'player_reset_3', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 67, 'player_sorry_3', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 68, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 69, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 70, 'player_3_3', 'Why does Mal Sikander want a copy of this holo recording?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 71, 'npc_1_4', 'A new development, citizen! The High Inquisitor has shared the findings of his investigation with me, and as it turns out, the holo expert I hired is really a vicious Rebel terrorist responsible for the deaths of hundreds of innocent Imperial citizens. Isn''t that ghastly? To think that I was taken in by this scoundrel''s charm! I''ve been given the important task of removing this menace, but being a Naboo and therefore a pacifist, I must rely upon others to shoulder this gruesome responsibility. Can you help me fix this once and for all?'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 72, 'npc_2_4', 'I knew I could rely upon you, my friend. You are a stalwart guardian of the Empire! A true champion in a time of great need! Make sure this data slicer is forever silenced. I mean, neutralized.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 73, 'npc_3_4', 'The High Inquisitor thought you might refuse, citizen. I''m afraid I have no choice but to send him a report with the details of our conversations. He may call upon you in the near future.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 74, 'npc_4_4', 'Ah, but those are exactly the ones that we need to watch! They look harmless until they execute a strike against Imperial installations, killing dozens of loyal citizens! Nay, friend, this terrorist must be stopped!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'What are you waiting for? The security of the Empire depends upon your prompt action!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Your loyalty to the Empire is without question, friend. I will mention your brave deeds to the High Inquisitor. I''m sure you shall be richly rewarded.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 77, 'npc_work_4', 'Has that terrorist been neutralized? He might be plotting some foul treachery even as we speak!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 78, 'npc_noloc_4', 'The High Inquisitor''s agents will provide me with the location of the terrorist shortly. Stand by, citizen.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 79, 'npc_failure_4', 'You allowed this Rebel agent to live? Why? I''m afraid I shall have to send a report of all my dealings with you to the High Inquisitor. Best of luck to you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 80, 'otherescort_4', 'Can''t talk right now. I''m trying to lay low.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 81, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Can''t talk right now. I''m trying to lay low.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'Wait! I did what I was asked to do! I doctored the recording to make it seem as if Alderaan destroyed itself! Please don''t kill me!'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 85, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 86, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 87, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 88, 'player_reset_4', 'I don''t want this mission right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 89, 'player_sorry_4', 'I''ll keep working on the mission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 90, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 91, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/throme_gormengal.stf', 92, 'player_3_4', 'But Blinkers seemed pretty harmless to me.'),
