('string/en/static_npc/naboo/zogor_sturm.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_2', 'Well, return when you can.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/zogor_sturm.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_3', 'Well, return when you can.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/zogor_sturm.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_4', 'Well, return when you can.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/zogor_sturm.stf', 140, 'npc_reset_5', 'Well, return when you can.'),
('string/en/static_npc/naboo/zogor_sturm.stf', 141, 'npc_reset_6', 'Well, return when you can.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 1, 'philosopher_1', 'There is no such thing as trying.  Something can either be done, or it can''t.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 2, 'philosopher_2', 'It''s always easier to ask forgiveness then permission.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 3, 'philosopher_3', 'There is nothing foolproof in the universe.  You will find fools to be quite ingenious...'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 4, 'philosopher_4', 'Never walk away from a running rancor.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 5, 'philosopher_5', 'All things are simple until made difficult by others.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 6, 'philosopher_6', 'If you seek an honest person, you should become one yourself.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 7, 'philosopher_7', 'The greatest teacher of all is failure.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 8, 'philosopher_8', 'If you tell the truth 1000 times, and lie just once, you are still a liar.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 9, 'philosopher_9', 'There are three stages to the truth:  First it will be ridiculed.  Then violently opposed.  Finally, accepted as obvious.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 10, 'philosopher_10', 'One person who has belief is as formidable as 100 people with ''interest''.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 11, 'philosopher_11', 'The greatest fault is not to be conscious of your faults.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 12, 'philosopher_12', 'Any man who has confidence in himself earns the confidence of others.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 13, 'philosopher_13', 'Courage means doing what you are afraid to do.  There is no courage without fear.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 14, 'philosopher_14', 'Fear is to be kept to oneself.  Courage is to be shared.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 15, 'philosopher_15', 'Do not mistake a man who is afraid to run away as courageous.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 16, 'philosopher_16', 'Criticizing is easier than creating.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 17, 'philosopher_17', 'It is not excellent to win a war by fighting.  What is excellent is winning a war without fighting.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 18, 'philosopher_18', 'There are such things as roads that must not be followed, enemies that must not be attacked.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 19, 'philosopher_19', 'There are relatively few musical notes.  But combinations of these give rise to more melodies than could ever be heard.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 20, 'philosopher_20', 'There is nothing particularly exceptional about being old.  It merely means you''ve continued to live, not necessarily to learn.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 21, 'philosopher_21', 'There is no concept of the many without the one.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 22, 'philosopher_22', 'Never discourage anyone who makes progress, no matter how slow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 23, 'philosopher_23', 'Death is not the worst thing that can happen to anyone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 24, 'philosopher_24', 'Even a small rock can hold back a great wave.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 25, 'philosopher_25', 'There is nothing more despicable than a man who believes one thing with his heart and speaks another with his mouth.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 26, 'philosopher_26', 'Isn''t it interesting how the man with a winning hand is always the most interested in playing fair?'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 27, 'philosopher_27', 'Remember that life isn''t stable.  Don''t be overjoyed in your successes, or overwhelmed by your defeats.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 28, 'philosopher_28', 'No act of kindness, no matter how small, is ever wasted.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 29, 'philosopher_29', 'Petty thieves are imprisoned.  Great thieves are elected.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 30, 'philosopher_30', 'Its always better to learn from others misfortunes than your own.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 31, 'philosopher_31', 'No government has ever stood secure without a formidable opponent.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 32, 'philosopher_32', 'Pure men need no laws.  Corrupt men break laws.  What part do laws then play in society?'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 33, 'philosopher_33', 'Advice should always be judged by its results.  Not its intentions.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 34, 'philosopher_34', 'If your life is peaceful, pure, and refined, your old age should well be untroubled.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 35, 'philosopher_35', 'Common ideals draw men together.  Even evil.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 36, 'philosopher_36', 'Nature does nothing that is useless.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 37, 'philosopher_37', 'We fight wars so that we can live in peace.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 38, 'philosopher_38', 'Being a good person and being a good citizen are not always the same thing.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 39, 'philosopher_39', 'Poverty has many children, among them crime and revolution.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 40, 'philosopher_40', 'Striving for the best brings you closer to the best.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 41, 'philosopher_41', 'Take pleasure in your tasks, but put perfection in your work.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 42, 'philosopher_42', 'Only an educated man can entertain an idea without accepting it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 43, 'philosopher_43', 'Witty sayings prove nothing.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 44, 'philosopher_44', 'Every man is guilty of all the good that he did not do.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 45, 'philosopher_45', 'Anything that doesn''t make sense when spoken should be sung.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 46, 'philosopher_46', 'It is not wise to ignore your enemies.  They are often more perceptive than your friends.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 47, 'philosopher_47', 'Only the educated can truly be free.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 48, 'philosopher_48', 'All beings are equal as far as death is concerned.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 49, 'philosopher_49', 'Every man dies.  Not every man lives.'),
('string/en/static_npc/philosopher.stf', 50, 'philosopher_50', 'Experience is that thing you gain right after you need it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'I do need agents, but the delicate nature of my assignments requires exclusivity. Come back when you''re free.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I can''t talk to you. I''m waiting for someone.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'I''m pretty busy at the moment. Don''t bother me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'I can''t talk to you right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Get lost, I''m busy.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 6, 'gotowork_1', 'You should be going.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 7, 'gotowork_2', 'You should be going.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 8, 'gotowork_3', 'You should be going.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 9, 'gotowork_4', 'You should be going.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 10, 'next', 'You''ve been quite helpful, but I don''t have anything else for you at the moment. Check back with me from time to time.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 11, 'notit_1', 'That''s not the surveillance holo I requested. Bring me the holo.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 12, 'notit_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 13, 'notit_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 14, 'notit_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 15, 'notyet', 'Sorry, I''m too busy to talk right now.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 16, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome to Narmle. The name''s Biribas Tarun and I''m in charge of security. For the most part things are pretty quiet around here, which makes Rori very attractive to smugglers. I spend most of my time encouraging them to go elsewhere. If you''re looking for assignments, I could sure use your help. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 17, 'npc_1_2', 'Thanks to that holo recording, I was able to identify a local starport dispatcher who''s been helping these gunrunners bypass standard docking procedures. I need this guy brought back here for questioning. Think you can help?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 18, 'npc_1_3', 'While you were out getting us this dispatcher, the gunrunners were taking revenge on the starport security guard''s family. Not sure how they found out who he was but they''ve nabbed his wife, who they probably intend to ransom. I''ve already sent one of my agents after her but he could sure use some backup. What do you say?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 19, 'npc_1_4', 'The dispatcher has given us the name and location of the gunrunners'' leader. I need this bloodthirsty killer brought down. I could hire a bounty hunter but I thought I''d give you a shot at him first. You in?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 20, 'npc_2_1', 'Great. Once you bring me that holo, I''ll be able to start making arrests. Good luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 21, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. The dispatcher was tipped off by a friend so I believe he''s currently trying to get off Rori. Fortunately for us, no smuggler will touch him since they believe he betrayed them for money.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 22, 'npc_2_3', 'I knew I could count on you. Before those scoundrels could get their hands on this brave young woman, it seems she managed to hide a tracer somewhere on her person. This bit of quick thinking has allowed us to track her movements. Hopefully it will also give you two the element of surprise. Best of luck! '),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 23, 'npc_2_4', 'That''s right - it''s payback time. If you''d like to bring some friends along, feel free. This sleemo will most likely have several bodyguards. Go show this scum who''s in charge.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 24, 'npc_3_1', 'This sort of work doesn''t appeal to you, huh? I understand. Just make sure you stay on the right side of the law.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 25, 'npc_3_2', 'That''s too bad. I''ll have to find someone else then.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 26, 'npc_3_3', 'Well then I''ll have to get more of my agents on this as soon as possible. Excuse me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 27, 'npc_3_4', 'Looks like I''ll have to hire a bounty hunter after all.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 28, 'npc_4_1', 'I have agents monitoring the countryside. They''re keeping an eye on unregistered ship landings, recording everything with holocams. I need you to pick up one of these surveillance holos. Can you do that?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 29, 'npc_4_2', 'Yeah, one of the starport security personnel suspected this guy all along and planted a tracer on him. He won''t escape us.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 30, 'npc_4_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 31, 'npc_4_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 32, 'npc_5_1', 'I''ve been tracking the movements of a particularly vicious group of gunrunners. This holo will show me who''s been aiding these smugglers.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 33, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 34, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 35, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 36, 'npc_6_1', 'These gunrunners have begun to suspect that they''re being watched, so no, it won''t be easy. Have your weapon handy and keep an eye out for scouts.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 37, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 38, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 39, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 40, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I really need that holo, friend. Do you want this assignment or not?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 41, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'If you don''t want to tackle this mission, I understand. '),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'This will be a dangerous mission. I understand if you''d like to reconsider.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'This is a dangerous assignment. If you feel this is over your head, I understand.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 44, 'npc_breech_1', 'Over here! Did Captain Tarun send you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 45, 'npc_breech_2', 'Uh oh, looks like trouble! I better get out of here!'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 46, 'npc_breech_3', 'Help! I''ve been kidnapped by gunrunners!'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 47, 'npc_breech_4', 'You shouldn''t have come here. Blast away, lads!'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 48, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 49, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'I''ll be proven innocent! You mark my words!'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 50, 'npc_dropoff_3', 'Thank you again. I''ll never forget your courageous act.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 51, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 52, 'npc_failure_1', 'I guess I''ll have to find some other way to get that surveillance data. Sorry you couldn''t help.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 53, 'npc_failure_2', 'It''s a shame that sleemo was allowed to escape. Looks like I''ll have to hire some bounty hunters.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 54, 'npc_failure_3', 'In the course of performing our duty, it''s always a tragedy when innocents are hurt. Sometimes, however, it can''t be helped.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 55, 'npc_failure_4', 'It''s a shame you couldn''t end that killer''s career. I''ll have to wait for another opportunity to strike at him.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 56, 'npc_more_1_1', 'Nope, I''m an independent agent. I gotta pay the bills somehow.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 57, 'npc_more_1_2', 'My supervisor! He''s always had it in for me. Jealous of my skill and good lucks. He''s the one you should be arresting, not me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 58, 'npc_more_1_3', 'Captain Tarun knew he was being watched by the gunrunners'' agents so he had my husband divert their attention elsewhere while a rescue attempt was made. This was why there were only three of these scoundrels guarding me.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 59, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 60, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 61, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 62, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 63, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 64, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 65, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 66, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 67, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 68, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I have to wait for my agent to transmit his coordinates. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 69, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I should be getting those coordinates in a few moments. Check back with me later.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 70, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I''ll get an update on the young woman''s location in just a moment.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 71, 'npc_noloc_4', 'My agents are making sure those coordinates we had for the gunrunner leader are still valid. Could you check back in a few moments?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 72, 'npc_reset_1', 'Security work requires a certain type of personality. Come back and see me if you think you''d like another shot at it.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 73, 'npc_reward_1', 'You handled that well. I could use more agents like you. Feel free to see me for more assignments.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 74, 'npc_reward_2', 'Good job. This criminal''s arrest should discourage more than a few smugglers from coming here.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 75, 'npc_reward_3', 'It''s a good thing you decided to help, friend. I could use more agents like you.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'You''re an example to the other agents on my team, friend. If it isn''t already, I hope you decide to make security your profession of choice.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 77, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Here''s that surveillance holo. This should help Captain Tarun crack this case. Good luck.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 78, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 79, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 80, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 81, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 82, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Okay, okay! Take it easy! I''ll come along quietly! But I was framed, I tell you!'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Thank you for your help. I owe you my life. I''m eager to see my husband again. Could you please escort me back?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 84, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 85, 'npc_work_1', 'Where''s that holo? I can''t make arrests without that evidence.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 86, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you brought that dispatcher in yet? If he gets offworld, I won''t be able to break up this gunrunning circle.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 87, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you help that young woman get away from those gunrunners? If you don''t hurry it may be too late.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you taken out that vicious criminal yet? We can''t afford to let him get away.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 89, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 90, 'otherescort_2', 'I''m not the guy you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 91, 'otherescort_3', 'I don''t think I''m the person you''re looking for.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 92, 'otherescort_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 93, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 94, 'player_1_2', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 95, 'player_1_3', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 96, 'player_1_4', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 97, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 98, 'player_2_2', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 99, 'player_2_3', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 100, 'player_2_4', 'No.'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 101, 'player_3_1', 'What would I have to do?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 102, 'player_3_2', 'Do you know this dispatcher''s current whereabouts?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 103, 'player_3_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 104, 'player_3_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 105, 'player_4_1', 'What''s on the surveillance holo?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 106, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 107, 'player_4_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 108, 'player_4_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 109, 'player_5_1', 'This sounds too easy. It isn''t, is it?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 110, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 111, 'player_5_3', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 112, 'player_5_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 113, 'player_more_1_1', 'Are you a member of CorSec?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 114, 'player_more_1_2', 'Who framed you?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 115, 'player_more_1_3', 'Where is your husband?'),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 116, 'player_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 117, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 118, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/static_npc/rori/rori_narmle_biribas_tarun.stf', 119, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
