('string/en/stat_d.stf', 1, 'absorption_bleeding', 'This skill mod decreases the damage taken from bleeding.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 2, 'absorption_disease', 'This skill mod reduces the damage taken from disease.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 3, 'absorption_fire', 'This skill mod reduces the damage taken from fire.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 4, 'absorption_poison', 'This skill mod reduces the the damage taken from poison.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 5, 'advanced_assembly', 'This skill mod affects the crafting of advanced starship systems.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 6, 'advertising', 'This is being removed for now.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 7, 'aim', 'This mod increases the efficacy of your aim command.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 8, 'alert', 'The Alert skill offers a chance to defend against a surprise shot from a covered sniper.  The higher the skill, the better the chance to successfully defend against this type of attack.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 9, 'anti_shock', 'This skill mod determines your resistance to shock.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 10, 'armor_assembly', 'This skill mod determines the chance of succeeding when crafting armor.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 11, 'armor_customization', 'This skill mod determines the extent of modification you can perform on armor items in the crafting process.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 12, 'armor_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when creating armor.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 13, 'armor_repair', 'This skill mod determines how effective you are at repairing armor.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 14, 'berserk', 'This mod improves your chance of succesfully entering the berserk state.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 15, 'bio_engineer_assembly', 'This skill mod governs the Bio-Engineer''s ability to craft creatures and tissue samples.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 16, 'bio_engineer_experimentation', 'This skill mod governs the Bio-Engineer''s ability to experiment on crafted creatures and tissue samples.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 17, 'blind_defense', 'This mod will protect you from being blinded.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 18, 'block', 'This mod increases the chance of succesfully blocking an attack. '),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 19, 'body', 'This skill mod determines how adept the Image Designer is at modifying a character''s body.  This is used to change height, weight, muscle, and other customizations.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 20, 'booster_assembly', 'This skill mod affects the crafting of boosters for starfighters.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 21, 'bounty_mission_level', 'Every point in this mod will allow access to more lucrative and difficult Bounty Hunter missions.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 22, 'burst_run', 'The burst run efficiency skill mod is a direct percentage decrease to the cost of using the /burstrun command.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 23, 'camouflage', 'A higher camouflage skill means the Ranger''s conceal ability will last longer and be more effective on himself and others.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 24, 'camp', 'A higher camping skill enables the use of increasingly complex camp kits.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 25, 'carbine_accuracy', 'As the Carbine Accuracy skill mod increases, the chance to hit an enemy with a carbine ranged attack also increases.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 26, 'carbine_aim', 'The Carbine Aiming skill modifier directly amplifies the effectiveness of the Aim command. A high skill in this can drastically increase your odds of Aiming, particularly if multiple Aims are used consecutively in the course of one attack.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 27, 'carbine_hit_while_moving', 'This mod improves your chace of hitting while moving with a carbine.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 28, 'carbine_speed', 'This mod improves your attack speed with carbines.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 29, 'center_of_being_duration_onehandmelee', 'This skill mod controls the duration o fthe center of being command when fighting with a one-handed melee weapon.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 30, 'center_of_being_duration_polearm', 'This skill mod controls the duration o fthe center of being command when fighting with a polearm.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 31, 'center_of_being_duration_twohandmelee', 'This skill mod controls the duration o fthe center of being command when fighting with a two-handed melee weapon.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 32, 'center_of_being_duration_unarmed', 'This skill mod controls the duration of the Center Of Being command when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 33, 'chassis_assembly', 'This skill mod affects crafting and experimentation of starfighter chassis.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 34, 'clothing_assembly', 'This skill mod increases the chance of succeeding when crafting clothing items.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 35, 'clothing_customization', 'This skill mod determines the extent of modification you can perform on clothing items in the crafting process.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 36, 'clothing_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when crafting Combat Medic medicines and medical items.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 37, 'clothing_repair', 'This skill mod determines how effective you are at repairing clothing.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 38, 'combat_equillibrium', 'This mod increases the chance of automatically recovering from a forced posture change.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 39, 'combat_haste', 'This mod impoves your speed for all combat actions.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 40, 'combat_healing_ability', 'This skill mod determines the range and sophistication of your combat medical techniques and medicines.  The higher the number, the higher the effectiveness of these techniques and medicines.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 41, 'combat_medic_effectiveness', 'This skill mod determines how effective you are at performing Combat Medic techniques.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 42, 'combat_medicine_assembly', 'This skill mod increases the chances of succeeding when crafting Combat Medic medicines.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 43, 'combat_medicine_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when crafting Combat Medic medicines and medical items.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 44, 'counterattack', 'This mod controls your chance of responding to an aggressive attack with an unblockable counterattack.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 45, 'cover', 'The Cover skill mod determines how safe you are from enemy notice and attack while in a covered state.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 46, 'crafting_repair', 'This skill mod determines how effective you are at general repair of crafted items.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 47, 'creature_assembly', 'This skill mod determines the chance at success when assembling creatures as a Bio-Engineer.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 48, 'creature_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive while assembling creatures as a Bio-Engineer.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 49, 'creature_harvesting', 'This skill mod is used to determine the quantity of resources harvested from a creature.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 50, 'creature_hit_bonus', 'Skilled scouts and rangers have gained the ability to strike creatures more effectively.  This raw to-hit bonus only applies to normal ranged attacks.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 51, 'creature_knowledge', 'When a player with creature knowledge examines a creature, they learn additional information about the creature''s abilities.  The higher this skill mod, the more information displayed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 52, 'dissipation_bleeding', 'This skill mod reduces the duration of bleeding.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 53, 'dissipation_disease', 'This skill mod reduces the duration of disease.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 54, 'dissipation_fire', 'This skill mod reduces the duration of fire.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 55, 'dissipation_poison', 'This skill mod reduces the duration of poison.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 56, 'dizzy_defense', 'This mod improves your chance to avoid being dizzied. '),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 57, 'dna_harvesting', 'This skill allows a Bio-Engineer to sample higher quality DNA from creatures with less trauma to their system.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 58, 'dodge', 'This mod increases your chance to dodge incoming attacks. '),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 59, 'droid_assembly', 'This skill modifier value affects the Droid Engineer''s success rate when it comes to assembling droids and droid-related objects.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 60, 'droid_complexity', 'This is an erroneous value.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 61, 'droid_customization', 'This skill modifier value affects the Droid Engineer''s success rate and capabilities when it comes to colorizing and customizing droids and droid-related objects.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 62, 'droid_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when creating droids.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 63, 'droid_find_chance', 'This skill modifier value affects the Bounty Hunter player''s success rate when it comes to utilizing a Bounty Hunter''s droid ''find'' feature.'),
