('string/en/stat_d.stf', 68, 'engine_assembly', 'This skill mod affects crafting of starfighter engines.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 69, 'face', 'This skill mod determines how adept the Image Designer is at modifying the facial attributes of a character. This is used to change eye color, eye size, nose width, and all other facial options.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 70, 'feign_death', 'As this ability improves,  so does the player''s chance of successfully performing feign death in combat.'),
