('string/en/stat_d.stf', 252, 'slope_move', 'Terrain negotiation affects the player''s ability to move in rough terrain.  From 0 to 50, this skill increases the player''s ability to move up slopes quickly.  From 50 to 100, this skill increases the player''s ability to move fast while prone.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 253, 'spice_assembly', 'This skill mod governs the effectiveness of spice crafting.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 254, 'spice_experimentation', 'This skill mod controls the quality of results in a spice experimentation session.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 255, 'steadyaim', 'This skill mod determines the effectiveness of a Squad Leader''s /steadyaim command.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 256, 'stored_pets', 'This is the number of pets you may have stored at any time.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 257, 'structure_assembly', 'This skill mod determines the chance of succeeding when crafting structures.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 258, 'structure_complexity', 'This skill mod determines the level of complexity you have at your disposal when creating structures.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 259, 'structure_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when creating structures.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 260, 'stun_defense', 'This mod will decrease your chance of being stunned.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 261, 'survey_flora_structural', 'A higher Flora Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 262, 'survey_flora_structural_range', 'The Flora Surveying Range skill determines the range at which surveying is possible. A high Flora Surveying Range skill means that one can either modify the range at which surveying is seen. The result is that it is possible to get more accurate readings by reducing the surveying range one is looking at. This requires a surveying tool that supports range modification.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 263, 'survey_flora_structural_resolution', 'A higher Flora Surveying Resolution tool gives prospecting players the ability to increase the number of resource marks seen on their survey screen. The result is that players with a higher skill in this will be much more efficient at expediently tracking down high resource deposits, as compared to a novice Artisan.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 264, 'survey_gas', 'A higher Gas Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 265, 'survey_gas_range', 'The Gas Surveying Range skill determines the range at which surveying is possible. A high Gas Surveying Range skill means that one can either modify the range at which surveying is seen. The result is that it is possible to get more accurate readings by reducing the surveying range one is looking at. This requires a surveying tool that supports range modification.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 266, 'survey_gas_resolution', 'A higher Gas Surveying Resolution tool gives prospecting players the ability to increase the number of resource marks seen on their survey screen. The result is that players with a higher skill in this will be much more efficient at expediently tracking down high resource deposits, as compared to a novice Artisan.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 267, 'survey_liquid', 'A higher Liquid Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 268, 'survey_liquid_range', 'The Liquid Surveying Range skill determines the range at which surveying is possible. A high Liquid Surveying Range skill means that one can either modify the range at which surveying is seen. The result is that it is possible to get more accurate readings by reducing the surveying range one is looking at. This requires a surveying tool that supports range modification.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 269, 'survey_liquid_resolution', 'A higher Liquid Surveying Resolution tool gives prospecting players the ability to increase the number of resource marks seen on their survey screen. The result is that players with a higher skill in this will be much more efficient at expediently tracking down high resource deposits, as compared to a novice Artisan.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 270, 'survey_solid', 'A higher Mineral Surveying skill allows players to obtain samples more efficiently. Resources will start to become extractable at lower percentages, and more resources may be found on a successful sample.  However, this skill mod does not necessarily increase the chances of getting a successful sample. Prospecting has always been something of a hit-or-miss vocation.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 271, 'survey_solid_range', 'The Mineral Surveying Range skill determines the range at which surveying is possible. A high Mineral Surveying Range skill means that one can either modify the range at which surveying is seen. The result is that it is possible to get more accurate readings by reducing the surveying range one is looking at. This requires a surveying tool that supports range modification.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 272, 'survey_solid_resolution', 'A higher Mineral Surveying Resolution tool gives prospecting players the ability to increase the number of resource marks seen on their survey screen. The result is that players with a higher skill in this will be much more efficient at expediently tracking down high resource deposits, as compared to a novice Artisan.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 273, 'surveying', 'As your surveying skill increases, you gain the ability to scan for resources over a greater distance.  You also gain a higher chance of successfully harvesting resources and yet a higher yield per successful sample attempt.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 274, 'take_cover', 'This modifier will increase your chance of succesfully taking cover in ranged combat.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 275, 'tame_aggro', 'This skill represents the Creature Handler''s ability to tame aggressive creature types.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 276, 'tame_bonus', 'This skill mod assists in the taming of wild creatures.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 277, 'tame_level', 'This skill mod increases the maximum level of pet that that you can tame, and the maximum number of pet levels you may have active at any one time.  For example, a total of 20 means that you can tame creatures that are of up to level 20.  You could call a level 20 creature, or two level 10 creatures.  Note that you must also have sufficient ''Additional Pets'' skill to call multiple pets regardless of level.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 278, 'tame_non_aggro', 'This skill represents the Creature Handler''s ability to tame non-aggressive creature types.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 279, 'taunt', 'This modifier will increase your chance of succesfully taunting a creature as a Brawler.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 280, 'thrown_accuracy', 'The Thrown Weapon Accuracy skill mod changes how often you tend to hit with thrown weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 281, 'thrown_speed', 'This mod improves your speed with thrown weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 282, 'tissue_assembly', 'This skill mod determines the chance of succeeding when assembling tissue as a Bio-Engineer.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 283, 'tissue_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when assembling tissue as a Bio-Engineer.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 284, 'trapping', 'The trapping skill mod represents a Ranger or Scout''s ability to use traps effectively.  As this skill mod increases, the player gains the ability to use more complex traps.  The player also becomes better at hitting increasingly stronger creatures with traps.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 285, 'twohandlightsaber_accuracy', 'This skill mod improves your accuracy with two-handed lightsabers.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 286, 'twohandlightsaber_speed', 'This skill mod improves your attack speed with two-handed lightsabers.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 287, 'twohandlightsaber_toughness', 'This skill mod decreases the amount of damage taken while wielding two-handed lightsabers.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 288, 'twohandmelee_accuracy', 'This mod improves your accuracy with two-handed melee weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 289, 'twohandmelee_center_of_being_efficacy', 'This skill mod controls the efficacy of Center Of Being when wielding a two-handed melee weapon.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 290, 'twohandmelee_speed', 'This mod improves your speed with two-handed melee weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 291, 'twohandmelee_toughness', 'This mod decreases the amount of melee damage you will take when using a two-handed melee weapon.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 292, 'unarmed_accuracy', 'This mod improves your accuracy when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 293, 'unarmed_center_of_being_efficacy', 'This skill mod controls the efficacy of Center Of Being when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 294, 'unarmed_damage', 'This mod improves your damage when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 295, 'unarmed_passive_defense', 'This modifier improves your chances of reacting to a succesful hit with a dodge, counterattack or block.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 296, 'unarmed_speed', 'This mod improves your speed when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 297, 'unarmed_toughness', 'This mod will decrease the amount of melee damage you take when fighting unarmed.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 298, 'vendor_item_limit', 'This skill mod determines how many items a merchant may sell on each vendor. '),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 299, 'volley', 'This mod improves your chance of successfully launching volley fire.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 300, 'warcry', 'This modifier increases the chance of succesfully executing the Brawler profession''s warcry command.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 301, 'weapon_assembly', 'This skill mod determines the chance of succeeding when crafting weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 302, 'weapon_experimentation', 'This skill mod directly affects how many experimentation points you receive when creating weapons.'),
('string/en/stat_d.stf', 303, 'weapon_repair', 'This skill mod determines how effective you are at repairing weapons.'),
