('string/en/talmont.stf', 1, 'tal1', 'I am the Prefect, Eugene Talmont.  I have a mission for you, but I must know where your loyalties lie first.  Tell me why I should trust you...\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 2, 'tal2', 'I am loyal to the Empire.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 3, 'tal3', 'Why should I trust you?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 4, 'tal4', 'Very good.  We shall see about that soon enough.  Your first task will be to round up a group of thieves.  This planet is full of them.  Can you handle that?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 5, 'tal5', 'Exactly the sort of insolence I would expect from someone on this planet.  Be gone with you.  And don''t return until you''ve learned some manners!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 6, 'tal6', 'I think so.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 7, 'tal7', 'I''m not sure.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 8, 'tal8', 'Excellent.  These thieves have a hideout at <location>.  There are three of them.  I want them dead or alive.  Now get moving!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 9, 'tal9', 'Well, if you''re not up to the task perhaps you should return when you feel a bit more comfortable with your abilities.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 10, 'tal10', 'So, you''ve decided to return, eh?  Have you learned a little bit about respect?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 11, 'tal11', 'Yes sir.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 12, 'tal12', 'Respect?  You?  You must be joking.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 13, 'tal13', 'Good.  Very good.  Think you can you handle a group of thieves on your own?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 14, 'tal14', 'Enough of your attitude.  Leave at once!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 15, 'tal15', 'Back again?  I hope this time you''re not wasting my time.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 16, 'tal16', 'Sorry.  I''m ready to work for you.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 17, 'tal17', 'You''re in charge of a desert.  How could I possibly be wasting YOUR time?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 18, 'tal18', 'Get out!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 19, 'tal19', 'There''s no shame in crawling back here.  Are you ready for your assignment?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 20, 'tal20', 'Yes, I am.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 21, 'tal21', 'The only shame would be actually taking orders from someone like you.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 22, 'tal22', 'You will suffer for this outrage!  Out of my office!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 23, 'tal23', 'I hope we won''t have any more performances like the previous ones?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 24, 'tal24', 'No sir.  I''m ready to work.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 25, 'tal25', 'I''m too busy to talk to you.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 26, 'tal26', 'Feeling better about yourself?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 27, 'tal27', 'Yes.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 28, 'tal28', 'No.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 29, 'tal29', 'Now that you''ve proven yourself I''m going to level with you.  My superior officers on this planet are a bunch of scum.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 30, 'tal30', 'What do you mean?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 31, 'tal31', 'What do you expect on Tatooine?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 32, 'tal32', 'They''re low-life criminals, the lot of them!  They take bribes.  They gamble.  Some of them might as well work for that Jabba the Hutt!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 33, 'tal33', 'I expect more from an Imperial Officer!  They''re a bunch of criminals, in league with the Hutt, Jabba.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 34, 'tal34', 'What shall I do?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 35, 'tal35', 'I want you to infiltrate Jabba''s organization.  Find Jabba''s ledger books.  Bring me the evidence I need to bring them all down!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 36, 'tal36', 'How should I do that?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 37, 'tal37', 'I''m going to give you a new identity.  Papers that will make you appear to be a criminal.  Like one of them.  I have such things at my disposal.\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 38, 'tal38', 'And then what?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 39, 'tal39', 'Do whatever they tell you.  Accept any job they''ll give you, no matter how illegal it may be.  After a while, you''ll earn their trust.  Then you can find those ledgers!\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 40, 'tal40', 'Won''t they kill me if they find out what I''m up to?\n'),
('string/en/talmont.stf', 41, 'tal41', 'You''ll have to be careful   But your new identity will be perfect.  Go to Jabba''s palace and talk to the TT8-L droid, and he''ll get you started.  You and I are going to clean up this waste of a planet!\n'),
