('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 1, 'greeting_1', 'Good day.  And what can I help you with?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 2, 'player_1', 'I''d like to ask you about the cities on Tatooine.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 3, 'player_2', 'Is there anything that you need done?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 4, 'player_3', 'What can you tell me about certain people?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 5, 'player_13', 'Can you give me directions?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 6, 'cities_1', 'Which city are you interested in?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 7, 'player_4', 'I''m curious about Mos Eisley...'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 8, 'player_5', 'Do you know about Mos Espa?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 9, 'player_6', 'Anchorhead is the city I want to ask about.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 10, 'player_7', 'What do you know about Bestine?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 11, 'player_12', 'Can I ask some more questions?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 12, 'people_1', 'Who do you want to know about?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 13, 'player_8', 'Do you know Jabba the Hutt?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 14, 'player_9', 'Who is prefect Talmont?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 15, 'player_10', 'Have you heard of Dera Darklighter?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 16, 'player_11', 'What do you know about the tusken raiders?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 17, 'mission_1', 'As soon as I know how to hand out missions I''ll give you one.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 18, 'mos_eisley_1', 'Ah, Mos Eisley is a wretched hive of scum and villainy.  Nice cantinas though.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 19, 'mos_espa_1', 'They used to hold the pod races there, until they were outlawed.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 20, 'anchorhead_1', 'There''s not much to say really.  Tosche station is there, but not much else.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 21, 'bestine_1', 'The imperial capital of Tatooine.  It''s a nice city, of course, but strict with it''s laws.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 22, 'jabba_1', 'Jabba might as well own Tatooine.  He''s a dangerous criminal, and not to be trusted.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 23, 'talmont_1', 'Ah, the prefect.  He''s nominally in charge of things here on Tatooine, at least from an Imperial end.  But I hear he''s quite incompetent.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 24, 'dera_1', 'The lovely daughter, and heir to the Darklighter fortune.  Some say she has sympathy for the rebellion.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 25, 'tuskens_1', 'Not much to say really.  Savage creatures.  Monsters.  Like evil bears.  Watch out for them.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 26, 'sure_1', 'Sure.  What else would you like to ask about?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 27, 'where_1', 'Where would you like directions to?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 28, 'player_14', 'Can you tell me how to get to any of the cities?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 29, 'player_15', 'I need to get to a specific place.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 30, 'player_16', 'I need to see someone...'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 31, 'find_city_1', 'Which city do you need help finding?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 32, 'directions_eisley', 'Mos Eisley.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 33, 'directions_espa', 'Mos Espa.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 34, 'directions_bestine', 'Bestine.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 35, 'directions_anchorhead', 'Anchorhead.'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 36, 'find_bldg_1', 'Where is it you''re trying to get to?'),
('string/en/tatooine_convo.stf', 37, 'bank', 'I need to get to the bank.'),
