('string/en/theme_park/racing/racing.stf', 218, 'narmle_waypoint_name_checkpoint15', 'Finish Line'),
('string/en/theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles.stf', 1, 'start', 'Ach!  Another wretched pirate.  You''ll never get away with this!  You filthy disease-ridden scum will pay!  Pay dearly!  I have friends in powerful places!  Poweful friends in powerful places!  That''s right!  Poweful!  They know how to deal with the likes of you!'),
('string/en/theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles.stf', 2, 'reply_1', 'I''m not a pirate.  I''m here to rescue you.'),
('string/en/theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles.stf', 3, 'noble_1', 'You''re not?  Oh, well, I mean of course you''re not.  I knew that.  I could tell just by looking at you.  You have that heroic sort of aura about you.  Indeed you do.'),
('string/en/theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles.stf', 4, 'noble_1_reply_1', 'You''re free to go'),
('string/en/theme_park/royal_kidnapping/nobles.stf', 5, 'noble_2', 'Hooray!  You''re my hero!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 1, 'escapee_start', 'I can''t believe I escaped that terrible place!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 2, 'escapee_reply_1', 'What place?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 3, 'escapee_1', 'The Warren!  It''s a terrible place!  The horrors!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 4, 'escapee_1_reply_1', 'Where is that?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 5, 'escapee_1_reply_2', 'What''s so bad about it?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 6, 'escapee_2', 'Here... Here''s a waypoint that leads to the dreadful place.  I''ll give you the passkey to get in as well.  Maybe you can put a stop to the horrible experiments that happen there.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 7, 'escapee_3', 'Oh the horrors committed there are unspeakable.  Some sort of research... on people''s BRAINS!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 8, 'worker_start', 'Don''t hurt me!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 9, 'worker_reply_1', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 10, 'worker_reply_2', 'What is this place?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 11, 'worker_1', 'I am a contract worker hired by Colonel Teraud to keep expanding this facility.... which is crazy given how big it is already.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 12, 'worker_1_reply_1', 'Are there more workers in here?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 13, 'worker_2', 'All the workers call this place ''The Warren''.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 14, 'worker_2_reply_2', 'What happened here?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 15, 'worker_3', 'There are many workers trapped below.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 16, 'worker_3_reply_1', 'What do you mean ''trapped''?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 17, 'worker_4', 'The elevator down is locked.  And it can only be unlocked from the Master Control Room by using the four pass-keys.  But you''ll never get to the Master Control Room without the Turret Defense passcode!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 18, 'worker_4_reply_1', 'What is the passcode?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 19, 'worker_5', 'I don''t know.  The only one who knew the passcode is dead by the elevator now.  Oh this is hopeless!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 20, 'worker_6', 'An Imperial bigwig came to visit Teraud, and something bad happened. Crazed lab animals burst out of the elevator going down and attacked the workers, killing many of them.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 22, 'turret_pass_active', 'Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  ACTIVE\n\nSpeak the passkey code to deactivate the MCRTDS.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 23, 'turret_pass_inactive', 'Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  INACTIVE.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 24, 'turret_pass_deactivated', 'Turret Defense System has been DEACTIVED.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 25, 'loyalist_start', 'Wow, the shock must have broken the cyborg circuitry... I can think on my own again... it was horrible, I volunteered to be one of Teraud''s Loyalists, but the cyborg device was controlling my mind... Look out for Teraud, he''s a megalomaniac, and he thinks he can topple the Emperor...'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 26, 'trooper_greeting_m', 'There''s another one of Teraud''s people... kill him!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 27, 'trooper_greeting_f', 'There''s another one of Teraud''s people... kill her!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 28, 'researcher_start', 'It''s hopeless!  The reactor core is going to blow!  We''ll all die!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 29, 'researcher_reply_1', 'What do we do?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 30, 'researcher_1', 'The only way to fix it, is to get the spare reactor core rods from the basement... behind the holding pen. The backup system should have taken over, but I think it was manually overridden.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 31, 'researcher_2', 'Good thing the reactor has been disabled!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 32, 'researcher_3', 'Now the reactor core rods need to be put in the reactor core.  But the door is locked... there are two manual override switches on this floor... somewhere.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 33, 'guard_warning', 'I''m guarding this cell so you better not come any closer.  Just head back the way you came and I won''t have to kill you.  Go on!  You can''t open this cell without the password anyway, and I''m sure not going to give it to you.  Now get out of here.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 34, 'cell_locked', 'The Cell Is Locked:  Authorization Required.  Speak the password to Unlock Cell #21342'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 35, 'cell_open', 'Cell 21342 is Unlocked'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 36, 'worker_bark1', 'The Inquisitor''s troops invaded... Teraud''s loyalists managed to capture her and I think they carted her off to a prison cell...'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 37, 'worker_bark2', 'Watch out, those Stormtroopers are shooting on sight, even if you''re a loyal Imperial Citizen!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 38, 'worker_bark3', 'Teraud is a madman... he made us carve the brains out of living Krayt Dragons... who knows what he did with them...'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 39, 'worker_bark4', 'Teraud uses a mind control device to control his cyborgs.  I think he planned to make us all his cyborg slaves.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 40, 'knag_greeting', 'My children... they''ll take over the facility, and kill those Stormtroopers... then Teraud will have to admit that I am smarter than he is... that I am the one that will one day rule!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 41, 'knag_wins', 'That one probably isn''t salvageable...'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 42, 'knag_attacks', '...this one will probably make a lovely cyborg...'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 43, 'mirla_done', 'I can''t thank you enough for the compassion you''ve shown me.  And you''ve exposed Teraud''s evil plans to the Empire.  I know the Emperor will take care of that mad scientist and this terrible place now.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 44, 'mirla_get_teraud', 'We know that Teraud is a madman, but the Empire will require proof of his treachery.  You''ve got to collect evidence against him and take it to the proper authorities.  Please!  Before it is too late!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 45, 'mirla_start', '(sob) What... what do you want?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 46, 'mirla_reply_1', 'What''s wrong?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 47, 'mirla_1', 'How can you ask me that?  Have you seen how crazy this place is?  The Stormtroopers killing everything in sight!?  The cyborgs rampaging through the corridors!  I was lucky enough to find a place to hide.  But... my husband... he was on the first floor and I don''t know if he made it out alive... if he knows I''m ok... '),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 48, 'mirla_1_reply_1', 'I have some bad news'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 49, 'mirla_1_reply_2', 'Don''t worry.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 50, 'mirla_2', 'My husband is.... dead?  Oh no... I should have known.  That madman Teraud, this is all his fault.  Thank you for delivering his letter to me.  But please, you have to take him down!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 51, 'mirla_2_reply_1', 'I will.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 52, 'mirla_3', 'Oh I do hope so... but I have a bad feeling.  Please leave me alone.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 53, 'mirla_4', 'The first thing you should do is to get to the Inquisitor.  Teraud''s men captured her and put her in a cell upstairs.  You''ll need the passcode to unlock the cell door, but I can tell you what that is.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 54, 'mirla_4_reply_1', 'What is it?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 55, 'mirla_password', 'The password is - %TO - just speak that near the cell door to unlock it.  Good luck.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 56, 'heff_done', 'Good to see you again!  No need to worry about Teraud''s research lab.  The Empire will take care of THAT place.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 57, 'heff_bye', 'No time to talk to you.  I''m a very busy man.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 58, 'heff_start', 'What do you want?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 59, 'heff_reply_1', 'I have evidence!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 60, 'heff_1', 'What?  Let me see that!  So... Teraud is a traitor.  Well this is all the evidence I need.  We''ll take care of this at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren.stf', 61, 'escapee_haskey', 'I already told you!  I even gave you a passkey to get inside!  Won''t you at least TRY to put a stop to the horrible experiments there?'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 1, 'waypoint_name', 'The Warren'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 2, 'welcome_terminal', 'Welcome to the premier Imperial Research Facility in the known Galaxy! Under the command of the magnanimous and brilliant Colonel Bors Teraud, this facility engages in cybernetic and cyborg research for the greater glory of the Empire.\n\nMaking use of cutting-edge technology, the brilliant scientists under Colonel Teraud''s command are pushing forward the boundaries of cyborg technology and neural interaction!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 3, 'comm_terminal', 'SUBJECT:  IMPERIAL INSPECTION\nCLASSIFIED\n\nTO: COLONEL BORS TERAUD\nFROM : GRAND MOFF ARDUS KAINE\n\nColonel, our impatience with your failure to account for the millions of credits in Imperial funding that have gone your way is increasingly leading us to the conclusion that some sort of malfeasance has been attempted. Our previous inspection by an Imperial Inquisitor resulted in the inquisitor never returning, and your bland answers to our inquiries have proven unsatisfactory.\n\nExpect a fresh inspection team, led by Imperial Inquisitor Janna bel Arde. She has the authority to inspect any aspect of your budget and finances, your team, your facility, and your experiments. Should she locate any irregularities whatsoever, you will be relieved of your command. Given the mysterious disappearance of our last auditor, Inquisitor bel Arde will be accompanied by a military contingent.\n\nI need not remind you that your extremely high levels of funding were in large part because of the personal interest that our illustrious Emperor took in your stated project goals. His eye on you can be valuable when you are doing well. I do not think you want his attention under any other circumstances.\n\nTRANSMISSION ENDS\n'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 4, 'diary_terminal', 'Dear diary,\n\nOh I am so sad today.  Just like yesterday and the day before.  I bet I will be even more sad tomorrow.  Working for Teraud is horrible.  First my friend Matlo vanished, and now my coworker whose name I can''t even pronounce, let alone spell, has mysteriously disappeared.  And I have to do all his work!  The screaming from some of the rooms raises the hair on the back of my neck.\n\nThey tell us those rooms are off-limits - they don''t even trust us to go down one floor without approval from four supervisors.  Like any of us ever want to go down there anyway!  All the animals are creepy, and Teraud''s personal Loyalists are even worse!  Considering this is an Imperial Research facility, these people don''t seem very loyal to the Empire.\n\nOh great, more screaming from the ... well that sounds closer than usual.  I better go see wha'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 5, 'diary_terminal_name', 'Diary Terminal'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 6, 'comm_terminal_name', 'Communications Terminal'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 7, 'passkey_name', 'Main Entry Passkey'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 8, 'passkey1_name', 'Master Control Room Elevator Control Passkey One'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 9, 'passkey2_name', 'Master Control Room Elevator Control Passkey Two'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 10, 'passkey3_name', 'Master Control Room Elevator Control Passkey Three'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 11, 'passkey4_name', 'Master Control Room Elevator Control Passkey Four'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 12, 'letter_name', 'a letter'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 13, 'letter_text', 'Dearest Mirla, \n\nWe don''t know what has happened down below, but shortly after the Imperials arrived, the beasts broke out of their cages and began a terrible rampage.  There is carnage everywhere here and I don''t think we''re going to last much longer.  I want you to know that I love you very much - as much today as the day of our marriage.\n\nI hope that you have found a safe place to hide until help arrives.  I''m writing this farewell letter in hopes that someone will find it and deliver it to you, because I don''t think I''m going to make it out of here alive.\n\nDon''t grieve for me.  I have known more happiness in the past few years than anyone deserves, and I''ll always be with you in your heart.\n\nI love you!'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 14, 'turret_data_name', 'Turret Sequence'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 15, 'mcr_term_deactivated', '+Security Lock Deactivated+'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 16, 'mcr_term_active', '+Passkey Not Found:  Security Lock is ACTIVE+'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 17, 'elev_one_secure', '+Master Control Security Lock Engaged:  ACCESS DENIED+'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 18, 'deactivate_core', '* REACTOR CORE DEACTIVATED *'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 19, 'switch_one', '* Reactor Core Lockdown Override #1 Activated *'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 20, 'switch_two', '* Reactor Core Lockdown Override #2 Activated *'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 21, 'switch_done', '* REACTOR CODE LOCKDOWN OVERRIDE COMPLETE *'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 22, 'turret_pass_deactivated', 'Turret Defense System has been DEACTIVED.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 23, 'turret_pass_inactive', 'Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  INACTIVE.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 24, 'turret_pass_active', 'Master Control Room Turret Defense System is:  ACTIVE\n\nSpeak the passkey code to deactivate the MCRTDS.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 25, 'inq_letter_name', 'FOUO: Imperial Communication Disk'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 26, 'inq_letter_text', 'Attacked by surprise en route to the research facility''s lower levels.  Teraud is no where to be seen, but his loyalists ambushed my Stormtrooper escort.  We were divided in the battle and I''ve been badly wounded, captured, and thrown into a cell.  I do not expect help to arrive in time.\n\nAny Imperial Citizen that finds this Communication Disk:  Consider this a direct order from Imperial Inquisitor Janna bel Arde:  Locate evidence to prove Colonel Teraud is a traitor and a madman.  He cannot be allowed to disrupt the peace and order of the Empire.  Blast your way through ''The Warren'' (as they call it here) if you must, but locate enough evidence to bring down the might of the Empire on this would-be despot.  Deliver this letter and the evidence you collect to the Captain Heff in the Theed Palace on Naboo.\n\nThe Captain will know what to do.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 27, 'cell_locked', 'The Cell Is Locked:  Authorization Required.  Speak the password to Unlock Cell #21342'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 28, 'cell_open', 'Cell 21342 is Unlocked'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 29, 'bio_terminal_name', 'Procedural Instruction Terminal'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 30, 'bio_terminal', 'BRAIN REMOVAL PROCEDURES-\nObey all procedural rules for critical brain evacuation in order to prevent trauma.  The following information is CLASSIFIED.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 31, 'dev_control_name', 'Encryption Key Generator'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 32, 'dev_control_terminal', '[Authorization required.]\n\nRemote encryption transmission system v8.06.\n\nLast access [TODAY] transmission to destination Airlock Blast Door Security Lockdown procedure 8.2.1.5.67b.\n'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 33, 'mnu_download', 'DOWNLOAD CODE'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 34, 'download_complete', 'DOWNLOAD COMPLETE'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 35, 'mirla_password', 'The password is - %TO - just speak that near the cell door to unlock it.  Good luck.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 36, 'name_jerrd', 'Jerrd Sonclim (a guard)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 37, 'name_knag', 'Doctor Knag (a researcher)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 38, 'name_dirk', 'Dirk Maggin (a dying loyalist)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 39, 'name_phy', 'Phy Hudgen (an escaped worker)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 40, 'name_ovitt', 'O''Evitt Piboi (an escapee)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 41, 'name_heff', 'Captain Heff (an Imperial Captain)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 42, 'name_mirla', 'Mirla (a worker)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 43, 'name_manx', 'M''anx Try (a researcher)'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 44, 'elev_range', 'You are too far away to use that'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 45, 'elev_toolow', 'You are already on the bottom floor'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 46, 'core_warning', 'WARNING:  Reactor Core Overload Imminent.  Control Center Lock-Down initiated.'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 47, 'got_evidence', 'You have already downloaded evidence from this terminal'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 48, 'get_evidence', 'DOWNLOAD EVIDENCE'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 49, 'access_denied', 'ACCESS DENIED:  YOU DO NOT HAVE THE PROPER PASSKEY TO ENTER THIS FACILITY'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 50, 'access_granted', 'ACCESS GRANTED:  Passkey code accepted.  Welcome to this Imperial Research Facility'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 51, 'switch_name_1', 'Reactor Core Lockdown Override Switch One'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 52, 'switch_name_2', 'Reactor Core Lockdown Override Switch Two'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 53, 'core_rod_name', 'Reactor Core Control Rod'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 54, 'mcr_term_name_on', 'Passkey Terminal: ON'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 55, 'mcr_term_name_off', 'Passkey Terminal: OFF'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 56, 'turret_term_on', 'Turret Control Terminal: ACTIVATED'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 57, 'turret_term_off', 'Turret Control Terminal: DEACTIVATED'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 58, 'core_name_on', 'Reactor Core: OVERLOAD IMMINENT'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 59, 'core_name_off', 'Reactor Core: SHUTDOWN'),
('string/en/theme_park/warren/warren_system_messages.stf', 60, 'insert_rod', 'You insert the reactor core control rods into the reactor core.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 1, 'player_1_1', 'Yes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 2, 'player_1_2', 'Sure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 3, 'player_1_3', 'Yeah, why not.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 4, 'player_1_4', 'Ok, I''m game.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 5, 'player_2_1', 'No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 6, 'player_2_2', 'Not a chance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 7, 'player_2_3', 'Not today.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 8, 'player_2_4', 'Can''t do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 9, 'player_3_1', 'What is this valuable artifact?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 10, 'player_3_2', 'Why are you coughing? Are you all right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 11, 'npc_1_1', 'Well, well, a visitor. Hem! Welcome to my humble museum. I am the curator. If you are here regarding the recent theft of a valuable artifact, I am -- hem! -- the one -- hem! Excuse me. -- You may talk to me. Will you pursue the thief and return the artifact?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 12, 'npc_1_2', 'Ah, welcome back. Hem! You helped my little museum greatly in what I now call the Tusken Robe Incident. Might you now handle a similar -- hem! -- regrettable theft? The purloined object is a part of the armor worn by chief miner Melnea Arnthout, one of Tatooine''s -- hem! -- original settlers. Will you go after it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 13, 'npc_1_3', 'Ah, you are ready for more work? I hoped you would inquire. Hem! Now some thief has stolen a mineral scanner that dates back to the original settlement of Tatooine. It defies understanding why anyone would steal it; it lacks -- hem! -- notable historic or economic value. Can you return it safely?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 14, 'npc_1_4', 'It defies belief, my friend, but -- hem! -- my museum is once again the victim of theft. I have no idea who would steal this artifact -- but the Hutts have many enemies, hem! So it is not inconceivable -- but I am maundering. Will you retrieve the artifact?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 15, 'npc_2_1', 'Excellent. The stolen Tusken Raider robe has a hidden homing beacon, as is standard museum procedure. In all likelihood you will find the thief at the designated coordinates. Thank you, thank you!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 16, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. The armor, like the robe you returned earlier, has a tracking beacon that should lead you right to the thief. I speed you on your way!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 17, 'npc_2_3', 'I trust the tracking beacon hidden within the scanner will lead you to the culprit, as always. Please return the item intact.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 18, 'npc_2_4', 'Splendid. You will recall, of course, that all museum artifacts have tracking beacons. It is fortunate the thieves never think to disable these! Please locate the thief and return the artifact by any means.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 19, 'npc_3_1', 'I apologize for my mistake. Please enjoy your visit to my little sanctuary. Hem!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 20, 'npc_3_2', 'Not available just now? I understand. Please enjoy your visit to my little sanctuary. Hem!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 21, 'npc_3_3', 'Very well, I wish you good luck in your other endeavors. Enjoy the museum.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 22, 'npc_3_4', 'Understandable. I wish you well in your travels around our world.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 23, 'npc_4_1', 'The artifact in question is a robe supposedly worn by the Tusken Raider who led the original assault on Fort Tusken centuries ago. The robe''s provenance is questionable, but I know no better candidate. I would -- hem! -- very much like it back.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 24, 'npc_4_2', 'It is the endless dust of this desert. Over the decades I must have inhaled enough to fill a -- hem! -- a binary load lifter. Now, the mission?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 25, 'npc_4_3', 'It is purely a function of budget, I assure -- hem! I must requisition yet more funds for greater anti-theft protection. It is a terrible indictment of Imperial funding priorities, no? Hem! Now as to the mission?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 26, 'npc_4_4', 'When the Hutts first arrived on Tatooine, long ago, they held a mass slaughter and subsequent feast. The artifact is, as best we can tell, a chunk of dried meat left over from that initial feast. Will you retrieve it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 27, 'npc_reward_1', 'Fine work! The robe appears relatively harmed after its ordeal. These senseless thefts grow ever more frequent. I hope the Empire will grant my petition for an increased theft-control budget.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 28, 'npc_reward_2', 'The armor appears to be in acceptable condition. Thank you again for your exemplary service. I anticipate a budget increase to handle these thefts soon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 29, 'npc_reward_3', 'This is yet another reason I am in your debt. Perhaps you will spread the word among Imperial authorities that this museum requires a greater budget to prevent theft.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 30, 'npc_reward_4', 'Thank you indeed! I daresay the museum''s collection would not be perceptibly harmed by the absence of this meat. But as a matter of principle, we must not tolerate artifact theft -- a point I hope the Imperial budget committee remembers when they allocate funds.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 32, 'player_3_3', 'Why are you seeing so many thefts at your museum?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 33, 'player_3_4', 'What kind of artifact is it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 34, 'gotowork', 'Ah, you''re here. But -- you have not yet resolved the matter we discussed, correct? Please return when you have results.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 35, 'enemy_1', 'Utinni! Nik maikka dinnika Dinhint!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 36, 'enemy_2', 'Hmm. Has that lickspittle of a curator changed his mind? I shall not cancel our arrangement. Rather, I shall cancel you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 37, 'enemy_3', 'You are the fence? Late! Dinhint did say right about how much valuable is this hunk of junk, yes? Wait! You are not --!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/curator.stf', 38, 'enemy_4', 'I know you! Hanging around the museum, right? Tell Dinhilt this is no gemstone. You won''t believe this, but -- Hey, what are you do--?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 1, 'gotowork', 'I still need for you to escort my friend to town. Please hurry! Thanks.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 2, 'cantwork', 'I would love your help escorting some friends of mine who are having trouble reaching town, but rumor has it that you''re already working on a task for someone else. Come back when you''re finished and we''ll talk. Thanks!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 9, 'not_it', 'No, sorry, that''s not the item I was looking for...'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 34, 'npc_1_1', 'Well, hello! I wonder if you can help me. Someone from the Sand Dragon Fresher company is supposed to come by the cafe to drop off supplies - but I''ve gotten word that they are lost just outside of town. Would you be able to find them and escort them to me? I can give you a fine bottle of Corellian Ale... (we have surplus).'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 35, 'npc_2_1', 'Great! I''m in desperate need of new supplies. Be careful out there!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 36, 'npc_3_1', 'I understand. Perhaps some other time? Take care.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 37, 'player_1_1', 'Yes. I will find the representative and escort them here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 38, 'player_2_1', 'No. I have no time for this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 39, 'npc_reward_1', 'Careful with this thing.  It''s well put together, but if you crush it it won''t be worth as much.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 52, 'npc_1_2', 'I hope you enjoy the Corellian ale! If you''re up to it - I have another request. At the moment, I''m embroiled in a legal battle with a cafe owner in Mos Teike who thinks she owns the recipe for "Talusian Flat-Bread" sandwiches. I am supposed to meet with my legal counsel... but unfortunately I got a distress message from him a few moments ago... Would you be willing to escort him to town?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 53, 'npc_2_2', 'Excellent! I look forward to your return... (and an end to this frivolous lawsuit)!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 54, 'npc_3_2', 'Well... okay. I''m not sure what I''m going to do about this lawsuit... but okay. Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 55, 'player_1_2', 'Yes. I will escort the advocate to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 56, 'player_2_2', 'No. I am unable to do this for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 57, 'npc_reward_2', 'Here''s your official proclamation.  It won''t be valid unless I get elected, but hang onto it just in case.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 58, 'npc_1_3', 'I''m preparing a banquet for my long-time friend and benefactor, Tour Aryon. As a surprise, I''ve recruited a chef from the "Fallen Star" hotel who knows how to prepare Aryon''s favorite dish! Unfortunately, the chef has not yet arrived - and it is getting late... So, if you''re willing - I would like for you to escort the chef to me. What do you think?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 59, 'npc_2_3', 'Good.  I regret that I can''t extend an invitation to the banquet - but I can certainly provide a worthwhile reward. Thanks!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 60, 'npc_3_3', 'That''s fine. If I could extend an invitation to the banquet, it might be more attactive, eh? Maybe later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 61, 'player_1_3', 'Yes. I will retrieve the chef for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 62, 'player_2_3', 'No. I can''t.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 63, 'npc_reward_3', 'Here you go.  This is a picture I took taking off from an undiscovered planet.  That picture is one of a kind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 70, 'player_1_4', 'Yes. I will find one of the clients and escort them you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 71, 'player_2_4', 'No. Sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 72, 'npc_1_4', 'The curator of our beloved Bestine Museum has started a match-making business on the side called "Dune-Hearts." It''s not going so well, though. Due to a problem with the museum''s antique messenger droid all of the clients have been given bad locations in their datapads... and are now wandering the desert, searching vainly for their true loves!  Would you be able to escort one of them back here so that I can set them straight?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 73, 'npc_2_4', 'Wonderful! I''m sure that the message droid problems will be fixed by the time you return! Be careful.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 74, 'npc_3_4', 'Yes, well - I guess people should solve their own problems. Thanks for your time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 75, 'npc_reward_4', 'Here''s a recording rod that I paid way too much for.  It''s valuable but fragile.  Be careful with it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 76, 'npc_4_1', 'My name is Om Aynat. Long ago I trained as a chef on Talus - but... bad things happened... and after bouncing unhappily from system to system, I wound up working here at the food-stand for my friend Tour Aryon. '),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 77, 'npc_4_2', 'I developed the recipe while studying under the master chef in Restuss. One weekend (for laughs), we made Talusian sandwiches for a cruiser-load of visiting students. It was a towering sensation! A few days later, word came that the Corellia Times wanted to write about it... and the Master expelled me. Suspicious, don''t you think? The Corellia Times never got their story. And ever since then I have been rooting out all of the liars who claim to have invented it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 78, 'npc_4_3', 'It''s just a nice thing to do! Right after I was exiled from the culinary conservatory in Restuss - some friends of mine in the Imperial Military introduced us. She is a testament to the greatness of the Empire: fair-handed, even-tempered, and... well... just a fantastic person!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 79, 'npc_4_4', 'I''m not sure. Perhaps being a curator of antiquities makes one unnecessarily fond of old and broken things. I''m sure that with the recent developments, there is no way that he can justify hanging on to this messenger droid. If he does - we''ll have many more people stranded out in the desert... looking for love.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 80, 'player_3_1', 'Who are you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 81, 'player_3_2', 'Did you invent "Talusian Flat-Bread?"'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 82, 'player_3_3', 'Why are you hosting a banquet for Tour Aryon?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 83, 'player_3_4', 'Why doesn''t he get a new messenger droid?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 84, 'dontknowyou', 'Hello, stranger. I can''t go with you. I''m waiting for someone else to arrive. Thank you!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 85, 'otherescort', 'I think you''re here to pick up someone else.  You''re certainly not taking ME anywhere.'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 86, 'escortother', 'You might be looking for someone else...');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 88, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Whew! I thought I would be stuck out here forever. Can you lead me to Om''s shoppe, please?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 89, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Ah yes. Could you take me to Om Aynat, please?'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 90, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Please get me to Bestine! I''m running out of time and I have so much delicious food to prepare!'),
('string/en/theme_park_bestine/om.stf', 91, 'npc_takeme_4', 'You don''t look like my date... but I''ll be happy to follow you if you''re headed to Bestine!'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 1, 'qualdo_1', 'I''m Herm.  Qual''do Herm.  You must be the new recruit.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 2, 'qualdo_1_r1', 'That''s me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 3, 'qualdo_1_r2', 'No, you''re confused.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 4, 'qualdo_2', 'Good.  I''ve got some work for you to do.  This was handed down from the Priness herself, but we don''t want to use one of our regular field agents.  Can we trust you with this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 5, 'qualdo_2_r1', 'Absolutely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 6, 'qualdo_2_r2', 'I''m sort of busy now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 7, 'qualdo_3', 'Sorry.  I thought you were with us.  Well, carry on then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 8, 'qualdo_4', 'Wizard!  I need you to escort a friend of ours.  He''s had some trouble with the imperials, but they aren''t bothering with him personally.  They''ve contracted his life out to a bounty hunter.  I need you to get him here safely, he''s one of our top scientists.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 9, 'qualdo_4_r1', 'Where is he?'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 10, 'qualdo_4_r2', 'What does he do?'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 11, 'qualdo_5', 'I knew I could count on you.  Here, I''ll upload his coordinates to your datapad.  Get to him and make sure he stays safe.  Bring him back here, for the good of the alliance, and I''ll make sure our superiors know your name.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 12, 'qualdo_6', 'He''s an expert in Imperial listening devices.  Without him they''d be listening into every conversation we have.  Fortunately he''s been able to block their scans.  But we need him back to do more research.  There''s a constant cat and mouse game of spying going on, and he''s the only hope we have of winning it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 13, 'qualdo_6_r1', 'Ok, where is he?'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 14, 'qualdo_6_r2', 'I''ll help you later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 15, 'qualdo_7', 'For the Alliance sake, don''t be long.  We don''t have time to wait for rookies to get ready.  We need you in the field!'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 16, 'qualdo_8', 'Well, we''ve been waiting. Are you ready yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 17, 'qualdo_8_r1', 'Sorry.  I''m ready.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 18, 'qualdo_8_r2', 'Nope, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 19, 'qualdo_9', 'Well, you''ve blown it.  We''re going to have to scramble everything now and put a lot of operations on hold until we get a new technician who can work on those listening devices.  Too bad you weren''t more helpful.'),
('string/en/theme_park_corellia/qualdo.stf', 20, 'qualdo_10', 'Excellent work.  I''m putting in a request right now to have you bumped up in pay scale.  When you''re ready to do more work see Lt. Lance.  He''ll have something for you to do.'),
