('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 94, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 95, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 96, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 97, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 98, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 99, 'npc_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 100, 'npc_noloc_1', 'The Rebel has yet to arrive. Return to me at a later time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 101, 'npc_noloc_2', 'She has not yet arrived on the planet. Return to me after some time has passed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 102, 'npc_noloc_3', 'The Rebel will be expecting you in short time. Return to me shortly and I shall dispatch you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 103, 'npc_noloc_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 104, 'npc_noloc_5', 'The broker is not able to be found at this time. Return to me later, and I''ll tell you when he can be destroyed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 105, 'npc_noloc_6', 'This one is not available'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 106, 'npc_reset', 'You have failed me. You are fortunate that I am more forgiving than my master.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 107, 'npc_reward_1', 'You have done well. I see that you have brought me the information the Rebel was delivering. I may have need of your skills shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 108, 'npc_reward_2', 'Interesting. It seems there is a deeper connection as I had suspected. You have performed well, Agent. I know I will have need of your services later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 109, 'npc_reward_3', 'I find this most disturbing. It seems the hero of the Rebellion shares the same name as this farm boy on Tatooine. Interesting. You may leave for now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 110, 'npc_reward_4', 'This information cannot be true. Obi-Wan would not have dared to hide himself there.  No! This information is false. You, however, have fulfilled your assignment. I will have more for you shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 111, 'npc_reward_5', 'Impressive. You destroyed him and his friends by yourself. You have done well by me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 112, 'npc_reward_6', 'This information is most disturbing. It appears that were Alderaan still in existence, I would interrogate Bail Organa to see what the connection between Skywalker and Bail''s daughter is. Alas, this cannot be done. Very well... I shall pursue a new endeavor. You have served me well, Agent. Fare well, for now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 113, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 114, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'Here''s the information Vader wanted. Why he cares about these droids is beyond me, considering he wasn''t able to stop them in time. I''ll be off now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 115, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 116, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'So look, here''s the lowdown on what happend in that cantina. Now you tell that armored freak that I expected to be paid for this, got it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 117, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 118, 'npc_smuggle_6', ''),
