('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 185, 'player_reset', 'I can no longer do this for you, Lord Vader.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 186, 'player_sorry', 'What are the details of my assignment?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 187, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Lord Vader is awaiting your return. Bring him the datapad to complete your mission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 188, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Lord Vader is waiting for you to bring those documents back to him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 189, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Now that you have the letter, return it to Lord Vader immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 190, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Darth Vader is waiting for this information. Return to him at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 191, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Return to Vader to inform him that the deed is done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 192, 'return_waypoint_description_6', 'Return to Lord Vader now that the Kenobi line has been destroyed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 193, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 194, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 195, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 196, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 197, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 198, 'return_waypoint_name_6', 'Darth Vader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 199, 'waypoint_description_1', 'You are to seek out and destroy this Rebel before he makes contact with his fellow conspirators.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 200, 'waypoint_description_2', 'You should be able to find the Emperor''s Hand waiting with some documents.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 201, 'waypoint_description_3', 'You are to kill Mellag Davin-Lars then locate any incriminating information you can find.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 202, 'waypoint_description_4', 'You are to meet with a member of Black Sun to retrieve some documents'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 203, 'waypoint_description_5', 'You are to give the information broker everything he deserves'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 204, 'waypoint_description_6', 'Destroy the friend of Obi-Wan Kenobi'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 205, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Rebel Courier'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 206, 'waypoint_name_2', 'Emperor''s Hand'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 207, 'waypoint_name_3', 'Rebel Sympathizer'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 208, 'waypoint_name_4', 'Information Broker'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 209, 'waypoint_name_5', 'Information Broker'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 210, 'waypoint_name_6', 'Obi-Wan Kenobi''s Friend'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/darth_vader.stf', 211, 'gotowork', 'Return to your master.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'You display much audacity, little one. You enter my chambers, yet your loyalties lie elsewhere. Think upon what I have said.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'If you''re not the one, then why are you talking to me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Who are you, then? Get outta here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Just doing my job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'I am sorry. I have mistaken you for someone else. Good day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 6, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Oh, nevermind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 7, 'dontknowyou_6', 'You aren''t. Oh, I''m sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 8, 'dontknowyou_7', 'Ooops. Sorry, I was... ummm... practicing my lines.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 9, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 10, 'gotowork_2', 'What''s this? The old guy said we were going to get something special.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 11, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 12, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 13, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 14, 'gotowork_6', 'She has told us that you would deliver a speech. Where is it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 15, 'gotowork_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 16, 'next', 'I have no need of your skills right now. In the meantime, hone your skills, and let your hate guide you.  Go and see my apprentice.  Lord Vader has some more tasks for you...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 17, 'notit_1', 'This is not what I asked for? Do you feel a trinket shall sway my favor?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 18, 'notit_2', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 19, 'notit_3', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 20, 'notit_4', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 21, 'notit_5', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 22, 'notit_6', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 23, 'notit_7', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 24, 'notyet', 'You display much audacity by stepping before me. This is... amusing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 25, 'npc_1_1', 'So you are the one I have heard so much about, eh?  I am certain you would not be adverse to helping me with a little problem, would you?  The Rebels have come looking for the datapad you recovered from the escaped prisoner.  I will now need to speak with the head of a local gang of thugs.  Would you bring him to me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 26, 'npc_1_2', 'The leader of these... mercenaries... has decided to curtail their criminal activites and have become loyal subjects to the Empire.  They have willingly offered their services for an errand I need done.  They are now awaiting a very special package, one in which I can entrust you to deliver, correct?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 27, 'npc_1_3', 'You may rise, my young friend.  I have need of your services again, for you have been most loyal to the Empire.  You will need to help disable some bothersome security experts in order to allow the team of mercenaries to fulfill their task.  You find yourself capable of doing such, do you not?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 28, 'npc_1_4', 'It seems that the Queen was not pleased with her visitors and has become quite vocal over this.  Lord Vader has informed her that the Empire had no involvement with this.  I am sending an escort to bring one of her Handmaidens here so that I may apologize for this misunderstanding.  You will wish to offer your services as escort, am I right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 29, 'npc_1_5', 'The Queen has been shown records of a Rebel raid that lost the Empire several crates of Stormtrooper armor.  It has been suggested to her that the Rebel imposters were trying to scare her into joining their side by masquerading as Imperial troops.  We tracked down these Rebels, and are sending a team to handle them.  You are that team.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 30, 'npc_1_6', 'The Queen has now decided to redirect her anger, and has recorded a rather... hateful... message to be viewed by the Naboo High Council.  This message must get to the Council immediately before they vote.  I trust you will be able to deliver this, correct?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 31, 'npc_1_7', 'The Queen''s hate has made us powerful.  The Rebel General is now fleeing the planet under the threat of imprisonment from the good Queen.  Our patience has paid off, young friend.  Go intercept the foolish Rebel and kill him personally.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 32, 'npc_2_1', 'I have had a message sent to this criminal, and he will be awaiting you to bring him here.  He is aware that he will be granted immunity for his gang''s activites whilst we speak.  Treat him with all due respect, and bring him within my presence.  I expect not to wait long...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 33, 'npc_2_2', 'Good, good.  I knew you would be most willing to offer yourself for this duty.  Take this datapad with the plans to a major... contruction... project that is in the works.  You will deliver it to our new Imperial subjects, for they will keep it safe.  Make sure that only they receive it.  I will be quite displeased to hear of you failing me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 34, 'npc_2_3', 'This pleases me to hear this.  You need to travel to the following location to eliminate the Queen''s security experts.  Destroy these fools in order to allow the mercenaries to perform their task undisturbed.  Worry not, my friend, the Queen shall not come to too much harm  She''s no good to me dead.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 35, 'npc_2_4', 'I expect the Handmaiden safely escorted here without any harm brought to her.  Treat her handmaiden as if it were the Queen itself, subject.  If anything happens to her, I will be...most displeased.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 36, 'npc_2_5', 'I do not believe you will.  You will need to locate the remainder of the band of criminals and exterminate them.  After you have eliminated the leader of their band, return here with the datapad he was safely hiding.  Your actions will be recorded for the Queen to see, so it would be wise to silence them before they speak.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 37, 'npc_2_6', 'Your dedication pleases me.  Take this holodisc and bring it to the Council.  The Queen will leave shortly to confirm her message to the Council, but this needs to be there immediately.  Return here after they have watched the message, so this way we can see our plans to their completion.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 38, 'npc_2_7', 'Do not fail me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 39, 'npc_3_1', 'I am distressed with your lack of conviction.  Very well, then.  You may leave.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 40, 'npc_3_2', 'Do you question my choices, subject?  Perhaps I can come to a much better solution...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 41, 'npc_3_3', 'I find your lack of versatility disturbing.  You will want to learn very quickly and return here to tell me of your successful lessons.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 42, 'npc_3_4', 'It is better that you decline and face the consequences than to fail me.  Your courage is admirable, but you loyalty is now... questionable....'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 43, 'npc_3_5', 'I have placed more faith in you than you seem to deserve.  It is a shame that such a valuable resource will go to waste...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 44, 'npc_3_6', 'No, your dedication would have been enough.  You have failed me horribly... Rebel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 45, 'npc_3_7', 'You will pay the price for your lack of vision, young fool!  I will deal with you shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 46, 'npc_4_1', 'Oh, there is no connection between these two parties.  At least, not yet.  Information has been intercepted that claims a Rebel General has been sent to personally recover the plans on that datadisc.  It has come to my attention that the Queen of Naboo will be harboring this Rebel General.  This so very displeases me.  Shall you do this now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 47, 'npc_4_2', 'Ahhh... you are quite impatient, young one.  The most pleasant of surprises are the ones that are well thought out.  I do so fear ruining the fun for everyone involved, that I cannot reveal anything more yet. *cackles*  Soon, soon, your patience will pay off.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 48, 'npc_4_3', 'In a manner of speaking, yes.  The Queen of Naboo has hidden the Rebel General away within her Summer Home, or so she thinks.  The mercenaries job will be to speak to the Queen in a quite... brutish... manner.  They will force her to reveal the whereabouts of the General, though I expect them to fail miserably.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 49, 'npc_4_4', 'Oh, for they were wearing Stormtrooper armor we provided when they did so.  She now believes the Rebel General that the Empire is a threat, and has called the Naboo High Council to vote on whether they should openly ally with the Rebels.  The Queens of Naboo are quite easily persuaded to believe anything, I fear...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 50, 'npc_4_5', 'The criminal leader is holding the datapad you delivered him earlier, which will be shown to the Queen.  This will show that the Rebel General was using the datapad story as a ruse to power down her generators.  The Queen will see the datapad holds plans to construct a super-weapon to be used by the Rebels...after a few changes, that is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 51, 'npc_4_6', 'The Queen has informed the Naboo High Council that she has witnessed evidence that the Rebels have tried to assassinate her through a devious plot.  Were it not for the intervention of the Empire, she would have surely been killed.  With much anger flowing through her, she has denounced the Rebellion and branded them as criminals.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 52, 'npc_4_7', 'Yes.. let your anger flow through you.  Not until the General is shown the true power of the Dark Side shall his life be extinguished.  Go now and destroy him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 53, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 54, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 55, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 56, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 57, 'npc_5_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 58, 'npc_5_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 59, 'npc_5_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 60, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 61, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 62, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 63, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 64, 'npc_6_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 65, 'npc_6_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 66, 'npc_6_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 67, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Do not tarry. I do not take well to those who make me wait.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 68, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Do not tarry. I do not take well to those who make me wait.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 69, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Do not make me wait any further.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 70, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Do not make me wait, subject.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 71, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Do not make me wait any further.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 72, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'Do not make me wait any longer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_7', 'Do not fail me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 74, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hey! You the one who''s gonna take us to the old guy?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 75, 'npc_breech_2', 'Are you the one who has the stuff?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hey, you''re not supposed to be here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_4', 'I am Altah, Handmaiden to Queen Kylantha. Are you my escort?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 78, 'npc_breech_5', 'Hey, you''re the one with the Emperor... hey, wait... he doublecrossed us!!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 79, 'npc_breech_6', 'Are you the emmisary sent by the Queen?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 80, 'npc_breech_7', 'I have just warned the Alliance that the Queen led us into a trap! Die, Imperial.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 81, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'So this is the the big guy''s place? I was expecting somethin'' bigger.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 82, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 83, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 84, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'You have treated me respectfully, therefore I offer you my thanks. I shall let the Queen know of your performance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 85, 'npc_dropoff_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 86, 'npc_dropoff_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 87, 'npc_dropoff_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 88, 'npc_failure_1', 'I had expected more from you. You are nothing but a sad, sad failure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 89, 'npc_failure_2', 'I am quite disappointed to hear this. Quite, quite disappointed...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 90, 'npc_failure_3', 'I sense in you weakness. This will not do...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 91, 'npc_failure_4', 'Bow your knee to me, pathetic insect. Perhaps then I may see some future usefulness in you...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 92, 'npc_failure_5', 'I can hear your fear in the sound of your breathing... yes.... yes... you have failed me, have you not?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 93, 'npc_failure_6', 'You have failed me for the last time, whelp.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 94, 'npc_failure_7', 'You have broken the trust I have placed in you, insect. If this is the way it will be, then so be it, INSECT!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 95, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 96, 'npc_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 97, 'npc_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 98, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 99, 'npc_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 100, 'npc_more_1_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 101, 'npc_more_1_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 102, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 103, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 104, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 105, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 106, 'npc_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 107, 'npc_more_2_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 108, 'npc_more_2_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 109, 'npc_more_3_1', '');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 110, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 111, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 112, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 113, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 114, 'npc_more_3_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 115, 'npc_more_3_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 116, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 117, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 118, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 119, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 120, 'npc_noloc_5', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 121, 'npc_noloc_6', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_7', 'I sense a disturbance... it is not time for this to happen. Come before me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 123, 'npc_reset', 'You are denying my will? You have much boldness about you, my young friend. Perhaps that can be focused and hardened, hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 124, 'npc_reward_1', 'Yes, you have served me well.  You may leave until the criminal and I are done with our... conversation.  And take this as compensation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 125, 'npc_reward_2', 'You have returned.  I trust the plans have been safely placed in their hands?  Good, good.  They should be preparing their men at this time for their assistance they have offered.  I will send for you when I need you to do your part, as well.  There is more compensation for you as well, I believe.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 126, 'npc_reward_3', 'The mercenaries have completed their task due to your assistance.  This is a desirable outcome to these events, don''t you think?  Now all we need is patience, and we shall see this plan come through.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 127, 'npc_reward_4', 'You have done a remarkable job, my friend.  I am very glad to see the... handmaiden.... was not harmed, for we perish the thought of bringing any harm to the people of Naboo.  Isn''t that right, Your Highness?  Yes, yes, I''m quite familiar with your tendency of taking on other... guises.Subject, you may leave now as the Queen and I discuss the horrible tragedy that was brought upon her by Rebel imposters.  Take this as your compensation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 128, 'npc_reward_5', 'You have performed successfully.  The Queen has watched the distasteful events that unfolded, and will now see what the Rebels really had planned to do.  The painful look she displayed upon her face when she realized she was betrayed by the Rebels was quite.... pleasing.  Go with my blessing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 129, 'npc_reward_6', 'Everything is proceeding as I have forseen.  The Rebels will be branded as criminals here on Naboo in short order and the Queen has been turned to our side.  The Rebels do not understand they are no match for the power of the Dark Side.  And now it is time for the General to walk into my trap.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 130, 'npc_reward_7', 'The Rebels will be sad to hear they have lost one of their most prized Generals.  Only now do they understand the might of the Empire.  The Rebels will now fear the threat of Naboo''s Queen.  Without guidance from this General, they will be quite inclined to stay away from Naboo as I continue with my project.  You have served me well, my Hand.  And for that you shall receive this compensation...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 131, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 132, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'This is all we were supposed to hide? Well, the guy is paying well, so I guess we''ll keep it hidden like he asked. Now, get out of here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 133, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 134, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 135, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 136, 'npc_smuggle_6', 'You have shown up just in time. The Council is to vote soon, and the Queen''s speech will help sway our decision.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 137, 'npc_smuggle_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 138, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Let''s move it. I don''t like waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 139, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 140, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 141, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Please take me to the Emperor at once. The Queen is waiting for my report as to what the Emperor has to say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 142, 'npc_takeme_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 143, 'npc_takeme_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 144, 'npc_takeme_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 145, 'npc_work_1', 'You have returned so soon. Why?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 146, 'npc_work_2', 'What do you want, my young friend?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 147, 'npc_work_3', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 148, 'npc_work_4', 'Yes, my young friend?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 149, 'npc_work_5', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 150, 'npc_work_6', 'Why have you returned so soon?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 151, 'npc_work_7', 'Why have you not dealt with the Rebel?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 152, 'otherescort_1', 'If you''re not the one, then why are you talking to me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 153, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 154, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 155, 'otherescort_4', 'I am sorry. I have mistaken you for someone else. Good day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 156, 'otherescort_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 157, 'otherescort_6', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 158, 'otherescort_7', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 159, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, at your command, my lord.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 160, 'player_1_2', 'You can place your trust in me, my lord.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 161, 'player_1_3', 'I shall do anything that is asked of me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 162, 'player_1_4', 'I would be honored to do this, my lord.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 163, 'player_1_5', 'I will not fail you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 164, 'player_1_6', 'Yes, my lord.  I am at your service.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 165, 'player_1_7', 'As you wish, my master.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 166, 'player_2_1', 'I do not trust myself to do this right.  I cannot.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 167, 'player_2_2', 'This sounds too important for me to do.  I feel Lord Vader should do this, not me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 168, 'player_2_3', 'I do not know how to disable security systems.  I cannot do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 169, 'player_2_4', 'I should not be given a great responsibility such as that.  Send someone else, please.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 170, 'player_2_5', 'I cannot do this all by myself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 171, 'player_2_6', 'Shouldn''t there be an entourage to take this to the Council?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 172, 'player_2_7', 'I have too much good in me still.  I''m afraid I might save the General at the last minute.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 173, 'player_3_1', 'What do these thugs have to do with the Rebel scum?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 174, 'player_3_2', 'Do these security systems guard the Rebel General?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 175, 'player_3_3', 'Do these security systems guard the Rebel General?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 176, 'player_3_4', 'Why is she blaming the Empire for this when they were clearly mercenaries?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 177, 'player_3_5', 'What will this prove to the Queen?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 178, 'player_3_6', 'What was the message she recorded?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 179, 'player_3_7', 'Shall I kill him?'),
