('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 264, 'npc_reset_5', 'You are denying my will? You have much boldness about you, my young friend. Perhaps that can be focused and hardened, hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 265, 'npc_reset_6', 'You are denying my will? You have much boldness about you, my young friend. Perhaps that can be focused and hardened, hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/emperor.stf', 266, 'npc_reset_7', 'You are denying my will? You have much boldness about you, my young friend. Perhaps that can be focused and hardened, hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'I''m sorry citizen, but this is not a facility for you to be wandering around. You will need to leave if you are under different assignments.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'If you were not sent here by the Emperor, then I have nothing to say to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'What? Get out of here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'What? Get out of here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Oh, nevermind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 6, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Indentification scans show -zzzrtzzz- show improper escort.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 7, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 8, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 9, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 10, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 11, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 12, 'next', 'Go and speak to Loam Redge.  Your past work has allowed you access to the main hall.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 13, 'notit_1', 'What''s this? Hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 14, 'notit_2', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 15, 'notit_3', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 16, 'notit_4', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 17, 'notit_5', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 18, 'notyet', 'Could you say that again please?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 19, 'npc_1_1', 'Greetings, citizen.  I am Kaja Orzee, Administrative Assistant to the Emperor, Himself.  I am assuming you are here so that you may help serve the Empire, am I correct?  We are in need of an armed escort to assist in the transportation of an important official.  Do you wish to serve the Empire in this manner?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 20, 'npc_1_2', 'Greetings again, citizen.  There has been progress made on the threats with the Moff, and the Empire has need of you again.  Imperial sector police have recorded a conversation detailing someone hiring an assassin to murder the Moff.  The Empire needs you to track down this person that paid for the contract and retrieve the evidence.  Will you do so?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 21, 'npc_1_3', 'Oh, it''s good you stopped by right now.  We have just been informed that the Sector Police have found the assassin, but they are not equipped to handle someone of his caliber.  Shall I tell them that I will be sending a specialist out there to assist them with his capture?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 22, 'npc_1_4', 'Good news, citizen!  We have tracked down the way the death threats were being sent to the Moff.  It appears that there was a group of Rebel terrorists, not just one acting alone.  We need someone to ''sneak'' into their midsts and remove their ability to cause any more damage.  Are you willing to serve the Empire this way?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 23, 'npc_1_5', 'Ah, citizen!  It seems that one of the Moff''s droids had not been altered and survived the last assault, though it is badly damaged.  We need that droid recovered, for it may have information that can be used by the Empire.  Would you be willing to assist in its recovery and escort it back here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 24, 'npc_2_1', 'You will be escorting a Moff of a local system to meet with other officials here within the Emperor''s retreat.  You will be expected to treat the Governor with proper respect, and see to it that no harm comes to him during his travel.  You may depart now, for the Governor is waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 25, 'npc_2_2', 'Very good, then.  He will probably still have receipts of his payment to the assassin, so detain him so that you can bring him and his records here.  If he does not cooperate, you are authorized to use force if necessary.  Here is the location where our droids have last spotted him.  Please make haste.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 26, 'npc_2_3', 'I shall inform them immediately - they will be glad to hear you are on your way.  Again, try to get the assassin to give himself up so that we can hand him over to the Emperor''s Inquistors.  If he is as recalcitrant as was his partner, you are again authorized to use whatever force is necessary.  Good luck!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 27, 'npc_2_4', 'I knew you could be counted on, citizen.  Here, this is where you can find these rebel terrorists.  Try to take care of them before they hatch another plan that might cause untold numbers to lose their lives, as some of them have been *VERY* willing to do in the past.  Ask them to surrender, and if not, end their terror.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 28, 'npc_2_5', 'Though I know it is a simple task, it is still important, which you seem to understand.  You will find the droid in the surrounding wilderness region, based off of its last transmission.  Please return that RA-7 model here safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 29, 'npc_3_1', '*sighs* Very well, then.  We will likely have to send Stormtroopers to escort him, then.  Your enthusiatic loyalty to the Empire will be noted, citizen.  If you don''t mind, I have business to attend to now.  Good day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 30, 'npc_3_2', 'I will have to quickly find someone else, then.  Remember, though, that when you let a Rebel terrorist walk free, you might as well be helping them with their anarchy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 31, 'npc_3_3', 'You should be ashamed of yourself!  You can handle something like an assassin, but yet you let these new recruits risk their lives?  This is a Rebel assassin, not some trained bounty hunter.  If you don''t do it for the police, at least do it for the Emperor!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 32, 'npc_3_4', 'Hm.  Perhaps I overestimated you, citzen.  Very well, then.  I shall try to find someone else who wishes to show the Emperor their loyalty.  I believe your answer clearly shows where yours ends.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 33, 'npc_3_5', 'Tsk, tsk.  A shame, citizen.  I believed you were someone who would continue to show initiative.  I see now that I will have to take your name off of the the ''up and coming'' list that is periodically viewed by the Emperor.  Good day to you, citizen.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 34, 'npc_4_1', 'Recently, one of the Empire''s Moffs has been receiving death threats from an unknown sender.  We are currently investigating the source of these threats - Rebel terrorists, no doubt - but the safety of the Moff''s life is in jeopardy at this time.  The less attention to the escort, the safer he will be.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 35, 'npc_4_2', 'You are dealing with the Empire here, not some ragtag band of misguided Rebels.  We have already detached a team of sector police to track down the assassin, citizen.  What we need is someone to track down the Rebel sympathizer who placed the contract.  We are hoping you will not scare him away before dealing with him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 36, 'npc_4_3', 'Yes, we do, but we cannot dispatch the Guards.  If we did, who would be there to protect the defenseless Emperor?  You handled the previous situation with such professionalism, that I feel you can handle this with ease.  In addition, this you will be doing your part to scourge this galaxy of another Rebel murderer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 37, 'npc_4_4', 'No, not yet.  It seems that with the receipts for the "hit" contract, there was an address.  An address that led us right to them... the droid repair shop the Moff used to give his droids tune-ups.  They''ve been planting listening devices in his droids the whole time!  Either way, they don''t know their leader is dead yet, so surprise is on now on our side.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 38, 'npc_4_5', 'This droid was a RA-7 model who''s loyalty programming was of a new design.  One in which we should apply to all of our droids, were it my decision.  This was the droid that confirmed the location of the Rebels.  With all their propaganda about their ''Heroic'' droids, I''d love those Rebels to hear that we have some heroic ones of our own, too!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 39, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 40, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 41, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 42, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 43, 'npc_5_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 44, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 45, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 46, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 47, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 48, 'npc_6_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 49, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 50, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 51, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 52, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 54, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hello!  Are you here for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 55, 'npc_breech_2', 'Sorry, but you''re in the way. I guess I''ll charge them for you too.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 56, 'npc_breech_3', 'Sorry, but you''re in the way. I guess I''ll charge them for you too.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 57, 'npc_breech_4', 'We knew the Empire would retaliate for us killing the Moff! You''ll die too!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 58, 'npc_breech_5', 'Zzzrtzz! In the name of the Empire, identify - zzzrtzzz-  In the name of - zzzrtzzz..'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 59, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'I will inform the chamberlain that you performed your duty to the tee.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 60, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 61, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 63, 'npc_dropoff_5', 'Long live the Emper-peror-peror.... -zzzrtttzzz-.... Priority override - Secure area achieved. Initiating temporary shutdown.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 64, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh dear... I''m not too sure Lord Vader will be pleased to hear that the Moff is dead.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 65, 'npc_failure_2', 'I am sorry to hear that you weren''t able to complete this. I guess I''ll have to record this on your dossier.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 66, 'npc_failure_3', 'Well, this just puts a damper on my day. I do not think Lord Hethrir will be too happy to hear that you have failed in this simple assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 67, 'npc_failure_4', 'Hmmm... unfortunately, I will not be able to alter these records to show you in a better light. Perhaps you my be able to learn from this failure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 68, 'npc_failure_5', 'Perhaps I misunderstood you. I believed you said you were able to do this. Were you to have told me that you were that incompetant, I wouldn''t have assigned this to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 69, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 70, 'npc_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 71, 'npc_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 72, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 73, 'npc_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 74, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 75, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 76, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 77, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 78, 'npc_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 79, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 80, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 81, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 82, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 83, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 84, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Odd. This report seems to conflict with the information I need to give you. Let me correct this, then check back with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 85, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Odd. This report seems to conflict with the information I need to give you. Let me correct this, then check back with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 86, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Odd. This report seems to conflict with the information I need to give you. Let me correct this, then check back with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 87, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Odd. This report seems to conflict with the information I need to give you. Let me correct this, then check back with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 88, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Odd. This report seems to conflict with the information I need to give you. Let me correct this, then check back with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 89, 'npc_reset', 'Fine, come back when you are more capable of helping.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 90, 'npc_reward_1', 'A superb job, citizen.  The Moff spoke highly of your efficiency. He did mention that you might be deserving of some compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 91, 'npc_reward_2', 'It is a shame he wouldn''t reason with you.  Then again, not all of them are misguided, I guess - some are just plain evil, and need to be taken care of accordingly.  I hope the Interrogation team can use this information to find his accomplices.  Please accept this compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 92, 'npc_reward_3', 'Our Inquisitor, will be upset to hear the assassin did not come peacefully.  But it was to be expected.  You cannot trust their kind, I say.  If only they would try to work with the Emperor rather than against him.  Oh, and the Inquisitor would like you to have this compensation. He feels you may have earned it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 93, 'npc_reward_4', 'Once again, you have performed your duties admirably, citizen.  I hope they didn''t give you too much of a fight.  When will these Rebels ever learn?  They cannot fight the Empire, for we are on the side of right!  Violence doesn''t solve problems, laws do! *sighs*'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 94, 'npc_reward_5', 'Wonderful!  You have performed in such an exacting manner, I''m certain the Emperor will want to hear of your achievements.  Good work, citizen!  I shall write you a wonderful letter of recommendation and have it placed in your record.  Have yourself a good day, and may the Emperor live forever!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 95, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 96, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 97, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 98, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 99, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 100, 'npc_takeme_1', 'You have taken your time coming out here, haven''t you? I''m a busy man, so let''s hurry this up.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 101, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 102, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 103, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 104, 'npc_takeme_5', 'Security code override. Malfunction reported -zzzrtzzrt- Require maintenance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 105, 'npc_work_1', 'Where is the governor?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 106, 'npc_work_2', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 107, 'npc_work_3', 'Yes? How can I help you, citizen?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 108, 'npc_work_4', 'Did you need your assignment explained again, citizen?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 109, 'npc_work_5', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 110, 'otherescort_1', 'If you were not sent here by the Emperor, then I have nothing to say to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 111, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 112, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 113, 'otherescort_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 114, 'otherescort_5', 'Indentification scans show -zzzrtzzz- show improper escort.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 115, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I wish to serve the Empire in this capacity.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 116, 'player_1_2', 'Yes, I will track him down for the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 117, 'player_1_3', 'Yes, please let them know that.  I will deal with this assassin myself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 118, 'player_1_4', 'I''d be happy to root out this Rebel scum!  Yes, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 119, 'player_1_5', 'By all means!  I''ll bring that heroic droid back here on the double!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 120, 'player_2_1', 'No, I do not feel I should be entrusted with this duty.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 121, 'player_2_2', 'I don''t believe I am suited to a task such as that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 122, 'player_2_3', 'Assassin?  Umm... no thanks.  Leave that to the police, I always say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 123, 'player_2_4', 'One was hard enough, Kaja.  I can''t handle a group of them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 124, 'player_2_5', 'No thanks, Kaja.  Just send out a droid recovery team, instead.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 125, 'player_3_1', 'Why aren''t you sending a squad of Stormtroopers to do so?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 126, 'player_3_2', 'Wouldn''t you want to track down the assassin first?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 127, 'player_3_3', 'Don''t you have any special teams designed for this type of work?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 128, 'player_3_4', 'Do they know we''re on to them yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 129, 'player_3_5', 'What''s so special about this droid?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 130, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 131, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 132, 'player_4_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 133, 'player_4_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 134, 'player_4_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 135, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 136, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 137, 'player_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 138, 'player_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 139, 'player_5_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 140, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 141, 'player_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 142, 'player_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 143, 'player_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 144, 'player_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 145, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 146, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 147, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 148, 'player_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 149, 'player_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 150, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 151, 'player_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 152, 'player_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 153, 'player_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 154, 'player_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 155, 'player_reset', 'I''m sorry, I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 156, 'player_sorry', 'I''ll get right back to work.  Just taking a breather.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 157, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'The Chamberlain is expecting you to return with the Moff. Keep him safe!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 158, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Kaja is waiting for the suspect. Since he died, she''ll accept the reciepts instead.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 159, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Kaja is waiting for the assassin''s return. Since he didn''t come willingly, she''ll accept his pronouncement of death.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 160, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Kaja is waiting to learn of what happened to the Rebels.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 161, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Kaja and a team of Technicians is awaiting the return of the droid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 162, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Kaja Or''Zee'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 163, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Kaja Or''zee'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 164, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Kaja Or''zee'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 165, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Kaja Or''Zee'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 166, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'Kaja Or''Zee'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 167, 'waypoint_description_1', 'This is where the Moff is waiting to be picked up. Don''t keep him waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 168, 'waypoint_description_2', 'Apprehend the man who hired the assassin to kill the Moff. If he doesn''t come willingly, kill him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 169, 'waypoint_description_3', 'Stop this assassin before he gets to the Moff. If he doesn''t come willingly, kill him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 170, 'waypoint_description_4', 'These are the true people behind the assassination attempt on the Moff. Kill them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 171, 'waypoint_description_5', 'An Imperial droid needs to be escorted back to the Retreat due to it being heavily damaged.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 172, 'waypoint_name_1', 'The Moff'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 173, 'waypoint_name_2', 'The Moff''s Rival'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 174, 'waypoint_name_3', 'The Moff''s Assassin'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 175, 'waypoint_name_4', 'Rebel Terrorists'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 176, 'waypoint_name_5', 'Damaged RA-7 Driod'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 177, 'backtowork', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 178, 'npc_backtowork', 'Don''t take too long, I need that task completed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/kaja_orzee.stf', 179, 'dontknowyou', 'I can''t talk now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Why are you disturbing me? It''s quite obvious by the look in your eye that you are already busy with other projects. Until you have time to spare, do not bother me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh, you''re not here for me? Umm... sorry. I guess I''m being a bit too paranoid as of late.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Oh, you''re here for the meeting? Sorry, invitiation only.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Oh, sorry. I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Oh, you''re not here for me? Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 6, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 7, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 8, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 9, 'gotowork_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 10, 'next', 'You have been of great value to me. I shall make certain that word of your service comes to the attention of Lord Hethrir.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 11, 'notit_1', 'What is this? I want the suspect, not some little trinket!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 12, 'notit_2', 'What''s this? I didn''t ask for it!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 13, 'notit_3', 'This is not the datapad containing the information I''ve asked for!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 14, 'notit_4', 'What? I didn''t ask for this? Get back to work at once, citizen!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 15, 'notyet', 'How did you get in here? If you need something, then speak with the chamberlain, Kaja Or''Zee.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 16, 'npc_1_1', 'Greetings, citizen.  I am Loam Redge, Chief Imperial Inquisitor here on Naboo.  I have been told you are a resourceful person, and quite willing the serve the Empire''s need.  I have an assignment for you that consists of apprehending a suspect and bringing him to me for questioning.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 17, 'npc_1_2', 'You''ve shown up just in time, citizen.  Our prisoner has been quite forthcoming with his information, and fortunately for him, he didn''t resist too much, which is a good thing.  I do so hate it when they insist on being stubborn.  Regardless, he has clued us into a meeting some underground Rebels will be having soon, and I''ll need you there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 18, 'npc_1_3', 'Well, it took some time, but he finally broke down.  I hate it when they struggle... it would be so much easier on them if they just gave in.  It seems that once again, I was able to garner his information just in time.  There is a Rebel that is beelining to their offworld contacts to give them the slicer''s data.  Intercept him, quickly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 19, 'npc_1_4', 'Ahhh... hopelessness is always a good tool to use when someone won''t talk.  It''s much more effective than intense pain, I do say.  Oh.  Where was I?  Yes, the leader.  He has finally revealed where the slicer has holed up.  He needs to be captured before he finds out his cover has been blown.  Do this quick!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 20, 'npc_2_1', 'This Rebel sympathizer has been quite open with his traitorous views, therefore he will not be too difficult to find.  Since he naively believes that the Empire does not know of him, he should not be too difficult to apprehend.  Return here when you have him in your custody.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 21, 'npc_2_2', 'When you bust up their meeting, you will need to identify which one of them is the leader, and convince him to come in for questioning.  Do not resort to force, for he is too valuable to have a fight break out between you.  I will be better able to convince him of the error of his ways.  Please leave quickly or you''ll miss the meeting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 22, 'npc_2_3', 'That''s the spirit, citizen!  Get the datapad the courier is carrying, and bring it back here immediately.  If he gives up on his own accord, bring him and the datapad back here immediately.  From the sounds of his orders, though, I doubt it will be that easy.  I will settle for just the datapad, if events turn out that way.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 23, 'npc_2_4', 'You will find the Slicer doesn''t know you''re coming, so a little surprise will be all you''ll need to get him to cooperate.  I know you are thoroughly capable of handling this, citizen.  *smiles* This is why I told the Emperor that I would entrust it to you.  Needless to say, do not fail him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 24, 'npc_3_1', 'Apparently the reports I''ve heard about you were wrong.  Let''s see, who signed these papers?  Ah, Kaja did.  I think I''ll need to present to her a few... questions... as to why she is recording false statements.  I sure do hope for her sake this was just filed wrong.  Hm?  Are you still here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 25, 'npc_3_2', 'You sniveling little worm!  When it gets a bit dangerous, you crawl into your hole?  Pshaw!  I have no need of you any further, now that you have shown me what you really are, worm.  Leave my presence!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 26, 'npc_3_3', 'You are going to give up just like that?  You have no willpower to speak of, do you?  Are you that pathetic?  Are you!?  Or perhaps.... perhaps you do, and there may be something you are forgetting to mention, hm?  Ahh... I think I understand now............');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 27, 'npc_3_4', 'You forget your station, citizen, and you also forget with whom you are speaking.  I no longer trust your motives for assisting, and I request that you do not leave the planet any time soon.  I am not finished with you yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 28, 'npc_4_1', 'I have just... learned... that there is a convicted slicer who has recently escaped from Kessel and is now here on Naboo to meet with some Rebels.  He is quite infamous for resisting many of our techniques, but I myself have yet to... converse... with him.  You will be gathering up a known Rebel sympathizer who may know his of present location.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 29, 'npc_4_2', 'Ah, him.  Well, since he was quite cooperative during his questioning, there will be no need to bring him up on charges.  Not all of these sympathizers have destruction in their hearts, they''ve just been seduced by the lies the Rebels use to sway the masses.  Now, will you be able make it to their meeting on time?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 30, 'npc_4_3', 'The Rebel leader didn''t know.  That data was stolen from some Secret Imperial Databanks and has been hidden since the slicer was incarcerated.  Accordingly, the information is encrypted in such a way that only their Rebel High Command can view it.  The Emperor seemed to feel this was most important, as well.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 31, 'npc_4_4', 'Aside from the fact that he escaped from an Imperial prison, defied the Empire by slicing into military computers, and aiding the Rebels?  Not much, other than the fact that he nearly gave the Emperor''s secret plans to the ...er... citizen, you are not cleared for that information.  Now, will you get out there and apprehend him for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 32, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 33, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 34, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 35, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 36, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 37, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 38, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 39, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 40, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I have clearly stated that you are to apprehend the suspect then bring him to me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 41, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Bring back the leader of these terrorists!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You are to get that data from that courier. At once!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You are to apprehend that Rebel scum before he knows you''re coming!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 44, 'npc_breech_1', 'I knew you would come for me one day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 45, 'npc_breech_2', 'How did you find this location? It was a secret!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 46, 'npc_breech_3', 'You''ll get this information over my dead body!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 47, 'npc_breech_4', 'Who are you? You don''t look like my normal contacts!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 48, 'npc_dropoff_1', 'You may have me, but my friend will come and save me. I swear to it!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 49, 'npc_dropoff_2', 'An Inquisitor? Ohhhh.... the Emperor must be getting very scared. Good.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 50, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 51, 'npc_dropoff_4', 'No, please... please, please, please... don''t hurt me! I was only playing around with the HoloNet! Seriously!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 52, 'npc_failure_1', 'So you say he died whilst you were escorting him here? Hmmm... perhaps you might have time for a few questions regarding this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 53, 'npc_failure_2', 'Why is it that I do not fully believe your story about him dying? Hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 54, 'npc_failure_3', 'So let me get this straight... you''re saying that the courier never actually had anything on him? Ah... yes... yes, I''ve heard this one before. Very well, citizen. Oh, if you could, please stick around until the guards... I mean, gift for your services arrive.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 55, 'npc_failure_4', 'I am supposed to give the Emperor a report as to what the Slicer had to say. I see that I will be giving him a different report, altogether.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 56, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 57, 'npc_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 58, 'npc_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 59, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 60, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 61, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 62, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 63, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 64, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 65, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 66, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 67, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 68, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I must track down where the most likely place to find the suspect. Speak to me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 69, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Hold on. Let me find where I wrote down the meeting location. Ask me again in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 70, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me find out from the prisoner where the courier was destined. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 71, 'npc_noloc_4', 'According to the information we have, the slicer might not be there right now. We shall wait until the time is right,'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 72, 'npc_reset', 'What? How dare you renege on your offer of assistance. Perhaps your loyalties do not lie fully with the Empire, hmmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 73, 'npc_reward_1', 'From the looks of him, I do not think this will be a long session.  In the meantime, here is compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 74, 'npc_reward_2', 'Superb work, citizen.  I hope he did not bore you with his incessant blather about the Empire.  He should prove a bit tough to persuade him to speak, but it will give me a good challenge, and I don''t get too many of those as of late.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 75, 'npc_reward_3', 'No courier, I take it?  Hmmm... a shame he didn''t come willingly - he could have led us to more of their contacts.  Well, at least I can hand over these plans... er... personnel files to the Emperor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 76, 'npc_reward_4', 'Wonderful... wonderful, wonderful, wonderful.  I am told that the Emperor personally wishes to explain to this slicer how important it is to not steal from the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 77, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 78, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 79, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 80, 'npc_smuggle_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 81, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Very well, then. There''s no use fighting, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 82, 'npc_takeme_2', 'So you''ve caught me, eh? What do you think you''ll do with me now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 83, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 84, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Oh no!!! I was told that I would never be caught by the Empire!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 85, 'npc_work_1', 'Why are you disturbing me again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 86, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you not understand me the first time?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 87, 'npc_work_3', 'Yes? What do you want?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Why are you still here? You will lose the element of surprise if you keep lollygagging around!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 89, 'otherescort_1', 'Oh, you''re not here for me? Umm... sorry. I guess I''m being a bit too paranoid as of late.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 90, 'otherescort_2', 'Oh, you''re here for the meeting? Sorry, invitiation only.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 91, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 92, 'otherescort_4', 'Oh, you''re not here for me? Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 93, 'player_1_1', 'Hm...Sure.  I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 94, 'player_1_2', 'I''ll do it.  What shall I do when I''m there?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 95, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll do it.  What shall I do when I''m there?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 96, 'player_1_4', 'He will be captured in a timely fashion!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 97, 'player_2_1', 'I''m not interested in rounding up civilians for interrogation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 98, 'player_2_2', 'I''m not going to rush in on a Rebel meeting!  They''ll kill me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 99, 'player_2_3', 'I doubt we will catch him in time, Loam.  The slicer has beaten us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 100, 'player_2_4', 'I am not Sector Police, Loam.  I am sick of all this apprehending people.  Do it yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 101, 'player_3_1', 'What is this person charged with?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 102, 'player_3_2', 'What happened to the sympathizer I brought in earlier?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 103, 'player_3_3', 'What is the Rebel carrying that is so important?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 104, 'player_3_4', 'Why all of this effort to catch an escaped slicer, of all people?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 105, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 106, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 107, 'player_4_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 108, 'player_4_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 109, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 110, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 111, 'player_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 112, 'player_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 113, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 114, 'player_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 115, 'player_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 116, 'player_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 117, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 118, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 119, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 120, 'player_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 121, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 122, 'player_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 123, 'player_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 124, 'player_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 125, 'player_reset', 'I cannot do this for you any longer, Inquisitor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 126, 'player_sorry', 'What do you wish me to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 127, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'The Inquisitor is awaiting your return. Don''t keep him waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 128, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Loam Redge is anxiously waitiing for you to return with the leader.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 129, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Loam Redge is waiting for you to return with the valuable data.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 130, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Loam Redge is waiting for you to return the Rebel terrorist.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 131, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Inquisitor Redge'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 132, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Inquisitor Redge'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 133, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Inquisitor Redge'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 134, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Inquisitor Redge'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 135, 'waypoint_description_1', 'You should be able to find the Rebel around here'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 136, 'waypoint_description_2', 'You should be able to stop the meeting before they''re gone. Hurry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 137, 'waypoint_description_3', 'You need to intercept this courier before he can get the information back to the Rebels.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 138, 'waypoint_description_4', 'Find the slicer, the arrest him! He doesn''t know you''re coming.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 139, 'waypoint_name_1', 'Suspected Rebel Sympathizer'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 140, 'waypoint_name_2', 'Rebel Sympathizer Leader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 141, 'waypoint_name_3', 'Rebel Courier'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 142, 'waypoint_name_4', 'Rebel Slicer'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 143, 'npc_backtowork', 'I would make haste in finishing this task, were I you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/loam_redge.stf', 144, 'dontknowyou', 'I''m sorry, I don''t really feel like talking now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 1, 'cant_work', 'Why are you bothering me, citizen? Can you not see I am even more busy than you are?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 2, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh, I thought you were about to attack me. I''m just an innocent citizen, minding my own business.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 3, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Oh, sorry. I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 4, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Oh, you''re one of us? Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 5, 'dontknowyou_4', 'You''re not? Well, have a good day. I''m waiting for someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 6, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Oh, you''re not with the Empire. Sorry, my mistake.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 7, 'gotowork_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 8, 'gotowork_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 9, 'gotowork_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 10, 'gotowork_4', 'I thought he said that he had a hot story on a disc or something.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 11, 'gotowork_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 12, 'next', 'You have served me quite well. I have noted on your record that you have displayed full loyalty to the Empire. Perhaps the visiting Captain may have use of you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 13, 'notit_1', 'What is this? I am not one known for a sense of humor, citizen.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 14, 'notit_2', 'What is this? This is not what I am expecting to receive!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 15, 'notit_3', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 16, 'notit_4', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 17, 'notit_5', 'What''s this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 18, 'notyet', 'I do not have the faintest idea who you are. Leave my chamber at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 19, 'npc_1_1', 'Your loyalty has been brought to my attention.  I have been assured you are willing to do anything to continue to prove your loyalty to the Empire, am I right?  Good.  You are commanded to locate a small time counterfeiter who is offering to sell the Empire some information.  You will be the contact to do business with him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 20, 'npc_1_2', 'This holodisc confirms exactly what I believed.  These are the ones who have been spreading the recent appearance of Rebel propaganda.  I will not tolerate this happening right under my nose.  Together, we will eliminate this threat.  First, you will need to punish the Rebel who has offered his home as a meeting place.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 21, 'npc_1_3', 'The datapad you recovered was most helpful.  It contained all of the names and locations of these propagandist instigators.  It also showed that a message was sent to warn their leader they have been found out.  You were quite sloppy, weren''t you?  I have a plan to bring him out of hiding, though.  You will help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 22, 'npc_1_4', 'The foolish Alderaanian propagandist has done exactly as expected.  He has come out of hiding, and has begun to make a nuisance of himself.  Finally, I will crush this annoyance, once and for all.  But first, one last thing.  I will need you to deliver this ''special'' holodisc to the local holonet broadcast station.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 23, 'npc_1_5', 'Sector Police have reported they have captured a local serial killer, the one shown on the most recent Holonet broadcast.  It seems the public were the ones who apprehended him.  Now that they have seen what evil that Rebel leader was capable of, they will no longer believe his lies.  Bring him to me for his trial.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 24, 'npc_2_1', 'You will gather the holodisc he is selling, and pay him with a quick death.  The Empire does not negotiate with terrorists, nor do we pay good credits for information leading to them.  His demise will provide ample message to others that we do not barter like simple merchants.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 25, 'npc_2_2', 'Your devotion is well noted.  You will meet with the owner of the Alderaanian''s meeting house, and eliminate him from the picture.  Since he is the hub of these propagandists, he should have a datapad that should provide information on their leader.  Locate that, for that is just as important.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 26, 'npc_2_3', 'You will take the fight to our man''s mentor, exterminate the old troublemaker, this should drive the point home.  I know you will not fail me again, will you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 27, 'npc_2_4', 'The Holonet broadcast station has been contacted by an ''anonymous citizen''.  The ''citizen'' claims to have visual proof as to who is responsible for these recent acts of violence.  You will act as the courier for the ''citizen'' and deliver them the holodisc.  Make sure they get it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 28, 'npc_2_5', 'Very good.  A local mob of citizens has gathered him up and brought him to the Sector Police.  The Emperor has given a statement that his crimes will be tried by the Procurator of Justice, myself.  You are to escort him to me for his... swift... trial.  Make haste, for I am looking forward to this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 29, 'npc_3_1', 'I have been misinformed of your loyalty, then.  You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 30, 'npc_3_2', 'If you are too weak to perform a simple duty, then I have no need of you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 31, 'npc_3_3', 'I am greatly disappointed in you.  You may have had a place in the Empire, but your future is quite... uncertain... now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 32, 'npc_3_4', 'HOW - DARE - YOU?!  WHO do you think you are speaking with?  Surely... surely you must be shocked from that explosion, or you wouldn''t have presumed to say that.  Report to the local medic and have yourself examined.  And I hope for your sake the medic''s checkup shows signs of trauma... or else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 33, 'npc_3_5', 'It is too late for you to back out now, friend.  If you seem to remember, I gave you an edited holodisc to give to the Holonet broadcast station.  The un-edited version still exists.  It would be most unfortunate if that copy were to fall into the hands of the public, wouldn''t it?   I will let you reconsider what you you just said.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 34, 'npc_4_1', 'It has come to my attention that there are some residents living nearby that were originally from Alderaan.  These ''refugees'' are more than likely up to something, and the counterfeiter claims to have a holodisc with recorded suspicious activities on their part.  You are now done with asking frivolous questions.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 35, 'npc_4_2', 'The holodisc contained some recorded images of these Alderaanians meeting at a safehouse.  These are the ones that are claiming Alderaan was destroyed by use of an Imperial weapon.  We both know that the truth is Rebel terrorists blew up the planet''s core to try gain sympathy for their cause, right?  Right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 36, 'npc_4_3', 'According to this datapad, the leader''s mentor retired from the Imperial Navy three years ago,  then later went on to help General Bel Iblis orchestrate the destruction of the Death Star.  A message from his teacher may help convince the leader to come out of hiding.  I am certain when you are done, that message will get to him loud and clear.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 37, 'npc_4_4', 'I had taken the liberty to place a holodisc recorder upon your person during these assignments, which have captured all you have done.  Your loyalty will be rewarded, so have no fear.  This particular disc has been edited in such a manner that all of your actions appear to have been done by the propagandist, not you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 38, 'npc_4_5', '*sighs*  Rather than making the propagandist a martyr in the eyes of the public, he has now become a reviled villain.  My function as the Procurator of Justice will be to try this man.  With the evidence we have creat - er - received, this will be all that is necessary to convict him in the eyes of the public.  Is your simple mind able to comprehend that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 39, 'npc_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 40, 'npc_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 41, 'npc_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 42, 'npc_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 43, 'npc_5_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 44, 'npc_6_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 45, 'npc_6_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 46, 'npc_6_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 47, 'npc_6_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 48, 'npc_6_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 49, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You will meet with informer and do business the Imperial way.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 50, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Get that information from the Rebel, fool!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 51, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Do the deed, agent. And do not ask any more stupid questions!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 52, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Get that holodisc to the reporter at once. If you do not... perhaps he may receive another one instead, hmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 53, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Go bring that Rebel to me! GO NOW!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 54, 'npc_breech_1', 'So you''re the one they sent, eh? Hey... what are you doing with that weapon?!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 55, 'npc_breech_2', 'Oh no! The Empire has found us! I need to warn the others!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 56, 'npc_breech_3', 'How dare you accost me! Oh... you''re here to kill me, eh? We''ll just see about that, won''t we?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 57, 'npc_breech_4', 'Are you the one the Procurator -er- I mean mysterious informant was sending?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 58, 'npc_breech_5', 'Oh good! Finally one of you Imperials will listen! Take me to your commander at once!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 59, 'npc_dropoff_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 60, 'npc_dropoff_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 61, 'npc_dropoff_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 62, 'npc_dropoff_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 63, 'npc_dropoff_5', 'Huh? I.. I don''t understand... what do you mean I killed my father? THE EMPIRE DID IT, NOT ME!!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 64, 'npc_failure_1', 'The informant didn''t have the datapad, you say? Hmmm... this seems quite convienent, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 65, 'npc_failure_2', 'You managed to let him get away? How could you be so thoroughly incompetant!?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 66, 'npc_failure_3', 'I find it quite disheartening that you were unable to perform such a simple task. Perhaps the Emperor will have more mercy than I... Sadly, I''m rarely wrong. Please, friend... stick around until I get back, alright?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 67, 'npc_failure_4', 'What a sad shame for you that you weren''t able to deliver that holodisc as I asked... what a sad, sad shame indeed....'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 68, 'npc_failure_5', 'What do you mean he died?! Everything I had planned relied upon him! HOW DARE YOU RETURN HERE WITH THE WORD FAILURE UPON YOUR TONGUE?!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 69, 'npc_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 70, 'npc_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 71, 'npc_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 72, 'npc_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 73, 'npc_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 74, 'npc_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 75, 'npc_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 76, 'npc_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 77, 'npc_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 78, 'npc_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 79, 'npc_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 80, 'npc_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 81, 'npc_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 82, 'npc_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 83, 'npc_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 84, 'npc_noloc_1', 'It is not time for you to leave just yet. Come back to me in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 85, 'npc_noloc_2', 'The time is not right just yet. Come back to me shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 86, 'npc_noloc_3', 'The time is not right. Return to me in a short while.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 87, 'npc_noloc_4', 'The reporter will not be able to leave just yet. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 88, 'npc_noloc_5', 'He should be ready for the taking rather soon. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 89, 'npc_reset', 'I''m sorry. Did I just hear you tell me that you are a Rebel sympathizer?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 90, 'npc_reward_1', 'Excellent.  I will review this holodisc to see if that lowlife actually had anything worth reporting.  Now, for some compensation...let''s see what I have...Ah, yes.  This will do quite nicely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 91, 'npc_reward_2', 'I hope you made his lesson quite painful, yes?  Good... that''s what I wanted to hear.  These Rebels should be rewarded with exquisite pain to repay them for all they have caused the Emperor.  I will have Kaja go through this datapad and recover names.  As for you, please accept this compensation as an expression of my gratitude.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 92, 'npc_reward_3', 'Sector Police have received a report of a local citizen having experienced an ''unfortunate'' accident.  This is the price one pays when they cross the Empire.  It''s a shame all of those wretched Alderaanian''s weren''t home when their world ceased to exist.  It shouldn''t be too much longer before the leader breaks his silence... then... we will have him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 93, 'npc_reward_4', 'The Holonet station has contacted the Empire to let us know they know they have some ''important evidence''.  Good work.  They are preparing to broadcast the holo to the public, then will give us the holo as evidence.  What I would give to be there to watch the Rebel propagandist''s face when he watches this broadcast.  This compensation is for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 94, 'npc_reward_5', 'Yesss.... By the look in his eye, his spirit has already been broken.  When he hears that he will be charged with 3 counts of murder, destruction of property, and being part of the Rebel plot to destroy Alderaan, well... I''m certain the horror in his eyes will increase ten-fold.  Ahh...exquisite.  I shall let the Emperor know of your... assistance... with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 95, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 96, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 97, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 98, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Wow... this will hit the HoloNet like wildfire! This story will make my career!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 99, 'npc_smuggle_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 100, 'npc_takeme_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 101, 'npc_takeme_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 102, 'npc_takeme_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 103, 'npc_takeme_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 104, 'npc_takeme_5', 'What do you mean I''m under arrest! The Empire has killed all those I love, and I have proof!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 105, 'npc_work_1', 'What do you need now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 106, 'npc_work_2', 'What do you want?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 107, 'npc_work_3', 'Why have you not left?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 108, 'npc_work_4', 'Why are you not performing your duties, agent?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 109, 'npc_work_5', 'What do you want?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 110, 'otherescort_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 111, 'otherescort_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 112, 'otherescort_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 113, 'otherescort_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 114, 'otherescort_5', 'Oh, you''re not with the Empire. Sorry, my mistake.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 115, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, sir, I understand.  What business shall I perform?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 116, 'player_1_2', 'Yes, this Rebel needs to be punished.  How shall I do it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 117, 'player_1_3', 'What do you need me to do, Lord Hethrir?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 118, 'player_1_4', 'You can place your trust in me, Lord.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 119, 'player_1_5', 'Now I understand!  I am honored to help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 120, 'player_2_1', 'I don''t think this is the right kind of job for me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 121, 'player_2_2', 'This doesn''t sound like the type of work that I am capable of.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 122, 'player_2_3', 'I fear I will fail you again, Lord.  I cannot do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 123, 'player_2_4', 'Get a Stormtrooper to do it.  I don''t lower myself to the level of a simple courier.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 124, 'player_2_5', 'But he didn''t do any of that!  That''s not justice!  I won''t have any part of this!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 125, 'player_3_1', 'You''re the Procurator of Justice, right?  Why are you dealing with mundane tasks such as this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 126, 'player_3_2', 'What was recorded on that holodisc?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 127, 'player_3_3', 'What is this plan of yours, if I may ask?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 128, 'player_3_4', 'What is so ''special'' about this particular holodisc?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 129, 'player_3_5', 'I don''t think I understand what you''re talking about, my Lord.  Can you please explain?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 130, 'player_4_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 131, 'player_4_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 132, 'player_4_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 133, 'player_4_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 134, 'player_4_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 135, 'player_5_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 136, 'player_5_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 137, 'player_5_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 138, 'player_5_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 139, 'player_5_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 140, 'player_more_1_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 141, 'player_more_1_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 142, 'player_more_1_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 143, 'player_more_1_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 144, 'player_more_1_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 145, 'player_more_2_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 146, 'player_more_2_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 147, 'player_more_2_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 148, 'player_more_2_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 149, 'player_more_2_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 150, 'player_more_3_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 151, 'player_more_3_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 152, 'player_more_3_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 153, 'player_more_3_4', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 154, 'player_more_3_5', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 155, 'player_reset', 'I cannot do this any longer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 156, 'player_sorry', 'What was I to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 157, 'return_waypoint_description_1', 'Lord Hethrir is awaiting your return.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 158, 'return_waypoint_description_2', 'Lord Hethrir is awaiting your report. Return to him immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 159, 'return_waypoint_description_3', 'Lord Hethrir is awaiting your return with details of the job being done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 160, 'return_waypoint_description_4', 'Lord Hethrir is waiting for you to tell him that the disc made it into the hands of the journalist.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 161, 'return_waypoint_description_5', 'Return this mass-murderer and place him in the hands of Imperial justice, Lord Hethrir.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 162, 'return_waypoint_name_1', 'Procurator of Justice'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 163, 'return_waypoint_name_2', 'Procurator of Justice'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 164, 'return_waypoint_name_3', 'Procurator of Justice'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 165, 'return_waypoint_name_4', 'Procurator of Justice'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 166, 'return_waypoint_name_5', 'Procurator of Justice'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 167, 'waypoint_description_1', 'You are to meet the informant, then kill him. Make sure you locate the recording he has.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 168, 'waypoint_description_2', 'You should be able to find the owner of the meeting place here. Gather whatever information you can, then dispose of him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 169, 'waypoint_description_3', 'You should find the Propagandist''s father here. Take him out and hope he won''t put up too much of a fight.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 170, 'waypoint_description_4', 'A journalist is waiting to receive the modified version of the recording. Make sure he gets it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 171, 'waypoint_description_5', 'Apprehend the leader of an Alderaanean movement to spread lies about the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 172, 'waypoint_name_1', 'The Informant'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 173, 'waypoint_name_2', 'Rebel Safehouse'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 174, 'waypoint_name_3', 'The Hapless Victim'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 175, 'waypoint_name_4', 'The Journalist'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 176, 'waypoint_name_5', 'Propagandist Leader'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 177, 'npc_backtowork', 'Do not take much more time in finishing this task.  It does not reflect well upon you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/lord_hethrir.stf', 178, 'notit', 'What is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 1, 'imperial_retreat_1', 'KAJA OR''ZEE has asked that you ESCORT the GOVERNOR to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 2, 'imperial_retreat_2', 'KAJA OR''ZEE needs you to return with the person who paid for the assassination attempts on the moff.  If he does not cooperate you are authorized to KILL him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 3, 'imperial_retreat_3', 'KAJA OR''ZEE would like you to ELIMINATE the ASSASSIN who made an attempt on the Governor''s life.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 4, 'imperial_retreat_4', 'KAJA OR''ZEE wants you to DESTROY the rebels who are responsible for the threats against the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 5, 'imperial_retreat_5', 'KAJA OR''ZEE wants you to RESCUE the Governor''s missing DROID, and return him to the Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 6, 'imperial_retreat_6', 'LOAM REDGE wants you to bring in a SUSPECT for questioning.  Arrest and ESCORT the suspect to the Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 7, 'imperial_retreat_7', 'LOAM REDGE wants you to find the REBELS and ESCORT the LEADER in for questioning.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 8, 'imperial_retreat_8', 'LOAM REDGE wants you to intercept the SLICER who is stealing information.  KILL him and RETURN WITH the evidence.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 9, 'imperial_retreat_9', 'LOAM REDGE wants you to Arrest the SLICER and ESCORT him back to the Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 10, 'imperial_retreat_10', 'LORD HETHRIR wants you to KILL the counterfeiter and RETURN with the HOLODISC'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 11, 'imperial_retreat_11', 'LORD HETHRIR wants you to ELIMINATE the LEADER OF THE REBEL MEETING HOUSE and RETURN WITH HIS DATAPAD'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 12, 'imperial_retreat_12', 'KILL the REBEL LEADER''S FATHER to drive home the point'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 13, 'imperial_retreat_13', 'LORD HETHRIR wants you to DELIVER the HOLODISC to the local holodisc brodcast station'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 14, 'imperial_retreat_14', 'LORD HETHRIR wants you to ESCORT he PRISONER back to the EMPEROR''S RETREAT'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 15, 'imperial_retreat_15', 'THRAWN wants you to ESCORT the STRIKE TEAM COMMANDER back to the EMPEROR''S RETREAT'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 16, 'imperial_retreat_16', 'THRAWN wants you to LOCATE the TRANSPONDER and RETURN with it as soon as possible.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 17, 'imperial_retreat_17', 'THRAWN wants you to DELIVER the BALLISTICS INFORMATION to GEG WINTHAZEN'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 18, 'imperial_retreat_18', 'THRAWN wants you to find a JAR OF FAMBAA BLOOD.  Perhaps there are some FAMBAA in the location marked on your datapad.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 19, 'imperial_retreat_19', 'THRAWN wants you to acquire a ROCKET LAUNCHER from a smuggler.  If she reacts negatively to an Imperial presence she is to be ELIMINATED'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 20, 'imperial_retreat_20', 'THRAWN wants you to DESTROY the HUTT responsible for bringing down the strike team''s shuttle'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 28, 'imperial_retreat_return', 'Return to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 29, 'imperial_retreat_21', 'VEERS wants you to ELIMINATE the SURVIVORS of the REBEL INSTALLATION'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 30, 'imperial_retreat_22', 'VEERS wants you to ELIMINATE the AGGRESSORS'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 31, 'imperial_retreat_23', 'VEERS wants you to find the CARAVAN carrying the guns and locate the MANIFEST'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 32, 'imperial_retreat_24', 'VEERS wants you to APPREHEND the Twi''lek BORVO'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 33, 'imperial_retreat_25', 'VEERS wants you to DESTROY any REBELS in this area'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 34, 'imperial_retreat_26', 'THE EMPEROR commands that you ESCORT the head of the local THUGS to him'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 35, 'imperial_retreat_27', 'THE EMPEROR commands you to DELIVER the PLANS to the head of the MERCENARIES'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 36, 'imperial_retreat_28', 'THE EMPEROR orders you to DESTROY the POWER GENERATORS that are keeping the mercenaries from performing their task'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 37, 'imperial_retreat_29', 'THE EMPEROR commands you to ESCORT the HANDMAIDEN to him'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 38, 'imperial_retreat_30', 'THE EMPEROR comands you to DESTROY the IMPOSTER REBELS and RETURN WITH THEIR DATAPAD'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 39, 'imperial_retreat_31', 'THE EMPEROR commands you to DELIVER the HOLODISC to the COUNCIL'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 40, 'imperial_retreat_32', 'THE EMPEROR commands you to ESCORT the REBEL GENERAL back to the RETREAT'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 41, 'imperial_retreat_33', 'LORD VADER commands that you DESTROY the REBEL and RETURN with anything valuable he was carrying'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 42, 'imperial_retreat_34', 'LORD VADER commands you to MEET with the EMPEROR''S COURIER and bring back the INFORMATION'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 43, 'imperial_retreat_35', 'LORD VADER commands you to HUNT DOWN and KILL the REBEL'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 44, 'imperial_retreat_36', 'LORD VADER commands you to meet with the INFORMATION BROKER and garner his INFORMATION.  '),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 45, 'imperial_retreat_37', 'LORD VADER wants the INFORMATION BROKER ELIMINATED'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 46, 'imperial_retreat_38', 'LORD VADER commands you to ELIMINATE the family of KENOBI'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/quest_details.stf', 47, 'emperors_retreat_return', 'Return to the Emperor''s Retreat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'I have been informed that you are a resourceful person, which I am in need of at this time.  A strike force sent to apprehend some criminals has met an unfortunate end.  I have received notification that the Commander of this team managed to survive.  It is imperative that he be escorted back here safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'You have returned in a timely fashion, which is good. It has been confirmed that a surface attack was responsible for the destruction of the shuttle, and most likely performed by Rebels. We will need the flight record from the ship to help deduce who is responsible for the attack.  You will need to travel to the debris and locate the transponder.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Welcome back, agent. The results of the flight logs show the shuttle was downed while it was close to the ground. This leads to the conclusion that there is a secret rebel base on this planet. Marvelously hidden at that, I might add. I need these readings analyzed by a specialist stationed nearby. I trust you will be able to keep these secure?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'He is currently in hiding, and wounded as well, therefore this task will not be an easy one. I will give you the coordinates of where he last was when he contacted us. Bring him back here safely, so that we can debrief him to learn why his team failed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Your eagerness has been noted. You should find it among the debris, but I would not put it past the locals to have already begun scavenging the ship for usable parts. At this time, the ship is not important. If the transponder, which possesses the flight data, is in the hands of a scavenger, you are authorized to liberate it from them. Now go.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'I have had your contact, Geg Winthazen, notified.  He is a ballistics expert that has an exemplary career with us, and I appreciate his eye for detail. I am certain he will be able to identify the odd readings and trace them back to their source. This is being kept low profile until all of the proof is in.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Though I recognize you are a special operative, rather than a fully enlisted member of the Imperial military, I still find your refusal a bit... disturbing. I am not used to having my orders disobeyed, and I find I do not like the feeling. I shall speak with the Emperor''s Chamberlain about this matter. If you will excuse me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I shall assume that these duties are more important than those assigned by a Captain of the Empire. Let us hope the next time we speak you are not so distracted.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Your lack of desire to further the Empire''s cause will be noted. I shall personally inform the Emperor of your unwillingness to follow an order by your superior.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'We are still unaware of the full details at this time. All we know is that the transport shuttle was nearing its landing sequence at which point all contact was lost with it. According to the Commander''s desperate call for help, we believe the shuttle was shot down by some form of ground based weapon.  This is all we know for now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'This is most likely the case, yes. Alas, not all of the enemies of the Empire are those with political agendas, though. Some wish to wreak their own self-righteous vengeance at the largest target they can find, which would be the Empire, of course. I prefer to explore every avenue before making a full decision, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'The only thing powerful enough to down the shuttle, without registering any noticable energy readings, would be a hand held weapon. I have noticed some readings that do not correlate with any known weapons that could have caused this, though.  Therefore, it is highly likely that this was a Rebel attack by a previously unknown base. Will you deliver these now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Excellent news. We will attend to the Commander''s wounds, then conduct a debriefing. From what he has just said, it seems this is an attack by the Rebels. If this is the case, then the Empire will need to keep a closer eye on these events. As for compensation I recommend you take this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'You have performed your duty in a timely manner. I shall now have this flight data analyzed by my Chief Lieutenant so that we may discern what caused a Lambda-class shuttle to be so easily felled from the sky. I may have further need of your services shortly, so please stay within the vicinity.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'I am glad to hear your mission encountered no complications. I am certain the results will come back shortly. I may have further assignments for you, agent, so please be nearby for the short future.  Oh, and Geg has asked me to give you this compensation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'I understand, sir.  I will bring him back safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Yes, Captain. I''ll bring it back immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'They will make it there safely, I assure you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'I''m sorry, sir, but I will be unable to follow this order.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I have other duties I must attend to. I cannot do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'I do not wish to take this responsibility.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Sir, if I may ask, what happened to the strike team?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'This was obviously done by the Rebels, right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'How does this point to the Rebels?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Sir, I am not able to perform the task you have commanded.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'At once, sir!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Bring him back here unharmed. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Though I recognize you are a special operative, rather than a fully enlisted member of the Imperial military, I still find your refusal a bit... disturbing. I am not used to having my orders disobeyed, and I find I do not like the feeling. I shall speak with the Emperor''s Chamberlain about this matter. If you will excuse me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'You are currently assigned to another task, I understand? I require your full attention if I were to use your skills.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'If you weren''t sent by Thrawn, then I cannot come with you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Perhaps I didn''t make myself clear earlier. You are to escort the Commander immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Why have you not left yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Yes?\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Identify yourself! Are you one of them, or were you sent by the Captain?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'We were here first!  Go find your own scrap!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'So, are you the guy the Captain sent?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'This does not contain the pertinant flight data. If this is an attempt at humor, I am not amused.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 41, 'notit_3', 'I don''t know what this is, but I don''t see any reading analysis here. Maybe you gave me the wrong one?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Make sure you have everything you need. That transponder must be recovered.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'There is no need to inform me of something that I have already expected to have been done. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'I shall assume that these duties are more important than those assigned by a Captain of the Empire. Let us hope the next time we speak you are not so distracted.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Your lack of desire to further the Empire''s cause will be noted. I shall personally inform the Emperor of your unwillingness to follow an order by your superior.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Something came up and I can no longer perform my duty.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I''m afraid that I cannot do this any longer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'I was preparing myself for the recovery mission, Captain.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'Nothing, sir.  I am about to leave at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Excellent. Thrawn assured me that help would be sent immediately, and he was true to his word. Let''s leave before these Rebels find us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Sorry.  I thought you were here to grab our salvage.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'If you''re not the guy I''m waiting for, why are you wasting my time?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Nevermind. I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'This is not what I requested from you. Do not return until you have what I asked for.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 59, 'notit_5', 'This is not rocket-launcher I was expecting. I am hoping this is not the one she sold to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'The ballistics report has turned up some interesting results. The mysterious energy readings match those of an Ion Cannon''s energy burst.  This confirms the presence of the Rebels'' new base. Whilst I prepare a full formal report to present to Lord Vader, I have need of someone to run a minor errand.  Would you be interested?"\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'Now that I have my paint, I now need a brush to paint with.  I have need of you to acquire a specially modified rocket for me. I have had a deal arranged with an agent from a local gun-smuggler, and I need you to carry through the purchase.  You''ll be there to make sure the transaction is completed, correct?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 63, 'npc_1_6', 'Through your help, I will now be able to present Lord Vader a more accurate report of what happened to the shuttle. For now, your orders will be to destroy the rest of these so-called revolutionaries.  Are you prepared to leave?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'I''m glad you are willing to help. I am in need of a jar''s worth of Fambaa blood.  I know that it sounds odd, considering the current revelation of the Rebel''s base, but I have a good feeling about this.  You should be able to find a sizable herd of these creatures out in the swamps of this planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'As I have expected from your previous work already. You will meet a woman by the name of Seldair Keeloo who will sell you the weapon.  She doesn''t know she is selling to the Empire, therefore she may react in an undesirable manner if she finds out. If this is the case, your objective is to acquire that rocket. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 66, 'npc_2_6', 'No, this will be more retaliation than vengeance. Vengeance will ensue at a later point. For now, the destruction of this small band will begin to give all the rebels a lesson in what happens when one attacks the Empire. Report back when you have destroyed the group.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'I hope you understand that this will cause a great inconvienence to me if I were to have to do this myself.  You wouldn''t want that to happen, now would you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'This is not what I was expecting to hear from you. I am quite surprised to say the least, agent. Very well, then, I shall have another operative do this. You need not return.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 69, 'npc_3_6', 'I''m sorry, agent. I don''t believe you understood me. This is not a request, this is an order. Perhaps you need a few sessions with the resident Inquisitor regarding insubordination?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'Yes, an errand.  I understand that this doesn''t sound like the most reasonable course of action, but perhaps the results will be as interesting as those provided by these energy readings. Rhyme and reason sometimes take twisted routes that are not easily seen.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'One will find that logic is not always a linear path to the end destination.  What appears at time to be convoluted chaos is in truth a disjointed thread in a larger, more ordered pattern. Many cultures throughout the galaxy call those who understand this ''Artists''. Much can be learned from these people, and I believe I will shortly learn more myself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 72, 'npc_4_6', 'The paint I used was originally used by a species who have never used metal. By itself, it is quite innocuous, but when placed in contact with metal it will react in such a manner that can be confused for Ion discharge. Using a rocket launcher only sold by this Gun-Runner Hutt, I fired the paint coated rocket, exactly duplicating the same readings found on the shuttle. A clever decoy, but not clever enough.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Very good.   Please continue.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Do not tarry. Every moment you waste will increase the likeliness that the gun-dealer will drop out of the deal.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'Very well, then.  Make sure it is done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'You''re no weapons dealer.  You''re that imperial agent everyone''s talking about!  I''m outta here...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'I hope you understand that this will cause a great inconvienence to me if I were to have to do this myself.  You wouldn''t want that to happen, now would you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', 'This is not what I was expecting to hear from you. I am quite surprised to say the least, agent. Very well, then, I shall have another operative do this. You need not return.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 81, 'npc_reset_6', 'I''m sorry, agent. I don''t believe you understood me. This is not a request, this is an order. Perhaps you need a few sessions with the resident Inquisitor regarding insubordination?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Wonderful.  I''ll be able to take this canister of gasses from the same swamp and combine these two together. I should be able to create a paste very similar to the paint used by the local amphibious natives in their art work. Check back with me shortly, for once I am done, I will have need of you to run another errand.  And take these, as compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Spectacular. This is designed exactly as was ''advertised'' - extra distance at the cost of a smaller explosion. Now, all I need to do is apply this paint to the surface of a rocket...and...done. Now, if you excuse me, I need to run some ballistics of my own. If this works, I believe we will find where the mysterious ''Ion Cannon'' has come from. Report back in a little while, agent.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 84, 'npc_reward_6', 'I take it the rebels have been demolished? Very good.  I have presented the information to Lord Vader, and he is quite upset by the news. I have suggested to him that Colonel Veers will be more than capable of handling this situation.  You should report to him now.  Good work, agent.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you acquired the blood from those creatures yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Do you have the weapon with you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 90, 'npc_work_6', 'Have the rebels been done away with?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'Yes, Captain, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'Consider it done, sir.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 93, 'player_1_6', 'Yes, sir. Vengeance will be exacted.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'I am sorry, but I will have to decline.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I will be unable to attend, Captain.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 96, 'player_2_6', 'I don''t understand this. No, I''m not doing it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'I''m sorry, but did you say an errand?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'I don''t understand what''s going on here. A weapon for a brush?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 99, 'player_3_6', 'How did your strange tests pinpoint the smugglers?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'This is too difficult.  I can''t do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'I will not be able to follow this through until the end.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'Not yet.  I am still gathering more.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'I have not met with the gun dealer yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 105, 'player_sorry_6', 'Not yet, sir.  I was adequately arming myself before doing so.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 108, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'Hmmm... yes, these look about right. Looking here, though, I think I see what Captain Thrawn was talking about.  Yes, I''ll take these back to my lab and run some tests.  Let Thrawn know that this should take a short bit, but I''ll have results for him later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 112, 'gotowork', 'Don''t you have something you should be doing?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_1', 'You were given both a clear and simple assignment, but were unable to accomplish even that. I am very disappointed in your performance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 114, 'npc_failure_2', 'It is a shame that the transponder was not there among the wreckage. It would have been better to have evidence to back us before we counter-attacked. '),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 115, 'npc_failure_3', 'I do not wish to hear any excuses from you, agent.  I expected more, especially considering how simple this task was.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 116, 'npc_failure_4', 'I do not wish to hear any excuses from you, agent.  I expected more, especially considering how simple this task was.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 117, 'npc_failure_5', 'Without that rocker I fear my tests will not provide the expected results.  I deeply regret you were not able to perform so simple a task.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 118, 'npc_failure_6', 'Perhaps I overestimated you. I believed you would have been able to handle this by yourself. A shame this did not turn out as expected.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 119, 'otherescort', 'Sorry, but I think you have the wrong person.  I thought I saw someone else nearby...'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 120, 'notyet', 'Since you are unaware of how to recognize rank, I will let you know you are speaking to a Captain. You have now been corrected, and I sincerly hope you do not make the mistake again. You may now leave my presence.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 121, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Let me gather the coordinates from the Chamberlain. Check with me in just a few moments.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I need to gather the logistics. Check with me in a few moments.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 123, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I will need to contact him before sending you out.  Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 124, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I need to contact Intelligence to find out where some Fambaas can be located.  Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 125, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Let me check my reports to find where you are to meet the gun dealer.  Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 126, 'npc_noloc_6', 'I need to check my reports for where the group can be found.  I''ll get back to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 127, 'player_reset_6', 'This is too big for me.  I can''t do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 128, 'npc_backtowork', 'Finish quickly.  I grow tired of waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 129, 'next', 'I am pleased with the work you''ve done, and I''m certain the Empire could make further use of your services. To that end, I would like to introduce you to an associate of mine - Colonel Veers.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 130, 'npc_breech_4', 'ROAR!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/thrawn.stf', 131, 'npc_breech_6', 'Imperials!  Protect yourselves!  And don''t let them take us!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'At ease, soldier. You have been assigned to me by Captain Thrawn to assist in the retribution for an attack upon a military Imperial vessel. I have been ordered to track down the Hutt crimelord responsible for this heinous act. I am told you are adept at reconnaissance, and I am in need of those functions performed. Do you understand, soldier?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'At ease, agent. I have an urgent assignment that I am choosing you for. The stormtroopers I''ve sent to secure the debris of the starport have come under fire. I have all of my other squadrons assigned elsewhere, therefore I need to send you too. Shall I give you the coordinates of their last known whereabouts?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Our search for the leader of the gun-smugglers has been fruitful. All reports have come back from other Stormtrooper squadrons that have been inspecting the surrounding starports, and it seems there is an unidentified shipment coming in. I''m certain this will lead to that Twi''lek''s base, then we can commence the attack.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'The rebels you recently eliminated have destroyed their own base.  Presumably some kind of self destruction.  Some people are out there trying to salvage whatever they can.  I suspect that most of them work for the Hutt, therefore I need you to eliminate everyone at that site. It is likely that some of their possessions will lead us to this Hutt. Depart at once, solider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'You should be able to find the squadron at these coordinates. Since the squadron leader was taken out, you are given full authority to lead them during the interim. Direct them to destroy all the surrounding opposition, then bring them back here. If the squadron has been decimated, then destroy the aggressors yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'The shipment has already landed and unloaded.  You will need to track down the caravan, which has opted to travel by land. Try to gauge what direction they are heading if possible and trail them. If not, destroy the gang that is transporting the shipment, and gather the manifest from the cargo. This may help the ISB.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I understand that you are a special agent of the Empire and not a solider, but I believed you would have assisted with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'It matters not that you hold no rank. I have given you an order to rescue that contigent of stormtroopers, and you are in direct defiance of those orders! I will report this to your superior immediately!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'And why is that? This is an important military matter, agent. Your help on this operation will be most beneficial, therefore I expect you to reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Captain Thrawn believes it has to do with a recent civilian law enforcement raid that was being looked into by our Empire. I believe there may be more to it. To risk such a bold move as attacking a clearly marked Imperial shuttle, I believe they were attempting to steal the identification codes assigned to the shuttle. Are you available to help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'They appear to have been ambushed on their way out to the target location. Those responsible for the ambush knew exactly where to strike first - the squadron leader. From the last report in, the stormtroopers were firing wildly everywhere. Well, more wildly than they already do, that is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'Our spies on Nal Hutta have failed to turn up any information on Borvo the Hutt. I have received information from the ISB referring to a Twi''lek that goes by that name, and has 14 charges of smuggling against him. I am certain he is the one using the Hutt pseudonym to inspire fear, but it will not work against the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'You have returned. I take it all went well with the elimination? I see you were able to find some information leading back to the Hutt. Well, we now have a name at least. I''ll have Intelligence check with their spies on Nal Hutta to track down who this ''Borvo the Hutt'' is. In the meantime, take this as compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'It is a shame that we lost that squadron. Though numerous, Stormtroopers are still valuable. Nonetheless, those bandits won''t be bothering any other Imperial soldiers in the future. You have done well, and I will make sure that is noted to Lord Vader at the end of this campaign. You should take this as compensation for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Very good. I will have this manifest inspected by the ISB.  With hope, this may help lead us to where Borvo can be located. Once we finally have that information, I can launch a full scale assault upon his base of operations. Scum like that do not deserve to prosper freely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Loud and clear, Colonel! I''ll lend a hand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Yes, sir! Where can I find them?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I understand. I shall intercept that shipment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'I understand, but I am unavailable right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Sir, I am an agent, not an Officer. I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'I am unable to do this for you, Colonel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Do we know why the shuttle was downed?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What happened to the stormtroopers?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Twi''lek? I thought Borvo was a Hutt?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I will no longer be able to perform this duty.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'I will be leaving immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Make it so.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'I understand that you are a special agent of the Empire and not a solider, but I believed you would have assisted with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'You seem to be preoccupied.  I cannot rely upon a soldier to perform their duties if they do not have their full mind on the task set before them. Return when you find yourself able to fully accept orders.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Sorry good sir. I mistook you for one of those vile Imperial types. Tata!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'I see you have not left yet. Why is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Why have you not dispatched yourself by now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Whay are you not intercepting the shipment?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Heads up, guys! The Imperials have shown up early! Kill them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Look guys!  There was still one left! Get him too!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Watch out! The Imperials found us! Take care of ''em, boys!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Carry on, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Make haste. You do not want your quarry eluding you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'It matters not that you hold no rank. I have given you an order to rescue that contigent of stormtroopers, and you are in direct defiance of those orders! I will report this to your superior immediately!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'And why is that? This is an important military matter, agent. Your help on this operation will be most beneficial, therefore I expect you to reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I can no longer perform the functions of an officer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I will not be able to follow this order, Colonel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'I needed to re-equip myself first. I depart now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'I am leaving to do so right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Nevermind.  Thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Ooops. I thought you were busting our illegal shipment. Nevermind then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'I don''t know who you are, but if you know what''s best for you, you''d get out of here NOW!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Move out of the way!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'The ISB has been quite thorough with their analysis, and have been able to triangulate where Borvo''s base can be found. I have been authorized to dispatch a team of special forces operatives to take him by surprise. I need you to be the one who will be responsible for the actual elimination of Borvo. Do you understand?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'I have been given rather... disturbing... news. It seems the person that was killed was not actually Borvo the Hutt, but a decoy instead. In a... er... display of anger, Lord Vader has put the messenger on the casuality list. I have been authorized by Lord Vader to destroy the only known supply line, in which I have been assigned your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Since the other operatives will be able to clear the way for you, all you have to do is identify Borvo - a Twi''lek -, and kill him. If there any guards nearby, do not allow Borvo to escape in the crossfire. You are dismissed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'I will lead a squadron of AT-ATs to destroy the buildings surrounding the supply line. Your job will be to take out the remaining rabble so that Borvo cannot be alerted until it is too late. Destroy any of them that you see.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'If this is a jest, I do not find the humor in it. Now, I have given you a clear order, and I expect you to follow through with it. Any other answer will be insubordination, and I will have to report this to Lord Vader. Now... do we understand each other?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'I do not appreciate your insinuation, agent. I have followed my orders to the letter, and completed my assigned duty. The ISB on the other hand will have much to answer to the Emperor for providing false information. That is none of my concern now, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'No, there will be several more operatives such as yourself out at the target''s location. Their job will be to pull away most of the guards surrounding this crime lord, whereas yours will be the actual elimination of the target - Borvo in this case. The Empire would never send you out alone against small numbers, agent.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'Unfortunately not. Lord Vader didn''t get much information out of him before he expired. We were able to find out that there is a major supply line that he was in charge of, in which we will have to capitalize. Aside from that, our leads have gone cold, and Lord Vader doesn''t wish to expend any more efforts upon this Borvo.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Your cocky attitude may jeapordize this operation, agent. I suggest that you drop the attitude before it gets you killed in the field. Back to work, now!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You must stop the refugees from fleeing, agent. This is very important.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'You led the Imperials straight here! Guards, get him! Guards? Guards?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'Get out of our way! Borvo will hear of this one way or another!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'If this is a jest, I do not find the humor in it. Now, I have given you a clear order, and I expect you to follow through with it. Any other answer will be insubordination, and I will have to report this to Lord Vader. Now... do we understand each other?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', 'I do not appreciate your insinuation, agent. I have followed my orders to the letter, and completed my assigned duty. The ISB on the other hand will have much to answer to the Emperor for providing false information. That is none of my concern now, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Well, well... Borvo the Twi''lek''s days of Imperial defiance are over with. As for you, agent, I offer you my congratulations for a job expertly done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'You have performed admirably, agent. The supply line has been destroyed, and Borvo wasn''t able to make it in time. I will have to write up an analysis on usage of these AT-ATs for full scale attacks, based on their performance in the field. Who knows... perhaps I might gain a promotion due to it. Again, agent, I commend your skills.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 85, 'npc_takeme_4', 'So, you got me... I knew that the pay was too good to do this job. Why wasn''t I greedy and asked the boss for more?... sigh....'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'The operation has begun! Why are you still here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Why have you not stopped Borvo''s messengers from leaving?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'Yes, sir.  It will be done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'I understand. I am at your disposal.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'That is not something I can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I will not engage in another failed venture, Colonel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Will I be the only one on this operation?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'Didn''t we get any information as to where the real Borvo is?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'I cannot do my part in this operation, Colonel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'I don''t want to follow this cockamamie plan, Colonel.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'I was waiting for it to start to give the others time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'I am about to leave shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 111, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I must consult my charts to locate the debris of the starport. Report back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 112, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me trace where the distress signal came from.  I''ll let you know in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 113, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me triangulate where this team may be located at this time. Check back shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 114, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I must consult the ISB''s information so that I may direct you to Borvo. Check with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Once we have triangulated the location of the supplyline, we will be able to launch the assualt.  Report back to me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'Nope, I''m not the person you''re looking for.  Try looking nearby.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'No, no... this is not it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'Not one of them had any indication of where their employer was?  I find that quite preposterous!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'I am disappointed in your lack of aptitude. Leave my presence immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'How did you let the shipment get away from you? I expected more from somebody of your caliber!'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'You let Borvo escape?! You were clearly instructed to destroy him! I do not believe Lord Vader will be pleased when I inform him of your failure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'You let Borvo''s filth get back to him. This has caused the assault to no go according to plan. I expect Lord Vader will speak with you shortly... and shortly at that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 124, 'npc_backtowork', 'There is no time for discussion.  Finish this task at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 125, 'next', 'You are about to receive a great honor... you have been commanded to present yourself to the Emperor at once.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 126, 'notit', 'Where is the item you were requested to bring back?'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/veers.stf', 127, 'notyet', 'You should speak with Lord Hethrir first.  I don''t have anything for you right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 1, 'kaja_orzee', 'You can not enter the main hall without permission from Kaja Or''Zee.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 2, 'veers', 'You can not enter the Throne Room until Veers gives you permission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 3, 'loam_redge', 'You can not enter the library until Loam Redge gives you permission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 4, 'vader', 'Only Lord Vaderand his personal charges have access to this area.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 5, 'lord_hethrir', 'You may not enter the secure area until Lord Hethrir has deemed you worthy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 6, 'emperor', 'You do not yet have permission to access this area.'),
('string/en/theme_park_imperial/warning.stf', 7, 'not_imperial', 'Sorry, only Imperial employees are allowed to work for us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 1, 'player_1_1', 'Sure.  I''ve already dealt with her thugs in the past.  This shouldn''t be a problem.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 2, 'player_1_2', 'This is beginning to sound interesting.  Count me in!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 3, 'player_1_3', 'I''ve come this far, haven''t I?  I''ll see this to the end!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 4, 'player_2_1', 'I''m tired of dealing with Valarian''s thugs. They''re not much of a challenge.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 5, 'player_2_2', 'If you can''t get away from working on those repulsorlifts, what makes you think you can pull this off?  Count me out.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 6, 'player_2_3', 'I have a bad feeling about this.  I''m going to have to say no from hereon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 7, 'player_3_1', 'What are you planning?  Something I shouldn''t know about?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 8, 'player_3_2', 'The suspense is killing me.  What''s your scientist friend going to do with the code cylinder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 9, 'player_3_3', 'What do these codes do?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 10, 'npc_1_1', 'Hey you!  I heard you been doing favors for Jabba''s cronies.  Maybe you can help me, huh?  I got a plan to earn my freedom from Jabba. But first I need to grab a special code cylinder from one of Valarian''s thugs. You think you can get that cylinder for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 11, 'npc_1_2', 'This is the cylinder I wanted, but I can''t crack the code. I need someone to take the cylinder to a scientist I know.  He can decode it.  Want the job?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 12, 'npc_1_3', 'Good work. The cylinder had a self-destruct code for one of Lady Valarian''s storehouses. I''ll give you the coordinates to the warehouse, but you''ll need to punch in the code. Then run.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 13, 'npc_2_1', 'Good, good. Here''s where you can find the roughneck. Once you''ve settled your business, bring me that code cylinder.  Meanwhile, I''ve got to get back to working on Jabba''s collection of repulsorlifts, or he might decide he doesn''t need me anymore, if you know what I''m sayin''...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 14, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. Take the cylinder to my friend. Check back with me after you''ve delivered it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 15, 'npc_2_3', 'Good. You''re earnin'' my trust.  When you''re done, come back here and tell me all about the blast. And don''t forget to run.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 16, 'npc_3_1', 'Hey, I can understand that. I''m just one of Jabba''s slaves, right?  I''ll be sure to let Bib know just how helpful you were to Jabba''s personal mechanic.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 17, 'npc_3_2', 'You''re missing out on a payin'' job.  But I''ll get this done with or without your help!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 18, 'npc_3_3', 'Hnh. Suit yourself. I can find someone else to take this job, if you don''t want it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 19, 'npc_4_1', 'Don''t ask so many questions. I''ll tell you what you need to know, when you need to know it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 20, 'npc_4_2', 'I need this cylinder scanned for security measures. I don''t want to be walking into any traps. And I''ll need copies made. It''s all part of my plan. But quit asking questions and just get to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 21, 'npc_4_3', 'There''s a terminal there that has a self destruct sequence on it.  Just set it and get out of there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 22, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good work gettin'' that cylinder. I knew you were looking for the trouble.  Let me make sure this thing isn''t wired, and then we''ll talk about the next part of my plan.  And here, I had these laying around, I figured you''ve earned a little bonus.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 23, 'npc_reward_2', 'My friend contacted me. The cylinder is clean and copies have been made. I''m thinkin'' you can be trusted to handle the next phase of my plan.  Oh, and one of the Gamorrean''s stumbled across this.  He wouldn''t say where he got em, but I suspect there''s a visitor missing.  Heh, I''ll give it to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 24, 'npc_reward_3', 'Good work! Tell me everything. Was it loud? How hot was it? Was the explosion a ball of flame, or a column of fire? I wish I could have been there! Anyway, Jabba thinks my plan was a good one. He''s promised me my freedom, but I still got a debt to work off... Oh, but I do have this for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 25, 'next', 'You better head to the throne room and see Bib.  He''s expecting ya.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 26, 'notyet', 'You shouldn''t be down here.  Why don''t you head back upstairs and see if anyone needs some work done.  Try Porcellus.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 27, 'npc_backtowork', 'Get back to work, I ain''t got time to chat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 28, 'npc_reset', 'Yeah, fine, whenever you''re ready.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 29, 'npc_work_1', 'Hey, did you get my cylinder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 30, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you deliver my cylinder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 31, 'npc_work_3', 'Did it blow up?  Or have you not gone yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 32, 'player_reset', 'I need to take a breather and try this again later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 33, 'player_sorry', 'Oh, yeah, I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 34, 'npc_breech_1', 'Jabba''s thugs eh?  You''ll be no match for us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 35, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hey, are you Barada''s buddy?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_3', 'ALARM!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 37, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'That''s the code Barada''s looking for.  Let me know what happens.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 38, 'gotowork', 'Sorry, too busy to talk.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 39, 'npc_failure_1', 'They said you could do anything, but I guess I heard wrong about you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 40, 'npc_failure_2', 'What, are you a bolthead? All I asked you was to deliver an object for me, and you couldn''t even do that? I guess I''ve got to get back to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 41, 'npc_failure_3', 'You ruined everything that I was working for! Now how am I gonna get out of being a slave to Jabba? Thanks alot...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/barada.stf', 42, 'notit', 'What''s this?  Where''s the item I asked for?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 1, 'player_1_1', 'I will bring Jabba''s contact here safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 2, 'player_1_2', 'Don''t worry, Romo will be safe. I can handle a bounty hunter.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 3, 'player_1_3', 'Yeah, I''ll do it as long as it pays well.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 4, 'player_2_1', 'My services don''t come free.  Either Jabba pays me, or you do the dirty work yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 5, 'player_2_2', 'You never said anything about a bounty hunter!  I''m not risking my hide for scum like Romo!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 6, 'player_2_3', 'I work for Jabba, not for you, Bib.  Get someone else to do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 7, 'player_3_1', 'Why has Jabba chosen me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 8, 'player_3_2', 'Why didn''t you tell me about the bounty hunter before?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 9, 'player_3_3', 'How will this schematic make your job easier?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 10, 'npc_1_1', 'His Excellency has requested your assistance, and I know you will be happy to please Jabba.  An associate of His Excellency is expected here soon, but we don''t want him leading any unwanted miscreants to the palace. Find Romo Vax and bring him here safely, and you will fulfill Jabba''s wishes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 11, 'npc_1_2', 'YOU FOOL! Romo was being pursued by a bounty hunter, and you''ve led the mercenary here!  My informants tell me that the bounty hunter is nearing the Palace even as we speak. You have but one chance to save yourself from Jabba''s Rancor. Kill the bounty hunter before he reaches Romo Vax!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 12, 'npc_1_3', 'Jabba and Romo Vax have been engaged in conversation for a while now. Since I am his majordomo, I must run Jabba''s operation for him while he is unavailable.  You will need to get in touch with one of my contacts and bring me a schematic he claims will make my job much easier.  You wish to do this for me and Jabba, correct?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 13, 'npc_1_4', 'My *now* FORMER contact has been paid for a faulty product.  Since he was unable to produce what he promised, he will NOT be paid for his failure.  He has been allowed to run a small time slaving operation here on Tatooine, but his ''charter'' will now be revoked.  Go out there and remove him and his band from Tatooine... permanently.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 14, 'npc_2_1', 'Jabba will be pleased to hear that you have so graciously offered your time. But if Romo Vax is harmed in any way, Jabba will not be so pleased.  And take care that no one follows you back to the palace! I''m sure Romo has a great many enemies...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 15, 'npc_2_2', 'It will be in your best interests to make certain that bounty hunter is dealt with before he can reach the Palace. I will distract Jabba long enough for you to clean up your mess.  Let me know when you have attended to the matter.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 16, 'npc_2_3', 'If what my contact says is true, then yes... yes, the pay off will be well worth it.  Now, go track him down, for he is in hiding after getting ahold of his plan. You will find him nearby, so you should depart as soon as possible.  I know you will bring me back this schematic safe and sound.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 17, 'npc_2_4', 'Very good.  You will find them out in the desert, quite unaware that their real payment will be coming. This will serve doubly to let everyone know that all slaves on Tatooine are property of Jabba, and no one else. Return here to let me know when it is done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 18, 'npc_3_1', 'Hmm.. I will be sure to let His Excellency know that you have turned down his request. You are truly wasting your potential.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 19, 'npc_3_2', 'It''s a pity that you are not more responsible. You should hope that no one informs Jabba about the mess you have made, hmm?  His Excellency will be most... displeased.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 20, 'npc_3_3', 'You work for Jabba now, my friend, but what if something bad were to happen to Jabba, hmm?  Someone would have to take over for him, of course. Preferably someone with a... long memory, perhaps?  I will let you think on that, my friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 21, 'npc_3_4', 'Mistakes, is it?  Very well, my friend.  I will be giving Jabba an update later today on his current profits.  I sure do hope I am able to get all the names straight of who has caused problems around here recently. For your sake, you may want to return to me before I give Jabba the report, if you follow what I am saying.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 22, 'npc_4_4', 'You ask a lot of questions, my friend.  Questions get people killed around here.  All you need to know is what I''ve told you, and nothing more.  If you''d like, though, I can tell Jabba that you are curious about how he does things around here.  I''m sure he would be happy to know how much of an interest you''ve taken to daily operations.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 23, 'npc_4_1', 'You have attracted Jabba''s attention. He favors those who exhibit great boldness. I have advised Jabba that only you can perform this task. Are you truly prepared to disappoint Jabba?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 24, 'npc_4_2', 'Surely you are not frightened by a mere bounty hunter, are you? Hmmm... perhaps I was wrong about you? Should I let Jabba know that you are not qualified for any jobs that require violence?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 25, 'npc_reward_1', 'Excellent.  Jabba will be pleased to learn that his associate has arrived unharmed. You have performed your duty well, which will be reported to His Excellency.  I will inform him now. '),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 26, 'npc_reward_2', 'The bounty hunter has been eliminated?  Good.  If you do not wish to become Jabba''s dinner entertainment, you will learn from your carelessness.  His Excellency does not enjoy hearing bad news. If I am caused distress such as this again, I will blast you myself. But we may still gain from this. Let me devise a new scheme. Return to me later.  Also, Ephant Mon wanted you to have this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 27, 'npc_reward_3', 'Now...let me look at this schematic.  Mmmhm.  Yes, I see.  Mmmhm. Hmm? What? No!  This is nothing as he had said.  Blast it!  This will never work!  Aaargh!  Wonderful... another of my day''s annoyances.  Very well, then. You have done what we agreed, therefore you will be compensated.  I will speak with you later.  What?  Your reward?  Ah, here, take this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 28, 'npc_reward_4', 'No one survived, correct?  Good.  I will now inform Jabba that the band of slavers that were trying to move into his territory have been dealt with.  Jabba will be most pleased to hear this.  I shall also let him know that you were personally the one who took care of the problem.  You are welcome, as well to take this. Good work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 29, 'player_1_4', 'Point me at them and they''ll be taken care of.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 30, 'player_2_4', 'I''m not fixing your mistakes, Bib. Go do it yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 31, 'player_3_4', 'Does Jabba know about this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 32, 'npc_4_3', 'This schematic may help create a means for me to solve my day''s annoyances.  If this schematic does what my contact says it does, then Jabba will never again have to fret his bloated - I mean - beautiful head over people trying to betray him... ever again.  If you do this for me, I have a good feeling you will go far within my - er - his Palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 33, 'next', 'Speak to G-5PO.   Jabba has some things for you to do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 34, 'notyet', 'You are not allowed in the throneroom yet.  Go back and see Barada.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 35, 'npc_backtowork', 'You''d better be finished with that task soon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 36, 'npc_reset', 'Don''t make me wait too long.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 37, 'npc_work_1', 'Where is Romo Vax?  Don''t tell me you haven''t gone to find him!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 38, 'npc_work_2', 'Has the bounty hunter been eliminated?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 39, 'npc_work_3', 'Where is my schematic?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 40, 'npc_work_4', 'Have those slavers been re-educated?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 41, 'player_reset', 'I need to start over.  Can I do that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 42, 'player_sorry', 'I''m getting back to work right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 43, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hello.  I''m Romo Vax!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 44, 'npc_breech_2', 'Where is Romo Vax?  You can''t hide him forever!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 45, 'npc_breech_3', 'Are you Bib Fortuna''s courier?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 46, 'npc_breech_4', 'One of Bib''s new thugs, huh?   Hahaha, you won''t last...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 47, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'That''s that.  You can head on back now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 48, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Ok, I''m ready to go to the palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 49, 'ohterescort', 'Sorry, I can''t chat right now.  '),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 50, 'npc_failure_1', 'I will not be the one to inform Jabba that you let Romo get killed. I will give you the pleasure of doing so yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 51, 'npc_failure_2', 'I think you would like to be the first person to know that Romo Vax was found dead in his chambers about an hour ago. And now... I will be letting Jabba know the same.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 52, 'npc_failure_3', 'Where is that schematic? Don''t think that I will believe for a moment that you have ''lost'' it... WHO DID YOU SELL IT TO!?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bib_fortuna.stf', 53, 'npc_failure_4', 'A group of sand-ridden worrts such as those salvers were too much for your skills!? Get out of here, for you disgust me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/bldg_destroy.stf', 1, 'bldg_destroy', 'System detects lifeforms inside building, shutting down self destruct'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 1, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I think I understand.  I''ll be happy to take care of them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 2, 'player_1_2', 'If Jabba needs this done, then I''m the one for the job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 3, 'player_1_3', 'I don''t want to see Jabba angry. I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 4, 'player_2_1', 'If you''re saying you want them killed, then I don''t want the job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 5, 'player_2_2', 'No, I''m not interested in doing courier "work".'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 6, 'player_2_3', 'I am sick of delivering ledgers.  Find someone else to do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 7, 'player_3_1', 'Why can''t Jabba''s customers protect themselves?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 8, 'player_3_2', 'What is so special about this courier?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 9, 'player_3_3', 'What''s so hard about reading a simple bank ledger?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 10, 'npc_1_1', 'Hngh. You want a job, eh? You want to serve Jabba? Valarian''s thugs are makin'' loud threats ''bout hurtin'' some of Jabba''s "customers".  They need to learn to be quiet.. Go silence them. For good. Do you understand?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 11, 'npc_1_2', 'Ngh. You back? Good. Jabba wants revenge against Valarian. You''re gonna find and punish one of her couriers. You wanna do this small favor for Jabba?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 12, 'npc_1_3', 'Hurn. We have a problem with the stolen ledger. Bib Fortuna can''t make snout nor stump of the ledger''s code....again. But Jabba has a code-slicer in his pocket. Jabba wants you to take the ledger to this slicer, Sirad Far. You gonna take this assignment?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 13, 'npc_2_1', 'Once you shut ''em up, return here to let me know.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 14, 'npc_2_2', 'Good. That courier is carryin'' a special package. Bring the package back to me. An'' make sure the courier is dead. We''re sendin'' a loud message to Valarian. She better learn to keep her snout outta Jabba''s business, or it''s gonna get chopped off.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 15, 'npc_2_3', 'Good choice, friend. Take this ledger to Sirad Far, who is waitin'' for you. I hear Sirad wants to thank you personally for helpin'' with some of his former...associates. Leave the ledger with him, then come back to the palace. '),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 16, 'npc_3_1', 'I''m gonna think that you turned down this job ''cause you''re spineless, not because you have a soft spot for Valarians'' thugs...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 17, 'npc_3_2', 'Hmmmm.... So, you''re too good for one of Jabba''s simple jobs now, eh? Maybe you don''t value your life or reputation?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 18, 'npc_3_3', 'Guess I was wrong about you. I thought you wanted to get close to Jabba. If you''re smart, you''ll reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 19, 'npc_reward_1', 'I hear you took care of our little problem.  Jabba''s clients will be glad to hear it.  Good job. Perhaps, you come back to me for future assignments, hmm?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 20, 'npc_reward_2', 'Ah, you have the ledger.  Good.  Jabba''s spies say that Valarian is foaming after losing it.  Take this reward for all your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 21, 'npc_reward_3', 'Jabba has heard your name. Keep showin'' your loyalty and I''m sure you''ll be invited to join his court. Maybe you can find more to do to keep on his good side.  Try Porcellus, he may have some work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 22, 'npc_4_1', 'Jabba protects anyone willin'' to pay for it. I''m not gonna let Lady Valarian''s thugs try to make Jabba look weak. So, you''re gonna show everyone on this planet that payin'' Jabba protection fee is worth every credit. You''re up for the job, right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 23, 'npc_4_2', 'The courier is nobody. Just another mercenary who needed a job. But Jabba wants what the courier is carryin''. The package has financial information from Valarian''s compound. We can use that information to ruin her.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 24, 'npc_4_3', 'Jabba''s spies are morons. None of ''em knew that the ledger was written in code. Valarian is using an obscure form of Old Drall in that book, an'' nobody here can read it. Fortunately, Jabba has a big brain named Sirad Far on the payroll. Jabba''s been helpin'' Far with a few of his problems, and now Sirad''s more than happy to read the ledger for the Hutt..'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 25, 'next', 'If you''re looking for something to do, try the kitchen.  Porcellus always needs a hand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 26, 'notyet', 'You shouldn''t be up here.  Go see Ree-Yees if you need a job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 27, 'npc_backtowork', 'You better get that task done quick.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 28, 'npc_reset', 'Yeah, ok.  Come back when you''re ready.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 29, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you take care of those loud mouths?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 30, 'npc_work_2', 'That courier get taken care of yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 31, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you deliver that ledger to our friend yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 32, 'player_reset', 'I''m not ready for this mission, I''d like to back out.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 33, 'player_sorry', 'I''ll get right to it sir.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 34, 'npc_breech_1', 'One of the green guy''s slugs eh?  We''ll take care of ya...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 35, 'npc_breech_2', 'Who are you?  What has Valarian gotten me into now?!?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hey, did you come to drop something off?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 37, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'That''s the ledger?  That was a snap.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 38, 'npc_failure_1', 'Ngh. You couldn''t even handle a group of thugs like that? Get outta of my face! And don''t even think of wanting to work for Jabba in the future, got it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 39, 'npc_failure_3', 'Let''s go over this again. You said a Krayt Dragon rose of the sand and ate the ledger? And you also thing that I''m a monkey-lizard, right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 40, 'npc_failure_2', 'You have a lot of courage coming back here without that package in your hands.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 41, 'gotowork', 'Sorry, I can''t talk now.  I have things to do...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 42, 'notit', 'So, uh, where''s that thing I asked for?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ephant_mon.stf', 43, 'dontknowyou', 'Sorry, I can''t talk now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 1, 'player_1_1', 'I will do as Jabba asks.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 2, 'player_1_2', 'No problem.  This will be child''s play.  How fast does Jabba want it done?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 3, 'player_1_3', 'Tell Jabba he can count on me to get it done!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 4, 'player_1_4', 'Now that sounds like some good action!  I''ll do this one for free!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 5, 'player_1_5', 'Hmm... sounds important.  Yeah, I''ll do it for Jabba.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 6, 'player_1_6', 'Bounty Hunters?  No problem. Point me to them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 7, 'player_1_7', 'Tell Jabba he''ll get his key.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 8, 'player_1_8', 'I would be honored to help the great Jabba recover that trophy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 9, 'player_2_1', 'Jabba should know that I''m above simple errands.  Tell him I want a real job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 10, 'player_2_2', 'I''m not interested right now in assassinating anyone.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 11, 'player_2_3', 'I''m still recovering from a recent fight. I don''t want any courier work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 12, 'player_2_4', 'Strike team?  Oh.  Umm... sorry, my trick knee is acting up. I can''t do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 13, 'player_2_5', 'If this is anything like that Strike team job, I''ll pass.  No thanks, Jabba.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 14, 'player_2_6', 'Bounty Hunters are too dangerous for me. Get Boba Fett to do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 15, 'player_2_7', 'Let Jabba know that I''m too busy for work at the moment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 16, 'player_2_8', 'I''m too talented for this.  Get someone else to do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 17, 'player_3_1', 'Why does Jabba care about a lowly accountant?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 18, 'player_3_2', 'Lady Valarian has a personal interrogater?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 19, 'player_3_3', 'Is this an important job, or will I be running a simple errand for Jabba?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 20, 'player_3_4', 'What type of strike team are we talking about here, Jabba?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 21, 'player_3_5', 'What will I be buying from this smuggler?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 22, 'player_3_6', 'What kind of smuggler leads bounty hunters here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 23, 'player_3_7', 'All this money for a key?  Is it worth all of these credits?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 24, 'player_3_8', 'Why is Jabba asking me to do this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 25, 'npc_1_1', 'The Illustrious Jabba the Hutt bids you welcome to his court.  He wishes you to perform a favor of great importance.  Lady Valarian has mistreated one of her accountants, one who understands the greatness of Jabba''s power.  You are instructed to locate Scrib Leras and bring him to Jabba''s court so that he may offer Jabba his information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 26, 'npc_1_2', 'While you were out, Jabba the Hutt, Prince of Tatooine, has learned that Lady Valarian did not wish to execute Scrib Leras.  Instead she wished to interrogate him, engaging the services of a most skilled interrogater.  Jabba wishes you to extinguish the life of this interrogater to repay Lady Valarian for past transgressions.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 27, 'npc_1_3', 'Jabba explains that his associate, Romo Vox, has uncovered yet another traitor within Jabba''s Court.   His Highness has been told that this traitor has sent a message to Lady Valarian via the services of a courier.  Jabba the Hutt demands that you find the messenger and recover that missive.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 28, 'npc_1_4', 'Jabba is quite furious over the contents of the recovered message. It included a schedule of guard changes, which Lady Valarian''s thugs plan to use to infiltrate the palace. The Resplendent Jabba wishes you to locate Valarian''s incoming strike team and deal with them accordingly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 29, 'npc_1_5', 'The Splendid Jabba the Hutt has requested your services again. You have served him well in the past and he believes you can be entrusted with another sensitive assignment. You are to intercept a smuggler who has business with the Lady Valarian. You are authorized to pay this smuggler more credits than Lady Valarian can offer, and bring whatever ''merchandise'' he is carrying to Jabba.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 30, 'npc_1_6', 'The Great Jabba the Hutt requires your previous assignment to be completed.  The smuggler, Belshu Dadar, has made contact with Jabba himself following your business deal.  It seems Dadar has a price on his head. Jabba wants you to terminate the bounty hunters pursuing Dadar.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 31, 'npc_1_7', 'You have been contracted to do another job for Jabba the Hutt. You are instructed to take this case of credits to an associate of Jabba''s, one Sliv Jurek. Jurek will then give you an electronic key, which you will bring to Jabba. You have proven yourself to Jabba in the past. Do not fail him now...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 32, 'npc_1_8', 'His Exhaltedness, Jabba the Hutt, has given you the honor of recovering the Rantok Sword for him.  Enter the predesignated warehouse using the provided passcode, and recover the sword.  You should be quite capable of dealing with any opposition. Shall I tell him you accept this mission?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 33, 'npc_2_1', 'His Highness says that you are to meet Scrib Leras and provide suitable protection as you escort him to the palace. Jabba will be most displeased if he has misplaced his trust in you. You are to return in a timely manner, for Jabba the Hutt is not to be left waiting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 34, 'npc_2_2', 'Lady Valarian''s torturer will be waiting for Scrib Leras. You will meet with him instead, and deal with the man using your special talents. Jabba will want a full report on how many times the torturer screamed before he died.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 35, 'npc_2_3', 'Jabba is pleased by your willingness to serve him. Return with the message in hand, and you will be rewarded well.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 36, 'npc_2_4', 'Excellent!  Now perhaps Jabba will stop blaming everything on me! As usual, the Glorious Jabba will expect this task to be completed quickly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 37, 'npc_2_5', 'That is so good to hear! Of course, what I mean to say is that Jabba is satisfied with your initiative and will expect this mission to be completed shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 38, 'npc_2_6', 'The Glorious Jabba the Hutt says that if you are able to eliminate these bounty hunters, you will prove yourself to him. That endorsement will take you far within his court, I must say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 39, 'npc_2_7', 'His Grandness says that he will expect you to follow through with this. If you think of taking the money for yourself... oh dear.. he says that he will watch you eaten by his pet brachno-jags for the next week. Please return with his key.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 40, 'npc_2_8', 'Jabba is eagerly awaiting his sword. He will enjoy displaying it to everyone. It will become a symbol of his swift justice. Please do return quickly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 41, 'npc_3_1', 'Jabba feels that his offer of employment was most generous, and he is angered by your rejection. I would suggest that you reconsider his offer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 42, 'npc_3_2', 'His Grandness is most disappointed in your response. He knows that you will reconsider his offer... um... and if you were smart, you would reconsider quickly, I must add.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 43, 'npc_3_3', 'Jabba is angered by your lack of initiative. He expected more from you, but now understands that you are not worthy of his employment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 44, 'npc_3_4', 'The Merciless Jabba does not care which of your appendages is malfunctioning. This mission must be completed. Jabba informs me that he will not take ''No'' for an answer. Were Jabba not so preoccupied with other matters, he would feed you to the rancor immediately. You may dwell on this threat...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 45, 'npc_3_5', 'Oh no!  Please do reconsider. If he does not get what he wants, Jabba may direct his anger towards me! The Vengeful Jabba says that you have a few moments to agree to this mission. If you do not... you will be fed to the Sarlaac next time... oh dear!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 46, 'npc_3_6', 'Oh dear... Jabba the Hutt tells you that if he has to pay Boba''s price for this mission, he will be most displeased.  He is upset that you do not wish to do business with him, and he is getting quite angry indeed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 47, 'npc_3_7', 'The Pungent - er, I mean to say - Perfectious Jabba the Hutt says he does not have time to wait. Another mercenary will be assigned this task.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 48, 'npc_3_8', 'His Magnificentness explains to you that position is easily changed.  He has also told me that he doesn''t want to hear a ''No'' or he will be very angry with me and ... oh dear, oh dear ... send me to the droid pit to be deconstructed.  I beg you, please tell him ''Yes''.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 49, 'npc_4_1', 'The Lady Valarian is to execute said accountant for a miscalculation amounting to a total of 4 credits.  Jabba the Hutt, in his generosity, understands that mistakes are made, and wishes to help him.  Jabba knows the accountant will be willing to offer any information to his Highness in return for this favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 50, 'npc_4_2', 'Jabba the Hutt says that Lady Valarian uses crude means of keeping her cronies in line.  She has hired a most competent interrogater to extract information from the less loyal members of her cadre. Jabba the Hutt says he would never resort to simple torture to ensure loyalty.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 51, 'npc_4_3', 'The Majestic Jabba says that any job he offers to someone is of the utmost importance, simply because it was GIVEN by the Illustrious Jabba.  But, if you must know, the message contains something about the bookkeeper you escorted here recently. Jabba is curious to know why Lady Valarian values this bookkeeper so.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 52, 'npc_4_4', 'Jabba explains that the strike team''s membership is still a guarded secret. It could include some of Lady Valarian''s lowly thugs, or perhaps trained Commandos. Jabba the Hutt, in his sagacity, places his full faith in your ability to handle this mild annoyance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 53, 'npc_4_5', 'The Wise Jabba says that you ask too many questions.  He has graciously allowed you this information: The smuggler supposedly works for Black Sun, which has chosen to do business with Lady Valarian. Jabba does not know what Valarian is buying, and this displeases him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 54, 'npc_4_6', 'Belshu Dadar is now Jabba''s loyal associate. His Greatness says that this is a favor he is doing for Belshu.  He has chosen to give you the contract because you have proven yourself talented, but expendable. In other words, he says to mind your own business and take the job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 55, 'npc_4_7', 'Jabba the Hutt has been told by Belshu, the smuggler now working for him, that there is a valuable Rantok Sword being held in a warehouse here on Tatooine. Jabba wants this sword to display on his wall. Jabba needs an electronic key to enter the warehouse, and his associate, Sliv Jurek, can provide that tool.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 56, 'npc_4_8', 'Jabba would prefer to offer this job to Boba Fett, but your fee is much more reasonable. Jabba has placed his trust in you. Do not take this honor lightly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 57, 'npc_reward_1', 'Jabba wishes to tell you that he is pleased with your escort services. Jabba will speak with the accountant later, but currently, eating his seventh meal of the day is more pressing. For now, Jabba wishes to extend to you his personal appreciation for an errand well done.  As a token he bequeaths you this reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 58, 'npc_reward_2', 'The Grand Jabba the Hutt expresses his appreciation. He is most overjoyed to hear the man died in a terrible fashion. Jabba the Hutt says you show great promise and he may have use of your services in the future.  He also bequeaths to you this reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 59, 'npc_reward_3', 'His Worshipfulness tells you that he is impressed with the speed in which you dealt with the traitor''s messenger.  Bib Fortuna will now decode the message and tell Jabba what it contains. Jabba is pleased... thank goodness.  As a result he has decided that you should take a short break, and as a means, he has provided this reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 60, 'npc_reward_4', 'Jabba the Hutt says that his next imbibed drink will be dedicated to you, for your brashness and skill. That is quite an honor, indeed.  You should be most grateful for that, and for this reward he has offered you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 61, 'npc_reward_5', 'His Imperiousness, Jabba the Hutt, wishes to commend you for a job well done. Please inquire later about any further jobs Jabba may have for you.  Oh, and yet another reward has been granted to you, Jabba''s most favored employee.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 62, 'npc_reward_6', 'The Great Jabba the Hutt has been informed of your victory over the bounty hunters. He wishes me to tell you that you are exactly the kind of scum he likes. He will be most happy to do business with you in the future.  He has given you this reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 63, 'npc_reward_7', 'Jabba the Hutt is impressed by your success. He says that you remind him of a daring smuggler he once employed. You should go far. This reward is for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 64, 'npc_reward_8', 'The resplendent Jabba the Hutt expresses his deepest thanks. He wishes to tell you that if you need a place to hide from authorities, he offers you his home, for he considers you to be a close associate.  Oh, I do thank you as well. If this had gone bad, he probably would have replaced me.  I am indebted to you!  As such I''m making sure that you get a good reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 65, 'next', 'Currently Jabba has nothing left for you to do.  Feel free to relax here within the palace.  Perhaps some more work will become available in the future.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 66, 'notyet', 'Jabba wishes to know why a worm such as you, who doesn''t even have the approval of Bib Fortuna, would even attempt to talk to him.   Perhaps you''d like to see our Rancor?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 67, 'npc_backtowork', 'The illustrious Jabba wishes you to continue with your mission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 68, 'npc_reset', 'His immenseness is most displeased with your lack of progress.  Do return when you''ve become powerful enough to work for Jabba.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 69, 'player_reset', 'Tell Jabba I can''t do this yet.  I''ll have to come back later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 70, 'player_sorry', 'Tell Jabba I''m on my way to finish my work now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 71, 'npc_work_1', 'The distinguished Jabba wishes to know where his new "friend" Scrib Leras is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 72, 'npc_work_2', 'The renowned Jabba the Hutt asks whether Valarian''s Interrogators have been dealt with...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 73, 'npc_work_3', 'The exalted Hutt, Jabba, wants to know if the traitor has been dealt with.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 74, 'npc_work_4', 'Glorious Jabba wishes to know what has happened to the strike team.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 75, 'npc_work_5', 'Jabba the Hutt, celebrated leader, is curious about the merchandise you were to retrieve.  Do you have it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 76, 'npc_work_6', 'The Remarkable Jabba the Hutt wants to know if the bounty hunters are still breathing.  You realize of course the answer to this question should be no...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 77, 'npc_work_7', 'Magnificent Jabba wants to know where the key is.  Have you spoken to Sliv Jurek yet?  I do hope you have...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 78, 'npc_work_8', 'Esteemed Jabba wants his Rantok Sword.  I do hope, for everyone''s sake, that you have acquired it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 79, 'npc_breech_1', 'Are you from the Palace?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 80, 'npc_breech_2', 'Jabba sends cronies to deal with us?  He should have sent someone competent.  Hah!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 81, 'npc_breech_3', 'No!  I didn''t want to turn against Jabba!  You won''t take me back alive!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 82, 'npc_breech_4', 'We''ve been ratted out!  Get that guy!  Don''t let him live!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 83, 'npc_breech_5', 'Psst!  Hey, are you the guy?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 84, 'npc_breech_6', 'What do you think you''re doing?  I think you''re dying!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 85, 'npc_breech_7', 'Hey, pal, how''s it going?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 86, 'npc_breech_8', 'ALARM!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 87, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'As dangerous as this is Jabba sure pays well, heh.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 88, 'smuggle_7', 'Whew.  I was getting worried out here.  Well, I guess our business is done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 89, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Ok, get me back to the Palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 90, 'npc_failure_1', 'The Vengeful Jabba says that he is most displeased with the outcome of your assignment. -Oh my!- He has asked you to stay for dinner and take part in the entertainment. I am afraid he has said this in such a way that it was not a suggestion, but rather and order. I am so sorry, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 91, 'npc_failure_2', 'The Sagacious Jabba says that if you could not handle one person, then you are not of the caliber he is looking for. Oh dear... Jabba the Hutt says you can go get lost in the Jundland Wastes for all he cares.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 92, 'npc_failure_3', 'Oh dear oh dear... the Wrathful Jabba says that he is most displeased by the turn of these events and that the -oh- the "normal" will be happening tonight.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 93, 'npc_failure_4', 'The Irate Jabba says that since you failed in what he wanted that perhaps a job cleaning the Kowakian Monkey-lizard at his tail would be more fitting for your aptitudes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 94, 'npc_failure_5', 'The Curious Jabba the Hutt, Khan of the Outer Rim, asks you what happened to the money he entrusted to you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 95, 'npc_failure_6', 'I will tell Jabba that you said you are still working on this. If he hears that you failed, he will do something most awful to... OH! Yes, your Highness? You could understand what I was saying? Oh my.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 96, 'npc_failure_7', 'Oh dear... run, friend! Jabba has called for the brachno-jags! RUN!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 97, 'npc_failure_8', 'The Vengeful Jabba says that he is most displeased with the outcome of your assignment. -Oh my!- He has asked you to stay for dinner and take part in the entertainment. I am afraid he has said this in such a way that it was not a suggestion, but rather and order. I am so sorry, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 98, 'npc_smuggle_7', 'Well, that''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 99, 'notit', 'Jabba wonders what became of the item he asked you to acquire?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/g5po.stf', 100, 'gotowork', 'Don''t you have something you should be doing?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Hm, hm, hmmm... yes, yes, you just might be the person I''m looking for.  I''m Porcellus, cook extraordinaire, chef to Senators and Royals alike, and now... *sigh*... slave to Jabba.  Jabba has requested a meal more exotic than his usual fare, and I have just the idea.  Would you gather some special meat for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Since Jabba loved his Kaadu Krunchies, he now wants to feast upon a rare beastie here on Tatooine.  He has sent scouts to find that oh so elusive Meat Beast.  Word came back one of the scouts spotted the Meat Beast, but it''s being studied by some official looking "veterinarian", whatever that is.  Take down that vet and see if he has the location of the creature.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'What exciting news!  They had actually tracked down the Meat Beast to its lair!  Aren''t you brimming with excitement?!  All you need to do now is go track down the Meat Beast at these coordinates, kill it, and bring back its fabled meat!  Does that sound good to you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 4, 'npc_2_1', 'I am quite overjoyed to hear you can help!  Prefect Talmont has paid a lot of credits to have a kaadu transported here to Tatooine.  After it''s unloaded and is being escorted to Prefect Talmont''s mansion, all you need to do is intercept Talmont''s toadies, kill the beastie, and bring me back a good slice from its haunches.  I''ll wait, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 5, 'npc_2_2', 'Good, good, good.  Now, from what the scout said, the "vet" shouldn''t be too far.  Then again, that''s information from one of Bib Fortuna''s men so, you know...  Remember you don''t need to bring back the "veterinarian"''s body,  just bring back his datapad.  If the guy was smart, he probably recorded where he spotted the Meat Beast!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 6, 'npc_2_3', 'Ohhh, excellent, excellent, excellent!  Go track down that beastie and bring me back a good chunk from its haunches or ribs or wherever!  Now.... what shall I make?  A pate, perhaps?  No, no, too gauche for his tastes.  Ah!  A fine Meat Beast pudding!  Yes!  Hmm?  Are you still here?  Go, go!  Get me that Meat Beast, friend!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 7, 'npc_3_1', 'All of you scum here are ungrateful bantha-fodder!  You eat my food, but you don''t care a whit if I get tossed into the rancor pit, do you?  Whatever will I do?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 8, 'npc_3_2', 'You charge too much, but you sure will eat the food I make, right?  Very well, then.  I will ask Jabba to send out a scout because you refused to do this for him.  I''m sure that little bite of information will settle well with him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 9, 'npc_3_3', 'No!  You don''t understand!  If I don''t make this meal soon for Jabba, he''ll throw me to the Rancor!  I don''t even belong here!  Please, you must help me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 10, 'npc_4_1', 'For Jabba''s dinner tonight, I am preparing him a succulent plate of charbroiled sand-maggot kidneys, served with a chilled carafe of fermented worrt milk.  Is this elegant meal enough for him? NO!  Jabba wants kaduu meat, which he heard Prefect Talmont is importing for a regal Imperial party he''s hosting.  Bah!  He''s so finicky!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 11, 'npc_4_2', 'Well, I''m not too sure what the Meat Beast is.  Rumor has it, though, that whoever eats a bite of it will never get indigestion ever again!  Supposedly it''s got big horns, two tails, eight eyes, nine legs, and fangs the size of a Jawa.  Then again, maybe not.  Who knows?  What I do know is that when I''m done with it, it''ll be quite tasty, indeed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 12, 'npc_4_3', 'What?  Can you not see?  I have won the Golden Spatula award 3 years in a row when I was a Master Chef on Coruscant! If I whip up a scrumptious pate made from the Meat Beast, maybe the story will spread to other worlds.  This may be my one chance for my colleagues to know I''m trapped here in this Palace!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 13, 'npc_reward_1', '*Sniiiiiiiffff*  Mmmm... Kaadu meat exudes such a wonderful aroma, wouldn''t you say.  Now, all this needs is a little spice coating, some... hrm... oil, yes oil would be good, hmm.... more spices, yes... and a little...ahhh, yesss... Eopie cheese... and voila - Kaadu Krunchies!  I''ll let you know if Jabba enjoyed his ''exotic'' meal!  Thank you!  Here, take this as a reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 14, 'npc_reward_2', 'You brought the datapad back!  Did you see any sign of the Meat Beast anywhere when you were out there?  Nah, I guess that was too much to expect.  Well, either way, I''ll have Bib decode this pad to see if the veterinarian left any information as to where its lair is.  Thank you, friend!  As a gift I''m giving you this out of my own pocket.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_3', 'Oh, how wonderful!  Good, good!  The meat is still in wonderful condition!  I will be known galaxy-wide for my Meat Beast Pudding!  And then, and then... maybe my fellow chefs might mount a rescue team to save me from wasting my talents on this horrid slug!  Thank you once again, friend!  Here, you can have this for all your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 16, 'player_1_1', 'A full belly keeps Jabba happy, I hear.  Sure, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 17, 'player_1_2', 'No problem!  I''ll go get it for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 18, 'player_1_3', 'Sure!  I can''t wait to see this ''Meat Beast''!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 19, 'player_2_1', 'No, you got the wrong person.  You must have mistaken me for a lowly kitchenhand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 20, 'player_2_2', 'Get another scout to go find the body.  I charge too much for body recoveries.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 21, 'player_2_3', 'Too bad.  I''m not going on a wild Cu-Pa chase to find this imaginary Meat Beast.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 22, 'player_3_1', 'What kind of meat are we talking about here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 23, 'player_3_2', 'What in the heck is a ''Meat Beast''?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 24, 'player_3_3', 'Why are you so excited about making this ''Meat Beast'' into a meal?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 25, 'next', 'Why don''t you head down to the garage and see what Barada''s up to.  I hear he''s cooking something up...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 26, 'notyet', 'You shouldn''t be back here.  This kitchen is for me and trusted staff only.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 27, 'npc_backtowork', 'Well, if you don''t get this done quick we''re both gonna be in trouble.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 28, 'npc_reset', 'Yeah, fine, I''ll find somebody else to do the real work around here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 29, 'player_sorry', 'Sorry, I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 31, 'player_reset', 'I think I''d like to get out of here for a while, maybe finish this later?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Where''s my Kaadu meat?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you get the location of the meat beast?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Where''s my meat beast...erm...meat?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hey, who are you?!?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 39, 'npc_failure_1', 'Very well... I shall remember this when you ask me for a tasty, tasty little treat.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 40, 'npc_failure_2', 'What do you mean you didn''t gather that location! Ah! This is a travesty!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 41, 'npc_failure_3', 'Oh, how much you have ruined my day.... I shall be thrown to the Sarlaac for this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/porcellus.stf', 42, 'notit', 'Where is it?  Why haven''t you brought me what I asked for?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 1, 'jabbas_palace_1', 'REELO BARUK needs you to find the TUSKEN RAIDER LEADER who has been harrassing Jabba''s friends and KILL him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 2, 'jabbas_palace_2', 'REELO BARUK wants you to find VALARIAN''S THUGS who have been hanging out near the palace.  They are to be DESTROYED.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 3, 'jabbas_palace_3', 'JABBA''S VISITOR is lost somewhere near the palace. REELO BARUK wants you to ESCORT him to the Palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 4, 'jabbas_palace_4', 'JABBA wants a slicer in his pocket, and in order to get him you need to KILL the slicers rival THUGS.  When you are done return to REE-YEES.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 5, 'jabbas_palace_5', 'REE-YEES wants you to find the transponder from a crashed starship and return it.  If the filthy JAWAS have stolen it you should KILL them and take it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 6, 'jabbas_palace_6', 'REE-YEES wants you to DELIVER the transponder to SIRAD FAR.  When you have done so return to the palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 7, 'jabbas_palace_7', 'EPHANT MON wants you to DESTROY some more of LADY VALARIAN''S thugs.  They''re harrassing Jabba''s loyal customers.  This must end immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 8, 'jabbas_palace_8', 'KILL the COURIER who''s making a delivery for LADY VALARIAN.  RETRIEVE anything important he might be carrying.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 9, 'jabbas_palace_9', 'DELIVER the ledger to SIRAD FAR.  Bib Fortuna will view this as a personal favor.  Return to EPHANT MON when you are done.  Allow no harm to come to our friend, the slicer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 10, 'jabbas_palace_10', 'Find and DESTROY the KAADU that is being delivered to Prefect Talmont.  Return to PORCELLUS with meat from the beast.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 11, 'jabbas_palace_11', 'RETRIEVE the location of the "meatbeast" from the VETERINARIAN.  Be careful as you may have to KILL the "vet" and the "vet''s" bodyguards.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 12, 'jabbas_palace_12', 'KILL the MEATBEAST and return with some of it''s meat so that PORCELLUS can finish Jabba''s Lunch.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 13, 'jabbas_palace_13', 'KILL VALARIAN''S THUG.  He has a special CODE CYLINDER that BARADA wants you to bring back to him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 14, 'jabbas_palace_14', 'DELIVER the CODE CYLINDER to the slicer.  When this is done return to BARADA.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 15, 'jabbas_palace_15', 'Go to LADY VALARIAN''S WAREHOUSE.  Get past the GUARDS however you can.  Use the SELF-DESTRUCT terminal to destroy the warehouse.  Return to BARADA.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 16, 'jabbas_palace_16', 'ESCORT ROMO VAX safely to the Palace.  Return to BIB FORTUNA when you are finished.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 17, 'jabbas_palace_17', 'DESTROY the BOUNTY HUNTER who has come to the Palace looking for Romo Vax.  Return to BIB FORTUNA when you are finished.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 18, 'jabbas_palace_18', 'RETRIEVE the SCHEMATIC that BIB FORTUNA has asked for.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 19, 'jabbas_palace_19', 'Find and KILL the SLAVERS who are moving in on BIB FORTUNA''S territory.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 20, 'jabbas_palace_20', 'ESCORT SCRIB LERAS to the Palace.  As usual, he is not to be harmed.  JABBA will be most pleased.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 21, 'jabbas_palace_21', 'Find and KILL the INTERROGATOR that LADY VALARIAN hired to torture Scrib Leras.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 22, 'jabbas_palace_22', 'DESTROY the STRIKE TEAM that VALARIAN has sent to the palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 23, 'jabbas_palace_23', 'Find and KILL the TRAITOR.  JABBA will not have this in his home.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 24, 'jabbas_palace_24', 'RETRIEVE the merchandise from JABBA''S friend the SMUGGLER.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 25, 'jabbas_palace_25', 'DESTROY the Bounty Hunters who are seeking our new friend.  ELIMINATE them without delay.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 26, 'jabbas_palace_26', 'DELIVER the BRIEFCASE to SLIV JUREK and in return bring back the ELECTRONIC KEY he will sell you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 27, 'jabbas_palace_27', 'STEAL the RANTOK SWORD from LADY VALARIAN''S warehouse.  ELIMINATE any resistance you encounter and bring the sword back to JABBA.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/quest_details.stf', 28, 'jabbas_palace_return', 'Return to Jabba''s Palace.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'New here eh?  Well, I''ve got a problem you can help me with. Some of those nasty Tuskens are starting to get brazen, hanging out too close to the palace.  Jabba hates that.  If you can go take care of them, I''ll see what else I can find for you.  Deal?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 2, 'player_1_1', 'Deal.  I''ll get to it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 3, 'player_2_1', 'No way.  Too dangerous.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 4, 'player_3_1', 'Tuskens?  I don''t understand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 5, 'npc_4_1', 'You know, the Sand People?  They wear those dirty robes and carry spiked clubs? Heads wrapped in bandages? But just take care of the leader and we''ll call it done.  Deal?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 6, 'npc_3_1', 'Fine.  You don''t look like Jabba''s kinda scum anyway, but I thought I''d give you a shot. Come back after you buy some courage.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 7, 'npc_2_1', 'Good. Just take care of the leader and I''ll take care of ya.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 8, 'npc_reward_1', 'Good work.  I''m impressed.  Come back later and I''ll find some more work for you.  Oh, but here, take this for your help.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 9, 'npc_1_2', 'Oh, it''s you. Good timing. I got something you can do for me. There''s some thugs that work for Lady Valarian hanging out around the palace.  I don''t know what they''re up to, but Jabba wants them, you know, taken care of.  Can I count on you again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 10, 'player_1_2', 'Of course.  I''ll get right to it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 11, 'player_2_2', 'Can''t do it now.  I''ll come back later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 12, 'player_3_2', 'Who''s Lady Valarian?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 13, 'npc_2_2', 'Great.  I''ll give you their last known location and you can take care of it.  When you get back I''ll see what else we have that needs to be done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 14, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, don''t be too long or I''ll have to find someone else to take this job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 15, 'npc_4_2', 'She''s a lowlife, small-time gangster that operates out of the Lucky Despot in Mos Eisley.  She''s a constant thorn in Jabba''s side, so whenever we get the chance, we do some damage to her operations.  So, can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Excellent work.  I hear people talking about you in the halls now.  You''re going to move up in this operation, I can feel it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 17, 'npc_1_3', 'Good to see you again. Jabba''s has a friend wandering out in the desert, trying to find the palace with a busted datapad and no sense of direction.  I need you to go out there and find this guy and bring him back.  Or maybe it''s a girl... I can''t remember.  Can you go get him?  Or her?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 18, 'npc_2_3', 'Thanks. You''ve saved my hide. If Jabba''s friend doesn''t get here, somebody''s going to be breakfast for the Sarlacc, and it could easily end up bein'' me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 19, 'npc_3_3', 'Well, I''ll try to find someone else to do it, but get back here as quick as you can ''cause I think everyone''s busy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 20, 'npc_4_3', 'I don''t know... somebody delivering something to Jabba, or bringing Jabba some info, or maybe credits, or something. Everything''s a big secret around here usually, so this lack of information is pretty standard.  I just need to know if you can go get them back here...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 21, 'player_1_3', 'Sure.  I''ll be back soon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 22, 'player_2_3', 'I''m kinda busy at the moment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 23, 'player_3_3', 'Who is this friend?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 24, 'npc_reward_3', 'You do good work.  I''ll let Ree-Yees know that I''m putting you on our available roster of employees and you can see what he has for you to do.  You know, I had reward for you.. ah here it is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 25, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Finally.  You''re the one Reelo sent to take me back to the Palace, right?  Well, let''s not waste any time chatting.  Just take me back there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 26, 'npc_work_1', 'You didn''t take care of the tuskens did you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 27, 'npc_work_2', 'You didn''t take care of the thugs did you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 28, 'npc_work_3', 'Where''s Jabba''s friend?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 29, 'player_reset', 'I think I need to start over with this one.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 30, 'player_sorry', 'Sorry, I''ll get right back to it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork', 'Well get back to it then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 32, 'npc_reset', 'Fine, come back when you think you can handle this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 33, 'notyet', 'Could you repeat that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 34, 'next', 'Go see Ree-Yees over there.  He may have some things he needs done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 35, 'npc_breech_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_2', 'It''s one of Jabba''s thugs, get him!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hey, I''m over here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 38, 'dontknowyou', 'I''m sorry, I''m waiting for someone.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 39, 'npc_failure_1', 'You let me down. No... I don''t think this business relationship is going to work out.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 40, 'npc_failure_2', 'I thought you said I could count on you? What happened between the time you said that and now?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/reelo_baruk.stf', 41, 'npc_failure_3', 'Now, let''s talk about this. I distinctly remember saying that I needed you to save my friend, right? Now you must have heard ''Go out and let my friend die in a horrible manner''. Now, it''s not that I''m above that... BUT I DIDN"T SAY THAT!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Are you looking at me!? You want a job, is that it? Okay, look, Jabba is missing a slicer since his last one had a little bit of an accident with the rancor.  Well, Jabba wants this one slicer, Sirad Far, in his pocket and he knows the best way to do it would be to help take out Sirad''s rivals.  You wanna help out with this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 2, 'player_1_1', 'Tell Jabba I''ll deal with Sirad''s rivals personally.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 3, 'player_2_1', 'That seems beneath me. Have someone else do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 4, 'player_3_1', 'What does this slicer do that Jabba wants him?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 5, 'npc_4_1', 'Why do you care, huh? All you need to know is that Jabba wants Sirad in his pockets - er- folds. Between you and me, though, Bib says that this Sirad guy is supposed to be one of the best here on Tatooine.  If Jabba does Sirad a favor, Sirad''s gonna need to do Jabba some too. So, you wanna prove yourself around here or not?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 6, 'npc_3_1', 'You think so? You keep talking like that, you''re gonna be buried beneath the palace. Now get outta here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 7, 'npc_2_1', 'Good move, worrt.  Here''s where you can find Sirad''s competition.  Finish them off, and maybe I''ll tell Bib you have a spine.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 8, 'npc_1_2', 'Hey, worrt! I gotta ''nother job for you. Bib just got word of some vessel that crashed out in the dunes nearby the Palace.  Jabba says he wants the transponder from that craft.  You wanna run out there and grab it for him?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 9, 'npc_2_2', 'From what Bib said, it shouldn''t be too far off from here.  If anyone else got to it before you do, let them know that Jabba owns all the space debris on this planet.  If they don''t give it up on their own, take it from them, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 10, 'npc_3_2', 'You know, when Jabba hears that you turned him down, I''m sure he''ll let ME do a good job on you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 11, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I''ll get that transponder for him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 12, 'player_3_2', 'Why does he only want the transponder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 13, 'player_2_2', 'Don''t waste my time. Tell Jabba to give me a real job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 14, 'npc_4_2', 'I don''t know why he wants it.  Do I look like Jabba to you?  Maybe once you get it, he''ll tell you.  Then again, maybe not.  Just get it, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Huh, you actually did it... I''ll let Bib know you''re tougher than you look. And maybe I''ll give you another job in the future, worrt.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Good work, worrt.  Jabba''s gonna be real happy to see that the transponder wasn''t damaged in the crash.  I don''t know what he wants with it, but he''ll be real happy, I''m sure.  Oh, and by the way, we decided you needed a reward.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 17, 'npc_1_3', 'Good news, worrt.  Jabba says that transponder is exactly what he was looking for.  Now Jabba is going to see if this Sirad Far guy was worth all the effort.  Take the transponder to Sirad Far so he can slice into the codes on this thing, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 18, 'npc_2_3', 'Yeah, I knew you''d want to do it.  Sirad''s been told he''s got a package showing up, so he''s waiting.  Get this over to him, and get it to him fast, you hear?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 19, 'npc_3_3', 'I told Jabba you would do it.  If you don''t get this done, and done soon, Jabba''s gonna get real angry.  You don''t want to see Jabba when he''s angry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 20, 'npc_reward_3', 'You know what, worrt? Word has been going around that Jabba and Bib are real happy over this Sirad Fal deal.  Just don''t go thinking that you can have my job.  Worrt or no worrt, I''ll still smash yer face if you play games with me.  But you''ve done good, so next time we''re in a cantina, I''ll buy us a round of bantha blasters!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 21, 'player_1_3', 'Sounds easy enough.  Yeah, I''ll get the job done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 22, 'player_2_3', 'What does Jabba take me for, some errand runner?  I''m not doing it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 23, 'player_3_3', 'What is Jabba planning on doing with the transponder once Sirad''s done with it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 24, 'npc_4_3', 'I heard Jabba say that the type of ship that crashed meets the same specifications as Jabba''s own personal starship.  I think what Jabba''s trying to do is have this transponder hooked up on his ship so that Jabba can transmit a false identity whenever he wants.  That Hutt is sly, I must admit.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 25, 'npc_work_1', 'Hey, worrt, did you deal with those thugs?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 26, 'npc_work_2', 'Where''s the transponder, wort?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 27, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you deliver our transponder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 28, 'player_sorry', 'Yeah, I''ll get right on that. '),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 29, 'player_reset', 'I think I need to take a break and start over.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 30, 'npc_reset', 'Ok, come back when you get some courage.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 31, 'npc_backtowork', 'Get on it then!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 32, 'next', 'You''ve got access to the upstairs now, worrt, go see if Ephant Mon needs anything done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 33, 'notyet', 'Hey, talk to Reelo.  I don''t deal with just everybody that comes in out of the desert.  That''s his job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 34, 'npc_breech_1', 'Thugs, eh?  Sirad Far will be sorry...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 35, 'npc_breech_2', 'Ootini!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hey, are you the guy old Reesy-Yeesy sent?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 37, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'That transponder should be just fine for Jabba''s purposes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 38, 'gotowork', 'Sorry, I''ve got a lot to do, maybe you have something you should be doing?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 39, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh, this is gonna be good. When he hears what happens, your face is gonna be smashed in real good-like!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 40, 'npc_failure_2', 'You couldn''t even do this one? You stupid little worrt! After Jabba hears about this, I''m gonna get to pay you a little visit. Heh...'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 41, 'npc_failure_3', 'What happened to the package, you poodoo-soaked Monkey-lizard?? You''d best have that package in your hands by the time I count to three!!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 42, 'notit', 'Where''s that item I asked you to get?'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 43, 'otherescort', 'I got things to do.  Can''t talk.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/ree_yees.stf', 44, 'dontknowyou', 'Can''t talk now.  Busy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/warning.stf', 1, 'ree_yees', 'You can not enter this area until Ree-Yees gives you permission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/warning.stf', 2, 'barada', 'You can not enter the Throne Room until Barada gives you permission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/warning.stf', 3, 'porcellus', 'You can not enter the garage until Porcellus gives you permission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_jabba/warning.stf', 4, 'jabba', 'Only Jabba and his close personal friends have access to this area.'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 1, 'lom', '4lom\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 2, 'admiral_ackbar', 'admiral ackbar\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 3, 'barada', 'barada\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 4, 'base_npc_theme_park', 'base npc theme park\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 5, 'bib_fortuna', 'bib fortuna\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 6, 'boba_fett', 'boba fett\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 7, 'boss_nass', 'boss nass\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 8, 'bossk', 'bossk\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_lookat.stf', 9, 'brea_tonnika', 'brea tonnika\n'),
