('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 1, 'hack_computer', 'You can not enter this area until the computer has been hacked.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 2, 'cant_get_module', 'You can''t get the module out of the droid...'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 3, 'cant_get_filter', 'It''s jammed in there pretty good...'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 4, 'card_winner', 'The credits have been deposited in your bank account for winning.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 5, 'card_tie', 'Your bet was returned since the game was a tie.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 6, 'card_loser', 'You lost.  Your credits are given to the winner of the game.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 7, 'acquired_memory', 'You have acquired the Droid Memory Module. Return it to Jinkins.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 8, 'acquired_gas', 'You have acquired the filtered gasses.  Return with them to Kole.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 9, 'all_nym_needed', 'You have everything you need to return to Nym.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 10, 'acquired_imggcu', 'You have acquired the IMGGCU''s, you need to find the Research information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 11, 'acquired_hard_drive', 'You have acquired the Research Information, you need to find the IMGGCU''s.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 12, 'need_passkey', 'You cannot enter the Research Laboratory without the Pass Key.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 13, 'inventory_full_hd', 'You have no room in your inventory for the hard drive.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 14, 'inventory_full_gas', 'You have no room in your inventory for the gas cannister.'),
('string/en/theme_park_nym/messages.stf', 15, 'inventory_fiull_imggcu', 'You have no room in your inventory for the IMGGCU.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Hello. I am C-3P0, Human-Cyborg Relations. My companion is R2-D2, and he has been informed from High Command that you are interested in assisting with the Alliance''s cause. According to R2, it seems there is a need for someone to deliver a shipment of food to sympathizers of our cause. Would you be interested in doing this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Good day to you again. Are you interested in offering further assistance? I''m certain that R2 can find something in the databanks, can''t you R2? I said find something in the databanks right now, R2! Okay... yes... okay, R2 says that medicine needs to be urgently delivered to an attack squad that has been wounded. Will you do this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Oh, R2 says that you are needed to help provide an escort for a person needing to reach this hidden base. See, R2, I told you this one could be trusted. Now, as I was saying, the Alliance requests your aid in acting as a bodyguard. Would you be available for this endeavor?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Oh, very good. R2 says to take this shipment to a Selonian spokeswoman who will be waiting for it''s arrival. R2 has provided the coordinates as to where you will meet her. Good luck to you in your journey!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Oh, they will be pleasantly surprised that you have offered to help. What was that, R2? What do you mean you''re surprised, too? Oh, whatever. As I was saying, R2 will alert one of their scouts to meet you so that the Imperials do not track you back to them. Please bring them this bacta.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'What glorious news! R2 has given you the last known coordinates of where the leader can be found.  He is waiting for you to pick him up, using this set of designated codewords. What do you mean you don''t have the codewords, you obsolete droid, you? Deleted? *ahem* I''m sorry, but there are no codewords. You''ll have to make do, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Oh, I do so understand. If you feel you wish to offer your assistance in the future, please stop by. I am sure R2-D2 will be able to find something in the computers.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Oh, please do reconsider. Without that medicine, any number of ghastly things could happen to their numbers. ....No, no R2, I''m sure this is the person the Princess said to give the mission to...    ...oh, what do you know, you rust-bucket!...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Oh, I understand. You cannot be asked to do something that you cannot help with. Perhaps someone else can help with this, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'What do you mean this person doesn''t have the proper clearance for that, R2? Well, I don''t think that''s polite to ask someone to do this without telling them why. *ahem* R2 says that some Selonian food stores have been attacked by the Imperials and the Alliance wishes to help them with this. Unfortunately, this is all he will say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'According to R2, there was an independent strike force that attempted to attack a Imperial Repair facility, but encountered greater resistance than expected. R2 is still being obstinate, and refuses to elaborate any further. Hmph, I swear I should have left you back on Tatooine, you pint-sized excuse for a Jawa. Oh, I''m sorry. Where were we?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'If you know what''s good for you, you''ll tell this kind person the whole story, R2! Ohhhh, I see. *ahem* R2 says that the leader of cell of covert Alliance members has come under questioning by the Empire, and High Command will be helping him escape off planet before he''s arrested. You are needed to escort him back here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Yes, that is a message that the Alliance will be most pleased to hear. On behalf of the Alliance, I am instructed to offer you our sincerest thanks.  R2 suggests that we might give you this reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'What an excellent outcome, I would say. With that bacta in their hands, they should be able to heal most of their injuries. Thank you very much. ............Yes, I just kicked you, you overgrown Mouse Droid! You said this kind person couldn''t do the job. Well, I think you now see you''re wrong, don''t you? Well, I still think you''re wrong..........Anyway, we don''t have much to offer ourselves, but you may have this reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'How exquisite this turned out. R2-D2 has sent a report to High Command that Taergle was able to make it here safely. According to R2, he will be smuggled off-planet, with his family to follow.  Both his dedication and yours to our cause is quite commendable.  Please accept this reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Yes, I''ll help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I''ll deliver the medicine.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'Yeah, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'No thank you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I''m sorry, but someone else should do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Sorry, I''m not a bodyguard. Find someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Who are these sympathizers?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What happened to the squad?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Who will I be escorting?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I had something come up. I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Oh, I do so understand. If you feel you wish to offer your assistance in the future, please stop by. I am sure R2-D2 will be able to find something in the computers.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'What a pleasure to meet you. I have been informed that you support the Alliance''s cause,which I find to be quite noble, indeed. If you have any time to spare, perhaps you may wish to help with some tasks that could use an extra hand?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'You are not the bringer of comestibles. Time cannot be wasted for other conversations.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'My, my, you are efficient. Have you already delivered the food supplies?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'My, my, you are efficient. Have you already delivered the medicine?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'My, my, you are efficient. Have you brought back the leader yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'You are who the Princess sends with the comestibles, yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'I hope you''re the one that Protocol Droid said was coming...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'They don''t make hyper-drives they way they used to, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 39, 'notit_1', 'Mrmmm... no this is not the comestibles that we were told of. Is this Alliance''s joking?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'What''s this? It''s message said that you''d be bringing some bacta, but this doesn''t look like any bacta I''ve ever seen before.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Oh, please do reconsider. Without that medicine, any number of ghastly things could happen to their numbers. ....No, no R2, I''m sure this is the person the Princess said to give the mission to...    ...oh, what do you know, you rust-bucket!...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Oh, I understand. You cannot be asked to do something that you cannot help with. Perhaps someone else can help with this, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I had something come up. I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I had something come up. I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 52, 'npc_takeme_3', 'What do you mean the codewords were dropped? Well, either way, I''ll trust you. Please, lead on before the Empire knows I''ve left.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Which, of course, you''re not. Look, I''m busy, alright?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Well, I guess I''ll mull over the fate of technology by myself, if you don''t mind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'This heat is sure oppressive, would''nt you say? Well, have a good day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'I don''t know what this is, but it sure doesn''t look like my contact information. Maybe you gave me the wrong thing?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'No, if it wasn''t for you, we would never have been in this mess. No. No, I still don''t like you. *ahem* Oh, excuse me, I was speaking with R2. You have been requested to take on this duty by *hmph* R2 of all people. The Alliance needs to have this delivered to the new leader of the cell.  Would you be so kind as to deliver it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Wonderful! Now, take this information to these coordinates. Your contact will be waiting for you there. Be safe in your travels!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Oh dear. I would''ve hoped that you were willing to perform this duty. Since you have proven yourself to R2 and I, I was so certain. Well, good day.   ....you stop your laughing, R2....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'It''s a list of contact information. You will be bringing it to the person who is taking over Taergle''s place as organizer of a small cell of eyes and ears for the Alliance. R2 says to guard this with your life, for many lives will be at stake if it gets into the wrong hands.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'I understand you must be quite busy. The Alliance appreciates anything you can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'How are you doing today? I find it to be quite oppressive *wink*, don''t you think?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'Oh dear. I would''ve hoped that you were willing to perform this duty. Since you have proven yourself to R2 and I, I was so certain. Well, good day.   ....you stop your laughing, R2....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Thank the Maker! You delivered it without the Empire finding out! This is wonderful news indeed. What''s that, R2? Yes, I think it''s about time you said that. R2 wishes to apologize for his exceptionally rude and crude, if I might add, behavior towards you. He wishes to thank you as well. He now believes you are smarter than he thought, and he wishes for you to take this reward for your assistance.  Really R2!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'My, my, you are efficient. Have you delivered the information yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'No problem.  I''ll take it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'Sorry, I have something else I need to do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Well, first what is it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'I had something come up. I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'No, not yet. I shall do so immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Ahhh... yes... nutritious comestibles for many. The Princess should be told that this will be held within our memories.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 107, 'npc_smuggle_2', 'Well, that droid wasn''t kidding. Tell the base that we''ll be able to make it back when the coast is clear. Thanks again, friend... you just saved a lot of lives!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 109, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Let me see... yes, these are my contacts. What? Well, I''ll be. Garello is a Rebel too? I would never have pegged him for a Rebel. Well, friend, I thank you for bringing this by. I can now start getting us organized again.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 110, 'gotowork', 'I think you have things to do, yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 111, 'npc_failure_1', 'Oh, that isn''t good news. What''s that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that without that food, the Selonians may not think of joining the Alliance. The Princess will be most disturbed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_2', 'Oh, that isn''t good news. What''s that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that without that medicine, some of their wounded will die. The Princess will be most disturbed by this news.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_3', 'Oh, that isn''t good news. What''s that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that the Princess will have to deliver the bad news to the rest of his family. I''m sure you tried your best, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 114, 'npc_failure_4', 'Oh, that isn''t good news. What''s that R2? Oh dear. R2 says that information was quite important and shouldn''t get into the wrong hands. I''m sure you tried your best, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Oh, what''s this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn''t correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 116, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Oh, what''s this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn''t correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 117, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Oh, what''s this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn''t correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 118, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Oh, what''s this? R2 says the information that is in the computer isn''t correct. He will try to recover it again. Please do ask again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 119, 'otherescort', 'No, I think you have the wrong guy.  Maybe there is someone around here that looks just like me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 120, 'player_reset', 'I don''t think I can handle this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 121, 'player_sorry', 'Sorry, I''ll get back to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 122, 'backtowork', 'Please don''t let us down.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 123, 'npc_reset', 'Ok, please return when you feel more comfortable working for the alliance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 124, 'notyet', 'My circuits must need cleaning.  What did you say?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/c3po.stf', 125, 'next', 'Please see our friend Qual''do Herm.  He may have some tasks for you as well.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Come in, don''t be shy. So, you''re the one I''ve heard so much about.  I am Captain Ackbar, responsible for much of our scattered fleet. Well, now that the introductions are over, on to matters of business. I have need of your skills in an operation that will help to hide some of our starships. Are you available?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'There have been some beneficial repercussions of your distraction assault. It seems there are some locals who have voiced their sympathy to our cause. One person in particular has offered to sell us some Imperial information at a reasonable price. Could I bother you to go represent us in this deal?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'I have some surprising information. It seems the bounty hunter who attacked you was... well... quite incompetant. He actually brought with him real information regarding guard schedules. I am going with my instincts this time and having this analyzed before walking into a potential trap. Could you deliver this to one of our operatives?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'The fact that you''ll be on this mission with us puts my mind at ease. I will need you to act as a special operative on this mission. In order to bring in a few damaged Corellian Corvettes, we need a distraction, which will be your part. You will need to go to this location and cause enough damage to draw the attention of the Empire. That''s when we can safely land the starships.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'I know this is not an exciting attack on the Empire, but this is still important nonetheless. Thank you for offering to help. Here''s where you''ll meet him to buy what he''s selling. Let me know when you''ve returned.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'You''ll be meeting with Teria Alessie out at a secret location. She''ll say the phrase, "The brighest stars burn out the fastest, wouldn''t you say?" in which you''ll respond with, "Every death makes room for new life". At that point, give her this datapad so that she can confirm if it''s real or not.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I understand. From what has been said of you, I feel this mission will go much more smoothly with your help. If you change your mind, please let me know as fast as possible.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as buying information can push the war in our favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as transporting information can push the war in our favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'It''s a well known fact that after the destruction of the Death Star, our base on Yavin IV has been under siege. We have re-established this emergency base after the Empire located our decoy base on the other side of Dantooine. Unfortunately, this planet is still under Imperial rule, therefore we have no permanent base for our small fleet of starships.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'He claims to have been a contractor working on the Death Star before it was destroyed and was able to steal codes relating to military guard movement schedules. I''m not sure how relevant it may be, but he is not asking too much for the information. We might be able to glean some information from it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'Her name is Teria Alessie, and she''s acting as a spy for us here on Dantooine. She has access to some information, and will be able to run these schedules through their databanks to confirm if it''s correct or not.  Once she has found out, she''ll be able to contact us with a positive or a negative.\n'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Wonderful, you''re back. The operation was a full success. While you enaged the Imperials, they sent several squads in your direction, diverting their sensors. We now have the Corvettes cleverly camoflaged while they undergo secret repairs. Your reputation is well deserved.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'What? Why didn''t I trust my feelings and recognize this as a trap? Well, I am sorry to have put you through that, friend. Let''s count ourselves lucky that Bounty Hunter wasn''t that skilled at his trade. I''ll still go through this information to see if it has any real information. Please, relax while we are looking through it, considering your close call.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'I''m glad you were able to make it there safely and back. Now all we have to do is wait for her report, then we can act. I thank you for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Always. How can I help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sure. I''ll make sure the information is purchased.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll do it. Where do you want me to take it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry Captain, but I''m a bit busy right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'That''s outside of my skills. No thanks.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Sorry, I''m not a courier. Get someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'What do you mean by "scattered fleet"?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What information are we buying?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Who is the operative?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Sorry, Captain, but I can''t be part of this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Yes I am. What am I to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'We need you to attack a squad of stormtroopers on the other side of the planet. Whilst you do so, we can engage our other team to direct the landing of a group Corvettes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'I understand. From what has been said of you, I feel this mission will go much more smoothly with your help. If you change your mind, please let me know as fast as possible.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Ah, I see you are a bit preoccupied with your time right now. When you have time for rather important matters, I would like to discuss them with you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Wait! You''re not a Rebel. Get out of here before we arrest you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Are you prepared for your mission?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Are you ready to go meet him?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Do you have a question about your assignment?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'What''s this? A Rebel! Don''t let them get away!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'I can''t believe you fools fell for it! The Empire''s going to pay a lot for your corpse!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'The brighest stars burn out the fastest, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 41, 'notit_3', 'Ummm... I though Ackbar said he had a datapad of information he needed me to confirm.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'All you have to do is pay our friend for the information he has. Once you have it, bring it back so that I can have one of our slicers pick through it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Her name is Teria, and she''ll meet you at the specified coordinates. All you need to do is give her the datapad.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as buying information can push the war in our favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Well, I understand that this is not glamorous, but not everything is flash and bang in our struggle. Sometimes the smallest thing such as transporting information can push the war in our favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Sorry, but this isn''t my style. I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'Yes I am. What exactly are my orders again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'Who am I supposed to give this to again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Aren''t you going to try to run so that I can chase you down?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'That''s something my mother used to always say. I don''t know what she meant by that, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'You don''t work for the Captain? I''m sorry, I thought you were someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Never mind. Move along.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'What''s this? This isn''t the Empire''s military information!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'I have just received the most exciting news since word of the Death Star''s destruction. Teria has relayed to me that all of this information is the real thing. What we have here is a comprehensive list of flight paths and guard changes. This needs to get to Admiral Bel Iblis immediately!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'A new Imperial General has been assigned to oversee Dantooine, replacing the one we captured. It looks as if his task is to destroy any remaining ''Rebels''. He is being escorted by a large number of unarmed, rookie Stormtroopers. Therefore, we will want to launch a quick hit-and-fade on the smaller group of armed ones. Will you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Thank you very much. I have contacted Bel Iblis and he has let me know that he''ll be sending his aide, Jeremes Kelton, to pick it up. Make sure it gets into his hands, for once the Admirial receives it, this may likely change the tides of this war into our favor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'Now, you need to listen to your orders very clearly. You will be the only one going out there to do this, for we want to make sure the Empire believes you''re acting alone. Attack the squadron and destroy them, then get out of there. We will be leaving a decoy body in the area to make it look like you didn''t survive.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Very well, then. I thought you would have wanted to help the Alliance a little more than you express right now. A shame, a shame.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'It''s not a foolish plan, it''s a desperate plan. Sometimes a person isn''t given too many options and just has to make the best of it. I hope you can see that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'What I am holding in my hands is a comprehensive list of ship flight paths, Star Destroyer patrols around this planet, guard schedule movements, names of officers in command, etcetera. In other words, this information will allow us to know what the Empire is doing even before they do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'Because it''s a trap! The information regarding guard schedules has been compromised.  I have a team who is ready to deal with the general, but I need you to take out those troopers beforehand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You''ll head out to a secret meeting location. I have provided your description so you will be recognized immediately. Give him the datapad and then come on back here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You will find it at the location listed in your datapad. We have another team there already to deposit the decoys after you''re done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'Let''s do this fast. I need to get back to the Admiral with the information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'What''s that over there? Rebels! Get them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'You can quit a job, but you cannot quit a cause. This is something that is in your heart, not mind. I am sorry to hear that you have lost your will to fight the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', 'It''s not a foolish plan, it''s a desperate plan. Sometimes a person isn''t given too many options and just has to make the best of it. I hope you can see that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'I have already been contacted by Admiral Bel Iblis and he tells me the information is in his hands. He is already beginning to move various splinters of the fleet to other areas. We have found some places on Dantooine alone that are never patrolled. Our war against the Empire looks like it has taken a turn for the good again. Thank you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Very good. According to the manner in which the Empire is responding to that, and by consulting the schedules, it would seem that they have fallen for the trick. If this new General is as pompous as the last one, then he will gloat over his success. That, in turn will hide our base all the more. Thank you for your help, friend. Now... I have been asked to direct you to Mon Mothma. She is awaiting you in the next room.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you contacted Jeremes yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Are you ready to depart?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll do it for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'I''ll help with your plan.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'I''m not taking any more documents anywhere.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I''m not interested in commiting suicide. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Why is this information so important?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'Why in blazes are we not attacking the General!?!?!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'I''m done with sending datapads around. I quit!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'I''ve changed my mind. I can''t do foolish plan anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'Where am I to meet him again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'Yes, I am. Where am I to do this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 108, 'npc_smuggle_3', 'Okay, let Ackbar know that I''ll check this information when I get back to the offices. Once I find out, I''ll send him the confirmation the ususal way. Good luck!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 109, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'This information will be essential to the future of the Alliance. With this, we can hide much of our fleet in safer locations until we can find a more permanant base. Ha! No more having to cause distractions.  I''ll get this to the Admiral immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 111, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Le me consult our battle plans so that I can choose the best place to cause a distraction. Please speak with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 112, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I''ll ask Lance where this sympathizer can be found right now. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 113, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I will have to contact her so that we can arrange a meeting place. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 114, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I have to designate where the meeting location will be. Once I find out, I''ll be able to tell you. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_5', 'I do not know where this area is. Let me consult the guard schedules to find out. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'Ummm... I think you have the wrong guy. Maybe that other person nearby was who you were looking for?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'Hmmm... I thank you for this, but I don''t think I''ll find a use for it. You should keep it yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'This is not good news. Without a adequate distraction, we will be unable to land these damaged ships without notice by the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'You mean this was just a hoax? He didn''t have any information? Ah, what a shame.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'I don''t understand why she wasn''t there. I can''t seem to contact her right now, so it''s possible she might have had to go into hiding if the Empire found out about her. We will be unable to use this information until we can confirm if it''s true, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'He never showed up? Let me contact Admiral Bel Iblis and find out what went wrong!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'You weren''t able to kill them all? This will not go good to hiding us even further.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 124, 'next', 'Mon Mothma is prepared to see you now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/captain_ackbar.stf', 125, 'notyet', 'I need someone to find and talk to our friend Han Solo.  Can you do that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'How are you doing, kid? Both Leia and Nien told me you can be counted on, which is what I need right now. If they haven''t already told you, I''m here to try to hook up a deal for the Alliance with one of the biggest smuggler pirates this side of the Outer Rim. I need you to go let an old associate know I need to get in contact with Nym. Can you do that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'I can''t believe that Nym! Who does he think he is?! He''s doing this just to get back at me! *sigh* Well, I guess I''m going to have to play by his rules. I''m going to need your help for this one if you don''t mind. I need you to help recover a stolen item of Nym''s before he''ll talk to me about any deals. Can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'I''ve just had E''Dycu tell Nym that I''m not going to be playing this game of his anymore. Nym has agreed to talk trade as long as I take care of the rest of that pirate band that has been bothering him lately. Again, I''m gonna need your help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'That''s what I wanted to hear. Now look, the guy you''re looking for is E''Dycu, an old smuggler I used to work with. Let him know I''m here, and bring him back so I can talk with him face to face. I know E''Dycu will still be able to get in touch with Nym so I can try to broker a deal for the Alliance. Good luck, kid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Okay, I''m going to go make a lot of noise with the Falcon next to the bandits'' hideout. This should scare them out of their den, which is where you come in. You tell the guy who has it that you''re not leaving without something called a ''Holocron''. Watch out, because this guy sounds like he prefers action over words.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'This is what we''ll have to do. Nym has let me know where the bandit''s leader can be found. You need to go out there and put a stop to him. The rest of his crew will then scatter to different parts of the Rim, Nym will then sell the spoils of his raids to Leia, and we''ll all be happy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Come on, kid. It''s nothing more than a simple message delivery, and maybe bring him back here. So what if you have to keep an eye out for the worst pirates not under Jabba''s employ?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Look, I don''t want to do this either, but Leia and Luke have managed to keep convincing me help out. The sooner we can do this, the faster we can leave. Do it for me, kid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'You think I like doing this too? I''m only doing this because Luke and Leia are convinced I can get Nym to sell us some of his spoils for use by the Alliance. Look, if you help, maybe I can hook you up with a reward from the Alliance. Think about it...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Yeah... I guess you could say that. Look, before I was part of the whole destruction of the Death Star thing, well, let''s just say I didn''t have the most respectable of jobs. This Nym guy used to hire me before I started working for Jabba, but let''s just say I made a bunch of people angry around here when I left. Let''s just leave it at that, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Of course I can get it myself! I''ve made the Kessel Run in under 12 parsecs and was there at the Death Star run.  Someone has to cause the commotion, and I don''t see you with a starship nearby.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'Well, Nym ain''t that great of a guy.  Matter of fact, when me and Chewie went to go work for Jabba - the worst decision I ever made, I might add - Nym and I had a few, well, not-so-nice words to say to each other. These pirates we''re taking care of are a step worse, though. They''re taking slaves and selling them to the Empire, which Nym is actually against, go figure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Hey-hey...E''Dycu! Long time no see, buddy! Just give me a moment. Hey, kid, let me talk with E''Dycu for a little bit here. Why don''t you see if Chewie wants to play a game of holochess with you. ...........Oh yeah... Make sure he wins.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Well, this looks like what he was talking about. According to E''Dycu, Nym said this used to belong to one of his friends before she died, and he''s keeping it for sentimental value. That pirate sent me out to pick up a piece of junk! Well, I''ll tell him a thing or two. Either way, thanks kid, your help was needed out there. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Good work, kid. I could''ve used you when I was still smuggling,you know that? Okay, now with that done, Nym had better give us a good deal on these supplies. I''ll have E''Dycu contact him again, then we can get out of here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Sounds easy enough. Sure, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I can help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'Sounds like fun. I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, but I can''t do it right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I''m not interested in helping a pirate king, Han. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Sorry, Han, but I don''t agree with this. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'I take it you don''t want to be seen around here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Can''t you get the item yourself?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'What''s the difference between Nym and these pirates?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I can''t find him and I don''t want to look any more.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Not yet. I think I''ll go look for him again.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Well, good luck kid. When a person doesn''t want to be found, it makes the job all the more difficult.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Come on, kid. It''s nothing more than a simple message delivery, and maybe bring him back here. So what if you have to keep an eye out for the worst pirates not under Jabba''s employment?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Hey kid, why don''t you come back when you are a little less busy, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'I don''t know you, right? How about we keep it that way?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'So, were you able to find E''Dycu?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you find the thing Nym wants back?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you put a stop to that pirate leader?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Whatever the problem is, I didn''t do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'I knew that raid would get Nym''s attention! Kill him, boys!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Nym isn''t going to be the Pirate King for too long. You''re going to die now, you hear?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'No, Nym said that he wanted a ''Holonomocron'', or something like that. From how he described it, this doesn''t look like it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Well get back out there. I can''t pull off my part without you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Well hurry it up. The faster we can do business, the faster we can get off this planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Look, I don''t want to do this either, but Leia and Luke have managed to keep convincing me help out. The sooner we can do this, the faster we can leave. Do it for me, kid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'You think I like doing this too? I''m only doing this because Luke and Leia are convinced I can get Nym to sell us some of his spoils for use by the Alliance. Look, if you help, maybe I can hook you up with a reward from the Alliance. Think about it...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t want to involve myself with this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I''m not enjoying this. I''m going to stop doing this now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'Not yet, but I think I will soon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'Not yet. He''ll be stopped soon.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'You''re a friend of Han Solo''s you say? Well, it''s been a while since I''ve seen that scoundrel. Take me to where he is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Nevermind. I thought you were working for Nym.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Sorry, I thought you worked for Nym. Never mind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Oh, you''re not Han''s friend after all. Well, thanks for the help, bub.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'I think it would be in your best interests if you left. Immediately.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 59, 'notit_5', 'What''s this!? This ain''t the money! Is Solo trying to pull another one past us again? Why I oughta...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'Why that lowdown, rotten, fink! Nym refused to involve himself with the Rebellion! When I get my hands on him, I''m goi- ...hold on a sec, kid, my commlink''s acting up... What do you want now? Huh? Okay, try to hold them off - I''ll send some help right now! Kid... a friend of mine''s been ambushed by Imperials. You''ve got to go save him!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'Okay, things have turned out for the best after all that. Nym has agreed to sell his current surplus to the Alliance. While I''m contacting Leia to let her know how this has turned out, I''m gonna need you to deliver the downpayment to his money guy. Will you do that one last thing for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Okay, he said he was holed up out at these coordinates. Since we are closer than any of Nym''s guys, he contacted me for help, which means he''s really desperate. He may not be the best of guys, but we go way back and I owe him a couple. If he''s been wounded, bring him back here so I can try to patch him up.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'Okay, kid, you''re going to need to meet up with his bruiser, Nateba Kerr. Nateba will then take the money back to Nym, then we can get out of here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Look, he''s not as bad as you think he is. I''ve worked with a bunch of bad people, and he''s a lot better than most. I need you to bring him back while I take out the rest of the Imperials. Just take my word for it, kid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', '*sigh* Kid, here''s the truth. I needed you to do this for me because when I last left here, Nym let me know that if I ever stepped foot on Lok ever again, he''d kill me himself. I''ve already got Jabba after me, I don''t want to risk finding out if Nym was telling the truth or not.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'Well, while we were talking, he said a little bit ago the Empire tried forcing Nym to either work for them or they''ll put him out of business. I guess this is intended to be a message to Nym they were serious. Who knows... if this turns out good, this might actually be our lucky day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'Nym makes a living plying the space-lanes and hitting cargo ships. A while back, he hit an Imperial convoy of freighters carrying shipments of bacta. Nym has a lot left over and is willing to sell his supply to the Rebellion now. Other than that, he''s not picking sides... and knowing him, I don''t think anyone will ever be able to convince him otherwise.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'What are you waiting for! Go out there and save him already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Well hurry it up. The faster we can finish this business, the faster we can get off this planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'Hey! You''re Han''s friend! Help me out with these Imperial toadies! I can''t do anything, my blaster''s jammed!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'You''d best have the money, or you''d best get out of here, you know what I''m saying?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'Look, he''s not as bad as you think he is. I''ve worked with a bunch of bad people, and he''s a lot better than most. I need you to bring him back while I take out the rest of the Imperials. Just take my word for it, kid.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', '*sigh* Kid, here''s the truth. I needed you to do this for me because when I last left here, Nym let me know that if I ever stepped foot on Lok ever again, he''d kill me himself. I''ve already got Jabba after me, I don''t want to risk finding out if Nym was telling the truth or not.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Thanks for doing that. I made sure the rest of the Imperials weren''t able to send for reinforcements. Now, after Chewie makes sure his wounds won''t kill him, I''m gonna have a little sit-down talk with my friend. Hopefully I can persuade him to convince Nym that we should start negotiations again.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'He''s keeping the bacta in ''The Old Place'', huh? Yeah, I still know where that is. I''ll fly us over there so we can bring it back to the base on Dantooine. Speaking of which, I told Leia how much help you''ve been. She''s asked me to tell you to meet with Captain Ackbar on Dantooine if you wish to keep helping. Thanks for your help, kid... I owe you one.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 85, 'npc_takeme_4', 'I''ve been shot, and shot pretty good, too. Can you help me back to your hideout?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Huh? What do you need?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Did you pay them yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'You''re right I''ll help!! Where is he?!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'Don''t worry, Nym will get his money.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'That''s what he gets! No, I''m not helping!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I think you should give him the money, not me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Why was he ambushed by Imperials?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'What exactly is the Alliance buying?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'Han, I can''t help this pirate out.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'Han, I think you should do this, not me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'Nothing. Just wanted to say ''Hi''.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'Not yet. I''m about to leave now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 110, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'Let me count it...... Okay, it''s all here. Nym says that the bacta is going to be in ''The Old Place''.  I''m also supposed to give Solo a good fist to the face for old time''s sake, so you''re lucky I don''t know you. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 111, 'noloc_1', 'Let me see if I can remember where he used to hang out. This was a long time ago, so give me a few minutes, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 112, 'noloc_2', 'Let me go start up the Falcon, then I''ll let you know where their hideout is. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 113, 'noloc_3', 'Let me see where Nym said this guy can be found. Check back with nme in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 114, 'noloc_4', 'Let me check the map to see where those coordinates are. Check with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 115, 'noloc_5', 'Let me find out where you''re supposed to meet his money guy. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'Aaargghh... I think ye be pickin'' the wrong person... ye be best to look around nearby.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'I don''t need this. Keep it for yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'What do you mean he''s no longer on Lok? Awww... but he has to be! What am I going to tell Leia?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'What do you mean he said he sold it!? You believed him?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'I was hoping you could have handled this guy. I guess I''ll go do this myself now. I''ve got to go now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'He''s dead?! Oh, this is not good....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'Okay, let me get this straight... You''re saying a Jawa leaped out from behind a boulder and stole the money?... Let''s go over this again...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 124, 'next', 'You should go to Dantooine.  Ackbar is looking for some help I hear.  He could use somebody like you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/han_solo.stf', 125, 'notyet', 'Talk to Nien.  I''m too busy right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome, welcome. Please come in. You have been highly recommended by both Leia and Mon Mothma. As you can tell, our base in under heavy siege, and won''t last too much longer. Right now, I am in need of your fabled skills to help some transports leave the planet. Can you help with this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'I am once again in need of you. One of our deep Intelligence teams has uncovered some very important military information regarding the Empire, but were unaware that that our base was under siege. They have landed far away from here to be safe, but they need to be escorted back here safely. Can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Watch your head! Feel that shaking? It''s the Empire ramping up their bombing efforts... they know we''re weakening.  At this rate, I''m not sure we''ll be able to get everyone out to safety. I need you for an operation that will hopefully slow them down. Can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'At this location, you will find a group of camouflaged transports that are to be leaving the planet. Every one of them is full of refugees from our bases, and they are being attacked by a band of stormtroopers. Eliminate the stormtrooper threat before they prevent the ships from ever leaving the planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Here is where their last communication came from. You should find their team out there waiting for your arrival. Once you find them, return back here immediately with them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Okay, I will need you to take out a group of stormtroopers that''s causing us trouble. If you can do this, you will buy us a lot more time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I''m sorry, I don''t think I heard you correctly. Did you just say that you are willing to let the Empire destroy many innocent lives?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Please reconsider. There aren''t too many able bodied people left here, and I trust you can get the job done.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'I understand, but you must understand as well : you are our only hope.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'This has been our base for some time now, but with the Death Star being destroyed we have revealed our presence to the the Empire. Most of the base''s personnel have been evacuated off the planet, but many still need to leave. With a host of X-Wings still left to cause distractions, we can safely see the rest of them off planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'They have been infilitrating the Empire for a few years now, only recently coming out from their disguise. They claim to have information regarding the exact fleet size of the Empire, and also the sectors they patrol regularly. This information has the potential to be the most important information we have seen in a long time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'The Empire is using a number of T.I.E. Bombers to keep up a steady attack.  Vader has a group of stormtroopers on the planet that are giving him coordinates to bomb.  I''m not sure why he''s steering clear of these temples, but whatever the case may be, his bombing campaign is beginning to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'With those Stormtroopers taken care of, the transports were able to leave the planet safely. We have lost many X-Wings, but fortunately there aren''t too many more needed to leave the planet. You did good work. I will have need of you again shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'This information will be a great help indeed. From the quick look I had of it, it seems that the Empire hasn''t changed their protocols since I was a Captain. You didn''t know that? Yes... I was one of the first Captains of the Imperial Class Star Destroyers. That, though, was a long time ago. When we are all done, I''ll see to it that everyone of them are scuttled and turned into plowshares.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'With the bombing out of the way, it will take the Empire''s forces quite a bit longer to rearm from their Star Destroyers. This should give us much more time to get the remaining people off of this base. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'I''ll help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'I''ll go lead them here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll take part of the operation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I don''t have the time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'No, I''m a bit busy right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'No thanks... a bit too scary for me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Why are we evacuating the planet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Who is this team I''m helping?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'How is the Empire conducting the siege?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I can''t do this mission for you anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'What did I need to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You need to get to those transports now before they are blown sky high! Eliminate the Stormtroopers causing the problem.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'I understand you have other things to do, but I deperately need your help. Could you please attend to your business then return as soon as possible?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Move along.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Why haven''t you left yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you have a question?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'There''s a Rebel! Kill him!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Help!  I''m the only one left from our team and I think I''m heavily wounded.....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'You will need to locate the infiltration team and escort them back here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You need to locate the stormtroopers sending coordinates and take them out.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 51, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Ugh... slowly... the rest of the team were killed by these... strange... things in the... jungle. Hurry... we have to get this... information back to General... Dodonna.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Oh. I thought you were someone else. You''d best be running along now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'You weren''t sent by General Dodonna? I see. Look, you might want to get out of here before it gets dangerous, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'What''s this? This isn''t the datapad that the General told me to deliver. Come on, we don''t have much time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 59, 'notit_5', 'Umm... I''m not too sure what this is. Are you sure this is what General Dodonna wanted you to bring me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'I have made an important discovery among the information the infiltration team has brought back. This information may help us to create a permanent base once again, one far away from Imperial probes. I dare not transmit this information where it can be intercepted, therefore I need you to deliver this to a pilot who will fly it to Mon Mothma.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'This is horrible!  Nateba was shot down by a turbolaser battery before he was able to make it out of the atmosphere. Other than Luke, who''s helping escort others off the planet, I don''t have anyone else to deliver the information. Wait... I''ll have to get another pilot.  I''ll need you to deliver this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Take the information encoded on the datapad to Nateba Kurr, one of the last X-Wing pilots I have available on the planet. Once he has it, he''ll depart to Dantooine and deliver it promptly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'Since Nateba Kurr''s X-Wing was completely obliterated, there''s no wreckage to recover the datapad from. Fortunately, I made another copy of this info for myself. Look... this is the last copy we have. It''s vital that it makes it to safety... I''m sure he''ll be able to avoid the turbolaser on his way off planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Look, we need to get this information to our current base, and you''re the only one I trust that can get it there. Please reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'What? This is very important! This could save the lives of thousands of the Rebellion! Ask yourself if you''ll be able to live with yourself if you refuse this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'As I said earlier, I was one of the first Star Destroyer captains when they were comissioned by the Old Republic, before the Emperor took over. With that experience, I can tell by looking at this information that the flight paths of the Empire''s Star Destroyers seem to overlook a few systems in thier patrols. The one that interests me the most is a small system called Hoth.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'It''s the only chance!  You''ve got to deliver that information!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You need to deliver the locations of potential base sites to Nateba Kurr. Once you have done so, Nateba will then be able to deliver the information to Mon Mothma himself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You need to get this vital data to Luke Skywalker immediately!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'Hurry! I need to get that information to High Command before I''m spotted by any T.I.E.s.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'Hello. You must be the person General Dodonna told me to expect.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Nateba has let me know that he is already inputting the navigation codes to Dantooine and should be off-planet within a few minutes. Thank you for getting that information there safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Okay, I feel much better knowing that Mon Mothma has this information. If there''s anyone who can manuever his way around turbolasers, it will be him. In order to speed up the evacuation of a group of archaelogists, would you mind going out to help Luke?  He should be just along this passage, deeper in the ruins.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'What do you need?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'You''re not gone yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll make sure it gets there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'I''ll take it to him right away!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'I''m a bit busy right now. Maybe some other time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I''m not running out with that information again. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'How were you able to find out so fast?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'Wait... what if HE gets shot down?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 109, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Okay, great! I''ll get back to my X-Wing and have my R2 unit plot a course to Dantooine. Good luck out here, and make sure you make it out of here alive, you got that? We can''t afford to lose good people like you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 110, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'Okay, from what General Dodonna said, this information needs to get to Mon Mothma''s hands herself. Let the General know that I''ll make sure it safely gets to her. Thanks for your help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 111, 'noloc_1', 'Let me get the coordinates of the transports. Ask me again in a few minutes. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 112, 'noloc_2', 'Let me get the coordinates of the landing site. Ask me again in a few minutes. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 113, 'noloc_3', 'Let me get the coordinates of the repair facility. Ask me again in a few minutes. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 114, 'noloc_4', 'I''ll contact Nateba and find out where he''ll meet you. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 115, 'noloc_5', 'Lert me contact Luke and find out where he can meet you. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'I don''t know who you are. Maybe you''re here to meet the person that was a little over there...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'I''m busy waiting for something right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'We have received word that four of our transports have been destroyed whilst still on the ground. On board those transports were 200 men and women. I hope you remember this day for a long time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'The information that they held was quite important. It very well could have changed the face of this Civil War. The fact that you let them die will be remembered by me for a long, long time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'With the Empire still being able to rearm as fast as they can bomb, I''m not sure how much time is left with this temple.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'Without that information getting to Mon Mothma in time, we may not be able to begin relocation to Hoth without being seen.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'That was the last copy of the information we had. We may never be able to move our way out to that system any longer.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 124, 'notyet', 'I can''t speak with you unless Mon Mothma has given you clearance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 125, 'next', 'Go find Luke.  I''m worried something might have happened to him.  He''s just along the corridor here, deeper in the temple.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_3', 'Don''t let them stop us! Keep broadcasting!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 127, 'player_sorry_2', 'What did I need to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 128, 'player_sorry_3', 'What did I need to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 129, 'player_sorry_4', 'What did I need to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 130, 'player_sorry_5', 'What did I need to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 131, 'player_reset_2', 'I can''t do this mission for you anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 132, 'player_reset_3', 'I can''t do this mission for you anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 133, 'player_reset_4', 'I can''t do this mission for you anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 134, 'player_reset_5', 'I can''t do this mission for you anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 135, 'npc_reset_2', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 136, 'npc_reset_3', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_4', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_5', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/jan_dodonna.stf', 139, 'npc_reset', 'I''ll find someone else to help that has more to offer, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'It''s good to meet you, soldier. I''ve been told by Solo to expect you, and you arrived just in time. I need immediate assistance regarding a deployment that is about to go horribly wrong if it goes unchecked. I need you to go to location of our old abandoned base and harry the stormtroopers that are stationed there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'I''ve just received a transmission from Solo. He''s in high orbit around Dantooine right now, and it seems he has a large shipment of bacta with him as well. Since my troops are still in transit from their successful operation, I''m short a few hands. Do you think you can help Solo land his YT-1300?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'I need your help to pull this off. I''m not too keen on the plan, but it''s been approved by both Ackbar and Mon Mothma, so what can I do, eh? I need you to help steal an Imperial Lambda-Class shuttle. Do you want to involve yourself in this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'That''s the answer I wanted to hear. These coodinates will lead you to the last known location of a group of stormtroopers near our abandoned base. You need to harrass them to draw the attention of the Empire, then get out of there. In other words, go destroy them then hightail it out of there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Well, I can''t say I trust the reformed smuggler too much, but we need all the help we can get. You need to go to this landing area and remove any potential Imperial eyes. If you see any Probots or Stormtroopers, destroy them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Here are the coordinates of a squadron of Stormtoopers that have landed from that shuttle. They are investigating an unauthorized landing, which was Solo of course. What I need you to do is to wipe out that squadron, and bring the pilot''s initialization codes back here. I''ll then be able to send a team to recover the shuttle.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Unless you''re a different person than the person recommended by Han and Leia, then I don''t understand. You ARE the one who helped them, right...?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I can''t say I blame you. I don''t care how much Leia insists we can trust him, I''m still a bit sketchy about him. Either way, we still need the bacta. I''ll give you a couple of minutes to think about it, then get back to me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Sounds like you''ve got a solid head on your shoulders there. If I weren''t ordered to oversee this plan, I wouldn''t be part of it, either. If you change your mind, I wouldn''t pass up your help, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Currently I have a covert operation in effect. A strike squad is about to perform a land based hit-and-fade maneuvre on an Imperial cargo landing site. We have just received word that a large detachment of Stormtroopers is about to set up a patrol around the area. Your attack will distract them long enough for us to finish the operation.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Well, I never believed he''d be able to get his hands on that much bacta to begin with. The answer is no, actually. This base is being used for now until we can find a more permanent one due to the fact that our Yavin base was found. This bacta is supposed to go out to Yavin to help with the siege, but Han can''t get it there... for now, that is.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'It seems that a bunch of Bothans that are helping the Alliance have come up with the idea to steal an Imperial shuttle, then change the authorization codes. They have managed to gather a number of codes to shuttles that they can use to replace the existing ones. I guess this is more an experiment than anything else. And I don''t like it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Well done. Well done, indeed. The strike team has just reported back in and the assault was a success. Thank you for your help. Now that it''s not so hectic, let me introduce myself - I''m Harrind Lance, but you can call me Lieutenant. Your help here at our base will be a relief. I may have futher need of you later. For now, take a little R&R.');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Good work. I''m glad that Leia recommended you to us here. Keep this up, and I''m sure that Captain Ackbar may assign you to work for him. Take a breather for now, because I see something coming up that I can use you for.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Now that we have the initialization code, we can load up the shuttle and get most of this bacta to Yavin. I pity the person who is going to be piloting this mission. Thank you for your help, friend. I''ve been asked by Captain Ackbar to direct you to him. He''s heard of you and needs your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Understood. I can help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Yeah, I can. Me and Solo go way back.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'Sounds quite bold. Sure!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I don''t think I can help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Sorry, I''ve helped him too much already. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'That''s crazy! No, I won''t be part of this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'What went wrong with the battle plan?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Is this where the bacta shipment was originally headed?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Back up there, Lieutenant. What kind of plan is this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'You caught me as I was leaving.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Double-time, soldier! We have little time to spare!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Unless you''re a different person than the person recommended by Han and Leia, then I don''t understand. You ARE the one who helped them, right...?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Greetings. I''m Lieutenant Lance - well, actually I''m Harrind Lance, but around here I''m the Lieutenant. I keep a clean operation around here, so if you have nothing you can contribute, I''m going to have to ask you to move out of the way. When you''re not busy, we can talk.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'You haven''t left yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Did you find anything out there?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'What do you need?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Sir, over there! We have movement!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hey, there''s one! Set blasters to stun!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'You must be part of the group that landed! Eliminate the Rebel!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Double-time, soldier! Solo will have to land before he''s spotted by a Star Destroyer patrol.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'He should have on him a numeric sequence that will start the shuttle. All Imperial Lambda shuttles have these security measures on them so no one comes running up to the shuttle and takes it. Which is, of course, what we''re planning to do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'I can''t say I blame you. I don''t care how much Leia insists we can trust him, I''m still a bit sketchy about him. Either way, we still need the bacta. I''ll give you a couple of minutes to think about it, then get back to me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Sounds like you''ve got a solid head on your shoulders there. If I weren''t ordered to oversee this plan, I wouldn''t be part of it, either. If you change your mind, I wouldn''t pass up your help, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Sorry, but I''m tired of helping out Solo.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'Sorry, but I can be part of this hare-brained plan anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'You caught me as I was leaving.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'What was I supposed to get from the pilot?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Move along. This area is restricted.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'If you''re not the suspect, then get out of here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 109, 'gotowork', 'No, this is not the initialization codes for the shuttle. I need the codes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 111, 'npc_failure_1', 'Our intelligence shows that our strike team has all been wiped out. Every last one of them dead. Those were some good men and women. I hope you can sleep tonight.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_2', 'Solo has to land now before he''s spotted by a Star Destoyer. I sure hope there''s nothing out there that will find him when he lands.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_3', 'The pilot didn''t have any codes on him? Oh well. I guess I''ll tell Ackbar that this plan was a failure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 114, 'npc_noloc_1', 'The location of the troops were around here a moment ago. Let me find them again, then get back to me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me contact Han Solo and find out where he plans on landing. Once I''ve found out, check with me again.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 116, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me check these schematics so that we can triangulate the location of the stormtrooper squad. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 117, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Move along. This area is restricted.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/lt_lance.stf', 118, 'next', 'Sorry, I''m just getting myself together before I go on assignment.  Can''t talk now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Oh, hello! What''s that? General Dodonna sent you to help me? Well, I sure could use a hand out here. This is hard work! Okay, we''re evacuating a group of archaeologists and boarding them on a transport. I''ll go get one of the work crews, but I''ll need you to get the supervisor. Would that be alright?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Awwww maaann!!! Something took a big chunk out of my R2 unit. I saw a bunch of broken teeth lying on the ground, so at least it stopped before it could do any more damage. Look, I need you help me find the little creature that swallowed my R2 unit''s motivator unit. Can you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'We''ve got some bad news, friend. I just spoke with the supervisor of this expedition team, and he says that they''re missing one of the guys. He told me where the guy was last digging, but I need to make sure my R2 unit is fixed before we leave. Do you think you could go out and bring him back here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Okay, the supervisor has been contacted and told to wait for his escort. Once you find him, just bring him back here. I should be back with the rest of the crew in that time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Okay, I''ll go check this way, you go check that way. I''m not sure what took a bite out of my droid, but it didn''t look too large judging by the teeth. It more than likely swallowed the part, so we''ll have to cut the little bugger open, I guess. Meet me back here if you find it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Thanks a lot, friend, I really appreciate it. By the time you get back with him, I should have my R2 unit fixed.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Weren''t you supposed to be helping me? I can''t do this all by myself! You mean you''ll let me gather up everyone while you do nothing? That''s not fair!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Well, I guess I''ll go do it all by myself then. I wish you''d lend me hand!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Come on!!! All you have to do is go find the guy! Is it that hard of you to do?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'They were here on Yavin IV before we set up our base here. A few of them were Pro-Rebel, so they contacted Mon Mothma and General Dodonna saying that these temples would be a good base. Since they let us use their area while they were digging through the ruins, we are rather obligated to help them get out before they get hurt, wouldn''t you say?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'There''s all kinds of wierd creatures in these jungles, I can''t even begin to list them all. I grew up on Tatooine, ever heard of it? We had womp rats and kreetles out there, but some of these things give me the creeps! The only thing I can imagine being worse than living in a jungle is living in some kind of swamp. Ugh!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'The supervisor says that this guy was working deep inside one of the temples and was insisting that he was about to make a discovery. Apparently the guy was so caught up in his work, he didn''t bother to pay attention to the return call. It sounds simple, but look... I have a bad feeling about this, so be careful, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Great work. I''ve gathered up all of the crew here, and now we can get them off the planet. Look, I need to get back to my X-Wing... I think I saw something lurking around it, and I can''t afford to try to fly these guys escort if my ship is damaged. I''ll be back in a bit.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'You found it? We''re saved! Thanks! I''ll get this back to my R2 unit and fix it up. Fortunately I''m pretty good at fixing up droids and the like. It''s like the way I fly, you know? It just comes to me. Check back with me in a little bit so we can get out of here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Whoa! You took that thing all by yourself? If I would have known, I would have gone out there with you. I got this lightsaber from a friend... he said it was my dad''s... and I''ve been wanting to practice with it. From the sound of it, that would have been good target practice. I''ll get this guy onboard the ship, then we can leave.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Of course I can help!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'I''ll help you track it down.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll go get him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, but I thought this would be more interesting. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Nevermind. I don''t want to look for critters.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Sorry, Luke, but I don''t do escort work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'What are archaelogists doing in our base?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What kinds of creatures are here on Yavin?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Why wasn''t this guy with the rest of them?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 27, 'player_reset', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 28, 'player_sorry', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You need to find one of the supervisors of their expedition and bring him back here so that they can be transported off the planet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 30, 'npc_reset', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Hello there. I sure could use a hand out here, when you have the time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'You''re not the guy here to take me back? Well, where in the heck is he?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Did you forget something?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Yeah?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Did you need something before you left?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Ho there! Are you the guy who''s going to bring me to the escape ship?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Ohhhh... please.... help me. I''ve been bit by that thing and my vision is getting hazy....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 40, 'notit_2', 'No, no, no! This isn''t the motivator for my R2 unit! I don''t know what it is, but it''s not a motivator!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Look around for something about this big, missing some teeth. It should have my R2 unit''s motivator on it or inside it''s stomach. Bring it back when you find it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You need to find the last archaeologist that''s out near the Massassi ruins. Once you find him, bring him back here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Great, let''s get out of here then. I don''t want to be left behind without a crew of diggers, if you know what I''m saying.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 52, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Oh, thank you so much. I don''t think I could have made it back by myself. I want to get as far away from this planet as I can. Maybe then the voices will go away.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Please... go send for help... tell my supervisor I have always loved him....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Ahh... you are not the one... you are someone elsssse... perhapsss you are to be initiated, yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'Nah, this doesn''t look like what he described.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 59, 'notit_5', 'Nooo.... the prophecy lied.... it said you would bring the knowledge of the master to us....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'Hey, I need you to do something. I''m going to try to patch this guy up before I take him to the transport. He said that he found a wierd looking box in the chamber that creature was in. Something tells me that box is important, and I really want to look at it. Can you go get it for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'Hey, do you think you can do me one last favor?  Can you go deliver this box-thing to someone out in the jungle? This thing gives me the creeps, and for some reason I don''t want the Imperials to find it after we leave. So, can you do this for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Good. I put on your datapad the area he said he found the box. He said he thought he saw two of those creatures, so the other one might have taken it by now. Do whatever you have to do to get it, but bring me back that box. It sounds... well, it sounds very interesting.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'Great. You should be able to find a tribe of people out there in the jungles that will be will be waiting for this. Why, I don''t know..... ummm... just go get it to them.... that thing makes me really uneasy...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'What? Whatever... I guess I''ll go do it myself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'What? Did you tell me No?? How dare you!?!? I''m Luke Skywalker, and my father was a powerful Jedi Knight!! Now, I''m going to give you a few minutes to think about what you said, and let you change your mind. Got it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'I don''t know. He said he had just a few moments to see what it looked like. From his description, it looks like some jeweled box in the shape of a pyramid. What is was doing being kept hidden in a temple, I can''t say. I have a wierd feeling that the box is very, very important, though. What was that? Oh, sorry... I thought I heard you say something.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'I don''t know, to tell you the truth. It''s weird looking, wouldn''t you say? I''ve been looking for a way to open it, but I can''t find anything. Huh? Sorry... I could''ve sworn you just said something. I have bad feeling about this thing, and don''t want it around me anymore. Either way, I think someone named Kyp or maybe Exar owns it... don''t ask me why, I just know.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Go find the box that the archaeologist was describing, then bring it back so I can take a look at it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You need to get this box to a tribe of people out in the jungles. Once you deliver it to them, come on back.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'Yesss.... you are the one that was foretold.... you have the blessed piece with you, correct?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Great! Now, let me take a look at this. Wow! It''s gorgeous! Huh? Did you say something? Oh... sorry... must be hearing things. Anyways, I''ll check this thing out to see if there''s some way to open it. I bet you there''s priceless treasure inside!!! Check back with me in a little bit to see if I found a way to open it. Huh? Oh.. uh.. nevermind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'You gave it to them, right? You know, I already feel so much better with that thing gone. Anyways, thank you for your help, friend. I''m going to get these guys out of here now. Hmmm... you know something? This place is actually rather calming... I may have to come back here someday when the war is over. I kinda like it. Take care, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Are you going to get it yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Have you taken it to them yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'Sure, I''ll get it for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'Sure, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'No thanks. I''m not going back out there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'You know what? You do it yourself, Luke. I''m not going to.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'What does this box look like?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'What is that thing? Is it just a box for holding things?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 110, 'npc_smuggle_5', 'Oh...wonderfuuullll.... just as the prophecy said... may the Dark Lord look over you.....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 111, 'noloc_1', 'Let me find out where the supervisor can be found. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 112, 'noloc_2', 'What''s that?... Hmmmm... I don''t know why, but I feel I may know which way it went. Check with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 113, 'noloc_3', 'Let me find out where he is. Check back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 114, 'noloc_4', 'Let me ask him where he was when he saw it. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 115, 'noloc_5', 'Let me think where those guys are. I''ve never seen them before, but I have a good idea where they might be. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'Nope. You''ve got the wrong guy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'No, this isn''t what I asked for. Could you come back with the right one, pleease?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'Did you just say that the supervisor was killed? Oh man... the General is going to kill me!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'You couldn''t find it either? Well, I guess I''ll have to try some tricky moves while I''m up there. Thanks for looking, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'You mean he was already dead when you go there? I''ll have to tell this to the supervisor. You stay here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'It was gone when you got there? That''s a shame. You know what, though? Something tells me that box is still out there...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'You couldn''t find them out there? That''s wierd. I know they''re out there somewhere... well, I don''t KNOW they''re there, I just have a real good feeling they are.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 124, 'notyet', 'I can''t talk to you right now.  Go see Jan Dodonna if you need something to do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 125, 'next', 'I don''t have anymore work for you.  The Alliance thanks you though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 126, 'player_reset_1', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 127, 'player_reset_2', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 128, 'player_reset_3', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 129, 'player_reset_4', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 130, 'player_sorry_1', 'What am I doing again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 131, 'player_sorry_2', 'What am I doing again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 132, 'player_sorry_3', 'What am I doing again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 133, 'player_sorry_4', 'What am I doing again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 134, 'player_sorry_5', 'What am I doing again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 135, 'npc_reset_1', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 136, 'npc_reset_2', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 137, 'npc_reset_3', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 138, 'npc_reset_4', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 139, 'npc_reset_5', 'What?! You can''t be serious!! I need you to help me!! I want to leave this planet and if you don''t help I''ll be here for a lot longer!!! Come on, already!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 140, 'notit', 'This isn''t what I asked you to bring me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/luke_skywalker.stf', 141, 'player_reset_5', 'I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome. I have a very important assignment that I feel I can only entrust to you, considering all you have done for the Alliance already. I need you to deliver this holovid of the attack on the Death Star to one of our spies. Can you do that?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'I have a more important mission for you, if you wish to undertake it. The recent information of troop schedules has helped us significantly in our efforts to keep this base hidden. From our information, it would appear that there is a strike team being sent to investigate recent activity. We need that team prevented from acheiving their task.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'The Alliance has enacted a plan that should buy us even more secrecy than before. The plan has gone according to plan, and what I need now from you is to take part of the recovery team. I will need you to find the escape pod of the Captain of a Corvette and escort her back here. Can you do this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Here is the holovid that needs to be broadcasted. I have arranged a site for you to meet our Bothan friend. I will provide your description to her so that she recognizes you and only you. Please go with this now, for we don''t have too much time. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Judging by the standard operation procedures of the Empire, the strike team will likely land far away. We have triangulated where they should be, therefore we have the element of surprise assisting us. I am certain that you can do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Thank you. Her name is Captain Altapi T''mman, and I will notify her that you are on the way to pick her up. Be aware that she will likely have been injured in the landing, so you will need to fend off any resistance you encounter.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I''m not sure I understand your reluctance. With this information spread to the masses, the lies of the Empire will be weakened. You don''t want to see an opportunity to strike the Empire go to waste, do you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I understand. I will look for someone that is more able-bodied to accomplish this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Hmmm... I do not understand the lack of concern on your part. Perhaps if you thought on it, you would change your mind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'A few hours ago High Command was contacted by our representatives with the Bothan SpyNet. They have managed to slice into a major HoloNet broadcast center on Coruscant. We must sieze this opportunity to show the Imperial citizens what happened at Yavin IV. It may convince many more to express sympathy towards our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'The hidden nature of this base is a very tenuous one. Unfortunately, we have not been able to find a more secure place. I authorized this base to be re-initialized after General Dodonna informed us that the siege on Yavin would end in our destruction. Until we find a more secure base, we must protect the secrecy of this one at all costs.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'The operation involved us sacrificing three of our Corellian Corvettes. We staged the Corvettes to look like an expeditionary force trying to return to Dantooine, then engaged them with a TIE Fighter squad. The Corvettes were only running a skeleton crew, and all the Captains have been accounted for save for one.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'I take it the delivery went without incident? Very good. After that holovid reaches the homes and apartments of the citizens across Coruscant, they will see what the Empire has been doing with their tax money. I am expecting much attention to be diverted to all of the rebellious citizens that should be springing up soon. Thank you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Wonderful. Whilst you destroyed the troops, I had another team hijack their shuttle for future use. The Empire will likely write this off as operater malfunction and leave it alone for now. At least we were able to buy more time. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Wonderful work. I see you have been able to bring the Captain back safely. Now all of the crew have been accounted for, we can only hope that the sacrifice of those precious Corvettes will convince the Planetary General that we don''t exist here anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'I''ll deliver it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'They will be prevented from finding us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll go rescue her.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, but I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I am not capable of doing this mission.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'I''m not interested.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Why the urgency?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Why all the effort to keep the base secret?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'What are the details of the operation?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 27, 'player_reset', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 28, 'player_sorry', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You are to deliver this holovid containing the events of the Death Star assault to our agent with the Bothan SpyNet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 30, 'npc_reset', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'I''m glad to see that you were so prompt wi - oh... It seems you''re busy right now. The Alliance is in need of your help, so when you are done with your agenda, please let me know.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Woohoo... you''re not the one who matches the lowdown. Sorry friend, but you''ll have to talk the walk alone.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Do you have a question?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'How can I help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Heyho... You have the look of someone who wants to broadcast, eh?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'There''s one! Set blasters for stun!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'If you''re an Imperial, watch out! I''ll blast you sky-high, bum leg or not!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 39, 'notit', 'What''s this bump? We were told to wait for a juicy set of images, and this doesn''t look like it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'You will need to locate the strike team that was sent by the Empire. Once found, you must make it a point that they do not report back to their commanders.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You are to locate Captain Altapi T''mman and escort her back here to the base.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 52, 'npc_takeme_3', 'You''re the one sent by Mon Mothma, I take it. Well, I''ve hurt my leg, so I''ll need a little help getting back to base. Lead on.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Move along. There''s nothing to see here.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Don''t mind me. I''m just enjoying this wonderful scenery.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Move along. There''s nothing to see here. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'Go away! I don''t know you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 57, 'dontknowyou_6', 'Huh? What''s going on here?!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'We have need of your assistance once again. One of our medical transports has returned from Yavin, bearing a full load of the wounded soldiers that are defending that base. The transport is being readied for return to Yavin, but it looks like a Stormtrooper squadron is about to come through the area. Are you available?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'Our efforts to secure secrecy of this base has had an unexpected outcome - the deployment schedules have been changed. The last information we were able to discern was that a Senior Engineer of a secret military project was to be landing on the planet. We must take this final opportunity to apprehend him for questioning.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 63, 'npc_1_6', 'It seems this project the Empire has been working on has been to create a very large Shield Generator, even larger than that used by Vader''s Super Star Destroyer. The Engineer was to retrieve schematics for it from the General on the planet. Though this may blow our cover, we need to get those blueprints. Can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'I will give you the coordinates of the wherabouts of the transport. You will need to eliminate the Stormtroopers in the surrounding area before the transport can leave the planet. Once done, we will give the signal for the ship to depart.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'The location in your datapad is the last known location of where he was to land. We do not know what type of forces are guarding him, so be aware. He is quite important to us finding out what this project is, so do not let any harm come to him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 66, 'npc_2_6', 'The Engineer said that he was to meet the General at the location in your datapad. There is still time to go out there and intercept him if you hurry. Once last thing : May the Force be with you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'I will see who else we have available, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'I see. It''s a shame that you could not find it within yourself to help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 69, 'npc_3_6', 'This is quite important, yet you turn your back on us. I am very disappointed in you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'The deployment schedules of this planet have keyed us into much of the troop movement on Dantooine. This has allowed us to determine where Stormtrooper, Star Destroyer, and TIE Fighter movements are to take place. This information has been quite invaluable.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'The operation in which we sacrificed the Corvettes has paid off very well. The local General has declared this world free of ''Rebel Infestation'', which means our base should remain hidden for a time to come. Unfortunately, with a change in security levels, our guard schedules are useless to us now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 72, 'npc_4_6', 'We do not see a need for a Shield Generator so large. It does explain why all of the generators were being taken from the old base and other locations, though. We will need the blueprints for this design in case the Generator were to ever be operational. If it is ever used by the Empire, it would be best if we knew it''s weaknesses.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You are to locate the squadron of stormtroopers that will be in the area and then eliminate them. Once done, the transport can then depart.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'You will need to locate and apprehend the Senior Engineer if this secret project. Once done, bring him back to me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 75, 'npc_backtowork_6', 'You are to intercept the General of this planet...and kill him. Recover the blueprints on his person.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'There''s some Rebels! Get them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'What? Wait!!! I''m just an Engineer! I don''t even know how to use a blaster!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 78, 'npc_breech_6', 'You''re not the Engineer! So, we have a Rebel among us, hmm? Guards, kill them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'The transport has left the planet safely and will be able to pick up more of the evacuees on Yavin. General Dodonna has informed us that the base is still holding up after all this time, but it can''t do so for much longer. You have done the Alliance a great service today.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Thank you for bringing him safely to us. We will now be able to discuss what he was working on in private. Hopefully he was high ranking enough to be able to provide enough information as to the nature fo the project. I may need you in a little while, so please check back with me in a few hours.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 84, 'npc_reward_6', 'Yes, this is quite large indeed. Well, we shall keep this in our Intelligence for future reference. Fortunately, with this information, it shows that a small strike team can disable whatever it is shielding. We''ll have to keep an eye out for that once we have a more permanent base. General Dodonna has requested your help with the evacuation on Yavin. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 86, 'npc_takeme_5', 'So, am I under arrest by you Rebels? I''ll talk as long as you don''t hurt me. I just make shield generators, nothing more!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'How may I help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 90, 'npc_work_6', 'Did you have a question?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'Yes, I can help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'I''ll get him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 93, 'player_1_6', 'I''ll take care of him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'Not at this time, no.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'Sorry, but I can''t help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 96, 'player_2_6', 'I can''t just kill someone in cold blood.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'How do we know Stormtroopers are coming in?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'Why was the schedule changed?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 99, 'player_3_6', 'Why would they need to make something so large?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Yes, this feels nice and smooth. I''ll get this back to my compatriots, then we''ll screen this for the viewers everywhere. I''m gone.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 112, 'gotowork', 'This is not the item I requested.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_1', 'The spy wasn''t at the location? Hmmm... I hope she wasn''t picked up by the Imperials.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 114, 'npc_failure_2', 'I hope that the strike team was unable to find any evidence. We will know shortly, though. Due to your failure, I will now have to set the base to evacuation alert.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 115, 'npc_failure_3', 'You let her die? She risked her life only to die when everything was safe. Such a shame.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 116, 'npc_failure_4', 'With you being unable to handle these stormtroopers, you have placed many lives in jepoardy.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 117, 'npc_failure_5', 'With the Engineer dead, we will never be able to find out what the Empire was constructing. Your failure has set us back quite a ways.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 118, 'npc_failure_6', 'Since you were unable to gather the blueprints, we may never know it''s weaknesses were it to be used as a military project. Let us hope that we never need to know how to destroy it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 119, 'otherescort', 'I''m not the person you''re looking for. Maybe that other guy that was nearby.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 120, 'notyet', 'I appreciate your eagerness to help, but I am quite busy right now. Perhaps Captain Akbar may be able to help you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 121, 'npc_noloc_1', 'I will check my message as to where the meeting location was supposed to be. Please check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 122, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me have Akbar bring in the coordinates of the strike team. Please return in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 123, 'npc_noloc_3', 'I will check the charts to find out where her escape pod landed. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 124, 'npc_noloc_4', 'let me get the coordinates of where the Stormtroopers can be found. Ask me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 125, 'npc_noloc_5', 'Something just came up. You''ll need to ask me again where the Enginer is in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 126, 'npc_noloc_6', 'Let me ask the Engineer where he was to meet the General. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 127, 'next', 'General Dodonna is still at our base on Yavin IV.  I''m terribly worried about him.  Perhaps you could go and find out how he''s doing?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 128, 'npc_reset_1', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 129, 'npc_reset_2', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 130, 'npc_reset_4', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 131, 'npc_reset_3', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 132, 'npc_reset_5', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 133, 'npc_reset_6', 'Perhaps when you are not so busy you can lend a hand to our cause.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 134, 'player_reset_1', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 135, 'player_reset_2', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 136, 'player_reset_4', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 137, 'player_reset_3', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 138, 'player_reset_6', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 139, 'player_reset_5', 'I can no longer complete this assignment.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 140, 'player_sorry_1', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 141, 'player_sorry_2', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 142, 'player_sorry_3', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 143, 'player_sorry_4', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 144, 'player_sorry_5', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/mon_mothma.stf', 145, 'player_sorry_6', 'What was I supposed to do again?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Hello to your person. The Regal One has messaged your expectation of arrival. Problems are had by myself concerning a made to be shifted linguistic decoder that was transacted by a regional purveyor of droids fittings. A request is made for your help. Locate the seller and transport him to my person. Are you understanding?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Thanks again for the previous help. When I was landing the Falcon in a safer, more secret hiding place, I noticed a small craft landing nearby our location. You weren''t expecting anybody were you? Nah... I didn''t think you were. Well, I hate to say, but you have someone following you, and you might want to take care of it before they find us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Uh-oh. What am I gonna do? If Han finds out about this, he''ll... hey! I... uh... need your help. I guess when I was tracking the bounty hunter''s ship, I never bothered to complete my own scans of the area. Yeah... um... well, it seems that our basecamp is in proximity to a nearby Pirate camp. Uh... could you help stop the Pirates stealing the Falcon?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Relief is greatly filling me. The location of the said trafficker is expected to be an inverse of a great distance. Appreciation will be granted upon the finality of your agenda. Hastened movement will increase the feelings of gratitude. Take your fears and dispatch them, for the dealer should comprehend the condition.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'I''m glad to hear that I won''t have to scrape you out of a mess. Now, from what I gather, I''m pretty certain the craft has fully landed, and this person is on their way to track you down. If they''re friendly, that''s fine... but I''ve seen that type of flying before, and I''ll wager 1000 credits that''s a bounty hunter. Stop by when the coast is clear.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Thank you, thank you, thank you! Okay, here''s where I landed the Falcon. You should find the pirates somewhere about here... I''ve highlighted it on your datapad for you. If you scare a number of them off, the rest should leave as well. If they won''t listen to reason... well, they''re pirates, if you understand what I''m saying.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'The emotion of anger is projected at the malfunctioning device in question. With a viewing of the past, knowledge provides information to the effect that currency should not have parted my appendages for said object. Blessings be unto you regardless of the outcome.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I''m not too sure about that, friend. By the looks of the ship - and I got a pretty close look without being spotted, I''d say that''s a bounty hunter after you. Then again, we are on Lok... I''d still rather be safe than sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Ooooh.... please! You have to help! If Solo finds out that I parked his baby next to some Pirates, he''ll kill me! Seriously! I think he might actually kill me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'A device created for the intent of the decoding of syllables between both Sullustan and Basic was aquired in exchange for legal tender. The aforementioned splinter of dung has experienced a series of failed functions, resulting in unintended methods of communication. Does the possibility exist of your person performing assistance?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Well, it''s still a bit hush-hush, so I can''t say much - that''s up to Han. I was asked by Solo to navigate us to a safe spot on the planet, so that''s why I''m out here. His Wookiee friend went to accompany him with gathering old contacts. From what I gather, I''m not too sure if I really want to ask too many questions about either of their pasts. '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'You mean the one that goes: there''s nothing Han Solo cares more about in this galaxy than the Millennium Falcon? Umm. Yeah. That''s why we can''t say anything to him about it, okay? He told me if anything happens to the Falcon, he''ll tell Chewbacca to get angry. You''ve heard what they say an angry Wookiee does to your arms, right?');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Thank you soooo much! I knew I should have been wary of buying a ''prototype'' using a protocol droid brain to translate to other languages. Thanks again! Princess Leia told us to expect you. Look, I have to go move the Millennium Falcon to a safer location, so I can''t talk right now. Check back with me in a bit, because I might have need of you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Well, from what you say, it sounds like you had a bounty hunter on your tail when you left Corellia and had been stalking you all over Lok. You sure are lucky this guy wasn''t a professional, or you wouldn''t be here to tell me about it. I''ll go see if Han is still busy... hmmm? What''s that? Hm. Let me check on this warning beacon, then we''ll talk some more.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'You saved the Falcon?! Oh, thank you so very much. Now, before Han finds out what happened, I''ll need to check the damage on this Falcon. If it''s damaged, it will be extremely hard to find parts. That''s an old YT-1300, not to mentioned heavily modified at that. If you would, could you please check back with me a little later?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'If you mean escort a guy here, sure I''ll help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Yeah, I''ll clean up after myself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'They''re stealing the Falcon!!? I''ll help you!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I can''t understand anything you''re saying. I can''t help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'No thanks. I know nobody followed me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Whoa! This is none of my business, Nien. No.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Why are you talking so weird?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Why are you and Han Solo here on Lok?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Is it true what they say about Han''s ship?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Okay, I''ve had enough of this. I''m not doing this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Umm... I think the answer is no, but I''m still looking?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'I do not see problems with this current status. Upon the aquisition of repair, all will be made better.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'The emotion of anger is projected at the malfunctioning device in question. With a viewing of the past, knowledge provides information to the effect that currency should not have parted my appendages for said object. Blessings be unto you regardless of the outcome.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Assistance has been offered, but a denial will ensue with gracious attachment. A thought comes to my mind that entails the visitation of Corellia.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Well, if you think of something you want, come look for me sometime.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Has the position of the merchandiser of rubbish been aquired?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Have you taken care of the tag-a-long?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Were you able to stop the Pirates?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Would you care to see my specially modifed droid parts?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'So this is where secret Rebel base is, hm? The Empire will pay a lot for this info...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Hey you!  Get out of here or get dead!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Well, you''d best hurry before that bounty hunter gets too close to our makeshift base.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Well hurry up! They''re pirates, for Sullust''s sake! They''re not going to wait around all day for someone to show up!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'I''m not too sure about that, friend. By the looks of the ship - and I got a pretty close look without being spotted, I''d say that''s a bounty hunter after you. Then again, we are on Lok... I''d still rather be safe than sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'How am I supposed to take them on!? I''m both a pilot and a navigator, I''m not a fighter!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I don''t think anyone was following me. I''m not doing this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I won''t be able to stop them, Nein!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'Not yet, but I''ll have it taken care of.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'No, I haven''t left yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'You''re not the person I''m looking for. Get out of here!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Didn''t you hear me the first time? I said my favorite line I like to say: Get out of here or get dead!!! That means go!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'What? You''re not the guy who wants to buy the Hyperdrive from me? Well, what are you wasting my time for?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'Okay..... I''ve spoken to Chewbacca... the hyperdrive is heavily damaged, but he says he can get it fixed if he had the right parts. I''ve managed to get in touch with a few shady pirates on this planet, and one guy said he has the part. Could you run out there and grab it for me? I would greatly appreciate it...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Thank you so much! Okay, I''ve told him I''m sending you out there. You might want to keep an eye open. I don''t really trust this guy... well, I don''t really trust any of the people here on the planet, to be honest. Just make sure he doesn''t try to rob you, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Ah, I understand. I guess I''ll see if Chewbacca can help m out. I really need to get the Falcon fixed before Han notices.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'Are you crazy?! I''m never going to tell him. As a matter of fact, unless it''s a matter of life or death, I''m never flying that thing again after we get off this planet! Even if we can stop the Empire once and for all, I won''t get in his ship again. Well... I guess if we could stop the Empire I would... But that would be the ONLY way I''d fly his ship again!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Okay, good. Make sure the part works before you accept it, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'You the one picking up this hyperdrive part? Good......'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'Ah, I understand. I guess I''ll see if Chewbacca can help me out. I really need to get the Falcon fixed before Han notices.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'Friend, you''ve helped me so much today, I greatly appreciate it. I can''t begin to thank you for your help. You''re the type of person who reminds me why we fight against the Empire. Oh yeah... I forgot you were here to speak with Han. I''ll let him know you''re here, and I''ll also let him know you''re completely dependable, too.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'So were you able to get the Hyperdrive?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'You''re a nice guy... sure.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'Sorry, Nien, but I don''t have time right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Are you going to tell Han what happened?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'Sorry, Nien, but I don''t have time to help you right now. I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'Not yet. I''m about to meet him right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 110, 'gotowork', 'Dunno what this is. Here, you can have it back.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 111, 'npc_failure_1', 'Understanding has eluded my grasp on the same height as yours.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_2', 'You led the bounty hunter straight here? Oh, I sure do hope it was just some local pirate, rather than someone working for the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_3', 'You let them steal the Falcon? YOU LET THEM STEAL THE FALCON?!?!?!? Oh, that''s it... I''ve got to get off this planet before Han finds out!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 114, 'npc_failure_4', 'He didn''t actually have a Hyperdrive for a YT-1300? Aaarrgg!!!!  What am I going to do now? *sigh* I guess I take my chances with telling him then...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Charts are in need of consulting before a quest is embarked upon.  Please refer back to me later.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 116, 'npc_noloc_2', 'Let me check the Falcon for my notes. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 117, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me look on this map to see where I hid the Falcon. Check back in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 118, 'npc_noloc_4', 'I need to find out where this place is that you''re supposed to meet him. Check back with me in a few minutes, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 119, 'otherescort', 'Whaaah? I don''t know you! What do you want with me? Oh.... you must be looking for the other person standing around nearby.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 121, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Blast it! I told that Sullustan not to get that droid brain wet! Arrrgh.... sure, I''ll fix it for him. Take me to him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 122, 'notyet', 'I can''t talk.  I''m too busy working for Princess Leia.  Well, I could talk to you if she said it was ok.  You know where she''s at right?  Somewhere on Cor....oh.  I shouldn''t say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 123, 'next', 'Talk to Han.  See what he has to say.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 124, 'notit_4', 'Chewbacca cannot fix the hyderdrive without that part.  I really need you to pick it up for me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 125, 'npc_smuggle_1', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 126, 'npc_smuggle_2', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 127, 'npc_smuggle_3', ''),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/nien_nunb.stf', 128, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Bah... can''t believe I let that go so cheaply. Get out of here before I change my mind.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Welcome! It''s a pleasure to meet you. I''ve been told what you''ve done, and on behalf of the Alliance, I wish to extend my thanks to you. I have a further request for you, though. I am overseeing the off-planet evacuation of a family that has helped us in the past, but one of them has been arrested. I need you to go rescue her, please.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Ah, it''s you. I have a request of you, if you are available. We have made contact with an Officer that works for the ISB, the Imperial Security Bureau. He wishes to come over to the Alliance, but requires my assurance he will come to no harm. He requested you to be his bodyguard, as well. Will you do this for us?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Good, you have arrived just in time. Tennelt has informed us that right before he defected, he provided information regarding a prominent Selonian politician that was being abducted and taken to the Inquisitors for interrogation, then execution. We need to save her before it''s too late!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'I thank you in advance for your help. We have her last known location before she was apprehended, but I''m not sure if she''ll be there. Once you have rescued her from the Stormtroopers, bring her back here so that we can reunite her with her family. Please hurry, for you are her only hope.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'I thank you very much. The ISB agent has designated a meeting place out within the wilds.  I don''t think I need to say that you should be prepared for a fight in case this is a trap. Please take caution in case he is not as sincere as he claims.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'The information that Tennelt has given us suggests that she will be taken along the route I have entered into your datapad. Accordingly, there is a small group acting as escort, which you will likely have to take care of. Once she has been rescued, bring her back here to the base so that we can help her to safety.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Umm.. I don''t understand. You don''t wish to help this person? Am I understanding that you would prefer for her to go off to the Empire''s prisons after all she''s done for us?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'I hate to burst your bubble, but if you look around, half of the people you see in the Alliance were once Imperials. Heck, General Dodonna was one of the first to Captain a Star Destroyer when the Emperor took over. That attitude does nothing to help our cause, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'After all you''ve done for us, I would have assumed you were the best person for the job. Very well, I''ll see if I can get Wedge to do it. I must attend to this now, so I no longer have any time to talk.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Her name is Deasie A''Fresel, and she''s the wife of the cell leader you helped to escape off planet a little while back. She opted to be the last one to leave the planet, making sure the rest of her family went before she did. Unfortunately, the Imperials have found her and are transporting her to the nearest Inquisitor.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'Actually, it was the woman you rescued earlier, Deasie A''Fresel. It seems her brother is an ISB agent, and the fact that she was going to be taken to the Inquisitors was the last straw for him. He has seen what you have done for his sister and brother-in-law, and wishes you to be his escort so that he may speak with me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'According to the information Tennelt has given us, it seems this Selonian is one of the Advocates on the Corellian Tribunal. It seems she has been rather vocal against the Empire as of late, and the plan was to remove her from the picture and replace her with someone a little more Pro-Imperial. We need to stop this from happening.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Oh, thank you so much. We''ll be able to set them up with a nice home on Rori where they''ll be safe, after all they have contributed. As for you, I''m certain they will be forever grateful for what you have done. Thank you once again.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Officer Tennelt has asked me to thank you for providing a safe trip here. I too offer you my thanks, for this will be a great boon to the Alliance if he truly is defecting. I''ll need to have a number of talks with him before I''m convinced, though. Thank you very much for you assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'As an Advocate on the Tribunal, she will be able to relate her story through her clan. I will send someone out to inform them of what transpired so that she can be smuggled back into their caves safely. Thank you very much for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'By all means! I''ll save her!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I''ll bring him here safely.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'I''ll definitely help!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'I''m sorry, Princess, but I cannot help with this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Sorry, I can''t stand looking at an Imperial.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'This doesn''t sound like a job for my skills. Sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Who am I to rescue?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'When did all of this happen?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'Why are the Imperials interested in a Selonian?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I''m sorry, Princess, but I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'You must understand that time is of the essence. You are her only hope!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Umm.. I don''t understand. You don''t wish to help this person? Am I understanding that you would prefer for her to go off to the Empire''s prisons after all she''s done for us?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Hello. You must be the person both Qualdo and Wedge have told me about. I wish to thank you for all you''ve done for our cause. With everyone''s help, such as yours, we may actually have a chance to put an end to the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Thank you for stopping them. I''ll be going back home now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you saved Deasie?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Where is the ISB agent?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Have you rescued the Selonian yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Please, help me! They''re going to send me to the Kessel mines!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Hold there. You wouldn''t happen to be the royal one''s emissary, would you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Please! You must stop them before they kill me!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Please make haste. If the Imperials find out he''s defecting, they might kill him outright!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You must hurry! You need to save her before she makes it to the Inquisitor!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'I hate to burst your bubble, but if you look around, half of the people you see in the Alliance were once Imperials. Heck, General Dodonna was one of the first to Captain a Star Destroyer when the Emperor took over. That attitude does nothing to help our cause, friend.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'After all you''ve done for us, I would have assumed you were the best person for the job. Very well, I''ll see if I can get Wedge to do it. I must attend to this now, so I no longer have any time to talk.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'I''ve changed my mind. I''m not helping any Imperials!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I''m no longer capable of handling this job.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'I haven''t made contact with him yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 50, 'npc_takeme_1', 'Oh, thank you so much! Once I''ve made it back to my family, I''ll make it a point to send you one of my famous garrenberry pies! Now, let''s go!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 51, 'npc_takeme_2', 'Very well. I understand the need for secrecy, but I do so hope you pay attention so that I don''t fall into a gully. Let us depart.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 52, 'npc_takeme_3', 'Oh, thank you! What? You were sent by Princess Leia? I knew I put my faith in the right side of this struggle. Please, lead on.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'What? You''re not the one who was described to me. I bid you good day.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Thank you for your assistance. I will be forever in debt to you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Hey now. You''re not running the same system as us, are you? Sorry... no business for you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'If you do not have official business here, move along!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 58, 'notit_4', 'What? This has no codes on it! What game are''ya playing here?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'We have just received some... well, very interesting news. It seems that Tennelt was actually a spy this entire time, until he revealed to us that he now truly wishes to defect. Since his revelation he has provided us every single code he was privy to, which we have encoded on a datapad. I need your help, for this needs to be delivered to our contacts immediately!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'Well, the Bothans sure did a good job. They managed to grab everything they could from Imperial Intelligence. In addition to a number of Star Destroyer flightpaths, they uncovered what appears to be a construction project being built near an out of the way system. We would appreciate it if you intercepted one of these shipments, please.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'I knew I could trust you to do this. You need to deliver this to our contact with the Bothan SpyNet, and very soon. Tennelt was supposed to check back in tomorrow. When the ISB realizes that he really defected, they''ll change every one of these codes. We need to give the Bothan slicers as much time as possible!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'We have targeted an outgoing shipment from this planet. What we need you to do is to identify the commander of the transport units, then capture him. He will be able to give us more information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'I understand this is quite important, but I wouldn''t have asked you unless I thought you were the person for the job. I have faith in you, so please reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'Yes, I know I''ve asked you for so much so far, but you are desperately needed! Please, please reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'Yes, it''s true. When he came here, he was actually intending on sneaking out and revealing where our base was. In the time that he has spent here and seen what the Empire is actually doing, rather than the propaganda he was fed by the Emperor, he has decided to really join our cause. I somehow knew inside that he was a good person, and fortunately I was right.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'We''re not sure at this time. Ever since we destroyed the Death Star, the Empire has been hurting for credits. It''s possible they may be building a new repair facility, or worse yet, another one of those monstrous Super Star Destroyers. We need to find out what this is before they can continue building it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'You must hurry! Those codes will be changed very soon, and we need to make the most of them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Well, you don''t want to miss it. You might want to set up an ambush for them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', 'Whoaaaa... you have a flashy look in your eye. What code are you sending me, huh?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'A bandit ambush! Put a stop to this, men!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'I understand this is quite important, but I wouldn''t have asked you unless I thought you were the person for the job. I have faith in you, so please reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', 'Yes, I know I''ve asked you for so much so far, but you are desperately needed! Please, please reconsider.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'From how you described your conversation with the Bothan, I''m sure you gave it to the right guy. They''re a bit odd, but they''re the best slicers in the Galaxy. Now all we have to do is wait and see what information they are able to steal. Thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Thank you. Once the questioning has been completed, we can inform Mon Mothma of the important news so that she can set up a battle plan. You know... I know a guy who could use your help with something he''s working on right now. If you''d like to travel to Lok, you might want to look up Han Solo. I''ll let him and Nien know you''re coming.  And take this reward for your assistance.  It''s the least we can do.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 86, 'npc_takeme_5', 'Very well, then. I surrender.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'What did the Bothan say when you delivered the codes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'Do you have the Commander in your custody?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll get it to them!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'No problem. I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'Sorry, but this is too much responsibility for me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'I can''t handle something like that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'I don''t understand. Tennelt told you he was a spy?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'What''s this Imperial construction project?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'I can''t handle this responsibility anymore!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'I give up. I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'Um... I haven''t yet delivered them yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'The shipment hasn''t arrived yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 109, 'npc_smuggle_4', 'Yeah, yeah, yeah. These are some tasty codes. We''ll get them sliced and diced in no time. When we''re done, we let the Princess know what secrets Old Papa is hiding, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 111, 'noloc_1', 'Let me check the message to see where she last was before being arrested. Please speak with me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 112, 'noloc_2', 'Let me look up where you are to meet him. Please check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 113, 'noloc_3', 'Let me check with Tennelt again as to the whereabouts of her extradition path. Please ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 114, 'noloc_4', 'I need to contact the Bothan SpyNet to let them know I''ll be sending them a courier. Check back with me in a few minutes, please.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 115, 'noloc_5', 'Let me check with the Bothan''s information. Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'No, I''m not in need of being escorted by anyone. Maybe you''re looking for someone else?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'Thank you for your kind offer, but this is not something I am in need of. You should offer it to someone less fortunate.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'She died in the scuffle? *sigh* Let me take care of this. I have to find some way to explain this to her husband...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'Did I just hear you say you let him get killed? What kind of bodyguard are you!?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'She died in the scuffle? *sigh* Let me take care of this, then. I have to find some way to explain this to the rest of her clan...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'The Bothan contact wasn''t there? But they''re always reliable... well, this could have been a great advantage, but we will persevere.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'The commander died in the crossfire, you say? Aarrgh! Without his information, the Empire might be able to get their project completed before we can stop it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 124, 'notyet', 'You shouldn''t be here.  Perhaps Wedge could use your help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/princess_leia.stf', 125, 'next', 'You should go to Lok and see my friend Nien Nunb.  He''s there with Han Solo.  Perhaps they could use some assistance?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'Hello there! I''m Qualdo Herm and a member of the Alliance like you. The Princess''s droids have spoken highly of you, and I think I can use your help. I have a friend that has recently decided to help the Alliance by providing some information. What I need, though, is for you to deliver this special comm-link to him. Sound good?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Hi there! I need your help again, friend. I''klee''trao has let me know that a special compound is being transported to his research facility. It seems that this compound is being used for the project he''s working on. My plan is to intercept that compound so that it will slow down their research. Can you do that for the Alliance?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'Well, hello there! My Ithorian friend has given us good news! It seems that without the compound, which is apparently quite expensive in it''s prototype form, the Empire is considering putting an end to the project. With a little help from I''klee''trao, we have devised a plan that might stop the project altogether. Can you help us with this?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Great!  It seems my friend, I''klee''trao, is working for a company making dampening devices. Well, he just found out the company''s secret project is actually being funded by the Empire. Being an Ithorian, he has no love for the Empire.  Bring him this special two-way commlink so that he can relay any special info to us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'Okay, I''ll give you the coordinates of where the shipment should be coming from. What we need is the compound that will be used to make a prototype for the project. Once we have that, we''ll be able to put a stop, or at least slow down, the research on this project. Good luck, friend!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Great! You''ll need to run over to the research facility and meet with the Imperial Officer that is overseeing this project. He is delivering the design documents, regarding the project that is, to a courier for transport back to a R&D facility. However you do it, you need to get those blueprints from him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'Well, I can understand that. I''d do it myself, but I need to oversee the evacuation of one of our guy''s family. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Hrmm... well, I can understand. I was just hoping you would be willing to help. Well, thank you anyways.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Well, I''m not sure I understand, but you''ve already been a big help to begin with, I guess I can''t complain. Thanks anyways.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'He''s an old friend I went to the Scientarium Academia with.  He specialized in acoustic technology, whereas I focused on alien surgery. As a matter of fact, I used to be the best medic for 10 parsecs around - that was before I just couldn''t take the nerves anymore. Just recently he got ahold of me again, and through some talking, offered to give the Alliance special information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'From what he says he made a breakthrough in sound dampening technology a little bit back. Apparently the Empire has now shown themselves to be the ones running the company, and are planning on using this for their Probe Droids.  Their plan is to make these droids far more quiet so they aren''t as easily detectable due to their loud whine and chatter.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'I''klee''trao suggested that since the project was under consideration due to security breaches, the best way to have it cancelled completely would be to destroy the design documents. He''s sent a false message to the Imperial Officer that has taken control of the facility. The message told him to deliver the documents to a courier, but you''ll intercept them.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'Great, you''re back! I''klee''trao has made contact with me through the commlink. If anything comes up, he''ll keep us posted. Thanks for your help, friend.  I don''t have much to offer, but take this reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'I see you found this compound! This is good news, indeed. With them not able to use this in their experiments, they''ll be slowed down long enough for us to work out a better plan.  Thanks, friend!  Oh, and here''s another reward for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Yes, these are the documents! I''ll have to give these and the compound to High Command. I''m sure that the project will be cancelled now that we have everything needed to actually research this. With them unable to make Probots silent, we''ll still be able to hear them a parsec away!  Oh, and take this reward for your assistance. You''ve earned it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'No problem.  I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sounds important. Yes, I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'Sure I''ll help!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, but I''m a bit busy right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'Sorry, it sounds a bit dangerous. I can''t.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Unfortunately, I can''t help you right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Who''s this friend of yours?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'What''s the project he''s working on?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'What''s the plan you''ve concocted?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'I''m sorry, but something came up.  I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'Sorry, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Okay, I was just checkin''.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'Well, I can understand that. I''d do it myself, but I need to oversee the evacuation of one of our guy''s family. Well, thanks anyway.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Hello there! I''m Qualdo Herm and a member of the Alliance like you. The Princess''s droids have spoken highly of you, and I think I can use your help when you''ve got some time.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh, I see. Well, if you ever meet him, say ''Hi'' for me, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Have you given I''klee''trao the commlink yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Do you have a question?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'How are you doing today?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hello. You wouldn''t happen to be Qualdo''s friend, would you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'Bandits!  Protect the compound at all costs!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'Wait one moment! You don''t look like a courier! You''re a Rebel!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 39, 'notit', 'Hmmm... I thought Qualdo said he''d be giving me a modified commlink.  This doesn''t look like one.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Well, hello to you too.  You really do need to get out there and grab that compound before it''s too late, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'Oh, I can''t complain. Sure beats being out in the field patching up blaster wounds.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Hrmm... well, I can understand. I was just hoping you would be willing to help. Well, thank you anyways.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Well, I''m not sure I understand, but you''ve already been a big help to begin with, I guess I can''t complain. Thanks anyways.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Qualdo, I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'I''m sorry, but I can''t do this mission anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'No, I just wanted to say ''Hi''.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'Doing fine, and you?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Oh, you''re not taking the shipment? Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'You''re not a Rebel? Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 55, 'dontknowyou_4', 'Please... send for help.... don''t know how... much longer.....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'Oh, this is bad news! The Imperials found ''Klee''s commlink and have had him arrested and sentenced to execution! We sent a team to rescue him, but they were all killed, save for I''klee''trao. Look, this is a matter of life and death! I need you to go out there and rescue him, then bring him back to me immediately! Will you do it?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'Okay, okay! Okay... let''s see.  Okay, ''Klee''s last transmission to us was from these coordinates. You need to get out there fast, then bring him back here. Be careful, for he''s been severely wounded and has probably lost a lot of blood. Okay, I''ll let you do your job and get out of your way now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'What? Oh... okay... let me think here. I can''t have another person killed, too... okay, I''ll have to ask the Princess what to do!!!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'Look, I''m a medic, not a commander. I couldn''t take doing the surgeries anymore, so I was transferred to a command position. Only an Ithorian would know how to operate on another Ithorian, due to their physiology. Or a Xeno-Surgeon... such as myself. I''m the only one who can save him from dying, but I vowed never to do an operation again. Now do you see?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Well, hurry. He doesn''t have much longer before he dies!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 76, 'npc_breech_4', '*moans*..can''t... see too well.... are you here to kill me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'What? Oh... okay... let me think here. I can''t have another person killed, too... okay, I''ll have to ask the Princess what to do!!!!!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'You brought him back just in time! Yes...yes... I can do this. Thank you for your help, friend - you may have just saved a man''s life... er... Ithorian''s life. I told Wedge about you, and he said he might need your help as well. Not to be rude, but out of my way... I''ve got a life to save!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 85, 'npc_takeme_4', 'Qualdo sent you.... *moans*.... please.... help me.... I think I''m dying.....'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Have you found him yet? Where is he?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'Absolutely!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'I''m not capable of doing something like that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'What happened to your calm demeanor?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'You''ll need to get someone else to do this. I can''t anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'I haven''t found him yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'Thank you. Tell Qualdo that I''ll keep him posted on whatever the Empire is planning to do with the project I''m working on. Good luck with your Alliance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 110, 'gotowork', 'Seems like you should be getting back to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 111, 'npc_failure_1', 'Well, that''s horrible!  Imperials got him, you say? I think I''m going to be depressed!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 112, 'npc_failure_2', 'They were able to get the shipment to the facility? Oh well. I guess we''ll have to step up our security a bit more in the future.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 113, 'npc_failure_3', 'You weren''t able to get the documents? Well, at least you tried to do your part.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 114, 'npc_failure_4', 'What? He''s dead? After everything he did for us, you let him die? What are you, a monster?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 115, 'npc_noloc_1', 'Hmmm... let me check where he said he would meet me.  Ask me again in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 116, 'npc_noloc_2', 'I''ll gather where the shipment is coming in from. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 117, 'npc_noloc_3', 'Let me contact ''Klee to find out where exactly the meeting point was supposed to be. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 118, 'npc_noloc_4', 'Let me find out where I''klee''trao''s last location was. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 119, 'otherescort', 'Sorry, friend, but I think you''ve got the wrong guy.  Check nearby, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 120, 'next', 'I''m dealing with some new recruits and some paperwork, but we appreciate your efforts for the Alliance.  Perhaps Wedge has some work that he needs done?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/qualdo_herm.stf', 121, 'notyet', 'The droids are the ones you should talk to.  I believe they need some assistance.   C-3PO and R2?  You''ve met them, yes?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 1, 'rebel_hideout_1', 'C-3PO needs you to DELIVER a shipment of food to the SELONIAN CONTACT.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 2, 'rebel_hideout_2', 'C-3PO needs you to deliver DERMAL MEDICINE to a REBEL CAPTAIN whose men have been wounded.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 3, 'rebel_hideout_3', 'C-3PO needs you to ESCORT CAPTAIN TAERGLE back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 4, 'rebel_hideout_4', 'C-3PO needs you to DELIVER a piece of INFORMATION to the REBEL CAPTAIN at the given coordinates'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 5, 'rebel_hideout_5', 'QUAL''DO HERM needs you to DELIVER a special COMMLINK to his friend, the ITHORIAN SCIENTIST'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 6, 'rebel_hideout_6', 'QUAL''DO HERM needs you to get the COMPOUND from the IMPERIALS who are holding it.  You are authorized to KILL if necessary.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 7, 'rebel_hideout_7', 'QUAL''DO HERM needs you to find the IMPERIAL who has the BLUEPRINTS and get them from him.  Use DEADLY FORCE if necessary.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 8, 'rebel_hideout_8', 'QUAL''DO HERM needs you to ESCORT his ITHORIAN SCIENTIST friend back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 9, 'rebel_hideout_9', 'WEDGE needs you to DELIVER a LETTER OF CONFIRMATION to his potential REBEL FRIEND'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 10, 'rebel_hideout_10', 'WEDGE needs you to find the OUTSPOKEN INDIVIDUAL who may ruin everything!  Try to REASON with her, but if not she may need to be ELIMINATED.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 11, 'rebel_hideout_11', 'WEDGE needs you to ESCORT the IMPERIAL who is overseeing the operations back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 12, 'rebel_hideout_12', 'WEDGE needs you to DESTROY the GENERATOR for the IMPERIAL STARPORT so that they can''t send for reinforcements.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 13, 'rebel_hideout_13', 'WEDGE needs you to GET THE CODE CYLINDER from the IMPERIAL who guards the warehouse and return it to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 14, 'rebel_hideout_14', 'PRINCESS LEIA needs you to ESCORT her FRIEND back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 15, 'rebel_hideout_15', 'PRINCESS LEIA needs you to ESCORT a potential EX-IMPERIAL who may be able to help the Alliance'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 16, 'rebel_hideout_16', 'PRINCESS LEIA needs you to RESCUE the SELONIAN who is being detained by the IMPERIALS.  You may need to KILL them to free her.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 17, 'rebel_hideout_17', 'PRINCESS LEIA needs you to DELIVER the IMPERIAL CODES to her CONTACTS'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 18, 'rebel_hideout_18', 'PRINCESS LEIA needs you to INTERCEPT a SHIPMENT that the IMPERIALS are carrying'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 19, 'rebel_hideout_19', 'NIEN NUNB (apparently) needs you to ESCORT the TECHNICIAN responsible for his broken translator to him'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 20, 'rebel_hideout_20', 'NIEN NUNB has warned you of a BOUNTY HUNTER who is trying to kill you.  You may want to DEAL WITH HIM first.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 21, 'rebel_hideout_21', 'NIEN NUNB needs you to KILL the PIRATES who may be hanging around the Millenium Falcon'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 22, 'rebel_hideout_22', 'NIEN NUNB needs you to RETRIEVE the PART he needs to fix the Falcon''s Hyperdrive'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 23, 'rebel_hideout_23', 'HAN SOLO needs you to ESCORT his old friend back to see him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 24, 'rebel_hideout_24', 'HAN SOLO needs you to RETURN A STOLEN ITEM from some BANDITS who have taken it'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 25, 'rebel_hideout_25', 'HAN SOLO needs you to ELIMINATE the PIRATES near Nym''s Fortress'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 26, 'rebel_hideout_26', 'HAN SOLO needs you to RESCUE his friend from the IMPERIALS who have arrested him.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 27, 'rebel_hideout_27', 'HAN SOLO needs you to deliver a payment of CREDITS to Nym''s bruiser, NATEBA KERR'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 28, 'rebel_hideout_return', 'RETURN to the REBEL who gave you the mission');
INSERT INTO `client_strings` (`stringFile`, `index`, `name`, `value`) VALUES
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 29, 'rebel_hideout_28', 'ACKBAR needs you to KILL a few STORMTROOPERS to cause a diversion so he can safely land his ships'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 30, 'rebel_hideout_29', 'ACKBAR needs you to MEET with someone who may be willing to SELL some INFORMATION to the Alliance'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 31, 'rebel_hideout_30', 'ACKBAR needs you to DELIVER the INFORMATION from the bounty hunter to his ASSOCIATES'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 32, 'rebel_hideout_31', 'ACKBAR needs you to DELIVER the INFORMATION gathered to ADMIRAL BEL IBLIS'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 33, 'rebel_hideout_32', 'ACKBAR needs you to TAKE OUT some IMPERIALS who are here to clean up the Rebel Base'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 34, 'rebel_hideout_33', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to DELIVER a HOLOVID of the Death Star''s Destruction'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 35, 'rebel_hideout_34', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to ELIMINATE the STRIKE TEAM that is preparing to attack the Rebel Base'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 36, 'rebel_hidout_35', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to ESCORT the CAPTAIN of the Corvette back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 37, 'rebel_hideout_36', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to TAKE OUT the STORMTROOPERS who are preventing her people from escaping'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 38, 'rebel_hideout_37', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to ESCORT the IMPERIAL who is to oversee the new troop movments back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 39, 'rebel_hideout_38', 'MON MOTHMA needs you to RETRIEVE WITH FORCE the BLUEPRINTS for whatever the Empire is building'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 40, 'rebel_hideout_39', 'GENERAL DODONNA needs you to ELIMINATE the STORMTROOPERS who are keeping his people from escaping'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 41, 'rebel_hideout_40', 'GENERAL DODONNA needs you to ESCORT his TROOPS back to the REBEL BASE'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 42, 'rebel_hideout_41', 'GENERAL DODONNA needs you to DESTROY the GENERATOR that is powering the TIE BOMBER FACTORY'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 43, 'rebel_hideout_42', 'GENERAL DODONNA needs you to DELIVER the INFORMATION to the PILOT who will take it to Mon Mothma'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 44, 'rebel_hideout_43', 'GENERAL DODONNA needs you to DELIVER the INFORMATION to LUKE SKYWALKER'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 45, 'rebel_hideout_44', 'LUKE needs you to ESCORT the ARCHAEOLOGICAL SUPERVISOR back to him'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 46, 'rebel_hideout_45', 'LUKE needs you to help him FIND the CREATURE that took a bite out of his droid.  You may need to KILL the creature to find the PART'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 47, 'rebel_hideout_46', 'LUKE needs you to ESCORT the missing archeologist back'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 48, 'rebel_hideout_47', 'LUKE needs you to RETRIEVE the BOX that he was looking at earlier'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/quest_details.stf', 49, 'rebel_hideout_48', 'LUKE needs you to DELIVER the BOX to someone he knows on YAVIN'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/warning.stf', 1, 'foyer1', 'Access Denied. You must be a member of the Rebel Alliance to enter.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/warning.stf', 2, 'dodonna', 'You cannot enter here until you have completed Mon Mothma''s tasks.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/warning.stf', 3, 'luke', 'You cannot enter here until you have completed Jan Dodonna''s tasks.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 1, 'npc_1_1', 'So, you''re the one that Qualdo told me about, eh? I admire your commitment to our cause. While my X-Wing is being repaired from a little scuffle I had with a couple of Interceptors, I figure I''ll help out the Princess with recruitment. I''m supposed to meet up with a spokesman from a group coming over. Can you do this for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 2, 'npc_1_2', 'Great... we''ve got some good news and some bad news. The good news is that they''ve all decided to come over to the Alliance. The bad news is that one of their number was a bit... well, outspoken about her views on the matter. They''ve told me that she''ll likely try to contact the Empire. I need you to go talk to her if you could?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 3, 'npc_1_3', 'I''m glad you showed up. My wingmates have keyed us in on some odd Imperial activity. It seems that rather than destroying the remains of the decoy Dantooine base, they''re shipping the power generators off planet and bringing them here. This isn''t the way the Empire does things, so we need to find out how much they know. Can you help?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 5, 'npc_2_1', 'Thanks a lot, friend. I''d do this myself, but I need to make sure that the repairs go right on my X-Wing. All I need you to do is bring this confirmation letter to a spokesman for a group of people I''m going to meet with. They want to hear from me firsthand about the Death Star. After they hear my story, I''m sure they''ll surely help the Alliance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 6, 'npc_2_2', 'From what they tell me, she likes to take long walks out in the wilderness. I''m hoping she''s not trying to contact the Empire as we speak. Either way, go out there and talk to her to convince her not to reveal too much. I just hope she listens to reason, rather than trying to use a blaster.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 7, 'npc_2_3', 'Okay, from what the Squadron was able to figure out, the General, I believe his name is ''Graise,'' should be arriving via shuttle in a remote location. I''m pretty certain you won''t have too much resistance from him, aside from his personal guard. Bring him back alive, if you can, but if he resists use whatever force you deem necessary. If you have to terminate him, make sure you bring back any documents you find.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 8, 'npc_3_1', 'I guess I can find someone else to do this, then. I just have to oversee that the Mechanics fix my modifications to my X-Wing correctly.  I don''t want another Kessel Run incident if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 9, 'npc_3_2', 'Yeah, I''m not one for talking too much, either. I''ll see if I can get Leia to talk to her then. Leia can convince anybody of anything! '),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 10, 'npc_3_3', 'Oh, okay, I understand. I''ll check with Leia to see who we have that can help. Well, good luck with whatever you''re doing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 12, 'npc_4_1', 'Well, I was there, but it wasn''t me who blew it up. Luke''s the guy you want to talk to about that. Darn good pilot, if you ask me. But, yeah, I was there flying beside him when it went up in smoke. Maybe someday when we stop the Empire I''ll tell you about it, eh? So, can you do this for me?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 13, 'npc_4_2', 'I don''t think it will be too much of a problem if I let you know, considering they are working with us now. These were some Union leaders for the Corellian Engineering Company, only the largest maker of starships here on Corellia. They don''t like the Empire''s "new ideas" regarding labor laws, so some of them chose to help us.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 14, 'npc_4_3', 'Oh, this will be a lot easier than it sounds. This General was promoted after he destroyed our Dantooine base... the one we abandoned a while back. Therefore, he''s not too competent. I expect him to have only a few guards about him, rather than a squad of Stormtroopers like a smart General would have. This is an opportunity we can''t pass up.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 15, 'npc_reward_1', 'So they were fine with the time and place, then? Okay, that''s good. Well, now I''ve got to brush up on my public speaking skills. Normally, I''d have Leia or Luke do this, but they specifically requested me. Ha! Wait till Luke hears this one. Anyways, thank you for doing that.  Oh, and here''s a little something for your assistance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 16, 'npc_reward_2', 'Well, that''s a shame... I''ll break the news to her former associates that she was about to sell them out.  Well, there''s some people we just can''t reach, but at least we only use force as a last resort. Sorry to have to put you through all this, friend. Well, thank you for your help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 17, 'npc_reward_3', 'Well... it''s a shame you weren''t able to bring him in. I don''t think the Empire will be too happy when they find out about this. Then again, considering how inept he was at his duties, we may have just helped the Empire by removing him. Well, at least you were able to recover these documents, they should give us a great deal of info. Thanks for your help!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 18, 'player_1_1', 'Not a problem! I''ll do it.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 19, 'player_1_2', 'Sure, I''ll talk to her.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 20, 'player_1_3', 'Sure, I can help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 21, 'player_2_1', 'Sorry, I can''t do this right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 22, 'player_2_2', 'I''m not the talking type, sorry.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 23, 'player_2_3', 'Sorry, Wedge, but I''m a bit preoccupied right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 24, 'player_3_1', 'Are you the same Wedge who blew up the Death Star?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 25, 'player_3_2', 'Who are these people that joined our cause?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 26, 'player_3_3', 'How do you expect me to get ahold of the General?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 27, 'player_reset_1', 'Sorry, but something came up. I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 28, 'player_sorry_1', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 29, 'npc_backtowork_1', 'Not a problem. If you could try getting it to them by today, though, it would be greatly appreciated.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 30, 'npc_reset_1', 'I guess I can find someone else to do this, then. I just have to oversee that the Mechanics fix my modifications to my X-Wing correctly.  I don''t want another Kessel Run incident, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 31, 'cantwork', 'Hey, you''re the one that Qualdo told me about, aren''t you? I just want to say thank you for what you''ve done for us so far. When you''ve got the time, maybe we can work together, eh?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 32, 'dontknowyou_1', 'Oh, you''re not? Sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 33, 'npc_work_1', 'Were you able to deliver the letter yet?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 34, 'npc_work_2', 'Were you able to find her?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 35, 'npc_work_3', 'Do you have the General in your custody?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 36, 'npc_breech_1', 'Hello! You must be the person that was sent by a ''friend'', right?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 37, 'npc_breech_2', 'You can''t stop me! The Empire will pay a lot for this information! Die!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 38, 'npc_breech_3', 'How dare you! I am an Imperial General! Arrest this Rebel!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 39, 'notit', 'Umm... I thought you were supposed to bring me a location where we would meet Wedge.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 42, 'npc_backtowork_2', 'Okay, but try to find her soon. You need to stop her from going to the Empire.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 43, 'npc_backtowork_3', 'You might want to pick up the pace before he has reinforcements show up. If that happens, you might not be able to get to him anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 44, 'npc_reset_2', 'Yeah, I''m not one for talking too much, either. I''ll see if I can get Leia to talk to her then. Leia can convince anybody of anything!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 45, 'npc_reset_3', 'Oh, okay, I understand. I''ll check with Leia to see who we have that can help. Well, good luck with whatever you''re doing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 46, 'player_reset_2', 'Wedge, I''m scared to talk to people. I can''t do this.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 47, 'player_reset_3', 'Wedge, something came up. I can''t do this anymore.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 48, 'player_sorry_2', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 49, 'player_sorry_3', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 52, 'npc_takeme_3', 'I cannot believe you would have the audacity to arrest a person of my rank! I demand you take me to your leader at once! Oh... that''s what you already planned on doing? Oh my...'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 53, 'dontknowyou_2', 'Oh, sorry, I thought you were someone else! Nevermind!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 54, 'dontknowyou_3', 'Sorry, I was practicing some lines from my favorite play.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 56, 'dontknowyou_5', 'You''re not here for the keys? Oh, sorry about that.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 61, 'npc_1_4', 'It seems this is part of a large construction project the Empire has started.  From what we know already, the Empire is retro-engineering all of the power generators and shipping them offplanet somewhere. We need to take out the man in charge of this endeavor, an Imperial General by the name of Boize.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 62, 'npc_1_5', 'According to the documents you recovered from General Boize, he was overseeing a storehouse here on Corellia that contains a number of confiscated starcraft and starcraft parts. You need to persuade the Quartermaster in charge of the place to let you in, if you know what I mean.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 64, 'npc_2_4', 'And that''s why I asked you. I know I can rely on you for something like this. All you need to do is take out General Boize. Go ahead and gather together whatever you need, then get rid of him!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 65, 'npc_2_5', 'I knew I could count on you. Here is where the Quartermaster should be able to be found. He''s going to have a unique code-cylinder on him that will open the storehouse. I doubt he''s going to just hand it over to you, so you may have to use the business end of a weapon to convince him. You might as well ask him first, though.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 67, 'npc_3_4', 'Well, I think you can do it, friend. If you feel you can''t, I understand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 68, 'npc_3_5', 'Oh, okay, I understand. I''ll check with Leia''s astromech and protocol droid to see who we have that can help. Well, good luck with whatever you''re doing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 70, 'npc_4_4', 'No, it seems that no one is privy to that information. All we know was that someone was assigned to oversee the transportation of the generators. He got to his position by being a yes-man rather than by asking too many questions. Even still, this is still important information.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 71, 'npc_4_5', 'He''s the person who''s in charge of all things being checked in and out of that building. Even though most of the pilots for the Empire are well trained, you still have some that want to hop in an X-Wing to try one out. That''s why the Quartermaster is the only one who has the keys to the place.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 73, 'npc_backtowork_4', 'Okay, let me know when you taken care of the General, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 74, 'npc_backtowork_5', 'Make sure you''re well prepared for his guards before you go running out there!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 77, 'npc_breech_5', 'You''ll get this code-cylinder when you pry it from my cold, dead hands!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 79, 'npc_reset_4', 'Well, I think you can do it, friend. If you feel you can''t, I understand.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 80, 'npc_reset_5', 'Oh, okay, I understand. I''ll check with Leia''s astromech and protocol droid to see who we have that can help. Well, good luck with whatever you''re doing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 82, 'npc_reward_4', 'So the general is out of commision, then? Good! Now we can start recovering these generators rather than having to purchase more. They can get pretty expensive from what I''ve been told. I''ll contact my wingmates to recover any more of them already in transit. You''ve done a good job!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 83, 'npc_reward_5', 'Well, I''ll be! With this code-cylinder, we''ll be able to recover a number of ships to rebuild our fleet. It''s a small step, but every bit counts. You''ve been a great help, friend! I was telling Leia about you, and she''s asked me to send you over to her when you got back. Once again, thank you!  And here, a rebel flight suit all for yourself.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 88, 'npc_work_4', 'Has the general been eliminated?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 89, 'npc_work_5', 'So, do you have the cylinder?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 91, 'player_1_4', 'I''ll do this job for you, Wedge.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 92, 'player_1_5', 'Yeah, I can do this for the Alliance.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 94, 'player_2_4', 'Whoa. That''s beyond my capabilities.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 95, 'player_2_5', 'Sorry, but I''m a bit preoccupied right now.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 97, 'player_3_4', 'Did we find out what the project was?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 98, 'player_3_5', 'Who''s the Quartermaster?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 100, 'player_reset_4', 'I''m sorry, but this is too much for me.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 101, 'player_reset_5', 'I can''t take him on myself, Wedge.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 103, 'player_sorry_4', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 104, 'player_sorry_5', 'No, not yet.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 106, 'npc_smuggle_1', 'One second... let me check this first... Oh, okay, we know where that is. Okay, tell Antilles that we''ll meet him there.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 111, 'noloc_1', 'I seem to have forgotten where I was supposed to meet him. Let me check my message again, then get back to me, okay?'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 112, 'noloc_2', 'Let me check with one of the guys to see where she might likely be. Check back with me shortly.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 113, 'noloc_3', 'Let me check with Rogue Squadron to find out where he''s going to land. Check back with me in a bit.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 114, 'noloc_4', 'Let me check his report so that I can point you to the right location. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 115, 'noloc_5', 'I''ll get you the location of the storehouse in a moment. Check back with me in a few minutes.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 117, 'otherescort', 'I''m not the person you''re looking for. Move along.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 118, 'gotowork', 'I think you should be getting to work.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 119, 'npc_failure_1', 'You say he wasn''t there when you showed up? Hrm... they must''ve gotten cold feet at the last minute, I guess.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 120, 'npc_failure_2', 'You weren''t able to find her? I hope she didn''t reveal to the Empire what her associates were doing.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 121, 'npc_failure_3', 'He died in the crossfire? How did you let that happen? Oh well... I guess I''ll go explain this one to Leia.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 122, 'npc_failure_4', 'You weren''t able to take out the general? Hmmm... well, we may need to send a special team out there to do it, then.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 123, 'npc_failure_5', 'He didn''t have the key on him? I can''t believe that!'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 124, 'next', 'I think Leia would like to speak with you.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 125, 'notyet', 'You should see if Qual''do needs some help.'),
('string/en/theme_park_rebel/wedge_antilles.stf', 126, 'npc_breech_4', 'You won''t get away with this!'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 1, 'Opening', 'I''m a conversationally experienced NPC.  What would you like to talk about?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 2, 'jawas', 'What can you tell me about Jawas?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 3, 'quest', 'Can you tell me where I can find a quest?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 4, 'leia', 'Is Leia really that hot?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 5, 'jawa answer', 'Well, I can tell you this, they sell scrap robots they find in the desert, they hate basketball, and they do not have a concept for the number 7.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 6, 'scrap', 'What is a scrap robot?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 7, 'seven', 'Um...number 7?...What?!?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 8, 'quest answer', 'Depends on what kind of quest you are looking for.  The Baker has zombies in his basement, the empire needs an NWAs Greatest Hits CD, and the princess needs her shoe repaired.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 9, 'zombie', 'Zombies sound cool.  Where can I find the baker?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 10, 'nwa', 'I think I have that CD.  Who should I give it to?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 11, 'shoe', 'I trained as a shoe repairman!  How lucky is that?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 12, 'leia answer', 'To be honest with you, I have always thought she was kind of uptight.  But man does she look good in that slave outfit.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 13, 'Han', 'Is she in love with Han Solo?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 14, 'luke', 'Is she Lukes sister?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 15, 'slave', 'Slave outfit?'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 16, 'robot', 'Scrap robots are just robots that the Jawas found out in the desert and basically fixed up so they could sell them cheap.  Well my cell phone is ringing so I gotta go.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 17, 'tall', 'Probably because they are short.  Also, they do not really like to play defense and the zone defense rules confuse them.  Well, I am off to get a smoothie.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 18, 'dumb', 'It is inexplicable.  You say, is it just one less than 8'' and they scratch their heads.  If you actually have 7 things and try to make them count them, they explode.  Well, I have a meeting now, see you later.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 19, 'baker', 'The Baker is over by the Starport, just around the corner from the Arena.  He should be able to tell you more when you get there.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 20, 'CD', 'Great, just take the CD to Admiral Cube at the All-Star Cantina.  He will pay handsomely for it.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 21, 'nu shooz', 'Sounds pretty lucky to me.  You can find her on Naboo hanging around the palace, limping casually from place to place and trying not to fall over.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 22, 'wookie', 'Yeah, but fear not.  I think he might be, you know, in love with the Wookiee.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 23, 'brother', 'Not at this point in our timeline.  We find that out in Jedi.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 24, 'outfit', 'Oh, sorry, that is in the future.  You see I am psychic.  But trust me, when she is chained to the big slug and Han is blind and Luke starts doing backflips you will see what I mean.'),
('string/en/toadspeak.stf', 26, 'hoop', 'why do they not like basketball?'),
