('string/en/ui_auc.stf', 219, 'err_vendor_deactivated', 'This vendor is currently deactivated and is not accepting new items to be placed up for sale or offer.  If you are the owner of this vendor, please make sure the maintenance fees for this vendor have been paid to reactivate the vendor.'),
