('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 1, 'help_wps_icons', 'This is your Datapad.\n\nPieces of information like waypoints and missions are stored here, as well as the schematics that you have learned, and a list of interesting points of interest on the current planet.\n\nThis first window displays all of the Waypoint items that you currently have.  These take up memory in your Datapad.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 2, 'help_info', 'This window displays detailed information on the current item.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 3, 'help_waypoint', 'Click this button to create a new waypoint at the point where your character is standing.\n\nA waypoint represents a location in the world.  These are useful to help find your way around, and can be mailed to friends to help meet up or plan events.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 4, 'help_wps_capacity', 'This is the capacity of your datapad.  As you create Waypoints, accept Missions, or gather other Data items, your datapad will fill up.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 5, 'help_wps_change', 'Click this button to change the view of your Waypoints to a list view.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 6, 'help_draft_icon', 'This second tab displays the Draft Schematics that you have learned.  Draft Schematics are necessary in order to craft items or Manufacturing Schematics.\n\nLike Points of Interest, these do not take up space in your datapad.\n\nYou can browse your schematics to see the necessary ingrediants and other requirements for the items that you can craft.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 7, 'help_data_icon', 'These pane holds Data items.  Like Waypoints, these data items take up space in your datapad.  Examples of Data items would be accepted missions, manufacturing schematics, and pet control devices.'),
('string/en/ui_datapad.stf', 8, 'help_poi_icon', 'This pane displays a list of Points Of Interest for the given planet.  These do not take up any space in your datapad.'),
('string/en/ui_droid.stf', 1, 'caption', 'Flight Commands'),
('string/en/ui_droid.stf', 2, 'available_commands', 'Available Commands'),
('string/en/ui_droid.stf', 3, 'loaded_commands', 'Loaded Commands'),
('string/en/ui_droid.stf', 4, 'load_warning', 'Once this chip has been burned into the droid, it cannot be removed.  It can only be destroyed.  Proceed?'),
('string/en/ui_droid.stf', 5, 'unload_warning', 'You do not know this command, and would need to purchase a chip to put it back in your droid.  Proceed?'),
