('string/en/ui_macro.stf', 1, 'help_name', 'This is the Macro page.\n\nYou can create and edit macros here.\n\nThis first entry is the name of the macro.  It must be one word.'),
('string/en/ui_macro.stf', 2, 'help_icon', 'Select an icon to associate with this macro.'),
('string/en/ui_macro.stf', 3, 'help_text', 'This is the actual macro definition.\n\nHere is an example macro:\nHi there;\n/stand;\n/pause 3;\n/bow %TT;\n\nThe first line is a text string that is spoken as spacial chat.  The second line calls the command Stand.  The third line makes the macro wait 3 seconds.  The final line makes your character bow to your current target.  See your documentation for more information about macros.'),
