('string/en/ui_shipcomponents.stf', 40, 'help_inventory', 'Inventory of Ship Components\n\nThese are ship components that you own. This includes both ship components in your inventory as well as those currently loaded on your ship.\n\nThis inventory list is broken down into categories of ship component types which correspond to component slots on your ship.'),
