('string/en/veteran_new.stf', 54, 'item_and_event_unique_are_you_sure', 'The item you are selecting can only be selected as a reward item once for the the lifetime of your account.  Additionally, once you select a reward with this character, you can not select a reward for this time period with another character on your account until you qualify for a new reward at a later time period.  Are you sure you wish to continue selecting this item with this character?'),
