('string/en/warren_item_d.stf', 23, 'warning_sign', 'A large sign stands next to the doorway with an illuminated inscription, reading:\n\n"WARNING-- due to the potentially dangerous nature of the droids created in this sector, an automatic turret secures the exit to this elevator.  To disable it, speak the passcode to the terminal in Room 201A (adjacent to the Droid Lab)."'),
