('string/en/weapon_detail.stf', 163, 'vibro_unit', 'A vibro-unit can turn a normal blade or axe into a much more destructive weapon by creating thousands of microscopic vibrations a second, greatly improving its cutting ability.'),
('string/en/weapon_detail.stf', 164, 'vibroknuckler', 'A blunt melee weapon equipped with a vibro-unit.  These are held in one hand, and can badly injure or kill an enemy.'),
('string/en/weapon_detail.stf', 165, 'victor_baton_gaderiffi', 'Black Metal Gaderiffi Baton seems to have been made with an ink-like metal. It is light, durable and well-balanced.'),
('string/en/weapon_detail.stf', 166, 'voltage_inducer', 'A voltage inducer.'),
