('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 44, 'armor_kashyyykian_black_mtn_bracer_l', 'This armor, wearable only by Wookiees, has moderate protective value. Wookiees of the planet Kashyyyk often used this type of armor while tracking small or medium-sized prey.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
