('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 48, 'armor_kashyyykian_ceremonial_bracer_l', 'This armor, wearable only by Wookiees, has some protective value, but is mainly used in formal ceremonies on the planet Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 49, 'armor_kashyyykian_ceremonial_bracer_r', 'This armor, wearable only by Wookiees, has some protective value, but is mainly used in formal ceremonies on the planet Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 50, 'armor_kashyyykian_ceremonial_chest_plate', 'This armor, wearable only by Wookiees, has some protective value, but is mainly used in formal ceremonies on the planet Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 51, 'armor_kashyyykian_ceremonial_leggings', 'This armor, wearable only by Wookiees, has some protective value, but is mainly used in formal ceremonies on the planet Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 52, 'armor_kashyyykian_hunting_bracer_l', 'This heavy armor, wearable only by Wookiees, provides a high level of protection. Wookies often prefer this type of armor when hunting any of the many large predators found on their home planet, Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 53, 'armor_kashyyykian_hunting_bracer_r', 'This heavy armor, wearable only by Wookiees, provides a high level of protection. Wookies often prefer this type of armor when hunting any of the many large predators found on their home planet, Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 54, 'armor_kashyyykian_hunting_chest_plate', 'This heavy armor, wearable only by Wookiees, provides a high level of protection. Wookies often prefer this type of armor when hunting any of the many large predators found on their home planet, Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 55, 'armor_kashyyykian_hunting_leggings', 'This heavy armor, wearable only by Wookiees, provides a high level of protection. Wookies often prefer this type of armor when hunting any of the many large predators found on their home planet, Kashyyyk.\n\nArmor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 56, 'armor_mandalorian_belt', 'This armor type was first created by the Mandalorian mercenaries, and is frequently used when both protection and agility are needed. Armor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.\n\nMandalorian Armor can only be worn by Master Bounty Hunters, Master Squad Leaders, Master Rangers, and Master Commandos.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 57, 'armor_mandalorian_bicep_l', 'This armor type was first created by the Mandalorian mercenaries, and is frequently used when both protection and agility are needed. Armor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.\n\nMandalorian Armor can only be worn by Master Bounty Hunters, Master Squad Leaders, Master Rangers, and Master Commandos.'),
