('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 59, 'armor_mandalorian_bracer_l', 'This armor type was first created by the Mandalorian mercenaries, and is frequently used when both protection and agility are needed. Armor can vary greatly in its effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the quality of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.\n\nMandalorian Armor can only be worn by Master Bounty Hunters, Master Squad Leaders, Master Rangers, and Master Commandos.'),
