('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 126, 'armor_tantel_skreej_boots_quest', 'This is an ancient type of armor rarely used any more. Armor can vary greatly in effectiveness depending on the type of materials used and the skill of the armorsmith. To wear this armor, double click on it from your inventory. This type of armor has encumberance and will decrease some of your maximum statistics when worn.\n\nThe padding sewn into the interior of this armor provides slightly higher defense in melee combat. Furthermore, the materials used in the crafting of this armor may help resist certain types of venom and poison.'),
