('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 155, 'backpack_s01', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 156, 'backpack_s02', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 157, 'backpack_s03', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 158, 'backpack_s03_quest', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".\n\nThis particular backpack is fitted with lightweight plating to provide extra protection, as well as a jointed harness, offering the wearer increased mobility over normal backpacks'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 159, 'backpack_s04', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 160, 'backpack_s05', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 161, 'backpack_s06', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 162, 'backpack_s06_quest', 'A backpack, a clothing item wearable by most humanoid species. It can be used as a container to hold other items. To wear a backpack, click on it in your inventory and choose "wear" from the radial menu. To open it, click on it in your inventory and choose "open".\n\nThis particular backpack is plated to provide extra protection, as well as specially configured to assist in wilderness survival.'),
