('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 514, 'ring_s03_quest', 'A ring, worn on the finger (if you are a species lucky enough to have fingers). To wear this ring, go to your inventory window and double click on it.\n\nThis particular ring bears the Rebellion insignia. It is usually given to those that have done a great service to the Rebellion. However, it is small enough so that it not usually noticed by Imperial troops.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 515, 'robe_inquisitor', 'A robe usually worn by an Imperial Inquisitor.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 516, 'robe_jedi_dark_s01', 'Designed for those who relish personal combat, these robes offer good protection with no hindrance to movement.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 517, 'robe_jedi_dark_s02', 'Designed for those who relish personal combat, and know that power comes to those who take it, these robes offer good protection with no hindrance to movement.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 518, 'robe_jedi_dark_s03', 'Designed for those who relish personal combat, and know that power comes to those who take it, these robes offer good protection with no hindrance to movement.'),
('string/en/wearables_detail.stf', 519, 'robe_jedi_dark_s04', 'These robes offer superior protection while still allowing full freedom of movement.  They are the robes of the true masters, those whose will and authority go unopposed.'),
